#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Well, they're not, so you can quite your snivelling."
msgctxt "h1cb2274cg3247g48abgb7ddgce642b5ed80c"
msgid "Well, they're not, so you can quit your snivelling."
msgstr "글쎄, 그런데 아니잖아? 그러니까 그만 찡찡대."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_ArabellaPowers_Arabella
#. Speaker = Arabella
#. NodeID = 6a75b0f8-ab6e-8408-a05c-71d07e13ccc4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_ArabellaPowers_Arabella:6a75b0f8-ab6e-8408-a05c-71d07e13ccc4
msgctxt "h1e095349gbefbg4acdg89c9g25fe254d1a5a"
msgid "I hope so. 'Cause it stinks."
msgstr "그랬으면 좋겠네요. 지금 기분은 엿 같으니까요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_ArabellaPowers_Arabella
#. Speaker = Arabella
#. NodeID = 6b0fd786-4635-462e-bf69-b40f020cba19
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - TWN_ArabellaPowers_State_MetAtCamp = False
#.      - TWN_ArabellasPowers_State_ToldParentsDead = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - TWN_ArabellaPowers_State_MetAtCamp = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_ArabellaPowers_Arabella:6b0fd786-4635-462e-bf69-b40f020cba19
msgctxt "h8cc6143dgd6bfg4fc9g8ea4g6906907bb416"
msgid "Hey you - I made it, easy-peasy!"
msgstr "이것 봐요, 제가 무사히 도착했어요. 식은 죽 먹기였죠!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_ArabellaPowers_Arabella
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 70080dde-b9c2-9d3e-00b8-537d5727a331
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_ArabellaPowers_Arabella:70080dde-b9c2-9d3e-00b8-537d5727a331
msgctxt "h8dc2fdf3g56bdg4fb6g850cg170b506b7589"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_ArabellaPowers_Arabella
#. Speaker = Arabella
#. NodeID = 779071b4-1106-be99-0b9b-3115a2ba5d4b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_ArabellaPowers_Arabella:779071b4-1106-be99-0b9b-3115a2ba5d4b
msgctxt "he619ea3dgcb09g4dc2g8225g3745cc145160"
msgid "I just wish - I wish it was different. I wish mum and pops was here."
msgstr "저는 그냥... 그냥 좀 다른 결말을 원했어요. 엄마 아빠가 이곳에 계셨으면 했다고요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_ArabellaPowers_Arabella
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7c74377a-7cda-ee93-be12-a99f64535f86
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - TWN_ArabellasPowers_State_ParentsFoundDead = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC_EVIL(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_ArabellaPowers_Arabella:7c74377a-7cda-ee93-be12-a99f64535f86
msgctxt "h2c6af084g24ddg440dg935dgf0951700f966"
msgid ""
"Oh, they're very dead. But don't worry - being an orphan makes you much more "
"interesting."
msgstr "아, 너희 부모님? 피떡이 됐던데? 그래도 너무 서운해하진 마. 고아가 되는 게 얼마나 재밌는 일인데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_ArabellaPowers_Arabella
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8cab42cb-9fb0-20d4-eb6c-133402b3ba19
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC_KELEMVOR(1) = False
#.      - CLERIC_EVIL(1) = False
#.      - BARD(1) = False
#.      - MONK(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_ArabellaPowers_Arabella:8cab42cb-9fb0-20d4-eb6c-133402b3ba19
msgctxt "he7cc0af0gf778g412dga867g4652629e3d62"
msgid "You don't have to believe me for it to be true."
msgstr "내 말이 거짓말이라고 생각한다면, 믿지 않아도 돼."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_ArabellaPowers_Arabella
#. Speaker = Arabella
#. NodeID = 924c2737-2061-8267-8b27-d6f256cd20ba
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_ArabellaPowers_Arabella:924c2737-2061-8267-8b27-d6f256cd20ba
msgctxt "ha8596060gee3ag4ca7g832dgf9c7aada1b8e"
msgid "You find mum and pops, I'll show you the spell. And that's that."
msgstr "엄마 아빠를 찾아주면, 주문을 알려줄게요. 이게 제 거래 조건이에요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_ArabellaPowers_Arabella
#. Speaker = Arabella
#. NodeID = aaa5286b-0c65-49b0-a7ad-9fa3f1fd649f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_ArabellaPowers_Arabella:aaa5286b-0c65-49b0-a7ad-9fa3f1fd649f
msgctxt "hb25e0919g5dfeg4e33ga91cgb62ebeb94306"
msgid "<i>I don't believe you.</i>"
msgstr "<i>믿을 수 없어요.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_ArabellaPowers_Arabella
#. Speaker = Arabella
#. NodeID = ab774bf3-f6a9-21f6-65c8-acae33bfbbd3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - TWN_ArabellasPowers_Event_AskedToLearn(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_ArabellaPowers_Arabella:ab774bf3-f6a9-21f6-65c8-acae33bfbbd3
msgctxt "h15ae1026g6615g4343gb0d5gb059b96e3753"
msgid "Nah - Mol taught me about deals. So I know a bad one when I hear it."
msgstr "거절할게요, 몰이 저한테 거래하는 법을 알려줬어요. 불공정한지 아닌지는 들으면 알 수 있다고요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_ArabellaPowers_Arabella
#. Speaker = Arabella
#. NodeID = b29742a2-a89f-4361-ba20-6c696bdeb514
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_ArabellaPowers_Arabella:b29742a2-a89f-4361-ba20-6c696bdeb514
msgctxt "h51f7131dgf611g4188ga567g0da7b47d51cb"
msgid "Well hurry. They gotta be somewhere. And I don't want 'em worrying."
msgstr "서둘러줘요. 분명 어딘가에 계실 거예요. 걱정 끼치긴 싫단 말이에요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_ArabellaPowers_Arabella
#. Speaker = Arabella
#. NodeID = b8a67174-a489-783a-7dbb-6079a0574512
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_ArabellaPowers_Arabella:b8a67174-a489-783a-7dbb-6079a0574512
msgctxt "h0d78d0ccg55d7g4b14gb34dg0b75f8189865"
msgid "Oh gods - no no no. You're lying. <i>I know it.</i>"
msgstr "오 신이시여. 안돼. 아니. 아니야. 거짓말이잖아. <i>그렇죠?</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_ArabellaPowers_Arabella
#. Speaker = Arabella
#. NodeID = bc950007-d434-4a2e-abfb-acd8201378ed
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - TWN_ArabellasPowers_State_ToldParentsDead = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_ArabellaPowers_Arabella:bc950007-d434-4a2e-abfb-acd8201378ed
msgctxt "h3f410b2cg9fd5g42a5gbc9fgc94c34892ea8"
msgid "No. No no no."
msgstr "안돼. 그럴 리 없어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_ArabellaPowers_Arabella
#. Speaker = Arabella
#. NodeID = c3523062-9845-b674-1bc3-c428bf65e671
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_ArabellaPowers_Arabella:c3523062-9845-b674-1bc3-c428bf65e671
msgctxt "h31851e71g448ag4bb8ga146g45545283c84b"
msgid "Then I'll teach you to conjure those vines."
msgstr "찾아주시면 덩굴을 조종하는 법을 알려드릴게요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_ArabellaPowers_Arabella
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c74e3f0d-8420-4d66-8ff4-e41126f91517
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - TWN_ArabellasPowers_State_ParentsFoundDead = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC(1) = False
#.      - CLERIC_KELEMVOR(1) = False
#.      - CLERIC_EVIL(1) = False
#.      - BARD(1) = False
#.      - MONK(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_ArabellaPowers_Arabella:c74e3f0d-8420-4d66-8ff4-e41126f91517
msgctxt "h4796d248g18beg41a0g9b4dg366d28618c8d"
msgid "Your parents are dead. I found their corpses."
msgstr "네 부모님은 죽었어. 시체를 발견했지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_ArabellaPowers_Arabella
#. Speaker = Arabella
#. NodeID = cafcb235-ea12-8f8f-193a-e52221857ca5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_Arabella_Event_HasMetAfter(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_ArabellaPowers_Arabella:cafcb235-ea12-8f8f-193a-e52221857ca5
msgctxt "h14a1d91egfdcag40cfgb00dg9c0a0fc6a401"
msgid "I guess I can take care of myself. I mean, I've gotten this far."
msgstr "잘 이겨낼 수 있을지도 몰라요. 그러니까 저는... 성장했으니까요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_ArabellaPowers_Arabella
#. Speaker = Arabella
#. NodeID = cceebd87-7bc0-b5ff-f06f-765c33758cd3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - TWN_ArabellasPowers_State_ToldParentsDead = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_ArabellaPowers_Arabella:cceebd87-7bc0-b5ff-f06f-765c33758cd3
msgctxt "h4729222ag0587g4257g8c1ag9129e875a96e"
msgid "Leave. Me. Alone!"
msgstr "<b>저, 좀, 내버려, 두라고요!</b>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_ArabellaPowers_Arabella
#. Speaker = Arabella
#. NodeID = e26b1ca4-08b9-1508-a704-575c7b3e21e5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - TWN_ArabellasPowers_State_TaughtSpell = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CAMP_Arabella_Event_HasMetAfter(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_ArabellaPowers_Arabella:e26b1ca4-08b9-1508-a704-575c7b3e21e5
msgctxt "h7ad7daaeg8c86g4bcbgb8a6g1fde6ce60f24"
msgid "If Bone Man says I'll be all right, I'll be all right."
msgstr "이 해골 할아버지가 괜찮다고 하면, 괜찮은 거겠죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_ArabellaPowers_Arabella
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f097a0a0-e9a3-9b9f-6713-9dffe72c4dfe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_ArabellaPowers_Arabella:f097a0a0-e9a3-9b9f-6713-9dffe72c4dfe
msgctxt "h7ac6783egdf25g4cc1g97e8g620b142d0f8f"
msgid "I'm so sorry, Arabella."
msgstr "유감이구나, 아라벨라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_ArabellaPowers_Arabella
#. Speaker = Arabella
#. NodeID = f9625174-6942-91c9-6658-7fc378a96693
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_ArabellaPowers_Arabella:f9625174-6942-91c9-6658-7fc378a96693
msgctxt "h9ec537a5g8ad4g40ceg939cg566ab1b550ad"
msgid "I don't feel so strong. Or anything, really. Just tired."
msgstr "저는 제가 강한지 모르겠어요. 정말 아무것도 생각할 수 없어요. 피곤할 뿐이에요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_ArabellaPowers_Arabella
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f9e5c5d7-a5b1-20e0-0501-7ee576fa7870
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC_EVIL(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_ArabellaPowers_Arabella:f9e5c5d7-a5b1-20e0-0501-7ee576fa7870
msgctxt "hd179e2f7g7127g4999gab41g58b2d1712269"
msgid "Pain and loss only make you stronger, child. Embrace it."
msgstr "고통과 상실만이 너를 강하게 만들어준단다, 얘야. 받아들여라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_ArabellaPowers_Arabella
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fc58c71b-81a3-142f-2b67-1820e3885389
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - TWN_ArabellasPowers_State_ParentsFoundDead = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC(1) = True
#.      - CLERIC_KELEMVOR(1) = False
#.      - CLERIC_EVIL(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_ArabellaPowers_Arabella:fc58c71b-81a3-142f-2b67-1820e3885389
msgctxt "hfbfa4af9g49eeg441fg8d99gf7f8d7dac8c2"
msgid "They're with the gods now, Arabella. I'm sorry."
msgstr "너희 부모님은 하늘 나라로 가셨어, 아라벨라. 유감이구나."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_ArabellaPowers_Arabella
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ffaf3193-4a3a-a38c-e69b-62cabae2103d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_ArabellaPowers_Arabella:ffaf3193-4a3a-a38c-e69b-62cabae2103d
msgctxt "hd028ba06geb31g4b6dg8fa1g40e2ccb2eb4d"
msgid "You've been so strong. They'd be so proud of you."
msgstr "넌 강해지고 있어, 아라벨라. 분명 자랑스러워 하실 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_ArabellaPowers_PAD_ArabellaLeftLetter
