msgctxt "h11bc8486gbc79g4b94ga809g00c57ab1fe7d"
msgid "Arabella's gone to the city, then. We may yet see her again."
msgstr "아라벨라가 도시로 떠났어. 곧 다시 만날 수 있을 지도..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_ArabellaPowers_PAD_ArabellaLeftLetter
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ca86eaf7-2445-4f44-9ec6-a737c534dd23
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_ArabellaPowers_PAD_ArabellaLeftLetter:ca86eaf7-2445-4f44-9ec6-a737c534dd23
msgctxt "h013d2d3cg2095g4c98g92afgf680380b962a"
msgid ""
"Arabella's gone, then. Even with those talents of hers, there's no guarantee "
"she'll survive..."
msgstr "꼬맹이가 가버렸군, 그래. 녀석이 대단한 능력을 갖고 있어도, 살아남을 거란 보장은 없지..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_ArabellaPowers_PAD_ArabellaLeftLetter
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ca86eaf7-2445-4f44-9ec6-a737c534dd23
