msgctxt "hdb1cdd22gd6b6g4795gbb83g4f4119b35aa8"
msgid ""
"You must have seen your share of horrors in Avernus. Tell me, does the fang-"
"toothed dopplerback have three spikes or four?"
msgstr "그렇다면 직접 그 공포스러운 아베르누스를 목격하고 왔겠군. 말 해보게, 송곳이빨 도플러백은 가시가 세개 나있던가 네개 나있던가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Courier_Dog
