msgctxt "h5af375aag0266g4a38gbfc7gf1a4ef5f132b"
msgid ""
"I don't know. Maybe you can tell me. "
"([CAMP_Courier_Dog_FetchedItemDescription_50004d01-651b-a7ea-308a-"
"451a9571cb85])"
msgstr ""
"나도 모르겠어. 네가 알려줘. ([CAMP_Courier_Dog_FetchedItemDescription_50004d01-651b-"
"a7ea-308a-451a9571cb85])"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Courier_Dog
