msgid ""
"I heard you and the owlbear cub in the night - I thought something might've "
"happened to you."
msgstr "밤중에 너와 아울베어 새끼가 내는 소리가 들리던데, 뭔가 잘못된 건 아닌가 했어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Courier_Dog
