msgctxt "hf12c8310g7867g450cg9769g214675f19e8f"
msgid "*The dog pants through a ball held firmly in his mouth.*"
msgstr "*개가 입에 공을 꽉 문 채 헉헉거립니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Courier_Dog
#. Speaker = Scratch
#. NodeID = 5f8c8dc6-b012-cc11-fe03-3ece2f1231ee
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - WYR_Posthouse_State_PlayerReclaimedDog = True
#.      - CAMP_Courier_Dog_State_TalkedAboutPosthouseKennels = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - PETPAL(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Courier_Dog:5f8c8dc6-b012-cc11-fe03-3ece2f1231ee
msgctxt "h347e89e7g53a5g48acg9b43gd4e3dbfc232b"
msgid "It's certainly good to be back at camp! How I've missed the smells."
msgstr "야영지로 돌아오니 정말 좋아! 이 냄새가 얼마나 그리웠는지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Courier_Dog
#. Speaker = Scratch
#. NodeID = 663d52a8-9ded-6ce6-17b8-c44f4a932841
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Courier_Dog:663d52a8-9ded-6ce6-17b8-c44f4a932841
msgctxt "hf52d97fdgffe9g4574gbbb4g1edc8a63554d"
msgid ""
"I stay with him and keep him company when he's scared. He'll settle down, in "
"time."
msgstr "그가 겁에 질려 있을 때 난 그의 곁에 있어 주고 말동무가 되어줘. 시간이 지나면 안정될 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Courier_Dog
#. Speaker = Scratch
#. NodeID = 70312fde-a116-9b8e-a87f-27a16edfe3ed
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - PETPAL(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CAMP_Courier_Dog_State_TalkedAboutDeadOwlBearCub = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Courier_Dog:70312fde-a116-9b8e-a87f-27a16edfe3ed
msgctxt "h520cb1d2g2994g4ab1ga61agdafe467a37bd"
msgid "Thank you. I needed that."
msgstr "고마워. 내게 필요했던 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Courier_Dog
