msgctxt "h2ebfb259ga1eag4dedg9698gc2341d2ce446"
msgid "But if you feel like throwing it - I wouldn't mind that at all."
msgstr "하지만 네가 그걸 던지고 싶다면, 난 전혀 상관없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Courier_Dog
