msgctxt "h42a7dd56g7d99g4b28gb812g4b176ab5c5c7"
msgid ""
"*He gives in and surrenders his find to you.* "
"([CAMP_Courier_Dog_FetchedItemDescription_50004d01-651b-a7ea-308a-"
"451a9571cb85])"
msgstr ""
"*녀석이 포기하고 발견한 것을 당신에게 넘깁니다.* "
"([CAMP_Courier_Dog_FetchedItemDescription_50004d01-651b-a7ea-308a-"
"451a9571cb85])"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Courier_Dog
#. Speaker = Narrator
