#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Courier_Dog:9eff5eb8-b6b4-afc1-91f0-fc198e13b099
msgctxt "hacda3520gc4c0g463fga299g002e6a2336f1"
msgid ""
"Indeed. And I'm sure Dringo will do a great job - he always took good care "
"of me."
msgstr "물론이지. 드링고가 해낼 거라고 확신해 - 항상 날 보살펴줬거든."

