msgctxt "h499a628fg553fg432dg846fg769c9251af30"
msgid "Master, friend... I stayed with him until... until I knew he was gone."
msgstr "주인, 친구... 그의 곁에 머물렀어... 그가 죽었다는 걸 깨닫게 되었을 때까지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Courier_Dog
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d8f59d57-9635-095c-6dfc-bd0207bda0ad
