msgctxt "ha09bae0fgbf82g4f19g893eg3360c83f0a55"
msgid "Here's the gold."
msgstr "돈은 여기 있습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0e0e30e0-d56d-2620-25c4-4d763d2c4952
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_Jergal_AskedAboutHelp(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal:0e0e30e0-d56d-2620-25c4-4d763d2c4952
msgctxt "hf343481bgd0d5g4f52g936dgb97fa741edee"
msgid "Care to explain why you're helping me?"
msgstr "왜 나를 돕는 건지 설명 좀 해주겠어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0ed7604d-6330-0107-ede7-78666ed2081d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   User:
#.      - CAMP_Jergal_AskedAboutServices(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal:0ed7604d-6330-0107-ede7-78666ed2081d
msgctxt "h8fa26e27ga0dbg4767g916fga3a747989592"
msgid "What kind of services can a skeleton offer?"
msgstr "해골이 대체 무슨 도움을 줄 수 있단 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1076776d-2795-b3c5-c841-f3650594d20d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal:1076776d-2795-b3c5-c841-f3650594d20d
msgctxt "h4400c2fegaac9g4f5dga579g51ac4d127db2"
msgid "Sorry. I was a bit quick on the draw there."
msgstr "미안해. 내가 좀 성급하게 굴었군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal
#. Speaker = Withers
#. NodeID = 109bd887-906f-acdd-7784-b67e8c3ef0d9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CHA_Jergal_HasMet(1) = True
#.      - CAMP_Jergal_HasMet(1) = True
#.   User:
#.      - CAMP_Jergal_AskedAboutServices(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal:109bd887-906f-acdd-7784-b67e8c3ef0d9
msgctxt "hd8ceb401g2f1bg4fe6g9db6g8787f019ae2c"
msgid "Fate spins along as it should. Have you need of my services?"
msgstr "운명은 순리대로 흘러가는구나. 그대는 나의 봉사를 필요로 하는가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal
#. Speaker = Withers
#. NodeID = 1226ae23-57a1-28e8-e365-693d536bc524
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal:1226ae23-57a1-28e8-e365-693d536bc524
msgctxt "hff532dfbgf70cg4303g97e7g49b236ff3bb9"
msgid ""
"Should thou or any of thy compatriots perish, I will cleave soul to body "
"once more."
msgstr "그대나 그대의 동료가 사망하는 일이 생기면, 내가 육신에 영혼을 다시 결합해 줄 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1452bd9b-3de9-d991-21e5-59103fbcdf11
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal:1452bd9b-3de9-d991-21e5-59103fbcdf11
msgctxt "h218d213cg385fg4d53g86b2gb74de16b921f"
msgid "All that power - are you a god's Chosen?"
msgstr "이 막강한 힘... 당신은 신에게 선택받은 자인가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 14793a5f-7c64-81ce-1158-68bb3eee4a37
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
