msgctxt "hcb37aacfg0401g4badgbe53ga3989dfc4348"
msgid "Here's the gold."
msgstr "돈은 여기 있습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal
#. Speaker = Withers
#. NodeID = 3784a2bc-40af-3a46-8090-206a139f5e52
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CAMP_Jergal_AskedAboutHelp(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal:3784a2bc-40af-3a46-8090-206a139f5e52
msgctxt "h401bfa65gcf6bg4412ga1ddgbb3aa565caa6"
msgid "Be assured it is not by choice."
msgstr "내 의지는 아니란 건 분명히 해 두마."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 38f0a1fb-ce9a-b2af-dac8-49e3ac1102a5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_State_DatingShadowheart(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal:38f0a1fb-ce9a-b2af-dac8-49e3ac1102a5
msgctxt "h30be3494gaceeg4ac5g8837g7fb80a9bf681"
msgid ""
"You mean Shadowheart...? Gods, I <i>wish </i>she were my 'bosom-companion'."
msgstr "섀도하트 말씀하시는 거예요...? 참나, 저도 그녀와 '육체적인 쾌락'을 나눌 관계였으면 <i>좋겠네요.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal
#. Speaker = Withers
#. NodeID = 391457a0-406e-af6a-1dc0-2a55f05b98fa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_Gale_Event_ResurrectedByElminster = True
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_Jergal_State_ElminsterDebtSettled(0) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CAMP_Jergal_AttackedJergal(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal:391457a0-406e-af6a-1dc0-2a55f05b98fa
msgctxt "hc52d9ea1g67d4g45b9gbf1cgef1be560c4ac"
msgid "You are indebted to Elminster Aumar. I shall accept coin on his behalf."
msgstr "너는 엘민스터 오마르에게 빚이 있구나. 그를 대신해서 동전을 받아주도록 하마."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal
#. Speaker = Withers
#. NodeID = 3a79e8a8-9ca6-9652-640b-79d36cad4d83
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_Jergal_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal:3a79e8a8-9ca6-9652-640b-79d36cad4d83
msgctxt "h7aa8430agd4a7g4425g9a50g4213c022d557"
msgid "Ah, another. Thy name has been recorded."
msgstr "아, 또 다른 이군. 그대의 이름은 기록됐노라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal
#. Speaker = Withers
#. NodeID = 3ab96fb6-b13c-2f34-d7c0-d528fd1a6547
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GEN_MaxPlayerCountReached = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - AVATAR(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - Hirelings_Event_StartCC(1) = True
#.     - GEN_TransferNPCPayment_3(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal:3ab96fb6-b13c-2f34-d7c0-d528fd1a6547
msgctxt "h147e5b43g4a49g4d4dga398g74fe4f19796b"
msgid "Choose."
msgstr "고르거라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3b44f170-4324-d43e-3704-c9e98dff64de
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal:3b44f170-4324-d43e-3704-c9e98dff64de
msgctxt "hdb6597a5gbc24g4ecbg8cd2g504cba93ccc5"
msgid "I'm more than capable of doing both."
msgstr "전 그 이상도 동시에 할 수 있어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal
#. Speaker = Withers
#. NodeID = 3c4aba4f-a840-f23c-abab-be733dfcd954
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal:3c4aba4f-a840-f23c-abab-be733dfcd954
msgctxt "h3af0e8b8ga956g4754gb297g515597818754"
msgid "No. Thy coinpurse is near empty."
msgstr "안된다. 그대의 지갑이 거의 바닥나 있구나."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal
#. Speaker = Withers
#. NodeID = 3cd52aa8-7286-850a-6e9b-d34afb6d898b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal:3cd52aa8-7286-850a-6e9b-d34afb6d898b
msgctxt "h70f7cb20gaec5g4bc0g9ba5g74c78a7f8f50"
msgid ""
"A matter of coin. ([GEN_CheckMagicPocketGold_6057ad05-9492-4630-9f0a-"
"be548b134c54])"
msgstr ""
"몇 푼의 금전이지. ([GEN_CheckMagicPocketGold_6057ad05-9492-4630-9f0a-be548b134c54])"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal
#. Speaker = Withers
#. NodeID = 3e088d2f-7958-795a-7580-07cd7f499d02
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - Hirelings_State_InCamp_1 = False
#.      - Hirelings_State_InCamp_3 = True
#.      - Hirelings_State_InCamp_2 = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal:3e088d2f-7958-795a-7580-07cd7f499d02
msgctxt "h6eb316afg24e1g426cgacb3g02dad88efe4f"
msgid "All three of thy hirelings wait in thy camp."
msgstr "그대가 고용한 세 명 모두 그대의 야영지에서 기다리고 있다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 40edd3a2-6ed3-fbed-16f5-8050bcc8dbf9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal:40edd3a2-6ed3-fbed-16f5-8050bcc8dbf9
msgctxt "h70ca0dbdgeb9bg475eg8b6fg2fa071cda1fc"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 413136d9-1d10-db53-2275-ad769e04ece0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal:413136d9-1d10-db53-2275-ad769e04ece0
msgctxt "h622f9350g7048g4531g9995g99ba0a5dddc5"
msgid "And look very ugly doing it."
msgstr "해골이 그래준다니 엄청 흉해 보이는걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 42138669-1f46-4e48-59e3-66920ef1b9f1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CAMP_Jergal_Knows_AskedAboutCrypt = False
#.   Quest:
#.      - CHA_Chapel.ReadSarcophagusPlaque(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal:42138669-1f46-4e48-59e3-66920ef1b9f1
msgctxt "ha0b64544g5960g4abag9617g24c70a9bfb1c"
msgid ""
"I found in a plaque in a Chapel about a 'Guardian of Tombs'. Is that you?"
msgstr "예배당에서 '무덤의 수호자'라는 명판을 봤어요. 그게 당신인가요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal
#. Speaker = Withers
#. NodeID = 43bb5aa0-b884-9837-af76-69d3e2c50ca9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal:43bb5aa0-b884-9837-af76-69d3e2c50ca9
msgctxt "h84160f7fg2ecbg4153g913bgfe8302106316"
msgid ""
"Love is no domain of mine. But it is often cited as the purpose of mortal "
"life. Wherefore turnst thou from it?"
msgstr "사랑은 내가 관장하는 영역이 아니지. 그러나 사랑은 필멸의 삶의 목적이라고들 하거늘. 어째서 그대는 도망치는가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 442e044d-c0c3-17b2-09f7-2311ab320c20
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CAMP_Jergal_State_CanResurrect_DismissedAvatar2 = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal:442e044d-c0c3-17b2-09f7-2311ab320c20
msgctxt "h84564579g3973g4e65g9b4cgbf828cf6c86f"
msgid ""
"I'd like you to return "
"[CAMP_Jergal_DismissedAvatarToResurrect_2_ab7994b8-7f12-6bf1-0c9b-"
"d8ed4d3432ac]."
msgstr ""
"[CAMP_Jergal_DismissedAvatarToResurrect_2_ab7994b8-7f12-6bf1-0c9b-"
"d8ed4d3432ac]을(를) 되살려주세요."

