msgid "Here's the gold."
msgstr "돈은 여기 있습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal
#. Speaker = Withers
#. NodeID = 4be5320f-3d3b-8c86-1359-dd321f9b0b48
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal:4be5320f-3d3b-8c86-1359-dd321f9b0b48
msgctxt "h030fca04g8ddcg44a0gb8e7gd27b9e0c06b6"
msgid "No, although Kelemvor chose well to bless one such as yourself."
msgstr "아니다. 그래도 안목을 보니 켈렘보르가 은총을 베풀 이를 제법 잘 골랐군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4bf6f31d-ea24-9f69-aef1-5a1480c475f2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CAMP_Jergal_Knows_AskedAboutCrypt = False
#.   Quest:
#.      - CHA_Chapel.ReadSarcophagusPlaque(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal:4bf6f31d-ea24-9f69-aef1-5a1480c475f2
msgctxt "h92e7a267g6b78g416bgad82gd18e0a10a253"
msgid ""
"I found a plaque in a crypt about a 'Guardian of Tombs'. Is that where you "
"came from?"
msgstr "묘실에서 '무덤의 수호자'라는 명판을 본 적 있어. 당신 혹시 거기서 나온 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal
#. Speaker = Withers
#. NodeID = 4c432e13-9301-f214-5890-977ae4dfab06
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   User:
#.     - CAMP_Jergal_AskedAboutServices(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal:4c432e13-9301-f214-5890-977ae4dfab06
msgctxt "h79eff01cgd24bg48ceg9bd5g9ecbd42baab1"
msgid "A mending of the threads between life and death."
msgstr "삶과 죽음 사이의 실타래를 다시금 이어주는 거지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal
#. Speaker = Withers
#. NodeID = 4cb753cc-534b-3ce3-1366-86b68816d867
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal:4cb753cc-534b-3ce3-1366-86b68816d867
msgctxt "hd8c52815gb1dcg4e69g9b53g53f79b3f788c"
msgid ""
"Suspicion always haunts the guilty mind. My services are all that I can "
"proffer thee. What thou wilt do with them is for thee to undertake."
msgstr "죄지은 게 있는 자는 늘 의심에 시달리지. 난 그대에게 도움을 제공하는 것일 뿐. 그자들을 어찌 쓸지는 오롯이 그대의 몫이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal
#. Speaker = Withers
#. NodeID = 500c9078-8c68-827f-5778-8c64ed143fcf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal:500c9078-8c68-827f-5778-8c64ed143fcf
msgctxt "h788890fdgfb2ag4af7g8db6g7f1170cf4b76"
msgid "I am not. Myrkul and I walk very different paths."
msgstr "그렇지 않다. 머큘과 나는 걷는 길이 무척 다르다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 55ecd3e5-31ec-cc98-3bfd-337451edf01c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal:55ecd3e5-31ec-cc98-3bfd-337451edf01c
msgctxt "h53d88850ge536g465ag9012gfea65ad1e3f6"
msgid "'Less worthy still'? More riddles from my resident jester."
msgstr "'오히려 부족하고'? 우리 상주 재담꾼이 또 수수께끼를 늘어놓는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 56864911-a22c-ea75-e7cd-e4c3bcf90513
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal:56864911-a22c-ea75-e7cd-e4c3bcf90513
msgctxt "h902555b2g3f2ag40f2gb44cg47111aa88032"
msgid "You are... incredibly annoying."
msgstr "당신... 엄청나게 짜증나네."

