msgid ""
"Only then canst their empty forms be preserved - neatly stored in mine "
"wardrobe til thou hast need of them. "
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal
#. Speaker = Withers
