msgid "<i>Excuse </i>me?"
msgstr "<i>뭐라고 </i>하셨죠?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal
#. Speaker = Withers
#. NodeID = 652dfca7-ce2e-59a6-e22e-c77ea43b308f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CAMP_Jergal_AskedAboutCalling(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal:652dfca7-ce2e-59a6-e22e-c77ea43b308f
msgctxt "h7b862e3fg94f1g4687g9978g8deb47d86c06"
msgid "Because it is my calling. There is little else to explain."
msgstr "그게 내 소명이기 때문이지. 그 외엔 달리 설명할 길이 없노라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 654f172e-40ff-8a4d-3d4f-aeb9d25d81d0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CAMP_Jergal_State_CanResurrectWyll = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal:654f172e-40ff-8a4d-3d4f-aeb9d25d81d0
msgctxt "h1b937beagf72ag41beg94b4g628199addcc6"
msgid "I'd like you to return Wyll."
msgstr "윌을 되살려주세요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 685cee4d-cd54-8f78-3bb8-0638dbca0620
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_DarkUrge_State_SparedIsobelWithShadowheart = True
#.      - ORI_DarkUrge_Event_KillFavouriteCharacter = True
#.      - ORI_DarkUrge_Event_AskedJergalAboutCompanionResurrection = False
#.      - NIGHT_DarkUrge_SparedIsobel = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal:685cee4d-cd54-8f78-3bb8-0638dbca0620
msgctxt "h9b943d41g0c76g4ee3gb5a8g018d618956be"
msgid "Please bring back Shadowheart. I can't live with what I did."
msgstr "섀도하트를 되살려 주세요. 이렇게 살 순 없어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6a1fbe26-56a3-5885-25a2-1361bf252e5e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal:6a1fbe26-56a3-5885-25a2-1361bf252e5e
msgctxt "hcef9e18bgff1ag48degae7dg76c544f85dae"
msgid "Please - as if anyone here deserves me."
msgstr "무슨, 제 수준에 맞는 사람이 있어야 말이죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal
#. Speaker = Withers
#. NodeID = 6a2d38e8-6180-71c6-f799-b2c7981049ac
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - Hirelings_State_Hired_3 = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal:6a2d38e8-6180-71c6-f799-b2c7981049ac
msgctxt "h9c8908cagb68eg4b44ga300g50318a72888c"
msgid "Thou hast reached thy limit."
msgstr "그대 한계에 다다랐다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal
#. Speaker = Withers
#. NodeID = 6a579b02-71a1-c71e-1b45-b29bd83b37f2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal:6a579b02-71a1-c71e-1b45-b29bd83b37f2
msgctxt "h422d8f28g12b9g4e05g8330g57cf1405562f"
msgid ""
"Their soul is in a place even I cannot peer into. A place no soul should "
"venture."
msgstr "그들의 영혼은 나조차도 들여다 볼 수 없는 곳에 있구나. 어떤 영혼이라도 발을 들여선 안되는 곳이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal
#. Speaker = Withers
#. NodeID = 6a72e6ef-ad68-9e13-6759-2244db7de20a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal:6a72e6ef-ad68-9e13-6759-2244db7de20a
msgctxt "h12b100d7g9201g41dagb697gdd5a995b77f4"
msgid "Then I shall wait here patiently until it is acquired."
msgstr "그럼 그 돈이 마련될 때까지 진득이 기다릴 뿐이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal
#. Speaker = Withers
#. NodeID = 6ae0950f-178a-91fe-4a71-169b1b4afe2d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_Jergal_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal:6ae0950f-178a-91fe-4a71-169b1b4afe2d
msgctxt "h64f62e1bg91f5g4762gbc20g22dec406b296"
msgid "Fate spins along as it should."
msgstr "운명이 순리대로 흘러가는구나."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6b0a7085-60e0-ed4a-7b40-f7429e89160f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CAMP_Jergal_Knows_AskedAboutCrypt = False
#.   Quest:
#.      - CHA_Chapel.ReadSarcophagusPlaque(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal:6b0a7085-60e0-ed4a-7b40-f7429e89160f
msgctxt "h193d399eg2593g4b77gaac7gb34872156006"
msgid ""
"I found a plaque in a crypt about a 'Guardian of Tombs'. Is that where you "
"came from?"
msgstr "묘실에서 '무덤의 수호자'라는 명판을 본 적 있어요. 당신 혹시 거기서 나왔나요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal
#. Speaker = Withers
#. NodeID = 6c4137fb-ba57-734a-9193-237bb1ec6838
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal:6c4137fb-ba57-734a-9193-237bb1ec6838
msgctxt "h7bfc52b2g6e80g42ccg8bcfga6bf6ba11dc5"
msgid ""
"For a mere pittance of coin, I might summon the worthiest among them to lend "
"aid to thy undertaking."
msgstr "약간의 동전만 내어주면, 그중 가장 가치 있는 자를 소환해 그대의 임무를 돕게 해줄 수도 있다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6c7fcbd4-dd0d-5697-5af3-a5de627f3a58
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CAMP_Jergal_State_CanResurrectHalsin = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal:6c7fcbd4-dd0d-5697-5af3-a5de627f3a58
msgctxt "h3f4a0265g9f43g4511gaaccgd5b9f3d09eb4"
msgid "I'd like you to return Halsin."
msgstr "할신을 되살려주세요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal
#. Speaker = Withers
#. NodeID = 6edc54b8-7498-6bc0-49ca-38be71045e31
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CAMP_Jergal_Knows_AskedAboutCrypt = True
#.   Quest:
#.     - CHA_Chapel.ConnectedSarcophagusJergal(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal:6edc54b8-7498-6bc0-49ca-38be71045e31
msgctxt "h47c90b1eg9ef7g4676gb33egbc5421a41e88"
msgid "That is where I was... housed, yes. And thou needst not know why."
msgstr "바로 그곳에서 내가... 거처했지. 맞다. 그 이유는 그대가 알 필요 없느니라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal
#. Speaker = Withers
#. NodeID = 6f403567-343f-2625-dcc5-588a78b8269d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal:6f403567-343f-2625-dcc5-588a78b8269d
msgctxt "hf60d9784g0e31g4349g8e70g1761b2fc75ca"
msgid ""
"I shall be here in thy camp, for whenever thou hast need of my services."
msgstr "내 도움이 필요해질 때를 대비해, 그대의 야영지에 머무르도록 하겠다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal
#. Speaker = Withers
#. NodeID = 6fca31c0-e1b8-382f-0b3d-19a3fc535e8a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal:6fca31c0-e1b8-382f-0b3d-19a3fc535e8a
msgctxt "h2c41837ag2918g44bbg92d1ge302e327d571"
msgid "Hast thou other business?"
msgstr "다른 볼일이 있는가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6fe495df-9f34-1496-d2ce-1802f1d6aa10
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_State_DatingWithWyll(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal:6fe495df-9f34-1496-d2ce-1802f1d6aa10
msgctxt "hfdfe2bbdg771bg44aag9da9geaf556c9d80d"
msgid "I kiss Wyll <i>once </i>and I get a lecture from a pile of bones!"
msgstr "딱 <i>한 번 </i>윌한테 키스 했을 뿐인데 해골 바가지한테 설교를 듣다니!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 70703204-d6ad-fdc2-2395-7c605ce85927
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal:70703204-d6ad-fdc2-2395-7c605ce85927
msgctxt "h394272e9ge15cg4c61gbadege5b551243228"
msgid ""
"What if I don't have that kind of gold right now? "
"([GEN_CheckMagicPocketGold_6057ad05-9492-4630-9f0a-be548b134c54])"
msgstr ""
"그만큼의 골드가 없다면? ([GEN_CheckMagicPocketGold_6057ad05-9492-4630-9f0a-"
"be548b134c54])"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 71a76e04-50fb-40c2-6c34-8561431b3624
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   User:
#.      - CAMP_Jergal_Event_AskedWhatAreYou(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   User:
#.     - CAMP_Jergal_Event_AskedWhatAreYou(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal:71a76e04-50fb-40c2-6c34-8561431b3624
msgctxt "hda559f74g446ag445eg99edg1750208f9a8c"
msgid "Not to be rude, but what <i>are</i> you?"
msgstr "무례하게 굴려는 건 아니지만, 당신은 대체 <i>뭐</i>야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 736e3b96-ad56-bf81-eb7e-96968947426e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CAMP_Jergal_Event_ResurrectedSomeoneOnce = False
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_CheckPocketGold = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CAMP_Jergal_Event_ResurrectedSomeoneOnce = True
#.     - CAMP_Jergal_State_WillResurrect_Hireling1 = True
#.   Object:
#.     - GEN_TransferNPCPayment(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal:736e3b96-ad56-bf81-eb7e-96968947426e
msgctxt "h66c39152g1b8eg467bgba2cgcce64c228f9d"
msgid "Here's the gold."
msgstr "돈은 여기 있습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 73b930cc-c95a-5252-a3f4-9b0e26282b1a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal:73b930cc-c95a-5252-a3f4-9b0e26282b1a
msgctxt "hdaf3b6d8g833dg4a4egaa91g27a0297b25b7"
msgid "<i>Attack.</i>"
msgstr "<i>공격한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal
#. Speaker = Withers
#. NodeID = 73c6f1a9-3b82-4c6f-1808-fccba31bf23c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - ORI_DarkUrge_Event_AskedJergalAboutMurderOfAlfira = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal:73c6f1a9-3b82-4c6f-1808-fccba31bf23c
msgctxt "hb8c2fe05g394ag48a5gbc12g51158bf0e4b4"
msgid "The bard's death is a weight for thine own conscience to bear."
msgstr "바드의 죽음은 그대의 양심이 감당해야 할 무게다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 74a30c4f-3bfa-83b8-b0cf-ce0d33a2dad2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal:74a30c4f-3bfa-83b8-b0cf-ce0d33a2dad2
msgctxt "h56624250gb4a1g4ba1g84f1g3609d3b64fac"
msgid "Actually, never mind."
msgstr "흠, 신경 쓰지 마세요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 764d16e0-3d0d-ea0e-6dee-5140546fcce9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal:764d16e0-3d0d-ea0e-6dee-5140546fcce9
msgctxt "hb0c46b8cgfe0ag41deg9456g7617607c3cf5"
msgid "I don't want a partner."
msgstr "난 파트너를 원하지 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal
#. Speaker = Withers
#. NodeID = 7662db50-08c2-ddc3-40c0-60d3cea76e05
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - Hirelings_State_FeatureAvailable = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal:7662db50-08c2-ddc3-40c0-60d3cea76e05
msgctxt "h042873d6g728ag4c1agbb40gb99ce2fc9747"
msgid "Dost thou require a new ally? Or mayhaps a resurrection, instead?"
msgstr "그대는 새 아군이 필요한가? 어쩌면 부활이 필요한 것이려나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal
#. Speaker = Withers
#. NodeID = 7bd3fced-32b5-371e-2a12-4966b54c979e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal:7bd3fced-32b5-371e-2a12-4966b54c979e
msgctxt "ha3e5e9dcg893fg4e3agafdcg967246c18aca"
msgid "She left behind a letter, as thou doth know."
msgstr "그대가 알다시피 그녀는 편지를 남겼다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal
#. Speaker = Withers
#. NodeID = 7c06710b-ae52-7370-419b-c44877965eb9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - AVATAR(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal:7c06710b-ae52-7370-419b-c44877965eb9
msgctxt "hd9b473afg73bcg49b8gb1b9gf11d99e1f819"
msgid "Choose."
msgstr "선택해라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal
