msgstr "민타라를 되살려주세요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = eb1efa06-f928-b460-e40f-ff8f1e318a0f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CAMP_Jergal_State_PartyMemberDead = True
#.      - CAMP_Jergal_State_ResurrectionServicesUnlocked = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal:eb1efa06-f928-b460-e40f-ff8f1e318a0f
msgctxt "h1954ba13g793fg4a4cga1e1g2bba783c5af1"
msgid "I would like to resurrect someone."
msgstr "부활시키고 싶은 사람이 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ef62cafa-6522-aa4f-8cf6-d3b7e66b4fbe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal:ef62cafa-6522-aa4f-8cf6-d3b7e66b4fbe
msgctxt "h03e06747g7253g47b0g9c45g1bf25823ae15"
msgid "No one piqued my interest."
msgstr "아무에게도 흥미가 없네요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = efcc1ae9-d224-d04c-92fb-5e65091806d4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal:efcc1ae9-d224-d04c-92fb-5e65091806d4
msgctxt "h6e29ab57gdc48g453eg8f47g0ad111e223cd"
msgid ""
"The closer you get to someone, the easier it is for them to stab you in the "
"back."
msgstr "누군가와 가까워질수록, 등 뒤에서 칼을 맞기 쉬워지는 법이죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f3f8cb80-3472-b1d8-6200-77bd4be13283
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_State_DatingLaezel(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal:f3f8cb80-3472-b1d8-6200-77bd4be13283
msgctxt "h7bd417a5g2870g4430gbc6cg0dbdb6eefdf1"
msgid "Lae'zel would never allow herself to be distracted from her mission."
msgstr "레이젤이 임무를 소홀히 하는 일은 없을 겁니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f4e97860-3523-2bce-79aa-df8e7dd425c5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - Hirelings_State_ShowIntro = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal:f4e97860-3523-2bce-79aa-df8e7dd425c5
msgctxt "h1617aba7g6b84g489fgaa14g573630d53d04"
msgid "What other services do you provide?"
msgstr "당신이 제공하는도움에 또 어떤게 있죠?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal
#. Speaker = Withers
#. NodeID = f5e789fc-3425-c033-c1ed-df16b3cd0366
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal:f5e789fc-3425-c033-c1ed-df16b3cd0366
msgctxt "he73216d0ge46fg4b25gb864gad5954cc9d73"
msgid "Amusing."
msgstr "참 웃기구나."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f5e98d10-a28a-1da7-75a2-2b113dd1e255
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - LAEZEL_ORPHEUSPATH(1) = False
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal:f5e98d10-a28a-1da7-75a2-2b113dd1e255
msgctxt "h1ecfeda5gd423g4ad9g90f4g3d4beb56ad8f"
msgid "This 'love' is against my queen's creed."
msgstr "이 '사랑'이란 것은 나의 여왕의 신조에 위배됩니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Jergal
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f668579f-0e68-a152-777c-e921453bd297
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CAMP_Jergal_Event_ResurrectedSomeoneOnce = True
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_CheckPocketGold = True
#. SetFlags:
