msgid "Oh no, this is Shadowheart's business. I am not getting involved."
msgstr "아니, 이건 섀도하트의 일이니까. 끼어들지 않을래."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_NightsongShadowheartVisit_PAD_NotShadowheart
