msgstr "판단의 착오라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = 0c9ac8d3-3297-7121-8221-60665d3e587e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:0c9ac8d3-3297-7121-8221-60665d3e587e
msgctxt "h7a180096g7205g43b5gb203g0a6a0d24d078"
msgid "A silent betrayal."
msgstr "과묵한 배반이라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0f413cef-9142-b5ed-67be-ab1e4931b9be
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:0f413cef-9142-b5ed-67be-ab1e4931b9be
msgctxt "h7e3c16aag348bg4ac5g95c3g4c05655788b5"
msgid "Who are you?"
msgstr "당신은 누구지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 14d0ac96-8381-e7e4-07c0-e97e82577e08
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:14d0ac96-8381-e7e4-07c0-e97e82577e08
msgctxt "hb98e948ag379bg4266ga7b1g29ce1acebb87"
msgid "I can't afford it. Isn't there some other way?"
msgstr "나는 그만한 돈이 없어. 다른 방법이 없을까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = 14d2e1e8-bafa-e7d3-b64c-e593148125c1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:14d2e1e8-bafa-e7d3-b64c-e593148125c1
msgctxt "h629b7d3cg4c32g4535gb6fegf8fc1346ca91"
msgid ""
"But you have fallen, and it seems you do not fully comprehend the reason why."
msgstr "그럼에도 그대는 타락했고, 여전히 그 이유를 제대로 이해하지 못하는 것 같구나."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = 18595ef5-40cf-e057-fc37-b86bfd94686c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:18595ef5-40cf-e057-fc37-b86bfd94686c
msgctxt "hc8958b98gad60g4b8cg85c3g079e1a003f78"
msgid "This is the cost of your transgression."
msgstr "이건 너의 배반에 따른 대가다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = 18abe0c2-4789-a61c-4ec5-1a33262d8481
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:18abe0c2-4789-a61c-4ec5-1a33262d8481
msgctxt "hbd5b2e04ga5b7g43e7g9012g2ebc22d7367c"
msgid "It is possible."
msgstr "가능해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = 18c76dde-ce02-6ad6-a4d3-e2ac63b1da18
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:18c76dde-ce02-6ad6-a4d3-e2ac63b1da18
msgctxt "h0846a12ag6dc0g4b69ga8d2g25bb0ff0fea0"
msgid ""
"When I finally saw the truth, he would not be reasoned with. So I ended him. "
"For this, I was called 'Oathbreaker'."
msgstr ""
"그러다 마침내 진실을 목도했을 때, 영주는 이미 이성을 잃은 상태였다. 그래서 직접 그의 삶을 끝냈다. 이로 인해 나는 '맹세파기자'로 "
"불리게 되었다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = 1acd80e3-d5cd-e8a9-f4ca-0f82521859af
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_OathbreakerKnight_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Local:
#.      - 99637390-c2b7-e01a-c8fb-361a7e36e384_B = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - OATHBREAKER(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 99637390-c2b7-e01a-c8fb-361a7e36e384_B = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:1acd80e3-d5cd-e8a9-f4ca-0f82521859af
msgctxt "h0a2ccd4bge7edg4445ga224g133339b60eb0"
msgid "Speak, oathbreaker."
msgstr "말하거라, 맹세파기자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1bc323c7-83c7-d9ef-745e-8cc1335d00cd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - NIGHT_DarkUrge_Bloodwedding = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:1bc323c7-83c7-d9ef-745e-8cc1335d00cd
msgctxt "h1a1f41e4gd55bg4552gb255g862f10abc73f"
msgid "I'm a child of <i>Bhaal</i> - how could I ever have become a paladin?"
msgstr "나는 <i>바알</i>의 핏줄이다 - 이런 내가 어떻게 팔라딘이 될 수 있었지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = 1cc5bcc0-0775-5c32-60c3-e220366dce1d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:1cc5bcc0-0775-5c32-60c3-e220366dce1d
msgctxt "h61530a08g7122g4a7dg9413gc99452db5aba"
msgid "Newfound wisdom. A sense of clarity."
msgstr "지혜의 재발견이라. 경지에 이르렀군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1de7c08a-cd6f-28ae-e625-880384b4a80d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_PaladinOathbreaker_State_AboutToBecomeOathbreaker(1) = True
#.      - GLO_PaladinOathbreaker_State_HasBeenOathbreakerOnce(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_PaladinOathbreaker_Event_BecomesOathbreakerAfterDialog(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:1de7c08a-cd6f-28ae-e625-880384b4a80d
msgctxt "h05c7ab91g03afg4da3g9c75gd3760474a448"
msgid "I will become an oathbreaker once more."
msgstr "다시 한 번 맹세파기자가 되겠다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1fb3bfc6-d01d-74e2-94d3-625c61cb5e03
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:1fb3bfc6-d01d-74e2-94d3-625c61cb5e03
msgctxt "h419b8d4bg4ef8g4f11gbdefg0f7c83c306c1"
msgid "That was a brave decision. It can't have been easy."
msgstr "용감한 결정이었네. 쉽지 않았을 텐데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = 23f80c45-f54c-b607-aa2b-4beeea9e611b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:23f80c45-f54c-b607-aa2b-4beeea9e611b
msgctxt "he4044555gf2a1g4007g820bg3e5340e9beb1"
msgid ""
"To know the reason for your fall is, perhaps, to know the shape of things to "
"come."
msgstr "넘어진 이유를 아는 것은 앞으로 일어날 일의 형태를 아는 것일 수도 있다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = 25326e97-df93-256e-8f23-869109ad7f87
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:25326e97-df93-256e-8f23-869109ad7f87
msgctxt "ha2a957aeg1c1eg4f4ag9c7dg8b98af3daa4a"
msgid "Resolve. Purpose. These will serve you well on your journey."
msgstr "결의. 목적. 이들은 너의 여정을 잘 지탱해줄 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2547db03-228f-fd4c-5fb8-6f0842be71a4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:2547db03-228f-fd4c-5fb8-6f0842be71a4
msgctxt "hd2184610g08c0g4087g8213g20a5724a6d67"
msgid ""
"Only in wielding the powers I lost can I achieve my aims. It is my destiny. "
"My right."
msgstr "내가 잃어버린 힘 없이는 목적을 이행할 수 없다. 이것이 나의 운명이자, 나의 권리다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = 279c88d6-0a66-b591-c992-bad2f98451ad
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:279c88d6-0a66-b591-c992-bad2f98451ad
msgctxt "h21071602g2b3dg48f1g8084g16f7f373ed63"
msgid ""
"Then the path to redemption remains closed. Only when the gold is paid can "
"your oath be reclaimed."
msgstr "그렇다면 구원의 길 역시 닫혀 있을 수밖에. 금을 지불해야만 맹세를 되돌릴 수 있다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = 27c4f3ad-7061-ead5-6a36-663105599c02
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:27c4f3ad-7061-ead5-6a36-663105599c02
msgctxt "ha1ec5080g1e75g4b1fga651gf2d9c6a32d04"
msgid ""
"First, you must pay the agreed price. Material sacrifice is required, to "
"prove your words have substance."
msgstr "먼저, 너는 합의된 가격을 지불해야 한다. 너의 약속에 실체가 있다는 것을 증명하기 위해서는 물질적인 희생이 필요하다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2d5318cb-a100-bb7e-ec54-09afa61373cc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:2d5318cb-a100-bb7e-ec54-09afa61373cc
msgctxt "hbdbced85g731ag4743ga064g8db5db24dc40"
msgid "I don't need your help, stranger. I can look after myself."
msgstr "네 도움은 필요없어, 이방인. 내가 알아서 할 수 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = 2d92e489-680f-eb0b-259b-a4ef3f12bf11
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - PALADIN_ANCIENTS(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:2d92e489-680f-eb0b-259b-a4ef3f12bf11
msgctxt "h3ef3c59fg9061g4695gafa2g3f82a481db23"
msgid ""
"You swore to protect life itself. To serve the natural order. To protect "
"those who value life, and vanquish those who would destroy it."
msgstr ""
"그대는 생명 그 자체를 보호하겠다고 맹세했다. 자연의 질서를 섬기겠다고. 생명을 소중히 여기는 자들을 지키고, 생명을 파괴하려는 자들을 "
"무찌르겠다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = 2de41365-96be-b9d2-8cfa-e5a139c19901
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:2de41365-96be-b9d2-8cfa-e5a139c19901
msgctxt "h38f097c1gb0ddg4054g9dcbga366f4274292"
msgid "Then hold to your oath. Let it be a comfort and a guide."
msgstr "맹세를 이행하라. 그리하면 위안과 인도를 얻을지니."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = 2df69bfe-62f5-edde-b014-565a7a136f59
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:2df69bfe-62f5-edde-b014-565a7a136f59
msgctxt "h6b52c304gf0e4g4b2cgac8eg8dc5a96b0283"
msgid ""
"I served a noble lord. I fought for him without question or restraint. Where "
"his light shone, my sword followed."
msgstr "나는 귀족 영주를 섬겼다. 나는 의문과 주저함도 없이 그를 위해 싸웠지. 그의 빛이 닿는 곳에, 내 검도 따랐다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = 2dfc3e11-8c57-1c2a-2bd9-9b9101999db4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:2dfc3e11-8c57-1c2a-2bd9-9b9101999db4
msgctxt "ha5c3c551g5db7g463bgbc43g80e946578063"
msgid ""
"It was the bounty placed on an oathbreaker's head. It was the sum placed on "
"my own."
msgstr "원래는 맹세파기자의 머리에 걸리는 현상금이었다. 내 머리에도 걸린 금액이었지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2e5fc7ee-a713-7fdc-606b-faf86a57c395
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:2e5fc7ee-a713-7fdc-606b-faf86a57c395
msgctxt "hcd88c454gff8dg48d4g97e9gbbb41608dc1d"
msgid "I had no choice. To follow it was to act against my conscience."
msgstr "선택의 여지가 없었어. 맹세를 따르는 것이 내 양심에 반하는 행동이었으니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = 2ee53b46-0b40-1f79-4808-51424fa75cc0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:2ee53b46-0b40-1f79-4808-51424fa75cc0
msgctxt "hb5a50292ga459g4b39gbb02g6415bf44c9be"
msgid "Until that day, I will be here, and my offer will remain."
msgstr "그날이 올 때까지 여기 있겠다. 제안은 언제든 유효하다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = 2f2031cb-bb86-0d16-7790-32c31a0d40d3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:2f2031cb-bb86-0d16-7790-32c31a0d40d3
msgctxt "h26108cb9gff0eg4e68gb400g5aebdb9417d4"
msgid "Darkness will obey your summons. The dead will march to your rhythm."
msgstr "어둠이 너의 부름에 응할 것이다. 망자가 너의 선율에 맞춰 행군할 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = 33e20641-00a1-97d8-b2e9-49d283c2111c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:33e20641-00a1-97d8-b2e9-49d283c2111c
msgctxt "h532cf50agcac1g447egb262g20057958c867"
msgid "When you feel ready to make it, I will be waiting for you."
msgstr "결정을 내릴 준비가 될 때까지 여기서 그대를 기다리겠다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3b371ac3-fc5f-31dd-d3dd-fc42dd129413
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 99637390-c2b7-e01a-c8fb-361a7e36e384_AskedAboutPowers = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:3b371ac3-fc5f-31dd-d3dd-fc42dd129413
msgctxt "h60999198g098bg4891gadd0g86c6201bbe81"
msgid "What powers do I have as an oathbreaker?"
msgstr "맹세파기자는 어떤 힘을 휘두를 수 있지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = 3b6a5d44-e877-b4d3-7fff-c262d21eb4ee
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:3b6a5d44-e877-b4d3-7fff-c262d21eb4ee
msgctxt "h23a0b2ffg2088g41a0g845ag45c301303e87"
msgid "I knew the consequences would be worse for those he continued to harm."
msgstr "그가 계속 해를 끼친 사람들에게 결과가 더 나빠질 것은 알고 있었다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = 3c025273-b12e-d8d3-a32f-e68e903e3630
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GEN_TransferNPCPayment(1) = True
#.     - GLO_PaladinOathbreaker_Event_ObtainedRedemption(1) = True
#.     - GLO_PaladinOathbreaker_State_HasBeenOathbreakerTwice(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:3c025273-b12e-d8d3-a32f-e68e903e3630
msgctxt "h0f262280gf83dg4a64g9c3fgeccc8ab65301"
msgid "Your offering is accepted. Kneel."
msgstr "제안을 수락하마. 무릎 꿇어라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = 3d459ca4-27eb-053d-acb6-ad675edfc000
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:3d459ca4-27eb-053d-acb6-ad675edfc000
msgctxt "hbec9c931g86f0g495ag83d9gf12fff2eeef5"
msgid "For casting aside your oath, you will be reclaimed."
msgstr "맹세를 저버리면, 다시 한 번 그 힘이 돌아오리라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = 3d60f33d-aec1-dd6f-fb0b-7d38e8751b0c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:3d60f33d-aec1-dd6f-fb0b-7d38e8751b0c
msgctxt "hee86e967g35a4g445cga52fged40ca2626da"
msgid "You may refuse. But this alone will not restore what was lost."
msgstr "거절해도 좋다. 그러나 선언만으로는 이미 잃어버린 것을 되찾을 수 없지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3d874baa-b8d7-fa5d-da38-38ed75eb6f99
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:3d874baa-b8d7-fa5d-da38-38ed75eb6f99
msgctxt "hca0059f9g9e9ag446bg8b81g53792f2f3718"
msgid "I seek moral guidance. It cannot be found lurking in the shadows."
msgstr "나는 도덕적 인도를 구한다. 그림자 속에 숨어서는 찾을 수 없는 것이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = 3f258bb0-95d0-6f87-5954-c696d0243d02
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:3f258bb0-95d0-6f87-5954-c696d0243d02
msgctxt "hd1b77716g3c70g47a2g9bd8g8542ceded7da"
msgid "That is your choice. I will be here, should you reconsider."
msgstr "그건 너의 선택이다. 나는 여기 있을 테니, 재고해 봐라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = 4129a653-e0bb-1fcb-ee47-fe2cf220cfd8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:4129a653-e0bb-1fcb-ee47-fe2cf220cfd8
msgctxt "hbc2ed73eg8654g4603g9eb6g25d670894795"
msgid "Though born of a vile source, these powers can be used for good or ill."
msgstr "사악한 근원에서 비롯되었지만, 이 힘은 선하게 또는 악하게 사용될 수 있다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 429acca4-b2f2-ecdf-7a66-ac84828159a5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:429acca4-b2f2-ecdf-7a66-ac84828159a5
msgctxt "hb6b2865bg8884g499fgb19fg40808c4a6817"
msgid "That was a brave decision. It can't have been easy."
msgstr "용감한 결정이었네. 쉽지 않았을 텐데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4463a3d2-d8b7-7ff4-5aed-b10ef31a75c5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:4463a3d2-d8b7-7ff4-5aed-b10ef31a75c5
msgctxt "h4a491727g81bfg4129g964bgcb92f2afadae"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4520142c-1154-7e36-3b15-c5e5dd9e0591
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:4520142c-1154-7e36-3b15-c5e5dd9e0591
msgctxt "he0cfa4afg09d9g456bga377g3890e06b6184"
msgid "Tell me more about these powers."
msgstr "이 힘에 대해 더 말해 줘."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4a744822-54d2-bcdb-6d9d-e79acefd2a17
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:4a744822-54d2-bcdb-6d9d-e79acefd2a17
msgctxt "h4ccfc8abg0707g403fg8335g0728792a3fdb"
msgid "Did you know you would be cast out?"
msgstr "당신이 쫓겨날 것을 알고 있었나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = 4e26fb12-ca50-20fd-cf11-9725cf38b631
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:4e26fb12-ca50-20fd-cf11-9725cf38b631
msgctxt "hb2e7cb96g750ag4681g9a14g053e7ea07860"
msgid "A journey with no end, trodden only by the desperate and the damned."
msgstr "끝이 없는 여정을 향한, 절박하고 저주받은 이들만이 걸어온 길이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4e586631-d8ef-e4d6-74c5-36f4729dd945
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:4e586631-d8ef-e4d6-74c5-36f4729dd945
msgctxt "h4e00a56agb335g42a2g8539gebe9c366f0d9"
msgid "Do you regret betraying your oath?"
msgstr "맹세를 저버린 것을 후회하나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = 4e8209cb-e7af-855d-526b-e254d3bbcb0d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_OathbreakerKnight_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:4e8209cb-e7af-855d-526b-e254d3bbcb0d
msgctxt "h16df9e7cg6e95g4161ga3a6g738e210591af"
msgid "If you stumble, know there is no shame in falling. Only release."
msgstr "맹세를 지키지 못하는 순간이 오면, 명심해라. 실패는 불명예가 아니다. 해방일 뿐."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = 5041eb99-5021-dabb-812b-323472c7efcc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:5041eb99-5021-dabb-812b-323472c7efcc
msgctxt "hafb1b46cg3ad4g4989g9aceg9b0e22a3f100"
msgid "The Oath of Devotion is once more yours to fulfil."
msgstr "헌신의 맹세는 다시 한 번 그대의 의무가 되었다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = 52caec1e-3e54-cde9-c587-30e9d61eac76
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:52caec1e-3e54-cde9-c587-30e9d61eac76
msgctxt "h32fb77a1gc01cg48e1ga0dag2c770c179940"
msgid "A desire for purity. Moral absolution."
msgstr "순결에 대한 갈망이라. 도덕적 면죄로군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = 549ad022-7247-acda-10da-e3051683378e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:549ad022-7247-acda-10da-e3051683378e
msgctxt "hf829d7afg4e54g4f5cga7eege26e211bdbc2"
msgid ""
"It is a path I have walked since the moment I fell. Now you will walk it too."
msgstr "내가 쓰러진 순간부터 걸어온 길이다. 이제 그대도 같은 길을 걷게 되리라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 55425038-6063-456a-fb0a-fb0d985fd68f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:55425038-6063-456a-fb0a-fb0d985fd68f
msgctxt "h4683afc1gcdb7g458bgae99g7836d25bc98a"
msgid "Why am I allowed to reclaim my oath, knowing what I am?"
msgstr "내 정체를 알면서도 어째서 다시 맹세를 이어가게 해 주겠다는 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = 55ed41b0-eae6-56ba-55de-0809a639fc7b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_OathbreakerKnight_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - OATHBREAKER(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 99637390-c2b7-e01a-c8fb-361a7e36e384_B = False
#.     - 99637390-c2b7-e01a-c8fb-361a7e36e384_A = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:55ed41b0-eae6-56ba-55de-0809a639fc7b
msgctxt "h4879c9d9g3225g4668g9a31gf488ff21ee2d"
msgid "Ask what you will."
msgstr "뭐든지 물어봐라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = 57d8fb37-775f-c2bd-dcb5-bb1ca4df5b73
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:57d8fb37-775f-c2bd-dcb5-bb1ca4df5b73
msgctxt "hda0f38f7gcc3fg4c84g9f8cg65dc10477345"
msgid ""
"Without gold, your pledge cannot be made. Return to me when you are ready to "
"pay."
msgstr "금 없이는 맹약을 맺을 수 없다. 지불할 준비가 되면 다시 돌아오거라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = 58dd8f96-f292-97f1-c04e-15885ca42a19
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:58dd8f96-f292-97f1-c04e-15885ca42a19
msgctxt "h83ab9636g1b1eg4a57g979egc98c2e464f38"
msgid "Regret is for those who would act differently. I feel no such desire."
msgstr "후회는 달리 행동했기를 바라는 사람들에게 있는 것이다. 나는 그런 바람이 없다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = 59cbc57c-6fdd-f691-afcd-29d1928c2c8b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:59cbc57c-6fdd-f691-afcd-29d1928c2c8b
msgctxt "h610fd1bag2cd4g4647g8639g844739e14c16"
msgid ""
"In the darkness, new power beckons. In the light, the promise of "
"restoration. But in between, there is nothing."
msgstr "어둠 속에서 새로운 힘이 손짓한다. 빛 속에는 치유의 약속이 있다. 그러나 중간 지대에는 아무것도 없다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = 5e3f5f12-0210-177f-daff-ccfe1f389368
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:5e3f5f12-0210-177f-daff-ccfe1f389368
msgctxt "h3610ff6cge584g4379gb872g37d8fd0632a6"
msgid ""
"I come to offer solace. And warning. For the way is soaked in the blood of "
"the desperate and the damned."
msgstr "나는 위안을 주러 왔다. 그리고 경고하지. 이 길은 절망한 자들과 저주받은 자들의 피로 흠뻑 젖어 있다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5f32926a-da48-73dc-6532-8a232da8dc53
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:5f32926a-da48-73dc-6532-8a232da8dc53
msgctxt "hc03a4b35g02e9g41b8ga5ecg5b208036a1cd"
msgid "Abandoning my oath tainted my soul. I wish to make it right."
msgstr "내 맹세를 버린 것이 내 영혼을 더럽혔어. 이를 바로잡고 싶어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 60e92e1c-7762-b8fa-1ea5-71ddd9078737
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:60e92e1c-7762-b8fa-1ea5-71ddd9078737
msgctxt "h04ee1b75g3e33g4e57g80c9g37948732f737"
msgid "I hope to lead a life without Bhaal again."
msgstr "바알과 무관한 삶으로 돌아가고 싶을 따름이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 61cd96f9-022b-cbd0-f5b0-ce95ae5bc8b0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:61cd96f9-022b-cbd0-f5b0-ce95ae5bc8b0
msgctxt "h70eb2424g5365g4c26gab1dg4d34800e2ad5"
msgid ""
"I understand better the meaning of my oath. I can serve it now, as I could "
"not before."
msgstr "나는 내 맹세의 의미를 더 깊이 이해하게 됐어. 전에는 이행할 수 없었던 맹세를 이행할 수 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = 62546dfb-67a5-ad0b-02c9-8282d8fd97a9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:62546dfb-67a5-ad0b-02c9-8282d8fd97a9
msgctxt "h7410a49bg852ag48eeg8b1fgdd0b5e6d57ba"
msgid "Tell me, why do you wish to reclaim your oath?"
msgstr "알려 다오. 어째서 맹세를 되찾고 싶은 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 63414941-72d2-7acd-8fe9-6efa096b2c4e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:63414941-72d2-7acd-8fe9-6efa096b2c4e
msgctxt "h37fe971eg74a5g48deg9abcg2feb50a96d1a"
msgid "I don't want this. I want to remain pure."
msgstr "나는 이런 걸 원하지 않아. 나는 순수한 상태로 남고 싶어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = 644764e2-9532-d184-0885-2f7d6a66452a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:644764e2-9532-d184-0885-2f7d6a66452a
msgctxt "h77d1ee9fg8eeeg4853g8f4dgdae7745fd611"
msgid "Repairing what was damaged. Atoning for the past."
msgstr "훼손된 것을 복구한다라. 과거에 대한 속죄로군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = 65138fe6-c4b5-9a1a-3773-c780e6bd047c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:65138fe6-c4b5-9a1a-3773-c780e6bd047c
msgctxt "hb085dad5g524cg43e9g86ddg1feb8e29a3fb"
msgid ""
"You may still reclaim your oath. So long as you are willing to pay. "
"([GEN_CheckMagicPocketGold_6057ad05-9492-4630-9f0a-be548b134c54])"
msgstr ""
"그대는 아직 그대의 맹세를 이어갈 수 있노라. 대가만 지불한다면. "
"([GEN_CheckMagicPocketGold_6057ad05-9492-4630-9f0a-be548b134c54])"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 66ee0568-2627-d9d9-33d6-7a9b96b6477f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_CheckPocketGold = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:66ee0568-2627-d9d9-33d6-7a9b96b6477f
msgctxt "h9d2cbefbg9d2fg4321g8bc2g0126a4920804"
msgid ""
"<i>Pay the gold. Reclaim your oath.</i> "
"([GEN_CheckMagicPocketGold_6057ad05-9492-4630-9f0a-be548b134c54])"
msgstr ""
"<i>금을 지불하여 맹세를 되찾는다.</i> ([GEN_CheckMagicPocketGold_6057ad05-9492-4630-9f0a-"
"be548b134c54])"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 66ee3c95-01b0-4678-7ccd-168b43e7eb27
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:66ee3c95-01b0-4678-7ccd-168b43e7eb27
msgctxt "h3d456895gc3dbg4875gaa64g287db964b432"
msgid "It was not my intention. My actions had unexpected consequence."
msgstr "내 의도는 그게 아니었어. 내 행동이 예상치 못한 결과를 초래했어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = 6be9afed-9aef-1c60-d63a-a46f88859faa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:6be9afed-9aef-1c60-d63a-a46f88859faa
msgctxt "h46f08944gad39g4716g908agc77c2694d7ff"
msgid ""
"Returning to your oath means relinquishing the darkness within you. Its evil "
"must be banished."
msgstr "너의 맹세로 돌아간다는 것은 네 안의 어둠을 버린다는 뜻이다. 그 악을 추방해야만 한다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = 6cf345d6-f966-ca38-e2bb-a78a34f0b524
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:6cf345d6-f966-ca38-e2bb-a78a34f0b524
msgctxt "h7964f870ga327g4abcga645g50903d7b60a4"
msgid "The Oath of the Ancients is once more yours to fulfil."
msgstr "선조의 맹세는 다시 한 번 그대의 의무가 되었다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = 6db9330f-189f-782c-7023-cc78ff4da11b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_OathbreakerKnight_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Local:
#.      - 99637390-c2b7-e01a-c8fb-361a7e36e384_A = False
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_PaladinOathbreaker_State_AboutToBecomeOathbreaker(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 99637390-c2b7-e01a-c8fb-361a7e36e384_A = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:6db9330f-189f-782c-7023-cc78ff4da11b
msgctxt "h8112c0b9g4286g4daagb846g8613a2867bb2"
msgid "You are between worlds, paladin. Have you made a choice?"
msgstr "그대는 중대한 갈림길에 서 있다, 팔라딘이여. 결정을 내렸나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = 6dbb8477-ba77-c547-a087-71384bb36d51
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:6dbb8477-ba77-c547-a087-71384bb36d51
msgctxt "h37fe9212geb45g4d86g8993g6242673d1e2b"
msgid "The Oath of Vengeance is once more yours to fulfil."
msgstr "복수의 맹세는 다시 한 번 그대의 의무가 되었다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6ea45c3a-fa1d-58af-6689-1a5deda9b0ab
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_PaladinOathbreaker_Event_BecomesOathbreakerAfterDialog(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:6ea45c3a-fa1d-58af-6689-1a5deda9b0ab
msgctxt "h8ae3def3g21aeg4303g8995g73c8529f9507"
msgid "In that case, I accept. I will become an oathbreaker."
msgstr "그렇다면, 제안을 수락하지. 맹세파기자가 되겠다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = 71bed961-7d8b-379d-e74b-9a0aab2b5df8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:71bed961-7d8b-379d-e74b-9a0aab2b5df8
msgctxt "h2cd1ed3bg8451g4761g8240ge14348ca30f6"
msgid ""
"Take comfort in your undoing. I, like you, abandoned my cause. But much can "
"still be achieved."
msgstr "실패에서 위안을 삼아라. 나도 너처럼 대의를 저버렸다. 하지만 지금도 많은 것을 이룰 수 있지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7219cae3-3c67-5ae6-f469-8ec5dd374b2c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:7219cae3-3c67-5ae6-f469-8ec5dd374b2c
msgctxt "hcbdde155g19b9g4e1fg9b9ag1f73abd2128b"
msgid "Why should I pay more? I did no worse than before."
msgstr "어째서 양이 늘어났지? 특별히 더 나쁜 짓을 저지른 것도 아닌데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = 73df6b12-31a0-1f74-795b-32b98ce908a1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - OATHBREAKER_DEVOTION(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:73df6b12-31a0-1f74-795b-32b98ce908a1
msgctxt "he2730219g23e4g4ed0gbe7cg4af0127de298"
msgid ""
"You swear to act with strength, compassion, and responsibility. To be a "
"paragon of honour and justice."
msgstr "그대는 힘, 연민, 책임감을 가지고 행동할 것을 맹세한다. 명예와 정의의 귀감이 되어라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7726cccc-b457-62cd-2535-2905f7be3f94
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:7726cccc-b457-62cd-2535-2905f7be3f94
msgctxt "h62d9bf34g7ea8g4a74g816bgc588caee7b98"
msgid "What oath did you swear?"
msgstr "당신은 무슨 맹세를 했지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = 7c7bbc00-b3e7-dac6-1517-916352b6747c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_OathbreakerKnight_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Local:
#.      - 99637390-c2b7-e01a-c8fb-361a7e36e384_A = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - OATHBREAKER(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 99637390-c2b7-e01a-c8fb-361a7e36e384_A = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:7c7bbc00-b3e7-dac6-1517-916352b6747c
msgctxt "h9a3c33c7g3e45g49d8gbf4cg00b330385412"
msgid "Oathbreaker. What do you need of me?"
msgstr "맹세파기자여. 무엇을 구하려 하는가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = 7f334bd1-d8f4-40a7-5eef-fe16c58521a9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:7f334bd1-d8f4-40a7-5eef-fe16c58521a9
msgctxt "h4876d028g83a8g4e22g906cg1a7d3a5fa6e2"
msgid ""
"I offer no riddles. Nor do I offer clarity. Where you must walk, there are "
"no signposts. There are no maps."
msgstr "나는 수수께끼를 내지 않는다. 장황하게 설명하지도 않는다. 네가 가야 하는 길에 이정표나 지도는 없다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = 804a042f-476e-d53c-ac9a-48d6485ff3b5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:804a042f-476e-d53c-ac9a-48d6485ff3b5
msgctxt "hff159d7dg0d47g447bg9696g7c9151846598"
msgid ""
"There are less worthy objects demanding a far higher price. For redemption, "
"this is no great ask."
msgstr "이보다 훨씬 더 가격이 높으면서 가치가 덜한 것들도 있다. 이건 구원의 대가로는 대단한 요구가 아니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8366e031-cda0-6ca4-3b7d-8fef0af2428d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:8366e031-cda0-6ca4-3b7d-8fef0af2428d
msgctxt "h4f9616aagd6d8g411cgb470g45a391677f18"
msgid "I no longer believed in its teachings."
msgstr "나는 그 가르침을 더 이상 믿지 않았다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = 87aab0e8-ae01-4e51-9987-00fce4695971
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:87aab0e8-ae01-4e51-9987-00fce4695971
msgctxt "h1f5e8c07gb5edg4d63gb0c4g749e29ab85d2"
msgid "You called to me. I am here to show you the way."
msgstr "네가 나를 불렀다. 나는 네게 길을 보여주러 왔다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = 87c2d1d8-aacd-a180-3edb-ca8f672c0496
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:87c2d1d8-aacd-a180-3edb-ca8f672c0496
msgctxt "h6ebb4546g6db9g49d8g9ee1gba78879ad591"
msgid "Do not resist. Surrender, and be remade."
msgstr "저항하지 마라. 굴복하라, 그리고 재탄생하라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = 8817a64e-c048-551c-1618-3eebb9933568
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:8817a64e-c048-551c-1618-3eebb9933568
msgctxt "h09df7c0fg3bb4g454fgbb43ga3b46a106456"
msgid "The gold must be paid."
msgstr "금을 지불해야 한다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8def65f1-5273-854f-f06c-9241da4c145b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:8def65f1-5273-854f-f06c-9241da4c145b
msgctxt "h01f5fae7g5851g49a2gaa2dg73dbc634acc3"
msgid "Turning on your own people? No wonder you were cast out."
msgstr "당신의 민중을 공격했다고? 추방될 만했네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = 8fb9be2e-aa99-6573-ab44-8f0b2317826c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:8fb9be2e-aa99-6573-ab44-8f0b2317826c
msgctxt "h458b6b0eged1dg413dg8c1cg64ffd706ed12"
msgid "What's past is past. We are here to discuss your future."
msgstr "과거의 일은 과거일 뿐이다. 우리는 너의 미래를 논하고 위해 여기 있다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 916671b4-77bb-1af3-a541-7c5f66223c0a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:916671b4-77bb-1af3-a541-7c5f66223c0a
msgctxt "h4bb0ac5egcaccg4335g9e93ge53cf828d677"
msgid "What did you achieve after abandoning your oath?"
msgstr "맹세를 파기한 후에는 무엇을 얻었지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = 91b944f5-88aa-5d64-b7f4-7cb85bfca1b0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:91b944f5-88aa-5d64-b7f4-7cb85bfca1b0
msgctxt "hc9ce7a42g5ddfg4ba7g9737g06c77f7b9765"
msgid "It is what you do, not what you are, that determines your oath."
msgstr "그대의 맹세를 정의하는 것은 그대의 내면이 아니라 그대의 행동이기 때문이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = 928ae82c-9b84-6a48-5f06-b24a79bf8bb9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:928ae82c-9b84-6a48-5f06-b24a79bf8bb9
msgctxt "h41041018g4432g4b26g9bbbgadfb05e0b62a"
msgid "A loss of purpose."
msgstr "목적의 상실이라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = 94f2d1ee-29ec-34aa-1d61-e7f40b666be2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:94f2d1ee-29ec-34aa-1d61-e7f40b666be2
msgctxt "hfd01710bga2e1g47a7ga4ccg544a6da2ca42"
msgid ""
"If you believe your oath to be of lesser value, you are under no obligation "
"to reclaim it. It is your decision."
msgstr "그대 스스로의 맹세보다 금이 더 아깝다면, 맹세를 되찾을 이유도 없지 않겠나. 판단은 그대에게 달려 있다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = 96faeddc-6643-8f14-423b-07bb72662490
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:96faeddc-6643-8f14-423b-07bb72662490
msgctxt "h0fbe2843g5fc4g4d6eg91eag628fdbbb4603"
msgid ""
"It is wise to first consider what is gained, and what is lost in the bargain."
msgstr "이 거래로 무엇을 얻고, 무엇을 잃을지를 먼저 생각하는 편이 현명할 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = 976d3159-60e8-1550-a1cd-02a831bc4c93
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:976d3159-60e8-1550-a1cd-02a831bc4c93
msgctxt "ha8a916b9g2bd0g407bga8c6ga877319d5845"
msgid "I felt the moment of your liberation - the shedding of your bond."
msgstr "너의 유대가 사라지는 해방의 순간을 느꼈다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 982bda95-e43d-1b1d-110b-6721d2739f3a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_PaladinOathbreaker_State_HasBeenOathbreakerOnce(1) = True
#.      - GLO_PaladinOathbreakerPath_State_CanRedemptThemself(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:982bda95-e43d-1b1d-110b-6721d2739f3a
msgctxt "h233fab63g78a6g466aga62dgd2a2ea8b731d"
msgid "I wish to take up my oath again."
msgstr "내 맹세를 다시 이어가고 싶어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = 9929dc4f-1158-fc82-5575-ca8a2d9ea7f8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:9929dc4f-1158-fc82-5575-ca8a2d9ea7f8
msgctxt "hfbffc8fdg2c57g42a6gb332g4603942b57c9"
msgid ""
"Your oath is broken. The light within you fades. A new power is awakening."
msgstr "너의 맹세는 깨졌다. 너의 내면에 있는 빛은 사라졌다. 새 힘이 깨어나고 있다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 996f2c3b-c86f-f0ca-6233-e93c7cf3374e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_PaladinOathbreaker_State_AboutToBecomeOathbreaker(1) = True
#.      - GLO_PaladinOathbreaker_State_HasBeenOathbreakerOnce(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_PaladinOathbreaker_Event_BecomesOathbreakerAfterDialog(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:996f2c3b-c86f-f0ca-6233-e93c7cf3374e
msgctxt "ha11326dbgecf9g40ecg9ee7g15fd8e28bc48"
msgid "I want to become an oathbreaker."
msgstr "맹세파기자가 되고 싶어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9a3035c2-d495-2da0-17eb-94d85a63ce1c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:9a3035c2-d495-2da0-17eb-94d85a63ce1c
msgctxt "h68712f31ga913g4398gb9fegba9025020fef"
msgid "What happens if I reclaim my oath?"
msgstr "만약 내가 맹세를 되찾는다면 어떻게 되지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9ae89b8a-de1f-0e36-fcc3-7425e94c020d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_PaladinOathbreaker_State_HasBeenOathbreakerOnce(1) = False
#.      - GLO_PaladinOathbreakerPath_State_CanRedemptThemself(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:9ae89b8a-de1f-0e36-fcc3-7425e94c020d
msgctxt "hf6820a46g1aefg4af0gae8cg5ebda0e4fd0e"
msgid "I wish to take up my oath again."
msgstr "내 맹세를 다시 이어가고 싶어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9b59f8e3-7831-21a8-bd6b-1a5e9ca16959
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:9b59f8e3-7831-21a8-bd6b-1a5e9ca16959
msgctxt "h2cb95bb4gdf29g4c66g95a8g805bbb46f1a3"
msgid "Powerless? I don't like the sound of that."
msgstr "무력하다니? 그거 왠지 안 좋은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = 9da25faa-25ae-404e-1c5e-cf85c9ec4566
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:9da25faa-25ae-404e-1c5e-cf85c9ec4566
msgctxt "he59575b1g71e1g416ega45bgbdd8dbae27b1"
msgid "It is a decision worthy of consideration."
msgstr "이건 숙고할 필요가 있는 결정이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = 9f799cea-5474-091d-8162-fd07aa1df1b5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:9f799cea-5474-091d-8162-fd07aa1df1b5
msgctxt "h2a2090a6g38beg490fga0cfg9a5a8542fdd6"
msgid ""
"To exist outside the confines of his doctrine was something I welcomed. It "
"was no punishment."
msgstr "그의 교리에 국한되지 않는 것은 나에게 환영할 만한 일이었다. 그것은 처벌이 아니었다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = 9f8df927-77e1-b229-23a6-708c757c807f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:9f8df927-77e1-b229-23a6-708c757c807f
msgctxt "ha98d5b51gc9c5g4729gb50cg7a96df1af0a3"
msgid ""
"Eventually, I heard the call of others who had strayed. I showed them the "
"way, as I show you now."
msgstr "결국, 나는 길을 잃은 다른 이들의 부름을 들었다. 나는 지금 네게 보여주는 것처럼, 그들에게 길을 보여주었다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a15d8bea-9ced-f318-d5f1-2cce86d759f0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:a15d8bea-9ced-f318-d5f1-2cce86d759f0
msgctxt "h66aa4af1g5fb7g4249g92bag2b25362323e7"
msgid "Did I break my oath before, when I went to the Temple?"
msgstr "신전을 찾아갔을 때, 그때도 내가 맹세를 어겼었나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = a25ce5fa-3c3f-3f55-b3d2-1a88d673270d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:a25ce5fa-3c3f-3f55-b3d2-1a88d673270d
msgctxt "h64f9a35dg0a58g4584g84b0g4fac911ebab8"
msgid ""
"It is possible, but such a promise must not be made lightly. Wealth must be "
"sacrificed, and your soul re-pledged."
msgstr "가능하지만, 그렇게 큰 약속은 가볍게 이루어질 수 없다. 부가 희생되어야 하고, 너의 영혼이 재서약을 받아야 한다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = a618e6df-a963-b7fb-bfc9-c1187ce7d251
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:a618e6df-a963-b7fb-bfc9-c1187ce7d251
msgctxt "h673d7151gfbf1g4acagbfcfg6000ff0c9dea"
msgid "Tell me - why did you abandon your oath?"
msgstr "내게 말해다오 - 어째서 맹세를 파기했나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = a76c45e1-e351-c8a6-048d-f208ec5f753c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_OathbreakerKnight_HasMet(1) = False
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_PaladinOathbreaker_State_AboutToBecomeOathbreaker(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CAMP_OathbreakerKnight_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:a76c45e1-e351-c8a6-048d-f208ec5f753c
msgctxt "h2ad9eeb6g1722g4369gbfa8g9604bdcf5f74"
msgid "I have been waiting for you."
msgstr "기다리고 있었다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a999d6b4-0d26-f95b-c730-c1249c50fee6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:a999d6b4-0d26-f95b-c730-c1249c50fee6
msgctxt "h6d23adeegf78fg489eg94e0g50a895dad23e"
msgid "I am a poor paladin - my mind is shattered and cruelty is within."
msgstr "나는 형편없는 팔라딘이다. 정신은 산산이 조각 났고, 잔인함을 내면에 품고 있다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = ab7af405-13fb-e719-ed1d-9153681c87cc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 99637390-c2b7-e01a-c8fb-361a7e36e384_AskedAboutPowers = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:ab7af405-13fb-e719-ed1d-9153681c87cc
msgctxt "h00bb9a82g95adg4eb2g8b41g2e9bbc2505c5"
msgid ""
"Even now, these shadows gather around you. They sense the cracks in your "
"armour. They yearn to be used, to be <i>inflicted</i>."
msgstr ""
"지금도 이 그림자들이 너의 주위에 모여든다. 그들은 네 갑옷의 균열을 감지한다. 그들은 이용당하고, <i>상처받기</i>를 갈망한다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = aebfe6c9-cd9d-72d8-8000-eb79772852c8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:aebfe6c9-cd9d-72d8-8000-eb79772852c8
msgctxt "h51b93c12g49e2g4625g9004g3a5a402e3872"
msgid ""
"Yes, and not for the first time. We have met before. I expect we will meet "
"again."
msgstr "그렇다. 처음도 아니었지. 우리는 이미 만난 적이 있다. 나는 우리가 재회하리라 믿고 있다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b1720d93-db46-3cc3-87dc-fe8b35a8947b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:b1720d93-db46-3cc3-87dc-fe8b35a8947b
msgctxt "ha16289ceg13c7g403bga115g33c5275f36e0"
msgid "Do you regret betraying your oath?"
msgstr "맹세를 저버린 것을 후회하나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = b41e6c96-5709-bb4a-e0d2-b45d232499ab
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:b41e6c96-5709-bb4a-e0d2-b45d232499ab
msgctxt "hfb26adc7gda49g43d7g89e0g13164a472e56"
msgid ""
"Cruelty need not conflict with purpose, and a shattered mind may yet uphold "
"an oath."
msgstr "잔인함은 목적에 부합하는 수단이 될 수도 있다. 산산이 조각난 정신으로도 맹세를 이행할 수 있다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = b5b16f09-06b3-d806-dab2-a596cecde2a1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - PALADIN_VENGEANCE(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:b5b16f09-06b3-d806-dab2-a596cecde2a1
msgctxt "hfca67ab1gc3a8g4a65g9beega0b06a22ff4a"
msgid ""
"You swore to deliver vengeance, to hunt down those who had wronged and "
"ensure they felt the sting of justice."
msgstr "넌 복수를 하기로 맹세했고, 부정한 사람들을 추적해 정의를 구현하기로 했었지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = b6167043-92b7-b78e-f26d-4922186e1542
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:b6167043-92b7-b78e-f26d-4922186e1542
msgctxt "hb7c09168g3699g4fa9g9ac8g0afb2f120b7c"
msgid "It was merely a choice. As I have made countless others since."
msgstr "단지 하나의 선택이었을 뿐이다. 그 후로도 나는 수많은 선택을 했다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = b7fe0fa6-b0e6-7dc2-7608-f0aeb4ece45c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:b7fe0fa6-b0e6-7dc2-7608-f0aeb4ece45c
msgctxt "h855852d6g6014g460fg8af4ga442c7c54ec2"
msgid "May you wield the darkness well."
msgstr "네 안의 어둠을 제대로 다스리길 바라마."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = b8c872be-46b4-dcd0-ba47-bfc15c49f013
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:b8c872be-46b4-dcd0-ba47-bfc15c49f013
msgctxt "h03e4752egb0e5g4b38gba12g75f31dd83ea3"
msgid "This is your fate. Your right. Oathbreaker."
msgstr "이건 너의 운명이자 권리다. 맹세파기자여."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = b95841b1-6255-9ba2-e021-1b3676def65b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:b95841b1-6255-9ba2-e021-1b3676def65b
msgctxt "hb8d56135gcc34g4b67gb5f5gcf2ad7bf78c3"
msgid "Oathbreaker."
msgstr "맹세파기자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ba4a44f1-9f5e-7ad1-7aad-ca5bc87643be
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:ba4a44f1-9f5e-7ad1-7aad-ca5bc87643be
msgctxt "hc0b888a1g5459g4f9ega074g63b5dbd1cef2"
msgid "I'm in no mood for riddles. Whatever you have to say, spit it out."
msgstr "장단 맞춰 줄 기분 아니거든. 할 말이 있거든 그냥 말하시지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bc71f195-c290-25a1-5ff6-f5a2af445536
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:bc71f195-c290-25a1-5ff6-f5a2af445536
msgctxt "hfcb9c3b1gdaf7g4025ga3aagba9634a9cc83"
msgid "I need time to think about it."
msgstr "이에 대해 생각할 시간이 필요해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = bd2a17bd-d257-7eaa-8507-7e631040dde9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_OathbreakerKnight_HasMet(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CAMP_OathbreakerKnight_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:bd2a17bd-d257-7eaa-8507-7e631040dde9
msgctxt "h7db1ca70ge9a1g4bbdg8b75ga916e627fe4b"
msgid "Your oath stands firm. Should you stumble, I will be waiting."
msgstr "너의 맹세는 확고하군. 너의 마음이 흔들린다면, 기다리고 있겠다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bdc91fc7-d83d-9050-431b-0d760671544c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:bdc91fc7-d83d-9050-431b-0d760671544c
msgctxt "h365fe7e9g1223g4d81gb55dgd92feca29c89"
msgid "Did you know what it meant to break your oath like that?"
msgstr "맹세를 파기하는 것이 무엇을 의미하는지 알고 있었나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = be687ca0-64f4-eedb-8f69-9590bd814d4a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:be687ca0-64f4-eedb-8f69-9590bd814d4a
msgctxt "h497278cege33bg4904gbe93g792d4a27c25e"
msgid "I will not be tainted. I will find a way to reclaim my oath."
msgstr "나는 더럽혀지지 않겠어. 내 맹세를 되찾을 방법을 찾아보지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = befc1657-d51d-1e39-c079-57bbe984988f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - OATHBREAKER_ANCIENTS(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:befc1657-d51d-1e39-c079-57bbe984988f
msgctxt "hb5ee1530g1c31g4317g9f5cg0953f484a986"
msgid ""
"You swear to defend life itself, to protect all that is good and natural, "
"and to repel wickedness wherever it threatens."
msgstr "그대는 생명 자체를 수호하고, 선하고 자연적인 모든 것을 보호하며, 악이 위협하는 모든 곳에서 악을 물리칠 것을 맹세한다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bf778799-e722-4241-5df5-a4cfb98b57ed
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:bf778799-e722-4241-5df5-a4cfb98b57ed
msgctxt "haf296e54gaa9cg4e6fg835bgc2b1ecc23eec"
msgid "Buying salvation sounds like cheating to me."
msgstr "구원을 구매한다는 것은 나에게 부정 행위로 들리는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = c1fec5e0-543f-70af-a0a3-152a8002aa95
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:c1fec5e0-543f-70af-a0a3-152a8002aa95
msgctxt "hbb641951gcf26g4460gb8b4g8e703af41ca8"
msgid "Kneel, oathbreaker."
msgstr "무릎 꿇어라, 맹세파기자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = c3cd606b-c140-4269-ccbb-b62065a58357
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:c3cd606b-c140-4269-ccbb-b62065a58357
msgctxt "hd14901c9g6910g451aga797ge88d1ac87196"
msgid "A higher purpose. A greater calling."
msgstr "목표가 높을수록. 소명도 커진다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c7e7e305-a4ff-7717-e303-d19a55771e51
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_CheckPocketGold = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:c7e7e305-a4ff-7717-e303-d19a55771e51
msgctxt "h3bb83291g34e2g455bg9c55g3520becc4b80"
msgid "I can't afford that."
msgstr "주머니 사정이 좋지 않군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cc535cda-f69a-a3f7-c90d-b866b6f26eeb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_PaladinOathbreaker_State_HasBeenOathbreakerTwice(1) = True
#.      - GLO_PaladinOathbreakerPath_State_CanRedemptThemself(1) = True
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_CheckPocketGold = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:cc535cda-f69a-a3f7-c90d-b866b6f26eeb
msgctxt "h7ae41a9fgd868g4e5ega457g06a8e15090e9"
msgid ""
"<i>Hand over the gold. Reclaim your oath. "
"</i>([GEN_CheckMagicPocketGold_6057ad05-9492-4630-9f0a-be548b134c54])"
msgstr ""
"<i>금을 지불하고 맹세를 되찾는다. </i>([GEN_CheckMagicPocketGold_6057ad05-9492-4630-9f0a-"
"be548b134c54])"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = cd345d7c-fff6-58d7-6229-48cd56f183e4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:cd345d7c-fff6-58d7-6229-48cd56f183e4
msgctxt "h76661837g1891g400cg949ag5cfa37fb6f90"
msgid ""
"My actions followed no teaching apart from my own justification. Good or "
"ill, I made my choices."
msgstr "내 행동은 내 스스로의 정의관을 제외하면 어떤 가르침도 따르지 않았다. 좋든 나쁘든, 나는 내 선택을 했다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = cdc2e91f-6aa3-93a3-68ba-ecd79a475014
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:cdc2e91f-6aa3-93a3-68ba-ecd79a475014
msgctxt "h5b0b09cdgc863g4bd2g8d69ge835f657f94e"
msgid ""
"Nobody belongs entirely to their bloodline, even those fathered by a god."
msgstr "세상에는 피보다 진한 것들이 수두룩하지. 신의 핏줄조차도 예외는 아니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = d0450440-443f-7a75-7ba8-c8d867dbf370
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:d0450440-443f-7a75-7ba8-c8d867dbf370
msgctxt "hc721e9edgaafag4e63gba7bg6d586075fd40"
msgid ""
"I wielded the powers of darkness, yet held a candle for those who needed the "
"light."
msgstr "나는 어둠의 힘을 사용하지만, 빛이 필요한 자에게는 촛불을 밝혀줬다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = d07050b0-d985-cea3-2337-61a45c8a568d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:d07050b0-d985-cea3-2337-61a45c8a568d
msgctxt "h2c40b69aga74fg4c4fga8e4g5405ca71081b"
msgid "A noble sacrifice."
msgstr "고귀한 희생이군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = d29c2d77-0556-e12e-a484-10f58b906c7e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:d29c2d77-0556-e12e-a484-10f58b906c7e
msgctxt "h3ff24dcdg1d39g4e1ag93e0g9928a1253f20"
msgid ""
"Oaths are not to be discarded and reclaimed without cause. Your inconstancy "
"bears a cost."
msgstr "맹세는 정당한 사유 없이 저버리거나 되찾을 수 없다. 불충에는 대가가 따르는 법이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = d3002de6-d96c-86d5-4fb4-0f46de7b30a3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:d3002de6-d96c-86d5-4fb4-0f46de7b30a3
msgctxt "hcdbc5a73g79bdg4668g9ae3g99b2d2122dcb"
msgid "Your oath no longer binds you - the choice is yours alone."
msgstr "너의 맹세가 더 이상 너를 구속하지 않을 것이다. 이 선택은 너 홀로 내린 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = d3b3c14a-997f-789f-b21f-9ff60047188f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:d3b3c14a-997f-789f-b21f-9ff60047188f
msgctxt "h9a24c2acgd608g4098g863agcfb0228c7f66"
msgid "I was the first. The first to swear. The first to fall."
msgstr "나는 첫 번째였다. 첫 번째로 맹세한 자. 그리고 첫 번째로 몰락한 자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d6d2da28-f12f-fd30-8809-b52bd3988c85
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_PaladinOathbreaker_State_AboutToBecomeOathbreaker(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_PaladinOathbreaker_Event_BecomesOathbreakerAfterDialog(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:d6d2da28-f12f-fd30-8809-b52bd3988c85
msgctxt "h7aeeeb8ag3873g4a14g8a68g0dfbd7e5e998"
msgid "I'm ready. I will become an oathbreaker."
msgstr "나는 준비됐어. 맹세파기자가 되겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = d6ef713d-62d2-7c93-6bb0-4bbf511c380a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Not_For_EA = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - OATHBREAKER_VENGEANCE(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:d6ef713d-62d2-7c93-6bb0-4bbf511c380a
msgctxt "h72c9340bg6d3cg4333gaa45gca5b15e9d603"
msgid ""
"You swear to deliver righteous retribution, vanquishing your enemies and "
"aiding those who suffer at their hands."
msgstr "그대는 적들을 물리쳐 정의로운 응징을 전하고, 적들의 손에 고통받는 사람들을 도울 것을 맹세한다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = da25ff7e-7269-d770-9ea0-1df82ea5bd59
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:da25ff7e-7269-d770-9ea0-1df82ea5bd59
msgctxt "h0322cbe6g17a0g4a44g91c2g71d0db2bd33f"
msgid ""
"Do you wish to pay? ([GEN_CheckMagicPocketGold_6057ad05-9492-4630-9f0a-"
"be548b134c54])"
msgstr ""
"금을 지불하길 원하나? ([GEN_CheckMagicPocketGold_6057ad05-9492-4630-9f0a-"
"be548b134c54])"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = db321ab8-0ab1-a2f9-f5e3-2251b5c0cdce
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:db321ab8-0ab1-a2f9-f5e3-2251b5c0cdce
msgctxt "he16cec04g5dd9g49c5ga064g925784ae2c03"
msgid "You chose a path, made a pledge, and Bhaal had no part in it."
msgstr "그대는 길을 택했고, 맹약을 맺었다. 바알은 손가락 하나 보태지 않았지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = dc9537b0-0e30-a177-950e-af458a4f3b06
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_CheckPocketGold = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:dc9537b0-0e30-a177-950e-af458a4f3b06
msgctxt "h3ae06797g0fb9g4bd8gbabfg94e14af2bd9a"
msgid ""
"<i>Hand over the gold. Reclaim your oath. "
"</i>([GEN_CheckMagicPocketGold_6057ad05-9492-4630-9f0a-be548b134c54])"
msgstr ""
"<i>금을 지불하고 맹세를 되찾는다. </i>([GEN_CheckMagicPocketGold_6057ad05-9492-4630-9f0a-"
"be548b134c54])"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = dd1b427f-0c94-6bc0-1b2a-dd5fd857a396
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 99637390-c2b7-e01a-c8fb-361a7e36e384_AskedOathbreakersPast = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:dd1b427f-0c94-6bc0-1b2a-dd5fd857a396
msgctxt "h65b24c42g7ce4g4c9bga457g1b022f435c17"
msgid "Why did you abandon your oath?"
msgstr "어째서 맹세를 저버렸나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e9d982f4-9741-81e3-e929-a92ac78b217c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:e9d982f4-9741-81e3-e929-a92ac78b217c
msgctxt "hdca51fc2g55dag42f9gb692ga3220ad31496"
msgid "The way to what?"
msgstr "무엇으로 향하는 길?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = ebd9df68-5cf2-cf8d-8c38-c3c6b6c091dd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:ebd9df68-5cf2-cf8d-8c38-c3c6b6c091dd
msgctxt "he300ef03g12e1g4bcdgb565g3ae6233c9cc6"
msgid ""
"Your oath-sworn powers will return. You will be bound again by the decrees "
"you promise to uphold."
msgstr "너의 맹세에 묶인 힘이 돌아올 것이다. 너는 자신이 지키겠다고 약속한 법령에 다시 구속될 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ec9ff5e0-0056-3ae1-8a6f-0015e0bab3be
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:ec9ff5e0-0056-3ae1-8a6f-0015e0bab3be
msgctxt "h6ebace41g5d95g4813gb178g8ccbbbda61c9"
msgid "Isn't there any way to reclaim my oath?"
msgstr "내 맹세를 되찾을 방법은 없나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = ee32b4cf-e695-6ace-e83d-01439495ab2d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - PALADIN_DEVOTION(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:ee32b4cf-e695-6ace-e83d-01439495ab2d
msgctxt "h41f98e1ag1656g4b57g820cg4a28511b4b8f"
msgid ""
"You swore to defend the defenceless, to stand as an emblem for all that is "
"good and just in this world."
msgstr "너는 힘없는 자들을 보호하고, 이 세상의 선하고 정의로운 모든 것을 상징하는 존재가 되겠다고 맹세했다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ee8043d8-4173-3925-afe8-b6c90a3bc62e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:ee8043d8-4173-3925-afe8-b6c90a3bc62e
msgctxt "h436d7724g6d16g40e0ga3a7g07fc3ff905d3"
msgid "I owe you no explanation. My reasons are mine alone."
msgstr "내가 너에게 설명할 필요는 없어. 내 이유는 나 혼자만의 것이니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ef05da27-f823-57bd-cbc3-68b93072464b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:ef05da27-f823-57bd-cbc3-68b93072464b
msgctxt "h938e6a02g0fb5g4eb5gb1eeg9bfc0a590c3d"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = f10c045e-346f-3747-52f4-43a2393bbd4d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:f10c045e-346f-3747-52f4-43a2393bbd4d
msgctxt "h775c0c43g7accg415ega643g9bfe5057a1eb"
msgid ""
"With each transgression, your burden grows. As does the price of redemption."
msgstr "죄를 지을 때마다 짐도 커지는 법이다. 구원의 대가에도 예외는 없지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f1e5d2da-f59f-2354-a785-98add6f0587a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:f1e5d2da-f59f-2354-a785-98add6f0587a
msgctxt "haedc2c72g4631g47bdg9f57gaf7772e00f28"
msgid "I'll remain as I am."
msgstr "나는 있는 그대로 남겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = f2bc6512-b648-dcf7-51f3-c369e8a8a8bf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:f2bc6512-b648-dcf7-51f3-c369e8a8a8bf
msgctxt "h6fad539fg31eeg4accgac00gcc162cdf215e"
msgid ""
"When another's oath is broken, I stand witness. I hear their sorrow. I see "
"their jubilation. I guide their hand."
msgstr "다른 이의 맹세가 깨질 때, 나는 목도한다. 그들의 슬픔을 듣고, 그들의 승리감을 본다. 그리고 그들의 손을 이끈다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = f3e35a36-e787-cda3-0562-12d677ad8b28
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:f3e35a36-e787-cda3-0562-12d677ad8b28
msgctxt "h4a39c07fg370fg4bfagb2dbg568ac9d74040"
msgid "Should you wish to do so, speak with me again."
msgstr "그렇게 하길 원한다면, 나에게 다시 말을 걸어라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f47d5033-19f2-1104-df97-e355502bb052
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:f47d5033-19f2-1104-df97-e355502bb052
msgctxt "h0945248aga152g47c0g8fe9g9abae41b7e57"
msgid "Murdering your own lord? No wonder you were cast out."
msgstr "너의 영주를 살해했다고? 추방될 만했네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = f5aefcbb-0159-f8d1-f587-307c9c7da9e0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:f5aefcbb-0159-f8d1-f587-307c9c7da9e0
msgctxt "hb8c9561bg8a0fg47c6g8a4fg6392b9ae14f7"
msgid ""
"In his name, I razed villages, put thousands to the sword. I believed our "
"greater purpose required such brutality, such sacrifice."
msgstr "그의 이름으로 나는 마을을 약탈하고, 수천 명을 학살했다. 우리의 대의를 위해서라면 이 같은 잔인함과 희생이 필요하다고 믿었다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = f68eadf9-56e8-a0b6-85e1-574698570968
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:f68eadf9-56e8-a0b6-85e1-574698570968
msgctxt "h28bd6441g4cd1g4b8dgbe01gfb8eaea05f8d"
msgid "Your coffers are empty. The price must be paid."
msgstr "주머니가 비었군. 대가는 반드시 지불해야 한다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = f79573b1-f355-fc7d-3db5-658493a92f2d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:f79573b1-f355-fc7d-3db5-658493a92f2d
msgctxt "h6612bb17g6720g4377gbb36gdac13c5da6cf"
msgid ""
"The powers you wielded were not yours alone. They were a gift, offered on "
"the condition that your oath was upheld."
msgstr "네가 휘두르는 이 힘은 순전히 너만의 것이 아니다. 네가 맹세를 지킨다는 조건 하에 제공되는 선물이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = f966891c-7392-e129-7b9e-91e871050d34
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:f966891c-7392-e129-7b9e-91e871050d34
msgctxt "h93d36ddagcec9g4811g8050g262d50dc7a1d"
msgid ""
"But his light was so radiant, it blinded me to all else. I could not see the "
"darkness and corruption of the path he led me down."
msgstr ""
"하지만 그의 빛은 너무 눈부셨고, 나는 그외에 아무 것도 볼 수 없었다. 그가 나를 이끈 길에 깔린 어둠과 부패를 보지 못한 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = fd396d48-0943-18c5-6b0d-9b48580ba852
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_OathbreakerKnight_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Local:
#.      - 99637390-c2b7-e01a-c8fb-361a7e36e384_B = False
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_PaladinOathbreaker_State_AboutToBecomeOathbreaker(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 99637390-c2b7-e01a-c8fb-361a7e36e384_B = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:fd396d48-0943-18c5-6b0d-9b48580ba852
msgctxt "h692ae73agee71g4963ga789g9ebf0ce8781b"
msgid "State your purpose, oathbreaker."
msgstr "용건이 뭔가, 맹세파기자여."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = fd75cbf2-628d-bc92-a3f8-008fb1a40043
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GEN_TransferNPCPayment(1) = True
#.     - GLO_PaladinOathbreaker_Event_ObtainedRedemption(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:fd75cbf2-628d-bc92-a3f8-008fb1a40043
msgctxt "h7509ccdfgeab3g4298gaf61g87d201b83f1f"
msgid "The price is paid."
msgstr "대가는 지불되었다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight
#. Speaker = Oathbreaker Knight
#. NodeID = fe6166db-bc53-8465-26a2-bb0081012b33
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight:fe6166db-bc53-8465-26a2-bb0081012b33
msgctxt "h92d811a2g3250g4b4dga641gb20fe2bdb214"
msgid "A shedding of responsibility."
msgstr "책임감이 다했군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight_PlayerIsNotPaladin
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 4c848550-e41a-0a2c-b2d6-466e15a60150
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_OathbreakerKnight_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight_PlayerIsNotPaladin:4c848550-e41a-0a2c-b2d6-466e15a60150
msgctxt "hb6ede3e9g1ff6g4ba8ga5dfg88434e53ee24"
msgid ""
"*The figure doesn't acknowledge your presence. They appear nothing more than "
"an empty suit of armour.*"
msgstr "*가까이 다가가도 이 형상은 당신을 인지하지 않습니다. 안이 텅 빈 갑옷 한 벌에 지나지 않는 것처럼 보입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight_PlayerIsNotPaladin
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = f90f95e6-c500-d8c1-a4f6-87ebd453833f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_OathbreakerKnight_HasMet(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CAMP_OathbreakerKnight_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OathbreakerKnight_PlayerIsNotPaladin:f90f95e6-c500-d8c1-a4f6-87ebd453833f
msgctxt "h2d32773fg1d8ag4a26ga03fgccbb6486f4be"
msgid "*Silent. Still. The armour does not react to your presence.*"
msgstr "*고요하고 정적일 따름입니다. 이 갑옷은 당신이 가까이 가도 반응하지 않습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Orthon_DiabolistHint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0a4e1c8b-2786-391b-f69f-a3e9c52fba75
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Orthon_DiabolistHint:0a4e1c8b-2786-391b-f69f-a3e9c52fba75
msgctxt "h9f50b418gab7fg4f57gaf29g5fcea6ac9ab9"
msgid "Why are you helping me?"
msgstr "어째서 나를 돕는 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Orthon_DiabolistHint
#. Speaker = Yurgir
#. NodeID = 11eb66d3-55aa-6c37-8e1b-9b52b6b58d3b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Orthon_DiabolistHint:11eb66d3-55aa-6c37-8e1b-9b52b6b58d3b
msgctxt "ha6f5debfg00f7g42a1g8f74g5afb45823a13"
msgid "The House of Hope - our mutual <i>friend </i>Raphael's abode."
msgstr "바로 희망의 집—우리 둘의 <i>친구</i>, 라파엘의 거처다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Orthon_DiabolistHint
#. Speaker = Yurgir
#. NodeID = 1391dafc-4d4a-3588-681d-6d8ac1b57308
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Orthon_DiabolistHint:1391dafc-4d4a-3588-681d-6d8ac1b57308
msgctxt "hd0dd371fgacd1g44fbgaaf3gfc1843b75078"
msgid ""
"Forget I was ever here - but remember what I said. See you around, maybe."
msgstr "내가 여기 왔다는 건 잊어버려라. 대신 내가 한 말만은 기억해라. 어쩌면 조만간 볼 수 있을지도 모르겠구나."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Orthon_DiabolistHint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1b05d1d8-097b-699b-f1f6-4ac1de107cc4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Orthon_DiabolistHint:1b05d1d8-097b-699b-f1f6-4ac1de107cc4
msgctxt "hae88b2b9g6eaag4deeg9474ga50ef6661c25"
msgid "Be on your way, then."
msgstr "그럼 이만 가 봐."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Orthon_DiabolistHint
#. Speaker = Yurgir
#. NodeID = 239e1ca0-7591-ba1d-2b7c-8ecb6e564a80
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - LOW_Orthon_State_HelpedToFindHouse = True
#.     - LOW_DevilsFee_Knows_HelsikWayHoH = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Orthon_DiabolistHint:239e1ca0-7591-ba1d-2b7c-8ecb6e564a80
msgctxt "h8797d013g7960g4a47g81a7ge42ad39e6016"
msgid ""
"There's a diabolist - name's Helsik - in the Lower City. Find her, and "
"she'll take it from there."
msgstr "하부 도시에는 헬시크라고 하는 악마학자가 한 명 있다. 그자를 찾아라. 그다음부터는 헬시크가 알아서 할 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Orthon_DiabolistHint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2b2d7fa5-edd3-7ef3-3eca-6b0404e54adc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Orthon_DiabolistHint:2b2d7fa5-edd3-7ef3-3eca-6b0404e54adc
msgctxt "h6a0f7cb7ge4a4g48cfga356g979539c45f9a"
msgid "Thank you."
msgstr "고맙군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Orthon_DiabolistHint
#. Speaker = Yurgir
#. NodeID = 44babcaa-5944-6220-6b65-1f6f44fb0900
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Monitor_State_MadeDeal = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Orthon_DiabolistHint:44babcaa-5944-6220-6b65-1f6f44fb0900
msgctxt "h29c53228gfb4fg4580g9d31g0ec21db88578"
msgid ""
"It was foolish of you to agree to a contract - that crown you signed away is "
"too powerful to wind up with the likes of Raphael."
msgstr ""
"네가 계약에 응한 건 어리석은 짓이었다. 네가 넘기기로 약조한 그 왕관은 라파엘 같은 놈의 손에 들어가기에는 너무 강력한 물건이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Orthon_DiabolistHint
#. Speaker = Yurgir
#. NodeID = 5d3f1234-f5b7-0c29-aa44-5e5d8e93585d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Orthon_DiabolistHint:5d3f1234-f5b7-0c29-aa44-5e5d8e93585d
msgctxt "h5b7ea99fg04e5g4fe4gbcccgc74678204c89"
msgid "You'd regret it. I snore, and kill in my sleep."
msgstr "그랬다간 후회할 거다. 나는 잘 때 코를 심하게 골고, 잠결에도 뭔가를 잡아 죽이니 말이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Orthon_DiabolistHint
#. Speaker = Yurgir
#. NodeID = 65b3d38a-8f3c-3484-5d08-9e5eb0949ed0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Orthon_DiabolistHint:65b3d38a-8f3c-3484-5d08-9e5eb0949ed0
msgctxt "h692207b1gb655g4267g94dfg00f4aed1bea8"
msgid ""
"Nice place you have here, little rabbit. Could use a few more trophies, "
"perhaps."
msgstr "꽤 괜찮은 곳에 자리를 잡았구나, 새끼 토끼야. 전리품을 좀 더 많이 전시해 두면 좋을 것 같기는 하다만."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Orthon_DiabolistHint
#. Speaker = Yurgir
#. NodeID = 709c075c-9b04-dda8-16a8-60388d85ec76
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Orthon_DiabolistHint:709c075c-9b04-dda8-16a8-60388d85ec76
msgctxt "h0e96708dgaa80g4506gba6ege2912fe5309a"
msgid "What can I say? You freed me from the tune."
msgstr "내가 달리 뭘 할 수 있겠나? 너는 날 그 노래로부터 풀어 주었지 않은가."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Orthon_DiabolistHint
#. Speaker = Yurgir
#. NodeID = 89f5183f-4245-f5e2-d027-edd06840e371
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Orthon_DiabolistHint:89f5183f-4245-f5e2-d027-edd06840e371
msgctxt "h1f00743fg9b9fg45fbg907cg76a02d8ee373"
msgid ""
"Ah, so I did. But even I'm not above a change of heart, if it keeps things "
"interesting..."
msgstr "아, 그랬지. 그렇지만 나 역시 흥미진진하기만 하다면 마음을 바꿀 수 있는 존재다..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Orthon_DiabolistHint
#. Speaker = Yurgir
#. NodeID = c0e2aa07-a13b-046b-a070-f98a630d63b4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Monitor_State_MadeDeal = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Orthon_DiabolistHint:c0e2aa07-a13b-046b-a070-f98a630d63b4
msgctxt "hb26820aeg9991g408cg9a05g238d1b8edd63"
msgid ""
"I'll keep this short, or my absence will be noted. You need the Orphic "
"Hammer, and I know where you need to look:"
msgstr ""
"용건만 간단히 말하겠다. 그러지 않으면 내가 자리를 비운 게 들통날 테니까. 너는 오르페우스의 망치를 필요로 하지. 나는 그게 어디 "
"있는지 알고 있다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Orthon_DiabolistHint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c5e64064-ec36-cbc8-3bdd-40b4945e011b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Orthon_DiabolistHint:c5e64064-ec36-cbc8-3bdd-40b4945e011b
msgctxt "h98292b26gb896g491bg9c01g7a3062cbd2f9"
msgid "Dare I invite you to stay...?"
msgstr "혹시라도 여기 머물 생각은 없어...?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Orthon_DiabolistHint
#. Speaker = Yurgir
#. NodeID = cfbb2f27-3063-af28-a669-806ae7d42f03
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Orthon_DiabolistHint:cfbb2f27-3063-af28-a669-806ae7d42f03
msgctxt "h472dd067gd0eeg48c2gbb38g101b58ba5f47"
msgid "Don't need you to dismiss me. Just remember what I said."
msgstr "그러잖아도 갈 생각이니 물리칠 필요 없다. 다만 내가 얘기한 것만은 기억해라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Orthon_DiabolistHint
#. Speaker = Yurgir
#. NodeID = f4fa80ce-7bfd-98ca-aa42-297e556c724e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Orthon_DiabolistHint:f4fa80ce-7bfd-98ca-aa42-297e556c724e
msgctxt "hab23ab59g9bdag42e5gb9e5g2e658f30aed4"
msgid ""
"I love a good hunt, and the best hunts keep things <i>sporting</i>. Besides, "
"you freed me from the tune."
msgstr ""
"나는 훌륭한 사냥을 무척이나 즐기기 때문이다. <i>도박적인</i> 맛이 있어야 최고의 사냥인 법이고. 게다가, 너는 그 노래에서 날 "
"풀어 주었지 않나."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Orthon_DiabolistHint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f5586743-61f3-3766-3b6b-2d4bbca241bc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Orthon_DiabolistHint:f5586743-61f3-3766-3b6b-2d4bbca241bc
msgctxt "h9a14f965g72fag4448gbaf2g443a67661af8"
msgid ""
"Last time, you said if I saw you again, it'd be because there was a bounty "
"on my head..."
msgstr "지난번에는 내 목에 현상금이 걸리지 않는 한은 날 다시 보고 싶지 않다고 했잖아..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Orthon_DiabolistHint
#. Speaker = Yurgir
#. NodeID = f65865f4-d34d-6a6d-36bf-2c1f27f19dfb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Orthon_DiabolistHint:f65865f4-d34d-6a6d-36bf-2c1f27f19dfb
msgctxt "hf4427018gf747g4a4cg904dgbbeb1a3584e5"
msgid ""
"Luckily, you have a way out. Find the contract, destroy it, and all's well. "
"You need to get to the House of Hope - Raphael's abode."
msgstr ""
"다행스럽게도 네게는 탈출구가 있다. 계약서를 찾아서 파괴하면 문제가 없을 거다. 그러려면 라파엘의 거처인 희망의 집으로 가야 한다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_OwlbearCub
