msgctxt "h7f402a26g02f2g4648ga6f7g20d0bd1e0f0e"
msgid "Take the weight off. You've earned it."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Shadowheart_PAD_Prayer
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 2cae3f7c-fcdc-4d73-b5ec-8d89b5575b83
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Shadowheart_PAD_Prayer:2cae3f7c-fcdc-4d73-b5ec-8d89b5575b83
msgctxt "h598b38ceg9d92g418fga126g4bc24c750dbf"
msgid "May the lives of your enemies be snuffed out like guttering candles."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Shadowheart_PAD_Prayer
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 2d6d6451-0de2-4cf0-b825-a04b7452ca03
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Shadowheart_PAD_Prayer:2d6d6451-0de2-4cf0-b825-a04b7452ca03
msgctxt "h4fd78668gb7cbg4602gbb28gdaf8857e1273"
msgid "Let the pains of the day be forgotten, soothed by your embrace."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Shadowheart_PAD_Prayer
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 5b708b89-3ea2-4ce1-981e-1d9f12a69c02
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 3e1aaf89-0417-b48c-54f6-43b4a2009612_A = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Shadowheart_PAD_Prayer:5b708b89-3ea2-4ce1-981e-1d9f12a69c02
msgctxt "hcd14f1edg3bd1g422dgbc14g0de38d537b68"
msgid ""
"Praise be to Lady Shar. As the sun retreats once again, all becomes your "
"realm."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Shadowheart_PAD_Prayer
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 6ddcc2ca-c897-4ad2-adda-412d6366ea9d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Shadowheart_PAD_Prayer:6ddcc2ca-c897-4ad2-adda-412d6366ea9d
msgctxt "h686d3a53g184fg4cb7gada9g0d0a1365333b"
msgid "Guide me where others fear to tread. Guide me to your embrace."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Shadowheart_PAD_Prayer
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 8b82d29e-b96c-4db2-865f-efabec14fbd1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Shadowheart_PAD_Prayer:8b82d29e-b96c-4db2-865f-efabec14fbd1
msgctxt "h88688fd9gf211g4fe3gba27g02a6b30d534f"
msgid ""
"I have ventured far from shadows. I have shared words with unbelievers. I "
"have followed your teachings imperfectly."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Shadowheart_PAD_Prayer
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 957b26c5-ada4-4103-82ee-4b255feb9444
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 3e1aaf89-0417-b48c-54f6-43b4a2009612_A = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 3e1aaf89-0417-b48c-54f6-43b4a2009612_B = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Shadowheart_PAD_Prayer:957b26c5-ada4-4103-82ee-4b255feb9444
msgctxt "hc5f7a6dbg3825g4edeg84b0g5cfb59642f2a"
msgid "Mistress of the Night, guide my hand, my step, my mind, and my blade."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Shadowheart_PAD_Prayer
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = a6a80928-b06d-4051-91b7-a81b88a84443
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 3e1aaf89-0417-b48c-54f6-43b4a2009612_C = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 3e1aaf89-0417-b48c-54f6-43b4a2009612_A = False
#.     - 3e1aaf89-0417-b48c-54f6-43b4a2009612_B = False
#.     - 3e1aaf89-0417-b48c-54f6-43b4a2009612_C = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Shadowheart_PAD_Prayer:a6a80928-b06d-4051-91b7-a81b88a84443
msgctxt "h665c99a9g43a8g4a7cg8fa0g64905c6562d4"
msgid "Lend me your strength, my Lady of Loss, for the battles yet to come."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Shadowheart_PAD_Prayer
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = bbb9b17e-6bd6-434e-8d0a-8bbdba1b511e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Shadowheart_PAD_Prayer:bbb9b17e-6bd6-434e-8d0a-8bbdba1b511e
msgctxt "ha96b2fa8gdd5eg4999g85e2gc018106f2f31"
msgid ""
"Let me follow in your path. Let me become one with your umbral splendour."
msgstr "당신의 길을 따르게 하소서. 당신의 찬란한 어둠과 하나 되게 하소서."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Shadowheart_PAD_Prayer
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = c82e5cf9-6b87-4b01-bf7a-c85a88cff9cf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Shadowheart_PAD_Prayer:c82e5cf9-6b87-4b01-bf7a-c85a88cff9cf
msgctxt "h29163a05gf506g46fag8869ga66eeec80cbf"
msgid ""
"May a time come when the sun never rises again, and your darkness reaches "
"eternity."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Shadowheart_PAD_Prayer
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = e04a6dfd-9fb5-43a6-8d08-22477e003f72
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Shadowheart_PAD_Prayer:e04a6dfd-9fb5-43a6-8d08-22477e003f72
msgctxt "h4fc94ce3g68ffg4a7eg8408g6a44ef5ca787"
msgid "Grant me the time and guidance I need to become your vessel, my lady."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Shadowheart_PAD_Prayer
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = f3352d43-7b9b-4d7f-9708-c242d19e13c9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Shadowheart_PAD_Prayer:f3352d43-7b9b-4d7f-9708-c242d19e13c9
msgctxt "hca98d989g9d55g491cga564g0af668984d99"
msgid ""
"Let the earth feast on the blood of the faithless, until only those who seek "
"the embrace remain."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Shadowheart_PAD_Prayer
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = f4b1c41b-003f-4b53-938f-12b57b36af5c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 3e1aaf89-0417-b48c-54f6-43b4a2009612_B = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 3e1aaf89-0417-b48c-54f6-43b4a2009612_C = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Shadowheart_PAD_Prayer:f4b1c41b-003f-4b53-938f-12b57b36af5c
msgctxt "h630c2d1cg6bfcg4d9dgbc80gf60faef676a5"
msgid "Blessed Nightsinger, grant me mercy."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = 009d02d5-4ba5-78ab-2a64-24e58d92e136
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - FOR_UnfortunateGnome_Knows_GnomeHasSmokepowder = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:009d02d5-4ba5-78ab-2a64-24e58d92e136
msgctxt "hb2fd4cf2g1071g434dgb434gdd3f7ccd1b82"
msgid ""
"Then, after a while, I'd find whoever killed him and put a smokepowder bomb "
"in their trousers."
msgstr "그렇다면, 나중에 그를 죽인 자를 찾아서 바지 안에 폭탄을 넣어줘야겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 03085bdf-8a17-1089-95e2-e77f63e1b309
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:03085bdf-8a17-1089-95e2-e77f63e1b309
msgctxt "hcfd500e7g0cd3g4505gabb8gcb6df96cfcf7"
msgid "<i>Shrug.</i>"
msgstr "<i>어깨를 으쓱한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = 035ed195-1086-b4dd-3713-9704ec99a8ac
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:035ed195-1086-b4dd-3713-9704ec99a8ac
msgctxt "h0ca618fcg65b9g436bg8efbg387ed1fbe973"
msgid ""
"The Ironhand Gnomes have proven the impossible. Runepowder is real. And they "
"have it in their possession."
msgstr "아이언핸드 노움들이 불가능을 가능케 했지. 룬파우더는 실존하고, 그 자들이 가지고 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = 09ab9f3d-4351-341a-c03c-f62b87196156
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:09ab9f3d-4351-341a-c03c-f62b87196156
msgctxt "h5261af87g76e6g4b3cgb997gf1c27cb468b3"
msgid ""
"Now we're talking! I can whip some up for you, no problem - but I'll need a "
"little time to gather the right supplies."
msgstr "이제야 말이 통하는군! 문제 없어, 내가 만들어줄 수 있지. 다만 제대로 된 물자를 모으기 위해 약간의 시간이 필요해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0a327ddf-d34f-649e-c27e-5cdebb6e6d41
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:0a327ddf-d34f-649e-c27e-5cdebb6e6d41
msgctxt "h30035421g8b1cg48e9g9ab3gfcf86dc14e9a"
msgid "Go on."
msgstr "말해 봐."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = 0aba49bc-6f94-f20f-273b-c950f0615db4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_UnforunateGnome_FindWulbren(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:0aba49bc-6f94-f20f-273b-c950f0615db4
msgctxt "h489fe1abgcd19g4014g9756g8a2340534940"
msgid ""
"Thank you for agreeing to find Wulbren. It means a great deal to me, indeed."
msgstr "울브렌을 찾겠다고 해 줘서 고마워. 내게 정말 많은 의미가 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = 0f945300-7eb3-1ebd-7ed2-7b1445438802
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:0f945300-7eb3-1ebd-7ed2-7b1445438802
msgctxt "hc98f01ceg77fag4495g99ccgf46b48328c1d"
msgid "I can't risk re-capture. I barely escaped last time."
msgstr "또 다시 붙잡힐 순 없어. 지난번에도 겨우 도망쳐 나왔으니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0fa85cd3-bc3a-d16c-a9ab-b57a0833181f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:0fa85cd3-bc3a-d16c-a9ab-b57a0833181f
msgctxt "hc1c45edag437bg42aaga5fdg6587d933bb7d"
msgid ""
"We can't count on Wulbren surviving the Towers. We should go after the "
"gnomes en route to Baldur's Gate."
msgstr "문라이즈 타워에서 울브렌이 살아남으리라 기대하긴 어려워. 발더스 게이트로 향한 노움들을 따라가자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0ffe8bb3-f427-cde0-357a-8cb4e27d3c78
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:0ffe8bb3-f427-cde0-357a-8cb4e27d3c78
msgctxt "h3c4eec0dgbd38g432dg8d99gf748332a5376"
msgid "What about?"
msgstr "무슨 일인데?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 104b8bf6-a6c4-a482-b1f8-9f35bfc5ae44
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - FOR_UnfortunateGnome_Knows_GnomeHasSmokepowder = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:104b8bf6-a6c4-a482-b1f8-9f35bfc5ae44
msgctxt "he853c1f7g7fecg425eg8129ge3f4c19ad0a7"
msgid "Your smokepowder bombs - are you an alchemist?"
msgstr "그 폭탄 말이지... 혹시 넌 연금술사야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = 118b055a-4402-8fe4-0da9-db69c0b258e5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:118b055a-4402-8fe4-0da9-db69c0b258e5
msgctxt "h7b48888ag0aa5g4f3cg8f2eg927068933038"
msgid "Oh, this is excellent - I'll get started right away!"
msgstr "오, 아주 좋군. 바로 착수하지!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = 12c040e4-f389-a6b2-669b-ca1a9dda76c7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:12c040e4-f389-a6b2-669b-ca1a9dda76c7
msgctxt "h265cef96gdcaeg4916gb2c7g58c15eb8a2b3"
msgid ""
"It's about Wulbren. We know he's been taken to Moonrise Towers. And we know "
"I'm going to save him."
msgstr "울브렌 말이야. 우리는 그 친구가 문라이즈 타워로 끌려갔다는 걸 알잖아. 내가 구하러 갈 거라는 것도 알지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = 139e5214-776a-be73-0bd8-681b0aaf6ec6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:139e5214-776a-be73-0bd8-681b0aaf6ec6
msgctxt "h0b9502b7g3cd7g4facga16bg2e39dc06316a"
msgid "A telepath."
msgstr "이심전심이군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = 17db105c-c24e-30fd-e2be-a66ad099d3cc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:17db105c-c24e-30fd-e2be-a66ad099d3cc
msgctxt "h3fe39398g6647g4f41ga395g7848b1ea4718"
msgid ""
"I haven't been there myself. The area around it is... well. Cursed. "
"Terrifyingly so."
msgstr "직접 가 본 적은 없지만, 그 주위 일대가...음. 아주 끔찍한 저주를 받았지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = 18b3b14b-28dc-423e-a226-aed31ec2e9a2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:18b3b14b-28dc-423e-a226-aed31ec2e9a2
msgctxt "h58c776c5g539cg4eb5ga48dg01bb4f8eb89d"
msgid ""
"I don't think you <i>really </i>believe that. A deep gnome strapped to a "
"windmill wasn't your business. A group of captives suffering under "
"mercenaries and cultists wasn't your business."
msgstr ""
"네가 <i>정말로 </i>믿는 것 같진 않군 그래. 풍차에 묶인 딥 노움은 네가 상관할 문제가 아니었어. 용병과 광신도들 밑에서 고통받는 "
"포로들도 네가 상관할 바 아니었고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = 24897e3a-d665-e155-c031-0c99810079eb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:24897e3a-d665-e155-c031-0c99810079eb
msgctxt "h6c6f7263gcdcfg4962gae6dg006b265052fe"
msgid ""
"Thank you. I think I have a plan. Perhaps I can <i>blast </i>my way in..."
msgstr "고마워. 내게 계획이 있는 것 같아. 들어가는 길을 <b>터뜨려서</b> 진입할 수도 있겠지..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 24a35940-d913-5ecb-c6cf-49f03f6903b6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:24a35940-d913-5ecb-c6cf-49f03f6903b6
msgctxt "h48487bc3ga74eg45dagbc38gc47d347910bd"
msgid "What will you do if Wulbren is dead?"
msgstr "울브렌이 죽었다면 어떻게 할 건데?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = 24f6c69a-218b-b208-2076-20968ea03f0d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:24f6c69a-218b-b208-2076-20968ea03f0d
msgctxt "h77988c53g46ddg4500g819cg986691bfb315"
msgid "I'd kiss you, but neither of us deserves that."
msgstr "키스라도 갈겨 주고 싶지만, 너도 나도 원하진 않을 것 같군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = 25c82be2-a54c-064b-7c84-336902d401c4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:25c82be2-a54c-064b-7c84-336902d401c4
msgctxt "hb5d96be2g0692g40a6g9e05g87e4037a5448"
msgid "A very fair trade, I think!"
msgstr "공정한 거래인 것 같네!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = 276c215c-8eb7-45a6-e317-c1dc36ccdf5b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:276c215c-8eb7-45a6-e317-c1dc36ccdf5b
msgctxt "he51ff810g4a5bg4f1fgb677gd77feab91161"
msgid ""
"I'm certain you do. But... if you should find yourself in the Towers, "
"perhaps you'll keep an eye out for him."
msgstr "물론 그렇겠지. 그래도... 만약 문라이즈 타워에 가게 되거든, 주위를 잘 둘러봐 줘."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 27d62d8f-0441-a2d2-fbf3-57b73c83825f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:27d62d8f-0441-a2d2-fbf3-57b73c83825f
msgctxt "h71a045d7gbce4g434ag9fadg314aa380ba91"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = 30c5bdc3-9045-54b6-73f3-9eef0b7b47dd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_IronhandGnomes_Knows_Runepowder = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:30c5bdc3-9045-54b6-73f3-9eef0b7b47dd
msgctxt "h907b96c8ga457g4903gbfc3g1e70802dbbde"
msgid "Runepowder. Do you know what it is?"
msgstr "룬파우더 말이야. 뭔지 알고 있어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = 360a3285-d58e-e579-caf5-2cd905d4aec6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:360a3285-d58e-e579-caf5-2cd905d4aec6
msgctxt "h7c165ff8g01e2g4a95ga373g1261b1956560"
msgid ""
"Ah, the so-called <i>Ironhand Gnomes</i>. Excellent access to technological "
"facilities, but their politics are... dangerous. Increasingly so."
msgstr ""
"아, 그 이름하여 <i>아이언핸드 노움</i>말이지. 그 자들의 기술 시설에 대한 접근성은 아주 뛰어나지만, 정치적인 "
"부분에선...위험하지. 점점 더 위험해지고 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = 363426ec-5a1a-a4f7-2b98-0e9dd7bf3d13
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:363426ec-5a1a-a4f7-2b98-0e9dd7bf3d13
msgctxt "h0bd1f752g8cbdg4d69gb998gf8db15aa4ffb"
msgid "Perfect for thinking, and I've been doing just that."
msgstr "생각하기에 안성맞춤이야. 이미 그러고 있던 참이고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = 3637c843-ea17-dec1-1ffa-dca1ce118974
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:3637c843-ea17-dec1-1ffa-dca1ce118974
msgctxt "h49618e02g82a7g4290gafe7ga6ca5784145c"
msgid "I suppose... I suppose I'd be very, very sad."
msgstr "아마... 아마 나는 매우, 매우 많이 슬플 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = 38f1dc65-ef70-5d60-f5c9-939591fa49fe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:38f1dc65-ef70-5d60-f5c9-939591fa49fe
msgctxt "hb3f32d89g6c3eg4476g9ef0g4960c201a41b"
msgid "Thank you."
msgstr "고마워."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = 3999dc53-5954-3b89-5fdf-b15e23b89efe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_UnfortunateGnome_AskedCompensation(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:3999dc53-5954-3b89-5fdf-b15e23b89efe
msgctxt "h8175e684gb3f0g4368g9d6fg164d33f59850"
msgid ""
"I'll soon be off to gather your compensation. With your track record, I'm "
"sure you'll find Wulbren in no time - so I'll be quick!"
msgstr "네 보상을 준비해 두려면 곧 떠나야겠어. 네 활약들을 보고 나니, 울브렌도 금방 찾을 수 있을 것 같거든. 어서 채비해야겠군!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = 3a0d0684-5a23-1c99-e3b3-1ce5a58fc8aa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:3a0d0684-5a23-1c99-e3b3-1ce5a58fc8aa
msgctxt "h4657bfaeg1299g408aga54ag9eb7b5bf3d38"
msgid "If you have a moment, I'd like your opinion on something."
msgstr "잠깐 괜찮다면, 네 견해를 좀 빌리고 싶은데 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = 3a559b21-4c57-035e-60e3-44206263b072
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Party:
#.      - CAMP_UnfortunateGnome_State_HasSpokeToPlayers(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:3a559b21-4c57-035e-60e3-44206263b072
msgctxt "hf51ce09ag34d8g4f76ga61agf6884e30365f"
msgid ""
"If anything's happened to Wulbren, someone is going to be very sorry. I'll "
"make sure of that."
msgstr "울브렌에게 무슨 일이라도 생기면, 그렇게 한 놈은 호된 대가를 치러야 할 거야. 내가 그렇게 만들 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = 3bd56e7e-a2e9-1b8b-e3e6-acb0eb812f3f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:3bd56e7e-a2e9-1b8b-e3e6-acb0eb812f3f
msgctxt "h6dff5ccag3273g4967g9890gc262050bfc78"
msgid "Right. Wulbren's life is at stake. We must focus."
msgstr "맞아. 울브렌의 목숨이 위험해. 집중해야 할 때야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3ec995df-f2af-33e8-c67f-078ac7e10296
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:3ec995df-f2af-33e8-c67f-078ac7e10296
msgctxt "hf444cdbcg7b72g450agba8eg44dff340ee01"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 45836522-027e-810b-1147-cd5503eaf3f6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:45836522-027e-810b-1147-cd5503eaf3f6
msgctxt "h236cc805g460ag4688gbb57g5608460da053"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = 47bf8a34-9be1-f6d9-2cfa-fae4bd1cd628
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:47bf8a34-9be1-f6d9-2cfa-fae4bd1cd628
msgctxt "h10c26a56gb687g440cg9e29g0d432cbb3bc1"
msgid "Honestly, I can't even remember the last time we spoke."
msgstr "솔직히 말해서, 마지막으로 이야기를 나눈 게 언제였던지 기억나지도 않는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = 4e25a75a-2146-779e-da32-f4817f5226b5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:4e25a75a-2146-779e-da32-f4817f5226b5
msgctxt "hd626398dgd6d6g41d8g84e9g21a71efdfddd"
msgid "No matter what he's done, I can't abandon Wulbren. You understand."
msgstr "울브렌이 무슨 일을 했든지 간에 버리고 갈 순 없어. 이해하겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = 4fe7bdde-8a14-3ebc-69ce-a64dd5382551
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:4fe7bdde-8a14-3ebc-69ce-a64dd5382551
msgctxt "h1bd3b04cg5ba5g46f4ga793g187834bfcf53"
msgid ""
"Alchemist, tinkerer, adventurer, curmudgeon... I wear many hats, most with "
"great enthusiasm."
msgstr "연금술사, 땜장이, 모험가 놈팽이... 난 많은 일을 하고 있고, 열정을 갖고 임하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = 5228fb7f-3d04-0c2e-a7e1-f8d2f36a390d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_IronhandGnomes_Knows_Runepowder = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:5228fb7f-3d04-0c2e-a7e1-f8d2f36a390d
msgctxt "hb8766acdgd9e5g43e1ga03fg4dc9ab92f186"
msgid ""
"I know you've learned about the gnomes' pursuit of runepowder. But do you "
"know what it truly <i>is?</i>"
msgstr "노움들이 룬파우더를 찾고 있다는 건 이제 알겠지. 그런데 그게 정말로 <i>무엇인지</i> 알고는 있는 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = 55e1c5a6-4622-7ac4-da63-722af586adf6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:55e1c5a6-4622-7ac4-da63-722af586adf6
msgctxt "hd2402828gd29fg48c6g9b78g1dc25d46e709"
msgid ""
"Meanwhile, I'll need to think of an alternative. I must find Wulbren, "
"especially now that... ahem. Anyway. Wish me luck."
msgstr "그동안 난 대안을 생각해 봐야겠어. 울브렌을 찾아야 해. 특히나 지금 같은 때엔... 에헴. 어쨌거나, 행운을 빌어 달라구."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = 565f1ec5-e705-f555-f1c5-36315c0d2414
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:565f1ec5-e705-f555-f1c5-36315c0d2414
msgctxt "hd1bff356gc952g48c1gb907g6d5e0b2ee0ac"
msgid "That myth has come to life."
msgstr "그 신화가 현실이 됐어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5978b05b-dea4-9f70-f255-0d724f428722
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:5978b05b-dea4-9f70-f255-0d724f428722
msgctxt "h890829e4gb8cag45b6g9eaeg7e52faa9e807"
msgid "I'll let you know if I hear anything - no more, no less."
msgstr "소식 들리는 게 있다면 알려주겠지만, 그 이상은 못 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = 5c13025f-4cb0-1e27-24f6-5a8a8fd90d60
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:5c13025f-4cb0-1e27-24f6-5a8a8fd90d60
msgctxt "h4752e026g426dg4aaeg93e7gb30afcf20f5c"
msgid "Find Wulbren, and you can have anything it is within my power to give."
msgstr "울브렌을 찾아준다면, 내 힘으로 해줄 수 있는 건 다 해줄게."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = 5cfa95db-6f28-8c4e-e3cf-5687418ffb4b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:5cfa95db-6f28-8c4e-e3cf-5687418ffb4b
msgctxt "hca4c7311gf99eg4ae9g8ca9g64919e393b74"
msgid "Pity. Everyone deserves a friend. Even me, apparently."
msgstr "안타깝군. 누구든 친구를 사귈 자격이 있어. 나까지 말이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = 5de4ae44-6b45-ee9e-07bd-b217111bc361
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CAMP_UnforunateGnome_FindWulbren(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:5de4ae44-6b45-ee9e-07bd-b217111bc361
msgctxt "ha4349012g2f9fg41bcg8ba4g6e4174b283fc"
msgid "That's... very decent of you. Thank you."
msgstr "자네 정말... 괜찮은 친구로군. 고마워."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5e513cee-7b85-aea5-3116-6ca18b4a45c7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CAMP_UnfortunateGnome_AskedCompensation(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:5e513cee-7b85-aea5-3116-6ca18b4a45c7
msgctxt "h381fd6c3g00eag4078gbb14gc520183dcc9b"
msgid "I don't work for free. Make me an offer."
msgstr "공짜로 일해주지는 않는다. 제안을 해 봐."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6202ab2c-8eaa-8f23-0462-e1d53f0dfd42
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:6202ab2c-8eaa-8f23-0462-e1d53f0dfd42
msgctxt "h4291cfa9g31c5g4136g88degc9c62c22f521"
msgid "What can you tell me about Moonrise Towers?"
msgstr "문라이즈 타워에 대해 알려줄 만한 게 있나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 64cd1b69-bb01-ec00-e956-6b43000ed331
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: (CLERIC_GARLGLITTERGOLD or PALADIN_GARLGLITTERGOLD) and !(DEEPGNOME and GNOME)
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:64cd1b69-bb01-ec00-e956-6b43000ed331
msgctxt "ha22cbd66g399dg4a9fg8b86gb76bb17ad5c0"
msgid ""
"The stuff of gnomish myth. Gaerdal Ironhand's private cache of the world's "
"most powerful explosive."
msgstr "노움 신화에 나오는 물건이야. 세상에서 가장 강한 폭발물을 모아 놓은 게르달 아이언핸드의 개인 저장소지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 65045501-c9a6-afe4-f933-df5d5abdae76
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:65045501-c9a6-afe4-f933-df5d5abdae76
msgctxt "h44c17044gc55ag468dgaa43gaa6463459d7e"
msgid "What do they want to do with it?"
msgstr "그걸 가지고 뭘 하려는 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = 69187138-ebd7-4c8d-954e-26b531c67521
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:69187138-ebd7-4c8d-954e-26b531c67521
msgctxt "h8f3464c3g16c4g4910gba82gc090362d3d4d"
msgid "Wulbren must know their plans. And <i>we </i>must find him."
msgstr "그 자들의 계획을 울브렌도 알아야 해. <i>우리</i>가 그를 찾아야 하고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = 6b5c1e26-5491-a66b-c983-9f42d4bc225b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:6b5c1e26-5491-a66b-c983-9f42d4bc225b
msgctxt "h1bf8335ege2eag4008gb68fge8041432ed07"
msgid ""
"I... haven't that much on me, I'm afraid. But I'll tell you what: you find "
"Wulbren, and I'll return with exactly that sum."
msgstr "그만한 돈은... 유감스럽게도 없군. 하지만 장담하건대, 울브렌을 찾아준다면 정확히 그 액수만큼 보답할게."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6f102a54-7f22-d582-0391-db761c788ff0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:6f102a54-7f22-d582-0391-db761c788ff0
msgctxt "h7fd33522ge5d3g41e0g855dgabe6d17a8ad2"
msgid "Good luck."
msgstr "행운을 빌어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = 6f272715-7399-ce55-da13-1d793e675686
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:6f272715-7399-ce55-da13-1d793e675686
msgctxt "h4285dc01gaeb9g4f54g9358g6e8f0c91ebb5"
msgid ""
"There's something else you should know. Something I can no longer ignore."
msgstr "네가 알아야 할 게 더 있어. 이제 더는 무시할 수 없는 것 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = 74d312fe-236b-331d-2af3-a469228e387e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:74d312fe-236b-331d-2af3-a469228e387e
msgctxt "h2a368aacg9250g496bgae62g441b33c67630"
msgid ""
"Aha! I know just the thing. You find Wulbren, and I'll gather the necessary "
"implements."
msgstr "아하! 뭔지 알다마다. 울브렌을 찾아준다면, 필요한 재료를 내가 모아올게."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = 7867dd4b-bf64-6bb5-b399-d5cb48aa76be
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:7867dd4b-bf64-6bb5-b399-d5cb48aa76be
msgctxt "h0d413745g0b02g47bag9bedg3a728899a6d7"
msgid ""
"Until very recently, I thought runepowder was a myth. A substance so "
"powerful it could fell a city - a <i>nation.</i>"
msgstr ""
"최근까지만 해도, 난 룬파우더가 신화인 줄로만 알고 있었어. 도시 하나를, 아니 <i>나라</i> 하나도 무너뜨릴 만큼 강력한 물질 "
"말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = 7f522201-c624-d6e3-29bd-dd716d7d1298
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:7f522201-c624-d6e3-29bd-dd716d7d1298
msgctxt "hdde7e3f2gaf74g4070g9d5age9bd6a066566"
msgid "You'd do it, then? You'd look for him?"
msgstr "그럼, 해 주겠어? 찾아봐 줄 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = 80b2c55c-1c54-c80b-53cb-22aa446c0b91
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:80b2c55c-1c54-c80b-53cb-22aa446c0b91
msgctxt "h6d0235b4g18e3g4e2bg9506g2d84f8a11936"
msgid ""
"They've nearly started an all-out war with the Gondians in the House of "
"Wonders in Baldur's Gate. There've been skirmishes, and now I fear..."
msgstr ""
"그 자들은 발더스 게이트의 경이의 집에 있는 곤드 신자들과 거의 전면전을 시작했어. 지금까진 소규모 교전만 있었지만, 이제부터는..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = 84a88d3d-f058-0631-1887-7006a6f23035
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:84a88d3d-f058-0631-1887-7006a6f23035
msgctxt "h297d30a2gc5d9g437egb801gc6a20417664c"
msgid ""
"Duergar who mentioned it sounded truly traumatised. It was almost amusing."
msgstr "그 얘길 들려준 듀에르가는 적잖이 충격받은 것 같더군. 제법 우스운 광경이었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = 865b9710-c03e-c21f-3482-5118f2c45658
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:865b9710-c03e-c21f-3482-5118f2c45658
msgctxt "haff7c7afg4342g4b81gacb1ge868644eb84a"
msgid ""
"I <i>did</i> hear something interesting, though. There are shades that "
"plague the path to the Towers - shades that fear not steel, but <i>light</i>."
msgstr ""
"그렇지만 흥미로운 얘기를 <i>듣기는</i> 했지. 문라이즈 타워로 가는 경로에는 그림자가 득시글거리는데, 그것들은 무기가 아닌 "
"<i>빛</i>을 두려워한다더군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = 888541b4-2bd5-9ec1-633c-b6025fc2b27a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:888541b4-2bd5-9ec1-633c-b6025fc2b27a
msgctxt "h663c8e2bg9942g4926gac73gc91fe3219f74"
msgid "A great deal. But I wouldn't mind halving the burden."
msgstr "어마어마한 일이지. 내 부담을 반으로 줄여 주겠다면 말리진 않을게."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = 8d227f17-9b73-3598-012b-f6c2e71cd9aa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:8d227f17-9b73-3598-012b-f6c2e71cd9aa
msgctxt "hb60cf268g6559g4c91g9abcg1022d47f2819"
msgid ""
"The problem is this: a preponderance of evidence that I am a terrible "
"adventurer."
msgstr "문제는 있잖아, 내가 모험가로서 끔찍하게 재능 없는 부류라는 증거가 차고 넘치거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9253419a-8a49-03d5-ec1c-ff99895e6108
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_UnforunateGnome_FindWulbren(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_UnfortunateGnome_State_PlayerOfferedHelp = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:9253419a-8a49-03d5-ec1c-ff99895e6108
msgctxt "h5991e6ddg918ag48caga872gdbb649396e8c"
msgid "I'm destined for Moonrise Towers. I could look for him."
msgstr "마침 문라이즈 타워로 가는 길이니, 내가 한번 찾아볼게."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = 9632e657-6e7b-7198-ed1d-584532d47157
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Party:
#.      - CAMP_UnfortunateGnome_State_HasSpokeToPlayers(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Party:
#.     - CAMP_UnfortunateGnome_State_HasSpokeToPlayers(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:9632e657-6e7b-7198-ed1d-584532d47157
msgctxt "hed4ea927g6710g46d0gad52gc737d3d733af"
msgid ""
"I thank you for the invitation to your camp. It's well-appointed. Not too "
"crowded."
msgstr "너희 야영지에 초대해 줘서 고마워. 잘 꾸며 놓았는걸. 너무 붐비지도 않고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 98110b58-6c8c-4f98-91d8-64f6b8cd9dbe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:98110b58-6c8c-4f98-91d8-64f6b8cd9dbe
msgctxt "h694ac185g710dg47ddga135g917f99002504"
msgid "I've heard some rather <i>explosive </i>gnomish myths about it."
msgstr "꽤나 <i>폭발적인</i> 노움 신화에 대해 들어본 적은 있지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = 9b2801dd-622a-f935-6b12-963f616fdb90
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:9b2801dd-622a-f935-6b12-963f616fdb90
msgctxt "h8def73cdg9bcag4d86gba36g1061292d7afd"
msgid ""
"Pah. If only that were true. Wulbren's a good sort, but he wouldn't know his "
"<i>arkayas </i>from his elbow."
msgstr ""
"하. 그러면 얼마나 좋겠어. 울브렌은 능력 있는 부류에 속하지만, 제 팔꿈치에 묻은 <i>아르카야</i>를 스스로 핥을 순 없는 법이라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = 9c56a4d8-37f9-e798-4fa9-62cc1c5b871b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:9c56a4d8-37f9-e798-4fa9-62cc1c5b871b
msgctxt "h090c7e6fg3853g466dgbeacg6b6492772b05"
msgid "You'll do it again. Won't you?"
msgstr "넌 외면하지 않을 거야. 그렇지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = 9eefc591-2ade-863f-955f-ce8d16378fb8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:9eefc591-2ade-863f-955f-ce8d16378fb8
msgctxt "h916e9aadg366eg47a9gb5ecgbb4434a19cce"
msgid ""
"I'm hesitant to prevail upon you again. But... I can't risk re-capture. I'd "
"be no help to Wulbren at all."
msgstr "매번 부탁만 하자니 염치없긴 하지만... 또 다시 붙잡힐 순 없어. 난 울브렌을 구하는 데 짐만 될 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9f0da784-f86c-ac4c-5722-d5a596b4f0eb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:9f0da784-f86c-ac4c-5722-d5a596b4f0eb
msgctxt "hcbaea1dag38b6g40c7g9589g4ac562477bfb"
msgid ""
"You'll give me gold. ([GEN_CheckMagicPocketGold_6057ad05-9492-4630-9f0a-"
"be548b134c54])"
msgstr ""
"골드가 좋겠어. ([GEN_CheckMagicPocketGold_6057ad05-9492-4630-9f0a-be548b134c54])"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = a555efa3-6a95-62ae-7095-cfcc2a120983
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:a555efa3-6a95-62ae-7095-cfcc2a120983
msgctxt "hd3078ab8gc335g4ea5g8079g32ad0ce02a2f"
msgid ""
"Now, more than ever, I need to find him. <i>We </i>need to find him. He's "
"the only one I might be able to speak to sensibly."
msgstr ""
"지금, 바로 지금이야말로 녀석을 찾아야 할 때야. <i>함께</i> 녀석을 찾아야 해. 내 말에 귀를 기울여 줄 사람은 녀석뿐이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = aa40ebab-4f3d-09bc-8515-fb74897fc2e8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:aa40ebab-4f3d-09bc-8515-fb74897fc2e8
msgctxt "h5e962feag9a89g4e67g960fgae3689a50b5b"
msgid ""
"Barcus Wroot is my name, Baldur's Gate is my home. Back in the city, I "
"offered my expertise to the highest bidder."
msgstr "바커스 루트, 내 이름이야. 발더스 게이트가 집이고. 도시에서는 부유한 의뢰인들에게 내 전문 기술을 제공하곤 했지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = ab066a19-dd91-89b6-0f03-f16c1c3cde04
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:ab066a19-dd91-89b6-0f03-f16c1c3cde04
msgctxt "h093f29c2gf138g467cga7d8g8f0dd3b684bb"
msgid ""
"To Baldur's Gate, I expect. I don't know what they plan to do with it, but "
"something of that power turned loose in the city... it could be carnage."
msgstr ""
"예상대로라면, 발더스 게이트겠지. 그걸로 무슨 짓을 저지르려는 건지는 모르겠지만, 그 힘의 일부만이 도시에 풀려나도... 대학살이 벌어질 "
"거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = b1cb4325-8647-9bc4-6b7f-373780024e8d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:b1cb4325-8647-9bc4-6b7f-373780024e8d
msgctxt "hb459c5f9g0108g412fga17ega5bd2d6520a6"
msgid "Trust me - you won't be disappointed."
msgstr "믿어 줘, 실망할 일 없을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b206d8a2-a99f-e3c5-9022-94d24fdbb147
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DEEPGNOME or GNOME
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:b206d8a2-a99f-e3c5-9022-94d24fdbb147
msgctxt "h35627987g32c4g408dg9314g1ebac7f7b80e"
msgid ""
"The stuff of myth. Gaerdal Ironhand's private cache of the world's most "
"powerful explosive. "
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b3432858-64c3-cf95-98ab-7353285f68ed
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_UnforunateGnome_FindWulbren(1) = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_DROWELF
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:b3432858-64c3-cf95-98ab-7353285f68ed
msgctxt "h7e094c64gac6fg447bga267g00daf9a6fa10"
msgid "I wouldn't hold out hope for any gnome taken by drow."
msgstr "나라면 드로우 손에 끌려간 노움에게 희망을 걸지 않겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b3432858-64c3-cf95-98ab-7353285f68ed
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_UnforunateGnome_FindWulbren(1) = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_DUERGARDWARF
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:b3432858-64c3-cf95-98ab-7353285f68ed
msgctxt "hd2d1f993ge4ffg4d4bgb855g88ccebf420df"
msgid "I wouldn't hold out hope for any gnome taken by duergar."
msgstr "나라면 듀에르가 손에 끌려간 노움에게 희망을 걸지 않겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = b5b6a97d-a9a2-6364-db1f-e2e431ecfc16
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:b5b6a97d-a9a2-6364-db1f-e2e431ecfc16
msgctxt "hf93dbc36g99f7g46bdg8231g1c30a97b94c4"
msgid ""
"Perhaps that's why you've agreed to look for him. I'm lucky - and grateful."
msgstr "어쩌면 네가 녀석의 가치를 알아본 건지도 모르겠군. 천만다행이야. 고마워."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b617a829-8f84-0e21-b723-df8dca3dfbcb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:b617a829-8f84-0e21-b723-df8dca3dfbcb
msgctxt "h18b1f16eg3351g459bgad4ag71cdd731ef39"
msgid "I will."
msgstr "그렇게 할게."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b7c9df84-178b-3cd0-a7b7-aba7b2d8fc45
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:b7c9df84-178b-3cd0-a7b7-aba7b2d8fc45
msgctxt "h6a5d8c14g1594g4875g913eg34814ddd9b04"
msgid "Where have they taken it?"
msgstr "그걸 어디로 가져가려 하는데?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bbf9d242-1b9e-2a6e-6601-408097608999
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:bbf9d242-1b9e-2a6e-6601-408097608999
msgctxt "h9a26fcbbg57ddg46abga9b5g18bdee881dd6"
msgid "There's something else I'd like to discuss."
msgstr "따로 더 논의하고 싶은 주제가 있는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c25c4e6f-75e8-b178-9149-faca49ed4752
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:c25c4e6f-75e8-b178-9149-faca49ed4752
msgctxt "h76d2f5bfgd5a8g41c2gad4ag84e5bf61f57d"
msgid "There's something else I want to discuss."
msgstr "다른 주제에 대해 더 얘기하고 싶어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c81a2ab5-623a-86d7-621f-aecf566a6b30
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:c81a2ab5-623a-86d7-621f-aecf566a6b30
msgctxt "h2ebb8a94g1f98g4a0ag84c0g8f4926fe6c69"
msgid "<i>Say nothing.</i>"
msgstr "<i>아무 말도 하지 않는다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c9994f09-92e6-e411-d96e-160b999748cf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:c9994f09-92e6-e411-d96e-160b999748cf
msgctxt "h633e7f28gd7f4g4eb1g8b81g4a97bd81f263"
msgid "What can you tell me about the gnomes you were with in the Underdark?"
msgstr "언더다크에서 함께 붙잡혀 있었던 노움들에 대해 말해 주겠어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = c9faf24b-33c8-a62e-f59c-85ea3d812494
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:c9faf24b-33c8-a62e-f59c-85ea3d812494
msgctxt "h5bb10b8cgd4c3g406egadfbg5b4227b0ee25"
msgid ""
"Destruction. The only thing it's good for. But destruction of what - well, "
"I'm hoping Wulbren will be able to tell us."
msgstr "파괴. 그걸 달리 어디에 써먹겠어. 하지만 무엇을 파괴하려고? 글쎄, 난 울브렌이 알려줄 수 있을 거라고 봐."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ccc129e2-9a1e-9ba5-c012-b95cb9c32834
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:ccc129e2-9a1e-9ba5-c012-b95cb9c32834
msgctxt "h1c927f4agb453g4a54gafb7g76043c7c15a6"
msgid "What aren't you telling me?"
msgstr "무슨 말을 하려다 만 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cd6e6c5d-7210-941b-e11b-05717ddb0f1f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:cd6e6c5d-7210-941b-e11b-05717ddb0f1f
msgctxt "hb8d1ff2fg2578g4ae8g8eb8g4de75fb5db2b"
msgid "Your friend can likely take care of himself."
msgstr "네 친구가 알아서 잘 처리할 것 같은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = cdcb3446-29b6-3b47-397d-47ec550a5420
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:cdcb3446-29b6-3b47-397d-47ec550a5420
msgctxt "hfb4716d6g3e00g4d60g8ef9gecb216246f12"
msgid "Well. There's no point speculating. Let us leave it at 'I fear'."
msgstr "글쎄. 어떤 추측도 이 이상은 의미 없어. 그냥 상상조차 '두렵다'는 것만 알아 둬."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = ce300afd-d648-5799-bf11-6210fa5ae3c4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:ce300afd-d648-5799-bf11-6210fa5ae3c4
msgctxt "he065b9e3ge9b1g4549g9a9bgb8213f9d8c74"
msgid "Like what?"
msgstr "이를테면?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cebb4d79-55d0-5300-980c-4140bbb2ad4b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:cebb4d79-55d0-5300-980c-4140bbb2ad4b
msgctxt "hced7f830g6b9eg47a8g833bg55505a2bc9bc"
msgid "I have my own matters to attend to."
msgstr "신경 써야 할 다른 일들이 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d3f9498e-02c7-b8ac-ecf5-7b06fc77c227
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:d3f9498e-02c7-b8ac-ecf5-7b06fc77c227
msgctxt "h8fa2bfb8g9927g48c5gb398g0e6f47a85bf6"
msgid "Yes, I do. Some people are worth it."
msgstr "이해해. 어떤 이들은 그만한 가치가 있지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d50fb461-5bb2-0b82-2d4f-641a6623ac4b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:d50fb461-5bb2-0b82-2d4f-641a6623ac4b
msgctxt "hdc5c7aa8g5672g4f79gbd8agefde4e87ce35"
msgid "Close, are you?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = d57d509f-8c9e-1bc4-f1ba-e1ff046718c6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:d57d509f-8c9e-1bc4-f1ba-e1ff046718c6
msgctxt "hca3628cag6d77g4d50gaabagee82a83f5187"
msgid ""
"Still, some bonds are simply unbreakable. Neither axe nor the ticking bomb "
"of time can sever them."
msgstr "그래도 어떤 인연은 쉽게 끊어지지 않아. 도끼나 시한 폭탄 따위에도 끄떡없을 만큼 끈질기다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = d767aba7-1273-4cf3-7978-4553353bb7ea
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:d767aba7-1273-4cf3-7978-4553353bb7ea
msgctxt "h4475f30fge7f8g4bc1g92d1g5b76bd325cce"
msgid "I was quite popular too - I'm not picky about my customers."
msgstr "제법 잘나가는 편이었다고. 고객이라면 가려 받지 않았거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = d8ea2251-9e5a-f50a-b3ed-e8e2a2377fa3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:d8ea2251-9e5a-f50a-b3ed-e8e2a2377fa3
msgctxt "h37c4a659g4f4eg4892g9fe8g3972d7fbc5bf"
msgid "Thank you for noticing."
msgstr "알아봐 주니 고맙네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = d8fa9fcd-cd7c-1564-224c-03d36f4ae6fa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:d8fa9fcd-cd7c-1564-224c-03d36f4ae6fa
msgctxt "hdf0d67f7gf545g4f0bg87a9g4622c2494976"
msgid ""
"Hmm. You've done so much already. I'm hesitant to prevail upon you again, "
"but..."
msgstr "흐음. 넌 이미 많은 도움을 줬어. 또 다시 부탁하기가 좀 망설여지긴 하지만..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d9edfd92-89f2-c8d9-2763-b568f83c843f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - FOR_UnfortunateGnome_Knows_GnomeHasSmokepowder = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:d9edfd92-89f2-c8d9-2763-b568f83c843f
msgctxt "hab0fd979g3dcbg4307g9a3cg692735defcfb"
msgid "I'll take some more of those smokepowder bombs."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = de3f70a4-ec5b-3795-b92c-d5a43a6b4e5a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:de3f70a4-ec5b-3795-b92c-d5a43a6b4e5a
msgctxt "h30ae507eg78e0g4797g81d5g079ba3d4b7c6"
msgid "I have the feeling you're about to tell me."
msgstr "네가 곧 설명해 줄 것 같다는 느낌이 드는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e4142deb-b396-9f5e-756f-22f4c811f90f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:e4142deb-b396-9f5e-756f-22f4c811f90f
msgctxt "h17944265ga1a6g4a84gbc62g2a67fa6465c4"
msgid "Tell me a little more about yourself."
msgstr "너에 대해 좀 더 알려줘."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e7eb7ec7-deb1-60e6-9f68-84a40bbe56b4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:e7eb7ec7-deb1-60e6-9f68-84a40bbe56b4
msgctxt "hb5356d48gd0cdg4965g9913g38598c4dc555"
msgid "Other than a valuable explosive? Perhaps not."
msgstr "가치 있는 폭발물이라는 것 외에? 글쎄, 별로."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = ec683911-971f-1ade-bf49-788cab9781a8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:ec683911-971f-1ade-bf49-788cab9781a8
msgctxt "hb847486dg4f1ag46afg8652g3cce9457c608"
msgid "I'm not sure I should trust Wulbren's fate to, well, <i>me.</i>"
msgstr "그러니까 울브렌의 운명을, 음, <i>내</i> 손에 맡겨도 좋을지 모르겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = ec8b3ab2-4940-73f8-2057-0742cb79763d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:ec8b3ab2-4940-73f8-2057-0742cb79763d
msgctxt "hf989ca88g7e8cg4060gb9bbgde7767a693c0"
msgid "Nor I. Which means quick action is necessary."
msgstr "나도 그래. 그러니까 빨리 조치를 취해야 한다는 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = f1e370af-cfac-0f47-76e4-2e8efb768e90
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:f1e370af-cfac-0f47-76e4-2e8efb768e90
msgctxt "h4e58f758gbbabg44d3g8891ga5ec1bc25892"
msgid "Would you... would you look for him?"
msgstr "혹시... 혹시 그를 찾아봐 주겠어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f2e37d23-154e-502e-a313-cdb0531bee16
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:f2e37d23-154e-502e-a313-cdb0531bee16
msgctxt "h6fee9cf1gb97ag461eg8b30g54231193100d"
msgid "Surprise me - but make it good."
msgstr "날 놀래켜 봐. 좋은 걸로."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f3d7dc80-9fd4-a2fc-194e-487c0685c861
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:f3d7dc80-9fd4-a2fc-194e-487c0685c861
msgctxt "hc39e12aage95fg4e3cgbaf2g1d988eacd6fd"
msgid "This is your business - not mine."
msgstr "이건 네 사업이잖아. 내 알 바 아냐."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = f8aeba9a-f358-23ba-7ab8-857cb498c874
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:f8aeba9a-f358-23ba-7ab8-857cb498c874
msgctxt "h374f92b7g1090g40a0g87a0g47e64ee91e26"
msgid ""
"I shouldn't have let him drift away. Shouldn't have let that lot get their "
"claws into him."
msgstr "녀석을 내버려 둬선 안 됐어. 아이언핸드 놈들이 마수를 뻗치도록 놔둬선 안 됐다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = fb2020f2-c524-52a1-a940-5ecfc9df5571
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:fb2020f2-c524-52a1-a940-5ecfc9df5571
msgctxt "h4c53a644g4674g4237gb0dcg29f5b464d934"
msgid ""
"You saw people in need, and you helped them. It's what you do, apparently."
msgstr "넌 도움이 필요한 사람들을 그냥 지나치지 않았어. 분명 그러지 않고는 못 배기는 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fdb95c98-e8f3-7a57-1aa9-577e60643b7a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:fdb95c98-e8f3-7a57-1aa9-577e60643b7a
msgctxt "h2e42b138g7cc9g4bc4ga279gc1ce4a452f6d"
msgid "<i>Change the subject.</i>"
msgstr "<i>주제를 바꾼다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fec31e8b-d00d-e33d-4d51-0c0b0c8fb495
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_UnfortunateGnome:fec31e8b-d00d-e33d-4d51-0c0b0c8fb495
msgctxt "hc3bab300gb85dg42d6gacabg2f9c2dad1fea"
msgid "I'll find your friend - and together, we'll stop the Ironhand Gnomes."
msgstr "네 친구를 찾아 낼게. 우리는 함께 아이언핸드 노움들을 막을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_AD_SpawnEscapes
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = d7d0f083-b1a1-38e6-4b42-f494f82fd516
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_AD_SpawnEscapes:d7d0f083-b1a1-38e6-4b42-f494f82fd516
msgctxt "h96d71428g2d1dg4addgbd69g50cb78a87458"
msgid ""
"You can teleport now? Cazador doesn't want to lose anyone else, I suppose."
msgstr "이젠 순간이동도 할 수 있어? 카사도어가 아무도 잃고 싶지 않은 모양이네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_AD_SpawnKidnapsAstarion
#. Speaker = Aurelia
#. NodeID = 23a830f3-26d5-e19e-aa69-9d9898d6bf6c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_AD_SpawnKidnapsAstarion:23a830f3-26d5-e19e-aa69-9d9898d6bf6c
msgctxt "h3926184fg4f37g4daagbe7eg3be2ac22c3ee"
msgid "Come brother, it's time to go home."
msgstr "형제여, 집으로 돌아갈 시간이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_AD_SpawnKidnapsAstarion
#. Speaker = Aurelia
#. NodeID = 85f3accd-56f8-be1b-57e4-2de81eb3fea9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GEN_SoloPlayer = False
#.      - CAMP_VampireAmbush_State_OneSpawnLeft = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_AD_SpawnKidnapsAstarion:85f3accd-56f8-be1b-57e4-2de81eb3fea9
msgctxt "h800be6afgc9b0g4955g9be2g0a83caae4a13"
msgid ""
"I'll take Astarion to the master. The rest of you - deal with the witnesses."
msgstr "아스타리온을 주인님께 데려가겠다. 나머지는 - 목격자들을 처리해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_PAD_AstarionKidnapped
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 433035cc-18cc-cfb8-3933-8c9c31aa886a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(0) = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_PAD_AstarionKidnapped:433035cc-18cc-cfb8-3933-8c9c31aa886a
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h671dddaag1e61g4836g9e51g9f0ef74ed025"
msgid ""
"Better save any rescue attempts until dawn. Darkness is no ally in the "
"pursuit of such an enemy."
msgstr "구출 시도는 새벽이 될 때까지 기다리는 게 좋겠어. 적을 상대로 어둠은 우리의 아군이 아니니까."

