msgctxt "h92896c60gba2bg4638g9bcbg4abca6d45947"
msgid "They've taken Astarion back to Cazador."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_PAD_AstarionKidnapped
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c51dce40-7d7d-4875-d43e-56bc017b3a78
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(0) = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_PAD_AstarionKidnapped:c51dce40-7d7d-4875-d43e-56bc017b3a78
msgctxt "he0fbd7bdg99aag4646ga47cgcd00bf7303d3"
msgid ""
"The spawn got Astarion. Which means he's on his way to Cazador's palace."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_PAD_AstarionKidnapped
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c51dce40-7d7d-4875-d43e-56bc017b3a78
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(0) = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_PAD_AstarionKidnapped:c51dce40-7d7d-4875-d43e-56bc017b3a78
msgctxt "h45686f3dgffbcg4377g8244g78bb3e1ce1c8"
msgid "They've got him. They're taking Astarion back to Cazador."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_PAD_AstarionKidnapped
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c51dce40-7d7d-4875-d43e-56bc017b3a78
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(0) = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_JAHEIRA
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_PAD_AstarionKidnapped:c51dce40-7d7d-4875-d43e-56bc017b3a78
msgctxt "hfb454777gb04cg4a0bg86adgb4f04edb27b1"
msgid "Cazador has his leash 'round Astarion's throat once more."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_PAD_AstarionKidnapped
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c51dce40-7d7d-4875-d43e-56bc017b3a78
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(0) = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_HALSIN
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_PAD_AstarionKidnapped:c51dce40-7d7d-4875-d43e-56bc017b3a78
msgctxt "h25f26641gd8f4g499fg844aga94d903c3159"
msgid "They have seized Astarion. He'll be in Cazador's clutches now."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_PAD_AstarionKidnapped
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c51dce40-7d7d-4875-d43e-56bc017b3a78
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(0) = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_MINSC
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_PAD_AstarionKidnapped:c51dce40-7d7d-4875-d43e-56bc017b3a78
msgctxt "h1cd970c4ge8bcg43cfgae89gbfdb527d884e"
msgid "Cazador has got his teeth into poor and pale Astarion once more."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_PAD_AstarionKidnapped
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c51dce40-7d7d-4875-d43e-56bc017b3a78
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[8].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(0) = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_MINTHARA
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_PAD_AstarionKidnapped:c51dce40-7d7d-4875-d43e-56bc017b3a78
msgctxt "hd4c6de5bg0a34g4652g954cge0edd265c222"
msgid ""
"Cazador's spawn took Astarion. It is time we paid him a visit - I have never "
"killed a vampire lord before."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_PAD_AstarionKidnapped
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c51dce40-7d7d-4875-d43e-56bc017b3a78
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[9].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(0) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_PAD_AstarionKidnapped:c51dce40-7d7d-4875-d43e-56bc017b3a78
msgctxt "heea24f9cg8aa0g47adg8b39ga78da002a59a"
msgid ""
"They got Astarion, damn it. He's probably back at Cazador's palace already."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar
#. Speaker = Aurelia
#. NodeID = 047efd11-2fc0-5f98-e1ca-3df63d5b752d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar:047efd11-2fc0-5f98-e1ca-3df63d5b752d
msgctxt "hd38c7477gd1cdg480dgbac3gafb1efd13f69"
msgid ""
"The master said you might offer to come willing, but his orders were very "
"specific."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar
#. Speaker = Aurelia
#. NodeID = 050c280f-b27e-34d0-aed5-e65e7148b585
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar:050c280f-b27e-34d0-aed5-e65e7148b585
msgctxt "hee54e012gc4edg48b9gad1egbeb08ae76324"
msgid ""
"The scars he carved into our backs bind us to the ritual. Seven spawn, seven "
"sigils."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 054bc6f3-4c7c-c3cb-f428-423756c46437
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar:054bc6f3-4c7c-c3cb-f428-423756c46437
msgctxt "hb324bd9ag1250g4993g96c3ge3ef9363ab36"
msgid "<i>Attack.</i>"
msgstr "<i>공격한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0a5d2c3e-b66c-c0f1-0221-7e65c55c6474
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar:0a5d2c3e-b66c-c0f1-0221-7e65c55c6474
msgctxt "hbe1e8982g1af4g4204g8795g1adb2a65dc15"
msgid "And if I refuse to come?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar
#. Speaker = Leon
#. NodeID = 0a9a2b5e-8d60-56f7-2739-96070f1a110a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar:0a9a2b5e-8d60-56f7-2739-96070f1a110a
msgctxt "h058ae02dg8d02g4607gba39gbd04cf0e4c87"
msgid "But if brother's right, we're more useful to him dead."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar
#. Speaker = Aurelia
#. NodeID = 0e7c1d49-633a-24ed-14cf-14ebe2c6908e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar:0e7c1d49-633a-24ed-14cf-14ebe2c6908e
msgctxt "ha8493408g8bd4g42d5g90b4gcaa06628b938"
msgid "And he needs you, Astarion. It's time to come home."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar
#. Speaker = Leon
#. NodeID = 0f985c22-8a7a-d60a-1aa3-edcdc7304764
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar:0f985c22-8a7a-d60a-1aa3-edcdc7304764
msgctxt "h0ff4950ag7a39g4507ga65fgd2d2b7676b76"
msgid "He's going to end us?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar
#. Speaker = Aurelia
#. NodeID = 10883f35-8705-5b6e-5421-71deaa9f00ab
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar:10883f35-8705-5b6e-5421-71deaa9f00ab
msgctxt "hea8cac2dgcc84g4821gb06fg9b8e79951cf1"
msgid ""
"Still picking fights you can't win? You always were pig-headed, brother."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 188e8ab1-17b3-fee9-0ddd-df0688450fff
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar:188e8ab1-17b3-fee9-0ddd-df0688450fff
msgctxt "hd0f73f3egaef4g4699gbb7egaad099c2fb19"
msgid ""
"*Should you face Cazador? Should you run? And what of his ritual - this "
"'Ascension' - how can you turn that to your advantage?*"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 20b926dd-b555-f21f-ff07-52e31f52e3ac
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar:20b926dd-b555-f21f-ff07-52e31f52e3ac
msgctxt "h925406b6g52a2g49d4g86fcg935db2264e48"
msgid ""
"*You're weighing up your prospects when a faint noise jerks you alert. "
"There's someone in the dark...*"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar
#. Speaker = Leon
#. NodeID = 275614a2-9755-174f-cb2c-ec57431be64e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar:275614a2-9755-174f-cb2c-ec57431be64e
msgctxt "hb48ba0e4g13fag4a6fg86fbg21b8d7277f54"
msgid "Together? Since when do you care 'bout anyone but yourself?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar
#. Speaker = Leon
#. NodeID = 27a0e08c-4cb5-b96f-56a6-f514d08a79dc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar:27a0e08c-4cb5-b96f-56a6-f514d08a79dc
msgctxt "h2bd9d3afg8df2g4579gba0fg3f98298c2c19"
msgid "Maybe you could take Cazador's place. Maybe you could free us."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar
#. Speaker = Aurelia
#. NodeID = 28acdbee-c48e-ecd8-248f-9dbc482e5e26
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar:28acdbee-c48e-ecd8-248f-9dbc482e5e26
msgctxt "hcf2eef6fg36c8g4879g8fd2gd1ee01408c0e"
msgid ""
"Of course not, the master needs us. We're loyal. And more to the point, "
"we're useful."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar
#. Speaker = Leon
#. NodeID = 2ab580a7-98da-b3fc-0f59-ea59ef57190f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar:2ab580a7-98da-b3fc-0f59-ea59ef57190f
msgctxt "hda0ab9f5g09dbg47f8g8133gc2ccff283724"
msgid "Fight him? You know we can't. "
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar
#. Speaker = Aurelia
#. NodeID = 2cfccf32-fd68-b3b0-0a48-1d84cda8a4b4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar:2cfccf32-fd68-b3b0-0a48-1d84cda8a4b4
msgctxt "hd5d9f1a9g2a4cg4dfagb77fg0f39fb0cb3cb"
msgid "You're not listening, brother. You have to come with us."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar
#. Speaker = Aurelia
#. NodeID = 3464d0f7-faf2-ce4a-aca1-86b83e25233e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar:3464d0f7-faf2-ce4a-aca1-86b83e25233e
msgctxt "ha2fab92cg17bbg49cegb0f0g5dba001cdd4a"
msgid ""
"You want us to throw away our chance at freedom? On your word that you can "
"defeat the master? Be serious."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar
#. Speaker = Aurelia
#. NodeID = 36033612-0bf4-f5fe-5b24-430271ab023b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar:36033612-0bf4-f5fe-5b24-430271ab023b
msgctxt "h41dccbc4gf0adg4992ga8d7gf8ace45d4d23"
msgid "Of course not, the master's no fool. He needs us."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar
#. Speaker = Leon
#. NodeID = 461410a5-5269-da2c-e924-aeb544900e50
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar:461410a5-5269-da2c-e924-aeb544900e50
msgctxt "h6aaae4a7g2689g4da1gad01gf74daada63ae"
msgid "Sorry, brother. This is the best we can do."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar
#. Speaker = Leon
#. NodeID = 4d9b9ecf-afc1-61ab-57ae-9ba46c15f491
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar:4d9b9ecf-afc1-61ab-57ae-9ba46c15f491
msgctxt "hcfccf24cgcc72g4273gaf4eg3a40b45eb054"
msgid "The master said bring you home - so you're coming home."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar
#. Speaker = Aurelia
#. NodeID = 4df1874f-0f4b-949b-8924-19c450b9af40
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar:4df1874f-0f4b-949b-8924-19c450b9af40
msgctxt "hd371ac18g738dg4077gb975gefe9fb53f3ce"
msgid "You may be free of his rules, but we're not."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 4f8eb43e-7b20-4482-822a-193370af0e9f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar:4f8eb43e-7b20-4482-822a-193370af0e9f
msgctxt "hb3eb7a54gb3cag4abbgb397gac08887f3b6b"
msgid ""
"*Rest does not come easy tonight. Your mind considers one future after "
"another, teasing apart the possibilities.*"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar
#. Speaker = Aurelia
#. NodeID = 5fc7db3e-c71e-6451-fcc7-d52f76b6b6c6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar:5fc7db3e-c71e-6451-fcc7-d52f76b6b6c6
msgctxt "hdb88f858g3969g4eefgb7d0g4a2e73b1c8ad"
msgid ""
"Easy to say, but we can't disobey the master. We're not as lucky as you, "
"Astarion."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 624c3c8a-8671-5a72-2357-ed339b57431b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 20
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_Astarion_Knows_RitualsPurpose = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar:624c3c8a-8671-5a72-2357-ed339b57431b
msgctxt "habf74074g0b27g4392g878cge94ff4b4cad4"
msgid ""
"Listen to me, this ritual of Cazador's - we're part of it. He's going to "
"sacrifice us all!"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 6b5fe787-898e-9f3a-3404-74cbb19dd64d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 15
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar:6b5fe787-898e-9f3a-3404-74cbb19dd64d
msgctxt "h2223b318g7ab3g4caagaf1bg79a0a785bc38"
msgid "It's a lie - Cazador would never share power with us."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar
#. Speaker = Leon
#. NodeID = 6bc609c5-b063-68dc-c114-4ce44a6a74d2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar:6bc609c5-b063-68dc-c114-4ce44a6a74d2
msgctxt "h67ce0d07g8204g4163ga93fga6ce524dec3c"
msgid "Not with you, maybe. Not with the runt of the kennel."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 72b0d056-4fb0-6900-a9f9-e305beff74ed
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 15
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar:72b0d056-4fb0-6900-a9f9-e305beff74ed
msgctxt "hbccd4da6g6df0g4dd7gb9f8g82bd60cde516"
msgid ""
"I can beat Cazador. Follow me, help me complete the ritual, and I'll set you "
"free."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7a887ca8-f038-671a-3d99-d3a3e2e5ffa6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar:7a887ca8-f038-671a-3d99-d3a3e2e5ffa6
msgctxt "hf228c403g810fg4f35g8cdegdffeb4d55f7a"
msgid "I'm not going anywhere with you."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7f8e3167-ede2-5972-d05f-8622b69c335a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar:7f8e3167-ede2-5972-d05f-8622b69c335a
msgctxt "he58cef1cgc7adg40b8g88b7gef0d462cfefa"
msgid "All right, let's go home."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar
#. Speaker = Leon
#. NodeID = 99de5a3d-dc19-852b-bde6-22aa225051ec
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar:99de5a3d-dc19-852b-bde6-22aa225051ec
msgctxt "h72411001gcbf4g4b16g8429ge23367542986"
msgid "Refuse? But 'thou shalt obey me in all things'."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar
#. Speaker = Leon
#. NodeID = a01302c6-2384-ae25-f692-17e94f4a0002
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar:a01302c6-2384-ae25-f692-17e94f4a0002
msgctxt "h92e80eb4gefa7g4a16g9d60g33dc41f35599"
msgid ""
"The master's holding a Black Mass. That's where he'll ascend, and we'll get "
"to live again."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar
#. Speaker = Aurelia
#. NodeID = a1d0a98c-00cf-f58e-164f-04631c846f09
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar:a1d0a98c-00cf-f58e-164f-04631c846f09
msgctxt "h3dfcd71fgf233g464fg86c9g109a95454e72"
msgid "You don't know? The Rite of Profane Ascension."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar
#. Speaker = Aurelia
#. NodeID = a322db08-195d-d3b1-7a8c-6c40a47279de
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar:a322db08-195d-d3b1-7a8c-6c40a47279de
msgctxt "h7d2fe8cdg507cg40c9gbc39g95f5561a60c1"
msgid "We've listened to you for long enough, brother. We have our commands."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar
#. Speaker = Leon
#. NodeID = a9412a93-1fce-04fb-d716-680ad1f4241e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar:a9412a93-1fce-04fb-d716-680ad1f4241e
msgctxt "hb428742fg469bg4910gab5dg76c1d0e098d7"
msgid ""
"And you're number seven - the final piece of the Rite. He needs us all for "
"the Black Mass."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b9202a47-f7b6-63c5-82c3-82b3ee20cf32
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_Astarion_Knows_RitualsPurpose = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar:b9202a47-f7b6-63c5-82c3-82b3ee20cf32
msgctxt "h25dd7337gb1d9g46a0g93c7gb3e5a4d4f215"
msgid "What ritual? What are you talking about?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar
#. Speaker = Leon
#. NodeID = c7e6fce0-22b7-a71d-889b-1a1353539c77
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar:c7e6fce0-22b7-a71d-889b-1a1353539c77
msgctxt "h324edb66ga921g44b7gbd39g60324fe6a8ad"
msgid "Follow you? The runt of the kennel? Master's favourite toy?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar
#. Speaker = Leon
#. NodeID = c8f1eecc-e5a9-7d43-2249-d44d3d8dd639
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar:c8f1eecc-e5a9-7d43-2249-d44d3d8dd639
msgctxt "h656cb67eg9f3fg4473ga4bbg36da710ca174"
msgid "Maybe. Don't change nothing, though."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar
#. Speaker = Aurelia
#. NodeID = ccf06549-b347-73fd-5085-fab1d1cfb70b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar:ccf06549-b347-73fd-5085-fab1d1cfb70b
msgctxt "h76d01861g3bbag47afgbe06gb0d30bc55aef"
msgid "When the master ascends, he'll take us with him. We'll all be free."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar
#. Speaker = Leon
#. NodeID = cd83fcd5-b914-5f56-a380-3fd0e93463b3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar:cd83fcd5-b914-5f56-a380-3fd0e93463b3
msgctxt "hf4215665ge0a8g4882g98e6g0befe79f58ed"
msgid ""
"The master told us to take you alive. 'As broken as possible, but alive.'"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar
#. Speaker = Leon
#. NodeID = cf468fb2-49bf-2f48-9630-8f09022335dc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 28819261-4c96-a019-1dd3-1ca89bd2aa5e_vampirescalledastarionweak = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar:cf468fb2-49bf-2f48-9630-8f09022335dc
msgctxt "h1616e926g6b54g4856gacd3gb535645c296f"
msgid "You were always weak, brother. We don't follow weak. "
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar
#. Speaker = Leon
#. NodeID = d8f092f5-6dbf-3d48-b049-3c4cb17f418f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar:d8f092f5-6dbf-3d48-b049-3c4cb17f418f
msgctxt "h799e3f17g22c1g4633g8933g85c6bd182ddc"
msgid ""
"Master said bring him home. Master said to fight... Never forbade us from "
"talking, though."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar
#. Speaker = Leon
#. NodeID = e11d3c4e-b54c-0d9c-248a-614e013e0793
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar:e11d3c4e-b54c-0d9c-248a-614e013e0793
msgctxt "h9790090ege9e0g46b9ga46ag237ec24ef768"
msgid ""
"We'll walk in the sun. We won't feel hungry all the time. We'll be <i>living "
"vampires</i>."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar
#. Speaker = Aurelia
#. NodeID = e35d4a42-4beb-ff1b-4eff-a5b5997b716b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - WYR_VampireSpawns_Knows_AstarionInCity = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar:e35d4a42-4beb-ff1b-4eff-a5b5997b716b
msgctxt "h76c81696g3915g4143g901ag8aec5367ed41"
msgid ""
"It seems Petras was right - the rules no longer apply to our dear brother."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar
#. Speaker = Leon
#. NodeID = e3f7d92c-f241-651f-8e5a-6cf72c1c77e0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar:e3f7d92c-f241-651f-8e5a-6cf72c1c77e0
msgctxt "h1d9fccc7g5f32g4cf3g9ffdgdfac6b66587c"
msgid "You do look different - stronger, fire in your eyes."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar
#. Speaker = Aurelia
#. NodeID = eab05c79-0a6e-ae92-b03d-be48afccb05f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar:eab05c79-0a6e-ae92-b03d-be48afccb05f
msgctxt "hd0513748ge0bbg416eg8f69g34b74483956d"
msgid "Peace, brother. We're just here to take you home."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar
#. Speaker = Leon
#. NodeID = ee432634-ce31-5cad-0caa-58f76712c5d3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar:ee432634-ce31-5cad-0caa-58f76712c5d3
msgctxt "h95504f5bg7270g4c8bg93f3g906f0479a664"
msgid "Don't matter. The master needs all seven of us for the ritual."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar
#. Speaker = Leon
#. NodeID = ee8a1d34-5c5e-a1f7-2f2e-1eeb6df270b9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar:ee8a1d34-5c5e-a1f7-2f2e-1eeb6df270b9
msgctxt "hb10897bcgb244g4882g9755ge0d8457ba542"
msgid "Shit."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = f2c5e63b-366f-7494-ebcc-6516d1909481
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 15
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - WYR_VampireSpawns_State_IntroHappened = True
#.      - ORI_Astarion_Knows_RitualsPurpose = False
#.      - ORI_Astarion_Act3_WantsRitualComplete = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar:f2c5e63b-366f-7494-ebcc-6516d1909481
msgctxt "hee003bcbg4a12g4ab0gada4g9e5cbf16aa0f"
msgid "What if we joined together? Fought Cazador together?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar
#. Speaker = Aurelia
#. NodeID = f360435d-9fff-28e0-4555-2dd3fb3a0b6d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar:f360435d-9fff-28e0-4555-2dd3fb3a0b6d
msgctxt "h6e54b328g48a9g46f7g9338g95c0423be258"
msgid "Then we'll die! Unlike our sweet brother, we've no choice but to obey. "
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar
#. Speaker = Aurelia
#. NodeID = f8f506f2-09aa-18f5-ea69-5cf602f857c8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar:f8f506f2-09aa-18f5-ea69-5cf602f857c8
msgctxt "h819c04bbg90eeg4803g858eg43a3d8451521"
msgid "Looks like the rules no longer apply to our dear brother. Curious."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar
#. Speaker = Aurelia
#. NodeID = fe0e711b-9ef1-6ff5-c967-4407a8902d45
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Avatar:fe0e711b-9ef1-6ff5-c967-4407a8902d45
msgctxt "h9cf7c220gd0dbg4859g8307gb0e8e53b4881"
msgid "We'll walk in the sun. We'll finally be <i>free</i>, brother."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 017828d1-9f65-74a8-955d-c88468a0de5a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:017828d1-9f65-74a8-955d-c88468a0de5a
msgctxt "h8ff207cbgd64dg4ee3gaf28gc969dd59fe3c"
msgid "Thank you for your unerring support."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Leon
#. NodeID = 023e9ab8-f82a-6560-efa0-e8cfcaab614a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - WYR_VampireSpawns_Knows_AstarionInCity = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:023e9ab8-f82a-6560-efa0-e8cfcaab614a
msgctxt "hfb732880g38deg4db2ga03eg178538a34ba4"
msgid ""
"You're free of him? Petras was right - you've changed. Maybe you could "
"complete the ritual. Maybe you could free us."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Leon
#. NodeID = 02f1c312-2e24-4269-93dc-b5bea64e84ac
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:02f1c312-2e24-4269-93dc-b5bea64e84ac
msgctxt "h67bd339cg54f3g4731g9c06g757580a49c1a"
msgid ""
"He is different - stronger, fire in his eyes.  Maybe he could take Cazador's "
"place. Maybe he could free us."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 03e400bd-29f6-6515-6c93-47b2837165ab
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:03e400bd-29f6-6515-6c93-47b2837165ab
msgctxt "h1119dd3bg809cg46f8gbac0g8efcf37f70a8"
msgid "Take him if you want, just keep it down. I'm trying to rest."
msgstr "데려가고 싶으면 마음대로 하고, 좀 조용히 해줘. 난 휴식 중이라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 05695c5e-bb8d-de59-a14c-a66ab6a6773a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 5b4812bc-634b-9181-033b-521e6b127bbc_vampiresfriendly = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:05695c5e-bb8d-de59-a14c-a66ab6a6773a
msgctxt "hf45e1c81g8726g475cga1a0g9cbe0c082013"
msgid "The way they contorted... they were compelled by Cazador, weren't they?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 08628a76-d31f-ab5a-ffe9-aa500e4204ee
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 18
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:08628a76-d31f-ab5a-ffe9-aa500e4204ee
msgctxt "h8b4de94dg5a92g4dd9g923dgb08bb1638910"
msgid "Astarion has the strength to defeat Cazador. We should stand together."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 09e63afd-1641-84d5-8063-c54b670bed36
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:09e63afd-1641-84d5-8063-c54b670bed36
msgctxt "hf2f45a20gdf6eg4c62g9753g91228b33428c"
msgid "I suppose it doesn't."
msgstr "그건 좀 아닌 것 같은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0c2da483-51b5-a908-d652-e684299f41db
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:0c2da483-51b5-a908-d652-e684299f41db
msgctxt "h299b3fbfg81a4g43b8ga981gfc3226f6ca47"
msgid ""
"There are many others like me who will care for you, if you care for them."
msgstr "네가 다른 사람들에게 관심을 주면, 그 사람들도 나처럼 널 좋아하게 될 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 0c3ea9d3-7ee4-5cd9-b73d-59143d6e3ea5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:0c3ea9d3-7ee4-5cd9-b73d-59143d6e3ea5
msgctxt "h92cf5814g442bg4cceg8305g70d5123a60e5"
msgid ""
"He will be <i>furious</i>. And he'll be even more furious when I get to that "
"crypt and stop him."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0c8373df-ab85-2a22-b358-a21cb1f01b36
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 15
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:0c8373df-ab85-2a22-b358-a21cb1f01b36
msgctxt "he8b529b5ged05g409fgba94g4482dc49778d"
msgid ""
"He's free of Cazador's command. You should follow him. He will save you."
msgstr "아스타리온은 카사도어의 명령에서 벗어났지. 그를 따르는 게 좋을 거야, 너희를 구해줄 수도 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 0dd9eb33-6369-e061-fed1-bdabad66d793
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:0dd9eb33-6369-e061-fed1-bdabad66d793
msgctxt "h060ec3e6g0311g41deg8067g13b223fd6f77"
msgid ""
"It wouldn't be the worst thing he's ever done to us. You know I'm right, "
"sister."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0ecefee6-e1ac-99da-b05d-2144233f6676
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:0ecefee6-e1ac-99da-b05d-2144233f6676
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h2d54a65bgf4f6g4381g99dbgb5bd111605fe"
msgid "I have no words. I'm so sorry."
msgstr "할 말이 없어. 정말 미안해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 102f1701-c35d-b16c-891f-6f6502397e23
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:102f1701-c35d-b16c-891f-6f6502397e23
msgctxt "he0e6854bgfb2eg42a5gb853g58a9d6300b1b"
msgid "I wish they had."
msgstr "그랬으면 좋았을 텐데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 10fbc6f8-dbdf-9b12-6335-ecdc2a3e60c2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:10fbc6f8-dbdf-9b12-6335-ecdc2a3e60c2
msgctxt "h88fa63d8g7f74g45a8ga23dg1beb13e4d054"
msgid ""
"After these centuries of torment, I know what you all want. More than power. "
"More than to walk in the sun."
msgstr "몇 세기간 고통을 받으면 너희가 뭘 원하는지 정도는 알아. 힘보다도, 태양 아래를 거니는 것보다도 더 원하는 걸 말이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 11f67b3a-9f9f-3b64-7d95-0b6119c350d9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
