msgctxt "hd6da8993g3dc6g46fbgba9bg40e1a2fa3a7f"
msgid "Vengeance will taste sweet, paired with Ascension. "
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 145f994b-93bb-6fd6-4617-8be412de1e1c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:145f994b-93bb-6fd6-4617-8be412de1e1c
msgctxt "hba266a90gf5cag4025g99c1g4422c0db8129"
msgid "<i>Give a sombre look.</i>"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 15a28273-981b-b061-c48b-27d0e5117bdd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:15a28273-981b-b061-c48b-27d0e5117bdd
msgctxt "h01abaa03g7b58g449ega9b6ge9a44d3044ab"
msgid "Get the hells away from me!"
msgstr "내 앞에서 썩 꺼져!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 15e337f3-d5fd-f4da-fa0e-ef7b34641b35
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:15e337f3-d5fd-f4da-fa0e-ef7b34641b35
msgctxt "ha39d9cf4g0642g4c43gaf24gbafd5609b3f3"
msgid ""
"The world can be a wonderful, kind place, Astarion, when you find a home in "
"it."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 17656e7f-0aa8-d3d3-2a34-1ec97ad61c2f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:17656e7f-0aa8-d3d3-2a34-1ec97ad61c2f
msgctxt "hf9a98426g06ddg4748gb71agb6db48d4ae1f"
msgid "I hope we can get some rest now."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 18c1d180-1328-bd79-a952-c23d86969009
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:18c1d180-1328-bd79-a952-c23d86969009
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "hb9b348abg94f1g4f36gba8egd16fd8a79d6d"
msgid ""
"Once - in the first decade of my slavery - I found a darling boy who I "
"couldn't bear to bring back to him. So I ran, instead of hurting that sweet "
"man."
msgstr ""
"내가 노예가 된 지 10년쯤 되었을 때였어. 너무나 사랑스러운 소년을 만났는데 도저히 희생양으로 데려갈 수가 없었지. 그래서 그 다정한 "
"사람을 갖다 바치는 대신 난 도망쳤어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1c729f99-81dc-faf7-e0bc-728d654d2abb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_Astarion_Knows_RitualsPurpose = True
#.      - ORI_Astarion_Act3_WantsRitualComplete = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:1c729f99-81dc-faf7-e0bc-728d654d2abb
msgctxt "hb9c5e5ecgb8e6g49e5g929egbc20943f1092"
msgid "Had we killed them, Cazador wouldn't be able to complete the Rite."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 225d44f0-2b78-3c90-88a7-36a01fa21389
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:225d44f0-2b78-3c90-88a7-36a01fa21389
msgctxt "h8d2f6b7fg8e7fg4df0g82bag999afcef9cea"
msgid "Don't act haughty, you're only one tadpole away from being one of them."
msgstr "오만하게 굴진 마. 너도 올챙이가 없었으면 저 사람들과 같은 처지야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 26816096-4de2-d9b6-4c7e-061fb98c78df
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:26816096-4de2-d9b6-4c7e-061fb98c78df
msgctxt "he9bae345g71efg4e67g9123g32a1b216e532"
msgid ""
"You think he's ever kept a promise? He will never let us be free... You all "
"know that."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 2864f962-5777-2572-1532-ae8cea332ba5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:2864f962-5777-2572-1532-ae8cea332ba5
msgctxt "heb8fa77ag0728g4f85ga11ag34a24a2d81df"
msgid "So don't you ever judge me for doing what Cazador ordered."
msgstr "그러니 내가 카사도어의 명령을 그대로 따랐다고 해서 날 비난할 생각 마."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 2c69c167-f5e9-9eee-3edc-4b863dbba37c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:2c69c167-f5e9-9eee-3edc-4b863dbba37c
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h94ec5dacg88c3g4a24g917fgfa5494ab374c"
msgid ""
"A year of silence. Months of scratching my hands raw, trying to carve my way "
"out. More months of not moving at all. Months wishing only for death."
msgstr ""
"침묵에 둘러싸인 일 년이었어. 몇 달 동안은 빠져나가려고 맨손으로 긁어댔지. 더 오랫동안은 움직일 수조차 없었고. 제발 죽기만을 바랐던 "
"날들이었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2d366e2b-5877-a01e-d59f-99c83044b88e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:2d366e2b-5877-a01e-d59f-99c83044b88e
msgctxt "h54ae3f44g5a59g467aga236g0cd4e663b5af"
msgid "We can save you. Let us help."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 2ed3744a-f0ba-31f2-04c9-945c4fe45fc3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:2ed3744a-f0ba-31f2-04c9-945c4fe45fc3
msgctxt "hc848ab53g9c1ag44dbg8ef9g00013a0562a9"
msgid "You want to see him dead."
msgstr "그놈이 죽은 걸 보고 싶은 거지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 3357b44a-562c-a75d-7e8a-226c63691438
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:3357b44a-562c-a75d-7e8a-226c63691438
msgctxt "hd4aae39cg52bcg45f1g830agd5479eb4d7f8"
msgid ""
"For what it's worth, thank you. No matter what happens down there, you "
"helped me stand up against him."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 33baa02d-d95f-4656-0f6b-570bd0e3b8e2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:33baa02d-d95f-4656-0f6b-570bd0e3b8e2
msgctxt "hfb3b60c4ge110g4eeega457ga28a4df96544"
msgid "Don't spoil this for me. I almost had them -"
msgstr "망치지 마. 거의 다 넘어왔는데..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 34137011-71bd-4fdc-077a-b27bb4f4d62f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 5b4812bc-634b-9181-033b-521e6b127bbc_vampiresfriendly = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:34137011-71bd-4fdc-077a-b27bb4f4d62f
msgctxt "h63639c57g945eg440ega6cegf8a0fe01df27"
msgid ""
"Cazador's bond forced their hands against us - can he still force yours?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 34653268-e02f-d978-08cd-4423f44cce49
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:34653268-e02f-d978-08cd-4423f44cce49
msgctxt "h90519278g68bbg4f1agabc7g13240b6ae3fe"
msgid "Easy to say the words, isn't it?"
msgstr "말로만 하는 건 참 쉽지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Aurelia
#. NodeID = 35f6470e-b6d0-72d6-6d7a-52f8f404684b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 5b4812bc-634b-9181-033b-521e6b127bbc_vampiresfriendly = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:35f6470e-b6d0-72d6-6d7a-52f8f404684b
msgctxt "h70a782fbg8a48g4796gb036g8a2d38d35202"
msgid ""
"This is our <i>only</i> chance to be free, to end <i>centuries</i> of "
"slavery. You will <i>not</i> ruin it, Astarion!"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 37ffe483-a3a3-bdbd-b1ca-e005c2d06938
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:37ffe483-a3a3-bdbd-b1ca-e005c2d06938
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "ha4ba2c1cg83ebg4798gbce7g2b02b48af294"
msgid "Move forward, and get your revenge."
msgstr "앞으로 나아가서, 네 복수를 해야지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 39e85ffc-78ab-c853-0344-399c07ff52ab
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:39e85ffc-78ab-c853-0344-399c07ff52ab
msgctxt "h7d3742b7gd9b0g4be4g9f67g780aac5141f1"
msgid "We aren't like them. We are <i>better</i>."
msgstr "우리는 그들과 달라. 우리는 더 <i>나은</i> 사람들이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Aurelia
#. NodeID = 4147f388-cf2b-a7ac-01e9-cb846aae040b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:4147f388-cf2b-a7ac-01e9-cb846aae040b
msgctxt "h493c2490gfd6dg45f4g9279g43f629ed8833"
msgid ""
"That's true. We can say whatever we like, once we're trying to take him "
"back. "
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4150f3a9-68bb-0f20-a83b-0c8a8227a1e6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:4150f3a9-68bb-0f20-a83b-0c8a8227a1e6
msgctxt "h9ee3458dg49e2g4f9dg8265gf7f244b06bde"
msgid "We are going to kill him, and anything that gets in our way."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Leon
#. NodeID = 452c1eeb-6461-fccb-cf4b-d5fd918c008b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:452c1eeb-6461-fccb-cf4b-d5fd918c008b
msgctxt "hab170c72g048cg4f8fgac9fg7e75a5b223d6"
msgid "He's going to kill us?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 475461d6-e2ab-3cfe-3dcf-d67d870da330
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_BloodMerchant_State_SupportedAstarionsDecisionNotToDrinkBlood = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:475461d6-e2ab-3cfe-3dcf-d67d870da330
msgctxt "h18f76996g0bf6g488eg9730g002b8e35972d"
msgid "No one ever looked out for me. No one ever said a kind thing to me."
msgstr "아무도 나를 생각해 주지 않았어. 나에게 친절한 말 한마디 해준 사람도 없었지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Aurelia
#. NodeID = 494151de-6e3d-ab99-d41e-c55e0303619e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:494151de-6e3d-ab99-d41e-c55e0303619e
msgctxt "h24c5bdcdg0383g453bgbe08g943aa3b36520"
msgid ""
"Master Cazador has known where Astarion was this entire time. He knew he "
"would return."
msgstr "카사도어 주인님께서는 내내 아스타리온이 어디 있는지 알고 계셨지. 그리고 돌아올 것도 알고 계셨어. "

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4ae19d87-1a1a-7abc-af28-ed2629d0489b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:4ae19d87-1a1a-7abc-af28-ed2629d0489b
msgctxt "h8321de89g8c76g44d3g9b1bge1865e549c1e"
msgid "You're slaughter-lambs, all. Cazador needs your souls."
msgstr "너희 모두 희생양이라는 거야. 카사도어는 너희의 영혼이 필요한 것뿐이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 4b966318-7896-3efa-9fa9-5c1478ae79ad
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:4b966318-7896-3efa-9fa9-5c1478ae79ad
msgctxt "h92990da1g39d6g48b2gba80gb04a2273db1c"
msgid "And when he doesn't need you anymore? What then, sister?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4c414a34-e3fb-d8f1-2f56-6e8232aaf9ef
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 18
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:4c414a34-e3fb-d8f1-2f56-6e8232aaf9ef
msgctxt "h2c53643dgbcdfg4853ga91eg4d714f5cbed8"
msgid "I was only teasing you."
msgstr "그냥 너한테 장난치려고 한 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4e9205af-6d86-8e3f-8d7c-231556cfb82d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:4e9205af-6d86-8e3f-8d7c-231556cfb82d
msgctxt "h6bfedeaeg7ca7g4dceg8d60gcb89bb5a02b5"
msgid "Come on, use your pretty heads. The ritual is a sacrifice."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 4e9b4a93-c9de-6700-979c-ffc63f116842
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:4e9b4a93-c9de-6700-979c-ffc63f116842
msgctxt "h63f95903g2a4fg49c6g88c1g9b34e46b4b91"
msgid ""
"After Cazador caught me, the bastard <i>sealed me</i>, <i>starving</i>, "
"inside a dusty tomb, all on my own, for an entire year."
msgstr "카사도어가 나를 붙잡은 뒤, 그 개자식은 일 년 동안 나를 더러운 무덤에 <i>가둬버렸어</i>. <i>굶긴 채로</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Leon
#. NodeID = 50498b90-dc77-56d4-2df4-5b32bb7e0038
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:50498b90-dc77-56d4-2df4-5b32bb7e0038
msgctxt "haed23f68g1411g41c9g9288g54abdf54276c"
msgid "Because it's more cruel... shit."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Leon
#. NodeID = 5167906b-f395-5995-ed5d-1be407c6c1eb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(2) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:5167906b-f395-5995-ed5d-1be407c6c1eb
msgctxt "h002ebe8dgb3c7g48e5gb563gf8178d9f8f96"
msgid "Sorry, brother, orders is orders. This is the best we can do."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 5229ff59-7a11-9364-9d38-31535fdaf366
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:5229ff59-7a11-9364-9d38-31535fdaf366
msgctxt "h4df4004dg465dg4f55g9965ge4db688cec78"
msgid "I'm glad you know."
msgstr "알고 있다니 다행이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Aurelia
#. NodeID = 531541db-47c9-478c-0ffb-d95c9c5886a0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 5b4812bc-634b-9181-033b-521e6b127bbc_vampiresfriendly = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:531541db-47c9-478c-0ffb-d95c9c5886a0
msgctxt "h1e7376c0g1c74g404fg9c93g292d1e00b9ad"
msgid ""
"The bond's hold. He owns us. We have no choice, we must obey. Get out of "
"here, Astarion, before..."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Leon
#. NodeID = 53c1306a-7ee0-406c-ab92-ecfcd2d62f56
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(2) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:53c1306a-7ee0-406c-ab92-ecfcd2d62f56
msgctxt "h602eaccega100g4f53g8a2bgdd0db3ed0662"
msgid ""
"The master said to take our brother alive. Didn't say anything about you."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 54387b37-21cb-4063-8910-db75a25a8737
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:54387b37-21cb-4063-8910-db75a25a8737
msgctxt "h357e1c30g9695g4926g8d5eg08fc418025f2"
msgid "He truly broke you."
msgstr "그놈이 널 정말로 망가뜨렸어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 5ab6cf5c-31bb-7d76-cf0b-a82700f7f78b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:5ab6cf5c-31bb-7d76-cf0b-a82700f7f78b
msgctxt "h1b74ec89gef41g4f3ag92cbgd8ea5842ebac"
msgid ""
"What a lovely invitation, but I'm afraid I'll have to decline. I intend to "
"kill him, you see?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 5e6aac19-5528-4b6c-8a5f-b65ac6ecc65a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_Astarion_Knows_RitualsPurpose = True
#.      - ORI_Astarion_Act3_WantsRitualComplete = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:5e6aac19-5528-4b6c-8a5f-b65ac6ecc65a
msgctxt "h8b81b4dcg4714g4486g9829g3808623b5050"
msgid "What a mess. Well, at least you've met my family now."
msgstr "이게 웬 난장판이람. 그래도 드디어 네가 내 가족을 만났구나."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 61ee9d5d-1757-4088-a93c-c054a41e2cde
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:61ee9d5d-1757-4088-a93c-c054a41e2cde
msgctxt "h8e6cbf95g9431g4c66g9b8cge4c4c2f6ef08"
msgid "<i>Attack these new spawn.</i>"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 630426a4-caa2-4d04-9884-9d0610862e81
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:630426a4-caa2-4d04-9884-9d0610862e81
msgctxt "he959cb3cg3c02g4caegb58aga30aa73ed367"
msgid ""
"Why bother? They seem to <i>like </i>their torturer, now. What does it "
"matter if they end up dead?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6580deaa-e32a-c7ee-c3e1-1721f8a45539
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:6580deaa-e32a-c7ee-c3e1-1721f8a45539
msgctxt "h27f10bdeg73ccg488bg933fg67a59b4fe23b"
msgid "Even if they're misled, they're in danger."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 663abef0-e9bd-a29c-a421-5c887cd8bc8b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 15
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:663abef0-e9bd-a29c-a421-5c887cd8bc8b
msgctxt "h6d230db3gcf9bg4984g81edgf0220d8b20ce"
msgid ""
"Have you no heart, Astarion? You're asking them to <i>die</i> for you in "
"this ritual."
msgstr "동정심도 없어, 아스타리온? 널 위해서 의식에서<i> 죽어달라고</i> 부탁하는 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 689798bb-2415-a8d0-386a-53489262c476
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_Astarion_Knows_RitualsPurpose = True
#.      - ORI_Astarion_Act3_WantsRitualComplete = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:689798bb-2415-a8d0-386a-53489262c476
msgctxt "h85ab09c4g9301g447cgadd2gdc48a4222b7a"
msgid ""
"I can't believe how you lied to them. You know they'll have to die for the "
"Rite to happen."
msgstr "왜 그런 거짓말을 한 거야? 의식을 치르려면 그 사람들이 죽어야 하잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 68a01214-cca1-8406-bb9b-eb349e1b4519
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_State_PartneredWithAstarion(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - ORI_State_PartneredWithAstarion(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:68a01214-cca1-8406-bb9b-eb349e1b4519
msgctxt "hc6ad1a6ag486eg4fe5g90d4gf835d428cfc8"
msgid ""
"Sorry, sweetheart, but consider our little love affair <i>over</i>. I don't "
"want to be with anyone who has kidnapping fantasies about their partner."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 6af1d1f9-b0dd-204e-0039-8e16ea7196f0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:6af1d1f9-b0dd-204e-0039-8e16ea7196f0
msgctxt "h0a9e5378g179eg4637g8c35g2d87aacd26aa"
msgid "You don't know what it was like. There was no way out."
msgstr "넌 그게 어땠는지 전혀 몰라. 빠져나갈 길이 없었다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Leon
#. NodeID = 6b384f4c-b104-0ad0-663f-da2981bb9889
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:6b384f4c-b104-0ad0-663f-da2981bb9889
msgctxt "h72795265g3a06g41e8ga3a7g37bc51e7c189"
msgid "Runt, we've spoken of vengeance time and again, and you never listened."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Aurelia
#. NodeID = 6d25b067-0116-e9a1-325c-e439f94c8a74
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(2) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:6d25b067-0116-e9a1-325c-e439f94c8a74
msgctxt "h3b32bc9fgc4f5g48b7g9151gcbef8d485e01"
msgid "And he needs you, Astarion. It's time to come home."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 71041b4d-1d2e-1cd2-5b4d-b0e8e0f32b1e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:71041b4d-1d2e-1cd2-5b4d-b0e8e0f32b1e
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h561c085cgc9bag4a6dgbfd5g16774d5d1f57"
msgid ""
"No, he didn't. I am still here. And I will fight him until I fight my last."
msgstr "아니, 그러지 못했지. 난 아직 여기에 있어. 그리고 마지막까지 그 자식과 싸울 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Leon
#. NodeID = 73f25671-24fd-2711-9133-0285e11ae696
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:73f25671-24fd-2711-9133-0285e11ae696
msgctxt "h2669c1c5gdc81g4df1g8565g330d22d5fb0f"
msgid ""
"Save us? That lickspittle only ever wanted to save himself - the rest of us "
"be damned."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 7a56e684-ae71-9e0d-a829-d185b294ffc9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 5b4812bc-634b-9181-033b-521e6b127bbc_offeredastarion = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:7a56e684-ae71-9e0d-a829-d185b294ffc9
msgctxt "h30a1af2agd886g4ceag9ec3g4efad5ec104f"
msgid "You said they could take me? <i>Really?</i>"
msgstr "네가 저것들한테 날 데려가도 된다고 했어? <i>정말로?</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 7b9647de-2b03-9804-a5ff-8093102c494c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:7b9647de-2b03-9804-a5ff-8093102c494c
msgctxt "hd778eb0fg89b7g426eg8954g857434986a07"
msgid "You haven't spent much time with my family."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 7e34bb8d-b2e3-c6ac-7a71-04317e2d6b4c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_State_PartneredWithAstarion(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:7e34bb8d-b2e3-c6ac-7a71-04317e2d6b4c
msgctxt "h2445bc7cg37b0g4227ga18ag8781c76b0bf0"
msgid ""
"I'm doing this for you, too, you know. To make sure we're both safe. "
"Forever, for good."
msgstr "이건 너를 위한 일이기도 해. 우리 둘 다 안전해지기 위해서야. 영원히."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7fc4f6a0-d8e2-e1e8-2097-b7dd2c854b24
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:7fc4f6a0-d8e2-e1e8-2097-b7dd2c854b24
msgctxt "h3c03ce35gd50fg4a02gba9dg57ab725f7c82"
msgid "How did you find us?"
msgstr "우리를 어떻게 찾아낸 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 80280ec7-09aa-47f1-48f7-e8cccee5b1a2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:80280ec7-09aa-47f1-48f7-e8cccee5b1a2
msgctxt "h7d5f8a01g19c9g49d1g8abag060927cdbdb4"
msgid "At least you've met my family now."
msgstr "그래도 드디어 네가 내 가족을 만났구나."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Aurelia
#. NodeID = 89538ea9-4735-66e8-8aa0-7835916c9844
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:89538ea9-4735-66e8-8aa0-7835916c9844
msgctxt "h9636fc3ag1182g4c64g9601g54261752b3b6"
msgid "Of course not, the master's no fool. He needs us."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Aurelia
#. NodeID = 8a23d225-72ed-6b03-d48b-0537a86e6256
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:8a23d225-72ed-6b03-d48b-0537a86e6256
msgctxt "h8109db42gadddg4b12gb097gd1606b734c05"
msgid "The Rite... The master needs him. He must attend."
msgstr "의식에… 주인님은 그가 필요하셔. 아스타리온이 꼭 참석해야만 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8b06154b-1cf7-74c2-bde7-f7e244dca493
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:8b06154b-1cf7-74c2-bde7-f7e244dca493
msgctxt "he7445a92g0262g49fegb1e4gc9c4901bc77f"
msgid "What does Cazador want with him?"
msgstr "카사도어가 왜 아스타리온을 찾는 건데?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Aurelia
#. NodeID = 8bae0797-51bc-3ac6-58dd-c00268cf298d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:8bae0797-51bc-3ac6-58dd-c00268cf298d
msgctxt "h6be9813bga99bg4534g9d7dg10a6a7b71091"
msgid "Perhaps, but even if this is true, we're bound. We can't disobey him."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8fdcd53c-9db1-f7f1-6fec-42ec19e72621
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:8fdcd53c-9db1-f7f1-6fec-42ec19e72621
msgctxt "hb99bd556g77b5g4ce7ga314g5518c7ce0c38"
msgid "You don't have sympathy for others sharing your plight?"
msgstr "너와 같은 처지에 있는 사람들에 대한 동정심은 없어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 90230ff3-adb2-c544-463f-0ea34978882a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_Astarion_Knows_RitualsPurpose = True
#.      - ORI_Astarion_Act3_WantsRitualComplete = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:90230ff3-adb2-c544-463f-0ea34978882a
msgctxt "h2adee0fcg3a75g4adeg9373g715d87fba1c8"
msgid "But to steal his life's work... that might be something."
msgstr "하지만 그놈 인생의 역작을 가로채는 건… 그건 의미가 있을지도 모르겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 91dce840-9e1d-6863-af9e-35bb71a323a3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:91dce840-9e1d-6863-af9e-35bb71a323a3
msgctxt "hd04f0f73g4b1cg48e4gb057g6a6d3ce07a89"
msgid ""
"*But if any of the bearers of the scar die before the ritual begins, he will "
"lose his chance to perform the Rite himself.*"
msgstr "*하지만 의식 전에 흉터를 지닌 자가 한 명이라도 죽는다면, 그는 직접 의식을 치를 기회를 놓치게 될 것입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 93631da8-c4d8-6eaa-3318-2fc33cff0415
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_State_PartneredWithAstarion(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:93631da8-c4d8-6eaa-3318-2fc33cff0415
msgctxt "hf1bd4ef6g6e62g4f4agbc32gc093518122ef"
msgid ""
"Don't look at me like that. With the sweet little 'disappointed I'm not "
"getting cuddly Astarion' pout. I can't take it. I can't be what you want to "
"see in me."
msgstr ""
"그렇게 쳐다보지 마. 그렇게 '아스타리온이 귀엽게 굴지 않아서 실망했어'라는 듯이 삐죽거리지 말라고. 더는 못 하겠어. 네가 바라는 "
"모습에 맞춰줄 수 없다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 96ee0514-91ea-5286-65aa-139599488ed8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:96ee0514-91ea-5286-65aa-139599488ed8
msgctxt "hb05862a6gd6d1g4505g87dag3bfb32f4b8d3"
msgid "And <i>that</i> was your gut response? <i>Really?</i>"
msgstr "그래서 <i>그 말이</i> 그냥 자동으로 나온 거야? <i>진짜?</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Leon
#. NodeID = 97d530e4-7862-361f-767c-58d30d74d5a5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 5b4812bc-634b-9181-033b-521e6b127bbc_offeredastarion = True
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(2) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:97d530e4-7862-361f-767c-58d30d74d5a5
msgctxt "ha6cc300fg44b9g4a51gaaa0ge1bd6cd4e1db"
msgid "The master said 'no witnesses'."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Aurelia
#. NodeID = 98133dc7-3759-2a45-0381-bde15fbfca73
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 5b4812bc-634b-9181-033b-521e6b127bbc_vampiresfriendly = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:98133dc7-3759-2a45-0381-bde15fbfca73
msgctxt "h4440acedg1b0eg48b8g8b81gd7da48fb918a"
msgid "Oh - raagh- RAAAGH-"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Leon
#. NodeID = 9827f5ef-c659-27f9-984f-86c114d5832b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:9827f5ef-c659-27f9-984f-86c114d5832b
msgctxt "h6a3adffdg6d21g415dg9132ga9aa506db436"
msgid "Enough! Enough talk and enough lies."
msgstr "됐어! 이젠 네 말도, 거짓말도 됐어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 99862a77-597c-48a0-842f-95e0dab52ff2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:99862a77-597c-48a0-842f-95e0dab52ff2
msgctxt "hed4b7d15gd501g4e68gaa25g67bdb3231d09"
msgid ""
"This is your chance. Stand with me. Name me your new master. We will get our "
"revenge, <i>and</i> you will all live again."
msgstr ""
"이게 네 기회야. 내 편에 서. 나를 새로운 주인으로 받아들여. 우리는 복수를 할 거야. <i>게다가</i> 너희는 모두 다시 살 수 "
"있게 될 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 9ad3b575-6040-a11f-55c0-8640e45dc57a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_Astarion_Knows_RitualsPurpose = True
#.      - ORI_Astarion_Act3_WantsRitualComplete = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:9ad3b575-6040-a11f-55c0-8640e45dc57a
msgctxt "h0c889af0g7afbg4b9cgbdedgc36dca8e752f"
msgid ""
"And while repaying what he did to me is impossible, I am damn well going to "
"steal that bastard's life work. I <i>will </i>become the Ascendant."
msgstr "내가 당한 짓을 되갚아 줄 수는 없지만, 그 개새끼의 역작을 훔칠 수는 있지. <i>내가</i> 승천할 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 9d0bdecf-1831-d1d3-0f85-611e15c8ba77
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:9d0bdecf-1831-d1d3-0f85-611e15c8ba77
msgctxt "h0b977754gdf10g483bg960cg6c5708b5a1ec"
msgid "Ha! He <i>cannot</i>, thanks to our wriggling friend."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = a00b0894-beed-8d3f-8101-ebae481ebee7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:a00b0894-beed-8d3f-8101-ebae481ebee7
msgctxt "hf7dbaf67g4040g4f5fgb2beg8a910d2c9b6c"
msgid "Nothing can make up for that. Not even Cazador's death."
msgstr "그건 어떤 걸로도 보상받을 수 없어. 카사도어의 죽음으로도 부족해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = a27339e0-e5fd-1458-eb00-21501309d508
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:a27339e0-e5fd-1458-eb00-21501309d508
msgctxt "h4f2d92abg7556g494bg972dge40fa15f6574"
msgid ""
"Everything has changed. What matters now is that I can stand up to Cazador."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Aurelia
#. NodeID = a36b9dde-316f-b030-2ab9-c7a2708936b4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:a36b9dde-316f-b030-2ab9-c7a2708936b4
msgctxt "h24a70374g4491g45b8gaff2g5796a915e951"
msgid ""
"Our fates were sealed in his writing long ago. A promise to his favourite "
"spawn, fulfilled in the crypt beneath his palace."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Aurelia
#. NodeID = a5b410af-7990-9439-a467-a4ad06112758
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:a5b410af-7990-9439-a467-a4ad06112758
msgctxt "h0550a88dgf2d2g4ad8gbe57g492349b5f5f3"
msgid ""
"'Die' in the ritual? Whatsoever are you speaking of? We are going to cheat "
"undeath."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = a65ad281-28c2-4333-5b30-f7b8f4e07dba
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:a65ad281-28c2-4333-5b30-f7b8f4e07dba
msgctxt "hbb7b394dgdb99g448cga754g8e16dc1a9b72"
msgid ""
"The Rite of Profane Ascension will be mine, and he won't see a scrap of its "
"glory. I am going to complete the ritual as the Ascendant, and then I am "
"going to kill him."
msgstr ""
"불경한 승천 의식은 내 것이 될 거고, 그놈은 그 영광을 구경도 못 하겠지. 내가 승천자로서 의식을 완료하고, 직접 놈을 죽일 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Leon
#. NodeID = a6b5a02d-5c75-bd82-e1d9-a90d3e210798
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:a6b5a02d-5c75-bd82-e1d9-a90d3e210798
msgctxt "h9940b2f0g4eb5g4adfgb7f2gf6c604e52aca"
msgid ""
"You're number seven - the final piece of the Rite. He needs us all for the "
"Black Mass."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Aurelia
#. NodeID = a7b4d1b3-1713-c669-811b-cfa657681257
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:a7b4d1b3-1713-c669-811b-cfa657681257
msgctxt "hdd9ae928g38ddg480cgbae3g4655e871df96"
msgid "We have been his servants for centuries, he has always needed us!"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = aa955e5b-d291-8921-cb25-8ebd5ff3139f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:aa955e5b-d291-8921-cb25-8ebd5ff3139f
msgctxt "h030fa5fcg639dg44f7g84fcg43d9dfe1522c"
msgid "I can. I can stop him, but you have to tell me what you know."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = aaedf8ca-0ac5-8c5d-9761-1672351c40ca
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:aaedf8ca-0ac5-8c5d-9761-1672351c40ca
msgctxt "h6501096dg7f54g4811gb9ebgbf281751ae96"
msgid ""
"Ugh. Well, I suppose you knew we could defeat them. I'll try not to think "
"what would have happened if we hadn't."
msgstr "으, 알았어. 우리가 걔들을 이길 수 있을 것 같으니 그랬겠지. 만약 졌다면 어떻게 됐을지는 생각하기도 싫어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Aurelia
#. NodeID = ac33426b-28ab-467e-944a-aafb34a42fdb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:ac33426b-28ab-467e-944a-aafb34a42fdb
msgctxt "h0a75b44eg2f4bg4d57g9e21ga2c43fc8b59a"
msgid "Peace, brother. We're here to take you home."
msgstr "진정해, 형제여. 우리는 너를 집에 데려가기 위해 왔어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = b3a34c19-7bc0-74e6-8a19-2db463516d4e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:b3a34c19-7bc0-74e6-8a19-2db463516d4e
msgctxt "hd078eda6ge86fg43e9g9c4egbdde0cca4692"
msgid ""
"He wouldn't throw away centuries of planning on a scrap like this. They were "
"pulled back just in time."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b5df31a5-7ae0-7785-5b67-404eee5c4a21
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:b5df31a5-7ae0-7785-5b67-404eee5c4a21
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h094f9a6dg859eg4109g91e4g0ea615224daf"
msgid "In turn, what does your life matter?"
msgstr "달리 말하면, 네 인생도 별 거 아니라는 거잖아?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b8011717-e2e3-8b0a-8a3b-768bba75d396
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 5b4812bc-634b-9181-033b-521e6b127bbc_vampirescalledastarionweak = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:b8011717-e2e3-8b0a-8a3b-768bba75d396
msgctxt "he72d3fa2g9871g4761g90b2g66018358c729"
msgid "Was it true what they said? That you gave up fighting him long ago?"
msgstr "그게 정말이야? 네가 오래 전부터 카사도어에게 저항하는 걸 관뒀다는 게?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = bbf8be1c-dfff-7b01-17f0-e2aca41fc7f8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - WYR_VampireSpawns_State_IntroHappened = True
#.      - ORI_Astarion_Knows_RitualsPurpose = False
#.      - ORI_Astarion_Act3_WantsRitualComplete = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:bbf8be1c-dfff-7b01-17f0-e2aca41fc7f8
msgctxt "hd161ebaag1b99g470ag8810g527d608eff6e"
msgid "Why should we let Cazador have all the fun? After all he's done to us."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = bda30057-ef7e-5117-b2e1-9101af81d7a5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:bda30057-ef7e-5117-b2e1-9101af81d7a5
msgctxt "h23a2cae9gadf2g4dedg933dg5ae1eb12ef89"
msgid "I'm doing what I have to... I can't be what you want to see in me."
msgstr "내가 해야 할 일을 하는 것뿐이야... 난 네가 바라는 모습이 되어줄 순 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Leon
#. NodeID = c109cf46-f79f-a65c-b93a-17a9cbd20c32
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 5b4812bc-634b-9181-033b-521e6b127bbc_vampirescalledastarionweak = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:c109cf46-f79f-a65c-b93a-17a9cbd20c32
msgctxt "h82923fd7gdc27g46ffg99fdg9f5b506231f2"
msgid "You were always weak, brother. We don't follow weak. "
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = c1a38cbc-50cb-69f6-893c-ca61199c29a6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:c1a38cbc-50cb-69f6-893c-ca61199c29a6
msgctxt "h9c6c43f2g77acg4219gac2dgaad67fab88a5"
msgid ""
"They mentioned my scars and a rite... I need to get to that crypt and find "
"out what these damn markings are <i>really for</i>."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Aurelia
#. NodeID = c460c6b7-1418-2948-6bc6-5bdfa56a7a08
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:c460c6b7-1418-2948-6bc6-5bdfa56a7a08
msgctxt "h5ec9d759g26b7g4c04ga5eeg93d739c2ae53"
msgid "Much as we'd love to, the master's orders were very specific."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Leon
#. NodeID = c4fe908b-65b0-a5dc-cc1e-e30ca4d036fa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:c4fe908b-65b0-a5dc-cc1e-e30ca4d036fa
msgctxt "h44d412e2g9b89g4fcbg865dg94f16a1c3b0b"
msgid ""
"The master needs all seven of us for the ceremony. Come with us and be "
"reborn. We'll live again."
msgstr "의식을 위해서는 우리 일곱 명 모두가 필요해. 함께 가서 다시 태어나자. 우리는 새로운 삶을 살게 될 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Aurelia
#. NodeID = c4ff2047-dfba-2ba5-d6da-2167e64ae98f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:c4ff2047-dfba-2ba5-d6da-2167e64ae98f
msgctxt "hedcacfd3g630bg41c2g8eb7g6b57eb6201d2"
msgid ""
"The master doesn't need to lie to us. He controls us, fully. Why go through "
"the trouble of giving us hope..."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c78640a4-2d3d-5556-1fd3-296cca63d403
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_Astarion_Knows_RitualsPurpose = False
#.      - ORI_Astarion_Act3_WantsRitualComplete = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:c78640a4-2d3d-5556-1fd3-296cca63d403
msgctxt "h32d4c322gfe34g4045gb851gd792fa1670fd"
msgid "We should try to save them, before it's too late."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Leon
#. NodeID = c7aa669c-3558-c68e-6efa-d986e5546ce5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:c7aa669c-3558-c68e-6efa-d986e5546ce5
msgctxt "h6ff5f9abge5c7g4b81gb9b6gc1c1e12aab09"
msgid ""
"Stand with the runt of the kennel? The one who always whimpered while he got "
"beat?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = cb37780a-e562-48c4-5a33-9e0971ad6367
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:cb37780a-e562-48c4-5a33-9e0971ad6367
msgctxt "h3ad127c8gc6a9g4608ga9e7g18d55e8fafa9"
msgid ""
"You're the only one. Other people don't have a heart like you. You're you. "
"No one is like that."
msgstr "너뿐이야. 다른 사람들은 너처럼 친절하지 않아. 너는 너야. 너 같은 사람은 아무도 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Leon
#. NodeID = cb8c57e9-0223-3327-3f24-fb98cf59b7a9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:cb8c57e9-0223-3327-3f24-fb98cf59b7a9
msgctxt "hbbe26f36gb2ceg4e71gbc7ag47d0089620f7"
msgid "We're doomed. All right - what do you need from us? We'll help you..."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cd9519c7-0d8a-64e7-168f-51abd19f2390
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:cd9519c7-0d8a-64e7-168f-51abd19f2390
msgctxt "h1d2cb144geb9cg4be4ga6d9g8f44fdec1c12"
msgid "I panicked in the moment!"
msgstr "그땐 너무 당황해서 그랬다고!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Leon
#. NodeID = cfa318af-7b33-900b-5b48-cb94af41e223
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:cfa318af-7b33-900b-5b48-cb94af41e223
msgctxt "h1ba39a3ag25e9g416fg8c3dg973ae3dc2995"
msgid "Master said bring him home. Never forbade us from talking, though."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d9b8a431-72e1-a4ea-8e28-c9b3117970f9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:d9b8a431-72e1-a4ea-8e28-c9b3117970f9
msgctxt "h1fe10ddbg62e9g4761g8a94g8ba00a32d013"
msgid ""
"A few tendays ago, you too would've leapt at the hope that Cazador might "
"free you."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = df46662d-f9bb-0c6f-7697-fe3c87674eb1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:df46662d-f9bb-0c6f-7697-fe3c87674eb1
msgctxt "h21ab3499g9f4bg44f1ga8dag76f20433a09b"
msgid "<i>Keep silent.</i>"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = dfd0723c-c28d-ef7f-67c6-25e084a8c217
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CAMP_VampireAmbush_State_AmbushFailed = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:dfd0723c-c28d-ef7f-67c6-25e084a8c217
msgctxt "hb3aa1bd1g9eb9g462fg8958g438c7598851c"
msgid ""
"*You sleep, but the wicked don't. Someone is here to disturb your rest...*"
msgstr "*당신은 잠들었지만, 악인들은 잠들지 않습니다. 누군가가 당신의 휴식을 방해하러 왔네요…*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = e04ed0a7-9ed2-b85b-53fc-517f2778bf82
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:e04ed0a7-9ed2-b85b-53fc-517f2778bf82
msgctxt "h5c962d31g9436g4f29ga5c1ge94fdd354287"
msgid ""
"I can't tell whether you're a bad liar or a worse jester, but either way, it "
"isn't cute."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = e237a539-9574-5acc-7194-d32d0f49ebd0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:e237a539-9574-5acc-7194-d32d0f49ebd0
msgctxt "h14017f19ged55g4a28g9299ga032216ca1ae"
msgid "But... perhaps there's something in what you say."
msgstr "그렇지만… 네 말에 일리가 있을지도 모르겠네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e25ace0a-bd95-e28c-5ef2-3cfcff8f1c3f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:e25ace0a-bd95-e28c-5ef2-3cfcff8f1c3f
msgctxt "hc410a5e1ge21eg489fga073ga075eb51630d"
msgid "I am rather special, aren't I?"
msgstr "내가 좀 특별하긴 하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = e3150e08-38f0-b10a-d23d-659b7f830ba7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:e3150e08-38f0-b10a-d23d-659b7f830ba7
msgctxt "hfdf89b56g7774g4ef7gb060g2c616971229b"
msgid ""
"You say, as a mind flayer thrall who spends their life sorting out other "
"people's problems."
msgstr "다른 사람들의 문제를 해결하기 위해 발 벗고 뛰어다니는 마인드 플레이어 노예가 할 법한 말이네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = e3e4ac29-3ce4-0f96-7130-cf228a9dd727
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:e3e4ac29-3ce4-0f96-7130-cf228a9dd727
msgctxt "ha35e2f06ge5e3g4e31g9075gc308453b0595"
msgid ""
"Yes. They cannot fight his compulsion. But I can, thanks to our wriggling "
"friend."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = e400ac57-245e-3bdb-9be7-ef7d0c651c1a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:e400ac57-245e-3bdb-9be7-ef7d0c651c1a
msgctxt "hb924eea6gcfeag42f2gbd9bg95c2166a7b77"
msgid ""
"*His liar's smile spells danger. He knows full well that his kin will die in "
"the ritual.*"
msgstr "*이 거짓말쟁이의 미소에는 위험이 새겨져 있습니다. 그는 동족들이 의식에서 죽을 것을 누구보다 잘 알고 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e8503753-3a09-2b8b-cd4a-eebec636075d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:e8503753-3a09-2b8b-cd4a-eebec636075d
msgctxt "h77d8a824g21e3g4d8egbd62g75a1660446b7"
msgid "Get away from us!"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Aurelia
#. NodeID = e87fb056-9f07-b7d3-a301-9610e086771b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:e87fb056-9f07-b7d3-a301-9610e086771b
msgctxt "h26b485b7gc12eg4d72g8867gfb346359dde1"
msgid ""
"We will live again, Astarion. The scars on our backs are sealed with the "
"cruellest power. Seven spawn, seven sigils."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = ea0a7ceb-0de6-5e64-52da-5ac734ed8b0a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:ea0a7ceb-0de6-5e64-52da-5ac734ed8b0a
msgctxt "hd7fbba52g5360g4939ga4c8g69354089d0e6"
msgid "Ah, don't sell yourself so short."
msgstr "아, 너무 겸손 떨지 마."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Leon
#. NodeID = ef16f8ef-ace3-7c74-d40d-d0291c776eae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:ef16f8ef-ace3-7c74-d40d-d0291c776eae
msgctxt "habfa32e1g157fg4132g84b6g617be9d6f8cf"
msgid "Better? What do you mean, 'better'?"
msgstr "'나은 대접'이라니? 무슨 소리야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f0c45241-00ef-c2b6-3e1b-5fc4665e6341
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:f0c45241-00ef-c2b6-3e1b-5fc4665e6341
msgctxt "h17200b61g5460g443fgba30gb6def012fbc4"
msgid "Still, you shouldn't have given up."
msgstr "그래도 포기하지 말았어야지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = f0f3add5-1f80-09c7-865a-918cb1bc7b58
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:f0f3add5-1f80-09c7-865a-918cb1bc7b58
msgctxt "h7e33887ag96b0g45b2g95b9gee55853be943"
msgid ""
"What does it matter? There's only six of them. And they are vampire spawn."
msgstr "무슨 상관이야? 겨우 여섯명인걸. 그리고 걔네는 뱀파이어 스폰이라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f1e43fe3-368b-f487-3de0-448d345dee98
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 20
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_Astarion_Knows_RitualsPurpose = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:f1e43fe3-368b-f487-3de0-448d345dee98
msgctxt "h78d303e2g705ag4317gb238g373c2b305b38"
msgid ""
"Listen to me, this ceremony is a mass sacrifice - Cazador is going to kill "
"you all!"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Leon
#. NodeID = f49f560c-2c1c-c860-7ffb-1b6608bac511
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:f49f560c-2c1c-c860-7ffb-1b6608bac511
msgctxt "he187ceadg7b75g4070ga6b7g060fb33593f6"
msgid ""
"And now you think we'll throw away our chance at freedom? By bowing to you?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = f870458a-dccc-8763-747e-c62bb71f48d1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_Astarion_Knows_RitualsPurpose = True
#.      - ORI_Astarion_Act3_WantsRitualComplete = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:f870458a-dccc-8763-747e-c62bb71f48d1
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "hba82a772gbdd0g4e90gaf59g3a8efd857d2f"
msgid ""
"Oh, I'm well aware of what the master needs. But don't we deserve better?"
msgstr "주인님이 뭘 원하는지는 잘 알고 있어. 그렇지만 우리는 더 나은 대접을 받아야 하지 않을까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = fa1ce0b7-eb18-4ae3-604a-970323b0a9f5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:fa1ce0b7-eb18-4ae3-604a-970323b0a9f5
msgctxt "h86a49b84gbc4dg48aaga879g6a5d21ad4665"
msgid ""
"*He needs them to run willingly to their deaths, thinking they stand a "
"chance against their master.*"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = fa300a18-f658-39d8-cab0-429cb83b0d40
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:fa300a18-f658-39d8-cab0-429cb83b0d40
msgctxt "h2514e0dag5f7cg4fddg951dg0012d2accf2a"
msgid "This needs to end, one way or another."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fe5f98c4-b0bb-94a0-b5ae-446e61073a89
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:fe5f98c4-b0bb-94a0-b5ae-446e61073a89
msgctxt "h9dab1db9gdda8g4894g98bbge8ef0ed0bb6d"
msgid "Can't we talk this through?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ff1ef6f4-1ebe-7774-e02d-cf8b4e75d72e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:ff1ef6f4-1ebe-7774-e02d-cf8b4e75d72e
msgctxt "h27b8fa9bg01edg4dd4ga05fgf5f457995eb6"
msgid "<i>Keep quiet.</i>"
msgstr "<i>침묵을 유지한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Aurelia
#. NodeID = ffd2b28e-d1c7-ed75-91da-06f4ad46ed94
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VampireAmbush_SCO_Companion:ffd2b28e-d1c7-ed75-91da-06f4ad46ed94
msgctxt "h249f10cag750ag47edgbaacg6630fb9b8053"
msgid ""
"Perhaps we can get back at Cazador, <i>and</i> finish the ritual. The seven "
"can unite -"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 015db8b2-3385-58f1-c38f-39ce4b2d671d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:015db8b2-3385-58f1-c38f-39ce4b2d671d
msgctxt "h22ac607bg0923g4f00g9291ge892a77423ba"
msgid "Perhaps you would hazard a guess as to why the mob turned on me?"
msgstr "혹시 저놈들이 왜 나를 공격했는지 짐작 가는 거라도 있나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 04cd361a-6480-173c-81de-880511fa77f0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:04cd361a-6480-173c-81de-880511fa77f0
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "hd710986bg08b5g4812gbe49gd14a9fc20a58"
msgid "No. It's true - but I reject Bhaal's influence."
msgstr "아니, 맞는 말이야. 하지만 난 바알의 지배를 거부하겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 051459eb-4513-3a8a-3a2a-1e193410d746
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Volo_State_FinalCampDialogExhausted = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:051459eb-4513-3a8a-3a2a-1e193410d746
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "hf39ca48eg4698g413cgb89ag113e06d2aa17"
msgid ""
"But I suppose you'll have to deal with the illithids first. Please, do find "
"me when you've thwarted <i>every</i> apocalypse that's currently in motion."
msgstr ""
"하지만 일리시드를 처리하는 게 먼저겠지. 부탁하건대, 자네 앞에 지금 닥친 <i>모든</i> 대재앙을 해결하고 나면 나를 꼭 찾아주게나."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 054b6888-1ca1-0111-e211-0b6863e18cdd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:054b6888-1ca1-0111-e211-0b6863e18cdd
msgctxt "h6671fcd8gc6cdg4c14gbbe4g17a31dccd77d"
msgid "I'll tell the tale better in my own words."
msgstr "내가 직접 노래로 만드는 게 더 좋을 것 같은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 05f1ae48-96cc-acdb-3d15-4536e76bd5ac
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:05f1ae48-96cc-acdb-3d15-4536e76bd5ac
msgctxt "h1a4649b7gad6fg4250gaa39g262210bb4b80"
msgid "Wonderful! I can scarcely think of anyone more suitable."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 06859fea-a41c-1974-443a-9cb58a48fe75
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:06859fea-a41c-1974-443a-9cb58a48fe75
msgctxt "ha287fcc7g0172g4265g9d24gdfe00391a1b9"
msgid "Fine. I'll take the book."
msgstr "알았어. 책을 가져갈게."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 083a0e74-ad1b-11c6-e9c7-dd9011f6e22b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:083a0e74-ad1b-11c6-e9c7-dd9011f6e22b
msgctxt "hd5955772gb14dg456cgaa51g4c48cde56ea2"
msgid ""
"Orin is his Chosen, and like Sarevok before her, she is able to take on the "
"savage form of the Slayer."
msgstr "선택받은 자는 오린이며, 이전에 사레복이 그랬던 것처럼 흉포한 슬레이어의 형태로 변할 수도 있다네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 0e7a4ffc-a9ca-8679-7123-b013b49107b5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:0e7a4ffc-a9ca-8679-7123-b013b49107b5
msgctxt "ha1c1c787gd39bg4469ga810ga42274959205"
msgid "You triumphed over Bhaal's Chosen? Marvellous!"
msgstr "자네가 바알의 선택받은 자를 상대로 승리했다는 건가? 굉장하군!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 108659d2-f677-98d9-a091-e03ed10ff08f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Volo_State_LeftPlayerSide = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:108659d2-f677-98d9-a091-e03ed10ff08f
msgctxt "h0a9f61fdg00c9g48c4g9237gf174b3288c1d"
msgid ""
"Perhaps it's time I started my field research for a Guide to Anywhere But "
"Here. Ta-ta."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 155523f5-51f7-b296-ca79-00ce9894f40e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:155523f5-51f7-b296-ca79-00ce9894f40e
msgctxt "h2ab058a7ga0d4g4f3bgab40g772876d5e74a"
msgid "I believe you will save this city."
msgstr "나는 자네가 이 도시를 구할 수 있다고 믿는다네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1a5d067e-788a-4a89-4cf5-c22dbb4c8c02
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:1a5d067e-788a-4a89-4cf5-c22dbb4c8c02
msgctxt "hb38a2aaeg5651g4e20ga51agfa88f4512f4e"
msgid "I'll need more than a book to face Bhaal's Chosen."
msgstr "바알의 선택받은 자를 상대하려면 책 가지고는 안 될 텐데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 1c681b95-308c-ff93-69ec-b801660eb3cd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:1c681b95-308c-ff93-69ec-b801660eb3cd
msgctxt "haa9d1bd8gfc52g4c58gb7e2g29f016fd4cc2"
msgid ""
"Without you, it is entirely possible your companion would already be lost. "
"Bhaal's will is not easily overcome."
msgstr "자네가 없었다면, 자네의 동료는 이미 사라지고 없었을 거네. 바알의 의지는 그리 쉽게 이겨낼 수 있는 게 아닐세."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 1d442fca-1fa4-e579-3bcc-db71cb010205
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:1d442fca-1fa4-e579-3bcc-db71cb010205
msgctxt "h71dac1fbg405bg4d83g8b8eg7c012b4e4e2f"
msgid ""
"And what will you do with that power? Slaughter the city? Brutalise the "
"world?"
msgstr "그 힘으로 뭘 할 셈인가? 도시를 학살할 건가? 세상에 폭력을 행사할 텐가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1d831f9e-2353-7e47-bd1a-fe4d479dd75c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_Volo_DarkUrgeDeception(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_DarkUrge_State_GivenSlayerForm = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:1d831f9e-2353-7e47-bd1a-fe4d479dd75c
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h3623db9eg7b1fg4cd8g926fg304a16f0fa35"
msgid "I already know plenty about the Slayer already - I can become it."
msgstr "슬레이어에 대해서는 아주 잘 알고 있어. 나도 변신할 수 있거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 20529bfe-e1e6-3c20-105a-f6caef972cb8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_DarkUrge_State_GivenSlayerForm = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:20529bfe-e1e6-3c20-105a-f6caef972cb8
msgctxt "hb5ec14c6g706fg4b15g890fg5a5141492190"
msgid "What is the Slayer?"
msgstr "슬레이어란게 뭐지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 250d552a-8597-dcaf-a518-63c828556478
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:250d552a-8597-dcaf-a518-63c828556478
msgctxt "h2fa600a7gbc70g40d1ga35dg6ab59db4bcda"
msgid "That's an outrageous accusation."
msgstr "터무니없는 비난이로군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 279ae448-a44a-2f35-f79a-93165b1b6f34
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:279ae448-a44a-2f35-f79a-93165b1b6f34
msgctxt "hd9b22e79g0a63g437cga767g34031d7a26e6"
msgid ""
"I see that. You have at least a measure of self-control, but Bhaal's "
"inheritance is not shrugged off so easily."
msgstr "그렇군. 적어도 자네는 자신을 통제하는 법을 아는 모양이지만, 바알에게 물려받은 유산은 그렇게 쉽게 떨쳐낼 수 있는 게 아니네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 293bbcc5-de73-50cd-183d-cdc366574b12
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:293bbcc5-de73-50cd-183d-cdc366574b12
msgctxt "hc31ae5d1g1a99g45c1g8182g681186e2f8c9"
msgid "This is a daunting task - I should begin my preparations now."
msgstr "힘겨운 싸움이 될 거야. 지금부터 준비를 해야겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 3025b67a-18cf-07e4-68b2-6816f08aba5c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:3025b67a-18cf-07e4-68b2-6816f08aba5c
msgctxt "h331b05ebgacdcg4afbgb6adg83e54393ccd0"
msgid "And he has you."
msgstr "그리고 자네가 있지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 38c3ee99-db40-05d5-96f1-27555388fa1a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:38c3ee99-db40-05d5-96f1-27555388fa1a
msgctxt "h07d03f22gb842g4f1egb675g4831f7890677"
msgid ""
"Did you speak out against the cult of the Absolute? They have eyes "
"everywhere."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 3a1bd840-0381-0c90-1258-fbf3b54e709f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:3a1bd840-0381-0c90-1258-fbf3b54e709f
msgctxt "hf4a95206gbd18g451agaa49g17d25b790fbc"
msgid ""
"It is a story of friendships forged and alliances that did not break even in "
"the darkest times."
msgstr "가장 어두운 시기에도 깨지지 않는 우정과 동맹에 관한 이야기지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3a964a57-f911-885b-d352-40b96a494e75
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:3a964a57-f911-885b-d352-40b96a494e75
msgctxt "h205ce5e8g91f7g4827g8d3dg663479065605"
msgid "I'll do it."
msgstr "내가 하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3ad473a0-93f9-7176-472b-121972e51a37
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_DarkUrge_State_BhaalAccepted = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:3ad473a0-93f9-7176-472b-121972e51a37
msgctxt "h32acdf56gf298g41c9gb3d5g8adff8625572"
msgid "Yes - and claimed her power as my own."
msgstr "맞아. 그리고 그 힘을 내 것으로 만들었지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 3d037374-4574-d810-db6c-f1a0c0a43f51
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:3d037374-4574-d810-db6c-f1a0c0a43f51
msgctxt "h8e5b984cgd62fg48f4g917fg9bdf8b6a35e7"
msgid ""
"This is your saga, my friend. And I hope I shall have the honour of "
"documenting its happy conclusion."
msgstr "이건 자네의 영웅담이라네, 나의 친구여. 그리고 내가 이 이야기의 행복한 결말을 기록할 수 있다면 더할 나위 없는 영광일 걸세."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 3f273206-129e-8416-7518-20d6319ae719
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:3f273206-129e-8416-7518-20d6319ae719
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "hbde6beb5g0799g4144g9bb6g8619415dfcc2"
msgid "Oh, but you must! There's nobody else available."
msgstr "아, 하지만 꼭 해야 하네! 자네 말고는 할 수 있는 사람이 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 40e8a19b-47ff-9645-1352-a2b67124b2b5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:40e8a19b-47ff-9645-1352-a2b67124b2b5
msgctxt "h8c511000g4277g4716ga3cdg9745920a03c7"
msgid ""
"It is a study of the Slayer, and may give you a much-needed edge when you "
"face Bhaal's Chosen."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 43e85a2e-df51-421f-a5d6-363ef004e67b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_DarkUrge_State_BhaalAccepted = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:43e85a2e-df51-421f-a5d6-363ef004e67b
msgctxt "h141a01ddg657eg4f79g9730g0308d4f69d5a"
msgid "I <i>am</i> Bhaal's Chosen. This city is my abattoir."
msgstr "<i>내가</i> 바알의 선택받은 자다. 이 도시가 나의 도살장이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4420cc71-6450-e0d8-68bf-e140a7ae7aab
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:4420cc71-6450-e0d8-68bf-e140a7ae7aab
msgctxt "habf47490g0262g46a8g93e4g836ef89987d6"
msgid "I'll find a bard to write my tale - they'll do a better job."
msgstr "내 이야기를 노래로 만들어 줄 바드를 찾을래. 그게 더 나을 것 같아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 45784226-84bd-9d56-d309-899198f1c371
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Gortash_State_PermaDefeated = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:45784226-84bd-9d56-d309-899198f1c371
msgctxt "h2b2469ffg89e0g45fag800fg33e5494774f0"
msgid "I've already slain Myrkul's Chosen - I can handle this."
msgstr "난 이미 머큘의 선택받은 자를 살해했어. 이것도 해낼 수 있을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 486aa8bd-7d81-ec20-30fe-b8be9ab3af79
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:486aa8bd-7d81-ec20-30fe-b8be9ab3af79
msgctxt "h334535c1gf719g4fb4gbfcbg0ac13aef2f60"
msgid ""
"Orin the Red controls a syndicate of killers - perhaps you've pissed her off."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4967a105-33e7-15aa-84bf-b6a23b281728
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:4967a105-33e7-15aa-84bf-b6a23b281728
msgctxt "h0ce28e4eg9e1bg4558g9f62gd739db2c24ab"
msgid "Then Baldur's Gate is doomed."
msgstr "그럼 발더스 게이트는 최후를 맞겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 4a0aec92-6a1e-3852-c1d1-338a14430102
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:4a0aec92-6a1e-3852-c1d1-338a14430102
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h86f78267g4442g4048ga48eg507622fe3a52"
msgid ""
"I have a very particular set of extraordinary skills. But fighting the "
"bestial avatars of murderous gods is not among them."
msgstr "내가 매우 뛰어난 기술을 여럿 보유하고 있긴 하지. 하지만 죽음의 신이 보낸 잔혹한 대리인과 싸울 만한 기술은 없다네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 4b7b31c9-6c09-814a-87cd-e11baf46b78b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:4b7b31c9-6c09-814a-87cd-e11baf46b78b
msgctxt "h3877c422g310cg4f26g8e7bgbfb0e08dab25"
msgid "You and I shall pen the book of your experiences together!"
msgstr "자네의 모험담을 꼭 출판하자고! "

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 4e4f6150-37ec-b473-da66-5a0d3ca03f0d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:4e4f6150-37ec-b473-da66-5a0d3ca03f0d
msgctxt "h9d866edfg01f0g45bdg81f4gb532176ce8b6"
msgid ""
"It is a beast of unspeakable violence that consumes all in its path, "
"including the soul of the one who is host to it."
msgstr "그것은 형언할 수 없는 폭력의 짐승이지. 앞에 놓인 것은 뭐든지 삼켜 버린다네. 불러낸 사람의 영혼까지 말일세."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 5107c826-058b-074a-2386-56132f1aa698
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:5107c826-058b-074a-2386-56132f1aa698
msgctxt "hb6df81f0g7407g4facgb89bg6cb138a741c5"
msgid "My quill is trembling in anticipation! Tell me everything!"
msgstr "내 깃펜이 기대감에 떨려오는군! 모두 다 말해주게나!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 53cb927e-fa05-7fc1-8364-850fd6dc8073
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Orin_State_PermaDefeated = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:53cb927e-fa05-7fc1-8364-850fd6dc8073
msgctxt "h418adce9g9417g43f2g84d2g22962c85deab"
msgid "I'm all he has - Orin is dead."
msgstr "아니, 나뿐이야. 오린은 죽었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 541cbbd7-5d44-3e80-80bf-30d763ec16c7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:541cbbd7-5d44-3e80-80bf-30d763ec16c7
msgctxt "hfec4d44fg3aceg4593g9fbfg1e5823c9476a"
msgid ""
"A genius. Exiled from his home in the elven paradise of Suldanessellar when "
"he attempted to seize the power of life itself, he instead turned his "
"magnificent mind to murder on a grand scale."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 57b02900-8454-1173-4f46-4d9b0cbfc4c0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:57b02900-8454-1173-4f46-4d9b0cbfc4c0
msgctxt "hbbd1443bg16c9g4586g81a3g5cd2131d72f9"
msgid ""
"This is not the first time your kind have threatened Baldur's Gate, and the "
"city still stands."
msgstr "자네와 같은 족속들이 발더스 게이트를 위협한 건 이번이 처음이 아닐세. 그리고 도시는 여전히 건재하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 58b6e7cb-b26c-0a2f-49eb-24ff5fd29fe2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:58b6e7cb-b26c-0a2f-49eb-24ff5fd29fe2
msgctxt "hf23640a8g9716g44a9g91a6gaff5f46a45d6"
msgid ""
"In the end, though Irenicus took the form of the Slayer for himself, it was "
"a Bhaalspawn who thwarted him. The same that saved Baldur's Gate. "
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 5a4d21c5-5515-a137-ed59-8527d084a630
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:5a4d21c5-5515-a137-ed59-8527d084a630
msgctxt "h6e2ae40dgc2deg4acagbfc5g6697568bbd96"
msgid "Then perhaps we have hope yet."
msgstr "그럼 아직 희망이 있다네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5ed890bc-0e26-2a10-4e43-4a280061ac8b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:5ed890bc-0e26-2a10-4e43-4a280061ac8b
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "ha8739bb6g812cg40d1g871bgd4cde9b420a3"
msgid "Bhaal does not <i>have</i> me - I reject his influence."
msgstr "바알은 나를 <i>지배</i>하지 못해. 난 거부할 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 62f29e8c-f768-3f4e-130e-27a8b8506d36
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:62f29e8c-f768-3f4e-130e-27a8b8506d36
msgctxt "ha5ae276bg2586g4247gbe34g3392aeffeecf"
msgid ""
"I believe the city may need a Bhaalspawn - may need <i>you</i> - if it is to "
"survive this new crisis."
msgstr "나는 도시가 이 난관을 헤쳐 나가기 위해선 바알스폰이 필요하다고 생각하네. <i>자네</i> 말일세."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 63619794-3295-e15b-4d20-3cec76108efa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:63619794-3295-e15b-4d20-3cec76108efa
msgctxt "hd31bbddeg394fg4f46g91a5g71e9a051bc56"
msgid "I don't think so. Not this time. It has to be you."
msgstr "그럴 것 같지 않네. 적어도 이번엔 아니야. 자네뿐일세."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 65a71e94-e54c-03de-f976-4be130aa4c4c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:65a71e94-e54c-03de-f976-4be130aa4c4c
msgctxt "h3d2ddf55gf5d1g4445g894agb12d0ddf7c66"
msgid ""
"Not mistaken, but very foolish. Surely you know this means I can't let you "
"live?"
msgstr "잘못 안 건 아니지만, 어리석은 짓이었지. 그럼 내가 당신을 살려 보낼 수 없다는 것도 잘 알겠군?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 66a35d0d-4580-ea55-6087-9bbbfb7e3c35
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:66a35d0d-4580-ea55-6087-9bbbfb7e3c35
msgctxt "h34a54823g2495g4d4fgbd9fgb4e5c430a240"
msgid ""
"I wish you luck, my friend. And I hope that when I see you again, you'll be "
"in one piece. Two or three at most."
msgstr ""
"나의 친구여, 행운을 빌겠네. 우리가 다시 만날 때 자네의 온전한 모습을 볼 수 있었으면 좋겠군. 박살이 나더라도 두 동강이나 세 동강 "
"정도로만 끝나길 바라네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6719fe28-9323-237f-4675-1bc93656053b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:6719fe28-9323-237f-4675-1bc93656053b
msgctxt "hd44ca719g2600g4fc8gaa30ga2936227bebc"
msgid ""
"So you know what I am. You should also know that means I can't let you live."
msgstr "내 정체를 알고 있다는 거네. 그럼, 당신을 살려 보낼 수 없다는 것도 알고 있겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 6867e35b-9875-9eff-1527-ec9791b80baa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Volo_State_LeftPlayerSide = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:6867e35b-9875-9eff-1527-ec9791b80baa
msgctxt "ha3b8e197g148dg4396gb983gfacccf93dbf3"
msgid ""
"It will survive you. And so will I - from as great a distance as possible."
msgstr "도시는 자네에게 지지 않아. 그리고 나도 마찬가질세. …최대한 멀찍이 떨어져 있어야겠지만."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 68a0cfb9-d7c7-e5ae-5bf6-b23bfc880ea3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:68a0cfb9-d7c7-e5ae-5bf6-b23bfc880ea3
msgctxt "h3970a35bg75f2g4b0dg98b7gdeeb08026d0e"
msgid ""
"My vintage is much darker - I will claim my birthright, and the power that "
"comes with it."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6acbd0e2-41af-f203-a224-b1a835841caa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 25
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:6acbd0e2-41af-f203-a224-b1a835841caa
msgctxt "hb6240cc5g5ea9g4f75gbb44g54f9e9982a2a"
msgid "Yes - you have this all wrong."
msgstr "그래, 완전히 틀렸어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 6b379788-9c0f-9168-d7e1-cd338d1a6e8f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:6b379788-9c0f-9168-d7e1-cd338d1a6e8f
msgctxt "h68b43067gad00g4fdeg9073gb24042b735bc"
msgid ""
"With the accompaniment of cacophonous tunes and gaudy dancing, no doubt? I "
"shudder to think."
msgstr "불협화음과 천박한 춤을 곁들여서 말인가? 생각도 하기 싫구먼."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 6ee58d77-3aec-20d9-c052-281d138a8213
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:6ee58d77-3aec-20d9-c052-281d138a8213
msgctxt "hcefb8457ga032g4462gb329g1c788634eb6e"
msgid ""
"The battle in the Temple itself... it seems you followed in the bloody "
"footsteps of the Gate's old Bhaalspawn hero."
msgstr "신전에서의 전투라… 자네는 바알스폰으로 태어났던 옛 영웅의 핏빛 발자국을 따라가는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 6f243d14-d455-0320-49ad-ec518f7b9b93
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:6f243d14-d455-0320-49ad-ec518f7b9b93
msgctxt "he997ab0fgb11ag451eg9f4eg91a84859aa5a"
msgid ""
"Pish-posh. That strutting tyrant has a long reach and a steel fist, but he's "
"a puppy dog compared to the real horror that haunts our streets."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 6fa32090-f47f-15ef-017b-1e1793897512
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - LOW_SlayerGuidebook_State_HasItem(0) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Volo_State_FinalCampDialogExhausted = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:6fa32090-f47f-15ef-017b-1e1793897512
msgctxt "h2bff52ebg2b4fg48d1gaf1fgb6b3ffb2c8cf"
msgid ""
"The book seems to have escaped from me. I had it when I arrived at your "
"camp, so I'm sure you'll find it somewhere hereabouts."
msgstr "내가 책을 잃어버린 것 같군. 자네의 야영지에 도착했을 때는 갖고 있었으니, 여기 근처 어딘가에서 발견할 수 있을 걸세."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 71f1efd4-62ff-0896-cc9b-bd90c9024b00
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:71f1efd4-62ff-0896-cc9b-bd90c9024b00
msgctxt "h712b8232g93abg49cagaa63g3442a1e23d8a"
msgid "Can I see your wares?"
msgstr "물건 좀 볼 수 있을까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 738ab932-8eae-6fea-a859-72e031a398f5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:738ab932-8eae-6fea-a859-72e031a398f5
msgctxt "h0292c59egf6fdg44f1gb3a2g4e1bc857b670"
msgid ""
"Slain by the Lord of Murder, and risen again to save Baldur's Gate. This is "
"stupendous!"
msgstr "살인의 군주에 의해 죽음을 맞이하고, 발더스 게이트를 구하기 위해 부활하다니. 이거 정말 엄청난 이야기인걸!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7547ea3a-8df3-0b6b-a89c-8325895b5c1a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_DarkUrge_State_BhaalDisappointed = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:7547ea3a-8df3-0b6b-a89c-8325895b5c1a
msgctxt "h0bd90e1dg746dg480egbadbg4ddf149c4e5a"
msgid "No triumph, just a nightmare I can hardly recall."
msgstr "승리가 아냐. 기억조차 하기 힘든 악몽일 뿐이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 78c431d9-f6c5-d842-8aab-8e1cde4527d9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:78c431d9-f6c5-d842-8aab-8e1cde4527d9
msgctxt "h1f823dc9g9a75g4e58ga9ccgfdeb9b3e8089"
msgid ""
"It is said the children of Bhaal are claimed throughout their sleep, ever-"
"disturbed by visions of a life of bloodshed and terror."
msgstr "바알의 자식들은 잠들 때마다 유혈과 공포로 가득 찬 환영에 시달린다고 하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7ca8be50-ba87-771a-3120-6674050e46c9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:7ca8be50-ba87-771a-3120-6674050e46c9
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h1f712f37gf263g4eb8g893fgb9213ac996d7"
msgid ""
"I'm afraid I'll never be a hero. My urges compel me to do terrible things."
msgstr "난 그런 영웅이 될 수 없을 거야. 내 안의 충동이 끔찍한 행동을 불러일으키고 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 7e6c90af-c5e2-e3f2-0f18-2284d74b8637
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:7e6c90af-c5e2-e3f2-0f18-2284d74b8637
msgctxt "h43e451e6g21c0g4f3ag9af4g1ad4c6d00740"
msgid "Optimist that I am, I hope you are of similar heroic vintage."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 7e7faa50-e759-fa2a-326e-c9f0bc59fdee
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - MINSC(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:7e7faa50-e759-fa2a-326e-c9f0bc59fdee
msgctxt "h65faec4bg34f1g4bf7gb639g35cad206147c"
msgid "Marvellous! The people do like a returning favourite."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 7f190b97-7cc8-01b6-0f5b-88c68f871291
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:7f190b97-7cc8-01b6-0f5b-88c68f871291
msgctxt "hdd0f25b2gaf3dg414bgadc7gee57ec3b023f"
msgid ""
"But not all of those who stood against him survived - and those who did were "
"never the same again."
msgstr "그러나 바알에게 대항한 모든 이가 살아남은 건 아니긴 하지. …살아남은 사람들도 예전 같지는 않았고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 8068a4bb-473a-9e0e-7928-8b40ca419088
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:8068a4bb-473a-9e0e-7928-8b40ca419088
msgctxt "h291fd190g791cg4380g95cfg6608d47cff93"
msgid ""
"Quite so. I was rather hoping you'd gathered all the rest of the adventuring "
"paraphernalia yourself. You'll need every advantage."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 80ae4d69-21ba-dd43-9747-09c6c2823f9b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:80ae4d69-21ba-dd43-9747-09c6c2823f9b
msgctxt "hd407db8eg0227g4c54gb95fg261dc79ff3db"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 80e10cd9-1519-824b-b9a2-a9d3feaab39c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:80e10cd9-1519-824b-b9a2-a9d3feaab39c
msgctxt "h4ebbf4adg5e32g4be7ga5a1g95a9d05cff82"
msgid "I assume you criticised Archduke Gortash. He controls the city now."
msgstr "공왕 고타쉬를 비판했을 것 같은데. 그 사람이 도시를 지배하고 있잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 830ab1e8-36f6-8129-0a61-02825a1b7266
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:830ab1e8-36f6-8129-0a61-02825a1b7266
msgctxt "h60e3084bg6d78g4484gaed4g37d715c8bb02"
msgid ""
"It is not the eyes that I fear, it is the intelligence behind them. The "
"Absolute is merely the outward form of something far more insidious."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 85a9c938-a13e-0bd0-3246-e02d209dc4cd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:85a9c938-a13e-0bd0-3246-e02d209dc4cd
msgctxt "ha1a8374eg3823g4622g804bg78aec9ab1a30"
msgid "Such a historic deed must be documented in every gory detail."
msgstr "그렇게 역사적인 순간은 세세한 것 하나까지 모두 기록해야지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 85d0bb76-10c0-1f88-fb76-44b5f5e26453
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:85d0bb76-10c0-1f88-fb76-44b5f5e26453
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h731683bfgdb50g488ag9abag8167c35ff881"
msgid "I really thought you were the one."
msgstr "난 정말 자네만 믿고 있었는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 86f4c7dd-b883-32a3-4e78-5b836cfa5524
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_DarkUrge_State_GivenSlayerForm = False
#.      - GLO_Orin_State_PermaDefeated = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:86f4c7dd-b883-32a3-4e78-5b836cfa5524
msgctxt "h9ce33fbfg7821g44fdga897g2f9020125df5"
msgid "I already defeated the Slayer."
msgstr "이미 내가 슬레이어를 처치했는걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 88e8bde3-9221-0fea-91c8-863278ea2eea
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Gortash_State_PermaDefeated = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:88e8bde3-9221-0fea-91c8-863278ea2eea
msgctxt "h3f2a833ag369dg4eb2gbf0fg9d1d6c7ab956"
msgid "I've already slain two Chosen - I can handle one more."
msgstr "난 이미 선택받은 자를 둘이나 살해했어. 이것도 해낼 수 있을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 89148163-bf67-4d10-6853-1cb7c60530c2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_Volo_DarkUrgeCompanion(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:89148163-bf67-4d10-6853-1cb7c60530c2
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "hd22bee89g99f2g418bg882bg78052bba5d1d"
msgid ""
"About my companion - do you think I can trust a Bhaalspawn to do the right "
"thing when the time comes?"
msgstr "내 동료 말인데, 바알스폰이 때가 되면 올바른 선택을 할 수 있을 거라고 믿어도 될까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 8a927c2c-4507-bcf5-e3b2-e4fcbc981f26
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:8a927c2c-4507-bcf5-e3b2-e4fcbc981f26
msgctxt "hf647864fg7437g4234gb401g28c8c468c684"
msgid ""
"In times gone by, there was an errant-hearted Bhaalspawn who stood against "
"his foul father, and brother Sarevok."
msgstr "오래전, 자신의 운명을 벗어던진 바알스폰이 있었다네. 사악한 아버지와 형제 사레복에 대항해 맞서 싸웠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 8c179981-04e9-49c1-2758-5bf0e2dbab75
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:8c179981-04e9-49c1-2758-5bf0e2dbab75
msgctxt "hdc24a416g310dg45f3gb19ag8f92ace11a89"
msgid ""
"And there is a way. I have a study of the beast, penned by the wizard "
"Irenicus himself. It contains all of the knowledge needed to slay the Slayer."
msgstr ""
"그리고 방법이 있다네. 위저드 이레니쿠스가 직접 야수에 관해 집필한 책이 있는데, 거기엔 슬레이어를 처치하는 데 필요한 모든 지식이 담겨 "
"있지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8d1b6407-55f9-e162-5f08-0f0d55cea920
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:8d1b6407-55f9-e162-5f08-0f0d55cea920
msgctxt "h5b72da77gdd17g4990gba50g4fdef249dd15"
msgid "Somebody will rise to the task."
msgstr "누군가 다른 사람이 하겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 8e186e26-6b23-cc9f-3e55-6f1f367642bf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:8e186e26-6b23-cc9f-3e55-6f1f367642bf
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h3ac7edb8g17fbg4233gbe6bg356e53b952c1"
msgid ""
"It is possible you could turn it against the city's enemies, but it would be "
"better to purge yourself of Bhaal's influence entirely."
msgstr "적을 상대할 때 그걸 이용할 수도 있겠지만, 자네가 바알의 영향력에서 완전히 벗어나는 편이 더 낫지 않을까 싶네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 933eb217-6fd2-821b-ba37-e720c2ed1585
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:933eb217-6fd2-821b-ba37-e720c2ed1585
msgctxt "hcc30352fg908fg47d3ga421g584a43f44e78"
msgid "Why don't you go fight the Slayer yourself?"
msgstr "직접 슬레이어와 싸워 볼 생각은 없는 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 93908abd-6b10-1e84-d966-5e58e9bc4b24
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_Volo_DarkUrgeDeception(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:93908abd-6b10-1e84-d966-5e58e9bc4b24
msgctxt "hf711f5f0g6a29g4a7fg9350g1b22ebdc47c8"
msgid "I'm afraid you're mistaken. I'm nobody special."
msgstr "당신이 오해하고 있는 것 같군. 난 특별한 사람이 아냐."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 95881fce-0400-64f1-8728-6d05e8efea6a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 25
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:95881fce-0400-64f1-8728-6d05e8efea6a
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h32bb5ca1g8a80g4414ga3c9g860dc72f387c"
msgid "More lies, Volo. I'm no Bhaalspawn."
msgstr "거짓말을 잘하네, 볼로. 나는 바알스폰이 아냐."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 95b2ab6b-03c8-5184-4ece-cd09821138b9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:95b2ab6b-03c8-5184-4ece-cd09821138b9
msgctxt "ha66ade1dg9afcg4a2bg87b0gf9c1345a185b"
msgid "<i>Tell him everything.</i>"
msgstr "<i>그에게 모든 것을 말해준다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 960d8eca-5305-508c-da21-65845991b1ff
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:960d8eca-5305-508c-da21-65845991b1ff
msgctxt "h93426752g02fdg4368gba4fgb7c75dc89b45"
msgid ""
"I have been known to exaggerate the truth on occasion, but do not take me "
"for a fool."
msgstr "내가 가끔 사실을 과장되게 표현하는 경향은 있지만, 나를 바보로 알지는 말게나."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 9bb0bb8a-8fcf-1fde-8299-c8fc93e653f8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:9bb0bb8a-8fcf-1fde-8299-c8fc93e653f8
msgctxt "h76a2d8bbga44eg43ccg98cdgeb7d2ffd3c45"
msgid "I believe you will be."
msgstr "자네라면 그렇게 될 거라고 믿네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 9c11e881-05f0-ad19-2c72-a328bb4d3abe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:9c11e881-05f0-ad19-2c72-a328bb4d3abe
msgctxt "hca72255bg1a92g4d09g8601g2a1dc58d3541"
msgid ""
"Now I just need a brave adventurer willing to face Bhaal's Chosen, and to "
"put the knowledge into practice."
msgstr "이제 바알의 선택받은 자에게 맞서, 지식을 실천으로 옮길 용감한 모험가만 찾으면 된다네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = a0eb001f-ea6c-1d83-d1a9-0dbf7eb3d68f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Volo_State_FinalCampDialogExhausted = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:a0eb001f-ea6c-1d83-d1a9-0dbf7eb3d68f
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h744ba801gbdf0g4ec2g9192gdc1291a10b0c"
msgid "And... thank you. For my life, for the stories, for all of it."
msgstr "그리고… 고맙네. 내 생명을 구해준 것과, 이야기를 전해준 것 모두."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = a533309a-0722-d095-04fc-d1fdf0ee2545
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:a533309a-0722-d095-04fc-d1fdf0ee2545
msgctxt "hb5263e5agec3cg49fbg98e8g5de709803cd1"
msgid ""
"I was hoping your better nature might come to the fore. Perhaps you never "
"had one."
msgstr "자네의 선한 본성이 모습을 드러내기를 바랐건만. 그런 건 애초에 없었나 보군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = a53b88bb-dbf8-3d97-a75d-775425ad8fd9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:a53b88bb-dbf8-3d97-a75d-775425ad8fd9
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "hb6eaf2f8gd24dg4a68gae0eg4d1234c36572"
msgid ""
"That is how he came to crave the power of the Bhaalspawn. He saw them not as "
"living things, but as tools for his own machinations."
msgstr ""
"그게 바알스폰의 힘을 갈구하게 된 원인이라네. 이레니쿠스는 그들을 살아있는 생명체로 보지 않았고, 자신의 음모를 위한 도구로 삼았지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = aab07c91-35ae-c541-89fa-7cc1910f957f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CAMP_Volo_DarkUrgeDeception(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:aab07c91-35ae-c541-89fa-7cc1910f957f
msgctxt "haeb5bb6bg5093g4cfdga77dgf9bd040973f3"
msgid ""
"A pity. For Baldur's Gate may need Orin's counterpart if is to survive this "
"crisis."
msgstr "유감이군. 발더스 게이트가 이 난관을 헤쳐나가기 위해선 오린에게 대적할 사람이 필요할지도 몰라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = b07d8c3e-faeb-053e-46b2-1a770f7210d8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:b07d8c3e-faeb-053e-46b2-1a770f7210d8
msgctxt "h39e826b2gaa96g430fgbf95g031f7d3d5196"
msgid ""
"It will serve you well. 'A Study of the Slayer', penned by Jon Irenicus. "
"It's a one-of-a-kind, so do try to keep it away from the inevitable "
"bloodbath."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b4449c4f-cd2e-8b74-2911-cbbbdb48b048
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:b4449c4f-cd2e-8b74-2911-cbbbdb48b048
msgctxt "hb117af80g698dg4adfg8ca6g6260fec639bb"
msgid "Tell me about Irenicus."
msgstr "이레니쿠스에 대해 말해줘."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = b4fe31a2-d300-8b6d-fc55-cb8d4082e7ed
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:b4fe31a2-d300-8b6d-fc55-cb8d4082e7ed
msgctxt "h7b4b08c2g2866g48d5gb216g589c71af09db"
msgid ""
"Once they have seen too much, once these dreams drive their minds to break, "
"they are beset by the Slayer."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b59c8f8c-e05d-5242-5e9b-21c4c4929402
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:b59c8f8c-e05d-5242-5e9b-21c4c4929402
msgctxt "h39401918gec83g467cg85fdgb0485d98bcfe"
msgid "It was traumatic. I really don't want to talk about it."
msgstr "너무 충격적이었어. 그 일에 대해선 더 이상 얘기하고 싶지 않아. "

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = b84c9a2b-89d3-3a59-57da-8bb717d81e95
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:b84c9a2b-89d3-3a59-57da-8bb717d81e95
msgctxt "hd5337013g2ebcg447fgaf7eg8cf4399aab16"
msgid ""
"Nonsense! It is my dedication to truth that endangers my wellbeing, and I "
"have uncovered the most startling truth imaginable."
msgstr "허튼소리! 안전을 포기하면서까지 진실을 추구하는 것이 나의 사명이라네. 그리고 나는 상상도 못 할 만큼 놀라운 것을 발견했지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = b920b5fc-a7ee-1054-260d-bc67a24a0cd1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_Volo_DarkUrgeDeception(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:b920b5fc-a7ee-1054-260d-bc67a24a0cd1
msgctxt "h54e7629cg2bd3g4e71gbfe8g3ad4e4acc179"
msgid ""
"I had hoped my instincts regarding your heritage were correct, and that you "
"were of similar heroic vintage."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = b9cde6b4-217d-e55f-1fb2-ccf9f1339089
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:b9cde6b4-217d-e55f-1fb2-ccf9f1339089
msgctxt "hd781a11dg3dfbg4a41g88b9ge06867511c32"
msgid "The heart of a Bhaalspawn is a flipped coin that lands on its edge.  "
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = bb2a055a-9484-6de9-300b-023e4cccf563
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:bb2a055a-9484-6de9-300b-023e4cccf563
msgctxt "h803e07acge8feg4921gb8f8gc6ff560550fd"
msgid "It is splendid to see you again, my friend."
msgstr "나의 친구여, 다시 보게 되어 정말 반갑네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bb49604d-d342-1ffb-a71f-0c5da554c88d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_DarkUrge_State_BhaalResisted = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:bb49604d-d342-1ffb-a71f-0c5da554c88d
msgctxt "hf28e958dgf0f2g45d6gb6f3ga42981e3baa1"
msgid "I did. Bhaal killed me for my troubles."
msgstr "그랬지. 바알은 날 골칫거리라고 여겨 죽여버리더군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = bc4b1191-f81b-f0cf-c585-ca62802579e9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:bc4b1191-f81b-f0cf-c585-ca62802579e9
msgctxt "hf08409bagd01bg4a31g9f7eg3b0ac001a8dc"
msgid "The Dream Eater."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = bd5eb186-8fa2-79e1-e774-7d48af827f6a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:bd5eb186-8fa2-79e1-e774-7d48af827f6a
msgctxt "h8940ad35g8fc3g4e4bg9354g22b279ecb17f"
msgid "The Lord of Murder has returned."
msgstr "살인의 군주가 돌아왔다네. "

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = bd913e56-8a10-b5bd-b394-9733d6994719
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:bd913e56-8a10-b5bd-b394-9733d6994719
msgctxt "ha53c69eege76ag4596ga09ege4ca8a9e6f8e"
msgid "Am I mistaken?"
msgstr "내가 잘못 알고 있는 건가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = bdebb435-9fb7-9b28-f692-6d0ab9a4feea
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:bdebb435-9fb7-9b28-f692-6d0ab9a4feea
msgctxt "hf170fb04g2dd3g4963g9f24g68e82fb13479"
msgid ""
"As you wish. Perhaps when the scars have healed we can reopen them. It will "
"give the people of Baldur's Gate much hope to hear your tale."
msgstr ""
"자네 뜻대로 하게. 상처가 아물면 다시 살펴볼 수 있을지도 모르지. 발더스 게이트의 사람들도 자네의 이야기를 들으면 희망을 품을 수 있을 "
"것이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = c09144fd-a9d0-064c-7b3f-42409a1c80b2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:c09144fd-a9d0-064c-7b3f-42409a1c80b2
msgctxt "hf78b91ffgbb87g422cga674gb991976e6697"
msgid ""
"A bard? The people want to hear the truth of the matter, not some trumped-up "
"song and dance."
msgstr "바드라고? 사람들은 진실을 알기 원하는 걸세. 흥겨운 노래와 춤은 필요 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = c0c114f4-798e-e0ab-fdd3-8907c23d624f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Volo_State_FinalCampDialogExhausted = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:c0c114f4-798e-e0ab-fdd3-8907c23d624f
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h1f32166bg1d82g4de5g9b21g2f1ed68a0f9b"
msgid ""
"All the Coast shall read my writings of <i>your </i>triumph. Ha! Bhaal's "
"seed has been wasted, spilled on the ground once again!"
msgstr "모든 사람들이 <i>자네의</i> 승리에 관한 내 책을 읽게 될 걸세. 하! 바알이 뿌린 씨앗이 또 허사로 돌아갔구나!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = c10c0ff5-19e7-6a6c-3cd9-ea6721593da3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:c10c0ff5-19e7-6a6c-3cd9-ea6721593da3
msgctxt "h7805e1efg86f0g4174gbb0ag6d6d81fb91ae"
msgid ""
"That is not true, my friend. Whether you're descended from the gods or not, "
"you have saved my hide more than once."
msgstr "그건 사실이 아닐세, 나의 친구여. 신의 아이건 아니건 간에, 자네는 나의 목숨을 여러 번 구해줬지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = c22a08fe-aafb-0282-0da3-fedf85f53595
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:c22a08fe-aafb-0282-0da3-fedf85f53595
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h2b451eafg3d06g4782gb53dgfe4fc154c85d"
msgid ""
"Quite right. But it's not Orin herself who has marked me for death. It is "
"her dread master."
msgstr "맞는 말이군. 그렇지만 내게 죽음의 표식을 붙인 건 오린이 아니고, 그 주인이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c2a81bcb-e9d9-5cc9-bf66-059c74e891bb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_DarkUrge_State_BhaalDisappointed = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:c2a81bcb-e9d9-5cc9-bf66-059c74e891bb
msgctxt "h2a17bd57gf21dg4955gb4b4g291419d71388"
msgid ""
"A terrible fate awaits me, as I did not impress my Father. I don't like to "
"think on it."
msgstr "아버지께 실망을 안겨드렸기 때문에, 나에겐 끔찍한 미래밖에 남지 않았어. 생각하고 싶지도 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c2e8ed1f-598b-81d1-ac82-b3940413ce1f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:c2e8ed1f-598b-81d1-ac82-b3940413ce1f
msgctxt "h7911449ag1250g44a0ga191gf7b89c0e35c7"
msgid "I hope so too - I think I can be the hero the city needs."
msgstr "그랬으면 좋겠어. 난 도시를 구할 영웅이 될 수 있을지도 몰라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c3d7be6f-af20-5297-495b-a044fc3f4f69
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:c3d7be6f-af20-5297-495b-a044fc3f4f69
msgctxt "h2a0bd622gf958g4f42ga94ag82dd6f8d57ad"
msgid "Don't look at me. I'm not about to volunteer."
msgstr "날 쳐다보지 말라고. 자원할 생각은 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = c6bad541-891c-e682-896b-a770a126845a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:c6bad541-891c-e682-896b-a770a126845a
msgctxt "h361a6cbcg2767g43a8gb9d8g60380273f1e2"
msgid ""
"When there are two or more, they will destroy one another until a single "
"heir to the throne of blood remains."
msgstr "둘 이상의 바알스폰이 존재할 땐, 피의 왕좌를 차지할 단 하나의 후계자가 남을 때까지 서로를 파괴하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c887fd75-b668-249b-243e-9391b3e2f298
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_DarkUrge_State_BhaalResisted = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:c887fd75-b668-249b-243e-9391b3e2f298
msgctxt "headffa70gd83eg4084ga080ge2d52da2b14e"
msgid "Yes - and defied the Lord of Murder himself."
msgstr "그래. 그리고 살인의 군주에게 반기를 들었지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ce692470-31d7-f95c-ac35-419322287863
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:ce692470-31d7-f95c-ac35-419322287863
msgctxt "h82f66be1gb138g4805g9347gf43c319344ed"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = cf287f0a-514e-6fa3-2d44-a7cfe6002638
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CAMP_Volo_DarkUrgeCompanion(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:cf287f0a-514e-6fa3-2d44-a7cfe6002638
msgctxt "ha684b964g9e72g4490g831bg7e571ccf4eb6"
msgid ""
"A child of Bhaal saved this city once before, by slaughtering his foul "
"siblings. Your companion may be able to repeat history - to be the hero we "
"need."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = d044606a-ae48-4594-7298-7757d0a59e75
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:d044606a-ae48-4594-7298-7757d0a59e75
msgctxt "h5b7f59ddg3804g45e9g8d37gd5bb45941da8"
msgid ""
"Not an accusation - an observation, based on a thorough knowledge of your "
"kind. And I note that your retort was not a denial."
msgstr ""
"비난이 아닐세. 자네와 같은 자들에 대한 지식을 바탕으로 한 관찰이라고 해 두지. 그리고 내 말에 자네가 부인하지 않았다는 점도 "
"참고해야겠고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = d3c553db-e842-9742-53be-62cf7a1f7bbe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:d3c553db-e842-9742-53be-62cf7a1f7bbe
msgctxt "h04435182g5189g442bg8347g5e67ff109166"
msgid ""
"If you did not have the strength to resist those urges, you would have "
"become a savage beast long ago."
msgstr "자네가 그 충동을 이겨 낼 힘이 없었다면, 이미 오래전에 포악한 야수로 변해 버렸을 걸세."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d42fbe7c-b604-fc8d-3b83-701db3920551
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Orin_State_PermaDefeated = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:d42fbe7c-b604-fc8d-3b83-701db3920551
msgctxt "h9765822fg32c8g45f8gb52dgc391fb95d111"
msgid "About one thing, yes. I'm the last - Orin is dead."
msgstr "한 가지는 틀렸어. 내가 마지막 한 명이지. 오린이 죽었거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = d4adde6c-1c1c-4f28-6c87-ec8658b56551
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:d4adde6c-1c1c-4f28-6c87-ec8658b56551
msgctxt "he2d89068g0b5bg4acbg99afg284b998c7df5"
msgid ""
"And I'd like to help, the only way I know how - with a Guidebook. This one "
"did not flow from my quill, but from that of the wizard Irenicus."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = d57887c5-4190-b803-383a-25de60a05e52
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:d57887c5-4190-b803-383a-25de60a05e52
msgctxt "h116b154eg6444g4460g93f0g1090697ba51a"
msgid ""
"If the Slayer is not stopped, it will slaughter every living thing in this "
"city. As one of those things, I'm particularly eager to stop it."
msgstr "슬레이어를 막지 못한다면 이 도시의 모든 생명을 학살할 테지. 나도 포함해서 말일세. 반드시 그걸 저지해야만 하네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = d57b629f-20a8-7f58-17ce-819adf98cb8a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:d57b629f-20a8-7f58-17ce-819adf98cb8a
msgctxt "h316e350fg83d8g4e9cg9e7dgbda3f45e7992"
msgid "They are a family set upon self-slaughter."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d5a6495b-02dd-ff46-3632-6bf5f8596387
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:d5a6495b-02dd-ff46-3632-6bf5f8596387
msgctxt "hf0128e99gddb8g474eg9b71gdb4dd4a98b27"
msgid ""
"I just assumed decades of spreading lies and misinformation had caught up "
"with you."
msgstr "수십 년 동안 거짓말과 잘못된 정보를 퍼트리고 다녀서가 아닐까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = d7e253cd-f404-f0a5-6007-a48ab52050b7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:d7e253cd-f404-f0a5-6007-a48ab52050b7
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h306da787g3d6cg4b36gac71g0cc174b014a7"
msgid ""
"And just as then, he has more than one Chosen to manifest his gruesome plot. "
"He has Orin."
msgstr "그리고 그때처럼, 그 소름끼치는 음모를 완성할 선택받은 자는 한 명이 아니라네. 오린이 있고,"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = dd9e16f1-8849-3760-1db7-ffa7df6d0196
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Volo_State_LeftPlayerSide = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:dd9e16f1-8849-3760-1db7-ffa7df6d0196
msgctxt "h8b0a6e0bgb5bcg404agaf56g5db20ff07d10"
msgid ""
"But if you're content for your heroics to be reduced to theatrical fancies, "
"I shan't stand in your way."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = e6435269-23fe-94fa-fa22-1380772b7447
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Volo_State_FinalCampDialogExhausted = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:e6435269-23fe-94fa-fa22-1380772b7447
msgctxt "hf7812503gc592g4dcdg80cdg732679abffad"
msgid ""
"Whatever happens next, be sure that I will document it all as accurately as "
"possible."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = e8e26413-5902-2871-358c-d00d3b2fbd3b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:e8e26413-5902-2871-358c-d00d3b2fbd3b
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h550a3bf3gc76ag4892g8129g2f8cb2a20539"
msgid "And you would use that power for good? A risky proposition."
msgstr "그 힘을 선의로 사용할 건가? 위험해 보이는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = ed8c1658-ac1a-56cc-03d5-816a2c8dec83
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:ed8c1658-ac1a-56cc-03d5-816a2c8dec83
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h2dbf06b6gc2f4g4856g88e9gb50def209206"
msgid ""
"But the saga of the Bhaalspawn is not the story of a hero fighting alone "
"against their own bloody inheritance."
msgstr "바알스폰의 영웅담은, 피비린내 나는 본성에 맞서 홀로 싸우는 주인공의 이야기가 아니라네. "

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = edb245fd-f016-dbc9-5fbb-9831fe7f3d1a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:edb245fd-f016-dbc9-5fbb-9831fe7f3d1a
msgctxt "h1154d352gc1abg4f4aga8dcg97403388d637"
msgid ""
"I am a living witness to Bhaal's defeat those hundred years ago, so I know "
"your battle against him is not futile. He can be stopped."
msgstr ""
"백여 년 전에 바알의 패배를 목격한 산 증인으로서, 자네의 이 싸움이 헛되지 않다는 걸 잘 알고 있네. 자네가 멈출 수 있을 걸세."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = f39eb44a-16f1-cebd-108e-def44dd64f6d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:f39eb44a-16f1-cebd-108e-def44dd64f6d
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "hadf513eagdeb1g4293g8637gb189066078a9"
msgid "It means nothing of the sort."
msgstr "그런 뜻은 아니었는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = f48fe670-3b70-1db5-86b2-8a7f7f9d768e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:f48fe670-3b70-1db5-86b2-8a7f7f9d768e
msgctxt "h64b33875g1ebeg4754g828dg9edfc4d01372"
msgid ""
"Take Irenicus' 'A Study of the Slayer'. And when you face Orin, be sure your "
"friend is by your side."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = f4d7f6e3-ab44-973e-9256-8e014aaee5eb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:f4d7f6e3-ab44-973e-9256-8e014aaee5eb
msgctxt "h31f34220gc7f9g4188gb903ge63517c28b12"
msgid ""
"If you hadn't saved me from that mob, I'd be penning a Guide to the "
"Afterlife, based on first-hand experience."
msgstr "자네가 나를 저 폭도로부터 구해주지 않았다면, 사후 세계 가이드를 집필할 뻔했구만."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f80c1b93-7756-8ca2-e79b-dae6e0e9a6fe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Origin_PartOfTheTeam_DarkUrge = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:f80c1b93-7756-8ca2-e79b-dae6e0e9a6fe
msgctxt "hdd07f6e3gda8eg461eg812eg2e0b96a47a55"
msgid ""
"Orin may not be the only Chosen of Bhaal - I believe we travel with another."
msgstr "바알의 선택받은 자가 오린뿐만이 아닌 것 같은데. 우리 여행 동료 중에도 있는 것 같거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = fbe36f20-fc47-04d2-05ce-11f1dd64d786
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:fbe36f20-fc47-04d2-05ce-11f1dd64d786
msgctxt "hf15a42adg096cg474agb75bg96a6ba1628fd"
msgid "Yours is a family set upon self-slaughter."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = fca9db97-f5d4-681a-0045-1b0c7525a409
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:fca9db97-f5d4-681a-0045-1b0c7525a409
msgctxt "ha4aa5ca5gf683g4079gb15dg3c5185c1241f"
msgid ""
"As he did a hundred years ago, Bhaal has set his accursed sights on Baldur's "
"Gate, and his temple runs red with the blood of the innocent."
msgstr "백 년 전에 그랬던 것처럼, 바알은 다시 발더스 게이트를 노리고 있다네. 바알의 신전은 무고한 자들의 피로 붉게 물들고 있지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = fe27f0dc-3050-1842-a3ee-016d7353b517
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_Volo:fe27f0dc-3050-1842-a3ee-016d7353b517
msgctxt "h6ecf1916g79fcg4146gae00g1ef57c6cd832"
msgid ""
"Still - perhaps Irenicus' study will help you to work out some techniques "
"for your own beastly form."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 0160705f-88a6-fedb-d6b4-939d23d6dfb5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Volo_State_Researched = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Volo_State_Researching = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:0160705f-88a6-fedb-d6b4-939d23d6dfb5
msgctxt "h190f7575gf8f7g4032gaa0agb3f9e4ec3a5c"
msgid ""
"I'll need to research the particulars, however. Give me a bit of time, and "
"I'll have this little issue sorted."
msgstr "그래도 자세한 사항은 더 연구를 해봐야 할 걸세. 약간의 시간만 준다면, 이 작은 문제를 내 해결해 보이리다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 0181f177-9b48-80a4-71f4-ab2f74aefa1e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:0181f177-9b48-80a4-71f4-ab2f74aefa1e
msgctxt "h658fb4f9g22d1g4425gbcf0g19d50296f350"
msgid "Stop? Now?!"
msgstr "멈추라고? 지금?!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 03971017-e66f-fcb2-59d6-aef09721f405
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:03971017-e66f-fcb2-59d6-aef09721f405
msgctxt "h0962edaagb10dg4774g9957g4fa536a737a3"
msgid "<i>Let him continue.</i>"
msgstr "<i>계속하게 둔다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 0403b3e5-04bc-865a-ee27-7c4921db5c9f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:0403b3e5-04bc-865a-ee27-7c4921db5c9f
msgctxt "h4ed68c96g9c81g415ag937cg66617d7e79ba"
msgid "There appears to be an amount of... cosmetic damage."
msgstr "보아하니 약간의... 외관상의 손상이 있는 것 같네만."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 04342064-2bcd-e302-3d32-0ca97e2088b0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:04342064-2bcd-e302-3d32-0ca97e2088b0
msgctxt "hc10ff770g1e52g4d28gb4f3g98c6f8263d95"
msgid "You're mad. But..."
msgstr "그대는 미쳤군. 그렇지만..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 076f3c81-2ce7-27fe-50a7-3abc6652686e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:076f3c81-2ce7-27fe-50a7-3abc6652686e
msgctxt "h7b7656fbgb1dcg4f78gaee7g69fc38886c70"
msgid "That's enough. Stop."
msgstr "그만하면 됐어. 멈춰."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 07ae58e8-9166-d133-04e8-19194241a269
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:07ae58e8-9166-d133-04e8-19194241a269
msgctxt "hb45b3aa0gd743g4c6eg888egf1325907b9a4"
msgid "Pblblblblblbl..."
msgstr "프르르르르르르르..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 09c256f6-7644-4cc0-0037-5a7bc27beb03
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:09c256f6-7644-4cc0-0037-5a7bc27beb03
msgctxt "heaec47eeg2b01g47cfga25agd3c52a2d3c35"
msgid ""
"Once I've written you into one of my books, there won't be a tavern in "
"Faerûn you can enter without receiving a hero's welcome."
msgstr "내가 그대의 이야기를 책에 담고 나면, 그대는 페이룬의 선술집에 들어갈 때마다 매번 영웅 대접을 받게 될 것이네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 09d5e9e9-8b98-80b8-a080-f38331193504
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:09d5e9e9-8b98-80b8-a080-f38331193504
msgctxt "h7522e418g28c1g4784ga81ag385bf23f4996"
msgid ""
"The creature's in your brain, somewhere behind the orbital socket. I could "
"attempt to remove it. I've a needle in my tunic..."
msgstr "그 괴물은 당신 뇌 안에, 안와골 뒤쪽에 자리잡고 있어요. 한번 제거하려 시도해볼 수는 있죠. 외투 안에 바늘이 있는데..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 09ec602b-c6d2-5f42-e936-7719d312782d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:09ec602b-c6d2-5f42-e936-7719d312782d
msgctxt "h982b7f84gd881g429dgb9aeg5050751bec37"
msgid ""
"I can't help but feel partly responsible. Perhaps there's something more I "
"can do..."
msgstr "부분적으로 내가 책임감을 느끼지 않을 수 없겠군.어쩌면 내가 해줄 수 있는 게 더 있을지도..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 0b1635ea-f949-927a-7064-1f2c278d3e21
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - GLO_Volo_OperationComplete(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Volo_OperationFailed = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:0b1635ea-f949-927a-7064-1f2c278d3e21
msgctxt "h113ccac8g1463g4499g9918g308894bd9526"
msgid "Ta!"
msgstr "하!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 0b23b3f7-2d28-8bf0-54d8-0018f64ef838
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:0b23b3f7-2d28-8bf0-54d8-0018f64ef838
msgctxt "h0a15410ag0817g48d5ga759g0b03d2ef5bc8"
msgid ""
"As you wish. But when your skin starts to peel away, remember - Volo offered "
"to help."
msgstr "원하는 대로. 하지만 그대 피부가 벗겨지기 시작하면 기억하게. 볼로가 도와주겠노라 했다는 것을."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0bc09d7a-3559-4692-c3d0-14e044b91097
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:0bc09d7a-3559-4692-c3d0-14e044b91097
msgctxt "h693adc6cgd31bg4f5ag8a2fg2973366099b7"
msgid "Examine me. Find out for yourself."
msgstr "나를 검사해 봐. 직접 봐줘."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 0bcb72c2-f2c7-a2e1-5ec1-cf6ff09d2c97
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:0bcb72c2-f2c7-a2e1-5ec1-cf6ff09d2c97
msgctxt "h03349fc1gcf0fg46c5gae66g0d9adb404443"
msgid "I... I mean... I mean yes, I suppose I can."
msgstr "음... 그러니까... 그래, 도와줄 수 있을 것 같군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 0dbe7a2d-bb65-7814-4a5a-863933966380
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:0dbe7a2d-bb65-7814-4a5a-863933966380
msgctxt "h6d3fbd5cgce25g4cfdgb3adgaa9429c3a660"
msgid "Now. Don't move."
msgstr "자. 가만히 있으시게."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 0fd55110-896c-408d-4bc8-6fd9785db3ed
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:0fd55110-896c-408d-4bc8-6fd9785db3ed
msgctxt "h980c1d66g17c6g4e6agafb7g345672aebfc8"
msgid "Drat!"
msgstr "젠장!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0fdf0222-0f95-a3be-bbd5-a7491a867eb8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 9d2506a6-fc08-6625-7877-37d138229182_AskedVoloWhoIsHe = False
#.      - 9d2506a6-fc08-6625-7877-37d138229182_FirstTimeMetVoloInThisDialog = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 9d2506a6-fc08-6625-7877-37d138229182_AskedVoloWhoIsHe = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:0fdf0222-0f95-a3be-bbd5-a7491a867eb8
msgctxt "h67b11d91gebf3g48bdg9917g6da8627ade3e"
msgid "Who are you?"
msgstr "넌 누구야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 18a5b916-0262-5b8c-4d63-c2bc562881d5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:18a5b916-0262-5b8c-4d63-c2bc562881d5
msgctxt "hf7008eeagf3d9g4efeg9174gdfbb7596d6c3"
msgid ""
"*Volo carefully holds one of your eyes open and begins to prod uncertainly "
"with the needle.*"
msgstr "*볼로는 당신의 한쪽 눈을 조심스럽게 잡아서 띄우고, 머뭇거리며 바늘로 찌르기 시작합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 1a1ca684-1e12-9517-3988-2098bee5bfa5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:1a1ca684-1e12-9517-3988-2098bee5bfa5
msgctxt "hc8020c60g1130g4f2bga299gf6eb14055f45"
msgid "Here?! On the Sword Coast? Impossible."
msgstr "여기서?! 이 소드 코스트에서? 불가능해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 1cd066da-c17d-4e5d-04ba-2c1ab238c21c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:1cd066da-c17d-4e5d-04ba-2c1ab238c21c
msgctxt "h0ab6a128g1581g472dga40fg5d061ffcad81"
msgid "If what you say were true, you'd <i>be </i>a mind flayer by now."
msgstr "그 얘기가 사실이라면, 그대는 이미 마인드 플레이어가 <i>되었을</i> 것이네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1d0e4537-dc8c-02c8-5f0a-0b2dd4cee05d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:1d0e4537-dc8c-02c8-5f0a-0b2dd4cee05d
msgctxt "h8002737cgb99eg40a0gafafg5e3590fb9b5d"
msgid "Kssssssssssssssssss."
msgstr "크으으으으으으으."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1de49f2f-ed2a-65d5-a8e3-84aec485907c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:1de49f2f-ed2a-65d5-a8e3-84aec485907c
msgctxt "he04bddc9g6fbcg4702g8f3fge7b24d0502cc"
msgid "Keep going."
msgstr "계속해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 1e53abbf-c551-44eb-8854-3c7ae345c3b5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:1e53abbf-c551-44eb-8854-3c7ae345c3b5
msgctxt "h59c35508g82aeg4cf4gbd9ag3267f9ce3579"
msgid ""
"Regrettable. Mark my words - ceremorphosis will be far more painful than "
"this procedure!"
msgstr "유감이군. 내 말 기억해 두게. 뇌변이는 이 시술보다도 더 고통스러우리라는 것을!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1f11c137-a12b-580d-dd6b-454b03380c08
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GLO_Volo_Ceremorphosis(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - GLO_Volo_Ceremorphosis(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:1f11c137-a12b-580d-dd6b-454b03380c08
msgctxt "h85d0c8a9g741bg43f5gb8b1gb38a20427af4"
msgid "Ceremorphosis? I'm listening."
msgstr "뇌변이라니? 말해 줘."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1f1e15b6-77c4-7cd6-0632-26aadc582794
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:1f1e15b6-77c4-7cd6-0632-26aadc582794
msgctxt "ha43b261agcd54g4e93g9c45g987e0a1ef229"
msgid "Perhaps not. You've done enough."
msgstr "안 해도 될 것 같군. 당신은 충분히 했어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2204f65e-20a5-3fd4-4082-9378bd463f55
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:2204f65e-20a5-3fd4-4082-9378bd463f55
msgctxt "h805918d3gaafcg4cd8gbc81g69213ff9106e"
msgid "Looks like I'm going to need to find help elsewhere..."
msgstr "다른 곳에서 도움을 구해야 할 것 같구만..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 226dd08c-6a0d-6d8e-3c03-52ec1a895b29
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:226dd08c-6a0d-6d8e-3c03-52ec1a895b29
msgctxt "h86d32538g55b2g4a3cg8d2eg7ab1d78d6cf2"
msgid "Wise."
msgstr "현명하군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 25dbf625-f105-798b-fb7c-dfdbfd946cf2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_Volo_Step6(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:25dbf625-f105-798b-fb7c-dfdbfd946cf2
msgctxt "h91a5882cg1fdeg4c72gbcaegafcd589db754"
msgid "Do you feel that? I believe we have the blighter on the run!"
msgstr "느껴졌나? 그 녀석이 도망치는 것 같아!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 284fbb76-9df8-126e-048c-8780285a2bf9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:284fbb76-9df8-126e-048c-8780285a2bf9
msgctxt "h3031fd27gf9e4g4d6bgbb88gdb74d9d7ce75"
msgid ""
"I'm sure you'll sort out your little brain problem one way or another. Far "
"away from here, if you've a heart."
msgstr "내가 보기에 그대는 어떻게든 그 사소한 뇌 문제를 해결할 것 같군. 그대가 이해해준다면, 여기서 멀리 떠나겠네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 28e8b072-91dc-2978-31ee-5ecaebc24c15
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:28e8b072-91dc-2978-31ee-5ecaebc24c15
msgctxt "h9ba852fcgf2c5g45f2g95b6gace8c4325255"
msgid "A mind flayer planted one of their larvae in my brain."
msgstr "마인드 플레이어가 내 뇌에 그 유충을 심었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 2b85d5ab-c75d-376c-eb83-7cdb31811656
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - GLO_Volo_Examined(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:2b85d5ab-c75d-376c-eb83-7cdb31811656
msgctxt "h612acdc7g339ag495fg8208g3e7187fa5aa0"
msgid "Oh... my... dear... sweet... <i>GODS!</i>"
msgstr "오... 이런... 세상에... 자애로우신... <i><b>신들이시여!</b></i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2b8e37c9-4e18-8f6d-eed5-d4d11c0c5d29
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Volo_RefusedOperation = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:2b8e37c9-4e18-8f6d-eed5-d4d11c0c5d29
msgctxt "h1c0292e9gdf6ag407fga15fg8f508c795bd6"
msgid "Yes. We're done here."
msgstr "그래. 끝이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2bc90c76-ee22-5555-bf4a-d36887e7203d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:2bc90c76-ee22-5555-bf4a-d36887e7203d
msgctxt "h24489307gc607g4d95g8951g6b073a2b5dfd"
msgid "Hnnnngggg..."
msgstr "흐으으느으으윽..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 2d53d76e-1406-cb8c-fbbd-5bf43fe2a494
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:2d53d76e-1406-cb8c-fbbd-5bf43fe2a494
msgctxt "hdb4fb929g2c2dg4433ga925g7a21d3971334"
msgid ""
"Quite the cosy set-up you have here. I'll just make myself comfortable - "
"thank you so much."
msgstr "여기 꽤나 아늑하게 꾸며놓았군. 편히 머물도록 하지. 정말 고맙네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2d5684bc-e280-0726-694a-255b90cbef2b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Volo_RefusedOperation = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:2d5684bc-e280-0726-694a-255b90cbef2b
msgctxt "hdb8cd76eg2f6fg48a5ga23bg428f2b4d6fbb"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 2f6fb51a-df1d-03e0-a25f-4f8f42c202c3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:2f6fb51a-df1d-03e0-a25f-4f8f42c202c3
msgctxt "h161b366fg93abg4039gbaf0g7a1516f45022"
msgid "Yes, quite. There is some... mild trauma."
msgstr "그래. 약간. 조금의... 가벼운 외상이 있군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 313e5883-d524-24c6-0edc-d4338f41ebdd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Halsin_Knows_PlayerTadpoleCondition = True
#.      - GLO_Daisy_State_TriggerDaisyMissionStatement = True
#.      - ORI_Laezel_State_HadDaisyMissionStatement = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:313e5883-d524-24c6-0edc-d4338f41ebdd
msgctxt "hcfe88036g1b23g45c0gbd17g09f13d1e9f73"
msgid ""
"This parasite is unusual. I have it on good authority that extraction is "
"currently impossible."
msgstr "이 기생충은 변종이야. 믿을 만한 출처에 따르면, 지금 당장은 적출이 불가능해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 31d3478d-060a-cb4c-a71e-9c7840c4fc4d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:31d3478d-060a-cb4c-a71e-9c7840c4fc4d
msgctxt "hd95fe4aagc1deg4793g9040gbaeccff2f13f"
msgid "I've also been infected with one of their parasites."
msgstr "게다가 녀석들의 기생충에 감염되기도 했지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 358eb3d7-b044-d3b1-42e7-4d754dbe7e94
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_Volo_Step2(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:358eb3d7-b044-d3b1-42e7-4d754dbe7e94
msgctxt "h76e55126g3f12g4192gae8fgc0b6e7bc0925"
msgid "I think I have it!"
msgstr "놈을 잡은 것 같은데!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 3596608d-4be6-30d1-27e2-acb1f3151e96
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_Volo_Step5(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:3596608d-4be6-30d1-27e2-acb1f3151e96
msgctxt "ha81360bdg4589g46a7g899eg6e98f416b40f"
msgid "*Cold metal presses against the skin beneath your brow, and then...*"
msgstr "*차가운 금속이 당신 눈썹 아래의 피부를 지긋이 누릅니다. 그러더니...*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 35eb00f3-e004-0ee1-9c03-ae404676d913
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:35eb00f3-e004-0ee1-9c03-ae404676d913
msgctxt "h57a76b0dg4c8fg40degab48gcf5325de54dc"
msgid ""
"Perhaps that's for the best. I'd be irresponsible not to debunk such a "
"strange claim."
msgstr "어쩌면 그게 최선이겠군. 그런 괴이한 주장이 틀렸음을 입증하지 않는다면 내 스스로가 무책임하게 느껴질 것 같으니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 3a4c4458-9e22-b4a4-da12-7ac12ed2a8cd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:3a4c4458-9e22-b4a4-da12-7ac12ed2a8cd
msgctxt "h7f454a9bgcb9eg411eg9420g8133fd48dd01"
msgid ""
"Perhaps you should visit a healer? You could have them check on your eye at "
"the same time."
msgstr "치유사를 찾아보는 게 어떻겠나? 그대의 다친 눈도 봐줄 수 있을 걸세."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 3c547a6e-1217-2829-453f-614ca6011fe4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:3c547a6e-1217-2829-453f-614ca6011fe4
msgctxt "h2171db02g90a8g40b3g8d9fg2254a87c1b48"
msgid "Hrm. I'd be irresponsible not to debunk such a strange claim."
msgstr "흐음. 그런 괴이한 주장이 틀렸음을 입증하지 않는다면 내 스스로가 무책임하게 느껴질 것 같군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 3d39e90f-eee7-672f-394a-a803f26a608a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_VoloBallad_State_SentToPartyCamp = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Volo_HasMet = True
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_Volo_HasMet_Personally(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:3d39e90f-eee7-672f-394a-a803f26a608a
msgctxt "hd9b48affgac4fg4dedg8e50g1ec73e8a8b27"
msgid "Ah, my good fellow!"
msgstr "아, 친애하는 친구여!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 3f509d30-eacb-c347-7e17-a4dd340b2ebb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:3f509d30-eacb-c347-7e17-a4dd340b2ebb
msgctxt "h1edbfbdbg6385g4ec1gae8fgd185856443c8"
msgid "Very good."
msgstr "아주 좋아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 4074a16d-1651-0b42-1669-322e3dded99b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:4074a16d-1651-0b42-1669-322e3dded99b
msgctxt "h1ede3e47gdc61g42fdgbf9ag5ed528d07e53"
msgid "Take this. A far superior relic to that old jelly you were chained to."
msgstr "이걸 가져가시게. 그대를 옭아매던 그 낡은 물렁한 것보다 훨씬 우월한 유물이라네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 421ef9d0-1482-1268-92dd-1e689736a3ef
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_Volo_Step7(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:421ef9d0-1482-1268-92dd-1e689736a3ef
msgctxt "h67e2df13g7aa1g496cg8e3fg665ea2c45489"
msgid "I agree! It's a feisty critter. Just... a little... further..."
msgstr "그렇다마다! 혈기 왕성한 생물이지. 조금만... 더... 들어가면..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 43db8946-5c1d-4dc5-934c-43c5bccdc510
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:43db8946-5c1d-4dc5-934c-43c5bccdc510
msgctxt "h3c7f8218gd804g4f54g9e43g12764c0bc2ce"
msgid "I killed a mind flayer in its lair, aboard a nautiloid."
msgstr "마인드 플레이어를 그 소굴에서 죽인 적이 있지. 노틸로이드 위에서."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 45792399-cd5d-9342-854d-5bd66e41d588
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:45792399-cd5d-9342-854d-5bd66e41d588
msgctxt "hcc352e6ag7102g4864g90d8g0fa541bc8f11"
msgid "That obstacle is my eye. Stop at once."
msgstr "그 장애물은 내 눈이야. 당장 멈춰."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 46633cc8-f938-d825-3278-cb4a285c8446
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:46633cc8-f938-d825-3278-cb4a285c8446
msgctxt "hb533515egb602g492fg8517g482d5e9cd53a"
msgid ""
"*Pain shoots through your body as the needle snags on your optic nerve.*"
msgstr "*바늘이 당신의 시신경을 찌르자, 고통이 온 몸으로 퍼져나갑니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 47d09a59-e7df-d2bc-51bf-096ff677c4a9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GLO_Volo_Examined(1) = True
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_Volo_LobotomyPatient(1) = False
#.      - GLO_Volo_StartON(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:47d09a59-e7df-d2bc-51bf-096ff677c4a9
msgctxt "h548e40cdgf0c1g442fgaf52gc38e3354fecf"
msgid "I want rid of this thing by any means necessary."
msgstr "무슨 수를 써서라도 이것을 없애고 싶어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 47e7ec0c-58fd-dc9f-192e-39b65bc0fac7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:47e7ec0c-58fd-dc9f-192e-39b65bc0fac7
msgctxt "h043d8293ge7aeg4971gb445gae10cf45a92c"
msgid ""
"As there's not a tentacle on your head, I can only assume you haven't been "
"infected."
msgstr "그대 얼굴에 촉수가 하나도 없으니, 감염되지 않았다고 생각할 수밖에."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 4a2835dc-1676-dfd9-e1e8-f72475d78a4d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_Volo_StartON(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:4a2835dc-1676-dfd9-e1e8-f72475d78a4d
msgctxt "hf6ddff29g5890g4e10gaa80gfc104d985daf"
msgid ""
"*The needle finds the gap between eyeball and socket. Volo frowns and begins "
"to push.*"
msgstr "*바늘이 당신의 안와와 안구 사이의 틈을 파고듭니다. 볼로는 눈살을 찌푸리고선 계속 밀고 들어갑니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 4a374c93-1165-d60f-41d3-77e5e4976ba5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:4a374c93-1165-d60f-41d3-77e5e4976ba5
msgctxt "hb76ddcf8g4821g401fgbb24g9dfba80f7a14"
msgid "*Tap. Tap. <i>STAB</i>.*"
msgstr "*탁. 탁. 하더니 <i>찌릅니다.</i>*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 4b4ce853-6ab0-1817-a8d9-bf62d4d31b01
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:4b4ce853-6ab0-1817-a8d9-bf62d4d31b01
msgctxt "h848ff4f2ga2c6g4282g848bg673f335d2dc0"
msgid ""
"Why, I'm practically an expert. They've <i>tentacles</i>, you know. Quite "
"shocking."
msgstr "이런, 나는 사실상 전문가라네. 알다시피, 놈들에겐 <i>촉수</i>가 달려 있잖나. 꽤나 충격적이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4b73de36-360b-e070-23e7-8fbdf0118f88
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_Volo_Event_BackedOut(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:4b73de36-360b-e070-23e7-8fbdf0118f88
msgctxt "hce760e1cg7a6eg4516g8568g058a6926be94"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4d2d352b-73ec-b07b-d0ec-5b929aa0e4a0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:4d2d352b-73ec-b07b-d0ec-5b929aa0e4a0
msgctxt "h753c5b57gce58g44aaga1a0gfabec30a873e"
msgid "All is well. I think."
msgstr "다 괜찮은 것 같네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4db41146-8417-8112-4614-8732ede8a0c5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_Laezel_State_HadDaisyMissionStatement = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:4db41146-8417-8112-4614-8732ede8a0c5
msgctxt "h4a317537gc3e0g4c58g9940g69b3528e4daa"
msgid ""
"This parasite is unusual. I have it on good authority that extraction is "
"currently impossible."
msgstr "이 기생충은 변종이야. 믿을 만한 출처에 따르면, 지금 당장은 적출이 불가능해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4e3f5185-9a96-2850-39e6-fa41535c845d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:4e3f5185-9a96-2850-39e6-fa41535c845d
msgctxt "hcde02815gaa8ag4c96ga48bg278cff829e43"
msgid "...Unless you've been infected with one of their parasites."
msgstr "...놈들의 기생충에 감염된 게 아니라면 말이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 513471a4-4cd7-5010-94c4-1672380c77bd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_Volo_Event_BackedOut(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:513471a4-4cd7-5010-94c4-1672380c77bd
msgctxt "h4eb82139g9259g4258gaebcg9cffaaf36590"
msgid ""
"Ridiculous though such a claim may be, a mind flayer is a terrible thing to "
"be."
msgstr "이런 주장이 우스꽝스러울 수는 있지만, 마인드 플레이어는 끔찍한 존재라네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 51d3f04b-5ec9-9f0d-7284-444e89f3fa71
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:51d3f04b-5ec9-9f0d-7284-444e89f3fa71
msgctxt "hccddb92eg663eg463dg8a7fg20c80790368c"
msgid ""
"I can't attest to the specifics. But I do know that not long after "
"insertion, the host (that's you) turns into a mind flayer."
msgstr ""
"자세한 걸 입증할 수는 없지만, 올챙이가 삽입된 지 오래 지나지 않아, 숙주가 (그대 말일세) 마인드 플레이어로 변한다는 것은 알고 있네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 51e04a6c-91c8-101f-b7a9-dfefc0623859
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:51e04a6c-91c8-101f-b7a9-dfefc0623859
msgctxt "hc417a635g7003g4467g8995g0a4dd762a1b9"
msgid ""
"As you wish, my friend. When the transformation occurs, I can only hope you "
"are <i>far </i>away from me!"
msgstr "원하는 대로, 친구여. 변이가 일어난다면, 그대가 내게서 <i>멀리</i> 떨어져 있기를 바랄 따름일세!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 53791f8a-03f3-f3bb-e2db-efb6a93fc53e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GLO_Volo_KnowsTadpole(1) = False
#.      - GLO_Volo_Knows_CampSite(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Volo_RefusedOperation = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:53791f8a-03f3-f3bb-e2db-efb6a93fc53e
msgctxt "hc99717c7gaa66g4473gbd2bg996d8c350cf8"
msgid "What do you know about mind flayers?"
msgstr "마인드 플레이어에 대해 무엇을 알고 있지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 538fe6c2-28fb-1c98-9f48-898650d6356e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:538fe6c2-28fb-1c98-9f48-898650d6356e
msgctxt "h0c878aa7g0bddg4741gb7f2g7215c7250487"
msgid "Ackack?"
msgstr "아으악?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 53f57f42-a3c5-8bd2-4a53-e40ccd42b741
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Volo_State_Researched = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:53f57f42-a3c5-8bd2-4a53-e40ccd42b741
msgctxt "h19a74f28ga957g4036gaa8cg4d128590bdd0"
msgid "Not yet, I'm afraid. But my expectations are very, <i>very </i>high!"
msgstr "아쉽지만, 아직일세. 하지만 내 기대치는 아주, <i>아주</i> 높다네!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 54245d15-567d-422d-6cc4-cef8ee0b67fe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:54245d15-567d-422d-6cc4-cef8ee0b67fe
msgctxt "h927c8802gb3e8g4671g9671g6ddd153ad755"
msgid "Hrm..."
msgstr "흐으으음..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 55447d83-b36c-5efb-e285-63a869b5ef7a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:55447d83-b36c-5efb-e285-63a869b5ef7a
msgctxt "h81bf50d5g48bfg4317ga86bg7314bf7f57e3"
msgid ""
"I can't attest to the specifics. But I do know that not long after "
"insertion, the host (that's you) turns into a mind flayer."
msgstr ""
"자세한 걸 입증할 수는 없지만, 올챙이가 삽입된 지 오래 지나지 않아, 숙주가 (그대 말일세) 마인드 플레이어로 변한다는 것은 알고 있네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 554c8245-fdde-bf22-b77d-93d02e4a8dde
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:554c8245-fdde-bf22-b77d-93d02e4a8dde
msgctxt "ha7260198gdccag4381g9057g9bbfcc4e7537"
msgid "Doubts aside, you should keep your distance from me."
msgstr "의심은 제쳐두고, 나와 거리를 두는 편이 좋을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 55a6c741-4ab7-5adb-e648-e9662b374530
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:55a6c741-4ab7-5adb-e648-e9662b374530
msgctxt "h56e912aeg5850g4766g9b01gb1ad218d0aeb"
msgid "I don't have much choice then. Fine, continue."
msgstr "그럼 선택지가 별로 없군. 좋아, 진행해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 59f464fb-26aa-c37f-202e-fce2511ca407
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:59f464fb-26aa-c37f-202e-fce2511ca407
msgctxt "hab1f29b3g451cg4ac4gbe04gbd3b1c6287a3"
msgid ""
"You're either an excellent storyteller... or you've experienced something "
"quite exceptional."
msgstr "그대는 뛰어난 이야기꾼이거나... 아니면 아주 특별한 경험을 했거나 둘 중 하나일 것일세."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5ccfaa86-cb79-f5db-d31f-f4799f1f75d3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:5ccfaa86-cb79-f5db-d31f-f4799f1f75d3
msgctxt "hbe639528g60ceg45e1gb9c6g0c54d95adb30"
msgid "I fought one of them."
msgstr "놈들 중 하나와 싸운 적이 있지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5d53e8f3-3161-73ad-4862-714e714d3720
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:5d53e8f3-3161-73ad-4862-714e714d3720
msgctxt "hdea3386dgb177g40c8gb75eg3649c2a865ee"
msgid "You're <i>very</i> responsible, so speak up."
msgstr "넌 <i>굉장히</i> 책임감이 있지. 자 말해 봐."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 5e82364e-87da-d221-b675-9afa9b55f47a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:5e82364e-87da-d221-b675-9afa9b55f47a
msgctxt "hc02168ccgac1fg49cbg8043gc1dd0629699d"
msgid ""
"Oh. Fantastic! That squint does wonders for your gravitas, in my humble "
"opinion."
msgstr "오. 환상적이군! 그 사팔뜨기가 그대의 중후함에 큰 도움이 될 것 같네, 내 조심스런 의견으로는 말이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5f820c3c-a7ab-6e5e-c5b7-af1127566d1c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:5f820c3c-a7ab-6e5e-c5b7-af1127566d1c
msgctxt "ha2b1580dg3f0eg416fg9a8cg4903941683d5"
msgid "Do you have the faintest idea of what you're doing?"
msgstr "지금 뭘 하고 있는지 조금이라도 알고 있는 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 613f76de-9464-dc7c-cbc6-7ea092b6ca7c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:613f76de-9464-dc7c-cbc6-7ea092b6ca7c
msgctxt "hf14ea62bg256dg4128g9039g97ee14e5e770"
msgid "I have. And the mind flayer infected me with a parasite."
msgstr "느낀 적 있지. 게다가 마인드 플레이어가 나를 기생충으로 감염시켰어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 654c9de8-87c1-be2b-49ed-3a42318e7c2d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 9d2506a6-fc08-6625-7877-37d138229182_MentionsMindFlayer = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 9d2506a6-fc08-6625-7877-37d138229182_MentionsMindFlayer = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:654c9de8-87c1-be2b-49ed-3a42318e7c2d
msgctxt "he858b2c6g37cbg41fagb614g3818d130645d"
msgid ""
"I was just settling in and reviewing my latest findings. Mind flayers, "
"cultists, and of course, your esteemed company!"
msgstr "나는 방금 여기 적응해서 최근 조사 결과를 검토하고 있었네. 마인드 플레이어, 이교도들, 그리고 존경하는 동지인 그대를 말일세!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 659e8a2b-a7a8-0ea7-a380-7f53251db565
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:659e8a2b-a7a8-0ea7-a380-7f53251db565
msgctxt "h28b0b24agb915g4b4bgacc9g78b07723cbec"
msgid "As a matter of fact, I do. But why do <i>you?</i>"
msgstr "사실은, 알고 있네. 그런데 <i>그대는</i> 어찌 아나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 668a6e4f-0983-9047-2796-bff040db6f9d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:668a6e4f-0983-9047-2796-bff040db6f9d
msgctxt "h590a2df7g7a72g42d0g9a54gf85aca3776a5"
msgid ""
"Illithids - their <i>technical</i> name - form a hivemind. One shouldn't be "
"able to hear their dark whispers... unless..."
msgstr ""
"일리시드, 이건 놈들의 <i>전문적인</i> 명칭인데, 녀석들은 군체 의식을 형성하지. 그 어두운 속삭임은 원래 들을 수 없는 "
"것이네... 단..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6734ac88-79af-8c10-4008-c643c4008918
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Volo_RefusedOperation = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:6734ac88-79af-8c10-4008-c643c4008918
msgctxt "h76deeff1gf86cg4834g9ad1gf32988809a15"
msgid "I said <i>stop.</i>"
msgstr "<i>멈추라고</i> 했어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 67d86a5f-4990-40d6-a5f7-5c2afbd848fb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:67d86a5f-4990-40d6-a5f7-5c2afbd848fb
msgctxt "hd9e1ec3bg8e3cg4169g9ce8g326f3667caf4"
msgid ""
"Volothamp Geddarm, realm-renowned author, auteur, and tastemaker, at your "
"service."
msgstr "세계에서 유명한 저자이자 연출가, 그리고 유행 전도사인 볼로뎀프 게담이 그대에게 인사하네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6b79cbae-b7dd-c73a-40ad-2a7b693c762f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GLO_Volo_Ceremorphosis(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - GLO_Volo_Ceremorphosis(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:6b79cbae-b7dd-c73a-40ad-2a7b693c762f
msgctxt "hae7eb003gcd65g4a79g95ccg8fcff8fb86ec"
msgid "Ceremorphosis? Tell me more."
msgstr "뇌변이라니? 더 알려줘."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6bc15911-307e-7de7-c368-9be3d3488d22
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:6bc15911-307e-7de7-c368-9be3d3488d22
msgctxt "hbf957e0bg3bcfg451bg8241g9bb48212d064"
msgid "No. Haven't noticed anything like that."
msgstr "아니. 그런 건 느껴본 적 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 6f0fbe12-f765-0ff6-b434-84258144dad8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:6f0fbe12-f765-0ff6-b434-84258144dad8
msgctxt "ha12338b7g8c29g4b96g9ebfg56f1b8eb7ad3"
msgid "Try it on for size. And, erm, it was... very nice to have met you."
msgstr "잘 맞는지 한번 끼워 보시게. 그리고, 음, 정말이지... 만나서 정말 반가웠네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 6f15cc35-f828-4bc3-fea3-b655d4e2c81d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:6f15cc35-f828-4bc3-fea3-b655d4e2c81d
msgctxt "h4d977f2fg7f29g4052gbdf0g7f41f1a0b375"
msgid ""
"Please, try not to overexert yourself. You're in a rather fragile state at "
"present."
msgstr "부디, 화를 추스려주게. 그대는 지금 많이 취약한 상태라네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 71d33b04-12ea-bfc1-c07f-e8b543a39043
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Volo_HasMet = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:71d33b04-12ea-bfc1-c07f-e8b543a39043
msgctxt "hd9592b01gafc8g4db2gae7ag8bbad66ef3dd"
msgid "Yes, my friend?"
msgstr "불렀나, 내 친구여?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7299c159-2778-55a2-7b1d-bbf25e927e50
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:7299c159-2778-55a2-7b1d-bbf25e927e50
msgctxt "h2d311d8bg609eg42c9g9086gc6e467739596"
msgid "I don't want you poking around in my head."
msgstr "당신이 내 머릿속을 쑤시는 건 원치 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 74cc2da1-ed0c-6902-cbca-f7a2ab5d7f02
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:74cc2da1-ed0c-6902-cbca-f7a2ab5d7f02
msgctxt "h8f9cf490ga42eg4d9cg9363g9835242aced6"
msgid ""
"My research turned up a rather brilliant technique that seems quite "
"actionable."
msgstr "내 연구 결과, 꽤나 실현 가능성 있는 기발한 기술을 발견했다네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 773e4ca6-48e6-de5a-3f97-c4b23e357cc9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:773e4ca6-48e6-de5a-3f97-c4b23e357cc9
msgctxt "h65fe94b9g30adg4323g8e47g561d6bf98420"
msgid "If only your disbelief could alter facts."
msgstr "당신의 불신이 사실을 바꿀 수 있으면 좋을 텐데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 7aba2730-3325-d871-a84d-ad57c8744a2f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GLO_Volo_Examined(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Volo_HasMet = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:7aba2730-3325-d871-a84d-ad57c8744a2f
msgctxt "h5819c798g6712g4d61g9d3bg8debf31a69af"
msgid "My friend! How do you fare?"
msgstr "내 친구여! 잘 지내고 있는가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7b210670-f4fc-f817-6880-51a05a400908
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Volo_RefusedOperation = False
#.      - GLO_Volo_State_Researching = False
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_Volo_Event_BackedOut(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:7b210670-f4fc-f817-6880-51a05a400908
msgctxt "hb888fe07g7070g4afdgb468g59c1f449ce08"
msgid "I want help with my parasite. By any means necessary."
msgstr "내 기생충 문제를 도와줘. 어떤 수를 써서라도."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 7c013d4d-f0c3-aee6-61ba-961aca4b35ec
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_Volo_Step3(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:7c013d4d-f0c3-aee6-61ba-961aca4b35ec
msgctxt "hd945d785g57a3g457ag9a1fg310dfe32f233"
msgid ""
"*Volo carefully withdraws the needle from your eye. Then, reaching into his "
"bag, he produces an ice pick.*"
msgstr "*볼로는 당신의 눈에서 바늘을 조심스럽게 빼냅니다. 그러고선 가방에 손을 뻗더니, 얼음 송곳을 꺼냅니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 7cb99a60-359a-45e1-b363-3793d85e1d5c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:7cb99a60-359a-45e1-b363-3793d85e1d5c
msgctxt "h16ada5fag1705g4f04ga4feg491709e22fc5"
msgid ""
"As there's not a tentacle on your head, I can only assume you haven't been "
"infected."
msgstr "그대 얼굴에 촉수가 하나도 없으니, 감염되지 않았다고 생각할 수밖에."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7ed28e1b-1e99-6d1e-bada-f8df51630ea0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - GLO_Volo_KnowsTadpole(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:7ed28e1b-1e99-6d1e-bada-f8df51630ea0
msgctxt "h2c624badg3dfeg4141gaae9gfa834f9db552"
msgid "I'm familiar - I've been infected."
msgstr "잘 알다마다. 감염도 되었지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 7edfab79-f9ad-6e80-e4c8-e02ebad64ad0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:7edfab79-f9ad-6e80-e4c8-e02ebad64ad0
msgctxt "h78f9159eg0821g44ccg96ddgd7a8e2423c2f"
msgid "Are you certain? We're nearly there..."
msgstr "진심인가? 거의 다 됐는데..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 7eedfa5a-e83f-b513-a9b1-e4b1ea1c06c1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:7eedfa5a-e83f-b513-a9b1-e4b1ea1c06c1
msgctxt "h38e774e0gcf4fg4e0bg8295g49e7da748d21"
msgid "That... that can't be..."
msgstr "그럴... 그럴 수는..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 87798fcc-3ee3-805a-4b49-6fed71552593
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:87798fcc-3ee3-805a-4b49-6fed71552593
msgctxt "h76c7ef7cgdda2g413fg97cegc99fdac4a5de"
msgid "Hmph."
msgstr "흐읍."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 889f2f5b-51ee-c3f9-6d50-57ca31875a1f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:889f2f5b-51ee-c3f9-6d50-57ca31875a1f
msgctxt "hc37480ceg23ebg47cdgb62fgc14348d0144e"
msgid ""
"If we managed it, we'd have a specimen of incredible rarity on our hands."
msgstr "만약 성공한다면, 우리는 놀라운 희귀성을 지닌 표본을 손에 넣게 될 걸세."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 88b7bc3a-a089-0775-c878-94e00f62aa77
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GLO_Volo_Knows_CampSite(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - GLO_Volo_Knows_CampSite(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:88b7bc3a-a089-0775-c878-94e00f62aa77
msgctxt "h1472e4adg68a3g42beg8362g5997b597d548"
msgid "How did you find the camp?"
msgstr "이 야영지는 어떻게 찾은 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 88cd11ab-74ff-c45d-1525-28ba854e0ca2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:88cd11ab-74ff-c45d-1525-28ba854e0ca2
msgctxt "hfa34e72dg832cg4fb1g96ebga78275e97f23"
msgid ""
"Tell me: have you noticed any residual psionic malaise since the alleged "
"encounter?"
msgstr "말해 주게: 그 만남 이후에 초능력에 의한 불안감이 남아있는 것을 느낀 적 있나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8968c6c5-a234-cd1c-69c9-2a056204106b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:8968c6c5-a234-cd1c-69c9-2a056204106b
msgctxt "h81f54829g4501g4b4dg99eeg695e973e9746"
msgid "<i>Leave</i>."
msgstr "<i>떠난다</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8a5e0952-0b9f-5e62-c067-a0f02183db08
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:8a5e0952-0b9f-5e62-c067-a0f02183db08
msgctxt "hc3581867g40fag46fbga83cge0a7ab5c2494"
msgid "<i>Hold your breath.</i>"
msgstr "<i>숨을 참는다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 8b0158b4-5add-1647-c823-5e66ecbe3351
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:8b0158b4-5add-1647-c823-5e66ecbe3351
msgctxt "hdbe11ed8g0db5g4242gb958g7451fc6bdf07"
msgid "Take this. A far superior relic to that old jelly you were chained to."
msgstr "이걸 가져가시게. 그대를 옭아매던 그 낡은 물렁한 것보다 훨씬 우월한 유물이라네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8d745551-e098-0f20-610d-d4949d6db1cb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:8d745551-e098-0f20-610d-d4949d6db1cb
msgctxt "hc07c0e34geafag401ag81ffg559fec9d1b47"
msgid "And their parasites? Do you know anything about them?"
msgstr "그들의 기생충은? 그것에 대해 알고 있나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8f32e992-5821-130e-7da7-1d3bdd8aeda5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:8f32e992-5821-130e-7da7-1d3bdd8aeda5
msgctxt "h60dc0d97g3e15g4f7fga763ga6d7b80cb420"
msgid "How many times have you done this before?"
msgstr "전에 이걸 몇 번이나 해 봤지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 907eced1-177f-bb7b-2f62-4267f6a3926a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:907eced1-177f-bb7b-2f62-4267f6a3926a
msgctxt "hc462054eg057ag4409g9070gf8c5c82f8fcc"
msgid "Not only have I encountered a mind flayer, I've killed one."
msgstr "마인드 플레이어를 마주쳤을 뿐 아니라, 한 놈 죽이기까지 했으니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 97969496-3f95-5c8a-45b8-36b5aa3e9971
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:97969496-3f95-5c8a-45b8-36b5aa3e9971
msgctxt "h0970bf49g1382g48a2gb025ga963343e4524"
msgid ""
"I must depart soon, but I insist you take this. You'll thank me when you try "
"it on for size."
msgstr "곧 떠나야 하지만, 이걸 가져가는 걸 추천하지. 입어보고 맞으면 고맙다고 해주게."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 9cf0b69f-4cf8-25b1-7ac5-700a7db0d76c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:9cf0b69f-4cf8-25b1-7ac5-700a7db0d76c
msgctxt "h3e6601ebgc22ag4e94g9e51g526c0551c0a4"
msgid ""
"Still... there'd be no harm in my taking a <i>teensy </i>look, would there? "
"I know all the signs..."
msgstr "그래도... 내가 <i>조금만</i> 살펴봐도, 해가 될 건 없겠지? 난 모든 징후를 알고 있네..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9d636f68-2255-88b0-e191-300cd98e301d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Volo_RefusedOperation = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:9d636f68-2255-88b0-e191-300cd98e301d
msgctxt "h3011cdfcg05f5g4708gb40ag9a7e426c1ac9"
msgid "Sorry, but I have no eyes left to spare."
msgstr "미안하지만, 더 이상 내줄 눈이 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9dfe48dd-8aa8-957b-00c9-b8f3d6b12a58
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:9dfe48dd-8aa8-957b-00c9-b8f3d6b12a58
msgctxt "hbff9cadegb80ag4edfgb7f4gfab961eefbe6"
msgid "<i>Hold as still as possible.</i>"
msgstr "<i>최대한 가만히 있는다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 9f742745-225b-0173-018f-f3bc34db1353
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:9f742745-225b-0173-018f-f3bc34db1353
msgctxt "h428ef3f5g687eg45fega88dgbe3e086c4e11"
msgid "Though, erm, perhaps there's something we can do..."
msgstr "그래도, 음, 우리가 할 수 있는 게 있을지도 모르지만..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = a2987165-1c6a-9d9f-826b-08145af4a0a3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:a2987165-1c6a-9d9f-826b-08145af4a0a3
msgctxt "hc83ecaa9g8299g45d2gb949g8d63abb40061"
msgid ""
"As you wish. But I'd be quite careful to whom I go spreading such rumours."
msgstr "원하는 대로. 하지만 그런 소문을 누구에게 퍼뜨릴지에 대해 매우 신중할 것이네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a3124a6f-aaec-8089-6d90-707833a8a431
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:a3124a6f-aaec-8089-6d90-707833a8a431
msgctxt "hf8c22fa0g0afbg4947ga440gf36299a58808"
msgid "Never mind."
msgstr "신경 쓰지 마."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = a40f91b1-c886-5845-5a99-3c6f90f85835
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:a40f91b1-c886-5845-5a99-3c6f90f85835
msgctxt "h13485a8cgbc7cg4141g99beg3aa049b97515"
msgid "I assure you, I've <i>dreamt </i>of it a thousand times over."
msgstr "장담컨대, 나는 이걸 천 번이 넘게 <i>상상했다네</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a4ae11eb-299b-334d-f477-387476ed8445
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:a4ae11eb-299b-334d-f477-387476ed8445
msgctxt "h9a46b7c1g7bcdg41f3g9056gf025932dfd9b"
msgid "<i>Endure the discomfort. Let him carry on.</i>"
msgstr "<i>불편함을 감내한다. 그가 진행하게 둔다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a4d3082f-7de2-64e5-0724-c1efa6255e15
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Volo_RefusedOperation = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:a4d3082f-7de2-64e5-0724-c1efa6255e15
msgctxt "hb70ab3cagbd2ag4a06g8ffbgcda511e4a53a"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = a4e2d3b2-f13e-85b2-965f-cb8bae106088
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:a4e2d3b2-f13e-85b2-965f-cb8bae106088
msgctxt "h006d114dg0132g4917gb7bag4fcf05ffe417"
msgid ""
"Hm. Are you familiar with the process of ceremorphosis? That is - what "
"happens when a mind flayer parasite infects a living host."
msgstr "흠. 뇌변이의 진행 과정에 대해 잘 아시는가? 마인드 플레이어가 살아있는 숙주를 감염시키면 일어나는 일이라네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = a5b64615-ce90-383d-d6c5-050dd31f74cc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:a5b64615-ce90-383d-d6c5-050dd31f74cc
msgctxt "hd8bce8efg8296g4157ga2dcg07fcb4cb86b3"
msgid "<i>You. </i>Infected by a mind flayer. It's ridiculous..."
msgstr "<i>자네가.</i> 마인드 플레이어에게 감염되었다니. 터무니없는 소리..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a9b6c011-bd9f-4537-71a5-607ca0274b9f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:a9b6c011-bd9f-4537-71a5-607ca0274b9f
msgctxt "h5043c61bg82d5g4922g83c0g56ba1b709198"
msgid "<i>Relent.</i>"
msgstr "<i>살펴보게 내버려 둔다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ac3de657-db71-6945-3241-0029426bfdb5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:ac3de657-db71-6945-3241-0029426bfdb5
msgctxt "hab9ee9c5g7b26g4f9ag9b30g5e23e99257cc"
msgid "Of course. Utterly ridiculous."
msgstr "물론. 완전 터무니없는 소리지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = ad626e0e-bc6c-c844-a2fe-18b7efaba651
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:ad626e0e-bc6c-c844-a2fe-18b7efaba651
msgctxt "ha3484b09g630fg4943g8989g43fe36463e9d"
msgid "Specifically, how not to extract them."
msgstr "특히, 어떻게 하면 꺼낼 수 없는지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = adf10218-fe25-7ebf-d67d-de3c352218ca
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:adf10218-fe25-7ebf-d67d-de3c352218ca
msgctxt "h5d9c8815g4c20g4cf1g8c18ga30cbe3b0799"
msgid ""
"*He taps the pick and your eye springs from its socket, dangling wetly on "
"your cheek.*"
msgstr "*그가 송곳을 두드리자, 당신의 눈알이 튀어나와 뺨에 촉촉하게 매달려 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = af151a09-2909-a80c-75f7-dc34a2cacb43
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_Volo_Event_BackedOut(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:af151a09-2909-a80c-75f7-dc34a2cacb43
msgctxt "h4c2bdf18g4c70g40c4gb3b0ge34dca9dd381"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b1d81806-0532-904c-5a55-10060611b0f3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - CANTLOSEEYE(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Volo_RefusedOperation = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:b1d81806-0532-904c-5a55-10060611b0f3
msgctxt "hfce04e68g15d2g4147ga31cg86504c5d6886"
msgid "No - I only have one good eye left."
msgstr "안돼, 볼 수 있는 눈은 하나 밖에 안 남았다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = b2557cfa-529e-5730-90c1-8a5aa6ccaa9b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:b2557cfa-529e-5730-90c1-8a5aa6ccaa9b
msgctxt "h8a29c3afg7aa6g43f4g8117g0bc062863a19"
msgid ""
"Don't fidget! The needle must slip <i>behind </i>your eye, not through it!"
msgstr "가만히 있게! 바늘이 눈을 안 뚫고 눈 <i>뒤편</i>으로 우회해야 하니!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b960876e-bf66-92fb-f55c-41c39152798b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Volo_State_Researching = True
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_Volo_StartON(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:b960876e-bf66-92fb-f55c-41c39152798b
msgctxt "hd6d77cbbg5c4cg4ef4gbe4cg7f0d5e686f05"
msgid ""
"Has your research turned up anything that might help with this parasite "
"problem?"
msgstr "기생충 문제를 해결하는 데 도움이 될 만한 연구 결과가 있었나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bb90f8f8-d9df-4985-4c1b-3bd3c5604612
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(1) = False
#.      - CANTLOSEEYE(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_Volo_Event_BackedOut(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:bb90f8f8-d9df-4985-4c1b-3bd3c5604612
msgctxt "h06b78688g9508g4d5bg8a6aga3e071b6e421"
msgid "Do it."
msgstr "어서 해줘."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bd7d7d74-32eb-e9f3-3209-316bc110118c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_Volo_Event_BackedOut(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:bd7d7d74-32eb-e9f3-3209-316bc110118c
msgctxt "h99f9ddf2g57d2g4056g9a4bga5e49a775020"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = bedf6908-0029-41a2-f19f-fd03f9b79cac
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:bedf6908-0029-41a2-f19f-fd03f9b79cac
msgctxt "hb276eea3g6016g4976gbeafg27926ebc2506"
msgid ""
"It's not too deep. Just behind the orbital socket. I <i>could </i>attempt an "
"extraction. I've a needle in my tunic, after all..."
msgstr ""
"그건 그렇게 깊숙이 있진 않네. 안와골 바로 뒤에 있지. 적출 시도를 <i>해볼 수는</i> 있다네. 어쨌거나 내 외투에 바늘이 "
"있으니까..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bfca8843-303b-bb95-975c-1289dde0e262
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:bfca8843-303b-bb95-975c-1289dde0e262
msgctxt "h2e9bbf2bg0925g45a4g9f51g3a76a3fae137"
msgid "<i>Say nothing.</i>"
msgstr "<i>아무 말도 하지 않는다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = c2862176-0a86-6c0f-e4a3-56e4a49ee8ac
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:c2862176-0a86-6c0f-e4a3-56e4a49ee8ac
msgctxt "h85e2d2d9g30aag4b2eg8f76g9ee205783d28"
msgid "Terribly sorry, my friend."
msgstr "정말로 유감이네, 친구여."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c5863ee0-26b6-db61-bd69-18bbb6c193bb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:c5863ee0-26b6-db61-bd69-18bbb6c193bb
msgctxt "h9ffff516g0a98g42bcgbed6g4e316bf9930e"
msgid "<i>Clench your fists.</i>"
msgstr "<i>주먹을 꽉 쥔다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c9e0fb3d-92ec-77a3-ab83-6fb8592bb656
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_Volo_Step4(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:c9e0fb3d-92ec-77a3-ab83-6fb8592bb656
msgctxt "hbf74c4fegff30g4b39g808cgd307665dfd5b"
msgid "<i>Eye the implement, but allow him to proceed.</i>"
msgstr "<i>기구를 쳐다보지만, 그가 계속 진행하도록 허락한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ca67907f-23b3-044b-5cbd-027a90602fe4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - GLO_Volo_DeniedTadpole(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:ca67907f-23b3-044b-5cbd-027a90602fe4
msgctxt "he9ce8c53ge3c0g45e2g8d61g796905b18538"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = ce82c44b-9351-763b-0bfb-00e2e4606373
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:ce82c44b-9351-763b-0bfb-00e2e4606373
msgctxt "h7a9ce81eg7ddcg439agbd90g40f34479722d"
msgid "Curious."
msgstr "흥미롭군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = d12bd2bf-0f62-b705-6abd-95bfc236d5f8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - GLO_Volo_KnowsTadpole(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:d12bd2bf-0f62-b705-6abd-95bfc236d5f8
msgctxt "h6d362a7agc0a6g4b2fg9fbbg7a16519a773b"
msgid "That's quite impossible. You'd have undergone ceremorphosis by now."
msgstr "말도 안 돼. 지금쯤이면 뇌변이가 일어나고 있었을 텐데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = d448271e-4db8-2b70-1d8d-a376994b2e2f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:d448271e-4db8-2b70-1d8d-a376994b2e2f
msgctxt "hef699633g6f02g4d45ga975g77c26ed1044a"
msgid ""
"Hm. I... seem to have misplaced it. It was a fine bauble, a replacement for "
"your eye."
msgstr "흠. 내가... 잘못 끼워 놨던 것 같군. 네 눈을 대신할 수 있는 좋은 장신구였어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = d46a2d9c-6b92-8a91-0d40-9f36369dde88
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:d46a2d9c-6b92-8a91-0d40-9f36369dde88
msgctxt "h619918aagdc2eg4238ga188gdee57c142fd9"
msgid ""
"<i>Finding </i>is my job, my friend. If there's anything in the world worth "
"knowing, I assure you, I do."
msgstr "<i>발견하는 것</i>이 내 직업 아닌가, 친구여. 장담컨대, 난 세상에 알 만한 가치가 있는 정보는 다 알고 있네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d485c6af-d3dc-18a3-d379-70975f05a152
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:d485c6af-d3dc-18a3-d379-70975f05a152
msgctxt "h253a3847g9c55g4c3cgb4d1gafd8095713b8"
msgid "Malaise is one word for it. More like... psychic transference?"
msgstr "불안감이란 단어로는 설명이 안 돼. 심령 전이... 라고 해야 하나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = d6dc71c2-240d-75fc-7c12-f2880e5b85ce
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_Volo_Step4(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:d6dc71c2-240d-75fc-7c12-f2880e5b85ce
msgctxt "h9b4c7a57g0751g4f80gb803g48e3204ee2ff"
msgid "*Volo slowly brings the ice pick closer to your eye.*"
msgstr "*볼로는 송곳을 천천히 당신의 눈에 가까이 가져옵니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = df65f980-60a2-27c4-badc-f04fd8d9b2bd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:df65f980-60a2-27c4-badc-f04fd8d9b2bd
msgctxt "h014f4201g2468g4d22g8f90ga45b0c03f9df"
msgid ""
"*He pauses, looks down at your eye, and recoils slightly as it sinks into "
"the mud.*"
msgstr "*그는 멈춰서 당신의 눈을 내려다봅니다. 그리고 눈이 진흙 속으로 가라앉자 흠칫 놀랍니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = df7b90a6-932f-7740-f6bb-7077c40c3510
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:df7b90a6-932f-7740-f6bb-7077c40c3510
msgctxt "hc544679ag7d14g4b2bgac26gd5040cb7ef14"
msgid ""
"Have it your own way! The important thing is we've learned a great deal "
"about these parasites."
msgstr "당신 마음대로 하시오! 중요한 것은 우리가 이 기생충에 대해 많은 것을 배웠다는 것일세."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = dfb1a643-d9c9-547b-dd64-bd3362516e5a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_Volo_LobotomyPatient(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:dfb1a643-d9c9-547b-dd64-bd3362516e5a
msgctxt "h8c250ca1gedc9g42fag8400gb66cf4c25084"
msgid ""
"*Volo tears the pick from your brain with a violent jerk; your eye plops "
"down into the mud.*"
msgstr "*볼로가 격렬한 몸놀림으로 당신의 뇌에서 송곳을 빼내자, 당신의 눈이 진흙탕에 철푸덕 빠집니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = e6deacfb-8b69-1b4e-e6ab-2b3b705a3e62
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:e6deacfb-8b69-1b4e-e6ab-2b3b705a3e62
msgctxt "hdad2e80bg9c2eg473dga825g728c47c7a6df"
msgid ""
"The druid Halsin had some kind of mind flayer specimen in a jar in his "
"quarters. A replica, no doubt, but truly fascinating to see up close."
msgstr ""
"드루이드 할신은 자기 숙소에 있는 항아리에 일종의 마인드 플레이어 표본을 보관하고 있었네. 분명 복제품이긴 하지만, 가까이서 보니 정말 "
"흥미로웠다네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e796dca0-f542-5038-bb3a-0731e05392a9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:e796dca0-f542-5038-bb3a-0731e05392a9
msgctxt "hbf8a907ag0365g40e2g8954gce9693b3a98e"
msgid "I'd rather get a second opinion."
msgstr "차라리 다른 의견을 듣고 싶군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = e7b1b600-0b14-90bc-9c87-868f61c73c71
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:e7b1b600-0b14-90bc-9c87-868f61c73c71
msgctxt "h443689dbg560ag4641g9653g30883d588c0a"
msgid ""
"*The needle see-saws back and forth, plucking the nerve like a harp string.*"
msgstr "*바늘이 시소처럼 앞뒤로 움직이며 신경을 하프 줄처럼 뽑아냅니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = e9662a6f-94f3-6a2d-f032-c5569e98bd6c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:e9662a6f-94f3-6a2d-f032-c5569e98bd6c
msgctxt "hd0f3abf8g6d79g4261ga187g3b62d367f492"
msgid "If I just peer in your eye, I could quickly..."
msgstr "내가 그대의 눈을 들여다보면 금방..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e9f721da-2dde-5ef6-1fda-51b376336a4c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:e9f721da-2dde-5ef6-1fda-51b376336a4c
msgctxt "hce49b24bg0886g4332g9fc8g300ee315be2d"
msgid "Stop. This is never going to work."
msgstr "그만. 이건 절대 안 될 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = eb714a39-4165-61da-5a41-11930cc0d500
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:eb714a39-4165-61da-5a41-11930cc0d500
msgctxt "hf66d83cfgc3c0g4d13ga22eg2100007f5fe1"
msgid "You won't find a more learned opinion on this matter, I assure you."
msgstr "이 문제에 관한 한 나만한 전문가도 없을 거라 장담하네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ecc31179-dbdb-744f-9e76-6eaf65234344
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:ecc31179-dbdb-744f-9e76-6eaf65234344
msgctxt "hbeccfd13g08a1g48dfg9e13g525596482a97"
msgid "No, no. This is too much. Knock it off."
msgstr "아니, 아니. 이건 너무하잖아. 그거 치워."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = ed76bc6d-ce57-3ffc-b8fd-d8ce3b942cff
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:ed76bc6d-ce57-3ffc-b8fd-d8ce3b942cff
msgctxt "hce4880deg04c7g4f23gae1dg96144f7fe363"
msgid "But - I nearly have it!"
msgstr "하지만 - 거의 다 됐어!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ed8c43a5-124a-071f-a505-92c199dadd3c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:ed8c43a5-124a-071f-a505-92c199dadd3c
msgctxt "he2bd0a73g0ec8g4f39gb40fg6e826e9cd6ff"
msgid "I was captured by mind flayers before. I'm lucky to be alive."
msgstr "마인드 플레이어에게 잡혔던 적이 있어. 살아있는 게 행운이라니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f3685f63-8758-5c44-d18c-cefb50b5bb3e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:f3685f63-8758-5c44-d18c-cefb50b5bb3e
msgctxt "h5d33e2c5gf35dg4e05g8aa5g92930e6bc257"
msgid "Quit the shouting. Can you help?"
msgstr "소리 지르지 마. 도와줄 수 있어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f4c1396b-5af4-5bce-04b5-999d287f889e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:f4c1396b-5af4-5bce-04b5-999d287f889e
msgctxt "hb6b7e488g2302g4291gbbdbgf31306d6e3a4"
msgid "YOU KNOCKED MY BLOODY EYE OUT!"
msgstr "네가 씨발 내 눈알을 날려버렸잖아!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = f5994f49-d224-54c4-1865-fc5d62b081f4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:f5994f49-d224-54c4-1865-fc5d62b081f4
msgctxt "hef67680egf702g4c05g846dgb7fa47bb85f5"
msgid ""
"Oh bother. There's some obstacle in the way. I shall need a more robust "
"implement."
msgstr "아, 귀찮구만. 경로에 뭔가 장애물이 있네. 좀 더 튼튼한 도구가 필요할 것 같군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = f6431085-ebfe-3768-8117-535456929446
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:f6431085-ebfe-3768-8117-535456929446
msgctxt "hbdde60f3g0ff1g4b11gbe15ged6b4ecf40ff"
msgid "...isn't it?"
msgstr "...그렇지 않나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f7a33ed3-84f6-e374-b903-bf47ff8ad77b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:f7a33ed3-84f6-e374-b903-bf47ff8ad77b
msgctxt "h2b1fe3bfg0d47g4596g9458ga89727cd94a8"
msgid "I can't seem to see through one of my eyes."
msgstr "내 한쪽 눈이 잘 안 보이는 것 같은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = f866f1a7-fb91-5713-3676-b5c17ac5d5e0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:f866f1a7-fb91-5713-3676-b5c17ac5d5e0
msgctxt "h397d82e8g417bg4f4agb605g98110d93c27a"
msgid "You only have a matter of days to live. Don't dally, my friend."
msgstr "살 날이 며칠 안 남았다네. 꾸물거리지 말게, 친구여."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = fe224f4d-766c-66a4-0a64-6822bfee2cac
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation:fe224f4d-766c-66a4-0a64-6822bfee2cac
msgctxt "h89689bf1g2aa4g4742gb786g83956f92b556"
msgid ""
"Are you sure? If I don't intervene, the parasite will continue to gestate "
"inside you."
msgstr "확실한가? 내가 개입하지 않으면, 그 기생충이 계속 그대 몸속에서 잉태할 텐데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation_PAD_Eye
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1497690d-863c-d043-53d4-87a9c6e76013
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - ONEEYED(0) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation_PAD_Eye:1497690d-863c-d043-53d4-87a9c6e76013
msgctxt "hc079a121g7e97g4af3g9b8ag6321d8deabec"
msgid "Not perfect, but better than expected."
msgstr "완벽하진 않지만, 기대했던 것보단 나은걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation_PAD_Eye
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1497690d-863c-d043-53d4-87a9c6e76013
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - ONEEYED(0) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation_PAD_Eye:1497690d-863c-d043-53d4-87a9c6e76013
msgctxt "hb9e8738cga16ag46b8gaa70g62280ed18412"
msgid "There we go. Sight from sore eyes."
msgstr "어디 볼까. 아픈 눈으로 보는 세상이라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation_PAD_Eye
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1497690d-863c-d043-53d4-87a9c6e76013
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - ONEEYED(0) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation_PAD_Eye:1497690d-863c-d043-53d4-87a9c6e76013
msgctxt "h08600d4agd640g4fd5ga663gf5ce9dce3f5e"
msgid "I can see! Nice."
msgstr "볼 수 있어! 멋지군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation_PAD_Eye
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1497690d-863c-d043-53d4-87a9c6e76013
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - ONEEYED(0) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation_PAD_Eye:1497690d-863c-d043-53d4-87a9c6e76013
msgctxt "h216e7678g16cag46daga6f2g53ce91fa9f2b"
msgid "It's functional. That will have to do."
msgstr "작동하는군. 그 정도면 충분해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation_PAD_Eye
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1497690d-863c-d043-53d4-87a9c6e76013
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - ONEEYED(0) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation_PAD_Eye:1497690d-863c-d043-53d4-87a9c6e76013
msgctxt "hdc57ddbagba63g4375g9c49g57e382659260"
msgid "Something of an improvement, at least."
msgstr "개선된 점은 있군, 적어도."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation_PAD_Eye
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1497690d-863c-d043-53d4-87a9c6e76013
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - ONEEYED(0) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation_PAD_Eye:1497690d-863c-d043-53d4-87a9c6e76013
msgctxt "h11f2be4bg4686g4e26ga776g1812c616ac16"
msgid "What do you know - it works."
msgstr "아니, 정말로 보이잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation_PAD_Eye
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1497690d-863c-d043-53d4-87a9c6e76013
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - ONEEYED(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation_PAD_Eye:1497690d-863c-d043-53d4-87a9c6e76013
msgctxt "hee19b92ag71dag42faga056g419a82480f85"
msgid "Ah. That's better."
msgstr "아. 한결 낫군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation_PAD_Eye
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3b3aca6e-c83d-c58c-aaa6-0f21c7128954
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation_PAD_Eye:3b3aca6e-c83d-c58c-aaa6-0f21c7128954
msgctxt "hd19dc2ccged2fg42d5g81e8g83a848f8f36c"
msgid "I'd rather put another tadpole in my eye, thank you."
msgstr "차라리 내 눈에 올챙이를 하나 더 넣을게, 고마워."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation_PAD_Eye
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3b3aca6e-c83d-c58c-aaa6-0f21c7128954
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation_PAD_Eye:3b3aca6e-c83d-c58c-aaa6-0f21c7128954
msgctxt "h0201baa9gf36dg49e0ga8b3g4667c4d1478d"
msgid "Quite worthless, as it turns out."
msgstr "알고 보니 꽤 쓸모없는 녀석이군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation_PAD_Eye
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3b3aca6e-c83d-c58c-aaa6-0f21c7128954
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation_PAD_Eye:3b3aca6e-c83d-c58c-aaa6-0f21c7128954
msgctxt "h1cd82875ga20ag4359g94eege38ed3a0172c"
msgid "Huh."
msgstr "허."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation_PAD_Eye
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3b3aca6e-c83d-c58c-aaa6-0f21c7128954
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation_PAD_Eye:3b3aca6e-c83d-c58c-aaa6-0f21c7128954
msgctxt "h37098b3ag7d9bg47b6g9449g6033d2c859df"
msgid "Worthless."
msgstr "쓸모 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation_PAD_Eye
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3b3aca6e-c83d-c58c-aaa6-0f21c7128954
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation_PAD_Eye:3b3aca6e-c83d-c58c-aaa6-0f21c7128954
msgctxt "hf36afdb4g392ag42ecgbb27g1e3bba8e8b92"
msgid "Useless."
msgstr "쓸모 없군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation_PAD_Eye
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3b3aca6e-c83d-c58c-aaa6-0f21c7128954
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation_PAD_Eye:3b3aca6e-c83d-c58c-aaa6-0f21c7128954
msgctxt "h00192b36gb016g41efgbabdg5deb4035650e"
msgid "What am I supposed to do with this thing?"
msgstr "이걸로 뭘 하라는 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation_PAD_Eye
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3b3aca6e-c83d-c58c-aaa6-0f21c7128954
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VoloOperation_PAD_Eye:3b3aca6e-c83d-c58c-aaa6-0f21c7128954
msgctxt "h143e8544g4d1cg4aadg96f5gc00301712aad"
msgid "Some bloody help."
msgstr "빌어먹을 도움이 안 되는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VossCampConfrontation_AD_AfterVossFight
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 4b7db6c8-358e-0b9f-0a15-26517df093f7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VossCampConfrontation_AD_AfterVossFight:4b7db6c8-358e-0b9f-0a15-26517df093f7
msgctxt "h60c316d1g5219g4013gb65cgcda4713db9b1"
msgid "The traitor Voss is dead. Let his heresy die with him."
msgstr "배신자 보스는 죽었다. 놈의 이단 또한 함께 묻히리라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VossCampConfrontation_PAD_PickupGithRadar
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 67394c3b-f573-4309-bf82-0c78a105d986
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VossCampConfrontation_PAD_PickupGithRadar:67394c3b-f573-4309-bf82-0c78a105d986
msgctxt "hbd723523g1a67g45dag80c7gd8aea6d23f3e"
msgid "A funny little trinket. I hope it's useful. Or even better, valuable."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VossCampConfrontation_PAD_PickupGithRadar
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 67394c3b-f573-4309-bf82-0c78a105d986
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VossCampConfrontation_PAD_PickupGithRadar:67394c3b-f573-4309-bf82-0c78a105d986
msgctxt "h815e8ab7g5192g4e9fgad43geff166effb16"
msgid "I've never seen an object like this. What was Voss doing with it?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VossCampConfrontation_PAD_PickupGithRadar
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 67394c3b-f573-4309-bf82-0c78a105d986
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VossCampConfrontation_PAD_PickupGithRadar:67394c3b-f573-4309-bf82-0c78a105d986
msgctxt "h46f39b93gad1fg4e74gb8e6g3fb654d6ca84"
msgid ""
"A curious device, certainly not powered by the Weave. I wonder, what's its "
"purpose?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VossCampConfrontation_PAD_PickupGithRadar
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 67394c3b-f573-4309-bf82-0c78a105d986
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VossCampConfrontation_PAD_PickupGithRadar:67394c3b-f573-4309-bf82-0c78a105d986
msgctxt "h7b3279deg21a5g4e52g9cdbg425f546cbb87"
msgid "Strange contraption. What does it do?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VossCampConfrontation_PAD_PickupGithRadar
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 67394c3b-f573-4309-bf82-0c78a105d986
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VossCampConfrontation_PAD_PickupGithRadar:67394c3b-f573-4309-bf82-0c78a105d986
msgctxt "ha0c7ecc8g048cg4952g80e4gb6b8b72044b0"
msgid "Strange little artefact. Question is - what's it do?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VossCampConfrontation_PAD_PickupGithRadar
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 67394c3b-f573-4309-bf82-0c78a105d986
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VossCampConfrontation_PAD_PickupGithRadar:67394c3b-f573-4309-bf82-0c78a105d986
msgctxt "h1f339854gb16fg422bg9ee6g323ac86a66dc"
msgid "Neat thing. What's it do?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VossCampConfrontation_PAD_PickupGithRadar
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 67394c3b-f573-4309-bf82-0c78a105d986
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
