msgctxt "h7cb6f7bfg9838g4673g9ebag7ce2c6b10828"
msgid "A curious item. What is its purpose?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VossCampConfrontation_PAD_PickupGithRadar
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 67394c3b-f573-4309-bf82-0c78a105d986
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[8].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VossCampConfrontation_PAD_PickupGithRadar:67394c3b-f573-4309-bf82-0c78a105d986
msgctxt "hd2b7dc2fg0bbcg4f46g85bbgbf5f8cf2f882"
msgid "What an odd gadget. What's it for, I wonder?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VossCampConfrontation_PAD_ReadSharessCaressNote
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7ffa7185-b6ba-440b-8361-98ad51a9b799
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VossCampConfrontation_PAD_ReadSharessCaressNote:7ffa7185-b6ba-440b-8361-98ad51a9b799
msgctxt "hbca6eca4g650cg48e9gbee4g3fb2c32d2836"
msgid ""
"So, Voss had an appointment with someone in Baldur's Gate. 'Sharess' Caress' "
"tavern - might be worth a look."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VossCampConfrontation_PAD_ReadSharessCaressNote
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7ffa7185-b6ba-440b-8361-98ad51a9b799
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VossCampConfrontation_PAD_ReadSharessCaressNote:7ffa7185-b6ba-440b-8361-98ad51a9b799
msgctxt "h980fdd2eg7a6eg430dg8cc2g0b89f8f2723f"
msgid ""
"The knight's destination was Baldur's Gate - a place called 'Sharess' "
"Caress'. I should look into it further."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VossCampConfrontation_PAD_ReadSharessCaressNote
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7ffa7185-b6ba-440b-8361-98ad51a9b799
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VossCampConfrontation_PAD_ReadSharessCaressNote:7ffa7185-b6ba-440b-8361-98ad51a9b799
msgctxt "h8a2f079dga59fg44c7gb5b6ga6c6891eb310"
msgid ""
"Voss is headed to Sharess' Caress? Something more than the 'company' draws "
"him there. When we reach the city, we should find out what."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VossCampConfrontation_PAD_ReadSharessCaressNote
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7ffa7185-b6ba-440b-8361-98ad51a9b799
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VossCampConfrontation_PAD_ReadSharessCaressNote:7ffa7185-b6ba-440b-8361-98ad51a9b799
msgctxt "h371e92d3gdf1bg4107g9872g7fb22f08ab19"
msgid ""
"Voss plans on meeting someone in Sharess' Caress. I remember it - a tavern "
"in Wyrm's Crossing."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VossCampConfrontation_PAD_ReadSharessCaressNote
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7ffa7185-b6ba-440b-8361-98ad51a9b799
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VossCampConfrontation_PAD_ReadSharessCaressNote:7ffa7185-b6ba-440b-8361-98ad51a9b799
msgctxt "h844f0a0bg040cg42d7g9228g4202836db4d8"
msgid ""
"Voss was headed to Sharess' Caress, in the city. We should pay it a visit."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VossCampConfrontation_PAD_ReadSharessCaressNote
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7ffa7185-b6ba-440b-8361-98ad51a9b799
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VossCampConfrontation_PAD_ReadSharessCaressNote:7ffa7185-b6ba-440b-8361-98ad51a9b799
msgctxt "h43cd0082gc324g4effga1bcg1e4a464e25a7"
msgid ""
"Voss was set to meet someone in Sharess' Caress. That's just outside the "
"city proper."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VossCampConfrontation_PAD_ReadSharessCaressNote
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7ffa7185-b6ba-440b-8361-98ad51a9b799
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_JAHEIRA
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VossCampConfrontation_PAD_ReadSharessCaressNote:7ffa7185-b6ba-440b-8361-98ad51a9b799
msgctxt "hf0c1a47bga931g4495g8986g7bef46cb3c13"
msgid ""
"Voss was due to meet a contact in Sharess' Caress. We ought to keep his "
"appointment."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VossCampConfrontation_PAD_ReadSharessCaressNote
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7ffa7185-b6ba-440b-8361-98ad51a9b799
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_HALSIN
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VossCampConfrontation_PAD_ReadSharessCaressNote:7ffa7185-b6ba-440b-8361-98ad51a9b799
msgctxt "h3b9cf4afgef1dg4807ga62agee02f96fdac9"
msgid ""
"Voss intends to meet with someone in Sharess' Caress - an inn in Baldur's "
"Gate. This may warrant investigation."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/CAMP_VossCampConfrontation_PAD_ReadSharessCaressNote
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7ffa7185-b6ba-440b-8361-98ad51a9b799
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[8].TagText[0]
