msgctxt "h57dfb45ag52e2g4ec9g9354g5176f95faa6b"
msgid ""
"We all have our shit to bear. As long you remember your manners, Astarion, "
"you're welcome at my fire."
msgstr "우린 모두 치워야 할 똥이 있지. 아스타리온, 예의만 지킨다면, 내 품에 언제든지 환영이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_AstarionHungerC_CRD_Astarion_MorningAfter
