msgctxt "h9bc253a6gd5cfg4048g9665g959f1ab40ed0"
msgid ""
"Standing in the sun, wading through a river, wandering into homes without an "
"invitation - they're all perfectly mundane activities now."
msgstr "햇볕 아래 서 있거나, 강을 헤엄치거나, 초대장 없이 집에 들어가는 행위 등은 이제 지극히 일상적인 활동이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_AstarionHungerC_CRD_Astarion_MorningAfter
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f9a296b8-8301-1f69-e681-e1132199dbd0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
