#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Astarion_CRD_SecondNight:13009f2d-e142-454c-b5ee-712237a7bf51
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h28dcb380g7f49g4099gaab5g8c60f94d89b1"
msgid ""
"Every time I heard the Tieflings cry, I remembered how you sounded crying "
"for me."
msgstr "티플링들이 흐느낄 때마다, 나를 가지고 싶어 안달났던 네 신음소리가 귓가에 맴돌았지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Astarion_CRD_SecondNight
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 1356ee6e-a4d5-4456-84a3-36ceb60f1efb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Astarion_CRD_SecondNight:1356ee6e-a4d5-4456-84a3-36ceb60f1efb
msgctxt "h80e63ed3g9b51g40d4g83a3ga6106759d881"
msgid ""
"I'm amazed you managed to keep your mind clear enough to fight, I've been "
"thinking about our last night together ceaselessly."
msgstr "네가 전투에 나설 만한 정신이 있었다는 게 놀라워. 난 우리가 함께했던 그날만 계속 생각하고 있었거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Astarion_CRD_SecondNight
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 150c49d0-7351-4d0c-99d7-9ee0a7ab0a81
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Astarion_CRD_SecondNight:150c49d0-7351-4d0c-99d7-9ee0a7ab0a81
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h82803e6fgec9ag439eg8e13g2d07e4a1108c"
msgid "I think it's better if we leave last time as a once-off."
msgstr "그때의 일은 한 번으로 끝내는 게 좋을 것 같아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Astarion_CRD_SecondNight
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 155daedb-2230-4690-bb8d-0d17762d66e5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Astarion_CRD_SecondNight:155daedb-2230-4690-bb8d-0d17762d66e5
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h2714d314g38e6g4f71gb478g99f4dc994ed1"
msgid ""
"If you don't remember how much you enjoyed it last time, I would like to try "
"again, until you can think of nothing else."
msgstr "네가 그때 얼마나 즐겼는지 잘 기억나지 않으면, 내가 다시 기억하게 해 줄게. 다른 건 하나도 생각할 수 없을 때까지 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Astarion_CRD_SecondNight
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 18f5c0af-fa32-4509-a9d2-94630f0fd079
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Astarion_CRD_SecondNight:18f5c0af-fa32-4509-a9d2-94630f0fd079
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "ha1f22ef9g567bg43f3g8289g6dad11a34a3e"
msgid ""
"When I'm with you, I feel practically alive, yet I crave only to die again "
"with you."
msgstr "네 곁에 있으면 내가 정말 살아있는 것처럼 느껴져. 너와 함께 다시 죽고 싶어을 정도로."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Astarion_CRD_SecondNight
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1beaeab0-85bc-450e-a07f-a13ad4057339
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Astarion_CRD_SecondNight:1beaeab0-85bc-450e-a07f-a13ad4057339
msgctxt "hcb96eeddg8239g45d3g9b59g7abbfa4e8b75"
msgid "'A little treat'? You can do better than that."
msgstr "'자그마한 간식'? 그것보단 잘할 수 있잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Astarion_CRD_SecondNight
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 1d92cb21-fcc7-4a23-96d5-8a104cf2b74e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Astarion_CRD_SecondNight:1d92cb21-fcc7-4a23-96d5-8a104cf2b74e
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h74900505g9bd3g4af5g9b7fg6e47abf30232"
msgid ""
"By all means, do something less exceptional, and think of me while you're "
"doing it."
msgstr "그렇다면 네가 별다른 감흥 없는 밤을 보냈으면 해. 그리고 그 밤 내내 나를 떠올리는 거지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Astarion_CRD_SecondNight
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 1e9f8a22-a7c9-483f-a18b-ea3df8086808
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
