msgctxt "h38e49a29g3e83g4816ga592g47780600e181"
msgid ""
"Here's my little treat with their cheeks all flushed. You <i>will </i>come "
"to my bed tonight, won't you?"
msgstr "여기 나의 자그마한 간식이 양 뺨을 붉힌 채로 오는군. 오늘 밤 내 천막에 <i>올 거지, </i>안 그래?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Astarion_CRD_SecondNight
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3e22a7da-338b-4675-a01e-1b8ad446a266
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
