msgid "Oh, I certainly can, it would be my pleasure."
msgstr "당연히 할 수 있지. 기꺼이 해 볼까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Astarion_CRD_SecondNight
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = fd3d174a-7d78-4714-842c-88e74a4ad9a0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Astarion_CRD_SecondNight:fd3d174a-7d78-4714-842c-88e74a4ad9a0
msgctxt "h4ce1fd6ag67d6g48c0gae47ge52cda697a93"
msgid "Hmm, let me give it another go:"
msgstr "흠, 다시 한번 해볼게."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Astarion_SD_ROM_SecondNight
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 245c38a8-d968-4d94-8957-952b892255c4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Camp_Event_SkipSleepCutscene = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Astarion_SD_ROM_SecondNight:245c38a8-d968-4d94-8957-952b892255c4
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h5eb7c6b0gbf60g49f0ga91fgf4436038a90f"
msgid "Let's see where the night takes us."
msgstr "이 밤이 어떻게 흘러갈지 기대되는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Astarion_SD_ROM_SecondNight
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 96f0f730-5883-4631-8cd7-aa15e24d00a1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Astarion_SD_ROM_SecondNight:96f0f730-5883-4631-8cd7-aa15e24d00a1
msgctxt "hcdd1f392g27eeg4579gbc36g47b7674108c8"
msgid ""
"I have missed you. And now you're all mine, and I'm all yours. Until morning "
"at least."
msgstr "네가 그리웠거든. 이제 넌 내 거고, 난 네 거야. 적어도 아침까지는."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Astarion_SD_ROM_SecondNight
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = c33c6ebf-af9e-4cc2-aaa3-d203020ee1e8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Astarion_SD_ROM_SecondNight:c33c6ebf-af9e-4cc2-aaa3-d203020ee1e8
msgctxt "h9287057egffe3g4310g94e9gc7649b260cde"
msgid "I hoped you would come."
msgstr "네가 오기만을 바랐어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_BackAtHome_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 0202d16e-0794-9232-b445-578702d8717c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_BackAtHome_CRD_Karlach:0202d16e-0794-9232-b445-578702d8717c
msgctxt "h1306516egad3bg46bdgb331g13f7ec9001e4"
msgid ""
"Hear, hear. And hey, kicking his arse might burn off a bit of this extra "
"heat."
msgstr "알았어, 알았어. 그리고 또 모르지, 고타쉬 엉덩이를 걷어차면 이 열이 좀 식을지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_BackAtHome_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0e369e81-6821-e992-e39f-b6c313b8fe16
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_BackAtHome_CRD_Karlach:0e369e81-6821-e992-e39f-b6c313b8fe16
msgctxt "hd08b577eg43e9g4751gbc8dgd1c662cbe1b1"
msgid "What makes you think he won't be able to help?"
msgstr "왜 대먼이 못 고칠 거라고 생각하는 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_BackAtHome_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 379cd532-5608-c59e-dd90-6bd1f2756f30
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_BackAtHome_CRD_Karlach:379cd532-5608-c59e-dd90-6bd1f2756f30
msgctxt "h412e4b79geb08g4edegb943g19bfa5d962d6"
msgid ""
"But don't worry. I'm not finished yet. Hell no - I've got a to-do list a "
"mile long in this city. Come on. Let's go home."
msgstr ""
"그래도 걱정은 하지 마. 난 아직 안 끝났어. 어림도 없지. 발더스 게이트에서 할 일 목록 적은 것만 책 한 권은 된다고. 가자."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_BackAtHome_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 3a24b2e4-0569-4404-fc88-eabad1f95eac
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_BackAtHome_CRD_Karlach:3a24b2e4-0569-4404-fc88-eabad1f95eac
msgctxt "he09f3facg2ca5g4d82gbed0g8568f536c4fd"
msgid ""
"With this heat going, I can't spare the energy to think. I just want to "
"enjoy whatever's left of this life of mine."
msgstr "이 열기를 견디느라 다른 데 신경 쓸 여유가 없네. 그저 남은 시간을 즐기고 싶다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_BackAtHome_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 3ed79764-9e7a-f6c4-062d-7a2fa0b441c8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_BackAtHome_CRD_Karlach:3ed79764-9e7a-f6c4-062d-7a2fa0b441c8
msgctxt "h3db5a8cbgc348g4b65g98fbg7d0111d8d3da"
msgid "Let's go home. It's about damn time."
msgstr "집에 가자. 이제 갈 시간이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_BackAtHome_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 3fb8ec95-9148-4bcd-81a7-a3d6fdee5fb5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_ForgingOfTheHeart_State_KarlachUpgraded = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_BackAtHome_CRD_Karlach:3fb8ec95-9148-4bcd-81a7-a3d6fdee5fb5
msgctxt "hefcacb4dgdbb3g418agb5f0g106a12a29617"
msgid ""
"I'm not past looking for Dammon, but I want us both to be ready if... well. "
"If he can't fix me."
msgstr "대먼을 찾는 걸 포기한 건 아니지만, 준비를 해둬야겠지, 만약... 만약 고칠 수 없다면 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_BackAtHome_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 4c9b27a8-dab7-b33a-8705-67f62783681d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_BackAtHome_CRD_Karlach:4c9b27a8-dab7-b33a-8705-67f62783681d
msgctxt "hb3c33addg10eeg4f11gb56bg187a8a0ae1a4"
msgid ""
"Hah. She'd turn us both into sheep, then serve mutton for dinner. Let's stay "
"here, where it's nice. For as long as we can."
msgstr "하, 자리엘은 아마 우릴 양으로 만들어서 저녁 식탁에 올릴걸. 여기 있자. 좋은 곳에. 될 수 있는 한 오래."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_BackAtHome_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 4fcc9284-7600-5758-47e4-c3f73c293667
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_BackAtHome_CRD_Karlach:4fcc9284-7600-5758-47e4-c3f73c293667
msgctxt "h930872acg8ebdg457ag8fe7gbfff1e29ba3f"
msgid "Ngh, soldier, my engine. It hurts."
msgstr "윽, 신참. 내 엔진. 이거 좀 아픈데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_BackAtHome_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 589ce71b-9f34-16a6-e106-ebf6b5bda6bb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_ForgingOfTheHeart_State_KarlachSecondUpgrade = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_BackAtHome_CRD_Karlach:589ce71b-9f34-16a6-e106-ebf6b5bda6bb
msgctxt "h6dd7cee0g4fd9g4e21gb066gf39261810afb"
msgid ""
"But look - we've just about made it to the city. That'll do me. Let's go "
"protect it. Whatever happens after that is between me and the so-called gods."
msgstr ""
"그래도 봐, 발더스 게이트에 도착했어. 이거면 됐어. 여길 지키자고. 그 뒤 일은 내가 <i>신이라던가 뭐라던가</i>랑 해결해 볼게."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_BackAtHome_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 59c15047-2930-0928-bf40-e9165e50e796
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_BackAtHome_CRD_Karlach:59c15047-2930-0928-bf40-e9165e50e796
msgctxt "h66e78fdeg2508g4739g8c11g6b949189d4a0"
msgid ""
"Life can come at you pretty fast, soldier. A good defence can help you stay "
"on your feet. I think you know that, even if you don't want to."
msgstr "인생이란 원래 준비하기 힘든 거라고, 신참. 그래도 잘 대비한다면 버틸 수 있을 거야. 아마 알기 싫어도 이미 알고 있겠지만."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_BackAtHome_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5ba1b32b-fb91-6c18-48f0-e136218bcd30
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_BackAtHome_CRD_Karlach:5ba1b32b-fb91-6c18-48f0-e136218bcd30
msgctxt "h90194428g203dg4e21ga905gd1b1b170acd8"
msgid "You don't think we'll find you a cure?"
msgstr "우리가 치료법을 찾으리란 희망은 버린 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_BackAtHome_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 60919319-9cd0-8c73-fd69-487293a9c114
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Gortash_State_PermaDefeated = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_BackAtHome_CRD_Karlach:60919319-9cd0-8c73-fd69-487293a9c114
msgctxt "heb2610c0g2513g4fc5g9f46g03d7cb27ce64"
msgid "No - it's between you and Gortash."
msgstr "아니, 그건 너랑 고타쉬 사이 일이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_BackAtHome_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 6507d806-a3f1-1192-4ff3-cd49b45dd17b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_BackAtHome_CRD_Karlach:6507d806-a3f1-1192-4ff3-cd49b45dd17b
msgctxt "h48e489d8gd476g483ag86e3g1cefeb8f520f"
msgid ""
"I think this might be it. Soon. Thing's burning hotter than I knew it could."
msgstr "시간이 얼마 안 남은 것 같아. 그 어느 때보다도 뜨겁게 타오르고 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_BackAtHome_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 75fc984b-907f-2eff-4c71-5c25fdd23868
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_State_PartneredWithKarlach(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_BackAtHome_CRD_Karlach:75fc984b-907f-2eff-4c71-5c25fdd23868
msgctxt "hfee0dc7bg0f2eg4c52ga3bdg44e25357179c"
msgid "No - it's between you, me, and Zariel. In Avernus."
msgstr "아니, 이건 너랑 나, 그리고 자리엘이 아베르누스에서 결판 지을 일이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_BackAtHome_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 76cb06ea-3a0f-476b-b7ce-c9f7e7cc5970
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_BackAtHome_CRD_Karlach:76cb06ea-3a0f-476b-b7ce-c9f7e7cc5970
msgctxt "h4e50b765g4904g4162ga9bcg845aba0a77d9"
msgid "I want us both to be ready if... well, if we can't fix me."
msgstr "준비를 해둬야겠지, 만약... 만약 고칠 수 없다면 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_BackAtHome_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 861d2da3-0f52-0857-1c93-437d715c7790
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_BackAtHome_CRD_Karlach:861d2da3-0f52-0857-1c93-437d715c7790
msgctxt "h6df18074g998cg4f46gacc9g63ac44259f01"
msgid "I'm so excited to go home. Anything that comes after that is extra."
msgstr "집에 가는 게 너무 기대되는걸. 다른 건 별로 신경 쓰고 싶지 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_BackAtHome_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 95b60323-3ab7-4b75-b371-f4f796676abd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_ForgingOfTheHeart_Knows_DammonCanUpgradeKarlach = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_BackAtHome_CRD_Karlach:95b60323-3ab7-4b75-b371-f4f796676abd
msgctxt "hf7214244g9cc9g40a9gab22g90823750a304"
msgid ""
"I'm not past looking for Dammon, but I want us both to be ready if... well. "
"If he can't fix me."
msgstr "대먼을 찾는 걸 포기한 건 아니지만, 준비를 해둬야겠지, 만약... 만약 고칠 수 없다면 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_BackAtHome_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 9a5b33f1-0171-490c-ba75-74d2cf1fe41a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_BackAtHome_CRD_Karlach:9a5b33f1-0171-490c-ba75-74d2cf1fe41a
msgctxt "h8c8ac4d9gc513g443fg99e6g1cb963f4a817"
msgid "Bit sweaty, but up for whatever's next. Thanks, soldier."
msgstr "좀 덥긴 한데, 준비는 끝났다고. 고마워, 신참."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_BackAtHome_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 9b8d5fce-5248-9414-ebd4-99a91bd5ef5e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitment_State_DammonUnavailable = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_BackAtHome_CRD_Karlach:9b8d5fce-5248-9414-ebd4-99a91bd5ef5e
msgctxt "h7ac2fb73ge418g4f6fgbb55gfe3fb1d463a0"
msgid "I want us both to be ready if... well, if we can't fix me."
msgstr "준비를 해둬야겠지, 만약... 만약 고칠 수 없다면 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_BackAtHome_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 9f1baccd-08ae-f3b9-f709-56ca3b510805
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_BackAtHome_CRD_Karlach:9f1baccd-08ae-f3b9-f709-56ca3b510805
msgctxt "h82f0cd19g6b5ag41cdg93a1gfeeeaba574c4"
msgid "Dammon's a smart guy, but this engine just feels... cooked."
msgstr "대먼은 솜씨 좋은 녀석이지만, 내 엔진이 완전히... 구워지는 것 같거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_BackAtHome_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = a061148a-d41c-6e8c-cbbb-778cef3400e4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_BackAtHome_CRD_Karlach:a061148a-d41c-6e8c-cbbb-778cef3400e4
msgctxt "hf20d8caegc1cag468egb36cgbc1336834293"
msgid ""
"Anyway, it could be worse. I'm exactly where I'm supposed to be. With who "
"I'm meant to be with. How many people can say that?"
msgstr "뭐, 최악은 아니야. 난 내가 있어야 할 곳에 함께 해야 할 동료와 있다고. 아무나 못 하는 거잖아?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_BackAtHome_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = beb8ad13-f315-4070-82bf-60801b5accde
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_BackAtHome_CRD_Karlach:beb8ad13-f315-4070-82bf-60801b5accde
msgctxt "h3f64a4fcg9d94g467eg89cegcb7f2a2ac73c"
msgid "I'm ready if you are."
msgstr "너만 괜찮다면 난 준비됐어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_BackAtHome_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d5688856-1ce8-558d-6609-d4a64b2b4bbe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_BackAtHome_CRD_Karlach:d5688856-1ce8-558d-6609-d4a64b2b4bbe
msgctxt "h4b630b57g2a46g4ee0ga2b8g0161971be054"
msgid "I'm not ready for that, and I never will be."
msgstr "난 아직 준비가 안 됐어. 앞으로도 그럴 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_BackAtHome_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ede45473-3af9-e9ba-4a3f-ba2bfc2f3b1f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Gortash_State_PermaDefeated = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_BackAtHome_CRD_Karlach:ede45473-3af9-e9ba-4a3f-ba2bfc2f3b1f
msgctxt "h859c3235gb177g40f9g85a3gbb9ec360c430"
msgid "Gortash is going to pay for what he did to you."
msgstr "고타쉬에게 대가를 치르게 해주자고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_BackAtHome_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = ee1733ce-a726-6045-63cf-acf0cf7c4644
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_BackAtHome_CRD_Karlach:ee1733ce-a726-6045-63cf-acf0cf7c4644
msgctxt "h1c7146f4g5443g4732gb2a0ga017a9817c01"
msgid "Can't wait to be home. Anything that comes after that is extra."
msgstr "집에 가는 게 너무 기대되는걸. 다른 건 별로 신경 쓰고 싶지 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Betrayal_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 10b68e4c-1e37-2710-ebef-dfa3d729d3c7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - FOR_Monitor_HasMet_Dinner = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Betrayal_CRD_Gale:10b68e4c-1e37-2710-ebef-dfa3d729d3c7
msgctxt "h42b92ae3g7529g4385g8c77g6dbb1c471215"
msgid "*It's the scent of Avernus.*"
msgstr "*이것은 아베르누스의 악취입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Betrayal_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 12262cba-a187-613a-44fd-6d3078e6c3e5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Betrayal_CRD_Gale:12262cba-a187-613a-44fd-6d3078e6c3e5
msgctxt "hb1b80d85g47beg487bg968dg5ea41e6fdd22"
msgid "*... fire. You hear laughter. You smell brimstone.*"
msgstr "*…불꽃이 보입니다. 웃음소리가 들립니다. 유황의 냄새도 느껴집니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Betrayal_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 16e5916d-474a-f6d7-6c6a-370e0124869f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Betrayal_CRD_Gale:16e5916d-474a-f6d7-6c6a-370e0124869f
msgctxt "h7739abcdg0ca9g4586gb2a3g7b4946a74614"
msgid ""
"I've had a solution in mind for a while now, it just took me some time to... "
"set it in motion."
msgstr "계속 염두에 두던 해결책이 있었거든. 그냥 행동으로 옮기는 게… 시간이 좀 걸렸을 뿐이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Betrayal_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 28e75ad4-e949-2d01-1e04-ad7b85557ee9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CAMP_Night3_CRD_Gale_MindMeldFail = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Betrayal_CRD_Gale:28e75ad4-e949-2d01-1e04-ad7b85557ee9
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "hd0ed165cgb7c2g45c0gab36g289be37f60bb"
msgid "Stop that! How dare you..."
msgstr "멈춰! 감히 무슨 짓을…"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Betrayal_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 29c9d2f9-fbd5-586e-2b51-6a392674419f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Betrayal_CRD_Gale:29c9d2f9-fbd5-586e-2b51-6a392674419f
msgctxt "h0362ca5ag99deg4505gbf95g035fa86a18aa"
msgid ""
"That's it - I won't take more of your time this lovely evening. Rest well."
msgstr "그게 다야. 네 소중한 저녁 시간을 더 이상 빼앗지는 않을께. 푹 쉬어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Betrayal_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 2bf1d14e-03ee-8f3f-07dc-2c6c68ec2312
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CAMP_Night3_CRD_Gale_MindMeldFail = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Betrayal_CRD_Gale:2bf1d14e-03ee-8f3f-07dc-2c6c68ec2312
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "hb00015c7g66bdg43eeg9d00g77d09a89a608"
msgid "Up to tricks, are we?"
msgstr "이제는 그런 짓도 하는구나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Betrayal_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 4e75039c-1412-bb5b-1585-186e4b2a2751
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Betrayal_CRD_Gale:4e75039c-1412-bb5b-1585-186e4b2a2751
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h1f497df1g3452g4114ga172g335c2e68c4ac"
msgid "A word, if you please."
msgstr "너에게 한 마디 좀 하고 싶은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Betrayal_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 512cfadb-72b0-9ba8-fb60-282af51747b4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Betrayal_CRD_Gale:512cfadb-72b0-9ba8-fb60-282af51747b4
msgctxt "hac62e4acgbf4ag4818gb5a5g5ae1f80c2954"
msgid "Not at all."
msgstr "전혀 그렇지 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Betrayal_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 567118f9-bedb-65db-a3de-aa3b811e1a48
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Betrayal_CRD_Gale:567118f9-bedb-65db-a3de-aa3b811e1a48
msgctxt "h0245c746g92a6g4cc1g8128g0551196ae3e4"
msgid ""
"Remember how I told you I was in dire need of magical artefacts to absorb?"
msgstr "내가 흡수할 마법 아이템을 찾는 게 얼마나 긴급한지 말하지 않았던가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Betrayal_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 5973f635-4e52-cfb9-3d48-fbfe2f3843af
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CAMP_Night3_CRD_Gale_MindMeldFail = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Betrayal_CRD_Gale:5973f635-4e52-cfb9-3d48-fbfe2f3843af
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h765fa86cg73fbg4136gb932ga005ccdf9508"
msgid "Stop that! How dare you - again..."
msgstr "멈춰! 감히 이런 짓을 또 하다니…"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Betrayal_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 64d16816-0cd8-5696-0f8c-8773aab7f4bb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Betrayal_CRD_Gale:64d16816-0cd8-5696-0f8c-8773aab7f4bb
msgctxt "h58983c4bgdcd1g4b5aga93bgb14fce8d1a75"
msgid "Forget whatever it was you saw. It's all beyond you now anyway."
msgstr "네가 뭘 봤든지 간에 잊도록 해. 어차피 이제 너와는 상관 없는 일이니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Betrayal_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 71de4266-5f3c-4cea-b9c9-f5ef8262f6a1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Betrayal_CRD_Gale:71de4266-5f3c-4cea-b9c9-f5ef8262f6a1
msgctxt "hec2dd9bcg4528g4992gab20gcc93dd425a1f"
msgid "No more than what I had to - and that's all I'll say on the matter."
msgstr "해야만 하는 일을 했을 뿐이야. 그 외에 더 할 말은 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Betrayal_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 74c3ea7d-4602-26e8-6078-dec0f49378df
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Betrayal_CRD_Gale:74c3ea7d-4602-26e8-6078-dec0f49378df
msgctxt "h551d5a55g18b3g4bf4ga46cg076720198d18"
msgid "We'll let all this rest for now, but it will be addressed again later."
msgstr "이 일은 잠시 접어두자. 나중에 다시 이야기해보자고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Betrayal_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 7c67181a-da83-ff2e-59b6-d30659d70744
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Betrayal_CRD_Gale:7c67181a-da83-ff2e-59b6-d30659d70744
msgctxt "h1d36d224gbf8eg4657gb665g9cea0eca0338"
msgid "Not really, no."
msgstr "아니, 안 돼."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Betrayal_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 7ebb8b70-7df1-01f4-2b45-410fec2d6c16
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Betrayal_CRD_Gale:7ebb8b70-7df1-01f4-2b45-410fec2d6c16
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h357fb19bg6cb8g4a88gaf4eg850069d7cf6e"
msgid "Much later. If ever."
msgstr "아주 나중이 되겠군. 그마저도 없을 것 같지만."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Betrayal_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7fb1f1e6-9e31-4988-6314-fa54f91e8124
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Betrayal_CRD_Gale:7fb1f1e6-9e31-4988-6314-fa54f91e8124
msgctxt "h260f43f5g40c8g45cfga273gba5eacf35f5b"
msgid "I don't follow. This seems awfully sudden."
msgstr "이해가 잘 안되는걸. 너무 갑작스러워."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Betrayal_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 875f5ad1-a891-d734-f4f1-563053fd7c08
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Betrayal_CRD_Gale:875f5ad1-a891-d734-f4f1-563053fd7c08
msgctxt "hc9e72aefgb268g4a71g9d5eg235f15fc4c03"
msgid "Good to know - and good night."
msgstr "잘됐네. 좋은 밤 보내."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Betrayal_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 87642b06-15da-00c0-ce84-2e56ff0e6f63
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Betrayal_CRD_Gale:87642b06-15da-00c0-ce84-2e56ff0e6f63
msgctxt "h804d189egea1cg4e5agba52gc851622df928"
msgid ""
"Clearly the matter has hardly been a priority of yours, but even so, you can "
"consider it closed."
msgstr "넌 그 일을 아주 사소하게 여겼던 것 같지만, 상관없어. 이젠 정말 너와는 관계없는 일이거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Betrayal_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 8be56d95-35e4-ab18-fd86-442ce2a62a7e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Betrayal_CRD_Gale:8be56d95-35e4-ab18-fd86-442ce2a62a7e
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "hb1037428g7118g45dagaa11g3d4dc3363e10"
msgid "In my mind, you are quite blind."
msgstr "내 생각에, 너는 장님이나 다름없거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Betrayal_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 8ff7cf4d-6ab0-98dc-1e17-f42c520b48ce
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Betrayal_CRD_Gale:8ff7cf4d-6ab0-98dc-1e17-f42c520b48ce
msgctxt "hbf660bbeg090fg4accg89b9g1ae133309121"
msgid "Suit yourself. Like I said: I no longer require your assistance."
msgstr "맘대로 해. 아까 말했잖아, 이제 네 도움은 필요 없다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Betrayal_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 94876eea-420c-8c84-8b84-e4a4b79c7216
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Betrayal_CRD_Gale:94876eea-420c-8c84-8b84-e4a4b79c7216
msgctxt "h1537f19ag075ag499agab16g005aa8679d40"
msgid "I don't think I want you around any longer."
msgstr "네 얼굴을 더 이상 보고 싶지 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Betrayal_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 97d97852-cca5-1287-6c8b-20af9a244fde
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Betrayal_CRD_Gale:97d97852-cca5-1287-6c8b-20af9a244fde
msgctxt "h14f370ddg8ecag4f7fg854fg8de0ac5125b3"
msgid "You too, Gale."
msgstr "너도, 게일."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Betrayal_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = a073576a-138b-563f-4a38-8e8e5437f704
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Betrayal_CRD_Gale:a073576a-138b-563f-4a38-8e8e5437f704
msgctxt "ha8a7bb90g141eg47d5g97b3g28ae8f9ee7af"
msgid "No matter. All you see is what I want you to see."
msgstr "상관없어. 넌 내가 보여주고 싶은 것 밖에 볼 수 없을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Betrayal_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = a7ad2c9c-f9a6-582f-b5e3-24f626773ffb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - FOR_Monitor_HasMet_Dinner = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Betrayal_CRD_Gale:a7ad2c9c-f9a6-582f-b5e3-24f626773ffb
msgctxt "h239692f4g83e7g4aadg84fag3ab94bd5ffaf"
msgid "*Mocking words drift back to you. 'This is the House of Hope.'*"
msgstr "*조롱하는 듯한 그 말이 뇌리에 떠오릅니다. '이곳은 희망의 집입니다.'*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Betrayal_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = af03013d-dcec-5470-93cf-05910bec0c25
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CAMP_Night3_CRD_Gale_MindMeldFail = True
