msgctxt "h4b5994edge8d1g4af1gb41dgf4cb3f809166"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 3ab7dd0f-36cb-606b-f05f-8f301192fa8e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:3ab7dd0f-36cb-606b-f05f-8f301192fa8e
msgctxt "h2a47a274ga0bag4bb9gbe2cg63b0174955f7"
msgid "Suit yourself. I've more than enough company."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 3b219842-dcb8-cf9b-f68c-cd8a4e1b38e5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - Approval_AtLeast_20_For_Sp2(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:3b219842-dcb8-cf9b-f68c-cd8a4e1b38e5
msgctxt "h8380897egc570g4943g818ag5a54d3124938"
msgid "Well, I'd hate to get in the way of a well-laid plan. So to speak."
msgstr "좋아, 나도 잘 짜인 계획을 방해하긴 싫어. 말하자면."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 3b2b0734-cec2-236c-521c-1995c04e61b7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_AstarionRefused(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:3b2b0734-cec2-236c-521c-1995c04e61b7
msgctxt "h6c18fb82gcb84g4f5eg95eage58c8ee60b39"
msgid "But fine. If you're determined to ruin your evening, I won't stop you."
msgstr "그래도 좋아. 너의 밤을 망치겠다면, 말리진 않을게."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4062ea5b-d652-c548-219b-c25ab1d22c31
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_ForgingOfTheHeart_State_KarlachSecondUpgrade = False
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_State_DoubleDating(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:4062ea5b-d652-c548-219b-c25ab1d22c31
msgctxt "h1fa254acg0049g4183gbc97g53101372f99b"
msgid "I have to admit, I wish I could share a bed with you tonight."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 422937fd-b93c-665f-9613-e0d18963c717
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_State_DoubleDating(1) = True
#.      - ORI_State_DatingAstarion(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:422937fd-b93c-665f-9613-e0d18963c717
msgctxt "h99fc1454g75dag4220gb88dg527ae6029139"
msgid "What would you like to happen?"
msgstr "무슨 일이 일어났으면 좋겠는데?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 42eff682-1695-e9e7-cd76-a8377c237aab
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:42eff682-1695-e9e7-cd76-a8377c237aab
msgctxt "h27edc726g5ddbg41c6g84fbgb57f2ba2c272"
msgid "Not what I'd call 'fun', or 'interesting', but sweet."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 4564a677-940e-02cd-bd28-e37829ce03a2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:4564a677-940e-02cd-bd28-e37829ce03a2
msgctxt "h6fd67c4eg1c94g482ag80f8ge01aa0a07ac5"
msgid "There's no better way to unwind after a long day of killing."
msgstr "살육의 긴 하루를 보낸 후, 긴장을 풀기에 이보다 더 좋은 방법은 없잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 463d3578-0d7f-b7d8-be2b-95b6561576b1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:463d3578-0d7f-b7d8-be2b-95b6561576b1
msgctxt "h284548d0g48fdg45efg9e61gecb3d75ba94a"
msgid ""
"I can replace those brutal fantasies of yours with desires you'll find "
"<i>much harder </i>to push away."
msgstr "너의 그 잔인한 환상 대신, 거부하기 <i>훨씬 더 어려운</i> 욕구에 눈 뜨게 해줄 수 있는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 4a00d0c0-3977-a223-1fbc-2362415a95b4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_HasPartner(1) = True
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_AstarionPartner(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:4a00d0c0-3977-a223-1fbc-2362415a95b4
msgctxt "h408bcb34g6036g457dg8e29g30eeec191920"
msgid "Indeed you will, my love. Indeed you will."
msgstr "물론이지, 내 사랑. 당연히 그래야지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 4acc5f9f-9ee4-4067-d39d-4922af8c9761
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_AstarionRejected(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:4acc5f9f-9ee4-4067-d39d-4922af8c9761
msgctxt "h2af13822g88d6g49d8g843dgc62f62500f1f"
msgid "I have standards."
msgstr "난 기준이 있거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4b686f31-2070-bd39-31d1-5418fdac3967
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:4b686f31-2070-bd39-31d1-5418fdac3967
msgctxt "h0febb04dg72ddg4505ga0efg2d04c9da8036"
msgid "I'd rather bed one of the goblins, <i>darling</i>."
msgstr "차라리 저 고블린 친구들과 동침하겠어, <i>자기</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 4c8d832d-d007-37df-eef8-96b924494bc2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_DrowPartner(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:4c8d832d-d007-37df-eef8-96b924494bc2
msgctxt "hb9c8341bg2e06g4243ga615gb367c96816cf"
msgid "Certainly better than pillow talk with your drow lover, hmm?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4cfe1a88-8e75-f483-8d93-c88098ee6c8e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:4cfe1a88-8e75-f483-8d93-c88098ee6c8e
msgctxt "hba1caf86g103cg4054gac8dgce82a4e53812"
msgid "White."
msgstr "화이트."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4fc45306-a808-3c77-8224-7bcd668de810
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:4fc45306-a808-3c77-8224-7bcd668de810
msgctxt "h8f18c007gbbc5g4ba5g9a00gc84e4974b050"
msgid "Are you offering anything better? Because I could be persuaded..."
msgstr "더 나은 제안 있어? 날 설득할 수도 있는데..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 52ad4a7e-bbcb-f9b9-29df-bbbbf1799487
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:52ad4a7e-bbcb-f9b9-29df-bbbbf1799487
msgctxt "heae61d2bgec0ag4664gb45cgd50ed6778329"
msgid "I'm sorry, I mistook you for someone with taste."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 56f9740c-f9f3-3bd2-558f-e453267d87c5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_ShadowheartPartner(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:56f9740c-f9f3-3bd2-558f-e453267d87c5
msgctxt "h61ede8edg8b24g4f62g9f89gb5f0c5745268"
msgid "Just so you know, I'm spending tonight with Shadowheart."
msgstr "너도 알다시피, 난 섀도하트랑 하룻밤을 보낼 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 5943c6f5-505a-9c64-48e1-db5a2d41ac08
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:5943c6f5-505a-9c64-48e1-db5a2d41ac08
msgctxt "h4cf67e6bg5cfdg49d4g9412g06df8740c2ef"
msgid "Oh don't be so sour - it's a party."
msgstr "오, 너무 까탈스럽게 굴지 마. 이건 파티잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
