#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:5a9268ed-3c55-235f-06ba-3ba625e46f95
msgctxt "h5405bd53ga773g4f08ga1e7gc7cd066535c3"
msgid "Interested in sharing a bed tonight?"
msgstr "나랑 하룻밤 같이 보낼 생각 없어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 5b19fe50-21cd-6fad-14b7-64a312623da8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:5b19fe50-21cd-6fad-14b7-64a312623da8
msgctxt "he25f19cdgfc71g4931g9060g2b4ebe361829"
msgid "Ha! You're braver than I thought."
msgstr "하! 넌 생각보다 용감하구나."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 5bbcb6ce-5f7d-6965-7c88-153dbd93d990
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:5bbcb6ce-5f7d-6965-7c88-153dbd93d990
msgctxt "hdd675a01g75dcg46a9g9710g494bd89e7e79"
msgid "Although that's not to say we can't have a little fun."
msgstr "그렇다고 우리가 재미있게 놀 수 없다는 말은 아니야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
