#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:64ca604e-0d45-8969-caf9-d5d6e00d48f5
msgctxt "h0b5e896ag037dg4b8bgb6f6ge1e49cad69be"
msgid ""
"Ha! No, my love, you and Shadowheart can hold hands all you want. It means "
"nothing to me."
msgstr "하! 아니야, 자기, 너랑 섀도하트는 마음껏 손을 잡아도 돼. 내겐 아무 의미도 없으니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6d1df08f-7d9f-f82a-cf6d-b9c8c1248071
