msgctxt "h8b7402d8gf4aag4e54gb09fgb95e486ed03a"
msgid "I'd hoped to get close to you, but I don't want to light you on fire."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 6f700de6-f4d9-72ab-95fa-8d4c1b734422
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:6f700de6-f4d9-72ab-95fa-8d4c1b734422
msgctxt "he7bbb384g1153g4517gba86g6561d8b43eea"
msgid "Really? Her?"
msgstr "정말? 그 여자가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 717991e7-8995-ec1b-a01e-149cf839f4ff
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:717991e7-8995-ec1b-a01e-149cf839f4ff
msgctxt "hbff46f8egfd4fg4a35g9263gcda92e5e8163"
msgid ""
"By the hells. Sex, my dear! Or whatever you can manage given your... "
"situation."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 717991e7-8995-ec1b-a01e-149cf839f4ff
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:717991e7-8995-ec1b-a01e-149cf839f4ff
msgctxt "h933c6728ga644g4185g8cbeg55d5cc34a27b"
msgid "By the hells. Sex, my dear. A night of passion."
msgstr "이런 세상에. 자기야, 섹스지. 열정의 밤 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 76d10d9f-fe07-ea51-aced-65c73aeadf0a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:76d10d9f-fe07-ea51-aced-65c73aeadf0a
msgctxt "ha5f2dd59g823dg413cgbc16gff0f7d8b0b1b"
msgid "Come on. There's a spark here. I know you've felt it too, darling."
msgstr "와봐. 우리 사이엔 불꽃이 있잖아. 너도 느낀 것 알고 있어, 자기야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 795470b3-c0fb-ded0-3fa5-56dc1b68c465
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:795470b3-c0fb-ded0-3fa5-56dc1b68c465
msgctxt "h749820a7ga6b2g44d2g9acdg0db91aeecb65"
msgid "There isn't. I haven't. And that's all there is to it."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 7a5f2fd6-bbb1-5af9-dbb2-1a680bbbd7e9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_DrowPartner(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:7a5f2fd6-bbb1-5af9-dbb2-1a680bbbd7e9
msgctxt "hbe56ed93g5ce9g4399g9b9dga43edcbf3f1c"
msgid "Does the drow know that? I saw how she looked at you earlier."
msgstr "네 드로우 친구도 그러려는 거 알아? 아까 너를 보는 눈빛이 어떤지 봤거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 7a7c1285-3ee9-b98a-e897-ac0247ffc46b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_HasPartner(1) = True
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_AstarionPartner(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:7a7c1285-3ee9-b98a-e897-ac0247ffc46b
msgctxt "h9c0265f5g3268g4806gb8c6geac2534c0344"
msgid "Cheeky little pup. I'll see you later."
msgstr "건방진 새끼 고양이 같으니. 좀 있다 만날게."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 7ca349e5-2219-f523-9ce4-9f2d3b890f62
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:7ca349e5-2219-f523-9ce4-9f2d3b890f62
msgctxt "hb0337b76g09dfg438cg8a80g9aa98e39cdd2"
msgid ""
"Be careful with that one. Her idea of a good time probably involves biting "
"your head off halfway through the act."
msgstr "그 사람은 조심하라고. 그녀가 생각하는 좋은 시간이란 건 아마 하는 와중에 네 머리를 물어뜯는 것일 테니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7d37417b-29c7-ba1d-215a-cbdf6795d9ed
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_State_DoubleDating(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:7d37417b-29c7-ba1d-215a-cbdf6795d9ed
msgctxt "he8986f3dg8c25g41d7gae61gb20f3b88762b"
msgid "Well, I'd planned to bed you..."
msgstr "그래, 널 침대로 데려갈 계획이었는데..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 7ef1692a-e48a-0ad6-ec42-d20a994415a0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:7ef1692a-e48a-0ad6-ec42-d20a994415a0
msgctxt "h08cb78a7gf0f2g4d7cga6e3g31cc5f26fa0d"
msgid "Are you now? Well, lucky her."
msgstr "오늘 한다고? 이거 그녀에겐 참 잘됐네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 7f59a5f1-fccc-5960-46a9-fee4e85e3bc6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:7f59a5f1-fccc-5960-46a9-fee4e85e3bc6
msgctxt "h9b597db2ge093g4a7egb9adg8962d5f2f13a"
msgid ""
"I just hope she leaves you in one piece. We can't take a tenday for you to "
"recover from whatever her idea of 'fun' is."
msgstr ""
"그녀가 네 사지를 멀쩡하게만 놔두길 바랄 뿐이야. 그녀가 '재미'를 보고 난 다음 네가 회복하는 걸 열흘 동안 기다릴 순 없잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 805c49e3-d2ee-e1fa-8488-5344ab7a3426
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - Approval_AtLeast_20_For_Sp2(0) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:805c49e3-d2ee-e1fa-8488-5344ab7a3426
msgctxt "h83793336gecafg44e1gaefdgd6a0e762323c"
msgid "So, has anyone in the camp caught your eye?"
msgstr "그런데, 이 야영지에서 네 눈길을 사로잡는 사람 있어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 81672d13-d12a-aba3-0a71-b3bcfe9d6b52
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_ForgingOfTheHeart_State_KarlachSecondUpgrade = True
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_State_DoubleDating(1) = True
#.      - ORI_State_DatingAstarion(1) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:81672d13-d12a-aba3-0a71-b3bcfe9d6b52
msgctxt "h113700f5gd5c0g4d67g808cgf25319bd919b"
msgid "Well, I'd had my heart set on bedding <i>you.</i>"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 82275048-ccc3-ebf8-10ae-0595bf2d2ec7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:82275048-ccc3-ebf8-10ae-0595bf2d2ec7
msgctxt "hcae7d04eg4a47g4e50g98dbg43f1372502a3"
msgid "I'm kidding. I'll see you tonight."
msgstr "농담이야. 오늘 밤에 보자고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 8498ebd6-e5da-5e75-b6bb-9259125651aa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:8498ebd6-e5da-5e75-b6bb-9259125651aa
msgctxt "hd56d1761gf72bg4862g9953g5ced6fe1ce32"
msgid "To victory!"
msgstr "승리를 위하여!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 87621bbd-da5f-a92c-266a-8f685d96b05e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_ShadowheartPartner(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:87621bbd-da5f-a92c-266a-8f685d96b05e
msgctxt "hf95a4b56g9963g4cc3g9266g5edbd2ff1e15"
msgid ""
"Although you're doing well enough on your own. I see you and Shadowheart "
"have a connection. It looks very sweet."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8bcbba53-78a0-27bf-f991-c428cbb83efe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:8bcbba53-78a0-27bf-f991-c428cbb83efe
msgctxt "hf71bd800g54d8g4690gbb43g998b73dec493"
msgid "Well done! I'll see you tonight."
msgstr "잘했어! 오늘밤 널 만나줄게."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 8d069579-9fe1-8782-79c2-e51d7dd2d3d6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - Approval_AtLeast_20_For_Sp2(0) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:8d069579-9fe1-8782-79c2-e51d7dd2d3d6
msgctxt "h8a4ef9d4g74c0g4c0cg92f5g24523072e2dc"
msgid "I'm flattered, but I think not. It's not you, you understand, it's me."
msgstr "제안은 기쁘지만, 그러지 않는 편이 좋겠어. 너 때문은 아니니, 이해해 줘. 나 때문이니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 926d9c53-568c-f34d-5fb1-c5dd6646f483
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_AstarionPartner(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:926d9c53-568c-f34d-5fb1-c5dd6646f483
msgctxt "h137d4d86g121ag422agb1a2gf7030d376187"
msgid "Not quite yet, love. Let's wait until they're asleep."
msgstr "아직은 너무 일러, 내 사랑. 녀석들이 잠들 때까지 기다리자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 93b90fff-4b9b-7b91-62c1-c84a167284da
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:93b90fff-4b9b-7b91-62c1-c84a167284da
msgctxt "h05647596g9c02g4c9dg96a5g419d5c1c9fe6"
msgid "To surviving another day."
msgstr "또 다른 하루를 살아남기 위해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 94b759bd-1b93-89a5-bb0e-a3096c156cb5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:94b759bd-1b93-89a5-bb0e-a3096c156cb5
msgctxt "h905ee7b4g86deg461bga271gc14141de14a6"
msgid "What?"
msgstr "뭐라고?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 960a390f-0bd6-ab4a-4d34-3cf381fc587e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_State_DoubleDating(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:960a390f-0bd6-ab4a-4d34-3cf381fc587e
msgctxt "h015a7933gad68g4f03g832cgf6b8488e3a86"
msgid "What would you like to happen?"
msgstr "무슨 일이 일어났으면 좋겠는데?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 971bf696-96e6-940b-19c4-db20f5ca60fb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - LAEZEL = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:971bf696-96e6-940b-19c4-db20f5ca60fb
msgctxt "hb25cfa78gb6ceg4c9agaaf7gf4cb87077706"
msgid "I'm tempted by Lae'zel."
msgstr "레이젤이 끌리는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9754de82-5773-5663-42f2-5fc7239a2100
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:9754de82-5773-5663-42f2-5fc7239a2100
msgctxt "h255c618dg6435g4677g817fg2bd7b9457abe"
msgid "I'm not ashamed. I just don't feel like boasting about it."
msgstr "부끄럽진 않아. 자랑할 기분은 아니라 그렇지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 98dce0e8-5184-8196-5393-57a483ed4f3b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:98dce0e8-5184-8196-5393-57a483ed4f3b
msgctxt "h8560fc2egd638g435bga9ccg3d1db2288e71"
msgid "And I wish I was drinking out of Cazador's skull. Life is tough."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 994495bd-ae76-ced8-581c-b9c20cd253ee
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_HasMet_Astarion(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:994495bd-ae76-ced8-581c-b9c20cd253ee
msgctxt "he17b15e1g70d5g4269ga1fdgd14b6096b44a"
msgid "Do you mind? I have a bottle to finish."
msgstr "잠깐 실례해도 될까? 아직 마시던 게 있어서."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 9b5dc3ae-fc08-a4b5-496b-fa43b444e5a8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_HasPartner(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:9b5dc3ae-fc08-a4b5-496b-fa43b444e5a8
msgctxt "h00bd8e31g2e7bg45feg90ffg88fa97f2d862"
msgid ""
"Please, don't count me out just because of your condition. I'm always up for "
"a challenge."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 9f06cf4f-2dc2-1bbc-e3ad-82bf1d52e871
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:9f06cf4f-2dc2-1bbc-e3ad-82bf1d52e871
msgctxt "h2c7f2e27gf59ag424agb463g704a31143c22"
msgid "I'll give you red."
msgstr "그럼 레드로 하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
