#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:a0670b46-5721-e96d-9210-dd105c5b3218
msgctxt "h6bce77fcg19aeg4a41gaabfg8d1570c255b0"
msgid "Interested in sharing a bed tonight?"
msgstr "나랑 하룻밤 같이 보낼 생각 없어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a1a52e09-aa23-2f33-6472-2ea3b5787bf2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_DrowCommander_State_Dead = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:a1a52e09-aa23-2f33-6472-2ea3b5787bf2
msgctxt "h86245402g0327g47bdg859eg14fdced3fec6"
msgid "I bet Minthara is fun."
msgstr "민타라는 흥미로울 것 같은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = a3a7f73b-0fbc-7e6d-9101-8f3997913d5c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_DrowPartner(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:a3a7f73b-0fbc-7e6d-9101-8f3997913d5c
msgctxt "h3198fb3eg8d98g4605g8e34gd88c10436771"
msgid ""
"Ha! No, my love, I'm not jealous of the drow. You have all the fun you want -"
" if you survive the night."
msgstr "하! 아니야, 자기, 드로우를 질투하는 게 아니야. 원하는 만큼 즐겨, 오늘 밤을 살아남는다면 말이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = a71f2279-bbc7-cc83-f156-aa624f83aaa7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_ShadowheartPartner(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:a71f2279-bbc7-cc83-f156-aa624f83aaa7
msgctxt "h221bbb9fge315g4a19gb518g3a7e37636263"
msgid "Does Shadowheart know that? I saw how she looked at you earlier."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = a7a6c8e6-bd1d-7b7c-6e38-489db45018aa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_HasPartner(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:a7a6c8e6-bd1d-7b7c-6e38-489db45018aa
msgctxt "h18adabf7g80c1g466ag991cgb1cd0799f967"
msgid "A bed and so much more."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a941011e-2c8e-e1aa-a24a-fc771a01250f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:a941011e-2c8e-e1aa-a24a-fc771a01250f
msgctxt "h6b178bb9g5a79g4b21gabf1gb25523b4789b"
msgid "To getting rid of this tadpole."
msgstr "올챙이 제거를 위해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = aa17b90b-ebc7-8f05-f0d9-c76c0c3c5c2f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:aa17b90b-ebc7-8f05-f0d9-c76c0c3c5c2f
msgctxt "h05ea31d0ge45fg415fgb982g5a3ebf4d0e5c"
msgid "Ha! No, it so rarely is. But it might be fun."
msgstr "하! 아무렴, 그럴 리 없지. 하지만 재미는 있겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = aab237b2-de10-0528-788f-8e4cedd43644
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:aab237b2-de10-0528-788f-8e4cedd43644
msgctxt "h019401a0gc8fag4b93g8cb3gb643b7dceaaa"
msgid "What are <i>you</i> drinking?"
msgstr "<i>넌</i> 뭘 마시는데?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = ac8675bb-fcc6-d8bb-de40-b351500ac519
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_HasPartner(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:ac8675bb-fcc6-d8bb-de40-b351500ac519
msgctxt "h34d8bedfgab6eg4831gaaa7g0eea9c64a769"
msgid "So. What happens next?"
msgstr "그럼. 다음은 어떻게 되지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = b1d53c35-72cd-6b36-e387-05a4e9b857b0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_AstarionRefused(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:b1d53c35-72cd-6b36-e387-05a4e9b857b0
msgctxt "h4bd79260g31fag41f8g8618g6490d285887e"
msgid "But have it your way. I'm happy to entertain myself."
msgstr "하지만 마음대로 해. 난 혼자서도 충분히 즐거우니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = b77b34e5-2bdf-9007-952a-f80810ce0d1b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:b77b34e5-2bdf-9007-952a-f80810ce0d1b
msgctxt "h14bac43egd5d2g4b98g9f28gaaaa60fdb236"
msgid "Ah, a good, full-bodied choice."
msgstr "아, 훌륭하고 풍미 있는 선택이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b9dfbd85-7e50-d97f-6097-144dd6e5b864
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_ForgingOfTheHeart_State_KarlachSecondUpgrade = False
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_State_DoubleDating(1) = True
#.      - ORI_State_DatingAstarion(1) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:b9dfbd85-7e50-d97f-6097-144dd6e5b864
msgctxt "h8b6946e9g8d00g4966g953bg286a8cba5d28"
msgid "I'd hoped to get close to you, but I don't want to light you on fire."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = bcc94818-e8ca-c7a8-2a4d-1769b395c6e7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:bcc94818-e8ca-c7a8-2a4d-1769b395c6e7
msgctxt "h9d750052gcca6g4d23gbd1fga63c54a273e6"
msgid "Here's to you!"
msgstr "너를 위해 건배!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = bdcc3e8d-74e5-cee3-2478-c04be5eacceb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:bdcc3e8d-74e5-cee3-2478-c04be5eacceb
msgctxt "ha44079bfgc311g4a00ga42dgdda2f3e29fee"
msgid ""
"Oh, a little talking, a little drinking, and - once everyone else is asleep -"
" we get to know each other."
msgstr "아, 얘기도 좀 하고, 술도 좀 마시고, 다른 사람들이 다 잠들면, 서로에 대해 알아가는 거지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bedd3fb3-4fe8-3a55-da88-45f47b2653db
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:bedd3fb3-4fe8-3a55-da88-45f47b2653db
msgctxt "hbaa45355gd1c4g4a14g9780g0366bf6863ba"
msgid "Beer, if you have it."
msgstr "맥주 있으면, 그걸로 줘."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = c12fd69c-36a5-1ec6-ff1f-41185bb0ba6a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:c12fd69c-36a5-1ec6-ff1f-41185bb0ba6a
msgctxt "h260ff2beg567fg48b2g849fg826df0b272b8"
msgid "You did what you had to. Don't be ashamed that you did it well."
msgstr "너는 해야 할 일을 한 거야. 네가 한 일을 부끄러워하지 말라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c2c43b9b-fc0e-0b38-e4a0-9fa19576088b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:c2c43b9b-fc0e-0b38-e4a0-9fa19576088b
msgctxt "h1cc630e5gcb01g439bgb24cgaf460a09c725"
msgid "On second thought, maybe we'd better not."
msgstr "다시 생각해 보니, 안 하는 게 낫겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = c2fc5d40-d1f0-b758-5bbd-7369dc13b130
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:c2fc5d40-d1f0-b758-5bbd-7369dc13b130
msgctxt "ha03da2e4g1dc7g4e0eg80e6g21b2768ed03f"
msgid "What's your poison? I have - ah."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c389c4c1-0832-69a6-9a2e-a60d32bf8606
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:c389c4c1-0832-69a6-9a2e-a60d32bf8606
msgctxt "h2196632bga754g49c2gb362g45bc1d1ce23b"
msgid "What do you mean?"
msgstr "무슨 뜻이야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = c51b6d96-60b7-26d4-d4e4-b1b77aa8407c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_State_DrowBetrayalOver = True
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_HasMet_AstarionAfterBetrayal(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:c51b6d96-60b7-26d4-d4e4-b1b77aa8407c
msgctxt "h4b005286g8850g4fa3ga0bcgff5754d6cd1d"
msgid "How about some rest? It's been quite an evening."
msgstr "휴식을 좀 취하는 건 어때? 꽤 긴 저녁이었잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = c6f201f3-67e5-4f38-4e35-331755cac716
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_AstarionRefused(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:c6f201f3-67e5-4f38-4e35-331755cac716
msgctxt "h8c3639c8g3a46g41c6g983fg2d3c65ae7995"
msgid "Well, you have fun. I'm more than happy with my cup anyway."
msgstr "그럼, 즐기라고. 아무튼 난 술잔이랑 더 좋은 시간을 보낼 거니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = c948d169-803b-e90c-3a7a-78cbd28f3b85
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_AstarionRefused(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:c948d169-803b-e90c-3a7a-78cbd28f3b85
msgctxt "hba697457ge21ag4598g9180gbea77adc5481"
msgid "Oh don't come crawling back. It's just embarrassing."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = cc7841ac-cf8e-8d37-29f0-a6467ad834ff
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:cc7841ac-cf8e-8d37-29f0-a6467ad834ff
msgctxt "h47ca8468ge2d3g4cfbg8940gf14b7eb16bac"
msgid ""
"I'm sure she is. If you can trust her not to bite your head off once you've "
"done the deed."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ccf1dca9-2a7f-bca6-0359-1b94e4141fb7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:ccf1dca9-2a7f-bca6-0359-1b94e4141fb7
msgctxt "hc75e83ddg95ceg4835g8225g1f3898b18c68"
msgid "Nothing."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cd5d854f-3906-ea1e-6431-5fa669384ee4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_DrowPartner(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:cd5d854f-3906-ea1e-6431-5fa669384ee4
msgctxt "h4e2405c1gafe9g45dbg9837ga00ea7d0d0f3"
msgid "Just so you know, I'm spending tonight with our drow host."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = ce179b35-8db6-9e5b-7a0a-b174f7d1488d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_LaezelPartner(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:ce179b35-8db6-9e5b-7a0a-b174f7d1488d
msgctxt "hc6e81a50ge712g401egb1c5gb370ae7ca990"
msgid ""
"Although you're doing well enough on your own. I see Lae'zel's marked you as "
"her territory."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = ce4dea2f-99fe-b54f-bf26-b8093828bfd3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:ce4dea2f-99fe-b54f-bf26-b8093828bfd3
msgctxt "h0e8c8576g753fg4c2cg96e8g024104dd2af8"
msgid "<i>Please.</i>"
msgstr "<i>제발.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = d07d340f-2358-b039-4c6e-1a8cd48cd7d7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:d07d340f-2358-b039-4c6e-1a8cd48cd7d7
msgctxt "h7e820919gc48bg48feg87b5g534d0052c303"
msgid "Ha! All right, to a mountain of corpses!"
msgstr "하! 알았어, 시체의 산더미를 위해!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d2ca65a7-7d25-f31b-902d-c26d8a136514
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:d2ca65a7-7d25-f31b-902d-c26d8a136514
msgctxt "h05d484e7gc78dg4d3cg9c56g33457a505fb4"
msgid "No, Astarion. It's not happening."
msgstr "아니, 아스타리온. 그럴 일은 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = d65275e7-0b8e-ed93-1ddf-09b27fab0eae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:d65275e7-0b8e-ed93-1ddf-09b27fab0eae
msgctxt "h9f521f5ag1f34g4fbfgb384gff84a8379c0e"
msgid ""
"I'd hate to get between the gith and her trophy. No, I think we'll end this "
"evening as friends."
msgstr "난 기스랑 그녀의 전리품 사이에 끼어들고 싶지 않아. 그래, 오늘 저녁은 친구 사이로 남자고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d65810a3-49f5-4269-e9b7-7aa982ea23f6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:d65810a3-49f5-4269-e9b7-7aa982ea23f6
msgctxt "h594083c0g60a0g4160g9e6cg7c7dd7203791"
msgid "Between us? Nothing."
msgstr "우리끼리? 잊어버려."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = da2ff909-d3cd-b4c6-463c-63602ead9778
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_ForgingOfTheHeart_State_KarlachSecondUpgrade = False
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_State_DoubleDating(1) = True
#.      - ORI_State_DatingAstarion(1) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:da2ff909-d3cd-b4c6-463c-63602ead9778
msgctxt "h119790eag8a1fg427cga50bgcca5d7e61feb"
msgid "I have to admit, I wish I could share a bed with you tonight."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = da3d6aa3-e3b0-ea5c-fe7d-71b6933074f8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:da3d6aa3-e3b0-ea5c-fe7d-71b6933074f8
msgctxt "h7a595ba7g3f13g4cc0g8dc5ge41c78d6352d"
msgid "Nothing? How can you be so cruel?"
msgstr "잊어버리라고? 어떻게 그리 잔인할 수가 있어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = de18b720-c3df-993d-2a65-a3a1143628ba
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_AstarionRefused(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:de18b720-c3df-993d-2a65-a3a1143628ba
msgctxt "h771e8273gad38g4685gb373g674a956c8850"
msgid "Fine. Enjoy your night with whatever goblin will have you."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = df7fcbaa-ba93-01ea-865e-955c4ea986f8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:df7fcbaa-ba93-01ea-865e-955c4ea986f8
msgctxt "h04145e31g5c1ag426bg98a2g6a400abbe5bf"
msgid "Your funeral."
msgstr "너만 손해지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = e14ec68a-98ee-db69-03d7-d0cfb7ce744b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_HasPartner(1) = True
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_AstarionPartner(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:e14ec68a-98ee-db69-03d7-d0cfb7ce744b
msgctxt "h57c02544g809ag46b1gb0dcgfe5e4151e14d"
msgid "Cheeky little pup. I'll see you later."
msgstr "건방진 새끼 고양이 같으니. 좀 있다 만날게."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e29210d2-ae0e-ae9b-b4fb-da9a0b340098
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:e29210d2-ae0e-ae9b-b4fb-da9a0b340098
msgctxt "hb2966e56gba47g425egbc88g97d5f5fbc650"
msgid "It was more a mountain of corpses than a pile..."
msgstr "시체가 한 더미라기보단 산더미였어..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e573fae4-4942-caf6-3145-b5d76b6e6118
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_LaezelPartner(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:e573fae4-4942-caf6-3145-b5d76b6e6118
msgctxt "h641f140fgc3dcg46a3g9069g04266c3d7fdf"
msgid "Just so you know, I'm spending tonight with Lae'zel."
msgstr "너도 알다시피, 난 레이젤이랑 하룻밤을 보낼 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e6edd559-4a69-b429-0b52-d91680621aca
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHADOWHEART = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:e6edd559-4a69-b429-0b52-d91680621aca
msgctxt "h69cbab3bgef1eg4c44g9c9cg62f1d9680ca6"
msgid "Shadowheart is looking very good tonight..."
msgstr "오늘 밤은 섀도하트가 아주 괜찮아 보여..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e84802f4-47e3-2eb8-85e3-71f7f27aec64
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_State_DoubleDating(1) = True
#.      - ORI_State_DatingAstarion(1) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:e84802f4-47e3-2eb8-85e3-71f7f27aec64
msgctxt "h5190bed8gb621g4db4g834cg73994b3c5a93"
msgid "Well, I'd planned to bed you..."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = ee76b08e-5886-424d-1232-095bc728558c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:ee76b08e-5886-424d-1232-095bc728558c
msgctxt "h0a1fccd3gb7aag4ce6g9cfbgd39602afe6a9"
msgid ""
"Good for you. As for me, I'm going to drink until I'm sure I won't hear you "
"grunting in the bushes."
msgstr "잘됐네. 나로선, 너희가 덤불 속에서 끙끙거리는 소리가 안 들릴 때까지 마셔야지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = ee99a33d-b34a-0417-9d14-618e987bc880
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:ee99a33d-b34a-0417-9d14-618e987bc880
msgctxt "h0390cce8gdbfbg41bcg9b09g41fce7bfe683"
msgid ""
"She does seem like a fun romp. As long as she doesn't bite your head off "
"halfway through the act."
msgstr "그 여자와는 재미있는 유희가 되겠군. 그녀가 도중에 네 머리를 물어뜯지 않는다면 말이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = efb09ea4-5e60-d635-8fb6-76b6e4ac0cc5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:efb09ea4-5e60-d635-8fb6-76b6e4ac0cc5
msgctxt "h7b3dbc0fgab20g48abg8be9g7853eb8bc731"
msgid "What's your poison? Red? White?"
msgstr "너의 독은 뭘로 고를래? 레드? 화이트?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f1882bb0-6fb0-3370-a08d-912bf0cfc481
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:f1882bb0-6fb0-3370-a08d-912bf0cfc481
msgctxt "h15d4c17bg8c38g4ee8g8cddgce203e4cb2b2"
msgid "Just water."
msgstr "그냥 물."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = f335ef57-5f25-5780-5daf-491f5c605fc3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:f335ef57-5f25-5780-5daf-491f5c605fc3
msgctxt "hdf0412cdgb157g4128g996cg501082f9d6fc"
msgid "Mmm. Delicious."
msgstr "음. 향긋하군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f3aba63c-4d09-2aa8-5ef4-a151c87d61a0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_State_DoubleDating(1) = True
#.      - ORI_State_DatingAstarion(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:f3aba63c-4d09-2aa8-5ef4-a151c87d61a0
msgctxt "heab0a1adg73ccg4e4agb6c1g32bc783dcabc"
msgid "Maybe. If you say 'please.'"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = f4748b76-6e61-51c3-18cc-24f0563d77cc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:f4748b76-6e61-51c3-18cc-24f0563d77cc
msgctxt "hd38ff5d9gd10bg4d72g8784gbc2f90580075"
msgid "Cheers."
msgstr "건배."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = f4f9f5d0-e29f-e77c-e32e-3102d83be353
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_AstarionRejected(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:f4f9f5d0-e29f-e77c-e32e-3102d83be353
msgctxt "hcc0f989ag687dg4bf1ga675gb078b1d9f5a5"
msgid ""
"Whatever makes you happy, I suppose. As long as you don't come scratching at "
"my door."
msgstr "네가 만족스럽다면 아무래도 상관 없겠지. 나중에 나한테 조르지만 않으면 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = f57378d1-b120-f1c1-d917-54c375e84b34
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:f57378d1-b120-f1c1-d917-54c375e84b34
msgctxt "had6a4a59g1fceg442cg9397g891480227635"
msgid "You are an insolent little pup, aren't you?"
msgstr "넌 아주 무례한 새끼 강아지구나, 안 그래?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f8d44751-7e75-72f8-acb9-ca98f9561144
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:f8d44751-7e75-72f8-acb9-ca98f9561144
msgctxt "h89fd46e3g2684g4c0cgb7fcgd2f1d535d62e"
msgid "What do you mean?"
msgstr "무슨 뜻이야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fc3bd5e3-be1e-c596-6315-96c39e5e3266
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_ForgingOfTheHeart_State_KarlachSecondUpgrade = True
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_State_DoubleDating(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:fc3bd5e3-be1e-c596-6315-96c39e5e3266
msgctxt "h3ddaa868g0e38g4907g9801g0c279c8db748"
msgid "Well, I'd planned to bed you..."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fd9cb160-481f-65f8-068c-6f16d707794a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Astarion:fd9cb160-481f-65f8-068c-6f16d707794a
msgctxt "h2ba25fb1ge6e8g43d8g8c0eg7d49c189321d"
msgid "I was thinking about you, actually."
msgstr "사실, 너를 생각하고 있었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 0c5f4a6c-e824-3a89-2fb0-88bef09aa37a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_Gale_Knows_Bomb = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Gale:0c5f4a6c-e824-3a89-2fb0-88bef09aa37a
msgctxt "h5be2a77eg400cg4397ga7cbga5e8f3b2fa55"
msgid ""
"Perhaps you'll understand me better when you know the truth of my condition."
msgstr "네가 내 상태를 진정으로 알고 나면, 날 더 잘 이해하게 될 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 0cb96dd1-7daf-e82a-5527-a557011d19eb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Gale:0cb96dd1-7daf-e82a-5527-a557011d19eb
msgctxt "h793530ffg9fe8g41b4g8414g3ba95fb83cac"
msgid "But at what cost?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 15a8fa04-4edd-a477-07a0-4a02cc83ff80
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Gale:15a8fa04-4edd-a477-07a0-4a02cc83ff80
msgctxt "hcee2637fg4835g4fb3g8f9eg39986e829d30"
msgid "I can see the answer in your eyes. And that's why I'm leaving."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 2bcefb6d-97f6-6b04-cb42-998c6e998e7b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_State_DrowBetrayalOver = True
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_HasMet_GaleAfterBetrayal(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Gale:2bcefb6d-97f6-6b04-cb42-998c6e998e7b
msgctxt "hc8770d3ag162ag4f32g913cgc2eaaf942581"
msgid "Go to sleep. If another knife awaits in the night, so be it."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2db384d3-6528-4bd7-483c-7027f0d6f18d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Gale:2db384d3-6528-4bd7-483c-7027f0d6f18d
msgctxt "hb6c8064bg2cabg4cb5gb2c5g856202e17977"
msgid "Quiet whining. You're killing the mood."
msgstr "그만 징징대. 네가 분위기를 망치고 있잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 3181443b-de0a-2014-3824-14648c5c70d3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_Gale_Knows_Bomb = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Gale:3181443b-de0a-2014-3824-14648c5c70d3
msgctxt "h31a65e38gb07bg439fg8b38g51f12ba61a44"
msgid ""
"I thought the orb to be the greatest of my sins, but I see now there are "
"darker depths to which I might yet sink. You may be content to sink into "
"that abyss, but I assure you - I am not."
msgstr ""
"난 그 보주가 나의 가장 큰 죄라고 생각했는데, 이제 보니 내가 더 어두운 아래로 가라앉을 수 있다는 걸 알겠어. 그런 심연에 가라앉는 "
"것에 너는 만족할지도 모르지만, 난 아니야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 36d8e2a6-6c87-80c1-c5dd-9a94d68b23e9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_Gale_Event_TookIdolAfterTieflingBetrayal = True
#.      - ORI_Gale_Event_ConsumeIdol = True
#.      - ORI_Gale_State_GotTwoMagicItems = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Gale:36d8e2a6-6c87-80c1-c5dd-9a94d68b23e9
msgctxt "he385160bgc18dg49b0ga4d9g407908d07094"
msgid "Yes. And I got you the Idol of Silvanus along the way."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 3b207be5-0374-88fa-27fb-7d16b30daff7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Gale:3b207be5-0374-88fa-27fb-7d16b30daff7
msgctxt "h19480fd6gc032g4df9g8eb1gbb67b3e017a6"
msgid "Precious little love lost between us, isn't there?"
msgstr "우리 사이에 그나마 조금 있던 사랑도 사라졌어, 안 그래?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 3d4e870b-4c23-4c9e-cac7-dc38b369d942
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Gale:3d4e870b-4c23-4c9e-cac7-dc38b369d942
msgctxt "h37b27eaag0513g4483gb456g55b7300fe5da"
msgid ""
"No - a night like this is unfit to bear witness to such a tale. It's unfit "
"for most things. Now please - permit me some peace amidst this vile revelry. "
"We'll speak, but another time. "
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 40164f48-a64f-7b8e-ee38-349fdf08241a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_DrowPartner(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Gale:40164f48-a64f-7b8e-ee38-349fdf08241a
msgctxt "h45ead9ccg72e0g464egb3dcg05e73c096f74"
msgid ""
"How does it feel to kill a woman still flush with the warmth of your body? "
"All par for the course for you, I suppose."
msgstr "아직 네 몸의 온기가 남아 있는 여자를 죽인 기분이 어때? 너에겐 일상이겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 46cebc0e-9ae0-0b56-659b-beec0864873b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Gale:46cebc0e-9ae0-0b56-659b-beec0864873b
msgctxt "hcb5c10aag0d8ag4b71gabe2gf8aea926b6aa"
msgid ""
"Two shadows are darkening my soul. The shadow within and the shadow without:"
msgstr "두 개의 어둠이 내 영혼을 어둡게 하고 있어. 내 안의 어둠 밖의 어둠:"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 53bd4b40-9e8b-924b-c31b-5741d85234a8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Gale:53bd4b40-9e8b-924b-c31b-5741d85234a8
msgctxt "h46cc772ag046eg49b3g9682g51efc5922ff2"
msgid ""
"What chances I have, I'll take them. I'd rather roll the dice than deliver "
"all this death."
msgstr "나에게 주어진 기회를 잡을 거야. 이런 학살을 할 바엔 차라리 도박을 하겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5429c9e9-a481-d0e5-2677-92697df008dd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Gale:5429c9e9-a481-d0e5-2677-92697df008dd
msgctxt "hbffbaca1g2386g44ccga150g27bfda9ebad8"
msgid "Go on then. There's no time like the present."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 584d02b8-94e2-c614-df43-c0f77065b812
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Gale:584d02b8-94e2-c614-df43-c0f77065b812
msgctxt "h6735e962g0259g4cc8gbb3cg596f1a96cd5a"
msgid "You make your own choices. Don't blame me for their outcomes."
msgstr "네가 스스로 선택한 일이야. 그 결과에 대해 날 비난하지 마."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 6a3d1f7d-a986-ef95-6b2c-c53b47feca8f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Event_GaleLeaves = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Gale:6a3d1f7d-a986-ef95-6b2c-c53b47feca8f
msgctxt "h71baea6egd91dg4e3eg805eg4e48b43690f7"
msgid "Farewell."
msgstr "잘 지내."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 6b31903b-55f0-fdb9-974c-02093c2500c4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_State_DrowBetrayalOver = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_HasMet_GaleAfterBetrayal(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Gale:6b31903b-55f0-fdb9-974c-02093c2500c4
msgctxt "hba0cc1a7ga163g4241ga211g4184bac81be8"
msgid ""
"Betrayed by a drow commander of the Absolute. How unexpected a turn of "
"events."
msgstr "절대자의 드로우 사령관에게 배신당하다니. 정말 예상치 못한 반전이군 그래."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 6c94731b-ded1-7596-6414-5bc3aa573f3f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Gale:6c94731b-ded1-7596-6414-5bc3aa573f3f
msgctxt "he01023b9g50beg4974ga608g57998b042336"
msgid ""
"You will. But not until then. Now please - I'd prefer to be alone with my "
"regrets. Enjoy these vile revelries, if that's your inclination. It "
"certainly isn't mine."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 76d66de9-7140-8ca9-7439-d86991b76846
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_Gale_Event_TookIdolAfterTieflingBetrayal = True
#.      - ORI_Gale_State_GotTwoMagicItems = False
#.      - ORI_Gale_Knows_NeedsMagicItems = True
#.   Object:
#.      - DEN_Thieflings_State_HasIdol(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Gale:76d66de9-7140-8ca9-7439-d86991b76846
msgctxt "h853b9370ga423g4413ga05fg0a650c3c1477"
msgid "Yes. And I got you the Idol of Silvanus along the way."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 77e83716-0509-c192-e2d9-76177ba71327
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Gale:77e83716-0509-c192-e2d9-76177ba71327
msgctxt "ha1f7ca28g2cb4g4fe5ga6f6g852b708564da"
msgid "At what cost? Are our lives truly worth so many others?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 7dc65253-d053-08bf-986b-75fb63abb434
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Gale:7dc65253-d053-08bf-986b-75fb63abb434
msgctxt "h2a487f9eg9760g4dbcg8993g016748c9499b"
msgid "You."
msgstr "너 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 8074daa5-9fd7-3d57-0ebc-2bb9daf78e4a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Gale:8074daa5-9fd7-3d57-0ebc-2bb9daf78e4a
msgctxt "hd382a384g6b63g46b7ga874gd6f7d441541d"
msgid "You led me down this path."
msgstr "네가 나를 이 길로 이끌었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8a67006b-b649-bb8f-0088-f63b58269ab0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Gale:8a67006b-b649-bb8f-0088-f63b58269ab0
msgctxt "h5d705030g5475g4f32gbf48g6fec021d84c8"
msgid "I'm sorry you feel that way."
msgstr "그렇게 생각한다니 미안하군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8f3de4ac-8bea-956d-dbf8-75c74aecd826
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 15
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Gale:8f3de4ac-8bea-956d-dbf8-75c74aecd826
msgctxt "hd8ce01ceg8f81g4feeg92e4g21a42061bc84"
msgid "You don't stand a chance alone. You're free to go. I dare you."
msgstr "너 혼자서는 가망이 없을 텐데. 가고 싶으면 어디 가 봐."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 93fa0e40-f70e-caf2-e3bc-1c431f3bd9ae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHunt_HasMet_Gale(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Gale:93fa0e40-f70e-caf2-e3bc-1c431f3bd9ae
msgctxt "h0c4fd2b4g5817g4365gafa4g2178ba2f09fb"
msgid ""
"This is the worst moment. When the screams of the dying have faded, and the "
"conquering hordes howl and yelp as they come to their vile climax."
msgstr "최악의 순간이군. 죽어가는 자들의 비명 소리가 사라지고, 정복자 무리가 사악한 절정에 이르러 울부짖고 고함을 지르는 순간이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 9e3df31d-82bd-d983-8264-96bbf47ce699
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Gale:9e3df31d-82bd-d983-8264-96bbf47ce699
msgctxt "h364a1c08gd045g464egb354g7c78e985b753"
msgid "Don't blame me for detesting them."
msgstr "내가 그 선택을 증오하게 됐다고 날 비난하지도 마."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a3b55ab7-7fea-b4f5-71de-7c06a3a6d19c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Gale:a3b55ab7-7fea-b4f5-71de-7c06a3a6d19c
msgctxt "hd747c750g1e3fg45e3g96fbgc4b72405b4b2"
msgid "They're the hands they always were. You've a knack for this."
msgstr "그들의 손은 그대로 남아있잖아. 너는 이 일에 재주를 터득했어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a6781c40-5099-6f9f-f375-68d2ac1c8e38
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Gale:a6781c40-5099-6f9f-f375-68d2ac1c8e38
msgctxt "had790950g4114g4ff0gaa24g7bb7a9f4305b"
msgid "Then leave."
msgstr "그럼 떠나."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = ac25da77-cb9d-22ee-4883-7ae5de496da0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Gale:ac25da77-cb9d-22ee-4883-7ae5de496da0
msgctxt "hebb42745gf248g4a7bgb88egfaf4d01b4cce"
msgid "Massacre. A spectacle of slaughter. And I participated."
msgstr "학살이자, 도살의 광경이지. 게다가 나도 가담했어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = b229d145-98fe-c27b-9477-70739127a6af
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Gale:b229d145-98fe-c27b-9477-70739127a6af
msgctxt "h2e0c0a34g9fbfg4f1bgabe3g3fa5268454df"
msgid ""
"What are these bloody stumps that used to be such delicate harpists of the "
"Weave?"
msgstr "우아한 위브 하피스트였던 이 피투성이 송장들은 뭐지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = be680188-9004-bf62-b27e-e3088d72d95d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Gale:be680188-9004-bf62-b27e-e3088d72d95d
msgctxt "hcdfa8ed7g37fbg4e2bg8f66g8b2fc4ad46bd"
msgid ""
"Yes. Yes, I suppose we do. Few things are more powerful than the will to "
"live."
msgstr "그래, 아무렴, 그런 것 같네. 살려는 의지보다 더 강력한 것은 찾아보기 힘들지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = c2c21e2c-5926-496a-1eb1-c60d4d7c6d5b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Gale:c2c21e2c-5926-496a-1eb1-c60d4d7c6d5b
msgctxt "h25b2dc20g5bcfg4444gaf38gcaa7855334da"
msgid "It's time to stop making excuses."
msgstr "용서를 구하는 건 그만둬."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c7db2b8c-1e99-203b-a2d4-3b30a4dc1260
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Gale:c7db2b8c-1e99-203b-a2d4-3b30a4dc1260
msgctxt "h10be5415gaab0g4a42g96c2g040ea985db22"
msgid "I guess I'll find out, when you're ready to tell me."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = c8c3aa42-3656-c2bf-f5cb-7da50ce807e2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Gale:c8c3aa42-3656-c2bf-f5cb-7da50ce807e2
msgctxt "h0edd8226g97e6g4706ga835gd0d90c80d867"
msgid ""
"Gods damn you - you're right. Few things are more powerful than the will to "
"live."
msgstr "망할, 네 말이 맞아. 살고자 하는 의지보다 더 강력한 것은 찾아보기 힘들지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = c95c5c80-ac8d-2da0-3962-ffb8dc55798d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_HasMet_Gale(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Gale:c95c5c80-ac8d-2da0-3962-ffb8dc55798d
msgctxt "h7b4cdcc4g6abag42a2gba85g80d07d28542f"
msgid "I've said my piece. Now let me dull my tongue with wine."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = d20e8b79-e229-54f1-0cfe-39f10ed5d347
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Gale:d20e8b79-e229-54f1-0cfe-39f10ed5d347
msgctxt "h7f44ca78gc3fag45f8gb73ega892a4b15961"
msgid "All the more blood."
msgstr "피만 더 채워졌지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = d31b5e38-0729-695d-06b7-4da3e1924130
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Gale:d31b5e38-0729-695d-06b7-4da3e1924130
msgctxt "h06a7b875ga628g46efg9b88g904315a45aff"
msgid "You really are absolutely heartless, aren't you?"
msgstr "넌 완전 비정한 자식이구나, 안 그래?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = d41e904c-271d-260a-91fb-1c63273377f1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Gale:d41e904c-271d-260a-91fb-1c63273377f1
msgctxt "hbc56c111g87cdg4cbegb491g7cfd91144e58"
msgid ""
"I don't know myself anymore. All this... It's not who I am. Around you, I'm "
"not who I want to be."
msgstr "더 이상 나 자신을 모르겠어. 이 모든 게... 내가 아니야. 네 곁에 있는 나는, 내가 되고 싶은 사람이 아니야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d8989b25-5352-2930-1a5a-95f6f2e12d07
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 15
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Gale:d8989b25-5352-2930-1a5a-95f6f2e12d07
msgctxt "h6df04744g5753g4fefgb2bag2cdec1fc08d8"
msgid "Stay. We make each other stronger. We make each other survive."
msgstr "남아줘. 우리는 서로를 더 강하게 만들고, 살아남게 해주잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = e7802f55-4775-2f4d-9d72-9a3e9fd23687
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Gale:e7802f55-4775-2f4d-9d72-9a3e9fd23687
msgctxt "h750120ecgb766g4582gb36eg6333db341c8f"
msgid "I should leave."
msgstr "나는 떠나야겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e84d808d-93cd-0d1e-cb61-19d59a09286a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Gale:e84d808d-93cd-0d1e-cb61-19d59a09286a
msgctxt "hf46176d1gb6e8g4068g8fc3g0bb3704a9672"
msgid "Perhaps we've gone too far, but what's done is done."
msgstr "우리가 선을 넘었을지 몰라도, 지나간 일을 되돌릴 순 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = f13f7bbe-924c-f25a-5a46-847cb321c571
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Gale:f13f7bbe-924c-f25a-5a46-847cb321c571
msgctxt "hf79d418bgaea7g461cga1cdg3c711e1a9492"
msgid ""
"But no matter. What's one more kill but a fitting coda to a day of carnage?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f3083078-d8b9-43ed-d588-9cd11182bf48
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Gale:f3083078-d8b9-43ed-d588-9cd11182bf48
msgctxt "h88fb5e49gb743g43f6gbf4dg5084de8c46c4"
msgid "You've seen your own true nature. Accept it."
msgstr "넌 자신의 본성을 찾았어. 받아들여."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = f9c06f21-6903-f671-fe97-1149b619e265
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Gale:f9c06f21-6903-f671-fe97-1149b619e265
msgctxt "h8a8865d2gc6bbg4540gb97eg915f4ea79f7c"
msgid "No!"
msgstr "안 돼!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = ff475268-c795-35ca-f722-c007ec7dddcd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Gale:ff475268-c795-35ca-f722-c007ec7dddcd
msgctxt "h0a6a5bd0g1e5dg4db5g977ag20ca4a2d9628"
msgid ""
"But carnage such as this... The shadow within is spreading like poison, "
"corrupting kindness and compassion."
msgstr "하지만 이런 대학살은... 내면의 어둠이 독처럼 퍼져서, 친절과 연민을 타락시키고 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 03cdc05a-18e9-3e11-5f5d-f0f677222451
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel:03cdc05a-18e9-3e11-5f5d-f0f677222451
msgctxt "h92fd0940g9e55g4976g8b0dgcab58d08b4d8"
msgid "Perhaps not."
msgstr "못할 수도 있고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 04712d16-3ef7-4853-7a9c-669c2714688f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_State_DrowBetrayalOver = True
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_HasMet_LaezelAfterBetrayal(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel:04712d16-3ef7-4853-7a9c-669c2714688f
msgctxt "he4a3135egdbb0g4829g9d43g8abb999bca02"
msgid "We must not forget this night. True allies are few."
msgstr "이 밤은 잊지 않도록 하자. 진정한 아군을 찾는 건 쉽지 않은 일이니."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 04877705-bf85-39d1-daf9-8c0d051e727b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel:04877705-bf85-39d1-daf9-8c0d051e727b
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h715aa826g40c6g4834gb337g5cc9493d0053"
msgid "I made my choice, Lae'zel."
msgstr "난 이미 선택했어, 레이젤."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 07aac76e-d96f-277a-72f6-b83c2ef95770
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_LaezelRefused(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel:07aac76e-d96f-277a-72f6-b83c2ef95770
msgctxt "hffcde2f6g077cg4c00ga04ag1aeaca12046d"
msgid "Celebrate now. Come dawn, we depart."
msgstr "지금은 축하를 나누자. 해가 밝으면, 떠나는 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 09d8b135-40fb-386e-85ce-f694f2e0496f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel:09d8b135-40fb-386e-85ce-f694f2e0496f
msgctxt "hb98b44a9g8d6fg44efga49fge94c91d7da4a"
msgid "Are you asking me for sex?"
msgstr "지금 나랑 섹스하자는 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 0d30c33b-9637-74ac-73c7-46df509220b3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_LaezelRefused(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel:0d30c33b-9637-74ac-73c7-46df509220b3
msgctxt "h11340c04g632dg4c05g91e9g3b3d9bb518a0"
msgid ""
"A loathsome hurdle. Watching you burn lit a fire in me I could not quench "
"alone."
msgstr "지긋지긋한 걸림돌이야. 네가 타는 모습을 보면서 내 안에 붙을 지폈고 혼자서는 그 불을 끌 수가 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 14e5bb30-ac63-6b16-8943-33414fead82c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_LaezelRefused(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel:14e5bb30-ac63-6b16-8943-33414fead82c
msgctxt "h3301f7b8gcfb4g452cga04cgf9a555ae231c"
msgid "I respect your error."
msgstr "네 실수를 존중하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 15965ef0-370f-fd67-4a57-3caa428be2f0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_GalePartner(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel:15965ef0-370f-fd67-4a57-3caa428be2f0
msgctxt "ha1afa004g440eg4cbag9362g7335c5ed186a"
msgid "A pity for us you have promised your night to Gale."
msgstr "네가 게일과 밤을 보내기로 했다니, 참 유감이군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 16459ca1-4c7c-d566-80e8-fa9493d00d2d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel:16459ca1-4c7c-d566-80e8-fa9493d00d2d
msgctxt "h50df8531gc9e4g4195g896bgdf3c141c4b37"
msgid "Bah - think if you must. The chance will pass come light of day."
msgstr "흥, 생각해봐도 상관없어. 날이 밝으면 기회는 사라질 테니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 172f4788-6814-4039-1274-c23ace9f1057
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_HasPartner(1) = False
#.      - Approval_AtLeast_20_For_Sp2(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel:172f4788-6814-4039-1274-c23ace9f1057
msgctxt "h280a9065g1992g4471gb508g59306c061961"
msgid "I smell their blood on you still. I smell your sweat."
msgstr "아직 네게서 그들의 피 냄새가 난다. 네 땀 냄새도 말이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 1c66b8a1-ad16-e46d-1e03-31d79e0b9b72
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel:1c66b8a1-ad16-e46d-1e03-31d79e0b9b72
msgctxt "h653f761cgfb58g493eg90d4g94b6069ab445"
msgid "Vlaakith demands of me no less."
msgstr "블라키스 님은 내게 많은 것들을 요구하시지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 233ca128-5971-53b5-9458-754f58aa1397
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ASTARIONCOMPANION = True
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_ShadowheartPartner(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_Celebration_LaezelChoseAstarion(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel:233ca128-5971-53b5-9458-754f58aa1397
msgctxt "hfa109d67g128dg460cgb1a7g5f241e49c7ed"
msgid ""
"There are, after all, other spreads before me. Astarion looks particularly "
"tempting tonight."
msgstr "결국 내겐 다른 선택지도 있잖아. 오늘 밤 아스타리온이 유난히 매혹적이네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 23936b1d-f4f2-d44b-18d8-030028558605
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel:23936b1d-f4f2-d44b-18d8-030028558605
msgctxt "h430ed6f1ga9f1g424dg971bg5c09f766ee9b"
msgid "Come morning, you will wonder."
msgstr "아침이 오면, 너는 궁금해질 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 23cd4583-480e-adcf-54bd-4e50d8139b1b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel:23cd4583-480e-adcf-54bd-4e50d8139b1b
msgctxt "h6586b1c2ga792g4c10g8023g8811b8eed20b"
msgid "But come morning, you will wonder."
msgstr "하지만 아침이 오면, 너는 궁금해질 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 23d24127-fb7d-4d3a-95b5-aa7c12ed0c0e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel:23d24127-fb7d-4d3a-95b5-aa7c12ed0c0e
msgctxt "hda0279d1g735ag4d78g9a23g6f6d981d4da4"
msgid "Oh, but do enjoy yourself this night. I intend to, myself."
msgstr "하지만 오늘 밤은 즐기도록 해. 나도 그렇게 할 거니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 25106c15-719e-b877-aae2-8d8c19a92e18
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_HasPartner(1) = True
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_LaezelPartner(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel:25106c15-719e-b877-aae2-8d8c19a92e18
msgctxt "h1e31c81ag8ab4g4b7eg9b69g2cda8867331c"
msgid "<i>Yes.</i>"
msgstr "<i>그래.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 29a634c5-27c8-c5c8-06d5-a95624e4233d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(1) = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_GITHYANKI
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel:29a634c5-27c8-c5c8-06d5-a95624e4233d
msgctxt "h49fdc4fdg72d1g41b4gbc3eg24879aabdbeb"
msgid "Yes. Let our pleasure honour Vlaakith."
msgstr "그래. 우리 환희로 블라키스 님께 영광을 돌리자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 29a634c5-27c8-c5c8-06d5-a95624e4233d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel:29a634c5-27c8-c5c8-06d5-a95624e4233d
msgctxt "h681a1863gad47g45c9g87ebgb9a71aecbb13"
msgid "Then taste it. I want you in my bed tonight."
msgstr "그럼 맛을 봐. 오늘 밤, 내 침대로 와."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 2a4f5282-bffc-a15e-c448-7e25a19f8bad
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_ShadowheartPartner(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel:2a4f5282-bffc-a15e-c448-7e25a19f8bad
msgctxt "h929a6e3cgeb41g46cfga52ag16b1445d331b"
msgid "A pity for us you have promised your night to the half-elf."
msgstr "네가 그 하프 엘프와 함께 밤을 보내기로 했다니, 유감이군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 2d679343-095e-8b92-503d-ea6eba4f7057
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_LaezelPartner(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel:2d679343-095e-8b92-503d-ea6eba4f7057
msgctxt "hffa54835gaa57g4f92gb11bg6e0a9f7b4e6e"
msgid "Soon. When you rest, I will come."
msgstr "곧. 네가 잠자리에 들면, 내가 찾아오겠다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 2efb428c-7eeb-7175-8fd4-a02cec07734b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel:2efb428c-7eeb-7175-8fd4-a02cec07734b
msgctxt "he16d9eb0ga073g4471gbde9gaf680bf798a9"
msgid ""
"You will wonder how my lips might have tasted, how my fingers on your skin "
"might have felt."
msgstr "내 입술의 맛이 어땠을지, 네 피부에 닿는 내 손가락의 느낌이 어땠을지 궁금할 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 2f5b5429-5478-0f11-d3ef-7d7f9ab794bb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel:2f5b5429-5478-0f11-d3ef-7d7f9ab794bb
msgctxt "hba5500e1g55beg4eecg8b13g9936516ef3ec"
msgid "For now."
msgstr "당분간은."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 320394fa-eae7-a3e8-41a1-fd3433e78f4e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel:320394fa-eae7-a3e8-41a1-fd3433e78f4e
msgctxt "h5473aee5g44bcg4fe2g9207g7d92fcef337f"
msgid ""
"A night such as this calls for flesh to feast on. And I have chosen the "
"sweetest."
msgstr "이런 밤에는 탐닉할 육신이 있어야 하는 법. 그리고 난 그중 가장 달콤한 것을 선택한 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 332f4195-1446-95d9-469a-014963c12a6c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel:332f4195-1446-95d9-469a-014963c12a6c
msgctxt "h61098381g39dag498ag9c3bg383d8222321c"
msgid ""
"I will do no such thing - not when you have turned your back on me so often."
msgstr "네가 그렇게 자주 내게 등을 돌리는데, 내가 그런 짓을 할 리가."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 35633831-12f5-8efe-070f-a464bf3d8c90
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel:35633831-12f5-8efe-070f-a464bf3d8c90
msgctxt "h55b2116dg21edg4c8fga0b4gf6e25efed97a"
msgid "I will have to seek relief elsewhere."
msgstr "다른 곳에서 도움을 구해야 할 것 같아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 367c070c-c9d4-a871-2595-a2dc4bde5e09
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_LaezelRejected(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel:367c070c-c9d4-a871-2595-a2dc4bde5e09
msgctxt "h54052479g9912g4793gb0c2g7af614589b34"
msgid "A pity for us both you've turned your back on me so often."
msgstr "네가 날 너무 많이 실망시켰다는 점이 유감스럽군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 3c27cdea-c201-5ff8-f500-fd0407433f3f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel:3c27cdea-c201-5ff8-f500-fd0407433f3f
msgctxt "h59da78faga5d1g4648ga5c6g28454a2b3c40"
msgid ""
"A lesson taught in flesh and bone this very night. Associate as you wish. "
"Avert your eyes at your peril."
msgstr "바로 오늘 밤 피와 뼈로 새겨진 교훈이지. 원하는 대로 어울려라. 다만 위협에서 눈을 돌리진 마라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 3d0b28c4-a558-d240-4f72-5b6353e83c6f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_LaezelRefused(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel:3d0b28c4-a558-d240-4f72-5b6353e83c6f
msgctxt "hbe3de238ge877g4fb7g8277gf92d9cac768c"
msgid "How torturous for us both that I'll never get a taste."
msgstr "내가 결코 맛볼 수 없다는 것이 우리 둘 다에게 얼마나 고통스러운지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 47e96a5a-5cdd-6e9e-bb25-2963cd311de2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel:47e96a5a-5cdd-6e9e-bb25-2963cd311de2
msgctxt "hc460a4eag142dg418ag8832g3452b0946f83"
msgid ""
"Yet they could not match your nerve today. It was enough to drive me to "
"madness."
msgstr "하지만 그들도 오늘 네가 보여준 용맹함에 비할 바는 되지 못한다. 그것은 나를 광기에 이르게 할 만큼 충분했어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 4c9ff40c-9740-97db-6545-698d1e540a6f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel:4c9ff40c-9740-97db-6545-698d1e540a6f
msgctxt "h9b770027g30b4g4056g985fg96a71243b311"
msgid "I've no doubt she will satisfy your tastes for endless conversation."
msgstr "그녀가 너의 끝없는 대화의 취향을 만족시킬 것이라 믿어 의심치 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4cb115d9-af03-5b3a-490e-02e2532d1639
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel:4cb115d9-af03-5b3a-490e-02e2532d1639
msgctxt "h0a88c480g76ebg4a24ga92eg1638255d0d6b"
msgid "You are a gifted warrior. It was pleasure enough to fight at your side."
msgstr "넌 타고난 전사야. 네 곁에서 싸운 것만으로도 기뻤어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4cb115d9-af03-5b3a-490e-02e2532d1639
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel:4cb115d9-af03-5b3a-490e-02e2532d1639
msgctxt "h5134ae31g64e4g4753gbe59g0b4d6d4f0dfd"
msgid "You are a gifted warrior. It was pleasure enough to fight at your side."
msgstr "넌 타고난 전사야. 네 곁에서 싸운 것만으로도 기뻤어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 4d9da004-e64c-ef5e-945f-60a7e940b21a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_DrowPartner(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel:4d9da004-e64c-ef5e-945f-60a7e940b21a
msgctxt "haffd09a1g5cebg42b0g82d8g93c0a825e1e8"
msgid "A lesson you might have heeded, had your flesh not been weak."
msgstr "네 육체가 약하지 않았더라면, 너는 그 교훈을 받아들였을지도 모른다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 50076644-a146-75d6-fd0e-b49898fec4cb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel:50076644-a146-75d6-fd0e-b49898fec4cb
msgctxt "hcfdcf9c4g0ce8g48eegb9ceg9f319471e27c"
msgid "There are, after all, other spreads before me."
msgstr "결국 내겐 다른 선택지도 있잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 5194a1b1-f2b6-6a22-de28-5a1afc928696
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel:5194a1b1-f2b6-6a22-de28-5a1afc928696
msgctxt "h016bd80cg6770g4b69g8d36g1adbd93bbb01"
msgid "One day, fortune may favour you."
msgstr "언젠가는, 행운이 네 편을 들어줄지도 모르지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 54006d0f-0b29-db46-486a-973ad4e5e739
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel:54006d0f-0b29-db46-486a-973ad4e5e739
msgctxt "h0082851bgf4f5g4998g8331g0d92551b6e8e"
msgid "I will take pleasure when I wish, and from whom I wish."
msgstr "난 내가 원할 때, 원하는 이와 즐길 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 5b76a9da-74b7-ae4f-d636-a2bac6f57448
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Laezel_Event_Act1RomanceAccept(1) = True
#.      - ORI_State_DatingLaezel(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel:5b76a9da-74b7-ae4f-d636-a2bac6f57448
msgctxt "h7dc969b4g1044g4d5ag93c0g71f19ce93c17"
msgid "A glorious reward for a glorious battle."
msgstr "영광스러운 전투에 대한 영광스러운 보상."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 650196d4-3a41-aed6-d071-0531a3b29b29
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_LaezelRefused(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel:650196d4-3a41-aed6-d071-0531a3b29b29
msgctxt "h5c609d76geea5g4f76g989dg056946227a6c"
msgid ""
"Go on, have your fun. And do not wipe away a single bead of sweat. It's "
"<i>intoxicating.</i>"
msgstr "계속 해, 즐겨. 그리고 단 한 방울의 땀도 닦지 마. 그건 <i>취하게</i> 하니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 66fa5624-6eac-7596-2ed6-6097dda75e4c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_HasPartner(1) = False
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_HasMet_Laezel(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel:66fa5624-6eac-7596-2ed6-6097dda75e4c
msgctxt "hc538b372g2f83g4976gb418gaff8c72feeac"
msgid "Mm. You have given in."
msgstr "음. 포기했군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 67270b00-f9c0-7587-0103-b4f1285f66b6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel:67270b00-f9c0-7587-0103-b4f1285f66b6
msgctxt "h9ddf48adgd41bg4995g85a1g95df9dbd4814"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 6c8de642-38ef-57aa-8157-b0375bab7ad7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_Astarion_Knows_Vampireness = True
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_AstarionPartner(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel:6c8de642-38ef-57aa-8157-b0375bab7ad7
msgctxt "h75fe3e9dg146cg497cgb084gd92af5329788"
msgid "A pity for us you have promised your body to Astarion."
msgstr "아스타리온에게 너의 몸을 약속했다니, 참 유감이군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 706b94d2-c609-0a34-9d7f-a37fdb8376e7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CAMP_ShadowheartLaezelFight_State_ResolvedPeacefully = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel:706b94d2-c609-0a34-9d7f-a37fdb8376e7
msgctxt "h8653ebcdg1617g4621ga801g27b3161772ab"
msgid ""
"Given our history, I can't believe you're asking. And I can't believe I'm "
"saying 'yes'..."
msgstr "우리의 지난 날들을 생각하면, 네가 원한다는 게 믿기지 않아. 그리고 내가 '그래'라고 말하는 것이 믿기지 않아..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 77b72d4c-7a61-01d5-7b95-577ee4853b0f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel:77b72d4c-7a61-01d5-7b95-577ee4853b0f
msgctxt "hc2b548b1g666eg44bdgb94eg446903b4f6bd"
msgid "Perhaps."
msgstr "그럴 수 있다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7e9f6460-3724-8303-7a91-ab3ab62d95f0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel:7e9f6460-3724-8303-7a91-ab3ab62d95f0
msgctxt "h3a06604fgab3dg4fb6g87c0g94ec3a8935b9"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 81fae5ef-9c6f-1629-27b9-d43032a020d0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_LaezelRefused(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel:81fae5ef-9c6f-1629-27b9-d43032a020d0
msgctxt "h92283c33gc620g47f6ga7a2g05a8c2cbb436"
msgid ""
"Too bad for us both your bunk will be quite busy. Take all the pleasures you "
"can, before dawn brings their end."
msgstr "우리 둘에겐 안타깝게도 너의 잠자리는 꽤 바쁠 거야. 새벽이 우리의 끝을 가져오기 전에 가능한 모든 즐거움을 누려봐."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 8495efc5-e5c5-a52d-a153-3c617c829077
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Laezel_Event_Act1Proposition(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel:8495efc5-e5c5-a52d-a153-3c617c829077
msgctxt "h32edac7eg1781g4c5egb689g7ff913d6f57f"
msgid "I smell their blood on you still. I smell your moisture."
msgstr "아직도 네게서 그들의 피 냄새가 나. 너의 축축함도 느껴져."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 87740522-b000-9d18-a3e5-32b8fd3540f6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel:87740522-b000-9d18-a3e5-32b8fd3540f6
msgctxt "h37c115bcg2d33g4dfdg80bbg0c7611df0744"
msgid "I've no doubt he will satisfy your tastes for endless conversation."
msgstr "그가 너의 끝없는 대화의 취향을 만족시킬 것이라 믿어 의심치 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 894af15c-2882-22d3-437d-51471d65733b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel:894af15c-2882-22d3-437d-51471d65733b
msgctxt "h8bef1b1agf7b7g4493gb38cg22872be17aee"
msgid "I will not go long without pleasure."
msgstr "나는 즐거움이 없으면 오래 가지 못할 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 962fcbb9-4885-62f7-5fd5-96d3b2548400
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel:962fcbb9-4885-62f7-5fd5-96d3b2548400
msgctxt "h997e139fg76cdg4922g811ege3ec0f13b843"
msgid "If only you'd earned the right to lay at my side."
msgstr "네가 내 침대 옆자리에 누울 자격이 없다는 점이 아쉽군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 9c1ba5e6-15a4-79ea-33c0-bd5f726a0b81
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHunt_HasMet_Laezel(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel:9c1ba5e6-15a4-79ea-33c0-bd5f726a0b81
msgctxt "h05f4e42bg27a3g48e9gaf5dg31826d7788c4"
msgid ""
"I have seen the <i>kith'raki</i> tear a screaming neogi's legs from its "
"belly to fashion into blades."
msgstr "난 <i>키스락</i>들이 비명 지르는 네오기의 다리를 찢어내 검으로 사용하는 모습을 본 적도 있다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = a105a191-bd44-9ec4-ff6b-16890a42b78b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel:a105a191-bd44-9ec4-ff6b-16890a42b78b
msgctxt "h45ab9446g1d14g41f0gab86g7c0049fb4412"
msgid "Vlaakith demands of me no less."
msgstr "블라키스 님은 내게 많은 것들을 요구하시지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a36aad56-e2bd-9e03-bc32-a9bff5f9888d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel:a36aad56-e2bd-9e03-bc32-a9bff5f9888d
msgctxt "hed184b34gd344g44f8ga42fg053f8194cc6a"
msgid "Yes, I <i>must</i> have you tonight."
msgstr "그래, 오늘밤 난 <i>반드시</i> 너를 가질거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = a656ba7d-04ef-205d-1b6d-f4eafb57572e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel:a656ba7d-04ef-205d-1b6d-f4eafb57572e
msgctxt "h0cb1b8aag8dddg458eg84afg206c3aaba11f"
msgid "I hope for your sake he doesn't come too near your neck."
msgstr "널 위해서 그가 네 목 근처에는 너무 가까이 가지 않기를 바라지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = a6a57346-f861-70f7-ef5d-7578629024eb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel:a6a57346-f861-70f7-ef5d-7578629024eb
msgctxt "h53c9a017gf649g406eg9263g33d26653bd27"
msgid "You know the fortune of my company."
msgstr "내 동료의 운명을 알고 있잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = a7c86e12-b863-5a0c-5364-1683afee977c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_HasPartner(1) = True
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_HasMet_Laezel(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel:a7c86e12-b863-5a0c-5364-1683afee977c
msgctxt "h6b51bedag7141g4053g856dg99752229c14d"
msgid "To think you might have known paradise."
msgstr "네가 낙원을 알게 됐을지도."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a7cdd870-efa6-33a5-81bf-7252b5b6dcf8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel:a7cdd870-efa6-33a5-81bf-7252b5b6dcf8
msgctxt "hc8a421d6g8c0ag4735g81aegfd05c45c5418"
msgid "No, I'm sorry. I don't see you as an intimate partner."
msgstr "아니, 미안해. 너와 그 정도로 친밀한 관계가 되고 싶진 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = aa7389da-f5e3-2ece-75d2-a8bd5ac25847
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_State_DoubleDating(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel:aa7389da-f5e3-2ece-75d2-a8bd5ac25847
msgctxt "h194627e8gaebfg4b26g9492g335a1376bfcd"
msgid "I smell their blood on you still. I'd have liked to have tasted it."
msgstr "아직도 너에게 그들의 피 냄새가 나. 그걸 맛보고 싶어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = aa9e338d-13dc-6bd9-f9f6-2e3b602a8ab0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel:aa9e338d-13dc-6bd9-f9f6-2e3b602a8ab0
msgctxt "hd2726ec9g8fa7g4143gbcc2gd1d2d2f0b0cd"
msgid "When you lie down for the night, I will come."
msgstr "오늘 밤 잠자리에 들면, 내가 찾아오겠다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = af745643-b612-a265-1c7b-b455e2053277
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel:af745643-b612-a265-1c7b-b455e2053277
msgctxt "h0eed64ddg8399g40e2g8856gd4a6a93e68ba"
msgid ""
"Another fortune yet stands before you. A warrior's flesh, rarely tasted."
msgstr "네 앞에 또 다른 운명이 있다. 전사의 육체, 좀처럼 맛볼 수 없는."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b31225ed-375b-df59-aad0-e026eaa68c01
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_ForgingOfTheHeart_State_KarlachSecondUpgrade = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel:b31225ed-375b-df59-aad0-e026eaa68c01
msgctxt "hab41fcafg881eg492ag898bge0629288e817"
msgid ""
"I'd love nothing more, but I'm afraid I can't touch anyone until my engine "
"is fixed."
msgstr "더 이상 바랄 게 없지만, 내 엔진이 수리될 때까지는 아무도 만질 수 없을 것 같아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b48e4956-5fa5-b272-88c8-18306616e2fe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel:b48e4956-5fa5-b272-88c8-18306616e2fe
msgctxt "h61d3bc85g0432g4640g9db5g5f07448ac2d4"
msgid "That's fine - I'm not interested anyway."
msgstr "괜찮아. 어차피 관심도 없는걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = b8aab1ee-c03d-d9e0-b85c-f217a24d9129
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel:b8aab1ee-c03d-d9e0-b85c-f217a24d9129
msgctxt "h3b5141c7gcbe3g4ef6g8b2fgd2202ce1b3bb"
msgid "Mm - if only I might lay claim to my proper trophy."
msgstr "음, 제대로 된 전리품을 차지할 수만 있으면 좋겠네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = b8b87974-f197-21dd-e50e-abece89df28a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel:b8b87974-f197-21dd-e50e-abece89df28a
msgctxt "h0564c144g5cc4g4a29gb5fega9071b0cd680"
msgid "Celebrate now. Come dawn, we depart."
msgstr "지금은 축하를 나누자. 해가 밝으면, 떠나는 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = bc88c9dd-d66e-938c-9eb1-82625f5dcfc9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ASTARIONCOMPANION = True
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_ShadowheartPartner(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_Celebration_LaezelChoseAstarion(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel:bc88c9dd-d66e-938c-9eb1-82625f5dcfc9
msgctxt "h13d5aad2gf391g4698gbaeega3fe270e1771"
msgid ""
"I will take pleasure when I wish, and from whom I wish. Astarion looks "
"particularly tempting tonight."
msgstr "난 내가 원할 때, 원하는 이와 즐길 것이다. 오늘 밤은 아스타리온이 특히 매력적으로 보이는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c1f1b581-33c8-f4af-3a1d-9bbc0c91b3a0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_ForgingOfTheHeart_State_KarlachSecondUpgrade = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel:c1f1b581-33c8-f4af-3a1d-9bbc0c91b3a0
msgctxt "h1f1616acg94e9g4f16gafafg6e2ee41ebd44"
msgid "I'd love to share my bed with you tonight."
msgstr "오늘 밤 내 침대를 너와 함께 나누고 싶어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c36837ee-be17-d7f1-0810-e5f68292eaa1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel:c36837ee-be17-d7f1-0810-e5f68292eaa1
msgctxt "h9bdb7646g6f57g470dgbbddgc9eea5448483"
msgid "I can hardly believe my own words, but - perhaps another night?"
msgstr "내 말을 믿을 수 없지만, 어쩌면 다음 밤이 될까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c36837ee-be17-d7f1-0810-e5f68292eaa1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel:c36837ee-be17-d7f1-0810-e5f68292eaa1
msgctxt "hfde8dc39g0461g4e88gb96eg5696de8e9e5c"
msgid "Maybe another night? It could be sweeter for waiting."
msgstr "다음 날 밤은 어때? 기다리고 나면 더 달콤할 수도 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = c7788257-036c-d176-99e6-3db786919519
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel:c7788257-036c-d176-99e6-3db786919519
msgctxt "h8f1456beg540ag4d1eg808dgfbfa658a1559"
msgid "So you say."
msgstr "그게 네 생각이군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = c8586d28-6057-3d23-fc0f-9d6d25a5e659
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel:c8586d28-6057-3d23-fc0f-9d6d25a5e659
msgctxt "hd1b8ca16g1a1eg4d2cga467g0d0cb6613bd0"
msgid "And I <i>will</i> take what is mine."
msgstr "그리고 난, <i>반드시</i> 내 것을 가져갈 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = c9fdfcc8-c5d4-4c6d-5b21-e79d1ed69ebd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_DrowPartner(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel:c9fdfcc8-c5d4-4c6d-5b21-e79d1ed69ebd
msgctxt "hf0a6b097g35abg4c5cgb83dg7f5a285f392f"
msgid "A pity for us you have promised your night to the drow."
msgstr "네가 그 드로우와 함께 밤을 보내기로 했다니, 유감이군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = d1dd40db-612e-dd30-4f9f-074ec08442df
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel:d1dd40db-612e-dd30-4f9f-074ec08442df
msgctxt "ha3e3d308gb761g48adg89b3g74629dd7e0e9"
msgid "Yes."
msgstr "그래."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d55b9b62-8152-9746-e9ef-13bfc4678b8a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel:d55b9b62-8152-9746-e9ef-13bfc4678b8a
msgctxt "h6224a54egc462g4b11g9111g2d13e938b81f"
msgid "You are a gifted warrior. It was pleasure enough to fight at your side."
msgstr "넌 타고난 전사야. 네 곁에서 싸운 것만으로도 기뻤어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = d711e64e-3d0d-4e74-8e73-79ee2842c846
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_LaezelRejected(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel:d711e64e-3d0d-4e74-8e73-79ee2842c846
msgctxt "h64b6d66dgec89g415cga058g9e4d9458e1f4"
msgid "Celebrate now. Come dawn, we depart."
msgstr "지금은 축하를 나누자. 해가 밝으면, 떠나는 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = d75b1348-76da-5077-d523-8046c02290ae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ASTARIONPARTY = True
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_ShadowheartPartner(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_Celebration_LaezelChoseAstarion(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel:d75b1348-76da-5077-d523-8046c02290ae
msgctxt "he83e913agd064g4befga25cg3c372ccb656e"
msgid ""
"Oh, but do enjoy yourself this night. I intend to, myself. Astarion looks "
"particularly tempting."
msgstr "하지만 오늘 밤은 즐기도록 해. 나도 그렇게 할 거니까. 아스타리온이 특히 매력적으로 보이는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d793916b-cd3c-6cfb-4c37-a126816a3555
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel:d793916b-cd3c-6cfb-4c37-a126816a3555
msgctxt "h6633fdeagb7d5g4e30ga05bgfb8baac68295"
msgid ""
"Of all people, you set your sights on <i>me</i>? I'll have to think about it."
msgstr "여러 사람중에 유독, <i>나를</i> 눈여겨 봤던거야? 생각해봐야겠네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d793916b-cd3c-6cfb-4c37-a126816a3555
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel:d793916b-cd3c-6cfb-4c37-a126816a3555
msgctxt "h0d1360e9gfc89g4986gac72g1c3f51de5333"
msgid "I'll think about it."
msgstr "생각해 볼게."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = e2c55580-02c9-a894-03da-402ad8c5ed79
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel:e2c55580-02c9-a894-03da-402ad8c5ed79
msgctxt "h4657b9cdg9841g45f9g8aa1gbd573575fa6f"
msgid "Associate as you wish. Indulge yourself at your own peril."
msgstr "하고 싶은 대로 어울려라. 스스로의 위험을 감수하고 탐닉하라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e386a186-8ed1-0aab-6fe3-d6ff184b84b1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_HasPartner(1) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel:e386a186-8ed1-0aab-6fe3-d6ff184b84b1
msgctxt "h1c297945g74e5g42d1g8d70gcdab4cc89498"
msgid ""
"Strange at seems with all that's happened between us, you might still "
"persuade me to your bed."
msgstr "우리 사이에서 일어난 일들을 생각해보면 이상하지만, 너는 여전히 너의 침대로 날 유혹할 수 있을 것 같아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e386a186-8ed1-0aab-6fe3-d6ff184b84b1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_HasPartner(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel:e386a186-8ed1-0aab-6fe3-d6ff184b84b1
msgctxt "h9e319423gbe1dg4281g955bg629b07508bb4"
msgid "You might still persuade me to share the night with you instead."
msgstr "나에게 대신 너와 함께 밤을 보내라고 설득할 수도 있잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e6ad57f8-9db1-a0cc-047e-320c6512ad60
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel:e6ad57f8-9db1-a0cc-047e-320c6512ad60
msgctxt "he0da30a7g768cg48dbga516gbe19c9e389ab"
msgid "A pity indeed. Maybe we can make amends some other night?"
msgstr "실로 유감이지. 혹시 다음날 밤에 만회할 수 있을까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = ee121984-8ce3-9642-1755-95d1b92fc06e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_State_DrowBetrayalOver = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_HasMet_LaezelAfterBetrayal(1) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_GITHYANKI
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel:ee121984-8ce3-9642-1755-95d1b92fc06e
msgctxt "h3a886870gea14g42adgb558gca92589506f7"
msgid ""
"'Turn your back not to your ally, lest you would see it pierced.' So "
"Vlaakith has taught us."
msgstr "'아군에게 등을 돌리지 말라, 그렇지 않으면 등을 꿰뚫리게 될지니.' 블라키스 님의 가르침이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = ee121984-8ce3-9642-1755-95d1b92fc06e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_State_DrowBetrayalOver = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_HasMet_LaezelAfterBetrayal(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel:ee121984-8ce3-9642-1755-95d1b92fc06e
msgctxt "h45c0b062g6ae2g4079ga5fbg4ec764925210"
msgid ""
"'Turn your back not to your ally, lest you would see it pierced.' A "
"githyanki dictum."
msgstr "'아군에게 등을 돌리지 말라, 그렇지 않으면 등을 꿰뚫리게 될지니.' 기스양키의 격언이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = f74b273b-1cb1-8e9c-ff33-c7affec5bcc3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel:f74b273b-1cb1-8e9c-ff33-c7affec5bcc3
msgctxt "hd0039dbfgda9fg48c8g8f7fg6dbda3f2711d"
msgid "I mean to taste it."
msgstr "그걸 맛보고 싶다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = f7dfcd78-3edf-2ab0-92e7-4492e866f8bb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Laezel:f7dfcd78-3edf-2ab0-92e7-4492e866f8bb
msgctxt "h05b102e7g7282g4a66gbe05g494b6a364a4f"
msgid "Sex."
msgstr "섹스."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 007c7d3f-3e75-e95c-c12f-12610e266aa8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_ShadowheartRejected(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:007c7d3f-3e75-e95c-c12f-12610e266aa8
msgctxt "hdce4b03bg3cb7g40a7gad8aga68d8d6b7ba8"
msgid ""
"In fact, I prefer the wine to your blind stabs at mockery. Get away from me."
msgstr "너랑 이러고 있을 바에 술이나 마시지. 빨리 사라져."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 050daa0f-f69e-cc52-a512-a84a316e747a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:050daa0f-f69e-cc52-a512-a84a316e747a
msgctxt "h7eed9ffbg7f71g4ccega632g8d4f4f9032f4"
msgid "I'm surprised she hasn't dragged you off to rut already."
msgstr "그녀가 널 아직 수렁에 빠뜨리지 않았다는 게 놀랍네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 06ca323f-550c-c332-c9f9-42de8ad6a184
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ShadowHeart_InParty_Knows_SharWorshipper = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:06ca323f-550c-c332-c9f9-42de8ad6a184
msgctxt "h03801205g886fg481bgbc0cg31d56a6ee43b"
msgid "I serve the Lady of Loss. We stripped those tieflings of hope itself."
msgstr "난 상실의 여인을 섬겨. 우린 그 티플링들의 희망 자체를 벗겨버린 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 093e4538-0de1-ffc8-b369-c25f91a76ca9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:093e4538-0de1-ffc8-b369-c25f91a76ca9
msgctxt "h13e9a5e3g3442g4ba1g9199g9f16f39ade23"
msgid ""
"Maybe if I down enough of this swill, it'll pickle the worm in my skull."
msgstr "이렇게 들이붓다 보면 머릿속 벌레 자식이 절여져서 죽을지도 모르지 ."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 0b4c5398-b853-34f2-8ffe-930049f384ca
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_ShadowheartRejected(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:0b4c5398-b853-34f2-8ffe-930049f384ca
msgctxt "h32a24fe2gf629g40cdg92b2g03b33ce9338e"
msgid "Get a girl's hopes up, why don't you? I need another bottle."
msgstr "여자의 기분을 좀 달래주는 건 어때? 한 병 더 마셔야겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 0c884e47-8268-b66d-d79a-67b4d311740a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:0c884e47-8268-b66d-d79a-67b4d311740a
msgctxt "heb63251eg665bg4637gb68fg82cdd827707a"
msgid "We set a pack of refugees on fire. A child could have done it."
msgstr "난민 무리한테 불 지른 게 다잖아. 이런건 애들도 할 줄 알아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 167b8ae6-0b69-2599-ca7c-c49f89037a49
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:167b8ae6-0b69-2599-ca7c-c49f89037a49
msgctxt "h1d1f9c0bg5723g434fgad2bg3bb50b3f68d8"
msgid "But I appreciate the thought."
msgstr "하지만 생각은 고마워."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 1b7cf718-21a6-e609-d74b-d9c47840646b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_HasPartner(1) = True
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_HasMet_Shadowheart(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:1b7cf718-21a6-e609-d74b-d9c47840646b
msgctxt "h9aa4e111g5608g4c4dg9907g644c96e09c74"
msgid "Shouldn't you be in someone else's bedroll by now?"
msgstr "다른 사람이랑 침대에 함께 있어야 하는 거 아니야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 1f03d0aa-4bac-f9fb-82f2-0c8d7cb75411
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:1f03d0aa-4bac-f9fb-82f2-0c8d7cb75411
msgctxt "hdeb39826g3d19g4a86g94bdg9521e060c242"
msgid "He does seem like the decadent type."
msgstr "퇴폐적인 유형처럼 보이긴 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 26c4fd65-9140-cc18-3895-c76065e8c245
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:26c4fd65-9140-cc18-3895-c76065e8c245
msgctxt "hbd5424afgd3dfg4cd2g9c33g2876389b5d9e"
msgid "Unless you meant to raise my spirits by other means?"
msgstr "아니면 다른 걸로 나 기분 풀어주려고 했던 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 2ec973ca-6ac2-4d0f-c6dd-c245e18f7d4c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:2ec973ca-6ac2-4d0f-c6dd-c245e18f7d4c
msgctxt "h04e27696ga7a5g4d59gb200gbb9ee46615ec"
msgid "The goblins stole good wine. It goes straight to the head."
msgstr "고블린이 술을 좋은 걸로 훔쳤네. 느낌이 바로 와."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 2f8118c9-9c6a-6a67-6565-4cef5ecb4f6e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_State_DrowBetrayalOver = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_HasMet_ShadowheartAfterBetrayal(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:2f8118c9-9c6a-6a67-6565-4cef5ecb4f6e
msgctxt "h90a64d8eg6641g4178g84bcg7384306f0ab4"
msgid "You sure know how to keep a party interesting."
msgstr "넌 확실히 파티를 흥미롭게 하는 데 능숙하구나."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 3412c7d8-c668-de8e-bc44-a7cf568f043b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:3412c7d8-c668-de8e-bc44-a7cf568f043b
msgctxt "h08ff51d8gbbaag4e19g9998ga76c1ab2535b"
msgid ""
"*But now an ill, twisting feeling lingers in her gut. One that has nothing "
"to do with the wine.*"
msgstr "*하지만 그녀의 뱃속에는 이제 불쾌하고 뒤틀린 느낌이 남아있습니다. 포도주의 영향은 전혀 아닙니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 367ab6e6-005a-17e2-b64e-9a072255631a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:367ab6e6-005a-17e2-b64e-9a072255631a
msgctxt "ha6476d79gde8eg4757g85abg5e6dc2d4eeaa"
msgid "But that... doesn't sound half bad."
msgstr "근데 그거... 그렇게 나쁠 것 같진 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 39c1d419-1fee-38e0-2b57-41515b869681
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_LaezelPartner(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:39c1d419-1fee-38e0-2b57-41515b869681
msgctxt "h27783584g0575g47a0ga86age42ec863d986"
msgid "And you're carousing with Lae'zel."
msgstr "그리고 넌 레이젤과 웃고 떠들고 있고 있지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3c739fd2-799a-ce78-2baa-5d60f2c756a2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:3c739fd2-799a-ce78-2baa-5d60f2c756a2
msgctxt "h5f921385g903cg4d59ga268g01f0ec53d20a"
msgid "Aren't you excited? We won."
msgstr "신나지 않아? 우리가 이겼잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 4044b285-5e47-6d84-4a14-a725e9e37cdf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:4044b285-5e47-6d84-4a14-a725e9e37cdf
msgctxt "h17f18627ge8d5g46a4g882cg20115e77647b"
msgid "Maybe... but I know better than to share my bed drunk."
msgstr "글쎄... 근데 나도 취한 채로 누구랑 자면 안 되는 건 알고 있거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 407b6566-5cc6-ae47-2349-9a4413fb47e9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_ShadowheartMindRead(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:407b6566-5cc6-ae47-2349-9a4413fb47e9
msgctxt "h608c9476gfa1dg41e2g8b2eg702ea7aa12ca"
msgid "<i>Why did killing those tieflings make me feel sick?</i>"
msgstr "<i>어째서 그 티플링들을 죽인 일이 날 이렇게 힘들게 하지? </i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 43d9ce09-e0da-3553-3582-b307dd432b13
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
