msgctxt "hc0672150gd0cdg46d9g88e8g440513a9258a"
msgid "I prefer to keep a few things secret. It's old habit."
msgstr "몇 가지는 비밀로 유지하고 싶어. 오래된 습관이거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntRaiderCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
