msgctxt "he0607d96g0953g4795gb644g9de98b08ebdb"
msgid ""
"Ha! No, my love, you and Shadowheart can get up to whatever you want. It "
"means nothing to me."
msgstr "하! 질투라니, 자기야. 섀도하트랑 하고 싶은 건 뭘 해도 돼. 나에겐 상관없는 일이니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 9d44c5f9-a487-3788-bfad-a1ee20dc2c13
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
