msgctxt "h54021c0cgba7cg4e05g9f86gb8632bad28d4"
msgid ""
"Ha! No. If he had an incubus instead of that cambion? That might be a "
"different story."
msgstr "하! 그건 아니야. 만약 그에게 캠비온이 아닌 인큐버스가 있었더라면? 그럼 얘기가 달라졌겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = cd3e21f5-54fd-c7ea-b0e5-5580de9df482
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
