#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Astarion:cd3e21f5-54fd-c7ea-b0e5-5580de9df482
msgctxt "h3dbf1b37g9c94g4044g81dcge33f91e91c0e"
msgid "But have it your way. I'm happy to entertain myself."
msgstr "하지만 마음대로 해. 난 혼자서도 충분히 즐거우니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = ceb4c4fa-0957-ccec-93e4-5c0ef201e125
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_LaezelPartner(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Astarion:ceb4c4fa-0957-ccec-93e4-5c0ef201e125
msgctxt "h344cf4d3gb414g496fgba06g84564ba4328d"
msgid ""
"Ha! No, my love, I'm not jealous of the beating our gith friend will give "
"you."
msgstr "하! 그렇지 않아, 자기야. 난 우리 기스 친구가 너에게 줄 고통을 질투하는 게 아니야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = cf2bb34a-6aa0-14e5-a9e9-d9e593a5fba0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Astarion:cf2bb34a-6aa0-14e5-a9e9-d9e593a5fba0
msgctxt "he0764a29g90e7g4a0cgb75cg3008e5f05af3"
msgid ""
"I'd hate to get between the gith and her trophy. No, I think we'll end this "
"evening as friends."
msgstr "난 기스랑 그녀의 전리품 사이에 끼어들고 싶지 않아. 그래, 오늘 저녁은 친구 사이로 남자고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = cfc6c8d5-08ae-8abb-6189-38d2f7de732a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
