#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Astarion:cfc6c8d5-08ae-8abb-6189-38d2f7de732a
msgctxt "he7ea8f37gd3b5g40bdg914dg10958866e506"
msgid "Do you think Gale would approve? I saw how he looked at you earlier."
msgstr "게일이 뭐라고 하지 않을까? 아까 너를 보는 눈빛이 어떤지 봤거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d05e3167-f2da-6fde-846c-ff6f06005ec7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
