#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Astarion:d05e3167-f2da-6fde-846c-ff6f06005ec7
msgctxt "h92107cebg49e5g412eg9d6bg456d5da580ec"
msgid "Just so you know, I'm spending tonight with Lae'zel."
msgstr "너도 알다시피, 난 레이젤이랑 하룻밤을 보낼 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = d0af55b0-b1cb-ef04-d2e4-72a20e21a491
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_GalePartner(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Astarion:d0af55b0-b1cb-ef04-d2e4-72a20e21a491
msgctxt "h2a142247ge176g4011gb0d7ge795ce3cdc06"
msgid ""
"It's easy for some, of course. You and Gale seem to be getting on very well."
msgstr "물론 누구한테는 쉬운 일이겠지. 게일이랑 아주 사이가 가까워 보이던데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = d166867f-35f7-7555-e572-0f40a270856e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_Astarion_State_MetGurHunter = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Astarion:d166867f-35f7-7555-e572-0f40a270856e
msgctxt "h1feda3efg27e9g4c25g9a59g80f175884912"
msgid ""
"Enjoy myself? There's a worm in my brain, hunters on my trail, and all I've "
"got to drink is wine that tastes like vinegar."
msgstr "즐기라고? 내 머릿속에는 벌레가 들어있고, 사냥꾼들이 내 뒤를 쫓으며, 식초 맛이 나는 포도주를 마셔야 한다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = d6888467-45ce-160f-096f-cf5bc3878ce5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Astarion:d6888467-45ce-160f-096f-cf5bc3878ce5
msgctxt "h480afcd0gf979g471dg8fccga9f50d54b105"
msgid "<i>Please.</i>"
msgstr "<i>제발.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = d6fa66ac-a1bc-30dc-0044-68e6ba52d610
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_HasPartner(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Astarion:d6fa66ac-a1bc-30dc-0044-68e6ba52d610
msgctxt "hfb310195gae34g4d96gab8eg723f96823bf3"
msgid "By the hells. Sex, my dear. A night of passion."
msgstr "이런 세상에. 자기야, 섹스지. 열정의 밤 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = dd8a7a3b-7773-b9e9-874c-e3f18a95c436
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Astarion:dd8a7a3b-7773-b9e9-874c-e3f18a95c436
msgctxt "h7b0e4eb6gb2b3g4a02gb47bg6f11e7be7013"
msgid ""
"Enjoy myself? There's a worm in my brain, I'm surrounded by idiots, and all "
"I've got to drink is wine that tastes like vinegar."
msgstr "즐기라고? 내 머릿속에는 벌레가 들어있고, 등신들에게 둘러싸인 데다, 식초 맛이 나는 포도주를 마셔야 한다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = dfd21684-e419-38e1-a3f3-80b8d72b2c1f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Astarion:dfd21684-e419-38e1-a3f3-80b8d72b2c1f
msgctxt "h58f23a44g0696g41fag9dbege7d601f14500"
msgid "Are you now? Well, lucky her."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Astarion
