msgctxt "h827739e7gec1cg4c65gbddfg896c38b1c9f3"
msgid ""
"Nothing so dramatic. Just you and me and - well, maybe a little death? "
"Figuratively speaking."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = ef534ba6-f82f-a7e5-49a7-658e44f36312
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Astarion:ef534ba6-f82f-a7e5-49a7-658e44f36312
msgctxt "hb676e7e5gba9bg4684gb448g1df6dbb6c47a"
msgid ""
"Once everyone's in their bedrolls, we'll slip out of ours and find each "
"other."
msgstr "다들 침낭에 들어가고 나면, 각자 빠져나가서 만나자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
