msgctxt "h9383a783gce03g4198gbec7g303b8dbf8f0a"
msgid "If you're looking for another shot, I'm afraid you've missed it."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fec6e67a-48c5-7130-005e-175702f36eed
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_State_DoubleDating(1) = True
#.      - ORI_State_DatingAstarion(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Astarion:fec6e67a-48c5-7130-005e-175702f36eed
msgctxt "h7823aed6g1b86g4f0cga666g8172ab194761"
msgid "Interested in sharing a bed tonight?"
msgstr "나랑 하룻밤 같이 보낼 생각 없어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 013ae257-a359-b883-370e-775d29809665
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_MinscPartner(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2:013ae257-a359-b883-370e-775d29809665
msgctxt "h58739f16gb500g4208g8d3cg0eae58dedb1d"
msgid "Actually, I may just want to spend the night with you instead of Minsc."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 021272c9-1d9a-baec-45b5-374d80a5d475
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2:021272c9-1d9a-baec-45b5-374d80a5d475
msgctxt "hd3968f5agdf9fg4dbagad21ge6c1478c7d17"
msgid "I do hope you know what you're doing."
msgstr "네가 지금 무슨 일을 하는지 알았으면 좋겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 083d2d3d-1468-7234-8fd6-5ed3d39231d3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_GaleRejected(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2:083d2d3d-1468-7234-8fd6-5ed3d39231d3
msgctxt "hd2bfef86g4be7g468bgb9aag01832f67bcf9"
msgid "I've said enough. Let silence do the talking."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 0c467d56-548f-103e-a887-e4416383737c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_GalePartner(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2:0c467d56-548f-103e-a887-e4416383737c
msgctxt "he45adb1dg8a6fg4664g88e6ge40453d52cb0"
msgid ""
"There's promise in patience, I assure you. Let the night run its course so "
"that we can run ours as well."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 1497e0b8-863a-fc74-bd65-eb71b331dd4b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2:1497e0b8-863a-fc74-bd65-eb71b331dd4b
msgctxt "hce9d8742g8b66g461eg9dcbge956807a3685"
msgid "That's usually followed by: in water there is good sense."
msgstr "그 말 뒤에 따라오는 말이 있지: 물에는 제정신이 박혀있다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 169b176e-380d-8691-4033-286ee574f76b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2:169b176e-380d-8691-4033-286ee574f76b
msgctxt "h784bf0a8gb250g4dc4g8222g3ecbfc40255a"
msgid ""
"Jealousy is in the eye of the beholder. Or something along those lines, the "
"wine might be befuddling me a smidge."
msgstr "질투란 보는 이의 눈에 달린 거라고 하지. 그와 비슷한 걸지도 모르고, 포도주를 좀 마셨더니 취한 걸지도 모르지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 1b9f8ed5-b395-0f44-3cd9-ee5350b3ec42
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - Approval_AtLeast_35_For_Sp2(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2:1b9f8ed5-b395-0f44-3cd9-ee5350b3ec42
msgctxt "h5302e7fagc825g4924gab28ge9a76ee1616e"
msgid ""
"The point is - I have hope. Each new sunrise may yet be the one to coax our "
"budding bond to blossom. But I think it's fair to say -  it won't be today's."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1bd2bce1-91e0-3530-869f-0559bf7dd1cd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2:1bd2bce1-91e0-3530-869f-0559bf7dd1cd
msgctxt "h79480fcag6e67g4f22g9f22ge5817987cf2e"
msgid "What for?"
msgstr "뭐가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 1c00e058-d61a-035b-9ba3-2c439cc4871c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2:1c00e058-d61a-035b-9ba3-2c439cc4871c
msgctxt "h9c1620bcg022fg4501gb24cg55b038fb5a6a"
msgid ""
"I'm glad you sought me out. Amid all this merriment I wasn't sure we'd have "
"a chance to speak this evening."
msgstr "네가 나를 찾아줘서 다행이야. 오늘 저녁의 이 모든 즐거움 속에서 우리가 대화할 기회가 있을지 확신하지 못했거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1f3871ec-925d-c836-fc71-fdd498a9f0e5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2:1f3871ec-925d-c836-fc71-fdd498a9f0e5
msgctxt "h645f4bd6ge0d7g482eg96d2g283d3aaa3de8"
msgid "Spontaneous thank-yous make me suspicious."
msgstr "갑자기 감사 인사를 하니 뭔가 의심스러운데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 1f950ee5-e379-1c08-d5ee-012269bb02de
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2:1f950ee5-e379-1c08-d5ee-012269bb02de
msgctxt "h67c710a0g4114g4b20g9881g5d1e8c572b2e"
msgid ""
"For now - please, enjoy the celebration. When it is done, I will show you "
"all."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 20bece06-4b02-8b52-b645-fd2dd3e338d0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2:20bece06-4b02-8b52-b645-fd2dd3e338d0
msgctxt "h40da3917g3a87g42bfga0b9gd4810248b5ed"
msgid "Didn't peg you for a sore loser, Gale."
msgstr "네가 패배자라고 한 건 아니야, 게일."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 22ff2ae2-d06d-01ac-8b58-6a7f68827d42
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_HasPartner(1) = True
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_GalePartner(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2:22ff2ae2-d06d-01ac-8b58-6a7f68827d42
msgctxt "h30ffbdf2gc584g4a6fg953ag1bfe4cd7bff7"
msgid ""
"A lesson. And trust me when I say - few have experienced the pleasure I "
"offer to teach."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2de7cc7c-b6c1-f160-97ab-a99f68c1251c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2:2de7cc7c-b6c1-f160-97ab-a99f68c1251c
msgctxt "hee2dfec5gd027g4b84gbec7gef497cf7fd83"
msgid "I like the sound of 'magical.' What do you have planned?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2e1e048d-bd41-129c-fd32-cf43651f64c0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_LaezelPartner(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2:2e1e048d-bd41-129c-fd32-cf43651f64c0
msgctxt "h42525b9eg2796g4278gb119g81436501b5fc"
msgid ""
"Actually, I may just want to spend the night with you instead of Lae'zel."
msgstr "사실, 레이젤이 아니라 너와 함께 밤을 보내고 싶어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 3149b221-5fbc-cc72-547e-41f00c5e49f3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_GaleRefused(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2:3149b221-5fbc-cc72-547e-41f00c5e49f3
msgctxt "hd6342472g30afg4352g9fa7g811c0654ff75"
msgid "Another night perhaps."
msgstr "다음 밤을 기대할게."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 404701fa-099d-da8c-c665-ae7b721b1c40
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2:404701fa-099d-da8c-c665-ae7b721b1c40
msgctxt "h82adddb5g4331g44d4gbd66gff2d77aef062"
msgid "There's that confidence I like."
msgstr "네 그 자신감이 참 좋아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 42141040-d3a1-97e4-c938-f792e168c1dc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2:42141040-d3a1-97e4-c938-f792e168c1dc
msgctxt "hc9803ccbg36cag432ega164gf856de579b81"
msgid "No thanks, Gale. I'm in no mood for magic this evening."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4721eeb6-c3d4-b8bd-b714-2149a4e06670
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_AstarionPartner(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2:4721eeb6-c3d4-b8bd-b714-2149a4e06670
msgctxt "h9d563495g7ea9g44cdga5d1g4d191fa2c5e5"
msgid ""
"Actually, I may just want to spend the night with you instead of Astarion."
msgstr "사실, 아스타리온이 아니라 너와 함께 밤을 보내고 싶어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 48772181-ee50-e766-b090-24c0d6044c07
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2:48772181-ee50-e766-b090-24c0d6044c07
msgctxt "hbff3d581g6813g4cecg8badgb8d55ac4ca25"
msgid "Far be it from me of course, to question your tastes."
msgstr "물론, 네 취향에 의문을 표할 생각은 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 5c2c4bf8-3984-1ab3-01dd-c5f0df928421
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2:5c2c4bf8-3984-1ab3-01dd-c5f0df928421
msgctxt "hd4e3bdedgfafbg42e4gb02fge2035b92541a"
msgid "Indeed?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 5d6efde5-bdfe-057b-f79e-a325215d4b0f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2:5d6efde5-bdfe-057b-f79e-a325215d4b0f
msgctxt "he6d45109g13b7g48a6g974eg00823f9cd63c"
msgid "Come now! This is a night for celebration, not suspicion."
msgstr "자자! 오늘은 축하의 밤이야, 의심이 아니라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 601a2571-6f61-d6d5-c2de-a1d95f201321
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_AstarionPartner(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2:601a2571-6f61-d6d5-c2de-a1d95f201321
msgctxt "h73b2ccffg1fccg419bg8ba4g6b077b54dceb"
msgid ""
"He has a certain charm about him, Astarion. Then again, so does a tiger when "
"it purrs."
msgstr "아스타리온, 그에겐 꽤 매력적인 구석이 있어. 하지만, 호랑이도 애교를 부릴 땐 매력적이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 61012c3e-5c8d-ab0d-14d9-a807fe8e48ce
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_WyllPartner(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2:61012c3e-5c8d-ab0d-14d9-a807fe8e48ce
msgctxt "h5bb2312dg5734g4059gb2dfg5dc80f5a9e9c"
msgid "Wyll's a good man. He may actually be a tried-and-true storybook hero."
msgstr "윌은 좋은 남자야. 정말로 진실한 노력을 다한 이야기 속의 영웅일지도 몰라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 635f6319-61ee-650b-1ed2-91a0b48e5f7d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - Approval_AtLeast_35_For_Sp2(0) = True
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_HasPartner(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2:635f6319-61ee-650b-1ed2-91a0b48e5f7d
msgctxt "h11808d5cg5890g4b26gad0eg155bdbedc160"
msgid ""
"I was hoping you'd spare me a moment. There was something rather magical I "
"wished to show you."
msgstr "잠깐 시간 좀 내줬으면 해. 보여주고 싶은 마법 같은 게 있거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 6c8770a8-6f2f-e926-00d7-f5b573bf5085
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_GaleRefused(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2:6c8770a8-6f2f-e926-00d7-f5b573bf5085
msgctxt "h6365aa06ge873g4a97ga4f3gfb6a45ad7e53"
msgid ""
"Now please, go and enjoy your evening. this won't be the first party I've "
"spent moping in self-indulgence with a bottle of wine for company."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 786a411b-a442-fbe5-0775-c4dbd6ecba8f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2:786a411b-a442-fbe5-0775-c4dbd6ecba8f
msgctxt "hcca78dbcgb129g4048ga1a7gbf5835cdafb9"
msgid ""
"That, my friend, must remain a secret. For now. Or rather: for as long as "
"you've eyes only for someone else among our troupe."
msgstr ""
"그건, 친구, 절대로 못 알려주지. 당장은 말이야. 정확히는, 우리 일행 가운데 다른 사람이 네 관심을 독차지하고 있는 동안은 안 되지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 7cda2d93-49c3-305f-1821-902493ad3c76
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2:7cda2d93-49c3-305f-1821-902493ad3c76
msgctxt "hbff08580g6004g41aag867dg8b066ab76dff"
msgid "Good sense will have to wait 'til the morrow."
msgstr "제정신은 내일까지 기다려야 돌아오겠네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 80d43d64-42b9-bf5a-8077-eef4f525ff8d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2:80d43d64-42b9-bf5a-8077-eef4f525ff8d
msgctxt "h024d7d7cg43afg415fg92b9gdc3645db017d"
msgid ""
"More's the pity you've already found someone else to make merry with, just "
"the two of you."
msgstr "불행한 건 네가 이미 다른 사람을 찾아서, 단둘이 즐거운 시간을 보낼 것이라는 사실이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 825f93ed-20dd-39b7-df82-bd6775fbbc56
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_HasMet_Gale(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2:825f93ed-20dd-39b7-df82-bd6775fbbc56
msgctxt "hf76a3cabgd27ag4a4cg8c62ge36d82fc0cdd"
msgid "Enjoy the night. It seems to me full of opportunities."
msgstr "밤을 즐겨. 기회가 가득한 것 같으니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8cbf7607-77e3-aabf-c8c3-3ff88c645854
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_KarlachPartner(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2:8cbf7607-77e3-aabf-c8c3-3ff88c645854
msgctxt "h23818c2eg46cag4cffgb1f2g29945292ded7"
msgid ""
"Actually, I may just want to spend the night with you instead of Karlach."
msgstr "사실, 칼라크보단 너와 밤을 보내는 편이 좋겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 8e391561-c305-da61-dd68-2194d255ecef
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2:8e391561-c305-da61-dd68-2194d255ecef
msgctxt "hf3fcf5bdg46bcg46beg8addg5ae9e6cf7f75"
msgid ""
"So please - go, and enjoy the festivities. Anticipation will only make our "
"reunion the sweeter."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9b540c1d-0911-fdaf-fb56-6c60232ffef5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2:9b540c1d-0911-fdaf-fb56-6c60232ffef5
msgctxt "h0a5e99e7g60fbg41ceg8fd4gf914157730b1"
msgid "Is that the wine talking?"
msgstr "취했어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 9e563096-bdeb-c652-781b-cbf1d79ae12a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2:9e563096-bdeb-c652-781b-cbf1d79ae12a
msgctxt "he4d14fcbgbdffg4798g9f3fg4eddcdbc8ad8"
msgid "I promise you - my offer is a perfectly sober one. So, what do you say?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = a207a37d-7f3e-23d0-8b7f-35c2f3b98612
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - Approval_AtLeast_35_For_Sp2(0) = False
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_HasPartner(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_GaleRefused(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2:a207a37d-7f3e-23d0-8b7f-35c2f3b98612
msgctxt "hd9b75fb7g6ef2g42e1gbc3bgd87d8de362db"
msgid ""
"Were our bond a little stronger, I might even have shared a moment of magic "
"with you."
msgstr "우리 사이가 조금만 더 끈끈했다면, 함께 마법의 순간을 보냈을 수도 있었을 텐데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = a7c7abf3-397f-94e0-7b3f-2c5ca0bf69bf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2:a7c7abf3-397f-94e0-7b3f-2c5ca0bf69bf
msgctxt "hf1c2fa3ag13c0g4289gbe3cgaa0cb96ac4fc"
msgid ""
"However, it's something best experienced in more intimate surrounds, once "
"the revelry has ended, and the stillness of the night has been restored."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = aaf573f5-f574-22b4-1c1c-39d962b800ff
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2:aaf573f5-f574-22b4-1c1c-39d962b800ff
msgctxt "had2668c2gd4cag4e6eg8d06gd71814967797"
msgid "And yet you question them nonetheless."
msgstr "그렇게 말하면서 이미 의심했잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ac951382-8ddf-018f-1a90-a85434ec3a07
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2:ac951382-8ddf-018f-1a90-a85434ec3a07
msgctxt "h0af153b0ge8c8g480dg87a1g9434cbbf57d7"
msgid "Do I detect a hint of jealousy?"
msgstr "질투의 기운이 느껴졌다면 기분 탓인가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = ae389449-92e3-854e-fa29-39179fcb9e91
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2:ae389449-92e3-854e-fa29-39179fcb9e91
msgctxt "h6b733613g0150g4688ga680gd876c7e35b92"
msgid "Am I? Perhaps I am. Or perhaps I need another glass of wine."
msgstr "그런가? 맞을지도 모르지. 아니면 포도주 한 잔이 더 필요할지도 모르고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = b3758ee2-c4dc-b7cf-f252-5c52e8a4f86f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2:b3758ee2-c4dc-b7cf-f252-5c52e8a4f86f
msgctxt "hb2da320cgb630g4d2eg8e34g06bb0b108438"
msgid ""
"Then again he's so full of himself it's a small miracle he hasn't resorted "
"to self-cannibalism yet."
msgstr "그렇지만 그는 자기애가 너무 충만해서, 자기 자신을 먹지 않은 것이 약간의 기적일 정도야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = b7b05f37-3755-e0c3-cb02-7d93c1ae654d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2:b7b05f37-3755-e0c3-cb02-7d93c1ae654d
msgctxt "h8c58069dgd5a9g4378gabd4g484db9213965"
msgid ""
"Alas, our fledgling acquaintanceship has not yet taken flight. Such intimacy "
"will have to wait."
msgstr "아아, 우리의 서먹한 친분 관계는 아직 분위기를 타지 못했어. 그러자면 시간이 좀 들겠는걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = ba9e6a96-fbca-f572-d721-0489152705b8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_ShadowheartPartner(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2:ba9e6a96-fbca-f572-d721-0489152705b8
msgctxt "h245e26b3g37c2g4f9bg858bg00fb0a4a3a92"
msgid ""
"There's something... unspeakable about Shadowheart. But I mean that in a "
"good way. She seems to me like a bud on the cusp of bursting into a rose."
msgstr "섀도하트는 뭔가... 이루 말할 수 없는 면이 있어. 좋은 뜻으로 말이야. 그녀는 마치 장미꽃이 피기 직전의 꽃봉오리 같아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bce7f992-c45e-0bba-e684-4e9a88e46d2d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2:bce7f992-c45e-0bba-e684-4e9a88e46d2d
msgctxt "h6004fa6dg20abg4afdga203g98fcacb9460c"
msgid "I'm sure you're welcome."
msgstr "당연히 그러셔야지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = c4810ddd-15d6-ea63-2dd1-46b00b792eb7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - Approval_AtLeast_35_For_Sp2(0) = True
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_HasPartner(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2:c4810ddd-15d6-ea63-2dd1-46b00b792eb7
msgctxt "h89f89acage65dg46cdg9b07gf22d6afa1972"
msgid "I wasn't sure we'd have a chance to make merry, just the two of us."
msgstr "우리가 이렇게 즐거운 시간을 보낼 기회가 있을 줄은 몰랐어, 우리 둘이서만 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = c5b284e4-3d05-b36b-f97d-802989340e38
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2:c5b284e4-3d05-b36b-f97d-802989340e38
msgctxt "hc1d77d38g9e51g446dg8530g1375a61f55c2"
msgid "Caught on to that, did you? Might be the wine talking."
msgstr "내가 그렇게 말했나? 술김에 그런 말을 했나봐."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = c7a166a1-2be1-5736-4a10-4ae52cef4184
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2:c7a166a1-2be1-5736-4a10-4ae52cef4184
msgctxt "hd97553bdg454cg4fedg9ff3g17cf8fb97f33"
msgid "As they say in Waterdeep: in wine there is truth."
msgstr "워터딥에는 이런 격언이 있어: 포도주에는 진실이 담겨 있다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = c96f88cd-668a-1d11-58e6-5c7576b1e567
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHunt_HasMet_Gale(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2:c96f88cd-668a-1d11-58e6-5c7576b1e567
msgctxt "h70741247gf8c9g4cceg8dd6g79bfeb371ccb"
msgid "Thank you."
msgstr "고마워."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = ca23e066-a06e-9f0c-4112-aca31fa64370
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2:ca23e066-a06e-9f0c-4112-aca31fa64370
msgctxt "hd6298209gb47eg463dgbcb0g64349aab9d46"
msgid ""
"I thank you for seeking me out. Amid all this merriment I wasn't sure we'd "
"have a chance to speak this evening."
msgstr "나를 찾아줘서 고마워. 오늘 저녁의 이 모든 즐거움 속에서 우리가 대화할 기회가 있을지 확신하지 못했거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = ce43e2e4-1d0c-1260-348d-b37057f23207
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_GaleRefused(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2:ce43e2e4-1d0c-1260-348d-b37057f23207
msgctxt "h86960068g4427g4eabgbc50gd694029e44e7"
msgid "Too bad. One should never be afraid to live life to the fullest."
msgstr "안타깝네. 아무도 자신의 삶을 즐기는 걸 두려워해선 안되는데 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d2279231-d344-ef17-559a-52e930e70993
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_WyllPartner(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2:d2279231-d344-ef17-559a-52e930e70993
msgctxt "h5871dfe9gf327g4595g8863g1ee7689e4193"
msgid "Actually, I may just want to spend the night with you instead of Wyll."
msgstr "사실, 윌이 아니라 너와 함께 밤을 보내고 싶어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d2fb5c27-db74-e24e-4e6c-fe17f52ffa23
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_ShadowheartPartner(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2:d2fb5c27-db74-e24e-4e6c-fe17f52ffa23
msgctxt "ha1926724g16fag48c3g9804g69023c4726b6"
msgid ""
"Actually, I may just want to spend the night with you instead of Shadowheart."
msgstr "사실은, 섀도하트가 아니라 너와 함께 밤을 보내고 싶어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = ddf190c4-d729-392c-90aa-eb53e6787487
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - Approval_AtLeast_35_For_Sp2(0) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_GaleRejected(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2:ddf190c4-d729-392c-90aa-eb53e6787487
msgctxt "h2b56b2a5g233ag419eg8f24gfd8cb705a948"
msgid ""
"You're all too quick to abandon the one you promised yourself to. That is "
"not a quality I admire."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = de6175e4-4326-bf8a-dbfe-7f8ee641f909
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_KarlachPartner(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2:de6175e4-4326-bf8a-dbfe-7f8ee641f909
msgctxt "h0fdde262gfb38g4f89gac68gd163fea50570"
msgid ""
"You might be in for an adventure with Karlach. More than you bargained for - "
"with a bit of luck."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = e22172a5-525c-f8a4-b72c-89e80da06145
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - Approval_AtLeast_35_For_Sp2(0) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_HasPartner(1) = True
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_GalePartner(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2:e22172a5-525c-f8a4-b72c-89e80da06145
msgctxt "h7456a41cge4dag437ag812dg69b495ff730f"
msgid ""
"I'm glad you feel the same way. But, while I'm eager to enjoy your company "
"on an exclusive basis later this evening, it would be selfish to keep you to "
"myself before then. "
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ea271448-accf-b629-8800-28ad5251db39
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2:ea271448-accf-b629-8800-28ad5251db39
msgctxt "h7d7b6f6agdc2eg41cdg833eg2296a62fa68b"
msgid "What were you going to show me?"
msgstr "나한테 뭘 보여 주려고 했어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = f46b2f50-f8d4-718c-11c9-b7b1a1255e67
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2:f46b2f50-f8d4-718c-11c9-b7b1a1255e67
msgctxt "h1f9ef666g6ef4g4aabg9260gb90c70a2e0db"
msgid "Or perhaps more than you bargained for - full stop."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = fc3ccb32-3f2f-3c71-c397-d42552ea21ed
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2:fc3ccb32-3f2f-3c71-c397-d42552ea21ed
msgctxt "h62f3c88ag6d9fg4a28gb7a0g2d9966896c08"
msgid "That or deadly nightshade."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = fd521a28-bd40-957d-d1d1-5eec8d721f28
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_LaezelPartner(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale2:fd521a28-bd40-957d-d1d1-5eec8d721f28
msgctxt "h35b76ef3gc01bg4b89gbe77g0bce062ebd0a"
msgid "Lae'zel. Blade like a razor, wit like a razor, tongue like a razor."
msgstr "레이젤은 마치 면도날과 같아서 생각과 입이 모두 날카로워."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 0100e6e9-3286-49b7-a823-533134b95b93
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3:0100e6e9-3286-49b7-a823-533134b95b93
msgctxt "h68ae4ed6gacebg4480g8f4dg0900a69a418d"
msgid ""
"It's a view I would once have shared with my companion. Though definitely "
"unaccompanied by such revelry."
msgstr "한때 동반자와 함께 올려다보던 경관이야. 그땐 확실히 이런 파티는 없었지만 말야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 04c81472-0246-b243-b0ed-dd54deef83fa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - ORI_State_DatingGale(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3:04c81472-0246-b243-b0ed-dd54deef83fa
msgctxt "h77f06151g070dg40abgad6fgb2b77738152e"
msgid "Don't stop now. What else do you like about me?"
msgstr "계속해. 또 내 어떤 점이 좋은데?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 0affa659-fc00-4e3d-bdce-aa819367014d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3:0affa659-fc00-4e3d-bdce-aa819367014d
msgctxt "h19696284g9fc7g4796gbe84g06fbefe5896a"
msgid ""
"You remind me of her somewhat. An expression you both share - when she gives "
"in to her more feline qualities, a mouse trapped beneath her paw..."
msgstr ""
"널 보면 타라가 생각나. 너희 둘이 공유하는 특징이 있어 - 타라가 고양이과 동물의 본성에 굴복해 앞발로 생쥐를 짓누르고 있을 때의..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 12681a26-6eb6-43d4-9d83-a709b53b34f5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3:12681a26-6eb6-43d4-9d83-a709b53b34f5
msgctxt "h593f2dc2g5636g44b6g9084g5638cf6ebe2a"
msgid "Not that I don't appreciate your musk. I actually rather like it..."
msgstr "그렇다고 네 체향이 싫다는 건 아니야. 사실 좋아하는 편에 가까워."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 1aa9dc85-b781-4472-b5c6-f3d86dd86842
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - NIGHT_GoblinHunt_TieflingCelebration = False
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_State_DatingGale(1) = True
#.      - ORI_Gale_Knows_DiscussedTressym(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3:1aa9dc85-b781-4472-b5c6-f3d86dd86842
msgctxt "hae66b0b4g78e3g43a7gb8ffg33987b0b19d3"
msgid ""
"A beautiful night, don't you think? Nothing like a brush with destruction to "
"make one appreciate the majesty of the celestial canvas."
msgstr "아름다운 밤이야, 안 그래? 살육의 현장만큼 밤하늘의 장엄함을 제대로 느끼게 해주는 게 없지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 1ea99750-44a8-2abb-4dfb-e434b78692d2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3:1ea99750-44a8-2abb-4dfb-e434b78692d2
msgctxt "h006fef11g4753g4b3fga341g5e77d862f1dd"
msgid "Nonetheless, your finer qualities are remarkably plentiful."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 21571b7c-4d56-eb3a-e2c5-5db84ada7f3b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3:21571b7c-4d56-eb3a-e2c5-5db84ada7f3b
msgctxt "h83732515gd4d1g4829g83dag4f9efd41b971"
msgid "Right. Understood. You shall hear no more on the subject from me."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 21a1ef61-7220-457c-a1c9-f340762fd0d2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3:21a1ef61-7220-457c-a1c9-f340762fd0d2
msgctxt "h3745f0adg194fg476dg9e24ga9a40f7d2bf2"
msgid ""
"I used to while away many hours just like these with my companion, though in "
"far comfier surrounds."
msgstr "나도 동반자와 함께 많은 시간을 보내곤 했지, 물론 더 편안한 상황이었지만."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 237949ff-6fd1-89cc-ce67-8a75ed0bf98e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_State_DatingGale(1) = True
#.      - ORI_Gale_Knows_DiscussedTressym(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3:237949ff-6fd1-89cc-ce67-8a75ed0bf98e
msgctxt "h512db164gdcc1g4640g81d7g28563f940a44"
msgid ""
"Don't worry about me - I'm quite content to enjoy the party from here. Go, "
"enjoy yourself."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 240cfa14-2251-9b08-57b9-a7f191698f51
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3:240cfa14-2251-9b08-57b9-a7f191698f51
msgctxt "h40c35773gca4cg4539g94e3ge11d1aa533ee"
msgid ""
"Suffice it to say, I think rather a lot of you. And there aren't many on "
"this plane who I'd give such high praise."
msgstr "솔직히 말하자면 사실 네 생각을 엄청 많이 해. 그리고 내가 칭찬하는 사람은 그리 많지 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2425ec2c-aa81-4aba-ea5e-64e8ead84b49
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3:2425ec2c-aa81-4aba-ea5e-64e8ead84b49
msgctxt "h40268f4cg7a59g4737gb564g76b0e67c2c00"
msgid "Friends with the mighty Gale of Waterdeep? I'd be honoured."
msgstr "워터딥의 위대한 게일의 친구? 나야 영광이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 26187e2a-f32d-262d-9327-bd7ba597cfbc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - ORI_State_DatingGale(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3:26187e2a-f32d-262d-9327-bd7ba597cfbc
msgctxt "h50437adegbcd4g4378ga542gd5f7401f02e2"
msgid "Actually, I was thinking we'd be wonderful <i>together</i>..."
msgstr "사실 우리가 <i>함께 한다</i>면 너무 좋을 것 같은데 말이야..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 32e8b385-e21d-f7bd-5bf2-130c2b867512
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_Gale_Knows_LearnedBackstory = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3:32e8b385-e21d-f7bd-5bf2-130c2b867512
msgctxt "h58456324gf7f2g4810g9144g55f075efef5a"
msgid "Who are you referring to? A former lover, perhaps?"
msgstr "누구 이야기야? 예전 연인 말하는 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 33c9dd16-65e2-4844-98ac-57fc664d629b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3:33c9dd16-65e2-4844-98ac-57fc664d629b
msgctxt "hb2da63d1g3e56g45abgb8abg9850f8e30940"
msgid ""
"I assure you, were you to meet Tara you would see the comparison for the "
"flattery it is. But perhaps that's not a point worth labouring further."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3b12c2a1-8006-03af-1957-e6ec6e371818
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3:3b12c2a1-8006-03af-1957-e6ec6e371818
msgctxt "hcd022596gb138g48a6g99b6g8c17e6f8f02b"
msgid "I'm flattered. Is your good opinion so hard to come by?"
msgstr "우쭐해지는걸. 네 마음에 들기가 그렇게 힘든 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 3cb7511f-77d4-9ed8-ba9e-5d30b9c0fb36
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - ORI_State_DatingGale(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3:3cb7511f-77d4-9ed8-ba9e-5d30b9c0fb36
msgctxt "h504e531egc5beg4860gbf83g8a0a7e27be87"
msgid ""
"Please - feel free to enjoy yourself elsewhere. No doubt there are others "
"here who offer more welcome company."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 3d71b188-f982-7a97-1db9-c2a52df752cd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3:3d71b188-f982-7a97-1db9-c2a52df752cd
msgctxt "h9c30cde9g9033g420agacc6g0e7379e4a67f"
msgid ""
"I've got aquaintances, certainly. Plenty of colleagues. But friends? Those "
"are precious indeed."
msgstr "나도 지인이 있어. 동료도 있고. 하지만 친구는 아주 소중한 사람을 말하는 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 42f83423-6b78-43ff-bf72-3c898851fb7a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3:42f83423-6b78-43ff-bf72-3c898851fb7a
msgctxt "h65b8618egc42dg46c6gaaa1gb619c8f07edf"
msgid ""
"'Smart' does her a disservice. She's a fine wizard in her own right, though "
"somewhat held back by her lack of opposable thumbs."
msgstr "그냥 '똑똑하다' 정도가 아니지. 나름 뛰어난 위저드이긴 한데, 손에 엄지손가락이 없어서 제약을 많이 받아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 439f9e6c-0b9b-4266-8dd8-4654cec98887
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3:439f9e6c-0b9b-4266-8dd8-4654cec98887
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h4ca5758dg1957g4ca5g807fgf0caf2843bc1"
msgid ""
"After so long being cared for by someone else, it feels good to have repaid "
"the favour. Not directly to Tara, but to these poor tieflings. I'm sure she "
"would approve."
msgstr ""
"이토록 오랫동안 보살핌을 받다가 보답을 하게되니 기분이 좋은걸. 타라가 아닌, 이 불쌍한 티플링들을 도운 거지만 말이야. 그녀도 만족할 "
"거라 확신해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 44b4b060-5c98-4940-8f30-b45315cd4915
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3:44b4b060-5c98-4940-8f30-b45315cd4915
msgctxt "h8adc3385gcf8bg482cgbc5dg004e21ec6293"
msgid "What is Tara like?"
msgstr "타라는 어떤 성격이야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 48430289-caea-e3a7-6973-70b6261a3ba4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - ORI_State_DatingGale(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3:48430289-caea-e3a7-6973-70b6261a3ba4
msgctxt "h7826040ag41e4g49bagbc7cg52057b57b965"
msgid "Don't stop there. What else do you like about me?"
msgstr "계속 해. 또 나의 어떤 점이 좋은데?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 4a18c67b-385e-a003-4656-fff410ddcaa8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3:4a18c67b-385e-a003-4656-fff410ddcaa8
msgctxt "h35b99154g6742g44f8g9aaegf1ecc4d89385"
msgid ""
"The pleasures I experienced in Mystra's embrace go far beyond the thrill of "
"having one's tummy tickled. I remember once, she took the smallest piece of "
"the Weave and made it into - "
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 4dbb827c-a03e-56cb-35c7-1be4b0ee2a42
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3:4dbb827c-a03e-56cb-35c7-1be4b0ee2a42
msgctxt "h71ce39b5g33abg493ag8cf7g790b14cbd464"
msgid ""
"She'll love you. So long as you don't rub her belly. She <i>hates</i> it "
"when anyone does that."
msgstr "아마 너도 좋아할 거야. 네가 배를 문지르지만 않으면. 누가 그렇게 하면 <i>진짜로</i> 싫어하거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 4f00b197-8f1b-0364-fa00-83ab81ab1156
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3:4f00b197-8f1b-0364-fa00-83ab81ab1156
msgctxt "h5e6db6d3g0c55g48e7g9bdbg74ce3ad94fc7"
msgid ""
"I'm glad. To know you enjoy my company is, well, it's rather wonderful "
"actually. I'd be loathe to waste the time of someone who's become rather "
"important to me."
msgstr ""
"기쁘군. 내가 함께 다니는 걸 너도 좋아한다니, 사실 아주 기분이 좋은데. 중요하지도 않은 사람에게 시간을 쏟는 건 나도 정말 싫거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 4f0905d3-6442-67ca-9d4f-dfb98b3c036e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - NIGHT_GoblinHunt_TieflingCelebration = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - ORI_State_DatingGale(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3:4f0905d3-6442-67ca-9d4f-dfb98b3c036e
msgctxt "he4a6742cge22fg40d5g8bceg9fa93ba4f725"
msgid ""
"I see. Then perhaps we see each other in the same light after all. A "
"resplendent one, flush with warmth and anticipation, but one which I must "
"shy away from, for now."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 546bd710-b0a2-4c46-b3e0-9755b367a4a2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3:546bd710-b0a2-4c46-b3e0-9755b367a4a2
msgctxt "hf63bb7e3gb9b2g4a76gb7ecgde1c31ca7e2b"
msgid ""
"I'd given up on myself, but Tara never did. It was her encouragement, her "
"research that led me to my treatment. Once we knew that magically-infused "
"items were the key, she went out to find them for me. She saved my life."
msgstr ""
"난 내 자신을 포기했지만, 타라는 끝까지 희망을 버리지 않았어. 내가 병을 조절할 수 있게 된 건 그녀의 연구와 격려 덕분이야. 마법이 "
"깃든 아이템이 열쇠라는 걸 알고 나서는 날 위해 밖으로 나가 찾아다녔지. 타라가 날 살려낸 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 57d97250-e7de-6155-aecd-990f498a20b1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3:57d97250-e7de-6155-aecd-990f498a20b1
msgctxt "h8765cbe8gedd6g4271g8889g9a0169be12f1"
msgid ""
"Go, indulge in the frivolities - they're good for the heart. And mine will "
"be all the lighter, to see you enjoying yourself."
msgstr "가서, 흥청망청 놀아봐. 그게 마음에도 좋은 거니까. 그리고 네가 즐기는 모습을 보니 내 마음도 한결 가벼워지는 것 같아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5b61f68f-b627-41c8-8eb4-daf1688a143f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - DRUID(1) = True
#. TagRule: DRUID
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3:5b61f68f-b627-41c8-8eb4-daf1688a143f
msgctxt "hd06d77a5gb3aag49a1g9584gc11d226dca7c"
msgid "She sounds like a fine animal. One I'd be honoured to know."
msgstr "멋진 동물인 것 같군. 알고 지내면 영광이겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 5c4bc47e-9087-9f34-3842-7df9bde5a17e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - NIGHT_GoblinHunt_TieflingCelebration = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3:5c4bc47e-9087-9f34-3842-7df9bde5a17e
msgctxt "h98ac6b3eg6a2dg40afg944fgee3a42f856b5"
msgid ""
"Even in such fraught times as these, there is peace to be found in the "
"stillness as evening draws in."
msgstr "요즘처럼 혼란스러운 때에도 저녁이 다가오면 고요함 속에서 평화를 찾을 수 있지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 5ea091ce-088f-c5a5-a7be-1cab844700c1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3:5ea091ce-088f-c5a5-a7be-1cab844700c1
msgctxt "h0dbf8d5dg80e0g4489gaae5ge4fc3eb41a21"
msgid ""
"Wine is to wit as meat is to... to... oh, I can't bloody remember it. There "
"I go, then, proving your point."
msgstr "포도주를 마셔야 재치가 생기고, 고기를 먹어야... 먹으면... 젠장, 기억이 안 나는군. 네 말이 맞다는 걸 증명한 셈이네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5f2cf7b1-f444-ca89-2dba-43f2204521fa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3:5f2cf7b1-f444-ca89-2dba-43f2204521fa
msgctxt "h63597ae8gbc16g4a29g936ag21dafff18dfa"
msgid "What if she doesn't like me?"
msgstr "날 안 좋아하면 어떡해?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5f4981f1-194b-0149-bd30-a356cd0d2c3b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3:5f4981f1-194b-0149-bd30-a356cd0d2c3b
msgctxt "h2e158e53gf007g4b8dgbe67g51f4cca38b57"
msgid ""
"I wouldn't call this a friendship. More a series of necessary interactions."
msgstr "우정이라고 하긴 어렵지. 일종의 꼭 해야 하는 상호작용에 가깝다고 생각해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 6171c41b-6921-480a-b0aa-2e04be6236ad
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3:6171c41b-6921-480a-b0aa-2e04be6236ad
msgctxt "hc7012866gc76dg4a72gae76g59ff8c923694"
msgid ""
"I wish she were here for me to make a formal introduction, but I would never "
"ask her to undertake such a journey. She is safer at home."
msgstr "타라가 여기 있어서 정식으로 소개하면 좋겠지만, 이런 긴 여행을 부탁하진 않을 거야. 타라는 집에 있는 게 안전해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 6449f9bb-816a-4236-efbb-f8cf170e2fc1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3:6449f9bb-816a-4236-efbb-f8cf170e2fc1
msgctxt "h69f50ad8g1bd2g45ccgb46bge17e5b4a9de4"
msgid ""
"I assure you, when I tell someone they're wonderful - I mean it. And you are "
"wonderful."
msgstr "내가 누군가가 환상적이라 하면 - 그건 확실히 진심이야. 그리고 넌 환상적이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 69fa5f0f-1c15-3f8b-4277-91307ce58625
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - NIGHT_GoblinHunt_TieflingCelebration = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3:69fa5f0f-1c15-3f8b-4277-91307ce58625
msgctxt "heae643e3g204ag4045g96bbg98cdb99243d1"
msgid ""
"Go - enjoy your evening. Nothing better for the heart than a good night's "
"rest, and mine is gladdened to know I'll have the pleasure of your company "
"again come morning."
msgstr "가, 가서 저녁 시간을 즐겨. 푹 자는 게 마음에도 좋아. 내일 또 다시 너희와 함께 할 수 있다는 생각에 내 마음도 기뻐."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 6aca6ee9-8b1a-4fad-a0b3-e7d9d3663f5b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3:6aca6ee9-8b1a-4fad-a0b3-e7d9d3663f5b
msgctxt "h80118888g413dg4c21gaa3dg4f615f079972"
msgid ""
"You remind me of her somewhat. There's a steeliness to you, an unwavering "
"tenacity even in the face of, to be frank, quite dire odds."
msgstr "널 보면 타라가 생각나. 엄청난 역경에도 굴하지 않는 강인함, 변함 없는 끈기가 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 6c94896c-e1b6-4cfe-a8cf-8b60d3027ddd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - ORI_Gale_Knows_DiscussedTressym(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3:6c94896c-e1b6-4cfe-a8cf-8b60d3027ddd
msgctxt "h7bc39692gca83g4b0bg8b4cg69eccc68a27a"
msgid ""
"Tara is not any cat. She's a <i>tressym</i>. And given your confusion, I'm "
"guessing you've never met one. They're brilliant creatures - fine company "
"for any self-respecting wizard."
msgstr ""
"타라는 고양이가 아니라 <i>트레심</i>이야. 혼란스러워하는 걸 보니 트레심을 만난 적이 없나 보군. 그 어떤 자부심 가득한 "
"마법사에게든 훌륭한 친구가 되어 줄 멋진 종족이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 6db5a096-bac0-4c1f-83f5-ff04aa03bed8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3:6db5a096-bac0-4c1f-83f5-ff04aa03bed8
msgctxt "h728de19egbde9g44edg8c5bgcc02ccfd8637"
msgid ""
"Besides, she was always telling me I needed to spread my wings, so to speak. "
"Find mortal friends, instead of hanging onto Mystra's coattails. So that's "
"what I'm doing. I hope."
msgstr ""
"게다가 타라는 항상 날개를 펴고 날아가라고 말했어. 미스트라의 꼬리에 매달리지 말고 필멸자 친구를 찾으라고. 그래서 그렇게 하고 있는 "
"거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 74a0d900-9642-460d-9ecf-610e8926b2b4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_Gale_Knows_LearnedBackstory = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3:74a0d900-9642-460d-9ecf-610e8926b2b4
msgctxt "hd409e2d4g9a29g49d9ga5cdg9243efbf2883"
msgid "I hope you aren't talking about Mystra again..."
msgstr "또 미스트라 얘기를 꺼내는 건 아닐거야..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 74c8713d-0434-d71e-95ae-cce9ccc3162a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3:74c8713d-0434-d71e-95ae-cce9ccc3162a
msgctxt "h56d13ec8g916cg4a97g98fdg5c125b2d628f"
msgid ""
"One doesn't become the most powerful archmage in Waterdeep <i>and</i> lover "
"to the goddess of magic herself by having low standards."
msgstr "눈이 낮아서는 워터딥의 가장 강력한 대마법사인 <i>동시에</i> 마법 그 자체인 여신의 애인이 될 수 없지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 74f3cc2c-a29c-4c90-af26-6770c38efbe9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3:74f3cc2c-a29c-4c90-af26-6770c38efbe9
msgctxt "h0d0de4feg69cbg41a6ga159g5faa1d3bdccf"
msgid "You remind me of her somewhat. The same sharp tongue. And sharp teeth."
msgstr "널 보면 타라가 생각나. 날카로운 혀와 날카로운 이빨이 똑같아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 76c9749a-dc4b-4ae4-99c8-2f256354300b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - ORI_Gale_Knows_DiscussedTressym(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3:76c9749a-dc4b-4ae4-99c8-2f256354300b
msgctxt "h98ddc789g23fag45bdgbeb4g970be792c633"
msgid ""
"I speak of Tara, my tressym, assistant, my constant companion through all "
"the ills and tribulations my hubris has thrust upon me."
msgstr "내 오만함이 불러온 모든 아픔과 시련을 함께한 나의 트레심이자 조수, 변함없는 동반자인 타라를 말한 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 78f83bb7-82ae-4b1b-a906-697a06ccc22e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3:78f83bb7-82ae-4b1b-a906-697a06ccc22e
msgctxt "hf96526b1g4168g4d02gb320gf7470c45d4de"
msgid ""
"You're the first person I've spent any significant time with in a year or "
"more. Spending time in your company, I realise that I may have left behind "
"the greater part of my wit, and sensitivity, in my tower."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 796f2bc2-4d3c-49d9-b133-90daff8bc35e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3:796f2bc2-4d3c-49d9-b133-90daff8bc35e
msgctxt "h596aacf7g61c5g4faeg9404g016af5e62b8c"
msgid ""
"You remind me of her somewhat. Something in the way you roll your eyes when "
"I speak..."
msgstr "널 보면 타라가 생각나. 내가 말할 때 네가 눈을 굴리는 모습이..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 798c8ddc-9176-d884-ce77-74d10c9e273d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3:798c8ddc-9176-d884-ce77-74d10c9e273d
msgctxt "h3faef2edg37b3g4f49g99a8gcc483bdee345"
msgid "Do you like having your belly rubbed?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 7b1889c2-fea8-0ae8-9bfe-293bac1faf09
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3:7b1889c2-fea8-0ae8-9bfe-293bac1faf09
msgctxt "h5b11a28eg8229g4b0ega758g4b69f3fb6fc5"
msgid ""
"Sadly not. If I'm being entirely honest, my social circle is rather small. "
"More of a dot. Or a pinhead."
msgstr "그렇진 않아. 솔직하게 말하면 사회적 관계가 좁다고 할 수 있지. 점이나 못보다는 크지만."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7b4a0387-5587-4549-b198-2ee6f9ef1f88
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3:7b4a0387-5587-4549-b198-2ee6f9ef1f88
msgctxt "h325dd0a7g4069g430egad57gff8425e6ab02"
msgid "You must have been lonely, with only Tara for company..."
msgstr "친구가 타라 뿐이었다니 외로웠겠구나."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 86a0f45c-3349-4228-bf02-c6a28d3b9f8b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3:86a0f45c-3349-4228-bf02-c6a28d3b9f8b
msgctxt "h8658a7c0g35e0g44c9gafcbg908bd9e1a508"
msgid "Bad luck on that front - I'm actually a nymph in disguise..."
msgstr "안 됐네, 난 사실 변장한 님프거든..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 87977419-9d1d-ee68-5acf-bc251cb08036
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3:87977419-9d1d-ee68-5acf-bc251cb08036
msgctxt "h1ad5eb31g0ee1g4158g9b6fg60be1546c3a4"
msgid "Then let me say it more plainly -"
msgstr "더 분명히 말할게."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 8a750efa-3151-56d6-f9e2-af1fe8981b99
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - NIGHT_ORI_Gale_ElminsterVisit = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3:8a750efa-3151-56d6-f9e2-af1fe8981b99
msgctxt "hf30ef5d5ge733g475dg9b10g00d4a4a0d3bc"
msgid ""
"However, my sentiments are all I can offer at present. With my condition as "
"volatile as it is, I wouldn't want to indulge in any undue, erm, "
"<i>excitement</i>. So to speak."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 8c3ae73a-f897-6e3d-6fdc-790169cd918a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - ORI_State_DatingGale(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3:8c3ae73a-f897-6e3d-6fdc-790169cd918a
msgctxt "h8a9075c7g0da4g4ba2g8d4cg8d8b9d439349"
msgid ""
"You know what, I think I've clearly had far too much wine. And you've had "
"nowhere near enough. I think this is a conversation best held back on - for "
"now."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 931db8ac-b72a-2dc4-7936-cf68f331ca72
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3:931db8ac-b72a-2dc4-7936-cf68f331ca72
msgctxt "h21e1cfb2g5bf3g473fgaaa4g8455ae6af4c4"
msgid ""
"I think you're rather wonderful. And that's not a word I waste on anyone "
"unworthy of it."
msgstr "넌 정말 멋진 사람이야. 그 비슷하지도 않은 아무나한테 그냥 하는 말은 아니야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 94a709c3-d231-41b6-a3b2-4e3e2baa062e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3:94a709c3-d231-41b6-a3b2-4e3e2baa062e
msgctxt "hfbee441cg8cbdg4278g983egb73d10f9c818"
msgid ""
"She preferred it when we were alone, curled up before a crackling hearth "
"with some ancient, esoteric tome between us, ink glinting in the firelight..."
msgstr ""
"그녀는 단둘이 있는 걸 좋아했어. 타닥타닥 타들어가는 난로 앞에, 난해한 학술서를 사이에 두고 서로를 끌어 안은 채, 불빛에 잉크가 "
"반짝이고..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 97119ed4-f6a2-b304-e02a-aff0f26123eb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3:97119ed4-f6a2-b304-e02a-aff0f26123eb
msgctxt "h9c3e004cg911ag42cbga528g03386ca00e05"
msgid ""
"Being mentioned in the same breath as your pet isn't the compliment you "
"think it is..."
msgstr "네 애완동물에 비견되는 건 네가 생각하는 그런 칭찬이 아니야..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 98311158-09d9-4d3d-8c72-6d092cbbed9a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3:98311158-09d9-4d3d-8c72-6d092cbbed9a
msgctxt "h2b3e08d7gcab8g467dga4b8ga1c3610ea077"
msgid ""
"She has a good heart, and she would recognise the same in your actions here. "
"I'm sure she'd approve of me lending myself to your efforts."
msgstr "타라의 영혼은 선해. 그리고 너를 보고도 선하다고 생각할 거고. 선한 여정에 내가 함께 하는 걸 기뻐할 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 983bd61f-dff4-4ac7-a926-d735ad81320d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3:983bd61f-dff4-4ac7-a926-d735ad81320d
msgctxt "h6df7f82ag76d8g47e7g8a3eg093c7d7d7a9c"
msgid ""
"Sometimes. But I imposed it upon myself, after all. I set up enough wards to "
"keep an army at bay, never mind the few colleagues who sought to inquire "
"about my welfare."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 9a4cf634-ddae-4ad6-b3c4-c5273a65e4ae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3:9a4cf634-ddae-4ad6-b3c4-c5273a65e4ae
msgctxt "h09f24786gba30g433dgbba3g28779acdc4ee"
msgid ""
"Tara did her best to keep my spirits up, of course, but there's only so much "
"one tressym can make up for one's entire social circle. And she was often "
"gone seeking items to treat my condition."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9ce3fe3d-74f0-a34d-91c5-8fbe1a9d4a33
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - ORI_State_DatingGale(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3:9ce3fe3d-74f0-a34d-91c5-8fbe1a9d4a33
msgctxt "he4a1c9cag240cg4609g8fdfg9d229d6596be"
msgid "I can't say I share the same high opinion of you, Gale."
msgstr "게일, 너에 대해서도 똑같이 느낀다고 할 수는 없겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 9dcf5328-f66b-46c8-9b22-77d5e0a25c47
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - NIGHT_GoblinHunt_TieflingCelebration = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3:9dcf5328-f66b-46c8-9b22-77d5e0a25c47
msgctxt "h3b995e0eg5ec5g493dga69cg65c1db578320"
msgid ""
"She'd be proud to see me keeping such fine company - the saviour of those "
"poor tieflings, no less. And I've given her precious little to be proud of "
"recently."
msgstr ""
"불쌍한 티플링을 구해준 사람을 친구로 둔 걸 알면 타라는 자랑스러워 할 거야. 한동안 타라가 날 자랑스러워 할 만한 일이 없었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a6113c4e-07c0-439b-8b5b-4f09587e036a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3:a6113c4e-07c0-439b-8b5b-4f09587e036a
msgctxt "hc6725315gd7b7g42dega63fg4263d2532738"
msgid "You don't have any friends?"
msgstr "넌 친구가 없어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = a77770b7-e641-57b6-4811-fbf636558eb4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3:a77770b7-e641-57b6-4811-fbf636558eb4
msgctxt "h76af3175g60c8g4d41ga2f3gd499a9263294"
msgid "Not an animal lover? Nobody's perfect, I suppose."
msgstr "아, 동물을 안 좋아해? 뭐 완벽한 사람은 없으니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a983f123-52c2-f89c-42db-4f7a8ecf79fd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - ORI_State_DatingGale(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3:a983f123-52c2-f89c-42db-4f7a8ecf79fd
msgctxt "hfc6f8255ge201g46begb2e1g49d2e5e72042"
msgid "If this is an attempt at flirting, you should stop. I'm not interested."
msgstr "유혹하려는 시도라면 그만두는 게 좋아. 관심 없으니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ace72bb7-403d-cabc-701c-140d9e8e3e33
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3:ace72bb7-403d-cabc-701c-140d9e8e3e33
msgctxt "hec562b96g0f55g4e70g8aabgf3b82454120c"
msgid ""
"She sounds great. But I was hoping I meant more to you than an animal "
"companion..."
msgstr "정말 멋진 트레심이네. 하지만 반려동물보다는 날 더 중요하게 생각하길 바랐는데..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = ad0aaf33-755e-da43-ea25-1ecc4fb339a5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3:ad0aaf33-755e-da43-ea25-1ecc4fb339a5
msgctxt "hd2f89a3bg457ag4732gad91ge5263bd79e43"
msgid ""
"Consider this budding romance thoroughly nipped. Though I hope our "
"friendship need not come to such an abrupt end."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ae73eb67-5f91-4126-228c-963c2b135ea6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - ORI_State_DatingGale(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3:ae73eb67-5f91-4126-228c-963c2b135ea6
msgctxt "h827cf3e6ga993g4638g89a8g0a0afc577c7e"
msgid "That depends. What do you like about me?"
msgstr "상황에 따라 다르지. 나의 어떤 면이 좋아?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = b14eb103-f744-f485-eb67-dd217b2fac06
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_State_DatingGale(1) = False
#.      - ORI_Gale_Knows_DiscussedTressym(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3:b14eb103-f744-f485-eb67-dd217b2fac06
msgctxt "hb79191a4ge553g416cg8f83g1bd8d1ab1d41"
msgid ""
"Don't let me drag you away. Enjoy yourself - you earned a night of revelry."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b19ecf9f-0575-4e78-a471-3b162feb7c94
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3:b19ecf9f-0575-4e78-a471-3b162feb7c94
msgctxt "h0897b427gc774g40cfga635g89d969d36adb"
msgid ""
"I rather like the Gale stood in front of me. In fact, I'd like to see more "
"of him..."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b64cebe0-c9d5-8132-e3f6-09de55d5dc87
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - ORI_State_DatingGale(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3:b64cebe0-c9d5-8132-e3f6-09de55d5dc87
msgctxt "h69137b9cg3a30g43fdga8a5g196bb0b746b4"
msgid "Of course. I hoped we might be more than friends..."
msgstr "물론이지. 우리가 친구 이상의 관계가 되기를 바라..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b828dcb6-bc8c-fdc0-0a78-b6e81db015ec
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - ORI_State_DatingGale(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3:b828dcb6-bc8c-fdc0-0a78-b6e81db015ec
msgctxt "h3f801b13g456dg4328g8204gbb134387462c"
msgid "I'm not interested in you, Gale. Not in that way."
msgstr "난 네게 관심 없어, 게일. 그런 쪽으로는 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = ba789e50-0105-771f-0dca-fe0592ef421d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3:ba789e50-0105-771f-0dca-fe0592ef421d
msgctxt "h81990df1g6a95g45fag87e4g26fa0b5144e0"
msgid ""
"Always bringing such candour to our conversations. Some would think twice "
"about mocking Gale of Waterdeep, but you just go straight for the gut."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bc0e7702-e17f-e7e7-a3bd-986c5bb1f7d8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - ORI_State_DatingGale(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3:bc0e7702-e17f-e7e7-a3bd-986c5bb1f7d8
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h4b7e3807geea2g4b19gbe51gb49f34a8830f"
msgid ""
"The feeling's mutual - you're a wonderful friend. Though usually more... "
"erudite."
msgstr "너도 나쁘지 않아. 약간... 범생이 같지만 말야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bd60bdbc-93fe-4b84-b8d9-db1fd0424e64
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3:bd60bdbc-93fe-4b84-b8d9-db1fd0424e64
msgctxt "h8de24263g6a54g41ffga483ge319b17d831e"
msgid "Are you... are you talking about your <i>cat</i>?"
msgstr "너... 네 <i>고양이</i> 얘기를 하는 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bfdeeb08-e46d-4d67-a539-ab127d898b48
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3:bfdeeb08-e46d-4d67-a539-ab127d898b48
msgctxt "hcabfbdf5g6a84g49a8g8450g19187341e13f"
msgid "No one came to visit you during your confinement?"
msgstr "갇혀 있는 동안 아무도 널 찾아오지 않았어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = c2f5c8b7-860c-ab1d-33ce-fdd51f735926
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3:c2f5c8b7-860c-ab1d-33ce-fdd51f735926
msgctxt "ha9f4575bgdb6cg4760g9abbgf60385988e46"
msgid "Wait. Are you saying..."
msgstr "잠깐, 네가 말하는 거 혹시..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c823b363-3326-4e4d-b66d-b6c8d6750098
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3:c823b363-3326-4e4d-b66d-b6c8d6750098
msgctxt "h08ebdf42gcf72g42d0g9cdcga992a85d89d8"
msgid "She must be very smart, to have done all that."
msgstr "그런 말을 해주다니 매우 똑똑할 것 같네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = c8950dec-995f-7675-e2e5-60ff3e00e043
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3:c8950dec-995f-7675-e2e5-60ff3e00e043
msgctxt "hba2b3e35g7486g4a9agb452gad0c5ca4e90d"
msgid ""
"I like that about you. It's one of your rarer qualities, though I fear my "
"ego can take no more of it tonight."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cc9c59b9-abdb-48a3-bd09-7f245777c1d3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3:cc9c59b9-abdb-48a3-bd09-7f245777c1d3
msgctxt "hc0b7702dg218cg46bbg9844g61a9ca8b7bbb"
msgid "You're doing just fine, Gale."
msgstr "잘 하고 있어, 게일."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = cd95abe5-3e14-420a-a9cb-17403bf15f31
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3:cd95abe5-3e14-420a-a9cb-17403bf15f31
msgctxt "h30d6a1c5g1295g409fga658g66a2d87e27d9"
msgid ""
"After I was afflicted with my condition, I locked myself in my tower for an "
"entire year. I was inconsolable, wallowing in my self-inflicted tragedy."
msgstr "내 증상으로 고통받게 된 이후, 난 내 타워에서 1년 내내 나오질 않았어. 스스로가 일으킨 비극에 빠져 위로받을 수 없었지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d288ae98-fa78-4d72-9b6e-9619faaf6d6d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale_CalledTaraCat = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3:d288ae98-fa78-4d72-9b6e-9619faaf6d6d
msgctxt "h3b648449gb9f0g4b50g9ef4g43980c6ebbea"
msgid "So I remind you of your pet? How romantic..."
msgstr "그래서 날 보면 반려동물이 생각난다는 거야? 퍽도 낭만적이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = d45294c1-a4af-0b74-b46f-d3a28298dcf6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - NIGHT_ORI_Gale_ElminsterVisit = False
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_State_DatingGale(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3:d45294c1-a4af-0b74-b46f-d3a28298dcf6
msgctxt "h5f08851eg9bb7g450bg9152gd616f9c54250"
msgid ""
"With my condition as volatile as it is, I fear any undue, er, excitement, "
"may tip it over the edge. So to speak."
msgstr "지금 내 상태가 불안정하니까 지나치게, 음, 흥분하면, 상황이 악화될까봐 걱정돼. 말하자면 그래."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d6017132-e945-a919-611a-1527e4bb9e34
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3:d6017132-e945-a919-611a-1527e4bb9e34
msgctxt "hdee6c1b9ga8abg4974gb978g0e58f94b32e7"
msgid ""
"Not as much as I hate talking about cats. Is there nothing else on your mind?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = d85f7153-2c7e-3691-a0d5-730b52936c32
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3:d85f7153-2c7e-3691-a0d5-730b52936c32
msgctxt "h4f69cca5g852fg4ad2gbfddg3df81fd12126"
msgid ""
"Perhaps we'd better leave it at that. My ineloquent tongue isn't worthy of "
"your ear at present."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = d9e320df-8143-415e-94a1-399dc7233879
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3:d9e320df-8143-415e-94a1-399dc7233879
msgctxt "hf09f3d7cg9327g42c0g977egdd7ed837f7bd"
msgid ""
"You remind me of her somewhat. You share her fierceness, and her passion."
msgstr "널 보면 타라가 생각나. 타라의 날카로움과 열정을 닮았어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = dd798dcb-2571-46e9-ab73-f46fae2d7c3e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3:dd798dcb-2571-46e9-ab73-f46fae2d7c3e
msgctxt "hdebd2d00g2b54g4507g8c8dgc00b60ffde84"
msgid "You remind me of her somewhat. You share her pragmatic streak."
msgstr "널 보면 타라가 생각나. 타라의 실용적인 면이 너와 닮았어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = de0003b7-9455-c662-8888-1168720ea310
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3:de0003b7-9455-c662-8888-1168720ea310
msgctxt "h9a48de5bg8413g454eg8c09g60d86ca83402"
msgid "Well, this seems as good a time as any for me to stop babbling on."
msgstr "이제 수다는 그만 떨어야겠다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e68e3e83-90fd-4f32-92ad-5f7f8d9d7d9d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3:e68e3e83-90fd-4f32-92ad-5f7f8d9d7d9d
msgctxt "h4cf93a4agcc4cg4c66g89b5geebf28d24db3"
msgid "Sounds, er, fun."
msgstr "어... 재밌어 보이네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = e7466ea0-d52b-4fa0-ae20-186b8e3a8800
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3:e7466ea0-d52b-4fa0-ae20-186b8e3a8800
msgctxt "hc7ff8f66gbda3g44adgb209g384b110e64d0"
msgid ""
"Not everyone is comfortable being alone with their thoughts. Though I never "
"felt alone with a book in my hand. Or with her for company."
msgstr "생각에 잠기는 게 편안하지 않은 사람도 많지. 하지만 나는 책을 읽을 때 외로움을 느낀 적이 없어. 그녀와 함께 있을 때도."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = e76fcfa6-8f29-0a36-ca55-5e3e03015c2d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3:e76fcfa6-8f29-0a36-ca55-5e3e03015c2d
msgctxt "h3d2a3728g920ag4650gaf14g505b57554ae3"
msgid ""
"Were I to recite that list, I fear we'd still be here at dusk tomorrow. Many "
"things, I assure you, but a conversation better saved for another time."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = ebf67ff3-0646-42d7-bbc8-89517bef2cb9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3:ebf67ff3-0646-42d7-bbc8-89517bef2cb9
msgctxt "h29fd264fgdb3dg4c20g959agf6a3008ce979"
msgid ""
"Very funny. But as we all know, nymphs are sticklers when it comes to their "
"bathing routines. You, my friend, haven't been near a fresh spring in a "
"tenday or more."
msgstr ""
"하 하. 하지만 님프는 정기적으로 목욕하는 거에 아주 민감하다는 걸 모두 알고 있지. 그리고 넌 한동안 깨끗한 샘물 근처에도 못 가 본 "
"것 같은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = ee64cad1-bf92-4250-8bf2-bab0eb46504c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3:ee64cad1-bf92-4250-8bf2-bab0eb46504c
msgctxt "h96aa67fbg103bg4d51g8789ge6d6a8a9d6da"
msgid "You remind me of her somewhat. You share a certain nobility of spirit."
msgstr "널 보면 타라가 생각나. 고결한 영혼이라는 점이 같아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = ef780487-03d1-4c1e-b606-643d1d018786
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - NIGHT_GoblinHunt_TieflingCelebration = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3:ef780487-03d1-4c1e-b606-643d1d018786
msgctxt "h966fa781g9450g43cfg8c50g470193319783"
msgid ""
"She'd be most impressed by our efforts saving these tieflings. Proud, even. "
"And I've given her little to be proud of recently."
msgstr "타라는 티플링들을 구해준 우리의 노력에 매우 감동받았을 거야. 심지어 자랑스러워했을지도. 최근엔 실망만 안겨주었거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = f3396ea5-bb99-4904-9e47-9be294d5560e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3:f3396ea5-bb99-4904-9e47-9be294d5560e
msgctxt "h7b4663eeg51e2g4a7bga6f8g908c239f68d3"
msgid "By Ahghairon's lost nose - no!"
msgstr "아가이론의 사라진 코에 맹세코, 아니야!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = fc6615a7-e232-3a94-ee19-89e90854cc3f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Gale3:fc6615a7-e232-3a94-ee19-89e90854cc3f
msgctxt "h7d46057dg0923g438dga264g52a784b2c709"
msgid ""
"I hope, though we've only known each other for a short time, I might be able "
"to count you among that number?"
msgstr "우리가 알게 된 지는 얼마 안 됐지만, 네가 나의 몇 안 되는 친구라고 말할 수도 있겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 010f1564-e484-feb0-6eab-dcd45140ab81
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CAMP_ShadowheartLaezelFight_State_ResolvedPeacefully = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel:010f1564-e484-feb0-6eab-dcd45140ab81
msgctxt "h73cbcd5cg8b68g408dg9514g9cbf95549be1"
msgid ""
"Given our history, I can't believe you're asking. And I can't believe I'm "
"saying 'yes'..."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 016eeeef-a538-59b7-3745-760f70cb4757
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel:016eeeef-a538-59b7-3745-760f70cb4757
msgctxt "h680d6735gbe52g452agafecgba71632dedc8"
msgid "I will not go long without pleasure."
msgstr "나는 즐거움이 없으면 오래 가지 못할 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 05e5630a-8e83-f1c4-b3cc-a1372443ae78
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel:05e5630a-8e83-f1c4-b3cc-a1372443ae78
msgctxt "h78880289g4961g4618gb65cgb55ffdf5f850"
msgid "For now."
msgstr "지금은 그렇겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 09228d2c-f1d4-d5cd-17c4-73e6ecd3b1ae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel:09228d2c-f1d4-d5cd-17c4-73e6ecd3b1ae
msgctxt "h791ee524ge3c6g404bg93e4g490c75bae6fe"
msgid ""
"Of all people, you set your sights on <i>me</i>? I'll have to think about it."
msgstr "여러 사람중에 유독, <i>나를</i> 눈여겨 봤던거야? 생각해봐야겠네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 09228d2c-f1d4-d5cd-17c4-73e6ecd3b1ae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel:09228d2c-f1d4-d5cd-17c4-73e6ecd3b1ae
msgctxt "h144a525fg23a7g4ed2g8996g270572512313"
msgid "I'll think about it."
msgstr "생각해 볼게."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0bf3dfd6-0c8c-cacc-8ebd-14956d6d1053
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel:0bf3dfd6-0c8c-cacc-8ebd-14956d6d1053
msgctxt "he2301c00ga0e9g4d7ag8bbdg40e402c4d40d"
msgid "Yes. I want your body, and I want it tonight."
msgstr "그래. 네 육체를 원해, 오늘 밤."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 10af6082-312a-7877-3e24-4877a9bbb18b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - WYLLCOMPANION = True
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_GalePartner(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_Celebration_LaezelChoseWyll(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel:10af6082-312a-7877-3e24-4877a9bbb18b
msgctxt "h54267496g9ed7g4564g9945g0422e303cee8"
msgid ""
"There are, after all, other spreads before me. Wyll looks particularly "
"tempting tonight."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 1250b363-38da-b2d1-9f7e-0cef703bf620
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_State_DoubleDating(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel:1250b363-38da-b2d1-9f7e-0cef703bf620
msgctxt "hbf62de08gfc58g41abgafffg583a4912cb5d"
msgid "I smell their blood on you still. I'd have liked to have tasted it."
msgstr "아직도 너에게 그들의 피 냄새가 나. 그걸 맛보고 싶어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 185c85a4-94d6-980a-7669-5dd60fc54dd7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(1) = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_GITHYANKI
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel:185c85a4-94d6-980a-7669-5dd60fc54dd7
msgctxt "h4292c5edg5702g4a21gb223ga63a5acbdf63"
msgid "Yes. Let our pleasure honour Vlaakith."
msgstr "그래. 우리 환희로 블라키스 님께 영광을 돌리자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 185c85a4-94d6-980a-7669-5dd60fc54dd7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel:185c85a4-94d6-980a-7669-5dd60fc54dd7
msgctxt "h385e8e74g6d7dg45e2g8ecbgdf0dbc0a05cc"
msgid "Yes. I will share my bed with you tonight."
msgstr "그래. 오늘 밤은 너와 침대를 나누도록 하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 196aaef2-2083-d47e-216a-d8a5aa6a46bb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_GalePartner(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel:196aaef2-2083-d47e-216a-d8a5aa6a46bb
msgctxt "h1e536fb4g16b7g46e4ga318g3dcc0f8c7ee1"
msgid "A pity for us you have promised your body to Gale."
msgstr "게일에게 너의 몸을 약속했다니, 참 유감이군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 1d9a8961-5797-8ba2-2726-7d71bea2ad65
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_Astarion_Knows_Vampireness = True
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_AstarionPartner(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel:1d9a8961-5797-8ba2-2726-7d71bea2ad65
msgctxt "h8192abf0g758eg44abg82f6g89d719b4c2b4"
msgid "A pity for us you have promised your body to Astarion."
msgstr "아스타리온에게 너의 몸을 약속했다니, 참 유감이군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 1eb85711-233c-e511-5e56-19d693d95d58
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - WYLLCOMPANION = True
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_GalePartner(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_Celebration_LaezelChoseWyll(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel:1eb85711-233c-e511-5e56-19d693d95d58
msgctxt "h719a4c89g8644g4af8ga13fg307b39ecf49a"
msgid ""
"I will take pleasure when I wish, and from whom I wish. Wyll looks "
"particularly tempting tonight."
msgstr "난 내가 원할 때, 원하는 이와 즐길 것이다. 오늘 밤은 윌이 특히 매력적으로 보이는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 203957be-a042-d6a4-5516-336222a7e118
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel:203957be-a042-d6a4-5516-336222a7e118
msgctxt "h30f71551gad8cg4877gbf51gbc99a56cac83"
msgid ""
"Another fortune yet stands before you. A warrior's flesh, rarely tasted."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 20d3ae80-741b-97de-b6be-f78917f535cd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel:20d3ae80-741b-97de-b6be-f78917f535cd
msgctxt "ha6e0a05egac00g487dg8fffg9b69a3acb4e5"
msgid "Vlaakith demands of me no less."
msgstr "블라키스 님은 내게 많은 것들을 요구하시지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 24e01d3d-d0c6-a9cd-6b5a-ae5f26e7ae27
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel:24e01d3d-d0c6-a9cd-6b5a-ae5f26e7ae27
msgctxt "h8f2a226dg280ag44c3gaa81g315d1c9991bf"
msgid "I've no doubt he's as seductive as he is succinct."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 27b65028-8fb1-8c77-8422-be487fdba039
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel:27b65028-8fb1-8c77-8422-be487fdba039
msgctxt "hcad0085cg21fbg4106ga47fg662dafcc844a"
msgid "I've no doubt she will satisfy your tastes for endless conversation."
msgstr "그녀가 너의 끝없는 대화의 취향을 만족시킬 것이라 믿어 의심치 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 2f7d7053-c802-92af-e6ba-667d99d9bb1b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel:2f7d7053-c802-92af-e6ba-667d99d9bb1b
msgctxt "h0d3cd689g6a74g492dg8a06g0a20c71ccb1d"
msgid "I've no doubt he will satisfy your tastes for the mundane."
msgstr "그가 따분한 녀석을 좋아하는 너의 취향을 만족시킬 것이라 믿어 의심치 않는다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 393cc57c-9089-30dc-0f4f-3928e846bf60
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel:393cc57c-9089-30dc-0f4f-3928e846bf60
msgctxt "ha4b6cde2g50e5g4dc8g9648gb75f1dc4e975"
msgid ""
"A night such as this calls for flesh to feast on. And I have chosen the "
"sweetest."
msgstr "이런 밤에는 탐닉할 육신이 있어야 하는 법. 그리고 난 그중 가장 달콤한 것을 선택한 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 3d854356-3152-77f9-080f-45b252091a28
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel:3d854356-3152-77f9-080f-45b252091a28
msgctxt "hd417424dg5725g4de8g8567g6295b9d16952"
msgid "I hope for your sake he doesn't come too near your neck."
msgstr "널 위해서 그가 네 목 근처에는 너무 가까이 가지 않기를 바라지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 4350e814-aa8a-53d4-c77c-89f36f0d417c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Laezel_Event_Act1Proposition(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel:4350e814-aa8a-53d4-c77c-89f36f0d417c
msgctxt "h28473d14g8b67g4f34g89a4gba7f7c595976"
msgid "I smell their blood on you still. I smell your moisture."
msgstr "아직도 네게서 그들의 피 냄새가 나. 너의 축축함도 느껴져."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 4698b100-9a43-ab2d-6209-8f770e026142
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GALECOMPANION = True
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_WyllPartner(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_Celebration_LaezelChoseGale(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel:4698b100-9a43-ab2d-6209-8f770e026142
msgctxt "h79bf7df7g1a5eg4f66g83efg57c7d14b8a9b"
msgid ""
"Oh, but do enjoy yourself this night. I intend to, myself. Gale looks "
"particularly tempting."
msgstr "하지만 오늘 밤은 즐기도록 해. 나도 그렇게 할 거니까. 게일이 특히 매력적으로 보이는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 470e32ec-a862-a0e3-4207-c00d518dff1f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_LaezelRefused(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel:470e32ec-a862-a0e3-4207-c00d518dff1f
msgctxt "hc2d35ce0g7895g4e48gb1e7ga7524fae906d"
msgid ""
"Too bad for us both your bunk will be quite busy. Take all the pleasures you "
"can, before dawn brings their end."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 483dd41c-ee22-49e7-8917-274386f87e4c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_ForgingOfTheHeart_State_KarlachSecondUpgrade = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel:483dd41c-ee22-49e7-8917-274386f87e4c
msgctxt "h47e9213ag946dg466dgacdbgfba8717c0765"
msgid "I'd love to share my bed with you tonight."
msgstr "오늘 밤 내 침대를 너와 함께 나누고 싶어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 48d75f3e-ebf9-5c14-bdae-8b8477429764
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_HasPartner(1) = True
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_LaezelPartner(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel:48d75f3e-ebf9-5c14-bdae-8b8477429764
msgctxt "h4e21174cgdb5dg4848g8b14g52f1cbc0ed5b"
msgid "<i>Yes.</i>"
msgstr "<i>그래.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 4948ac88-5316-9ef2-2c48-d177ff4689e9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_HasPartner(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel:4948ac88-5316-9ef2-2c48-d177ff4689e9
msgctxt "hc2d4048dg611ag4eb8g8742g8fc7b862528e"
msgid "A pity for us both you have promised yourself to another."
msgstr "다른 이와 약속했다니, 참 유감이군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 50d67023-f6e6-9184-21b0-718df282ba8a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GALECOMPANION = True
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_WyllPartner(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_Celebration_LaezelChoseGale(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel:50d67023-f6e6-9184-21b0-718df282ba8a
msgctxt "h12c60d29g1253g43f8ga1f4g93d00bd5d948"
msgid ""
"I will take pleasure when I wish, and from whom I wish. Gale looks "
"particularly tempting tonight."
msgstr "난 내가 원할 때, 원하는 이와 즐길 것이다. 오늘 밤은 게일이 특히 매력적으로 보이는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 51262c50-35ef-81ce-5370-463fbad11c8a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel:51262c50-35ef-81ce-5370-463fbad11c8a
msgctxt "h905c05f3ge12cg48ceg8926g345881520642"
msgid "Come morning, you will wonder."
msgstr "아침이 오면, 너는 궁금해질 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5261065e-309e-5db2-2220-b38d6d3af205
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel:5261065e-309e-5db2-2220-b38d6d3af205
msgctxt "hbfa88acegd110g49ecg9a08ge3c652f02f71"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 529e2655-9033-b2e9-b36b-094135bc5c4d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ASTARIONCOMPANION = True
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_ShadowheartPartner(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_Celebration_LaezelChoseAstarion(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel:529e2655-9033-b2e9-b36b-094135bc5c4d
msgctxt "h1971867bg07c8g4ea9g9347g25a229e2786d"
msgid ""
"There are, after all, other spreads before me. Astarion looks particularly "
"tempting tonight."
msgstr "결국 내겐 다른 선택지도 있잖아. 오늘 밤 아스타리온이 유난히 매혹적이네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 53524f44-ae03-737a-5e40-dd6eac692d37
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_ShadowheartPartner(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel:53524f44-ae03-737a-5e40-dd6eac692d37
msgctxt "h1de96991g9494g451bgac6fg55e67bc02f21"
msgid "A pity for us you have promised your night to the half-elf."
msgstr "네가 그 하프 엘프와 함께 밤을 보내기로 했다니, 유감이군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 53976491-4ce5-af47-9edb-4af43b899dea
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel:53976491-4ce5-af47-9edb-4af43b899dea
msgctxt "h46d2b46ag0e01g4f27g8b2ag446528ee1dc3"
msgid "I'm grateful for your aid. You really are a gifted warrior."
msgstr "네가 도와줘서 정말 고마워. 넌 진정으로 탁월한 전사야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 54f1f7c9-4de8-eef0-72e5-1102795fdcd4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel:54f1f7c9-4de8-eef0-72e5-1102795fdcd4
msgctxt "h2b944cf3g36e8g43c2g8c5agada9f781ed6c"
msgid "Perhaps."
msgstr "그럴지도 모르지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 55eae132-17e9-6f5e-8b18-a6835665343c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_GalePartner(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel:55eae132-17e9-6f5e-8b18-a6835665343c
msgctxt "h43359140g0804g4acega347gaca1851a0914"
msgid "A pity for us you have promised your night to Gale."
msgstr "네가 게일과 밤을 보내기로 했다니, 참 유감이군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 56ea67b6-3286-b125-22d9-c6d10c43fd1d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_LaezelRefused(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel:56ea67b6-3286-b125-22d9-c6d10c43fd1d
msgctxt "h2847485eg1ae0g49f5g88cbg014e6e0875a2"
msgid "I respect your error."
msgstr "네 실수를 존중하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 5759f26f-4585-5543-706e-b344faad2e66
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel:5759f26f-4585-5543-706e-b344faad2e66
msgctxt "he40b07d4g28e2g4dbdg8c92g61cbfca69355"
msgid "And I <i>will</i> take what is mine."
msgstr "그리고 난, <i>반드시</i> 내 것을 가져갈 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 5951fd33-c07d-2ffa-b48a-701eadd56a96
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel:5951fd33-c07d-2ffa-b48a-701eadd56a96
msgctxt "h1f3b4767gfc24g4b6bgb6ebg72fedf06f87e"
msgid "But come morning, you will wonder."
msgstr "하지만 아침이 오면, 너는 궁금해질 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 597025a5-26c8-5a08-70df-9fa68c415150
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_LaezelPartner(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel:597025a5-26c8-5a08-70df-9fa68c415150
msgctxt "he46e1e13g5d65g4f99gb7b1gb5b378d9bf75"
msgid "Soon. When you rest, I will come."
msgstr "곧. 네가 잠자리에 들면, 내가 찾아오겠다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 5c91b531-5596-d48b-5870-b6b4b8fe154c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel:5c91b531-5596-d48b-5870-b6b4b8fe154c
msgctxt "hfe236c55g160fg4bddgb042g7e4aabe1312d"
msgid "I've no doubt he will satisfy your tastes for endless conversation."
msgstr "그가 너의 끝없는 대화의 취향을 만족시킬 것이라 믿어 의심치 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 604f0033-7d92-9ab1-60e9-ca2bc2b4c820
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel:604f0033-7d92-9ab1-60e9-ca2bc2b4c820
msgctxt "h647a891dg9418g4ea1g93b7g0ab6d64c8bf6"
msgid "Celebrate now. Come dawn, we depart."
msgstr "지금은 축하를 나누자. 해가 밝으면, 떠나는 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 6106779c-8339-a1bb-e423-0a6dea3e44d0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_LaezelRejected(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel:6106779c-8339-a1bb-e423-0a6dea3e44d0
msgctxt "head23337gf2a5g48dag83a5g5ddd7a88a5de"
msgid "Celebrate now. Come dawn, we depart."
msgstr "지금은 축하를 나누자. 해가 밝으면, 떠나는 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 643c6bfc-34ce-a5b1-1fff-2ec13429a027
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - WYLLCOMPANION = True
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_GalePartner(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_Celebration_LaezelChoseWyll(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel:643c6bfc-34ce-a5b1-1fff-2ec13429a027
msgctxt "h15e64dd9gae5fg45a3g92f3gfed56bbde11a"
msgid ""
"Oh, but do enjoy yourself this night. I intend to, myself. Wyll looks "
"particularly tempting."
msgstr "하지만 오늘 밤은 즐기도록 해. 나도 그렇게 할 거니까. 윌이 특히 매력적으로 보이는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 67fd9c3b-7af9-47d4-0842-6e002006d71d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel:67fd9c3b-7af9-47d4-0842-6e002006d71d
msgctxt "h0231ddc7g6b07g4332g97e1g72827ddaa12d"
msgid "Yes."
msgstr "그래."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 6938a338-b83e-ad08-6935-4544f9c30592
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel:6938a338-b83e-ad08-6935-4544f9c30592
msgctxt "hf4a455c3g69dcg41a0g871ag38b34ffde7d2"
msgid ""
"I will do no such thing - not when you have turned your back on me so often."
msgstr "네가 그렇게 자주 내게 등을 돌리는데, 내가 그런 짓을 할 리가."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 84c4cd70-d04f-ea99-d4e4-40c9325967de
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel:84c4cd70-d04f-ea99-d4e4-40c9325967de
msgctxt "h5356bbc8g0bf2g428fg99e5g18ad71bebe2a"
msgid "I don't appreciate the snide tone. I'm happy with my choice."
msgstr "그런 헐뜯는 말투는 마음에 들지 않는데. 난 내 선택에 만족해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 8b971a5c-92ef-ba4e-2701-77790de96848
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_KarlachPartner(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel:8b971a5c-92ef-ba4e-2701-77790de96848
msgctxt "h51fe19b3g824cg4902gad85g703541cfd19e"
msgid "A pity for us you have promised your body to the tiefling."
msgstr "그 티플링에게 너의 몸을 약속했다니, 참 유감이군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 92321ce0-3d9e-b6da-4bd8-64f12692c102
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel:92321ce0-3d9e-b6da-4bd8-64f12692c102
msgctxt "h7ca806e8g3d07g487dg875fgd7cb14f22803"
msgid "Bah - think if you must. The chance will pass come light of day."
msgstr "흥, 생각해봐도 상관없어. 날이 밝으면 기회는 사라질 테니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 9283cfc3-c3ac-f959-7dbd-57470cdde4f2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Laezel_Event_Act1RomanceAccept(1) = True
#.      - ORI_State_DatingLaezel(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel:9283cfc3-c3ac-f959-7dbd-57470cdde4f2
msgctxt "hf03d8615g561dg46bfga35egff98e01d5560"
msgid "A glorious reward for a glorious battle."
msgstr "영광스러운 전투에 대한 영광스러운 보상."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 95d86cc9-66ad-6d83-d0cc-df473a26998f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_LaezelRefused(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel:95d86cc9-66ad-6d83-d0cc-df473a26998f
msgctxt "hc172ba24g8749g4b86g9a04gd0f246732a2d"
msgid "Celebrate now. Come dawn, we depart."
msgstr "지금은 축하를 나누자. 해가 밝으면, 떠나는 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 95f07c4b-e568-847d-9d51-35942318c8ef
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel:95f07c4b-e568-847d-9d51-35942318c8ef
msgctxt "hdabf5a5eg44bfg4425gb13bg65dfec620730"
msgid "I've no doubt she will satisfy your tastes for the mundane."
msgstr "그녀가 따분한 여자를 좋아하는 너의 취향을 만족시킬 것이라 믿어 의심치 않는다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 96d69e9f-d7e2-7ba7-3355-68330e07440d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_HasPartner(1) = True
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_HasMet_Laezel(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel:96d69e9f-d7e2-7ba7-3355-68330e07440d
msgctxt "h3a8e73edg8da7g4aadg976fg9b760a46a6f2"
msgid "To think you might have known paradise."
msgstr "네가 낙원을 알게 됐을지도."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 970bb886-8db5-7e97-5a37-782ce3d2675a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_HasPartner(1) = False
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_HasMet_Laezel(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel:970bb886-8db5-7e97-5a37-782ce3d2675a
msgctxt "h32bb7859g2d9dg4dddg976eg65a0047872df"
msgid "Mm. You have given in."
msgstr "음. 포기했군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 997e01d7-ff8c-6ab4-50d0-a18b06f3ef67
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ASTARIONCOMPANION = True
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_ShadowheartPartner(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_Celebration_LaezelChoseAstarion(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel:997e01d7-ff8c-6ab4-50d0-a18b06f3ef67
msgctxt "h4bf9fc68gd390g4f6bga3dfg814a6ab900c7"
msgid ""
"Oh, but do enjoy yourself this night. I intend to, myself. Astarion looks "
"particularly tempting."
msgstr "하지만 오늘 밤은 즐기도록 해. 나도 그렇게 할 거니까. 아스타리온이 특히 매력적으로 보이는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 9b0fa5f1-6baa-9e7d-c5c0-add5e57436aa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_HasMet_Laezel(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHunt_HasMet_Laezel(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel:9b0fa5f1-6baa-9e7d-c5c0-add5e57436aa
msgctxt "hc261ac7eg6427g4e17gb372g8aa922a8fb96"
msgid ""
"I have seen the <i>kith'raki</i> tear a screaming neogi's legs from its "
"belly to fashion into blades."
msgstr "난 <i>키스락</i>들이 비명 지르는 네오기의 다리를 찢어내 검으로 사용하는 모습을 본 적도 있다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a1ce2d44-d4f3-6f33-b486-fe1717e25303
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_HasPartner(1) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel:a1ce2d44-d4f3-6f33-b486-fe1717e25303
msgctxt "h571dd3f2gcde4g4e43g8c68g50593b73c8ff"
msgid ""
"Strange at seems with all that's happened between us, you might still "
"persuade me to your bed."
msgstr "우리 사이에서 일어난 일들을 생각해보면 이상하지만, 너는 여전히 너의 침대로 날 유혹할 수 있을 것 같아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a1ce2d44-d4f3-6f33-b486-fe1717e25303
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_HasPartner(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel:a1ce2d44-d4f3-6f33-b486-fe1717e25303
msgctxt "h33b419cdg6ed4g4c82g9d07g640a2058a89f"
msgid "You might still persuade me to share the night with you instead."
msgstr "나에게 대신 너와 함께 밤을 보내라고 설득할 수도 있잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = a209bee1-4a84-fb62-94c6-d0f2ffc6e55a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel:a209bee1-4a84-fb62-94c6-d0f2ffc6e55a
msgctxt "he742b8eag1317g4c9eg9f60gef0b5a048f4a"
msgid "I will take pleasure when I wish, and from whom I wish."
msgstr "난 내가 원할 때, 원하는 이와 즐길 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = a28652d5-f36a-e9dd-e11c-67388aec41ef
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel:a28652d5-f36a-e9dd-e11c-67388aec41ef
msgctxt "h2bde51cbg3cc1g452bgb7b4g6f6282b7d4f1"
msgid "So you say."
msgstr "그게 네 생각이군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a8d6d03e-feab-4e71-69b3-b9629a8634e1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel:a8d6d03e-feab-4e71-69b3-b9629a8634e1
msgctxt "h1bc8fa1agd906g4a07g860bg16c69ee88b3b"
msgid "Sorry, but I'm not interested in you like that."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = aa640af9-1616-eebe-c401-d35fc7e687e4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel:aa640af9-1616-eebe-c401-d35fc7e687e4
msgctxt "h338c64cdga361g4cbag84d5g0581f8b0218a"
msgid "Sex."
msgstr "섹스."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = aad8d3b6-5c07-3570-0a9f-b4d46f3c0564
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel:aad8d3b6-5c07-3570-0a9f-b4d46f3c0564
msgctxt "h7987d58egeaefg4146g90b1g578b63b120a1"
msgid "Vlaakith demands of me no less."
msgstr "블라키스 님은 내게 많은 것들을 요구하시지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = aba54c20-8628-5957-fb59-23f55dbb4f7d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GALECOMPANION = True
