msgctxt "hae8093adgfad5g4e15g9e1cgd9cef3130270"
msgid "For you, it's as clear as cool water you have that heroism within you."
msgstr "네겐, 시원한 물처럼 맑은 영웅심이 내재되어 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_ROM_Wyll_PostEA
