msgctxt "h0dde00b5g42e4g47c1g89a0gb96ce16e6141"
msgid ""
"I'm a devil. I love the people from the grove, but I unsettle them deep down."
msgstr "나는 데빌이야. 숲의 사람들을 사랑하지만 마음 깊은 곳에서는 그들을 불안하게 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_ROM_Wyll_PostEA
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 614cb4d1-4983-6874-530a-a69cfc617f55
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_ROM_Wyll_PostEA:614cb4d1-4983-6874-530a-a69cfc617f55
msgctxt "h96262656g938ag4190g95e8gc7b57066db2d"
msgid "But not tonight. Tonight is about you."
msgstr "하지만 오늘밤은 아냐. 오늘밤은 널 위한 거니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_ROM_Wyll_PostEA
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 62093bb2-1541-f040-f8d6-7ab96d9dafbc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_ROM_Wyll_PostEA:62093bb2-1541-f040-f8d6-7ab96d9dafbc
msgctxt "had33ce12g0309g4602gb9b8gfbdff467d6f1"
msgid "It's a long shot, but - maybe you've grown fond of me."
msgstr "그럴 일은 없겠지만, 어쩌면 그새 정이라도 들었는지 모르지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_ROM_Wyll_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 630497d0-6115-3a68-044b-313f6bf9e7c1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_ROM_Wyll_PostEA:630497d0-6115-3a68-044b-313f6bf9e7c1
msgctxt "h8a9fb912g6637g448egb4a7g5c6e6b8f8a73"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_ROM_Wyll_PostEA
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 63db0a72-89a2-8cab-0d5d-37121dc89181
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_ROM_Wyll_PostEA:63db0a72-89a2-8cab-0d5d-37121dc89181
msgctxt "hc22b5c54geccfg4b5dgb699ga87e215ace06"
msgid "Ouch! You don't need to mock me when I'm feeling low."
msgstr "아야! 기분이 안 좋을 땐 조롱하지 말라구."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_ROM_Wyll_PostEA
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 63e347d5-9c6f-3e50-96aa-870539fb2ea1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_ROM_Wyll_PostEA:63e347d5-9c6f-3e50-96aa-870539fb2ea1
msgctxt "h6861cfeeg2d61g471bg886cg40cad8f9058c"
msgid "Thanks. It's good to know someone's looking out."
msgstr "고마워. 누가 신경써준다니 좋군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_ROM_Wyll_PostEA
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 652e3075-4b88-2009-b0c8-d37c0ca492e4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_ROM_Wyll_PostEA:652e3075-4b88-2009-b0c8-d37c0ca492e4
msgctxt "hcb8174d5g05e2g4f95ga6f5gdb55a736240e"
msgid ""
"In truth, I don't feel in a festive mood, and didn't want to cast a grey "
"cloud over the night."
msgstr "사실, 축제를 즐긴만한 기분이 아니야, 분위기를 흐리고 싶지도 않았고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_ROM_Wyll_PostEA
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 6a5c40f8-eb3b-ef94-fd2c-b067e728709c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_ROM_Wyll_PostEA:6a5c40f8-eb3b-ef94-fd2c-b067e728709c
msgctxt "h56aa247egeceag4327ga322g57742a40c836"
msgid ""
"You cut quite a fine figure. I can just imagine leading you with an entire "
"ballroom watching."
msgstr "넌 정말 멋진 모습을 보여줬어. 연회장 전체가 지켜보는 가운데 네가 이끄는 모습이 딱 상상이 돼."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_ROM_Wyll_PostEA
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 6e79566c-9a08-f29c-ce5f-8f136c6a8f9d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_ROM_Wyll_PostEA:6e79566c-9a08-f29c-ce5f-8f136c6a8f9d
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h025984c3g7fe1g4d20g8498gf4d04332c5a8"
msgid "But off with you. This is your day! Have a dance. Enjoy the music."
msgstr "여튼 가 봐. 오늘은 너의 날이잖아! 춤도 추고. 음악을 즐겨."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_ROM_Wyll_PostEA
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 6e8c27f8-78d4-fce9-61d8-f5cc46a2fead
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_ROM_Wyll_PostEA:6e8c27f8-78d4-fce9-61d8-f5cc46a2fead
msgctxt "hcf6d59d3g9b7ag403ega6cdg8ee844610664"
msgid "Maybe."
msgstr "그럴지도."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_ROM_Wyll_PostEA
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 6f1e4660-7fd0-bb45-9dbb-912adde03915
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_ROM_Wyll_PostEA:6f1e4660-7fd0-bb45-9dbb-912adde03915
msgctxt "hadda219egf603g4e15gbd8ag381f8562e292"
msgid ""
"It's a long shot, but - maybe you've grown fond of me. Gods know I've grown "
"fond of you."
msgstr "확률은 낮지만, 네가 나를 좋아하게 된건지도 모르지. 내가 너를 좋아하게 된 건 신은 아실거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_ROM_Wyll_PostEA
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 7092f837-2e5e-cac1-17ee-cf01d7ad95b7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_ROM_Wyll_PostEA:7092f837-2e5e-cac1-17ee-cf01d7ad95b7
msgctxt "h281985f7ge973g4169gb477g382aa0d00598"
msgid "Still - it's a night to remember. You've made sure of that."
msgstr "그래도, 기억에 남을 만한 밤이야. 네가 그렇게 만들었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_ROM_Wyll_PostEA
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 7246294d-8ec3-eafe-fd30-ae9596fe950d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_ROM_Wyll_PostEA:7246294d-8ec3-eafe-fd30-ae9596fe950d
msgctxt "h685b4335g385bg470dg9868gbd8e19035b49"
msgid "As I seem to unsettle everyone nowadays."
msgstr "요즘은 내가 모두를 불안하게 만드는 것 같으니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_ROM_Wyll_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7470e061-615f-80b5-79bd-dfc276913ee3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_ROM_Wyll_PostEA:7470e061-615f-80b5-79bd-dfc276913ee3
msgctxt "h9544cf12g7575g4547gb2b4gdcdd59b2f127"
msgid "So? If they die, they die. That's life for you."
msgstr "그래서? 죽으면 그냥 죽는 거야. 삶이란 게 다 그런 거지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_ROM_Wyll_PostEA
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 782392f1-eeef-3312-4fae-c3c33c44e6ff
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_ROM_Wyll_PostEA:782392f1-eeef-3312-4fae-c3c33c44e6ff
msgctxt "h5cfd6460ga96ag4683gb9dagdef0de161e14"
msgid ""
"If so, I'm afraid I must remain a passing fancy. If not, well, it wouldn't "
"be my first misjudgement."
msgstr "만약 그렇다면, 이 유대감이 일시적인 변덕은 아닐까 두려워. 그게 아니라면, 음, 내 촉이 잘못된 게 처음도 아니니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_ROM_Wyll_PostEA
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 7a45aa23-5c80-6413-8ede-d76777e95f2f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_ROM_Wyll_PostEA:7a45aa23-5c80-6413-8ede-d76777e95f2f
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "hc5dc6697g756ag4fffga9adg51fdb5a24fdc"
msgid "Too many reasons to count. I might share them someday."
msgstr "너무 많은 이유가 있지. 언젠가 이야기 할 기회가 있을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_ROM_Wyll_PostEA
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 7a65374c-912f-505d-95cf-90870254fdba
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_ROM_Wyll_PostEA:7a65374c-912f-505d-95cf-90870254fdba
msgctxt "h700e07c5gde86g4964gbd99g9992d7deb613"
msgid ""
"Aw, by Balduran's elbow, I can't stay feeling gloomy with you looking at me "
"like that."
msgstr "이런, 발더란의 팔꿈치에 맹세컨대, 네가 그렇게 쳐다보고 있으면 계속 우울한 기분이 들 수가 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_ROM_Wyll_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7e0610f6-b80c-f702-46d5-74416b3ff65c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DRAGONBORN(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_ROM_Wyll_PostEA:7e0610f6-b80c-f702-46d5-74416b3ff65c
msgctxt "hfc63d8d9g85e2g4812g97dag7d5f6fb4b822"
msgid "To our kind, those features just make you more attractive."
msgstr "우리 종족에게는 그 특징들이 당신을 더 매력적으로 보이게 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_ROM_Wyll_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7ebcad99-aca4-2bb1-e204-bdc5c30eda51
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_ROM_Wyll_PostEA:7ebcad99-aca4-2bb1-e204-bdc5c30eda51
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h0554d69dg4035g47b9g99a7g94863e47f879"
msgid "Sounds like some pretty words for sulking to me!"
msgstr "부루퉁하다를 좋게 말하면 그렇지!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_ROM_Wyll_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7f3b7680-82b9-296c-ffae-dfe84e0dcbda
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_ROM_Wyll_PostEA:7f3b7680-82b9-296c-ffae-dfe84e0dcbda
msgctxt "ha4051cfdg3f6fg4972ga343g60a67fee5618"
msgid "Have some faith. Whatever happens, they'll survive it."
msgstr "믿음을 가져. 무슨 일이 있더라도, 저들은 살아남을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_ROM_Wyll_PostEA
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 7f9a805a-0e0e-6799-da89-ba2e2e1505dd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_ROM_Wyll_PostEA:7f9a805a-0e0e-6799-da89-ba2e2e1505dd
msgctxt "hdda24684g9d7fg4f09gbec4g5b68f7199371"
msgid ""
"I - well, then. Erm, you've got a party to get back to. After all, tonight "
"is about <i>you</i>."
msgstr "난, 흠, 이제. 음, 동료들에게 돌아가야겠지. 어쨌든간에, 오늘밤은 <i>너</i>의 밤이잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_ROM_Wyll_PostEA
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 86039601-7f8e-31fa-f5e6-dc05d6de4c17
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - WYLL_DEVIL(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_ROM_Wyll_PostEA:86039601-7f8e-31fa-f5e6-dc05d6de4c17
msgctxt "hd73aa9dfgf3eeg42fega2f9g2befb5e9e8f7"
msgid "The world spits on those partial to devils. I'm hardly a prime catch."
msgstr "세상은 데빌을 옹호하는 사람들에게 침을 뱉어. 난 그다지 좋은 상대가 아니야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_ROM_Wyll_PostEA
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 8a0d69bf-cd86-58c6-08f2-61caab89bcf6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_ROM_Wyll_PostEA:8a0d69bf-cd86-58c6-08f2-61caab89bcf6
msgctxt "hbdc56b94g8619g4718ga684ga1425843b205"
msgid "Let me think... Why are you really here?"
msgstr "생각해보자... 진짜로 여기 왜 온거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_ROM_Wyll_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8b65761e-fa6f-7488-568f-a4bdbc8c47a8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_ROM_Wyll_PostEA:8b65761e-fa6f-7488-568f-a4bdbc8c47a8
msgctxt "hf802274agd43bg4057g9cabg0cc70e573810"
msgid "Don't complain. We're all still alive, aren't we?"
msgstr "불평하지 마. 우린 아직 살아있잖아, 안그래?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_ROM_Wyll_PostEA
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 8ec3247f-5939-cf35-5a10-8337127f1e67
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_ROM_Wyll_PostEA:8ec3247f-5939-cf35-5a10-8337127f1e67
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h48966799g6aa6g47c0g8476g86ac38c8d0b0"
msgid "Not that I'd necessarily object."
msgstr "내가 꼭 반대한다는 건 아니야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_ROM_Wyll_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8fa78b7f-3ce9-f025-c32f-1eaa8491640d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_ROM_Wyll_PostEA:8fa78b7f-3ce9-f025-c32f-1eaa8491640d
msgctxt "h5a8f5e12g14d1g47e8g8329g239ddf531724"
msgid "Because I like you. And I want to know you better."
msgstr "왜냐면 널 좋아하거든. 그리고 널 더 알고 싶어."

