msgctxt "h9bc5377bg1c0cg4b69ga79fg09b1da6df621"
msgid "I mean - the Blade hasn't exactly lived up to his own reputation."
msgstr "내 말은, 칼날은 자신의 명성에 걸맞게 살지 못했어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_ROM_Wyll_PostEA
