msgctxt "ha0a66ef5ga209g4a14g9758g73e461e329f5"
msgid "Ah, I'll be fine. Seeing you has cheered me more than you can know."
msgstr "아, 금방 괜찮아질 거야. 네가 여기 나타나 줘서 얼마나 위안이 되는지 모를걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_ROM_Wyll_PostEA
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = c3ac7c9d-5b75-2fde-d8e0-451ebabda8fd
