#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h6f80bc23ge762g4a15g8d2fg2d22bd2d7be4"
msgid "Then we share a similar affliction. For I've grown fond of you too."
msgstr "그럼 우린 비슷한 고통을 나누고 있는 거네. 나도 널 좋아하게 되었으니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_ROM_Wyll_PostEA
