msgctxt "h243f880aga8e3g41e9g88d1g82f01d5067c4"
msgid "You're safe another day. Really, that should be enough."
msgstr "넌 오늘까진 무사해서 좋았나. 정말로, 더 이상 바라면 안 될 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_ROM_Wyll_PostEA
