msgctxt "hd99a69b2g45dag4e19ga599gd6454d42d89e"
msgid "She's started a huge fire, and you're trying to save my life."
msgstr "칼라크가 큰 불을 내서, 지금 내 목숨 구해주러 온 거지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_ROM_Wyll_PostEA
