msgctxt "h79b3f18cg1952g4fc7ga231g672bb5673b99"
msgid ""
"You have a vow from the Blade. He will show you a wonderful time, another "
"night."
msgstr "넌 칼날로부터 하나의 다짐을 받았어. 또 다른 밤, 멋진 시간을 보여줄 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_ROM_Wyll_PostEA
