msgctxt "hcc8aabfegaad1g4b1bga421gdb2cfd729c39"
msgid "Come on, you're exaggerating. Not that much has changed."
msgstr "야, 그건 너무 과장이잖아. 별로 변하지도 않았구만."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_ROM_Wyll_PostEA
