#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_ROM_Wyll_PostEA:d6c3ff6c-bcc9-04ee-a5b5-54c8b3cab6e5
msgctxt "h7942baeag2d84g4b99ga5cbg80acda2cdbee"
msgid ""
"Some time alone beneath the stars, and I'll be back to my old self. Promise."
msgstr "별 아래서 혼자 시간을 좀 보내면, 예전의 나로 돌아가 있을 거야. 약속할게."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_ROM_Wyll_PostEA
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = d84e3648-7f27-2a55-8971-99deddad0aa2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_ROM_Wyll_PostEA:d84e3648-7f27-2a55-8971-99deddad0aa2
msgctxt "h6bf64dfage0e1g416agad27g558c9601a47d"
msgid "You pull them off far more finely than I do."
msgstr "네 말 솜씨가 나보다 훨씬 더 품위 있군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_ROM_Wyll_PostEA
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = d8773387-2385-5397-3bdd-5c60ae52d33b
