msgctxt "hde31ed8fg8b51g4e65g8d47g38b32fd9a443"
msgid ""
"Now, you've got a party to get back to. Don't forget, tonight is about "
"<i>you</i>."
msgstr "이제 파티에 돌아가야지. 잊지마, 오늘 밤은 <i>널</i>위한 거니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_ROM_Wyll_PostEA
