msgctxt "h873569f2g542eg4cf6gb7d6g40d57dd8e0d6"
msgid "Much to the exhaustion of the good ladies and gentlemen of the Gate."
msgstr "게이트의 많은 선량한 신사 숙녀들이 탈진하셨지."

