"Shar..."
msgstr "비슷한 거야. 샤님과 상관없는 것은 전부 거부하라고 배웠거든..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 122b75ea-cca0-56c7-6c2f-2823adb920dd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:122b75ea-cca0-56c7-6c2f-2823adb920dd
msgctxt "h57855352g5a53g4d4agac9cg088edbbbcc55"
msgid "If you do that, well... I see no reason why we shouldn't get closer."
msgstr "네가 그런다면, 뭐... 우리가 더 가까워지지 않을 이유가 없지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 152800ae-0807-47c3-ca24-76760457dfd3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:152800ae-0807-47c3-ca24-76760457dfd3
msgctxt "hd08e0e30ge1beg4ccdg8815g3b31a182b7ff"
msgid ""
"There - some liquid courage. And try to get some rest too if you can; "
"tomorrow's another day."
msgstr "봐, 취기가 용기를 주잖아. 이제 푹 쉬어, 내일은 또 다른 날이 기다리고 있으니."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 156f1292-0192-d394-5cf3-ea9da5a768eb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:156f1292-0192-d394-5cf3-ea9da5a768eb
msgctxt "heb1eaceeg1389g4c83g9296ga6e0c4584cde"
msgid ""
"You're putting words in my mouth - I never said I disliked you. It's just we "
"have some work to do, to get on each other's good sides."
msgstr "내가 할 말을 대신하지 마, 널 싫어한다고 한 적은 없어. 다만 아직 서로를 알아갈 시간이 부족했을 뿐이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 16603d5c-4e50-1854-0b3d-5b7bad39dd2d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:16603d5c-4e50-1854-0b3d-5b7bad39dd2d
msgctxt "hfeab2902g1169g4ac3g9f5eg6d5b5a1de5ad"
msgid "I wouldn't quite say that... but no, that's not what I mean."
msgstr "내가 그렇게 말하진 않았을 거야... 내 뜻은 그게 아니야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 17848524-e574-d248-3140-7ff2805801a4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - ff03d474-7d7d-b098-ccee-6b873f44651e_GaveRomanceHint = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:17848524-e574-d248-3140-7ff2805801a4
msgctxt "hc7422d2ag6fa2g428ag97c7g25dd5e1b9920"
msgid ""
"And yes, I'm sure there's someone out there for you. You should go see who'd "
"like to spend the night with the saviour of the grove..."
msgstr "그리고, 맞아, 분명 저기 널 기다리는 누군가가 있을 거야. 숲의 구원자와 밤을 보내고 싶은 사람을 찾아봐..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1a926d89-0d34-c24c-7c5f-18a8cb4bae56
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:1a926d89-0d34-c24c-7c5f-18a8cb4bae56
msgctxt "hde3af856gd11fg4fc9gbebdgeab46e589408"
msgid "Another time."
msgstr "다음에."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 1c906310-81e0-e96d-e04b-69e817ce4863
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:1c906310-81e0-e96d-e04b-69e817ce4863
msgctxt "h7b59e8b4g137cg498ag8132g9ff6ce12a17a"
msgid "Best enjoyed someplace private, I think."
msgstr "사적인 곳에서 즐겼으면 좋겠는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 1c964645-d94a-5a6e-1fb1-8a7967ffdb4a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:1c964645-d94a-5a6e-1fb1-8a7967ffdb4a
msgctxt "h04d01b22gd881g4753gaf41g0fcb8abfe29c"
msgid ""
"Far be it from me to judge. Blood must still be running a little hot after "
"everything."
msgstr "평가하려는 건 아니야. 이 모든 걸 겪었으니, 분명 아직 피가 끓겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 1e0b1331-3d99-cc16-65e1-ee46dc2e08b2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_WyllPartner(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:1e0b1331-3d99-cc16-65e1-ee46dc2e08b2
msgctxt "hcf23e93dgf644g4cf3gbb36g9aa88bb5eaa3"
msgid "I saw you with Wyll. You two looked... cosy."
msgstr "네가 윌과 함께 있는 걸 봤어. 둘이 아주... 친밀해 보이던데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 20afbad1-4e11-d933-111e-a6aa3cf754a9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:20afbad1-4e11-d933-111e-a6aa3cf754a9
msgctxt "h7b1e0231g8707g4c28g8693g700eb1247f58"
msgid ""
"Maybe you would. But I'm not cruel enough to get your hopes up. In spite of "
"what some might believe..."
msgstr "혹시 모르지. 하지만 나는 널 희망고문할 만큼 잔인하지 않아. 누가 어떻게 생각하든..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 22375eda-70ad-3220-c6f5-e9529535d790
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:22375eda-70ad-3220-c6f5-e9529535d790
msgctxt "h3caf47cbgd236g4ac8gab61gd0418b823ccd"
msgid "Maybe I'd like to celebrate with you..."
msgstr "너와 함께 축하를 나누고 싶을지도 모르지..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 231610d6-5b27-f029-33af-b2b7fed7ac3f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_ShadowheartRefused(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:231610d6-5b27-f029-33af-b2b7fed7ac3f
msgctxt "he14de324g9347g4805g8f7ag3761d2597533"
msgid "I already got my answer. Let's not make this awkward."
msgstr "이미 대답했잖아. 더 이상 어색해지진 말자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 248a8c30-d379-f9b6-d556-014483c1e261
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_ShadowheartPartner(1) = True
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_HasPartner(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:248a8c30-d379-f9b6-d556-014483c1e261
msgctxt "h1691bd88g4dc0g4a91g9bf4g4562c55eb4a6"
msgid "Not tonight."
msgstr "오늘 밤은 아니야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 288aaddf-6899-8467-9aba-caef2c5873fa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ShadowHeart_InParty_Knows_SharWorshipper = True
#.      - CAMP_ShadowheartLaezelFight_State_ResolvedPeacefully = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:288aaddf-6899-8467-9aba-caef2c5873fa
msgctxt "h463137cfg74eeg4873g9f7agba3762fbfae5"
msgid ""
"I'm not half as mysterious as you might think. Respect my privacy, my "
"beliefs, keep us focused on finding a cure..."
msgstr "난 네 생각만큼 비밀스럽지는 않아. 내 사생활과 믿음을 존중하고, 치료할 방법을 찾는데만 집중하면..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 28e105c6-f637-7e0b-e2aa-643fbf902f1a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:28e105c6-f637-7e0b-e2aa-643fbf902f1a
msgctxt "h7af8bdcag6f24g4417g893fg1befd9bfa2e0"
msgid ""
"Oh you do, do you? I'm not some dewy-eyed tiefling maiden you just saved - "
"you'll need to do a lot more leg-work before I commit to any hip-work."
msgstr "오, 그러셔? 난 네가 방금 구해준 눈물 맺힌 티플링 처녀 같은 게 아니야. 나랑 자고 싶다면 그것보단 노력해야 할 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 2a825101-9759-9916-ba3c-7c747178ca11
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart_CaughtMindmeld(1) = False
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_ShadowheartRejected(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:2a825101-9759-9916-ba3c-7c747178ca11
msgctxt "h4ea91634ge98dg4b2bga63agc989de4ef829"
msgid "Enjoy the rest of your night. But maybe do it elsewhere."
msgstr "즐거운 밤 보내. 하지만 여기선 말고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 2cb80ac9-587d-27a1-468c-a55c9b572a0b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_ShadowheartPartner(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:2cb80ac9-587d-27a1-468c-a55c9b572a0b
msgctxt "h0f52a288g6b9ag42e9gbdf1gb6aab3654c74"
msgid "Don't forget our little agreement. As soon as things quiet down here..."
msgstr "우리 약속 잊지 마. 밤이 더 깊어지면..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2d6ac253-caa3-0ad5-78a8-3542c807b491
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:2d6ac253-caa3-0ad5-78a8-3542c807b491
msgctxt "h220c8720gdc90g44d0gb9c9g475382eff54b"
msgid "Just a bottle?"
msgstr "한 병 가지고 되겠어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 30241328-89e5-a170-cf98-d855b07da852
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_ShadowheartPartner(1) = True
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_HasPartner(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:30241328-89e5-a170-cf98-d855b07da852
msgctxt "hce15448cgbad4g4055g8b17g0dec4b01f6e6"
msgid "Best not keep me waiting. I'd prefer not to entertain myself..."
msgstr "기다리게 하진 마. 혼자 즐기긴 싫으니까..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 3226e04d-a837-7ecd-de80-5c9092abde48
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:3226e04d-a837-7ecd-de80-5c9092abde48
msgctxt "h42e8946dg3400g49a5gbfabg372b739fc1ff"
msgid "I will, but not as much as you'll enjoy yours, I'm betting..."
msgstr "그럴 거야, 아마 너보단 즐거운 시간을 보내지 못하겠지만..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 39c1e634-8e19-aa86-664c-864ac515bc61
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_HasPartner(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:39c1e634-8e19-aa86-664c-864ac515bc61
msgctxt "h68ad96c4g57d8g4591gb6f4g2c8001e0379b"
msgid ""
"It's <i>quite </i>a bottle. I liberated one of the finer vintages earlier."
msgstr "<i>평범한 </i>병이 아니야. 아주 좋은 빈티지를 따 놨거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 3ad9bd41-bc74-e813-c37a-e9a3003715bd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - Approval_AtLeast_-10_For_Sp2(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:3ad9bd41-bc74-e813-c37a-e9a3003715bd
msgctxt "hc546cc22g4480g45b5gb5dfg3c47929e9d88"
msgid "Your words, not mine. But not what I mean."
msgstr "네가 말한 거다. 어쨌든 내 뜻은 그게 아니야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 3d92426c-5eba-d397-9b62-356b73420ee4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:3d92426c-5eba-d397-9b62-356b73420ee4
msgctxt "hf2e0be3ag3423g4376gbb52gdd86a30d35ad"
msgid "...but there'll be time for penance later."
msgstr "...하지만 분명 다음에 속죄할 시간이 있겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3fef3121-0139-54f9-5349-acb4fe6882fb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:3fef3121-0139-54f9-5349-acb4fe6882fb
msgctxt "hb76b2baegbfaag4d53g9669g6296047ff9eb"
msgid "I've arranged some... <i>company</i>, yes. It could be a long evening."
msgstr "오늘 밤에... 약속을 잡아뒀어, 그래. 아주 긴 밤이 될지도 모르겠네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 442b63c4-24fc-8e15-e6c5-3580ef6d3b9e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:442b63c4-24fc-8e15-e6c5-3580ef6d3b9e
msgctxt "h441c52a6g941fg4e4bg9ec7g2d6fd2792f9d"
msgid "In that case, I'll leave you to enjoy your evening."
msgstr "그렇다면, 즐거운 저녁 시간을 보내길 바랄게."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 46dd002b-138a-b4ea-5531-2a3d46491e12
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ShadowHeart_InParty_Knows_SharWorshipper = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:46dd002b-138a-b4ea-5531-2a3d46491e12
msgctxt "h46456999g8d14g4c58g8082g5513763af4ee"
msgid "Shar?"
msgstr "샤?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 47d844a2-ca64-13c0-2562-9779db22f21a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_HasPartner(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:47d844a2-ca64-13c0-2562-9779db22f21a
msgctxt "h02bc3cbcgf771g47a7g894dg89f9210c8f52"
msgid ""
"Just a bottle. I think you have other plans afterwards - wouldn't want to "
"keep you."
msgstr "한 병 만이야. 밤에 다른 계획이 있는 것 같은데, 방해하진 않을게."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 48b14491-19db-7f16-f42c-fdfaf2ff61c5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:48b14491-19db-7f16-f42c-fdfaf2ff61c5
msgctxt "had78e811g2abeg4a27ga99cg2576076d4845"
msgid ""
"How pragmatic. One would think letting the goblins torch the grove would "
"have resulted in the same."
msgstr "아주 실용적이구나. 누군가는 고블린이 숲을 불태우도록 내버려 뒀어도 같은 결과를 얻었을 거라고 생각할 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 4d013fb9-c8e6-15e2-3636-a3164ad30aca
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:4d013fb9-c8e6-15e2-3636-a3164ad30aca
msgctxt "hd7eb9710g6c5bg4382gbb6fg711122508d0b"
msgid "What? No, don't be ridiculous."
msgstr "뭐? 당연히 아니지, 바보 같은 소리 하지 마."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 5384d6fd-6a00-6b6c-7145-6f48eada0554
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:5384d6fd-6a00-6b6c-7145-6f48eada0554
msgctxt "hcbcca3b3gf8aeg4bb9gaa62gd938aa7c30ac"
msgid "Now, on you go. And happy hunting."
msgstr "그럼, 가. 즐거운 사냥 시간이 되길 바랄게."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 53aef699-d17b-f271-bd0a-02049808414c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:53aef699-d17b-f271-bd0a-02049808414c
msgctxt "h2693edd6g8104g4915g9c7bg2d4135e3e07c"
msgid "...Well, maybe I would. But first come, first served."
msgstr "....뭐, 그럴지도 모르지. 하지만, 선착순이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 5b393d55-edb1-1e11-a66b-859415547e2e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_HasMet_Shadowheart(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:5b393d55-edb1-1e11-a66b-859415547e2e
msgctxt "hbc1b57b5g9532g4901g983bga463e2b8d25a"
msgid "We should've had wine more often. More warming than the fire."
msgstr "포도주를 더 자주 마셔야겠다. 불 가에 앉아 있는 것보다 따뜻해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 5c3d2f95-60a4-746b-c6ef-c471eeebc21f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_AstarionPartner(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:5c3d2f95-60a4-746b-c6ef-c471eeebc21f
msgctxt "hec4faa9bgc23fg472egaf54gb69a73e2b6d8"
msgid "I saw you with Astarion. You two looked... cosy."
msgstr "네가 아스타리온과 있는 걸 봤어. 둘이 아주... 친밀해 보이던데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 5c9e4f11-96d2-7828-c4bf-c0f8c15103f6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_HasPartner(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:5c9e4f11-96d2-7828-c4bf-c0f8c15103f6
msgctxt "h05f84a79ga7a3g4511gb308g5f86b4ef948a"
msgid "Strange... you know who I never thought I'd find myself caring for?"
msgstr "이상해... 내가 가장 신경 쓰지 않을 거라 생각했던 게 누군지 알아?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 5d643f7e-a68b-3a7a-706e-d89e7e81fd0f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:5d643f7e-a68b-3a7a-706e-d89e7e81fd0f
msgctxt "h64f228a7g972eg4934g9684gb169364bd340"
msgid ""
"Desperate people... refugees. Never gave them much thought. Certainly not "
"that bunch in the grove."
msgstr "절박한 사람들... 피난민 말이야. 그들에 대해선 딱히 생각해본 적이 없어. 숲에 있는 이들은 말할 것도 없고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5e5f3bd0-8590-39bc-51b2-5f595b1de76a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:5e5f3bd0-8590-39bc-51b2-5f595b1de76a
msgctxt "hecdfbdb5gf1b2g4d8bgb3c1g6b068995984f"
msgid "I don't suppose you'd consider some sort of <i>shared arrangement?</i>"
msgstr "뭔가 <i>샤와 관련된 의식을 말한 건 아니겠지?</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 619727d8-b5db-8880-51e4-0a975a498252
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:619727d8-b5db-8880-51e4-0a975a498252
msgctxt "hb368618bg5613g4d29g9c2dg08331cc5f652"
msgid "Refugees?"
msgstr "피난민들?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 61a7a5d4-0273-0c88-32b6-7900243c10dc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:61a7a5d4-0273-0c88-32b6-7900243c10dc
msgctxt "hf79785a4g517cg4d87gae10g8f4cec8a1cd5"
msgid "I thought you might've wanted to mingle with the others."
msgstr "네가 다른 이들과 어울리고 싶어할 줄 알았는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 65fc2f7e-79ca-c7e7-26fd-f6324aa0b367
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:65fc2f7e-79ca-c7e7-26fd-f6324aa0b367
msgctxt "h30f938daga7e2g4aa1g9e8cg5bf6ae2a6272"
msgid "You sure about that? Maybe they dislike me as much as you do."
msgstr "확실해? 그들도 너만큼이나 날 싫어할지도 모르는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6b0ab4f0-28be-30e2-9859-61a4f215717f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:6b0ab4f0-28be-30e2-9859-61a4f215717f
msgctxt "h27ecd8e1gffe7g4e69g9568g8980af20dbb6"
msgid "Are you trying to get rid of me?"
msgstr "날 보내버리려고 하는 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 6b678b89-dfdb-5abe-ff41-9678967b7974
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:6b678b89-dfdb-5abe-ff41-9678967b7974
msgctxt "hce7aa1c5g07f9g465cg9a67gb0fe6b7e35fa"
msgid "Yet we came through for them. We saved their lives. Odd."
msgstr "그런데 우리가 결국 그들을 위해 해냈어. 그들의 생명을 구한 거야. 이상해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6fa9f3f9-a2e6-8aff-c75c-ccf0f825f9bd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:6fa9f3f9-a2e6-8aff-c75c-ccf0f825f9bd
msgctxt "hf259bcf6g5eb2g4f4bg9f09gce72737e8a14"
msgid "Others? What do you mean?"
msgstr "다른 이들? 무슨 뜻이야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 72703008-a3c5-a940-2df3-756b44968d59
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:72703008-a3c5-a940-2df3-756b44968d59
msgctxt "h1e670c59gd76fg4aacgb6cfg5a39e869ab1e"
msgid ""
"Besides, I'm sure there's plenty of people who'll be keen to celebrate "
"<i>most thoroughly </i>with you."
msgstr "게다가, 분명 너와 함께 <i>진심으로 </i>축하하고 싶은 사람들이 많이 있을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 73b52ec3-020f-2990-b50e-4b8ebfd2ad9d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart_CaughtMindmeld(1) = True
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_ShadowheartRejected(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:73b52ec3-020f-2990-b50e-4b8ebfd2ad9d
msgctxt "h96a7f25agc3bbg4de0g8f48ge373dd5a1d61"
msgid "Best hope all this wine makes me forget what you tried to do."
msgstr "이 포도주가 네가 하려고 했던 일을 잊게 해주길 바라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 74e4107e-1e70-3a0d-abb7-1b0021726d22
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:74e4107e-1e70-3a0d-abb7-1b0021726d22
msgctxt "h019c3c0egf78ag40eag95dfg527692fe2aff"
msgid ""
"I think you'll find I've been showing ample concern for myself since the "
"moment we met."
msgstr "우리가 만난 그 순간부터 나에 대해선 충분히 신경 쓰고 있다는 걸 알아차렸을 줄 알았는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 75559cd3-1b09-cf64-fff9-4ba8cf899062
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:75559cd3-1b09-cf64-fff9-4ba8cf899062
msgctxt "h42bb71c6gf422g49begb7b6g4de3b96a1967"
msgid "On second thought, perhaps not. I should honour my other arrangement."
msgstr "다시 생각해 보니, 그러지 않는 게 좋겠어. 선약이 있어서 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 77021f0a-9ff4-cc9c-4704-8f0c2518e7f5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:77021f0a-9ff4-cc9c-4704-8f0c2518e7f5
msgctxt "h46c22658ga2ccg46a5gb441g789f2ed411e3"
msgid "There'll be time for that later."
msgstr "다음에 그럴 기회가 있을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 78cdcc32-023a-dbe9-dc3b-6af96aa5a9ad
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_KarlachPartner(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:78cdcc32-023a-dbe9-dc3b-6af96aa5a9ad
msgctxt "h6ac11d99g04b7g46a6gaa94g8ccdd30d1dbc"
msgid "I saw you with Karlach. You two looked... cosy."
msgstr "네가 칼라크와 있는 걸 봤어. 둘이 아주... 친근해 보이던데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 790c4e2b-d853-e1bd-d472-eb0d3fe77a35
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart_State_Happened = False
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_State_DoubleDating(1) = False
#.      - Approval_AtLeast_20_For_Sp2(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:790c4e2b-d853-e1bd-d472-eb0d3fe77a35
msgctxt "h998f737cg30eag4fdfg8d59g5748a2788c45"
msgid "Share a bottle with me?"
msgstr "같이 한 병 마시겠어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 79524fa8-e3d5-67bb-e9d4-9b03a72241c5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:79524fa8-e3d5-67bb-e9d4-9b03a72241c5
msgctxt "h656bbd29g0b60g4a66g8699g763bab5244a8"
msgid ""
"Exactly right. Never gave them much thought. Certainly not that bunch in the "
"grove."
msgstr "정확해. 딱히 그들에 대해 생각해 본 적도 없어. 숲에 있던 이들은 말할 것도 없고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 7a232984-9806-232e-0083-e7e127ae8a71
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:7a232984-9806-232e-0083-e7e127ae8a71
msgctxt "h37a09ad4g31f0g44ffgb8d6g02371c147b14"
msgid ""
"I mean you saved the grove. I'm sure you'll find you're quite popular, if "
"you look around."
msgstr "네가 숲을 구원했잖아. 분명 꽤 인기가 많을 거야, 주변을 둘러보기만 하면 말이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 7aca1504-606c-9547-95f1-bb7de4cffc5e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - ff03d474-7d7d-b098-ccee-6b873f44651e_GaveRomanceHint = False
#.   Object:
#.      - Approval_AtLeast_30_For_Sp2(5) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - ff03d474-7d7d-b098-ccee-6b873f44651e_GaveRomanceHint = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:7aca1504-606c-9547-95f1-bb7de4cffc5e
msgctxt "h6fbff388gc5efg4967g959eg3d51d707a0c0"
msgid ""
"Now enough about me. Did you see the way Astarion's been looking at you? "
"Hungry in more ways than usual, maybe. Go on, you know what to do..."
msgstr ""
"이제 내 이야기는 그만. 아까 아스타리온이 널 바라보던 눈빛 봤어? 평소보다 더 입맛을 다시던데. 가 봐, 뭘 해야 할지 알잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7b2e5799-9080-b942-0fa5-770cac412f07
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:7b2e5799-9080-b942-0fa5-770cac412f07
msgctxt "h4114e587g2713g4724gaa07g4bfa0cb78c8f"
msgid "I suppose I should. Enjoy your evening."
msgstr "그러는 게 좋겠네. 즐거운 밤 보내."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7dd6c1ec-9340-8580-7ddc-adf0e5d59ad8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:7dd6c1ec-9340-8580-7ddc-adf0e5d59ad8
msgctxt "h34b60957gada5g4cffg9f66g975654a912a3"
msgid "Sounds like the wine is talking."
msgstr "많이 취했구나."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 7eaa2f5c-dd9d-3792-530d-f4e908d6b8e1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_GalePartner(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:7eaa2f5c-dd9d-3792-530d-f4e908d6b8e1
msgctxt "hcd72ade8g91e0g4908g9a01g7d567a3b2961"
msgid "I saw you with Gale. You two looked... cosy."
msgstr "게일과 함께 있는 걸 봤어. 둘이 아주... 친밀해 보이던데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7f219f7c-28bd-53c8-bf8a-d712115a0045
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:7f219f7c-28bd-53c8-bf8a-d712115a0045
msgctxt "hb5343639g1a2ag41fdgad13g72ad512c43bc"
msgid ""
"You're not that bad, no. You might <i>pretend </i>to be that bad from time "
"to time..."
msgstr "넌 좋은 사람이야. 가끔 나쁜 <i>척을 </i>하긴 하지만..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 80049363-61da-6a1b-a1da-80eedae5ef67
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - ff03d474-7d7d-b098-ccee-6b873f44651e_GaveRomanceHint = False
#.   Object:
#.      - Approval_AtLeast_30_For_Sp2(2) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - ff03d474-7d7d-b098-ccee-6b873f44651e_GaveRomanceHint = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:80049363-61da-6a1b-a1da-80eedae5ef67
msgctxt "hb2fae107g102ag47cbg9381gc0aafa2b33c1"
msgid ""
"Enough about me. I saw Lae'zel looking at you a little less murderously than "
"usual. Go on, you know what to do..."
msgstr "내 이야기는 그만. 레이젤이 널 평소보단 덜 무섭게 노려보던데. 가 봐, 뭘 해야 할지 알잖아..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 865352a1-add5-10a5-6da8-2b96d7946b8f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:865352a1-add5-10a5-6da8-2b96d7946b8f
msgctxt "h67e7aaddgecc5g4a50gb5edg8a0ee697c294"
msgid "That's more easily said by some than others."
msgstr "그건 아무나 쉽게 할 수 있는 말은 아니지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 8833c2c6-3249-4ad2-9a80-f79e78d8b114
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - ff03d474-7d7d-b098-ccee-6b873f44651e_GaveRomanceHint = False
#.   Object:
#.      - Approval_AtLeast_30_For_Sp2(4) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - ff03d474-7d7d-b098-ccee-6b873f44651e_GaveRomanceHint = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:8833c2c6-3249-4ad2-9a80-f79e78d8b114
msgctxt "hca14b404g3c5fg40a8g8e47ga5ea5c4ddd25"
msgid ""
"And yes, I'm sure there's someone out there for you. Gale's been stealing a "
"glance or three in your direction..."
msgstr "그리고 맞아, 분명 저기 널 기다리는 누군가가 있을 거야. 게일이 널 몇 번 훔쳐보던데..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 884c6055-49db-e865-9cd5-57ce5a830771
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:884c6055-49db-e865-9cd5-57ce5a830771
msgctxt "h43d7aef2gb7feg490bgb6feg676cc6d2d9f2"
msgid ""
"*Shadowheart says nothing, but the glimmer of interest in her eyes is "
"unmistakable.*"
msgstr "*섀도하트는 아무 말도 하지 않지만, 그녀의 눈에서 호기심이 반짝입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 89e16c10-d5d1-5086-1856-e97ef4e8c03e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:89e16c10-d5d1-5086-1856-e97ef4e8c03e
msgctxt "h7137f2b9g5e65g41bfg845eg751735666715"
msgid "Keep prodding, and maybe you'll find out for certain."
msgstr "계속 재촉해 봐, 그럼 확실히 알아낼지도 모르니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 8d911247-31f6-7fc2-14f7-56654ec000e6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:8d911247-31f6-7fc2-14f7-56654ec000e6
msgctxt "hc8b347d3g6e4cg4361g81b1g9c7831b8e9c9"
msgid ""
"That so? I won't pretend I'm not surprised... we haven't always seen eye to "
"eye, after all."
msgstr "그래? 놀란 척은 하지 않을게... 우리 생각이 항상 일치한 건 아니니까 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 91f936c4-de66-7088-2722-72c7f8ea1b9c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - Approval_AtLeast_20_For_Sp2(0) = False
#.      - Approval_AtLeast_0_For_Sp2(0) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:91f936c4-de66-7088-2722-72c7f8ea1b9c
msgctxt "hf206d9d0g1a3dg49d8g90fcgeda5bc529faf"
msgid ""
"I'd rather enjoy this wine on my own, so... find your entertainment "
"elsewhere?"
msgstr "이 포도주는 혼자 즐기는 게 좋겠어, 그러니... 다른 곳으로 가 주겠어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 966b39f5-ad03-1975-722e-4e71efd0b07d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - ff03d474-7d7d-b098-ccee-6b873f44651e_GaveRomanceHint = False
#.   Object:
#.      - Approval_AtLeast_30_For_Sp2(2) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - ff03d474-7d7d-b098-ccee-6b873f44651e_GaveRomanceHint = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:966b39f5-ad03-1975-722e-4e71efd0b07d
msgctxt "he36cb7d6g3eb4g4c21gad9bg40911366b221"
msgid ""
"And yes, I'm sure there's someone out there for you. Lae'zel for example - I "
"saw her looking at you a little less murderously than usual."
msgstr ""
"그리고, 맞아, 분명 저기 널 기다리는 누군가가 있을 거야. 예를 들어 레이젤이라든가. 평소보단 덜 죽여버리겠다는 표정으로 널 보던데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 97c66560-d332-3ba0-c5e4-e73328cfa642
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:97c66560-d332-3ba0-c5e4-e73328cfa642
msgctxt "h4422e7a1g0c49g493eg9e86g220efff2cbe9"
msgid "Me?"
msgstr "나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 9a6bc514-6399-e260-ee48-db2ac0c1f607
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:9a6bc514-6399-e260-ee48-db2ac0c1f607
msgctxt "h5806cf5bga8a0g46bfga5a1g718a483dcd55"
msgid ""
"I'm not half as mysterious as you might think. Respect my privacy, my "
"opinion, keep us focused on finding a cure..."
msgstr "난 네 생각만큼 비밀스럽지 않아. 내 사생활과 의견을 존중하고 치료할 방법을 찾는데만 집중하면..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9e02cbf4-ec70-2177-bf81-71ba1db95eea
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:9e02cbf4-ec70-2177-bf81-71ba1db95eea
msgctxt "hcb4f13c7g2faag4e7ag8492gd3ab64f40836"
msgid "Not so odd. We did the right thing."
msgstr "이상할 것 없어. 우린 옳은 일을 한 거니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a1bd1674-435e-89d9-23ad-aecad2f8ff08
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:a1bd1674-435e-89d9-23ad-aecad2f8ff08
msgctxt "h1a94a43ag59beg4108g8ac4g92fdeab14f58"
msgid "I'll find you after everyone's turned in for the night."
msgstr "다른 이들이 잠자리에 들고 나면 널 찾아갈게."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = a1f1e360-bb0a-296a-0036-bfb2ad30234c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - ff03d474-7d7d-b098-ccee-6b873f44651e_GaveRomanceHint = False
#.   Object:
#.      - Approval_AtLeast_30_For_Sp2(4) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - ff03d474-7d7d-b098-ccee-6b873f44651e_GaveRomanceHint = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:a1f1e360-bb0a-296a-0036-bfb2ad30234c
msgctxt "hc15ebbdcgbdd4g4b4fg873eg88ccf6499f04"
msgid ""
"Now enough about me. Haven't you seen the way Gale's been stealing looks at "
"you? Go on, see if he wants something, or <i>someone</i>..."
msgstr "이제 내 이야기는 됐어. 게일이 널 바라보는 눈빛 봤어? 가봐, 그가 뭘, 아니 누굴 원하는지 알아봐..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = a37cb4a6-539f-08f5-6506-70fee80b3041
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ShadowHeart_InParty_Knows_SharWorshipper = True
#.      - CAMP_ShadowheartLaezelFight_State_ResolvedPeacefully = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:a37cb4a6-539f-08f5-6506-70fee80b3041
msgctxt "h38464fb9g9584g4dedg83c3gc87eddef82fc"
msgid "Respect my mission, my beliefs, keep us focused on finding a cure..."
msgstr "내 임무와 믿음을 존중하고, 치료할 방법을 찾는데 집중하기만 하면..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = acd9b4e3-7419-3eaa-8049-2c4c19de7009
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:acd9b4e3-7419-3eaa-8049-2c4c19de7009
msgctxt "h8e684d66g2545g4922g9df8g60d343e91d84"
msgid "Have fun... and don't be a stranger."
msgstr "즐거운 시간 보내... 그리고 가끔 소식 좀 알려줘."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b4964988-2edf-0938-1a0e-d2e57e30a12b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:b4964988-2edf-0938-1a0e-d2e57e30a12b
msgctxt "hd02de32egef11g43afga296gd6ba55710655"
msgid "I think I could win you over, if I wanted."
msgstr "내가 원하면, 넌 설득할 수 있을 것 같은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b831966c-a1b7-74db-d463-9d03aa5f2c11
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:b831966c-a1b7-74db-d463-9d03aa5f2c11
msgctxt "hd35462edga1a7g4bddgb5cag302a4b1d8d92"
msgid "Let me guess... yourself?"
msgstr "맞춰볼게... 너 자신?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c0377808-159d-026b-87f3-9289191c6307
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:c0377808-159d-026b-87f3-9289191c6307
msgctxt "h49bd3532g3221g44a1g8fc3g2fc80430a71b"
msgid "Not keen on sharing with the others?"
msgstr "다른 이들과 나누긴 싫은가 보지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = c82a6c1b-bdd0-415d-d60e-8a6c9dd58d57
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_ShadowheartRefused(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:c82a6c1b-bdd0-415d-d60e-8a6c9dd58d57
msgctxt "hd43ec76eg384eg40eegbcf5gc016e5ce6666"
msgid "As you like. Try not to tire yourself out too much."
msgstr "마음대로 해. 너무 무리하진 말고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cc793b78-977b-c5b0-146c-798fe98a7cd2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:cc793b78-977b-c5b0-146c-798fe98a7cd2
msgctxt "hf02f6862g13b7g4896gaee4g414a6a4c8c96"
msgid "You're all the company I need right now."
msgstr "지금 내게 필요한 건 너 뿐이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cf9b8633-0400-662b-9bf7-7488344f6c61
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ShadowHeart_InParty_Knows_SharWorshipper = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:cf9b8633-0400-662b-9bf7-7488344f6c61
msgctxt "hddb52dd6g2b20g49b0gb17ag51f59f828281"
msgid "Are you worried Shar won't approve?"
msgstr "샤님이 싫어하실까 두려운 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = d0573ef2-3218-9165-ff4a-65f541e9eaeb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - ff03d474-7d7d-b098-ccee-6b873f44651e_GaveRomanceHint = False
#.   Object:
#.      - Approval_AtLeast_10_For_Sp2(3) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - ff03d474-7d7d-b098-ccee-6b873f44651e_GaveRomanceHint = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:d0573ef2-3218-9165-ff4a-65f541e9eaeb
msgctxt "h15ec7a28g6e91g455agb09fg4d12ac6f5dd3"
msgid ""
"And yes, I'm sure there's someone out there for you. You should have seen "
"the look Wyll was giving you earlier..."
msgstr "그리고, 맞아 분명 저기 널 기다리는 누군가가 있을 거야. 윌이 널 아까 바라보던 모습을 봤어야 하는데..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d19a9716-be88-f06a-7c9e-d2579c673390
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:d19a9716-be88-f06a-7c9e-d2579c673390
msgctxt "h5ea478bdg221ag4563gb3e6gc06932a4b2c8"
msgid "I see. So that no is final...?"
msgstr "그렇군. 그럼 완전히 거절하는 건가...?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = d32cfb7a-7066-9415-99b8-a94da33591d4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:d32cfb7a-7066-9415-99b8-a94da33591d4
msgctxt "hbe119784g9911g4893ga0feg7fb7e919eada"
msgid ""
"No, but I thought you might be keen to get away from <i>me</i>. We haven't "
"always seen eye to eye, after all."
msgstr "아니, 하지만 네가 나한테 거리를 두려고 안달이 난 줄 알았어. 우리 의견이 항상 일치하진 않았잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = d8e6295c-4a18-af39-7739-2955a31ea42d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:d8e6295c-4a18-af39-7739-2955a31ea42d
msgctxt "h22613a66ge534g4f63g8844g23d5728ee00f"
msgid ""
"For now. Don't worry, there'll be plenty of fun for you tonight. Just not in "
"my tent."
msgstr "지금은. 걱정 마, 오늘 밤은 즐겁게 보낼 수 있을 거니까. 다만 내 근처에선 말고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = daa1fb73-7614-6823-4a96-0d66bce19f22
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - Approval_AtLeast_20_For_Sp2(0) = False
#.      - Approval_AtLeast_0_For_Sp2(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:daa1fb73-7614-6823-4a96-0d66bce19f22
msgctxt "h17ee06beg02bdg4422gbfaagde4450279158"
msgid ""
"*Shadowheart trails off and glances around at the party. She turns back to "
"you, mildly surprised you're still there.*"
msgstr "*섀도하트가 자리를 비켜서서 연회를 둘러봅니다. 그러다 당신이 아직 거기 있다는 사실에 살짝 놀란 표정으로 돌아섭니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = dab22dfa-27fa-3572-8356-ee2de17d22a3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:dab22dfa-27fa-3572-8356-ee2de17d22a3
msgctxt "h1d0b47c2g52f6g498bgbfdcgbb281ea3e7fb"
msgid ""
"What, some advice on how to make me more bearable? All right, if you like..."
msgstr "왜, 어떻게 하면 날 더 잘 견딜 수 있는지 조언이라도 필요해? 좋아, 네가 원한다면..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = db152ce8-9a10-211e-68fc-7c10f59a207d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_LaezelPartner(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:db152ce8-9a10-211e-68fc-7c10f59a207d
msgctxt "heed29d4ag2852g4cd2g922bgb219876adec1"
msgid "I saw you with Lae'zel. You two looked... cosy."
msgstr "레이젤과 있는 걸 봤어. 둘이 아주... 친밀해 보이던데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = db528748-c7ac-3a7d-a0ec-e00df8f8ee35
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHunt_HasMet_Shadowheart(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:db528748-c7ac-3a7d-a0ec-e00df8f8ee35
msgctxt "hcaccd9bdg85ddg4adcg8067ge1f824212c6d"
msgid "Everyone seems to be in high spirits."
msgstr "다들 꽤 신난 거 같네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = ddb523cd-e245-4c24-bf14-4ad0e2d294dd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_HasPartner(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:ddb523cd-e245-4c24-bf14-4ad0e2d294dd
msgctxt "hc0d17232gebffg419eg8b84g793be6b29849"
msgid "We should wait a little while. Until the others have drifted off."
msgstr "잠시 기다리는 게 좋겠어. 다른 이들이 곯아떨어질 때까지 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = de4073cf-a414-9c73-b2cb-a16f05c623f7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:de4073cf-a414-9c73-b2cb-a16f05c623f7
msgctxt "h39abe63bg376ag4307gad60gd316df0b48d9"
msgid "Why I've no idea of what you mean..."
msgstr "무슨 뜻인지 전혀 모르겠는데..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e48b6e74-f139-2fe8-bf95-00654169d43b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:e48b6e74-f139-2fe8-bf95-00654169d43b
msgctxt "hb2ac3a99g6f7cg4de6gb04bgd7fbfd1367ff"
msgid "You sure about that? There's a cruel streak in you, I think."
msgstr "그거 확실해? 넌 좀 잔인한 면이 있는 것 같아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = e774275a-f292-7021-c075-0432b5432429
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:e774275a-f292-7021-c075-0432b5432429
msgctxt "h380ee330gd427g40ffg9b99g9693781c29f3"
msgid ""
"Now enough about me. You should go see who'd like to spend the night with "
"the saviour of the grove..."
msgstr "이제 내 이야기는 됐어. 가서 숲의 구원자와 함께 밤을 보내고 싶은 사람을 찾아봐..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ed450ac5-e2c6-646a-df96-59a82dba62de
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:ed450ac5-e2c6-646a-df96-59a82dba62de
msgctxt "hf8905bdbg848bg4a67g8f6fg493a1cff4ab4"
msgid "I understand. Before I go... how can we see eye to eye?"
msgstr "이해했어. 가기 전에... 어떻게 하면 우리 의견이 좀 더 맞을 수 있을까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = f0bafafb-44a5-e405-2669-b17175e8c498
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:f0bafafb-44a5-e405-2669-b17175e8c498
msgctxt "h0b8f95e8ge174g4b6bg91d9g0150a9c17725"
msgid ""
"I mean desperate people... like those refugees. Never gave them much "
"thought. Certainly not that bunch in the grove."
msgstr ""
"내 말은 절박한 사람들 말이야... 저 피난민들처럼. 그들에 대해선 딱히 생각해 본 적이 없어. 숲에 있는 이들은 말할 것도 없고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = f823382e-748c-23a4-e98f-16cb50433808
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:f823382e-748c-23a4-e98f-16cb50433808
msgctxt "h96f3899fgf62fg4eb1ga3b6gc70db3ffc251"
msgid "It's not talking enough for my liking."
msgstr "내가 원하는 만큼 마시진 않았어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = f9ce5c12-d686-e9e1-96bc-9ff656884a8e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_Astarion_Knows_Vampireness = True
#.   Local:
#.      - ff03d474-7d7d-b098-ccee-6b873f44651e_GaveRomanceHint = False
#.   Object:
#.      - Approval_AtLeast_30_For_Sp2(5) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - ff03d474-7d7d-b098-ccee-6b873f44651e_GaveRomanceHint = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:f9ce5c12-d686-e9e1-96bc-9ff656884a8e
msgctxt "h8ccfacafg7265g428cga3dag9f88a75fd010"
msgid ""
"And yes, I'm sure there's someone out there for you. I saw the way "
"Astarion's been stealing glances at you. Hungry in more ways than usual, "
"maybe."
msgstr ""
"그리고, 맞아, 분명 저기 널 기다리는 누군가가 있을 거야. 아까 아스타리온이 널 훔쳐보는 걸 봤어. 평소보다 더 굶주려 보이던데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fa1ffa6f-a2c2-e5cb-2b7f-ade1bbe8466f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:fa1ffa6f-a2c2-e5cb-2b7f-ade1bbe8466f
msgctxt "h0ddd24aeg1ac9g4c24g8ef7g592e6c830ddb"
msgid "I'd be glad to."
msgstr "물론이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fba18f10-0ed1-a20f-650e-501f5de8cc77
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Shadowheart:fba18f10-0ed1-a20f-650e-501f5de8cc77
msgctxt "h51ff0d2eg1ec1g48edg8e7dge06f864f548f"
msgid "Now that you mention it... thanks for the tip. Enjoy your evening."
msgstr "네가 그렇게 말한 김에... 조언 고마워. 즐거운 저녁 시간 보내."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 003bf7e9-cf64-5700-4975-2920a9453579
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll:003bf7e9-cf64-5700-4975-2920a9453579
msgctxt "haac7fec5ga20dg40e3g9217g3bc82c8c166a"
msgid "I'd be flattered, honestly."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 028a565a-ea21-efcd-b874-ea7cc4e8a843
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll:028a565a-ea21-efcd-b874-ea7cc4e8a843
msgctxt "h4f5d7369gbe9fg42a9gad6agcd54b901b4c0"
msgid "Cool your blood. I'm not interested in you like that."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 07bb55ab-8c78-ec54-5375-f7a2909d952e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll:07bb55ab-8c78-ec54-5375-f7a2909d952e
msgctxt "h0f589741gc52dg4dd2g9b81g52dab3e40d40"
msgid "Are you coming on to me?"
msgstr "작업 거는 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 0b02d3a1-6bf7-d647-c69d-460e9e6e43b0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll:0b02d3a1-6bf7-d647-c69d-460e9e6e43b0
msgctxt "hdad0a5e2g1bdbg4230gaffdg931d608f8bfa"
msgid ""
"Grab a tankard and suck down some ale. You've an edge in bad need of dulling."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 0f8d2b3d-51a8-0b6e-50cd-0a081ab3b172
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_GalePartner(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll:0f8d2b3d-51a8-0b6e-50cd-0a081ab3b172
msgctxt "h2fc848ecg37eeg4d45gb54agda598aad1d6d"
msgid "And to you and Gale. May your stars burn ever bright."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 176098c9-61e2-dd77-0478-2fc6f1b95159
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll:176098c9-61e2-dd77-0478-2fc6f1b95159
msgctxt "h967ee0e9g39c3g47e8gbc66g62ce23be62c2"
msgid "Now go off, have your fun. I've got a tankard keeping me company."
msgstr "이제 가 봐, 즐겨야지. 난 맥주잔이랑 시간을 보낼게."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 19c81785-2140-05d5-928e-3fae875a6154
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll:19c81785-2140-05d5-928e-3fae875a6154
msgctxt "hf2f0c1f4gd192g488fga1a2g3b6450a0a8ce"
msgid "Your heart beats strong, friend. I'm proud to fight at your side."
msgstr "넌 강한 심장을 가졌어, 친구. 네 곁에서 싸우게 되어 자랑스러워."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1a0e7966-4926-20bc-c8b1-21beabcbade5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll:1a0e7966-4926-20bc-c8b1-21beabcbade5
msgctxt "h5e55369eg823eg4ac3g92e3g5c22f5c5a9b2"
msgid "We should really continue this conversation in my bed."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 1a16ab3c-1e99-afa5-0113-e513b7b4615a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll:1a16ab3c-1e99-afa5-0113-e513b7b4615a
msgctxt "he78d6ee8gc735g43d0g94ccgab1157af0397"
msgid "Hmm - I'm not really feeling the connection."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 1fef83ee-cbdf-dd53-50ff-7ee5f86fca08
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll:1fef83ee-cbdf-dd53-50ff-7ee5f86fca08
msgctxt "h93633f97gd949g4721gbae1g711a0fe6c146"
msgid "And if I were?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2364c7fb-a050-6cc6-3ec6-cc4297815835
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll:2364c7fb-a050-6cc6-3ec6-cc4297815835
msgctxt "h4076eb6cg209ag4944gb457g6ee5589dbe37"
msgid "You need to stay out of my business."
msgstr "내 사생활에는 간섭하지 마."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2ca40b45-f1ce-1d34-c4ea-b13eddafa366
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll:2ca40b45-f1ce-1d34-c4ea-b13eddafa366
msgctxt "hb6c2181bgb486g4ab6g94d5gf4ab6fac3f5a"
msgid "'Forever linked?' That isn't 'fortune' - that's a threat."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2d062ae2-5529-a6c9-6fcf-7942b425780e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll:2d062ae2-5529-a6c9-6fcf-7942b425780e
msgctxt "h73d795fbg53c6g453fg832fg2408e1fca747"
msgid "Wyll, I'd like you to join me in my bunk tonight."
msgstr "윌, 네가 오늘 밤 내 침대에 들어오면 좋겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 34091cc1-3876-de19-8eb0-640b0fa3bb10
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll:34091cc1-3876-de19-8eb0-640b0fa3bb10
msgctxt "h8cb3a512gb487g4be4ga304gc53b1f4a527d"
msgid "Eh - go off, have your fun. I've got a tankard keeping me company."
msgstr "에 - 가 봐, 즐겨야지. 난 맥주잔이랑 시간을 보낼게."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 39d5ebcf-2f34-e682-0bf9-4a9029d60dc1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll:39d5ebcf-2f34-e682-0bf9-4a9029d60dc1
msgctxt "h90672dd5g8741g4231g8186g70e0fefd3aac"
msgid "Meet you at your bunk when you're ready."
msgstr "네가 준비되면 네 침대에서 만날게."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 4249cdc1-7d9b-4727-795c-7a0903e3e93d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll:4249cdc1-7d9b-4727-795c-7a0903e3e93d
msgctxt "h1a2f64c8g1822g4963g9f10g31893ba94897"
msgid "Don't keep me waiting, I beg you."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 433b5d86-0807-d1ab-aa1f-07f6cb69ce8f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll:433b5d86-0807-d1ab-aa1f-07f6cb69ce8f
msgctxt "h6ab82bfag564cg4000ga39ag6b9c9c5b3b94"
msgid "And to you and your paramour. May your stars burn ever bright."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 46b11014-d4b5-5243-7b9d-1a15defbc4cf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll:46b11014-d4b5-5243-7b9d-1a15defbc4cf
msgctxt "h2dfb45a3ge683g4f23gbb63g74dd54435490"
msgid "Your business is plain as a dread pirate's pikestaff, chief."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 4a89f78c-c7d9-d150-fe9d-e2d1d3da2ea2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll:4a89f78c-c7d9-d150-fe9d-e2d1d3da2ea2
msgctxt "ha05dcdbbg04aag4e68gbdc2ga3d8de497f4a"
msgid ""
"To freedom from tyranny! May we hew a clear path for the downtrodden to "
"travel."
msgstr "폭정으로부터의 자유를 위하여! 탄압받는 자들이 다닐 수 있는 깨끗한 길을 만들어가길."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 4b81ca67-3879-ac91-f7e0-300a5f8c27c3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll:4b81ca67-3879-ac91-f7e0-300a5f8c27c3
msgctxt "h224b3ae8g1522g4b5fgaf0ag2bd7c1a6efe5"
msgid "I reckoned our union might extend to your bunk tonight."
msgstr "나는 오늘 밤 우리 인연이 네 침대에서 이어질 것이라 믿어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 4c5ec7d9-af7d-96f1-43f6-f00479517b36
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_ShadowheartPartner(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll:4c5ec7d9-af7d-96f1-43f6-f00479517b36
msgctxt "h30379a08ge629g46bagaf03gcddadb371642"
msgid "And to you and Shadowheart. May your stars burn ever bright."
msgstr "그리고 너와 섀도하트를 위해. 너희 별빛이 영원토록 밝게 빛나기를."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 53ae99ea-d1b8-a06b-d086-87aa70cc727a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_WyllPartner(1) = True
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_HasPartner(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll:53ae99ea-d1b8-a06b-d086-87aa70cc727a
msgctxt "h9f0eb6ccg37cag411ag8a62gb565874186d6"
msgid "I trust I won't have to wait long."
msgstr "오래 기다릴 필요 없을 거라 믿을게."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 57e30d66-bb93-fb83-849f-c58d47fbe850
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_HasPartner(1) = False
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_HasMet_Wyll(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll:57e30d66-bb93-fb83-849f-c58d47fbe850
msgctxt "h2ee1840dg165cg4ee6gad32gf90c3a4ba4ac"
msgid "A fine night for it!"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 5d94fcb5-0a6a-c735-c582-14497b346131
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll:5d94fcb5-0a6a-c735-c582-14497b346131
msgctxt "hf8c38196gf214g454dgbd77g2544f2f5ca5a"
msgid "Already, the bards are preparing their anthems, the poets their verses."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 5dd1d3b3-9c84-6583-82c2-ac3dbe215dc9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_HasPartner(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll:5dd1d3b3-9c84-6583-82c2-ac3dbe215dc9
msgctxt "hf36c1d8dgef11g436bgb002g0f0ebe2fe968"
msgid "And of course, to us."
msgstr "그리고 물론, 우리에게도."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 6384c19c-9425-5b2c-78f5-cb71bafead99
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll:6384c19c-9425-5b2c-78f5-cb71bafead99
msgctxt "h0bf79b18g719dg4ccfga0ebge34c552d6bf4"
msgid "If I didn't know better, I'd think you were reading my mind."
msgstr "내가 잘 알지 못했다면, 네가 내 마음을 읽는 줄 알았을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 645fa885-eb95-a9aa-d4dc-de685722b104
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll:645fa885-eb95-a9aa-d4dc-de685722b104
msgctxt "h24d5e916g0dabg4bf4ga784g82f70e668ef3"
msgid "I'd enjoy watching you squirm."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 664ae22d-12d6-00e7-a591-ab2b473ab331
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll:664ae22d-12d6-00e7-a591-ab2b473ab331
msgctxt "h7839461cg3794g4600gb972ge68798defb79"
msgid ""
"I'm as real as the heart that beats in your chest. Now go off, have your fun."
msgstr "내 이야기는 네 심장 박동만큼이나 진실이야. 이제 가 봐, 즐겨야지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 670b343a-ea3b-41b8-4434-148c6dc1c9e5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll:670b343a-ea3b-41b8-4434-148c6dc1c9e5
msgctxt "hfa73ba25g98e6g48e2ga5cbg3c3873965b8c"
msgid "Your heart beats strong, friend. The Blade rarely seeks partnership..."
msgstr "넌 강한 심장을 가졌어, 친구. 이 칼날이 동료를 만드는 일은 드문데 말이야..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 69e50bea-3741-9ddd-3c3c-ce9555106631
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_WyllPartner(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll:69e50bea-3741-9ddd-3c3c-ce9555106631
msgctxt "h06cddc26g7136g4856g9bf4gcdd208df5f57"
msgid "Such exquisite torture."
msgstr "정말 정교한 고문이네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 72165fd1-625e-6c27-fa62-eb964585d8ae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll:72165fd1-625e-6c27-fa62-eb964585d8ae
msgctxt "h9ac1aab2gaf8dg4199gbb9egda771aab1c16"
msgid "Go off, have your fun. I've got a tankard keeping <i>me</i> company!"
msgstr "가서 즐거운 시간 보내. 나는 <i>내 곁</i>을 함께하는 맥주 한 잔이 있으니까!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 74532913-3a3f-fd0c-7296-93abeee5f0d5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll:74532913-3a3f-fd0c-7296-93abeee5f0d5
msgctxt "h96aee358gd940g42acg8b54g73f27e949e0d"
msgid "Hear! Hear!"
msgstr "건배! 건배!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 775f3def-6d46-467c-e03b-c233b0013389
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll:775f3def-6d46-467c-e03b-c233b0013389
msgctxt "hd162f8bfgaf7eg4586gbe61gcf7db32f78fe"
msgid "But consider me flattered. A boon for my ego."
msgstr "하지만 고마워. 자존심에 도움이 됐어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 793a9ed4-03b3-79d9-2d03-3c72f2d3b49f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHunt_HasMet_Wyll(1) = True
#. TagRule: MALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll:793a9ed4-03b3-79d9-2d03-3c72f2d3b49f
msgctxt "h4fbfc469ga4f3g4b93g9dbbg760c7bf212af"
msgid "There he is - the man himself. Let us raise a glass!"
msgstr "바로 그 남자가 여기 있군. 건배하자!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 793a9ed4-03b3-79d9-2d03-3c72f2d3b49f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHunt_HasMet_Wyll(1) = True
#. TagRule: FEMALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll:793a9ed4-03b3-79d9-2d03-3c72f2d3b49f
msgctxt "hb2f7f36ag0396g426dga21fg181f0c6826e3"
msgid "There she is - the woman herself. Let us raise a glass!"
msgstr "바로 그 여자가 여기 있군. 건배하자!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 793a9ed4-03b3-79d9-2d03-3c72f2d3b49f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHunt_HasMet_Wyll(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll:793a9ed4-03b3-79d9-2d03-3c72f2d3b49f
msgctxt "h4fcbae8fg95a1g4550gb618g1b616ed7397a"
msgid "There they are - the hero themselves. Let us raise a glass!"
msgstr "바로 그 영웅이 여기 있군. 건배하자!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7db7e96d-13d1-ffba-7055-5b5adeea9017
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll:7db7e96d-13d1-ffba-7055-5b5adeea9017
msgctxt "h241ceb1ag0917g4142ga076g919cf6921ad8"
msgid "The Blade lives up to his myth!"
msgstr "넌 칼날의 신화에 걸맞구나!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 7f160fc7-272d-6663-1e22-5677527460b6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_WyllRejected(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll:7f160fc7-272d-6663-1e22-5677527460b6
msgctxt "hd7c681ceg5fa5g4d9cga56cg2330fcc3e723"
msgid "Cheers."
msgstr "건배."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 8283ee35-f1fd-70d0-14e0-5adb51e565eb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll:8283ee35-f1fd-70d0-14e0-5adb51e565eb
msgctxt "h27e8c9a0g7d07g4178g8d78g4daec318cb5f"
msgid ""
"I'm as real as the heart that beats in your chest. Now go off, have your fun."
msgstr "내 이야기는 네 심장 박동만큼이나 진실이야. 이제 가 봐, 즐겨야지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 8503de20-b7c2-ab32-8bdf-a63835396413
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll:8503de20-b7c2-ab32-8bdf-a63835396413
msgctxt "h17604c3ag854eg44aag970bgc324ec368ee7"
msgid "I hadn't imagined myself so subtle. Or, to put it another way: yes."
msgstr "내 말이 그렇게 애매할 줄은 상상도 못했어. 다시 말하자면, 맞아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 8b18cbe9-dd9a-ba33-9b6d-8d04e44354cf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll:8b18cbe9-dd9a-ba33-9b6d-8d04e44354cf
msgctxt "h82c49f09gbbd2g414bgba76g6ebc89c6cd40"
msgid ""
"Oh, but the Blade is no myth, chief. Myths are tall tales, fleeting as "
"Cormyrian rain."
msgstr "오, 하지만 칼날은 신화가 아니야, 대장. 신화는 코어미어의 비만큼이나 덧없는 이야기지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8be1fb03-28d0-7e71-9c14-e6febeb77b94
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll:8be1fb03-28d0-7e71-9c14-e6febeb77b94
msgctxt "hb18420c9gd180g420agb500g43abf8194945"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8ce84133-a8b5-4a66-2cc0-89e0501ee486
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CAMP_MizorasJudgement_Event_Judged = True
#.   Object:
#.      - Approval_AtLeast_10_For_Sp2(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll:8ce84133-a8b5-4a66-2cc0-89e0501ee486
msgctxt "h62f3e064gf214g4cbbg9548g0040f66520a9"
msgid "My mind isn't entirely made up. Perhaps you might join me instead."
msgstr "아직 마음이 완전히 정해진 건 아니야. 너와 함께하는 것도 괜찮을지도."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 955d6ec1-e633-515c-f23f-23855e980275
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll:955d6ec1-e633-515c-f23f-23855e980275
msgctxt "he94d3b01g9402g4a07ga950g9afecf2bbd06"
msgid "I reckoned our union might extend to your bunk tonight."
msgstr "나는 오늘 밤 우리 인연이 네 침대에서 이어질 것이라 믿어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 995f4e01-1324-a3ef-6a5f-f310e4a11956
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CAMP_MizorasJudgement_Event_Judged = True
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_HasPartner(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_WyllRejected(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll:995f4e01-1324-a3ef-6a5f-f310e4a11956
msgctxt "h806ae6adg73dbg458dgaeccgc9be32f02e6a"
msgid "And to the Blade! Another wrong righted, another page written!"
msgstr "그리고 칼날을 위하여! 다시 한번 정의가 바로 섰고, 또 다른 전설이 추가되었군!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 999a03a7-d9b6-40ba-4c6a-a85a74ebc3fe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll:999a03a7-d9b6-40ba-4c6a-a85a74ebc3fe
msgctxt "hffc10f19g9a81g429fg93cfg7d3b34cc975c"
msgid "Meet you at your bunk when you're ready."
msgstr "네가 준비되면 네 침대에서 만날게."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 9debd061-787f-7d83-e611-e5528c3c29ac
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll:9debd061-787f-7d83-e611-e5528c3c29ac
msgctxt "h54be72cagd9bcg4c09g842ag51c6a77752e5"
msgid "I've got a tankard keeping me company."
msgstr "난 맥주잔이랑 시간을 보낼게."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 9e232c2e-829a-3973-c4ee-4fae36a56d26
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll:9e232c2e-829a-3973-c4ee-4fae36a56d26
msgctxt "h383e7135gcd3eg41acgb19ag592f1719783d"
msgid "To fortune!"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = a35bdb86-e108-6a20-71e4-6adca504a0ee
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll:a35bdb86-e108-6a20-71e4-6adca504a0ee
msgctxt "h01ec4f33g9a59g4e2egbef2g10869d783b4d"
msgid "... but the frontier provides few of life's creature comforts."
msgstr "... 하지만 변방에는 생명체가 누릴 수 있는 안락함이 거의 없지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = a6d00cba-c8a1-f435-50f5-b1aaa98935a7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll:a6d00cba-c8a1-f435-50f5-b1aaa98935a7
msgctxt "hfaaf693fg2ce3g48f4gb5bfg09edfe24caf6"
msgid ""
"Your name will be forever linked to the Blade of Frontiers. Could you have "
"imagined such fortune a tenday ago?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = a7ee3b47-7dd5-30e0-d0ea-e22a5a0def7d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_KarlachPartner(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll:a7ee3b47-7dd5-30e0-d0ea-e22a5a0def7d
msgctxt "hee970a79g5db7g4fe7g9db5g465d26ea7de9"
msgid "And to you and Karlach. May your stars burn ever bright."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = aa6254a7-4f8c-f000-8472-94ac680b5957
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll:aa6254a7-4f8c-f000-8472-94ac680b5957
msgctxt "h2bc8ab76g0d09g4b78gad95g6aeb05e31f91"
msgid "'The Blade' would have very much failed on his own."
msgstr "'칼날'도 혼자였다면 확실히 실패했을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = aafdff34-88b4-264b-906d-a404169f18cc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll:aafdff34-88b4-264b-906d-a404169f18cc
msgctxt "h42ee7b7bge68dg4f89g96edg8cdb9b135f20"
msgid ""
"Cheeky! But let's not sour the evening with talk of maybes and might-have-"
"beens."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ab0458db-7be7-bd6c-9de5-ddd0531e93a7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll:ab0458db-7be7-bd6c-9de5-ddd0531e93a7
msgctxt "h1ca1e400g17b9g492ag889fg6e1568b362cf"
msgid "Hear! Hear!"
msgstr "건배! 건배!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ae6ad574-12be-3692-3759-5ccc6507b4d3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_WyllRefused(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll:ae6ad574-12be-3692-3759-5ccc6507b4d3
msgctxt "hf3d55ff9g6110g4a3agabe8gca3588b97ac7"
msgid "No. We're allies, nothing more."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = afef4a3a-f25c-8018-b949-133554b8541b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll:afef4a3a-f25c-8018-b949-133554b8541b
msgctxt "h7da3a984gf15bg495ega8dbge09caf2e791a"
msgid "Of course, of course. Why complicate such a valuable partnership?"
msgstr "그럼, 그럼. 이렇게 소중한 동료 관계를 왜 복잡하게 만들겠어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b14b992a-578a-46d8-00eb-9401d0a12207
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll:b14b992a-578a-46d8-00eb-9401d0a12207
msgctxt "h5c5efb5cg0bb0g495ag812fg833d1ed5fb66"
msgid "I'd like that."
msgstr "그거 좋겠는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b4247caa-30ec-120c-e956-2d6402601b17
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll:b4247caa-30ec-120c-e956-2d6402601b17
msgctxt "h420d6b5bged9ag4e60ga8f8g1a5facd31498"
msgid "The Blade lives up to his myth!"
msgstr "넌 칼날의 신화에 걸맞구나!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = b8b71466-6524-dace-da9d-5765595f01a8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll:b8b71466-6524-dace-da9d-5765595f01a8
msgctxt "h4852f597g08c7g416eg8331g6355a68adae2"
msgid "Your heart beats strong, friend. The Blade rarely seeks partnership..."
msgstr "넌 강한 심장을 가졌어, 친구. 이 칼날이 동료를 만드는 일은 드문데 말이야..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = baa9e2bb-c2fa-e672-793d-4fa412704072
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll:baa9e2bb-c2fa-e672-793d-4fa412704072
msgctxt "h7c208de8ge586g4a2cgb78bg44b9edc21801"
msgid "Wyll, I thought you might want to join me in my bunk tonight..."
msgstr "윌, 오늘 밤엔 내 침대를 함께 쓰는 건 어떤지에 대해 생각해 봤는데..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bb8d4fb3-8d14-0439-34a0-a16030934c79
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_WyllRefused(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll:bb8d4fb3-8d14-0439-34a0-a16030934c79
msgctxt "hfa582f58gec4bg49d4g9bedg1579aabe1be2"
msgid "I've thought about your offer, and I'm afraid I'm not interested."
msgstr "네 제안을 생각해봤는데, 유감스럽게도 나는 관심 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = bde9e0a6-c281-be02-7aa3-c0dc9123ebc2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll:bde9e0a6-c281-be02-7aa3-c0dc9123ebc2
msgctxt "he6a1d8dcg8cf0g4653gafb0gc1fad561378c"
msgid "May our bond only grow stronger."
msgstr "우리의 유대감이 더욱 강해지기를."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = c0c0ae48-1de5-0da3-ca5b-13b8fc92fa1a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll:c0c0ae48-1de5-0da3-ca5b-13b8fc92fa1a
msgctxt "habbb45c2g6ccbg42edgb1dbgb98df8f076ea"
msgid "... but the frontier provides few of life's creature comforts."
msgstr "... 하지만 변방에는 생명체가 누릴 수 있는 안락함이 거의 없지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = c22e6025-e2ae-b58e-e381-1b8241b66fa1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CAMP_MizorasJudgement_Event_Judged = True
#.   Object:
#.      - Approval_AtLeast_10_For_Sp2(0) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_WyllAdditionalPartner(1) = True
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_AdditionalPartner(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll:c22e6025-e2ae-b58e-e381-1b8241b66fa1
msgctxt "h8e0b1a05gfdf3g466dg80d8g612e51fa63f3"
msgid "You do know how to set the Blade's heart all a-flutter."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = c38022f8-a994-6aa1-dcf3-aeb0021beb34
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll:c38022f8-a994-6aa1-dcf3-aeb0021beb34
msgctxt "h9f98bbcdg3eabg4993gb842g412eaa2335a6"
msgid "It's a good thing I'm not jealous then."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c5aed4af-5e11-a624-4798-d61ec9bc52fb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_WyllRefused(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll:c5aed4af-5e11-a624-4798-d61ec9bc52fb
msgctxt "h1479d78cg25a5g40e6g9a54g2cd1a6e74de9"
msgid "We're only allies - and I'd like to keep it that way."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = cafa178e-a70d-a6d3-4d49-6cfd973f5943
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll:cafa178e-a70d-a6d3-4d49-6cfd973f5943
msgctxt "hb84feb04ge762g4dbfg896ag3fb750928912"
msgid ""
"Oh, but the Blade is no myth, chief. Myths are tall tales, fleeting as "
"Cormyrian rain."
msgstr "오, 하지만 칼날은 신화가 아니야, 대장. 신화는 코어미어의 비만큼이나 덧없는 이야기지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cfa7c906-6ced-a53c-6451-e36c70aca24b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll:cfa7c906-6ced-a53c-6451-e36c70aca24b
msgctxt "h7a061dabg26e4g49d8gae6ag2c71164e2a81"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = d22a3b30-aeb7-800e-6a00-5110cc326a19
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll:d22a3b30-aeb7-800e-6a00-5110cc326a19
msgctxt "hfd0800b9gd395g44dfga573g5d8ec471cd15"
msgid "To you - a legend in the making."
msgstr "너에게는 전설이 쓰이길."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d3db4ba9-0416-3a22-a68f-b2b5da2ea30b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll:d3db4ba9-0416-3a22-a68f-b2b5da2ea30b
msgctxt "he6ba275eg97f1g4ea5gbc9cgeef7048cd5b6"
msgid "To fortune!"
msgstr "행운을 위하여!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = d53696cf-5e31-a262-a0b3-3b63572fa165
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_HasPartner(1) = True
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_HasMet_Wyll(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll:d53696cf-5e31-a262-a0b3-3b63572fa165
msgctxt "hb4489a80g69bcg4500gbaffg10132dfc8e28"
msgid "A fine night for it!"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = d8b1c232-4915-3ca8-59ea-ce29d3a7c21b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll:d8b1c232-4915-3ca8-59ea-ce29d3a7c21b
msgctxt "hc15c60c3g59beg40a0ga13dgc4507ed98dd5"
msgid "I've got a tankard keeping me company."
msgstr "난 맥주잔이랑 시간을 보낼게."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = d9ae767d-d47a-2586-e423-7ad2f4e3f03c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll:d9ae767d-d47a-2586-e423-7ad2f4e3f03c
msgctxt "hfb9f5726gd57dg40d4ga812gd4d9cc28996b"
msgid ""
"Of course, of course. Our future holds countless victories to celebrate."
msgstr "그럼, 그럼. 우리 미래에는 기념할 만한 수많은 승리가 펼쳐져 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = df1167fb-c88a-e1f2-e2be-5ffd9053862f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll:df1167fb-c88a-e1f2-e2be-5ffd9053862f
msgctxt "h4e2d3325g6710g41c8g8745gcfeb08242c6e"
msgid "Of course, of course. Why complicate such a valuable friendship?"
msgstr "그럼, 그럼. 이렇게 소중한 친구 관계를 왜 복잡하게 만들겠어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e0a2fc24-bf25-f5f2-5dae-f9d5f1b3223c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_WyllRefused(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll:e0a2fc24-bf25-f5f2-5dae-f9d5f1b3223c
msgctxt "hc9159205g36b7g4009ga4d7gaad5a6a5c71b"
msgid "Maybe another time."
msgstr "다음에 하자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = e21a40ee-dc8d-4fbc-5caa-b135a6267afd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll:e21a40ee-dc8d-4fbc-5caa-b135a6267afd
msgctxt "h8049febdg7613g423eg8d77g36021ed0b808"
msgid ""
"When the time comes to rest, just say the word and we'll meet at your bunk."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = e4143f83-56f7-0d91-8261-74ee1a398d5e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll:e4143f83-56f7-0d91-8261-74ee1a398d5e
msgctxt "hd315d75agacafg4ab4gbbf3g66d0468064e6"
msgid "Consider me jealous as a sisterless hag, then."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e422eecf-6d41-b631-cd22-195b7717fc8b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll:e422eecf-6d41-b631-cd22-195b7717fc8b
msgctxt "hf23410abgb5ffg4b9cga2d2gba3cb92fb2b9"
msgid "We should explore this bond in my bunk tonight."
msgstr "오늘밤 내 침대에서 이 유대를 넓혀나가야지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = e58b220a-a3f5-fd42-8cb7-05c17c6bad7d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll:e58b220a-a3f5-fd42-8cb7-05c17c6bad7d
msgctxt "h806b831eg841eg4603g9d67gf01f636e086b"
msgid ""
"Ah. Well. An intriguing offer, truly, but - I just don't feel that kind of "
"connection."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f09ed418-1601-a72c-6c52-137231741183
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll:f09ed418-1601-a72c-6c52-137231741183
msgctxt "h71a71136g5a4dg429eg970cg40f7aff1aae1"
msgid "It wouldn't matter one way or another."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = f53db11a-e813-4c7a-1a01-06b0502480eb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_LaezelPartner(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll:f53db11a-e813-4c7a-1a01-06b0502480eb
msgctxt "h7335e83cg2627g49a5gb03dg0a51c53a59f7"
msgid "And to you and Lae'zel. May your stars burn ever bright."
msgstr "그럼 너와 레이젤을 위하여. 너희 별이 뜨겁게 불타오르기를."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f85eae3f-199d-874e-ec44-b4358be16215
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll:f85eae3f-199d-874e-ec44-b4358be16215
msgctxt "h51b75879gf20dg4a21g90b4gdd6e9a69304c"
msgid "Are you jealous?"
msgstr "질투하는 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = f8832dec-4b32-3d83-832d-fcd5ea05cf82
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_WyllRefused(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll:f8832dec-4b32-3d83-832d-fcd5ea05cf82
msgctxt "h2df73045gd161g476cgae46gf1cdb660f7ae"
msgid "Cheers!"
msgstr "건배!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = f92fd0a4-c6d3-9f6a-c175-490eb8fb075a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll:f92fd0a4-c6d3-9f6a-c175-490eb8fb075a
msgctxt "h71ff7ac3g9538g4dd2g82f2gf25b7e954e71"
msgid "But consider me flattered. A boon for my ego."
msgstr "하지만 고마워. 자존심에 도움이 됐어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = fa1287ce-e962-88fc-b22d-35ecd8d8abba
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll:fa1287ce-e962-88fc-b22d-35ecd8d8abba
msgctxt "hbe366bcegb276g4b31g91f8g5cba60132b15"
msgid "Fuss all you want - this celebration is too sweet for you to sour it!"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = ff7e2653-9bcf-a87b-ecc5-e722a2f7c5fa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_AstarionPartner(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_GoblinHuntTieflingCelebration_CRD_Wyll:ff7e2653-9bcf-a87b-ecc5-e722a2f7c5fa
msgctxt "hf082f5d1g1a81g4844gb7eag06dd0d89304f"
msgid "And to you and Astarion. May your stars burn ever bright."
msgstr "그럼 너와 아스타리온을 위하여. 너희 별이 뜨겁게 불타오르기를."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Halsin_Minthara_CFM_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 0f164ae4-73a3-937c-800b-370c86a50bbd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Halsin_Minthara_CFM_Confrontation:0f164ae4-73a3-937c-800b-370c86a50bbd
msgctxt "h96583b89g9b7eg4c6agae52ga6efce93e75f"
msgid ""
"Lolth has discarded me, and the cult of the Absolute abused my mind, and "
"stole my body. If you stand against them, you stand with me."
msgstr ""
"롤쓰님은 날 버렸고, 절대자의 광신도들이 내 머릿속을 헤집어 놓고 몸뚱아리를 훔쳤어. 네가 만약 그들과 적대한다면, 우린 같은 편이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Halsin_Minthara_CFM_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 2b13ab60-51ac-527f-671c-c3ccd52d79c2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Halsin_Minthara_CFM_Confrontation:2b13ab60-51ac-527f-671c-c3ccd52d79c2
msgctxt "hc0de6e9ag2cc5g4860g8fb1gde6d2ccfb396"
msgid ""
"I am loathe to put an ultimatum to you, but either Minthara or I must leave. "
"I shall honour your choice, whatever it may be."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Halsin_Minthara_CFM_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2b6656da-0601-4e74-aa7a-48cbdf27fad0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Halsin_Minthara_CFM_Confrontation:2b6656da-0601-4e74-aa7a-48cbdf27fad0
msgctxt "h91ba3faag8ee9g42b6gb31cgf914019405b0"
msgid "He's right, Minthara. I'm not willing to risk travelling with you."
msgstr "할신 말이 맞아, 민타라. 너와 여행하면서 불필요한 위험을 지고 싶진 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Halsin_Minthara_CFM_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2c4b1d48-2eda-17c5-7089-9cc8044cc353
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_Companion_Leave(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Halsin_Minthara_CFM_Confrontation:2c4b1d48-2eda-17c5-7089-9cc8044cc353
msgctxt "h1657559dg81a0g4a46gb9a6g3d828d5fd44a"
msgid "Agreed. Goodbye, Minthara."
msgstr "맞는 말이야. 잘 가, 민타라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Halsin_Minthara_CFM_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 40d0640f-10e4-4004-8542-747579379470
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_Companion_Leave(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Halsin_Minthara_CFM_Confrontation:40d0640f-10e4-4004-8542-747579379470
msgctxt "h4f81faefga650g4e2cga799gd99ba55eadd5"
msgid "Then you must go, Halsin. I'm sorry."
msgstr "그럼 넌 떠나야만 해, 할신. 미안하지만."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Halsin_Minthara_CFM_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 57d9f03a-3b12-4be0-aafa-fdc0dc2e73ec
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Halsin_Minthara_CFM_Confrontation:57d9f03a-3b12-4be0-aafa-fdc0dc2e73ec
msgctxt "he2d5483ag3ed8g4a4eg853bg34a563fa1f63"
msgid ""
"May the Oak Father preserve you throughout the challenges that await. You "
"shall be in my prayers, always."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Halsin_Minthara_CFM_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 5c67a83d-8147-4e50-bdaa-84e56a61249b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Halsin_Minthara_CFM_Confrontation:5c67a83d-8147-4e50-bdaa-84e56a61249b
msgctxt "h9f246c00gdd71g4ecdga30cg9c149b67932b"
msgid ""
"It was the Absolute that directed my hand toward your grove - the same "
"Absolute that I am sworn to destroy now that I am free of its influence."
msgstr "날 숲으로 이끈 건 절대자였어. 내가 세뇌에서 풀려나고서부터 죽이기로 맹세한 그 절대자 말이야. "

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Halsin_Minthara_CFM_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 5ee14859-d00c-409e-8aa6-26539012f60b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Halsin_Minthara_CFM_Confrontation:5ee14859-d00c-409e-8aa6-26539012f60b
msgctxt "h0d8a61ccgd5a1g48bag89bfgd3b737b01bc6"
msgid ""
"I know that was not easy, but you made the right choice. A viper cannot "
"escape its true nature, no matter how calm it may seem."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Halsin_Minthara_CFM_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6f1a6e8a-8918-3b71-66da-457c465c402d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Halsin_Minthara_CFM_Confrontation:6f1a6e8a-8918-3b71-66da-457c465c402d
msgctxt "h02752870g06edg41e0gb98eg425eb5f256c6"
msgid "Not my problem. You're on your own."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Halsin_Minthara_CFM_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 6feed625-a776-060c-5714-d0092bac51bc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Halsin_Minthara_CFM_Confrontation:6feed625-a776-060c-5714-d0092bac51bc
msgctxt "h5e6a6155g88fag473agb007g6e879f7ddd8f"
msgid ""
"If we meet again, kill me quickly if you can. I prefer oblivion to "
"enslavement."
msgstr "다음번에 우리가 마주치게 된다면, 최대한 빨리 날 죽여 줘. 노예가 되는 것보단 영원한 망각을 맞이하는 게 나으니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Halsin_Minthara_CFM_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 73631b06-4b35-48da-9729-ce32754905d1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Halsin_Minthara_CFM_Confrontation:73631b06-4b35-48da-9729-ce32754905d1
msgctxt "h409fb2beg4899g48e7g9807gc9b2278adff1"
msgid ""
"I am sorry. You have proven an unmatched ally to me... but I cannot remain "
"with you if that killer, Minthara, is to stay also."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Halsin_Minthara_CFM_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 7bc8d9cd-1775-a2b6-3863-0ca045bab39c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Halsin_Minthara_CFM_Confrontation:7bc8d9cd-1775-a2b6-3863-0ca045bab39c
msgctxt "he4ea4d55g49b4g482dg90a5g186bd2ff70fa"
msgid ""
"Regrettable. But if I am forced to weigh her life and freedom against your "
"own, then I see little choice. "
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Halsin_Minthara_CFM_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 7fca3289-f755-4a54-b572-6254050b3ee6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Halsin_Minthara_CFM_Confrontation:7fca3289-f755-4a54-b572-6254050b3ee6
msgctxt "h501aae4bg5bacg446dg9fedgc6fdf115cd93"
msgid ""
"The Absolute was just an excuse to indulge your base instincts. You shall "
"find another."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Halsin_Minthara_CFM_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 8d49c367-e9c8-4269-82cc-a9d290a2550a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_LiftingTheCurse_State_HalsinRecruitable = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Halsin_Minthara_CFM_Confrontation:8d49c367-e9c8-4269-82cc-a9d290a2550a
msgctxt "h400affbcgf8bbg4cb3gaad2ge6241343fd0a"
msgid ""
"If that is your wish, so be it. I sincerely hope I am proven wrong, but I "
"cannot remain in order to find out."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Halsin_Minthara_CFM_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 8daf9833-e804-4ead-a699-03ba8bd08f66
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Halsin_Minthara_CFM_Confrontation:8daf9833-e804-4ead-a699-03ba8bd08f66
msgctxt "h416c598bg38d0g4a3fgaec5g29aa8cf4cb65"
msgid ""
"Spare me your sanctimony, druid. You kill to preserve your natural order, do "
"you not? Or are the claws and fangs simply for show?"
msgstr ""
"독실한 척은 그만두지 그래, 드루이드. 넌 네 주관을 위해서 살해를 저지르지, 그렇지 않나? 아니면 그 날카로운 발톱과 송곳니는 장식으로 "
"붙여놨나? "

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Halsin_Minthara_CFM_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 904a46cd-aaf8-42c6-a16b-c5ffe4f2f991
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Halsin_Minthara_CFM_Confrontation:904a46cd-aaf8-42c6-a16b-c5ffe4f2f991
msgctxt "h6ed7349dg97fbg4478g8232g573bfc8815d1"
msgid "Then I must say farewell."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Halsin_Minthara_CFM_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 91e86f01-136d-462f-8ac7-461841e0c0ba
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Halsin_Minthara_CFM_Confrontation:91e86f01-136d-462f-8ac7-461841e0c0ba
msgctxt "hafa05d90gb814g4279g8412ga24578a65ba7"
msgid ""
"I am not without sympathy... but the risk is too great. We may share a foe, "
"but we cannot be allies."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Halsin_Minthara_CFM_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 928f2e6f-ed26-44a4-8a0b-698b73a53c9a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Halsin_Minthara_CFM_Confrontation:928f2e6f-ed26-44a4-8a0b-698b73a53c9a
msgctxt "h83ff646cg32ecg48fbga6a5gfeef77ae39e5"
msgid "If I leave, I die."
msgstr "여길 떠나면 난 죽는다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Halsin_Minthara_CFM_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 9b45c1ad-a4c9-43c0-99e6-28ab2fe61452
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Halsin_Minthara_CFM_Confrontation:9b45c1ad-a4c9-43c0-99e6-28ab2fe61452
msgctxt "h5e3a8d13g5ab2g42a1gb100g7d66340419ef"
msgid ""
"I am no stranger to the Underdark. Cruelty comes to Lolth's followers as "
"naturally as breathing. I have seen it - experienced it."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Halsin_Minthara_CFM_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a58bf6bc-6ed4-0c27-9b40-b33e50e23313
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Halsin_Minthara_CFM_Confrontation:a58bf6bc-6ed4-0c27-9b40-b33e50e23313
msgctxt "h137f5badg0233g49fdga558g5e22be73baa5"
msgid "What do you say to that, Halsin?"
msgstr "그렇다는데. 어떻게 생각해, 할신?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Halsin_Minthara_CFM_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ad6b012c-80f0-bda6-0731-a8b4befc5e3e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Halsin_Minthara_CFM_Confrontation:ad6b012c-80f0-bda6-0731-a8b4befc5e3e
msgctxt "hc846e51ag67afg4484ga1abg906b328f5fe6"
msgid "I can't do that to her, Halsin. She stays with us."
msgstr "그럴 순 없어, 할신. 민타라는 우리와 함께 할 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Halsin_Minthara_CFM_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = af4a9b82-4d40-4a81-9cd7-4f20728dbb03
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Halsin_Minthara_CFM_Confrontation:af4a9b82-4d40-4a81-9cd7-4f20728dbb03
msgctxt "h561c309aga9c4g49ddgbaeag1ca96d9a34ea"
msgid "I'm sorry, Minthara, but I trust Halsin's judgment. You need to leave."
msgstr "민타라, 미안하지만 난 할신의 판단을 믿어. 네가 떠나줘야겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Halsin_Minthara_CFM_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = bbc48db9-2c1b-75a2-99c9-7c4df6616aa8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Halsin_Minthara_CFM_Confrontation:bbc48db9-2c1b-75a2-99c9-7c4df6616aa8
msgctxt "h1f06389ag3597g4233g9e28g56765711b31d"
msgid "I have no quarrel with you."
msgstr "너에게 악감정은 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Halsin_Minthara_CFM_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bbdf05f6-0711-4512-b0cb-6b8e02a8aa03
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_Companion_Leave(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Halsin_Minthara_CFM_Confrontation:bbdf05f6-0711-4512-b0cb-6b8e02a8aa03
msgctxt "h14e1e7f2ga558g4351g8dd6ga948cbfa0db0"
msgid ""
"Minthara is dangerous - and that's precisely what we need to win this fight. "
"She stays, Halsin."
msgstr "민타라는 위험하지만, 우리가 이 싸움에서 이기기 위해선 꼭 필요한 자산이야. 민타라는 여기 남을 거야, 할신."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Halsin_Minthara_CFM_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bbfde148-a8f1-b805-8b62-0b8418085218
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Halsin_Minthara_CFM_Confrontation:bbfde148-a8f1-b805-8b62-0b8418085218
msgctxt "h37fdf19bg5b2bg4ae5ga8e7g334c09f4c484"
msgid "I'm sorry, Minthara, but you need to leave."
msgstr "민타라, 미안하지만 네가 떠나줘야겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Halsin_Minthara_CFM_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = bd9e1bb6-71d9-47d0-a120-371602a72d5d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_LiftingTheCurse_State_BreathHasBeenRestored = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Halsin_Minthara_CFM_Confrontation:bd9e1bb6-71d9-47d0-a120-371602a72d5d
msgctxt "h7d58cbddgfae6g41e2g8304g6db1aeead1f5"
msgid ""
"Thank you, for all you have done. Thaniel shall never forget you. Nor shall "
"I."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Halsin_Minthara_CFM_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = d1fe4725-c998-2ea8-243c-9d521a199970
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Halsin_Minthara_CFM_Confrontation:d1fe4725-c998-2ea8-243c-9d521a199970
msgctxt "h356516e5g4f0ag4986g8a90g5479dbba2a04"
msgid ""
"No... worse than death. If I leave, if I am not protected from the "
"Absolute's voice as you are, then it will take me again. Body, mind and soul."
msgstr ""
"아니... 죽음보다 더한 걸 겪게 되겠지. 난 너처럼 절대자의 목소리에서 보호되는 게 아니라, 떠난다면 절대자가 다시 모든 걸 차지하게 "
"될 거야. 내 몸과, 정신과, 영혼까지도 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Halsin_Minthara_CFM_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = e45f4aee-d1cd-4ce4-99c9-3cd40eede6b5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Halsin_Minthara_CFM_Confrontation:e45f4aee-d1cd-4ce4-99c9-3cd40eede6b5
msgctxt "h5ad250ccgf80fg44dcga7a8gbfc59b53fd38"
msgid "Goodbye."
msgstr "안녕."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Halsin_Minthara_CFM_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = eb210247-2efb-1c9a-cb6a-4df021958783
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Halsin_Minthara_CFM_Confrontation:eb210247-2efb-1c9a-cb6a-4df021958783
msgctxt "hacb1eaccg48c1g41d0gb551g3ece0342375f"
msgid "So be it."
msgstr "맘대로 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Halsin_Minthara_CFM_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = edf840a9-8aa0-ebf2-8975-81a6ff6a36da
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Halsin_Minthara_CFM_Confrontation:edf840a9-8aa0-ebf2-8975-81a6ff6a36da
msgctxt "hdba02d74g2bcbg4800g9180gdcd541a2924f"
msgid ""
"She's right - if we force her to leave, we condemn her to a horrible fate."
msgstr "민타라 말이 맞아. 우리가 민타라를 쫓아낸다면, 끔찍한 운명에 처하게 만드는 꼴이라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Halsin_Minthara_CFM_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = f657cc12-b013-44f9-8484-bc9c590d1690
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_LiftingTheCurse_State_BreathHasBeenRestored = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Halsin_Minthara_CFM_Confrontation:f657cc12-b013-44f9-8484-bc9c590d1690
msgctxt "hfc54ff3fg704ag4b6egaad4gf636315009a8"
msgid ""
"I am sorry. You took great lengths to help me - to help <i>Thaniel</i>... "
"but I cannot remain with you if that killer, Minthara, is to stay also."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Halsin_Minthara_CFM_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = fa1c3245-18a1-4fb9-9a78-cc5e679d3c49
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Halsin_Minthara_CFM_Confrontation:fa1c3245-18a1-4fb9-9a78-cc5e679d3c49
msgctxt "h1a17f2edgdabeg4651gbfb1g885e8588ca72"
msgid ""
"She would have commanded her minions to slaughter everyone in the grove, "
"given the chance. It was only because of Kagha's foolishness that she was "
"denied her bloody prize."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_CoolingDownForYou
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 150a986d-08f4-a0fd-d9b8-e52257d76faf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_CoolingDownForYou:150a986d-08f4-a0fd-d9b8-e52257d76faf
msgctxt "hc73b29c1gc75ag4f14g92b0g76df5710dba7"
msgid "Hmm. Let me try something."
msgstr "흠. 뭔가 시도해 볼게."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_CoolingDownForYou
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2c07ee7f-a077-8480-813f-1d0f12d638dd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_CoolingDownForYou:2c07ee7f-a077-8480-813f-1d0f12d638dd
msgctxt "h8639d5b9g04b8g4d86gb15dg261cfba1baf3"
msgid "Nothing is coming to mind. Sorry."
msgstr "생각 나는 게 없네. 미안해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_CoolingDownForYou
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 364abef1-84c7-fef5-75db-106cb22188ec
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_CoolingDownForYou:364abef1-84c7-fef5-75db-106cb22188ec
msgctxt "hee598d49g451fg445cg8032gbc1965105c54"
msgid ""
"There's got to be something, right? Something cold - or water! Or maybe if "
"you were less... burnable. There's a thought, right?"
msgstr ""
"방법이 있을 거야, 그치? 무언가 차가운 거, 물도 있고! 아님 네가 좀 덜... 불타는 소재가 된다든가. 생각하자면 많아, 그치?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_CoolingDownForYou
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 5315afa2-20e5-86e7-5426-4d95229d8117
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - ORI_Karlach_State_HelpingAboutBurningOthers = True
#.     - ORI_Karlach_State_WaitingForSolution = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_CoolingDownForYou:5315afa2-20e5-86e7-5426-4d95229d8117
msgctxt "h494f4f68g022eg4543g82ecg5c12c37976a3"
msgid "Yes!"
msgstr "좋아!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_CoolingDownForYou
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 5994eef4-2ffe-2770-f4bf-06c6fdd5b825
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_CoolingDownForYou:5994eef4-2ffe-2770-f4bf-06c6fdd5b825
msgctxt "hd12a34a4g1998g4765g972bg66df268f6158"
msgid "Hey, soldier - you said you might try cooling me down. Any leads?"
msgstr "어이, 신참. 날 식혀 줄 방법을 찾겠다며. 단서 좀 찾았어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_CoolingDownForYou
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 886e48f7-cd51-d728-9704-a58e45df2f20
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_CoolingDownForYou:886e48f7-cd51-d728-9704-a58e45df2f20
msgctxt "h9edc66aag6712g4281g894fg1ddb1e182528"
msgid "Do you have any ideas?"
msgstr "좋은 생각이라도 있어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_FacingDeath
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0080a914-3329-5c88-86eb-7ead5ed25a12
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_FacingDeath:0080a914-3329-5c88-86eb-7ead5ed25a12
msgctxt "h69f1f065g64b5g498fgb1bcgd823242c8ee6"
msgid "If you're going to explode, I suggest you stay far away from me."
msgstr "폭발할 거면, 멀리 떨어져서 하는 걸 제안하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_FacingDeath
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 07c7b0bc-1be9-42ea-3ccb-feab3320bb1a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_FacingDeath:07c7b0bc-1be9-42ea-3ccb-feab3320bb1a
msgctxt "h91d1e3a5g4ad0g4031gabf3ga50704635e7f"
msgid "We'll do it together. Whatever it takes."
msgstr "함께 하자. 무슨 일이 있어도."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_FacingDeath
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 1013e0fd-26cb-e764-73fe-eaa65597dfde
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_FacingDeath:1013e0fd-26cb-e764-73fe-eaa65597dfde
msgctxt "hc6145d87g79cfg47c1g9e26g40523532bae2"
msgid ""
"I'd never have protected a Banite, even a decade ago. I looked after that "
"fucker with my life. I <i>trusted </i>him."
msgstr ""
"10년 전이라도, 베인 신도란 걸 알았으면 지키지 않았을 텐데. 난 그 개새끼를 목숨 바쳐 지켰어. 그 놈을 <i>믿었다고</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_FacingDeath
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 1786aba9-6bf7-fce3-5005-9ba88df69841
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - ORI_Karlach_Knows_Gortash = True
#.     - ORI_Karlach_Knows_GortashGrudge = True
#.     - ORI_Karlach_Quest_HuntGortash = True
#.     - ORI_Karlach_Event_SetHighLevelBurningState = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_FacingDeath:1786aba9-6bf7-fce3-5005-9ba88df69841
msgctxt "h471d74a4g3581g421fga557g6869a5d0599f"
msgid "He has to die. And I'm gonna be the one who kills him."
msgstr "그 놈은 죽어야 해. 내가 그 놈을 죽여버리겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_FacingDeath
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 29238363-bbf7-1a6c-3321-fbe3eae2f8db
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_FacingDeath:29238363-bbf7-1a6c-3321-fbe3eae2f8db
msgctxt "h11459f52g7f46g407eg9f7egea448013a940"
msgid "Not if I kill him first."
msgstr "내가 죽일 건데?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_FacingDeath
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 2a4eb46c-9be4-42cb-3237-f9802679731a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_FacingDeath:2a4eb46c-9be4-42cb-3237-f9802679731a
msgctxt "h5a3c0855ge7b4g46b2g98b2g6160434a2723"
msgid ""
"He gave me away to Zariel without a second thought, and now he's looking to "
"ruin the entire Sword Coast."
msgstr "그랬는데 나를 자리엘한테 두 번 생각 안하고 줘버렸어. 그리고 이젠 소드 코스트 전체를 망쳐 놓으려 하잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_FacingDeath
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 2aee0296-0a10-ea56-b856-3617dd38fba0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_Karlach_Knows_GortashGrudge = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - ORI_Karlach_State_BlockFacingDeath = True
#.     - ORI_Karlach_Event_SetLowLevelBurningState = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_FacingDeath:2aee0296-0a10-ea56-b856-3617dd38fba0
msgctxt "h18af0ca5gbbffg405cg9952gc06dab60ccdf"
msgid ""
"You saw Gortash, didn't you? What the fuck was he doing down there? Is all "
"of this because of him?"
msgstr "고타쉬를 봤지, 그렇지? 고타쉬가 저 아래서 씨발 뭘 하고 있었던거야? 이거 전부 그 놈 짓이야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_FacingDeath
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2ca8653d-5801-e661-432b-69e8146caead
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_FacingDeath:2ca8653d-5801-e661-432b-69e8146caead
msgctxt "h9e0322degc0fbg47d8gbd40gdc28f8ee54c0"
msgid ""
"We can keep our eyes peeled, but I'm more concerned about the giant illithid "
"brain that just left for the city."
msgstr "그런 사람이 있는지 살펴는 보겠지만, 도시 쪽으로 간 거대한 일리시드 뇌 쪽이 더 걱정이라서 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_FacingDeath
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 361d2005-882e-b797-b2f8-a75899eac1d2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_FacingDeath:361d2005-882e-b797-b2f8-a75899eac1d2
msgctxt "he2cf02e7gb24eg4a72g9479ge3672edd881b"
msgid ""
"Then I need to find an infernal mechanic - and quickly. I'm hanging on, but "
"just by my fingertips."
msgstr "그럼 빨리 지옥의 기계공을 찾아야 해. 버티고는 있지만, 아슬아슬하거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_FacingDeath
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 39c8052f-e860-eefb-4bec-7321c5726de9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - ORI_Karlach_State_BlockFacingDeath = True
#.     - ORI_Karlach_Knows_GortashGrudge = True
#.     - ORI_Karlach_Event_SetLowLevelBurningState = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_FacingDeath:39c8052f-e860-eefb-4bec-7321c5726de9
msgctxt "h4fd9fe0egad0bg45fagbb94g1ead67625950"
msgid ""
"I heard about what happened. Ketheric. Myrkul. And Gortash. What the fuck "
"was he doing down there? Is all of this because of him?"
msgstr ""
"무슨 일이 있었는지 들었어. 케서릭. 머큘. 거기에 고타쉬. 고타쉬가 저 아래서 씨발 뭘 하고 있었던거야? 이거 전부 그 놈 짓이야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_FacingDeath
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 44d4fcd7-b643-e1e4-3d7b-710f1ed5d923
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_FacingDeath:44d4fcd7-b643-e1e4-3d7b-710f1ed5d923
msgctxt "ha92d9aa3g0546g4c95g8768g6f596429292d"
msgid "There must be someone we can consult in Baldur's Gate."
msgstr "발더스 게이트에 도와줄 수 있는 사람이 있을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_FacingDeath
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 45d8b71c-89ac-ad01-4f1b-779c92abc14c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_FacingDeath:45d8b71c-89ac-ad01-4f1b-779c92abc14c
msgctxt "he9f538b7g0e5dg41a7gb334g48ed5d45f3ff"
msgid ""
"I've got a long list of evil fucks to deal with. And I'm not going out until "
"I do."
msgstr "내가 손봐줘야 할 나쁜 개자식 목록이 길다고. 다 해결하기 전엔 못 죽어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_FacingDeath
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 4a983aaf-d2a4-514b-d3ab-7f7ede0db065
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_FacingDeath:4a983aaf-d2a4-514b-d3ab-7f7ede0db065
msgctxt "h810b00efg6eefg4f95gbb6cgbd4290c04ccf"
msgid "The tadpole, the Absolute... <i>how?!</i>"
msgstr "올챙이에, 절대자에... <i>어떻게 된거냐고?!</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_FacingDeath
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 4e3a28f2-0203-06e5-c698-49c39fad89f2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_FacingDeath:4e3a28f2-0203-06e5-c698-49c39fad89f2
msgctxt "ha814b112g7503g4e4agac6egcd3555d4fa85"
msgid ""
"Whatever the fuck he's been up to in the last ten years, we have to stop "
"him. He can't just keep ruining people's lives. He can't get away with it!"
msgstr ""
"지난 10년 간 뭘 한 건지는 몰라도, 그 놈을 막아야 해. 그 놈이 계속 사람들을 좌지우지하게 둘 수는 없어. 그냥 내버려둘 순 없다고!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_FacingDeath
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 5eda394c-3f5a-8cd7-d6d3-8ed9345a03ca
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_Karlach_Knows_EngineIsGoingToExplode = False
#.      - ORI_Karlach_Knows_InfernalEngineExists = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - ORI_Karlach_Knows_EngineIsGoingToExplode = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_FacingDeath:5eda394c-3f5a-8cd7-d6d3-8ed9345a03ca
msgctxt "hb945e9ebgeed7g4415gbdeag7dc1cbfc69a8"
msgid ""
"I can feel it. The engine. It's getting hotter. Louder. I feel like... like "
"it might burn out completely. And soon, if I don't find some way to fix it."
msgstr "느껴져. 엔진이, 더 시끄럽고 뜨겁게 타고 있어. 아마... 완전히 타버릴 거야. 고치지 않으면, 금방 그렇게 되겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_FacingDeath
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 5ff0e01a-6ca9-efad-a1cb-57ba9016ecf9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_ForgingOfTheHeart_State_KarlachSecondUpgrade = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_FacingDeath:5ff0e01a-6ca9-efad-a1cb-57ba9016ecf9
msgctxt "h11104842g92beg410fg805cg43fe72a6beb4"
msgid ""
"I can feel it. The engine. It's getting hotter. Louder. It's going to blow, "
"if we don't find another way to fix it."
msgstr "느껴져. 엔진이, 더 시끄럽고 뜨겁게 타고 있어. 고치지 않으면, 폭발할 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_FacingDeath
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 6bbcb5f3-a8ea-e714-a622-54a21da014b6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_FacingDeath:6bbcb5f3-a8ea-e714-a622-54a21da014b6
msgctxt "h589a4c1fg054ag4b97g841dgca5f03bb06af"
msgid ""
"I won't know peace 'til I've dug my thumbs into his eyes. 'Til I've ripped "
"his throat out with my teeth. Hear that, Gortash?! I'm coming for you!"
msgstr "그 놈 눈깔에 손가락을 쑤셔넣기 전까진 쉬지 않겠어. 목구멍을 이빨로 뜯어내기까지는. 들리냐, 고타쉬?! 너 잡으러 간다!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_FacingDeath
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 6d8553bb-fee7-38a6-e5df-edc41fa142a2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_FacingDeath:6d8553bb-fee7-38a6-e5df-edc41fa142a2
msgctxt "h2262ad3bg4b0ag447dgb3c6g2317155df646"
msgid "I'm not going out yet - got business with a motherfucker first."
msgstr "난 아직 죽을 생각 없어. 손봐줘야 할 씹새끼가 있거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_FacingDeath
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 6fd8bbff-5a37-4304-c051-657ff94673c5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_FacingDeath:6fd8bbff-5a37-4304-c051-657ff94673c5
msgctxt "h32a18b48g0bf9g4a77gb2bcg8d79f22d65fc"
msgid "I want to live to fight it. Not burn out before I get the chance."
msgstr "나도 살아서 그거랑 싸우고 싶어. 싸우기 전에 타버릴 게 아니라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_FacingDeath
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 7553ed55-2f5e-ab57-22ef-a99f9e80e7f0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_FacingDeath:7553ed55-2f5e-ab57-22ef-a99f9e80e7f0
msgctxt "h9b9dbbbeg7d0bg40c7g82e7g625598fecea3"
msgid ""
"I need to find an infernal mechanic - quickly. I'm hanging on, but just by "
"my fingertips."
msgstr "빨리 지옥의 기계공을 찾아야 해. 버티고는 있지만, 아슬아슬하거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_FacingDeath
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 787338a2-d189-2417-4a58-b23b8f9d21fe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_FacingDeath:787338a2-d189-2417-4a58-b23b8f9d21fe
msgctxt "h8b565cfag9c24g4756g895bg28f48277fdad"
msgid "How can we fix your engine?"
msgstr "엔진은 어떻게 고치지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_FacingDeath
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 78be2124-8f5d-98ed-291d-4c1f530effca
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_FacingDeath:78be2124-8f5d-98ed-291d-4c1f530effca
msgctxt "h4feba048gd86dg49e0gaab5g583c4cb3ed88"
msgid "Careful, Karlach! You're burning up!"
msgstr "조심해, 칼라크! 너 불타고 있어!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_FacingDeath
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 81562408-d167-153b-1c5c-151984e4681e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_FacingDeath:81562408-d167-153b-1c5c-151984e4681e
msgctxt "h62088849gf3e0g4ee3gb489gca0b7526b95a"
msgid "And now he'd use up the entire Sword Coast."
msgstr "게다가 그 놈이 이제 소드 코스트를 망쳐놓으려 하잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_FacingDeath
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 8b68a603-74c8-6c47-9cbd-58021d70f9fe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_FacingDeath:8b68a603-74c8-6c47-9cbd-58021d70f9fe
msgctxt "h85985156g042cg495egbb1dg0ae727e23a62"
msgid "Here's hoping."
msgstr "그러면 좋겠네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_FacingDeath
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 9b8a0ae2-50ed-ad03-99e1-55d263f0ae7a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_FacingDeath:9b8a0ae2-50ed-ad03-99e1-55d263f0ae7a
msgctxt "hece0edb6g40eeg4b33gbcaag339255435d4e"
msgid ""
"An infernal mechanic could do it - and quickly. I'm hanging on, but just by "
"my fingertips."
msgstr "지옥의 기계공이라면 고칠 수 있을 거야. 찾을 거면 빨리 찾아야해. 버티고는 있지만, 아슬아슬하거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_FacingDeath
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 9c0e8940-5e58-7772-6712-95d776ed6ca6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_FacingDeath:9c0e8940-5e58-7772-6712-95d776ed6ca6
msgctxt "h16a37584g7e14g4bd0g9c70g1f16f09cc11a"
msgid ""
"I'm more likely to implode than blow up, more's the pity. Wouldn't mind "
"taking out a few cultists on my way out the door. But better if it doesn't "
"come to that."
msgstr ""
"정확히 말하면, 난 폭발보단 붕괴할 가능성이 높아. 참 안된 일이지. 어차피 나갈거면 사교도 몇명 데려가도 좋았을 텐데 말이야. 그렇게 "
"되지 않는 편이 더 좋겠지만."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_FacingDeath
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 9da0b939-202d-64e8-5820-0188c538d65e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_FacingDeath:9da0b939-202d-64e8-5820-0188c538d65e
msgctxt "ha50b4fe5g305ag4e48g9ff9g4132277640e4"
msgid ""
"He can't get away with what he's done. To me, to us. He won't get away with "
"it!"
msgstr "나한테, 우리한테 그런 짓을 한 놈을 내버려둘 순 없어. 내버려 두지 않을 거야!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_FacingDeath
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9ef358a4-11e7-29e7-8bbc-058592855162
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_FacingDeath:9ef358a4-11e7-29e7-8bbc-058592855162
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h6c6551fdga682g4302gb103gdbb9396a5725"
msgid "We won't let that happen."
msgstr "폭발하게 두지는 않겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_FacingDeath
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = a5d19757-240a-c811-1777-882512c579fa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_FacingDeath:a5d19757-240a-c811-1777-882512c579fa
msgctxt "hc853fb25g85feg46e7gb39eg6e02f44e39f6"
msgid ""
"He used me up and gave me away when he was done with me. Didn't matter how "
"much I trusted him."
msgstr "그 놈은 날 써먹다가, 다 쓰고 나선 나를 남에게 줘 버렸어. 난 그를 믿었는데, 중요하지 않았던거지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_FacingDeath
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = adb32d0c-10c0-d5aa-48da-fe194d0a4211
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_FacingDeath:adb32d0c-10c0-d5aa-48da-fe194d0a4211
msgctxt "h97d8c739g9721g4c29gb8d4gc89c7402e4aa"
msgid "We'll find out when we get to Baldur's Gate."
msgstr "발더스 게이트에서 알게 되겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_FacingDeath
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ae124e7d-126b-ddbc-690a-402e26eb7c6d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_Weaponsmith_Knows_Elturel = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_FacingDeath:ae124e7d-126b-ddbc-690a-402e26eb7c6d
msgctxt "h18f6a8acg1fa3g41b2gbbe8gbde571e23971"
msgid ""
"I might know someone - a tiefling weaponsmith we met in the druids' grove."
msgstr "아는 사람이 있어. 드루이드 숲에서 봤던 티플링 무기장이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_FacingDeath
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = b25f226e-6aa0-6fe6-c942-cf5c020f7a50
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_FacingDeath:b25f226e-6aa0-6fe6-c942-cf5c020f7a50
msgctxt "h1a67eab3g2561g4c0ega31egc0a26359560c"
msgid ""
"Let's get to the city. Got business there I'm highly fucking keen to attend "
"to."
msgstr "도시로 가자. 존나 꼭 해야 할 일이 있거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_FacingDeath
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = b570d331-4c52-017e-19a6-b70ccc2ca216
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - ORI_Karlach_Knows_InfernalEngineExists = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_FacingDeath:b570d331-4c52-017e-19a6-b70ccc2ca216
msgctxt "hd47293acg61dfg4662gbe04g339e1e152149"
msgid ""
"Do you know what's inside me? An infernal engine. It burns as hot as the "
"Hells, and it's been running in overdrive since I left Avernus."
msgstr "내 몸 속에 뭐가 있는지 알아? 지옥의 엔진이야. 지옥만큼 뜨겁게 타오르는데, 내가 아베르누스에서 나온 후로 쭉 과부하 상태야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_FacingDeath
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = ba5a28ce-456c-840d-a6ea-2146724b951e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_Karlach_Knows_InfernalEngineExists = True
#.      - GLO_ForgingOfTheHeart_State_KarlachUpgraded = False
#.      - GLO_ForgingOfTheHeart_State_KarlachSecondUpgrade = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - ORI_Karlach_Knows_EngineIsGoingToExplode = True
#.     - ORI_Karlach_Knows_InfernalEngineExists = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_FacingDeath:ba5a28ce-456c-840d-a6ea-2146724b951e
msgctxt "h5fb7ed61g3dd3g44ecgab57g722931c87f18"
msgid ""
"Do you know this engine inside of me is going to blow? If I don't find an "
"infernal mechanic, I'm finished."
msgstr "내 몸 속에 있는 이 엔진이 폭발하려는 거 알아? 지옥의 기계공을 찾지 못하면, 난 끝장이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_FacingDeath
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = be60d0b3-11f9-10f7-42a5-9f9cf8d538f5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_FacingDeath:be60d0b3-11f9-10f7-42a5-9f9cf8d538f5
msgctxt "hda623640g9a11g45bag9c05gb379eb2122b2"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_FacingDeath
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = c069fdf8-35c8-6eb4-39fb-8d8c81c77e30
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_FacingDeath:c069fdf8-35c8-6eb4-39fb-8d8c81c77e30
msgctxt "h3802c2b9g331dg4bedgb399g2742117a0a35"
msgid "I need to get myself fixed in time to make him pay."
msgstr "제때 이걸 고치고, 그 놈에게 값을 치르게 해야 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_FacingDeath
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = c6603ead-fa2d-5f46-b037-281b5fede63e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_FacingDeath:c6603ead-fa2d-5f46-b037-281b5fede63e
msgctxt "hfe4a751fg0cf3g4329gbe8fg5fe4ff1445df"
msgid "You bet your arse I am. And I won't stop 'til that fucker is dead!"
msgstr "그야 존나 당연하지. 그 씹새끼가 죽기 전까진 멈출 수 없어!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_FacingDeath
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = d5e86c90-0631-eccd-57e0-696e3c53c83e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_FacingDeath:d5e86c90-0631-eccd-57e0-696e3c53c83e
msgctxt "hc978de74g9290g4dbdgac38g124e3476b24c"
msgid ""
"Zariel may have put the fucking thing in, but Gortash gave her the go-ahead. "
"You expect this shit from devils. But not from the people you care about."
msgstr ""
"이 좆같은 걸 집어넣은 건 자리엘이지만, 그래도 된다고 한 건 고타쉬야. 이런 건 데빌들이나 할 짓이지, 가까운 사람들한테 당할 일이 "
"아니라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_FacingDeath
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d65b165b-6528-54d3-a7e2-df04f1ba69e6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_FacingDeath:d65b165b-6528-54d3-a7e2-df04f1ba69e6
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h7e29601ag8ddeg49f1gaad5ga199b319b753"
msgid ""
"I don't know how this plot fits together yet. But we <i>will </i>stop him."
msgstr "나도 이게 다 어떻게 맞아 들어가는지는 몰라. 그래도 그를 <i>반드시</i> 막을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_FacingDeath
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = d9d9267c-af31-e051-391e-d19312640b98
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_FacingDeath:d9d9267c-af31-e051-391e-d19312640b98
msgctxt "ha937f9e6g2d00g4104ga276ga2ae23462a92"
msgid ""
"If he went on to Baldur's Gate, we might be able to find him. He owes you a "
"favour after what you did, right?"
msgstr "그 사람도 발더스 게이트로 갔다면, 또 볼 수도 있겠네. 그렇게 도와줬으니 부탁은 들어주겠지, 그렇지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_FacingDeath
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = ea23b0e0-eb55-51bf-269f-29871286b9bf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_FacingDeath:ea23b0e0-eb55-51bf-269f-29871286b9bf
msgctxt "he091c251g47d6g420ag9eb1g8c5d588ca77f"
msgid ""
"He gave me away to Zariel just for kicks. He ruined my life just when it was "
"starting."
msgstr "그랬는데 나를 자리엘에게 팔아 먹었어. 내 삶은 막 시작이었는데, 그 놈이 망쳐버렸다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_FacingDeath
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = eb40a113-d058-543f-7d62-e3028037d66d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_Karlach_Knows_EngineIsGoingToExplode = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_FacingDeath:eb40a113-d058-543f-7d62-e3028037d66d
msgctxt "h4158b52ag229fg46e3gb60dg34f6bb6991c5"
msgid ""
"I can feel it. The engine. It's getting hotter. Louder. It's going to blow, "
"if we don't find another way to fix it."
msgstr "느껴져. 엔진이, 더 시끄럽고 뜨겁게 타고 있어. 고치지 않으면, 폭발할 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_FacingDeath
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = f063a19c-4b5b-d85b-9fc9-d6dbfcf3a9d0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_FacingDeath:f063a19c-4b5b-d85b-9fc9-d6dbfcf3a9d0
msgctxt "ha1060985gc7e6g4faaga5b7g583992f44a54"
msgid ""
"I was his bodyguard. I looked after him with my life. I trusted him more "
"than anything."
msgstr "난 고타쉬의 경호원이었어. 그를 목숨 바쳐 지켰다고. 누구보다도 그를 믿었는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_FacingDeath
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f467f0d0-510a-6cdf-8744-76e2915b90d2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_FacingDeath:f467f0d0-510a-6cdf-8744-76e2915b90d2
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "hd7df7054g929bg4570gbd8cg214600919bf9"
msgid ""
"It seems he's a servant of Bane, as Ketheric served Myrkul. Who knows what "
"powers he's gained since you knew him?"
msgstr ""
"케서릭이 머큘을 섬겼던 것처럼, 고타쉬는 베인의 종인 것 같아. 너랑 알고 지내던 시절 이후로 무슨 힘을 얻었어도 이상하지 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_FacingDeath
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = f706368b-9eac-8a2e-e31c-82fee6d69e5d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_FacingDeath:f706368b-9eac-8a2e-e31c-82fee6d69e5d
msgctxt "h20f830a9gac93g4000g85e8gda06e2510689"
msgid ""
"You know, Zariel may have put the fucking thing in, but Gortash gave her the "
"go-ahead. You expect this shit from devils. But not from the people you care "
"about."
msgstr ""
"있지, 이 좆같은 걸 집어넣은 건 자리엘이지만, 그래도 된다고 한 건 고타쉬야. 이런 건 데빌들이나 할 짓이지, 가까운 사람들한테 당할 "
"일이 아니라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ForgingOfTheHeart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0959d522-461d-f26f-259b-f2cc1dd8a2df
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ForgingOfTheHeart:0959d522-461d-f26f-259b-f2cc1dd8a2df
msgctxt "haaf1bec1g8325g420ag828fg085bcc15832f"
msgid "Of course. Nothing would make me happier."
msgstr "좋아. 그것보다 기쁜 일은 없을 테니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ForgingOfTheHeart
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 1ce1c269-a3d5-d90e-0a45-c9b957208ff1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ForgingOfTheHeart:1ce1c269-a3d5-d90e-0a45-c9b957208ff1
msgctxt "hb07b2237g05c4g4761gad38gbd171ea47a25"
msgid "But I do. And I want you. Or I thought I did, anyway."
msgstr "난 알아. 그리고 널 원해. 그렇다고 생각했던 걸지도, 여튼 그래."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ForgingOfTheHeart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3a6854c6-a739-c00e-2e6f-19319969e708
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ForgingOfTheHeart:3a6854c6-a739-c00e-2e6f-19319969e708
msgctxt "h76a5e929g555eg40c4g9468g3987822f6541"
msgid ""
"Of course you can. But you should know I may not want to cross certain lines "
"physically."
msgstr "당연히 그래도 되지. 근데 내가 육체적인 어떤 선을 넘고 싶지 않아 할 수도 있다는 건 알아줘."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ForgingOfTheHeart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5154422e-41eb-7757-c1f8-668e506abdd1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ForgingOfTheHeart:5154422e-41eb-7757-c1f8-668e506abdd1
msgctxt "h47a765dag884eg42c1g8009g5d09038a858d"
msgid "Shall I knock the others out to hurry them up?"
msgstr "다 기절시키고 얼른 할까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ForgingOfTheHeart
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 5fc6a424-fa0e-52c3-0294-915a7d220343
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ForgingOfTheHeart:5fc6a424-fa0e-52c3-0294-915a7d220343
msgctxt "h398659e3gc654g49ebg8bcagcf452a5018e5"
msgid "You mean you - you aren't interested anymore. In me."
msgstr "그러니까 너, 너 이제 나한테 관심 없다는 거 맞지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ForgingOfTheHeart
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 604de307-8c37-4176-3b77-e77d11f91206
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ForgingOfTheHeart:604de307-8c37-4176-3b77-e77d11f91206
msgctxt "hd088cf97gd789g4390g82d0g971fb3071bcb"
msgid "Haha! Please. We've waited long enough, I think."
msgstr "하하! 제발. 이정도면 충분히 오래 기다린 거지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ForgingOfTheHeart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 83b660bb-8999-13ad-1d9a-61fd5688386b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ForgingOfTheHeart:83b660bb-8999-13ad-1d9a-61fd5688386b
msgctxt "h37bceaf4g8d07g433dg9c9fgbd33f558aa75"
msgid "Argh, I'm just confused. I don't know what I want."
msgstr "아, 그냥 좀 혼란스러워. 내가 뭘 원하는지도 모르겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ForgingOfTheHeart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8e6b7bc2-6da9-1e71-41ac-083207f57ce4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ForgingOfTheHeart:8e6b7bc2-6da9-1e71-41ac-083207f57ce4
msgctxt "hfc3ea920gdccfg4d72g8d6fg27f616568196"
msgid "That's it. I'm sorry."
msgstr "맞아. 미안해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ForgingOfTheHeart
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 9ef5bd22-a90b-905b-609c-2d1699adaae3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - ORI_Karlach_State_RomanceSceneInProgress = False
#.   Object:
#.     - ORI_State_DatingKarlach(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ForgingOfTheHeart:9ef5bd22-a90b-905b-609c-2d1699adaae3
msgctxt "h5137387dg4d1eg4f44g8350g5cdae1d152e4"
msgid ""
"I'll - I mean - I need to do some thinking. Thanks for telling me, I guess. "
"I - sleep well, I guess."
msgstr "난, 그러니까, 생각할 시간이 필요해. 말해줘서 고마워. 그, 그럼 잘자, 그래."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ForgingOfTheHeart
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = a102e3d6-2e5b-a572-947f-a317a75ad999
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ForgingOfTheHeart:a102e3d6-2e5b-a572-947f-a317a75ad999
msgctxt "h091fd9cfg4632g44c9gbd32ge7cdc23e72b7"
msgid ""
"Oh man. My heart. I - I <i>really </i>had the wrong end of the stick there."
msgstr "아 정말. 마음이 아파. 내, 내가 <i>진짜</i> 잘못 이해했던 거구나."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ForgingOfTheHeart
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = a1c8a749-ca58-712a-16e4-6bddbac96153
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - HAV_ForgingOfTheHeart_State_SelectedAvatar(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ForgingOfTheHeart:a1c8a749-ca58-712a-16e4-6bddbac96153
msgctxt "h6ed9cf7fgcd31g4096gb518g5c2cb4875f97"
msgid "Me too. See you later. I can't wait."
msgstr "나도야. 나중에 봐. 기다리기 힘드네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ForgingOfTheHeart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b2bd3183-b606-b483-9c50-4078c3b46fc6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ForgingOfTheHeart:b2bd3183-b606-b483-9c50-4078c3b46fc6
msgctxt "h357a2812g5663g47degae11g0d0e5c0a589d"
msgid "I'm not sure, Karlach. I think maybe this has gone far enough."
msgstr "잘 모르겠어, 칼라크. 이 정도면 충분한 거 아닐까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ForgingOfTheHeart
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = bf817894-6588-1608-2ff3-29e04c872cbd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - HAV_ForgingOfTheHeart_State_SelectedAvatar(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ForgingOfTheHeart:bf817894-6588-1608-2ff3-29e04c872cbd
msgctxt "ha525a411g0d0cg4ef1g9facgfe29e735a60e"
msgid "See you later. I can't wait."
msgstr "나중에 봐. 기다리기 힘드네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ForgingOfTheHeart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d071fb3f-4b22-e6a2-410c-ccf77574b7d8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ForgingOfTheHeart:d071fb3f-4b22-e6a2-410c-ccf77574b7d8
msgctxt "h4fb46f39g20c0g4568gb57age8ceb7a17476"
msgid ""
"Honestly, I'm not sure I ever was. I just wanted to see where things would "
"go."
msgstr "솔직히는, 있었던 적도 없었어. 그냥 어떻게 되는지 보고 싶었을 뿐이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ForgingOfTheHeart
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = d0cbaf32-7fa8-e71f-6e8d-33f2f6493b30
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ForgingOfTheHeart:d0cbaf32-7fa8-e71f-6e8d-33f2f6493b30
msgctxt "h7e78d60agc15dg4b6fgb581g069054d877db"
msgid ""
"You don't have to love me. You don't even have to like me. But you do have "
"to treat me with respect."
msgstr "날 사랑할 필요는 없어. 좋아할 필요도 없지. 하지만 존중은 해줘야지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ForgingOfTheHeart
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = dbc4fc2e-4dfb-a525-540c-d91f59fb7a98
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ForgingOfTheHeart:dbc4fc2e-4dfb-a525-540c-d91f59fb7a98
msgctxt "h3e742323ga8d5g4f1eg8fbdg1dd19c33066c"
msgid ""
"That's perfectly fine. I just want to be with you. No expectations. No "
"pressure. Just us."
msgstr "그건 진짜 괜찮아. 그냥 같이 있고 싶은 거니까. 기대 없이. 부담 없이. 그냥 우리 둘."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ForgingOfTheHeart
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = dedbcbfa-ddba-a094-31b5-b533bef795c1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ForgingOfTheHeart:dedbcbfa-ddba-a094-31b5-b533bef795c1
msgctxt "hd48e6a5bg9762g42c4ga581g85a3059f0a7c"
msgid ""
"I want to be with someone who's sure about me. Someone who wants me as much "
"as I want them. It seems like that isn't you."
msgstr "나에게 확신을 가진 사람과 함께 하고 싶어. 내가 원하는 것 처럼 나를 원하는 사람. 그런데 넌 아닌 것 같네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ForgingOfTheHeart
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = e0e1dd5e-ef7a-3228-e189-50271bb49638
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ForgingOfTheHeart:e0e1dd5e-ef7a-3228-e189-50271bb49638
msgctxt "hec57690cg04adg479dga970g3e0248d3599e"
msgid ""
"Bit badly done, to jerk me around like that. You may not care about this, "
"but I did. <i>I did.</i>"
msgstr "날 가지고 놀다니, 좀 너무하는군. 넌 신경도 안쓰겠지만, 난 쓰여. <i>신경 쓰인다고.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ForgingOfTheHeart
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = e56b2014-3425-608c-9900-b5d39fdceced
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
