#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ForgingOfTheHeart:e56b2014-3425-608c-9900-b5d39fdceced
msgctxt "haee9a6a6g6bb0g4909g9d61g7f4db78ff352"
msgid "Do some thinking on how you treat people, soldier. This isn't the way."
msgstr "사람을 어떻게 대할지 생각해보도록, 신참. 이건 아니야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ForgingOfTheHeart
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = e6c1fff4-879a-4234-f008-3e893bc71eb6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ForgingOfTheHeart:e6c1fff4-879a-4234-f008-3e893bc71eb6
msgctxt "h2d0da0d4gd30ag4f9bgb631gda1d27eeac52"
msgid ""
"Hey, soldier. I thought I might come visit you later. When everyone's asleep."
msgstr "어이, 신참. 나중에 너한테 갈 생각인데. 다들 잠들면 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 0919bc5c-7577-b953-1265-d3bfc5bbee07
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance:0919bc5c-7577-b953-1265-d3bfc5bbee07
msgctxt "hb5f265feg192ag498fgbb4egc332befbdd41"
msgid "And... and nothing bad is going to happen now?"
msgstr "그리고... 이제는 어떤 나쁜 일도 생기지 않는 거겠지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 136b2a8a-2bcf-4d95-ea8f-6865b294a3b7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance:136b2a8a-2bcf-4d95-ea8f-6865b294a3b7
msgctxt "h7b3d4884g8bbdg41c0g8ccage3910e533575"
msgid "Thank you."
msgstr "고마워."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 16b2622d-a5d2-19ad-222f-661ee469c259
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance:16b2622d-a5d2-19ad-222f-661ee469c259
msgctxt "h73735e0ag1260g4874g8d70g1ef18f6065e3"
msgid ""
"Last night was incredible. This morning is incredible. Every moment with you "
"is... beyond belief."
msgstr "지난밤은 정말 굉장했어. 오늘 아침도 굉장하고. 너랑 함께하면 매 순간이... 믿을 수 없을 만큼 좋다고 느껴져."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 19b3c92b-7dfe-e56f-b4bc-05fe87792fa4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance:19b3c92b-7dfe-e56f-b4bc-05fe87792fa4
msgctxt "h807de79egd0b4g4abcgb43bg645ed78bd723"
msgid "Thank the gods for that."
msgstr "그렇다니 정말 다행이네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1d1ca008-c234-151c-3a28-a1753a5822d9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance:1d1ca008-c234-151c-3a28-a1753a5822d9
msgctxt "h8376031eg05b9g4e7bg8742g893a147b37d1"
msgid "Morning, not-so-sleepy head."
msgstr "좋은 아침이야. 잠꾸러기는 아닌가 보네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 1d769a16-cfe0-c0e0-c46f-9294431e8624
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance:1d769a16-cfe0-c0e0-c46f-9294431e8624
msgctxt "h2093f4f4gbb4dg439dgaf95g9de9d84c1fae"
msgid ""
"Still. You looked so peaceful. I wanted to go wherever you were. But I'm me, "
"so I did a lap of camp instead."
msgstr ""
"그래도. 네가 너무 푹 자고 있어서. 마음 같아서는 네가 있는 곳 어디라도 같이 있고 싶었지만, 내 성격 알잖아. 그래서 야영지 한 바퀴 "
"뛰고 왔어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1e2dd34f-ab93-54d8-5a6c-0ec09f6884e0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance:1e2dd34f-ab93-54d8-5a6c-0ec09f6884e0
msgctxt "h385d6fe5gbdc6g408ag86a4g90bf60679173"
msgid "I'm sorry, Karlach, but I think... I think last night was a mistake."
msgstr "미안해, 칼라크. 하지만 나는... 지난밤에 있었던 일이 실수였다고 생각해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 225b5a77-9610-d4ca-86d9-1900df7d559f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance:225b5a77-9610-d4ca-86d9-1900df7d559f
msgctxt "h08180be6g8b24g4e50g9079g2744b12c07e0"
msgid "Haha. Wait. Are you serious?"
msgstr "하하. 잠깐만. 진지하게 이러는 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 27253ae3-94b0-c5ba-3e47-eba6e8de2f1a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance:27253ae3-94b0-c5ba-3e47-eba6e8de2f1a
msgctxt "hc164c739g3db3g4c25gba65gea0b97ea7f4f"
msgid "No, I'm sorry - it was just a joke. Of course I still like you."
msgstr "아니야, 미안해. 그냥 농담이었어. 당연히 난 아직 널 좋아해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2981d03b-fd8d-e0b3-bb2c-59e07ae2aa1f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance:2981d03b-fd8d-e0b3-bb2c-59e07ae2aa1f
msgctxt "h134cc8ccgd147g4331g8adbgb32500742996"
msgid "I wouldn't have minded."
msgstr "깨워도 괜찮았을 텐데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 2c6e415e-6b1f-eea6-d09b-2f6fa3e30e72
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance:2c6e415e-6b1f-eea6-d09b-2f6fa3e30e72
msgctxt "h92a8c1a3g11d7g4d99g8b8bg1b1c040157ce"
msgid ""
"Nothing bad is going to happen now. Not now that we're finally so... so "
"close. Right?"
msgstr "이제는 어떤 나쁜 일도 생기지 않을 거야. 마침내 우리가 이렇게... 가까워졌으니까. 그렇지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 34b617c7-d47e-20ae-2e13-8e8b438c9c5b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance:34b617c7-d47e-20ae-2e13-8e8b438c9c5b
msgctxt "h4e727d2bgda52g47aag95fbg568310741c36"
msgid ""
"I loved being able to touch you last night. Hold you, kiss you, all of it."
msgstr "지난밤에 널 만질 수 있어서 너무 좋았어. 널 껴안고, 입맞추고 한 거, 전부 다 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 377a6874-bc77-8fda-0c34-7ef052110849
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance:377a6874-bc77-8fda-0c34-7ef052110849
msgctxt "had6b15fdg3b42g40e7g8b06g560270857979"
msgid ""
"My gods, if I smile any bigger my face is going to crack. I'm pathetic. "
"Besotted! And it's all your fault."
msgstr "맙소사, 미소가 지어지는 걸 주체할 수가 없어서 얼굴이 부서질 지경이야. 나도 진짜 주책이라니까! 다 너 때문이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4007e8cb-6d80-311e-1b27-44b6d4da0470
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance:4007e8cb-6d80-311e-1b27-44b6d4da0470
msgctxt "hb12902e4g25c5g44b9g87d2g73b34972d409"
msgid "Well, I don't just 'like' you. I much more than like you."
msgstr "그야, 널 그냥 '좋아하기만' 하는 게 아니거든. 난 널 그 이상으로 아껴."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 447630c9-6fe4-5628-8705-61b782ffdb9b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance:447630c9-6fe4-5628-8705-61b782ffdb9b
msgctxt "h2dc1679dg0bc9g4dd8gafd1g5dfd89be24fb"
msgid "Get out of my face. Wanker."
msgstr "그 낯짝 들이밀지 말고 저리 꺼져, 쓰레기야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 46bfcdb4-ccf2-c374-05b9-87e1fe104b16
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance:46bfcdb4-ccf2-c374-05b9-87e1fe104b16
msgctxt "h1efe98b3g2104g47c6gb23fg9e08771b325c"
msgid "Mmm... la da da... bum ba du-dumdum..."
msgstr "으으음... 랄랄라... 두둠칫 뚜쉬뚜쉬..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 516bf8e3-194f-5cdc-7af6-503aefc29b24
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance:516bf8e3-194f-5cdc-7af6-503aefc29b24
msgctxt "h26117d99g6a5cg4463g8277g81fe69fccfb4"
msgid "Last night I dreamt a bird was singing to me. And look, there she is."
msgstr "지난밤 꿈에는 내게 노래를 불러주는 새 한 마리가 나왔어. 바로 여기 있었네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 529aff47-5736-71c4-260e-251ba54e5362
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance:529aff47-5736-71c4-260e-251ba54e5362
msgctxt "h3741d896g3f71g4e7agaab5gbf858b268b2f"
msgid "Yes, really."
msgstr "그래, 정말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 560d8cb0-406f-3457-7a38-3ba25c347fe0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance:560d8cb0-406f-3457-7a38-3ba25c347fe0
msgctxt "hf2f638c9g080cg462cgbefcg1dc953bccce2"
msgid "Oh! Gods, sorry, I was in my own world. Hi. Hello, good morning."
msgstr "앗! 이런, 미안해. 나만의 세계에 잠겨 있느라고. 안녕. 반가워. 좋은 아침이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5ef755b2-cfd5-dfea-dee6-814651fa5344
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance:5ef755b2-cfd5-dfea-dee6-814651fa5344
msgctxt "h1a3499d8g495cg4d35gbc6cgb17c681c116a"
msgid "I think you know better than that."
msgstr "그 질문의 대답은 너도 이미 잘 알고 있을 거라 생각해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 5fbad985-b8f0-dba8-fdff-d2107a2f3c28
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance:5fbad985-b8f0-dba8-fdff-d2107a2f3c28
msgctxt "hcbf98f4bgcd7ag4c37g9b17gf9444039045f"
msgid "You're welcome.  Ahem."
msgstr "천만에. 어흠."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 62083645-50c9-c6e2-c4ad-4f2a46989bd9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance:62083645-50c9-c6e2-c4ad-4f2a46989bd9
msgctxt "h454dc40fg6f9eg45f2gade4g04fc5676fcff"
msgid "I adore you, you know."
msgstr "있지, 난 널 정말 아껴."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 65c4ca72-cd56-0c53-f5c2-f57398a9c424
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance:65c4ca72-cd56-0c53-f5c2-f57398a9c424
msgctxt "hd939f541g633fg4152g9742g40be04650e4a"
msgid "I loved it too. More than I've ever loved anything."
msgstr "나도 마찬가지야. 지금까지 살면서 좋았던 일 중에서도 최고였어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 70ee6f5b-3ec1-265a-eecd-8d66b7787723
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance:70ee6f5b-3ec1-265a-eecd-8d66b7787723
msgctxt "h0725166bg1092g49efgac88g83ea2a10b564"
msgid "Dada-dadum, mmm..."
msgstr "랄랄라라, 으으음..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 78594a8b-a429-b725-b18e-068838002b27
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance:78594a8b-a429-b725-b18e-068838002b27
msgctxt "h0e1af80bgafb3g41beg8bbfg1cff2d2937f5"
msgid "I... love you."
msgstr "나는... 너를 사랑해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 7af81a00-ca6b-3476-ec93-b1e0bb68dbeb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance:7af81a00-ca6b-3476-ec93-b1e0bb68dbeb
msgctxt "h92b80f4cg2408g4f90gaa24gc865eb742623"
msgid "Really?"
msgstr "정말이야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 7e90b578-d477-6b74-c5f1-3c1ddc1a9319
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance:7e90b578-d477-6b74-c5f1-3c1ddc1a9319
msgctxt "h5cb10427g173bg4d16ga106g8efe62d3e430"
msgid "Like the dead. The excruciatingly happy dead."
msgstr "죽은 듯이 푹 잘 잤어. 엄청나게 행복한 상태로 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 86b375c1-abc1-9b0e-6d61-4e590884a932
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance:86b375c1-abc1-9b0e-6d61-4e590884a932
msgctxt "hbe86087bg1bbbg446eg90c7g19ff73349d86"
msgid ""
"If our record is anything to go by, there are plenty of disasters in our "
"future. But we'll face them together."
msgstr "지금껏 우리가 겪은 일을 생각하면, 앞으로도 재난을 수도 없이 겪게 될 거야. 그렇지만 우리 둘은 함께 헤쳐 나가겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8cb5d185-0b27-6472-f1f6-7b2fb2078de4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance:8cb5d185-0b27-6472-f1f6-7b2fb2078de4
msgctxt "h43fb3c7ag3c23g4b94g919dg21e90705c5bd"
msgid "I much more than 'like' you."
msgstr "난 널 '좋아하는' 것 이상으로 아껴."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 944f77ce-cae8-d494-abe5-abc3da512793
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance:944f77ce-cae8-d494-abe5-abc3da512793
msgctxt "h8f3aec49g73beg4056g956fg7818478797ea"
msgid "Of course I do. Never doubt it."
msgstr "당연하지. 한 번도 의문이 든 적 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 997b4347-7eb3-d234-d2b3-75e3aff448bf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance:997b4347-7eb3-d234-d2b3-75e3aff448bf
msgctxt "h93d10ecdgd1ffg4121gb256g2162c85b237f"
msgid "In that case, bring it on."
msgstr "그렇다면야, 어디 덤벼 보라지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 9f50e967-6438-7379-6060-c7aadd875afc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance:9f50e967-6438-7379-6060-c7aadd875afc
msgctxt "hf4cb2009g2eacg4baagb1a5ga8bc59ddda5b"
msgid "You still like me, right?"
msgstr "너 날 아직 좋아하는 거지, 그렇지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a20ab81d-81d6-023e-a5fd-a2a6f9313c2f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 7
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance:a20ab81d-81d6-023e-a5fd-a2a6f9313c2f
msgctxt "h17972958g13d0g4b14g8cb7g951a5275624d"
msgid "No, nothing bad is going to happen to us ever again."
msgstr "맞아. 우리에겐 다시는 나쁜 일은 생기지 않을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a3fefacf-3f14-82f4-b8c2-5916f6c6ed67
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance:a3fefacf-3f14-82f4-b8c2-5916f6c6ed67
msgctxt "h46ee1d7ag5209g4084g87fcg4a801641e77a"
msgid "Did you sleep well last night?"
msgstr "간밤에는 잘 잤어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = a42fcb93-8551-806d-d3fa-67715e075269
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance:a42fcb93-8551-806d-d3fa-67715e075269
msgctxt "ha26ff3f9g808fg43feg92adg7b12438a5352"
msgid ""
"All right. Well fuck you too then. Using me like I'm a fucking grenade in "
"your pack. Well, you did your damage. Are you happy?"
msgstr ""
"알았어. 너도 결국 씨발새끼였네. 내가 무슨 네 가방에 든 수류탄이기라도 한 것처럼 이용해 먹고 내뺀다 이거지. 거 상처 한 번 제대로 "
"주긴 했어. 만족해?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = a59eca98-0a89-4d90-af43-271ca493f96e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance:a59eca98-0a89-4d90-af43-271ca493f96e
msgctxt "h0d505400gf9dbg4636g81e2g0b1f532751c7"
msgid ""
"I guess we'd better get the day on. So much to do, so much to see... "
"together! Wheyyy."
msgstr "이제 슬슬 하루를 시작해야겠네. 할 일도 많고, 봐야 할 것도 많으니까... 우리 둘이 함께 말이야! 야호."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = b02da0a4-3cfc-683a-76ed-cb0aadd3bf0d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance:b02da0a4-3cfc-683a-76ed-cb0aadd3bf0d
msgctxt "hf3ea2801g44e0g4f22g9f07g636b3f53eeeb"
msgid ""
"But you're not the gilding type. Straightforward, true as the day is long."
msgstr "그렇지만 너는 괜한 말을 하는 사람은 아니니까. 넌 정직하고 진솔한 사람이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b6ec3d56-4dc0-e854-b802-8da92906a083
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance:b6ec3d56-4dc0-e854-b802-8da92906a083
msgctxt "h03205cb7g41a7g4ad7g994eg8f2781377644"
msgid "About that..."
msgstr "거기 관해서 할 말이 있는데..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = b87c6e0b-8743-26e7-bd5a-8cc0b6e7a253
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance:b87c6e0b-8743-26e7-bd5a-8cc0b6e7a253
msgctxt "h7a650633g4813g4582ga8b8g6e6f57f1dbef"
msgid ""
"A beautiful lie. But I guess whatever comes, we'll be there. Together. "
"That's enough for me."
msgstr "선의의 거짓말이네. 그렇지만 앞으로 무슨 일이 닥치든, 우리는 함께 맞설 거야. 난 그거면 충분해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b950e603-d3d9-c45c-6997-64864b3ccd06
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance:b950e603-d3d9-c45c-6997-64864b3ccd06
msgctxt "h65d77c3eg7523g488fgba6ag32c77f29a17b"
msgid "No, no, I'm sorry. I was only messing around."
msgstr "아니, 아니야. 미안해. 그냥 괜히 장난쳐본 거였어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = cd23ca65-08a2-41f1-db55-8a4b1cbe0446
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance:cd23ca65-08a2-41f1-db55-8a4b1cbe0446
msgctxt "ha0f91a20g6541g492bgb229gbc93b0109fa7"
msgid ""
"My gods, I think my heart almost stopped completely. Don't scare me like "
"that, you scallywag!"
msgstr "세상에, 방금 심장이 완전히 멎는 줄로만 알았잖아. 그런 식으로 겁주지 마, 짜샤!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = d1ea2d2a-c19d-b4bd-6fb5-2c8da7aa2126
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance:d1ea2d2a-c19d-b4bd-6fb5-2c8da7aa2126
msgctxt "hd925b570g7828g4f35gbaa7g06a6f7a4a7c7"
msgid ""
"Sorry I didn't wait around this morning. I was just... just <i>buzzing</i>. "
"Didn't want to wake you."
msgstr "네가 깰 때까지 기다리지 않은 건 미안. 그냥... 그냥 <i>기분에 너무 취해서</i>. 널 깨우고 싶지가 않았어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = dca71072-a4f3-6cc6-7816-e87bd938f32b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance:dca71072-a4f3-6cc6-7816-e87bd938f32b
msgctxt "h41f20e0egdb91g4983g93e5g9d53702f03d6"
msgid "I do. But sometimes I don't mind being lied to."
msgstr "그렇기는 해. 그렇지만 가끔은 거짓말을 들어도 나쁘지 않단 말이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = debf4f69-b1f1-1efd-afe4-1e35289067f7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance:debf4f69-b1f1-1efd-afe4-1e35289067f7
msgctxt "h8f835c81g0078g4ddfg8637g708d7e21abb0"
msgid "I LOVE YOU TOO! Oh my gods, I've been dying to say that."
msgstr "<b>나도 널 사랑해!</b> 아, 세상에. 그 말을 하고 싶어서 죽는 줄 알았어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e46d0665-b59f-5d0d-a24b-cb83de503b76
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance:e46d0665-b59f-5d0d-a24b-cb83de503b76
msgctxt "h475ae919gc035g49b1g92bag57efd05a4d02"
msgid "<i>Watch her quietly.</i>"
msgstr "<i>가만히 지켜본다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = e48bbc4e-5be3-2830-70ef-80a44c5c7a59
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance:e48bbc4e-5be3-2830-70ef-80a44c5c7a59
msgctxt "hbeb8f98cgf593g49d7g88b7gd59845b50adf"
msgid "I much more than like you too."
msgstr "나도 널 좋아하는 것 이상으로 생각해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ea0022b7-cb19-38f2-2d8c-590a5a47f376
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance:ea0022b7-cb19-38f2-2d8c-590a5a47f376
msgctxt "h784777fbg2821g487agbc30gc04802ccd7cb"
msgid "I adore you too."
msgstr "나도 너를 무척 아껴."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = ecc65f93-f573-7365-949d-dc7593d94b9b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_MorningAfterRomance:ecc65f93-f573-7365-949d-dc7593d94b9b
msgctxt "h63757c30ge14cg4680g9fc2geef99ccab3c8"
msgid "I knew it. <i>Good.</i>"
msgstr "그럴 거라고 생각했어. <i>좋다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_PaladinsOfTyrAndEngine
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 01116808-4328-520e-aa6f-6e8d61567bf3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_PaladinsOfTyrAndEngine:01116808-4328-520e-aa6f-6e8d61567bf3
msgctxt "h29180df7gfd8eg44b0ga089g78b98f57a581"
msgid ""
"A weaponsmith, huh? Not sure if he's the guy, but I'd love to find out. A "
"tune-up would do this rusty heart a world of good."
msgstr "무기장이라, 음? 그 사람이 맞을 거라는 확신은 없지만, 찾아보고 싶어. 조정만 하면 이 녹슨 심장에 큰 도움이 될 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_PaladinsOfTyrAndEngine
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 069396e5-10eb-75b7-8d55-4fb4f0d1d718
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_PaladinsOfTyrAndEngine:069396e5-10eb-75b7-8d55-4fb4f0d1d718
msgctxt "h80ada40bg7ec5g4373gb77eg8f508c6c5dca"
msgid ""
"They were agents of a devil. I wasn't going to let them roam the area "
"unchallenged."
msgstr "그놈들은 데빌의 수하였어. 그놈들이 아무 방해 없이 이곳을 돌아다니게 놔둘 수는 없었지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_PaladinsOfTyrAndEngine
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 083ca1a5-f813-b278-78ae-583924d2f712
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_PaladinsOfTyrAndEngine:083ca1a5-f813-b278-78ae-583924d2f712
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h1f5541e5g56d1g48degac12g24cb6a1e4176"
msgid "You... did? Wow. That was sound of you. Why'd you do it?"
msgstr "해치웠...다고? 와. 네가 하겠다고 말하긴 했지만. 왜 그런 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_PaladinsOfTyrAndEngine
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 09b1d945-c6ad-ee93-c04f-4de9201cc4d4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_PaladinsOfTyrAndEngine:09b1d945-c6ad-ee93-c04f-4de9201cc4d4
msgctxt "h35c2ff0fg0c34g4f69g8137gad5b14a7460d"
msgid "I always take care of my people."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_PaladinsOfTyrAndEngine
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 132c5a97-faaf-58ae-a441-bc672596e253
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - DEN_Weaponsmith_Knows_Elturel(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitment_State_DammonUnavailable = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - ORI_Karlach_State_ToldKarlachAboutDammon = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_PaladinsOfTyrAndEngine:132c5a97-faaf-58ae-a441-bc672596e253
msgctxt "h5a1fd319gfc7dg4517g880fg6be2095c6993"
msgid ""
"I met someone who might be able to help - a smith who worked in the Hells "
"for a time."
msgstr "지옥에서 좀 일했던 대장장이를 만난 적 있는데, 널 도와줄 수 있을지도 몰라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_PaladinsOfTyrAndEngine
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 1a971440-c03c-a9c1-ae2e-7516900c47b9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_State_PaladinsPermaDefeated = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_PaladinsOfTyrAndEngine:1a971440-c03c-a9c1-ae2e-7516900c47b9
msgctxt "h41249dbdg22afg44d6g870dg0269c1ffe64f"
msgid ""
"Hey, soldier. We've got a long way ahead of us - and there's something I "
"want to tell you."
msgstr "이봐, 신참. 우리 갈 길이 멀잖아, 그래서 말인데 하고 싶은 얘기가 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_PaladinsOfTyrAndEngine
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1d4d04bb-b0fb-6003-65f0-3af6aef0737a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_PaladinsOfTyrAndEngine:1d4d04bb-b0fb-6003-65f0-3af6aef0737a
msgctxt "h1e04e9cfgbab9g49f0gbca7g52276e375746"
msgid "How the hells did you get an infernal engine for a heart?"
msgstr "도대체 어쩌다 지옥불 엔진을 심장에다 박은 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_PaladinsOfTyrAndEngine
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 24c7b95b-ff82-c2c3-752d-f03e55a73691
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_PaladinsOfTyrAndEngine:24c7b95b-ff82-c2c3-752d-f03e55a73691
msgctxt "hc06b0779ge683g41abgbeb4g1c64adbe0d4f"
msgid ""
"Won't be seeing my mechanic any time soon, so I've been making the most of "
"the extra heat. But it's meant I can't get too friendly. If I'm excited, "
"nervous, scared, I'll light you up like a firework."
msgstr ""
"금방 기계공을 만날 수 없을 것 같아서, 여분의 열을 최대한 활용하고 있었어. 그러니까 너무 친밀해질 수 없다는 뜻이야. 내가 "
"흥분하거나, 긴장하거나, 겁이 나면, 널 폭죽처럼 태워버릴지도 모르니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_PaladinsOfTyrAndEngine
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 2af11ace-be66-b362-d027-0b6ba0dc1770
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_PaladinsOfTyrAndEngine:2af11ace-be66-b362-d027-0b6ba0dc1770
msgctxt "h894e88f0g8534g449fga847g943d5f4f5ad0"
msgid ""
"Thanking you. A tune-up would give this rustbox of mine a new lease on life."
msgstr "고마워. 정비공이 있으면 이 고물상자 생명 연장에도 도움이 될 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_PaladinsOfTyrAndEngine
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 307596a1-6514-52f5-58da-2f168062938e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_State_PaladinsPermaDefeated = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Quest_ToldKarlach = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_PaladinsOfTyrAndEngine:307596a1-6514-52f5-58da-2f168062938e
msgctxt "he1afcc5cg12f9g42ecga024g205b7cc24282"
msgid ""
"I already took care of those Paladins of Tyr  - you don't need to worry "
"about them anymore."
msgstr "티르 팔라딘들은 다 처리했어, 이제 신경 안써도 괜찮아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_PaladinsOfTyrAndEngine
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 39c998c6-0697-a3f8-e848-56c752ac7469
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_PaladinsOfTyrAndEngine:39c998c6-0697-a3f8-e848-56c752ac7469
msgctxt "hc222a5f9g9104g4c66g9dc4gb49ad7ada820"
msgid ""
"Burn, baby. As hot as I can tolerate. I have to admit it helps in battle, "
"though I wouldn't have chosen it for myself - if I'd been given a choice."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_PaladinsOfTyrAndEngine
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 3a85c371-5cdb-d638-5798-71c2b6b4bda2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_PaladinsOfTyrAndEngine:3a85c371-5cdb-d638-5798-71c2b6b4bda2
msgctxt "h83c8db9eg4136g4113g8880gf98cfdcddf8a"
msgid ""
"Wild, right? And believe it or not, I'm one of Zariel's <i>least</i>-"
"mutilated pets."
msgstr "대단하지? 믿거나 말거나, 내가 자리엘의 <i>그나마 덜</i> 개조된 애완동물이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_PaladinsOfTyrAndEngine
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 48d93b97-5f2e-4018-cddd-2fe834cb771b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_PaladinsOfTyrAndEngine:48d93b97-5f2e-4018-cddd-2fe834cb771b
msgctxt "h058a59a8g258cg4cd7g99d7g1db563885758"
msgid "It's important to me. Are you going to help me or not?"
msgstr "나한텐 그게 중요한 일이란 말야. 날 도와줄 거야, 안 도와줄 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_PaladinsOfTyrAndEngine
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 57d9f961-95ca-6ed4-a4f2-17ccf31b6929
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_PaladinsOfTyrAndEngine:57d9f961-95ca-6ed4-a4f2-17ccf31b6929
msgctxt "h30c40ff5gc051g4b8dg98ccg90f3e5d1a9a5"
msgid "I'm always keen for a good fight."
msgstr "난 언제나 멋진 싸움을 갈망하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_PaladinsOfTyrAndEngine
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 5ab0fff4-b6d4-1208-e785-32a2f9dad2d8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_PaladinsOfTyrAndEngine:5ab0fff4-b6d4-1208-e785-32a2f9dad2d8
msgctxt "hc32992cbg369bg4e87ga8cfg2fdb9e53af9d"
msgid "Who knows! Maybe I can run like this indefinitely. But... maybe not."
msgstr "누가 알겠어! 이렇게 무한정 작동할 수도 있는데. 아마... 그렇진 않겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_PaladinsOfTyrAndEngine
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 5b157615-a693-65ab-bba0-5bcd2608b152
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_PaladinsOfTyrAndEngine:5b157615-a693-65ab-bba0-5bcd2608b152
msgctxt "h51ab492eg0b09g49e1gb853g155cd4fa3e69"
msgid "Don't worry. It's nothing bad. Well. Depending."
msgstr "걱정 마. 나쁜 일은 아니니까. 음. 생각하기에 따라 다르려나."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_PaladinsOfTyrAndEngine
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 5b1f80e8-5739-b67f-07ae-96679adddf27
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_PaladinsOfTyrAndEngine:5b1f80e8-5739-b67f-07ae-96679adddf27
msgctxt "hd9cd2460g0298g4ae8gb0ddg5f03557517f1"
msgid "Then again, facing 'em down might've put my tin can into overdrive."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_PaladinsOfTyrAndEngine
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 653a6ef0-d015-a15e-174a-c68c6d2d068b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_PaladinsOfTyrAndEngine:653a6ef0-d015-a15e-174a-c68c6d2d068b
msgctxt "h709293b4g4acag48f7g8694gc4199199336e"
msgid "What does the engine allow you to do?"
msgstr "엔진으로 뭘 할 수 있어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_PaladinsOfTyrAndEngine
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 6544132b-f267-6c22-d87b-95a877b98ed9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_PaladinsOfTyrAndEngine:6544132b-f267-6c22-d87b-95a877b98ed9
msgctxt "h432ab7c0g1e76g4341g8b4agdb69b3437f02"
msgid "Before we head off, there's something I want you to know."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_PaladinsOfTyrAndEngine
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 65c12c7e-7b44-03a6-d5f2-a2a2db9f46d6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_PaladinsOfTyrAndEngine:65c12c7e-7b44-03a6-d5f2-a2a2db9f46d6
msgctxt "hdd40456agd49eg4f6egae99g5c6de48b33ff"
msgid ""
"The first time I faced down those 'paladins,' they let slip they'd met an "
"infernal mechanic in the area. A tiefling. But I didn't see him anywhere."
msgstr ""
"내가 그 '팔라딘' 들을 처음 만났을 때, 자기들이 지옥의 기계공을 이 지역에서 만난 적이 있다는 정보를 흘렸어. 티플링이라더라. 그런데 "
"아무리 찾아도 안 보이더라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_PaladinsOfTyrAndEngine
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7bcbc9bd-78c9-d15b-e177-7f4a708387b8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_State_PaladinsPermaDefeated = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_PaladinsOfTyrAndEngine:7bcbc9bd-78c9-d15b-e177-7f4a708387b8
msgctxt "h948c1875ge7c2g47aag9c0dga803dc4f063a"
msgid "Agreed. We'll make sure they can't hurt anyone again."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_PaladinsOfTyrAndEngine
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 7c1387eb-2299-7f8f-1712-e62ae922d174
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_PaladinsOfTyrAndEngine:7c1387eb-2299-7f8f-1712-e62ae922d174
msgctxt "hc1ffb324gab45g4b01ga64ag496eb52e31c2"
msgid "High pain tolerance. And a dynamic duo of truly shitty bosses."
msgstr "고통 진짜 잘 참기. 그리고 등신같은 상사들의 환상적인 조합."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_PaladinsOfTyrAndEngine
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 7dc14c56-3623-1141-0faf-bac9d72afaf7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - PLA_PaladinsOfTyr_Event_BlockActChange = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_PaladinsOfTyrAndEngine:7dc14c56-3623-1141-0faf-bac9d72afaf7
msgctxt "hc0b813b2g8608g48bdgb535ga4c70814ecf2"
msgid "Yes! Now we're talking."
msgstr "좋았어! 이제야 말이 통하는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_PaladinsOfTyrAndEngine
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 825e5f00-4e6e-0478-76c5-6b551291156a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_PaladinsOfTyrAndEngine:825e5f00-4e6e-0478-76c5-6b551291156a
msgctxt "h3c13870dgbc98g471eg8156gdd81fc53115e"
msgid "It's not a priority. Get in line or go it alone."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_PaladinsOfTyrAndEngine
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 82787212-783e-2a32-8c20-c10fd57dc411
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_Companion_Leave(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_PaladinsOfTyrAndEngine:82787212-783e-2a32-8c20-c10fd57dc411
msgctxt "h5f0cf16fgc8e9g42b4gb5a3ge09ba8c1299d"
msgid "Good luck. I'm gonna miss you. You better miss me too. Or else."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_PaladinsOfTyrAndEngine
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9df14b12-4c85-c3ec-e929-b411323cae4f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - ORI_Karlach_State_InSearchOfMechanic = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_PaladinsOfTyrAndEngine:9df14b12-4c85-c3ec-e929-b411323cae4f
msgctxt "hc6651be0gd682g4fe0g9ab6g03f00464639e"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_PaladinsOfTyrAndEngine
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = a4b7d849-bc3b-2a0c-2a85-088f647541e3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_PaladinsOfTyrAndEngine:a4b7d849-bc3b-2a0c-2a85-088f647541e3
msgctxt "h07ff2524g9d6dg4760gbf5agfae45a4b9db0"
msgid ""
"I'm not willing to let servants of Zariel roam the Sword Coast unchecked. Or "
"to regroup and come after me again. Let's go get 'em. Together."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_PaladinsOfTyrAndEngine
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = a7241ad7-ecf7-a1f8-b667-448ac6d060fb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - ORI_Karlach_Knows_InfernalEngineExists = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_PaladinsOfTyrAndEngine:a7241ad7-ecf7-a1f8-b667-448ac6d060fb
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h4181a1dag0965g498fga0abgcab104c23b36"
msgid ""
"Hear that? Infernal engine for a heart. Lets me burn as hot as the Hells. "
"Thing's been running in overdrive since I left Avernus."
msgstr "들려? 심장용 지옥불 엔진이야. 지옥불만큼 뜨겁게 불타오르게 해주거든. 근데 아베르누스에서 떠난 후로 과부하에 걸린 상태야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_PaladinsOfTyrAndEngine
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = a7647b31-5ffa-4b68-1fdd-c14066199aa7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_PaladinsOfTyrAndEngine:a7647b31-5ffa-4b68-1fdd-c14066199aa7
msgctxt "h4df083d4g327fg4cecgab7cg5ba2d1edd0ea"
msgid ""
"Wish I could've been there to watch those <i>ignots </i>crumble, but I'm "
"just happy they're off my tail."
msgstr "나도 거기서 그 <i>멍청이들</i>이 박살나는 걸 봤으면 좋았겠지만, 지금은 그놈들이 나한테서 떨어져서 기분이 좋아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_PaladinsOfTyrAndEngine
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ab9ac037-5911-e585-0f9b-ba9e23f88e55
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - ORI_Karlach_State_InSearchOfMechanic = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_PaladinsOfTyrAndEngine:ab9ac037-5911-e585-0f9b-ba9e23f88e55
msgctxt "hfbb07cf3g2f44g4ea7g9143g16fe73f053ba"
msgid "I'll keep an eye out for someone like that."
msgstr "네가 말한 그런 사람이 있는지 잘 살펴볼게."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_PaladinsOfTyrAndEngine
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b16a50fc-ed79-8b4f-3c18-647e2b7d7d13
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_TieflingRefugees_State_LeftDen = False
#.      - DEN_PartyProgress_EnteredGrove = True
#.      - DEN_AttackOnDen_Event_TieflingPartyInvitation = False
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitment_State_DammonUnavailable = False
#.      - DEN_AttackOnDen_State_HostileTieflings = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - ORI_Karlach_State_InSearchOfMechanic = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_PaladinsOfTyrAndEngine:b16a50fc-ed79-8b4f-3c18-647e2b7d7d13
msgctxt "h52d377eeg3e60g4549g8944g4560880ef6e3"
msgid ""
"There are some tieflings holed up in a druid's grove nearby. We might look "
"there."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_PaladinsOfTyrAndEngine
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = b67671cb-61bc-37aa-71b7-21a16cb56800
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_PaladinsOfTyrAndEngine:b67671cb-61bc-37aa-71b7-21a16cb56800
msgctxt "hf2388007g2ce3g4916gbb86g8e667e40baa0"
msgid "Well. Alone it is."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_PaladinsOfTyrAndEngine
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = b91b92cb-a958-a9c1-a0fc-94f670cfff88
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_PaladinsOfTyrAndEngine:b91b92cb-a958-a9c1-a0fc-94f670cfff88
msgctxt "h353a605cg36aeg4f6eg8c6fg190c58228f2b"
msgid ""
"I'll tell you the story, but I <i>really </i>need to find someone who can "
"tune up my engine sooner rather than later. Believe me when I say this thing "
"is <i>hot.</i>"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_PaladinsOfTyrAndEngine
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bb87f189-8372-620a-6feb-2e90e491cad9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_State_PaladinsPermaDefeated = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_PaladinsOfTyrAndEngine:bb87f189-8372-620a-6feb-2e90e491cad9
msgctxt "h6c7f5ed6g1178g45a7g84fcg0a01fccef7cf"
msgid ""
"If it's that important to you, you have my support. We'll find them together."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_PaladinsOfTyrAndEngine
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = c01345c3-3b98-28af-ceff-b8d241016572
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_PaladinsOfTyrAndEngine:c01345c3-3b98-28af-ceff-b8d241016572
msgctxt "hfd99361bga0b1g42a9gaab4g92f60a56c6e7"
msgid "If you can lead the way, I'll gladly follow."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_PaladinsOfTyrAndEngine
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = ce2db8c4-2285-9bb1-3fa6-904d9edaf357
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_PaladinsOfTyrAndEngine:ce2db8c4-2285-9bb1-3fa6-904d9edaf357
msgctxt "h52f638f2gfedbg43bdg8d7eg348af636fd20"
msgid ""
"Well now! Maybe I could make his acquaintance? A tightened screw or two "
"might let me keep a little calmer."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_PaladinsOfTyrAndEngine
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d1a7897d-f312-a5c3-89b9-51e8d67582db
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_PaladinsOfTyrAndEngine:d1a7897d-f312-a5c3-89b9-51e8d67582db
msgctxt "h1e6990c5gf0fcg40b0ga9ceg20b61d712d7d"
msgid ""
"We have important things to do, Karlach. Cutting down Zariel's lackeys isn't "
"one of them."
msgstr "우리에겐 중요한 할 일들이 있어, 칼라크. 자리엘의 졸개들을 쓰러뜨리는 건 거기에 포함되어 있지 않다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_PaladinsOfTyrAndEngine
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = ddbeeabd-db3b-5fbc-4875-ff57c7db4fa2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_PaladinsOfTyrAndEngine:ddbeeabd-db3b-5fbc-4875-ff57c7db4fa2
msgctxt "h600ea75fgd486g4d3bg9995g0cb48c998a6f"
msgid ""
"If this is really goodbye, soldier, I guess... well... thanks for "
"everything. I'd hoped we'd be able to stick together a bit longer, but "
"that's life, isn't it."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_PaladinsOfTyrAndEngine
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = e09a71ff-3f1f-707d-c0bd-d5cebfe1278b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
