msgctxt "h68ac3493gd06bg4b4bgbf23g2c42d9ec7725"
msgid ""
"Maybe even manage a pat or bump without burning someone to death. It's been "
"a <i>long </i>time."
msgstr "어쩌면 누굴 만질 때 불태워 죽이지 않고 해낼수 있을지도 몰라. 안그런지 <i>오래 </i> 됐거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_PaladinsOfTyrAndEngine
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = fc69e133-508c-fab2-75c5-ac5427337b86
