msgctxt "h658a9595gac50g4028ga42ag6ed3ad1c73cd"
msgid ""
"Hey, soldier. I'm getting a little nervous. We're getting further and "
"further from those pricks who were hunting me."
msgstr "이봐, 신참. 지금 약간 긴장돼. 날 쫓던 멍청이 놈들한테서 점점 멀어지고 있잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_PaladinsOfTyrAndEngine
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = fc965040-9933-5e36-aeb9-b6964016818a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
