msgctxt "h46b9d0d4gffabg4139gbddcg0ac5f6addc3d"
msgid ""
"Same. Wish you would've brought me along for the ride, but I'm just happy "
"those <i>ignots </i>are off my tail."
msgstr "마찬가지야. 나도 데려가줬으면 했지만, 지금은 그 <i>멍청이들</i>이 나한테서 떨어져서 기분이 좋아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_PaladinsOfTyrAndEngine
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = fce3d038-1b61-b7a4-5275-7d9b9ac9f127
