msgctxt "h33610f32g581fg4e3eg8fcag8dd1f8f6cbef"
msgid "I'm from another realm entirely. It would be difficult to explain."
msgstr "난 완전히 다른 영역에서 왔기에, 설명하기 어렵겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date
