msgctxt "h30eb722cg9f03g421fg94a3gcf1565a16301"
msgid "Huh."
msgstr "허."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = b9f04614-fd71-50d1-bdf5-31d966576e06
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date:b9f04614-fd71-50d1-bdf5-31d966576e06
msgctxt "h400a7579geafcg4395g9fe2g19e0b8af4692"
msgid "Oh - hey! Here comes our food. "
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ba2bfaff-ab74-fef2-169d-2f2cb7922584
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date:ba2bfaff-ab74-fef2-169d-2f2cb7922584
msgctxt "h09f040bcg75edg4718gbd59gc3b71a21aaf4"
msgid ""
"I grew up in a crèche, like most gith. Not much fun to be had, but plenty of "
"discipline."
msgstr "난 대부분의 기스들처럼 양성소에서 자랐어. 많이 즐겁진 않았지만, 많이 단련되긴 했지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = ba8c7429-3112-0b9d-12b2-786ad4d4c2a8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date:ba8c7429-3112-0b9d-12b2-786ad4d4c2a8
msgctxt "hcb900f5cg1e83g46e3gbb54g06dda07aa913"
msgid "Thank you."
msgstr "고마워."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bc3fcdb1-df07-401f-6b7b-fa4663388cac
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date:bc3fcdb1-df07-401f-6b7b-fa4663388cac
msgctxt "h28c7f074g3991g4069ga2a3g01946d862edd"
msgid "That was an unexpected and very welcome twist."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = bce72662-1e69-411a-1049-6c1fd6f1b78d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Karlach_Event_AgreedGoingOnADate(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date:bce72662-1e69-411a-1049-6c1fd6f1b78d
msgctxt "h75db7c32g7981g4c5dgac1dg73ee777def87"
msgid "All set?"
msgstr "준비됐어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = be489fe3-d619-4ef0-5820-1415971aeb93
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date:be489fe3-d619-4ef0-5820-1415971aeb93
msgctxt "h4cccf0e9g5d09g4306gb8c3ga29177cf098d"
msgid ""
"Fucking <i>preach</i>. Any rat bastard comes after you again, and I'll "
"destroy them. I promise."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c078d375-1eba-1746-4404-a572c7aba367
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date:c078d375-1eba-1746-4404-a572c7aba367
msgctxt "h6e112fadg4157g4c88gbe3dge560cade601e"
msgid "It'll have to wait - I think our food is coming."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = c0aff545-a038-ffa1-d2d6-bbafa7950daf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date:c0aff545-a038-ffa1-d2d6-bbafa7950daf
msgctxt "hd8e9aecfgcfbag4408gb27dge85c89133a40"
msgid ""
"Good question. And easy enough, in my case. I'm afraid of dying with "
"regrets. Of living small and giving up the ghost before I've done what I "
"came here to do."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = c0d49b08-09c5-c21d-6752-5aa9a0ce9476
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date:c0d49b08-09c5-c21d-6752-5aa9a0ce9476
msgctxt "h18769aa6g1480g4a3dg8669ga9379d2852c3"
msgid "Sorry, sorry. Hope they don't stain. Care to raise your glass to that?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c3f12c42-8a61-782f-dc30-a6705a0caefb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date:c3f12c42-8a61-782f-dc30-a6705a0caefb
msgctxt "hd78d2174g4c59g4844ga939g36855816a440"
msgid "Water."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = c802aff8-ffaa-16c7-66d7-2049e430b0eb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date:c802aff8-ffaa-16c7-66d7-2049e430b0eb
msgctxt "h19dd33b3g9d31g4b4bga81bgb13e9f7534d0"
msgid ""
"Hey! Oaves have feelings too. I don't know why I'm nervous. Looks like we'll "
"have to raise <i>your </i>glass."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = ca1b65c9-1233-0a2c-d39a-876e0967d888
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date:ca1b65c9-1233-0a2c-d39a-876e0967d888
msgctxt "h7914413agcf4eg42aeg87b8gda45ba0108ed"
msgid ""
"It's one of the things I love about you - your ability to see things through."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = caa0a027-7773-bb83-33b8-cfa98b3fbcec
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date:caa0a027-7773-bb83-33b8-cfa98b3fbcec
msgctxt "h1b92abe1g2f58g4d77gac77g7e263d46e580"
msgid "No, after <i>you</i>."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = cb4a0c19-626d-3480-ab3c-612dab958686
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date:cb4a0c19-626d-3480-ab3c-612dab958686
msgctxt "h81205249g7ce5g46c6gba7egf83de83ef241"
msgid "We'll both have the seafood stew, please. And two glasses of..."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cb80ed3e-e534-b6ea-1f01-1b11480015bb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date:cb80ed3e-e534-b6ea-1f01-1b11480015bb
msgctxt "h42e185e0g8221g475ag9d43g837ccfa9ff20"
msgid "I often faint at the sight of blood."
msgstr "나는 피만 보면 자주 기절하곤 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cbdfcbab-4a4e-28c4-5645-223cc7c512c9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date:cbdfcbab-4a4e-28c4-5645-223cc7c512c9
msgctxt "h3042af9ag4c08g46cbg95f9g23b7776c4913"
msgid "Beer."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cc8a5e99-910b-73d6-f3df-daa0a323d11e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date:cc8a5e99-910b-73d6-f3df-daa0a323d11e
msgctxt "ha3c578e0g331fg4a88g8180g49f6769703ee"
msgid "I'm not sure my orifices are ready."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = d3c9503b-4d7a-1a51-be8f-ef5db02618bb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date:d3c9503b-4d7a-1a51-be8f-ef5db02618bb
msgctxt "h403dfeeeg0c59g42a1g98d3gf57875f66eaa"
msgid "You look nice."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = d4dd96c4-5bcd-05b7-866a-639195fd0c0a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date:d4dd96c4-5bcd-05b7-866a-639195fd0c0a
msgctxt "hfae6cab3gdfa5g4f7dgb1d0g9cf84809bdc1"
msgid ""
"I know I can't stay forever. Here. With you. In fact, I feel like... like I "
"don't have long left at all."
msgstr "나도 언제까지고 너랑 여기 있을 수 없단 건 알아. 사실, 나 말야… 시간이 얼마 안 남은 것 같아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d52bd762-c732-936a-8442-9b49949539c5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date:d52bd762-c732-936a-8442-9b49949539c5
msgctxt "h4b402b44g97d6g4b78g867ag32963e565d80"
msgid "You're not a hell-beast. You're a hell-champion."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = d5f0050c-f5d5-1f51-6646-0524e1496f9f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date:d5f0050c-f5d5-1f51-6646-0524e1496f9f
msgctxt "h3677ea7bg86efg4585g899eg2e64d118aaab"
msgid ""
"But hang on, this isn't first date talk. Tonight, I'm a mystery to you, and "
"you're a mystery to me."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = d78d2bc4-9835-1303-2a59-06f22349b090
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date:d78d2bc4-9835-1303-2a59-06f22349b090
msgctxt "hfeb62db0g654cg49b4ga0b9g5cf87472d0aa"
msgid ""
"That explains your grit. And your strength. And so many other things I love "
"about you."
msgstr "이제야 이해가 되네. 네 근성도, 네 힘도, 그리고 내가 사랑하는 네 다른 많은 것들도."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = d7c62796-84ab-31bd-f9be-44efb53d45d6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date:d7c62796-84ab-31bd-f9be-44efb53d45d6
msgctxt "h7c55466bg94ffg483bg8f3bgceb0bfa9ed3f"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry, but I don't have time for that. Literally. I care about you, but "
"I'm not going to chase after you."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d9aa1d7e-0bb2-4bd5-ea9f-1d48b5c28dc6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - WYLL_DEVIL(1) = True
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date:d9aa1d7e-0bb2-4bd5-ea9f-1d48b5c28dc6
msgctxt "heccb1801g1c7dg4c80ga061g62f589591b3d"
msgid "To look within and find I've become the devil I appear to be."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d9f99456-b524-f525-225a-29b29ead631b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date:d9f99456-b524-f525-225a-29b29ead631b
msgctxt "hed22519bgbff3g4139gb5d4g3795a07a814a"
msgid "Cliff diving? Naked horse riding? Duelling a troll?"
msgstr "절벽에서 뛰어내리기? 벌거벗고 말 타기? 트롤과 결투하기?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = da0915e4-d0ae-3953-ca9f-d32657255672
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date:da0915e4-d0ae-3953-ca9f-d32657255672
msgctxt "ha0056489g76e1g49c9gad01ge5bf7359df66"
msgid "I just think we ought to slow things down."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = da2d1a03-99c0-883e-03f1-9901fee5fd48
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date:da2d1a03-99c0-883e-03f1-9901fee5fd48
msgctxt "h9eaaab54gda86g4a66ga18dgeeff7f0a839e"
msgid "What did you have in mind?"
msgstr "어디까지 생각해봤어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = da3d5ba9-3927-7022-1422-71305c9ebf48
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date:da3d5ba9-3927-7022-1422-71305c9ebf48
msgctxt "h86da76dag8e1bg44ceg89beg5ffed847d4ae"
msgid "Like you, I wear my heart on my sleeve. Can't we skip the pleasantries?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = db1c70aa-9baf-19b5-b36e-2d99d32d5eb9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date:db1c70aa-9baf-19b5-b36e-2d99d32d5eb9
msgctxt "h688e5dbbgc558g460fg91f3g2db9338f0352"
msgid ""
"You deserve better. You deserve the <i>best</i>. I wish I could give it to "
"you for the rest of your life, but I swear it for the rest of mine."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = dfb5d30d-e17e-7c43-1252-24c4204c4201
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date:dfb5d30d-e17e-7c43-1252-24c4204c4201
msgctxt "h888c91f0g65e5g4f4egb09eg833d01867e46"
msgid ""
"So you can lap me up like dessert, but a <i>meal </i>together is taking "
"things too far?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e2cf420d-372e-ead3-e4f5-2cbb1b2993a2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date:e2cf420d-372e-ead3-e4f5-2cbb1b2993a2
msgctxt "h35647ed4g969bg4d43g84fbg58063857dd3d"
msgid "Where are we going, exactly?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e399b59e-b2f9-c64b-b201-aad103eed42c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date:e399b59e-b2f9-c64b-b201-aad103eed42c
msgctxt "hb749f465g7d72g4e1ega359g456530e13a92"
msgid ""
"I once claimed to have read all six volumes of 'Lichen and Its Curative "
"Properties' to impress a comely botanist. Alas, a falsehood."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e54b30a1-eba4-fcb4-bd02-d39381000c71
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date:e54b30a1-eba4-fcb4-bd02-d39381000c71
msgctxt "h29efb4bcg1789g4fd8ga780g3765ce6c1e25"
msgid ""
"Most of my secrets are lost to the ether. It's not the most exciting "
"thing... but I can't swim."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date
#. Speaker = Tender Henk
#. NodeID = e5cfe2e7-8650-c61b-ebc7-b5ea5d47fefa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_3 = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date:e5cfe2e7-8650-c61b-ebc7-b5ea5d47fefa
msgctxt "h1f8d60cdg4039g4494gbb0ag4748cb3a328d"
msgid "Hmph."
msgstr "흐음."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = e6605151-1864-62f1-c297-0c4ba86903ca
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date:e6605151-1864-62f1-c297-0c4ba86903ca
msgctxt "h06a4f7d2gbfefg467aga161gb308767505a3"
msgid ""
"It does. There's so much about you I don't know, but I'm hungry for every "
"part of it."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = e67bb878-eb5a-9b78-21cc-60761389c55f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date:e67bb878-eb5a-9b78-21cc-60761389c55f
msgctxt "hb802bfc6g9db0g4a6cg96feg723583f555e3"
msgid ""
"I know, but this is our <i>first </i>date, remember? Tonight, you're a "
"mystery to me."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = e7024528-b576-19b2-dad3-207a9322968d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date:e7024528-b576-19b2-dad3-207a9322968d
msgctxt "h4d3c2809geab4g42eega9a2g9e2bdc9df2d2"
msgid ""
"You mean you <i>haven't </i>read all six volumes?! Gale Dekarios, I'll never "
"look at you the same."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = ea2c0685-b3a7-3190-bdfe-96ac792ab472
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date:ea2c0685-b3a7-3190-bdfe-96ac792ab472
msgctxt "h0bad1195gdeb4g4e6bga226g4fcdbea47f69"
msgid ""
"I rented us a room for the whole night. Just the two of us - alone, finally."
msgstr "하룻밤을 보낼 방 하나 빌렸어. 마침내 너랑 나, 단둘이서."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = ea31fd43-1503-f26b-f206-3c19a33b904e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date:ea31fd43-1503-f26b-f206-3c19a33b904e
msgctxt "h9010061dg9bd1g4703g94e1gf29418398b79"
msgid ""
"Hard to imagine you as a naughty little boy. Who knew he'd grow up to be the "
"very paragon of right-doing?"
msgstr "개구쟁이 꼬마 시절의 너라니 상상도 안 가네. 그러던 애가 커서 이런 성인군자가 될지 누가 알았겠어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = eaa4ffb4-6d4e-db6d-561d-5d142f2a89e2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - ORI_Karlach_State_WentToDate(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date:eaa4ffb4-6d4e-db6d-561d-5d142f2a89e2
msgctxt "h26fe54fcgf305g475fg82acg87773c0b1054"
msgid ""
"I'm buying, all right? Let it be said, let it be written, let it be done."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = eafadcef-0d1b-87d7-53dd-2b13207b4b2e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date:eafadcef-0d1b-87d7-53dd-2b13207b4b2e
msgctxt "he7f59ec5gc80eg4976gbe81g568e5583ca19"
msgid "Hear, hear."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = eb3be579-f150-d790-8f9b-07428680af8f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date:eb3be579-f150-d790-8f9b-07428680af8f
msgctxt "h51d76e10gecccg424agb39fg3523260a2ea5"
msgid "I'm afraid of not truly belonging anywhere."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = ebcf9d1b-8eee-4ddb-c8f9-b2e285a33700
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date:ebcf9d1b-8eee-4ddb-c8f9-b2e285a33700
msgctxt "h76070f46g1087g4ff6g84bag760853101c45"
msgid ""
"Might've, if you spent any time in the Outer City. We didn't exactly hide "
"ourselves under a bushel."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = ebd9e6ec-d818-d90b-c82e-ae223cee31a3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date:ebd9e6ec-d818-d90b-c82e-ae223cee31a3
msgctxt "hdc64a407gd04ag4fc9g9482g1f64f618db8e"
msgid "Hup hup, eh? I haven't got forever."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = ec3ccd74-c7cb-4ea3-99f2-e436ecb305e7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date:ec3ccd74-c7cb-4ea3-99f2-e436ecb305e7
msgctxt "hb29dcbaegcd0fg414cgb023g733ef796582e"
msgid ""
"That could never happen. You're the best person I've ever met. Soul and body."
msgstr "그럴 일 없어. 넌 내가 만난 사람 중 최고라고. 몸도 마음도."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = ed2877ab-99d9-4015-290e-c285764cf483
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date:ed2877ab-99d9-4015-290e-c285764cf483
msgctxt "hd967dd86gb64bg4465ga969g1e0f2aa281b3"
msgid "Two of the rothé ribs, please. And two glasses of..."
msgstr "로테 등갈비 둘 주시고, 음료 두 잔은…"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = ef02fcf6-391c-98ac-1e8e-99ce7902885c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date:ef02fcf6-391c-98ac-1e8e-99ce7902885c
msgctxt "h2954d392gc225g4438g979egc8228b1f068e"
msgid "Exactly. Anything you'd like to know about your enigmatic new paramour?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = ef227dfa-b2f7-eedf-8f5a-ba39ddd0236c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date:ef227dfa-b2f7-eedf-8f5a-ba39ddd0236c
msgctxt "h675d80c2g97cfg4f27g8b3cgbf31423a3481"
msgid "Come on. There's something I want to show you upstairs."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f116d5ba-9765-84e6-03c5-b9d5b35ca7ac
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date:f116d5ba-9765-84e6-03c5-b9d5b35ca7ac
msgctxt "h66398604g1268g4c9bg9412g39c66f7cb184"
msgid "Ready when you are."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = f1999c24-1b3b-3a7c-4813-d265416e4415
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date:f1999c24-1b3b-3a7c-4813-d265416e4415
msgctxt "hce00d2a4g1b04g4d60g8e72g19ca68bc90f3"
msgid "...and two glasses of beer."
msgstr "…맥주도 두 잔 주세요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = f310b0d2-3d2a-8133-d8c9-e83aef174a68
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date:f310b0d2-3d2a-8133-d8c9-e83aef174a68
msgctxt "he3d5b0b1g54efg4d6bg8f5dg75018d11de8e"
msgid "Friends? What do you mean?"
msgstr "친구라니? 무슨 뜻이야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = f3a31859-21c7-ca61-14f8-dfeb4710685a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date:f3a31859-21c7-ca61-14f8-dfeb4710685a
msgctxt "hbcf43de4gcb76g4b91ga808g44e65b77f58b"
msgid "Nice and light. Sounds perfect."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = f3c5a035-3c8f-6f7e-c5b5-4d6bd4e13096
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date:f3c5a035-3c8f-6f7e-c5b5-4d6bd4e13096
msgctxt "h5990e4bag9c40g4686g94d9g3707024c7f20"
msgid "Your turn!"
msgstr "네 차례야!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = f4f3c974-09fe-7d68-cd54-6871d7623712
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_DarkUrge_State_SparedIsobelWithKarlach = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date:f4f3c974-09fe-7d68-cd54-6871d7623712
msgctxt "hc81e7262g0cf6g4b11gb7eeg94df892b90d2"
msgid ""
"Never thought I'd be the type to fall for a <i>fatale</i> like you, but "
"there's a sweetness to you, just beneath the surface. It's irresistible."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = f57542b7-3852-d0b7-ff15-72cdb37b3d00
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date:f57542b7-3852-d0b7-ff15-72cdb37b3d00
msgctxt "h756afcbag6129g46d3g9dc0g0f2983094fca"
msgid ""
"But to be here, with you, in the city I love, in this world that I love so "
"much... It's all I could really ask for."
msgstr "이토록 좋아하는 세계의, 좋아하는 도시에서, 너와 함께 있으니… 더는 바랄 게 없네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = f6ce26e7-9cdc-1ef6-4b4e-4f4aad085b81
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date:f6ce26e7-9cdc-1ef6-4b4e-4f4aad085b81
msgctxt "h8bde261dg744dg49c5g8c8dg39a95305c283"
msgid ""
"After... after everything? Everything you said? Everything <i>I</i> said? "
"You..."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f8887c1d-5cd5-147f-efef-510493440712
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date:f8887c1d-5cd5-147f-efef-510493440712
msgctxt "h9f141c4bg610bg42a2ga2begd35e5290d6f2"
msgid ""
"I like you, but I'm not sure I'm ready to take things to the next level."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f98f3c1b-64bc-89c4-95f5-8f94b5395f0b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date:f98f3c1b-64bc-89c4-95f5-8f94b5395f0b
msgctxt "h7cea1de0g2be5g4c09g99a7g0dc7b1c04004"
msgid "Pumpkin stew sounds lovely."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fb5c6ee8-cd16-fd25-a3ad-1c400d909552
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date:fb5c6ee8-cd16-fd25-a3ad-1c400d909552
msgctxt "h24041fd5g0cb6g4c09g92e9g61a59c7b2618"
msgid "For me, it's control. I won't be under someone's thumb ever again."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ff6eda53-2ade-1fae-0504-22652aa02748
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date:ff6eda53-2ade-1fae-0504-22652aa02748
msgctxt "h044db5acgaf63g4028g907eg93f396619b07"
msgid "Does mysteriousness suit me?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = ff9a7a1d-192c-f4b9-4f9b-5ffd1c72daf4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Karlach_CRD_ROM_Date:ff9a7a1d-192c-f4b9-4f9b-5ffd1c72daf4
msgctxt "hb6d16cafgc39ag4176g9515gea0718c2a55d"
msgid ""
"I get it. I can't speak for Vlaakith, but <i>I'll</i> always know who you "
"are. The bravest, fiercest, most gorgeous woman in all the Realms."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_AfterRomance2
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 057b8fb8-c61f-f237-31ca-def7a9fc0252
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_AfterRomance2:057b8fb8-c61f-f237-31ca-def7a9fc0252
msgctxt "h3e48b5c6gc7cdg47ddg9a40g827b1586309e"
msgid ""
"Then I will give you that, and more. I will burn you, bite you, brand you "
"with the wounds of my obsession."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_AfterRomance2
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 0f69507b-49bd-92cd-0c2c-bfa42ba64ca2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_AfterRomance2:0f69507b-49bd-92cd-0c2c-bfa42ba64ca2
msgctxt "h0949d00fg41cfg48b1gbf52gcb45c58750cd"
msgid ""
"I've been pierced by a beholder's rays and sliced open by a neogi's talon. "
"But this wound will run much deeper."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_AfterRomance2
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 210a6584-1f57-c112-c181-dd9f71c60aff
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_AfterRomance2:210a6584-1f57-c112-c181-dd9f71c60aff
msgctxt "h9d73f2b6gd7fcg4e50g9577gf4b870cca643"
msgid ""
"Soon, I would know you again. Not to claw you, but to caress you. Not to be "
"burned in your heat -"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_AfterRomance2
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 22ae0de0-838d-95da-ce67-dead17379c40
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_AfterRomance2:22ae0de0-838d-95da-ce67-dead17379c40
msgctxt "h5f3c071cga2c3g42a9gb5e9gf613c3b32f33"
msgid ""
"Truthfully, it took more courage to ask for a soft touch than it would to "
"meet the gaze of the Ninefold Dragon."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_AfterRomance2
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 26de3282-5b85-c79d-46f4-0980e8858da0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_AfterRomance2:26de3282-5b85-c79d-46f4-0980e8858da0
msgctxt "h1f7aba10gb22dg42fdg900agec6f64676eba"
msgid ""
"I expect you to do the same. Leave your mark. <i>Be the source of my "
"bruises.</i>"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_AfterRomance2
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 33cb0165-f316-2e3a-e4ad-9675aabb12aa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_AfterRomance2:33cb0165-f316-2e3a-e4ad-9675aabb12aa
msgctxt "h8ac5b099g0a33g44d1g85f1g431575a0dc71"
msgid ""
"You are still my friend, my fellow warrior. And still the source of my "
"bruises."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_AfterRomance2
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 391bec0d-5d02-5414-20b1-c9fcf5159e80
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_AfterRomance2:391bec0d-5d02-5414-20b1-c9fcf5159e80
msgctxt "h5d6ea878g5a67g4fdcgb0bbg4dbe51ac52c9"
msgid "- but to be bathed in your warmth."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_AfterRomance2
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 5c2f1bbc-6fdd-e931-71fb-2f2fbcdf2a9e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_AfterRomance2:5c2f1bbc-6fdd-e931-71fb-2f2fbcdf2a9e
msgctxt "hd900c81egc669g484dgb536g19ef6adcae3d"
msgid ""
"But now I see more in you still. You are iron and steel, yes - but you are "
"also silk and satin."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_AfterRomance2
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7850cd8f-7c1d-4750-69b6-03a666c92e36
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_AfterRomance2:7850cd8f-7c1d-4750-69b6-03a666c92e36
msgctxt "h00ea49c6g19e3g42f6ga10fg90ba94e57268"
msgid "Maybe another time. I need rest, not sex."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_AfterRomance2
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8a158fb9-12e8-3c4a-fe82-e17c54976d24
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_AfterRomance2:8a158fb9-12e8-3c4a-fe82-e17c54976d24
msgctxt "h687eeab9g4552g485cgad6dg1de3148eb233"
msgid "Yes. I've longed for a tender touch."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_AfterRomance2
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a206d31e-432a-1a10-4dc3-41e3f8ae2e99
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - ORI_State_WasPartneredWithLaezel(1) = True
#.     - ORI_State_PartneredWithLaezel(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_AfterRomance2:a206d31e-432a-1a10-4dc3-41e3f8ae2e99
msgctxt "h8787f50bge57cg488eg8876g48392a47136f"
msgid "I'm calling things off, Lae'zel."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_AfterRomance2
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = ab5b3631-5c31-17cf-33e0-5c8519a0fa46
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_AfterRomance2:ab5b3631-5c31-17cf-33e0-5c8519a0fa46
msgctxt "ha020bbcagcc90g49d6gb760g61c6de49da88"
msgid "Hells."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_AfterRomance2
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = b117474b-1748-502e-bbe4-c6852079c6bc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_AfterRomance2:b117474b-1748-502e-bbe4-c6852079c6bc
msgctxt "h258ed557g58dag45f1gb112g9b4e583e2979"
msgid "Mm. You crave the icy heat of iron and steel."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_AfterRomance2
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b83877bd-d593-c795-ad94-cfca189e4a72
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_AfterRomance2:b83877bd-d593-c795-ad94-cfca189e4a72
msgctxt "h72073b4cg90e1g43c2g88a0g45b15382c80d"
msgid "I prefer heat. Ravage me, show me no mercy."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_AfterRomance2
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = b960103c-1955-32c9-4015-849eac46531c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_AfterRomance2:b960103c-1955-32c9-4015-849eac46531c
msgctxt "h527703dfga500g4750gafb6g51c84453ea4c"
msgid "I see."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_AfterRomance2
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = d0763842-30bc-b702-cd4a-3bd299481c9f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_AfterRomance2:d0763842-30bc-b702-cd4a-3bd299481c9f
msgctxt "h050c0240g74e1g430cga4a5g35126eb7ec71"
msgid ""
"Our flesh-bond is broken, but our alliance is not. Our kinship will be the "
"blade that cleaves the our enemies."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_AfterRomance2
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = d3e5a842-b149-3a09-cf22-f9afff95b9fe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_AfterRomance2:d3e5a842-b149-3a09-cf22-f9afff95b9fe
msgctxt "h03319667gdc39g4d1dg85c8g40e3eae04679"
msgid "Thus far I've taunted you, devoured you, battled you."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_AfterRomance2
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = d6aacc77-e225-a948-95b0-2c23c6e5b23e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_AfterRomance2:d6aacc77-e225-a948-95b0-2c23c6e5b23e
msgctxt "hcd3c63d9g269eg4299g99aagfe1342cf54bf"
msgid "<i>Zhak vo'n'ash duj.</i>"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_AfterRomance2
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = e671058c-e3ed-b9ae-06c0-fce181688b32
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_AfterRomance2:e671058c-e3ed-b9ae-06c0-fce181688b32
msgctxt "h3d0dc552g9d22g4910g8b05g748a8abbcca5"
msgid "Let us hope, then, that time does not too quickly run out."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_AfterRomance2
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = f03e1f2a-ac18-8970-5236-6e4c29541fd2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_AfterRomance2:f03e1f2a-ac18-8970-5236-6e4c29541fd2
msgctxt "h497732c1g5aeeg4901g8458g9e27a9d0a390"
msgid "As have I."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_AfterRomance2
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = fe46fb7d-2bc0-5bdf-296f-e1cd88f3684d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_AfterRomance2:fe46fb7d-2bc0-5bdf-296f-e1cd88f3684d
msgctxt "hbf85f7ccgce83g455bg8c50gb839ad6e6e79"
msgid ""
"I thought I'd seen the whole of you. Mighty as Tiamat's dragons, monumental "
"as the One in the Void."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_AfterRomance2
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = ff0931a3-4cb8-685f-02f5-111fc5a8acf2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_AfterRomance2:ff0931a3-4cb8-685f-02f5-111fc5a8acf2
msgctxt "h4a79ac0cg8d4fg4536gba42g1610e1c66ac1"
msgid "Now, I want more than anything to soothe you."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_SecondNight
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 06ada346-04be-4014-b6d6-b1348212bf33
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_SecondNight:06ada346-04be-4014-b6d6-b1348212bf33
msgctxt "h7d3f7b9cgb39ag4c90g8e97gdfc346cfb629"
msgid ""
"<i>Chk</i>. Overheated grappling, that wastefully eats into time better "
"spent resting our muscles."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_SecondNight
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 078deea4-7c7a-4dec-bc4c-8bf004b6efdd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - ORI_State_DatingLaezel(1) = False
#.     - ORI_State_PartneredWithLaezel(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_SecondNight:078deea4-7c7a-4dec-bc4c-8bf004b6efdd
msgctxt "hc5b0e2f6g47f8g478dgbaa1g9d825594d77e"
msgid "You've read this all wrong. I'm not interested, Lae'zel."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_SecondNight
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 079388dc-b7f2-4c53-9c8c-798c0892075e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - ORI_Laezel_Event_SecondNightInvitation = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_SecondNight:079388dc-b7f2-4c53-9c8c-798c0892075e
msgctxt "h46d8c261g2aabg4d85gb72dgb3d379b06791"
msgid ""
"Ever since we shared each others' flesh, I've caught you looking at me with "
"lidded eyes."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_SecondNight
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 11bb4ce2-40b2-4ed2-82b1-3a4d0f6ee660
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_SecondNight:11bb4ce2-40b2-4ed2-82b1-3a4d0f6ee660
msgctxt "h52e0377dgb9aeg4510g8b99g457b3c11b7fa"
msgid "And either like a coward or a fool, you tremble."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_SecondNight
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 29a439cc-6def-4d36-9f69-17884788e30f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_SecondNight:29a439cc-6def-4d36-9f69-17884788e30f
msgctxt "h1ac358dbg514bg4e2cg993ag93c9f37e0882"
msgid ""
"Perhaps the parasite has weakened you. Or perhaps - perhaps you still long "
"for my taste."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_SecondNight
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 2dc84f29-1772-4101-95b2-0b0e6f3173a2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_SecondNight:2dc84f29-1772-4101-95b2-0b0e6f3173a2
msgctxt "h7ae0a92agc489g4e50gbdf8gb82c554d578a"
msgid ""
"Have the curiosities of this land muddled your head? <i>Bah</i> - at least "
"you are choosing to lay with me instead of one of <i>them</i>."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_SecondNight
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3749376f-8a5c-42e5-8148-d84920ba9fc4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - ORI_State_DatingLaezel(1) = False
#.     - ORI_State_PartneredWithLaezel(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_SecondNight:3749376f-8a5c-42e5-8148-d84920ba9fc4
msgctxt "h9de8df00g57bbg42ceg935cg666f8f0f75ce"
msgid "On second thought, I'd rather be alone tonight."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_SecondNight
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 38cf07c5-60ad-4862-a2b6-394997043349
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_SecondNight:38cf07c5-60ad-4862-a2b6-394997043349
msgctxt "h40dc459dg17fag4506g9cb4g5106c8346017"
msgid "And you've never strangled a Berbalang with your bare hands."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_SecondNight
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3bb9bf69-c260-471d-8df2-fdf31e57cfeb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_SecondNight:3bb9bf69-c260-471d-8df2-fdf31e57cfeb
msgctxt "h9439ee04ge5deg4a77gabceg513e768cd0fd"
msgid "Shouldn't we enjoy all the sensations of Faerûn while we are here?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_SecondNight
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 3e7290dc-ad11-423b-8bca-690573078ce4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_SecondNight:3e7290dc-ad11-423b-8bca-690573078ce4
msgctxt "hb55254fcg29c1g47f4g8559g2afccd3c9ef8"
msgid ""
"Besides, I can't deny the lure of your taste. Sweet, yes, but also bitter as "
"ginger."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_SecondNight
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 40925ffd-60b5-4938-9059-b054a1eae769
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_SecondNight:40925ffd-60b5-4938-9059-b054a1eae769
msgctxt "h0abb055fga333g4108gb9f3g0477ff9a22f9"
msgid "You've never done it before, have you?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_SecondNight
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 57dd8e31-a6ec-494b-9700-c67b9e928024
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_SecondNight:57dd8e31-a6ec-494b-9700-c67b9e928024
msgctxt "hea3bc2a5g95f3g4712gb80dge94edea512fc"
msgid "It is foolish of me. I promise I shall stop."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_SecondNight
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 591053ac-9e74-41c6-9e67-70df7f293d31
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_SecondNight:591053ac-9e74-41c6-9e67-70df7f293d31
msgctxt "h485bc0c9gf19cg4998gb7fdgbaeec7f0e48d"
msgid ""
"I remember your heartbeat from before. Quick, light, like a frightened "
"rabbit."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_SecondNight
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 5f0533f9-7a0f-4763-b11c-d335319e54db
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_SecondNight:5f0533f9-7a0f-4763-b11c-d335319e54db
msgctxt "h6a1ec036g3683g41a2gb6d9ga7c0a94a3a11"
msgid "Very well. I will claim you once you have taken to rest."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_SecondNight
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 618162a2-0954-46d9-854a-99e768701ae9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_SecondNight:618162a2-0954-46d9-854a-99e768701ae9
msgctxt "h7f5e9e80g0136g4523g8ee8gc8ddc151c903"
msgid "I <i>have</i> been hoping we could spend the night together again."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_SecondNight
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 626f2997-fd02-4ea3-a1f9-2809f3d0ebc9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - ORI_Laezel_State_AgreedOnSecondNight(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_SecondNight:626f2997-fd02-4ea3-a1f9-2809f3d0ebc9
msgctxt "h517ac5cdg12f6g4fd8g9172g13b1bcc350fb"
msgid "Enough! I have given you my word. Do not be late."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_SecondNight
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 68960266-1435-49b1-ab01-f38e800b1f77
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_SecondNight:68960266-1435-49b1-ab01-f38e800b1f77
msgctxt "hbd581f67gc516g4942g82f8g268981a32e3c"
msgid "Tempt me."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_SecondNight
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7265d24e-941e-4da9-9c82-68a81733d6e5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_SecondNight:7265d24e-941e-4da9-9c82-68a81733d6e5
msgctxt "hedcfe995gb896g4ab7ga84bgc9338cf07e85"
msgid "You're free to be with who you choose, but I hope you'll choose me."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_SecondNight
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7ad90bd8-80fa-4471-9a68-402cbde7adb8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_SecondNight:7ad90bd8-80fa-4471-9a68-402cbde7adb8
msgctxt "h1f74aea1gd8b5g436dga9d1g9f6cbc45c595"
msgid "Deep down, you like me more than anyone else here."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_SecondNight
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 82d2073d-9f9c-43ac-ae78-c8a8b23200da
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_SecondNight:82d2073d-9f9c-43ac-ae78-c8a8b23200da
msgctxt "h3b84d94agc379g4934g8e10g7dd3ce85e3cb"
msgid "Just when my tongue was craving a second sample."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_SecondNight
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 8bd547fa-0957-4c80-95a8-0b7cebded979
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_SecondNight:8bd547fa-0957-4c80-95a8-0b7cebded979
msgctxt "h14c2b6deg2c78g42aeg8ed8g49cf373e55c9"
msgid "Why would a lesser act spark greater desire in you?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_SecondNight
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9004020a-6400-486b-9770-83fc52377b92
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_SecondNight:9004020a-6400-486b-9770-83fc52377b92
msgctxt "hdf80463ag86e1g42f6ga4b4g7a5c2e8f9dd8"
msgid ""
"I want to press my head to your chest and feel the war drum of your heart."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_SecondNight
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 944268be-1c6e-43b7-98d9-6c8c194612f7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_SecondNight:944268be-1c6e-43b7-98d9-6c8c194612f7
msgctxt "hc6707de4gdf31g42d6gbdbfg2fa54bc56f49"
msgid ""
"I did not say it was unwelcome. Should a warrior not enjoy the flattery of "
"her admirers?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_SecondNight
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a16285e2-ef17-48ac-982c-297114ccb1a2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_SecondNight:a16285e2-ef17-48ac-982c-297114ccb1a2
msgctxt "had018c1fg5b71g4b4ag93c8ga6c324b42e94"
msgid "The sex gets better the more experience you have with someone."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_SecondNight
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = af4d34b2-aec7-41f1-a57b-70d15366d21e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_SecondNight:af4d34b2-aec7-41f1-a57b-70d15366d21e
msgctxt "h7a96a08cgfd97g42edgaa1ag4434b80a30fb"
msgid ""
"Yes. I have the pick of Faerûn's litter, though all I see are runts. They "
"are the rule; you are the exception."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_SecondNight
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = b8d9f7b6-aee7-4b2e-bc4c-5f4f5fee93a1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_SecondNight:b8d9f7b6-aee7-4b2e-bc4c-5f4f5fee93a1
msgctxt "h01309311gf64fg46c2g89ccg4dd0f4e53e85"
msgid ""
"You are exceptional amongst our pack. You are clearly their leader, and they "
"look to you for guidance. That, I admire."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_SecondNight
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c8cac585-60c0-46ea-b19b-5b557f6efa28
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_SecondNight:c8cac585-60c0-46ea-b19b-5b557f6efa28
msgctxt "hbe411f20gefe2g4770gb1daga9eea18bf482"
msgid "I look forward to it dearly."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_SecondNight
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = cb8a30b4-1f29-4c54-a375-7e2043404642
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_SecondNight:cb8a30b4-1f29-4c54-a375-7e2043404642
msgctxt "hc6f44f82g068dg4e7dg8326g139354ddad5f"
msgid ""
"I never promised more than a night - though I can't deny the lure of your "
"taste. Sweet, yes, but also bitter as ginger."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_SecondNight
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = d96a9fb1-c66a-4af9-80b0-a30fb2f042b2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_SecondNight:d96a9fb1-c66a-4af9-80b0-a30fb2f042b2
msgctxt "h9731d09fgb1bbg415bga14ag24af9d451518"
msgid ""
"Like the shield-bearer and pikeman must train to march their formation in "
"tandem."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_SecondNight
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = da12d835-3c92-4f43-b508-9390ddda1fb0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_SecondNight:da12d835-3c92-4f43-b508-9390ddda1fb0
msgctxt "hfe1c13bfg801cg4893g9682g0b3c68f218d7"
msgid "Only if you promise to stick around for a cuddle afterwards."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_SecondNight
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = e114f1a6-ff96-4ba4-afd6-3eea69e295a1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - ORI_Laezel_State_AgreedOnSecondNight(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_SecondNight:e114f1a6-ff96-4ba4-afd6-3eea69e295a1
msgctxt "h8fba5d25gc155g4632g9116gff5b35f88584"
msgid "Yes. <i>Good.</i>"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_SecondNight
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e81c8ff6-2c33-4da0-a220-34c5e7e5f956
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - ORI_State_DatingLaezel(1) = False
#.     - ORI_State_PartneredWithLaezel(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_SecondNight:e81c8ff6-2c33-4da0-a220-34c5e7e5f956
msgctxt "hcf91af8fg2c12g45e6g8e21g0d6295ac0351"
msgid "I think you're mistaken, I've been having no such thoughts."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_SecondNight
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ee54d34f-9236-4875-b9e6-9ec841bd717f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_SecondNight:ee54d34f-9236-4875-b9e6-9ec841bd717f
msgctxt "hd9ad0bafg0df9g40b3g8b2bg409b1179753d"
msgid "Good."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_SecondNight
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = f5dce963-79db-4c5a-8e5e-a5730cf06a1a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - ORI_State_WasPartneredWithLaezel(1) = True
#.     - ORI_State_DatingLaezel(1) = False
#.     - ORI_State_PartneredWithLaezel(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_SecondNight:f5dce963-79db-4c5a-8e5e-a5730cf06a1a
msgctxt "h6eeffbbeg2b9eg4cd3g9083ga895d23000cd"
msgid ""
"<i>Chk</i> - to think you'd starve yourself while gazing at a feast luscious "
"as this."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_SecondNight
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = fbfc52bd-ac72-4525-aca5-643e86a752aa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Laezel_CRD_SecondNight:fbfc52bd-ac72-4525-aca5-643e86a752aa
msgctxt "h951dd7f7gcd46g4a9fgb3cdg9f9cb7fdfa57"
msgid ""
"I'll keep your request in mind. Perform well, and perhaps I'll consider it."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_MizorasJudgement_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 086cc8d5-a6e0-773c-61ab-63b70050925f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_MizorasJudgement_CRD_Karlach:086cc8d5-a6e0-773c-61ab-63b70050925f
msgctxt "h2787b6dege0adg482agb86fg99d302615252"
msgid "I'm just glad you're all right. I save my sword for monsters."
msgstr "네가 무사해서 다행이지. 내 검은 괴물들을 위해 아껴둬야겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_MizorasJudgement_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 114e8e6d-49d5-d1c2-c37c-1ccf241ceffe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_MizorasJudgement_CRD_Karlach:114e8e6d-49d5-d1c2-c37c-1ccf241ceffe
msgctxt "he4967d05g0265g45aegb1c1gd9305fc5d795"
msgid "Funny how the line between 'fool' and 'hero' is so thin."
msgstr "'바보'와 '영웅'이 종이 한 장 차이라는 게 참 재밌지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_MizorasJudgement_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 22fe8d7e-8810-93ec-d3ee-f261904b51a9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_MizorasJudgement_CRD_Karlach:22fe8d7e-8810-93ec-d3ee-f261904b51a9
msgctxt "h83b274abg9416g4beeg8ed8g017528c9d87c"
msgid ""
"Keep 'em clean and dry, apply a bit of seed oil now and again, and they'll "
"<i>shine.</i>"
msgstr "깨끗하고 건조하게 유지해줘, 이따금 종자유를 발라주면, <i>광이 날거야.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_MizorasJudgement_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 35d4e6ec-b4d3-afb4-c3cb-1dfce33fba89
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_MizorasJudgement_CRD_Karlach:35d4e6ec-b4d3-afb4-c3cb-1dfce33fba89
msgctxt "h53794358g1f06g4a89ga91cg7cb8e4e9b303"
msgid ""
"I'll figure out a way to make it up to him. What do heroes like? Swords... "
"shields... shiny things..."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_MizorasJudgement_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 470d4234-1cd7-7225-09fe-65c496deda8a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_MizorasJudgement_CRD_Karlach:470d4234-1cd7-7225-09fe-65c496deda8a
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "hb4307ee1g9870g4cf5gaab7g348214a98d89"
msgid "Wouldn't be courage without the risk, would it."
msgstr "위험이 없다면 용기라고 할 수 없겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_MizorasJudgement_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 52c99a18-0676-4080-e12e-d74d89b7e51a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_MizorasJudgement_CRD_Karlach:52c99a18-0676-4080-e12e-d74d89b7e51a
msgctxt "hf6523ddbgbd0dg4d7dg86b1gb1982fa6dfc9"
msgid ""
"I'm glad you saw me for who I am. And - and I think I can see who you really "
"are too. A hero."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_MizorasJudgement_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 54905d30-90ba-d0b7-fed9-4dbce3648eec
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - AVATAR(1) = True
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_MizorasJudgement_CRD_Karlach:54905d30-90ba-d0b7-fed9-4dbce3648eec
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "ha7987c85g2940g447ag8a91gf5128ce426c8"
msgid "Wyll. I don't know what to say. I can't believe what you did."
msgstr "윌. 뭐라고 말해야 할지 모르겠네. 그런 일을 하다니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_MizorasJudgement_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 6a406217-b9e0-7baa-4cd7-e275430d4382
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_MizorasJudgement_CRD_Karlach:6a406217-b9e0-7baa-4cd7-e275430d4382
msgctxt "h91ab020bg902fg4ad7gafddg3a9b8208317a"
msgid ""
"Can't say I blame you. I can tell you right now, I wouldn't have done the "
"same in your position. But I'm... well, I'm grateful you're better than me."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_MizorasJudgement_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 6e8576aa-e040-a15f-a3da-d196bb01ab95
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_MizorasJudgement_CRD_Karlach:6e8576aa-e040-a15f-a3da-d196bb01ab95
msgctxt "hce071b0bgec89g4244gb2e1gc241faa907d7"
msgid ""
"I won't forget this, Wyll. Not ever. You may look like a devil, but you're "
"one of the most noble men I've ever met."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_MizorasJudgement_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6ee573a2-a520-0c29-ce69-44ac31d65a87
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_MizorasJudgement_CRD_Karlach:6ee573a2-a520-0c29-ce69-44ac31d65a87
msgctxt "h19fb8860gd57cg4e28g9ba6g111b02275b8b"
msgid ""
"I don't want thanks. If I'd known this would be result, I might've chosen "
"differently."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_MizorasJudgement_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 732633e9-de4d-e333-8606-98d1f8583056
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_MizorasJudgement_CRD_Karlach:732633e9-de4d-e333-8606-98d1f8583056
msgctxt "h8b52c493gd42ag4cc0gb3f9g0a010817aa71"
msgid "Some advice on proper horn care wouldn't go amiss."
msgstr "뿔 관리 하는 적절한 방법을 알려줬으면 좋겠는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_MizorasJudgement_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 89e18b1d-18c2-25f3-82ab-851189e05c6e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_MizorasJudgement_CRD_Karlach:89e18b1d-18c2-25f3-82ab-851189e05c6e
msgctxt "h11fda974gf427g4e83g8008gfefbff413904"
msgid "You can have my back when it comes down to it."
msgstr "필요하다면 내가 널 지켜줄 수 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_MizorasJudgement_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 921776df-48d1-3d99-b728-ae1542f2ec2b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_MizorasJudgement_CRD_Karlach:921776df-48d1-3d99-b728-ae1542f2ec2b
msgctxt "h4c5b998eg83a4g4f66g9592gbf04a8ca6bd3"
msgid ""
"I'm grateful I get to travel with you, Wyll. You may look like a devil, but "
"you're one of the most noble men I've ever met."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_MizorasJudgement_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 9d701b1b-5dc0-5673-f0f5-f3424660b635
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_MizorasJudgement_CRD_Karlach:9d701b1b-5dc0-5673-f0f5-f3424660b635
msgctxt "h88ba6788g3452g4124g99b9g26a882f7db7f"
msgid ""
"I'll be honest, soldier - I'm reeling. Wyll hardly knows me, but he chose my "
"life over his."
msgstr "솔직히 말할게, 신참. 난 혼란스러워. 윌은 날 잘 알지도 못하면서 날 위해 자기 인생을 포기했어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_MizorasJudgement_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a3e82b30-0a7e-bd57-1d1f-7a603a00261b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - WARLOCK(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_MizorasJudgement_CRD_Karlach:a3e82b30-0a7e-bd57-1d1f-7a603a00261b
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h17a28a4dgf35fg4dc5gafc1g56039a7f1370"
msgid ""
"Defying his patron like that was extremely dangerous. It was a courageous - "
"or very stupid - move."
msgstr "자기 후원자를 거역하는 건 매우 위험해. 용감한 행동이었지, 아주 멍청한 행동일수도 있고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_MizorasJudgement_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = a4703f82-1c26-33cf-82c6-40ea5daa8311
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_MizorasJudgement_CRD_Karlach:a4703f82-1c26-33cf-82c6-40ea5daa8311
msgctxt "h799f4a2bg73cag41dfga239g3d51fbf8a21f"
msgid ""
"Been a long time since someone stuck their neck out for me like that. How "
"can I thank you?"
msgstr "누가 날 위해 목숨을 걸어준 건 오랜만이야. 어떻게 감사를 표해야 할까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_MizorasJudgement_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = b65f060f-8115-11a7-9f59-f1be8e7b3f22
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_MizorasJudgement_CRD_Karlach:b65f060f-8115-11a7-9f59-f1be8e7b3f22
msgctxt "h0f11e4c0gf90ag456cg915dgaf04bee9cbaa"
msgid "Been a long time since someone stuck their neck out for me like that."
msgstr "누가 날 위해 목숨을 걸어준 건 오랜만이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_MizorasJudgement_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = ca22e300-e514-5e91-5903-3124db9c31d9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_MizorasJudgement_CRD_Karlach:ca22e300-e514-5e91-5903-3124db9c31d9
msgctxt "h5a73ad70g9e03g4c08gba2ag2ef6a341f759"
msgid ""
"You can say that again. When he was chasing me through Avernus I thought he "
"was just another sad merc. How wrong I was."
msgstr "그러니까 말이야. 윌이 날 아베르누스에서 쫓아다녔을 때는 그저 또 한심한 용병이 나타났다고 생각했거든. 말도 안 되는 소리였지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_MizorasJudgement_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = ca861148-3dbb-22dc-d0fc-9cc940751439
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_MizorasJudgement_CRD_Karlach:ca861148-3dbb-22dc-d0fc-9cc940751439
msgctxt "hf2694c80g22e9g4891g8719g68f3583527c4"
msgid ""
"Hah. Look, I'm sure you'd rather live without 'em, but those babies are "
"absolutely magnificent. As far as I'm concerned, you've never looked better."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_MizorasJudgement_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = e4345514-044c-971a-d41a-3a229c97a210
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_MizorasJudgement_CRD_Karlach:e4345514-044c-971a-d41a-3a229c97a210
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "hc0bd5b8bgc5e8g4a2ega14ag6367b26761fd"
msgid "Oh, I've got your back. Front. Side to side. Name it, and I'm there."
msgstr "아. 내가 너의 뒤를 봐줄게. 앞이든. 옆이든. 말만 해, 거기 있을 테니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_MizorasJudgement_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e6e92703-ca67-e94d-7176-faf1c175c74c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_MizorasJudgement_CRD_Karlach:e6e92703-ca67-e94d-7176-faf1c175c74c
msgctxt "h54543b9dg1f77g47b2g831dg1fb34850c9ed"
msgid "You must be relieved."
msgstr "한시름 덜었겠네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_MizorasJudgement_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ee151374-2160-981f-d800-3bf8627121dd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - WARLOCK(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_MizorasJudgement_CRD_Karlach:ee151374-2160-981f-d800-3bf8627121dd
msgctxt "ha3e990f7g5dcbg492fgae76g517ca7f1e5c2"
msgid "A foolish decision - and now he'll have to pay the consequences."
msgstr "바보 같은 짓이었어, 그리고 이제 그 대가를 치르게 되겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_MizorasJudgement_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = ee64ef21-cdf6-ea06-d9db-978a0393fbfc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_MizorasJudgement_CRD_Karlach:ee64ef21-cdf6-ea06-d9db-978a0393fbfc
msgctxt "hae770a85g0965g473dg83a0gcc6c74b32a02"
msgid ""
"Gobsmacked, really. But grateful. <i>Really </i>grateful. I could learn a "
"thing or two from a man like that. Hopefully we won't turn into mind flayers "
"first."
msgstr ""
"정말 할 말이 없네. 그래도 고마워 하고 있어. <i>진짜로</i>. 그런 사람에게서 나도 배울 게 좀 있을 것 같아. 그 전에 우리가 "
"마인드 플레이어가 되지 않는다면."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_MizorasJudgement_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fb2b28d1-d974-d208-b659-43854c7e667e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_MizorasJudgement_CRD_Karlach:fb2b28d1-d974-d208-b659-43854c7e667e
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h272fbea5g430fg4e7egbe38g34a3b3ebc0b2"
msgid "He's a good man. Maybe the best of us."
msgstr "윌은 좋은 사람이야. 아마 우리 중에 제일 착할지도."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 03e0cce2-106d-7a12-b9e6-d3edc14a5b54
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Astarion:03e0cce2-106d-7a12-b9e6-d3edc14a5b54
msgctxt "h6031953cge896g47dbgb712g52e82fad0a1e"
msgid "The pleasure is all mine. Sweet dreams."
msgstr "내가 좋아서 하는 일인걸. 좋은 꿈 꿔."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 0c0b3093-c430-e374-44d7-62438b9f5587
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Astarion:0c0b3093-c430-e374-44d7-62438b9f5587
msgctxt "h9931ff64gc2e8g4aa3g8821g6c3d8dce5f0a"
msgid "I'll be awake awhile yet. Today has been a lot."
msgstr "아직은 깨어있으려고. 오늘 많은 일을 겪었잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 186dda33-b07c-cee8-e1b8-0a6173cd0d2c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Astarion:186dda33-b07c-cee8-e1b8-0a6173cd0d2c
msgctxt "h6e1c75c8gf044g4458g9a17ga14f1d988a65"
msgid "I'm not tired yet. I'll sleep later."
msgstr "아직은 피곤하지 않아. 나중에 잘 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 1900a520-e02a-df5f-3fa8-8e288a6caf1c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Astarion:1900a520-e02a-df5f-3fa8-8e288a6caf1c
msgctxt "hb011afdeg3e82g4879gb281gfa78aee543dc"
msgid "I need some time to think things through. To process this."
msgstr "곰곰이 생각할 시간이 좀 필요해. 상황을 정리해야지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 2014e031-dd77-125d-14f1-15420b42ff87
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Astarion:2014e031-dd77-125d-14f1-15420b42ff87
msgctxt "he117101ag1183g4b77gae32g9fb75c919a77"
msgid "Ah, no - tea isn't really my drink."
msgstr "아, 아니. 차는 별로 좋아하지 않아서."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2a9ce87f-cfa8-a49b-4dd5-4b0726851a58
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Astarion:2a9ce87f-cfa8-a49b-4dd5-4b0726851a58
msgctxt "h742c6176g9aacg4fbdga030g6f3ee3f02646"
msgid "It's no feather bed, but it'll do."
msgstr "푹신한 잠자리는 아니지만, 이 정도면 됐지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 34c78aec-283b-d0ad-e0d7-9dbf3b7c9b10
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Astarion:34c78aec-283b-d0ad-e0d7-9dbf3b7c9b10
msgctxt "hcde332b3gf7ebg4c3bg971fg8c6ce49bd899"
msgid "Curling up in the dirt and resting is... a little novel."
msgstr "흙바닥에 웅크리고 잠을 잔다는 건... 좀 생소하네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 354a2929-6beb-b636-7040-41a72aec13de
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_Night1_State_SpokenToFirst(1) = True
#.      - CAMP_Night1_State_SpoenToSecond(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_Night1_State_SpoenToSecond(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Astarion:354a2929-6beb-b636-7040-41a72aec13de
msgctxt "h7ebcd280g6249g4812ga3e0g2e9595685a1c"
msgid ""
"Bit of a grim mood tonight. Sounds like the others don't relish the thought "
"of sprouting tentacles."
msgstr "야영지 분위기가 좀 축 쳐져 있네. 돋아날 촉수를 상상하자니 다들 입맛이 썩 좋지 않겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 3a1d6c84-edd0-5a8a-d2c7-ff5925f49a49
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_Night1_Event_GaleSpokenToFirst(1) = True
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_Night1_State_SpokenToFirst(1) = True
#.      - CAMP_Night1_State_SpoenToSecond(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_Night1_State_SpoenToSecond(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Astarion:3a1d6c84-edd0-5a8a-d2c7-ff5925f49a49
msgctxt "hff9370a8gb98dg4450gabc4g4569db5f99ea"
msgid ""
"Your magician seems dour tonight. Must not relish the idea of sprouting "
"tentacles."
msgstr "마법사 녀석, 기분이 꿀꿀한가 봐. 돋아날 촉수를 상상하자니 입맛이 썩 좋지 않겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 4411d4c3-8bca-591e-11a3-d4fd5ab37ab3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_Night1_State_SpokenToFirst(1) = True
#.      - CAMP_Night1_State_SpoenToSecond(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Astarion:4411d4c3-8bca-591e-11a3-d4fd5ab37ab3
msgctxt "h7765f781g5d20g4aa4g9a66g4e5b8c04006d"
msgid "Do you mind? I'm brooding."
msgstr "좀 가 줄래? 지금 생각 중이거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 44e5bd90-9583-ad33-0787-5ef7547cce8e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: !REALLY_ELF
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Astarion:44e5bd90-9583-ad33-0787-5ef7547cce8e
msgctxt "h2e89d0c5g3b65g4ea7g915cgde840b9f29a3"
msgid "You sleep. I'll keep watch."
msgstr "넌 자. 내가 망봐줄게."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 44e5bd90-9583-ad33-0787-5ef7547cce8e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Astarion:44e5bd90-9583-ad33-0787-5ef7547cce8e
msgctxt "h15d235bcg310cg4303gb062g111481fd1610"
msgid "You rest. I'll keep watch."
msgstr "넌 쉬어. 내가 망봐줄게."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 489f8896-f412-d9b5-379f-ce36db3dc139
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Astarion:489f8896-f412-d9b5-379f-ce36db3dc139
msgctxt "h57199715g5c89g48e1g8499g6671ff9e728c"
msgid ""
"I'll be awake awhile anyway. I need some time to think things through. To "
"process this."
msgstr "난 어차피 깨어있을 거야. 곰곰이 생각 좀 해야겠거든. 상황을 정리 해야지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5cbd9aa9-22d4-0b07-76c6-b56171d9e378
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Astarion:5cbd9aa9-22d4-0b07-76c6-b56171d9e378
msgctxt "hafea1285g5337g47c3g9e56g33a0c6abc7c1"
msgid "Thank you. I'll sleep better for that."
msgstr "고마워. 덕분에 편하게 잘 수 있겠네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 6413801f-2c9f-5912-5d88-1adeb290f596
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_Night1_Event_LaezelSpokenToFirst(1) = True
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_Night1_State_SpokenToFirst(1) = True
#.      - CAMP_Night1_State_SpoenToSecond(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_Night1_State_SpoenToSecond(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Astarion:6413801f-2c9f-5912-5d88-1adeb290f596
msgctxt "h2e0bf774gd399g482cg9a36g3fe069f0fa1c"
msgid ""
"Your gith friend seems on edge. Mustn't relish the thought of sprouting "
"tentacles."
msgstr "네 기스 친구, 날이 잔뜩 선 거 같아. 돋아날 촉수를 상상하자니 입맛이 썩 좋지 않겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 6b9af1df-7ce8-9634-e23f-0eae0caf254d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Astarion:6b9af1df-7ce8-9634-e23f-0eae0caf254d
msgctxt "h360aac51gb7bbg4282ga769g95d862c9dfc1"
msgid "No, I'm more than happy to put my feet up. I'm just not used to this."
msgstr "아니, 나도 발 뻗고 쉬고 싶어 죽을 지경이라고. 그냥 이 상황이 생소해서 그렇지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 6e397c66-57fd-b450-4bd5-c1d7148858f8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Astarion:6e397c66-57fd-b450-4bd5-c1d7148858f8
msgctxt "hc4512b5ag0dbdg40ccgb581g071de4db3726"
msgid "I'm in no place to rest yet. Today has been a lot."
msgstr "아직은 쉴 기분 아니야. 오늘 많은 일을 겪었잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 743a9940-255b-f4de-f10a-d63fa2c2cc98
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Astarion:743a9940-255b-f4de-f10a-d63fa2c2cc98
msgctxt "h02cf3668g29b6g4853g8183g95a07efb472d"
msgid "Keep walking if you want. I'm getting some rest."
msgstr "계속 길 가고 싶으면 맘대로 해. 난 좀 쉬어야겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 74f74131-a3b4-165c-364b-2e6fa7ac2bd5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DRUID or MONK or RANGER
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Astarion:74f74131-a3b4-165c-364b-2e6fa7ac2bd5
msgctxt "h368db382g3977g46edg9d7ag027d7b071875"
msgid "The right herbs can make a soothing tea, if you can't settle in."
msgstr "마음이 심란하다면, 알맞은 약초를 써서 진정 효과가 있는 차를 만들어 줄 수 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 82ca3cd9-5dcc-e653-20b2-63e49e673e4c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_Night1_Event_ShadowheartSpokenToFirst(1) = True
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_Night1_State_SpokenToFirst(1) = True
#.      - CAMP_Night1_State_SpoenToSecond(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_Night1_State_SpoenToSecond(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Astarion:82ca3cd9-5dcc-e653-20b2-63e49e673e4c
msgctxt "h706d5866gff00g4fcdgb533g37680aeb2eaf"
msgid ""
"Shadowheart seems jumpy. Must not relish the thought of sprouting tentacles."
msgstr "섀도하트가 예민해 보이는데. 돋아날 촉수를 상상하자니 입맛이 썩 좋지 않겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 8f219899-848f-e2a1-b180-331857ef4b49
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Astarion:8f219899-848f-e2a1-b180-331857ef4b49
msgctxt "h7b9ba117gf3e0g414ag86c2ga2d7d7434fc6"
msgid "Suit yourself. Sweet dreams."
msgstr "좋을 대로 해. 좋은 꿈 꿔."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 901a005f-91bd-8562-fefe-c8e56347225f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_Night1_State_SpokenToFirst(1) = False
#.      - CAMP_Night1_State_SpoenToSecond(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CAMP_Night1_Event_AstarionSpokenToFirst(1) = True
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_Night1_State_SpokenToFirst(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Astarion:901a005f-91bd-8562-fefe-c8e56347225f
msgctxt "ha88851f8g8d83g48acgb591g384c458335d9"
msgid "So, we're resting here? Turning in for the night?"
msgstr "우리 여기서 쉬는 거야? 이런 데서 눈을 붙이겠다고?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 93a4977b-6e5a-1bb5-5d62-07697de71d88
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Astarion:93a4977b-6e5a-1bb5-5d62-07697de71d88
msgctxt "hbe1969bfg9a70g4a5fg98feg10b6f3524bbb"
msgid ""
"I suppose. I'm not sure what I expected, really. This is all a little new."
msgstr "그럴지도. 사실 내가 뭘 기대한 건지도 잘 모르겠네. 내겐 이 모든 게 좀 낯설어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9b926873-82dd-fe5e-2afe-6632f246e236
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Astarion:9b926873-82dd-fe5e-2afe-6632f246e236
msgctxt "h53541798g1335g4eb8gb807g54969d725cb4"
msgid "Give it a try. We'll need to be fresh tomorrow."
msgstr "이참에 해 봐. 내일 맑은 정신으로 채비해야 한다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a38e98db-9c83-7931-6e59-1851584126db
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Astarion:a38e98db-9c83-7931-6e59-1851584126db
msgctxt "h698eee58g6566g4589g9c41gd5a089863d74"
msgid "Rest or don't. It's up to you."
msgstr "쉬든지 말든지. 네가 알아서 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = ad57c04d-d364-d661-4824-5c383b4c47e6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Astarion:ad57c04d-d364-d661-4824-5c383b4c47e6
msgctxt "hfae4645fge98bg4daeg9746g15c27e17d5a6"
msgid "But suit yourself. I'm sure we'll drift off at some point."
msgstr "뭐, 좋을 대로 해. 너나 나나 언젠가는 곯아떨어질 건데, 뭐."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = afa51187-3f64-4810-408b-f6e20b9e45d3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Astarion:afa51187-3f64-4810-408b-f6e20b9e45d3
msgctxt "hb0854f73g1683g4b01g9f9dg5454f53389cb"
msgid ""
"Understandable. Can't say I'm a fan either. It's just hard to join in when "
"all of this feels so new."
msgstr "이해는 가. 나도 그 생각하면 질색인걸. 이 모든 게 내겐 너무 낯설어서 같이 어울리기 힘들 뿐이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = b66ca462-3138-5054-72ad-31b9629ba63a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Astarion:b66ca462-3138-5054-72ad-31b9629ba63a
msgctxt "h228d0fc5g62a4g4d34g8e04gd185b874bf87"
msgid "You know, if you want to spend time with me you only have to say so."
msgstr "있잖아, 나랑 같이 시간 보내고 싶은 거라면 그냥 그렇다고 말하라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d0a4053e-cb70-d4f6-8c45-c8ef6d05e596
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Astarion:d0a4053e-cb70-d4f6-8c45-c8ef6d05e596
msgctxt "h98db2dd5g7710g4b5aga1cag0a015f37545c"
msgid "What? You've never slept in the woods before?"
msgstr "왜 그래? 숲속에서 자는 게 처음이야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e6122a94-141d-1f5e-6bd0-234ffd08ce56
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: !REALLY_ELF
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Astarion:e6122a94-141d-1f5e-6bd0-234ffd08ce56
msgctxt "h6ee1cc47g2262g4d90g829bg3f5730aca7d4"
msgid "We'll both stay up. I'm not ready to turn my back on a stranger."
msgstr "나도 깨어있을 거야. 낯선 녀석한테 내 안위를 맡길 준비는 안 됐거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e6122a94-141d-1f5e-6bd0-234ffd08ce56
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Astarion:e6122a94-141d-1f5e-6bd0-234ffd08ce56
msgctxt "hb2821f8dg7828g42eaga4c8gb05d8cd8fc8e"
msgid "We'll both stay up. I'm not sleeping helpless in front of a stranger."
msgstr "나도 깨어있을 거야. 낯선 녀석 앞에서 마음 놓고 곯아떨어질 생각은 없거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = e83255a1-3f76-4aa0-5fa0-8db0d047c6a1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Astarion:e83255a1-3f76-4aa0-5fa0-8db0d047c6a1
msgctxt "h52442ce3g52e4g4932gbe72gacaa23ec2160"
msgid "It's all a little new to me, I admit."
msgstr "솔직히 내겐 이 모든 게 좀 낯설어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = ef516a18-bffc-4ea0-5ec7-73d283cdb7c4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Astarion:ef516a18-bffc-4ea0-5ec7-73d283cdb7c4
msgctxt "h0f89bb6bgf49fg4bd7gb77fge2f784836665"
msgid "The night normally means bustling streets, bursting taverns."
msgstr "내게 밤이란 보통 북적거리는 거리나, 떠들썩한 주점을 내포하거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 071ceaac-735e-54cc-610d-0f485b814c78
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Gale:071ceaac-735e-54cc-610d-0f485b814c78
msgctxt "h1263c580g798fg4956gb8adg39073086dc9a"
msgid "Oh. Nothing, nothing. I'm just poorly making a point."
msgstr "아. 아니, 아니야. 말이 좀 잘못 전달된 것 같네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 164bed16-fa2f-b902-e584-5429d6d33602
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Gale:164bed16-fa2f-b902-e584-5429d6d33602
msgctxt "h76d55357gbf1eg4c90g986agaeef625d0f3f"
msgid "What a difference a day makes."
msgstr "그랬던 게 하루 만에 이리 달라질 줄이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 206aa89c-6ecf-4381-3f57-135e9fe943da
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Gale:206aa89c-6ecf-4381-3f57-135e9fe943da
msgctxt "h97f73edfg07afg486egb89bg3860d7c8d36d"
msgid "Hah. You're a good sport."
msgstr "하. 넉살 참 좋은걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 23f3f0eb-c169-0f36-7f97-d35944952da2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Gale:23f3f0eb-c169-0f36-7f97-d35944952da2
msgctxt "h3416fb59gcbdbg471cga5a3g89d52539e6d2"
msgid ""
"'Go to Hell.' An everyday expression. So trivial it's almost meaningless."
msgstr "'지옥에나 떨어져'. 자주 쓰이는 표현이지. 너무 식상해서 그 의미가 잘 와닿지도 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 274d8a78-8504-ec2b-e1a5-569c28351c07
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Gale:274d8a78-8504-ec2b-e1a5-569c28351c07
msgctxt "hd0acde12gb3e1g49e9g8001gcdebe7fe8c09"
msgid "You sound a tad more dejected than when we first met."
msgstr "처음 만났을 때랑 비교하면 조금 풀이 죽은 거 같은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 315c97aa-9f7a-c4e5-0dc4-1c9c2e610752
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Gale:315c97aa-9f7a-c4e5-0dc4-1c9c2e610752
msgctxt "ha7e23481ge461g481cgaabfgf7b3f1f3d540"
msgid "Perhaps you should get some rest."
msgstr "너 좀 쉬어야 할 거 같아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 338e7cf8-2e8d-c7a5-d285-9aa3294c993a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Gale:338e7cf8-2e8d-c7a5-d285-9aa3294c993a
msgctxt "hb1ca98deg01a6g49dfg90fdgfb817f2a3c54"
msgid "Was there anything in particular I did to deserve such a greeting?"
msgstr "내가 그런 말 들을 정도로 뭔 잘못이라도 저질렀던가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 39dfd3c7-3b80-7a37-b864-d658543eba22
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Gale:39dfd3c7-3b80-7a37-b864-d658543eba22
msgctxt "h7664e9dag8349g4f36ga869g15655c66858b"
msgid "This ballet of flames invites reflection. But you're right."
msgstr "이 춤추는 불길을 보니 성찰할 게 생겨서 말이야. 그래도 네 말이 맞아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 573f80a0-a7c9-2440-def7-78ef26e4f599
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Gale:573f80a0-a7c9-2440-def7-78ef26e4f599
msgctxt "h1fff78e6g99f8g46acgb6feg70f2ee8dd419"
msgid ""
"Devils, dragons, mind flayers - they used to be abstracts. Pictures on a "
"piece of paper."
msgstr "데빌, 드래곤, 마인드 플레이어. 그건 추상적인 존재들이었어. 삽화에서나 볼 수 있는 존재였다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 5a3a1432-3725-2bb1-d95d-be4472b6a94f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Gale:5a3a1432-3725-2bb1-d95d-be4472b6a94f
msgctxt "h70738de8g10b3g4c2egbb5cg2e8951917668"
msgid "Go to Hell."
msgstr "지옥에나 떨어져."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5a6bdd40-32f0-aabc-8346-9d5d05223169
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Gale:5a6bdd40-32f0-aabc-8346-9d5d05223169
msgctxt "h5ae1be7dga59ag4dacga190g40f58154b5aa"
msgid "What can I say but that you're right? We're in deep you-know-what."
msgstr "뭐라 할 것 없이 동감만 드네. 우리 깊숙이 처박혀 있는 '그걸' 생각하면 말이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 616fe9ff-7528-9d9d-befc-f67fa20ecc98
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Gale:616fe9ff-7528-9d9d-befc-f67fa20ecc98
msgctxt "ha10b3c8egd8aag45c1gaab3g720509f17c73"
msgid ""
"I'll wake you bright and early. We'll need to find a healer before the wee "
"one gets hungry."
msgstr "아침 일찍 깨워 줄게. 머릿속 쪼끄만 게 배고파지기 전에 치유사를 찾아내야지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6d4c1351-3e01-bc16-8d95-d7b2ba833987
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Gale:6d4c1351-3e01-bc16-8d95-d7b2ba833987
msgctxt "hfd3ad252g1e9bg427fgb409g56895c74e6c8"
msgid "And good evening to you too."
msgstr "그렇게 반겨주니 나도 반갑네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6da3e9dd-19bc-ee36-b5a9-df8edcf2c6d7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Gale:6da3e9dd-19bc-ee36-b5a9-df8edcf2c6d7
msgctxt "h5d4f4e8egd374g4f37g9556ge5dc3a84b67e"
msgid "Watch your damn mouth!"
msgstr "아가리 함부로 놀리지 마!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 6eee3ae9-beb0-4803-f771-2f40bcd303ca
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Gale:6eee3ae9-beb0-4803-f771-2f40bcd303ca
msgctxt "hc6b50e42g9f74g46fdga023g14cc99da32d4"
msgid ""
"That's the spirit. Let's be up with the lark - find a healer before the wee "
"one gets hungry."
msgstr "바로 그 정신이지. 아침 일찍 일어나자. 머릿속 쪼끄만 게 배고파지기 전에 치유사를 찾아내자고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 71690556-7b77-c2b2-e09f-e8769716ec55
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Gale:71690556-7b77-c2b2-e09f-e8769716ec55
msgctxt "hc0b2af74g13dcg4caag8270g067d1d17b935"
msgid "But we've seen Hell. It's real. And it isn't trivial."
msgstr "근데 우린 지옥을 직접 봤어. 진짜를 말이야. 그건 식상하지 않더라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 7220ec0e-4fc8-38be-f021-33cd282f1487
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Gale:7220ec0e-4fc8-38be-f021-33cd282f1487
msgctxt "h11d8873ag5223g47d4gba25g4140edec7630"
msgid "Merely contemplating."
msgstr "그냥 생각에 잠긴 것뿐이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 72e7bf5a-60e9-bbbd-31ff-6617bb79ff0e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Gale:72e7bf5a-60e9-bbbd-31ff-6617bb79ff0e
msgctxt "h4b11c674g9f8eg4e5fgac68g3e13d1010577"
msgid "That's not abstract."
msgstr "그건 추상적이지도 않지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 8340762f-82ba-1608-f024-54de30ae97f5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Gale:8340762f-82ba-1608-f024-54de30ae97f5
msgctxt "h8bd2a659gfd5fg411bg9f77g999ee7178127"
msgid ""
"Let's be up with the lark - find a healer before the wee one gets hungry."
msgstr "아침 일찍 일어나자. 머릿속 쪼끄만 게 배고파지기 전에 치유사를 찾아내자고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 945587d4-6540-96e1-0548-4c110f797aa7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Gale:945587d4-6540-96e1-0548-4c110f797aa7
msgctxt "hd658e09fg794eg4612g932agda3fe43005b6"
msgid "Point well-made, I see."
msgstr "내 뜻이 잘 전달됐나 보군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 975da3ab-294c-dfb0-e6b2-152992d8e997
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Gale:975da3ab-294c-dfb0-e6b2-152992d8e997
msgctxt "h29929bc8g1b3eg48ddg9716ga23a1067be6c"
msgid "Hold your horses! I'm just poorly making a point."
msgstr "잠깐 진정해! 아무래도 말이 잘못 전달된 것 같네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = a11ccad4-2105-2250-9a58-b34ffcb77d8b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Gale:a11ccad4-2105-2250-9a58-b34ffcb77d8b
msgctxt "he6f0e1b7gcd39g4de3g8aa6ga44a7c7d4595"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a7d5bc98-9c0c-618c-8b51-ac64f155cc29
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Gale:a7d5bc98-9c0c-618c-8b51-ac64f155cc29
msgctxt "h0af15dcagd34cg43b7g9b26g1cd701693a50"
msgid "<i>Watch the flames in silence.</i>"
msgstr "<i>조용히 불꽃을 바라본다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c0d02e2f-0e8e-b8c4-d872-2ccc726f5e7d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Gale:c0d02e2f-0e8e-b8c4-d872-2ccc726f5e7d
msgctxt "hac6f35c1g4a41g40a9gb330gca042d0821a7"
msgid "Brooding will get us nowhere. Action will."
msgstr "축 쳐져있어 봤자 아무 도움 안 돼. 행동을 해야지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c696b70f-968d-b83a-5d08-f2aad7105b98
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Gale:c696b70f-968d-b83a-5d08-f2aad7105b98
msgctxt "h53835e15g0a39g4686g925eg68a3b6759155"
msgid "What's on your mind, Gale?"
msgstr "뭐 때문에 그러는 거야, 게일?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = d546c878-61f4-3a48-d71f-bd196e25aa74
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Gale:d546c878-61f4-3a48-d71f-bd196e25aa74
msgctxt "h8de0ce14gb265g4ebag91a5gc10206dbc39f"
msgid ""
"Now we have tadpoles slithering through our heads like carnivorous foeti."
msgstr "이젠 태아라도 된 것처럼 머릿속을 헤집고 다니는 올챙이를 품은 신세까지 됐어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e00464c0-0784-1aaf-c9b2-dc8eeeaca55a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Gale:e00464c0-0784-1aaf-c9b2-dc8eeeaca55a
msgctxt "h2fc59379ged81g4fb4g83c8g32cc6411bb0c"
msgid "I'm not too worried. We'll find someone who can help us."
msgstr "난 별로 걱정되지 않아. 도와줄 사람을 찾고야 말 테니까 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 0354c41b-1a73-0c58-9f24-1d25cc7bc361
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Karlach:0354c41b-1a73-0c58-9f24-1d25cc7bc361
msgctxt "h3f77ed49g5923g41c5gb3f5gae7033c809c2"
msgid ""
"<i>Gods, </i>my bed looks so good I could cry. Goodnight, sleep tight, don't "
"let the lemures bite."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 0c92433b-65a2-598b-c2a1-a7460050ed25
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Karlach:0c92433b-65a2-598b-c2a1-a7460050ed25
msgctxt "ha7d94f7dgeca3g44d6g9eb6gb2e7746bf12a"
msgid ""
"Either way, it's pretty interesting. If I turn into a mind flayer tomorrow, "
"I can't say it wasn't an exciting ride."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 2544c84e-ffb0-6516-5b6a-dbe5cd374549
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Karlach:2544c84e-ffb0-6516-5b6a-dbe5cd374549
msgctxt "h2650e7c1g1b9dg431eg9835gc1c0bdde6d39"
msgid "And proud."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 310bdcff-40ed-d56e-936b-a8c4b14b109f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CAMP_Night1_State_KarlachSpokenToFirst(1) = True
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_Night1_State_SpokenToFirst(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Karlach:310bdcff-40ed-d56e-936b-a8c4b14b109f
msgctxt "h3f1bdadcg8e37g47c6g93b3g84d0fb5d076a"
msgid "Haven't gone camping since I was a little girl. Very exciting."
msgstr "어렸을 때 이후로 한 번도 야영해 본 적이 없어. 이거 엄청 신나는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 38b7ff24-0d6e-aa7c-58b6-b66d4a097608
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Karlach:38b7ff24-0d6e-aa7c-58b6-b66d4a097608
msgctxt "h40c32682gc597g4024g867fg7b40873e648e"
msgid ""
"Guess we ought to rest up, eh soldier? If today's been any indication, "
"tomorrow's going to keep us on our toes."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 39c3fcb7-21b4-f1a2-5221-b3c31120d9ad
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Karlach:39c3fcb7-21b4-f1a2-5221-b3c31120d9ad
msgctxt "h9d763785g55eag4a08g8903gd2b5d3a3abdf"
msgid "Happy hunting."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 3c40b1bd-8f49-72c8-ed7e-d141e333d1fe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Karlach:3c40b1bd-8f49-72c8-ed7e-d141e333d1fe
msgctxt "h538b855agba43g4100gb655g45b4848247eb"
msgid ""
"Me either. I've got a lot of living to do, and I'm going to need my horn for "
"most of it."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 4c77af26-5761-1303-95ca-8388e758d450
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Karlach:4c77af26-5761-1303-95ca-8388e758d450
msgctxt "ha9eb938dge71ag4610g8536g75b044019ab1"
msgid "A-thank you. Very happy indeed."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 66b9141a-40e1-8c75-edca-85c0f96ea98a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Karlach:66b9141a-40e1-8c75-edca-85c0f96ea98a
msgctxt "hcbaa54d4ga066g48fdgaab4gdc7c76227a36"
msgid ""
"Guess you can't have it all. To be honest, a fire, a bit of nature, and a "
"bedroll of my own is more than enough - more than I thought I'd ever have."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 72cd2f69-8735-853b-6e68-8ba7d43349a9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Karlach:72cd2f69-8735-853b-6e68-8ba7d43349a9
msgctxt "hc21bfdf5ga0e7g4eb8g80c0g83709159985a"
msgid "Good night, sleep tight, don't let the lemures bite."
msgstr "잘 자, 좋은 꿈 꾸고, 레무어 안 물리게 조심해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 77c88369-7027-6a24-f0d3-3a9b0d2f7e17
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Karlach:77c88369-7027-6a24-f0d3-3a9b0d2f7e17
msgctxt "h22ea1f28g04c7g4076g95d6g1dec5b92c77b"
msgid ""
"Ah-ah. If <i>I'm </i>a mind flayer, <i>you </i>are too. Checkmate, spots."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 7d0edbb3-a418-f1d8-57bb-fcd9f4aedbdf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Karlach:7d0edbb3-a418-f1d8-57bb-fcd9f4aedbdf
msgctxt "hb4d92e3dgadcdg486bg8954g650890220a80"
msgid ""
"Rough. You've seen Avernus - nothing but rocks and evil pricks as far as the "
"eye can see."
msgstr "대충 잤지 뭐. 아베르누스 봤잖아. 눈에 보이는 거라곤 바위랑 나쁜 놈들밖에 없는 곳이라는 걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 83485831-eaa6-8fb1-81d7-322637c1ad33
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Karlach:83485831-eaa6-8fb1-81d7-322637c1ad33
msgctxt "h7290a799gf93ag4a7fg85dbgf831e067b611"
msgid ""
"Never thought I'd be so keen to take orders from a future mind flayer. But "
"that's tomorrow's problem, isn't it? Right now I'm not worried about "
"anything but where these pyjamas came from."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 84835462-7d53-3d26-4b7e-95fb3ef905de
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Karlach:84835462-7d53-3d26-4b7e-95fb3ef905de
msgctxt "h9619dbf3g5b8bg4d0dg8656g0d5d1797a97b"
msgid "Where'd you sleep in the Hells?"
msgstr "지옥에 있을 때는 어디서 잤어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 87ffa9f7-5644-929a-9da4-2c7904b2c74e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Karlach:87ffa9f7-5644-929a-9da4-2c7904b2c74e
msgctxt "h94071c85gf1eag440aga23fg4cbe0adb6b4b"
msgid ""
"So no campfire songs and ghost stories for ol' Karlach. Damn, I thought I "
"was <i>out </i>of the Hells."
msgstr ""
"그러니까 다 큰 칼라크를 위한 캠프파이어 노래나 무서운 이야기는 없다 이거구나. 젠장, 분명 지옥 <i>밖</i>에 나와 있다 생각했는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 8acdc18a-4c36-b3c4-938d-b27b7438d427
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_Night1_Event_AstarionSpokenToFirst(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Karlach:8acdc18a-4c36-b3c4-938d-b27b7438d427
msgctxt "h1549b9e6ga660g467dg974dge29fae0a9b88"
msgid ""
"Astarion's a riot, isn't he? Reminds me of a noble I knew back in the Gate. "
"Wit like a dagger, hair like my granny."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8b23a329-02f6-57f5-36f6-71bc6900eebf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Karlach:8b23a329-02f6-57f5-36f6-71bc6900eebf
msgctxt "h753ca254g70c7g4b1dg87c0g48693fc2ce19"
msgid "No one's turning into a mind flayer - least of all me."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8bdaba11-69fd-bf7a-3e1f-41f50b4500b1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Karlach:8bdaba11-69fd-bf7a-3e1f-41f50b4500b1
msgctxt "hdbfce682g33f1g4d44ga7d5gbeffc1a8bf09"
msgid "It's been a while for me, too. This is all so unusual."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 92b7e35a-8361-a5b3-2a00-060f437e8139
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_Night1_State_SpoenToSecond(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Karlach:92b7e35a-8361-a5b3-2a00-060f437e8139
msgctxt "hcb97243fg8455g4ebegbba7gb3cd3d5eaae6"
msgid "Hey, soldier. Doing the rounds?"
msgstr "어이, 신참. 순찰 중이야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 92e138f9-7546-0bdd-0817-afc82db62036
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Karlach:92e138f9-7546-0bdd-0817-afc82db62036
msgctxt "h75b8c6b9gf587g4933g98b5g8e193a1a3bfc"
msgid ""
"If I turn into a mind flayer tomorrow, I'll at least have gone out on a high "
"note."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 933124c0-02a8-263f-761a-5d58e73c1cc0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Karlach:933124c0-02a8-263f-761a-5d58e73c1cc0
msgctxt "h6c208736gfa8ag4f21g8e93g438bea2a20a6"
msgid "You're easily pleased."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9550c2a8-c812-f545-7cfb-2e1fea06dc1f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Karlach:9550c2a8-c812-f545-7cfb-2e1fea06dc1f
msgctxt "h269b1551gaf34g4007gbdf2g2d84622672c4"
msgid "This isn't <i>camping </i>- it's making camp."
msgstr "이건 <i>야영</i>이 아니야. 야영지를 만드는 거라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = a6c955db-6af2-37ba-e6d3-ee25572a4593
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_Night1_Event_ShadowheartSpokenToFirst(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Karlach:a6c955db-6af2-37ba-e6d3-ee25572a4593
msgctxt "h5bf0afbeg8f1ag49d9gb920g0501fc9f0b3b"
msgid ""
"Couldn't help but overhear you and Shadowheart earlier. She's a little "
"prickly, but I like her."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = a7d75d49-b569-4497-9686-3d56f2e45015
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_Night1_State_SpokenToFirst(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_Night1_State_SpoenToSecond(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Karlach:a7d75d49-b569-4497-9686-3d56f2e45015
msgctxt "h05dfd2b2g2cb7g4e3eg8772g5f7717ef0cbd"
msgid "Hey, soldier. Doing the rounds before bed, ey?"
msgstr "어이, 신참. 잠들기 전에 순찰이라도 도는 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b3dbaa75-7c2f-b077-8e4d-6b99afe1acc6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Karlach:b3dbaa75-7c2f-b077-8e4d-6b99afe1acc6
msgctxt "h537b6bacg4c44g403egb11dgaf0f452407e6"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = bc8dff96-1c13-d16c-e8ef-5042108da527
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_Night1_Event_WyllSpokenToFirst(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Karlach:bc8dff96-1c13-d16c-e8ef-5042108da527
msgctxt "h2a350faeg26ceg48aag9cf0gc4e3ab6b162d"
msgid ""
"I considered going to make nice with Wyll, but I thought he might want a "
"little space from little old me."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = bc9c7b1c-4c73-cee1-185c-52c4b301a327
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Karlach:bc9c7b1c-4c73-cee1-185c-52c4b301a327
msgctxt "h28c712d0gd8c3g4836g89e2g0250d4e9e77b"
msgid ""
"But this - a fire, a bit of nature, and a spot to call my own - this is "
"<i>nice.</i>"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = c8707b75-620d-2519-4aa1-272b4bfbd356
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Karlach:c8707b75-620d-2519-4aa1-272b4bfbd356
msgctxt "h5db2fa6fg8cbeg4d40g872eg33b4b23b27f1"
msgid ""
"Damn straight we are. I've got a lot of living to do, and I'm going to need "
"my horn for most of it."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = c98ccfa5-21dc-bee2-37a7-cb66044bd7f3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_Night1_Event_GaleSpokenToFirst(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Karlach:c98ccfa5-21dc-bee2-37a7-cb66044bd7f3
msgctxt "ha6e83651g5901g4bebgab48gd35066e97dcc"
msgid ""
"Gale's pretty lost in his thoughts, isn't he. Poor guy. Roughing it like "
"this can't be his style."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = d9839c48-aa78-6c69-e699-4f89718774f8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Karlach:d9839c48-aa78-6c69-e699-4f89718774f8
msgctxt "hd330076fgedcbg4c0bg94efg6ba5850bc12c"
msgid ""
"You're doing a good job keeping this merry band of freaks together. Good "
"leaders are hard to come by, you know."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = e47968b2-8f7e-338a-4c5c-9ff9a64fc1e9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Karlach:e47968b2-8f7e-338a-4c5c-9ff9a64fc1e9
msgctxt "hda682553gd810g4dd4gb99bga61aceaab7bb"
msgid ""
"You can say that again. Weird turn after weird turn, with the occasional "
"twist of luck on top. Someone out there's either looking out for us, or "
"fucking with us."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = eae0385c-20e8-1a8d-6948-adfb37b1c8bc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Karlach:eae0385c-20e8-1a8d-6948-adfb37b1c8bc
msgctxt "hb9f2c2a6geac1g4919gad88ge78358651a15"
msgid "That won't happen - we're going to find a cure."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f3469dba-e638-a7eb-6d55-02ad30dfedbe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Karlach:f3469dba-e638-a7eb-6d55-02ad30dfedbe
msgctxt "he0a8dab9g7c53g41d5gbcebgc58ca280eb68"
msgid "If you turn into a mind flayer tomorrow, I will take your head."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f9bd1ca6-f464-9897-0f7f-6498634e32d7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Karlach:f9bd1ca6-f464-9897-0f7f-6498634e32d7
msgctxt "hd62496b6ga416g4a04g8be8g69d7f06ff671"
msgid "Good night, Karlach."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = fcf57c69-85da-d363-75f2-56dda91a1b41
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_Night1_Event_LaezelSpokenToFirst(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Karlach:fcf57c69-85da-d363-75f2-56dda91a1b41
msgctxt "hb28483ffg28c4g4277g818agab5ee8971a56"
msgid ""
"Almost went to chat up the githyanki myself, but then I thought - you know "
"what, Karlach? You don't need to lose a finger tonight. You just got home."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 1d5c54a7-e50e-376c-b2f7-f11fe72c3d20
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CAMP_Night1_Event_LaezelSpokenToFirst(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Laezel:1d5c54a7-e50e-376c-b2f7-f11fe72c3d20
msgctxt "h520aad63g1eb8g416fg9a2dga03063eb6cf3"
msgid "Be quick about your rest. We must locate a crèche."
msgstr "쉬려거든 짧게 마쳐라. 우린 양성소를 찾아 나서야 한다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 238d7eaa-0de9-f64f-0dac-fa08c384a502
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ELF
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Laezel:238d7eaa-0de9-f64f-0dac-fa08c384a502
msgctxt "hb1155f52gdb86g492eg98c4gaf4bce231f07"
msgid "We're hardly going to turn while taking a rest... are we?"
msgstr "설마 쉬는 동안에 변이되기라도 하겠어? ...안 그래?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 238d7eaa-0de9-f64f-0dac-fa08c384a502
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Laezel:238d7eaa-0de9-f64f-0dac-fa08c384a502
msgctxt "hf50fed27g5ba6g4ee7ga6a4g2901022b7065"
msgid "We're hardly going to turn in our sleep... are we?"
msgstr "설마 자는 동안에 변이되기라도 하겠어? ...안 그래?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 33bed7d4-ae6b-0819-d15c-47189365ecdc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Laezel:33bed7d4-ae6b-0819-d15c-47189365ecdc
msgctxt "he05d1b09g86d8g4a1bgbb45gc623a3ef51a0"
msgid ""
"I do <i>not</i> trust a common healer to extract a <i>ghaik</i> tadpole "
"without killing its host. At a crèche, a <i>ghustil</i> may cleanse us - "
"safely."
msgstr ""
"평범한 치유사에게 <i>게이크</i> 올챙이를 무사히 적출할 실력 따위 있을 리 없다. 양성소에 가면, <i>거스틸</i>이 우리를 "
"정화해 줄 거야. 무사히 말이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 3d192056-f63a-b311-ca73-d25820c3a0f1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Laezel:3d192056-f63a-b311-ca73-d25820c3a0f1
msgctxt "h43b1cbabg8ee0g4a5agb1b2gdd771efac4d8"
msgid "I did not expect you to prove quite so... fragile."
msgstr "네가 이 정도로 나약해 빠진 줄은... 몰랐는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 408239a0-134f-ce05-e86e-76d852f6c362
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Laezel:408239a0-134f-ce05-e86e-76d852f6c362
msgctxt "h6490dfc5g46eag4c82gb060gca703d19043d"
msgid "Take your rest. I will stand watch."
msgstr "넌 쉬어라. 난 망을 보겠다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 4259d764-591c-3a13-2d8e-a92c07d37dbf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_Night1_State_SpokenToFirst(1) = False
#.      - CAMP_Night1_State_SpoenToSecond(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_Night1_State_SpokenToFirst(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Laezel:4259d764-591c-3a13-2d8e-a92c07d37dbf
msgctxt "h324643d4g2a10g4e79gb527gc42586d47bd8"
msgid "A monster forms inside us, and you think to be idle?"
msgstr "우리 안에 괴물이 자라고 있는데, 이리 빈둥거려도 될 것 같나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 4cfeb33e-a709-4af0-d25b-86193f002ba3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_Night1_State_SpokenToFirst(1) = True
#.      - CAMP_Night1_State_SpoenToSecond(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_Night1_State_SpoenToSecond(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Laezel:4cfeb33e-a709-4af0-d25b-86193f002ba3
msgctxt "h134d5437g6559g43bag8463ga4cb0dca3802"
msgid "A monster forms inside us, yet you waste time with idle chatter."
msgstr "우리 안에 괴물이 자라고 있는데, 쓸데없는 잡담으로 시간 낭비하는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 5a4795c3-2dad-89db-664a-231b137dd5b3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Laezel:5a4795c3-2dad-89db-664a-231b137dd5b3
msgctxt "hebdc561agd712g4816gbee2gc1a975915956"
msgid "A thickheaded notion in a complex circumstance."
msgstr "어수선한 상황에서 우러난 아둔한 발상이군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 60c39294-4a10-f5ac-a21a-0190db91b09f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Laezel:60c39294-4a10-f5ac-a21a-0190db91b09f
msgctxt "hdb573d96g66d8g40e0g9ff7gcb4ac602041e"
msgid ""
"We need to pace ourselves. Don't you know an exhausted warrior is an "
"ineffective one?"
msgstr "쉴 때는 쉬어 둬야지. 기진맥진한 전사는 무력한 법인 거 몰라?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 6b0dbef3-9632-b5a1-65f7-7a267cfc169d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Laezel:6b0dbef3-9632-b5a1-65f7-7a267cfc169d
msgctxt "h7385aee5gd1a0g4e2agb25fgab09b4511d61"
msgid ""
"The parasites inside us do not rest. Even as we speak, they defile our "
"brains and warp our bones."
msgstr "우리 안의 기생충은 휴식 따위 하지 않는다. 지금 이 순간에도, 우리 뇌를 오염시키고 뼈를 뒤틀고 있겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 6f969ac4-9d63-25ce-1962-8b87851aca6e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Laezel:6f969ac4-9d63-25ce-1962-8b87851aca6e
msgctxt "h93a30508g5b16g4863g967fg384898cb9a0e"
msgid ""
"Should a single tentacle split your skull, I will not hesitate to end you."
msgstr "촉수 하나라도 네 두개골을 뚫고 나오면, 단숨에 널 끝장내버릴 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9e7ed655-eb6e-6644-31e3-05573d0b1fcc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Laezel:9e7ed655-eb6e-6644-31e3-05573d0b1fcc
msgctxt "h6b20435bg1fbbg4d9cgb37egbacacfae638c"
msgid "This crèche notion of yours - are you sure it's our only option?"
msgstr "네가 말하는 그 양성소 말인데, 그게 유일한 방법인 게 확실해?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = ad085405-94f5-6eca-f1e5-c856296255f5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Laezel:ad085405-94f5-6eca-f1e5-c856296255f5
msgctxt "hd0f769fdg2aa5g4d5cg9772g3b69d3e28ea4"
msgid "I knew your kind to be fragile. But I didn't foresee the severity."
msgstr "너희 종자의 나약함은 알고 있었다만, 이렇게나 심각한 줄은 몰랐군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = bc56bebb-bd7e-b9e5-f0f9-18b5ff2a763d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Laezel:bc56bebb-bd7e-b9e5-f0f9-18b5ff2a763d
msgctxt "h1187741fgfc8bg46d1g9f9cg6bde1eedfa5f"
msgid "You would doubt me?"
msgstr "날 의심하는 거냐?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = eab391ef-941d-5e94-269c-2c5c961bfcf9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Laezel:eab391ef-941d-5e94-269c-2c5c961bfcf9
msgctxt "h7fee5f48g1217g43ccgb3a4g738aae740983"
msgid ""
"Do you suppose the parasites inside us dare to rest? That the <i>ghaik</i> "
"do not still pursue us with each peal of the bell?"
msgstr "우리 안의 기생충이 휴식 따위 할 것 같으냐? 지금 이 순간에도 <i>게이크</i> 놈들이 따라붙고 있지 않다고 여기나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = f1aba91c-8626-e68e-e662-6433573d5a76
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_ThingLikeMe_Event_ToldAboutCreche = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CAMP_Night1_Event_LaezelSpokenToFirst(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Laezel:f1aba91c-8626-e68e-e662-6433573d5a76
msgctxt "hf5e1b874g92c7g48a6g95cega9266d4b2790"
msgid "Be quick about your rest. We must hurry towards the crèche."
msgstr "쉬려거든 짧게 마쳐라. 우린 시급히 양성소로 가야 한다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Narrator
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 2b6021d4-554b-29c4-ce0b-97254c936de0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Narrator:2b6021d4-554b-29c4-ce0b-97254c936de0
msgctxt "h7117e5f7g1371g4f3eg813fg51134be99594"
msgid ""
"*You're sure you can feel the parasite tickling your skull. How long before "
"your limbs start to twist and knot? How long before tentacles erupt from "
"your face?*"
msgstr ""
"*기생충이 두개골을 간지럽히는 것이 확실히 느껴집니다. 사지가 뒤틀리고 꼬이기까지 얼마나 남았죠? 얼굴에서 촉수가 튀어나오기까지는 얼마나 "
"남았을까요?*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Narrator
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 83d12a6f-9978-dee5-37b0-913f8df61137
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Narrator:83d12a6f-9978-dee5-37b0-913f8df61137
msgctxt "h345cf5a9ge7bfg48f1g8971gaa33ad1f3944"
msgid ""
"*The questions fill your mind to bursting. Only time holds the answers. But "
"in the here and now, that is no comfort at all.*"
msgstr ""
"*당신의 머리는 수많은 질문에 터져버릴 것 같습니다. 오직 시간만이 그 답을 알겠죠. 하지만 지금, 그 사실은 전혀 위안이 되지 "
"않습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Narrator
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = af91926e-3a09-64d3-e9f5-239b849432ef
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Narrator:af91926e-3a09-64d3-e9f5-239b849432ef
msgctxt "h11bf9232g413cg4ea3g87d3g43cdfffbdadc"
msgid "*The air is still. Your mind, however, is another matter.*"
msgstr "*공기는 고요합니다. 하지만, 당신의 마음은 그렇지 않군요.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 039c2aee-2004-d2f6-527d-ed833628f915
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart:039c2aee-2004-d2f6-527d-ed833628f915
msgctxt "h6d4f48f3gcb05g4a7dga655ge1a7cdcce760"
msgid "I see."
msgstr "그렇구나."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 04733b97-8599-77ec-ffef-f2d1668f0f50
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart:04733b97-8599-77ec-ffef-f2d1668f0f50
msgctxt "he5f5c2b7g816ag4af5ga2c6g5018472ac88e"
msgid "Rest well. We'll need our strength."
msgstr "푹 쉬어. 힘을 아껴둬야지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 04f3237b-e181-9209-95ab-4d0b74f8849d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Tadpole_State_Awakened = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart:04f3237b-e181-9209-95ab-4d0b74f8849d
msgctxt "hb0e859e5g3e8dg45ffgabd0ga652d055de63"
msgid "This isn't all bad. The tadpoles seem to have given us powers."
msgstr "이 상황이 나쁘지만은 않은데. 올챙이가 우리한테 힘을 준 것 같거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 120a33ea-6a49-39f7-1398-f7abe103d2ba
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart:120a33ea-6a49-39f7-1398-f7abe103d2ba
msgctxt "h59a8915cga5bbg4b11g9e47g2b2a16904b27"
msgid "Maybe. But we might get lucky. We're overdue some good fortune."
msgstr "그럴지도. 하지만 운이 따라줄 수도 있지. 슬슬 운이 트일 때도 됐잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 13b4a9f5-4fb3-2d37-3a42-bf671b095e5c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart:13b4a9f5-4fb3-2d37-3a42-bf671b095e5c
msgctxt "hf4852ac6gaa69g4b09g9b71g3f1ae6dd8e2b"
msgid "You don't trust Wyll?"
msgstr "윌이 미덥지 않은 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 19a3db66-90a8-ed9c-16ee-2e18a7df3a8e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart:19a3db66-90a8-ed9c-16ee-2e18a7df3a8e
msgctxt "h89643509gdc7bg4d90gae49g67866076e266"
msgid "It's late. We can talk about this in the morning."
msgstr "시간이 늦었어. 이 얘기는 아침에 마저 하자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1cdd0736-99c7-8bf4-e80b-e7b0755cd21b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart:1cdd0736-99c7-8bf4-e80b-e7b0755cd21b
msgctxt "h71d7c428g6facg4f8cga6f1gd3a6449c6805"
msgid "You don't trust Lae'zel?"
msgstr "레이젤이 미덥지 않은 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 216376c0-a16c-b9ca-c604-f7cebbcdb099
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart:216376c0-a16c-b9ca-c604-f7cebbcdb099
msgctxt "h251bf9a4g61cbg44bdg9cc4g0653e16e0305"
msgid "If we're to survive, we need to trust each other."
msgstr "우리가 살아남으려면, 서로를 믿는 게 우선이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 217d4236-b54c-183e-4b55-2ae64bfc8bb6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_Night1_Event_LaezelSpokenToFirst(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart:217d4236-b54c-183e-4b55-2ae64bfc8bb6
msgctxt "h8b5cf527g6593g4487gb593ge215476b3397"
msgid "You and that githyanki."
msgstr "너랑 그 기스양키 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 277b0f6d-6124-fad3-8fd2-131c165593a1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_Night1_Event_GaleSpokenToFirst(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart:277b0f6d-6124-fad3-8fd2-131c165593a1
msgctxt "ha4f7aa4bge7d8g42b5g8c21ge961c41689ad"
msgid "You and Gale."
msgstr "너랑 게일 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 2a491503-1724-4e6e-35a9-b5a87eaad691
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart:2a491503-1724-4e6e-35a9-b5a87eaad691
msgctxt "hb2a495bdg21c4g4ac7g823dg93ddf5a80daa"
msgid "Outside threats, perhaps."
msgstr "외부 요인은 그럴지도 모르지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 2a57f4b0-b03c-f974-4d9a-b91534783b20
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart:2a57f4b0-b03c-f974-4d9a-b91534783b20
msgctxt "h6dc13dc4gb090g4071g9a91gdba2d09eedd4"
msgid "We did just talk about it. Let's rest."
msgstr "얘기할 건 다 했는걸. 이만 쉬자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 2af841a1-f343-2451-1615-24656f411207
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GITHYANKI or REALLY_PLANAR
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart:2af841a1-f343-2451-1615-24656f411207
msgctxt "hf4f22984gef20g43a5gafeag38de641d3282"
msgid ""
"She's a stranger to these parts, same as you. But you strike me as "
"reasonable, while she has her own agenda. I'd be surprised if our interests "
"remained aligned."
msgstr ""
"걔나 너나 여기서 이방인인 건 똑같지. 근데 넌 말이 통하는 반면에, 걔는 자기 꿍꿍이속에만 미쳐 있잖아. 반목하는 일이 안 생기면, "
"그게 더 신기할 듯한데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 2af841a1-f343-2451-1615-24656f411207
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart:2af841a1-f343-2451-1615-24656f411207
msgctxt "h163f2aeag04d3g4473gb3a2g2302e6ab0e50"
msgid ""
"She's not of this world. I'd be surprised if our interests remained aligned."
msgstr "걔는 다른 세상의 존재잖아. 반목하는 일이 안 생기면, 그게 더 신기할 듯한데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2b556b86-b67f-eef8-1902-2f915d7ff816
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart:2b556b86-b67f-eef8-1902-2f915d7ff816
msgctxt "h7cf73b58gf2a5g4631g9a74g2bcdba594c2f"
msgid "We were just discussing the next steps."
msgstr "그냥 앞으로의 일들에 관해 얘기 나눴지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2e666254-9ddb-68f5-ce04-3b8106c69939
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart:2e666254-9ddb-68f5-ce04-3b8106c69939
msgctxt "hd77fe826g3b8eg4916g95fdg13b234311f07"
msgid "You don't trust our companions?"
msgstr "우리 동료들이 미덥지 않은 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 313a5b8e-5850-f4a5-f1fa-64dcf9f9d1c2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart:313a5b8e-5850-f4a5-f1fa-64dcf9f9d1c2
msgctxt "h97f148d6gf111g4891gb0fcgb8875d4a75ae"
msgid ""
"Each hour that passes, the thing inside us grows. We need to find a healer. "
"Let's wake up at first light."
msgstr "시간이 지날수록, 우리 속에서 그것들이 자라나고 있어. 치유사를 찾아야만 해. 해 뜨자마자 얼른 일어나자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 3cfa18ca-f836-8c4f-d6d6-a1c9234ef68c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart:3cfa18ca-f836-8c4f-d6d6-a1c9234ef68c
msgctxt "h50d31040gf819g4fecg93fcg11a6da0912de"
msgid "I have my reasons - they're nothing for you to be concerned about."
msgstr "그건 다 이유가 있어. 네 걱정거리가 될 부분은 하나도 없다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 435506c7-56e5-8425-b488-4f06f82cd1e6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart:435506c7-56e5-8425-b488-4f06f82cd1e6
msgctxt "ha664d421gff00g4979gb30ag9ecc223da31f"
msgid "No, you've lost me. No idea what you're talking about."
msgstr "무슨 말인지 모르겠는데. 네가 뭔 얘기를 하려는 건지 모르겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 461194a9-d841-469c-8ff2-527a7b0c4ec5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart:461194a9-d841-469c-8ff2-527a7b0c4ec5
msgctxt "hdcd5c81cgfe11g45d9ga141g460e01cbf7d3"
msgid "Agreed. Our top priority, as far as I'm concerned."
msgstr "동감이야. 나도 그걸 최우선 목표로 여기고 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 48fd9535-230a-7f66-432e-024f6bf28998
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart:48fd9535-230a-7f66-432e-024f6bf28998
msgctxt "h452e3befg3d99g4497g94cfgaf1508708cff"
msgid ""
"...But speaking of focus, let's be clear: come daybreak, finding a healer is "
"our first priority, yes?"
msgstr "...기왕 집중 얘기가 나왔으니, 확실히 해 두자. 해 뜨고 나면, 치유사부터 최우선으로 찾는 거야, 알았지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 4ecfad9a-f9ab-39ab-3d00-16a21efcf4ef
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart:4ecfad9a-f9ab-39ab-3d00-16a21efcf4ef
msgctxt "h0f0784afgb32ag4312g9ceag089bd2316cbe"
msgid "Fine. But not for too long."
msgstr "좋아. 그래도 너무 퍼지진 말자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4fe32fa5-277f-c8ff-ab43-836b810c8d63
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart:4fe32fa5-277f-c8ff-ab43-836b810c8d63
msgctxt "h215a929bgc2d4g4e99gab29g4fbdc82b36ea"
msgid ""
"You like to stir things up, don't you? Stop looking for trouble and stay "
"focused."
msgstr "분란 일으키는 걸 좋아하나 봐? 괜히 문젯거리 들쑤시지 말고 신경 쏟을 데나 집중해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 546670f3-fa7c-85c4-4d6b-62e051a7b798
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart:546670f3-fa7c-85c4-4d6b-62e051a7b798
msgctxt "h6925c76bg831bg4ea9ga4efg220835684814"
msgid ""
"If anyone has me concerned, it's you. You haven't exactly been open about "
"yourself."
msgstr "내가 조심해야 될 사람이 있다면, 그건 너야. 넌 너에 관해 제대로 털어놓은 게 없잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 56f6dc70-8466-b7f4-8ad4-b04c690f58c4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart:56f6dc70-8466-b7f4-8ad4-b04c690f58c4
msgctxt "h2ddde6c8g8ed0g4504gb917ga72474393af6"
msgid "Don't fret. We need some rest."
msgstr "조바심 내지 마. 좀 쉬기도 해야지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 58b6ec03-50cc-a0da-69dc-fbe14ca281c4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart:58b6ec03-50cc-a0da-69dc-fbe14ca281c4
msgctxt "he5ed3103g0313g429eg8174g7c9d4513d39a"
msgid "He's a wizard. All they care about is power."
msgstr "걔는 위저드잖아. 힘만 밝히는 족속이라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5cc6a94b-d4fe-523c-8c2a-b981e425ab0e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart:5cc6a94b-d4fe-523c-8c2a-b981e425ab0e
msgctxt "h5166070dge606g4163g8e69ga16ba4e1dd75"
msgid "I wasn't confiding in anyone. I was just talking."
msgstr "조심하고 자시고 할 거 없어. 그냥 얘기 좀 나눴을 뿐이라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 614f4f26-ad90-8493-ef9a-a4e74ff8ba51
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_Night1_Event_WyllSpokenToFirst(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart:614f4f26-ad90-8493-ef9a-a4e74ff8ba51
msgctxt "hac13e355g9209g44e1g93d7gaeb93781cf4f"
msgid "I'd be careful with Wyll."
msgstr "나라면 윌을 조심할 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 622b03fa-04a0-c6fd-8832-ba31b826badb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart:622b03fa-04a0-c6fd-8832-ba31b826badb
msgctxt "hcfcc363dg3b02g459eg889fga7560161a4ed"
msgid ""
"These powers must have a price. They come from invasive parasites that will "
"turn us into mind flayers."
msgstr "이런 힘에는 대가가 따르는 법이야. 그건 우리를 마인드 플레이어로 바꿀 기생충에게서 비롯된 힘이라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 62a5cd9a-6ae2-5d0d-0f63-8a441475f2f6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart:62a5cd9a-6ae2-5d0d-0f63-8a441475f2f6
msgctxt "h94db9a27g9994g4977g94eag35ec0bc2d3c5"
msgid ""
"Good. We might even get lucky and find one right away. As I see it, we're "
"overdue some good fortune. Rest well."
msgstr "좋아. 어쩌면 운수 좋게 바로 하나 찾게 될지도 몰라. 내가 보기엔, 슬슬 운이 트일 때가 됐거든. 푹 쉬어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 62ebb8bd-446a-2aca-7ab8-411f8692ea79
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ShadowHeart_InParty_Knows_SharWorshipper = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart:62ebb8bd-446a-2aca-7ab8-411f8692ea79
msgctxt "h14c8e21fgd33bg4636g9b41g187c773a9a34"
msgid ""
"I think I've been more than candid - you know about my faith, for one thing."
msgstr "난 충분히 솔직하게 대한 듯한데. 일단 넌 내가 누굴 섬기는지 알고 있잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 65540564-b63b-3034-7574-e337e0ec1049
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_Night1_Event_AstarionSpokenToFirst(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart:65540564-b63b-3034-7574-e337e0ec1049
msgctxt "h6db7185dg64f1g4426gbb23gd4d1edfdb8b8"
msgid "You and the pale fellow."
msgstr "너랑 그 창백한 놈 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6675051c-c21d-d0a9-91f3-8704bc97b715
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart:6675051c-c21d-d0a9-91f3-8704bc97b715
msgctxt "haee2aa4fg6afbg4061gb7e9g9644c7cad6e0"
msgid "Agreed. The sooner we find someone to help us, the better."
msgstr "동감이야. 우릴 도와줄 사람을 빨리 찾아내는 편이 좋지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 6af79471-ec99-9840-f35c-9f3cdc055374
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart:6af79471-ec99-9840-f35c-9f3cdc055374
msgctxt "h856d6d6eg533ag47b2g8b78g1005c1bb2687"
msgid ""
"There are lit fuses in our heads. Sooner or later, they're going to blow."
msgstr "우리 머릿속엔 불붙은 도화선이 있다고. 머지않아 일이 터지고 말걸?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 6bcdad7f-bd29-ec80-5262-7f383146dbb4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_Night1_State_SpokenToFirst(1) = False
#.      - CAMP_Night1_State_SpoenToSecond(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CAMP_Night1_Event_ShadowheartSpokenToFirst(1) = True
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_Night1_State_SpokenToFirst(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart:6bcdad7f-bd29-ec80-5262-7f383146dbb4
msgctxt "hbd925484g8c8cg40eeg9f57gd91fd59667a5"
msgid "I'm not sure this is a good idea."
msgstr "이러고 있는 게 좋은 생각인지 모르겠네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7491d626-a6b8-6d80-2bd5-21f1cda57250
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart:7491d626-a6b8-6d80-2bd5-21f1cda57250
msgctxt "h4cf08c6agb396g48d8ga5a4g8a56c68e47a0"
msgid "What do you mean?"
msgstr "그게 무슨 소리야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 7d3a5672-ea2c-3bbb-cfc2-2c739743a4e6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart:7d3a5672-ea2c-3bbb-cfc2-2c739743a4e6
msgctxt "hcca510bcgd5ffg48b8gb34bg1f12415d5315"
msgid "Wrong. Your business is mine. We're entwined, thanks to <i>this</i>."
msgstr "아니. 네 사정이 곧 내 사정이라고. 우린 서로 얽혀있잖아. <i>그것</i> 덕분에 말이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7dfa9b22-6c57-fdac-f5d9-336ad2abbc6f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart:7dfa9b22-6c57-fdac-f5d9-336ad2abbc6f
msgctxt "hf5545998gcd72g402bgbe03g4cac899b2743"
msgid "Sure <i>what </i>is a good idea?"
msgstr "<i>뭘</i> 두고 좋은 생각이냐는 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 82065476-6419-03a2-ae22-8bcf2d4aa688
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart:82065476-6419-03a2-ae22-8bcf2d4aa688
msgctxt "h00f7f0d5gada8g4b99g93c2gc3e3cee72c52"
msgid ""
"Either way, be careful. You never know what lengths someone might take to "
"solve this little problem of ours."
msgstr "아무튼, 조심해. 우리 머릿속의 그 작은 골칫거리를 해결할 때까지 얼마나 오래 함께 해야 할지 모르니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8cf1c8f5-a410-ef82-5857-a62b3e20c4cd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart:8cf1c8f5-a410-ef82-5857-a62b3e20c4cd
msgctxt "h63bab38cge85bg4c39gafd5g4e6f103fc5e4"
msgid "You don't trust Gale?"
msgstr "게일이 미덥지 않은 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 8e45a3e0-452b-bda4-4ee3-ce5d0768d648
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart:8e45a3e0-452b-bda4-4ee3-ce5d0768d648
msgctxt "h42194e21gc591g4437g82c7ge7a94823613a"
msgid "That sort of danger - I'm fine with. I can <i>fight </i>it."
msgstr "그런 위험이라면, 난 괜찮아. <i>맞서</i> 이겨낼 수 있으니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 962e31cb-2a6a-dc22-c840-8aeda3590809
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart:962e31cb-2a6a-dc22-c840-8aeda3590809
msgctxt "h7167f899g19a8g46d6gaff8g17f7cd1f3ab1"
msgid "What were you two talking about?"
msgstr "아까는 둘이서 무슨 얘기를 했던 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 97546036-03d8-09c8-bc94-289056ab41a2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_Night1_Event_AstarionSpokenToFirst(1) = False
#.      - CAMP_Night1_Event_LaezelSpokenToFirst(1) = False
#.      - CAMP_Night1_Event_GaleSpokenToFirst(1) = False
#.      - CAMP_Night1_Event_WyllSpokenToFirst(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart:97546036-03d8-09c8-bc94-289056ab41a2
msgctxt "hfda6853cg39e1g4e90gabe7g21f08bc88ca3"
msgid "Don't play the fool, please."
msgstr "시치미 떼도 소용없다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 98bac20e-8006-bcaa-baa9-3c68d981bb1f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_Night1_Event_AstarionSpokenToFirst(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart:98bac20e-8006-bcaa-baa9-3c68d981bb1f
msgctxt "hdc4375f0g5cd5g423dga525gff00b098ede3"
msgid "I'd be careful with Astarion."
msgstr "나라면 아스타리온을 조심할 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 98da10ea-752f-5255-aa9b-73c2937ac5bc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart:98da10ea-752f-5255-aa9b-73c2937ac5bc
msgctxt "h1e832a96g8de3g428aga73fg08ec6c6bc97e"
msgid "We need to get rid of them."
msgstr "그것들은 없애버려야 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 9bbc60af-e909-0eb4-01b6-588c065e403b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_Night1_Event_WyllSpokenToFirst(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart:9bbc60af-e909-0eb4-01b6-588c065e403b
msgctxt "h580ebc80gb8f9g465ag9b8ag672802e6257a"
msgid "You and Wyll."
msgstr "너랑 윌 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = a62f3862-4aac-b6c3-fd96-b586681f8ade
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart:a62f3862-4aac-b6c3-fd96-b586681f8ade
msgctxt "h99ba6bddgfa8ag42c5g98ddg3ec9001ea692"
msgid "So am I."
msgstr "나도 그래."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = a6343988-946c-e160-6d10-2020d1f51304
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart:a6343988-946c-e160-6d10-2020d1f51304
msgctxt "h0f57252agb556g45f3g839ag1cd62da3af3c"
msgid "Well, what do we <i>really </i>know about them...?"
msgstr "뭐, 우리가 걔들에 관해 뭐 <i>제대로</i> 아는 거라도 있어...?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = a7b2ed1b-cff8-1745-55da-12c66b6053e3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart:a7b2ed1b-cff8-1745-55da-12c66b6053e3
msgctxt "heabe322ag0632g4fd7gb18ag7f1718149a01"
msgid "Maybe we will get lucky. We're overdue some good fortune."
msgstr "어쩌면 운이 따라줄 수도 있지. 슬슬 운이 트일 때도 됐잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ac73465e-61bf-8b82-8c35-09034b85603b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart:ac73465e-61bf-8b82-8c35-09034b85603b
msgctxt "h57c8ced0g0256g4cd8g8297g041ccc368394"
msgid ""
"This is unfamiliar territory. Rushing will only land us in more trouble than "
"we can handle."
msgstr "여긴 우리한테 낯선 곳이잖아. 조급하게 굴면 감당하기 벅찬 문제만 더 생겨날 뿐이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = ad81c11f-8822-c13c-1943-657d4c4b206c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart:ad81c11f-8822-c13c-1943-657d4c4b206c
msgctxt "h4947fd8bga93ag4a9fga020g9157776b311c"
msgid "Get some rest. We move at dawn."
msgstr "좀 쉬어. 동이 트면 움직이자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = afbf6ea8-aae2-01c5-4d82-ce20050836da
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart:afbf6ea8-aae2-01c5-4d82-ce20050836da
msgctxt "h91695867gf235g45b8gbf10gd986079fc9e4"
msgid "Fine. Just don't expect my confidence if I don't have yours."
msgstr "좋아. 네가 날 믿지 않으면 나도 똑같이 대할 수밖에 없단 것만 알아 둬."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = b3520795-82bc-b77d-712e-55621391c464
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart:b3520795-82bc-b77d-712e-55621391c464
msgctxt "h423eb0ddg04eeg4e3bga2a0g2186a8f528d3"
msgid "You should get some rest. We've got hard times ahead."
msgstr "좀 쉬는 편이 좋겠어. 앞으로 힘든 일들을 겪게 될 테니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = b63dfd30-a6de-1f39-120c-1aaef0201249
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_Night1_State_SpokenToFirst(1) = True
#.      - CAMP_Night1_State_SpoenToSecond(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart:b63dfd30-a6de-1f39-120c-1aaef0201249
msgctxt "h97c2b79ag2e5ag4272g9ab4g898a75460306"
msgid "Doing the rounds, are you? You'd better get some rest."
msgstr "순찰이라도 도는 중인가 봐? 이만 쉬는 편이 좋을 텐데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c224c980-98a0-1bcc-4343-84c1ff968b5a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart:c224c980-98a0-1bcc-4343-84c1ff968b5a
msgctxt "hb1f081e2ge257g4810g87d8g6d9d5b795192"
msgid "Relax. This camp seems safe from threats."
msgstr "진정해. 이 야영지엔 위험할 거리가 보이지 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c25946d3-b739-81b8-fb33-d00b4f280efc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart:c25946d3-b739-81b8-fb33-d00b4f280efc
msgctxt "hdbba2a10gbde1g4bcag8119g6635bc0ead9f"
msgid "You don't trust Astarion?"
msgstr "아스타리온이 미덥지 않은 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = c3502a0e-8a4a-d702-490d-84c660019289
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_Night1_Event_GaleSpokenToFirst(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart:c3502a0e-8a4a-d702-490d-84c660019289
msgctxt "h768029b4g0d55g4890gb66bg649c9ae014c8"
msgid "I'd be careful with Gale."
msgstr "나라면 게일을 조심할 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c533fcc0-7173-b819-7ba9-5efe790ea01b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart:c533fcc0-7173-b819-7ba9-5efe790ea01b
msgctxt "hef956f91ga11ag4219gb24fg0d428c748095"
msgid "Don't question me."
msgstr "내 일에 토 달지 마."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = c81fa41b-5af2-ad60-855b-9d7b3848c544
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart:c81fa41b-5af2-ad60-855b-9d7b3848c544
msgctxt "hd3217ac2g104fg4a64g99f1g62dacc8ee2d9"
msgid ""
"Heroic types can be brittle, I find. Better to trust someone with greater "
"flexibility."
msgstr "영웅이란 것들은 심지가 약한 편이거든. 좀 더 융통성 있는 쪽이 오히려 믿음직하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cc724970-4d68-ac0a-b605-98e26c90e32c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart:cc724970-4d68-ac0a-b605-98e26c90e32c
msgctxt "h1b15ce96g6c53g4a12gba71ga1d7ec49e231"
msgid "Let's not abandon all caution. This is unfamiliar territory."
msgstr "조심성 없이 굴지 말자. 여긴 우리한테 낯선 곳이잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = cded8537-da32-74cf-2ef8-7848d2d38049
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart:cded8537-da32-74cf-2ef8-7848d2d38049
msgctxt "h379e6827g2db6g47bcg962bg737dc84b8f14"
msgid "I was merely making an observation."
msgstr "난 그냥 관찰을 한 것뿐이라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = d419a52e-f818-2a0b-9ac5-131eb60d273c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_Night1_State_SpokenToFirst(1) = False
#.      - CAMP_Night1_State_SpoenToSecond(1) = False
#.      - Approval_AtLeast_0_For_Sp2(0) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CAMP_Night1_Event_ShadowheartSpokenToFirst(1) = True
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_Night1_State_SpokenToFirst(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart:d419a52e-f818-2a0b-9ac5-131eb60d273c
msgctxt "h83e489f9g422cg4c9bg8de0g7e68f17fd2fa"
msgid ""
"You strike me as the reliable sort, but are you sure this is a good idea?"
msgstr "너를 믿음직스럽게 여기곤 있지만, 이러고 있는 게 좋은 생각이라고 확신해?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = d4c64a74-b1c5-f8df-18f4-4059aae711db
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart:d4c64a74-b1c5-f8df-18f4-4059aae711db
msgctxt "h150b40d1g8302g4a2bg9bf9g4bfac1be4940"
msgid ""
"Caution is a luxury we don't have. Let's rest and wake up at first light."
msgstr "조심스럽게 굴 여유 따위 없어. 이만 쉬고 아침 일찍 일어나자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = d9db514d-e336-c858-c5e2-30c7e523c061
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_Night1_Event_LaezelSpokenToFirst(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart:d9db514d-e336-c858-c5e2-30c7e523c061
msgctxt "hd2ff133bg553cg41b1g97d2gb83934d064dc"
msgid "I'd be careful with Lae'zel."
msgstr "나라면 레이젤을 조심할 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = ddfd08aa-d7e9-e08f-bd61-beb9aad835ed
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart:ddfd08aa-d7e9-e08f-bd61-beb9aad835ed
msgctxt "h0d9e5885g6916g41a4g9e98g961d727e8aab"
msgid "Let's hope we rapidly find a healer."
msgstr "부디 빠른 시일 내에 치유사를 찾길 바라자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e24b2eb7-6d52-f964-c400-240c186d3db1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart:e24b2eb7-6d52-f964-c400-240c186d3db1
msgctxt "h13150436g1097g4d8ag805dg308bd6b2a98d"
msgid "Fine. But it won't be easy, searching this wilderness."
msgstr "알았어. 하지만 이 황야에서 치유사를 찾는 건 쉬운 일이 아닐 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = e2b0268c-d393-c62e-481c-b06e47082540
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart:e2b0268c-d393-c62e-481c-b06e47082540
msgctxt "h9cf93e66gd8f1g4118g8b69gf17f409e7790"
msgid ""
"And just to be clear, come daybreak, finding a healer is our first priority."
msgstr "미리 말해두겠는데, 우린 동이 트는 대로 치유사 찾는 걸 급선무로 삼아야 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e6be07de-f7f6-86e4-352f-ea819047b3fe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart:e6be07de-f7f6-86e4-352f-ea819047b3fe
msgctxt "h2519a10fg2e1fg4ed6g8d2dgd1a4c274fce4"
msgid "If that was any of your business, we'd have called you over."
msgstr "너랑 조금이라도 상관있는 얘기였다면, 너도 불러다 얘기 나눴겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = e9e5b9f7-336c-211c-c863-4098f4978e54
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_Night1_State_SpokenToFirst(1) = True
#.      - CAMP_Night1_State_SpoenToSecond(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_Night1_State_SpoenToSecond(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart:e9e5b9f7-336c-211c-c863-4098f4978e54
msgctxt "h00c9990ag9903g445bg90e6g85e1d97a1839"
msgid "What were you two talking about?"
msgstr "아까 둘이서 뭔 얘기를 나눴어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = eac29dc9-c5c4-c7f9-c248-755d6f5c8d8e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart:eac29dc9-c5c4-c7f9-c248-755d6f5c8d8e
msgctxt "h4e161938ge8f2g4065g81f1ga52347343c51"
msgid "They make the best servants."
msgstr "끝내주는 하인 감이거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = eb5867d2-17a4-f06c-007d-90fcbceaa6f6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart:eb5867d2-17a4-f06c-007d-90fcbceaa6f6
msgctxt "hf74eb31eg69c6g47d1g85d5g68b6fc7d4846"
msgid ""
"Trust is a rare currency. Not sure I'd spend it on someone who drew a knife "
"on me moments after I met them."
msgstr "신뢰란 좀처럼 얻기 힘든 것이지. 만나자마자 목에 칼을 들이민 녀석한테 내어줄 만한 것일지, 난 모르겠는걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = ed3c3acc-6b1d-c940-f4de-0d3eda2bec7e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: MALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart:ed3c3acc-6b1d-c940-f4de-0d3eda2bec7e
msgctxt "h391ef41bgff0eg4115g8e7dg797be0bb578e"
msgid "Oh, it's going to be like that? I love strong men."
msgstr "오, 그런 식으로 구시겠다? 난 기 센 남자가 좋더라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = ed3c3acc-6b1d-c940-f4de-0d3eda2bec7e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: FEMALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart:ed3c3acc-6b1d-c940-f4de-0d3eda2bec7e
msgctxt "hbf57fa18ga815g4dc9ga1a5g1ecac4b8c2b5"
msgid "Oh, it's going to be like that? I love strong women."
msgstr "오, 그런 식으로 구시겠다? 난 기 센 여자가 좋더라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = ed3c3acc-6b1d-c940-f4de-0d3eda2bec7e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart:ed3c3acc-6b1d-c940-f4de-0d3eda2bec7e
msgctxt "h5094a981gdb08g4432g853bgc251a9adacec"
msgid "Oh, it's going to be like that? I love strong ones."
msgstr "오, 그런 식으로 구시겠다? 난 기 센 사람이 좋더라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = f0229b01-6d8c-5d7a-b7be-f343f3d34226
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_Night1_Event_AstarionSpokenToFirst(1) = False
#.      - CAMP_Night1_Event_LaezelSpokenToFirst(1) = False
#.      - CAMP_Night1_Event_GaleSpokenToFirst(1) = False
#.      - CAMP_Night1_Event_WyllSpokenToFirst(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart:f0229b01-6d8c-5d7a-b7be-f343f3d34226
msgctxt "h7a2801b8g241ag4c12g9516gff1892fc0ae9"
msgid "I'd be careful with who you confide in."
msgstr "나라면 마음 털어놓을 상대를 조심히 택할 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = f3e147cb-2ebe-58b8-380d-5bc37a57d5a0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - Approval_AtLeast_0_For_Sp2(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart:f3e147cb-2ebe-58b8-380d-5bc37a57d5a0
msgctxt "hf554285fg58dag46c1g8e23g6be4aa62ef9d"
msgid ""
"You seem reliable. I think you know how important it is that we find someone "
"who can cure us. Best if we focus on that."
msgstr ""
"넌 믿음직하게 느껴져. 너라면 우리를 치유해줄 사람을 찾아내는 일이 얼마나 중요한지 잘 알고 있겠지. 우린 그 일에 집중해야 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = f60adf6f-19f8-d4c3-00bc-b04030e8b2ac
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - Approval_AtLeast_0_For_Sp2(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night1_CRD_Shadowheart:f60adf6f-19f8-d4c3-00bc-b04030e8b2ac
msgctxt "hc8b7dff2g3dceg4fb8gac61g55370cd38a92"
msgid "Spare me the petty tyrant routine - you're better than that."
msgstr "어쭙잖은 폭군 놀이는 관둬. 넌 그런 사람이 아니잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0154bbca-cec5-3ffd-f370-7109eccfe8cd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion:0154bbca-cec5-3ffd-f370-7109eccfe8cd
msgctxt "h283039ccgb89bg4999g9c18g224f00af6117"
msgid "A knife. That seems quick."
msgstr "칼을 택하겠어. 신속할 것 같아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 02d1acb0-f49c-1bc0-3ff7-d0f5ddfc1659
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion:02d1acb0-f49c-1bc0-3ff7-d0f5ddfc1659
msgctxt "h4545b739ge29bg418fg816bg6e8be0c632a0"
msgid "I can bear a lot."
msgstr "상관없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 05ef4944-f57b-f8cb-0014-185b714efe85
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion:05ef4944-f57b-f8cb-0014-185b714efe85
msgctxt "h1a57e60cg8720g4da8g80d7gafec7205b23c"
msgid "That's what everyone's saying. Is it so strange?"
msgstr "모두들 너처럼 말하더군. 그렇게 이상한가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 07d21625-556c-2ae4-293a-754ac21d559e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion:07d21625-556c-2ae4-293a-754ac21d559e
msgctxt "he8b114c6g9addg4235gadd8gb4f1c4274bbf"
msgid ""
"How much damage will you cause if you transform? How much blood can you bear "
"to have on your hands?"
msgstr "네가 변이한다면 얼마나 많은 피해를 끼칠까? 너의 손에 얼마나 많은 피를 묻힐까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 07e64886-82b7-a4dd-4805-477b9f79facd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion:07e64886-82b7-a4dd-4805-477b9f79facd
msgctxt "hf3e3bbd1g0024g40a8g9575g80a5fef2ae38"
msgid "Don't be so pig-headed, I'm being practical."
msgstr "그렇게 꽉 막혀 있지 말고, 나는 현실적으로 생각하고 있단 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0943cf45-5ff7-3740-7235-5619e7095d8b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion:0943cf45-5ff7-3740-7235-5619e7095d8b
msgctxt "h71a4397cg0bbfg42cfg8e10g28e95fbcf565"
msgid ""
"Killing me would rather <i>decrease</i> your odds of survival. Dramatically, "
"in fact."
msgstr "날 죽이는 건 네 생존 확률을 <i>줄이게</i> 될 걸. 아주 극적으로."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 104befab-d08a-a162-8afa-038c9dfe6e07
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion:104befab-d08a-a162-8afa-038c9dfe6e07
msgctxt "h72793d5dgd9b4g4e2dga9fbgcbe11baba43c"
msgid "Poison, then. Something painless."
msgstr "그럼, 독을 택하겠어. 고통이 없을 것 같아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 10863ea8-7359-3c19-cd21-e6a3f58b1b49
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion:10863ea8-7359-3c19-cd21-e6a3f58b1b49
msgctxt "h0a569de1g2aa4g4c2dg9159gaa6facf6f0d1"
msgid "Oh, I see how it is."
msgstr "오, 어떤지 알겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 11ae6cb8-cb10-d584-60f2-4d4b9a845bf6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion:11ae6cb8-cb10-d584-60f2-4d4b9a845bf6
msgctxt "he7e88413gc949g4a8bgba88gac3f4a06767d"
msgid "'Yet'."
msgstr "'아직'은."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 13b1271c-d12e-e292-5cb9-838435e56f24
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion:13b1271c-d12e-e292-5cb9-838435e56f24
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "hacfb870bg45aag4860ga6e3g96d988c09921"
msgid "Try it and I'll spill your guts."
msgstr "해 봐. 내장을 뿌려줄 테니."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 155fce76-9574-243e-49a3-718a6f754328
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_Astarion_Night2_PickedNothing(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion:155fce76-9574-243e-49a3-718a6f754328
msgctxt "hfe45d3eeg979ag4819gaf38gb676712f184b"
msgid "Fine, but if they botch it - don't come bleeding to me."
msgstr "좋은데, 하지만 다른 녀석이 일을 망치더라도 내게 피를 흘리며 오지는 마."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1f93b132-33d4-26c9-275b-260dbf175e1f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion:1f93b132-33d4-26c9-275b-260dbf175e1f
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h2f94420fg632cg4ca1g9146g446d79a51bd7"
msgid "Poison? That sounds painless."
msgstr "독? 아프진 않을 거 같은걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2a2986b0-0de4-713a-7ef0-510f82d80559
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion:2a2986b0-0de4-713a-7ef0-510f82d80559
msgctxt "ha3b9ebd2gca3dg409ag887agaf9f5917e1f1"
msgid "I could say the same to you."
msgstr "너도 똑같아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 3d5f2acf-12f8-59d3-7484-b4f1bdc27fed
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_Astarion_Night2_PickedDecapitation(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion:3d5f2acf-12f8-59d3-7484-b4f1bdc27fed
msgctxt "h0bb80532ga46cg48cfg86f7g398311f54b3c"
msgid "A fine choice. Now, to use sword or axe? Or a saw? Hmm."
msgstr "좋은 선택이야. 그럼, 검이나 도끼를 사용해서? 아니면 톱? 흠."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 41661458-b215-2ae6-805d-9548e5c568dc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion_AskedAstarion(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion:41661458-b215-2ae6-805d-9548e5c568dc
msgctxt "h263bba48g4ad6g4b1bgaa11g127d0350edbe"
msgid "But we were talking about you. What'll it be?"
msgstr "근데 이건 내 얘기고, 넌 어때?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 446c10e4-b218-57ed-6c70-14506f9f1053
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion:446c10e4-b218-57ed-6c70-14506f9f1053
msgctxt "ha287f77dg6805g4564ga72cg7024814bbbbb"
msgid "I like you. Rest assured, whatever happens, I'll make the right choice."
msgstr "마음에 드는데. 아무튼, 어떻게 되든 안심하라고. 난 올바른 선택을 할테니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 45fe8a54-950d-1beb-c579-473bf9a47277
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_Night2_State_Night2Com(1) = True
#.      - Camp_Night2_CRD_GaleTalkedTo(1) = True
#.      - CAMP_Night2_CRD_LaezelTalkedTo(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion:45fe8a54-950d-1beb-c579-473bf9a47277
msgctxt "h76d01c6fg8da5g4159ga455g2ab41331bf03"
msgid "I saw you getting a lecture from our magical friend."
msgstr "네가 우리 마법사 친구에게 강의를 듣는 걸 봤어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 47a68e7b-e833-aa1e-fbee-5b5aab71db07
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion:47a68e7b-e833-aa1e-fbee-5b5aab71db07
msgctxt "haeefc90cg3b63g45e6g93ddg2761716cfb1f"
msgid "Not yet."
msgstr "아직은 그래."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 4a40e6e6-9027-07a3-fbe1-e7e6bc2d7405
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion:4a40e6e6-9027-07a3-fbe1-e7e6bc2d7405
msgctxt "hcb2266e8gf9a1g40adg95d3ge107bdf9823f"
msgid ""
"If the last day has taught me anything, it's that the impossible is more "
"likely than you think."
msgstr "지난 하루를 통해 배운 것이 있다면, 불가능한 일이 일어날 확률은 생각보다 높다는 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 50129a8c-cbb3-25eb-63c1-0a2979d9b943
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion:50129a8c-cbb3-25eb-63c1-0a2979d9b943
msgctxt "h92495340g0599g4bc4g8e54g19af5be78184"
msgid "If I <i>had </i>to choose, I'd want the knife. Make it quick."
msgstr "선택<i>해야 한다면</i>, 칼을 택하겠어. 빠르게 죽을 테니."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 50d3e54f-63d4-7c7c-2fa2-948ec4db70ed
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion:50d3e54f-63d4-7c7c-2fa2-948ec4db70ed
msgctxt "h17107e23ge803g4da0g9bfcga1c57eef15e1"
msgid "Poison, then. It should be painless at least."
msgstr "독이 좋겠군. 최소한 고통은 없을 테니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 543e962d-d622-2905-7bde-bf3bbc320047
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion:543e962d-d622-2905-7bde-bf3bbc320047
msgctxt "h27e78729g60aeg4ee6g85f6g79c77a65c1f7"
msgid "If I die, I'll take you with me."
msgstr "만약 내가 죽는다면, 너도 데려갈 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 561f0f4d-03ae-7484-ac3e-ce2ae7fc9f88
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion:561f0f4d-03ae-7484-ac3e-ce2ae7fc9f88
msgctxt "h1d43e988gad59g4e55g8183g13138418a40e"
msgid "It's unexpected, but we shan't complain."
msgstr "예상치 못한 일이잖아. 딱히 불만은 없지만."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 58e1c195-5326-96f0-b5cc-952826bb962e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion:58e1c195-5326-96f0-b5cc-952826bb962e
msgctxt "h4d1c5b10g38d8g40d2gae2cg5f7614203349"
msgid "Don't make me choose! There are too many good options."
msgstr "도저히 못 고르겠군! 매력적인 선택지가 너무 많아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 5b3246af-07f5-d6f4-3b49-037bbd5054ee
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion:5b3246af-07f5-d6f4-3b49-037bbd5054ee
msgctxt "h284bbc51g1a70g48e1g865cgfa8aa4c5359f"
msgid ""
"Now, let's get some rest? The sooner we start tomorrow, the better our "
"chances of keeping this hypothetical."
msgstr "이제 좀 쉴까? 내일 빨리 움직일수록 이 가설이 말로만 머물 확률이 커질 테니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6001446c-f57c-1909-4936-a0ece099f638
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CAMP_PartySize_AtLeast3 = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion:6001446c-f57c-1909-4936-a0ece099f638
msgctxt "hf819c97bg228bg4b23gb8a4g8f6a46a66adb"
msgid "I'd rather have one of the others do it."
msgstr "차라리 다른 사람의 손에 맡길래."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 6002ebe3-898d-3244-1b5b-542fcd0bca1b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion:6002ebe3-898d-3244-1b5b-542fcd0bca1b
msgctxt "h3d8926c0g5714g4fe8gb66fgbe566a57cedb"
msgid "So can I."
msgstr "나도 그래."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 652e51dd-c38a-6bec-d8c7-492a15e86cd8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion:652e51dd-c38a-6bec-d8c7-492a15e86cd8
msgctxt "hf7f0e696ga5b7g4d62ga462g287addd61304"
msgid ""
"Of course, first sign of change and I'll have to stop that pretty little "
"heart of yours."
msgstr "물론, 변화의 징조가 보이면 나는 너의 그 앙증맞은 심장을 멈춰야겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 66eb3a3a-19d4-caa0-e3d0-6ba28b7c6a00
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_Astarion_Night2_PickedNothing(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion:66eb3a3a-19d4-caa0-e3d0-6ba28b7c6a00
msgctxt "h01e5a121g498fg4d0eg9978g7dfaeb9826e1"
msgid "Don't worry, darling. I like you. I'm sure I'll make the right choice."
msgstr "걱정 마, 자기. 난 네가 좋아. 내가 올바른 선택을 해줄게."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 67465e50-6d63-933b-86b8-91fdd5ba1488
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion:67465e50-6d63-933b-86b8-91fdd5ba1488
msgctxt "h14c5e433g6bd5g481fgad9ag834b1b3efa28"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 68d817de-43fd-02c6-2cce-4cfd0b44d7ff
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion:68d817de-43fd-02c6-2cce-4cfd0b44d7ff
msgctxt "hc3beb7ddg6bd9g48e8ga6abg043f6ad4a422"
msgid ""
"I'm afraid I'm deadly serious. Try it, and I'm taking everyone with me. "
"<i>Everyone</i>."
msgstr "미안하지만 난 아주 진지해. 해 봐, 그럼 다 같이 죽는 거야. <i>다 같이</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 69d681ce-8ee5-fe3d-1cd9-ad9aff715250
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion:69d681ce-8ee5-fe3d-1cd9-ad9aff715250
msgctxt "h917c4a4bgd24cg428egbc37g315d09616e8c"
msgid "I don't think poison is for me. Nor stabbing, come to think of it."
msgstr "독은 좀 아니야. 생각해 보니 찔리는 것도 그렇고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6bbfddc3-16fd-f97e-15ba-9009e725f12f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CAMP_PartySize_AtLeast3 = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion:6bbfddc3-16fd-f97e-15ba-9009e725f12f
msgctxt "h68415d9fgc00eg4049g85bbgc067f7a38540"
msgid "Then I'll ask someone else to do it."
msgstr "그럼 다른 사람한테 부탁해야겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 75d340c2-3e7a-708c-754a-85b183f28cbd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_Astarion_Night2_PickedNothing(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion:75d340c2-3e7a-708c-754a-85b183f28cbd
msgctxt "hc4dfd834gc11fg48f2gac36g62457daf2911"
msgid "Sweet dreams, darling."
msgstr "좋은 꿈 꾸라고, 자기."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 7916c312-ee10-af0c-eb7e-b9834a8f3f77
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion:7916c312-ee10-af0c-eb7e-b9834a8f3f77
msgctxt "h3f5ba0c9g4503g496aga8f3g4ea8bad3d3e3"
msgid ""
"I am open to suggestions. Knives, poison, strangulation - whatever you'd "
"prefer."
msgstr "어떤 제안이든 좋아. 칼, 독, 교살... 네가 원하는 방식을 말해 봐."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 7ced0c7d-8836-e6f5-6463-be07664d41cc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion:7ced0c7d-8836-e6f5-6463-be07664d41cc
msgctxt "hcd3cd07aga1a7g4200g95a9g7c343366de8b"
msgid "Well, that's a little dramatic, don't you think?"
msgstr "음, 그건 조금 과한 것 같은데, 안 그래?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7f6ea32c-87af-d226-c27b-52da1e15aa1b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion:7f6ea32c-87af-d226-c27b-52da1e15aa1b
msgctxt "h6bcda775ge150g49c4g98abg74a0154f2dc1"
msgid "Obviously. But that won't happen. It can't."
msgstr "물론. 그런 일은 없을 거야. 불가능해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 801b3224-203e-d449-2560-3248e48448ce
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion:801b3224-203e-d449-2560-3248e48448ce
msgctxt "h1033d786ge501g47a4gb2f7g72c7bc252591"
msgid ""
"If they're mixed well, you'll just close your eyes and drift away. And if "
"they're not..."
msgstr "잘 섞이면, 너는 그냥 눈을 감고 떠날 거야. 아니라면 뭐..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 8bb58c59-4169-013e-7c7c-3234a3f0ea50
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_Astarion_Night2_PickedPoison(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion:8bb58c59-4169-013e-7c7c-3234a3f0ea50
msgctxt "h90a5c5b0gdc6fg4e04g9de2g3f5c8d94cb52"
msgid ""
"A fine choice! I can think of some nightshades that are deliciously fatal."
msgstr "좋은 선택이야! 끔찍하게 맛있는 가지과 식물이 몇 가지 떠오르는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 98395b0a-1309-2bae-5749-36b8783bbead
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_Night2_State_Night2Com(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion:98395b0a-1309-2bae-5749-36b8783bbead
msgctxt "h300825b6g5955g47cag8dbegd2032bc3ebf1"
msgid "Sounds like you've been learning all about your gruesome future."
msgstr "소름끼치는 미래에 대한 내용을 많이 배운 것 같네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 9aea1523-a057-7d3e-62d0-fa043895ab68
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion:9aea1523-a057-7d3e-62d0-fa043895ab68
msgctxt "he5539e97g5e5cg46e9g98c5g3d246c04599a"
msgid ""
"I'm not taking anything for granted, of course. First sign of change and "
"I'll have to stop that pretty little heart of yours."
msgstr "물론 나는 그 어떤 것도 당연하게 생각하지 않아. 변화의 징조가 보이면 나는 너의 그 앙증맞은 심장을 멈춰야겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9d710a75-2491-7d9f-c959-7965eb04ce06
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion:9d710a75-2491-7d9f-c959-7965eb04ce06
msgctxt "h534f6f06gd025g4409gb95bg79716acce0d2"
msgid "I'm hoping it'll stay that way."
msgstr "계속 이랬으면 좋겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 9de97f61-2476-7087-97c6-ff22d884d286
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion:9de97f61-2476-7087-97c6-ff22d884d286
msgctxt "h61589f0cg58feg47b7gb56dg790a163e50d6"
msgid ""
"I have to say, I thought you'd look worse, but no. Not a tentacle to be seen."
msgstr "솔직히 말해서, 네 상태가 더 나빠 보일 줄 알았는데, 아니었네. 촉수 하나 안 보이니 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a22fe1c5-75f3-8a83-3446-ac61b8341a65
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion:a22fe1c5-75f3-8a83-3446-ac61b8341a65
msgctxt "h3cc42e94gdf21g43d8g9bedgcf8b8a50da22"
msgid ""
"Should that happen, my advice would be to drop your weapon and <i>run</i>. "
"Very, very fast."
msgstr "만약 내가 변이한다면, 당장 무기를 버리고 <i>도망치는 게</i> 좋을 거야. 아주, 아주 빠르게."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = ab687fc5-7625-5333-30d2-d8aff4b609e4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion:ab687fc5-7625-5333-30d2-d8aff4b609e4
msgctxt "haa7a82bfg802bg4368gbe76ga09eb7797953"
msgid "Come on, humour me. If you had to choose..."
msgstr "어서, 나를 재미있게 해 봐. 만약 네가 선택해야 한다면..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = ab875574-d2ec-ed7e-0bc7-c3c86dfef330
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_Night2_State_Night2Com(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_Night2_State_Night2Com(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion:ab875574-d2ec-ed7e-0bc7-c3c86dfef330
msgctxt "h3667a8b8g9707g4965g974egeeb785beda8c"
msgid "So. Not a tentacle to be seen."
msgstr "음, 촉수 하나 없이 말끔하네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = ab8bc21e-9642-1a6f-a948-9664083794d9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion:ab8bc21e-9642-1a6f-a948-9664083794d9
msgctxt "h36c3b1dfg28c1g4290gb3f3ge9241510ef51"
msgid "Ha! I do like you, you know. You've got fire."
msgstr "하! 넌 내 마음에 드는군. 정말이야. 네가 불을 지폈어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = ae6de230-8041-0957-6c39-a7e7ca6e6d0f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion:ae6de230-8041-0957-6c39-a7e7ca6e6d0f
msgctxt "h594d95e1g8fb8g4542ga237ga47dacb07097"
msgid "Whatever happens, I'll make the right choice."
msgstr "어떤 일이 벌어지든, 난 옳은 선택을 할 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = ae7d25b9-5a40-15ad-8cfa-268ace4ecdbc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_Astarion_Night2_PickedKnife(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion:ae7d25b9-5a40-15ad-8cfa-268ace4ecdbc
msgctxt "h96a94c42gd9bcg41e6gb7e9g8c51d23ff036"
msgid "A classic! One good thrust to the heart and you're gone."
msgstr "고전적이군! 심장을 한 번만 잘 찌르면 바로 죽을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = aefad0ff-0277-0e1d-0a88-014585594e4c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion:aefad0ff-0277-0e1d-0a88-014585594e4c
msgctxt "h5ed50d29gc725g49ccgba8bg31055a10e7a4"
msgid ""
"We need a good blade, of course. Don't want to waste time hacking and "
"prodding with a dinner knife..."
msgstr "물론 우리에게 좋은 칼날이 필요하겠지. 식사용 나이프로 쿡 찌르고 써는 데 시간을 낭비하고 싶진 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b08eca8b-01c3-ccd5-7b1b-1c2ec8ef5ae1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion:b08eca8b-01c3-ccd5-7b1b-1c2ec8ef5ae1
msgctxt "h9a97fa3age780g4dcdg81fcga3462249acfb"
msgid "Decapitation sounds good, actually."
msgstr "듣고 보니, 참수도 괜찮을 것 같네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b13a5c7d-975b-71ab-0aff-240b1a1e6544
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion_AskedAstarion(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion:b13a5c7d-975b-71ab-0aff-240b1a1e6544
msgctxt "hf185c3b4g3432g4658gbed3g8b48a3a8231c"
msgid "And you? How should I kill you?"
msgstr "그럼 너는? 내가 어떻게 죽여줄까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = c0746ef2-136a-f714-4115-a6ad872cf7c2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion:c0746ef2-136a-f714-4115-a6ad872cf7c2
msgctxt "h8feadc8dg3797g4b36gae1dga268c3c32c48"
msgid "Then I suppose we'll just see what happens."
msgstr "그렇다면 우리는 무슨 일이 일어나는지 그저 지켜봐야겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = c2b80ee3-dfbf-4745-e606-affa442ce6ef
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion:c2b80ee3-dfbf-4745-e606-affa442ce6ef
msgctxt "h6b900f8dgd189g4b81g9f9ag73969ff0620f"
msgid ""
"Indeed you could. We're all doing surprisingly well, given the circumstances."
msgstr "물론 그럴 수 있겠지. 상황을 고려하면, 우리 모두 아주 잘 지내고 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = c318f2cd-ae5d-9e16-a4f6-00ccac941884
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion:c318f2cd-ae5d-9e16-a4f6-00ccac941884
msgctxt "hb712b7e1gcf26g4661gaa89g17ee7d195079"
msgid ""
"Well, I'm getting ahead of myself. This is all a worst case scenario, "
"obviously."
msgstr "이런, 내가 너무 앞서 나가고 있었네. 물론 이건 모두 최악의 시나리오지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ce0a098f-2e8d-42e7-40fc-343d60a38d29
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion:ce0a098f-2e8d-42e7-40fc-343d60a38d29
msgctxt "he0cc175ag07ddg48afg99f6gf6301be98573"
msgid "I'd prefer not to die."
msgstr "나는 죽고 싶지 않은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = cedf5938-bbbd-08e8-a2a2-231a5522459c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_Night2_State_Night2Com(1) = True
#.      - Camp_Night2_CRD_GaleTalkedTo(1) = False
#.      - CAMP_Night2_CRD_LaezelTalkedTo(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion:cedf5938-bbbd-08e8-a2a2-231a5522459c
msgctxt "h5abdc71cga4e0g45f3g9a77gf70365877f90"
msgid "I saw our gith friend inspecting you."
msgstr "우리 기스 친구가 널 검사하는 걸 봤어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = d6505c53-71f0-8335-0007-6220dd6de6e4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion:d6505c53-71f0-8335-0007-6220dd6de6e4
msgctxt "he269d0bdg6704g424fga302gea5473088565"
msgid ""
"I've always felt decapitation was a fine choice. One good swing and then - "
"nothing."
msgstr "난 항상 참수가 괜찮은 선택이라고 생각했어. 한 번만 휘두르면, 그대로 끝이잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = dc7fd513-2fff-e4df-a483-c2ec6416f635
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion:dc7fd513-2fff-e4df-a483-c2ec6416f635
msgctxt "heca9885dga1f1g468dga713g96567f289014"
msgid "Not sure. How would you like to go?"
msgstr "모르겠는데. 너라면 어떻게 하고 싶어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = e4331ba2-40cb-1b3d-c92f-b373bb73e614
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion:e4331ba2-40cb-1b3d-c92f-b373bb73e614
msgctxt "hccc7f218g8ceag448agb277g027f0f4475f2"
msgid ""
"Well now you're just being close-minded. There are some lovely ways to go."
msgstr "너는 꽉 막혀 있구나. 멋지게 죽을 수 있는 방법들이 많이 있다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ee1b93cc-e6d1-482e-2918-f446f814b338
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion:ee1b93cc-e6d1-482e-2918-f446f814b338
msgctxt "hc6273504geec5g46f1gae9egacb022a8af30"
msgid "I <i>don't </i>have to choose."
msgstr "나는 선택할 <i>필요 없어</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = eeae4644-a304-19e9-b59d-2445d079fc4b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion:eeae4644-a304-19e9-b59d-2445d079fc4b
msgctxt "ha90596begea01g4fb4g9e69g7611e06b3d15"
msgid "Naturally. But I was thinking: what if it doesn't?"
msgstr "그럼. 하지만 변이가 시작된다면?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = eef5bbf1-0f4b-44ab-da77-27636c346e8d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion:eef5bbf1-0f4b-44ab-da77-27636c346e8d
msgctxt "h2eaab47eg56b7g441dg8c30gc43a8f75970e"
msgid ""
"I've watched urchins freeze to death on the street. It looks peaceful - just "
"like falling asleep."
msgstr "나는 거리에서 부랑자가 얼어 죽는 것을 본 적이 있어. 마치 잠든 것처럼 평화로워 보였는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = f1a9c8c6-0639-3d26-dd56-6b7f94c603bc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: MALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion:f1a9c8c6-0639-3d26-dd56-6b7f94c603bc
msgctxt "hf2738ccagdd1dg4c37g95fag2699374cf2c5"
msgid "Ha! Oh, my boy. I'd like to see you try."
msgstr "하! 오, 그래. 네가 그러는 걸 보고 싶은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = f1a9c8c6-0639-3d26-dd56-6b7f94c603bc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion:f1a9c8c6-0639-3d26-dd56-6b7f94c603bc
msgctxt "h7b1e1e1bgaf2eg4192gad6bg13bff7001221"
msgid "Ha! Oh, my dear. I'd like to see you try."
msgstr "하! 오, 자기야. 네가 그러는 걸 보고 싶어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = fbbbab61-8995-f8f8-fcfe-a95ef60bb08f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Astarion:fbbbab61-8995-f8f8-fcfe-a95ef60bb08f
msgctxt "hf0ce5ccfg8479g4237gb5bdg408ccdf5f478"
msgid "See you in the morning. Sweet dreams, darling."
msgstr "내일 아침에 보자. 좋은 꿈 꿔, 자기."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 008c0c89-aa02-ddd1-36c1-87a2ec38df09
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale:008c0c89-aa02-ddd1-36c1-87a2ec38df09
msgctxt "h7ddb11c2g8b2ag4756gb66ag0a8b95108377"
msgid "Day seven: a mind flayer is born."
msgstr "7일째, 마인드 플레이어가 태어나는 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 011ee3f8-dd96-e7b9-73b7-1baf616ce362
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale:011ee3f8-dd96-e7b9-73b7-1baf616ce362
msgctxt "h45f55599g4d3bg42e4gb505ge7ab330a272f"
msgid "A githyanki's worst fate."
msgstr "기스양키 최악의 운명이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 01e9b966-ec8a-7df4-8577-bffd0a948ce7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale:01e9b966-ec8a-7df4-8577-bffd0a948ce7
msgctxt "h8c9b7e05g8c97g4f49g88ebgcbf9fa533ec3"
msgid "<i>Nod.</i>"
msgstr "<i>끄덕인다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 06f9fb5b-3241-0c43-2193-e9fd24c9f489
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale:06f9fb5b-3241-0c43-2193-e9fd24c9f489
msgctxt "h81e0e770g4a4bg4670gadcdg4f38844a8ee1"
msgid "Be that as it may."
msgstr "그건 그렇고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0db09353-4b94-2cc9-44c0-7967507af556
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale:0db09353-4b94-2cc9-44c0-7967507af556
msgctxt "h91345bafg2dc9g4a2eg9c73gcada49990220"
msgid "What are you doing?"
msgstr "뭐 하는 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 10ed9d6b-fe09-dc9c-41d5-3a4800c924cf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale:10ed9d6b-fe09-dc9c-41d5-3a4800c924cf
msgctxt "he5d5ee27ged2cg438eg8dbag10083aa72cdc"
msgid "Be with you in a moment!"
msgstr "잠시만!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 12dc0ce6-59cb-0cfd-6be0-6e4d35532f28
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale:12dc0ce6-59cb-0cfd-6be0-6e4d35532f28
msgctxt "h9daa7245gfe45g4b1fga1ddg4f3e755ed835"
msgid "A rogue might call it luck; a priest might call it fate."
msgstr "로그는 그걸 운이라고, 사제는 운명이라고 부를지도 모르지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1f0c1395-8e76-7cb7-e103-6577f5d9af51
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: !(SORCERER and WARLOCK and WIZARD)
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale:1f0c1395-8e76-7cb7-e103-6577f5d9af51
msgctxt "hda1ac9ceg859fg45f0g92dbg51d5fd940523"
msgid "All that wizardry makes me uncomfortable."
msgstr "그 온갖 마법 때문에 불편해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 21e60927-fdfc-fb72-01bc-30b194a352d9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale:21e60927-fdfc-fb72-01bc-30b194a352d9
msgctxt "h274b1e0fg65d8g4920g8cc1gf8cbcf2bc513"
msgid "Just wrap this up, will you?"
msgstr "그냥 좀 마무리 해주지 않을래?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 22b0b22f-c2fb-b368-5895-1d2f14f1829c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale:22b0b22f-c2fb-b368-5895-1d2f14f1829c
msgctxt "h1e8f222cg7543g42e1g97d2g662de503e0f8"
msgid "If you're about to start a lecture, I'm not interested."
msgstr "강의를 늘어놓고 싶은 거라면, 관심 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 2a6366e0-040d-2fca-ce7b-b29447f3aaa0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale:2a6366e0-040d-2fca-ce7b-b29447f3aaa0
msgctxt "h28c1c009g5e9cg41b2g97ccg3fc9491a1d32"
msgid ""
"Day four: excruciating pain as the skeleton and organs reform and reposition."
msgstr "4일째, 골격과 내장들이 재구축되고 위치를 옮기면서 극심한 통증이 찾아와."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 2be1609b-aeaa-cf68-5792-48087123be45
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale:2be1609b-aeaa-cf68-5792-48087123be45
msgctxt "h9fc266d6gf92cg4d58ga6acg7317f2e2e6de"
msgid "I take it you get the picture?"
msgstr "이제 이해되지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2d01eed4-3c67-7d49-09db-0504066f6dfc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale:2d01eed4-3c67-7d49-09db-0504066f6dfc
msgctxt "hbaa5288bge1f3g47efg93ebg0b580242d00f"
msgid "A very vivid picture. And very upsetting."
msgstr "아주 생생한걸. 아주 불길하고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3031cf6e-e061-a81b-aa6a-fedc207ae6eb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale:3031cf6e-e061-a81b-aa6a-fedc207ae6eb
msgctxt "h719defb9g49f6g48fag85ccg2233d99857d5"
msgid "First and foremost: that damn tadpole."
msgstr "무엇보다도 그 망할 올챙이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 334ef13f-6350-bade-ac45-fd34c2a1114d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - SORCERER_WILDMAGIC(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale:334ef13f-6350-bade-ac45-fd34c2a1114d
msgctxt "haf4fe2begc7fcg49bdg9a2egce02037ecb41"
msgid "Make it dance. Oh, or breathe fire!"
msgstr "춤을 추게 해봐. 오, 아니면 불을 뿜게!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 381cb68c-5208-0db1-826f-01316733ac57
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale:381cb68c-5208-0db1-826f-01316733ac57
msgctxt "h7b3647f8gd433g4740g8f71gfd6c1e3d5ac3"
msgid "Day two: hallucinations and greying skin."
msgstr "2일째, 환각이 보이고 피부가 회색으로 변해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 39d77b7f-5370-93af-0d29-2d91fe85201c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale:39d77b7f-5370-93af-0d29-2d91fe85201c
msgctxt "hbd894a3dge179g4e16ga08cgf12559fb750b"
msgid "I'll toast to that."
msgstr "건배."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 43911b84-f5a8-b600-144a-ddb9a96940fe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale:43911b84-f5a8-b600-144a-ddb9a96940fe
msgctxt "he22931eegf234g4c92ga7ddga4a6defb87fd"
msgid "Any expert will agree: this is... abnormal."
msgstr "어느 전문가라도 동의하겠지. 이건... 뭔가 비정상적이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 4435e721-963f-c6d7-52be-18f78dceca0b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale:4435e721-963f-c6d7-52be-18f78dceca0b
msgctxt "hf52b0afag09efg4cb7g9369gc6f3c10109b2"
msgid ""
"But what is happening, or rather not happening to us, is entirely "
"undocumented."
msgstr "하지만 우리에게 일어나거나, 어떻게 보면 일어나지 않고 있는 일은, 기록된 적 없는 일이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 450f888f-98dd-57ca-6a07-317ae5cb77ae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale:450f888f-98dd-57ca-6a07-317ae5cb77ae
msgctxt "h389f7ac3g044cg4c4bgb9deg013020588372"
msgid "Long live the abnormal."
msgstr "비정상 만세."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 4715562f-d882-a377-db75-d6ae761d470b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale:4715562f-d882-a377-db75-d6ae761d470b
msgctxt "ha5b56bcag7b34g4c02g8332gfaeef32eb79e"
msgid "Whatever for? Look at him! Never too much of a good thing, I say."
msgstr "뭣 때문에 그래? 저 친구 좀 봐! 뭐, 멋진 것도 지나치면 나쁜 법이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 4a3d2b3a-8bd3-b891-3524-315278c46e01
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale:4a3d2b3a-8bd3-b891-3524-315278c46e01
msgctxt "h58ec65c8g7773g4574g9f0dg7d933d9a6dec"
msgid ""
"Our orifices remain blissfully unbloodied. Our heads remain clear, and our "
"blood temperature normal."
msgstr "우리 구멍들은 핏방울 하나 없이 깨끗해. 우리 정신은 아직 맑고, 체온도 아주 정상이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 50be604e-6b32-7331-0821-aea643d66171
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_Night2_CRD_LaezelTalkedTo(2) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale:50be604e-6b32-7331-0821-aea643d66171
msgctxt "h3207104fgfd9bg4748g9c6fgb946dbd516a0"
msgid "Ceremorphosis. What does it make you think of?"
msgstr "뇌변이. 그 말을 들으면 무슨 생각이 들지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 50f84e68-f666-c154-4016-68090f525c65
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale_SpotOn(2) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale:50f84e68-f666-c154-4016-68090f525c65
msgctxt "hfaaaaf24g0fceg40ccg9a03g0c33b24285f0"
msgid "Exactly."
msgstr "정확해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 52dcc540-6b5a-8aee-f8f9-13416c467626
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(2) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale_GotRight(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale:52dcc540-6b5a-8aee-f8f9-13416c467626
msgctxt "hc62b7c33g3497g45ceg9511g0526d20315fc"
msgid "I do, but I'd like to see if you get the rest right."
msgstr "그렇긴 한데, 나머지 부분도 잘 설명하는지 보고 싶어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 554c6aa9-e992-fabf-2536-456dab543bb1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale:554c6aa9-e992-fabf-2536-456dab543bb1
msgctxt "h0c50820dg1cd6g4d20g8fe0gbee636d63e81"
msgid "And what makes you the expert?"
msgstr "네가 뭔데 전문가라는 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 582eaf8c-2b9d-582c-479f-537dd5f7c446
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale:582eaf8c-2b9d-582c-479f-537dd5f7c446
msgctxt "h599aa2c5g71fbg4e06gb672gb29f62743507"
msgid "Agreed. This is not the version I learned by heart."
msgstr "동의해. 이건 내가 배운 판본이 아니야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 683281e6-db53-50d1-e831-b505cbbefad5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale:683281e6-db53-50d1-e831-b505cbbefad5
msgctxt "h43e452degaf7dg463fg847eg22f6faf62452"
msgid ""
"Thanks to the tadpole, we should have developed more than invasive symptoms "
"by now, but we haven't."
msgstr "이 고마운 올챙이들 덕에, 지금쯤이면 외과적인 증상이 나타나고도 남아야 했는데, 전혀 그러지 않고 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 6a92085a-b1c6-a46a-17d4-7f750a4b7ed6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale:6a92085a-b1c6-a46a-17d4-7f750a4b7ed6
msgctxt "hd38219c5g20dfg49ecgb1e2gcc9204b087f6"
msgid "As for myself: I'm a pragmatic. I see the silence before the storm."
msgstr "내 생각을 말하자면, 난 현실주의자야. 이건 마치 폭풍 전의 고요함 같아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 6c869a0d-a2be-4c97-f64b-6819e5133676
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale_SpotOn(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale:6c869a0d-a2be-4c97-f64b-6819e5133676
msgctxt "hf6b4cc0eg462cg4568g95d9g64ff5d1f8c37"
msgid "Spot on again."
msgstr "다시 한번 정답이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 72933969-f65e-8252-250b-cd387e3755c0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale:72933969-f65e-8252-250b-cd387e3755c0
msgctxt "h0ab67faag87aeg415bgbb0cgb1316c435d2e"
msgid "Day six: the flesh around the mouth splits to make way for tentacles."
msgstr "6일째, 촉수를 위한 자리를 만들기 위해 입 주변의 살갗이 갈라져."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 7849d144-030b-3f7f-8e10-089b507c7d47
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_Night2_CRD_LaezelTalkedTo(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale:7849d144-030b-3f7f-8e10-089b507c7d47
msgctxt "hec41a287gf6ccg4a03ga2e2g1d233d3fc4f2"
msgid "I saw Lae'zel giving you a look-over. Great minds think alike."
msgstr "아까 레이젤이 널 살펴보는 걸 봤어. 현명한 사람들은 생각이 비슷한 법이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7a91b7fa-b527-f40d-7bbb-7edc6b67bbf1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale:7a91b7fa-b527-f40d-7bbb-7edc6b67bbf1
msgctxt "h97778551gd01cg4d68ga32eg1d51c6f7e520"
msgid "<i>Shake your head. You know this routine all too well.</i>"
msgstr "<i>고개를 흔든다. 당신은 이 과정에 대해서 아주 잘 알고 있다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 7d3bcd6a-9fb3-c4e8-7eab-1e054e32140b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale:7d3bcd6a-9fb3-c4e8-7eab-1e054e32140b
msgctxt "h16f10631g4e2dg44abg9ce8g710004df5c9b"
msgid "The pragmatic in me, however, sees only the silence before the storm."
msgstr "하지만, 내 안의 현실주의자가 보기엔, 그저 폭풍 전의 고요함 같아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 7f1c53ce-9f3c-286e-9f76-f59abde206a0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale:7f1c53ce-9f3c-286e-9f76-f59abde206a0
msgctxt "h3974c506g4d5bg4701g884bg8b6f9e1fbde5"
msgid "The storyteller's gift."
msgstr "내 말솜씨 덕분이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 893a50af-b7ce-2f21-c2c1-343e94da0364
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - SORCERER(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale:893a50af-b7ce-2f21-c2c1-343e94da0364
msgctxt "h75490963g110ag4845g90a4g2ffb7a38bd64"
msgid "Typical. A wizard using magic just to admire his own beard."
msgstr "아주 전형적이네. 위저드가 자기 수염을 보고 감탄하기 위해서 마법을 사용하다니."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8b9ee97c-1012-5d3f-2d08-9b360d89997c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - SORCERER_DRACONIC(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale:8b9ee97c-1012-5d3f-2d08-9b360d89997c
msgctxt "h43830d3dg5b20g4692gb93ag1bd09e95ea85"
msgid "Dragon blood is hardy stuff. I'm not surprised I'm immune."
msgstr "드래곤의 혈통은 아주 강인해. 내가 면역력이 있다고 해도 별로 놀랍진 않을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 8c1fa2a5-119f-21b1-6af1-7d66a6dd01ec
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale:8c1fa2a5-119f-21b1-6af1-7d66a6dd01ec
msgctxt "h8ca43d30g4071g4e7fgb66ag00d86b4cc9bc"
msgid "It's done all that and more at plenty a soirée, I can tell you."
msgstr "훌륭한 파티에서 그보다 멋진 솜씨를 뽐낸 적이 많았지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 8f04642e-fd41-9f1e-dad9-672439af01b6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale:8f04642e-fd41-9f1e-dad9-672439af01b6
msgctxt "h2cf50e28g927dg496cgbc86gfe234702a307"
msgid "Study."
msgstr "배웠으니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 8f298f23-afd9-8c72-61c1-30151310776a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale:8f298f23-afd9-8c72-61c1-30151310776a
msgctxt "he2bf5e1agfa98g4992gbcd7g7372f034f2e4"
msgid ""
"No doubt she came to the same conclusion: we're healthier than we should be."
msgstr "의심할 필요도 없이 같은 결론에 도달했겠지. 우린 비정상적으로 건강해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 906961c6-57a4-f2ea-961c-4c697551dad2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale:906961c6-57a4-f2ea-961c-4c697551dad2
msgctxt "h3d8cdcd2gf80cg4670gbecfg84e8ccf7d855"
msgid "Can you explain why the symptoms aren't showing?"
msgstr "왜 증상이 나타나지 않는지 설명해줄 수 있어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 930a967c-aaf7-c92c-43cd-56072a7a1029
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale:930a967c-aaf7-c92c-43cd-56072a7a1029
msgctxt "h0d1060b7g5e7dg479fg91bbgc45bc4af00b9"
msgid "Day three: hair loss and blood leaking from all orifices."
msgstr "3일째, 머리털이 빠지고 모든 구멍에서 피가 새어나오기 시작해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 95415269-96f3-2cde-50a2-c529e62f455c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale_SpotOn(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale:95415269-96f3-2cde-50a2-c529e62f455c
msgctxt "h0f8e4e72gdf75g4bc7gb0e3g8d367d8ac7af"
msgid "Spot on."
msgstr "정확히 맞혔어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 97536a13-390a-8653-c399-20ee9c6ee78e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - IMPOSSIBLE = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale:97536a13-390a-8653-c399-20ee9c6ee78e
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "ha3976249g3b35g4268gb689g9b8f194e4db6"
msgid "This version was more than vivid enough for my tastes."
msgstr "이 버전은 내 취향에 넘치도록 생생했어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 975b290f-d4c4-db47-0247-4528a1d35f27
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale:975b290f-d4c4-db47-0247-4528a1d35f27
msgctxt "hf48bd239g556bg40dbg9fadgd95a7aa2263b"
msgid "Neat trick."
msgstr "근사한 속임수네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 99130356-fb9b-1832-4db1-061419aba603
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale:99130356-fb9b-1832-4db1-061419aba603
msgctxt "h5b2dd230g3dd6g4fd2ga607gfa965790d15b"
msgid ""
"My point is this: our orifices remain blissfully unbloodied. Our heads "
"remain clear, and our blood temperature normal."
msgstr "요점은 이거야. 우리 구멍들은 조금도 피에 젖지 않았어. 정신은 아직 또렷하고, 체온도 정상이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 9ab3cc81-db1b-1d9b-8bf1-254abbdbd771
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale:9ab3cc81-db1b-1d9b-8bf1-254abbdbd771
msgctxt "h42c553e2g488cg43a2g89a0g3e5f52d4c03a"
msgid ""
"What is happening, or rather not happening to us, is entirely undocumented."
msgstr "우리에게 일어나거나, 어떻게 보면 일어나지 않고 있는 일은, 기록된 적 없는 일이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 9cb1f2f8-d4d5-d76b-e1bd-4bd7a0d2c8dc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale:9cb1f2f8-d4d5-d76b-e1bd-4bd7a0d2c8dc
msgctxt "h7f76f71egb83cg4bfbgbaa7gc284d016285f"
msgid "Need I go on?"
msgstr "계속할까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9dd0ab6a-71ec-80ea-dbd8-1237d5a4f793
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(2) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale:9dd0ab6a-71ec-80ea-dbd8-1237d5a4f793
msgctxt "habb5a3aeg4e6cg4c9eg914cgc7af5eb18e57"
msgid "<i>Shake your head.</i>"
msgstr "<i>고개를 흔든다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9ec27209-a0a1-618a-ecfe-88cfa20ec8a1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale:9ec27209-a0a1-618a-ecfe-88cfa20ec8a1
msgctxt "h42d2d1dbgb344g4b6cgae43gd40ff21bab4d"
msgid "We should be having a fever by now. Greying skin even."
msgstr "지금쯤엔 발열이 나타났어야 해. 피부도 회색으로 변하고 말이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = a6ba4b3b-aa76-fc3e-5aad-b9a3bec1f736
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale:a6ba4b3b-aa76-fc3e-5aad-b9a3bec1f736
msgctxt "ha1274dd0gf053g4d2aga15fgf3abbd9f0da7"
msgid "Ah, yes. The good old days."
msgstr "아, 그래. 좋았던 시절이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = ab7e4747-60a5-cde6-a071-bd1beaaa6847
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale:ab7e4747-60a5-cde6-a071-bd1beaaa6847
msgctxt "hc5e14963g94d1g49fega3dagdef89eb93f2d"
msgid "Uncharted territory. The silence before the storm."
msgstr "미지의 영역이야. 폭풍 전의 고요함이랄까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = ae67303c-1478-7421-304e-9caa6cad953f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale:ae67303c-1478-7421-304e-9caa6cad953f
msgctxt "h009a5ea9g6133g48b1g803dg23f15f5a58e0"
msgid "Not the prettiest of transmutations, is it?"
msgstr "어때, 예쁜 변이는 아니지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = af3f09d2-4d09-fbc6-a6e1-bde8f3c4fdec
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(2) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale:af3f09d2-4d09-fbc6-a6e1-bde8f3c4fdec
msgctxt "h1821a8f0g9d3fg4be2gaff2g3cc648913264"
msgid "I do, but you might as well finish the picture."
msgstr "이해는 되지만, 마저 설명해 줘."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = b0ecb9b0-95d6-76d5-95cb-1fd786631666
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale:b0ecb9b0-95d6-76d5-95cb-1fd786631666
msgctxt "h3c1c5343g4a32g46f4g91adg96fe0bbfc0ed"
msgid "Day one: fever and memory loss."
msgstr "1일째, 발열과 기억 상실."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b5bc7ac8-9211-491e-de51-6c7bd4218853
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale:b5bc7ac8-9211-491e-de51-6c7bd4218853
msgctxt "h137ba62bge9aag49a3g97e1gbcb0cf24efee"
msgid "Until quite recently, nothing at all."
msgstr "최근까지는, 아무 생각도 없었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = bdce6e03-0ac7-bfe5-df18-4accffc7d86b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale:bdce6e03-0ac7-bfe5-df18-4accffc7d86b
msgctxt "he101cb8egaca4g42b0gb068gb82b017f365f"
msgid "Something to sleep on. We should get some rest."
msgstr "자면서 고민해 봐야 할 문제야. 좀 쉬자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c096c3a7-591f-daa6-77a2-75322189797f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale:c096c3a7-591f-daa6-77a2-75322189797f
msgctxt "h3bb6362dg1fd5g4688ga5cdg7fbae592261d"
msgid "I've heard enough."
msgstr "충분해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = c469bbcc-7822-002e-9ccb-465b58cec2a5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale:c469bbcc-7822-002e-9ccb-465b58cec2a5
msgctxt "hb278a5b2gc855g414ag9a90g07c057ed3b7d"
msgid "Long story short then:"
msgstr "요약하자면."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = d34237ce-61ee-c9e8-42af-d120e6fb955b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale:d34237ce-61ee-c9e8-42af-d120e6fb955b
msgctxt "h8056874cgbf68g463egbd9bg1656664b2eba"
msgid "Not a trick, my friend. Magic!"
msgstr "속임수가 아니라 마법이야, 친구!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = d4189160-4608-0472-4074-2a202a0df47a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale:d4189160-4608-0472-4074-2a202a0df47a
msgctxt "ha983ca4eg425dg4f49gb0a3g81e1f65c5b4a"
msgid "Indulging in a spot of vanity. Handsome devil, aren't I?"
msgstr "허영심에 사로잡힌 거지. 나 정말 잘생기지 않았어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = d48660e6-7e96-d5cb-a01b-d94247badfc5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale:d48660e6-7e96-d5cb-a01b-d94247badfc5
msgctxt "h1a37c28eg3065g4b94gb94cgcae58ffdea2f"
msgid ""
"Day five: the host's personality has disappeared. Fingers, toes and limbs "
"elongate."
msgstr "5일째, 숙주의 인격은 사라지고, 손가락과 발가락, 팔다리가 늘어져."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = d502b7a9-9d80-4021-581c-a1ea11e8c35a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale:d502b7a9-9d80-4021-581c-a1ea11e8c35a
msgctxt "h939f7d00gdb9fg4a62ga85cg5261e3c6c9a3"
msgid "Can't say I blame you."
msgstr "어쩔 수 없지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = df523706-53bb-75be-73f0-cc2986baff9f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale:df523706-53bb-75be-73f0-cc2986baff9f
msgctxt "h6206ccaeg202dg448cga804g33fe3ced8858"
msgid "That, alas, is where my knowledge fails me."
msgstr "그건, 안타깝게도 내 지식 밖이야 ."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = e47cc522-11c3-18b3-eec9-f7336c07c301
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - IMPOSSIBLE = True
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale_GotRight(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale:e47cc522-11c3-18b3-eec9-f7336c07c301
msgctxt "h3841ff68g4588g46adg9b9bg816f3e544d5b"
msgid "A faultless if abridged version of the facts."
msgstr "현실에 대한 요약으로 흠잡을 데 없는 이야기지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = eb5df538-d113-1aaa-4252-2b161eb358c0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_Night2_State_Night2Com(2) = True
#.     - Camp_Night2_CRD_GaleTalkedTo(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale:eb5df538-d113-1aaa-4252-2b161eb358c0
msgctxt "hcaeb535egafa6g4032g84acgc304447385e9"
msgid "*Indistinct humming.*"
msgstr "*희미한 콧노래.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = ee0e39b9-8487-ba4a-fe94-d24fa2f90eea
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - IMPOSSIBLE = True
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale_GotRight(2) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale:ee0e39b9-8487-ba4a-fe94-d24fa2f90eea
msgctxt "hc7187608g4bbfg476dg85c3g09a77cbe5ca2"
msgid "This is the abridged version of course."
msgstr "물론 이건 요약본이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = efecc15d-388b-905f-a31d-268febf99b46
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale:efecc15d-388b-905f-a31d-268febf99b46
msgctxt "he031b922g22e5g4a15g8df9gf1816d642fc0"
msgid "Yes, but that doesn't quite explain little old me, now does it?"
msgstr "그래, 하지만 내 경우를 설명할 수는 없잖아, 안 그래?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = f04cd593-7c89-33be-344f-bd9627120c00
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale:f04cd593-7c89-33be-344f-bd9627120c00
msgctxt "h9ff7f05egaef9g4852ga5fbg770bd69e7a69"
msgid "A gentleman's only as dashing as his least groomed locus."
msgstr "신사는 가장 단장이 덜 된 부분만큼만 멋있을 뿐이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fd964b73-cfd3-81e6-27a2-06ab453a3e69
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: WARLOCK or WIZARD
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Gale:fd964b73-cfd3-81e6-27a2-06ab453a3e69
msgctxt "h4e9ac5d2g538fg4f25gafdag2009ac1e3881"
msgid "Why are you studying your own mirror image?"
msgstr "왜 네 스스로의 거울상을 그렇게 바라보고 있는 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 012a350f-24b2-65fa-168e-5eb62dea1bb5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Karlach:012a350f-24b2-65fa-168e-5eb62dea1bb5
msgctxt "h5e6a6a85gb0bbg409eg8370gda251c5c738c"
msgid "What am I listening for, exactly?"
msgstr "정확히 뭘 들어보라는 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 0a2785ee-9e3b-1736-f28c-c66e3eafc31c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Karlach:0a2785ee-9e3b-1736-f28c-c66e3eafc31c
msgctxt "h163e27d9g67bdg4cc8g83a7gdf302064ad80"
msgid "And do you want to know my favourite part?"
msgstr "그리고 그중에서도 가장 좋은 게 뭔 줄 알아?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 148f0ca1-4b66-977d-1de8-0b18e17a4f18
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Karlach:148f0ca1-4b66-977d-1de8-0b18e17a4f18
msgctxt "he5eb6618ga4d4g469dg92e7gae3146415865"
msgid "And what's that?"
msgstr "그게 뭔데?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1c7bf3d1-c2b6-5daf-562f-995ae05023e1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Karlach:1c7bf3d1-c2b6-5daf-562f-995ae05023e1
msgctxt "hce157d9egc744g425bgb9e7g806a2864d000"
msgid "I hadn't taken you for a frolicker."
msgstr "네가 이렇게 말이 많은 줄은 몰랐는걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 1d18d2ec-43fa-f2fe-e496-7f7ffa3e39dc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Karlach:1d18d2ec-43fa-f2fe-e496-7f7ffa3e39dc
msgctxt "hce3a60eagc668g4864gb9a4gc7a12b1b7ff8"
msgid ""
"Well, I'm certainly part of it! The breeze, the fire, me big stupid head. I "
"love it here. So much."
msgstr "뭐, 나도 그 안에 있긴 하지! 이 바람, 이 모닥불, 그리고 내 멍청한 헛소리까지. 난 여기가 너무 좋아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 21c56bf0-858f-3354-9c9a-b75be9826523
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Karlach:21c56bf0-858f-3354-9c9a-b75be9826523
msgctxt "hed2a82a1ga933g4d22ga395gca5b8dc5c9a6"
msgid ""
"Yes! And the fire, and a faint murmur in the distance. I love it here. So "
"much."
msgstr "그래! 그리고 모닥불 소리랑, 멀리서 들려오는 희미한 웅성거림도. 난 여기가 좋아. 정말."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 23509262-e70f-9f99-000a-88592c747255
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_WLDMAIN_State_InRegion(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Karlach:23509262-e70f-9f99-000a-88592c747255
msgctxt "h71284d03g5069g40f9gb1c9g722004f0c8d2"
msgid ""
"Granted this isn't the world's best spot for grassing, but I've taken my "
"opportunities where I could."
msgstr "물론 여기 잔디가 최고는 아니겠지만, 어디든 즐길 수 있다면 즐겨야지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 39b24975-dc2a-f764-bc8a-34b632c43b20
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Karlach:39b24975-dc2a-f764-bc8a-34b632c43b20
msgctxt "h147ffbf4g750eg473dga4b4g4feea2ca72eb"
msgid "Crushing evil-doers?"
msgstr "사악한 놈들을 박살 내는 거?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 3f0aa5cb-dc22-e1be-b536-643408fb35b6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Karlach:3f0aa5cb-dc22-e1be-b536-643408fb35b6
msgctxt "hb3a71c48ge652g4b95gb6cagc48af532eb26"
msgid "Baby, I'm nothing if not frolicsome."
msgstr "그래, 말 많은 거 빼면 아무것도 아니지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 43ae6242-1ef0-74ac-4f86-ab99e2119113
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Karlach:43ae6242-1ef0-74ac-4f86-ab99e2119113
msgctxt "h509aa5dagc4d3g4b87ga624ga8a60199e1b4"
msgid "Crackling fire. A little breeze. I love it here. So much."
msgstr "탁탁 튀는 불꽃. 가볍게 부는 바람. 여긴 정말 좋아. 정말."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4f38c7c5-6490-e65a-d8b9-35585838c852
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Karlach:4f38c7c5-6490-e65a-d8b9-35585838c852
msgctxt "h90ff3c00g6cc4g4d66g8603g458437284c2c"
msgid "Tell me."
msgstr "말해 봐."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 52954e27-4ab8-b8eb-a485-344dcd4eb353
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Karlach:52954e27-4ab8-b8eb-a485-344dcd4eb353
msgctxt "h80c89691g25cdg4f6dg8152gc39bc319fb1f"
msgid "This camp. Faerûn. Toril. The Material Plane. <i>Paradise.</i>"
msgstr "이 야영지. 페이룬. 토릴. 물질계. <i>낙원</i>이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 568d2fcc-4a87-8cc5-50d3-58d220c36581
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Karlach:568d2fcc-4a87-8cc5-50d3-58d220c36581
msgctxt "hc6aea9c1g0141g4d2bg8caeg38bbe2bfd2d9"
msgid "All I hear is you."
msgstr "네 목소리밖에 안 들리는걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 595e1179-c1a1-a716-7df0-1ecb9386074f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Karlach:595e1179-c1a1-a716-7df0-1ecb9386074f
msgctxt "h3035a1b1ge02ag4386gb39eg2345f2c1a50f"
msgid "Could be worse, I suppose."
msgstr "이 정도면 나쁘지 않지, 내 생각에도 그래."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 647601ae-e88f-0821-691f-0908812590f5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Karlach:647601ae-e88f-0821-691f-0908812590f5
msgctxt "hce6e53a3g5f52g47aega397gcb9256a18a8a"
msgid ""
"I've got everything I need in abundance, right here. Including my "
"<i>favourite </i>thing."
msgstr "여긴 내가 필요한 모든 게 넘쳐나잖아. 내가 <i>제일 좋아하는 것</i>도."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 65207733-ca60-ec04-4e2b-a138aceb6433
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Karlach:65207733-ca60-ec04-4e2b-a138aceb6433
msgctxt "h0fdd5d28g3d79g4748g9749ga554ea50d2a8"
msgid ""
"After where you've been, I'm not surprised this place seems like heaven."
msgstr "네가 있던 곳을 생각하면, 천국같이 느껴져도 이상하지 않지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6935f054-464f-453d-6b5b-996b488d22fb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - DRUID(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Karlach:6935f054-464f-453d-6b5b-996b488d22fb
msgctxt "h50a3be6bg74a2g4c2ag90bbg3b26e3fb3810"
msgid "'Grave-hair'. A beautiful name for it."
msgstr "\"무덤의 머리카락\". 아름다운 이름인걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6bb180f2-fa7e-84a8-fdf7-58c2ba288b53
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Karlach:6bb180f2-fa7e-84a8-fdf7-58c2ba288b53
msgctxt "h9bb0b820g6070g4865gb0b1g2cf9b752860b"
msgid ""
"There is a far finer paradise than this waiting for those who serve the gods."
msgstr "신을 모시는 자에겐 이보다 훨씬 근사한 낙원이 기다리고 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 764fff91-d1f1-13d5-095a-e07e04fd78aa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Karlach:764fff91-d1f1-13d5-095a-e07e04fd78aa
msgctxt "hf7305812g6637g4f41g9544g793eccccc964"
msgid ""
"Oh my gods, grass. Perfect, soft, grave-hair. Feels like heaven between the "
"toes."
msgstr "맙소사, 잔디야. 완벽하고, 부드러운 무덤의 머리카락. 발가락 사이에서 천국이 느껴지는 것 같아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 77374293-b625-a7cc-d03b-483bab087356
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Karlach:77374293-b625-a7cc-d03b-483bab087356
msgctxt "hc14ea141g2a38g443fg8fc5g1768c80127a1"
msgid ""
"Greedy bastard. Look around you. A beautiful, interesting world, a few risks "
"and bothers to keep us on our toes. Friends, food, a bed to sleep in. I'm "
"telling you, this is <i>it</i>."
msgstr ""
"욕심이 많네. 주변을 보라고. 아름답고 흥미진진한 세상이 펼쳐져 있잖아. 우릴 귀찮게 하고 괴롭히는 위협도 많지 않지. 친구도, 음식도 "
"있고, 잠잘 침대도 있어. <i>여기</i>가 낙원이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 812d46db-1a9b-4532-81f7-91c1ecaee046
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Karlach:812d46db-1a9b-4532-81f7-91c1ecaee046
msgctxt "h64dab9a7gfacbg48afgb754gabf754e875bd"
msgid "Well, I'm going to tell you anyway."
msgstr "괜찮아. 어차피 말해줄 거였거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 88b44d35-2a2e-16d5-58a1-e3c493db2750
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Karlach:88b44d35-2a2e-16d5-58a1-e3c493db2750
msgctxt "h660da965g5c07g44degb7e0g1227fa2ea5a8"
msgid "<i>Grass. </i>Perfect, soft, grave-hair. Heaven between the toes."
msgstr "<i>잔디야</i>. 완벽하고, 부드러운 무덤의 머리카락. 발가락 사이에서 천국이 느껴지는 것 같아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 8e6b352d-7d0a-0ff8-22ee-4d7c2120462d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Karlach:8e6b352d-7d0a-0ff8-22ee-4d7c2120462d
msgctxt "h6d4cbc60g3282g4de0ga626g3430b254b63f"
msgid "Damn, I'm so fucking happy to be back."
msgstr "젠장, 돌아오니까 존나 좋은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 949df9cd-e712-bfd0-770f-fc1376b09e6d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Karlach:949df9cd-e712-bfd0-770f-fc1376b09e6d
msgctxt "h73673543g937cg4dd0g88d8g112653216d19"
msgid "Good gods, you ain't lying."
msgstr "그래, 네 말이 맞아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9655f265-3621-56a8-441e-e26317a996f3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Karlach:9655f265-3621-56a8-441e-e26317a996f3
msgctxt "h7e054ddfge245g4f00g81fdg7afc4c3b4329"
msgid "A bit of a breeze, a snapping twig?"
msgstr "바람 소리와 나무가지 꺾이는 소리?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 98c27f40-8bc9-f375-4e21-945ebd1ab92e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Karlach:98c27f40-8bc9-f375-4e21-945ebd1ab92e
msgctxt "hd5b1a751g5c33g491dg90b7g766b8979a4ab"
msgid "You're in the top ten. But I was thinking of... <i>grass.</i>"
msgstr "너도 10위 안에 들긴 해. 난 사실... <i>잔디</i>를 생각하고 있었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a2cd1019-cd44-5bbb-e78d-345459db6357
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Karlach:a2cd1019-cd44-5bbb-e78d-345459db6357
msgctxt "hf615e9aag6b7fg44b8g8c0bg27e4e8e6abb4"
msgid "Not particularly."
msgstr "잘 모르겠는걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = a48a2b83-2e9d-b075-053f-05ae8d13b42e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Karlach:a48a2b83-2e9d-b075-053f-05ae8d13b42e
msgctxt "hae40704fg5ac4g4162g9cf8g623dc5b9bc9f"
msgid "And it is, in loads of places. But here? Here we've got it all."
msgstr "당연하지. 얼마나 끔찍한 곳이 많은데. 여기? 필요한 건 다 있잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = b55d3430-975e-9bad-2055-83b542dc4b04
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Karlach:b55d3430-975e-9bad-2055-83b542dc4b04
msgctxt "hf1408d16g135eg45cfg9fe5g8a95fba62558"
msgid ""
"Even if this place, this <i>moment</i>, isn't your idea of heaven, believe "
"me: it could be a gixillion times worse."
msgstr "이곳, 이 <i>순간</i>이 네겐 낙원처럼 느껴지지 않는다 해도, 잊지 마. 이건 정말 나쁘지 않은 거라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = bb09914c-3bd8-dba0-dd53-78c1decabcc1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Karlach:bb09914c-3bd8-dba0-dd53-78c1decabcc1
msgctxt "h996724a7g02ebg45d8g817agf081b97dae39"
msgid "It's grass. Perfect, soft grave-hair. Heaven between the toes."
msgstr "잔디야. 완벽하고, 부드러운 무덤의 머리카락. 발가락 사이에서 천국이 느껴지는 것 같아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c04c82dd-8c88-fc52-d188-747f520cf27f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - RANGER(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Karlach:c04c82dd-8c88-fc52-d188-747f520cf27f
msgctxt "h7d9b622dg7356g469agadd8gd4a2a2f1adbd"
msgid "I know exactly what you mean."
msgstr "무슨 말인지 알 것 같은걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c12a71d7-bce6-c7d9-5aa0-9ec6af4c78cb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Karlach:c12a71d7-bce6-c7d9-5aa0-9ec6af4c78cb
msgctxt "he862fb7agd082g47cbg9e44gac69f51bfa01"
msgid "Gods, I hope there's a better paradise than <i>this </i>out there."
msgstr "제발 <i>여기</i>보다는 더 나은 낙원이 있어야 할 텐데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c5063661-780c-2c8d-f19a-5e28bcf821c8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Karlach:c5063661-780c-2c8d-f19a-5e28bcf821c8
msgctxt "hca5d8f25g4c8bg4d13gb472gefd1864fab9e"
msgid "Me?"
msgstr "나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c74418c1-bf93-d536-f44c-fa343621112c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Karlach:c74418c1-bf93-d536-f44c-fa343621112c
msgctxt "h63c438b5g6210g437cga6afg50b2831296f6"
msgid "No grass in Avernus, I'm guessing."
msgstr "아베르누스엔 잔디가 없나 보네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c9db0461-1ff7-dae6-a11b-7cd270416bb2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Karlach:c9db0461-1ff7-dae6-a11b-7cd270416bb2
msgctxt "h372b46fdg19f7g4687g9a00g15e523ae4844"
msgid ""
"I feel like you want me to ask what your favourite thing is. But I don't "
"want to ask."
msgstr "네가 제일 좋아하는 게 뭐냐고 물어봐 주길 바라는 것 같은데, 난 안 물어볼 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = cf949aa2-63ec-a112-519f-8ee41072f303
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Karlach:cf949aa2-63ec-a112-519f-8ee41072f303
msgctxt "h412217dcg5bfeg4950g9c0eg496346969926"
msgid ""
"Sorry, I forgot about your delicate sensibilities. But you know what? I "
"wouldn't change a thing about you."
msgstr "미안해, 네 섬세한 감성을 잠깐 잊었어. 그래도 걱정하지 마. 네 취향을 바꾸려거나 하지는 않을테니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = d1802109-b7cc-f466-b35d-963a1f5863af
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Karlach:d1802109-b7cc-f466-b35d-963a1f5863af
msgctxt "he8dc02ffg5e1fg488cga67ega838b62a851b"
msgid ""
"My mum used to call it that. Said to tread with care, cause every blade "
"might've been fed by someone important to someone."
msgstr "어머니가 그렇게 부르셨거든. 조심스레 밟으라고 하셨어. 모든 이파리가 누군가에게 소중한 사람 양분 삼아 자랐을 수 있다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = d20a3555-696c-c157-672a-1b666660899f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_Night2_CRD_KarlachTalkedTo(1) = True
#.     - CAMP_Night2_State_Night2Com(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Karlach:d20a3555-696c-c157-672a-1b666660899f
msgctxt "hb8e57046gef67g4035g9d02g47c9c584ad8c"
msgid "Hear that?"
msgstr "들려?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = d7c0aab6-b94d-4602-b97c-c3108b08c82d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Karlach:d7c0aab6-b94d-4602-b97c-c3108b08c82d
msgctxt "he8a90506g3721g47f1g87c5gbeeea2a2c378"
msgid "Too bad!"
msgstr "이런!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = d861f70b-1179-0202-d722-c0d208f6f633
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Karlach:d861f70b-1179-0202-d722-c0d208f6f633
msgctxt "h2ba7954cg0493g4bb0g9e7agc9fca23a125c"
msgid ""
"Only blades there are bloody. When I stumbled off that nautiloid and onto "
"the banks of the Chionthar, the first thing I did was find something green "
"to fall in."
msgstr ""
"피 묻은 칼날만 잔뜩 있지. 노틸로이드에서 떨어져 치온타르 강둑에 도착했을 때, 내가 제일 먼저 한 건 푸른 뭔가를 찾아 그 위에 눕는 "
"일이었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = e2ecbe47-99f9-64a1-76d6-90d7ad4bd94f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Karlach:e2ecbe47-99f9-64a1-76d6-90d7ad4bd94f
msgctxt "haeae2236ge65cg4c57gb976g3011f2df5e6f"
msgid "Nothing like it, right?"
msgstr "이만한 게 없지, 안 그래?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f02a414d-a40b-5c5a-cac2-4dbf70150c3f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Karlach:f02a414d-a40b-5c5a-cac2-4dbf70150c3f
msgctxt "hc3655123g9588g4589g9d17g20adafd1f814"
msgid "I don't need to hear more about your toes, thanks."
msgstr "발가락 얘기는 그만 듣고 싶은걸. 미안."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = f329f35f-76c0-1aae-04e7-b4c3362e9086
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Karlach:f329f35f-76c0-1aae-04e7-b4c3362e9086
msgctxt "h67611c1eg70f4g4a02g89f7g40e1df53857c"
msgid ""
"You can keep it. I'd rather live for myself in <i>this </i>heaven than live "
"for someone else in another."
msgstr "난 사양할게. 봉사하는 삶을 살 바에는 차라리 <i>이 낙원</i>에서 살겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = f5589543-b754-0ee8-fb93-09b77ca567dc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Karlach:f5589543-b754-0ee8-fb93-09b77ca567dc
msgctxt "h85f4700ag696fg498ega79dg89f342c2f396"
msgid ""
"That ranks very high indeed, but my honest-to-gods favourite thing is "
"<i>grass.</i>"
msgstr "그것도 아주 높은 순위에 있긴 한데, 솔직히 내가 제일 좋아하는 건 <i>잔디</i>야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = fd067376-01a3-23bc-2fe3-53597ac19276
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_Night2_State_Night2Com(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Karlach:fd067376-01a3-23bc-2fe3-53597ac19276
msgctxt "hc5bd21fag1cf2g416bg8005g7eebff80e4f7"
msgid "Rest up, soldier. Who knows what tomorrow's got in store for us?"
msgstr "푹 쉬어, 신참. 내일 또 무슨 일이 생길지 누가 알겠어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 073fafaa-98ed-a563-2c4c-7f85579db0fa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GNOME(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Laezel:073fafaa-98ed-a563-2c4c-7f85579db0fa
msgctxt "hf5c5cac1gc4c8g479dgb12fg92418834b169"
msgid "On the contrary. This is most excellent news."
msgstr "반대야. 이건 아주 훌륭한 소식이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0bfbde36-23dc-4706-a259-094fdc2542af
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Laezel:0bfbde36-23dc-4706-a259-094fdc2542af
msgctxt "ha82614d6g6e1cg4777g831eg669a039aa9cf"
msgid "Why? Expecting to see something?"
msgstr "왜? 보여야 하는 거라도 있어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 199ad7be-35e9-3be0-8a44-e453a16dc0f0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GNOME(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Laezel:199ad7be-35e9-3be0-8a44-e453a16dc0f0
msgctxt "h734c5549gd1b2g4017ga39agb42d640a9ac5"
msgid "How is my good health 'disturbing'?"
msgstr "내가 건강한 게 왜 충격적인 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 51622975-0b28-4bf8-f243-4148ff8923e8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Laezel:51622975-0b28-4bf8-f243-4148ff8923e8
msgctxt "hf81c1c96g771bg4c57gab79gb8e3b89e24b4"
msgid "About you? No."
msgstr "너를? 그렇지 않다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 5ea7a34d-995f-eab9-1ca4-8ea8fdd6f609
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Laezel:5ea7a34d-995f-eab9-1ca4-8ea8fdd6f609
msgctxt "h27a69c48g4fcag436egb254g615309c11704"
msgid "Our bones should ache, our mouths should bleed."
msgstr "뼈가 아프고, 입에서는 피가 흘러야 하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 61e37a7f-1f79-da7d-a0a6-0b071b216c69
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Laezel:61e37a7f-1f79-da7d-a0a6-0b071b216c69
msgctxt "hbafe9ef8g9850g4965g8304gb0e126afd4b2"
msgid "Perhaps we should keep our distance from now on."
msgstr "이제부터는 서로 거리를 두는 편이 좋겠는걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 62ec4479-95c6-e3f4-62b8-01ded5bbc690
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Laezel:62ec4479-95c6-e3f4-62b8-01ded5bbc690
msgctxt "hd1d17c2ag596eg48ecg9aa7g558d2a906892"
msgid "It is what I do <i>not </i>see that concerns me."
msgstr "보여야 하는 게 <i>안 보인다는 사실</i>이 우려되는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 69ae8414-0944-5ca7-b471-ca3ab0d13921
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GNOME(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Laezel:69ae8414-0944-5ca7-b471-ca3ab0d13921
msgctxt "h4ffcae51g7d17g4fdag90ebg4fe1e715108d"
msgid "<i>Do as she asks.</i>"
msgstr "<i>시키는 대로 한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 6bca3701-9f22-7c4d-bb43-fe5ec01a6461
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Laezel:6bca3701-9f22-7c4d-bb43-fe5ec01a6461
msgctxt "ha1e73b13g30b4g4fdfg82d2g9f318a0b5243"
msgid "Yet we thrive. It is <i>madness.</i>"
msgstr "우린 아직 멀쩡해. 이건 <i>미친 일이야.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 73ea14db-9faa-dc12-525b-b45d439d2349
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - HALFORC(1) = True
#.      - REALLY_HALFORC(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Laezel:73ea14db-9faa-dc12-525b-b45d439d2349
msgctxt "h7eee44c5g4282g40eegb833g5e01fa2c94a0"
msgid ""
"Dry skin, clear eyes, stolid bearing. You do not suffer - you "
"<i>flourish.</i>"
msgstr "건조한 피부, 맑은 눈동자, 무신경한 태도까지. 시달리고 있지 않군, <i>멀쩡하다</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 7640dd04-9da5-75bc-7b2b-bde19a17466e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_LaezelInParty_HadCFM1(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Laezel:7640dd04-9da5-75bc-7b2b-bde19a17466e
msgctxt "h3c9abb22g835cg43feg86a9g10a5eeb5a2d4"
msgid "Keep your rest short. Time is not our ally."
msgstr "휴식을 짧게 취해라. 시간은 우리 편이 아니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 79e96d01-22de-ec3a-f7fa-b4fd4e1e3497
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Laezel:79e96d01-22de-ec3a-f7fa-b4fd4e1e3497
msgctxt "h66926fb3g8057g4ed5gaeefgfee17c120f99"
msgid "Dry skin, clear eyes. You do not suffer - you <i>flourish.</i>"
msgstr "건조한 피부, 맑은 눈동자. 시달리고 있지 않군, <i>멀쩡하다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = b8e00807-dd49-f49f-3241-e62fe8e1b983
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_Night2_State_Night2Com(1) = True
#.     - CAMP_Night2_CRD_LaezelTalkedTo(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Laezel:b8e00807-dd49-f49f-3241-e62fe8e1b983
msgctxt "h4886eb16gd8e3g47ccg8e75g7bc98f0ad544"
msgid "<i>Tchak'i. </i>Come closer."
msgstr "<i>차키.</i> 가까히 와라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = bce6337d-e82b-935d-a753-47244f3806d5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Laezel:bce6337d-e82b-935d-a753-47244f3806d5
msgctxt "h7a9bcb70g5bfag46f4gbf78g7a5fa63b32d8"
msgid "Disturbing."
msgstr "충격적이군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = c6cd5211-823c-a114-dccf-2802ef36d2df
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Laezel:c6cd5211-823c-a114-dccf-2802ef36d2df
msgctxt "h5f857b66ga1fag49e0gb57dgb9d0e16b0e10"
msgid "We should feel them <i>now.</i>"
msgstr "<i>지금</i> 느끼고 있어야 한다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cb8de92d-7e96-26ab-a1f2-f9789da4d540
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Laezel:cb8de92d-7e96-26ab-a1f2-f9789da4d540
msgctxt "h9a22e832g9c79g4900gba93g6b5373e45363"
msgid "I didn't think you cared, Lae'zel."
msgstr "네가 날 신경 쓰는지 몰랐는걸, 레이젤."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = d49c10cf-9766-4e22-68b9-381787a50c02
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Laezel:d49c10cf-9766-4e22-68b9-381787a50c02
msgctxt "h6caff137g44a1g4a6agbfeeg22989f528813"
msgid "As if I craved another whiff of sour breath."
msgstr "네 입냄새를 맡고 싶어했다는 것처럼 말하는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = d77aa240-d6c1-8d0b-070b-8881dff1163b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Laezel:d77aa240-d6c1-8d0b-070b-8881dff1163b
msgctxt "h8ce4b576gba2bg47fbgae9cg17499512470e"
msgid ""
"Abominations grow inside us. Our bones should ache, our mouths should bleed."
msgstr "혐오스러운 것이 우리 몸속에서 자라나고 있다. 뼈가 아프고 입에서 피가 흘러야 하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = f10818cc-3666-1cb7-eab9-77336c87bc7b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_Night2_State_Night2Com(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Laezel:f10818cc-3666-1cb7-eab9-77336c87bc7b
msgctxt "h805bbac4gd372g4f4cgb5f5geacc6dbdcd67"
msgid ""
"Abominations grow inside us. Our bones should ache, our mouths should bleed."
msgstr "혐오스러운 것들이 우리 안에서 자라고 있다. 뼈가 아프고 입에서 피가 나야 하는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = f276da07-faff-cea9-e541-b8eb79441f14
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - DRAGONBORN(1) = True
#.      - REALLY_DRAGONBORN(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Laezel:f276da07-faff-cea9-e541-b8eb79441f14
msgctxt "h957bd10cge5b3g4173g8040g0ce480ee2325"
msgid "Dry scales, clear eyes. You do not suffer - you <i>flourish.</i>"
msgstr "건조한 피부, 맑은 눈동자. 시달리고 있지 않군, <i>멀쩡하다</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = fafc3e80-a734-ec3e-f653-a4c80a22081c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Laezel:fafc3e80-a734-ec3e-f653-a4c80a22081c
msgctxt "hf6ea3676g346fg4eeagae64g080d5cdbc969"
msgid "Yet we thrive. It is <i>madness.</i>"
msgstr "우린 아직 멀쩡하다. <i>미쳤군.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = feef9029-a339-afda-2fb5-fb96e9e621f8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Laezel:feef9029-a339-afda-2fb5-fb96e9e621f8
msgctxt "hc2c1a991g72c3g43abg93eaga5ea900839ef"
msgid "How much longer before we start noticing symptoms?"
msgstr "증상이 느껴지려면 얼마나 걸리는 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Narrator
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 22cda9ad-caa6-3fd6-7e74-41c4db1ebf90
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Narrator:22cda9ad-caa6-3fd6-7e74-41c4db1ebf90
msgctxt "hd0de8b6fg2bc1g4761g9dd0gf3e5931e45d9"
msgid ""
"*You take stock of your senses. Your hearing is sharp, your mind is lucid. "
"You feel no pain, no fever, no ill sensations.*"
msgstr ""
"*당신은 당신의 감각을 되살펴 봅니다. 청각은 예리하고, 정신은 또렷하군요. 고통도, 열감도, 불편한 감각도 느껴지지 않습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Narrator
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 36b473a7-2f5e-abef-e5e7-2f217c382e1b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Narrator:36b473a7-2f5e-abef-e5e7-2f217c382e1b
msgctxt "h57ef75a7g2811g422dg9de7g39f78ead0f85"
msgid ""
"*Resistance to the sun's rays aside, you feel no different than you did a "
"tenday ago. You are still <i>you</i>.*"
msgstr "*햇빛에 대한 저항이 생긴 걸 제외하고, 당신은 지난주와 달라진 것이 없습니다. 당신은 여전히 <i>당신</i>입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Narrator
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 807182a8-8b5d-5480-002d-46005f07d80c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Narrator:807182a8-8b5d-5480-002d-46005f07d80c
msgctxt "h38802870g23d2g4385g92f4g8bb75399f4a3"
msgid "*You are still <i>you</i>.*"
msgstr "*당신은 여전히 <i>당신</i>입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Narrator
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 89f32c18-5494-62eb-5fbd-95bb9ca489de
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Narrator:89f32c18-5494-62eb-5fbd-95bb9ca489de
msgctxt "h967bf27bgdf21g49cdgb28cg0986c416651b"
msgid "*One breath in, one breath out. Slowly, gently.*"
msgstr "*천천히 숨을 들이쉬고, 부드럽게 내쉽니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Narrator
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = dc71b5d0-a529-7fa4-431c-b14514a2086c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Narrator:dc71b5d0-a529-7fa4-431c-b14514a2086c
msgctxt "h538a856egf8f8g4804ga593g36fa3062c905"
msgid ""
"*Another breath in, another breath out. You can worry and wonder tomorrow. "
"Until then, you must rest.*"
msgstr "*당신은 다시 한번 숨을 들이쉬고 내쉽니다. 걱정과 의문은 내일로 미루면 됩니다. 내일까지는 휴식을 취하겠죠.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Narrator
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = e545b686-ba6f-4eba-49d4-7957fb94b7e3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Narrator:e545b686-ba6f-4eba-49d4-7957fb94b7e3
msgctxt "h09b4a551g1f7eg4c3eg96e6g0071b73b3cdc"
msgid ""
"*Old questions give way to a new one: shouldn't you have begun to change by "
"now?*"
msgstr "*지나간 질문은 새로운 질문을 낳습니다. 지금쯤 변화가 시작됐어야 하는 건 아닐까요?*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 0913090c-21df-723f-0f78-32c1597c12ee
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Shadowheart:0913090c-21df-723f-0f78-32c1597c12ee
msgctxt "hea507750g1946g4f66g90c0gbe8a68a37d7a"
msgid "All right, I've kept you from your blanket long enough. Rest well."
msgstr "좋아, 너무 오래 붙잡고 있었던 것 같네. 편히 쉬어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0bf933f9-a100-7201-cfa3-a8222a296c3f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Shadowheart:0bf933f9-a100-7201-cfa3-a8222a296c3f
msgctxt "h0c671907g4214g4a79g8c4bg0bafa4ef14ca"
msgid "What do you mean?"
msgstr "무슨 말이야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 114ad9ab-f7b9-82fe-0dcb-1f40c0c84d12
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Shadowheart:114ad9ab-f7b9-82fe-0dcb-1f40c0c84d12
msgctxt "h68f172f4g9b16g4e17g892bg020d536751f3"
msgid "Fine. Much better than I thought I would, given the circumstances."
msgstr "괜찮아. 우리 상황을 고려해 봤을 때 생각했던 것보다 훨씬 좋아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 1310d382-b77e-619a-274c-87a54e9114f5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_Apprentice_Quest_FindHalsin = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Shadowheart:1310d382-b77e-619a-274c-87a54e9114f5
msgctxt "hb7925d19g3f81g4afbg95d6gc990acc76b30"
msgid ""
"Either way, we can't take the lack of symptoms for granted. We have to find "
"a healer."
msgstr "어찌 되었든, 증상이 나타나지 않고 있다고 해서 안심할 수는 없어. 치유사를 찾아야만 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 190886f1-9d05-921a-4fc2-961671ef3134
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Shadowheart:190886f1-9d05-921a-4fc2-961671ef3134
msgctxt "hac15255agc4dag4766gbcaag7c4898f56c27"
msgid ""
"Anyway, I feel the same. Other than the occasional mental exchange, it's "
"almost as if we're not infected."
msgstr "아무튼, 내 생각도 같아. 가끔 우리 정신이 뒤엉키는 것 빼고는, 마치 감염되지 않은 것 같아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1ac0b7a9-c2be-43e7-463a-bc858e2fd100
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Shadowheart:1ac0b7a9-c2be-43e7-463a-bc858e2fd100
msgctxt "h475504a7g6235g427cg8595g4afa0925df8f"
msgid "Maybe it's a compliment."
msgstr "칭찬일지도 모르지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 1f22f3dc-c3b8-255c-9405-591fe2040231
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Shadowheart:1f22f3dc-c3b8-255c-9405-591fe2040231
msgctxt "h9f647e66g352eg4aebg9482gba94617af6ca"
msgid ""
"The voice said I'd become a 'beautiful weapon'. What do you think that means?"
msgstr "그 목소리가 나더러 '아름다운 무기'가 될 거라고 했어. 이게 무슨 뜻일까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 3a7f8685-22a9-33e3-2e5c-4c6b7e25d1bc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Shadowheart:3a7f8685-22a9-33e3-2e5c-4c6b7e25d1bc
msgctxt "h93c7e952g7a1bg4f21g9e14gbd17728564c0"
msgid "Hah! Adorable. But your timing is awful."
msgstr "하! 귀엽네. 하지만 타이밍이 최악이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 45b77ce5-da62-be0c-bcc3-6f237981ec4b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_Night2_State_Night2Com(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_Night2_State_Night2Com(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Shadowheart:45b77ce5-da62-be0c-bcc3-6f237981ec4b
msgctxt "he48354c5ge58dg4119gb997ge99b43cfc855"
msgid "How do you feel?"
msgstr "기분이 어때?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 4ce8e54d-f7be-fb6a-8b39-6edeedd36561
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Shadowheart:4ce8e54d-f7be-fb6a-8b39-6edeedd36561
msgctxt "hf1975218g73e5g4cefg8f07g1c7d6d392933"
msgid "Me too. It's hard to sleep knowing that thing is in your head."
msgstr "나도야. 머릿속에 있는 걸 생각하면, 잠들기가 힘들어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 4fc60b6b-126f-aba9-ed5a-9d8721581dee
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Shadowheart:4fc60b6b-126f-aba9-ed5a-9d8721581dee
msgctxt "h74be53e2gdb71g4663gb99bg6047effcbc6e"
msgid ""
"The voice on the ship told me I'd become a 'beautiful weapon'. What do you "
"think it meant?"
msgstr "함선에서 들은 목소리가 나더러 '아름다운 무기'가 될 거라고 했어. 이게 무슨 뜻일까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 61b1be6d-5b6b-3a93-737a-ce9d1a187a77
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Shadowheart:61b1be6d-5b6b-3a93-737a-ce9d1a187a77
msgctxt "ha52e346eg7d0ag402cg97a5gf6ec64c6d4dc"
msgid "Honestly? More than a little frightened."
msgstr "솔직히? 조금 겁나는 것 이상이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 6c7a46c4-1c6b-50c4-6dfe-4a27f8fd1dfd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Shadowheart:6c7a46c4-1c6b-50c4-6dfe-4a27f8fd1dfd
msgctxt "h75e85fc7gcfceg4f26ga078g282082f2f974"
msgid "Yes, almost like it's whispering to me still..."
msgstr "그래, 아직도 내게 속삭이는 것 같아..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 71b62535-5ad0-a5b2-2a1f-db8ed95aee8b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Shadowheart:71b62535-5ad0-a5b2-2a1f-db8ed95aee8b
msgctxt "h43d3ee63ga671g4cd2g9ceeg02be4baecc8c"
msgid ""
"Better than I ought to. Other than the occasional mental exchange, it's "
"almost as if we're not infected."
msgstr "내가 생각했던 것보단 훨씬 좋아. 가끔 우리 정신이 뒤엉키는 것 빼곤, 마치 우리가 아예 감염되지 않은 것 같아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 754e4b4f-549d-dcb9-d2df-5c7d9432f8f8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_Apprentice_Quest_FindHalsin = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Shadowheart:754e4b4f-549d-dcb9-d2df-5c7d9432f8f8
msgctxt "h3c90f716g8207g4a95g943bga1c20f162f92"
msgid ""
"Either way, we can't take the lack of symptoms for granted. We have to find "
"Halsin."
msgstr "어찌 되었든, 증상이 나타나지 않았다고 안심하고 있을 순 없어. 할신을 찾아야 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 77277cfc-81d4-435f-3da2-95aca9fdf088
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Shadowheart:77277cfc-81d4-435f-3da2-95aca9fdf088
msgctxt "h291aed4fgcde7g4679g86f7g721a3292ff1a"
msgid ""
"After they put that tadpole in my eye, I heard this voice. It was... "
"soothing."
msgstr "놈들이 내 눈 안에 올챙이를 집어넣고 나서 목소리가 들렸어. 그러니까... 마음이 편해지더라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 77540e0a-1316-0cbb-160e-0c3e30153036
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Halsin_Knows_IsMissing = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Shadowheart:77540e0a-1316-0cbb-160e-0c3e30153036
msgctxt "h6a4ca642gbdd4g47c7gbdbfg36af158f69b8"
msgid "Anything's possible. But we still need to find a healer."
msgstr "무슨 뜻이든 될 수 있겠지. 하지만 우리는 아직 치유사를 찾아야 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 7bd57e65-fd45-efc9-9569-42b22b43e7a4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Shadowheart:7bd57e65-fd45-efc9-9569-42b22b43e7a4
msgctxt "h381281eeg6df1g452fg8fe3gbe58d34d9432"
msgid ""
"I feel... good. It's so strange... do you remember the voice? Aboard the "
"ship?"
msgstr "오히 기분이... 좋아. 이건 너무 이상해... 함선에서 들었던 목소리 기억나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9c156392-dc31-7893-a5f2-02b630f8641e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Shadowheart:9c156392-dc31-7893-a5f2-02b630f8641e
msgctxt "h9dad8c98g0907g4ef7g9acbg8a7d1fb42b9d"
msgid "I don't know. How do <i>you </i>feel?"
msgstr "모르겠어. <i>네 </i>기분은 어떤데?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 9c4a32f3-c017-576e-9b8b-ffe47b8ce908
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_Night2_State_Night2Com(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Shadowheart:9c4a32f3-c017-576e-9b8b-ffe47b8ce908
msgctxt "h2e70d5d9g8f83g4153g8d0egd5c119f3cceb"
msgid ""
"I couldn't help but overhear... well, all right, I could've helped, but "
"didn't."
msgstr "듣지 않을 수 없었어... 뭐, 솔직히, 그냥 듣지 않을 수도 있었지만, 그러지 않았어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 9e957cb2-0649-d55d-7407-119f945da230
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Shadowheart:9e957cb2-0649-d55d-7407-119f945da230
msgctxt "h92624f10g2909g4ab1gb193gc194df7635a7"
msgid ""
"Whatever the mind flayers' plans were, those dragons spoiled them. That "
"doesn't make our situation less dangerous."
msgstr "그 마인드 플레이어들의 계획이 뭐였든 간에, 드래곤들이 그걸 망쳐놨어. 그렇다고 해서 우리 상황이 덜 위험해졌다는 건 아니야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = a19cb7af-f717-582e-42c6-9f5d9c3fa38b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Shadowheart:a19cb7af-f717-582e-42c6-9f5d9c3fa38b
msgctxt "hbad16079g6445g4dc8g9ee1gdc340e57a2bf"
msgid "Whatever they were, those plans were interrupted by the dragons."
msgstr "그게 뭐였든 간에, 드래곤들이 망쳐놨지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = a223e74a-24be-6ae3-9586-72ea3aca7fc2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Shadowheart:a223e74a-24be-6ae3-9586-72ea3aca7fc2
msgctxt "h27b09f32gf134g4593g80edg22bc4013e355"
msgid "I suppose so. They've certainly been useful in a tight spot..."
msgstr "그런 것 같기는 해. 긴박한 상황에선 확실히 유용했지..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = a35271eb-2fc2-f6e3-6213-c7fe02228b3d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Shadowheart:a35271eb-2fc2-f6e3-6213-c7fe02228b3d
msgctxt "hee2b70fcg56b5g4605g9f27g396e954ef90c"
msgid "We should discuss this."
msgstr "이 주제에 대해서 논의를 좀 해야겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = a8e717ff-403b-d046-7431-813519dc6e5c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Shadowheart:a8e717ff-403b-d046-7431-813519dc6e5c
msgctxt "hd6f6b453gb689g4726g8e58gdb853c1564bd"
msgid ""
"Yes... me as well. Besides the occasional mental exchange, it's almost as if "
"we're not infected."
msgstr "그래... 나도 마찬가지야. 가끔 정신이 뒤엉키는 것만 빼면, 마치 아예 감염되지 않은 것 같아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = aaf603ed-a82a-c416-1f35-1c7976a8b3fe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_Apprentice_Quest_FindHalsin = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Shadowheart:aaf603ed-a82a-c416-1f35-1c7976a8b3fe
msgctxt "h84b9106eg3a54g4712ga598g4e12db48da52"
msgid ""
"For now. But we can't take the lack of symptoms for granted. We have to keep "
"looking for Halsin."
msgstr "지금은. 하지만 증상이 없다고 해서 안심하고 있으면 안 돼. 할신을 계속 찾아야지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = ab6a22dc-3dc4-86fc-b9dd-5879896f3a9a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Shadowheart:ab6a22dc-3dc4-86fc-b9dd-5879896f3a9a
msgctxt "hb4ede129g9561g4c1eg9bacg2da5e76f1a86"
msgid ""
"But other than the occasional mental exchange, it's almost as if we're not "
"infected."
msgstr "그래도 가끔 정신이 뒤엉키는 것만 아니면, 아예 감염되지 않은 것처럼 느껴져."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = acdb5349-37a7-ace7-c868-29dde85ae46d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Shadowheart:acdb5349-37a7-ace7-c868-29dde85ae46d
msgctxt "h514e655bgc69ag4fa7g8cbbg9b05fd87cf69"
msgid ""
"Who knows? Could've been a hallucination. I'm just glad we're still alive."
msgstr "누가 알겠어? 그저 환각이었을지도 모르지. 아직 우리가 살아있다는 게 다행인걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = adf2e8c6-3fb6-b2e3-ecf5-172067a4b19d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Shadowheart:adf2e8c6-3fb6-b2e3-ecf5-172067a4b19d
msgctxt "h8549378cg51feg45bdg9d65g5f0991645f48"
msgid "It's so strange... do you remember the voice? From the ship?"
msgstr "이건 참 이상하지... 함선에서 들었던 목소리 기억해?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = af77a640-bda4-ff98-c24f-d96e0cbeed8a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Shadowheart:af77a640-bda4-ff98-c24f-d96e0cbeed8a
msgctxt "had37fa16gdd68g4494ga4b5ga229b2932056"
msgid "Sounds like it had plans for us."
msgstr "마치 우리를 위한 계획이 있는 것처럼 들렸어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = b4544937-906c-b15c-9058-e9206b981332
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Shadowheart:b4544937-906c-b15c-9058-e9206b981332
msgctxt "h147a9e3dgdf0dg4b9agb807g4eaefe0ab235"
msgid "I've said my piece. Good night."
msgstr "할 말은 그게 다야. 잘 자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = b6bc5d34-4e7e-b93d-df83-7a0ba28e8662
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - Approval_AtLeast_0_For_Sp2(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Shadowheart:b6bc5d34-4e7e-b93d-df83-7a0ba28e8662
msgctxt "ha0563599g1fa4g4157g9f44g7a701713db63"
msgid "Sorry... but a problem shared, and so on. We should discuss this."
msgstr "미안하지만... 우리가 공유하는 문제잖아. 이야기 해 볼 필요가 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = bb895154-27a2-4d1c-9af4-b61c835ec24d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_Apprentice_Quest_FindHalsin = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Shadowheart:bb895154-27a2-4d1c-9af4-b61c835ec24d
msgctxt "hb3601713g9adbg497fg8b50gd780161dc5b5"
msgid ""
"For now. But we can't take the lack of symptoms for granted. We have to keep "
"looking for a healer."
msgstr "지금까지는. 하지만 증상이 나타나지 않는 걸 당연히 여겨선 안 돼. 계속 치유사를 찾아보자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bbaf493d-4b16-ecb0-db6a-a856f2274de1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Tadpole_State_Awakened = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Shadowheart:bbaf493d-4b16-ecb0-db6a-a856f2274de1
msgctxt "hdc044a1bg2985g4a49g83f0g9fd00429b621"
msgid "Weapon...? Might be connected to those powers we gained."
msgstr "무기라고...? 우리가 얻은 능력과 연관이 있을지도 몰라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = c15751c1-06a5-80a1-af3d-181a5d7a0cfc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Shadowheart:c15751c1-06a5-80a1-af3d-181a5d7a0cfc
msgctxt "h6f3e39a2gea4fg45c0gaa78g88e8aeb589e6"
msgid "Agreed. We can't take the lack of symptoms for granted."
msgstr "동의해. 증상이 나타나지 않는 걸 당연히 여길 순 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c9f18d52-896d-657a-340d-2667ba8203f4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Shadowheart:c9f18d52-896d-657a-340d-2667ba8203f4
msgctxt "h26f1dfbcgd55bg4934gb08fg119cb4d7dfa1"
msgid "I was trying not to dwell on it, but thank you for reminding me."
msgstr "그냥 잊고 살려고 했는데, 일깨워줘서 고마워."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = cbaa253a-c758-b45d-d572-8f2c58ce4d91
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_Apprentice_Quest_FindHalsin = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Shadowheart:cbaa253a-c758-b45d-d572-8f2c58ce4d91
msgctxt "hee6daa8fgc04ag4b49gb2b7g2a0f5fc1a77a"
msgid "The sooner we find a healer, the better. Get some rest."
msgstr "치유사를 최대한 빨리 찾아야 해. 좀 쉬어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = d1afc802-87b8-3ad9-dc0f-63ea65280ff8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_Apprentice_Quest_FindHalsin = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Shadowheart:d1afc802-87b8-3ad9-dc0f-63ea65280ff8
msgctxt "h4e45c792g246eg41c5g9b7bgd1b5f28a8e7c"
msgid "The sooner we find Halsin, the better. Get some rest."
msgstr "할신을 최대한 빨리 찾아야 해. 좀 쉬어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = d6ecdfac-e96d-a5db-4c22-978bcf3bbc80
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Shadowheart:d6ecdfac-e96d-a5db-4c22-978bcf3bbc80
msgctxt "h26f37744g1775g40acg84fag93c94e3b11ba"
msgid ""
"But there will be a price to pay. We can't take the lack of symptoms for "
"granted."
msgstr "하지만 대가를 치러야 할 거야. 증상이 나타나지 않는 걸 당연히 여겨선 안 돼."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e17605cb-0acb-887d-18e2-d23c34499087
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Halsin_Knows_IsMissing = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Shadowheart:e17605cb-0acb-887d-18e2-d23c34499087
msgctxt "h1717457fgdbc8g4527g8c3bge0c779bca387"
msgid "I don't know. But Halsin might - if we can find him."
msgstr "모르겠어. 하지만 할신을 찾는다면, 알고 있을지도 모르지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = f5d77550-e734-c42f-13f3-7e01c6d9902b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Shadowheart:f5d77550-e734-c42f-13f3-7e01c6d9902b
msgctxt "hacd77403g629ag4319ga6d5gebe3b0bf85c3"
msgid "Well, I've said my piece. Get some rest."
msgstr "좋아, 할 말은 이게 다야. 이제 좀 쉬어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f87cd7b4-e4f9-a8dd-f399-72da2772f223
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Shadowheart:f87cd7b4-e4f9-a8dd-f399-72da2772f223
msgctxt "h2327f23fgc133g4789ga2f0g37535f50a07f"
msgid "It's been hard to forget."
msgstr "그걸 잊긴 힘들지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 0b4bf141-be1d-d3d1-99d7-682c576b2bce
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Wyll:0b4bf141-be1d-d3d1-99d7-682c576b2bce
msgctxt "h43167cc2g9af1g4f74gaf04g6fe1622e476a"
msgid "I'm glad to see you're not one to give up."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 0f427def-99b1-7755-8ef2-4520b2b326e0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Wyll:0f427def-99b1-7755-8ef2-4520b2b326e0
msgctxt "hbb228356gd822g41e7g9e52gcc7c9486f7ad"
msgid ""
"Most people don't find it so easy to conquer. It's a good thing for us that "
"we aren't 'most people'."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 0fc87bcb-0279-9867-a780-91a347ac30d0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Wyll:0fc87bcb-0279-9867-a780-91a347ac30d0
msgctxt "he618fc9cgaa63g444eg9e70gb34124fc80ea"
msgid ""
"Slay your doubt, and nothing can stop you. Not a demon, not a dragon, and "
"certainly not an illithid worm."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 374fbe93-4c7b-c7bf-2775-3f5070730315
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Wyll:374fbe93-4c7b-c7bf-2775-3f5070730315
msgctxt "he978c64cg982cg47f0ga127g5f8856c44b8a"
msgid "I can't say I have."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3863c85e-f123-494e-96aa-9d95ad03fffb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Origin_PartOfTheTeam_Laezel = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Wyll:3863c85e-f123-494e-96aa-9d95ad03fffb
msgctxt "h0c349e2eg1eddg414fg801eg2032e52e631e"
msgid "Lae'zel's tenacious battle-cries?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 38903059-108a-a4b5-19b4-4d3de030e972
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Wyll:38903059-108a-a4b5-19b4-4d3de030e972
msgctxt "hb23285cfgcdd8g4dffg9edag0c74810b366f"
msgid ""
"Loud enough to wake the dead, and shrill enough to shatter a golden goblet."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 3a4b4e41-577a-312c-6e8d-ea95d365c91f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Wyll:3a4b4e41-577a-312c-6e8d-ea95d365c91f
msgctxt "h699c9992g4a5bg4c98gae4fg0e87776880f1"
msgid ""
"I thought it the most terrible noise in all sixteen planes. But there's one "
"even more fearsome than that."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4041f17d-981b-96de-64a1-8cc163b0ade8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Wyll:4041f17d-981b-96de-64a1-8cc163b0ade8
msgctxt "hf1d68e57gd9e3g47ceg82dbg7b671a9cc882"
msgid "What is it?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 439f879e-7724-1be7-a6c3-55bc46883376
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Wyll:439f879e-7724-1be7-a6c3-55bc46883376
msgctxt "ha0551170gaec3g4099gb8ccg1f54ce15a794"
msgid "The clatter of the rising undead?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 496e880a-8f56-3178-3ff3-3f61ab0eb50c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Wyll:496e880a-8f56-3178-3ff3-3f61ab0eb50c
msgctxt "h4ffe9d5fge86cg4c24g8d11gcdfbe85d9f2d"
msgid ""
"Yes, well - <i>ahem</i>. If you'd ever actually heard one, you'd not heard a "
"whimper, but a wail."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 4cac7bef-5ae8-b745-65ca-0d0317a1de0c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Wyll:4cac7bef-5ae8-b745-65ca-0d0317a1de0c
msgctxt "hf9261039gf613g4f83g80aege2cc5276cf4e"
msgid "No, I was thinking of a far more loathsome sound:"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 60c2684f-0ea1-6ef6-1979-d17518de785f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Wyll:60c2684f-0ea1-6ef6-1979-d17518de785f
msgctxt "h420f2e86gfd3cg4c7eg9c54ga43494123dc0"
msgid ""
"Oh, the lad's quite the tease. But he's a charming sort of cad - well, most "
"of the time."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 659bd5c1-8a0c-887f-1f9c-d5b514cf46a1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Wyll:659bd5c1-8a0c-887f-1f9c-d5b514cf46a1
msgctxt "h3f236998g2ed8g4a13g8491gdb67a1d56a7b"
msgid ""
"Doubt is the greatest villain we face. Greater than all the Hells' devils, "
"greater than a murderous god."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 74d265db-e4ea-94db-58d2-00bbb7bdb20f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Wyll:74d265db-e4ea-94db-58d2-00bbb7bdb20f
msgctxt "hb299be62g9a9ag4ea9gba89gf775f1179ae5"
msgid "Yes. It made a terrible howl."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 77c56a78-a3f6-dd0a-cf9b-e2921dcdec1b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Wyll:77c56a78-a3f6-dd0a-cf9b-e2921dcdec1b
msgctxt "h4e49a96ag6f99g435eg90ddge1a601564b95"
msgid ""
"Not even close. I find them comforting, even. What I'm thinking of is far "
"more malicious:"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7e1e9690-9de0-8da0-bc63-4be39cdec39f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Wyll:7e1e9690-9de0-8da0-bc63-4be39cdec39f
msgctxt "h062b07f8g7c20g4488g93b2g950b802505fe"
msgid "The shrieks of the goblins at the grove's gates?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 814b2bec-ea2f-f9ab-3bbd-de87cea8e866
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Wyll:814b2bec-ea2f-f9ab-3bbd-de87cea8e866
msgctxt "hee7c644cgaa69g435bg872dg4f18f439481f"
msgid "'It's hopeless', it says. 'Stop resisting. Give up and give in.'"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 81e32c24-6dd0-a510-2427-3f53dfd2efa0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Wyll:81e32c24-6dd0-a510-2427-3f53dfd2efa0
msgctxt "h2d6657b5gac01g46edg9986g480d378a8147"
msgid ""
"They screeched most horribly, yes - but I know of one even more ruthless:"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 83d24e66-ccaf-c2ad-8c5b-1739a05ac6b1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Wyll:83d24e66-ccaf-c2ad-8c5b-1739a05ac6b1
msgctxt "hdd4f17f2gc8c3g4d02g9b58g775d9655abb6"
msgid ""
"Incredible, wasn't it? Loud enough to wake the dead, and shrill enough to "
"shatter a golden goblet.\n"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 9d6e104d-c9d4-4968-ad61-87ba9dbb121e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_Night2_CRD_WyllTalkedTo(1) = True
#.     - CAMP_Night2_State_Night2Com(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Wyll:9d6e104d-c9d4-4968-ad61-87ba9dbb121e
msgctxt "h3302ecf1ge007g4ce3g8b7eg9610b01ab77c"
msgid "Question for you: have you ever heard a banshee's scream?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c474b762-9b81-6e98-4d88-4c2a3f3b2def
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Wyll:c474b762-9b81-6e98-4d88-4c2a3f3b2def
msgctxt "hb51ca3dfg8751g4bf2gb239g8911740bcde5"
msgid "No, but I once made one whimper a bit."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = c58136ce-4fa0-eedd-8c0b-bac8bbfe425c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Wyll:c58136ce-4fa0-eedd-8c0b-bac8bbfe425c
msgctxt "h414b64a3g606ag4f82g818age07213a330ec"
msgid ""
"Mm - for the best that you haven't. An agonising wail. Loud enough to wake "
"the dead, and shrill enough to shatter a golden goblet."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = cd2bcca0-10a8-665c-1193-10a2d6bf53f5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Wyll:cd2bcca0-10a8-665c-1193-10a2d6bf53f5
msgctxt "hbd4a811ega4d8g4980g96b2gacb3fd52b7f0"
msgid ""
"They do clack out a dreadful rhythm. But the one I'm thinking of is even "
"more dire:"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = e3a05081-49d0-5b9a-756e-9e8b53e1f3a0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_Night2_CRD_WyllTalkedTo(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Wyll:e3a05081-49d0-5b9a-756e-9e8b53e1f3a0
msgctxt "h9bf62dd8g4768g4e82gbe4eg0bfb12a6f6ad"
msgid "We should rest these weary bones of ours."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e8887209-a6a3-7f81-1146-347b55b1178f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Origin_PartOfTheTeam_Astarion = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Wyll:e8887209-a6a3-7f81-1146-347b55b1178f
msgctxt "h763c920fg674fg4c71g9e34ge0c1c468250f"
msgid "I bet it's Astarion's flirtatious drawl."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = f5536e6a-7fd7-4067-3c02-8349a64b8b19
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night2_CRD_Wyll:f5536e6a-7fd7-4067-3c02-8349a64b8b19
msgctxt "hccce3ac2gbce1g4be6gb229g0192318a71bd"
msgid "The doubt in our minds crying out for attention."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 0d6c588a-b992-ae43-8d48-f08d9e260a5a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion:0d6c588a-b992-ae43-8d48-f08d9e260a5a
msgctxt "hc769bf9fg810dg4913gaef6g65a4da7e5b6c"
msgid ""
"Will she know how to bring the worm under control? Will this little "
"adventure of ours be over?"
msgstr "녀석이라면 이 벌레를 통제할 방법을 알고 있을까? 우리의 이 짧은 모험도 끝을 맞겠고?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1581abb8-cb1a-3dad-3dc1-d9f51165054e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion:1581abb8-cb1a-3dad-3dc1-d9f51165054e
msgctxt "h76ee8a47g0cc5g4b3cgb5d5g27157f24b354"
msgid "Perhaps we should get to know one another better..."
msgstr "서로에 대해 좀 더 알아가야겠는데..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 217dd88f-de3a-266d-3356-d9225b651a78
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_CapturedGoblin_Knows_Priestess = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion:217dd88f-de3a-266d-3356-d9225b651a78
msgctxt "hfb1b74b9g3b3ag4e75g9870g2ba0f02aa083"
msgid ""
"Reflecting on what tomorrow might bring, when we meet this goblin priestess."
msgstr "내일 이 고블린 여사제라는 자를 만나면 어떤 일이 벌어질까 생각하면서 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 21917a2f-e7fb-3d36-fa32-05bc6e08108b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion:21917a2f-e7fb-3d36-fa32-05bc6e08108b
msgctxt "h51d4007ag4336g4e0bg90fcgec6b46b086e3"
msgid "Pardon, I didn't mean to disturb such important work."
msgstr "실례했네. 그렇게 막중한 임무를 방해할 생각은 없었는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2886afb2-eb32-6360-ec41-94d1d7f62761
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion:2886afb2-eb32-6360-ec41-94d1d7f62761
msgctxt "h4c3677b5g696dg4c86gb4e9ge0f1231c1b2f"
msgid "Probably. Once the worm is gone, I'm going my own way."
msgstr "아마 그렇겠지. 벌레를 제거하면, 나만의 길을 걸어보려고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 2bea3138-c9e4-4950-4966-3eb753bc6add
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion:2bea3138-c9e4-4950-4966-3eb753bc6add
msgctxt "h1b7a1a22g4cfcg4d79gad58g8261620e311b"
msgid "I'll forgive you. I'm mostly just thinking anyway."
msgstr "용서하지. 어차피 이런저런 생각 때문에 정신이 팔려 있었으니."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2e611b45-d0a6-4bec-6268-350f6fe1d732
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - NIGHT_Ceremorphosis2 = False
#.      - NIGHT_Ceremorphosis1 = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion:2e611b45-d0a6-4bec-6268-350f6fe1d732
msgctxt "hfe1b776fg40dag4d6ega9e4g4a70aa83631a"
msgid "We hardly know each other..."
msgstr "아직은 서로에 대해 잘 모르는걸..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 30400812-c4de-edb8-58ac-55ffa8936793
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion:30400812-c4de-edb8-58ac-55ffa8936793
msgctxt "ha4a6bfccg362eg4507g9f6fg81cf7488ddae"
msgid "A delicious thought, but..."
msgstr "군침이 싹 도는데. 그렇다면..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 31e2d918-e782-6d7c-fad7-d8d32e33e1de
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion:31e2d918-e782-6d7c-fad7-d8d32e33e1de
msgctxt "hefbfc7f9g134eg4958g9cf8g3d2dcf2f9648"
msgid ""
"You've been to the Hells and back. Survived the crash. Survived everything "
"that's followed."
msgstr "넌 지옥에서 돌아왔고. 추락에서 생존했어. 그 뒤에 벌어진 모든 일에서도 살아남았지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 31eb455d-bbf8-88bf-b1b8-7e2a59a5cc95
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion:31eb455d-bbf8-88bf-b1b8-7e2a59a5cc95
msgctxt "h1923c6a2g19e2g413cg8a4bg18daf7cefacb"
msgid "...get some air. Clear my head."
msgstr "...밤공기나 쐐야겠어. 머리를 식혀야겠거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 34288eca-3eed-1709-b0d1-68ddd6d404d8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion:34288eca-3eed-1709-b0d1-68ddd6d404d8
msgctxt "h50ea40bagb79fg45c1g93dbg3c5a9fd61a52"
msgid "Watch yourself, Astarion."
msgstr "그쯤 해 둬, 아스타리온."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 358dc779-2410-3552-3ed8-8dc34c047df7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion:358dc779-2410-3552-3ed8-8dc34c047df7
msgctxt "h9ca5726fgffedg48aeg8cc7g7792fdb1af36"
msgid "I have many talents. If you want to explore them..."
msgstr "난 다양한 능력을 가지고 있지. 네가 그걸 보길 원한다면..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 3feaac86-8660-5b8a-dd0b-4dc923ab7ed8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion:3feaac86-8660-5b8a-dd0b-4dc923ab7ed8
msgctxt "hbdd11658g2a16g42a9ga97fge7ae28ecf207"
msgid "Ha! Why not?"
msgstr "하! 왜 아니겠어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 4a88fd97-67bf-ed75-6788-261a75bc7700
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion:4a88fd97-67bf-ed75-6788-261a75bc7700
msgctxt "hae91c32cgba7ag46f9gbf33g1ca092023142"
msgid "I'm sure I'll see you when I get back. Sleep tight."
msgstr "돌아오거든 다시 보자고. 좋은 꿈 꿔."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4c787fd2-95e6-5510-449e-c63c5e545e25
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion:4c787fd2-95e6-5510-449e-c63c5e545e25
msgctxt "hfd99308cg2b58g455dg884bga7e03e50492e"
msgid "I'm just trying to survive. Like you."
msgstr "그저 살아남으려 애쓰는 것뿐이야. 너처럼."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4f3fecbc-17b9-9fb0-f682-b2a801d8853c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion:4f3fecbc-17b9-9fb0-f682-b2a801d8853c
msgctxt "hed5377a5g674dg4a42gb201g7259f5264393"
msgid "You're too close."
msgstr "적당히 하지 그래."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 5833377f-38ab-c4de-d2d1-a4fea035c106
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion:5833377f-38ab-c4de-d2d1-a4fea035c106
msgctxt "h7841da51ga54cg4d1aga449gcec784ac1d79"
msgid "The stars, I mean. I could take or leave your chin."
msgstr "그러니까, 별들 말이야. 너도 참아줄 만은 하네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 5c918a40-eb2b-9fa9-2733-b1b1fff6226d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion:5c918a40-eb2b-9fa9-2733-b1b1fff6226d
msgctxt "hc78d2f8fg4350g4687g87ffg125911ca24c2"
msgid "Yes, we're more similar than I thought..."
msgstr "그래, 생각보다 우린 비슷한 점이 많네..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5d12fdbf-87a2-8b68-ae11-b48a99a777b9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion:5d12fdbf-87a2-8b68-ae11-b48a99a777b9
msgctxt "ha10e1e9cg2002g4ac9g81e2g729a86a1a802"
msgid "You can stop staring."
msgstr "그렇게 뚫어져라 쳐다보지 않아도 돼."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 60a29c5b-fc4f-a75d-466d-620e643ec897
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion:60a29c5b-fc4f-a75d-466d-620e643ec897
msgctxt "hb3963566gd772g4845gbc31g456d1b7b8de9"
msgid "It doesn't have to be. We can still travel together."
msgstr "꼭 그럴 필요는 없지. 계속 함께 여행할 수 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 62e9f674-f997-89f0-f19f-8b79528841cc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion:62e9f674-f997-89f0-f19f-8b79528841cc
msgctxt "hc9ab3c4fg30eag4b62g9f07g28386871c701"
msgid "Aren't you just..."
msgstr "너 참..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 6966c22e-9996-ca2d-bdf7-6cd9ab0e80d0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion:6966c22e-9996-ca2d-bdf7-6cd9ab0e80d0
msgctxt "hd9c4af83geabag49a5g972fgc94b143c2114"
msgid "...I'm sorry, I - I need to clear my head."
msgstr "... 미안. 어, 잠깐 머리 좀 식혀야겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 6e27e53f-fc5e-3e77-b72d-5c35529b4823
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion:6e27e53f-fc5e-3e77-b72d-5c35529b4823
msgctxt "h03313f8dgf947g44aag9d5bg4d7dffa3efc4"
msgid "No, just thinking."
msgstr "아니, 그냥 생각 중이었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 708cdfc0-6544-3fcf-49be-103acd5608e8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion:708cdfc0-6544-3fcf-49be-103acd5608e8
msgctxt "h66456786g1fd1g44bfg91e2geb98276699d1"
msgid "I am. I've been thinking."
msgstr "그래. 생각을 좀 했어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 7144892f-57ff-b55d-e34f-d342e5b1e3bf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion:7144892f-57ff-b55d-e34f-d342e5b1e3bf
msgctxt "h994663b3g0dedg4c3eg884bgb5bc7492c3d5"
msgid "Was I? I just..."
msgstr "그랬어? 난 그냥..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 737ea01a-ccc4-5435-0bab-ca33aa7146c7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion:737ea01a-ccc4-5435-0bab-ca33aa7146c7
msgctxt "hd6a637a2g8cfdg4f35g8ef0g309d259d82b9"
msgid "Heavens forbid. I've learned my lesson. I just..."
msgstr "하늘도 너무하시지. 훈계는 그만 됐어. 그냥..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 75289c6c-fbb1-cb10-8400-6f11e8354cb7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion:75289c6c-fbb1-cb10-8400-6f11e8354cb7
msgctxt "h09cf96b7g3091g4292g9355g85347e55e2b4"
msgid "You seem more relaxed."
msgstr "긴장이 좀 풀린 것 같네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 7753729b-be7f-615b-56ec-5a9720a76b3b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion:7753729b-be7f-615b-56ec-5a9720a76b3b
msgctxt "h201db3a9g9d93g4ddag848fg373e8c2f466b"
msgid "Sleep tight. I'll see you later, I'm sure."
msgstr "잘 자. 나중에 보자고, 꼭."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 782c5817-0429-336d-087f-c55e3d482d29
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion:782c5817-0429-336d-087f-c55e3d482d29
msgctxt "h85a390a8g4ebeg4f04gafbfgff65e90dad58"
msgid ""
"Will we find out how to bring the worm under control? Will this little "
"adventure of ours be over?"
msgstr "이 벌레를 통제할 방법을 찾아낼 수 있을까? 우리의 이 작은 모험이 끝날까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7c3f4dd2-6744-890d-b473-f97c3cfd2039
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion:7c3f4dd2-6744-890d-b473-f97c3cfd2039
msgctxt "h7e514d11g6b8dg45a7g8ce8g90f6c48ebe34"
msgid "...Why?"
msgstr "...뭐하러?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7d9a8b18-bdc5-f01a-6730-b7f62eaabfa4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_Astarion_Knows_Vampireness = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion:7d9a8b18-bdc5-f01a-6730-b7f62eaabfa4
msgctxt "he5b5e23fg94e5g4f5bga286g60e7fa868b07"
msgid "Just don't try to bite me again. It won't go well for you."
msgstr "그냥 날 물 생각은 다시는 하지 마. 네게 좋게 끝나지 않을 테니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 80b149f3-d22e-4fa5-f658-142de4f62ded
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion:80b149f3-d22e-4fa5-f658-142de4f62ded
msgctxt "h4373ee91g4b1bg44cbg861eg967607d24dcc"
msgid ""
"I can see the stars from Baldur's Gate, of course, but not with such "
"clarity. It got me thinking."
msgstr "별들이야 물론 발더스 게이트에서도 볼 수 있지. 하지만 이렇게 밝진 않아. 덕분에 생각 좀 해 봤어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 8d0b489e-eb1e-ddb3-5e04-024cd86424e0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion:8d0b489e-eb1e-ddb3-5e04-024cd86424e0
msgctxt "h6dbe07a8gfda2g4b22g8cbcg6c6254cc61d7"
msgid ""
"Will he know how to bring the worm under control? Will this little adventure "
"of ours be over?"
msgstr "그가 이 벌레를 통제할 방법을 알고 있을까? 우리 이 작은 모험이 끝날까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 90061004-7987-9f9e-8e82-ea4ea0f7b3b6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion:90061004-7987-9f9e-8e82-ea4ea0f7b3b6
msgctxt "h4aefaf1cge8e1g4c6ag9408g6196ce8baf3c"
msgid "<i>Turn and walk away.</i>"
msgstr "<i>뒤돌아 떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 9062d6b9-32dd-4c4f-7e59-5e72b1a167f7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion:9062d6b9-32dd-4c4f-7e59-5e72b1a167f7
msgctxt "hf0cec608gecc8g4878g9ea5g963e40e7a4cf"
msgid "Of course. Terribly sorry."
msgstr "물론이지. 죽을 죄를 지었네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 91a016ed-cddc-0da6-822b-5112b1fbd9d9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Hag_Knows_ToldHagTadpole = True
#.      - GLO_Hag_Knows_Teahouse = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion:91a016ed-cddc-0da6-822b-5112b1fbd9d9
msgctxt "h82c9dc3eg9425g4e99g92b9gb8a2fbe63e91"
msgid ""
"Reflecting on what tomorrow might bring, when we get to this hag's teahouse."
msgstr "내일 이 해그의 찻집에 가면 어떤 일이 벌어질까 생각하면서 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 93517c05-2821-d05b-874a-107f7ada5db1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion:93517c05-2821-d05b-874a-107f7ada5db1
msgctxt "h3f92c545gcb9eg4a41g9cf5gc3fb8bff564a"
msgid ""
"It's something of a novelty. I'm usually quite busy at night, but now I'm "
"just lying here and thinking."
msgstr "오래 살고 볼 일이야. 밤이면 눈코 뜰 새 없이 바빴는데, 지금은 그냥 한가로이 자빠져 생각에 잠겨 있다니."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 93d78fdb-b2bd-0d7d-a675-0f2c4a666231
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion:93d78fdb-b2bd-0d7d-a675-0f2c4a666231
msgctxt "h01e19659g5e08g49a4ga412g57504f28ec15"
msgid "True. I am pretty impressive."
msgstr "사실이야. 내가 깊은 인상을 남기곤 하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 95505f24-efab-c155-7dca-a7e08f647a6d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion:95505f24-efab-c155-7dca-a7e08f647a6d
msgctxt "hf7db7e8dgc508g406dga5acg1d613660b76a"
msgid "I was just going anyway. I need to clear my head."
msgstr "어차피 가려던 참이었어. 머리를 좀 식히고 싶거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 976e9690-f0f9-abd0-b9c7-994881cfde48
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion:976e9690-f0f9-abd0-b9c7-994881cfde48
msgctxt "h70870ce1gec3bg4e9dgb674g7224ce1a289a"
msgid ""
"*The smile on his pretty lips is a touch too composed, a bit too perfect. He "
"may not mean a word he says.*"
msgstr "*그의 아름다운 입술에 걸린 미소는 너무 차분하면서도 완벽합니다. 그의 말이 진실인지는 알 수 없습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 979d7ca9-2536-14f5-1981-74fb4ec05f85
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion:979d7ca9-2536-14f5-1981-74fb4ec05f85
msgctxt "h4690e73eg3cceg4d99ga477gbb5550d2335c"
msgid "The right moment..."
msgstr "적절한 순간이랄까..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 9d8fdaa3-9d2a-2fa8-9b3c-dd07cc0aa4bd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_ThingLikeMe_Event_ToldAboutCreche = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion:9d8fdaa3-9d2a-2fa8-9b3c-dd07cc0aa4bd
msgctxt "hd43c97aagbf3fg4fbag9479g56b50844c936"
msgid ""
"Reflecting on what tomorrow might bring, when we arrive at this gith crèche."
msgstr "내일 이 기스 양성소라는 곳에 도착하면 어떤 일이 벌어질까 생각하면서 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a0a4be46-bc2a-d7f6-2983-5d410bba06ac
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion:a0a4be46-bc2a-d7f6-2983-5d410bba06ac
msgctxt "h5f5c60e5gb6c2g4997gb802g350a3b088e66"
msgid "I thought you didn't like me."
msgstr "나를 싫어하는 줄 알았는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = a241013c-ac12-8db9-db39-c3395b034872
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion:a241013c-ac12-8db9-db39-c3395b034872
msgctxt "hedbd3402g5770g4b95g984fgec0b8d6ecf24"
msgid "...I just need to get some air. Clear my head."
msgstr "...밤공기나 좀 쐐야겠어. 머리를 식혀야겠거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a71186ee-c7c1-0218-467c-fd9a97137c0d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion:a71186ee-c7c1-0218-467c-fd9a97137c0d
msgctxt "ha2cf106dg9895g43a1gb791g56d4103889bf"
msgid "Are you feeling all right?"
msgstr "너 괜찮아?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = a7360fac-6932-be9e-a74d-03e1d7ae8850
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CAMP_Global_State_Night3Com = False
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_WLDMAIN_State_InRegion(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CAMP_Global_State_Night3Com = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion:a7360fac-6932-be9e-a74d-03e1d7ae8850
msgctxt "h5cd4ae50g92a3g4f56gbed3gcf1ebaad9e47"
msgid "Do you mind? I was rather enjoying my view of the ceiling."
msgstr "좀 비켜 줄래? 한참 밤하늘을 즐기고 있었는데 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = ad7b7b86-b2ee-0c8c-54e8-2d6abcc82fa1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_DWARF or REALLY_GNOME or REALLY_HALFLING
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion:ad7b7b86-b2ee-0c8c-54e8-2d6abcc82fa1
msgctxt "hd9320845g6708g4992gafdeg08c79b6ae21c"
msgid ""
"I'm not normally impressed by people of your stature, but you're stronger "
"than I gave you credit for."
msgstr "너 같은 위치에 있는 사람에게 보통 감명받을 일은 없는데, 넌 내가 생각했던 것보다 훨씬 강인하구나."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = ad7b7b86-b2ee-0c8c-54e8-2d6abcc82fa1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion:ad7b7b86-b2ee-0c8c-54e8-2d6abcc82fa1
msgctxt "h7b20a1c3g0194g4d5dgba4bgd302bb77e046"
msgid ""
"I'm not easily impressed by people, but you're stronger than I gave you "
"credit for."
msgstr "내게 인상을 남기는 사람은 잘 없는데, 넌 내 생각보다 훨씬 강인하구나."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = af3808f8-b0ef-32c4-01ef-d3862727a709
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion:af3808f8-b0ef-32c4-01ef-d3862727a709
msgctxt "h6b4f2019gdcb9g4124gbe05g69ff854a8c1f"
msgid "I'm joking. Relax."
msgstr "농담이야. 긴장 풀어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = b3b7eee8-6ae4-ac79-20dd-5fd3f269ab23
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion:b3b7eee8-6ae4-ac79-20dd-5fd3f269ab23
msgctxt "h87d61ef4g5d73g45f4gbdf2g3f09a6f0a79f"
msgid "You have your charms... more than you think."
msgstr "넌 매력적이야... 네가 생각하는 것보다 더."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = b8a6d69f-799a-eb66-46d2-71a5efea6fc6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion:b8a6d69f-799a-eb66-46d2-71a5efea6fc6
msgctxt "ha2cab3fegf561g4057g9e56g74a155370319"
msgid ""
"You're quite the ally, after all. Traversing Avernus. Surviving the crash. "
"Surviving everything that's followed..."
msgstr "결국에 넌 엄청난 동료잖아. 아베르누스를 활강하고. 추락에서도 살아남고. 뒤따르는 모든 일을 뚫고 살아남았으니..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = ba87f762-7ea7-5dc6-cb3d-f7cda436d229
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_Apprentice_Quest_FindHalsin = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion:ba87f762-7ea7-5dc6-cb3d-f7cda436d229
msgctxt "h521ae609g5caag4804gbe6fg9dda9d04c5c1"
msgid "Reflecting on what tomorrow might bring, when we find the druid."
msgstr "내일 이 드루이드를 찾으면 어떤 일이 벌어질까 생각하면서 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = c1345d20-7701-2e43-a75d-1a984d7479f6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion:c1345d20-7701-2e43-a75d-1a984d7479f6
msgctxt "h08114721gf321g45b4g9987g4b4e2b49f3a4"
msgid "I think I'll just - just clear my head."
msgstr "그냥 잠깐... 잠깐 머리 좀 식혀야겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c61be45d-6fcf-d668-998b-f0188b0e60f8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion:c61be45d-6fcf-d668-998b-f0188b0e60f8
msgctxt "h75c3d29cg7686g4d94gaf4bgdb4488366360"
msgid "Am I disturbing you?"
msgstr "내가 방해한 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c758dace-f250-7c94-2895-1d13fc9176e7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion:c758dace-f250-7c94-2895-1d13fc9176e7
msgctxt "hddd63342gb486g4fa9gb0c0g483403041625"
msgid "<i>A waste of time. Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>시간 낭비다. 떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ce1435fd-cd56-cf8c-3a86-a7b74c7d3c26
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_Astarion_Knows_Vampireness = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion:ce1435fd-cd56-cf8c-3a86-a7b74c7d3c26
msgctxt "hced8bd00gb348g4b16gb27fg776bfd664f52"
msgid "Just keep your eyes away from my neck."
msgstr "당장 내 목에서 눈 떼."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = ce6814bf-a609-a005-e92d-5dc3fc1827fd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion:ce6814bf-a609-a005-e92d-5dc3fc1827fd
msgctxt "h179926c9gab08g4c25ga459g8047883d62df"
msgid "A pity. A great pity."
msgstr "아쉽네. 정말 아쉬워."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = cffaf010-2b9e-9d94-754d-80ba39cef765
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_CapturedGoblin_Knows_Priestess = False
#.      - DEN_ThingLikeMe_Event_ToldAboutCreche = False
#.      - DEN_Apprentice_Quest_FindHalsin = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion:cffaf010-2b9e-9d94-754d-80ba39cef765
msgctxt "h33d273a5g25c3g4845g9c38gb11b127c3eb2"
msgid "Reflecting on what tomorrow might bring."
msgstr "내일 어떤 일이 벌어질까 생각하면서 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d3aee2a4-15e6-9e74-b650-63fe18a0c7d7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion:d3aee2a4-15e6-9e74-b650-63fe18a0c7d7
msgctxt "hbb523b3bgbd5ag4358gbce8g9e734e6e80a4"
msgid "But? What are you waiting for?"
msgstr "그런데? 뭘 기다리고 있는 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = d5118289-2867-89ef-3200-3ad8094d8ee2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion:d5118289-2867-89ef-3200-3ad8094d8ee2
msgctxt "h7bc534a7g7b52g4357ga61eg8aea98fb3696"
msgid "Oh, you're no fun."
msgstr "오, 시시하기는."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = db08238e-43d0-a0ef-8139-b713bf3b9c70
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion:db08238e-43d0-a0ef-8139-b713bf3b9c70
msgctxt "h68293468gf94eg412egabbag546af2d6c22a"
msgid "Hmm? Yes! Of course, me too."
msgstr "흠? 아, 물론이지! 나도 웃자고 한 소리였어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = e4406ff8-e8ee-4a3c-c3bc-3ac36f8cb7dc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CAMP_Global_State_Night3Com = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CAMP_Global_State_Night3Com = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion:e4406ff8-e8ee-4a3c-c3bc-3ac36f8cb7dc
msgctxt "h196909e3g39a2g4127g9474gea6de4c7a880"
msgid "It's quite a sight."
msgstr "참 보기 좋은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = e62e0523-e40a-f89b-6a81-371cecca1ff8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion:e62e0523-e40a-f89b-6a81-371cecca1ff8
msgctxt "h8a40ffd7g5c62g4e79gaa23gae6521e562c6"
msgid "I'll see you later, I'm sure. Sleep tight."
msgstr "그래, 그럼 나중에 보자고. 잘 자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = eb2cdff0-e7be-8a3d-5f33-bb12550e78ac
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CAMP_Global_State_Night3Com = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 2f40b469-81de-5579-a303-7f644385f959_SpokeToOThers = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion:eb2cdff0-e7be-8a3d-5f33-bb12550e78ac
msgctxt "he90c4c3dga1f0g4426g8114g7e7ca59e4b66"
msgid "You know, I've been thinking."
msgstr "있잖아, 내가 생각을 좀 해봤는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = ec51be6b-2a8a-b65a-b35c-b64074f75d6c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion:ec51be6b-2a8a-b65a-b35c-b64074f75d6c
msgctxt "h18d48f04gc476g444cgb858geb531af5dd11"
msgid "Good! I don't want you to run off just yet."
msgstr "훌륭해! 아직은 도망칠 생각 말아 줬음 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = eee222b1-91e2-22dd-f8a1-1c592415a718
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion:eee222b1-91e2-22dd-f8a1-1c592415a718
msgctxt "hbe0bbd97g68bcg4ef4g912ag21246fffd520"
msgid "Hmm? Oh, I was leagues away. I just need to..."
msgstr "음? 오, 잠깐 정신이 팔려 있었네. 그냥 좀..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f4cb6662-794e-796e-03cd-466ebafeee96
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion:f4cb6662-794e-796e-03cd-466ebafeee96
msgctxt "h2c99dbccg1d42g4c2bg9a9dg1e769c0250b8"
msgid "What? Will you miss me?"
msgstr "뭐? 내가 그리워지기라도 할 거라는 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f731ea76-1594-500b-8777-13cdf4bd1d6e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Astarion:f731ea76-1594-500b-8777-13cdf4bd1d6e
msgctxt "heca82d0bg0569g48a1g96a3gefb9b616b9d9"
msgid "They are beautiful tonight."
msgstr "오늘따라 더 아름다워 보이네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 074ccb49-b98c-924d-c4b8-1faed7df0cbe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Karlach:074ccb49-b98c-924d-c4b8-1faed7df0cbe
msgctxt "hc2778910g132dg4880gbb5dge7c550b67701"
msgid "Don't bother looking in. That's the past. Look to the future."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 10d8f5d9-fb65-fcae-1130-181f24381c7d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Karlach:10d8f5d9-fb65-fcae-1130-181f24381c7d
msgctxt "h5396a443g7ea9g4afdgb292g2b6788d9c8ab"
msgid "Buck up. It seems we might have a cure for the parasite soon."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 11b4bcca-c1bf-e797-0c72-fecaf479585e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Karlach:11b4bcca-c1bf-e797-0c72-fecaf479585e
msgctxt "hbfb790a1ge17cg4d65ga358gbac9b06896e6"
msgid "Hey, that's <i>my </i>thing."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 16646384-748a-2861-7a0c-99275743a8c2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Karlach:16646384-748a-2861-7a0c-99275743a8c2
msgctxt "hd2c59510gdf2bg4fd9ga992g7e3b0e30496c"
msgid ""
"I was just a kid, but I knew what she meant. I thought about it a lot while "
"I was in the Hells."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2b6b5e67-810f-9b8d-2bff-3b6a508fcd67
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - DARK_URGE(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Karlach:2b6b5e67-810f-9b8d-2bff-3b6a508fcd67
msgctxt "h1b1a9d81g5c12g4a54g8e01gf6c4573b1276"
msgid "If you're a pit, I'm an oubliette."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2c1c1208-d037-a435-2933-e688d777b39a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Karlach:2c1c1208-d037-a435-2933-e688d777b39a
msgctxt "h420ed068g77eeg4a53ga8c3g21f190da84ec"
msgid "Give it time. You've only been out a short while."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 36fa3ff7-a75a-baca-0393-152a699eeb69
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Karlach:36fa3ff7-a75a-baca-0393-152a699eeb69
msgctxt "hdc8b36d5g7b06g4649gbd7egf9f135ac54d8"
msgid "I can tell. You're glowing."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 44117fd8-13df-fc2f-b5e4-c927c38616fd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Karlach:44117fd8-13df-fc2f-b5e4-c927c38616fd
msgctxt "h5598c070g648bg413eg8458g499e6a587e86"
msgid ""
"I don't know. Maybe not <i>nothing</i>. But maybe... maybe nothing I'm ready "
"for."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 5b852ee1-46b3-8a27-7354-7896d96e74ec
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Karlach:5b852ee1-46b3-8a27-7354-7896d96e74ec
msgctxt "h4fc59120gcbc4g47a1gaf85gbeeacac97657"
msgid "We'd better. Running out of days, aren't we?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5c7cb48a-4d05-8853-310f-95134e439f69
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Karlach:5c7cb48a-4d05-8853-310f-95134e439f69
msgctxt "hef6fe3aege6d6g489egba70ge6e9781d1741"
msgid "I'll leave you to it."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 619b56fe-ba46-9924-3686-a45c4c1359f2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Karlach:619b56fe-ba46-9924-3686-a45c4c1359f2
msgctxt "h32a0f4e9gbd8dg4353g9003gc5059878399f"
msgid "Well. Let no one say we led boring lives, if nothing else."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 624b02cf-822a-d0d9-2a6a-80aa7ae48076
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Karlach:624b02cf-822a-d0d9-2a6a-80aa7ae48076
msgctxt "hf4a78e6cg7ba4g4b10g969dg5e017eae5913"
msgid "I feel the same. In some ways, I've never felt better."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 671546db-b994-4cc6-644a-46c26e07f19b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Karlach:671546db-b994-4cc6-644a-46c26e07f19b
msgctxt "h897e20d0g801cg4c87ga50cgf27898d6ef3f"
msgid "Sure it's not the hellfire? "
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 6da00f5a-bf71-ce41-7fb1-380dcf5587fe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Karlach:6da00f5a-bf71-ce41-7fb1-380dcf5587fe
msgctxt "h46ff9892g6f29g4e63gadaegcde981f733b0"
msgid ""
"Eventine Grantz was her name. Halfling, ran the bakery in my neighbourhood "
"in the Outer City."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6df35088-84a0-cd72-455e-9154cbbe81d1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Karlach:6df35088-84a0-cd72-455e-9154cbbe81d1
msgctxt "h1e09265dgae10g41efg826fg89dfc391497c"
msgid "Actually, I feel like hell."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 82150d44-0805-556e-cd2c-1b6bc418d165
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Karlach:82150d44-0805-556e-cd2c-1b6bc418d165
msgctxt "he7811b82g3f4fg40d8g8471g420bcf7df9f2"
msgid ""
"Thanks for lending me your ear, soldier. I'll unbend it now. But I "
"appreciate it."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 88b55092-647d-b943-e014-baa9fba2b423
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Karlach:88b55092-647d-b943-e014-baa9fba2b423
msgctxt "h0584eb3agfa43g4cfbga6e4g35d476f3a833"
msgid ""
"I have - had - this old friend. Really old. She must've been around a "
"hundred and forty by the time I met her."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 8b367618-f603-3d44-c7fa-0e84ad10012f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Karlach:8b367618-f603-3d44-c7fa-0e84ad10012f
msgctxt "h9503a107gf43fg4d79g9fe7g2ab9bd7b4f66"
msgid ""
"Well... you may feel shitty, but you look pretty good from where I'm "
"standing. Now - let's get some shut-eye before I say something I regret and "
"lie awake in rictus horror all night."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 8c43c392-a5ea-abb7-96c8-18ed82078102
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Karlach:8c43c392-a5ea-abb7-96c8-18ed82078102
msgctxt "hf52df43egc821g453ag819ageb5c2da1c0e1"
msgid "So - bear with me."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = a960f072-27ed-4a90-ab5e-a4c4eeeed5db
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CAMP_Global_State_Night3Com = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Karlach:a960f072-27ed-4a90-ab5e-a4c4eeeed5db
msgctxt "h52ae0b63ga047g4658g8fb9g7f9bb21945c2"
msgid ""
"Let me get one last look at you in case the brain bug  takes us in the "
"night. There. Got it."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = b3227136-a9e4-65f4-fab1-2a15a4f033b2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Karlach:b3227136-a9e4-65f4-fab1-2a15a4f033b2
msgctxt "hd505ff51g368fg45a9g9d6fg716c3834d0a4"
msgid ""
"As glad as I am to be free, Avernus is in me still. Less of a <i>garden </"
"i>and more of a... I don't know, a <i>pit</i>. But when I try to look "
"inside, I can't feel anything."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = b3aedfbe-c2b0-ee39-cbc1-823d640f4022
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Karlach:b3aedfbe-c2b0-ee39-cbc1-823d640f4022
msgctxt "hc08f3294gcfa9g4416g819fgb2875d5debb7"
msgid "Then again, I feel pretty good. Strong. You know? "
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = b5709f17-57b5-d572-4621-8ad5f8656430
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CAMP_Global_State_Night3Com = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Karlach:b5709f17-57b5-d572-4621-8ad5f8656430
msgctxt "h6e7b061bgf2f1g4679ga83eg62b44d7dd8a9"
msgid ""
"Hey, soldier. You surprised me. For the best, I suppose. I was getting a "
"little lost."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b758c918-32a7-46d8-d3d4-881077494cde
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Karlach:b758c918-32a7-46d8-d3d4-881077494cde
msgctxt "h71371957g64c2g41e9g90b7ga9b94ef7948b"
msgid "What do you mean?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = c19390fd-6c33-6bb6-e98f-50094b3c8a46
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Karlach:c19390fd-6c33-6bb6-e98f-50094b3c8a46
msgctxt "hf303b2e9g39d4g41efg9932g8082dde3660d"
msgid ""
"Went in for a fresh seedloaf once, only to find her sitting on a stool with "
"her head in her hands. I asked her if she was all right."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = c4822f58-3fb2-3b7e-1a22-e4457c3c4904
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Karlach:c4822f58-3fb2-3b7e-1a22-e4457c3c4904
msgctxt "hb179b077gc263g4e5fg9d17g270aed6e3626"
msgid ""
"True enough. Don't know why I'm rushing things, except the risk of imminent "
"mind flayerisation. But hey, we've got a cure in the works, right? Right."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = c98bcb0c-14ae-fc93-8d95-d666860fad67
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Karlach:c98bcb0c-14ae-fc93-8d95-d666860fad67
msgctxt "hc966dd18g892ag4c58g835eg37018c60a1a7"
msgid ""
"Hah. I bet I could handle it. If you could handle the void-like Hell maw "
"inside me."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = cb9a8ee1-8695-162f-b9de-c7833a9f6be8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Karlach:cb9a8ee1-8695-162f-b9de-c7833a9f6be8
msgctxt "h7ca3143ag38f6g42a3g81dbgdc4131e52d38"
msgid "And you know what? That feels <i>good. </i>"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = cbef39a6-e82a-a28f-c998-0c7fbf96b375
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Karlach:cbef39a6-e82a-a28f-c998-0c7fbf96b375
msgctxt "h872799c7g98a1g4269g96c7ga77f4c1977a1"
msgid ""
"We better get some shut-eye if we're going to face whatever's coming our way "
"tomorrow. At the rate things are going, I expect nothing less than something "
"totally unexpected."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d58668d1-a339-6aab-89ce-18701679b387
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Karlach:d58668d1-a339-6aab-89ce-18701679b387
msgctxt "hc4fb2628g00e9g42f1g99eeg9c83f2b57d8e"
msgid "Nothing?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = e1df8aef-32ae-13f5-f668-1be409fe106d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Karlach:e1df8aef-32ae-13f5-f668-1be409fe106d
msgctxt "h2f22bfa5g0d35g4c4bga7bagbb5f36c36d22"
msgid ""
"The future. I foresee... sunny days - lots of them. A little place in the "
"city. And more adventures with the likes of you."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = eba9de75-17bd-5072-d28a-2c44ef319e06
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Karlach:eba9de75-17bd-5072-d28a-2c44ef319e06
msgctxt "h398a6c37gb92ag4efeg8fb0g6aa13e86600b"
msgid ""
"But you look pretty good yourself, I have to say. Now - let's get some shut-"
"eye before I say something I regret and lie awake in rictus horror all night."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = fb6fa46b-1881-c9fd-35d5-a38814b674e2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Karlach:fb6fa46b-1881-c9fd-35d5-a38814b674e2
msgctxt "h4d28c85bg9ed6g4e23g8a8eg06f20df6ee51"
msgid ""
"Maybe this is how the squiddie fuckers get you. They put a pep in your step, "
"then burst out of your skull when you least expect it."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = feab6f50-0d0a-0f77-96b4-a25c1fb07650
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Karlach:feab6f50-0d0a-0f77-96b4-a25c1fb07650
msgctxt "hd2079e02gddbeg4532g8983gbd137f038180"
msgid ""
"'I will be,' she said. 'Just tending to my garden of sadness. Things have "
"got rather overgrown.'"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 1064b712-3873-9aeb-e724-845b9f00f1a9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Laezel:1064b712-3873-9aeb-e724-845b9f00f1a9
msgctxt "hd6c476edgc2c9g4922gba30gd8539616cd59"
msgid ""
"The Tears follow behind it. Rocky bodies tumbling through the Sea of Night. "
"One of them is my crèche: K'liir."
msgstr "그 뒤를 따르는 것이 눈물이다. 밤의 바다를 가로지르는 울퉁불퉁한 바위들이지. 그 중 하나가 나의 양성소인 클리르다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 1ac25000-f95a-34ad-c195-fd4195506d2d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Laezel:1ac25000-f95a-34ad-c195-fd4195506d2d
msgctxt "h88afd281gfd40g4381g8193g74bf1eddedbd"
msgid "Next time you're able, look to the sky, watch the moon cross it."
msgstr "다음에 기회가 된다면, 달이 하늘을 가로지르는 걸 유심히 봐라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1aecd18c-0627-7368-0439-8855df472ad1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(1) = False
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Laezel:1aecd18c-0627-7368-0439-8855df472ad1
msgctxt "hc15019acgbdc4g43f9g91c1g169b55a9fe15"
msgid "Are all githyanki from the Tears?"
msgstr "모든 기스양키들이 눈물에서 온 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 1cd65688-223f-673a-5e21-ba8b86797b28
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Laezel:1cd65688-223f-673a-5e21-ba8b86797b28
msgctxt "h9c2a4dd0g8aeag4b46g95f2gf6479467a99a"
msgid ""
"But enough of this. You are wasting your resting time. Come dawn, we resume "
"our search for a crèche."
msgstr "하지만 이쯤 하지. 넌 휴식 시간을 낭비하고 있다. 새벽이 되면 양성소를 다시 찾도록 하자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 224c1098-4f7f-0236-727c-f7b94917ee71
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Laezel:224c1098-4f7f-0236-727c-f7b94917ee71
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h66394913g9ed7g4dafg8ad4g0ac39ea5c63f"
msgid ""
"Extinguish the Tears? Your dedication to your goddess blinds you to their "
"import."
msgstr "눈물을 지운다니? 네 여신에 대한 맹목적인 신앙심 때문에 별의 가치를 애써 부정하는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 24aebe9a-5cf8-baba-6825-14abb07e2cdf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Laezel:24aebe9a-5cf8-baba-6825-14abb07e2cdf
msgctxt "hb6c3beb2g7691g414fg922fg946d4c182492"
msgid ""
"It's there I first saw a <i>kith'rak</i> mount a red dragon. Where I slit my "
"cousins' throats at the <i>varsh</i>'s command."
msgstr ""
"그곳에서 난 처음으로 <i>키스락</i>이 레드 드래곤에 타는 것을 목도했다. 그리고 <i>바쉬</i>의 명령으로 내 사촌들의 목을 "
"베어버리기도 했지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 25fc7fe4-73ba-f9a6-796e-0472df3e933a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Laezel:25fc7fe4-73ba-f9a6-796e-0472df3e933a
msgctxt "ha9eb706fg042bg4df2gb3a9ga520ca97952d"
msgid "Yes. Rocky bodies named after a false goddess."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2eab6523-7675-64d0-de0d-a42b808ad2cb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_HIGHELF(1) = True
#.      - REALLY_WOODELF(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Laezel:2eab6523-7675-64d0-de0d-a42b808ad2cb
msgctxt "h70ea961bg78acg41d8gbe49gc59e7b36e4ff"
msgid ""
"The Tears of Selûne? I've spent many a night observing these celestial "
"bodies."
msgstr "셀루네의 눈물? 수많은 밤을 그 천체의 육신을 관찰하며 보냈지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 38891c7b-c02c-e86b-debe-feaaa9ab51ac
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_WLDMAIN_State_InRegion(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Laezel:38891c7b-c02c-e86b-debe-feaaa9ab51ac
msgctxt "hf2bb4fe9g8dcag4454g82adgc5e33ecd10ee"
msgid "Perhaps we may see them this eve. Look above, to the Sea of Night."
msgstr "오늘 밤에는 볼 수 있을지도 모르겠군. 위를 봐라, 밤의 바다를 찾아봐."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 39f0fdf0-4ad1-ad79-fa62-b74520b11150
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Laezel:39f0fdf0-4ad1-ad79-fa62-b74520b11150
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "hae9e5629gb82fg4b7dgbcaeg431b8da9c3bb"
msgid ""
"You are too easily astonished. There is more to this realm than this grassy "
"pebble."
msgstr "참으로 쉽게 놀라는 군. 이 세계에는 수풀과 조약돌 따위보다 더 많은 게 있다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 3a31b174-34e6-0ff9-c7c8-16e22a28a415
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Laezel:3a31b174-34e6-0ff9-c7c8-16e22a28a415
msgctxt "he76f4188g4bbcg40b0g93a2g3455f96ad44b"
msgid "We infiltrated a neogi spelljammer and laid waste to its crew."
msgstr "네오기 스펠재머를 탈취해 선원들을 처치해버리기도 했지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3ec751ec-d2a6-4701-e6ce-90673b395df3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ShadowHeart_InParty_Knows_SharWorshipper = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Laezel:3ec751ec-d2a6-4701-e6ce-90673b395df3
msgctxt "h83251551g052ag47efg85b2g2845f4fc0094"
msgid "The Tears of Selûne? They mar the sky - I'd extinguish them if I could."
msgstr "셀루네의 눈물 말이야? 하늘을 더럽히는 불결한 상징이지. 할 수만 있다면 지워버리고 싶어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4546764c-12f6-dc1f-62ee-3fa9d04ff2a4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(1) = False
#. TagRule: CLERIC_SELUNE or PALADIN_SELUNE or REALLY_GALE or REALLY_PLANAR or WIZARD
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Laezel:4546764c-12f6-dc1f-62ee-3fa9d04ff2a4
msgctxt "hee498c6cg2360g485bg9c73g6b611c7dfe92"
msgid "The Tears of Selûne, you mean?"
msgstr "셀루네의 눈물 말이야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 4554ac1b-4d58-f1ee-9a1b-1b5842a9be35
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Laezel:4554ac1b-4d58-f1ee-9a1b-1b5842a9be35
msgctxt "hc682e50eg26a8g4d47gab97g784800a5d83e"
msgid "'Only?'"
msgstr "그럴리가."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 45cf1c16-7c63-f9a3-e0ab-31dddcfed241
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Laezel:45cf1c16-7c63-f9a3-e0ab-31dddcfed241
msgctxt "habd8b04fg7ed9g4285ga5e0g9356b353f2f4"
msgid "The moonlight shines warmly on us. The breeze caresses our faces."
msgstr "달빛이 우리를 따뜻하게 비추고, 산들바람이 우리 얼굴을 어루만지는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 5ac2fb74-b629-0760-98f1-5d5fb10f7bc0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Laezel:5ac2fb74-b629-0760-98f1-5d5fb10f7bc0
msgctxt "h3fcc69a0g5a8eg4c94g917bg21fead4a69db"
msgid "My entire clutch battled beholders deep within the Eye of the Sky."
msgstr "내 무리 전체가 창공의 눈 속 지하에서 비홀더들과 싸웠다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5d9428b1-5b76-db4a-7879-119e4d153a26
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Laezel:5d9428b1-5b76-db4a-7879-119e4d153a26
msgctxt "h81e8c4a7g8636g47bcg8b04gba3c32abd0a5"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 6061b19d-2620-9364-edc6-c5e36a6171f4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Laezel:6061b19d-2620-9364-edc6-c5e36a6171f4
msgctxt "h97588beegeb23g4825g96e2g8b6b10cd088a"
msgid "My entire clutch battled beholders within the Eye of the Sky's tunnels."
msgstr "내 무리 전체가 창공의 눈 속 지하에서 비홀더들과 싸웠다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 64ace15e-b196-e9e6-eaeb-00e0e5405775
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CAMP_Global_Event_SpokeLaezel = True
#.     - CAMP_Global_State_Night3Com = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Laezel:64ace15e-b196-e9e6-eaeb-00e0e5405775
msgctxt "hbafc87ddg3199g474dga022gaf93b0905024"
msgid "<i>G'lyck.</i> I remember who I was in Crèche K'liir."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 82381d4e-9864-7b59-2bd6-c827824557a2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Laezel:82381d4e-9864-7b59-2bd6-c827824557a2
msgctxt "hbab590bfgd549g4b31g9bb5ga837c20fc1bc"
msgid ""
"The Tears span Toril's sky, <i>vin'iisk</i>. There is more to this realm "
"than this grassy pebble."
msgstr "눈물은 토릴의 하늘 전역에 존재한다, <i>비니스크</i>. 이 차원엔 풀투성이 자갈들만 있는 게 아니야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 93837fb6-2329-ae30-875d-b9fe33cb5aa7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(1) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE or REALLY_GITHYANKI
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Laezel:93837fb6-2329-ae30-875d-b9fe33cb5aa7
msgctxt "hfb7771c9gdac4g454dg8782gde4996bbcef8"
msgid "Did you only train within the Tears?"
msgstr "눈물 안쪽에서만 훈련한 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9b72475b-da8f-1fa1-9294-a9cbc18f6786
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Laezel:9b72475b-da8f-1fa1-9294-a9cbc18f6786
msgctxt "he2a8f570g6cabg48faga989g409b99b700b0"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 9d87c8b9-0da8-d65e-c775-a6b53270a8c3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Laezel:9d87c8b9-0da8-d65e-c775-a6b53270a8c3
msgctxt "h27381294gf8b2g4297gb5dcg78f287359d45"
msgid "They rely on strangers' swords, when they should be forging their own."
msgstr "이방인들의 칼날에 의존하다니. 직접 만들어 싸울 용기 따윈 없나 보군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a5960bad-1e03-0932-3793-1c42a8aeed93
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC(1) = False
#.      - REALLY_HALFLING(1) = True
#.      - PALADIN(1) = False
#.      - WIZARD(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Laezel:a5960bad-1e03-0932-3793-1c42a8aeed93
msgctxt "h2a3fa686gb6e5g4681g8371g61aa36f650af"
msgid "You mean you come from up there? In the <i>sky?</i>"
msgstr "그럼 저 위에서 왔다는 거야? <i>하늘에서?</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = a9534679-bf4a-b5c1-a137-86246fc26745
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GITHYANKI
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Laezel:a9534679-bf4a-b5c1-a137-86246fc26745
msgctxt "h395f1fb5g5206g463cg9d28g172c02cb00ce"
msgid ""
"The Tears span Toril's sky. There is more to the realm than this grassy "
"pebble, kin."
msgstr "눈물은 토릴의 하늘 전역에 존재한다. 이 차원엔 풀투성이 자갈들만 있는 게 아니야, 동족이여."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = a9534679-bf4a-b5c1-a137-86246fc26745
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Laezel:a9534679-bf4a-b5c1-a137-86246fc26745
msgctxt "h18bd2a24g05a7g4aebg918cg273c3a36cc8c"
msgid ""
"The Tears span Toril's sky. There is more to the realm than this grassy "
"pebble, <i>vin'iisk.</i>"
msgstr "눈물은 토릴의 하늘 전역에 존재한다. 이 차원엔 풀투성이 자갈들만 있는 게 아니야, <i>비니스크.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = aa2053a7-65f3-8171-01b7-e921a0c95f40
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Laezel:aa2053a7-65f3-8171-01b7-e921a0c95f40
msgctxt "h90083254gcb5fg48b1g8831g19af01cf57a1"
msgid "Your curiosity is to be commended."
msgstr "호기심이 대단하군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = aed0e88a-e798-7e88-aebc-288622f18ca4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - Laezel_InParty_Event_SpokeOfDangers(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - Laezel_InParty_Event_SpokeOfDangers(1) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_PLANAR
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Laezel:aed0e88a-e798-7e88-aebc-288622f18ca4
msgctxt "h3b880ea7ge7a7g4beagba99g2888de061b4a"
msgid "Perhaps Faerûn has its value. You shouldn't discount it just yet."
msgstr "페이룬도 자신만의 가치가 있을지도 몰라. 아직은 속단해선 안 돼."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = aed0e88a-e798-7e88-aebc-288622f18ca4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - Laezel_InParty_Event_SpokeOfDangers(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - Laezel_InParty_Event_SpokeOfDangers(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Laezel:aed0e88a-e798-7e88-aebc-288622f18ca4
msgctxt "he0e0f53cg698fg4fe8ga7ebg0d59b3994c01"
msgid "Faerûn isn't so bad. Give it a chance."
msgstr "페이룬도 그렇게 나쁘진 않아. 기회를 줘."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = b5d68434-3960-27a6-9702-1b196cd30f18
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Laezel:b5d68434-3960-27a6-9702-1b196cd30f18
msgctxt "h8d62c2f3g93a9g47bagb18fg513e0efb3bad"
msgid "Hideous. <i>All of it.</i>"
msgstr "흉측하군. <i>전부 다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = bd66ccf6-d46c-6db6-db55-169d8390033f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Laezel:bd66ccf6-d46c-6db6-db55-169d8390033f
msgctxt "hf31c5460gd1f9g448bg9369g7ad65168b60d"
msgid ""
"Then perhaps you've unknowingly gazed at my crèche, K'liir, as it tumbled "
"past."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = c3ce4340-e7b8-1f68-58bb-e7df84cd31c6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Laezel:c3ce4340-e7b8-1f68-58bb-e7df84cd31c6
msgctxt "hedbe494bgac0eg4566ga9ddgdf0899b3ecb4"
msgid "Should you be fortunate, you may see Crèche K'liir tumble past."
msgstr "운이 좋다면, 클리르 양성소가 지나가는 것을 볼 수도 있겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = c9d8a931-dcfb-51ce-0940-345e25a24250
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Laezel:c9d8a931-dcfb-51ce-0940-345e25a24250
msgctxt "h1c0e12afga53fg4ea1gb517g8772f6660ddc"
msgid ""
"Githyanki are hatched in crèches all throughout Realmspace. K'liir is one of "
"many."
msgstr "기스양키는 차원계 우주 전체의 양성소들에서 태어난다. 클리르는 그중 하나에 불과하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cb117aa7-a0e7-7754-015a-800d3a366064
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC_SELUNE(1) = False
#.      - WIZARD(1) = False
#.      - REALLY_GALE(1) = False
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(1) = False
#.      - PALADIN_SELUNE(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Laezel:cb117aa7-a0e7-7754-015a-800d3a366064
msgctxt "hb5592796g7cc9g495eg9075g398db9bf3213"
msgid "What do you mean by 'the Tears'?"
msgstr "'눈물 속'이라니 그게 무슨 뜻이지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = cbb20694-f316-9b78-ee71-f6af69355830
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Laezel:cbb20694-f316-9b78-ee71-f6af69355830
msgctxt "h18dda143g9a96g4312gad16g3e3b85d40f76"
msgid "We infiltrated a neogi Spelljammer and laid waste to its crew."
msgstr "네오기 스펠재머에 침투해 승무원들을 처치하기도 했지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = d0d6719b-7991-68f2-d391-0078e4cb047f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Laezel:d0d6719b-7991-68f2-d391-0078e4cb047f
msgctxt "h6484c623g1608g40d7g851bg8a46198d71fd"
msgid "Would that I were doing battle up there, among the Tears."
msgstr "저 위에서 전투나 벌이고 있었다면 좋았을 텐데, 눈물 속에서 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = d5a659b4-498a-6f2e-0ef6-3ddd8a1535bf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Laezel:d5a659b4-498a-6f2e-0ef6-3ddd8a1535bf
msgctxt "h31559452g6e66g405dg919bg3e5b2c81f0b1"
msgid ""
"Flowering meadows and fecund soil have softened their minds and muscles."
msgstr "비옥한 토양과 드넓은 목초지가 놈들의 정신과 근육을 부드럽게 만들었다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = d8b0e4f3-0f27-0bdf-47f9-4af20540c68a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Laezel:d8b0e4f3-0f27-0bdf-47f9-4af20540c68a
msgctxt "h8a5b0128g4940g4774gb86cg98e6ba9feb9d"
msgid ""
"I was hungry to face my first <i>ghaik</i>, my sword pined for their blood."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = d92b2b8d-276f-41c5-9060-da3d679fa4c2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_WLDMAIN_State_InRegion(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CAMP_Global_Event_SpokeLaezel = True
#.     - CAMP_Global_State_Night3Com = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Laezel:d92b2b8d-276f-41c5-9060-da3d679fa4c2
msgctxt "ha741ab18g0683g4497ga3b3g9672f9b81e53"
msgid "A fine evening, don't you think?"
msgstr "멋진 저녁이군, 그렇지 않나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = dbeb5a0d-9ec6-bcf1-40ca-bd9bf89d43dc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Laezel:dbeb5a0d-9ec6-bcf1-40ca-bd9bf89d43dc
msgctxt "h6d48287cg80ebg4fe1ga732g2bb9060d7781"
msgid "You want to do battle <i>up where?</i>"
msgstr "<i>어디서</i> 전투를 하고 싶다고?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = e0956bc2-9907-f232-5f55-2b347a069bfc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_WLDMAIN_State_InRegion(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Laezel:e0956bc2-9907-f232-5f55-2b347a069bfc
msgctxt "h4d04174bg632dg44d1gabccg91b0e1842c07"
msgid "Look above. Watch the moon cross the sky."
msgstr "위를 봐. 달이 하늘을 가로지르는 걸 유심히 봐라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = e581b44e-3cdd-62fc-b7a7-4b964520511b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Laezel:e581b44e-3cdd-62fc-b7a7-4b964520511b
msgctxt "he1bd3953gbb38g47d2g8eaeg698ba804f2c3"
msgid "I see naught but cowards cowering in their groves and grottos."
msgstr "내 눈에는 겁쟁이들이 자기들의 숲과 동굴에 숨어 벌벌 떠는 모습밖에 보이지 않는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = eaafefcd-8acd-5c9d-1b79-39e4527f1187
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Laezel:eaafefcd-8acd-5c9d-1b79-39e4527f1187
msgctxt "h1f77521bgc550g436agaae9g5eb503c30915"
msgid ""
"You are wise not to waste your resting time. Come dawn, we resume our search "
"for a crèche."
msgstr "현명해, 휴식 시간을 허투루 쓰지 않는 군. 해가 뜨면, 양성소를 계속해서 수색하자고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = f1890eb8-d700-6377-255d-aeff1d22acc4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_WLDCAVGRN_State_InRegion(1) = True
#.      - CAMP_WLDCAVSND_State_InRegion(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CAMP_Global_Event_SpokeLaezel = True
#.     - CAMP_Global_State_Night3Com = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Laezel:f1890eb8-d700-6377-255d-aeff1d22acc4
msgctxt "h89d80108ge379g42a4gbc1bg5cc8bc8cd33d"
msgid ""
"<i>G'lyck.</i> Sleeping in a cave reminds me of my adolescence - in Crèche "
"K'liir."
msgstr "<i>글리크.</i> 동굴에서 잠을 청하니 내 유년기가 생각나는 군. 클리르 양성소에 있을 적 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = f76fdab0-7889-c9ed-453f-d207c761d713
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Laezel:f76fdab0-7889-c9ed-453f-d207c761d713
msgctxt "hc1591d51gc3b2g41acg872cgbab1db155a6c"
msgid "Do you think me so sheltered?"
msgstr "내가 그렇게 연약해 보이나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fde09c09-47c9-a891-9111-d592be95fea8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Laezel:fde09c09-47c9-a891-9111-d592be95fea8
msgctxt "h14aaf37fg7568g437cga84cg30e8d959a8fe"
msgid "It must be quite a shock, to leave your crèche behind and arrive here."
msgstr "네 양성소를 떠나 이곳에 오다니, 충격이 꽤 컸겠네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Narrator
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 0716a01a-5a50-e0a6-cb68-6b925ac2adcf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Narrator:0716a01a-5a50-e0a6-cb68-6b925ac2adcf
msgctxt "h4d310bd8g1ea2g4b0ag9a6agfa35bf001c59"
msgid "*...maybe you've got more time to find a cure than you thought.*"
msgstr "*...어쩌면 치료법을 찾아낼 시간이 더 많이 남아있을지도 모릅니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Narrator
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 1cf950cf-24dd-c8c9-af9f-e6369a7bde1d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Hag_Knows_ToldHagTadpole = True
#.      - GLO_Hag_Knows_Teahouse = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Narrator:1cf950cf-24dd-c8c9-af9f-e6369a7bde1d
msgctxt "h53e8bc07g7a6fg4e5dg88c8gf48767eef4a6"
msgid ""
"*Great wisdom lies behind Auntie Ethel's kind eyes. She can heal your "
"infection, you're certain.*"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Narrator
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 1fecfa00-cdcb-cb34-c70e-e1a89fb6d7b8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_CapturedGoblin_Knows_Priestess = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Narrator:1fecfa00-cdcb-cb34-c70e-e1a89fb6d7b8
msgctxt "he247ccbag5739g4f26ga46ag181b1f480dfa"
msgid ""
"*A goblin priestess seems an unlikely ally, but you have faith she can "
"destroy the tadpole in your brain.*"
msgstr "*고블린 여사제가 당신의 편이 되어줄지는 모르겠지만, 당신은 그녀가 머릿속 올챙이를 없애줄 수 있으리라 믿습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Narrator
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 3333cbda-5871-52c2-33f5-5eec6e3e6919
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_Apprentice_Quest_FindHalsin = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Narrator:3333cbda-5871-52c2-33f5-5eec6e3e6919
msgctxt "h02d52a54g450fg40e6ga113ge62213841842"
msgid ""
"*The druid Halsin sounds like a remarkable talent. He can still the "
"parasite, you're sure of it.*"
msgstr "*드루이드 할신은 놀랄만한 재능을 지녔습니다. 그는 그 기생충을 진정시킬 수 있을 겁니다. 당신은 확신에 차 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Narrator
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 3726d9a9-bcba-1da8-5b46-157005dcc0f6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Narrator:3726d9a9-bcba-1da8-5b46-157005dcc0f6
msgctxt "h8670c85fgd2f5g4463gb122g8bc45f66e57e"
msgid ""
"*You feel as healthy as ever - healthier than the day before, in fact. You "
"will reach a crèche, and you will be purified. You're certain of it.*"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Narrator
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 566dd823-3eaa-a9e0-57e0-d9e511d8a10a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Narrator:566dd823-3eaa-a9e0-57e0-d9e511d8a10a
msgctxt "hbd1c1b7fgf0feg4392gb30ag7e1c8795d442"
msgid ""
"*You feel as healthy as ever - healthier than the day before, in fact. Maybe "
"the parasite is... broken, or dying...*"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Narrator
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 7b4c8287-1a63-1106-1e0a-2470b8d089a9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CAMP_Global_State_Night3Com = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Narrator:7b4c8287-1a63-1106-1e0a-2470b8d089a9
msgctxt "h99486bb5g2942g4383ga5f9ga266a5a98b69"
msgid ""
"*The dark clouds of your imagination part, and a speck of hope shines "
"through.*"
msgstr "*당신의 상상 속 어둠이 물러나고, 한줄기 희망이 비추기 시작합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Narrator
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 8a561e14-9299-d372-4fe1-1d2bff4ecb22
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Narrator:8a561e14-9299-d372-4fe1-1d2bff4ecb22
msgctxt "hee4cee03ga3a4g44a4gac26g742793625ede"
msgid ""
"*A smile threatens to curl your lip. A cure is on the horizon. Soon, you'll "
"be rid of this tadpole for good.*"
msgstr "*미소가 입가에 스며듭니다. 치료법이 가까이에 있습니다. 곧, 이 올챙이를 영원히 제거할 수 있을 겁니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Narrator
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = c399381a-6ec7-0ceb-6a33-0b302966cfec
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_ThingLikeMe_Event_ToldAboutCreche = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Narrator:c399381a-6ec7-0ceb-6a33-0b302966cfec
msgctxt "h4a2aaf46g87d9g4895ga6dbg4b7bb5edee24"
msgid ""
"*Lae'zel's promised purification at a githyanki crèche. And she's given you "
"no reason to disbelieve her.*"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0b7e58f0-4987-588a-108d-f93a3042de22
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart:0b7e58f0-4987-588a-108d-f93a3042de22
msgctxt "hda0dc32egcfdfg4f36gaea0g4b7f02ff5e4c"
msgid "We're just working towards a common goal. Don't get sentimental."
msgstr "우린 그저 공동의 목표를 위해 함께 일하고 있을 뿐이야. 감상적으로 생각하지 마."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0e08445c-5a08-97ca-a40e-05f423839e91
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart:0e08445c-5a08-97ca-a40e-05f423839e91
msgctxt "heff5449eg6ed2g4980gbffcgea1f80ca35ec"
msgid "How are you feeling?"
msgstr "기분이 어때?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 0ecd583e-900d-cda7-1e77-67137c46609d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart:0ecd583e-900d-cda7-1e77-67137c46609d
msgctxt "h5cc94c61g7e80g4113g9bafg2238c8b6a55a"
msgid "We should get some rest. Good night."
msgstr "이만 쉬는 게 좋겠어. 잘 자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 10532e13-f15c-de5c-5ce0-01a2fd5c8591
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart:10532e13-f15c-de5c-5ce0-01a2fd5c8591
msgctxt "h6774ea8fg7430g4332gb617gf04a8fabc7d7"
msgid "Keep this up, and I'm out of here."
msgstr "이대로만 계속해, 그럼 난 여기서 떠날 테니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 105b3223-6359-9482-68a7-9f2a29332339
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart:105b3223-6359-9482-68a7-9f2a29332339
msgctxt "h82a59169g1d3bg4c20g8d1fg1e0ff1715141"
msgid "Hmmm... you'd do well where I'm from. But don't try it again."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 11360614-3548-4e82-ef62-24aa16a29211
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - Approval_AtLeast_10_For_Sp2(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart:11360614-3548-4e82-ef62-24aa16a29211
msgctxt "h741f3980g2cc5g447aga6e4gbbac369d9703"
msgid ""
"Wise... though I hope you'd miss me after I'm gone. I think I would, if the "
"positions were reversed."
msgstr "현명하네... 내가 가고 나면 네가 날 그리워할 줄 알았는데. 내가 그 상황이었다면 그랬을 것 같거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 13fd6e89-5cc3-b264-2991-b2c88bc38d8b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart:13fd6e89-5cc3-b264-2991-b2c88bc38d8b
msgctxt "h3482d45bg7fb9g4b68gbfdag4d40484755ca"
msgid "I just want to know how you <i>really </i>feel."
msgstr "그냥 네가 진짜로 어떻게 느끼는지 알고 싶어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 15ca00ca-f576-ddf6-a98c-d262b55b0347
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart:15ca00ca-f576-ddf6-a98c-d262b55b0347
msgctxt "h2f8d28d8gb878g451bg837fg86fc6616530f"
msgid ""
"Ah... that sounds... interesting. But on second thought, I'm<i> </i>quite "
"tired."
msgstr "아... 그것 참... 흥미롭네. 다시 생각해 보니까, 좀 피곤해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1808d30d-e39b-cb5d-85f8-7093943adcd7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart:1808d30d-e39b-cb5d-85f8-7093943adcd7
msgctxt "h95c35b42g2de1g45b8gaa04gc4d93735f411"
msgid "Let's not do this. I don't like hypothetical questions."
msgstr "그만하자. 가상의 질문은 별로야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 18fc6ff8-3db2-3382-90ae-85bfa6c75cde
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - Approval_AtLeast_5_For_Sp2(0) = False
#.      - Approval_AtLeast_0_For_Sp2(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart:18fc6ff8-3db2-3382-90ae-85bfa6c75cde
msgctxt "h7713e9c6g332bg4aa0ga3f5g7e969b4cc9fe"
msgid ""
"I hope not. I'd miss our little conversations... wouldn't you miss them as "
"well?"
msgstr "그러지 않기를 바라. 우리 소소한 대화가 그리워질 거야... 너도 그럴 거 같지 않아?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1a44c8ad-2367-ef07-6f6b-8837d3e2949a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart:1a44c8ad-2367-ef07-6f6b-8837d3e2949a
msgctxt "h073fb7e4gabadg4858gbfacgf0616fb815f9"
msgid "How about a few songs around the fire with the others?"
msgstr "모닥불 주위에서 다른 사람들과 함께 노래나 몇 곡 부르는 건 어때?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 256d4d0b-d0a5-82fc-8c48-3676b7d651c9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart:256d4d0b-d0a5-82fc-8c48-3676b7d651c9
msgctxt "h6578c36eg2857g4e6fga3c4g1a5b96db83a6"
msgid ""
"I'm glad. Hopefully we can eke out some more time together, before all's "
"done and dusted..."
msgstr "다행이네. 모든 것이 끝나고 먼지로 사라지기 전에 함께 시간을 더 보낼 수 있기를 바라자..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 25ccb094-8e83-0f49-9063-d496b6c4d4dc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart:25ccb094-8e83-0f49-9063-d496b6c4d4dc
msgctxt "hbf947d1fg5aacg4270gbe6dgd8cb23662522"
msgid ""
"But you're right - if we're to make it through all this, there can be no "
"room for hesitation. You're doing well."
msgstr "하지만 네가 맞아, 이 모든 걸 해쳐내려면, 망설일 시간 따위 없어. 잘하고 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 2923bc3c-138f-174b-b047-45361074bf73
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_WLDMAIN_State_InRegion(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart:2923bc3c-138f-174b-b047-45361074bf73
msgctxt "h0b6950e2gfc52g4ec6g9076g79fea597cbf3"
msgid ""
"It's a beautiful night. I think I'll stay up to enjoy it while I still can. "
"Rest well."
msgstr "아름다운 밤이야. 아직은 깨어 있으려고. 푹 쉬어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 2a70abd9-301a-a8bc-fa20-26d5fa636947
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_WLDMAIN_State_InRegion(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart:2a70abd9-301a-a8bc-fa20-26d5fa636947
msgctxt "h102e081dg341ag4625g905cg99fbcdd2ec79"
msgid ""
"It's a beautiful night. I think I'll stay up to enjoy it while I still can. "
"Rest well."
msgstr "아름다운 밤이야. 아직은 깨어 있으려고. 푹 쉬어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 2bc7c34d-a77e-7508-ea8b-51ecda1d6888
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart:2bc7c34d-a77e-7508-ea8b-51ecda1d6888
msgctxt "hba7fb485g280eg4d5bg894ega3b35930d739"
msgid "Do that again, and I'll split your skull, understand?"
msgstr "그걸 한 번만 더 했다간, 네 머리를 쪼개버리겠어, 알겠어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 2eb96a45-dc29-b230-e98d-b6c452dfd1f5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart:2eb96a45-dc29-b230-e98d-b6c452dfd1f5
msgctxt "ha1bdc2d1g72d5g4ec0g8375g1ed2f7be82ba"
msgid "Adventurous."
msgstr "모험심이 넘치네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 377ddbbf-8b82-3f88-b8cf-8b0bff23d1bc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart:377ddbbf-8b82-3f88-b8cf-8b0bff23d1bc
msgctxt "hf02ee9bbg3333g469dgaeabg0d333ce7172c"
msgid ""
"Oh. In that case, I won't keep you from your blanket. The time in my company "
"will pass more quickly if you're asleep. Good night."
msgstr "아. 그렇다면, 이불은 덮어둘게. 자고 있으면 나와 함께 있는 시간이 더 빨리 지나갈 거야. 잘자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 3d40d94b-ba0b-e524-7da3-1478cdcdc39c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart:3d40d94b-ba0b-e524-7da3-1478cdcdc39c
msgctxt "h73d2d141g06f3g44bag887eg446cd97f5250"
msgid "If I want you to know something, I'll tell you."
msgstr "네게 알려주고 싶은 게 있다면, 직접 말해줄게."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3d723205-13f5-0464-b9a2-cd9ab226548b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart:3d723205-13f5-0464-b9a2-cd9ab226548b
msgctxt "hd9338f98gf6c9g4a1bg9e2eg4374d1f5ce5b"
msgid "Just an observation."
msgstr "그냥 관찰일 뿐이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 409cfa00-c294-b018-f40e-7bba308851c6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CAMP_Global_State_Night3Com = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart:409cfa00-c294-b018-f40e-7bba308851c6
msgctxt "h39c278a0gb3e9g4c5fg8f70g6b7e5c54ef89"
msgid "The leader of the pack comes to chat."
msgstr "무리의 지도자께서 대화하러 오시는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 45a796fa-d375-c92a-5767-d696262918c0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart_MindmeldSuccess2(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart:45a796fa-d375-c92a-5767-d696262918c0
msgctxt "h19626652g30d0g4ba0g9e41gf320f1e6026a"
msgid ""
"*She <i>is</i> serious. Even she seems surprised. She's attracted to you...*"
msgstr "*그녀는 진지합니다. 약간 놀란 것 같기도 합니다. 그녀는 당신에게 매력을 느끼고 있습니다...*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 47c6678e-1a94-e44d-b6dc-e046005c862a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart_MindmeldSuccess1(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart:47c6678e-1a94-e44d-b6dc-e046005c862a
msgctxt "h98086a76gc04eg4630g9945g1f2981df6ee9"
msgid ""
"*You find a current of hope flowing through her thoughts. She believes you "
"all have a real chance.*"
msgstr "*그녀의 생각의 흐름 속에서 희망이 느껴집니다. 그녀는 당신 모두에게 기회가 있다고 믿습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 49ea2a2f-8882-18ef-d79d-966e7d207a63
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart:49ea2a2f-8882-18ef-d79d-966e7d207a63
msgctxt "h2ac4dedegbf9fg4e2aga3d8g97de16e0a069"
msgid "Hah! And I'd chase you as fast as my tentacles could carry me."
msgstr "하하! 그럼 난 내 촉수로 널 재빠르게 쫓아갈게."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 4c271c7c-f86f-a794-9330-dfd746b656de
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart:4c271c7c-f86f-a794-9330-dfd746b656de
msgctxt "h4af4085bge1e6g4958g975agaca9af81c34e"
msgid ""
"Perhaps something else will come to you, before we part ways. Rest well."
msgstr "아마도 우리가 헤어지기 전에 다른 기회가 있을지도. 편히 쉬어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 564f77d9-ecad-4f0d-6758-47ea40721e02
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart:564f77d9-ecad-4f0d-6758-47ea40721e02
msgctxt "h897e2cb0g4857g4964gaf01gefd0b15124a8"
msgid "Journey's not over yet. We should both get some rest."
msgstr "아직 여정은 끝나지 않았어. 우리 둘 다 휴식을 좀 취해야 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5677bc01-79de-7189-9b61-edaa77149e74
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart:5677bc01-79de-7189-9b61-edaa77149e74
msgctxt "ha4687421ga4ceg492egbe40g2b30723a2690"
msgid "<i>Change the subject.</i>"
msgstr "<i>주제를 바꾼다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 56d3a32a-28d8-8b0d-84ae-662644bb10d4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart:56d3a32a-28d8-8b0d-84ae-662644bb10d4
msgctxt "h5ebf81bcgbe7fg4d59gb53cgeb771c3f2aa6"
msgid "Do what again? What are you talking about?"
msgstr "뭘 다시 하자고? 무슨 말을 하는 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 5a053e73-9cdd-d0ab-30e6-db026656cd49
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CAMP_Global_State_Night3Com = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CAMP_Global_State_Night3Com = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart:5a053e73-9cdd-d0ab-30e6-db026656cd49
msgctxt "h33044ca4g1402g4c4bgbdfbg131b3be033df"
msgid "Finally, some good fortune. Come morning, we know what to do."
msgstr "마침내, 행운이 찾아왔네. 아침에 다시 와, 우리 모두 뭘 해야 할지 알고 있으니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 5c916aae-c2b0-1c70-9c12-ff2bba05fd63
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart:5c916aae-c2b0-1c70-9c12-ff2bba05fd63
msgctxt "h186d5965g0502g4d13g8480g8b8196a4b1cf"
msgid ""
"Besides, I can't afford to tire you out - we still have work to do. Rest "
"well."
msgstr "게다가, 아직 할 일이 남았어, 널 지치게 할 순 없지. 푹 쉬어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 5d77e3f8-1142-a664-b8d0-85d0d19e6c92
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - Approval_AtLeast_5_For_Sp2(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart:5d77e3f8-1142-a664-b8d0-85d0d19e6c92
msgctxt "h563b66eegc9dfg4853g99f7g896c1f8d1652"
msgid "I hadn't thought of that. What do you have in mind?"
msgstr "그 생각은 해본 적 없는데. 네 생각이 뭐야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 61dd28d1-96a2-2101-2cf8-53cbe1eede2d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart:61dd28d1-96a2-2101-2cf8-53cbe1eede2d
msgctxt "h0d507cb5g0781g4021gb721g4c5ff745ced3"
msgid "I have enjoyed your company, yes."
msgstr "너와 함께 있어서 즐거웠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6a041221-d003-0eb1-95e7-a97353d85e16
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart:6a041221-d003-0eb1-95e7-a97353d85e16
msgctxt "hb444b483g0923g4804g92dfgdc334d68021d"
msgid "Maybe I could leave you tied up while I hunted for a cure."
msgstr "네가 묶여있는 동안 치유할 방법을 찾으러 떠났을 수도 있겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 6f1a6420-83a4-6a44-6e8a-e13bb9cc4dad
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart:6f1a6420-83a4-6a44-6e8a-e13bb9cc4dad
msgctxt "hcd0bbb51g0798g4c82g8de9g670193af7fd3"
msgid "You're funny."
msgstr "너 참 재밌네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 747505c3-6c1e-309b-df78-f1efb6cb69fd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - ORI_Shadowheart_CaughtTryingMindMeld(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - ORI_Shadowheart_CaughtTryingMindMeld(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart:747505c3-6c1e-309b-df78-f1efb6cb69fd
msgctxt "h3f23718fgc0fag45f3g9bdfg1887dae9c179"
msgid "What are you doing...? <i>Stop!</i>"
msgstr "뭐 하는 거야...? <i>멈춰!</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 773159fb-ed81-cb02-2943-276494090abe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart:773159fb-ed81-cb02-2943-276494090abe
msgctxt "h817c0043g4474g40e1g982ag5619bf1906f9"
msgid ""
"We'll need that kind of thinking to make it through all this. You're doing "
"well."
msgstr "이 모든 상황을 헤쳐 나가자면 그런 결단이 필요해. 잘하고 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 7baf3f9d-dd6c-5b84-0d5f-a0caf1447a3a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart:7baf3f9d-dd6c-5b84-0d5f-a0caf1447a3a
msgctxt "h6401e665g184dg4e37gb46fg4c96fe06fa89"
msgid "Let a girl have some secrets. Was there anything else?"
msgstr "여자의 비밀을 지켜줘. 다른 할 말 있어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 7bb03c47-6635-fd01-5ec4-dbc98b9824de
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart:7bb03c47-6635-fd01-5ec4-dbc98b9824de
msgctxt "h2d480978gaaabg44c2gb35fgcd02da44ec86"
msgid "The sooner we part ways, the better. Until then, keep away from me."
msgstr "우리가 더 빨리 헤어질수록 좋아. 그때까진, 내게서 떨어져 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 807c103b-8163-dcfb-2c49-e05880631209
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart:807c103b-8163-dcfb-2c49-e05880631209
msgctxt "h3f2a2a4fgaf44g4d70gbc1dgf3873713c84b"
msgid "Once this is all over, we should find a tavern and celebrate properly."
msgstr "이 모든 일이 끝나면, 여관을 찾아서 제대로 된 축하연을 벌이자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 81e5a4ee-2313-f12a-2f3a-b3a9a81057e6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart:81e5a4ee-2313-f12a-2f3a-b3a9a81057e6
msgctxt "ha65427a4g2558g4021gae9dg0560a5e9bf9b"
msgid "Now go rest. And keep your mind to yourself."
msgstr "이제 좀 쉬어. 그리고 마음을 좀 편히 가져."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 85ef1cdb-1a34-298d-3ef3-4721592229f1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart:85ef1cdb-1a34-298d-3ef3-4721592229f1
msgctxt "h5c9beb96ge93ag406bgb0ddgf556004c4434"
msgid "Yes, vastly so. But I don't want to talk about her. Not right now."
msgstr "그래, 대단히 그렇지. 하지만 그녀에 대해선 이야기하고 싶지 않아. 지금은 아니야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 8654a0e2-4957-c2e3-1e37-3079d5ebb4a2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart:8654a0e2-4957-c2e3-1e37-3079d5ebb4a2
msgctxt "hc05828d6g73d1g4a02g9c81g430a82ef0243"
msgid "The same. These parasites are proving suspiciously benign."
msgstr "똑같아. 이 기생충들은 의심스러울만치 얌전히 지내고 있으니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 86ac03ad-6b0d-629c-7ed4-959762232c94
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart:86ac03ad-6b0d-629c-7ed4-959762232c94
msgctxt "h194aab0bg0376g40f8g9e94gc1161ac97931"
msgid "Probably wise to just get some rest."
msgstr "좀 쉬는 게 좋을 것 같아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 86ba9582-7b32-b770-9006-2ea8dc90fcaa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart:86ba9582-7b32-b770-9006-2ea8dc90fcaa
msgctxt "h04ef8f07g2041g436cg8c05gb20505d675f6"
msgid "Really? I'd just kill you."
msgstr "정말? 난 그냥 널 죽여버릴 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 8bfb70fa-efac-b3da-05de-833ebbb0694f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart:8bfb70fa-efac-b3da-05de-833ebbb0694f
msgctxt "hc27c96aeg8e00g4563gbc9ag1cba0582451e"
msgid "I can't wait to get this thing out of my head."
msgstr "이걸 머릿속에서 어서 빼내고 싶어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8e60d102-4b7f-5d0b-8f8d-a558c6200a04
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. TagRule: ILLITHID or TRUESOUL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart:8e60d102-4b7f-5d0b-8f8d-a558c6200a04
msgctxt "h7317a3e5gb7bfg453dga225gb5deceb8b93c"
msgid "<i>Is she serious? Probe her thoughts using your shared connection.</i>"
msgstr "<i>그녀가 진심일까? 연결된 정신을 이용해 그녀의 생각을 살핀다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 9065095f-720b-0b41-8502-42b08547c35c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart:9065095f-720b-0b41-8502-42b08547c35c
msgctxt "h45bff162gf673g4ad9g8b94g5e8fbbced1a4"
msgid "I hope so. Good night."
msgstr "그러길 바라. 잘자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 90baf6d2-5f3c-a465-a5a6-a476a19b6e67
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_CapturedGoblin_Knows_Priestess = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart:90baf6d2-5f3c-a465-a5a6-a476a19b6e67
msgctxt "haa14c19ag644fg439cg807dg734517627478"
msgid ""
"The sooner we find this 'Priestess Gut', the better. I can't wait to get rid "
"of this thing in my head."
msgstr "이 '여사제 거트'를 빨리 찾아야지. 이걸 어서 내 머릿속에서 빼내고 싶어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 91e11953-fef6-944f-1930-b29ddd381b34
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 8
#. TagRule: ILLITHID or TRUESOUL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart:91e11953-fef6-944f-1930-b29ddd381b34
msgctxt "hc0792e1ag56f9g4036g9da3g3957e0b9d3d5"
msgid "<i>Use your shared connection. Probe her thoughts.</i>"
msgstr "<i>연결된 정신을 통해 그녀의 생각을 조사한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 93039736-3bc5-ecd8-5405-17c002c1c15f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart:93039736-3bc5-ecd8-5405-17c002c1c15f
msgctxt "hf5ed0f43gfd76g4926g99e5ga090153ec6e9"
msgid "What's on your mind? You must be pleased to have a clear path forward."
msgstr "무슨 생각 중이야? 필시 갈 길이 명확해져서 기쁘겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 942c379e-bc15-b3af-1fe3-8f7a5a3221d1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart:942c379e-bc15-b3af-1fe3-8f7a5a3221d1
msgctxt "hfe95c640geb49g4abcg9ae4g805d5faadf3f"
msgid "No. I just want to put all this behind me."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 995955c0-f987-146a-c450-714ddf6ce795
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart:995955c0-f987-146a-c450-714ddf6ce795
msgctxt "hb219fadbg9420g4301gb16dg51f5dbbbfbcb"
msgid "But suppose I turn... what would you do?"
msgstr "그래도 내가 변한다면... 넌 어떻게 하겠어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9c1ff329-6e38-b7d1-4676-8b22500cb0e5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart:9c1ff329-6e38-b7d1-4676-8b22500cb0e5
msgctxt "he00a3500g2427g40aagb872g79a13f708ded"
msgid "No hesitations. I'd just end your misery, then and there."
msgstr "고민할 것도 없지. 네 고통을 끝내주겠어. 바로 그 자리에서."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 9cd53ffe-d610-ced4-e73e-6e7f092c0eaa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_Apprentice_Quest_FindHalsin = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart:9cd53ffe-d610-ced4-e73e-6e7f092c0eaa
msgctxt "h67642252g9370g42b0g8b72g3c3abb398c5c"
msgid ""
"The sooner we find the druid Halsin, the better. I can't wait to get rid of "
"this thing in my head."
msgstr "드루이드 할신을 빨리 찾는 편이 좋겠어. 머릿속에서 이 괴물을 빨리 없애버리고 싶으니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = a12e7d0a-1e93-de17-e765-982bc079f383
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart:a12e7d0a-1e93-de17-e765-982bc079f383
msgctxt "h7376eea1ge138g44aag94bcgaaf2e76540c7"
msgid "...but let's take care of our problem first. Rest well."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = a2c425f7-00db-5e4d-4fcb-7838c5c89d0d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_ShadowHeart_Knows_CityGoal = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart:a2c425f7-00db-5e4d-4fcb-7838c5c89d0d
msgctxt "h9f605da8g2458g4559gbcb7g8c2f18100f2d"
msgid "Head to Baldur's Gate. Someone's waiting for me."
msgstr "발더스 게이트로 가야지. 날 기다리는 사람이 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = a3908a4e-d561-0c22-7529-dba1c1f42229
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart:a3908a4e-d561-0c22-7529-dba1c1f42229
msgctxt "hf13f4035g79ffg46f5g817eg966012bd471c"
msgid "I can't trust you, can I?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a48c06d3-9869-f66c-d3f5-0a4afcddc307
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart:a48c06d3-9869-f66c-d3f5-0a4afcddc307
msgctxt "h07f27a98g48b9g46f4ga7c7g1d02bb678f8f"
msgid "Oh yes? Who?"
msgstr "아 그래? 누군데?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = aea138c1-624a-3659-2ebf-182b07b77498
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart:aea138c1-624a-3659-2ebf-182b07b77498
msgctxt "hf2c205b3g8c18g448dg970eg06293f45d19e"
msgid "I had to be sure I could still trust you."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = afc269ef-7d6d-df1c-5860-5e9f50a2c18d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart:afc269ef-7d6d-df1c-5860-5e9f50a2c18d
msgctxt "h3db113ebg6818g4adfg92a9g13708ae6a140"
msgid "*... but you sense more - a warm swell of embarrassment.*"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b0ab195c-8dc7-a7cd-c71f-7bdf3fdb5c68
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart:b0ab195c-8dc7-a7cd-c71f-7bdf3fdb5c68
msgctxt "hf66196b3g0a47g4eafgb429g0cca604fc18c"
msgid "If you turned into a monster? I'd run away."
msgstr "만약 네가 괴물로 변한다면? 나야 도망치겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = b135a1af-3190-b145-c00f-d121d260e9fe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart:b135a1af-3190-b145-c00f-d121d260e9fe
msgctxt "h3cba81d3gf215g4acfg93e7gb0d03233e0e0"
msgid "We should get some rest. Good night."
msgstr "이만 쉬는 게 좋겠어. 잘 자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = b45afddc-38f6-0a79-9bc1-b3e3768d9e7e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart:b45afddc-38f6-0a79-9bc1-b3e3768d9e7e
msgctxt "hdc02ea76gfe6eg46cfg963bgcef97d5db5ac"
msgid "Perhaps we should wait for more comfortable surrounds."
msgstr "어쩌면 좀 더 편안한 상황이 오기만을 기다려야겠네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = b7e6409a-bcd4-27a9-c273-5d6bbb056ec8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart:b7e6409a-bcd4-27a9-c273-5d6bbb056ec8
msgctxt "ha8404c4fgfe62g42c3g9e7dgd35b2ef56592"
msgid "A firm answer. I'd do the same."
msgstr "확고한 대답이네. 나라도 그렇게 하겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bc745bc0-f353-221c-40f2-91580d5fd011
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart:bc745bc0-f353-221c-40f2-91580d5fd011
msgctxt "hd8c7c501g19ceg482ag8c9dg7d4e45c0151a"
msgid "You know, this could be our last night together."
msgstr "있잖아, 이게 함께 보내는 마지막 밤일 수도 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = bde6fc0a-8f29-2d2f-c5af-9df0f742241a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart:bde6fc0a-8f29-2d2f-c5af-9df0f742241a
msgctxt "habcc14b2g5065g4b7dg8f22gc39494c34f5e"
msgid "Now leave me alone."
msgstr "이제 날 내버려 둬."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = bf940954-d162-0c98-21eb-9ae5e41a805b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart:bf940954-d162-0c98-21eb-9ae5e41a805b
msgctxt "hf7107353g237bg4c02gb0e1gf712b7ddefe6"
msgid "Disappointing."
msgstr "실망스럽네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = c0ce94fb-e866-8f5b-1090-0c8c8a8c569a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart:c0ce94fb-e866-8f5b-1090-0c8c8a8c569a
msgctxt "h6f3bfd2agf0d5g4e74g9420g1e59d78b5047"
msgid "At least you're honest. Don't do that again."
msgstr "적어도 정직하긴 하네. 다시는 그런 짓 하지 마."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c240b073-0ec9-10ae-dea2-cc73d669a068
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart:c240b073-0ec9-10ae-dea2-cc73d669a068
msgctxt "hf1981774ga7a5g4505g89cfge91a27158f42"
msgid "So what will come next for you, once this is all over?"
msgstr "이 모든 게 끝나고나면 뭘 할 생각이야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c5f798fb-a982-4c72-d9f5-8e4e2ba567a3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart:c5f798fb-a982-4c72-d9f5-8e4e2ba567a3
msgctxt "hb003eecdg4e18g4952gbff1gec13f279e8a6"
msgid "We could find somewhere discreet right now... away from the camp."
msgstr "좀 더 은밀한 곳을 찾는 게 어떨까, 야영지에서 떨어진 곳으로 말이야..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = c9ea3b7c-d3ff-7e64-5892-75a9110f48d5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - ORI_Shadowheart_CaughtTryingMindMeld(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart:c9ea3b7c-d3ff-7e64-5892-75a9110f48d5
msgctxt "h51c43f2dg41a8g49f1gbfa1g4fcb545fa368"
msgid "Stop! I already warned you not to do that again."
msgstr "멈춰! 그걸 다시 하지 말라고 이미 경고했잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = cee992d4-3b8e-56f8-d396-07083587a131
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart:cee992d4-3b8e-56f8-d396-07083587a131
msgctxt "h406ef1cfg9828g4cb2ga957g07f1dbf804c2"
msgid "It's hardly hypothetical - we're still in danger, after all."
msgstr "그저 가정이라고 할수는 없지 - 아무렴, 우린 아직도 위험에 처해 있으니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d1c0d990-5748-ca2a-952f-2ce9232f40a6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart_MindmeldSuccess1(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart:d1c0d990-5748-ca2a-952f-2ce9232f40a6
msgctxt "hcd9d3e61g6aa2g44a7gaed1g6a74fdb79420"
msgid "This person in Baldur's Gate must be very important to you."
msgstr "발더스 게이트에 있는 누군가가 네게 무척 중요한 인맥인가 보네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = d1d0a299-cda7-0afe-d1d7-e46e7b08ef23
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart:d1d0a299-cda7-0afe-d1d7-e46e7b08ef23
msgctxt "he45042f6gfb63g44beg9dcegfca04e4a46a1"
msgid "Heh. A little comfort and company doesn't sound bad..."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = d401a547-bef8-7e1d-9a22-1075cb4da357
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart:d401a547-bef8-7e1d-9a22-1075cb4da357
msgctxt "h051faf05g12adg4fa4gb852g66f68d5824be"
msgid "Ah, this cursed <i>thing</i>! "
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = d8117b76-2b49-fcba-061f-098eb1317b4f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart:d8117b76-2b49-fcba-061f-098eb1317b4f
msgctxt "h6b18acdag7e46g4cd2g8d1cg63c858b189db"
msgid ""
"*She's anxious to find this person in Baldur's Gate. Whoever it is has a "
"strong hold over her, and can give her something she desperately wants...*"
msgstr ""
"*그녀는 발더스 게이트에서 이 사람을 찾고 싶어합니다. 그녀를 강하게 사로잡고 있으며, 그녀가 간절히 원하는 것을 내어줄 수 있는 "
"사람입니다...*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d94330b6-ccde-a2a2-ce2f-8883ea9ef6e2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart:d94330b6-ccde-a2a2-ce2f-8883ea9ef6e2
msgctxt "h048e02d1g2334g46bbg81ceg9e439410c2f9"
msgid "I'm sorry. I couldn't resist."
msgstr "미안해. 저항할 수가 없었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = f2652a31-ac91-8a37-8c15-074ce60d92a7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_WLDMAIN_State_InRegion(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart:f2652a31-ac91-8a37-8c15-074ce60d92a7
msgctxt "h08bc04f4gc9e5g41eeg92b1g3a3309f6ebcb"
msgid "Hmmm... Brambles on bare skin aren't as fun in practice, I'm afraid."
msgstr "흐음... 덤불에서 나체로 뒹구는 건 생각만큼 재밌지 않을 거 같아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = f9cde5db-adc9-131a-b676-f53db3cb64e6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart:f9cde5db-adc9-131a-b676-f53db3cb64e6
msgctxt "h57910370g8ed2g4f52gb5fag8dba6a59529f"
msgid "Anyway, get some rest. Try not to dream about tying me up."
msgstr "어쨌든, 휴식을 좀 취해. 꿈에서 날 밧줄로 묶진 말고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = fb26d075-c732-bb7b-0d12-616616efd1d6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Shadowheart:fb26d075-c732-bb7b-0d12-616616efd1d6
msgctxt "hbd0acf30ga4deg4c48g98f3g681f4a227551"
msgid ""
"That's not something I'm accused of very often... but I suppose you're "
"right. I'll let you get your rest - good night."
msgstr "그런 말을 자주 듣진 않는데... 네 말이 맞는 것 같아. 이제 좀 쉬도록 해, 잘 자."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2413f747-a948-69f2-cf5a-c8653f05ea85
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Wyll:2413f747-a948-69f2-cf5a-c8653f05ea85
msgctxt "hb18294b7g1123g43degbfeaga82edb812cea"
msgid ""
"You've shown me the kind of man you are. I'll call you a friend for as long "
"as you'll have me."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 2fd8ac0e-57a1-0113-1c35-c83273300e6a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Wyll:2fd8ac0e-57a1-0113-1c35-c83273300e6a
msgctxt "hebe16e50gae11g45f9g8326g4423de01b580"
msgid "So deep, in fact, that I'd probably need more than one shovel."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 3831527d-09dc-c8b0-0ff7-ff7138d311f6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Wyll:3831527d-09dc-c8b0-0ff7-ff7138d311f6
msgctxt "h75f74258gd970g447egbb4dgf5b8a9e989cd"
msgid ""
"Friends it is. When your storms gather and lightning strikes, I'll come "
"calling."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 42105c93-a46c-63f1-f820-3d991e2e5ab2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Wyll:42105c93-a46c-63f1-f820-3d991e2e5ab2
msgctxt "h48ae29d1g2a7dg4582gb7fegcedcde292c75"
msgid "Let's not get ahead of ourselves, we haven't 'cured' anything yet."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 4f259dab-254d-d8a0-d5be-969f746f151f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Wyll:4f259dab-254d-d8a0-d5be-969f746f151f
msgctxt "h75721af6g9dcdg49e4g9a3dge4dc67c4a77b"
msgid ""
"I'm glad to hear that Karlach. Who would have thought my prey might become a "
"good partner instead?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 53e42a24-6ec2-5b6f-b48c-54bcfd358cbb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Wyll:53e42a24-6ec2-5b6f-b48c-54bcfd358cbb
msgctxt "h9b1345cdgc0bbg4561g8597ga44ea263403c"
msgid "Now, let's rest. I wager tomorrow'll be a big day."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 5ac75ec5-26da-793d-3294-56df0ad8c755
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Wyll:5ac75ec5-26da-793d-3294-56df0ad8c755
msgctxt "h9c40201fgacd5g43f6gb547g076ff77c073e"
msgid "Then I hope the road rises to meet you, wherever it leads."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 76190144-d997-3c8c-a6be-af5d24ad816b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Wyll:76190144-d997-3c8c-a6be-af5d24ad816b
msgctxt "h2f933965gc8d9g4ac5g90a1ge7b32c2bf28d"
msgid ""
"My duty is to Queen Vlaakith. I'll be leaving this place as soon as I'm able."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 900120e3-1b69-7048-b5f1-519489ddae76
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Wyll:900120e3-1b69-7048-b5f1-519489ddae76
msgctxt "h11b2208dg85c9g4188g8acdg3fe6d061df37"
msgid "'Maybe' is better than 'no' last I checked. I'll take it."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = b4a172ae-b0c8-df66-d557-bf23969057fb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Wyll:b4a172ae-b0c8-df66-d557-bf23969057fb
msgctxt "h562ea881ga346g41b2g91a7gc31f4ce5b62a"
msgid "I hope your queen values the treasure she has in you."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b9fb70c1-220c-ef5b-66ea-8460b2386e2a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Wyll:b9fb70c1-220c-ef5b-66ea-8460b2386e2a
msgctxt "hba437a22gb81fg40e9gb993g8dddc5cb3950"
msgid "That sounds great. The more friends the better."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = c5d09b60-b24a-3e07-4684-0f6d73c494ce
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Wyll:c5d09b60-b24a-3e07-4684-0f6d73c494ce
msgctxt "h9fe119b0g1cbeg4b5bga1f5gbaa8f8110b71"
msgid ""
"Oh, Astarion. I bet I'd find a touch of sweet under all that sour, if I "
"digged deep enough."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d3ce52d1-5119-63fb-5d9c-187b7a8e209d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Wyll:d3ce52d1-5119-63fb-5d9c-187b7a8e209d
msgctxt "h78930a30g618dg486agb8aeg9657586dc37b"
msgid "Maybe. No promises."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = d4eadca9-3349-9524-3c69-05be0fc6d334
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Wyll:d4eadca9-3349-9524-3c69-05be0fc6d334
msgctxt "hf433bb8dg2f8dg460fg873fgd7602cd1f344"
msgid "Now, let's rest. I wager tomorrow'll be a big day."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = ec144a7b-cdc2-6317-ec18-a95cb22122e0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_Night3_Event_SpokeNight3(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Wyll:ec144a7b-cdc2-6317-ec18-a95cb22122e0
msgctxt "hf4f18bdbg1e01g4aa0g9c5ag86cc7efc2780"
msgid ""
"This might sound presumptuous, but I hope we'll stay allies once we're cured."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = ef3dea5b-6293-612c-c6a4-bf5df4562335
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Wyll:ef3dea5b-6293-612c-c6a4-bf5df4562335
msgctxt "hf054d1c2gf67bg4cf8g87e6g3f3c8291525a"
msgid ""
"A shame. A warrior of your merits could cleanse the Coast of its monsters, "
"and still have time to hunt supper."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Wyll
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f207f380-2ccf-dcc8-a970-3adb04b906bf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Night3_CRD_Wyll:f207f380-2ccf-dcc8-a970-3adb04b906bf
msgctxt "hb16baad4g316cg4f95ga0aeg5be1668e606e"
msgid "No thanks. I'll be going my own way."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_OwlbearCub_CRD_1
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 03b39ab5-10d6-cee3-4e13-ec5472b6f897
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CAMP_OwlbearCub_Event_Fight = True
#.   Object:
#.     - TemporaryHostilityAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_OwlbearCub_CRD_1:03b39ab5-10d6-cee3-4e13-ec5472b6f897
msgctxt "h4d5aae2dg4dcbg4b61g9083geec3cedf7df0"
msgid "<i>Meet his charge.</i>"
msgstr "<i>녀석의 돌진을 받아낸다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_OwlbearCub_CRD_1
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 081c9950-ae48-8821-0781-e98572becc54
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - AVATAR(2) = False
#.      - REALLY_GALE(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_OwlbearCub_CRD_1:081c9950-ae48-8821-0781-e98572becc54
msgctxt "h8050f810g37abg4c18g9067g5ab5336758ae"
msgid "I stand corrected."
msgstr "내가 틀렸네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_OwlbearCub_CRD_1
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 084704a0-4a33-2146-57d4-b5f6ed6c56d4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_OwlbearCub_CRD_1:084704a0-4a33-2146-57d4-b5f6ed6c56d4
msgctxt "hdecdaa93g511fg47abg9482ge2b3493933b7"
msgid "<i>Eat the food.</i>"
msgstr "<i>음식을 먹는다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_OwlbearCub_CRD_1
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 0a784352-de68-4e3c-46c9-75f0d80516bf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CAMP_OwlbearCub_State_Friend = True
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_OwlbearCub_Event_Feed(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_OwlbearCub_CRD_1:0a784352-de68-4e3c-46c9-75f0d80516bf
msgctxt "h7ea913b6g3dceg4cecg8a81g6bb20c63e2a4"
msgid ""
"*The creature gulps the food down - it seems he hasn't eaten in some time.*"
msgstr "*이 동물은 게걸스럽게 음식을 먹어 치웁니다. 한동안 굶주린 것 같습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_OwlbearCub_CRD_1
#. Speaker = Owlbear Cub
#. NodeID = 0daf43cc-ac40-1bdf-2ade-d83df316e41e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_OwlbearCub_CRD_1:0daf43cc-ac40-1bdf-2ade-d83df316e41e
msgctxt "hbf7a1e13g4fcbg4788ga111ge5afea2f8bd7"
msgid "*SCREECH!*"
msgstr "*키이익!*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_OwlbearCub_CRD_1
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0e2ad6a8-257b-7676-2cf7-7050ef13b9bb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - AVATAR(2) = False
#.      - REALLY_GALE(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_OwlbearCub_CRD_1:0e2ad6a8-257b-7676-2cf7-7050ef13b9bb
msgctxt "h749bb58fg624cg4663g856fg279a7990da05"
msgid ""
"The hand that feeds is the hand that's loved. It'll never leave your side "
"now."
msgstr "음식을 주면 보답을 받는 법이지. 이제 네 곁을 떠나지 않을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_OwlbearCub_CRD_1
#. Speaker = Owlbear Cub
#. NodeID = 1124b7d0-b454-7de8-c80f-a0c6d3e7debe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_OwlbearCub_CRD_1:1124b7d0-b454-7de8-c80f-a0c6d3e7debe
msgctxt "h7eddac5dg5e0bg4a71ga88fgbb0ed683a658"
msgid "Food. Eat! BITE!"
msgstr "음식. 먹을래! 물거야!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_OwlbearCub_CRD_1
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 16df6c29-32e5-1b23-7950-d443d587b8b0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_OwlbearCub_CRD_1:16df6c29-32e5-1b23-7950-d443d587b8b0
msgctxt "h753f2e8agd00cg4906g8b84gb2a7fff32a83"
msgid "*Any food you had is gone. The owlbear will go hungry.*"
msgstr "*당신이 갖고 있던 음식이 다 사라졌습니다. 아울베어는 굶주릴 것입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_OwlbearCub_CRD_1
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 187a6000-0068-9721-7e1a-1ce0dbca92a7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CAMP_OwlbearCub_Event_Fight = True
#.   Object:
#.     - TemporaryHostilityAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_OwlbearCub_CRD_1:187a6000-0068-9721-7e1a-1ce0dbca92a7
msgctxt "heafcbf43g301bg41b7g8473g41ee055aa96a"
msgid "<i>Attack him.</i>"
msgstr "<i>공격한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_OwlbearCub_CRD_1
#. Speaker = Owlbear Cub
#. NodeID = 1bd0338c-3841-e37f-636f-b0eecf390ab9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_OwlbearCub_CRD_1:1bd0338c-3841-e37f-636f-b0eecf390ab9
msgctxt "h364d3db6g2ed5g43c5g9a0ag8b5f48e54aec"
msgid "*Hoo-hoot!*"
msgstr "*후-훗!*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_OwlbearCub_CRD_1
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 296b088d-8776-a44d-7913-a1106412982b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
