msgid ""
"*Though you seek repose, you needn't spend the night alone. With whom will "
"you share a bed?*"
msgstr "*쉬고 싶긴 하지만, 밤을 혼자 보낼 필요도 없습니다. 누구와 동침하겠습니까?*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_TieflingCelebration_CompanionChoice
