msgctxt "h7385bb4dga7b5g4d4egb14bg0190ac1f7881"
msgid "*You sleep alone, uplifted by memories of your recent triumphs.*"
msgstr "*당신은 승리에 대한 기억에 고취되어 혼자 잠에 듭니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 00803449-9329-3712-15ec-4b0619189380
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:00803449-9329-3712-15ec-4b0619189380
msgctxt "h064f3ea1gac6fg4d3dg825dg56b45ffb4106"
msgid ""
"My favourite in all of the Coast. All of Faerûn, even. Not even the Sea of "
"Stars could rival its magnificence -"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 0625309a-712d-a593-3cc4-a942a4f51c54
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CAMP_Wyll_Act3Romance_Event_Began = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:0625309a-712d-a593-3cc4-a942a4f51c54
msgctxt "hc84bf383ga31ag477fg9462gba0481c29e81"
msgid "It's funny."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 062b8d0b-d265-88d4-a43f-66dff455ebda
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:062b8d0b-d265-88d4-a43f-66dff455ebda
msgctxt "hfa8b5bd9gdab8g48b4g984eg5740a6845f9f"
msgid "It is. I swear, I've lived a thousand lives since I've known you."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 06f50e7e-c310-e961-a59d-dee7337ef7a3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:06f50e7e-c310-e961-a59d-dee7337ef7a3
msgctxt "h7c620d77g415cg4b2cga6eeg5fec5e88e61d"
msgid "How is this a question? The answer is Mizora. It's always been Mizora."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 070d9e3b-927e-cbd7-fdf8-cc2b29fe1c18
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:070d9e3b-927e-cbd7-fdf8-cc2b29fe1c18
msgctxt "h489b02e4gc0ccg4515g9467g512f44d8ab7a"
msgid "I deserve that. And I'm sorry."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 08e92600-792f-8e2c-cd2b-44af491fa64b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:08e92600-792f-8e2c-cd2b-44af491fa64b
msgctxt "hcbf0ef39g0bb0g40a8g8046ged4ba466f6f5"
msgid ""
"I've lived at the mercy of fiends - a devil's plaything trying to right the "
"Coast's wrong."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 08ff817f-c37d-d2c6-e549-e0f90fb863ce
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:08ff817f-c37d-d2c6-e549-e0f90fb863ce
msgctxt "hf4e11eb7gde7bg4e5egbabbgd7cfb5f8d8cc"
msgid ""
"It builds mountains and deserts, only to tear them asunder. It fells armies, "
"it conquers kings, queens - even gods."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 0a5752b3-b240-433a-fbcb-0fe61fa25974
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:0a5752b3-b240-433a-fbcb-0fe61fa25974
msgctxt "h9c3604b8g2cc9g4ca6g8db4gf0205dec021b"
msgid ""
"*Your stomach falls briefly as the acorn touches your hand. You shiver with "
"melancholy - and hope.*"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0b2511c7-6e3b-8bd7-59b0-8a8d80c0c61e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:0b2511c7-6e3b-8bd7-59b0-8a8d80c0c61e
msgctxt "h7f46a01cg926eg4a1cg9b70gea4c6bff147d"
msgid "<i>Ignore his favour.</i>"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 0b65f46a-0fb9-97ec-0772-e22329e5c393
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_ForgingOfTheHeart_State_KarlachSecondUpgrade = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:0b65f46a-0fb9-97ec-0772-e22329e5c393
msgctxt "h15d93b01gf0deg4dc8gaa44g112d98842306"
msgid "Sit with me. It's time we started our happily-ever-after."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 0cac78de-a377-5286-d87c-41d9f1ce8dd1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:0cac78de-a377-5286-d87c-41d9f1ce8dd1
msgctxt "h435d1cc5g27d2g42f5g902eg14dc7e14ace9"
msgid ""
"But time caught up with me. Father is dead. Baldur's Gate nears its ruin. My "
"one and only duty must be to the city."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 0dd8a649-b159-1937-1534-73cd41c7ed6d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:0dd8a649-b159-1937-1534-73cd41c7ed6d
msgctxt "h3bece503g27b9g4ee3g9a5fg6ffbcde0693f"
msgid "Understood. Your will is strong, and I would have it no other way."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 0ff4018a-f338-cbe3-fc22-c6ed770822a2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:0ff4018a-f338-cbe3-fc22-c6ed770822a2
msgctxt "hf619d934gabceg4974g8803g1b1d8103e785"
msgid ""
"We blink, and we're gone. And our hopes, our memories, our heart-bonds are "
"gone with us."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 1007dfdd-1161-05ca-99ae-021c16e2b6a9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:1007dfdd-1161-05ca-99ae-021c16e2b6a9
msgctxt "h26727227gb189g4f0bg905cg8ce47442a730"
msgid "I was thinking - how about one last dance. For old times' sake?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 10df6c3a-01bb-af8c-5bd0-7d34c80c7e1e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:10df6c3a-01bb-af8c-5bd0-7d34c80c7e1e
msgctxt "h4b427127g9ff9g449bg93degc93ad25af741"
msgid "And who I want at my side as it passes."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 13362b01-f59c-9e17-fa0d-f63d0e695ddf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART and SHADOWHEART_SHARPATH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:13362b01-f59c-9e17-fa0d-f63d0e695ddf
msgctxt "hd8fd287egad0bg49cagbe18g39d4eed78f26"
msgid ""
"Eternity will yield to Lady Shar's darkness, eventually. If you are content "
"to share me with her... I accept."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 13362b01-f59c-9e17-fa0d-f63d0e695ddf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART and SHADOWHEART_ENEMYOFSHARPATH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:13362b01-f59c-9e17-fa0d-f63d0e695ddf
msgctxt "heb3ccd4ag5f12g4ad9g8235g237df00ea3b4"
msgid ""
"Sometimes I feel like I never had a yesterday. But that doesn't mean I can't "
"have a tomorrow. Yes, I am yours."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 13362b01-f59c-9e17-fa0d-f63d0e695ddf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:13362b01-f59c-9e17-fa0d-f63d0e695ddf
msgctxt "h1ccf1dd8g261ag448bg8cf2gdb00da065845"
msgid "Yes, yes, yes!"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 163fdc58-e341-a227-c1d9-960552cb1fcd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:163fdc58-e341-a227-c1d9-960552cb1fcd
msgctxt "hb87d42eeg55d4g4917g8f18g2dfe504b5bdb"
msgid "For old times' sake."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 17d527ce-4893-c4f7-262b-f596eef6e7b6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:17d527ce-4893-c4f7-262b-f596eef6e7b6
msgctxt "h9242e8cdgc120g4191gab51gfd80fc9421f3"
msgid "A beautiful story. I'm glad you told it to me."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 198764d4-0bb7-69d1-158d-25402435a783
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:198764d4-0bb7-69d1-158d-25402435a783
msgctxt "h70311059g62d3g47a7g91d7gf7e1fa3b5d27"
msgid "I did. But also to see something else:"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 1ba43426-3e24-d250-ed14-9ef2db29bc33
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_ForgingOfTheHeart_State_KarlachSecondUpgrade = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:1ba43426-3e24-d250-ed14-9ef2db29bc33
msgctxt "h6456511ag38e1g407bg8af7gf4f52e4048a8"
msgid "Get down here, already. It's time we started our happily-ever-after!"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 1eda8ad2-b801-a025-9c6d-34e719340ece
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:1eda8ad2-b801-a025-9c6d-34e719340ece
msgctxt "h30a8dd4cg11a8g43c1g9790g3d4ca4a2def4"
msgid "But I've only now come to see who my true enemy's been."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 24e355ad-caea-f16a-71d2-215696da8c38
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:24e355ad-caea-f16a-71d2-215696da8c38
msgctxt "hfe172c5egecb3g401dgb6f0g2cb728368713"
msgid "I'm not sure I can see into forever. But it's still a nice view."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 25058813-adcb-bdd9-8ac2-556364474d1d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:25058813-adcb-bdd9-8ac2-556364474d1d
msgctxt "hf7ddb536g7366g4ff2gbb4cgffc08e628608"
msgid "Come, let me show you."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 2d722180-fc89-41e1-e605-cc444fb92303
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CAMP_MizorasPact_State_WyllEternalPact = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:2d722180-fc89-41e1-e605-cc444fb92303
msgctxt "h664909e9gbe14g40daga217g28b302ad04ef"
msgid ""
"Time is so gods-damned greedy. It can never give, only take. My eternal soul "
"is at its mercy."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 2ea4316f-2843-7ff0-b6ee-2482ef60192a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:2ea4316f-2843-7ff0-b6ee-2482ef60192a
msgctxt "h167cce36g70c8g4ce8g9361g974c6f902d04"
msgid "If just for a moment."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 2f4b84b9-12a0-4475-77b4-948c83878e0d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:2f4b84b9-12a0-4475-77b4-948c83878e0d
msgctxt "h565bc03ag2afcg4aaag908fgb84c5c6f118c"
msgid "Gods. You've made me the happiest soul in all the Realms."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 32b1fc25-025b-4ece-b877-72860c87ad09
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:32b1fc25-025b-4ece-b877-72860c87ad09
msgctxt "hc4219f5fg767fg46d4g93a0g8ce49b1284a8"
msgid "The poignant tedium of your story?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 33ce819d-204c-4c78-2ea8-66bb49393aaa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:33ce819d-204c-4c78-2ea8-66bb49393aaa
msgctxt "h03e77991g7cacg4fe9ga953g3fea960474f2"
msgid "Maybe. But I think the right answer is much simpler than that:"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 357d36fd-3a2e-2739-2049-d905b5bd73b1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:357d36fd-3a2e-2739-2049-d905b5bd73b1
msgctxt "h463a9873gda1eg468bg8498g89536cab5900"
msgid "For now, let's enjoy this piece of eternity."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 35887d26-7ee6-01c5-ccf2-8df1abc8096c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:35887d26-7ee6-01c5-ccf2-8df1abc8096c
msgctxt "h95924cfagf044g42fbgafd8g4f7b4fbab4c4"
msgid "A toll of the bell - it's all I ask. Our problems can wait that long."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 3b6f06de-58e2-4ea1-cb25-29190c60578c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:3b6f06de-58e2-4ea1-cb25-29190c60578c
msgctxt "h769b7a52g6e7fg48aag8786g8117bcf99b3f"
msgid "I was hoping you'd think so."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3c9a9038-0357-b654-5393-ab73a6c8f45c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_ForgingOfTheHeart_State_KarlachSecondUpgrade = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:3c9a9038-0357-b654-5393-ab73a6c8f45c
msgctxt "h0b149cebg155dg4836gb052g220b4978f9fb"
msgid "Go on - I'll follow."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 3d46e4de-bea1-bb16-8f8c-91288b527891
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:3d46e4de-bea1-bb16-8f8c-91288b527891
msgctxt "h2596112bge9e8g4d17g8147g66865e5c5a97"
msgid "I understand, truly. All I need is you. The rest is just details."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3fddc0ea-8138-c897-a849-04a36d7ba29e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - WYLL_DEVIL(1) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART and SHADOWHEART_SHARPATH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:3fddc0ea-8138-c897-a849-04a36d7ba29e
msgctxt "ha84214c9g82edg4174gb560ge880817777e4"
msgid ""
"Lady Shar will appreciate the wickedness, at least. Let's see the snake this "
"devil's been hiding."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3fddc0ea-8138-c897-a849-04a36d7ba29e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - WYLL_DEVIL(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:3fddc0ea-8138-c897-a849-04a36d7ba29e
msgctxt "hc9a56939ga862g428dga4beg4e52c09790c5"
msgid "Shit, yes. Let's see the snake this devil's been hiding."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 40debc7c-b299-a45a-89ed-e1050975b983
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:40debc7c-b299-a45a-89ed-e1050975b983
msgctxt "h8237e723gbc30g4c9ag84d8g99792148ab36"
msgid "Time."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 41ec6b8e-33ca-55cc-bb98-14444334bef9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:41ec6b8e-33ca-55cc-bb98-14444334bef9
msgctxt "h40099cefg5a24g489ag8472g265529acf301"
msgid "Not yet, Wyll. Not 'til all this trouble is behind us."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 42b69315-43f6-8cd8-fc5c-276f7afaf996
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:42b69315-43f6-8cd8-fc5c-276f7afaf996
msgctxt "h286ed1f1g7d29g4606gaa39ga2244d31c349"
msgid ""
"It even comes for your people in the astral sea. Time may hunt slowly - but "
"it still hunts."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4425b021-6b67-05bb-8d05-712b32993ee0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 20
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 1fd1c4b6-8331-5774-d37f-d5601908c4ca_persuasion = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 1fd1c4b6-8331-5774-d37f-d5601908c4ca_persuasion = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART and SHADOWHEART_SHARPATH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:4425b021-6b67-05bb-8d05-712b32993ee0
msgctxt "hed9a61bdg5ae7g4819gbd39ged93099d765a"
msgid ""
"I cannot promise you eternity - I belong to Lady Shar. But even she will not "
"begrudge me tonight, if you wish..."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4425b021-6b67-05bb-8d05-712b32993ee0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 20
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 1fd1c4b6-8331-5774-d37f-d5601908c4ca_persuasion = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 1fd1c4b6-8331-5774-d37f-d5601908c4ca_persuasion = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:4425b021-6b67-05bb-8d05-712b32993ee0
msgctxt "h8fdb1480gec17g4624g8460g215164b9c7e3"
msgid "I can't give you forever, Wyll. But I can give you tonight."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 45b450db-2631-1ab5-d3c0-ae7eed9f697f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_ForgingOfTheHeart_State_KarlachSecondUpgrade = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:45b450db-2631-1ab5-d3c0-ae7eed9f697f
msgctxt "h296a8b34gf07dg4da3gb215g5738e07fc008"
msgid ""
"I can't take your hand without hurting you, but I'll follow where you lead."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 45ccc586-b5a0-4723-f740-4d23b26b9f23
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:45ccc586-b5a0-4723-f740-4d23b26b9f23
msgctxt "hd441145cg20e1g4966g96ffg3354146d043f"
msgid "<i>Smile and take Wyll's hand.</i>"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 476b8c4e-04b2-f03d-f6b6-bb3f4ba12137
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:476b8c4e-04b2-f03d-f6b6-bb3f4ba12137
msgctxt "ha73f5f6eg283ag4f87gbe92gecadf361b610"
msgid ""
"The dragon lords sparking the skies above it. The moon elves first plucking "
"the strings of the Weave."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 479e1974-1c5d-26cb-892c-8a410360f218
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:479e1974-1c5d-26cb-892c-8a410360f218
msgctxt "h96404c86gb2f0g4a06gbc83g5d72aec080e1"
msgid ""
"I'll leave you to your thoughts. I hope somewhere in them, you find peace."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 47a2babf-01bf-279d-416b-5243bffb4f2d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:47a2babf-01bf-279d-416b-5243bffb4f2d
msgctxt "ha830efd4gdc80g45f6ga2d7g9f07c856826b"
msgid "I'd like to think not. The answer is much simpler than that:"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 49adf892-6ee6-de42-71f2-3e7f4068e6d2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:49adf892-6ee6-de42-71f2-3e7f4068e6d2
msgctxt "h38170758gb17eg433dgbaf6g31cde7f03e6b"
msgid "All this time, and that's still what you see?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 4eb6ef12-54f9-a1b0-e26b-e2e7cc1ec4d0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:4eb6ef12-54f9-a1b0-e26b-e2e7cc1ec4d0
msgctxt "h97fc948cg2765g4d82g9098gf3a295961ad3"
msgid ""
"But - I can't resist you. I'd sooner know one unforgettable night than a "
"lifetime of 'what ifs'."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 51d4bb77-c525-1d32-0637-19a8a9916957
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:51d4bb77-c525-1d32-0637-19a8a9916957
msgctxt "hd02ea31fg2e79g4882ga120ga05ce0a55bf6"
msgid ""
"I used to come here and climb it when father's eye was turned elsewhere - "
"daydream of the stories it might tell, if I listened close enough."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5d34112d-b12f-b320-a63b-0ecd2f3d0ad6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:5d34112d-b12f-b320-a63b-0ecd2f3d0ad6
msgctxt "hbbed36d3g480eg4b1fga3a7gbd8c227ea276"
msgid "You mean so much to me. I can feel my heart bleeding."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 5d6334c7-4438-71fe-97b7-42882f7af96f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:5d6334c7-4438-71fe-97b7-42882f7af96f
msgctxt "ha935e31cg68f7g47edgaf4dgdaa22ac18b3d"
msgid "Time is so gods-damned greedy. It can never give, only take."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 60065d37-8484-2a5d-4383-a87b2337f442
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:60065d37-8484-2a5d-4383-a87b2337f442
msgctxt "hfe646a63g7588g4a9dg96bag245eed005b22"
msgid "So you'd think. But the right answer is much simpler than that:"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 658762a5-c63f-dd55-1f40-18208c684d70
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:658762a5-c63f-dd55-1f40-18208c684d70
msgctxt "hf5e0d000g5335g4a1bgadcbg473349e82a40"
msgid "Pull me too close, and I'm destined to hurt you."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 68fad44c-adcb-6f21-8488-f6e590b5772f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:68fad44c-adcb-6f21-8488-f6e590b5772f
msgctxt "h34dc7554gf15cg41f6g9569gd3d4d31fcf9a"
msgid ""
"I love you. Will you be mine - today, and tomorrow, and reaching into "
"eternity?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 6f672daa-56b1-4b24-b03e-8fc82449ac8f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - ORI_State_WasPartneredWithWyll(1) = True
#.     - ORI_State_PartneredWithWyll(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:6f672daa-56b1-4b24-b03e-8fc82449ac8f
msgctxt "h7895c492gd54eg4a3eg946cg79c263c4aa31"
msgid ""
"May you be granted every wish you ask for. You deserve each and every one."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 705ce8c6-f694-1af5-7a45-939055bf9ebf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:705ce8c6-f694-1af5-7a45-939055bf9ebf
msgctxt "h69ceb7ceg4ddfg4f81g9a90g289dc7da0b9f"
msgid "Get down here, already. It's time we started our happily-ever-after!"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 70b9929a-10c9-f531-d2ee-b8d36b8f6c82
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART and SHADOWHEART_SHARPATH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:70b9929a-10c9-f531-d2ee-b8d36b8f6c82
msgctxt "h67f8e741gff95g414bg8169g812b8e72a4d6"
msgid ""
"I'm not sure I can promise eternity - Lady Shar demands fealty... this is a "
"lot to take in."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 70b9929a-10c9-f531-d2ee-b8d36b8f6c82
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART and SHADOWHEART_ENEMYOFSHARPATH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:70b9929a-10c9-f531-d2ee-b8d36b8f6c82
msgctxt "h4dbae302g3fe2g4435g92f9gb497ec8dce6c"
msgid ""
"I'm not sure I can promise you that much. After Shar, I need to live my own "
"life. This is a lot to take in..."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 70b9929a-10c9-f531-d2ee-b8d36b8f6c82
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:70b9929a-10c9-f531-d2ee-b8d36b8f6c82
msgctxt "h19975bf7g10f5g416fg99d8g6a33adce2456"
msgid "I'm not sure. It's a lot to take in."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 732b8bf0-d810-9989-263d-82f0299ed715
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:732b8bf0-d810-9989-263d-82f0299ed715
msgctxt "h7f1fe719gdf74g40e9g9781g927c445d3f9e"
msgid "Standing here, I feel like I can see into forever."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 757a6299-3153-b768-b915-8257a570f4d4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:757a6299-3153-b768-b915-8257a570f4d4
msgctxt "h14ce3495gb70dg459fgb260g7487e76b6c05"
msgid ""
"My mother always said the Wilden Oak's acorns held just a touch of wishing "
"magic."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 79d20807-a59c-af96-5440-aff869590e30
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_ForgingOfTheHeart_State_KarlachSecondUpgrade = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:79d20807-a59c-af96-5440-aff869590e30
msgctxt "h024a7d0dgb0f7g4f86g9fc0gc45937e05180"
msgid "<i>Smile and take Wyll's hand.</i>"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 80b31dde-44fa-03f4-3f31-3f11de0c6ac4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:80b31dde-44fa-03f4-3f31-3f11de0c6ac4
msgctxt "h40b89784gd5e7g4e65ga8e8g45c4b8887f69"
msgid ""
"You break up with me and then ask to dance? That's some godsdamned nerve."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 815936af-e0cf-cb46-e541-8a68a67ebd7f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:815936af-e0cf-cb46-e541-8a68a67ebd7f
msgctxt "h165a8676g7a51g4894gb6c8gb9750b8f90b0"
msgid "The Wilden Oak. Legend has it it's stood since the Age of Dawn."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 825c6769-f8be-bec7-56c2-7220fea78d3e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 20
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 1fd1c4b6-8331-5774-d37f-d5601908c4ca_persuasion = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 1fd1c4b6-8331-5774-d37f-d5601908c4ca_persuasion = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:825c6769-f8be-bec7-56c2-7220fea78d3e
msgctxt "h1fb76f61gc6ebg4b08g8ed4g23950f6c4c64"
msgid "I don't want a commitment. But I'd welcome a good roll in the hay."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 846eba1a-d9e4-354b-b0bb-6f2c24bc50ed
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:846eba1a-d9e4-354b-b0bb-6f2c24bc50ed
msgctxt "h899b3589gb9a2g45b1gb8afg18f7d279515d"
msgid "The elder brain?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 848147d3-d1ed-a646-1f6d-3e93f74acca1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:848147d3-d1ed-a646-1f6d-3e93f74acca1
msgctxt "heba5df51g4758g466agb03bgcb123a44458e"
msgid "We've got big problems to solve, Wyll. Maybe later."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 87f8baf9-a049-29a1-4d85-acd497f3891a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:87f8baf9-a049-29a1-4d85-acd497f3891a
msgctxt "h293d02cbge156g4b3dg8799gf698c52f6366"
msgid "Lucky for us, I've found a way to stop it -"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 88d59da9-1e77-fc76-3c94-d9525556810c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:88d59da9-1e77-fc76-3c94-d9525556810c
msgctxt "h66649938g7348g41d6g8f5dg17722048df8a"
msgid "But do me one favour:"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8c19d4ee-db2c-fdb5-a69e-222a56780b55
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:8c19d4ee-db2c-fdb5-a69e-222a56780b55
msgctxt "h9b59c9acgdd0eg46c5g9292g8a4228047244"
msgid "Seriously? You dragged me out here to look at a <i>tree?</i>"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 8e31e9d7-7e6d-af6a-5988-1ef38850be5d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:8e31e9d7-7e6d-af6a-5988-1ef38850be5d
msgctxt "h018a4ea8g5b95g40f1gbb0cgd09461e38e6b"
msgid ""
"I used to come here and climb it when father's eye was turned elsewhere - "
"daydream of the stories it might tell, if I listened close enough."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 8fb1d7c8-cf23-4d7c-4e57-9b1b2944cd91
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:8fb1d7c8-cf23-4d7c-4e57-9b1b2944cd91
msgctxt "hef79c754ga564g4b09gaab0g4df4e49fa4bc"
msgid ""
"Not so long ago, I was dreaming of our own personal forever, endless nights "
"in each other's arms."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 8fc9c45e-9b4d-5790-0776-f726873fd71f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:8fc9c45e-9b4d-5790-0776-f726873fd71f
msgctxt "heccbdd90g8f15g4ccag812ege247e396771d"
msgid "Me too."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 90b25497-a0d4-e8f2-e7c5-61f473a89a67
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:90b25497-a0d4-e8f2-e7c5-61f473a89a67
msgctxt "hb4369f64gf0e9g4631gb2f6gef50dc568910"
msgid "Sorry, but a 'no' will have to do."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 930f4437-b14d-b7a9-9d8a-e824b376a96e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:930f4437-b14d-b7a9-9d8a-e824b376a96e
msgctxt "hf6cfb8c6g30cdg4243gbb4cgb44bfa78084b"
msgid "Maybe I can staunch it. Just - for a moment."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 94df8543-c50d-9e06-b58b-857f7e25444f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:94df8543-c50d-9e06-b58b-857f7e25444f
msgctxt "h3156f32cgba3bg4306g84cegdf4be260fdfc"
msgid "The archdevil Zariel?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 95606a64-a1ae-3375-e34b-e764443262d7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - ORI_State_WasPartneredWithWyll(1) = True
#.     - ORI_State_PartneredWithWyll(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:95606a64-a1ae-3375-e34b-e764443262d7
msgctxt "hf5a7a0d4g0a07g4281g848dg05292421a6aa"
msgid ""
"Ours is such a beautiful story, and this isn't the ending I wanted to write."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 992d2d8c-59b2-28c3-bc04-5730f77b8517
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:992d2d8c-59b2-28c3-bc04-5730f77b8517
msgctxt "h17d2582agc840g401dgb916g40a0da830c1d"
msgid "<i>Join Wyll in the grass. Give yourself to him completely.</i>"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9a9b1e30-c56c-a269-17f6-b1040927e111
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:9a9b1e30-c56c-a269-17f6-b1040927e111
msgctxt "hbd04d8d7g66e1g420bg92ddg0601f96e827b"
msgid "You, yourself?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 9acfe943-bb0e-7e13-1230-320e2f16b533
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:9acfe943-bb0e-7e13-1230-320e2f16b533
msgctxt "hbcee7d8aga8bfg45fcga07agcc61fd3cf2b8"
msgid "At least - take this."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 9b04f680-6c86-84eb-a778-9eb8132288e8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:9b04f680-6c86-84eb-a778-9eb8132288e8
msgctxt "h8e0acd19g3d72g4235gb810gb284f8fdfb5d"
msgid ""
"And none of it shall go to waste, you have my solemn promise. But - truth be "
"told, it's not just Baldur's Gate I'm protecting."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9b8e64ee-63c2-0d19-9e67-2b3d6a3152d7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:9b8e64ee-63c2-0d19-9e67-2b3d6a3152d7
msgctxt "hd74ed504gd14bg4932g9375g4fdab587f9a7"
msgid "<i>Dance. Remember your precious moment with Wyll.</i>"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 9c8c14ac-1538-28a5-f48f-b0fae5800bd0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:9c8c14ac-1538-28a5-f48f-b0fae5800bd0
msgctxt "hdb0ef737gca1ag4e8dg86bbg3499b3021f82"
msgid "If that be so, then may my greatest wish come true tonight:"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = a0f13866-355e-8b2f-e7a0-041b860b0594
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:a0f13866-355e-8b2f-e7a0-041b860b0594
msgctxt "h11c586efg5fdbg4ef4g9834g726821a4bfd3"
msgid ""
"I've been thinking a lot about forever. Moreso, I've been thinking "
"everything that comes before -"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = a3a3c6df-06f5-418b-a2d9-975d500d20cc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CAMP_MizorasPact_State_WyllEternalPact = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:a3a3c6df-06f5-418b-a2d9-975d500d20cc
msgctxt "ha3fe64ccge858g4c37gb948g91c3f3fa47b2"
msgid ""
"I live at the mercy of fiends. A devil's plaything awaiting a future in the "
"Hells."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = a76f3b22-3bec-d64d-68bb-633b96c6d1fc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:a76f3b22-3bec-d64d-68bb-633b96c6d1fc
msgctxt "h941fd100gcbefg492cgbe16g8a0f54ee74f8"
msgid "The Wilden Oak. Legend has it it's stood since the Age of Dawn."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a9827f73-4db1-9d57-0bfb-5350b37345ad
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_ForgingOfTheHeart_State_KarlachSecondUpgrade = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:a9827f73-4db1-9d57-0bfb-5350b37345ad
msgctxt "h3010e129g5ba5g4535gb10cgbdf141aaaea5"
msgid "All right. But this better be worth it."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ad119523-1f4b-7fa9-6788-07fc4f29c2e2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:ad119523-1f4b-7fa9-6788-07fc4f29c2e2
msgctxt "hd0a4d571g0a5fg4b17g85b1ge54e4123de07"
msgid "I understand. The city needs you, and I'd only be getting in the way."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b03433bf-33e9-ba31-9f76-6378a8e9f3a3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:b03433bf-33e9-ba31-9f76-6378a8e9f3a3
msgctxt "hf3ddee23g574cg4673g85edg02f6c38a15c7"
msgid "<i>Enjoy the view. Enjoy Wyll's quiet company.</i>"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b2e720fd-f563-f24c-bbbb-92761c0480a5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:b2e720fd-f563-f24c-bbbb-92761c0480a5
msgctxt "hf6bad1acg2f1eg4decg8992gcd9e477877ef"
msgid "So this is a break-up? I should've known, after all I've given you."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = b38a8d00-3b8c-8594-4298-20945d24f3f9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CAMP_MizorasPact_State_WyllEternalPact = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - WYLL_DEVIL(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:b38a8d00-3b8c-8594-4298-20945d24f3f9
msgctxt "h047a5620gb4e7g447dg88c8ge00f6cb374dd"
msgid ""
"I live at the mercy of fiends. A man with the horrid face of a devil, "
"awaiting his future in Hells' blistered army."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b4717423-681f-11e5-31ad-07f5bcb98786
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 20
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_ForgingOfTheHeart_State_KarlachSecondUpgrade = True
#.   Local:
#.      - 1fd1c4b6-8331-5774-d37f-d5601908c4ca_persuasion = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 1fd1c4b6-8331-5774-d37f-d5601908c4ca_persuasion = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:b4717423-681f-11e5-31ad-07f5bcb98786
msgctxt "hec4f4b1ag3df9g450eg8b4egbcf71806639d"
msgid "I don't want a commitment. But I'd welcome a good roll in the hay."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = b8992ab3-fc4e-e768-ef3b-7007d8d44c39
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:b8992ab3-fc4e-e768-ef3b-7007d8d44c39
msgctxt "hc30de18cga197g48cdgb49bg172fb41aa0f6"
msgid ""
"*Your skin flushes and your soul sings as you palm the acorn. Wishing magic, "
"affection, love - whatever the cause, it's as real as the ground beneath "
"you.*"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = bf35cac3-0895-e348-dc8e-83bc597c6107
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:bf35cac3-0895-e348-dc8e-83bc597c6107
msgctxt "hd39a38f1g9441g4bb7ga8f2g703361683b72"
msgid ""
"One monster slain, then. And another after that, and then another. There "
"will always be one more evil to fell."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = c815e806-c6f1-a3be-fea2-037ad6075c26
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:c815e806-c6f1-a3be-fea2-037ad6075c26
msgctxt "hc6da9151g24fag4696ga7fbg629785d11e0f"
msgid "I - I understand. All the more fool am I for pressing my fortunes."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ca59dab3-df58-fd5b-6cfd-3ec524979e19
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - WYLL_DEVIL(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:ca59dab3-df58-fd5b-6cfd-3ec524979e19
msgctxt "hb96f7f0ag40feg4e83g9d5fgf175115fb437"
msgid "It's about time. Let's see what the Blade can do with his weapon."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cf339cc0-7d69-c8a3-b9d2-4506b61a184c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:cf339cc0-7d69-c8a3-b9d2-4506b61a184c
msgctxt "h1deab9a8gfc5cg4116g8b8dgd40e228c685a"
msgid "Oh gods, no. You've got the wrong idea about all this."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d076040b-f74b-5fb0-b536-9bb755bea369
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART and SHADOWHEART_SHARPATH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:d076040b-f74b-5fb0-b536-9bb755bea369
msgctxt "h56be63aag4432g4c5fg87d3g445d2027f807"
msgid ""
"<i>Lady Shar may not approve of such a commitment... but you can make it up "
"to her, surely. Take the acorn.</i>"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d076040b-f74b-5fb0-b536-9bb755bea369
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:d076040b-f74b-5fb0-b536-9bb755bea369
msgctxt "he3b4a659gf647g468cg89aegd27da171ff15"
msgid "<i>Take the acorn and nod.</i>"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = d15df7b5-7f14-e134-2c74-6ea27d53633e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:d15df7b5-7f14-e134-2c74-6ea27d53633e
msgctxt "h3554ac63gb66ag49cbgadabg670c8d3cf8fa"
msgid ""
"As the Blade, I've faced untold brutes and beasts. Together we've seen "
"illithid horrors most souls could merely fathom."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = d45abb78-71ee-f1e8-7f2a-5bf003b22d63
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:d45abb78-71ee-f1e8-7f2a-5bf003b22d63
msgctxt "hae62a2a2g8122g43d3g817dge2c881495037"
msgid "Nor could it rival yours."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = d79bf056-47ae-3bc8-da02-cb202e5755f7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:d79bf056-47ae-3bc8-da02-cb202e5755f7
msgctxt "h5ad55b7bg5711g4d66g8063g20a035f092b2"
msgid "Standing here, I feel like I can see into forever."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = d7d06c3e-e9f2-a2aa-84d6-55884f67804c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Ravengard_State_Defeated = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - ORI_State_WasPartneredWithWyll(1) = True
#.     - ORI_State_HandledBreakupWithWyll(1) = True
#.     - ORI_State_PartneredWithWyll(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:d7d06c3e-e9f2-a2aa-84d6-55884f67804c
msgctxt "hd658b905ge79cg4d84gba69gd3a6c3235ed8"
msgid ""
"Time is so godsdamned greedy. It races forward no matter how hard we rail "
"against it."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = d9510d79-7251-5f77-8894-3c74776d93e7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:d9510d79-7251-5f77-8894-3c74776d93e7
msgctxt "h2b5bcb9bgddf3g4588g8a4cgd4abc79fed90"
msgid ""
"My father taught me more lessons than I can count. But perhaps the greatest "
"one is this: a champion's heart's as sharp as a new blade."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = db5653f8-ab99-5f96-e1a1-0550c9f4be6a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:db5653f8-ab99-5f96-e1a1-0550c9f4be6a
msgctxt "h05d11ad2ga7d5g4b1eg824cg772bb09e7a07"
msgid "<i>Me.</i>"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = dc92fe09-6fec-7187-cccd-c677fcfa7cd9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - ORI_State_WasPartneredWithWyll(1) = True
#.     - ORI_State_PartneredWithWyll(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:dc92fe09-6fec-7187-cccd-c677fcfa7cd9
msgctxt "hecb37374g6359g458dg888dg99589ea74da6"
msgid "Dance. And when you do, think of me."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = dd1e61f3-79f9-f6fb-b3ea-b9d3fff5d405
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:dd1e61f3-79f9-f6fb-b3ea-b9d3fff5d405
msgctxt "h79799e4bg14efg43cdg974fg9125bd441e5d"
msgid "Forever could only be a dream."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = e4b5f8f7-dd28-521d-e622-f8ed0cee8e77
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:e4b5f8f7-dd28-521d-e622-f8ed0cee8e77
msgctxt "h8cd26baage5fdg411fg8b0dgdbcaee6b10ce"
msgid "Gods, I want you. But I can't take your body without taking your heart."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e50def53-1581-4d66-a242-91b6039c6cbe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:e50def53-1581-4d66-a242-91b6039c6cbe
msgctxt "h153858c8g7ecfg44ffg8832g891633d248cc"
msgid "Friends, then. I'd like that."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = e566313c-055b-e430-af1c-7758fb8fad7e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:e566313c-055b-e430-af1c-7758fb8fad7e
msgctxt "h0235b7e0gfeb2g40e0gb9c4g19e2a36fd77e"
msgid "It is. I promise."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = e617eb2e-91ee-3c38-f87a-af95d7b174e9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:e617eb2e-91ee-3c38-f87a-af95d7b174e9
msgctxt "hdd2c1d0bg7c32g4d1ega183g4ec6213723dd"
msgid "Quite the opposite. I'd be getting in yours."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e697489a-e41d-ceec-42c7-f576947baa4d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:e697489a-e41d-ceec-42c7-f576947baa4d
msgctxt "hf5e690d3g15fbg4928g96acgf10a4ff78242"
msgid "All right. But this better be worth it."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = eb6974e0-2ae3-1401-c6a4-80b9de3c1e12
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:eb6974e0-2ae3-1401-c6a4-80b9de3c1e12
msgctxt "h7e065ee9g9863g48e7gb8b3g205a7bb83032"
msgid "We can still have it, Wyll. We can defeat the Brain and be together."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = f06795b5-0f84-8109-2034-959a6b21c40d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:f06795b5-0f84-8109-2034-959a6b21c40d
msgctxt "hddfdcc2bg168dg4359gabbbg73ef7708f6d6"
msgid "Lucky for us, I've found a way to stop time -"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f1e72927-92f3-3865-9ded-1bea992716cf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - WYLL_DEVIL(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:f1e72927-92f3-3865-9ded-1bea992716cf
msgctxt "haefa76d2g1eceg42ccg9394g3ec4871ca1ee"
msgid "Gods, no. Have you looked at yourself? You're hideous."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = f2839b66-ba79-fd28-42b3-6021d1678596
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:f2839b66-ba79-fd28-42b3-6021d1678596
msgctxt "h044b4138g77b9g459dgb58bg0c3c48a18b6e"
msgid ""
"The dragon lords sparking the skies above it. The moon elves first plucking "
"the strings of the Weave."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f2d4034d-5650-ee2a-7c39-d16bbc7db2ce
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:f2d4034d-5650-ee2a-7c39-d16bbc7db2ce
msgctxt "h6e97245cg2db3g4d2eg90b4g069cf8c59d04"
msgid "I can't. I'm sorry, Wyll."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f3dc5cfe-ddd3-21d1-e83a-f1af428ffc1b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:f3dc5cfe-ddd3-21d1-e83a-f1af428ffc1b
msgctxt "h9b567b5ag19aeg47b2gbc9fga7ab5b8d6ac1"
msgid "I couldn't have said it better. Let's go."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f5383be6-5667-a477-ab15-730f2e11ddbf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:f5383be6-5667-a477-ab15-730f2e11ddbf
msgctxt "h256df9ecgbd72g4569g935dgb1e1dfb8aeaa"
msgid "<i>Leave without a word.</i>"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f6f3fb6b-f79a-5872-61bc-50d9a2c1217b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:f6f3fb6b-f79a-5872-61bc-50d9a2c1217b
msgctxt "hfa35c4bdg7e11g4fc1g842cg0594899585c5"
msgid "<i>Walk away without a word.</i>"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = f757a27a-1195-a526-0264-a9f8a0e7cf23
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:f757a27a-1195-a526-0264-a9f8a0e7cf23
msgctxt "h94ff721fg7285g40e8gb6f4g5ca4ac041926"
msgid "But I'm ready to live a thousand more, if you can bear me."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = fa43f1e2-7ebe-cac2-5e3f-bb649ab4600a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:fa43f1e2-7ebe-cac2-5e3f-bb649ab4600a
msgctxt "h81885ccag2fc3g4afeg9b17gb8b4cbd69a56"
msgid "One last dance, for old times' sake."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fb097325-d5b9-1655-7156-fbdb0ea87ebb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART and SHADOWHEART_SHARPATH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:fb097325-d5b9-1655-7156-fbdb0ea87ebb
msgctxt "h83364771g7bcdg40c5gab52gd0503e11db96"
msgid ""
"I am Lady Shar's - she will always come first. But if you are content to "
"share me with her... I accept."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fb097325-d5b9-1655-7156-fbdb0ea87ebb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART and SHADOWHEART_ENEMYOFSHARPATH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:fb097325-d5b9-1655-7156-fbdb0ea87ebb
msgctxt "he371d56bgd63dg450aga317g66f15506b22e"
msgid ""
"<i>Bear you? </i>My life didn't start until we met. Of course I want to be "
"with you."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fb097325-d5b9-1655-7156-fbdb0ea87ebb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_Act3Romance_ROM:fb097325-d5b9-1655-7156-fbdb0ea87ebb
msgctxt "hf7725320g0415g4cb9g95bbg097471d25a90"
msgid "Yes. I want to be with you, for as long as you'll have me."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_PostRecruitment
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 1ce62725-c757-fe8a-d89a-62e3d414046c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_PostRecruitment:1ce62725-c757-fe8a-d89a-62e3d414046c
msgctxt "hb01285fcg8c25g4188g8f72g8c2ef7fb1e58"
msgid "Let's get some rest. Dawn comes sooner than we think."
msgstr "좀 쉬어 두자고. 날은 생각보다 빨리 밝아오니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_PostRecruitment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1d0a7428-ac7f-3e8e-4b44-d390aff0ed74
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Hag_State_FailedTadpole = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_PostRecruitment:1d0a7428-ac7f-3e8e-4b44-d390aff0ed74
msgctxt "h93504040gd135g48eagb41fg59f6e6598d30"
msgid "I have reason to believe the parasite is touched by Netherese magic."
msgstr "난 기생충이 네더릴 마법의 영향을 받았다고 생각해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_PostRecruitment
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 1f1ed71a-925c-3329-12e9-ad530d1c14f9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_PostRecruitment:1f1ed71a-925c-3329-12e9-ad530d1c14f9
msgctxt "hf9aeffb4g74c5g4a97gb179gb8f20b9fa8fb"
msgid ""
"Heh. I speak out of curiosity, not wishful thinking. At least I'll know to "
"skip supper if you're doing the cooking."
msgstr "헤. 희망사항을 말한 게 아니라, 호기심에서 해 본 말이야. 네가 요리를 맡겠다면 적어도 저녁은 거를 수 있겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_PostRecruitment
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 261daff4-5d8f-e2f7-3843-3a1db80a24c0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_PostRecruitment:261daff4-5d8f-e2f7-3843-3a1db80a24c0
msgctxt "hbd338af0g800dg4ad2gbeadg7c8ac34d0fc9"
msgid "Courage in danger's shadow. I love to see it."
msgstr "위험의 그림자 속에서의 용기라. 보기 좋은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_PostRecruitment
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 4a902ba2-6733-b29d-ae6c-d438a55a6710
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_PostRecruitment:4a902ba2-6733-b29d-ae6c-d438a55a6710
msgctxt "ha4a59580g7a0bg4d62ga34bg4fb237278782"
msgid "How do you feel?"
msgstr "기분이 어때?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_PostRecruitment
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 51d83baf-4a3c-8958-765a-69e32e935845
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_PostRecruitment:51d83baf-4a3c-8958-765a-69e32e935845
msgctxt "h10b08170gd428g477agb4f0g8c67dea51d22"
msgid ""
"Before the illithids' unscheduled surgery, I'd felled hundreds of beasts and "
"a fair few fiends."
msgstr "예정에도 없던 일리시드 수술을 받기 전에, 나는 수백 마리의 야수와 꽤 많은 마족을 처치했어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_PostRecruitment
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 54c7c5e1-ea9f-8854-726c-3780f628382a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_PostRecruitment:54c7c5e1-ea9f-8854-726c-3780f628382a
msgctxt "h609b18f9g62edg4f9cgb707ge15adfe5c693"
msgid ""
"We could conjecture all night. I suppose the 'why' doesn't matter so much as "
"the 'what next'."
msgstr "추측이야 밤새도록 할 수 있지. 어쨌든 '이유'를 캐묻기보다 '다음 계획'을 따져 보는 게 더 중요하다고 생각해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_PostRecruitment
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 592b9425-7486-a230-d1c9-bdf33832bec3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_PostRecruitment:592b9425-7486-a230-d1c9-bdf33832bec3
msgctxt "h93f0ef6dge17dg499bgb56dgf6f8ad197c6c"
msgid "Healthy. And troubled by that fact."
msgstr "건강해. 그래서 문제야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_PostRecruitment
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 599200fa-cd85-6c1b-9a32-63f84593aa22
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_PostRecruitment:599200fa-cd85-6c1b-9a32-63f84593aa22
msgctxt "h5c0bcf70gac0fg4c25gbd42gb26973ec70e9"
msgid ""
"Ah, there it is - that shiver. Our little brain-worms have made fast "
"friends, it would seem."
msgstr "아, 또 찾아오셨군. 그 떨림이. 작은 뇌벌레들이 우릴 순식간에 친구로 만들어주는 모양이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_PostRecruitment
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 5a5b555b-c79d-1aca-b8cd-37d0e49e17ce
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_PostRecruitment:5a5b555b-c79d-1aca-b8cd-37d0e49e17ce
msgctxt "hbc1e7d12g5f71g4836gb536g7a686aca12be"
msgid "'Surprising' is just the word, isn't it?"
msgstr "'놀랍다'는 표현이 딱 어울리긴 하지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_PostRecruitment
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 5fd51d2a-71c4-ddb7-95ea-43c10f884893
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_PostRecruitment:5fd51d2a-71c4-ddb7-95ea-43c10f884893
msgctxt "h968cbabcgac3ag4218g9b46gaf90854f3daf"
msgid ""
"Indeed. Perhaps the worms' vat was poisoned. Perhaps we're uncommonly fit."
msgstr "과연. 어쩌면 벌레 배양통에 누군가 독을 풀었는지도 모르지. 아니면 단지 우리가 말도 안 되게 건강할 뿐이거나."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_PostRecruitment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7d77c71f-2f42-fb06-f5aa-b152cb3e8b1c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Absolute_Knows_TrueSoul = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_PostRecruitment:7d77c71f-2f42-fb06-f5aa-b152cb3e8b1c
msgctxt "h79b28e80gee00g4144gad5cg7fabd3eaf32f"
msgid "There are others, too - these 'True Souls' that worship the Absolute."
msgstr "다른 문제도 있어 - 절대자를 숭배하는 이 '참된 영혼'이라는 자들 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_PostRecruitment
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 7f8754e8-7898-aff9-5be3-bfa89702648a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_PostRecruitment:7f8754e8-7898-aff9-5be3-bfa89702648a
msgctxt "h08223f18g4aa4g46aag983bg1fa05d46660e"
msgid ""
"And that answer is plain as the horns on a wardevil's head: we get these "
"things out."
msgstr "다음 할 일이야 죽은 워데빌의 뿔만큼이나 분명하지. 곧장 머리에서 뽑아버린다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_PostRecruitment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8191926a-5b57-538b-9d1f-0acc90875f2f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_PostRecruitment:8191926a-5b57-538b-9d1f-0acc90875f2f
msgctxt "h62771405ga0f6g4004g9afegd15b8a97e957"
msgid "It makes no sense, I know. Why haven't we turned?"
msgstr "전혀 말이 안 되지. 그건 나도 알아. 왜 우리가 아직 변하지 않은 걸까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_PostRecruitment
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = ae59704e-b7e5-dff1-8ef6-a2c11e0b6b8e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - ORI_Wyll_PostRecruitmentCRD_State_Done = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_PostRecruitment:ae59704e-b7e5-dff1-8ef6-a2c11e0b6b8e
msgctxt "h7c104dc1g6fa5g452bg8e00g96b310292faf"
msgid "*A tingle runs through your head and down to your feet.*"
msgstr "*머리에서 발끝까지 전율이 찌르르 울립니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_PostRecruitment
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = b832a747-028a-7552-2a0d-580385728fe8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_PostRecruitment:b832a747-028a-7552-2a0d-580385728fe8
msgctxt "h7c513607g8854g46e0ga4f1g153ecfd195f0"
msgid "But shouldn't the shadow have crept closer, gone darker by now?"
msgstr "하지만 그 그림자가 지금쯤 더 가까워지고 더 어두워졌어야 하지 않을까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_PostRecruitment
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = bd464d09-5e31-4944-375c-772073f8e56c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: ELF
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_PostRecruitment:bd464d09-5e31-4944-375c-772073f8e56c
msgctxt "hec33526bgc50cg43b5g8b51g24f967a42330"
msgid ""
"Netherese? Ancient magic, that. Netheril is a memory so distant, I wager "
"even you elves have forgotten."
msgstr "네더릴? 그 고대 마법 말인가. 네더릴 얘기는 너무 오래된 기억이라, 너희 엘프들조차도 잊었지 싶은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_PostRecruitment
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = bd464d09-5e31-4944-375c-772073f8e56c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_PostRecruitment:bd464d09-5e31-4944-375c-772073f8e56c
msgctxt "hc62acd1fg7786g4a05g8aceg50fd1c154c69"
msgid ""
"Netherese? Ancient magic, that. Netheril is a memory so distant, I wager "
"even the elves have forgotten."
msgstr "네더릴? 그 고대 마법 말인가. 네더릴 얘기는 너무 오래된 기억이라, 엘프들마저 잊었을지도 모르겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_PostRecruitment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c1cc7eb5-0b5c-d189-d12a-d00b9c795711
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_PostRecruitment:c1cc7eb5-0b5c-d189-d12a-d00b9c795711
msgctxt "h867dee5ag4ac7g4070g9dd4g9df7c99b6334"
msgid "Surprisingly fine, in spite of it all."
msgstr "놀랄 만큼 괜찮아. 예상과는 영 딴판이네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_PostRecruitment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c4c95774-8105-2749-efa3-4252dd82506b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_PostRecruitment:c4c95774-8105-2749-efa3-4252dd82506b
msgctxt "h2c88d449gfcd6g4b93gbf39g8a51d09edc40"
msgid "I'm more interested in how you feel."
msgstr "네 기분이 어떤지가 더 궁금한데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_PostRecruitment
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = d20340f9-d849-58c6-a0b2-69639a50e0ab
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_PostRecruitment:d20340f9-d849-58c6-a0b2-69639a50e0ab
msgctxt "h6488a7d2gaf37g482fg8020gc69dd83005ad"
msgid "Perhaps the worms' vat was poisoned. Perhaps we're uncommonly fit."
msgstr "어쩌면 벌레 배양통에 누군가 독을 풀었는지도 모르지. 아니면 단지 우리가 말도 안 되게 건강할 뿐이거나."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_PostRecruitment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d7b996a6-488b-846c-6516-af74d207b03f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_PostRecruitment:d7b996a6-488b-846c-6516-af74d207b03f
msgctxt "h9c3c042dgc614g4826g97e0gcc9ad59d441a"
msgid ""
"We could probably dig up some poison mushrooms, if you're that keen to be "
"sick."
msgstr "그렇게 아프고 싶다면야 독버섯을 좀 찾아봐야겠는걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_PostRecruitment
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = dd8ca68a-5822-fdc0-91f6-03d9ba78c8d0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_PostRecruitment:dd8ca68a-5822-fdc0-91f6-03d9ba78c8d0
msgctxt "h40291542g2da0g4ccdg8011g41a5ae1a9119"
msgid ""
"The tadpole's weakened me, suppressed greater talents. But beyond that -"
msgstr "올챙이에게 힘을 뺏기기 전엔 그랬지. 놈은 내 능력을 억제하고 있어. 하지만 그걸 제외하면..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_PostRecruitment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = dea5f6c9-1fc4-bdfd-65a0-a74d5f5b65d6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_PostRecruitment:dea5f6c9-1fc4-bdfd-65a0-a74d5f5b65d6
msgctxt "hd9e7b173g23e4g4b0agb5b4g072a170caf40"
msgid "Confident. No tiny tadpole will be getting the best of me."
msgstr "자신감이 넘쳐. 작은 올챙이는 날 이길 수 없을 테니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_PostRecruitment
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = e70ae950-1c7a-5e12-5b4d-fbaf13dca77d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_PostRecruitment:e70ae950-1c7a-5e12-5b4d-fbaf13dca77d
msgctxt "h38b90cd0g62feg45ecg9d35g29d98b5e28c4"
msgid ""
"I've shown no sign of turning. No nausea, no pain, not even a hot flash."
msgstr "변이의 징후는 보이지 않아. 메스꺼움도, 고통도, 피부의 홍조 따위도 찾아볼 수 없지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_PostRecruitment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ecddba75-d75f-3390-17f0-8c76fb91dcd2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_PostRecruitment:ecddba75-d75f-3390-17f0-8c76fb91dcd2
msgctxt "h22e17595g2bbag4d71g9a0cg5f65f5f5004b"
msgid "Something's special about us. Or at least, about our tadpoles."
msgstr "우린 뭔가 특별해. 아니면, 적어도 우리 올챙이가 특별하든지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_PostRecruitment
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = f6380c6b-1be4-db5c-fe25-f580ed4b736a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_PostRecruitment:f6380c6b-1be4-db5c-fe25-f580ed4b736a
msgctxt "hc3f14d0cg101dg4217g8910g26a947609032"
msgid "Or perhaps the tadpoles are merely on holiday."
msgstr "혹은 우리 올챙이 씨가 조용히 휴가를 즐기고 있는 걸지도."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_PostRecruitment
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = f8ae5802-ee96-5df7-7b71-4070706ef50b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_PostRecruitment:f8ae5802-ee96-5df7-7b71-4070706ef50b
msgctxt "h069a7cccg2ba1g4e4fg812fg6fc82be578cc"
msgid ""
"Not the best company to be sharing. Blessedly, their god's remained quiet to "
"us."
msgstr "확실히 어울려 다니기 좋은 부류는 아니야. 천만다행으로, 놈들의 신은 우리에게까지 명령을 내리진 않았지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_PostRecruitment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fac0aed3-0cb2-3ad4-50d5-0f6d707fd0a0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_PostRecruitment:fac0aed3-0cb2-3ad4-50d5-0f6d707fd0a0
msgctxt "h45adb5dfg254eg4953ga40bg750c53a1dfe4"
msgid "Nervous. I don't like the idea of that thing in my brain."
msgstr "신경 쓰이지. 놈이 뇌 속에 들어 있다니 좋지 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_PostRecruitment
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = ff241b55-1906-1002-2ebd-799a857313aa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_CRD_PostRecruitment:ff241b55-1906-1002-2ebd-799a857313aa
msgctxt "h66886659gc091g4735ga67eg38e96ca0e0ac"
msgid ""
"It's natural, to suffer a touch of worry. But an illithid worm should be "
"causing more than mild anxiety."
msgstr "약간의 걱정쯤이야 자연스러운 반응이지. 하지만 일리시드 벌레는 가벼운 불안감 이상의 결과를 초래할 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_Recruitment_PostKarlachDeath
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 0973e38b-9d4e-d9c6-14a8-ef2e6b18fecf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_Recruitment_PostKarlachDeath:0973e38b-9d4e-d9c6-14a8-ef2e6b18fecf
msgctxt "ha0d01147g6e28g4c85gbf80g891e3c76481d"
msgid ""
"I haven't sprouted a tentacle just yet - but I'm thinking it's only a matter "
"of time."
msgstr "아직 촉수 돋아난 건 없지만, 결국은 시간 문제일 거란 생각이 들어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_Recruitment_PostKarlachDeath
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 09fbd75c-2d2b-49b1-b6cc-62754ac3350b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_Recruitment_PostKarlachDeath:09fbd75c-2d2b-49b1-b6cc-62754ac3350b
msgctxt "hfcf60a12g25dfg436eg90b1g630190e2fba8"
msgid "There's no lie a devil won't tell, no soul it won't reap."
msgstr "데빌은 그 어떤 거짓말도 서슴지 않고, 어떤 영혼도 놔두지 않지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_Recruitment_PostKarlachDeath
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 14281a8a-af4e-5b04-ffb1-7279d8c8c7d7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_Recruitment_PostKarlachDeath:14281a8a-af4e-5b04-ffb1-7279d8c8c7d7
msgctxt "ha9c32eaeg3551g4074g9de7g4c30350bc841"
msgid ""
"I propose an alliance. We search for a cure; I pledge you my talents, and "
"you pledge me yours."
msgstr "동맹을 제안할게. 함께 치료법을 찾자. 내 힘을 빌려줄 테니, 너도 내게 네 힘을 빌려줘."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_Recruitment_PostKarlachDeath
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 15741f26-40ee-b574-c8f9-6d0dc3e239b7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(3) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - e37cddb3-78a7-9821-fe57-be01edb4f351_Gale = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_Recruitment_PostKarlachDeath:15741f26-40ee-b574-c8f9-6d0dc3e239b7
msgctxt "h42451a13g18efg47fbg88c7g7fb2e4f6405b"
msgid ""
"I'm placing my bets on a resounding 'no'. An innocent tiefling died by our "
"hands."
msgstr "나는 아주 확실하게 '아니오' 쪽에 걸겠어. 무고한 티플링이 우리 손에 살해당한 거라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_Recruitment_PostKarlachDeath
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1b2d5b49-910e-c274-0f9d-efb5b3c6aa96
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - ORI_WyllConfrontation_State_WyllLeft = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_Recruitment_PostKarlachDeath:1b2d5b49-910e-c274-0f9d-efb5b3c6aa96
msgctxt "h5dc0b167ge3a1g4feegb6b3gcff9fac7026f"
msgid "I think you should go your way, and I'll go mine."
msgstr "서로 갈 길 가는 편이 좋을 거 같은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_Recruitment_PostKarlachDeath
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 2a09c4e2-ddb3-d104-c227-271a3440127a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_Recruitment_PostKarlachDeath:2a09c4e2-ddb3-d104-c227-271a3440127a
msgctxt "h41f67919g269fg4e52gb655g9f6d40114280"
msgid "You can just call me Wyll."
msgstr "넌 그냥 윌이라 불러도 돼."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_Recruitment_PostKarlachDeath
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 34d4662a-0266-1ec1-2d67-d10dcd13b1aa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_Recruitment_PostKarlachDeath:34d4662a-0266-1ec1-2d67-d10dcd13b1aa
msgctxt "h226ef3d6g1c53g4d92ga648ga94f01607140"
msgid ""
"I chased Karlach through the flames of Avernus. Her axe split the living and "
"undead alike."
msgstr "난 칼라크를 쫓아 아베르누스의 불길 속을 누비고 다녔어. 녀석의 도끼는 산 자든 죽은 자든 구분 없이 썰었지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_Recruitment_PostKarlachDeath
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 386cf9c4-312b-e124-8b42-21f2e1b5d7a1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_Recruitment_PostKarlachDeath:386cf9c4-312b-e124-8b42-21f2e1b5d7a1
msgctxt "h5441c673gbed9g4660g85dfg950c179e7474"
msgid ""
"The honour is mine. Consider my blade yours, 'til death makes me lay it down."
msgstr "나야말로 영광이지. 내 칼날은 이제 네 거나 마찬가지다. 죽음이 거둬갈 때까지 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_Recruitment_PostKarlachDeath
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 40b5ee55-6f32-b73a-8123-ee171c284658
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - e37cddb3-78a7-9821-fe57-be01edb4f351_Gale = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_Recruitment_PostKarlachDeath:40b5ee55-6f32-b73a-8123-ee171c284658
msgctxt "hf0658203gc8c6g4b4dg8672g339bac7071e5"
msgid "I - no, my fellow. You've got it all wrong."
msgstr "나는... 아니야, 친구. 그건 한참 오해라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_Recruitment_PostKarlachDeath
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 49f7c299-61a5-7c46-7985-c6e7bbd7b82a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_Recruitment_PostKarlachDeath:49f7c299-61a5-7c46-7985-c6e7bbd7b82a
msgctxt "hbac1a5d9g2bd5g410fga180gecf600cd912c"
msgid "'Hero,' 'Blade' - names strangers gave me. My friends call me 'Wyll'."
msgstr "'영웅', '칼날'은 남이 붙여준 이름이지. 내 친구들은 나를 '윌'이라 불러."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_Recruitment_PostKarlachDeath
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 654fd861-de9a-8e9b-9cdc-047b26c99fb5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_Recruitment_PostKarlachDeath:654fd861-de9a-8e9b-9cdc-047b26c99fb5
msgctxt "ha9821f41ga9bfg46fegacaagc631d5d31b14"
msgid "Consider my blade yours, 'til death makes me lay it down."
msgstr "내 칼날은 이제 네 거나 마찬가지다. 죽음이 거둬갈 때까지 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_Recruitment_PostKarlachDeath
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 68d7087d-0b4b-fa70-7ebe-32f009ef13b8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_Recruitment_PostKarlachDeath:68d7087d-0b4b-fa70-7ebe-32f009ef13b8
msgctxt "hab0753ccg3e4ag48c7g849eg3b3d359bb7cf"
msgid ""
"*For a brief moment, you minds become one, and a single emotion rises above "
"all others: doubt.*"
msgstr "*찰나의 순간 당신들의 정신이 합쳐지고, 한 감정이 다른 모든 걸 제치며 솟구칩니다. 의구심 말이죠.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_Recruitment_PostKarlachDeath
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 6cc285a7-39cd-56f6-41dd-a4262376e4fd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_Recruitment_PostKarlachDeath:6cc285a7-39cd-56f6-41dd-a4262376e4fd
msgctxt "hbfbea29agedf6g451bg8133gb95a8fecbc2a"
msgid "Then goodbye it is. May the path rise to meet you, wherever it leads."
msgstr "그럼 작별이로군. 네 길이 어디로 이어지든 부디 순탄하길 빌지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_Recruitment_PostKarlachDeath
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 75e07f95-26be-f6d2-df1f-cee267187115
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_Recruitment_PostKarlachDeath:75e07f95-26be-f6d2-df1f-cee267187115
msgctxt "hbe045cd1gdaa3g455ega87bgc9a8e467717d"
msgid ""
"If I'd let Karlach live, she'd have brought the Blood War to the Sword Coast "
"and set the whole of it ablaze."
msgstr "내가 칼라크를 살려뒀다면, 그년은 피의 전쟁을 소드 코스트까지 끌고 와 전부 불바다로 만들었을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_Recruitment_PostKarlachDeath
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 7a1fd5bb-691f-1715-c513-376e963956b8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_Recruitment_PostKarlachDeath:7a1fd5bb-691f-1715-c513-376e963956b8
msgctxt "hf17deae5g7785g4dd1g9910ga7ceea182eda"
msgid ""
"She - she was a danger to the people, <i>my</i> people. What kind of man "
"would I be if I didn't keep them safe?"
msgstr "그년은... 사람들에게 위험했어. <i>내</i> 사람 말이야. 그들의 안전을 도모하지 않는다면 내가 뭐가 되겠냐고?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_Recruitment_PostKarlachDeath
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7f10c260-fea8-8ad2-4cbb-3958815d0fc3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_Recruitment_PostKarlachDeath:7f10c260-fea8-8ad2-4cbb-3958815d0fc3
msgctxt "h4a8b2939g4264g427cgb14egeca985fd4afd"
msgid "Are you sure we did the right thing, killing Karlach?"
msgstr "칼라크를 죽인 게 정말 옳은 일이었다고 확신해?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_Recruitment_PostKarlachDeath
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 8f0cccce-c2a7-6b18-b077-f8cc23d1c5b7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_Recruitment_PostKarlachDeath:8f0cccce-c2a7-6b18-b077-f8cc23d1c5b7
msgctxt "h830d57f7g672eg49b3g9c6dgea1deebdd046"
msgid ""
"We've a lot in common, it seems. An aversion of devils for one. A parasite "
"stuck in our brains for another."
msgstr "우린 공통점이 많은 것 같군. 데빌 놈들에 대한 혐오감에, 뇌 속에 기생충이 박혀 있다는 점도 같지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_Recruitment_PostKarlachDeath
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 914d7ff0-617f-dbe7-4cdb-6685ff8af58b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_Recruitment_PostKarlachDeath:914d7ff0-617f-dbe7-4cdb-6685ff8af58b
msgctxt "hbc556da6gab57g45f1g840eg65f3c9621c80"
msgid "How about a proper introduction?"
msgstr "제대로 된 소개부터 듣고 싶은데?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_Recruitment_PostKarlachDeath
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9acc81e4-1e5b-c20a-d5f8-70a9eb703cf3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_Recruitment_PostKarlachDeath:9acc81e4-1e5b-c20a-d5f8-70a9eb703cf3
msgctxt "h98edf10dg9648g4393g9b44gba2888e0a73b"
msgid "A man of courage. It would be an honour to have you at my side."
msgstr "배짱이 대단한걸. 나와 함께해준다면 영광이겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_Recruitment_PostKarlachDeath
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9f5debbc-f3c2-712f-e1eb-b47733e32700
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_Recruitment_PostKarlachDeath:9f5debbc-f3c2-712f-e1eb-b47733e32700
msgctxt "h97eb90a9g6c12g4922g8f36g818056ddfbdb"
msgid "Let's partner up and find a cure for this infection."
msgstr "같이 힘을 합쳐 이 감염의 치료법을 찾아내보자."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_Recruitment_PostKarlachDeath
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = b56f1b38-a8f2-8e71-3903-aa7fd4582701
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_Recruitment_PostKarlachDeath:b56f1b38-a8f2-8e71-3903-aa7fd4582701
msgctxt "h8c38700bg7eddg46afgb2d7ga4abfa59fc1d"
msgid "Excellent. If we ever become friends, I'll know what to call you."
msgstr "그러셔. 만약에라도 친구가 된다면, 알려준 대로 불러줄게."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_Recruitment_PostKarlachDeath
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = bc3fb239-a461-dbbc-bf7a-d1e29c90decf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(2) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_Recruitment_PostKarlachDeath:bc3fb239-a461-dbbc-bf7a-d1e29c90decf
msgctxt "h13775e79gd005g498egbbcfg5483c3fa77fa"
msgid ""
"Hmph - the famous Blade of Frontiers. Clever, this hero act you've got going."
msgstr "흠. 그 유명한 변경의 칼날이라니. 영웅놀이가 제법 능숙해 보이는걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_Recruitment_PostKarlachDeath
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = f5965351-ece2-da69-6600-132fceb69c6a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_Recruitment_PostKarlachDeath:f5965351-ece2-da69-6600-132fceb69c6a
msgctxt "h2d44ce6egcb6bg4672gb1f1g297756fbd507"
msgid "You did the right thing. Another fiend, cast back into the Hells."
msgstr "넌 옳은 일을 해줬어. 마족 하나를 지옥에 돌려보낸 것뿐이라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_Recruitment_PostKarlachDeath
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = f6c733b3-f816-b210-42f6-b8aee55a2bc5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_Recruitment_PostKarlachDeath:f6c733b3-f816-b210-42f6-b8aee55a2bc5
msgctxt "he36c087fg8592g47b4gad18g8183fb493128"
msgid "Apart, we can roar. But together, we'll <i>thunder.</i>"
msgstr "혼자 힘은 포효에 그치지. 함께라면, <i>천둥</i>이 될 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_Recruitment_PostKarlachDeath
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = f8bb895f-a941-e22e-f40d-cc34dce1e78a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/CAMP_Wyll_Recruitment_PostKarlachDeath:f8bb895f-a941-e22e-f40d-cc34dce1e78a
msgctxt "hba705b93g6f04g47fcg9774gc9401449f961"
msgid ""
"Some call me the Blade of Frontiers. Others, the Pride of the Coast, or the "
"Protector."
msgstr "누군가는 나를 변경의 칼날로 부르지. 누군가는 소드 코스트의 긍지, 또는 수호자로 부르고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 01a2adbb-669a-8efb-a87a-4179aac9756b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:01a2adbb-669a-8efb-a87a-4179aac9756b
msgctxt "hb7c41b10g0b2bg4df2g9318g1357553b4277"
msgid "It was nothing."
msgstr "별거 아니었는걸요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 020f6dee-f31e-d88c-f25e-b51da230da6b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:020f6dee-f31e-d88c-f25e-b51da230da6b
msgctxt "h94aa57faga4aag4f43g9457g99051e6a4d59"
msgid ""
"I want more than to fight at your side, or sit around the campfire with you. "
"I want to lay with you under the stars and feel your skin against mine."
msgstr ""
"그대의 편이 되어 싸우는 것만으로는, 함께 모닥불 주변에 둘러앉는 것만으로는 부족하네. 별이 빛나는 밤하늘 아래 함께 누워서, 그대와 "
"살결이 맞닿는 걸 느끼고 싶다네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 021f7b04-a685-59ac-35ab-3018f1e8b923
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:021f7b04-a685-59ac-35ab-3018f1e8b923
msgctxt "h7aca7b72ge8f3g4388ga21fg5ee86f78d922"
msgid ""
"But tell me I'm wrong, and the matter can rest. I do not wish to sour our "
"friendship, but I have to know if it can be something more."
msgstr ""
"하지만, 그게 아니었다면 그걸로 됐네. 우리의 우정을 상하게 할 마음은 없으나, 거기서 더욱 발전할 수 있는 관계인지는 알고 싶다네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 07b44450-ec5d-295c-bc4e-278840c843c7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_State_PartneredWithKarlach(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:07b44450-ec5d-295c-bc4e-278840c843c7
msgctxt "h9a7976e7ge96dg44d5gafd1g65570dd02eff"
msgid ""
"You have bonded with Karlach, body and soul. Her scent lingers on your skin. "
"If there is to be anything between us, it must be with her consent. And "
"perhaps some day, her participation."
msgstr ""
"그대는 몸도 마음도, 칼라크와 함께이군. 그대의 살갗에 칼라크의 향기가 남아 있다네. 우리 둘 사이의 관계를 위해서는, 칼라크의 허락이 "
"필요할 걸세. 그리고 언젠간, 함께할 자리도."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 09c3c886-18ff-acc5-e205-7e02569f1ae6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:09c3c886-18ff-acc5-e205-7e02569f1ae6
msgctxt "h496f9b9ag4244g49cdgaf97g5fb072508bfb"
msgid "Did I have a choice? You basically invited yourself along."
msgstr "선택의 여지가 없지 않았나요? 당신은 스스로 따라온 거나 마찬가지였잖아요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 09eeb892-2560-f18b-45f1-18811b534039
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - Approval_AtLeast_10_For_Sp2(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:09eeb892-2560-f18b-45f1-18811b534039
msgctxt "ha1687be3ge074g450ag8d24g466eca9e5bcf"
msgid "Ha! I am honoured to be your beast of burden, then."
msgstr "하! 그렇다면 짐꾼 노릇을 맡을 수 있어 영광이네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 11ca8e39-05a7-93a6-6a72-3592c9233df5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_State_PartneredWithKarlach(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_Halsin_CRD_Romance_CheckWithExistingPartner(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:11ca8e39-05a7-93a6-6a72-3592c9233df5
msgctxt "h32e81f21gecb1g40dbgab9dgc19758f19a5f"
msgid "I will speak with Karlach."
msgstr "칼라크와 이야기해 볼게요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 137f4455-fa99-2383-2b4f-0534e35c6b1b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:137f4455-fa99-2383-2b4f-0534e35c6b1b
msgctxt "h211327f4g8fa3g4550g9f34ge58d26156b58"
msgid "Take your time. I'll be waiting."
msgstr "천천히 하게. 기다리겠네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 13c023a4-cdd5-930c-956f-8abd8d863dc2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:13c023a4-cdd5-930c-956f-8abd8d863dc2
msgctxt "h46a6cf97g288ag48b2ga76dga876c242ae2b"
msgid "Just a friend?"
msgstr "그냥 친구라고요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1501edc8-ca13-82ac-b9d7-a065187cce36
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_State_PartneredWithGale(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:1501edc8-ca13-82ac-b9d7-a065187cce36
msgctxt "hc65d3c86ge270g47b3ga4fbg954585b3fbd3"
msgid "I want you. Consider things ended between Gale and I."
msgstr "전 당신을 원해요. 게일과 저 사이의 관계는 끝났다고 생각해 주세요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 1b56e373-139c-58f4-9c83-9e786339b771
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Halsin_BranchExhausted(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - IMPOSSIBLE = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:1b56e373-139c-58f4-9c83-9e786339b771
msgctxt "h7f0dff21gdcd4g4873g9898gfb7cb16e18af"
msgid ""
"I think you feel the same way. Do you remember the celebrations after you "
"saved the grove? There was a connection."
msgstr "그대 생각도 마찬가지 아닌가. 숲을 구한 뒤의 축하연을 기억하고 있나? 연결고리는 분명히 있었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 22b9f570-2f45-d50f-44d7-3eead319b117
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:22b9f570-2f45-d50f-44d7-3eead319b117
msgctxt "h003e7417ga957g4243gbcfeg9b7dc82176ef"
msgid ""
"<i>Many</i> lovers? Perhaps your heart stirs more easily than you think."
msgstr "<i>수많은</i> 연인이요? 의외로 가슴이 쉽게 뛰시는 거 아닌가요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 23f42cf7-029f-d048-91c3-77c92db77543
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:23f42cf7-029f-d048-91c3-77c92db77543
msgctxt "h0323d328gc072g4fd7g8749ge364da209f6e"
msgid ""
"I still have hot blood in my veins. Nature gifted us our desires, and the "
"means to act on them. But we muddied its beautiful simplicity with rules, "
"social strictures... <i>clothes</i>."
msgstr ""
"내 안에는 여전히 뜨거운 피가 흐른다네. 자연은 우리에게 욕구를 주었고, 그 욕구에 따라 행동할 수단도 주었어. 하지만 우리는 그 "
"아름다운 소박함을 흩트렸지. 규칙과, 사회적 제약과… <i>옷으로</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 255d50f9-6020-d271-41df-a40b22e06515
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Halsin_BranchExhausted(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:255d50f9-6020-d271-41df-a40b22e06515
msgctxt "hd526f74dg59fag4f4ega1e9g7d590a1ac80d"
msgid ""
"Truly? I was sure there was a connection, ever since we celebrated after you "
"saved the grove."
msgstr "정말인가? 그대가 숲을 구하고 나서 축하했던 그날 밤 이후로, 우리 사이에 친밀함이 싹 텄다고 확신하고 있었네만."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 27e3fa90-a2ac-636f-aeca-24f5317e975a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CAMP_Halsin2_Event_RejectedHalsin(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:27e3fa90-a2ac-636f-aeca-24f5317e975a
msgctxt "h0acae2f2g4bd2g4b77g816eg82ee97cdfcef"
msgid "I'm afraid I just don't see you that way."
msgstr "미안하지만 전 당신을 그런 식으로 생각하지 않아요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2bb09711-95ab-b153-63ec-1add8ecd3f8e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:2bb09711-95ab-b153-63ec-1add8ecd3f8e
msgctxt "hee4f014egf579g4968g81d6g3a5d5ac8ef03"
msgid ""
"Honestly, I just needed someone strong enough to carry around all my gear."
msgstr "솔직히 장비들을 들고 다녀 줄만큼 힘센 누군가 필요할 뿐이에요. "

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 2dc40b99-e3ca-e80b-329e-60367f570aad
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_State_PartneredWithWyll(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:2dc40b99-e3ca-e80b-329e-60367f570aad
msgctxt "h0febfa19g749cg43d0gb0c6g7ee88b019759"
msgid ""
"You have bonded with Wyll, body and soul. His scent lingers on your skin. If "
"there is to be anything between us, it must be with his consent. And perhaps "
"some day, his participation."
msgstr ""
"그대는 몸도 마음도, 윌과 함께이군. 그대의 살갗에 윌의 향기가 남아 있다네. 우리 둘 사이의 관계를 위해서는, 윌의 허락이 필요할 "
"걸세. 그리고 언젠간, 함께할 자리도."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2f39b237-64f1-b959-fb29-4837e921eef4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:2f39b237-64f1-b959-fb29-4837e921eef4
msgctxt "hd31c941cg0fc8g4413ga01dgd8a5164f865e"
msgid "I had my reasons for helping. You're a useful ally."
msgstr "도와드릴 만한 이유가 있었는걸요. 유능한 동료시기에."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 31b9b15b-9ef9-821d-b6ea-3f6ffc9f48a2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:31b9b15b-9ef9-821d-b6ea-3f6ffc9f48a2
msgctxt "h504acabfg13a1g473ag9de7g1d7f8ce8df41"
msgid "You're welcome."
msgstr "천만에요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 35426435-1b0c-7dad-c106-49be0676485a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_State_PartneredWithAstarion(1) = False
#.      - ORI_State_PartneredWithShadowheart(1) = False
#.      - ORI_State_PartneredWithWyll(1) = False
#.      - ORI_State_PartneredWithLaezel(1) = False
#.      - ORI_State_PartneredWithKarlach(1) = False
#.      - ORI_State_PartneredWithGale(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:35426435-1b0c-7dad-c106-49be0676485a
msgctxt "hcaf68fd7g5288g4e60g96a8gfa53889b7669"
msgid "I want you. Consider my other relationship a thing of the past."
msgstr "전 당신을 원해요. 제 다른 관계는 전부 지나간 일이라고 생각해 주세요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 37a3f015-aabf-e8b8-91f5-37dd01683fe4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:37a3f015-aabf-e8b8-91f5-37dd01683fe4
msgctxt "h13b06e8dg7964g462ag8d14g2dff60ab8977"
msgid ""
"You're too modest. I wager you don't even know how extraordinary you truly "
"are. But I do."
msgstr "자넨 너무 겸손해. 스스로가 얼마나 비범한 존재인지도 모르지 않나. 하지만 난 안다네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 3c81c8e5-c4ce-5b64-b412-d17529eab537
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:3c81c8e5-c4ce-5b64-b412-d17529eab537
msgctxt "h0dea29bcg18beg44f0gab9fg307666dfb31b"
msgid ""
"A simple 'no' would have sufficed. I will trouble you with the matter no "
"more."
msgstr "그냥 ‘아니요’ 한 마디면 충분했을 텐데. 다시는 이 이야기로 그대를 귀찮게 하지 않겠네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 3dc72c2a-077a-9d83-9795-d5cb45d3cbbb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - Halsin_InParty_Even_ToldPlayerHisAge(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:3dc72c2a-077a-9d83-9795-d5cb45d3cbbb
msgctxt "h382ad7a1gc16fg4c60gadecg1930b0ef6f50"
msgid ""
"Truly? I was sure we had a connection - you seemed more than a little "
"curious about my current love life, for one."
msgstr "진심인가? 그대와 나는 서로 인연인 줄 알았네만. 그대가 지금의 내 애정 생활에 관심 있기만 한 건 아니라고 생각했다네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 3e921c48-e051-c9a6-78e6-f616f7ed6906
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - ORI_State_PartneredWithHalsin(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:3e921c48-e051-c9a6-78e6-f616f7ed6906
msgctxt "ha6df09aagf89fg40d5g99b9gef2ecbd16b76"
msgid ""
"When the others are sleeping, we'll slip away together. And we <i>won't</i> "
"get much sleep."
msgstr "모두가 자고 있을 때, 우리 둘이 빠져나가세. 푹 자지는 <i>못할</i> 걸세."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 409d8d9a-b390-4023-bd5f-074495e1744c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:409d8d9a-b390-4023-bd5f-074495e1744c
msgctxt "h4195591egedadg44dbg8fbbg0b86294791d8"
msgid ""
"I never quite realised how burdened I was, until I met you. The threat of "
"the shadow curse, the politics of the grove..."
msgstr "그대를 만나기 전까지는, 나 자신이 짊어진 짐이 얼마나 무거운지 실감하지 못하고 있었다네. 그림자 저주의 위협, 숲의 정세…"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 412f41b3-43ab-c94b-ee37-ef5483abc4b7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:412f41b3-43ab-c94b-ee37-ef5483abc4b7
msgctxt "h5d9df9e0g036bg4bbdg9942g218a2a608b5e"
msgid ""
"Are you sure you wish to end the affair so... coldly? Perhaps if you speak "
"to her, she may show an open mind."
msgstr "정말 그렇게 관계를 끝낼 셈인가… 매몰차게? 그대가 이야기한다면, 마음을 열어 보일지도 모르잖나."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 416c96d6-d420-a57a-599e-0a814559b7b4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:416c96d6-d420-a57a-599e-0a814559b7b4
msgctxt "he5581ae0g5481g40e4g9d90g078a47a11b84"
msgid ""
"Are you sure you wish to end the affair so... coldly? Perhaps if you speak "
"to him, he may show an open mind."
msgstr "정말 그렇게 관계를 끝낼 셈인가… 매몰차게? 그대가 이야기한다면, 마음을 열어 보일지도 모르잖나."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 4486858f-5da8-c242-655a-24f9e0a1ad6f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:4486858f-5da8-c242-655a-24f9e0a1ad6f
msgctxt "h6833c478ge9a5g4177gb097g4d4b436f83ce"
msgid ""
"Are you sure you wish to end the affair so... coldly? Perhaps if you asked, "
"you may find your lover has an open mind."
msgstr "정말 그렇게 관계를 끝낼 셈인가… 매몰차게? 그대가 이야기한다면, 애인이 마음을 열어 보일지도 모르잖나."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 49b60d7d-9b49-e8dc-8a12-f2469d43d8f9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:49b60d7d-9b49-e8dc-8a12-f2469d43d8f9
msgctxt "hbeb261d7gc297g44efgae63g51bfdb4a90be"
msgid "I thought you might, but it still warms my heart to hear you say it."
msgstr "그럴 거라 예상했어. 그래도 직접 말하는 걸 들으니 마음이 따뜻해지는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 4abbe652-dafb-143e-5e1a-1bbbae5e8175
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_State_PartneredWithLaezel(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:4abbe652-dafb-143e-5e1a-1bbbae5e8175
msgctxt "hbd276e0fge501g434bga15age48f08816f33"
msgid ""
"You have bonded with Lae'zel, body and soul. Her scent lingers on your skin. "
"If there is to be anything between us, it must be with her consent. And "
"perhaps some day, her participation."
msgstr ""
"그대는 몸도 마음도, 레이젤과 함께이군. 그대의 살갗에 레이젤의 향기가 남아 있다네. 우리 둘 사이의 관계를 위해서는, 레이젤의 허락이 "
"필요할 걸세. 그리고 언젠간, 함께할 자리도."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 4ad37a2a-e02b-fe29-6af4-b7d7da5f6696
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCE_Halsin_Event_FlirtHint(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:4ad37a2a-e02b-fe29-6af4-b7d7da5f6696
msgctxt "h82565244gddbbg4123gbfbcgd164a4c5ea86"
msgid ""
"Truly? I was sure you felt the same way. Once the power of the shadow curse "
"was broken, the connection was undeniable."
msgstr ""
"정말인가? 그대도 나와 같은 기분일 거라고 확신했어. 그림자 저주의 힘이 약해지고 나서, 우리 사이의 친밀함은 너무나도 선명했었지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 4ff74e6a-71ed-7c49-0377-92df5605c6b8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - ORI_State_PartneredWithAstarion(1) = False
#.     - ORI_State_PartneredWithShadowheart(1) = False
#.     - ORI_State_PartneredWithWyll(1) = False
#.     - ORI_State_PartneredWithLaezel(1) = False
#.     - ORI_State_PartneredWithKarlach(1) = False
#.     - ORI_State_PartneredWithGale(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:4ff74e6a-71ed-7c49-0377-92df5605c6b8
msgctxt "haf8a8bb6g15fbg4a64gaeeag6bf41865721d"
msgid "I... I do. I want this. I want <i>you</i>."
msgstr "그… 그렇네. 그래도 좋네. <i>그대가</i> 좋아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 51076a30-d694-2bb6-a7ad-caaf2c449742
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_State_PartneredWithGale(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_Halsin_CRD_Romance_CheckWithExistingPartner(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:51076a30-d694-2bb6-a7ad-caaf2c449742
msgctxt "h926cdbbdg0dfbg40c8g8bbfg62d94abff1b2"
msgid "I will speak with Gale."
msgstr "게일과 이야기해 볼게요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 5c62843e-e7ee-30a3-99b6-1b9417b209be
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:5c62843e-e7ee-30a3-99b6-1b9417b209be
msgctxt "h8060c391g6488g4c88gb4afgac5995b8c854"
msgid "No. It was everything."
msgstr "아니. 내겐 전부였다네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5ee1bc90-1acf-c626-ab3f-f2d3bab741d3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:5ee1bc90-1acf-c626-ab3f-f2d3bab741d3
msgctxt "h7068b5bbge822g4483g87a5ge0b4d1c38495"
msgid "I'm glad, Halsin. I feel the same way."
msgstr "기쁘군요, 할신. 나도 같은 마음이에요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 5f1a3353-f691-84a6-c1af-8f3a340cdbe8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:5f1a3353-f691-84a6-c1af-8f3a340cdbe8
msgctxt "hbdbce010g9397g438dgbccegc92a37219528"
msgid ""
"Are you sure you wish to end the affair so... coldly? Perhaps if you speak "
"to him, he may show an open mind."
msgstr "정말 그렇게 관계를 끝낼 셈인가… 매몰차게? 그대가 이야기한다면, 마음을 열어 보일지도 모르잖나."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 61efd46c-5aef-e092-6cbc-a28abc618e17
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_State_PartneredWithWyll(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:61efd46c-5aef-e092-6cbc-a28abc618e17
msgctxt "h12fea652g838ag448ag93b0g7aef5d1b2a11"
msgid "I want you. Consider things ended between Wyll and I."
msgstr "전 당신을 원해요. 윌과 저 사이의 관계는 끝났다고 생각해 주세요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 68003d48-3de8-66d6-f276-90716d44a4a5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - Halsin_InParty_Event_LearnedAboutLovers(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:68003d48-3de8-66d6-f276-90716d44a4a5
msgctxt "hda9b048fg904cg4dd4gbdd2g447ade221c84"
msgid ""
"Like I said, I've lived a long time, travelled far and wide. I've lain with "
"elf maidens under the boughs of oaks. I've had a Nelanther pirate claw my "
"back and cry my name until he was hoarse."
msgstr ""
"앞서 말했듯이, 나는 오랜 세월을 살아오며, 멀리까지 많은 곳을 다녀왔지. 참나무 가지 아래서 처녀 엘프들과 함께 누웠던 적도 있고, "
"넬란더 제도의 해적이 내 등을 할퀴며 목이 쉴 때까지 내 이름을 부르짖었던 적도 있다네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6efaf6fa-55a7-776d-760f-a56ef378db2f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:6efaf6fa-55a7-776d-760f-a56ef378db2f
msgctxt "hd665bf1bg10e6g42d5g9b0dg4da14b6644b1"
msgid "No. I've made up my mind. Do you still want this?"
msgstr "아뇨. 전 이미 마음을 정했어요. 그래도 좋으시죠?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 702705a8-550b-8fa1-e241-37b517ded00b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:702705a8-550b-8fa1-e241-37b517ded00b
msgctxt "h6016dbf8gaec3g44f3g8425gb4876ddf9007"
msgid ""
"I believe so. Perhaps in another life, we would have felt something more "
"stir between us... but that was not meant to be.\n"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 70ff3c7d-b048-c214-b74e-1c78d304cd0d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_Halsin2_Event_FlirtedWitHalsinInSCL(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:70ff3c7d-b048-c214-b74e-1c78d304cd0d
msgctxt "h7abe3dfeg6237g4a56ga165g846728ce22b9"
msgid ""
"Truly? I thought you felt the same as I did - you saw to my needs here in "
"camp with the care of a lover, not a host."
msgstr "정말인가? 나와 같은 기분일 줄 알았는데. 그대는 집주인이 아니라 마치 연인처럼 내가 필요한 것을 살폈었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 73833682-d847-3943-8061-7b177373b301
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:73833682-d847-3943-8061-7b177373b301
msgctxt "h664d80c3g4779g4dd1gb193gf928374875de"
msgid "...I was forgetting who I was, but you lifted the fog. Thank you."
msgstr "…나 자신이 누구인지도 잊어가고 있었지만, 그대 덕에 안개가 걷혔다네. 고맙네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7b724bbe-aac8-5d8f-2411-14b2977d10e7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_State_Partnered(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:7b724bbe-aac8-5d8f-2411-14b2977d10e7
msgctxt "hfbc6d4b5g5a53g4dacg8285g90f02f534602"
msgid ""
"I'd be lying if I said I wasn't interested - but I'm already in a "
"relationship."
msgstr "흥미가 없는 건 아니지만… 이미 사귀는 상대가 있어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7b86b040-8be3-185a-5abf-ac82f05b7533
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_State_PartneredWithAstarion(1) = False
#.      - ORI_State_PartneredWithShadowheart(1) = False
#.      - ORI_State_PartneredWithWyll(1) = False
#.      - ORI_State_PartneredWithLaezel(1) = False
#.      - ORI_State_PartneredWithKarlach(1) = False
#.      - ORI_State_PartneredWithGale(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_Halsin_CRD_Romance_CheckWithExistingPartner(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:7b86b040-8be3-185a-5abf-ac82f05b7533
msgctxt "h443ad1acgfc55g4f6bg84d9g6d6ce78a99d2"
msgid "I will speak with my current lover."
msgstr "제 애인과 이야기해 볼게요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7c083854-d874-ce83-774c-1989a0276547
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:7c083854-d874-ce83-774c-1989a0276547
msgctxt "hf7657740g7fcdg498aga5a2g5c376fb47a8a"
msgid "What are you saying exactly?"
msgstr "그게 무슨 말씀이세요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 7c84eb2e-d2a1-85f7-82d1-db6675de6a50
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:7c84eb2e-d2a1-85f7-82d1-db6675de6a50
msgctxt "h7ff95a25g9893g4a9ag9f89g2e3a84d61411"
msgid ""
"I will not ask you to dedicate yourself to me. I roam as nature wills me to, "
"and your heart remains your own. I just wish to share in it."
msgstr ""
"그대가 내게 일편단심이길 요구하지는 않겠네. 나는 자연이 이끄는 대로 움직이며, 그대의 마음은 그대의 것일세. 난 단지 그 마음을 나눠 "
"가지길 바랄 뿐."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 8045fe67-45a9-8477-6164-1f5d8d07863e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - IMPOSSIBLE = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:8045fe67-45a9-8477-6164-1f5d8d07863e
msgctxt "h207c7ccfg73dcg48abg8bd4gbb15ea2e50bb"
msgid "I think you feel the same way. The connection is... palpable."
msgstr "분명 그대도 같은 걸 느끼지 않았나. 뚜렷한… 연결고리를."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 8106cc1d-c8e6-5efd-038c-efb328c530fc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CAMP_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance_Event_Polyamory(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:8106cc1d-c8e6-5efd-038c-efb328c530fc
msgctxt "hc7da20f3g492fg4b04gbf78g21137c3bb0a7"
msgid ""
"Some treat their relationships like a walled garden - tidy, tamed, cut off "
"from the world. That is their right, but it is not for me. I do as nature "
"does, and let my heart run wild. Desire flourishes wherever it finds "
"purchase."
msgstr ""
"어떤 이들은 관계를 마치 울타리가 쳐진 정원처럼 다루지. 깔끔하고 다듬어진, 오려낸 듯한 무언가처럼. 그건 그들의 마음이지만, 내 마음은 "
"아닐세. 나는 자연의 방식대로, 마음 가는 대로 한다네. 발 디딜 곳을 찾으면 그곳에 욕구가 피어나지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 86ed2d5d-44cb-2810-30ba-889c64365cc8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:86ed2d5d-44cb-2810-30ba-889c64365cc8
msgctxt "h786fe182g6fc0g4616ga2e1g8dc08957b12f"
msgid "And I've been to the Underdark. Many times."
msgstr "언더다크에도 다녀왔다네. 그것도 여러 번."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 89695de0-ae0e-dbc4-9602-c191ce6f21fd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:89695de0-ae0e-dbc4-9602-c191ce6f21fd
msgctxt "h326625d8g4a45g4c83ga6deg8875cf28291e"
msgid ""
"Truly? I thought you felt the same way as me. There was a connection, I was "
"sure."
msgstr "진심인가? 그대 생각도 마찬가지인 줄 알았네만. 연결고리가 있었다고, 분명히."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 89c45b14-3b7f-fe7d-78f8-cc5f4ba2166d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CAMP_Halsin2_Event_RejectedHalsin(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:89c45b14-3b7f-fe7d-78f8-cc5f4ba2166d
msgctxt "hc612d4dfgad1fg4cfdga323g2c4d22b0c2fa"
msgid ""
"If I wanted to rut with half a tonne of dumb muscle, I'd seduce a deep rothé."
msgstr "근육만 가득 찬 모지리와 뒹굴고 싶었으면, 딥 로테 한 마리를 꼬셨겠죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 8e205896-3fe9-053c-e559-6f32d944a15a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_Halsin2_Event_FlirtedWitHalsinInSCL(1) = True
#.      - CAMP_Halsin2_Event_FlirtedWithHalsinInWLDMainA(1) = True
#.      - Halsin_InParty_Even_ToldPlayerHisAge(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:8e205896-3fe9-053c-e559-6f32d944a15a
msgctxt "h27e22427g89d5g4a58g9ff3ga87ee3b1cd5f"
msgid ""
"I think you feel the same way - why else would you have been so concerned "
"about whether I had a lover before?"
msgstr "그대도 같은 생각이겠지. 그렇기에 내게 연인이 있었는지 어떤지가 신경 쓰였던 것 아닌가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 94129d52-0c94-0256-b176-f824c0be6b2b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:94129d52-0c94-0256-b176-f824c0be6b2b
msgctxt "h9406cf2egedd6g4878g954cg2db658a87173"
msgid ""
"I already knew I had found a strong ally in you - but now I see I have been "
"blessed with a true friend also."
msgstr "우리가 강력한 동맹을 맺었다는 건 이미 알고 있었어. 하지만 이제는 서로 진정한 친구가 되는 축복도 얻었다는 걸 깨달았네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 991860d9-22ce-03b7-a826-2f8cd9f0b57a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:991860d9-22ce-03b7-a826-2f8cd9f0b57a
msgctxt "h65489f02g0073g4aecga04bg4a71f35d740b"
msgid ""
"Ha! I suppose I did, didn't I? I was so focused on helping Thaniel that my "
"sense of decorum was neglected."
msgstr "하! 아마 그랬던 것 같군. 그렇지? 테니엘을 돕는 일에 너무 열중한 나머지 예의범절을 위한 분별력 따윈 무시했었지.\n"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 99c85e19-dd0d-e4a9-8261-724098387a62
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_Halsin2_Event_FlirtedWithHalsinInWLDMainA(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:99c85e19-dd0d-e4a9-8261-724098387a62
msgctxt "h3a971429ge01cg44dbg9939g3d93a8430b08"
msgid ""
"Truly? I thought you felt the same as I did - you saw to my needs here in "
"camp with the care of a lover, not a host."
msgstr "정말인가? 나와 같은 기분일 줄 알았는데. 그대는 집주인이 아니라 마치 연인처럼 내가 필요한 것을 살폈었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 9b27af21-11da-c1e0-8a82-2276a5636d8e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_State_PartneredWithGale(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:9b27af21-11da-c1e0-8a82-2276a5636d8e
msgctxt "hf3315060gd256g406cg8eeeg96c0bf23cd65"
msgid ""
"You have bonded with Gale, body and soul. His scent lingers on your skin. If "
"there is to be anything between us, it must be with his consent. And perhaps "
"some day, his participation."
msgstr ""
"그대는 몸도 마음도, 게일과 함께이군. 그대의 살갗에 게일의 향기가 남아 있다네. 우리 둘 사이의 관계를 위해서는, 게일의 허락이 필요할 "
"걸세. 그리고 언젠간, 함께할 자리도."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 9bb8b882-1737-5a8b-ad41-42494f000bb7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:9bb8b882-1737-5a8b-ad41-42494f000bb7
msgctxt "ha5f1d983geac4g4f27g82eegf063c228f43c"
msgid ""
"It allowed me to see you. Truly see you. I have lived a very long time. I "
"have taken many lovers. My heart does not stir lightly. But it does now."
msgstr ""
"덕분에 자네를 볼 수 있었어. 진정한 자네를. 난 오랜 세월을 살아왔으며, 수많은 연인을 만나보았지. 내 가슴은 쉽게 뛰지 않네만, "
"지금은 거세게 뛰고 있다네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 9ef59ed7-f702-5594-83f6-3af2e3430b53
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:9ef59ed7-f702-5594-83f6-3af2e3430b53
msgctxt "h63c39346g044ag4660gb1e2g4b27b80ce548"
msgid ""
"If we do this, I need you to understand exactly what I <i>do not </i>ask of "
"you:"
msgstr "그렇다면, 내가 그대에게 뭘 요구하지 <i>않을 것인지를 </i>알아뒀으면 하네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 9fe0badf-6d41-6153-88d1-b030e677e814
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:9fe0badf-6d41-6153-88d1-b030e677e814
msgctxt "hdee4f8cbga2d6g49f8g9fb5g37f10e0a130f"
msgid ""
"I did not wish for another day to end without telling you how I felt, and "
"now I have done so. Rest well, and thank you once again."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = a05778b9-b798-ec7c-454b-a1f6bfe0b1e0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:a05778b9-b798-ec7c-454b-a1f6bfe0b1e0
msgctxt "hc0fc6d10gbfa4g4d1bg8447gaa0199ef91e2"
msgid ""
"I was concerned perhaps my imagination was playing tricks on me - my stomach "
"was in knots like some lovelorn ninety-year-old."
msgstr "내가 나의 상상에 놀아나는 것 같아 걱정이었다네. 사랑에 미친 아흔 살짜리처럼 간장이 죄어들었지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = a8fc3bcc-0f4c-914e-b019-37184f6cc0f5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:a8fc3bcc-0f4c-914e-b019-37184f6cc0f5
msgctxt "hf30733cdgc090g47cbgbadcg19505e999b34"
msgid ""
"It has its place, but it is not for me. The wolf mates for life, but the "
"bear roams free and partners as its instinct dictates."
msgstr ""
"그걸 따르는 이들도 있긴 하지만, 나는 안 그러네. 늑대는 일평생을 한 마리의 짝하고만 보내지만, 곰은 자유로이 돌아다니며 본능이 이끄는 "
"대로 관계를 맺는다네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = aaaa61b8-0795-6870-bba6-a0c59b6b05dc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:aaaa61b8-0795-6870-bba6-a0c59b6b05dc
msgctxt "h92d2d823g2a64g4614ga63bg37d4d2dd2991"
msgid "You just want to share? What do you mean?"
msgstr "나눠 갖고 싶다니, 그게 무슨 뜻인가요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = aab790e6-3080-eb91-c6b3-7f4df1f718ae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_State_Partnered(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - ORI_State_Partnered(1) = True
#.     - ORI_State_PartneredWithHalsin(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:aab790e6-3080-eb91-c6b3-7f4df1f718ae
msgctxt "h6a861e42g0cb3g4c82gb92dga1b36406526f"
msgid "You're not wrong. Far from it."
msgstr "아니었긴요. 정확한걸요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = af5fa0ef-3ff3-b53c-78fd-52ca7b70c46b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:af5fa0ef-3ff3-b53c-78fd-52ca7b70c46b
msgctxt "heb835656gd36cg447ag8d49gc189ef977b0c"
msgid ""
"I shall endeavour to be more tactful when trying to make friends in future."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b1290906-40d5-22ca-7886-5ef92b52961e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_State_PartneredWithAstarion(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_Halsin_CRD_Romance_CheckWithExistingPartner(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:b1290906-40d5-22ca-7886-5ef92b52961e
msgctxt "h3f7d7682g1289g4021g90c4g3a29a21b2351"
msgid "I will speak with Astarion."
msgstr "아스타리온과 이야기해 볼게요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = b1eba871-4d9c-b127-f4c9-c86562e4e9ff
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:b1eba871-4d9c-b127-f4c9-c86562e4e9ff
msgctxt "h1d5a53e3g2f24g4d59g944egc275245ab88b"
msgid ""
"I want to be more than that to you. I have lived a very long time. I have "
"taken many lovers. My heart does not stir lightly. But it does now."
msgstr ""
"난 자네에게 그보다 더한 존재가 되고 싶다네. 난 오랜 세월을 살아왔으며, 수많은 연인을 만나보았지. 내 가슴은 쉽게 뛰지 않네만, "
"지금은 거세게 뛰고 있다네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b36a608d-bad2-1808-f838-56c09bbf8550
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:b36a608d-bad2-1808-f838-56c09bbf8550
msgctxt "h78b53015g3e56g41b2g81d6g4b4cd0c39938"
msgid "You can share in my heart. And a lot more besides."
msgstr "내 마음을 함께 나눠도 좋아요. 그리고 또 다른 수많은 것들도요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = b731555b-0fb4-3102-51d9-5b667d5d1e1a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_Halsin2_Event_FlirtedWithHalsinInWLDMainA(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - IMPOSSIBLE = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:b731555b-0fb4-3102-51d9-5b667d5d1e1a
msgctxt "h3f0fed42g03a7g4f14g9911g08aa8b26a906"
msgid ""
"I think you feel the same way - you saw to my needs here in camp with the "
"care of a lover, not a host."
msgstr "그대도 같은 기분이겠지. 내게 필요한 게 뭔지 집주인 노릇이 아닌 마치 연인이 걱정하듯 살펴 줬어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = bdc7b087-c92e-6ab3-39aa-1dba65f32b0e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_Halsin2_Event_FlirtedWitHalsinInSCL(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - IMPOSSIBLE = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:bdc7b087-c92e-6ab3-39aa-1dba65f32b0e
msgctxt "hd0ac69caga2e5g4b01g9687gb5341457d045"
msgid ""
"I think you feel the same way - you saw to my needs here in camp with the "
"care of a lover, not a host."
msgstr "그대도 같은 기분이겠지. 내게 필요한 게 뭔지 집주인 노릇이 아닌 마치 연인이 걱정하듯 살펴 줬어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = bde091ae-aaae-d91a-efd1-632d5bd6cfef
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_State_PartneredWithShadowheart(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:bde091ae-aaae-d91a-efd1-632d5bd6cfef
msgctxt "h421470a5g31e4g4761g91ebg0ce689054ad5"
msgid ""
"You have bonded with Shadowheart, body and soul. Her scent lingers on your "
"skin. If there is to be anything between us, it must be with her consent. "
"And perhaps some day, her participation."
msgstr ""
"그대는 몸도 마음도, 섀도하트와 함께이군. 그대의 살갗에 섀도하트의 향기가 남아 있다네. 우리 둘 사이의 관계를 위해서는, 섀도하트의 "
"허락이 필요할 걸세. 그리고 언젠간, 함께할 자리도."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = c2801e67-de30-3ebb-04b9-623d7a3dbc74
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:c2801e67-de30-3ebb-04b9-623d7a3dbc74
msgctxt "hd2089205g27b5g44d7g8100gb9ff6dc1ca3c"
msgid "The bond we share remains deeply precious to me, all the same."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c34521af-683d-a553-1e30-1cc083ba0af6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:c34521af-683d-a553-1e30-1cc083ba0af6
msgctxt "h5f08bae8g16cbg4a0dg9ee8g0b2200507981"
msgid "So the fog's lifted - what have you discovered?"
msgstr "안개가 걷히니, 무엇이 보이던가요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = c46f82fc-e77d-0e8d-7864-e7592257a887
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:c46f82fc-e77d-0e8d-7864-e7592257a887
msgctxt "h040d12e8gac46g49a3g9ba1g589a3a6cd54a"
msgid ""
"I see... well, perhaps not all friendships are destined to be balanced and "
"reciprocal. But I remain eternally grateful for having met you, all the "
"same. Rest well."
msgstr ""
"그렇군... 뭐, 모든 우정이 균형 있고 상호적인 운명을 맞을 순 없지. 그래도 자네를 만났던 일은 변함없이 앞으로도 늘 감사하게 생각할 "
"거야. 잘 쉬게."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = c63d4d23-01a0-d344-a03f-5944443ebfd2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:c63d4d23-01a0-d344-a03f-5944443ebfd2
msgctxt "h93e93c7fgd6a0g43b4ga06egf8551fe6f02b"
msgid ""
"But know that if you are open to it, I will not demand commitment of you. "
"Your heart is your own - I just want to share in it."
msgstr ""
"하지만 그대만 괜찮다면, 내게 일편단심이길 요구하지는 않겠네. 그대의 마음은 그대의 것일세. 난 단지 그 마음을 나눠 갖고 싶을 뿐이라네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = c6953e07-b8a6-6826-5668-1156de7556c8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:c6953e07-b8a6-6826-5668-1156de7556c8
msgctxt "h1be8899cgef8fg4ff4gb112g1177086e8f39"
msgid "I understand. If that is where the matter ends, so be it."
msgstr "알겠네. 그렇게 되었다면, 그걸로 된 걸세."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c74a47ad-d3bd-edc4-5bbd-9fa00186a384
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance_Event_Polyamory(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:c74a47ad-d3bd-edc4-5bbd-9fa00186a384
msgctxt "hbe734582g74ecg4c58g98fcg718e99a5f3f7"
msgid "You don't believe in monogamy?"
msgstr "일부일처제를 따르시는 거 아니었나요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ce17ccad-2efe-564b-e9b3-fe48a4627c66
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_State_PartneredWithLaezel(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_Halsin_CRD_Romance_CheckWithExistingPartner(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:ce17ccad-2efe-564b-e9b3-fe48a4627c66
msgctxt "h5a1ec36ag9f12g4ec6gb16cg9569f032a341"
msgid "I will speak with Lae'zel."
msgstr "레이젤과 이야기해 볼게요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = d0ea2a50-b9ef-53c0-33e8-b2e7bb467dff
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_Halsin2_Event_FlirtedWitHalsinInSCL(1) = True
#.      - CAMP_Halsin2_Event_FlirtedWithHalsinInWLDMainA(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:d0ea2a50-b9ef-53c0-33e8-b2e7bb467dff
msgctxt "h793a79ccgaaa1g426cg8394g3ca80bb1e6dd"
msgid ""
"I think you feel the same way - you saw to my needs here in camp with the "
"care of a lover, not a host."
msgstr "그대도 같은 기분이겠지. 내게 필요한 게 뭔지 집주인 노릇이 아닌 마치 연인이 걱정하듯 살펴 줬어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = d34da3bd-af51-dfd4-431d-98f1071e1f41
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCE_Halsin_Event_FlirtHint(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:d34da3bd-af51-dfd4-431d-98f1071e1f41
msgctxt "h44de24deg2bf7g4559g8c34gd2941ec4ed6a"
msgid ""
"I think you feel the same way. Once the power of the shadow curse was "
"broken, the connection was undeniable. We both felt it."
msgstr "그대도 같은 기분이겠지. 그림자 저주의 힘이 깨어지고 난 후부터, 그대와 나 둘 다 너무나도 선명한 친밀함을 느꼈잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d48b99e8-0c47-6d0b-6a3b-80d39a208868
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_State_PartneredWithAstarion(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:d48b99e8-0c47-6d0b-6a3b-80d39a208868
msgctxt "h02f5e93egc062g4d0dg9a5cg40289cd54ba5"
msgid "I want you. Consider things ended between Astarion and I."
msgstr "전 당신을 원해요. 아스타리온과 저 사이의 관계는 끝났다고 생각해 주세요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = d62e6d42-de07-392d-bc48-53ce4726eb81
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:d62e6d42-de07-392d-bc48-53ce4726eb81
msgctxt "h4c259b62g947fg4ba3g8912g9071b0e5bba4"
msgid ""
"Are you sure you wish to end the affair so... coldly? Perhaps if you speak "
"to him, he may show an open mind."
msgstr "정말 그렇게 관계를 끝낼 셈인가… 매몰차게? 그대가 이야기한다면, 마음을 열어 보일지도 모르잖나."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d6de7220-7ee9-c079-9f4e-7c25d1d864bc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance_Event_Polyamory(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:d6de7220-7ee9-c079-9f4e-7c25d1d864bc
msgctxt "h33aae34fg8d2ag4425g81fbgff9309606071"
msgid "I'm sorry, I've changed my mind. We shouldn't do this."
msgstr "미안해요, 마음이 바뀌었어요. 이러면 안 될 것 같아요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = da33f976-32e3-039c-055a-6d463f77ddcf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_State_PartneredWithKarlach(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:da33f976-32e3-039c-055a-6d463f77ddcf
msgctxt "hb8f71255g2114g46a8g8eb5g52ce98fc17e3"
msgid "I want you. Consider things ended between Karlach and I."
msgstr "전 당신을 원해요. 칼라크와 저 사이의 관계는 끝났다고 생각해 주세요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = db97a02d-b292-f1e3-75a6-d3cbc7b810f3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:db97a02d-b292-f1e3-75a6-d3cbc7b810f3
msgctxt "hae5a6c2bg1697g428dg8d81g5b5250795240"
msgid ""
"But I respect your choice, if that's how you truly feel. Your friendship "
"remains precious to me."
msgstr "그래도 그게 그대의 진심이라면, 그 선택을 존중하겠네. 그대와의 우정은 여전히 내게 소중하니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = e09b46bc-a41a-4685-e19d-37ef1fc1509e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:e09b46bc-a41a-4685-e19d-37ef1fc1509e
msgctxt "h8cb353bfg6215g4d91g8a73g871695f2f9ee"
msgid "So, I am not bound to nature. I am unbound in nature."
msgstr "그러니, 자연과 나는 한 몸이 아닐세. 나는 자연에 결속되지 않은 존재라네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = e2183cf0-985c-7fd7-9898-f92033d94cbc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:e2183cf0-985c-7fd7-9898-f92033d94cbc
msgctxt "h1bb64a91ge87dg45deg812bgdb4253c71a14"
msgid ""
"I have lived a very long time. I have taken many lovers. My heart does not "
"stir lightly. But it does now."
msgstr "난 오랜 세월을 살아왔으며, 수많은 연인을 만나보았지. 내 가슴은 쉽게 뛰지 않네만, 지금은 거세게 뛰고 있다네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e26e2a4c-a71d-a63f-c709-f6ba677af522
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_State_PartneredWithShadowheart(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_Halsin_CRD_Romance_CheckWithExistingPartner(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:e26e2a4c-a71d-a63f-c709-f6ba677af522
msgctxt "h52836aa8gc507g4625g8462gdff09fe3f6c2"
msgid "I will speak with Shadowheart."
msgstr "섀도하트와 이야기해 볼게요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = e29add01-950f-4206-0123-2123f3179974
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_Halsin2_Event_FlirtedWitHalsinInSCL(1) = True
#.      - CAMP_Halsin2_Event_FlirtedWithHalsinInWLDMainA(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:e29add01-950f-4206-0123-2123f3179974
msgctxt "h18befb56g611dg467dgb7aeg6dba4d58816d"
msgid ""
"Truly? I thought you felt the same as I did - you saw to my needs here in "
"camp with the care of a lover, not a host."
msgstr "정말인가? 나와 같은 기분일 줄 알았는데. 그대는 집주인이 아니라 마치 연인처럼 내가 필요한 것을 살폈었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = e470f5d7-a420-a4b8-401a-7e027eecb9fc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:e470f5d7-a420-a4b8-401a-7e027eecb9fc
msgctxt "h49d50132g9ba9g4840gb3e2gfb649b90461b"
msgid ""
"<i>You. </i>I discovered you. I have lived a very long time. I have taken "
"many lovers. My heart does not stir lightly. But it does now."
msgstr ""
"<i>자네일세. </i> 자네가 보였어. 난 오랜 세월을 살아왔으며, 수많은 연인을 만나보았지. 내 가슴은 쉽게 뛰지 않네만, 지금은 "
"거세게 뛰고 있다네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e70f633d-93f1-a721-1621-744c3b9a456b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance_Event_Polyamory(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:e70f633d-93f1-a721-1621-744c3b9a456b
msgctxt "h02f009d3g0aeeg42dag95b8g91099eec00f3"
msgid "I don't think we share the same nature. This isn't to be, I'm sorry."
msgstr "우리의 천성은 서로 다른 것 같군요. 미안하지만 이런 걸 원하진 않아요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = ea3a665f-039f-3a98-1507-f3b8d13ad2c1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:ea3a665f-039f-3a98-1507-f3b8d13ad2c1
msgctxt "h72ae54e3gc3fag4c6dga34cgc5982c58f90c"
msgid ""
"Still... I could not have forgiven myself had I not taken the plunge. Better "
"to have tried and failed."
msgstr "그래도… 큰맘 먹고 그대에게 말하지 못했으면 나 자신을 용서하지 못했을 걸세. 해 보고 실패한 게 차라리 다행이네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = eb4ccbc3-97ba-619b-104c-292783f7641d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:eb4ccbc3-97ba-619b-104c-292783f7641d
msgctxt "h4269f136gfea5g4e4agab78gcd4b56d4a801"
msgid ""
"I need to stay true to my nature, and you to yours. Perhaps you are like me, "
"or perhaps not."
msgstr "나도 그대도, 자신의 본성에 충실할 필요가 있어. 그대의 본성은 나와 같을 수도, 다를 수도 있겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ecba4ac9-e48f-a3bf-0eef-3c72e6c0cf7f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:ecba4ac9-e48f-a3bf-0eef-3c72e6c0cf7f
msgctxt "h95727f65g1a2fg486cgb0c2ga0095121a1ec"
msgid "I'm sorry - I'm in a relationship. I don't want to jeopardise it."
msgstr "죄송하지만, 제겐 사귀는 상대가 있어요. 관계를 위태롭게 만들고 싶진 않아요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = f09406f8-b687-3d9e-b4b2-7b17611449e9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:f09406f8-b687-3d9e-b4b2-7b17611449e9
msgctxt "h0d9d7dd1gb5dcg4e8fg9a48g9095407297e3"
msgid ""
"Are you sure you wish to end the affair so... coldly? Perhaps if you speak "
"to her, she may show an open mind."
msgstr "정말 그렇게 관계를 끝낼 셈인가… 매몰차게? 그대가 이야기한다면, 마음을 열어 보일지도 모르잖나."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f3434ccf-a5c1-8f91-eca6-1312c63b651e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:f3434ccf-a5c1-8f91-eca6-1312c63b651e
msgctxt "h07d96c8fgbbf3g4805g9ed8gf0932f05ecc7"
msgid "I'm flattered - but not interested."
msgstr "과찬이시지만, 관심 없어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = f4ff7654-5846-79ee-cdcd-27f06e25a56f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:f4ff7654-5846-79ee-cdcd-27f06e25a56f
msgctxt "hcbf16cc6g7498g4634ga715g28176e903980"
msgid "I understand, and I still cherish our relationship."
msgstr "알겠네. 내겐 여전히 그대와의 관계가 소중하다네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f5710135-b7e7-b33f-3e71-ac3d37da57dd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:f5710135-b7e7-b33f-3e71-ac3d37da57dd
msgctxt "h108b3f33g54f0g45a4ga5e0gd90ab4de6e46"
msgid "I thought you were bound to nature."
msgstr "자연과 한 몸 아니셨던가요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f583abbb-f896-d1ee-923c-ac1ca07d9ba7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
