#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:f583abbb-f896-d1ee-923c-ac1ca07d9ba7
msgctxt "h0764bf29g7d14g42abg8334gdbef4ab7a5ae"
msgid "I will speak with Wyll."
msgstr "윌과 이야기해 볼게요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = f594970b-1277-57a7-c453-369fe9d99d9c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_State_PartneredWithAstarion(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:f594970b-1277-57a7-c453-369fe9d99d9c
msgctxt "hf81c79e1g974fg4753gac33g8704556bb846"
msgid ""
"You have bonded with Astarion, body and soul. His scent lingers on your "
"skin. If there is to be anything between us, it must be with his consent. "
"And perhaps some day, his participation."
msgstr ""
"그대는 몸도 마음도, 아스타리온과 함께이군. 그대의 살갗에 아스타리온의 향기가 남아 있다네. 우리 둘 사이의 관계를 위해서는, "
"아스타리온의 허락이 필요할 걸세. 그리고 언젠간, 함께할 자리도."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = f5eefb20-880e-c45c-2989-54afeff6e44a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:f5eefb20-880e-c45c-2989-54afeff6e44a
msgctxt "hef82a153ge039g48bbga6e7gf8a782af943e"
msgid ""
"Are you sure you wish to end the affair so... coldly? Perhaps if you speak "
"to her, she may show an open mind."
msgstr "정말 그렇게 관계를 끝낼 셈인가… 매몰차게? 그대가 이야기한다면, 마음을 열어 보일지도 모르잖나."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f81276e8-f592-2838-0f22-d981911137fd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_State_PartneredWithLaezel(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:f81276e8-f592-2838-0f22-d981911137fd
msgctxt "hac87655agabdbg4acbg9e4ega9c5a9634f1f"
msgid "I want you. Consider things ended between Lae'zel and I."
msgstr "전 당신을 원해요. 레이젤과 저 사이의 관계는 끝났다고 생각해 주세요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fccd2b75-9e58-2fd3-35d5-4ca811b9e767
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_State_PartneredWithShadowheart(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/Camp_Act3_CRD_HalsinRomance:fccd2b75-9e58-2fd3-35d5-4ca811b9e767
msgctxt "h2ab8f637gaa50g4aa9g8e51g730785026c67"
msgid "I want you. Consider things ended between Shadowheart and I."
msgstr "전 당신을 원해요. 섀도하트와 저 사이의 관계는 끝났다고 생각해 주세요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/PLA_GithChokepoint_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 10b2cb3c-81cd-e853-0ca5-ddda775dde25
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/PLA_GithChokepoint_CRD_Laezel:10b2cb3c-81cd-e853-0ca5-ddda775dde25
msgctxt "h70dfed10gaaffg4eb8g8e90g9e5f446490fc"
msgid ""
"I will remove the parasite. I will see the <i>kith'rak</i> dead, and present "
"his head to Vlaakith herself."
msgstr "기생충을 제거하고, 그 <i>키스락</i>이 죽는 모습을 지켜보겠다. 그리고 그의 머리를 블라키스 님께 바치겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/PLA_GithChokepoint_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1e43f927-376e-a1f0-c4c8-3e323315a8ff
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/PLA_GithChokepoint_CRD_Laezel:1e43f927-376e-a1f0-c4c8-3e323315a8ff
msgctxt "hebb1fa95g9011g47degbbd9g861dcabecc19"
msgid "Given how badly <i>that</i> went, what do you plan to do next?"
msgstr "그건 나쁘게 흘러갔으니, 이제 뭘 어떻게 할 계획이야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/PLA_GithChokepoint_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 1efca610-71e8-b23a-fc79-a5d8c2440eaa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/PLA_GithChokepoint_CRD_Laezel:1efca610-71e8-b23a-fc79-a5d8c2440eaa
msgctxt "hb5e0abb8gf403g4208g89a3gac6f48edab17"
msgid "Yes. Judicious counsel - and vexing, given the source."
msgstr "그래. 아주 현명하지만, 출처를 생각하면 성가신 조언이군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/PLA_GithChokepoint_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 2553fc9f-571f-ab29-16b3-415469bd0c13
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/PLA_GithChokepoint_CRD_Laezel:2553fc9f-571f-ab29-16b3-415469bd0c13
msgctxt "h04d04c98g348cg4c3eg8a2fg81aba53c6fe9"
msgid ""
"This accursed weapon has distorted his loyalty. He'd sever our heads, given "
"the chance."
msgstr "이 저주받은 무기가 그의 충성심을 왜곡시켰어. 기회만 주어진다면, 우리의 머리를 자를 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/PLA_GithChokepoint_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 26975d4a-a4ce-7ae2-194a-f5dc1f14fc5c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(1) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_GITHYANKI
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/PLA_GithChokepoint_CRD_Laezel:26975d4a-a4ce-7ae2-194a-f5dc1f14fc5c
msgctxt "hb915929bg2ae7g4ddbgb3bbgefb9d44d678f"
msgid ""
"And yet you say <i>nothing</i>. You should rage at this heresy, and scream "
"for his head!"
msgstr "그런데도 넌 <i>아무말도</i> 하지 않는군. 이 이단에 분노하고, 그자의 머리를 향해 소리쳐야 하거늘!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/PLA_GithChokepoint_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 29a11f5e-10ef-d5c5-fda8-90b3e461aaed
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_GithChokepoint_Quest_GithLeave = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_GITHYANKI
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/PLA_GithChokepoint_CRD_Laezel:29a11f5e-10ef-d5c5-fda8-90b3e461aaed
msgctxt "hdd6470d0g26fcg44f0g80e1g5e5b9e30d98d"
msgid "A <i>kith'rak </i>demanded my death. <i>He'd deny us a cure.</i>"
msgstr "<i>키스락</i>은 내 죽음을 요구했다. <i>그가 우릴 치료해 주는 걸 거절할 거야.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/PLA_GithChokepoint_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 29a11f5e-10ef-d5c5-fda8-90b3e461aaed
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_GithChokepoint_Quest_GithLeave = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/PLA_GithChokepoint_CRD_Laezel:29a11f5e-10ef-d5c5-fda8-90b3e461aaed
msgctxt "h696513a6g905bg4d31g9e17gddda9be0ad88"
msgid "A <i>kith'rak </i>demanded my head. <i>He'd deny me a cure.</i>"
msgstr "<i>키스락</i>이 내 머리를 요구했다. <i>치료받을 기회마저 앗아가다니.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/PLA_GithChokepoint_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2a6f3d81-dc1c-ddc9-73aa-2d650d5366ae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/PLA_GithChokepoint_CRD_Laezel:2a6f3d81-dc1c-ddc9-73aa-2d650d5366ae
msgctxt "h3b3fefbdg722dg4c6fga20cgc259bc4249f4"
msgid "The <i>kith'rak</i> was following Vlaakith's orders."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/PLA_GithChokepoint_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2bccd154-e0a9-1bfa-94bb-4a8452501da2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/PLA_GithChokepoint_CRD_Laezel:2bccd154-e0a9-1bfa-94bb-4a8452501da2
msgctxt "hb6df3810g652eg44dfgb28dg80a53ed6674f"
msgid "He is a heretic."
msgstr "그는 이단자야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/PLA_GithChokepoint_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 3c8240b4-5d96-83ef-d6fd-04aefa9c5071
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GITHYANKI
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/PLA_GithChokepoint_CRD_Laezel:3c8240b4-5d96-83ef-d6fd-04aefa9c5071
msgctxt "h4d08a365g6082g400dg8e6agb9cd812b7d5e"
msgid ""
"The <i>kith'rak </i>is consumed by his hunt. He'd have taken our lives, "
"given the chance."
msgstr "<i>키스락</i>은 스스로의 사냥에 사로 잡혀 있다. 기회가 주어졌다면 그는 우리의 목숨을 앗아갔을 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/PLA_GithChokepoint_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 3c8240b4-5d96-83ef-d6fd-04aefa9c5071
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/PLA_GithChokepoint_CRD_Laezel:3c8240b4-5d96-83ef-d6fd-04aefa9c5071
msgctxt "h16e2a741g6efdg4f2aga856g058a32a57250"
msgid ""
"The <i>kith'rak </i>is consumed by his hunt. He'd have taken my life, given "
"the chance."
msgstr "<i>키스락</i>은 스스로의 사냥에 사로 잡혀 있다. 기회가 주어졌다면 그는 나의 목숨을 앗아갔을 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/PLA_GithChokepoint_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 43325107-60d4-35c1-c68a-882ba69b43cc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_GithChokepoint_Quest_GithLeave = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/PLA_GithChokepoint_CRD_Laezel:43325107-60d4-35c1-c68a-882ba69b43cc
msgctxt "h2595ce2dgf8b6g4c2ag935cgcb1817f3a59c"
msgid "A <i>kith'rak</i> demanded my head. I should have given him yours."
msgstr "<i>키스락</i>이 내 머리를 요구했다. 네놈의 것을 줬어야 하는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/PLA_GithChokepoint_CRD_Laezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 43e986f4-3e8d-12de-f6ae-0bf1116c63ac
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CAMP_GithChokepoint_Event_LaezelCRD = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/PLA_GithChokepoint_CRD_Laezel:43e986f4-3e8d-12de-f6ae-0bf1116c63ac
msgctxt "h27df6372gaaf7g4647g9671g9ab73f4b9cac"
msgid "<i>What?</i>"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Camp_Relationship_Dialogs/PLA_GithChokepoint_CRD_Laezel
