#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice:3fb854ab-3536-f37b-47d9-d9f75f168800
msgctxt "h819bfd90gc47ag459bg9477g18f774ef7c26"
msgid "*You stare, frozen, until she finally locks eyes with you.*"
msgstr "*당신은 얼어붙은 채 빤히 바라봅니다. 마침내 그녀가 당신을 똑바로 바라볼 때까지.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 40c5946b-e797-6fc1-b6c2-8af07e65ff5b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice:40c5946b-e797-6fc1-b6c2-8af07e65ff5b
msgctxt "hc1f24ad9g3834g493dgaff6g5712b97a2cb0"
msgid "'First, thou shalt not drink of the blood of thinking creatures.'"
msgstr "‘첫째, 그대는 지성체의 피를 마시지 말지어다.’"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice
