msgctxt "hd049a400g8a01g4142gb73fg076a66500930"
msgid "*You stare, frozen, until he finally locks eyes with you.*"
msgstr "*당신은 얼어붙은 채 빤히 쳐다봅니다. 그가 마침내 당신을 똑바로 바라볼 때까지.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 46d2e657-1be8-8861-5662-40a1b05bd839
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice:46d2e657-1be8-8861-5662-40a1b05bd839
msgctxt "h0137a04bg4a16g4ae4gbb32g5748c55b4111"
msgid ""
"*The tiefling's blood pulses hot as lava, pungent with a harrowing, life-"
"ending power.*"
msgstr "*이 티플링의 피는 용암처럼 뜨겁게 끓어오르며, 생명을 앗아갈 만큼 끔찍한 힘을 내뿜습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 476cb535-15b2-59d8-d515-f1c1dea24d3b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_Astarion_TheHungerA_BiteSpeaker(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice:476cb535-15b2-59d8-d515-f1c1dea24d3b
msgctxt "h9f86e31bgc466g4bbbg927eg6433eec60b2f"
msgid "*You try to wrench your head back, but your jaw refuses to obey.*"
msgstr "*당신은 머리를 뒤로 젖히려고 애쓰지만, 턱이 말을 듣지 않습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 47ff8bf7-c27c-3c0d-e64e-7c4595493ea8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_Astarion_TheHungerA_BiteSpeaker(3) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CAMP_Astarion_TheHungerA_Drain = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice:47ff8bf7-c27c-3c0d-e64e-7c4595493ea8
msgctxt "hd4849134g5108g4fcag9dbdge55587137cb7"
msgid ""
"*You drink and drink and drink. Until, without even a whimper, it's all "
"over.*"
msgstr "*당신은 마시고 마시고 또 마십니다. 그러다 한순간, 신음 소리 하나 없이 모두 끝나버립니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 484cbe7a-71c4-8636-eba8-0d51717a4631
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_Astarion_TheHungerA_BiteSpeaker(2) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CAMP_Astarion_TheHungerA_Drain = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice:484cbe7a-71c4-8636-eba8-0d51717a4631
msgctxt "h647bb766g719ag4f1egafc2ga58df9c6cb41"
msgid ""
"*You drink and drink and drink. Until, without even a whimper, it's all "
"over.*"
msgstr "*당신은 마시고 마시고 또 마십니다. 그러다 한순간, 신음 소리 하나 없이 모두 끝나버립니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 4aa512aa-3a0a-7309-2508-7013e4a47939
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice:4aa512aa-3a0a-7309-2508-7013e4a47939
msgctxt "hb72ab755g331cg42e3gb833g08ef17ece218"
msgid ""
"*Cazador. Your <i>Master</i>. You have to get back to him quickly. If you're "
"late, he'll flay you. Again.*"
msgstr "*당신의 <i>주인</i>, 카사도어입니다. 서둘러 돌아가야 합니다. 늦는다면 또다시 매질을 당할 겁니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 4b28fe86-1744-260a-5935-2ee9fbf221af
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_Astarion_TheHungerA_BiteSpeaker(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice:4b28fe86-1744-260a-5935-2ee9fbf221af
msgctxt "hcd3d5380g9d10g4c8cga7d6g724d0d7938dc"
msgid "*You fall back, glorious blood coating your throat.*"
msgstr "*당신은 뒤로 물러납니다. 영광스러운 피가 목구멍을 뒤덮습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4cd16410-455f-a3cf-6d77-e88c0500e875
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_Astarion_TheHungerA_BiteSpeaker(1) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice:4cd16410-455f-a3cf-6d77-e88c0500e875
msgctxt "h320fcbf0g1c1eg4974ga163gcea2327d694d"
msgid "Thank the gods. I was ready to kill you. Crisis averted."
msgstr "천만다행이야. 까딱하면 널 죽일 뻔했어. 위기는 넘겼군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4cd16410-455f-a3cf-6d77-e88c0500e875
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_Astarion_TheHungerA_BiteSpeaker(1) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice:4cd16410-455f-a3cf-6d77-e88c0500e875
msgctxt "he59605d6gbb6cg425bg9b00gef109b3a4425"
msgid "<i>Chk</i>. My dreams can't be trusted..."
msgstr "<i>츠크</i>. 내 꿈은 도무지 믿을 수가 없군..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4cd16410-455f-a3cf-6d77-e88c0500e875
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_Astarion_TheHungerA_BiteSpeaker(1) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice:4cd16410-455f-a3cf-6d77-e88c0500e875
msgctxt "h56c7c4d0g9966g4fd9g85c5g1d54022aec6f"
msgid ""
"Dream? But we're elves, we don't dream like these others do... bah, this "
"must be the tadpoles at play."
msgstr "꿈이라니? 우리는 엘프잖아. 다른 이들처럼 꿈을 꾸지는 않는다고... 쳇, 올챙이의 장난질이 분명해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4cd16410-455f-a3cf-6d77-e88c0500e875
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_Astarion_TheHungerA_BiteSpeaker(1) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice:4cd16410-455f-a3cf-6d77-e88c0500e875
msgctxt "h9f512048g4653g4fcbgbb57g4f9741a5be67"
msgid "Ugh - the tadpole must be messing with my head."
msgstr "어휴, 올챙이가 내 정신을 흐뜨려놓는 것이 틀림없군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 50581ca9-d802-499f-23be-8e2ee796a719
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CAMP_Astarion_TheHungerA_Drain = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice:50581ca9-d802-499f-23be-8e2ee796a719
msgctxt "hccad264eg8e2fg4d01gb5c0gdc89afc55a93"
msgid ""
"*You drink and drink and drink. Until, without even a whimper, it's all "
"over.*"
msgstr "*당신은 마시고 마시고 또 마십니다. 그러다 한순간, 신음 소리 하나 없이 모두 끝나버립니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 5123a475-fb05-126f-2d87-5a3d032d5482
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice:5123a475-fb05-126f-2d87-5a3d032d5482
msgctxt "hb1e200d6g363ag42afga1bag969c26b11fc5"
msgid ""
"*And then it dawns on you: if you're free to walk in daylight, can you be "
"free of Cazador too?*"
msgstr "*당신은 문득 깨닫습니다. 한낮에도 자유롭게 걸을 수 있다면, 카사도어에게서도 벗어날 수 있지 않을까?*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5167bac9-e262-69bc-d13c-5637c916ddfc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_Astarion_TheHungerA_BiteSpeaker(1) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(1) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice:5167bac9-e262-69bc-d13c-5637c916ddfc
msgctxt "h09bf3f1eg6803g4cbbgbb31g2bc521cd9d87"
msgid "You clearly have your secrets - I have mine."
msgstr "너만의 비밀 하나 갖고 있지? 나도 그래."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 52636509-c501-73d8-e885-1bebb996e355
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_Astarion_TheHungerA_BiteSpeaker(3) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - AVATAR(3) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_Astarion_TheHungerA_Recognized(3) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice:52636509-c501-73d8-e885-1bebb996e355
msgctxt "h2a285c22gb7b9g4001ga355gff9019372125"
msgid "You're a bloody vampire! But you bit off more than you can chew."
msgstr "망할 뱀파이어였다니! 하지만 필요 이상으로 물어뜯었군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 53e357f2-9173-5650-7bc4-ddb7485d2527
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CAMP_Astarion_TheHungerA_BadDream = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice:53e357f2-9173-5650-7bc4-ddb7485d2527
msgctxt "hd161f98agef61g400fga336g2572e77fbc70"
msgid "*You creep back to your bedroll. A lucky escape for you both.*"
msgstr "*당신은 다시 잠자리로 기어듭니다. 두 사람 모두에게 기적의 탈출이었습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 548239ec-df79-f9b9-7876-9a6f53f2b179
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice:548239ec-df79-f9b9-7876-9a6f53f2b179
msgctxt "hb77fb721g6b4bg4d8egabd2g2a3201508179"
msgid ""
"*What will he say when he finds you can walk in the sunlight and he can't?*"
msgstr "*당신이 햇볕 아래에서도 멀쩡하다는 사실을 알게 되면 그가 뭐라고 할까요?*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 55704f36-433e-347a-3637-92e68454a735
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_Astarion_TheHungerA_BiteSpeaker(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice:55704f36-433e-347a-3637-92e68454a735
msgctxt "h3a8b0988g85c3g4498g8617gaf892ca3540b"
msgid "It won't happen again. You have my word."
msgstr "다신 그런 일 없을 거야. 약속할게."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 5bf4a56f-9d16-f6f3-e77f-8992354185f0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CAMP_Astarion_TheHungerA_HalfDrain = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice:5bf4a56f-9d16-f6f3-e77f-8992354185f0
msgctxt "h8526c16eg0e9eg4ab7ga5cage7d43959b067"
msgid ""
"*You creep back to your bed with a full belly and singing heart. For the "
"first time in centuries, you feel happy.*"
msgstr "*당신은 만복감을 안고 흥얼거리는 마음으로 잠자리에 기어듭니다. 수백 년 만에 처음으로, 행복한 기분이 듭니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 5c8c020b-a38d-3584-f47c-f03a98fb5970
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CAMP_Astarion_TheHungerA_BadDream = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice:5c8c020b-a38d-3584-f47c-f03a98fb5970
msgctxt "hc53eea0agc92dg4bd1gac12gd18ef71b0eb2"
msgid "*You creep back to your bedroll. A lucky escape for you both.*"
msgstr "*당신은 다시 잠자리로 기어듭니다. 두 사람 모두에게 기적의 탈출이었습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5d019888-d7b0-3904-385f-53ee43e328db
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - aeffcfd5-d17f-12b2-954b-9cf82f734bcb_MaleVictim = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice:5d019888-d7b0-3904-385f-53ee43e328db
msgctxt "hb10e468ag3f94g4541gbe99g3cd494019fb3"
msgid "<i>Tell him everything - the dream, Cazador's orders - all of it.</i>"
msgstr "<i>모두 털어놓는다. 악몽과 카사도어의 명령은 물론이고 전부 다 숨김없이.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 5fc9c0c9-fcfa-fa4d-ccca-b4959af0ba2d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice:5fc9c0c9-fcfa-fa4d-ccca-b4959af0ba2d
msgctxt "h5bbb2682g4089g4648g8a92gfc9ead1c72dd"
msgid ""
"*Blood gushes into your mouth. You can feel it filling the maw inside you - "
"filling your soul.*"
msgstr "*피가 입 안 가득 흘러듭니다. 당신 안의 굶주린 아귀가 만족스럽게 채워지는 듯합니다. 영혼이 충만해집니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 635c46a9-6795-854d-e602-0eb34d3523a7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CAMP_Astarion_TheHungerA_HuntAnimal = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice:635c46a9-6795-854d-e602-0eb34d3523a7
msgctxt "hbef83344g26f4g4e55ga711g3d164f2a10a5"
msgid "<i>Change your mind. You can feed on an animal instead.</i>"
msgstr "<i>마음을 바꾼다. 바깥의 동물로 굶주림을 달랜다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 639b9cb0-dcd4-f6d1-4c9d-ebc4f6a59636
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_Astarion_TheHungerA_BiteSpeaker(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_Companion_LeaveDisappearInstantly(1) = True
#.     - CAMP_Astarion_TheHungerA_LeaveParty(1) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice:639b9cb0-dcd4-f6d1-4c9d-ebc4f6a59636
msgctxt "h69857840g8b60g444dg98f7g9694bd1d1fdc"
msgid "You bit me once - you won't fool me twice. This is where we part ways."
msgstr "넌 날 한 번 물었고, 두 번 속였어. 이제 그만 서로 갈 길 가야겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 639b9cb0-dcd4-f6d1-4c9d-ebc4f6a59636
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_Astarion_TheHungerA_BiteSpeaker(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_Companion_LeaveDisappearInstantly(1) = True
#.     - CAMP_Astarion_TheHungerA_LeaveParty(1) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice:639b9cb0-dcd4-f6d1-4c9d-ebc4f6a59636
msgctxt "h48a5d301g650eg4f60gae7dg48f34aaae5c7"
msgid ""
"I need a friend I can trust. That isn't you. You better hope I don't see you "
"again, Astarion. Ever."
msgstr "난 신뢰할 수 있는 친구가 필요해. 넌 틀려먹었고. 어디선가 마주칠 일 없길 바라, 아스타리온. 다시는."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 639b9cb0-dcd4-f6d1-4c9d-ebc4f6a59636
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_Astarion_TheHungerA_BiteSpeaker(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_Companion_LeaveDisappearInstantly(1) = True
#.     - CAMP_Astarion_TheHungerA_LeaveParty(1) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice:639b9cb0-dcd4-f6d1-4c9d-ebc4f6a59636
msgctxt "h6caefb30gd132g4713g98a3ga3545084e7b9"
msgid "I have suffered one parasite; I will not suffer another."
msgstr "난 이미 기생충으로 고통받고 있다. 또 다른 기생충은 사양하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 639b9cb0-dcd4-f6d1-4c9d-ebc4f6a59636
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_Astarion_TheHungerA_BiteSpeaker(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_Companion_LeaveDisappearInstantly(1) = True
#.     - CAMP_Astarion_TheHungerA_LeaveParty(1) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice:639b9cb0-dcd4-f6d1-4c9d-ebc4f6a59636
msgctxt "h46d4c854g197bg40degadc5gf0150ee22da9"
msgid ""
"You're even worse at lying than you are at sneak attacks. You and I are done."
msgstr "몰래 덮치는 솜씨에 비해 거짓말은 아주 형편없네. 우리 동행은 끝났어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 639b9cb0-dcd4-f6d1-4c9d-ebc4f6a59636
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_Astarion_TheHungerA_BiteSpeaker(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_Companion_LeaveDisappearInstantly(1) = True
#.     - CAMP_Astarion_TheHungerA_LeaveParty(1) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice:639b9cb0-dcd4-f6d1-4c9d-ebc4f6a59636
msgctxt "hf91a9d13gb6a7g4943ga76bg31c1bf305ba6"
msgid "We are done, Astarion. Even the Blade has his limits."
msgstr "우린 끝이다, 아스타리온. 변경의 칼날조차도 인내심엔 한계가 있지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 63bab571-2dca-d3da-73bb-e66de16b2a20
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_Astarion_TheHungerA_BiteSpeaker(1) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - AVATAR(1) = False
#.      - REALLY_GALE(1) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice:63bab571-2dca-d3da-73bb-e66de16b2a20
msgctxt "hc66d5142gf194g430cg854bg4fcc5403849e"
msgid ""
"What the... Back off! And spit that out if you know what's good for you!"
msgstr "이건 무슨... 물러나! 제정신이라면 당장 도로 뱉어내도록 해!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 64baf850-f36b-db49-f9c0-fa0a7d7becad
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_Astarion_TheHungerA_BiteSpeaker(3) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CAMP_Astarion_TheHungerA_StealthFail = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice:64baf850-f36b-db49-f9c0-fa0a7d7becad
msgctxt "h4e8c7323g077eg46d2g92a7gbf91fe32c9db"
msgid ""
"*You try to control yourself, but it's too much. The hunger takes over.*"
msgstr "*당신은 스스로를 통제하려 애쓰지만, 이미 선을 넘었습니다. 굶주림이 밀려듭니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 657bf401-e72b-c719-e924-0ddbdac0d1e5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SavingThrow
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 5
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice:657bf401-e72b-c719-e924-0ddbdac0d1e5
msgctxt "h70119a7cgda2fg4e40gbb80gef9a3e6ae24a"
msgid "<i>Stop and pull away.</i>"
msgstr "<i>중단하고 물러난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 6bcef7b1-cc9a-073d-66ac-e1af817f72f9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - aeffcfd5-d17f-12b2-954b-9cf82f734bcb_MaleVictim = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CAMP_Astarion_TheHungerA_BiteAvatarFail = True
#.     - ORI_Astarion_Knows_Vampireness = True
