msgctxt "h5e18b3acg770ag4ac3gb231g19854e1e080c"
msgid "Thank the gods. I was ready to kill you. Crisis averted."
msgstr "천만다행이야. 까딱하면 널 죽일 뻔했어. 위기는 넘겼군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 752e1c76-fa65-ffe6-1478-7da81657f003
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_Astarion_TheHungerA_BiteSpeaker(3) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice:752e1c76-fa65-ffe6-1478-7da81657f003
msgctxt "h97e47fb5gab71g499cg9328gd13b784d04c6"
msgid "<i>Chk</i>. My dreams can't be trusted..."
msgstr "<i>츠크</i>. 내 꿈은 도무지 믿을 수가 없군..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 752e1c76-fa65-ffe6-1478-7da81657f003
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_Astarion_TheHungerA_BiteSpeaker(3) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice:752e1c76-fa65-ffe6-1478-7da81657f003
msgctxt "h680834a2g5686g4ca8ga5ccg82c467c12926"
msgid ""
"Dream? But we're elves, we don't dream like these others do... bah, this "
"must be the tadpoles at play."
msgstr "꿈이라니? 우리는 엘프잖아. 다른 이들처럼 꿈을 꾸지는 않는다고... 쳇, 올챙이의 장난질이 분명해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 752e1c76-fa65-ffe6-1478-7da81657f003
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_Astarion_TheHungerA_BiteSpeaker(3) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice:752e1c76-fa65-ffe6-1478-7da81657f003
msgctxt "h332ee10dg9f58g497bgb5a6g8d29d8a1a80e"
msgid "Ugh - the tadpole must be messing with my head."
msgstr "어휴, 올챙이가 내 정신을 흐뜨려놓는 것이 틀림없군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 75458b18-6a32-68c3-ea5b-44ec7c8835c0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CAMP_Astarion_TheHungerA_BadDream = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice:75458b18-6a32-68c3-ea5b-44ec7c8835c0
msgctxt "h926f5478gcfcdg44baga6c2gbd9eabddad10"
msgid "*You creep back to your bedroll. A lucky escape for you both.*"
msgstr "*당신은 다시 잠자리로 기어듭니다. 두 사람 모두에게 기적의 탈출이었습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 797540b3-24d7-552e-dabc-3568af792f17
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice:797540b3-24d7-552e-dabc-3568af792f17
msgctxt "h1a22f0eege9efg44c5g898cga256839ec6ab"
msgid ""
"*You can smell the sweetness of their skin - hear the beat of their pulse...*"
msgstr "*피부에서 달콤한 냄새가 풍기고, 조용히 맥박 뛰는 소리가 들립니다...*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 79d0475c-d702-2560-acc5-74b6a9703965
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_Astarion_TheHungerA_BiteSpeaker(3) = True
