msgctxt "h25c97997g7236g4eefg93deg568d8f3dcb19"
msgid "<i>Approach [GEN_PlayerName2_85df4a15-4d9b-4f68-0512-d104305d8dac].</i>"
msgstr "<i>[GEN_PlayerName2_85df4a15-4d9b-4f68-0512-d104305d8dac]에게 다가간다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 80c61e57-b5b2-78b8-acb8-b5e22c09f4fb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 20
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_Astarion_TheHungerA_BiteSpeaker(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice:80c61e57-b5b2-78b8-acb8-b5e22c09f4fb
msgctxt "hf95a1ac1ge232g4136g9085gec676cd334ad"
msgid "Relax, this is just a bad dream."
msgstr "진정해. 단지 악몽일 뿐이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 8553975e-5fc0-d886-710f-526aebef5fe8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CAMP_Astarion_TheHungerA_BiteAvatarFail = True
#.     - ORI_Astarion_Knows_Vampireness = True
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_Astarion_TheHungerA_Recognized(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice:8553975e-5fc0-d886-710f-526aebef5fe8
msgctxt "hdeb01259g809fg4f04g8aaag94cc29890a3b"
msgid "*You stare, frozen, until they finally lock eyes with you.*"
msgstr "*당신은 얼어붙은 채 빤히 바라봅니다. 두 사람의 눈이 마침내 똑바로 마주칠 때까지.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 85b099b2-d857-c550-f0d0-74789f244096
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CAMP_Astarion_TheHungerA_Drain = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice:85b099b2-d857-c550-f0d0-74789f244096
msgctxt "h0003edd4g9ae0g4246gbf0dg0c404ffc6585"
msgid ""
"*You drink and drink and drink. Until, without even a whimper, it's all "
"over.*"
msgstr "*당신은 마시고 마시고 또 마십니다. 그러다 한순간, 신음 소리 하나 없이 모두 끝나버립니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 8baee533-4460-f7dd-46bb-71c64263e1ff
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_Astarion_TheHungerA_BiteSpeaker(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice:8baee533-4460-f7dd-46bb-71c64263e1ff
msgctxt "h779e766dgab5fg47e6gb3b3g1b092dce98c6"
msgid "It won't happen again. You have my word."
msgstr "다신 그런 일 없을 거야. 약속할게."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 8d9ef3bd-906f-4464-0ef6-703ee12a3ffe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice:8d9ef3bd-906f-4464-0ef6-703ee12a3ffe
msgctxt "hc90ec4c4gae60g4d24g9b81gdd4b9347b9cb"
msgid ""
"*Blood gushes across your lips, but something's wrong. Very, very wrong.*"
msgstr "*피가 입술을 적시지만, 무언가 잘못되었습니다. 몹시, 매우 좋지 않습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 8ec5123e-a885-d767-ee51-4d723821c069
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - aeffcfd5-d17f-12b2-954b-9cf82f734bcb_MaleVictim = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice:8ec5123e-a885-d767-ee51-4d723821c069
msgctxt "h672b4cc8g7f8cg4de0gb484gde79ab547604"
msgid ""
"*You can smell the sweetness of his skin - hear the beat of his pulse...*"
msgstr "*피부에서 달콤한 냄새가 풍깁니다. 맥박 소리에 귀를 기울여 보세요...*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8f044eb0-5ef9-6c52-a944-13c2a541d54c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_Astarion_TheHungerA_BiteSpeaker(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_Astarion_TheHungerA_Recognized(1) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice:8f044eb0-5ef9-6c52-a944-13c2a541d54c
msgctxt "h8fd617cfg33e3g4a55ga95cg6c03971df6d2"
msgid ""
"Then let my blood be a warning to you: there's more to me than meets the "
"eye. I am <i>not</i> for eating."
msgstr "그렇다면 내 피에서 교훈을 좀 얻었길 바라지. 이래 봬도 많은 비밀을 간직하고 있거든. 먹어선 <i>안 되는</i> 몸이라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8f044eb0-5ef9-6c52-a944-13c2a541d54c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_Astarion_TheHungerA_BiteSpeaker(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_Astarion_TheHungerA_Recognized(1) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice:8f044eb0-5ef9-6c52-a944-13c2a541d54c
msgctxt "h45bafe18g5abdg48ebgae3eg3aad912fa882"
msgid "Try that again, and you're ash. Got it?"
msgstr "한 번만 더 그러면, 잿더미로 만들어버릴 거야. 알았어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8f044eb0-5ef9-6c52-a944-13c2a541d54c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_Astarion_TheHungerA_BiteSpeaker(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_Astarion_TheHungerA_Recognized(1) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice:8f044eb0-5ef9-6c52-a944-13c2a541d54c
msgctxt "h5d65ed7bg30d2g409bgbb43gfbb4e00d24fa"
msgid ""
"I accept your explanation. We remain allies - for now. But I suggest you "
"find a new subject for your... tests."
msgstr "네 해명을 받아들이겠다. 우린 동맹으로 남는다. 지금 당장은. 하지만 새로운... 실험체를 찾아보길 권하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8f044eb0-5ef9-6c52-a944-13c2a541d54c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_Astarion_TheHungerA_BiteSpeaker(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_Astarion_TheHungerA_Recognized(1) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice:8f044eb0-5ef9-6c52-a944-13c2a541d54c
msgctxt "h95dafd5bg152cg493cga841g656c58c60ba3"
msgid ""
"A rat sucking vampire. Just my luck. But all right. You sound sincere. But "
"no more of this - next time it'll be a stake in the heart."
msgstr ""
"쥐새끼나 빨아먹는 뱀파이어라니. 다행이라고 해야 하나. 뭐, 괜찮아. 퍽 진심인 것 같으니. 하지만 다음은 없어. 또 그러면 심장에 "
"말뚝을 박아 넣을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8f044eb0-5ef9-6c52-a944-13c2a541d54c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_Astarion_TheHungerA_BiteSpeaker(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
