msgctxt "h9cb96a19g9db0g43cag9d36g29247c2b0996"
msgid ""
"Let my blood be a warning to you: there's more to me than meets the eye. I "
"am <i>not</i> for eating."
msgstr "내 피에서 교훈을 좀 얻었길 바라지. 이래 봬도 많은 비밀을 간직하고 있거든. 먹어선 <i>안 되는</i> 몸이라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice
