msgctxt "hfc4560a5g4ac7g4e10gae6cgc672efa1a9c5"
msgid ""
"Then let my blood be a warning to you: there's more to me than meets the "
"eye. I am <i>not</i> for eating."
msgstr "그렇다면 내 피에서 교훈을 좀 얻었길 바라지. 이래 봬도 많은 비밀을 간직하고 있거든. 먹어선 <i>안 되는</i> 몸이라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9af35f1c-d445-908d-6ab2-978f59977c35
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_Astarion_TheHungerA_BiteSpeaker(3) = True
#. SetFlags:
