#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice:9af35f1c-d445-908d-6ab2-978f59977c35
msgctxt "h730ecaa4ge7b8g4f3ag8e32gcaed8628385a"
msgid "Try that again, and you're ash. Got it?"
msgstr "한 번만 더 그러면, 잿더미로 만들어버릴 거야. 알았어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9af35f1c-d445-908d-6ab2-978f59977c35
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_Astarion_TheHungerA_BiteSpeaker(3) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_Astarion_TheHungerA_Recognized(3) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice:9af35f1c-d445-908d-6ab2-978f59977c35
msgctxt "h2e02d172gda95g484cg9c5eg14155e3c039c"
msgid ""
"I accept your explanation. We remain allies - for now. But I suggest you "
"find a new subject for your... tests."
msgstr "네 해명을 받아들이겠다. 우린 동맹으로 남는다. 지금 당장은. 하지만 새로운... 실험체를 찾아보길 권하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9af35f1c-d445-908d-6ab2-978f59977c35
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_Astarion_TheHungerA_BiteSpeaker(3) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_Astarion_TheHungerA_Recognized(3) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice:9af35f1c-d445-908d-6ab2-978f59977c35
msgctxt "hd621d217gcce6g4662g848cgadc49eb9402f"
msgid ""
"A rat sucking vampire. Just my luck. But all right. You sound sincere. But "
"no more of this - next time it'll be a stake in the heart."
msgstr ""
"쥐새끼나 빨아먹는 뱀파이어라니. 다행이라고 해야 하나. 뭐, 괜찮아. 퍽 진심인 것 같으니. 하지만 다음은 없어. 또 그러면 심장에 "
"말뚝을 박아 넣을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9af35f1c-d445-908d-6ab2-978f59977c35
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_Astarion_TheHungerA_BiteSpeaker(3) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_Astarion_TheHungerA_Recognized(3) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice:9af35f1c-d445-908d-6ab2-978f59977c35
msgctxt "h9455d7e0g0cb9g418bg895egff15d4684bd3"
msgid ""
"Fine. You sound sincere. But no more of this - next time it'll be a stake in "
"the heart. ."
msgstr "좋아. 진심인 것 같군. 하지만 다음은 없어. 또 그러면 심장에 말뚝을 박아 주지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 9b7587ec-ef2a-29c4-5e44-31ba502dbc9b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CAMP_Astarion_TheHungerA_Drain = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice:9b7587ec-ef2a-29c4-5e44-31ba502dbc9b
msgctxt "h374db35eg464ag4d1cgb32fg15db5024e768"
msgid ""
"*You drink and drink and drink. Until, without even a whimper, it's all "
"over.*"
msgstr "*당신은 마시고 마시고 또 마십니다. 그러다 한순간, 신음 소리 하나 없이 모두 끝나버립니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 9b9c6a1f-1ea8-4205-3da1-0e9179ca311e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - aeffcfd5-d17f-12b2-954b-9cf82f734bcb_FemaleVictim = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice:9b9c6a1f-1ea8-4205-3da1-0e9179ca311e
msgctxt "h67fcfc48g0b6cg45b1gb097gc0aa048c5b29"
msgid ""
"*You can smell the sweetness of her skin - hear the beat of her pulse...*"
msgstr "*피부에서 달콤한 냄새가 풍깁니다. 맥박 소리에 귀를 기울여 보세요...*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 9bfc38b2-1b14-b5b1-52dc-dd916053f2bc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 15
#. CheckFlags:
