#.     - CAMP_Astarion_TheHungerA_Recognized(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice:9dada34c-c777-acda-65d9-4a0ae1085139
msgctxt "h6ae9a496g8436g49fdg9c2ag04a945784677"
msgid "*You stare, frozen, until they finally lock eyes with you.*"
msgstr "*당신은 얼어붙은 채 빤히 바라봅니다. 두 사람의 눈이 마침내 똑바로 마주칠 때까지.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice
