#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice:a5103c89-f014-a30c-a090-c106cce9a46f
msgctxt "h1b20382egfe9dg459eg9b9eg13c63600c713"
msgid "For your reference: bites hurt. Consider that a given."
msgstr "혹시 몰라서 말해 두는데, 물면 아파. 당연한 상식이라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_IVB_SCO_Avatar_Choice
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a5103c89-f014-a30c-a090-c106cce9a46f
