msgid "<i>Lash out with your elbow.</i>"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 80138ae0-60dc-3b84-7496-e084ff24e26e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion:80138ae0-60dc-3b84-7496-e084ff24e26e
msgctxt "h03c999d8g0fa2g44a6g8e63g54aaab0de2a1"
msgid "I'll go and find something on four legs to eat, I suppose."
msgstr "먹을만한 네 다리 짐승을 찾아야겠네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 801f827b-9964-be30-b8f1-8cc0c4db77df
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion:801f827b-9964-be30-b8f1-8cc0c4db77df
msgctxt "ha99e30ebgcf47g4e61ga4eagcd2d62ef257d"
msgid "I feed on animals. Boars, deer, kobolds - whatever I can get."
msgstr "나는 동물들을 먹고 살아. 멧돼지, 사슴, 코볼트 - 잡히는 뭐든 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8256dffe-245d-4356-97c5-1495adce879c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_ForgingOfTheHeart_State_KarlachSecondUpgrade = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion:8256dffe-245d-4356-97c5-1495adce879c
msgctxt "h97ca1c4dgbe45g4d4dg856agb89c6649d0cd"
msgid "Go ahead, if you want to burn your lips off."
msgstr "해봐, 입술을 불태우고 싶다면야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 835e919f-0911-0067-4599-73abfdb274d7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion:835e919f-0911-0067-4599-73abfdb274d7
msgctxt "h043aaa7bgacd4g457dgaddagaf4c023201fb"
msgid "Leave. If I ever see you again, I'll kill you."
msgstr "꺼져. 널 다시 보게 된다면 죽여버릴 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 8761ff87-eae6-24d9-8cae-03db80f2c973
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion:8761ff87-eae6-24d9-8cae-03db80f2c973
msgctxt "h0d9920aeg0a70g4a67g987fg735895dfab2a"
msgid ""
"*You can hear how weak your voice is. So can he, but he doesn't care. He's "
"long past caring.* "
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 895ac0a3-dbec-5465-7389-6baab0323014
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion:895ac0a3-dbec-5465-7389-6baab0323014
msgctxt "ha91f930dga53dg4cbbgbec4gb26b6d4777b1"
msgid "*But something inside you stirs, and the cold fades.*"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 8a842eef-46fa-053d-7378-3231805ee458
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion:8a842eef-46fa-053d-7378-3231805ee458
msgctxt "h233e20degc149g4626g8dbfg30e9295b83f3"
msgid "But I do trust you. And you can trust me."
msgstr "그런데 난 너를 믿고 있어. 너도 날 믿어도 돼."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8b3b5075-2aae-b486-00db-0de268117d50
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion:8b3b5075-2aae-b486-00db-0de268117d50
msgctxt "h4113fbd7gf23ag4dc0g9d1eg0b0587051d7d"
msgid "Are you mad? No!"
msgstr "정신 나갔냐? 안 돼!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 8bcfd195-d4e1-8138-3035-82979d2de662
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion:8bcfd195-d4e1-8138-3035-82979d2de662
msgctxt "hcb7d341ege06bg4039ga8fbgb134c0ac09d7"
msgid "*You feel yourself repulsed as the doors of his mind slam shut.*"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 8c18639e-e516-1e55-f0c3-c8f54781b69c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion:8c18639e-e516-1e55-f0c3-c8f54781b69c
msgctxt "h940c3bc8g276dg471cga805g83620ff4a76a"
msgid "Shouldn't take long. So many people need killing."
msgstr "오래 걸리지 않을걸. 죽일 사람들이 정말 많으니까 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 8da1040f-4a20-5c92-df32-23263b56e062
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion:8da1040f-4a20-5c92-df32-23263b56e062
msgctxt "h040d2d14gbdcag4844ga7f4g5195c0bea3ee"
msgid ""
"*You lean into him, losing yourself. You can feel your blood racing, "
"coursing through both your bodies. A gentle, numb feeling starts to spread.*"
msgstr "*당신은 정신을 놓은 채, 그를 받아들입니다. 당신의 피가 하나가 된 두 육체를 통해 흐르는 것이 느껴집니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 8f113b0e-230d-78e9-0ac3-156e4e09182b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion:8f113b0e-230d-78e9-0ac3-156e4e09182b
msgctxt "h9f9d03c8ga05eg44c8g8c37ge9988dd8242e"
msgid "No, I needed you to trust me. And you <i>can </i>trust me."
msgstr "아니, 네가 날 믿어주길 바랐어. 그리고 넌 날 <i>믿어도 돼</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 903ecde5-5aef-b902-ae87-ef7d2a1bb5e9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion:903ecde5-5aef-b902-ae87-ef7d2a1bb5e9
msgctxt "ha245f2ccg6da9g40e5gb8f1g00e2937ecfee"
msgid "Ah. Perhaps I went a little far."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 90a96a54-19cd-3fce-f9f9-9a29782b1b4d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - ORI_Astarion_Event_UnlockVampireBite = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion:90a96a54-19cd-3fce-f9f9-9a29782b1b4d
msgctxt "hc0293126g33feg4c00gbf1agecb9ff944e71"
msgid ""
"If I just had a little blood, I could think clearer. Fight better. "
"<i>Please</i>."
msgstr "피를 조금만 더 마신다면, 생각이 잘 돌아갈 것 같아. 더 잘 싸울 수 있고. <i>부탁할게</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 91f79332-38c0-4819-1526-9f95f4d506c9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion:91f79332-38c0-4819-1526-9f95f4d506c9
msgctxt "h100e9758g2587g4f36g9694g87a92dd38d2b"
msgid "This is not the time to start invading each other's minds."
msgstr "서로의 마음을 헤집고 다닐 때는 아닌 것 같은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 931bb0cf-c799-af5d-f600-caf46fb30871
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion:931bb0cf-c799-af5d-f600-caf46fb30871
msgctxt "hbf047217g1f80g4a30ga9eeg364b7aebebea"
msgid "What are you - oh no, there's no need for that!"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 932abbef-bd68-a833-9c06-c86cce63e759
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAG_GurHunter_State_MentionedAstarion = True
#.      - GLO_GurHunter_State_PermaDefeated = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion:932abbef-bd68-a833-9c06-c86cce63e759
msgctxt "hf8027310g2f4eg4a21ga20dgf347f2321260"
msgid "That hunter in the swamp was right - you're a vampire spawn."
msgstr "늪지에서 본 사냥꾼 말이 맞았어. 네가 뱀파이어 스폰이었다니."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9351f186-77ca-5e57-4462-d4cc9f2ccbda
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion:9351f186-77ca-5e57-4462-d4cc9f2ccbda
msgctxt "hc5f26a89gcc0cg4240g9169g4aca6b30c9a1"
msgid "Think of it as a warning. I am <i>not </i>for eating."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 96582478-905e-9ce2-5816-487b929b88a4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion:96582478-905e-9ce2-5816-487b929b88a4
msgctxt "hc9a79393gd3aeg4056ga05bg656a7301fef7"
msgid "But I didn't. And that's what matters."
msgstr "하지만 아니었지. 그게 중요한 거 아니겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 980bec07-6ec7-2bc9-fbac-a34aeedd241f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Strength
#. DifficultyClass: 7
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion_AvatarFought(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion:980bec07-6ec7-2bc9-fbac-a34aeedd241f
msgctxt "hb13bab52geee6g47c6g859cgf9a7018b9fc1"
msgid "<i>Push him back.</i>"
msgstr "<i>그를 밀쳐낸다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 9a3a6ed6-d10d-810d-0d01-34c972e23eac
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion:9a3a6ed6-d10d-810d-0d01-34c972e23eac
msgctxt "hce5ca317g2fffg4034g858ag457b1cc8772c"
msgid "I wasn't going to hurt you! I just needed - well, blood."
msgstr "널 다치게 할 생각은 아니었어! 난 그냥... 음, 피가 필요해서."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 9e864ea5-ccb5-bb62-0ac5-f58b68558b8b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion:9e864ea5-ccb5-bb62-0ac5-f58b68558b8b
msgctxt "h6d5cae91ge0bag4420gbc99gc552152cc499"
msgid ""
"*He moves in quickly, eagerly, and his bite is like a shard of ice through "
"your neck.*"
msgstr "*그는 빠르고 열정적으로 움직입니다. 그가 깨물자 얼음조각이 목을 관통하는 것 같습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 9f61b21e-8284-b10d-a3a2-f534e2a27a73
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion:9f61b21e-8284-b10d-a3a2-f534e2a27a73
msgctxt "he4a05efdgaf5bg4b32ga8a4g1f0077286a60"
msgid "Really? Well, let's see, shall we?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = a0f6dc97-7e27-105d-4d48-772d5daff47c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion:a0f6dc97-7e27-105d-4d48-772d5daff47c
msgctxt "h486aea6bga95bg4c3cg978dgbc83c0441299"
msgid "Ah! Of course."
msgstr "아! 물론."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = a126b34a-ac4c-57e3-6637-04c779d70adc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CAMP_Astarion_TheHungerC_Leave = True
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_Companion_LeaveDisappearInstantly(0) = True
#.   Quest:
#.     - ORI_COM_Astarion.CompanionLowRelation(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion:a126b34a-ac4c-57e3-6637-04c779d70adc
msgctxt "h27bae7c8g8522g4c6fgb172g0b2859662b8e"
msgid "Ah! You wretch!"
msgstr "아! 이 개자식!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a30a564e-7ef7-bd7d-7fcc-40e7c1999166
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(1) = False
#.      - REALLY_GALE(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - ORI_Astarion_Event_LetAstarionBite(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion:a30a564e-7ef7-bd7d-7fcc-40e7c1999166
msgctxt "ha13df6d3gf4eag4b58gb34age100a0c58a82"
msgid "Fine. But not a drop more than you need."
msgstr "좋아. 하지만 필요 이상으로는 한 방울도 더 빨지 마."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = a4b66917-7db6-7553-1ce0-f1c1bcfe126f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion:a4b66917-7db6-7553-1ce0-f1c1bcfe126f
msgctxt "h36ba63e9ga6e3g4bdfgae6fg571d9734f9cd"
msgid "I need you alive. You need me strong."
msgstr "난 널 살려둬야 해. 넌 내 강함이 필요하고 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = a54216d6-5b12-dca5-c26d-d94ba12733d8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion:a54216d6-5b12-dca5-c26d-d94ba12733d8
msgctxt "hc71fb90eg0ba5g4376gb529g103d85676c27"
msgid ""
"Urgh! Gods! Another drop and I would've burnt a hole from lips to navel. I "
"thought we had that fire under control?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = ac1ef269-c913-9627-4726-e702f74b1172
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CAMP_Astarion_TheHungerC_Bite = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion:ac1ef269-c913-9627-4726-e702f74b1172
msgctxt "h7f758e5fgc1aeg4f7fga3f7g83a9a13e1ea8"
msgid ""
"*It's like a shard of ice into your neck - a quick, sharp pain that fades to "
"throbbing numbness. Your breath catches, your pulse quickens.*"
msgstr "*얼음조각이 목을 뚫는 것 같습니다- 빠르고 날카로운 고통이 무딘 욱신거림으로 잦아듭니다. 숨이 가팔라지고 심장이 고동칩니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = af747424-5e97-adc8-a335-b591527047dc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion:af747424-5e97-adc8-a335-b591527047dc
msgctxt "h038f9991g504bg452fgb41bgdcbc283c19ca"
msgid "*You drive the wood into his chest, but it glances off a rib.*"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = b064c325-589a-6c70-da2c-5c0816f1fb03
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion:b064c325-589a-6c70-da2c-5c0816f1fb03
msgctxt "hcd52609fg242bg429ega9efgc158895d5874"
msgid "See you in the morning."
msgstr "아침에 봐."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = b083dc73-6d3d-5b33-8f3f-d449bd6a4522
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion:b083dc73-6d3d-5b33-8f3f-d449bd6a4522
msgctxt "hf076b20fgb6e5g48a7g9081geb515b343d82"
msgid "You'd toss me aside over this?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = b34a5265-6741-a4b8-32b7-c05f12707366
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ELF
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion:b34a5265-6741-a4b8-32b7-c05f12707366
msgctxt "hb536b254g2fe2g419dg95d9g9d3587343c49"
msgid ""
"*Maybe you break your meditation because you know something is wrong. Or "
"maybe you just get lucky.*"
msgstr "*어쩌면 당신은 무언가 잘못되었음을 알기 때문에 명상을 깨뜨릴 수도 있습니다. 아니면 그냥 운이 좋은 것일 수도 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = b34a5265-6741-a4b8-32b7-c05f12707366
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion:b34a5265-6741-a4b8-32b7-c05f12707366
msgctxt "hb14652adg1d59g40ddg8603gc8ba3edb14da"
msgid ""
"*Maybe you wake up because you know something is wrong. Or maybe you just "
"get lucky.*"
msgstr "*어쩌면 당신이 뭔가 잘못되었음을 깨달았기 때문일지도, 아니면 그저 운이 좋았던 것일지도 모릅니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = b7e960da-4e04-ec06-fd3e-a68bb2c72ab8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Quest:
#.     - ORI_COM_Astarion.LearnedVampire_GaveBlood(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion:b7e960da-4e04-ec06-fd3e-a68bb2c72ab8
msgctxt "h57649884g2f9fg4e51g8f09g60b57221efe1"
msgid "This is a gift, you know. I won't forget it."
msgstr "이건 네가 준 선물이야. 잊지 않을게."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b9031163-f8ba-6007-bf1a-81264da36807
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_Gale_Knows_SharedBomb = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion:b9031163-f8ba-6007-bf1a-81264da36807
msgctxt "h949b07c7g6e42g4aa9g8cfcgec9f641fff16"
msgid ""
"That's a long story involving the goddess of magic herself. Not one I'm "
"inclined to tell to the man who just tried to <i>bite me</i>."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bc854f00-46d1-fa47-3ffb-a096c7833dc2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion:bc854f00-46d1-fa47-3ffb-a096c7833dc2
msgctxt "h118536a8g7d30g431cg8a2fg9d2fb5f716bb"
msgid "Guess my blood just isn't for drinking."
msgstr "내 피는 마실만하지 않나 봐."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = bc9ae4b1-d9f5-7436-9aff-812fba056ef8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CAMP_Astarion_TheHungerC_AvatarDeath = True
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion_KilledYou(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion:bc9ae4b1-d9f5-7436-9aff-812fba056ef8
msgctxt "hbf245e29g1041g40eag92a0g0a67bcde4306"
msgid ""
"*You feel a little cold, but that's all. There's no more pain, no more fear, "
"no more struggle. It's all over...*"
msgstr "*약간의 추위가 느껴지지만, 그뿐입니다. 더 이상 고통도, 두려움도, 몸부림도 없습니다. 모든 것이 끝났습니다...*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bd38f2b3-96fd-0e43-e191-3cc269daec3a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_ForgingOfTheHeart_State_KarlachSecondUpgrade = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - ORI_Astarion_Event_LetAstarionBite(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion:bd38f2b3-96fd-0e43-e191-3cc269daec3a
msgctxt "h87eb4b35g051fg47e1g9dcdg782f3dd412df"
msgid "All right, but go too far and I'll drive a stake through your chest."
msgstr "좋아, 하지만 선 넘으면 네 가슴에 말뚝을 꽂아버릴 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = bdb872dd-6665-e1b1-9815-ad8b8d8212b4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_AstarionHunger_SC_Companion_HasStake(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion:bdb872dd-6665-e1b1-9815-ad8b8d8212b4
msgctxt "hd3172d67g9b6bg4339g8ec7gdc197bd7a6d1"
msgid "At best, I was sure you'd say no. At worst..."
msgstr "잘해봤자 네가 거절할 거라 확신했어. 최악의 경우엔..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = be1c2f43-7add-a773-8c5e-37e7421e6da5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion:be1c2f43-7add-a773-8c5e-37e7421e6da5
msgctxt "h0e958a1fgb526g4129gb8ecgb9d256a293ea"
msgid "But it's not enough. Not if I have to fight. I feel so weak."
msgstr "하지만 내가 싸우기 위해선, 그걸로는 부족해. 허약하다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = c1c5fdab-93f5-dbfd-95bb-a9a7dec59bb0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CAMP_Astarion_TheHungerC_Kill = True
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_Companion_Murder(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion:c1c5fdab-93f5-dbfd-95bb-a9a7dec59bb0
msgctxt "hfce8e801g87bbg4ea8gb33bg7be86fb082e8"
msgid ""
"*He doesn't finish the thought. It slides away as the light fades from his "
"eyes.*"
msgstr "*그는 생각을 마치지 못합니다. 그는 눈에서 빛이 사라지면서 풀썩 쓰러집니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c2d6f688-9e5e-86d4-bb3f-9339b5882e1a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion:c2d6f688-9e5e-86d4-bb3f-9339b5882e1a
msgctxt "hb176c533g7bd0g4092g87e8g36d1b512b446"
msgid "I don't. That felt wrong."
msgstr "난 아니야. 실수였던 것 같아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = c3210750-7d86-6e13-9acb-338bfc091227
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion:c3210750-7d86-6e13-9acb-338bfc091227
msgctxt "hff855c36gfd2dg45b3gadcagf1e0836f61a9"
msgid "<i>You -</i>"
msgstr "<i>너...</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = c65f816e-3165-d5fe-2169-a49b2b58676c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion:c65f816e-3165-d5fe-2169-a49b2b58676c
msgctxt "h0587df0dg7465g4630g8ca8g2ee64e970adb"
msgid "Thank you. Do you think you could trust me just a little further?"
msgstr "고마워. 나를 조금만 더 믿어 줄래?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = c67fa147-abd5-9ad7-b71b-37975044b8be
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion:c67fa147-abd5-9ad7-b71b-37975044b8be
msgctxt "hc3fbf64egceb2g4073gbc10g2d05c5598008"
msgid "Really? I - of course. Not one drop more."
msgstr "정말? 난... 물론이지. 한 방울도 더는 안 돼."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = c6b44af8-4639-852f-7cce-1ef126f6279d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion:c6b44af8-4639-852f-7cce-1ef126f6279d
msgctxt "h494681b5g7737g4327gb597g6a11ac6cc3b4"
msgid "And look what you've gained. Together, we can take on the world."
msgstr "그리고 네가 얻은 것을 봐. 우리는 함께 세상을 차지할 수 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c8b73d6e-b57a-c9d2-2c9f-fbc448732f9f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - ORI_Astarion_Event_LetAstarionBite(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion:c8b73d6e-b57a-c9d2-2c9f-fbc448732f9f
msgctxt "h1d070612g2e99g4c1eg8e4cg2bee5110a410"
msgid "Go ahead. But be warned - you might bite off more than you can drink."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = cabe4049-95cf-6980-0d76-b948f9574956
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion:cabe4049-95cf-6980-0d76-b948f9574956
msgctxt "h6b2993adg11f7g40c0gbcb9gf10437e8db40"
msgid "Mhh? Oh, of course."
msgstr "음? 오, 알겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = ce3399e5-b447-41cf-83e0-68843d37cd9e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_TadpoledCount4(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_TadpoledCount4(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion:ce3399e5-b447-41cf-83e0-68843d37cd9e
msgctxt "ha418f36dg16f5g46bfgbadcg06844174348f"
msgid ""
"*A shadow swims across your vision, and a familiar voice tells you to be "
"calm. You are loved.*"
msgstr "*그림자가 낀 듯이 눈앞이 흐려지더니, 익숙한 목소리가 당신을 달래줍니다. 사랑이 느껴집니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = d16d8473-b624-874f-97bd-e2c02078c374
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion:d16d8473-b624-874f-97bd-e2c02078c374
msgctxt "h7f0e21ceg7526g4834g8047g1dd444227fa0"
msgid ""
"Don't be so dramatic. This is just a little transaction between friends."
msgstr "너무 극적으로 생각하진 마. 그냥 친구끼리의 작은 거래니까. "

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = d42f84f8-49f6-7e62-ba43-dfa54dcc7941
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion:d42f84f8-49f6-7e62-ba43-dfa54dcc7941
msgctxt "h9f51f67eg1451g4812gbaf7g916d7f368553"
msgid "I wasn't going to hurt you, I swear. I just needed - well, blood."
msgstr "널 다치게 할 생각은 아니었어, 진심이야. 난 그냥... 음, 피가 필요해서."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = d5330ea9-1bc1-ef5d-a241-dfa818c0d763
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion:d5330ea9-1bc1-ef5d-a241-dfa818c0d763
msgctxt "h619281c0g33d6g4b08gb2d2gdd3c1f8ef445"
msgid "Now now, there's no need for that."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = d67af3d6-b7c7-e710-13f3-b4677344fcaf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CAMP_Astarion_TheHungerC_Leave = True
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_Companion_LeaveDisappearInstantly(0) = True
#.   Quest:
#.     - ORI_COM_Astarion.CompanionLowRelation(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion:d67af3d6-b7c7-e710-13f3-b4677344fcaf
msgctxt "h7a91f2d7g579dg41a3g9e4bg244030255cce"
msgid "Fine. See how far you get without me."
msgstr "좋아. 나 없이 어디까지 갈 수 있나 보자고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = d7ae0fc4-39c5-1dca-e502-98bd03215d78
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion:d7ae0fc4-39c5-1dca-e502-98bd03215d78
msgctxt "hc28c0f47ge573g488bg8fb4gbe54d8cffc22"
msgid ""
"At best, I was sure you'd say no. More likely, you'd ram a stake through my "
"ribs."
msgstr "잘해봤자 네가 거절할 거라 확신했어. 오히려 내 가슴팍에 말뚝을 박아넣을 가능성이 높겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d7f3744f-92ae-d630-d1ce-d443f67629cc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 5
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion:d7f3744f-92ae-d630-d1ce-d443f67629cc
msgctxt "hb8bbc78fg523bg49e5gb862g1a427e8164a4"
msgid "That's enough."
msgstr "그 정도면 됐어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = d8d8903d-f1bd-4e80-bbe1-1355d400f9ef
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_TadpoledCount1(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_TadpoledCount1(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion:d8d8903d-f1bd-4e80-bbe1-1355d400f9ef
msgctxt "hd32bf2c4gd377g4dacg8f7ag35d9926d039e"
msgid "*A shiver runs across your mind... You feel sated.*"
msgstr "*전율이 불현듯 머릿속을 스쳐 지나가고... 만족감이 듭니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = dab69ca9-a081-4d79-a69f-0072d4d05ec2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion:dab69ca9-a081-4d79-a69f-0072d4d05ec2
msgctxt "h75135f5dgf606g4fc2ga6efg4160a8561ce5"
msgid ""
"*You focus on the source of the power, but it is quiet and still. It needs "
"to rest.*"
msgstr "*힘의 원천인 존재에 정신을 집중하지만, 응답이 없습니다. 휴식이 필요한 겁니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = dcf73f69-89cb-8d44-03ee-c3e1f6793f5f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion:dcf73f69-89cb-8d44-03ee-c3e1f6793f5f
msgctxt "h20c98c6dgd900g46c8gbdb9gcbf33c8b5849"
msgid "<i>Relax. Let yourself drift away...</i>"
msgstr "<i>차분히 있는다. 정신을 잃을 때까지…</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = ddfb3538-f1df-7b68-1f20-bb66951e3ab5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion:ddfb3538-f1df-7b68-1f20-bb66951e3ab5
msgctxt "hc4bf8824gba01g4817gbe71gbb10cea4a0ff"
msgid "*You watch as he stalks off. Stronger. More confident. Ready to hunt.*"
msgstr "*당신은 그가 떠나는 것을 지켜봅니다. 더 강해졌고, 자신감이 넘칩니다. 사냥할 준비가 되었습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e2512f4e-170e-36f5-450d-0a60c4f9e043
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion:e2512f4e-170e-36f5-450d-0a60c4f9e043
msgctxt "h1c8a7ae8g05c2g42cfg9030g546753d13383"
msgid "I don't care how much you need - you're not drinking my blood."
msgstr "네게 무엇이 필요한지 알게 뭐야- 넌 내 피 한 방울도 못 마셔."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_AstarionHunger_SCO_Companion
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = e30629cc-7473-42cf-8eb6-a420c03ac9f9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_TadpoledCount5(1) = False
