msgid "So you found the seat of the Absolute's power, and what a power it is."
msgstr "절대자의 힘이 어디서 나오는지 찾아내셨군요. 참으로 얼마나 강력한 힘인지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = 23c752c8-1fab-9dbd-a87c-6ca073346ae9
