msgctxt "h933e8d90gb144g4a82ga37dgee217cd102a0"
msgid "The creature that took him away - he was controlling it. But how?"
msgstr "놈을 데려간 괴물 - 놈은 그걸 통제하고 있었어요. 대체 어떻게?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD
