msgctxt "h6140a612g4755g478bgad8fgf6d58793508e"
msgid "The creature that took him away - he was controlling it. But how?"
msgstr "놈을 데려간 괴물 - 놈은 그걸 통제하고 있었어요. 대체 어떻게?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 26eff4b7-7f74-284a-fe29-b9c6a9400a5c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD:26eff4b7-7f74-284a-fe29-b9c6a9400a5c
msgctxt "ha29683a2g12a2g47abg812bg600fc57d14f9"
msgid "You won't give up, will you?"
msgstr "포기하지 않을 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 270aa377-2750-14e9-a5d2-7fc0a76a8081
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD:270aa377-2750-14e9-a5d2-7fc0a76a8081
msgctxt "h6176fe6cgbeacg4882g971dgd523c165eb9d"
msgid "Focus! Don't you dare drop my protection."
msgstr "집중해라! 내 보호막을 깨뜨릴 생각은 추호도 하지 마."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2769e2c9-96c6-07db-2b99-e43eec41722a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD:2769e2c9-96c6-07db-2b99-e43eec41722a
msgctxt "h5cea89d6g4b6fg4ebdg90e8g2e6570550e2f"
msgid "Can I still count on you?"
msgstr "아직 당신을 믿어 봐도 되겠어요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = 282e335b-041d-22de-1f80-23a2990705d8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DAISY_FEMALE_VOICE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD:282e335b-041d-22de-1f80-23a2990705d8
msgctxt "h886963a6g056bg4b77gb030g5357ef900aad"
msgid "I'm not going to argue with you but pray you never find out."
msgstr "논쟁하자는 게 아니에요. 단지 당신이 알 필요 없기만을 기도해 왔을 따름이에요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = 282e335b-041d-22de-1f80-23a2990705d8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DAISY_MALE_VOICE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD:282e335b-041d-22de-1f80-23a2990705d8
msgctxt "h55d9b13cg9fe1g4030g81abge1b73b2c8263"
msgid "I'm not going to argue with you but pray you never find out."
msgstr "논쟁하자는 게 아니에요. 단지 당신이 알 필요 없기만을 기도해 왔을 따름이에요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 28c1143e-d1e8-d5ec-3897-2387d0709dca
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD:28c1143e-d1e8-d5ec-3897-2387d0709dca
msgctxt "h9f3172cbg318dg46d9gaed9g1b490add4697"
msgid "It wasn't even a choice. They needed my help."
msgstr "선택의 여지조차 없었어요. 제 도움을 필요로 했으니까요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2f56f5ef-9692-33ad-2bb7-75932b6239e9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD:2f56f5ef-9692-33ad-2bb7-75932b6239e9
msgctxt "h9bca65acg9749g4646g8b74gaaacebfd8478"
msgid "Let them come. I will face them."
msgstr "오게 두라지. 피할 생각은 없어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = 31e58150-cec9-11b0-b34c-6dbf3d18c82b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DAISY_MALE_VOICE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD:31e58150-cec9-11b0-b34c-6dbf3d18c82b
msgctxt "h62edc47dg91f1g423bgbcc2g0cfc80c7e7cf"
msgid ""
"As long as the Absolute exists, I am trapped within the Prism. I can only "
"control the power from here."
msgstr "절대자가 존재하는 한, 나는 프리즘에 갇혀 있을 수밖에 없어요. 이 안에선 힘을 통제하는 게 고작이죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = 31e58150-cec9-11b0-b34c-6dbf3d18c82b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DAISY_FEMALE_VOICE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD:31e58150-cec9-11b0-b34c-6dbf3d18c82b
msgctxt "he8c320b2gd43ag4e79gbc39gb6017d52dd76"
msgid ""
"As long as the Absolute exists, I am trapped within the Prism. I can only "
"control the power from here."
msgstr "절대자가 존재하는 한, 나는 프리즘에 갇혀 있을 수밖에 없어요. 이 안에선 힘을 통제하는 게 고작이죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = 3281ff18-3dba-3ca2-0bc5-5b5ecfcc9b4b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DAISY_FEMALE_VOICE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD:3281ff18-3dba-3ca2-0bc5-5b5ecfcc9b4b
msgctxt "hf1e0a937gca45g4eabg944eg743478e544dc"
msgid ""
"But now that they know you have the artefact, Vlaakith's forces will hunt "
"you to the ends of the world. Are you afraid?"
msgstr "하지만 당신이 아티팩트를 지니고 있다는 사실을 알았으니, 블라키스의 군대가 세상 끝까지 당신을 쫓아올 겁니다. 두려우신가요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = 3281ff18-3dba-3ca2-0bc5-5b5ecfcc9b4b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DAISY_MALE_VOICE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD:3281ff18-3dba-3ca2-0bc5-5b5ecfcc9b4b
msgctxt "h584393f5g195dg4d92g8ae6ged2b221ccb08"
msgid ""
"But now that they know you have the artefact, Vlaakith's forces will hunt "
"you to the ends of the world. Are you afraid?"
msgstr "하지만 당신이 아티팩트를 지니고 있다는 사실을 알았으니, 블라키스의 군대가 세상 끝까지 당신을 쫓아올 겁니다. 두려우신가요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = 339d4750-44a6-2daa-52e9-e034673833ac
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_AttackOnDen_State_RaiderVictory = True
#. TagRule: DAISY_MALE_VOICE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD:339d4750-44a6-2daa-52e9-e034673833ac
msgctxt "h0a7596ecg3a83g4291g8cf3gb826cdbca243"
msgid ""
"The task ahead is monumental. But you've proven that you have the resolve to "
"do what must be done."
msgstr "가공할 만한 과제들이 우리 앞에 있습니다. 하지만 당신은 해야 할 일을 해내고 말겠다는 의지를 보여 주셨죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = 339d4750-44a6-2daa-52e9-e034673833ac
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
