msgctxt "hcf493ab1g5506g4169g821bg5ed8dafe4b9b"
msgid ""
"The task ahead is monumental. But you've proven that you have the resolve to "
"do what must be done."
msgstr "가공할 만한 과제들이 우리 앞에 있습니다. 하지만 당신은 해야 할 일을 해내고 말겠다는 의지를 보여 주셨죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = 33df22da-7762-67af-c43a-eefa93118677
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DAISY_MALE_VOICE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD:33df22da-7762-67af-c43a-eefa93118677
msgctxt "ha20d91b4g9fd8g4b2bg9de7g4539feee0b78"
msgid "Better enjoyment than regret."
msgstr "회한보다는 즐거움이 낫지요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = 33df22da-7762-67af-c43a-eefa93118677
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DAISY_FEMALE_VOICE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD:33df22da-7762-67af-c43a-eefa93118677
msgctxt "hfe12ad35gd2c4g490fg8e82g6f431ac46495"
msgid "Better enjoyment than regret."
msgstr "회한보다는 즐거움이 낫지요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 36ce7ce7-6190-7574-3091-aa0750ec75d3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD:36ce7ce7-6190-7574-3091-aa0750ec75d3
msgctxt "h2c3b5a81gc4fbg44b8g8801g74b956704206"
msgid "Yes. I am full of regret."
msgstr "맞아요. 후회가 막심해요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = 3bfd009f-9ed2-c801-59b1-4b85d9bd252c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DAISY_MALE_VOICE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD:3bfd009f-9ed2-c801-59b1-4b85d9bd252c
msgctxt "h73869bd5g4061g43a5ga309gaa7d3ae8dedc"
msgid ""
"We have to work together or the Absolute will enthral us both. I cannot keep "
"this up indefinitely."
msgstr ""
"우리는 함께 맞서야 해요. 그러지 않으면 절대자가 우리 둘 모두를 노예로 만들고 말겠죠. 이 보호막을 언제까지나 유지할 순 없어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = 3bfd009f-9ed2-c801-59b1-4b85d9bd252c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DAISY_FEMALE_VOICE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD:3bfd009f-9ed2-c801-59b1-4b85d9bd252c
msgctxt "h4fd273e1g042bg40ddgb945g3ebd4002528a"
msgid ""
"We have to work together or the Absolute will enthral us both. I cannot keep "
"this up indefinitely."
msgstr ""
"우리는 함께 맞서야 해요. 그러지 않으면 절대자가 우리 둘 모두를 노예로 만들고 말겠죠. 이 보호막을 언제까지나 유지할 순 없어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3cc7cd48-cac9-1107-fa44-161e0364a6b3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD:3cc7cd48-cac9-1107-fa44-161e0364a6b3
msgctxt "hf30dfad5g93bag4e1fg8d54g19098453b78a"
msgid "It was a waste of time. I regret it now."
msgstr "시간 낭비였어요. 후회되는군요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = 460745c2-347c-2594-cc02-9b4f1f212196
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DAISY_MALE_VOICE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD:460745c2-347c-2594-cc02-9b4f1f212196
msgctxt "h3819701egc6d0g49b8gbab0g49098764ceb6"
msgid "Does what happened in the grove bother you?"
msgstr "숲에서 일어났던 일이 당신을 괴롭히나요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = 460745c2-347c-2594-cc02-9b4f1f212196
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DAISY_FEMALE_VOICE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD:460745c2-347c-2594-cc02-9b4f1f212196
msgctxt "h5b9bcb97g2dd5g4050gb7feg9c58090676c6"
msgid "Does what happened in the grove bother you?"
msgstr "숲에서 일어났던 일이 당신을 괴롭히나요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 460b322c-bdf8-a8bf-61fa-d3280ef8cc3e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD:460b322c-bdf8-a8bf-61fa-d3280ef8cc3e
msgctxt "h57385f20g4b96g4a9eg83efg715ea656bda9"
msgid "Thank you."
msgstr "고마워요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = 47efbbe7-fa5c-2be1-0024-ec3fd4e8b227
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DAISY_MALE_VOICE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD:47efbbe7-fa5c-2be1-0024-ec3fd4e8b227
msgctxt "h1dd4b1bbg8c77g41c8ga23bgbf40141c1e4c"
msgid ""
"For what it's worth, you made the right choice. If we don't accomplish "
"<i>our</i> goals, none of this matters. Not their fate, not anyone's."
msgstr ""
"결과야 어쨌든, 옳은 선택을 하셨어요. 만약 우리가 <i>우리의</i> 목적을 달성하지 못한다면, 아무것도 중요하지 않아요. 그들의 "
"운명이 됐든, 누구의 운명이 됐든 말이에요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = 47efbbe7-fa5c-2be1-0024-ec3fd4e8b227
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DAISY_FEMALE_VOICE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD:47efbbe7-fa5c-2be1-0024-ec3fd4e8b227
msgctxt "h431b02cag7cefg4823g89a9g7099960d2c97"
msgid ""
"For what it's worth, you made the right choice. If we don't accomplish "
"<i>our</i> goals, none of this matters. Not their fate, not anyone's."
msgstr ""
"결과야 어쨌든, 옳은 선택을 하셨어요. 만약 우리가 <i>우리의</i> 목적을 달성하지 못한다면, 아무것도 중요하지 않아요. 그들의 "
"운명이 됐든, 누구의 운명이 됐든 말이에요."

