msgid ""
"It just doesn't stop. We are being bombarded by waves of telepathic energy."
msgstr "좀처럼 멎질 않는군요. 우린 텔레파시 에너지 파동에 포격당하고 있어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = 7cc45858-6829-c4d9-6424-ad34d04188c5
