#. TagRule: DAISY_MALE_VOICE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD:7cc45858-6829-c4d9-6424-ad34d04188c5
msgctxt "h7c1b6ee2g5a59g4401gbdfage3fce5b9a720"
msgid ""
"I would've picked another route than assaulting the Absolute in its seat of "
"power, at least until I knew what we were up against. But you made the "
"choice for us."
msgstr ""
"저라면 우리가 누구를 상대하는지 알아내기 전까지는 절대자의 권좌를 습격하지 않았을 거예요. 다른 길을 찾았겠죠. 하지만 당신은 모두를 "
"위한 용단을 내리셨어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD
