msgctxt "h0de785b7ga37cg46fcgb0bfg21c5b3a29a34"
msgid ""
"You don't care what others think of you. You just follow your instincts."
msgstr "당신은 남들이 어떻게 생각하든 신경 쓰지 않아요. 단지 본능을 따를 뿐이죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = 8277f5c3-d5e7-99b9-7f95-316bcb0cdcd6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DAISY_MALE_VOICE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD:8277f5c3-d5e7-99b9-7f95-316bcb0cdcd6
msgctxt "hc84f2ce4g1d00g49a8ga72dg46aef5e2e4bc"
msgid ""
"I am the only one who can resist the Absolute's influence. Hence its fear of "
"me, its <i>desperation</i>."
msgstr "절대자의 영향력에 저항할 수 있는 건 나뿐이에요. 그래서 놈이 나를 두려워하는 거죠. <i>절박한</i> 심정으로요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD
