msgctxt "hb426d511g60b6g457egb343gbdb0b9db5360"
msgid ""
"I am the only one who can resist the Absolute's influence. Hence its fear of "
"me, its <i>desperation</i>."
msgstr "절대자의 영향력에 저항할 수 있는 건 나뿐이에요. 그래서 놈이 나를 두려워하는 거죠. <i>절박한</i> 심정으로요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = 84293b4c-c2fd-d8bd-e5df-21be6e95a69d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DAISY_MALE_VOICE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD:84293b4c-c2fd-d8bd-e5df-21be6e95a69d
msgctxt "h309d375dg9be8g4d87ga017gabddcf580714"
msgid ""
"In any case, the Absolute knows you carry me with you now. It wants to "
"retrieve me."
msgstr "좌우간 절대자는 당신이 나를 데리고 있다는 걸 알고 있어요. 놈은 나를 되찾고 싶어하죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD
