msgctxt "h95e0f457gfb28g44a9g9297g3b3dff907391"
msgid ""
"In any case, the Absolute knows you carry me with you now. It wants to "
"retrieve me."
msgstr "좌우간 절대자는 당신이 나를 데리고 있다는 걸 알고 있어요. 놈은 나를 되찾고 싶어하죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
