msgid ""
"No. It belonged to another. But that is not for you to concern yourself with."
msgstr "아니요. 다른 데서 빌려온 것입니다. 하지만 당신은 신경 쓰지 않는 편이 좋겠어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = 89a9c437-a15a-3705-b8ef-fa0a4ba1439b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DAISY_MALE_VOICE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD:89a9c437-a15a-3705-b8ef-fa0a4ba1439b
msgctxt "h4ffd30efg6411g46edg896bgf476ed0cae8a"
msgid ""
"You've shown your loyalty to the Absolute, but to gain an audience with it, "
"you must prove yourself to Ketheric Thorm."
msgstr "당신은 절대자에 대한 충성심을 보여 주었지만, 절대자와의 알현을 확정지으려면 케서릭 쏨에게 스스로를 증명해야 합니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD
