msgid "Pull yourself together. We've got work to do."
msgstr "정신을 다잡으세요. 우리에겐 해야 할 일이 있어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a806e219-f23e-e4a7-0c78-f5d32022d8b1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD:a806e219-f23e-e4a7-0c78-f5d32022d8b1
msgctxt "h26ebf446gbd89g43e6gb7e6g624535405409"
msgid "What is it?"
msgstr "무슨 일이죠?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = aa1c7d9b-466e-5eb1-1625-36d1be936557
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD:aa1c7d9b-466e-5eb1-1625-36d1be936557
msgctxt "h5c4295f7g9683g461bg87eag94cc4d471af0"
msgid "Don't get used to it. I'm more of the strong and silent type."
msgstr "너무 익숙해 지진 마요. 난 강하고 조용한 성격이니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = ab59f175-96f7-a33b-941e-4f5a35bb41f1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DAISY_MALE_VOICE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD:ab59f175-96f7-a33b-941e-4f5a35bb41f1
msgctxt "h44d02880g2065g4ccega6a9g4285d93d32b5"
msgid ""
"You could have helped the people in the grove, but what then? The cultists' "
"influence is growing by the day, and the road to Baldur's Gate is long."
msgstr ""
"숲에 있는 사람들을 도울 수도 있었지만, 그런 다음에는요? 숭배자들의 영향력은 나날이 팽창하고 있으며, 발더스 게이트로 가는 길은 "
"멀기까지 합니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = ab59f175-96f7-a33b-941e-4f5a35bb41f1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DAISY_FEMALE_VOICE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD:ab59f175-96f7-a33b-941e-4f5a35bb41f1
msgctxt "hed74f83bge43fg4639g9d30gb02b0a598f61"
msgid ""
"You could have helped the people in the grove, but what then? The cultists' "
"influence is growing by the day, and the road to Baldur's Gate is long."
msgstr ""
"숲에 있는 사람들을 도울 수도 있었지만, 그런 다음에는요? 숭배자들의 영향력은 나날이 팽창하고 있으며, 발더스 게이트로 가는 길은 "
"멀기까지 합니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b245440e-7212-c06e-6ae5-101d0db13a38
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_SavingPrisoners_Knows_CapturedTieflings = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD:b245440e-7212-c06e-6ae5-101d0db13a38
msgctxt "h89187c95g4dccg48f0gb5e1gd436d6ca5e0d"
msgid ""
"I did what I could, but I'm not sure they'll survive out there on their own."
msgstr "제 할 일은 끝냈지만, 그들이 스스로를 지켜낼 수 있을지는 모르겠군요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b5731e11-f550-8f3d-d949-de09e3f8a555
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD:b5731e11-f550-8f3d-d949-de09e3f8a555
msgctxt "h50434b77gd62cg4de1g8ca5g3d426f63eb9f"
msgid "I try not to think about it."
msgstr "생각하지 않으려고 애쓰고 있어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = ba164a40-bfa5-3e93-3600-792af01de7b8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_MoonriseTower_EverEnteredBefore = True
#. TagRule: DAISY_FEMALE_VOICE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD:ba164a40-bfa5-3e93-3600-792af01de7b8
msgctxt "h9a58b894gfd7bg4ee8g861egd4b08ad67b99"
msgid ""
"You're on the right track. It's in Moonrise Towers. But I don't know where "
"exactly."
msgstr "제대로 가고 계세요. 문라이즈 타워 내부가 확실해요. 하지만 정확히 어디인지는 모르겠어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = ba164a40-bfa5-3e93-3600-792af01de7b8
