msgctxt "h73baca56ge732g4a06gaa8bgd5a28fba6c27"
msgid ""
"You're on the right track. It's in Moonrise Towers. But I don't know where "
"exactly."
msgstr "제대로 가고 계세요. 문라이즈 타워 내부가 확실해요. 하지만 정확히 어디인지는 모르겠어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = bdb68b2a-555e-f786-34b7-876a864d0b63
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
