msgctxt "h4e7ccf79g286ag47a5ga916g6c75e209c1a5"
msgid "Of course."
msgstr "물론이죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = bebbddc4-f2ce-5638-e2b0-08a485905adb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DAISY_FEMALE_VOICE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD:bebbddc4-f2ce-5638-e2b0-08a485905adb
msgctxt "hbb008c54g140fg4e96g859cg8d22acb20eb4"
msgid "Of course."
msgstr "물론이죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bf9c5fc4-268f-26e4-487d-8b85be98dd52
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD:bf9c5fc4-268f-26e4-487d-8b85be98dd52
msgctxt "h8edf6b44g0c66g4c6dgb32bge21f7beec14d"
msgid "So you keep on saying. Why should I believe you?"
msgstr "항상 같은 소리. 내가 왜 당신을 믿어야 하지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = c2b0109e-cff7-ad5e-0c78-53778f05c5f7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DAISY_MALE_VOICE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD:c2b0109e-cff7-ad5e-0c78-53778f05c5f7
msgctxt "h0022fd19gdad9g42e6ga694g776c38987a09"
msgid ""
"Time works differently here. It's hard to explain. Sometimes I can barely "
"even remember what it was like before..."
msgstr "여기선 시간이 다르게 흐른답니다. 설명하긴 어렵지만, 가끔은 예전의 내 삶이 어땠는지 기억조차 나지 않아요..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = c2b0109e-cff7-ad5e-0c78-53778f05c5f7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DAISY_FEMALE_VOICE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD:c2b0109e-cff7-ad5e-0c78-53778f05c5f7
msgctxt "h3947b757g513cg4493g9ffege5b930986427"
msgid ""
"Time works differently here. It's hard to explain. Sometimes I can barely "
"even remember what it was like before..."
msgstr "여기선 시간이 다르게 흐른답니다. 설명하긴 어렵지만, 가끔은 예전의 내 삶이 어땠는지 기억조차 나지 않아요..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ca4c7282-f87f-459f-a08f-c8d5bd497275
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD:ca4c7282-f87f-459f-a08f-c8d5bd497275
msgctxt "h7393f097gcf54g4aacg9bf1g25b98f4bd9ef"
msgid "I'm not proud of leaving people behind. I wish I'd helped."
msgstr "사람들을 남겨 두고 온 건 전혀 자랑스럽지 않아요. 난 그들에게 도움이 되길 바랐어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cea70dc2-9d05-8d1c-6fd4-5ba9e99fba1c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_AstralPrison_State_SpokeWithDaisy = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD:cea70dc2-9d05-8d1c-6fd4-5ba9e99fba1c
msgctxt "hec42a2bcg5972g4a6ag82b1g0014ae56c530"
msgid "Just how long have you been trapped inside that Prism?"
msgstr "도대체 프리즘 안에 얼마나 오랫동안 갇혀 있었던 거예요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = d020b0fe-d5f0-f13f-423f-40769809a490
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DAISY_MALE_VOICE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD:d020b0fe-d5f0-f13f-423f-40769809a490
msgctxt "hf2531ad9g6be0g4d59g9a1eg44076590e149"
msgid ""
"Our task is more important, yes, and yet you did not begrudge others their "
"lesser needs. For what it's worth, I think you did the right thing."
msgstr ""
"물론, 우리에게 맡겨진 임무가 더 중요하긴 하죠. 그래도 도움의 크기가 사소하다고 해서 아깝게 여기신 적은 없잖아요. 그만한 가치가 "
"있었어요. 저는 당신이 옳은 일을 하셨다고 봅니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = d020b0fe-d5f0-f13f-423f-40769809a490
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DAISY_FEMALE_VOICE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD:d020b0fe-d5f0-f13f-423f-40769809a490
msgctxt "ha2603622geaf8g4b66g931bg03aef8419b06"
msgid ""
"Our task is more important, yes, and yet you did not begrudge others their "
"lesser needs. For what it's worth, I think you did the right thing."
msgstr ""
"물론, 우리에게 맡겨진 임무가 더 중요하긴 하죠. 그래도 도움의 크기가 사소하다고 해서 아깝게 여기신 적은 없잖아요. 그만한 가치가 "
"있었어요. 저는 당신이 옳은 일을 하셨다고 봅니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD
