#. TagRule: DAISY_MALE_VOICE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD:d312c69b-388a-fe0e-1905-bd775e21cbdf
msgctxt "h3f19eac1g3ff1g42e6g8a7cg19fe56f5c8a2"
msgid "Who's to say they would even have survived?"
msgstr "그들이 살아남을 거라고 어떻게 장담할 수 있을까요?"

