msgctxt "hae5d853bgdb79g4e46gbb1dgbd1643c1a45d"
msgid ""
"Each wave, a set of orders to the infected. The order for your "
"transformation has been given many times already."
msgstr "각 파동마다 일련의 명령이 감염자들에게 내려져요. 당신의 변신 명령은 이미 몇 차례나 전달되었죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f32e7c66-8b17-3acd-95c5-1f0dabc345e3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_State_LeadersAreDead = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD:f32e7c66-8b17-3acd-95c5-1f0dabc345e3
msgctxt "h9d23f639gb281g4485gbca3g5aca27f21dee"
msgid "I didn't do it for them. The goblins were in my way, so I killed them."
msgstr "그들을 살리자고 한 일이 아니야. 단지 고블린들이 길을 막길래 죽여버렸을 뿐."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_AvD
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = f36d1385-080c-5689-4e35-37d11295169f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DAISY_MALE_VOICE
