#. TagRule: DAISY_MALE_VOICE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyMissionStatement_AvD:089728c1-12ca-5b05-a1c4-99918ed6c5a9
msgctxt "h1ea4088cg1506g4f39gac4eg28932aeffb94"
msgid ""
"Just like you, I was infected with a mind flayer parasite. Just like you, I "
"seek to be free of it."
msgstr "나도 당신처럼 마인드 플레이어의 유충에 감염됐고, 벗어나는 방법을 찾고 있으니까요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyMissionStatement_AvD
