msgctxt "hb6bedf28g20d0g4adeg982cg8472eda8a246"
msgid ""
"Just like you, I was infected with a mind flayer parasite. Just like you, I "
"seek to be free of it."
msgstr "나도 당신처럼 마인드 플레이어의 유충에 감염됐고, 벗어나는 방법을 찾고 있으니까요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyMissionStatement_AvD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0d4abdc8-784f-2211-0e07-02017d6a2b30
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer_State_ConnectionPerformed = True
#.   Local:
#.      - 7b3381d2-bfa3-a808-11bc-ac75a74655b0_OmeluumAttemptReferenced = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyMissionStatement_AvD:0d4abdc8-784f-2211-0e07-02017d6a2b30
msgctxt "hea2c5ffagdc98g4b49ga1e5gf2627f057739"
msgid ""
"Omeluum mentioned some sort of strange magic preventing the tadpole from "
"being removed - what do you know about that?"
msgstr "오멜룸 말로는 기이한 마법이 올챙이를 제거하지 못하게 막고 있다던데, 혹시 아는 바 있나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyMissionStatement_AvD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 10416dc7-3be7-ef9d-152c-d08eeac939bf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyMissionStatement_AvD:10416dc7-3be7-ef9d-152c-d08eeac939bf
msgctxt "h374d65ceg6444g422fgb558gb1223e4e6aec"
msgid "I couldn't find anyone who could help me."
msgstr "도와줄 사람을 찾지 못했어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyMissionStatement_AvD
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = 119eff54-c18f-7c96-9851-19d96fd1bf2f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DAISY_MALE_VOICE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyMissionStatement_AvD:119eff54-c18f-7c96-9851-19d96fd1bf2f
msgctxt "hb3d43ea5gdc03g4f60g80cdga4a92d3ddf01"
msgid "Hells. They need me. I have to go."
msgstr "젠장. 그들에게 제 힘이 필요해요. 돌아가야겠어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyMissionStatement_AvD
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = 119eff54-c18f-7c96-9851-19d96fd1bf2f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DAISY_FEMALE_VOICE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyMissionStatement_AvD:119eff54-c18f-7c96-9851-19d96fd1bf2f
msgctxt "h4036d05fga95cg438bg8c00gb6fd084c3964"
msgid "Hells. They need me. I have to go."
msgstr "젠장. 그들에게 제 힘이 필요해요. 돌아가야겠어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyMissionStatement_AvD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1358aec5-80e1-d803-d710-3c2b4225ce88
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_WolfPens_State_HalsinIntroHappened = True
#.   Local:
#.      - 7b3381d2-bfa3-a808-11bc-ac75a74655b0_HalsinAttemptReferenced = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyMissionStatement_AvD:1358aec5-80e1-d803-d710-3c2b4225ce88
msgctxt "hda3ae4acg6501g49c5g86fdgda7852b31f5c"
msgid "Halsin mentioned that these tadpoles have been modified with magic."
msgstr "할신은 이 올챙이들이 마법에 의해 변질되었다고 말했어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyMissionStatement_AvD
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = 1480ab29-98ce-0ef1-4825-c74fbee372fc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DAISY_MALE_VOICE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyMissionStatement_AvD:1480ab29-98ce-0ef1-4825-c74fbee372fc
msgctxt "heef59328gfb23g47a0g9b90g900ab0537b2f"
msgid ""
"I have kept a careful watch on the movements of the cult. Though the "
"Absolute's aims are not yet clear to me, its methods are."
msgstr "전 그 추종 집단의 움직임을 면밀히 관찰해 왔어요.절대자의 목적은 아직 불분명하지만, 그 수단은 분명해요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyMissionStatement_AvD
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = 1480ab29-98ce-0ef1-4825-c74fbee372fc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DAISY_FEMALE_VOICE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyMissionStatement_AvD:1480ab29-98ce-0ef1-4825-c74fbee372fc
msgctxt "h52b01153g742ag4dddgade5g25cb90d108a8"
msgid ""
"I have kept a careful watch on the movements of the cult. Though the "
"Absolute's aims are not yet clear to me, its methods are."
msgstr "전 그 추종 집단의 움직임을 면밀히 관찰해 왔어요.절대자의 목적은 아직 불분명하지만, 그 수단은 분명해요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyMissionStatement_AvD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 15216748-2176-4dcf-07b2-1d1ffa10794b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyMissionStatement_AvD:15216748-2176-4dcf-07b2-1d1ffa10794b
msgctxt "h6d9d30d0g9671g4c10g965fgc8b6d387e0c1"
msgid "I never want to live in the darkness again."
msgstr "다시는 어둠 속으로 돌아가고 싶지 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyMissionStatement_AvD
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = 153cfa57-eab4-dd96-54fa-f5db1bb1998f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DAISY_MALE_VOICE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyMissionStatement_AvD:153cfa57-eab4-dd96-54fa-f5db1bb1998f
msgctxt "h06d84d18g9014g49acgbd64gf7715b4db6ae"
msgid ""
"Now, through you, I've been given a new chance. You can go where I cannot. "
"And I can protect you from that evil."
msgstr ""
"이제, 당신 덕분에, 새로운 기회가 찾아왔어요. 당신은 제가 갈 수 없는 곳을 갈 수 있어요. 그리고 저는 악으로부터 당신을 보호할 수 "
"있고요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyMissionStatement_AvD
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = 153cfa57-eab4-dd96-54fa-f5db1bb1998f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DAISY_FEMALE_VOICE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyMissionStatement_AvD:153cfa57-eab4-dd96-54fa-f5db1bb1998f
msgctxt "h71c63bd1g4b44g43f7g9c35g9c8c13c4d0ed"
msgid ""
"Now, through you, I've been given a new chance. You can go where I cannot. "
"And I can protect you from that evil."
msgstr ""
"이제, 당신 덕분에, 새로운 기회가 찾아왔어요. 당신은 제가 갈 수 없는 곳을 갈 수 있어요. 그리고 저는 악으로부터 당신을 보호할 수 "
"있고요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyMissionStatement_AvD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 163cf0e7-88c1-1889-b6a4-2c941c7c94a2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyMissionStatement_AvD:163cf0e7-88c1-1889-b6a4-2c941c7c94a2
msgctxt "h0f33cb9egb6adg4fb5g8d29ge6920091942a"
msgid "Why are you protecting me?"
msgstr "날 왜 지켜주는 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyMissionStatement_AvD
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = 1810e4d6-3cb5-0ed9-b2e9-76e1f05460c1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Nettie_State_SoughtTadpoleCure = True
#. TagRule: DAISY_MALE_VOICE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyMissionStatement_AvD:1810e4d6-3cb5-0ed9-b2e9-76e1f05460c1
msgctxt "hebcd86e6g2842g415bgb348g1719e45bd470"
msgid ""
"You thought Nettie might be able to help you in the druids' grove. But all "
"she did was reaffirm the danger."
msgstr "드루이드 숲의 네티에게 도움을 빌리고자 하셨지만, 그녀가 한 일이라곤 위험을 재차 확인한 것뿐이죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyMissionStatement_AvD
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = 1810e4d6-3cb5-0ed9-b2e9-76e1f05460c1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Nettie_State_SoughtTadpoleCure = True
#. TagRule: DAISY_FEMALE_VOICE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyMissionStatement_AvD:1810e4d6-3cb5-0ed9-b2e9-76e1f05460c1
msgctxt "h9d7b14c4g76ffg4fc5gaa57ga4aa704e0ee6"
msgid ""
"You thought Nettie might be able to help you in the druids' grove. But all "
