msgid "Good - conserve your energy."
msgstr "좋아요 - 힘을 아끼세요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyMissionStatement_AvD
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = 9962acff-0333-2bb3-2523-014683ee8fc8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Absolute_Knows_TrueSoul = True
#. TagRule: DAISY_MALE_VOICE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyMissionStatement_AvD:9962acff-0333-2bb3-2523-014683ee8fc8
msgctxt "haac62ef0g439ag4135gbcd0g65e162af298f"
msgid ""
"The highest of their rank are called True Souls. They carry a tadpole just "
"like yours. It is how they receive their orders. It is what makes them "
"<i>obey</i>."
msgstr ""
"숭배자들 중 가장 높은 계급을 참된 영혼이라 부르는데 당신과 마찬가지로 올챙이가 심어져 있어요. 이를 통해 명령을 받고 <i>복종</"
"i>하게 되죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyMissionStatement_AvD
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = 9962acff-0333-2bb3-2523-014683ee8fc8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Absolute_Knows_TrueSoul = True
#. TagRule: DAISY_FEMALE_VOICE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyMissionStatement_AvD:9962acff-0333-2bb3-2523-014683ee8fc8
msgctxt "h9eb06272g612ag4a3cga6a0g5a63c118fedd"
msgid ""
"The highest of their rank are called True Souls. They carry a tadpole just "
"like yours. It is how they receive their orders. It is what makes them "
"<i>obey</i>."
msgstr ""
"숭배자들 중 가장 높은 계급을 참된 영혼이라 부르는데 당신과 마찬가지로 올챙이를 지니고 있어요. 이를 통해 명령을 받고 <i>복종</"
"i>하게 되죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyMissionStatement_AvD
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = 9b5b7eef-adab-033f-b948-9075718682be
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DAISY_MALE_VOICE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyMissionStatement_AvD:9b5b7eef-adab-033f-b948-9075718682be
msgctxt "h354db1fcgd4abg4919g9a1bgf3f457b684e5"
msgid ""
"From transforming into a mind flayer, yes. But that is not the only thing "
"these parasites can do."
msgstr "마인드 플레이어로 변이되는 걸 막아주긴 하지. 하지만 유충이 하는 일이 그것만 있는 건 아니야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyMissionStatement_AvD
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = 9b5b7eef-adab-033f-b948-9075718682be
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DAISY_FEMALE_VOICE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyMissionStatement_AvD:9b5b7eef-adab-033f-b948-9075718682be
msgctxt "hf720dd5dg999eg4d56gbfe2ga73c57d382a4"
msgid ""
"From transforming into a mind flayer, yes. But that is not the only thing "
"these parasites can do."
msgstr "마인드 플레이어로 변이되는 걸 막아주긴 하지. 하지만 유충이 하는 일이 그것만 있는 건 아니야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyMissionStatement_AvD
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = 9be2cf72-112e-fd9d-a174-8650e1a94d78
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DAISY_FEMALE_VOICE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyMissionStatement_AvD:9be2cf72-112e-fd9d-a174-8650e1a94d78
msgctxt "h72451a26ga525g40c4g8f3dg9a1c20054290"
msgid ""
"When the order to transform is given, it will not be a matter of days - they "
"will be mind flayers in an instant."
msgstr "변이 명령이 내려지면 며칠씩 걸리지도 않을 거예요 - 순식간에 마인드 플레이어로 변할 테죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyMissionStatement_AvD
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = 9be2cf72-112e-fd9d-a174-8650e1a94d78
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DAISY_MALE_VOICE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyMissionStatement_AvD:9be2cf72-112e-fd9d-a174-8650e1a94d78
msgctxt "h08d66c38g382eg4150g9bd8g8902fdcbcc42"
msgid ""
"When the order to transform is given, it will not be a matter of days - they "
"will be mind flayers in an instant."
msgstr "변이 명령이 내려지면 며칠씩 걸리지도 않을 거예요 - 순식간에 마인드 플레이어로 변할 테죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyMissionStatement_AvD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9e37d7c9-5a8c-9af5-dd9c-8b8472ea7357
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - NIGHT_DarkUrge_ButlerIntro = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyMissionStatement_AvD:9e37d7c9-5a8c-9af5-dd9c-8b8472ea7357
msgctxt "h61dc64f4g8a87g417fga71bg13ff96b7dd82"
msgid ""
"I don't care about the tadpole. I have been offered a greater power by my "
"butler."
msgstr "난 올챙이 따위엔 관심 없어. 내 집사가 훨씬 더 강력한 힘을 약속했거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyMissionStatement_AvD
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = a16ef25b-a327-cc3f-446e-9c4d6822dc3b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DAISY_MALE_VOICE
