msgctxt "h1723112eg8708g418ega8b5gc7086c406a00"
msgid ""
"You must discover the source of the magic that controls the parasites before "
"that happens."
msgstr "그런 위기가 닥쳐오기 전에 기생충을 조종하는 마법의 근원을 찾아내셔야만 해요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyMissionStatement_AvD
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = a1d8b17e-9203-7abc-27ed-62702cc4d323
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DAISY_FEMALE_VOICE
