msgctxt "hbdb4e48bg26e3g480agb011ga2570d33a2b1"
msgid "It may not transform you immediately, but it's only a matter of time."
msgstr "지금 당장은 변이하지 않는 것 같아도, 결국 시간 문제일 뿐이예요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyMissionStatement_AvD
