msgctxt "h4a4df8b3g332fg49afg8bedge0b5004b7577"
msgid "How do I destroy the source of the tadpole's magic?"
msgstr "올챙이에 얽힌 마법의 근원을 어떻게 파괴하지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyMissionStatement_AvD
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = ba33f77a-9dbc-9b6d-eecf-85e9c1004ff3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer_State_ConnectionPerformed = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 7b3381d2-bfa3-a808-11bc-ac75a74655b0_OmeluumAttemptReferenced = True
#. TagRule: DAISY_MALE_VOICE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyMissionStatement_AvD:ba33f77a-9dbc-9b6d-eecf-85e9c1004ff3
msgctxt "h6880a768gba33g4d51g8d88g38303a1ce3fb"
msgid ""
"You thought a mind flayer might know how to extricate one of its own from "
"you, but Omeluum couldn't help you. Your tadpole lives."
msgstr ""
"마인드 플레이어라면 동족인 올챙이를 간단히 끄집어낼 수 있을 거라 생각하셨지만, 오멜룸은 도움이 되지 않았어요. 올챙이는 여전히 살아 "
"있죠."

