#. TagRule: DAISY_FEMALE_VOICE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyMissionStatement_AvD:ba33f77a-9dbc-9b6d-eecf-85e9c1004ff3
msgctxt "h9e49d81ag2b3fg43a3g9bf2gedb19687eac9"
msgid ""
"You thought a mind flayer might know how to extricate one of its own from "
"you, but Omeluum couldn't help you. Your tadpole lives."
msgstr ""
"마인드 플레이어라면 동족인 올챙이를 간단히 끄집어낼 수 있을 거라 생각하셨지만, 오멜룸은 도움이 되지 않았어요. 올챙이는 여전히 살아 "
"있죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyMissionStatement_AvD
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = bf6b6b6c-058c-ac4f-5649-d69c62432fa8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Tadpole_PartyMetATrueSoul = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Absolute_Knows_TrueSoul = True
#. TagRule: DAISY_MALE_VOICE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyMissionStatement_AvD:bf6b6b6c-058c-ac4f-5649-d69c62432fa8
msgctxt "hfe4c8825gcedbg428fgbc6fgc7e08efed047"
msgid ""
"The highest of their rank - the True Souls - carry a tadpole just like "
"yours. It is how they receive their orders. It is what makes them "
"<i>obey</i>."
msgstr ""
"숭배자들 중 가장 높은 계급인 참된 영혼들은 당신과 마찬가지로 올챙이를 지니고 있어요. 이를 통해 명령을 받고 <i>복종</i>하게 되죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyMissionStatement_AvD
