msgctxt "h643bf4a9gdcc3g4124ga1a8g8c0e661bfe67"
msgid ""
"The highest of their rank - the True Souls - carry a tadpole just like "
"yours. It is how they receive their orders. It is what makes them "
"<i>obey</i>."
msgstr ""
"숭배자들 중 가장 높은 계급인 참된 영혼들은 당신처럼 올챙이를 지니고 있어요. 이를 통해 명령을 받고 <i>복종</i>하게 되죠."

