msgctxt "h23dd9defg25cbg4f41gb6bagaed0aaba9b71"
msgid ""
"We share a common cause and a common enemy. Allegiances have been built on "
"less."
msgstr "우린 공통의 목표와 공통의 적을 공유하고 있어요. 동맹 관계는 훨씬 더 보잘 것 없는 조건에서 구축되기도 하죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyMissionStatement_AvD
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = c3b57be0-d22c-3122-8a52-26ff2a6823a0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DAISY_MALE_VOICE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyMissionStatement_AvD:c3b57be0-d22c-3122-8a52-26ff2a6823a0
msgctxt "h69f68e8agd262g4f6agb72bgb1b5fd1db5eb"
msgid ""
"I've been trying to escape from this evil for a long time. Once, I almost "
"succeeded."
msgstr "전 오랫동안 이 악으로부터 벗어나기 위해 시도해 왔어요. 한 번은 거의 성공할 뻔했죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyMissionStatement_AvD
