msgctxt "hce899e4agdbf2g49e0gb953g419aff64402e"
msgid ""
"I've been trying to escape from this evil for a long time. Once, I almost "
"succeeded."
msgstr "전 오랫동안 이 악으로부터 벗어나기 위해 시도해 왔어요. 한 번은 거의 성공할 뻔했죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyMissionStatement_AvD
