msgctxt "ha404a4afg0d83g4eadg851bg0f1932a55d8c"
msgid "I'm worried I'll go mad if I take it out."
msgstr "놈을 머릿속에서 꺼내면 미쳐버릴지도 몰라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyMissionStatement_AvD
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = c6cded40-4651-ef01-4185-e31156804bbb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DAISY_MALE_VOICE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyMissionStatement_AvD:c6cded40-4651-ef01-4185-e31156804bbb
msgctxt "h376c5ab0g3eddg4cadg8680gd15bef834bac"
msgid ""
"Use the powers your parasite gives you to convince them you are one of them. "
"And when you find the source of their magic, destroy it."
msgstr ""
"기생충의 힘을 적극 사용해, 놈들이 당신을 같은 편이라고 믿게 만드세요. 그리고 놈들이 사용하는 마법의 근원을 찾거든 없애버리세요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyMissionStatement_AvD
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = c6cded40-4651-ef01-4185-e31156804bbb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
