msgctxt "h40096534gcc7ag4f80g9f98ga840d243da02"
msgid ""
"Use the powers your parasite gives you to convince them you are one of them. "
"And when you find the source of their magic, destroy it."
msgstr ""
"기생충의 힘을 적극 사용해, 놈들이 당신을 같은 편이라고 믿게 만드세요. 그리고 놈들이 사용하는 마법의 근원을 찾거든 없애버리세요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyMissionStatement_AvD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c8db93d5-624a-a9c0-5471-75fc52a7247b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
