msgctxt "h62b48f37g901eg4179gbe02g9dee6f8d48f2"
msgid ""
"You were lucky that Omeluum realised this before he attempted a fatal "
"extraction."
msgstr "오멜륨이 치명적인 수술을 시도하기 전에 이를 알게 되어 천만다행이에요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyMissionStatement_AvD
