msgid ""
"You were lucky that Omeluum realised this before he attempted a fatal "
"extraction."
msgstr "오멜륨이 치명적인 수술을 시도하기 전에 이를 알게 되어 천만다행이에요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyMissionStatement_AvD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f8670184-96e6-32cf-ced9-3b3dc0c6b113
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyMissionStatement_AvD:f8670184-96e6-32cf-ced9-3b3dc0c6b113
msgctxt "he0f96dedg596ag40a3ga1fbgdfe40dfa9a78"
msgid "Why should I believe you?"
msgstr "내가 널 왜 믿어야 하지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyMissionStatement_AvD
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = fb857d78-4bb2-fb59-a5af-cb6dbe6f77e6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DAISY_MALE_VOICE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyMissionStatement_AvD:fb857d78-4bb2-fb59-a5af-cb6dbe6f77e6
msgctxt "h43abde48gc006g45b3g8cd1g28b7d611936e"
msgid ""
"But I know what it is like to be burdened by forces outside of your control."
msgstr "하지만 통제할 수 없는 힘 때문에 부담을 떠안는 느낌이 어떤 건지는 저도 잘 알아요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyMissionStatement_AvD
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = fb857d78-4bb2-fb59-a5af-cb6dbe6f77e6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DAISY_FEMALE_VOICE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyMissionStatement_AvD:fb857d78-4bb2-fb59-a5af-cb6dbe6f77e6
msgctxt "h05911345gae7eg4427ga501g3f6e97bd843d"
msgid ""
"But I know what it is like to be burdened by forces outside of your control."
msgstr "하지만 통제할 수 없는 힘 때문에 부담을 떠안는 느낌이 어떤 건지는 저도 잘 알아요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyMissionStatement_AvD
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = ff715db2-85d7-4b1f-fa19-1af592405976
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_WolfPens_State_HalsinIntroHappened = True
#.   Local:
#.      - 7b3381d2-bfa3-a808-11bc-ac75a74655b0_HalsinAttemptReferenced = True
#. TagRule: DAISY_MALE_VOICE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyMissionStatement_AvD:ff715db2-85d7-4b1f-fa19-1af592405976
msgctxt "h5a158791gb194g441aga816gc50f4ee25e63"
msgid "You were lucky that Halsin knew this. His instincts are right."
msgstr "할신이 이를 알아서 다행이었어요. 그의 직감이 옳아요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyMissionStatement_AvD
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = ff715db2-85d7-4b1f-fa19-1af592405976
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_WolfPens_State_HalsinIntroHappened = True
