msgctxt "h2ca092ffgc67eg4bebga203g56066dda96ae"
msgid "You were lucky that Halsin knew this. His instincts are right."
msgstr "할신이 이를 알아서 다행이었어요. 그의 직감이 옳아요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyMissionStatement_AvD
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = ff988e77-c0eb-1a0d-4260-c1d9776e7c1b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DAISY_MALE_VOICE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyMissionStatement_AvD:ff988e77-c0eb-1a0d-4260-c1d9776e7c1b
msgctxt "hd88d01d7gbb0dg43c4gbac6gab41513ff6e7"
msgid "If we work together, we may turn this around."
msgstr "우리가 함께한다면 상황이 뒤바뀔지도 몰라요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyMissionStatement_AvD
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = ff988e77-c0eb-1a0d-4260-c1d9776e7c1b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DAISY_FEMALE_VOICE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyMissionStatement_AvD:ff988e77-c0eb-1a0d-4260-c1d9776e7c1b
msgctxt "h2377bbc6g7072g42a3gb954g2a208ab6170a"
msgid "If we work together, we may turn this around."
msgstr "우리가 함께한다면 상황이 뒤바뀔지도 몰라요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = 071d2050-e995-7bff-3159-417aa6a7214f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD:071d2050-e995-7bff-3159-417aa6a7214f
msgctxt "h7e6d9512g6878g4cabgb336g04b0f0f8f6ef"
msgid ""
"<i>You are impatient. Even in this, you remind me of her, of Belynne "
"Stelmane. </i>"
msgstr "<i>조급해하는군. 이런 상황에서조차 널 보면 벨린 스텔메인, 그녀가 떠오르는구나. </i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = 16008122-0124-5507-9ddf-a77f138f73c2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Tadpole_Event_AstralTouchedTadpoleEaten = False
#.      - GLO_Tadpole_Event_AstralTouchedTadpoleDestroyed = False
#.      - GLO_General_State_SomeoneIsPartialCeremorph = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD:16008122-0124-5507-9ddf-a77f138f73c2
msgctxt "h81bc3267g9178g47cagbc5cg3559f8847ca9"
msgid ""
"<i>You have shown me great empathy. We are closer now, close enough - I hope "
"- that I can ask you to reconsider your position regarding your physical "
"form. </i>"
msgstr ""
"<i>너는 내게 대단한 이해심을 보여주었다. 이제 우린 더욱 긴밀해졌다. 육체의 형태를 대하는 태도를 재고해 보라 요청할 정도로 막역한 "
"사이가 되었다면 좋겠군. </i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = 167a1271-4a3f-a37d-9bed-4e57e76578a8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Tadpole_Event_AstralTouchedTadpoleEaten = False
#.      - GLO_Tadpole_Event_AstralTouchedTadpoleDestroyed = False
#.      - GLO_General_State_SomeoneIsPartialCeremorph = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD:167a1271-4a3f-a37d-9bed-4e57e76578a8
msgctxt "h6a7bc22ega30bg42a7gbc29gc382e3aad9c3"
msgid ""
"<i>You remain very attached to your physical form. I suggest you shed it. "
"</i>"
msgstr "<i>넌 여전히 네 육신의 형태에 집착한다. 그 집착을 버리길 권하지.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = 18157582-6c48-f3ce-2d74-dbc6064a1417
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD:18157582-6c48-f3ce-2d74-dbc6064a1417
msgctxt "hdbe62c9ag4723g40b5g8bd8g542281312990"
msgid ""
"<i>We are more alike than you would like to acknowledge. I am merely further "
"along in my evolution than you. </i>"
msgstr "<i>넌 인정하고 싶지 않아 한다만, 우리는 서로 닮은 존재다. 난 그저 너보다 진화의 단계를 조금 더 거쳤을 뿐이다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = 1962cef2-6efd-6482-d04c-cff9208d49f0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD:1962cef2-6efd-6482-d04c-cff9208d49f0
msgctxt "hdec9540eg1a20g4f03g9e6eg4a49ab0bfe77"
msgid ""
"<i>I understand my outer membrane and appendages unnerve you. But despite my "
"exterior, I still feel.</i>"
msgstr "<i>내 껍질과 사지가 너를 불안하게 만든다는 점은 이해한다. 하지만 외형이 이럴지라도, 나에겐 여전히 감정이 있다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = 1b6b9b1f-6a4d-3539-5695-c779e694b103
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD:1b6b9b1f-6a4d-3539-5695-c779e694b103
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h8d7498dfg6a5fg47e8g81cag45564ed89ae1"
msgid "<i>And yet you emulate it so well.</i>"
msgstr "<i>그렇게 말하지만 참으로 그녀를 닮아가고 있단 말이지.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1e719156-a7ce-bb81-d525-3cf24eec886a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD:1e719156-a7ce-bb81-d525-3cf24eec886a
msgctxt "h925e6278g2d5bg46a2g9a5dg5ee0dfb6fcc3"
msgid "<i>Give the Emperor's hand a reassuring squeeze. </i>"
msgstr "<i>신뢰의 표시로 황제의 손을 쥔다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2707985f-24ac-bf79-0ff3-bc163ae7b530
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Daisy_ToldPlayerAboutBelynne = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD:2707985f-24ac-bf79-0ff3-bc163ae7b530
msgctxt "hc822de62g01b6g4a00gbea2g9d30af6791cc"
msgid "Belynne, is it? The duke that's dead?"
msgstr "벨린, 맞지? 그 죽었다던 공작?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = 2d06815e-fcfd-9b95-41a6-9811ce50275e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD:2d06815e-fcfd-9b95-41a6-9811ce50275e
msgctxt "h841a6609g33f4g4336g866egc56a985cf4c8"
msgid ""
"<i>Trying to guard us. The brain is restless. But I'm distracted, and my "
"lack of focus is endangering us.</i>"
msgstr "<i>우릴 보호하려 노력 중이다. 엘더 브레인은 휴식을 모르니. 하지만 나는 산만해졌고, 내 부주의는 우리에게 위험이지.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = 2f6d0cd3-31b4-55b4-35b3-331a06f61a5b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Tadpole_Event_AstralTouchedTadpoleEaten = False
#.      - GLO_Tadpole_Event_AstralTouchedTadpoleDestroyed = False
#.      - GLO_General_State_SomeoneIsPartialCeremorph = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD:2f6d0cd3-31b4-55b4-35b3-331a06f61a5b
msgctxt "h5aa1d3bagdaf5g4f9aga7eega6df6aed530d"
msgid "<i>I won't. </i>"
msgstr "<i>그럴 거다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = 2fd6da83-3417-5647-9f6e-a0ef14a1d246
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD:2fd6da83-3417-5647-9f6e-a0ef14a1d246
msgctxt "h09a1fae2g64d9g4889g8b63g0b3d7bdb863e"
msgid "<i>Your company isn't unwelcome.</i>"
msgstr "<i>네가 곁에 있는 건 불편하지 않다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = 341decf4-6a3f-06b0-552b-c1243e4703c0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD:341decf4-6a3f-06b0-552b-c1243e4703c0
msgctxt "hd3967007ge0ebg4769ga35bgfd43b729e489"
msgid "<i>I appreciate the offer, but I don't think it will help.</i>"
msgstr "<i>제안은 고맙다만 도움이 될 것 같진 않군.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 34c3d306-d495-42db-f8b8-07fcd0c203a5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD:34c3d306-d495-42db-f8b8-07fcd0c203a5
msgctxt "h109df812g0edfg4d3ag9abcg9d512d449c68"
msgid "What are you doing?"
msgstr "뭐 하는 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = 34fc1301-d279-53f1-87fd-0f75a657f4db
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD:34fc1301-d279-53f1-87fd-0f75a657f4db
msgctxt "ha53407e8g4b6eg4ddcg90b7g5451ef15f65b"
msgid ""
"<i>But unlike you, unlike the others of my kind, I am no slave to either. "
"</i>"
msgstr "<i>그러나 너, 그리고 내 다른 동족들과는 달리, 난 두려움에도, 인정욕에도 매여있지 않다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3569d1ed-7ecf-de14-701d-1f68e0eaa72c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   User:
#.      - CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_State_ComfortedDaisy(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD:3569d1ed-7ecf-de14-701d-1f68e0eaa72c
msgctxt "he04be290g82bdg4453g974eg5630db23c3bf"
msgid "Do you need another hug?"
msgstr "또 안아줄까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3644f1bf-14f2-bc2a-ff65-c2fd3b796094
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD:3644f1bf-14f2-bc2a-ff65-c2fd3b796094
msgctxt "h9a994674g2d21g42c8g9926gd257caf7ff79"
msgid "I really don't care what your relationship with her was like."
msgstr "솔직히 네가 그 여자랑 뭔 관계였던 신경 안 써."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = 37c3405e-848b-9990-f4d5-d701361f1fed
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD:37c3405e-848b-9990-f4d5-d701361f1fed
msgctxt "hb8cbd38fg4dbeg4342g934bgcd79e74312a1"
msgid ""
"<i>Most people think that mind flayers are soulless husks who feel nothing. "
"I am glad you are not most people.</i>"
msgstr ""
"<i>대부분의 사람들은 마인드 플레이어가 감정도 영혼도 없는 껍데기에 지나지 않는다 여긴다. 네가 그 다수에 속하지 않아서 기쁘군.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = 3a942791-2ec8-60f6-5962-515b889d01ab
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD:3a942791-2ec8-60f6-5962-515b889d01ab
msgctxt "h9db17388g79b6g447cga66egd2308c528b1a"
msgid "<i>Apology accepted.</i>"
msgstr "<i>사과를 받아들이지.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = 3dbf706c-ea29-da92-cde4-575b9d4c304c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD:3dbf706c-ea29-da92-cde4-575b9d4c304c
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h43bb9a86g9e30g49begacd8g1aa151d32557"
msgid "<i>My end is and has always been freedom.</i>"
msgstr "<i>내가 추구하는 궁극적 목표는 언제나 자유다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3dd17946-258c-3b52-9415-cdd426304360
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD:3dd17946-258c-3b52-9415-cdd426304360
msgctxt "h3cacb35eg3a52g43e8gb57ag98fb296b0494"
msgid "If I didn't know you were a mind flayer, I'd say you were upset."
msgstr "네가 마인드 플레이어라는 사실을 몰랐다면, 네가 지금 속상하다고 생각했을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = 3e70c864-cbb2-c276-80fc-02ddda821c3b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD:3e70c864-cbb2-c276-80fc-02ddda821c3b
msgctxt "h3645560dg1dc9g4219gb028ga7006bbcd81c"
msgid ""
"<i>I could not have done any of it without her. Just as I cannot do any of "
"this without you. But now she's gone. </i>"
msgstr ""
"<i>벨린 없이는 아무것도 해내지 못했을 거다. 네가 없었다면 이 모든 게 불가능했을 것과 마찬가지로. 하지만 이제 벨린은 죽었군.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 401935d9-1624-3b28-471c-65eb12e1f852
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD:401935d9-1624-3b28-471c-65eb12e1f852
msgctxt "h6f166f6ag9ebbg4fedga77bgc5f8e8448bfc"
msgid ""
"*You feel the Emperor's fear as if it were your own. An elder brain enslaved "
"is one thing, an elder brain unleashed will be the end of everything.*"
msgstr ""
"*황제의 두려움은 당신 내면에 같은 감정을 불러일으킵니다. 지금은 노예화된 상태이지만, 만에 하나 엘더 브레인이 풀려나는 경우 모든 것이 "
"끝장날 겁니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 404ce548-4bde-3e4f-9a67-87b35774a8f6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CAMP_DaisyStelmane_State_CalledOutManipulation = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD:404ce548-4bde-3e4f-9a67-87b35774a8f6
msgctxt "h7b86c4edg02d4g4c26gbb6bgb6b09555c0b2"
msgid "Drop the act. I know you don't have feelings."
msgstr "연기는 그만둬. 너한텐 감정이 없다는 걸 알아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = 454f079f-9244-a1ab-7445-0b3422e2a75f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD:454f079f-9244-a1ab-7445-0b3422e2a75f
msgctxt "h90373637g6d76g4276g8563g0f37bd712d3d"
msgid "<i>Very well. Then let us move on. </i>"
msgstr "<i>좋다. 그렇다면 앞으로 나아가도록 하지.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 49514a66-5726-346c-62f6-3f38fdae4aba
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   User:
#.      - CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_State_ComfortedDaisy(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD:49514a66-5726-346c-62f6-3f38fdae4aba
msgctxt "hd5cbda85g89eeg41a5ga55cg601aafe8a979"
msgid "Do you need a hug?"
msgstr "안아줄까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = 4badf693-188b-bd68-c291-eac9b35acd2d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD:4badf693-188b-bd68-c291-eac9b35acd2d
msgctxt "h35cdfcc1ga674g439dgadd5g688ca82a4e47"
msgid "<i>You would do well to be more like me. Now leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>나를 닮아가는 편이 좋을 거다. 이제 가라.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4bf9c393-d5b0-e856-df66-6870b0398895
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD:4bf9c393-d5b0-e856-df66-6870b0398895
msgctxt "h9d32fa61g1c9ag4c12g9073g3c89f6aa65ae"
msgid "Don't let your guard down again."
msgstr "다시는 경계 늦추지 마."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = 4d75800d-d70f-86bf-6d3a-057caf18e28c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD:4d75800d-d70f-86bf-6d3a-057caf18e28c
msgctxt "h9b7676e5gb384g4b0ag9d6dgeec43026de37"
msgid ""
"<i>Once those orders are complete, there is a good chance it will break "
"free. </i>"
msgstr "<i>상황이 정리되고 나면, 놈들의 손아귀에서 벗어날 공산이 크다. </i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = 4f6261cf-c675-a51b-2b82-842ab23219a0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CAMP_DaisyStelmane_Knows_StoryOfStelmane = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD:4f6261cf-c675-a51b-2b82-842ab23219a0
msgctxt "hcddb379cge989g4132g9b67ge669f772b258"
msgid ""
"<i>In life, she was my business partner. Back when we ran the Knights of the "
"Shield. A difficult task, for a mind flayer.</i>"
msgstr ""
"<i>생전에 벨린은 내 사업상 파트너였다. 우리가 나이츠 오브 더 실드를 운영했을 때 말이다. 마인드 플레이어에겐 어려운 일이었지.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = 50124442-8fce-3711-17ea-96e8bc4b00e8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD:50124442-8fce-3711-17ea-96e8bc4b00e8
msgctxt "hc79490f2g7626g4dbdg8414gee460f2f786b"
msgid "<i>Belynne understood this. Belynne became my freedom. </i>"
msgstr "<i>벨린은 이를 이해했다. 벨린이 나의 자유가 되어주었지. </i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = 50ecaed2-261f-16c4-3f55-bcd2b2aa17ab
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD:50ecaed2-261f-16c4-3f55-bcd2b2aa17ab
msgctxt "hfc42955cg7260g4979ga522gf82e40d0cfd3"
msgid ""
"<i>We will do better against the elder brain the more illithid we <b>both</"
"b> are.</i>"
msgstr "<i>우리 둘 <b>모두</b>가 일리시드에 가까울수록 엘더 브레인을 더 수월하게 상대할 수 있을 거다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = 519acb29-bc51-e689-e113-148b6bec5a1e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD:519acb29-bc51-e689-e113-148b6bec5a1e
msgctxt "h4dadcbf2g2f48g4fa4gbe68g168b480c3505"
msgid ""
"<i>Far from it. I have long sought the allyship of others - it is the only "
"way to succeed.</i>"
msgstr "<i>전혀 아니다. 난 오랜 시간 동안 동맹을 찾아왔다. 그것이 성공하기 위한 유일한 방도였으니.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = 565bc70f-56e0-a9b1-d0cc-f506c6aaab7f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD:565bc70f-56e0-a9b1-d0cc-f506c6aaab7f
msgctxt "h0e10e7fcg0d2eg482agad53g82482940e79f"
msgid "<i>I am glad you were able to learn something.</i>"
msgstr "<i>네가 배울 수 있는 사람이라서 기쁘군.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5bbf5bba-6e66-dcbf-a5c3-45583547087b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Daisy_ToldPlayerAboutBelynne = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD:5bbf5bba-6e66-dcbf-a5c3-45583547087b
msgctxt "h7cb154e0g3975g489eg9ab2g183fa62ea2cc"
msgid "Who do you think of?"
msgstr "누굴 생각하고 있는데?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = 5bd38791-65a8-1643-567c-2e6d1b4fea8b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD:5bd38791-65a8-1643-567c-2e6d1b4fea8b
msgctxt "hf09c1548g3855g4c9cgb6b0gef56d31c9cfa"
msgid "<i>I appreciate your understanding.</i>"
msgstr "<i>이해해 주어서 고맙다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = 5e1cd26f-6123-791b-ba09-25da7ad058e1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD:5e1cd26f-6123-791b-ba09-25da7ad058e1
msgctxt "h63f1a1f8gbf19g44c8g8af4g09a72ae64b58"
msgid ""
"<i>Another quake. The brain is rebelling again. I need to focus. And so do "
"you. </i>"
msgstr "<i>또 흔들리는군. 엘더 브레인이 다시 저항하고 있다. 이제 집중해야겠다. 너도 마찬가지겠지.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5f1ee178-a746-9ff8-0740-3156cf0b2df6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD:5f1ee178-a746-9ff8-0740-3156cf0b2df6
msgctxt "h38faa4e5g8d5dg4346gbe3ege57342563394"
msgid "You seem troubled."
msgstr "심란해 보이네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5fb62699-e021-13d3-38f4-302df7b42d98
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD:5fb62699-e021-13d3-38f4-302df7b42d98
msgctxt "h3a25163agb20fg42bdgbd00g447faa0f1096"
msgid "Was it more... intimate?"
msgstr "더... 사적인 사이였나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = 61746566-4ed7-5704-de61-648a6609ab07
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD:61746566-4ed7-5704-de61-648a6609ab07
msgctxt "h491cf2d5g6768g4f72g9f2egc9deab3e8e02"
msgid "<i>You are weaker than I imagined, if you lie to yourself so.</i>"
msgstr "<i>스스로에게 그렇게 거짓말한다면, 넌 내가 상상했던 것보다 나약한 사람이다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 62909d01-7469-76f8-f9f1-e239d0e3cf9e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD:62909d01-7469-76f8-f9f1-e239d0e3cf9e
msgctxt "h59b2d5c4g3387g4636gbe59g0569c90ef5ef"
msgid "I just want a dreamless sleep for once."
msgstr "한 번이라도 꿈을 꾸지 않고 잘 수 있기를 바랄 뿐이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = 6297a753-eace-febc-66b2-b40911e19102
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD:6297a753-eace-febc-66b2-b40911e19102
msgctxt "hacd6d4b8gfd17g47cagb889ga0e53399ebc1"
msgid ""
"<i>Like you, mind flayers know fear. Like you, we crave recognition.</i>"
msgstr "<i>너와 마찬가지로, 마인드 플레이어도 두려움을 느낀다. 우리 역시 인정받길 갈망한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = 69499f1a-5965-a439-68a6-191031cffe25
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD:69499f1a-5965-a439-68a6-191031cffe25
msgctxt "h84002d69g1d53g4cdbgb5c7g058eabe24fb0"
msgid ""
"<i>I know it is no easy choice for you, but we will have a far better time "
"ridding the city of Gortash if you accept just a touch of illithidness.</i>"
msgstr ""
"<i>절대 쉬운 선택지가 아니라는 건 안다만, 네가 일리시드됨을 조금만 받아들여도 고타쉬의 손에서 도시를 탈환하기가 훨씬 수월해질 "
"거다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = 721884bb-72a5-c696-6b1f-a9e7028bd4b6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD:721884bb-72a5-c696-6b1f-a9e7028bd4b6
msgctxt "h13f47e72g2bd2g407aga349gca859378a578"
msgid ""
"<i>I need to focus. The brain is rebelling again. Be on your way and leave "
"me to my thoughts. </i>"
msgstr "<i>이제 집중해야겠다. 엘더 브레인이 다시 반항하고 있으니. 난 내 생각에 잠기게 두고, 네 갈 길로 떠나가라.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = 72fbaaa9-29d7-fc8b-b44f-d500a757df36
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD:72fbaaa9-29d7-fc8b-b44f-d500a757df36
msgctxt "h4ff4895eg6ac6g4261gaac7ge047e24058a5"
msgid "<i>Come, you may as well sit a while, now that you're here.</i>"
msgstr "<i>여기 앉아라. 이곳에 왔으니 잠시 머물러도 좋다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = 7aba9a8f-f8a7-e1e3-1883-4f1bbdb78f71
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD:7aba9a8f-f8a7-e1e3-1883-4f1bbdb78f71
msgctxt "h40058024g4ecfg4cb0ga1baga55d206a04ca"
msgid "<i>An accurate summary. I have found myself distracted of late. </i>"
msgstr "<i>정확한 지적이다. 최근 들어 정신을 집중하기가 어려워졌다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7b494fe0-58c3-509f-054c-d1c6a2a79251
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD:7b494fe0-58c3-509f-054c-d1c6a2a79251
msgctxt "hbb9d05f6gdd3fg430bg8d30gbc77be1657aa"
msgid "<i>Your </i>company is disgusting."
msgstr "<i>네가</i> 곁에 있으면 역겨워."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = 7fc19512-afd6-3755-214d-d065f9a35822
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Knows_BrainBreakingFree = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD:7fc19512-afd6-3755-214d-d065f9a35822
msgctxt "hac42941ag1aeeg4f7cgbb1bg793516440d62"
msgid ""
"<i>Its rebellion against Orin and Gortash has been fierce. Even as it "
"executes their final orders. </i>"
msgstr "<i>엘더 브레인은 오린과 고타쉬에 맞서 점점 더 강하게 발버둥치고 있다. 최종 명령이 떨어진 상황인데도 말이지. </i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = 84185c8d-db8b-b9db-fbc9-87d2b9fa58d0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD:84185c8d-db8b-b9db-fbc9-87d2b9fa58d0
msgctxt "ha89f1867gaf03g48b3g8e5egff5bd5282f29"
msgid "<i>And yet you hurt them. </i>"
msgstr "<i>그럼에도 난 네 언행에 상처를 받는다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = 86fbe1bf-bbe0-980b-0cfb-f94f780211c2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD:86fbe1bf-bbe0-980b-0cfb-f94f780211c2
msgctxt "hec6afefegfeeeg4912ga847ga3853810f6cb"
msgid ""
"<i>Beautiful, isn't it? The mighty Prince Orpheus, contained in submissive "
"slumber.</i>"
msgstr "<i>아름답지 않은가? 강대한 오르페우스 왕자께서 순종적인 잠에 빠진 모습이라니.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = 8741e7e9-81f0-929d-1d6b-9fd4d7b26a15
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Tadpole_Event_AstralTouchedTadpoleEaten = False
#.      - GLO_Tadpole_Event_AstralTouchedTadpoleDestroyed = False
#.      - GLO_General_State_SomeoneIsPartialCeremorph = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD:8741e7e9-81f0-929d-1d6b-9fd4d7b26a15
msgctxt "h8dc98fc4g0f84g4dc5g834ag1bf8aaa74d6a"
msgid ""
"<i>You would do well to be more like me. Your humanoid tendencies are "
"becoming an encumbrance. Leave me. </i>"
msgstr "<i>나를 닮아가는 편이 좋을 거다. 네 그 인간적 기질이 이제 거의 폐를 끼치는 수준이란 말이다. 가라.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 894f7983-60ca-e037-df67-a6406bca33f2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD:894f7983-60ca-e037-df67-a6406bca33f2
msgctxt "h9c7d4e1fg2b23g4816g8186g6d36645d83a2"
msgid "I expected you to be more on guard this close to the brain."
msgstr "엘더 브레인에 이렇게 가까워졌으니, 더 경계하고 있을 거라 생각했는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = 92fef682-3e80-36ba-eb62-c09a98317caf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD:92fef682-3e80-36ba-eb62-c09a98317caf
msgctxt "hbce1779bg6d30g4364gb8fdg720276ab2e9f"
msgid ""
"<i>I see you are unable to let that go. But do not forget that I trusted you "
"with my life, as you trusted me with yours. </i>"
msgstr ""
"<i>그 생각을 떨쳐낼 수 없다는 걸 알겠다. 하지만 내가 목숨을 걸고 너를 믿었으며, 너 또한 그리했다는 사실을 잊지 말길 "
"바란다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = 96b66256-b80e-1449-9b32-373cf3d8307d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD:96b66256-b80e-1449-9b32-373cf3d8307d
msgctxt "h6390e8d1g8595g4f17g96bag255094941240"
msgid ""
"<i>It was she who met with the merchants, politicians, patriars. It was she "
"who negotiated deals and signed off on agreements. Her rooms played host to "
"the most important conversations in the city.</i>"
msgstr ""
"<i>상인, 정치인이며 호족을 만나 거래를 협상하고 합의안에 서명한 사람이 벨린이었다. 벨린이 머무는 방은 발더스 게이트에서 가장 중요한 "
"대화가 오가는 공간이 되었지.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = 973cde66-0360-eb5d-4f38-c2b368f30b9e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD:973cde66-0360-eb5d-4f38-c2b368f30b9e
msgctxt "h01aed588gdf34g421cga768g64d52c581a7c"
msgid "<i>At least - when she was alive.</i>"
msgstr "<i>어디까지나 그녀가 살아 있었을 때 말이지.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = 97fc9bde-c4b5-3c7e-e9a0-03f0dbcec326
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD:97fc9bde-c4b5-3c7e-e9a0-03f0dbcec326
msgctxt "hff362c74g0e6fg472bga71ag67be9aa08ccb"
msgid ""
"<i>Not to mention the elder brain itself. Our chances against it greatly "
"improve the more illithid we <b>both</b> are.</i>"
msgstr ""
"<i>엘더 브레인을 상대할 때도 마찬가지일 것이란 사실은 말하지 않아도 알겠지. 우리 둘 <b>모두</b>가 일리시드에 가까울수록 승리의 "
"가능성이 무척 증대된다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = 9f3106d2-404d-50a3-de0e-fdb1012e9c78
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD:9f3106d2-404d-50a3-de0e-fdb1012e9c78
msgctxt "hfc8ed118g758bg4839ga76ag8b04d225376d"
msgid ""
"<i>But I could do with your assistance. You remain attached to your physical "
"form. I suggest you shed that attachment. </i>"
msgstr "<i>하지만 네가 협조해 준다면 좋겠군. 넌 여전히 네 육신의 형태에 집착한다. 그 집착을 버리길 권하지.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = 9f61b1a1-f933-0256-0190-0da283e55546
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD:9f61b1a1-f933-0256-0190-0da283e55546
msgctxt "h3f434772gf844g40adgae60g9d600b9de947"
msgid "<i>You thought you were my first ally?</i>"
msgstr "<i>네가 나에게 최초의 동료였으리라 생각했나?</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9fc6ca81-7204-d8f8-7003-3bba5c7785df
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - NIGHT_DarkUrge_SparedIsobel = True
#.      - NIGHT_DarkUrge_KilledIsobel = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD:9fc6ca81-7204-d8f8-7003-3bba5c7785df
msgctxt "hcbd72becged96g46e5ga3f8gefd1cc19ab4a"
msgid "Watching your loves die only makes you tougher."
msgstr "사랑하는 사람의 죽음은 널 더 강하게 만들어 줄 뿐이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = a01ba184-c2e7-ecca-eebb-7b4b589ef97b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD:a01ba184-c2e7-ecca-eebb-7b4b589ef97b
msgctxt "h3cd71b47g6450g41f2g870ag1a7576c1282d"
msgid ""
"<i>Forgive me. I am drained. Ever since you killed Ketheric and took his "
"Netherstone, the Chosen's control of the brain has been... brittle. </i>"
msgstr ""
"<i>용서해라. 완전히 지쳐버렸다. 네가 케서릭을 죽이고 네더스톤을 차지한 뒤로부터 선택받은 자들의 통제력이... 불안정해졌다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a691a3ad-4349-45ef-f051-8c1d902d30c4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD:a691a3ad-4349-45ef-f051-8c1d902d30c4
msgctxt "h4c14a8c4g7ba8g4273ga01cgccf252308b7b"
msgid "Did you manipulate her like you manipulated me?"
msgstr "날 조종했던 것처럼 스텔메인도 조종했나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a802bf5f-3e77-1aaa-b9ce-dbe89823625f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD:a802bf5f-3e77-1aaa-b9ce-dbe89823625f
msgctxt "he41421bag97eag4cd1gb435gab5bd70e69f6"
msgid "I'm sorry for your loss."
msgstr "소중한 사람을 잃게 되어 유감이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ae777009-9383-9fe8-fc72-935dc0649983
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Daisy_ToldPlayerAboutBelynne = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD:ae777009-9383-9fe8-fc72-935dc0649983
msgctxt "hf91935f4geea8g4480gb36ag129ee560d926"
msgid "Someone from your past?"
msgstr "네 과거에 얽힌 사람이야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = afa3e179-c0a2-5ebd-cdbc-d0024861f675
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD:afa3e179-c0a2-5ebd-cdbc-d0024861f675
msgctxt "h49156e5fgb3f8g453fgb650gc20e9609f6b7"
msgid "That was... insightful."
msgstr "그건... 깨달음을 주네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = b46ffab9-3a8f-8706-992b-058402988361
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD:b46ffab9-3a8f-8706-992b-058402988361
msgctxt "h80629affgd805g4a76ga557g6a9de23ef872"
msgid ""
"<i>I suspected that when we took Ketheric's stone, the brain would begin to "
"break free. Those brainquakes confirm that my suspicion was correct.</i>"
msgstr ""
"<i>우리가 케서릭의 돌을 차지하면 엘더 브레인이 풀려나지 않을까 의심했다. 근래의 뇌 지진은 내 추측이 옳았음을 입증하는 징조다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = b8da95ef-a408-391e-9413-9021a9673775
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD:b8da95ef-a408-391e-9413-9021a9673775
msgctxt "hff268df8gc862g4becgb4f6gfb0ad39e1b14"
msgid ""
"<i>What I feel is deeper than superficial cures can reach. And not entirely "
"unwelcome. </i>"
msgstr "<i>지금 내가 느끼는 감정은 피상적 조치로는 달랠 수 없다. 그리고 완전히 불유쾌한 것만도 아냐.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = b92307f3-7126-53d2-5ef5-edc2846156f9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD:b92307f3-7126-53d2-5ef5-edc2846156f9
msgctxt "h2390b5f3gc134g4622gb790gb327a7a719d4"
msgid ""
"<i>The very same. Duke Stelmane, as she was known in Baldur's Gate. </i>"
msgstr "<i>그렇다. 발더스 게이트에선 스텔메인 공작이란 이름으로 알려졌었지.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = bc6b6692-49ab-71da-5f1a-916599511cd3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD:bc6b6692-49ab-71da-5f1a-916599511cd3
msgctxt "hcd57c9b6ge8c0g421aga95egdd49873c21f6"
msgid ""
"<i>I do not know what happens now when it receives their orders, and I do "
"not dare guess. </i>"
msgstr "<i>놈들의 명령이 하달된 지금은 무슨 일이 일어나고 있는지 알 수 없다. 짐작조차 조심스럽군. </i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = bd138fd5-3e55-d3ea-4e8c-8e8eb9e1455a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD:bd138fd5-3e55-d3ea-4e8c-8e8eb9e1455a
msgctxt "hafaa5a0bg03b2g45cfg88d3gd34b907a81a2"
msgid ""
"<i>Manipulation or not, we need each other. My relationship with Belynne was "
"similar in this regard. Though - less dramatic. </i>"
msgstr "<i>조종이든 아니든, 우리는 서로가 필요하다. 그 점에선 나와 벨린과의 관계도 비슷했다. 덜... 극적이었다만.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = c2669c0e-e3ef-4568-ba3c-2f506bfd1f39
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD:c2669c0e-e3ef-4568-ba3c-2f506bfd1f39
msgctxt "h97a7f76dg1a7cg45e6g92bcg5b35ad0dc0ed"
msgid ""
"<i>Not love, no. What I had with Belynne Stelmane was much more than that. "
"It was - unique. </i>"
msgstr "<i>아니, 사랑은 아니었다. 내가 벨린 스텔메인에게 품었던 감정은 그보다 훨씬... 특별했다. </i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c32606fa-d2e8-b14a-ff63-8247e704f6e5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD:c32606fa-d2e8-b14a-ff63-8247e704f6e5
msgctxt "h4fc6cf03g0eb1g4364g8e52gf4b04adfde59"
msgid "The past is past. Move on."
msgstr "과거는 과거일 뿐이야. 앞으로 나아가자고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = c6bef242-2f6d-6959-819f-bf303cdf7428
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD:c6bef242-2f6d-6959-819f-bf303cdf7428
msgctxt "h85ba72f8g3b54g4b7fgbeabg2fbff810ebde"
msgid ""
"<i>Indeed. Duke Stelmane. Or as I knew her - Belynne. When she was alive.</i>"
msgstr "<i>그렇다. 스텔메인 공작. 나에겐 벨린이었지. 살아있을 적에는.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = c708ede0-100a-66bc-9030-a5ec45af1ea7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD:c708ede0-100a-66bc-9030-a5ec45af1ea7
msgctxt "hcc78d8deg9192g4366ga998ga6531c9072e5"
msgid "<i>In a way. But not the way you're thinking of. </i>"
msgstr "<i>나름대로. 하지만 네가 생각하는 그런 관계는 아니었다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c8eb2f7b-5ee2-7877-097c-ddbc6d0f4f2a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD:c8eb2f7b-5ee2-7877-097c-ddbc6d0f4f2a
msgctxt "h9460a7afg0bd8g4698ga42agcf4d6ac3cfd1"
msgid "Thank you for sharing that."
msgstr "알려줘서 고마워."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = ccab46ea-6756-6767-8222-a6f651e3b247
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD:ccab46ea-6756-6767-8222-a6f651e3b247
msgctxt "h4210b3f2g172bg4b26gb553g87db8c999e4b"
msgid "<i>Astute as ever.</i>"
msgstr "<i>으레 그랬듯 영리도 하군.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d0ac944f-bfbd-20f3-6509-64fdd8b44caf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CAMP_DaisyStelmane_State_CalledOutManipulation = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD:d0ac944f-bfbd-20f3-6509-64fdd8b44caf
msgctxt "ha0f624d2g10abg424cg997dg9569451f8eef"
msgid ""
"I know you're trying to manipulate me. It's not working. I know what you are."
msgstr "날 조종하려는 거 알아. 그렇게는 안 될걸. 난 네가 어떤 놈인지 안다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = d1a2327f-1fd5-730b-2bcb-e8ca3bbf4367
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD:d1a2327f-1fd5-730b-2bcb-e8ca3bbf4367
msgctxt "h3e743b61g83f4g4e24ga181gdd26151d57b9"
msgid ""
"<i>Though my relationship with Belynne was - different, from my relationship "
"with you. </i>"
msgstr "<i>비록 벨린과 나의 관계는... 우리의 관계와는 달랐다만.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d1b4a91d-b9f4-6d2d-c381-4f6f082b1416
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD:d1b4a91d-b9f4-6d2d-c381-4f6f082b1416
msgctxt "h7d3b5287g26f5g48dfg9616g79950f2f7dab"
msgid "<i>You</i> have a love interest?"
msgstr "<i>너한테도</i> 사랑하는 사람이 있었어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = d66d995c-c912-42a8-90ac-ea375d959c70
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD:d66d995c-c912-42a8-90ac-ea375d959c70
msgctxt "h1548357dg78e9g4540g8039g693af36b703d"
msgid ""
"<i>How did you - oh. It's you. I must have let my mind wander. Enough for "
"you to wander in. </i>"
msgstr "<i>어떻게... 아, 너로군. 네가 이곳으로 흘러들어올 수 있었을 정도로 내 정신이 흐트러졌던 모양이다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = d98e477c-63d4-8712-5cf6-ea985f549095
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD:d98e477c-63d4-8712-5cf6-ea985f549095
msgctxt "h01b4ddd6g1eacg4833g92fega1ba8847deda"
msgid ""
"<i>I'm haunted by memories. They are relentless. I can think of nothing - no "
"one - else.</i>"
msgstr "<i>추억이 나를 쉼 없이 괴롭힌다. 그녀 외엔 도무지 그 무엇도 생각할 수가 없군. </i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = df567e83-87ea-8795-7798-3bd09bc098d4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD:df567e83-87ea-8795-7798-3bd09bc098d4
msgctxt "h4efdeafdgc274g4276gb779gc05a5f128137"
msgid ""
"*As your eyes blink shut, you fall into the deepest slumber of your life. A "
"quietness so vast it feels almost like death.*"
msgstr "*눈이 감기면서 당신은 살면서 가장 깊은 잠에 빠져듭니다. 그 정적이 너무나 광활하여 거의 죽음처럼 느껴집니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = e040becf-df2e-9d85-524a-a40c67ec499b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD:e040becf-df2e-9d85-524a-a40c67ec499b
msgctxt "h7059a612gafe0g4385g85e1gfa34580aa75b"
msgid "<i>Another quake. The brain is rebelling again. I need to focus. </i>"
msgstr "<i>또 진동하는군. 엘더 브레인이 다시 반항 중이다. 이제 집중해야겠다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e3a8535e-350d-3eac-9051-9168b3fba4fd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD:e3a8535e-350d-3eac-9051-9168b3fba4fd
msgctxt "h089bd7a5g3c2dg467fgbbefg370b948e2ce1"
msgid "Sorry I was mean to you."
msgstr "못되게 굴었던 거 미안해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = e5e1c975-a3f9-fbeb-bc55-cb8991deb2ca
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD:e5e1c975-a3f9-fbeb-bc55-cb8991deb2ca
msgctxt "hc2aa5186g9174g4806gbfaag340f428f2a9d"
msgid ""
"<i>Together, we brought order to chaos. At its height, everything that "
"happened in that city went through the Shield. Through us.</i>"
msgstr ""
"<i>벨린과 나는 함께 혼돈에 질서를 세웠다. 전성기 시절엔 도시에서 벌어지는 모든 일이 나이츠 오브 더 실드의 영향력 아래 있었지. "
"우리 아래 있었어.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = e7b018b2-d500-d1a5-1682-f23517be5975
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD:e7b018b2-d500-d1a5-1682-f23517be5975
msgctxt "h88d9c066ga583g42e2gbb4fgfafdab07924c"
msgid ""
"<i>Duke Stelmane trusted me, and the city trusted her. I conceived the plot, "
"but Belynne took centre-stage.</i>"
msgstr "<i>스텔메인 공작은 나를 신뢰했고, 도시는 벨린을 신뢰했다. 계획을 짠 건 나였지만 핵심에 있었던 건 벨린이었어.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = ea2f3f7c-7a3c-4841-3dec-b9f0f234520b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD:ea2f3f7c-7a3c-4841-3dec-b9f0f234520b
msgctxt "h57f13bb4gacb5g494ega51eg82af602321c0"
msgid ""
"<i>You are wrong. Feeling is vital to the pursuit of anyone's goals. Even a "
"mind flayer's. </i>"
msgstr "<i>그 생각은 틀렸다. 감정이란 사람이 목표를 추구하는 데 있어 필수적인 요소다. 마인드 플레이어라 해도 그러하다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = ed8df86a-8479-7327-df39-be4dc0446633
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD:ed8df86a-8479-7327-df39-be4dc0446633
msgctxt "h2243a831g7648g41c7g8448ge043273032da"
msgid "<i>You are correct. I should be.</i>"
msgstr "<i>맞는 말이다. 그리해야 할 텐데.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = edbe04f4-8758-f111-f23f-73dc537b80a7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD:edbe04f4-8758-f111-f23f-73dc537b80a7
msgctxt "he4d4c1f5g7bc7g4ae7g96bdg3c9bc9440f06"
msgid ""
"<i>You think that mind flayers are soulless husks who feel nothing. Belynne "
"thought the same at first. </i>"
msgstr "<i>넌 마인드 플레이어가 아무 감정도 느끼지 못하는 영혼 없는 껍데기라고 생각하고 있다. 벨린도 처음에는 그랬었지.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f6e7f8ea-ab71-26b4-4ac8-0c07ad94df87
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD:f6e7f8ea-ab71-26b4-4ac8-0c07ad94df87
msgctxt "h3d697dbcgeec7g4f8ag8453gff76665673b3"
msgid "How so?"
msgstr "어떻게 다른 건데?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = fb4098b3-1c24-2936-5a00-a7d3ac656a66
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD:fb4098b3-1c24-2936-5a00-a7d3ac656a66
msgctxt "h760e4afbgdc39g40c5gaa33g084d9590ac08"
msgid ""
"<i>Duke Stelmane. Or Belynne, as I knew her. I wasn't ready for her "
"death.</i>"
msgstr "<i>스텔메인 공작. 혹은 내가 불렀던 대로, 벨린. 벨린이 죽었단 소식을 들을 마음의 준비가 안 됐었다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = fd27670e-f3a6-6a1f-9acb-322d8f4f3402
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD:fd27670e-f3a6-6a1f-9acb-322d8f4f3402
msgctxt "h7c22b0a9g2673g4009gb958g95be47ce6eeb"
msgid ""
"<i>I apologise. I didn't mean to burden you with my woes. You have enough to "
"worry about. </i>"
msgstr "<i>미안하다. 네 어깨에 내 괴로움이란 짐을 지울 생각은 아니었다. 네겐 이미 근심거리가 충분하지. </i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = fe4ded2a-fe0c-0d3f-6784-b2b59edccb55
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Knows_BrainBreakingFree = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DaisyStelmane_AvD:fe4ded2a-fe0c-0d3f-6784-b2b59edccb55
msgctxt "h483cbc04g87f2g4e9dg8d5bg4a23c5570cb5"
msgid "<i>It's rebelling against Orin and Gortash. Fiercely. </i>"
msgstr "<i>이제 엘더 브레인은 오린과 고타쉬에게 저항 중이다. 격렬하게. </i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 001ad7c1-45b1-3a84-1221-c2e789669c3f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion:001ad7c1-45b1-3a84-1221-c2e789669c3f
msgctxt "h6b92880fg7237g4dfagaf42gb40657b34aca"
msgid "Then steel your mind and destroy them. Simple."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0164b475-2328-3b90-9c16-303c5fb1603e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion:0164b475-2328-3b90-9c16-303c5fb1603e
msgctxt "ha411a1c9g62d4g400dgabdcg679e818ce463"
msgid "Good book?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 05680c54-5fce-12c6-cb53-368b6f01a53b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion:05680c54-5fce-12c6-cb53-368b6f01a53b
msgctxt "h03b26922g4ffbg47e8gb75agbc9b55e1d338"
msgid "Sounds dangerous. Maybe you should leave it alone."
msgstr "위험한 책 같은데. 건들지 않는 게 좋겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 0988675b-f2e2-08cd-370c-642452849c8e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_Gale_State_IsInParty = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion:0988675b-f2e2-08cd-370c-642452849c8e
msgctxt "h1c935f03g1213g462agb94ag38549e0b2850"
msgid "No, I won't kill them! Well, maybe Gale..."
msgstr "아니, 아무도 안 죽여! 그래도 게일 쯤은..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 0ba571be-9803-ed71-2554-fbe1467d4e51
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_Wyll_State_IsInParty = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion:0ba571be-9803-ed71-2554-fbe1467d4e51
msgctxt "hca80cfa7g5a05g473bg8128g18ce926ae01b"
msgid "No, I won't kill them! Well, maybe Wyll..."
msgstr "아니, 아무도 안 죽여! 그래도 윌 정도는..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 175713e5-f53c-78c6-19e4-feff02df4a3e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion:175713e5-f53c-78c6-19e4-feff02df4a3e
msgctxt "h50bebbdcg22d9g4833gb62bgceb3b147f3bf"
msgid ""
"Although I can't make any progress as long as those spirits remember their "
"mission. It seems to be all they know."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 18ba2e7f-b783-9d33-1fcc-26aa6db26ea3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion:18ba2e7f-b783-9d33-1fcc-26aa6db26ea3
msgctxt "h730f946ag8554g4524g95d2g4f6189dc58e6"
msgid ""
"It's powerful magic, not to be toyed with. I could take it off your hands."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 1e21c0ee-3617-ac73-4cfe-b2bb1e97abeb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion:1e21c0ee-3617-ac73-4cfe-b2bb1e97abeb
msgctxt "h3142c0ebg07d2g4b62ga771g5299e9f8be21"
msgid ""
"I wouldn't be trying to reason with them if 'murder' was an option, would I?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 2006d04a-8dfb-fca4-f580-ec8a5eef6b63
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion:2006d04a-8dfb-fca4-f580-ec8a5eef6b63
msgctxt "h58801720gfbd0g49bbgb4c7g0778215d66fd"
msgid "Just tell me what I need to know. Tell me your secrets."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 226c9fdf-8e99-acab-1efe-33189d893d22
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_Gale_Knows_NeedsMagicItems = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion:226c9fdf-8e99-acab-1efe-33189d893d22
msgctxt "hc1ce50c7g60acg4a31gb41fga97e9331be55"
msgid "Gale would take it off your hands."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 22ee30c1-1272-2289-3297-7dc621caf165
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion:22ee30c1-1272-2289-3297-7dc621caf165
msgctxt "h6b56c207ge30ag4fc7gaa67g745591c7d390"
msgid "What are you hoping to find in there anyway?"
msgstr "애초에 거기서 뭘 찾으려는 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 240bfa42-054e-5962-28db-bc81067f5916
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion:240bfa42-054e-5962-28db-bc81067f5916
msgctxt "h02c6b457gf690g4b7agb5a6gac744bd3968a"
msgid "Keep at it. Maybe you'll figure out a way."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 245e6606-3d24-021e-03bc-4a40a318f26f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - FOR_DangerousBook_State_SecondPageRead = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion:245e6606-3d24-021e-03bc-4a40a318f26f
msgctxt "hbceada67gf58dg437bg8a3dg66c8a2d5e0b1"
msgid ""
"I got deep into the pages of this book before they drove me out. And almost "
"drove me mad."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 26b85404-eb04-d52a-8070-5dfd6833a6ce
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion:26b85404-eb04-d52a-8070-5dfd6833a6ce
msgctxt "h2eeb2629g357cg4108gb579g43ba377cc8a3"
msgid "Let. Me. Go! Ah... Hello."
msgstr "이거. 당장. 놓으라고! 어... 안녕?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 28335d1d-eabc-1d9c-1729-eb6246c85176
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion:28335d1d-eabc-1d9c-1729-eb6246c85176
msgctxt "h1cd7ba44g396eg4d69gb4dcg0edf74b69f06"
msgid "Maybe. Maybe not. It's hard to know what's lurking in here."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 2ab18436-9bce-d3cc-8890-370949a9cc58
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_ShadowHeart_State_IsInParty = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion:2ab18436-9bce-d3cc-8890-370949a9cc58
msgctxt "hd5e03559g308cg4b10g80b6g957ceb687395"
msgid "No, I won't kill them! Well, maybe Shadowheart..."
msgstr "아니, 아무도 안 죽여! 그래도 섀도하트 정도는..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2b102727-3f32-5246-bb7b-3ae79a955503
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion:2b102727-3f32-5246-bb7b-3ae79a955503
msgctxt "h179447f0g2ab4g4820ga6d2g5a583bfa6a7c"
msgid "I didn't say anything."
msgstr "아무 말도 안 했는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 2c8f38c9-db21-33fb-d649-02777b548fc1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion:2c8f38c9-db21-33fb-d649-02777b548fc1
msgctxt "h9fd8859fg7a85g4237g8b98ga4d74544c926"
msgid "They're too strong for that. They must be hiding something good."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2cbb6f03-0fb0-2afe-c940-d0753b246a7e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion:2cbb6f03-0fb0-2afe-c940-d0753b246a7e
msgctxt "h8f9a5749g54e5g427bgad7bg376eec50f86b"
msgid "Probably. It's a tome of necromancy, after all."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 32d9b299-fd86-14ba-37ad-a0abc1a435cd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion:32d9b299-fd86-14ba-37ad-a0abc1a435cd
msgctxt "h752f3fa9gebcdg4d47gab74g629b19b24ba3"
msgid ""
"No, there's something in here. But the voices - the spirits in the book "
"won't let me see it."
msgstr "아냐, 분명 쓸만한 게 있어. 근데 책에 있는 혼령이랄까, 목소리가 못 보게 가로막고 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 34a9ecb1-d319-0aac-5799-60934f749679
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion:34a9ecb1-d319-0aac-5799-60934f749679
msgctxt "h5af32400g54fcg4f55gb07ag9a9c91ecf697"
msgid "I'm not sure. A dance with death, maybe."
msgstr "나도 모르겠어. 죽음과 춤을 추는 것 같았는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 34e0d26e-5a45-4781-8d07-c004fc67094b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion:34e0d26e-5a45-4781-8d07-c004fc67094b
msgctxt "hed804d0cg0f9dg4f2agac21g6d2d9a9d2918"
msgid ""
"Can you summon the dead? Bring them back? Can you - ugh, can you shut up and "
"let me read?"
msgstr "죽은 자를 일으킬 수 있니? 되살릴 수 있어? 아니면... 어, 읽는 데 집중하게 좀 닥쳐줄래?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 34e89e17-d463-4b0d-9878-c2aea72867f1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - AVATAR(0) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion:34e89e17-d463-4b0d-9878-c2aea72867f1
msgctxt "hca5842f9gdd0fg4802g8372g792d67951284"
msgid "Come on, come on. What are you hiding?"
msgstr "어디 보자, 뭘 숨기고 있느냐?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 369469e1-1202-36c1-e6d4-2d11abcf5df6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion:369469e1-1202-36c1-e6d4-2d11abcf5df6
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h1972888bg8afcg492bgba8fg2eff240b6ea1"
msgid "I can't risk it. There's something valuable in here."
msgstr "리스크가 너무 커, 여기엔 분명 값진 게 있긴 하거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 3cb889a7-bbf4-fdd7-1070-433ce95229a0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion:3cb889a7-bbf4-fdd7-1070-433ce95229a0
msgctxt "hefaa33e5g4543g4063gaeafg2ca94bbb2325"
msgid ""
"Indeed. As long as the spirits remember their mission, the book is a lost "
"cause."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 3f242598-d4d6-c6c7-f04a-15f56c1bc06a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion:3f242598-d4d6-c6c7-f04a-15f56c1bc06a
msgctxt "h00262c0cga87ag401dg9151g45e3f4a38540"
msgid ""
"As long as those spirits remember their mission, I doubt it. Keeping the "
"book safe is all they know."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 41b180f3-0011-db27-cf13-aae78d8218f4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion:41b180f3-0011-db27-cf13-aae78d8218f4
msgctxt "hb568b8bagdb16g4c7cgbbb5g77cd07759fef"
msgid ""
"Anyway, I'd rather keep it where I can see it. Its time will come, I'm sure."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 4502e412-be7c-a42f-6ba6-05219d0a3fb0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - FOR_DangerousBook_State_BookFinished = False
#.      - FOR_DangerousBook_State_FirstPageRead = False
#.      - FOR_DangerousBook_State_SecondPageRead = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion:4502e412-be7c-a42f-6ba6-05219d0a3fb0
msgctxt "hc5880ae0g6527g46d4gadb2gcefd596a8618"
msgid "I barely opened it when they started whispering from the shadows."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 45eecb32-0c6d-2b0d-f650-28ba3cb6e550
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion:45eecb32-0c6d-2b0d-f650-28ba3cb6e550
msgctxt "hd16a9316g126fg41a0g9122g6cd5c7dd20f8"
msgid "What? No - not you."
msgstr "뭐? 아니, 너 말고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4bf6909e-5a6b-df08-1e82-da34cd34a807
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion:4bf6909e-5a6b-df08-1e82-da34cd34a807
msgctxt "h7f20e830gbfb3g4fa8g91b3gd67e8f6db5ba"
msgid "What in the hells was that?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4c7542be-2cfb-3f20-0127-99ed242c2e90
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion:4c7542be-2cfb-3f20-0127-99ed242c2e90
msgctxt "ha182760eg597eg41b6gaa02g67a370fa6429"
msgid "What secrets?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4fc01afa-ed40-f98c-9d1d-30b22d4f4478
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion:4fc01afa-ed40-f98c-9d1d-30b22d4f4478
msgctxt "h8f06ebe0g26e7g4596gbff6gd83f1978f637"
msgid "<i>Stay silent.</i>"
msgstr "<i>침묵을 유지한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 5102b7bb-1931-85dd-645e-5ee3dc211382
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion:5102b7bb-1931-85dd-645e-5ee3dc211382
msgctxt "hced6c0b8g9c1fg4f1bg8a26ga05194365af0"
msgid "But still, we live in hope. Figuratively speaking."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 5708027d-e6fd-0041-5b80-2e870306e0d1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - FOR_DangerousBook_State_FirstPageRead = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion:5708027d-e6fd-0041-5b80-2e870306e0d1
msgctxt "h5d56c95agf056g4111g9418g3392a206ae15"
msgid "I only read one page before their maddening whispers drove me away."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 5edb813e-d81e-d08c-63f0-4d620067fb30
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion:5edb813e-d81e-d08c-63f0-4d620067fb30
msgctxt "h24ecb9fag2b26g4235g9f2dg372abac11161"
msgid ""
"Thank you, very helpful. But I can't risk it. There's something valuable in "
"here."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 62da785e-702a-11df-ee3e-816643299e13
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion:62da785e-702a-11df-ee3e-816643299e13
msgctxt "h7f931859g8b84g441fg8e59gf6feb43334cf"
msgid "No! He's not eating this one. It's too valuable."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 65089849-91b7-7cdf-79e8-c77f87486b1e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion:65089849-91b7-7cdf-79e8-c77f87486b1e
msgctxt "h9625e42bg67d0g4f5eg83cegbb2a776c14b3"
msgid "Still. If nothing else, maybe I can beat Cazador to death with it."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 67148d27-6bae-0aed-c53c-4163a3925513
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion:67148d27-6bae-0aed-c53c-4163a3925513
msgctxt "h1d6f403eg97e7g4b5cg8120g50fc224ce1dc"
msgid "This is a powerful book of necromancy, but it's guarded by spirits."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 74745345-f468-d16c-3f0a-d0c5c890c66f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion:74745345-f468-d16c-3f0a-d0c5c890c66f
msgctxt "h39eeb4adg7148g469bg8c03g12bf09dfc9a1"
msgid "Yes, best to focus on what's urgent."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 7b92d291-48e9-8112-480d-c1a67539dfa9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_Karlach_State_IsInParty = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion:7b92d291-48e9-8112-480d-c1a67539dfa9
msgctxt "h6d47cc4ag4cd8g4630g8579gd80919c9e2c8"
msgid "No, I won't kill them! Well, maybe the tiefling..."
msgstr "아니, 아무도 안 죽여! 그래도 티플링 쯤은..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8069f54b-987b-67fc-7a3c-0a7f64b87bbb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion:8069f54b-987b-67fc-7a3c-0a7f64b87bbb
msgctxt "ha206e906g30b5g467agbf21g4a7886d56d28"
msgid "It sounds like you need an exorcism."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 8c3b5035-12cb-75b1-515b-c1671e65c45a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion:8c3b5035-12cb-75b1-515b-c1671e65c45a
msgctxt "ha2e96785g1cecg4064gacd2gd0173e24dfad"
msgid ""
"I mean it plays with your mind. There are secrets here, but the book has "
"spirits. They fight you every step of the way."
msgstr "책이 네 정신을 조종하려 드는 거야. 이 안엔 비밀이 있지만, 영혼도 서려있거든. 한 장 넘길 때마다 싸움이 벌어지는 셈이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 9da37bb9-b9e7-45a6-727b-709276eba828
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion:9da37bb9-b9e7-45a6-727b-709276eba828
msgctxt "h5a6bd588g200ag4a56g9cb9g515838f6f64c"
msgid ""
"Still, I doubt this will help us with our parasites. Maybe it's better to "
"put it aside for now."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = a320bfba-985b-d710-a8e1-2cbd8db26094
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion:a320bfba-985b-d710-a8e1-2cbd8db26094
msgctxt "h83c4724ag37feg4447ga5f2ge50908580a95"
msgid "Perhaps. But would that damage the tome itself?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a4fb3fba-6fab-4983-564f-a8269c3d8245
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion:a4fb3fba-6fab-4983-564f-a8269c3d8245
msgctxt "h8e8fbc68gc8ffg46a0gbcf2gd8105d925811"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = a87baabe-a6b7-30b8-8dbc-a87e3d74c2b4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion:a87baabe-a6b7-30b8-8dbc-a87e3d74c2b4
msgctxt "h91f64432gf803g4773g9cd2gd86e844e9136"
msgid "A unique read, certainly. A tome of necromancy, guarded by spirits."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = aea84552-dbb0-f0cd-17f9-39df569e8d6a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_Astarion_Knows_CazadorMaster = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion:aea84552-dbb0-f0cd-17f9-39df569e8d6a
msgctxt "hff5bf613g5cc4g4bc1gac5agb0c0f7deb655"
msgid ""
"Whatever's in here, it might give me an edge over Cazador. Or free me from "
"him entirely."
msgstr "여기에 뭐가 적혀 있던, 이걸로 카사도어에게 우위를 점할 수 있을지도 몰라. 어쩌면 날 그자로부터 완전히 해방시킬 수도 있겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = af9c52fd-652a-5360-f8b8-823305f89d89
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion:af9c52fd-652a-5360-f8b8-823305f89d89
msgctxt "hfd68efb6gbf99g4fbeg8c6dged84e3d713e6"
msgid "I could hold on to it if you like?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = b4ebf543-a792-9541-ceb6-a2161556cb02
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion:b4ebf543-a792-9541-ceb6-a2161556cb02
msgctxt "h82bf5422gbfb4g46cfgbf8eg4754c35ba7d6"
msgid "Forgive me. This book reads you more than you read it."
msgstr "하, 미안해. 이 책을 읽을수록 책도 나를 읽어내거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = b82b6494-dfd7-bbdf-6fc5-5d4fc644c3bc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion:b82b6494-dfd7-bbdf-6fc5-5d4fc644c3bc
msgctxt "hb1c55db7g92f4g42a1g9de8g2e7af0606a15"
msgid ""
"Trust me, the spirits won't be any kinder to you. As long as they remember "
"their duty to protect this book, no one's getting in."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = bcd9d550-a451-05bd-d3d2-8bb6fb9eb85d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion:bcd9d550-a451-05bd-d3d2-8bb6fb9eb85d
msgctxt "h3e041d4ag2afag44afg8a92gc0e8c5239a8d"
msgid ""
"I can't. I feel a connection with it, but the spirits within fight me at "
"every step."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = bd1cd59e-3e36-ea2e-fcb4-97ab80ea8cc2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_Gale_Knows_NeedsMagicItems = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion:bd1cd59e-3e36-ea2e-fcb4-97ab80ea8cc2
msgctxt "hd2cd3b94g7eb6g46eegb351g9d2434bb48a7"
msgid "No! You're not eating this one. It's too valuable."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bfb62664-816a-140f-85bc-4a9cf94daa76
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion:bfb62664-816a-140f-85bc-4a9cf94daa76
msgctxt "h8a47bfb7g8339g42fegbb57g0b17331ef054"
msgid "Then stop reading it!"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = c4f16bae-5d64-aede-21c2-914c8285dac5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion:c4f16bae-5d64-aede-21c2-914c8285dac5
msgctxt "h2aecdac7g3385g4c9cga614g3db7d2822bac"
msgid "And I should rest. This has all been a lot."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c8ca0784-0d90-9fea-6fa7-b2491965f5aa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion:c8ca0784-0d90-9fea-6fa7-b2491965f5aa
msgctxt "hf39f5508gea4ag4204gb34dg0389842a8954"
msgid "Need some help?"
msgstr "내가 도울 거라도 있어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = c900551c-7626-45b8-942b-1f1fd271ab90
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion:c900551c-7626-45b8-942b-1f1fd271ab90
msgctxt "hebe6f765g8f57g41degbae5g71b504c4155f"
msgid "I don't know. That's the point - they're <i>secret</i>."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = ca876ee7-4767-8e9a-7ec2-6640b16e2c37
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion:ca876ee7-4767-8e9a-7ec2-6640b16e2c37
msgctxt "h6d5438c6g6283g468fg971eg824892e1fbb5"
msgid "No - stop it - I won't kill them!"
msgstr "안 돼, 멈춰. 아무도 안 죽일 거니까!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = cb698ea6-b387-dafd-83aa-7ad8f3a31528
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion:cb698ea6-b387-dafd-83aa-7ad8f3a31528
msgctxt "h06bf545ag28dcg4191g8a56gb146ed3080d9"
msgid ""
"Now every time I open it, the voices surge back into my mind. I can't reason "
"with them - they exist to protect that book."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = ccc479a0-1579-2331-0354-0d26ca4a3a11
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion:ccc479a0-1579-2331-0354-0d26ca4a3a11
msgctxt "h88a9c775g9c80g49a2gb685gc6dae2082bad"
msgid "What? No. I - I'm fine."
msgstr "뭐? 아, 아냐. 난 괜찮아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = cd4e5be0-acb4-9f5b-98c7-9c01ae28311b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_Astarion_Knows_CazadorMaster = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - ORI_Astarion_Knows_CazadorMaster = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion:cd4e5be0-acb4-9f5b-98c7-9c01ae28311b
msgctxt "h33ae8f39gcc0dg44e6ga23cg67f17cf964ee"
msgid ""
"Whatever's in here, it might give me an edge over my old master Cazador. Or "
"free me from him entirely."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = cd7f3408-0a75-8a14-caf9-76d2d7947ff9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion:cd7f3408-0a75-8a14-caf9-76d2d7947ff9
msgctxt "hce5f464fg1038g43aega4d3g97d24268213a"
msgid "Of course I'm not. It's just - it gets to you."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = d118c398-9605-2635-d461-1f9ccf16b0d9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - FOR_DangerousBook_State_BookFinished = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion:d118c398-9605-2635-d461-1f9ccf16b0d9
msgctxt "h6d042d6bg2bd7g457fg97e7g89ef814f397a"
msgid ""
"I almost reached the end before they drove me out. And drove me all but mad."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d3ef505c-7a80-4524-7bb4-4eb2f84651ae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion:d3ef505c-7a80-4524-7bb4-4eb2f84651ae
msgctxt "h5b2acee9ge69cg4a57ga1e2g5d2d8802dbf3"
msgid "I've no idea."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = d5d33aad-552a-8c5f-c3b9-33342a551ba3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_Laezel_State_IsInParty = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion:d5d33aad-552a-8c5f-c3b9-33342a551ba3
msgctxt "h27fb772egd220g407aga62bg235a48aa7975"
msgid "No, I won't kill them! Well, maybe the gith..."
msgstr "아니, 아무도 안 죽여! 그래도 기스라면..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = d6c1ac5f-4dfc-c38e-9b51-8c1650158158
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion:d6c1ac5f-4dfc-c38e-9b51-8c1650158158
msgctxt "hc74ef59dg8ca0g445agafabg82d9ef80bb24"
msgid ""
"It's a book of necromancy, full of secrets about controlling the dead, "
"returning the dead to life, and who knows what else."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d7e5a3c2-47bf-d55e-663a-bd5e4c68c262
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion:d7e5a3c2-47bf-d55e-663a-bd5e4c68c262
msgctxt "h28b94363gcf28g4d72ga4eegf7f229fbc76b"
msgid "Give it to me, then."
msgstr "그럼 그냥 나한테 줘."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = d8abd220-4063-ddf0-4a88-3a0f71525abb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_Gale_Knows_NeedsMagicItems = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion:d8abd220-4063-ddf0-4a88-3a0f71525abb
msgctxt "hf1a704bbg976fg4a69gb786g1d9e4906eac3"
msgid "Generous, but I'd prefer to keep it. It may be rather valuable."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = dac3b8b1-c3f5-f9ca-330c-f4ab5b821b34
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion:dac3b8b1-c3f5-f9ca-330c-f4ab5b821b34
msgctxt "h51362487gffa4g478fgb459gdf8dc81d61c4"
msgid "I can't. I won't. Now - stop!"
msgstr "난 못 해. 안 할 거야. 이제 - 그만!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = de8eba98-4088-d795-bc34-bd16a1344c3f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion:de8eba98-4088-d795-bc34-bd16a1344c3f
msgctxt "h7e752110g42c6g4b73gbc88g3feee10a04d9"
msgid "Is there anything we can do?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = e2631697-4833-4b92-7f35-90bd56139408
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion:e2631697-4833-4b92-7f35-90bd56139408
msgctxt "h61744e4cgb626g4364gba02g00e9165e6a8b"
msgid ""
"Someone went through a lot of trouble to protect this tome. It has to be "
"something more than a book of cantrips."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = e5bc0557-8732-31db-c8b1-70d600b12479
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion:e5bc0557-8732-31db-c8b1-70d600b12479
msgctxt "he22665a8gcd28g416aga6d5g00323107e741"
msgid "No! There's something in here - I know it."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ea12ac86-7706-674c-6dc2-85e10e47cbcc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion:ea12ac86-7706-674c-6dc2-85e10e47cbcc
msgctxt "h99436da4g1116g4682gb3d7gbc714cc4b7e4"
msgid "You're not killing anyone in this party."
msgstr "우리 중에 죽일 사람은 없다고 말했어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = effc8cb1-1a3c-d07f-bce4-a2562c8a7cf5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion:effc8cb1-1a3c-d07f-bce4-a2562c8a7cf5
msgctxt "h761e935dg3fdeg42cdgb3f2g0b706e7e988a"
msgid "What do you mean?"
msgstr "그게 무슨 뜻이야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = f5ee3d17-b46a-473d-ff2e-b65041c85ef9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DangerousBook_IVB_CFM_Astarion:f5ee3d17-b46a-473d-ff2e-b65041c85ef9
msgctxt "h5322fae9gc400g4b88ga8cag19739f3c414b"
msgid "I was just perusing this little find and - WILL YOU SHUT UP?!"
msgstr "그냥 살짝 몇 줄만 읽고 있... <b>그 입 좀 닥쳐줄래?!</b>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 01ca55f5-e136-643e-3c39-f69c58680e21
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:01ca55f5-e136-643e-3c39-f69c58680e21
msgctxt "h161b79b7g978bg4b55g8f4ag2392c7189e99"
msgid ""
"For all the gifts Bhaal's children inherit - a peaceful night's sleep is not "
"among them."
msgstr "바알의 자손들은 숱한 선물들을 물려받지만, 평화로운 밤잠만은 예외지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 037adeef-6527-3ba9-0175-3baae726d012
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_State_DarkUrge_ToldJaheiraBhaalspawn = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:037adeef-6527-3ba9-0175-3baae726d012
msgctxt "h476ff000gda93g482cga6b6gb8f40661e07c"
msgid "Is this the reward for my confession? A dagger in the night?"
msgstr "내 고백을 이런 식으로 갚으시겠다는 건가요? 오밤중의 단검으로?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 0727cc3e-f963-f3c8-9662-15fb85c0e498
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:0727cc3e-f963-f3c8-9662-15fb85c0e498
msgctxt "h23c99c2ega904g4900ga8d5gabc919ed4361"
msgid "What more could you need?"
msgstr "더 필요한 거라도 있어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0a47358d-75e6-4a24-906e-7342a2c9b2a1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:0a47358d-75e6-4a24-906e-7342a2c9b2a1
msgctxt "hdec8382cgff55g4b52g923dg723151e23388"
msgid ""
"This power will save the world from the Absolute. The price doesn't matter."
msgstr "이 힘으로 절대자로부터 세상을 구해낼 겁니다. 대가는 중요하지 않아요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Minsc
#. NodeID = 0da14c57-6ee1-368b-64d7-4190437498ad
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:0da14c57-6ee1-368b-64d7-4190437498ad
msgctxt "h34dd8dabgf90cg49f0ga3a0gb0a2e2ba2584"
msgid ""
"Well, you cannot understand Boo's wisdom. So I suppose we must listen to "
"Jaheira instead."
msgstr "음, 넌 부의 지혜 이해하지 못한다. 그러니 자헤이라한테 대신 물어보는 게 좋겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 10368207-247a-34e0-b9b1-4f67fa6cddb2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:10368207-247a-34e0-b9b1-4f67fa6cddb2
msgctxt "ha268672ag6133g461dgb7a9ga4e96e141a6a"
msgid ""
"*You rest with the knowledge that you are being watched over. Or indeed, "
"guarded.*"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 126aefb3-1ab8-d0e9-f0d0-9d3cc6888f62
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:126aefb3-1ab8-d0e9-f0d0-9d3cc6888f62
msgctxt "h6bc31a0dga4d9g400cgb098ga40e7aa56d75"
msgid ""
"There is one last piece I've been toying with. A terrible and familiar power "
"I've sensed around you for some time."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 158847df-5385-3f80-6d0c-192e8dbd0e0d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:158847df-5385-3f80-6d0c-192e8dbd0e0d
msgctxt "h1adb4b3fg2c8ag4603g8f76g79cce2bb615b"
msgid ""
"I think I can guess. Visions of blood on your hands. The blood in your "
"<i>veins</i>, perhaps."
msgstr "알다마다. 두 손 가득 피를 묻힌 환상이겠지. 바로 네 <i>혈관</i>에 흐르는 피 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 1671112c-14d3-3a05-8c84-5acbc282b043
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:1671112c-14d3-3a05-8c84-5acbc282b043
msgctxt "h9518f348gfd0cg4858ga77fg93b13942723f"
msgid "I don't think I have any -"
msgstr "들려줄 얘기 같은 건 하나도..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 16abc409-60b6-253a-6f7f-c2af3cfffc37
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:16abc409-60b6-253a-6f7f-c2af3cfffc37
msgctxt "h60f43bf7g7f77g410ag9328ge4d30056c11d"
msgid "Distracting you."
msgstr "네 주의를 돌리고 있지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Minsc
#. NodeID = 16afb6a3-4dbf-b958-f956-93a3fe475d55
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:16afb6a3-4dbf-b958-f956-93a3fe475d55
msgctxt "hf11acbe1gb65eg4e88ga2bbg738f11ef05d3"
msgid "NO!"
msgstr "안 돼!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 16d40980-e10e-7750-887d-55c82d39ee60
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:16d40980-e10e-7750-887d-55c82d39ee60
msgctxt "h6f84d43cg2a94g4bacg90d8g2924e47e9416"
msgid ""
"In another time - with another of your kind - we found a better way. I would "
"dearly like to find it again."
msgstr "예전에도 너 같은 부류와 더 나은 길을 찾아낸 적이 있지. 다시 한 번 희망을 걸어 보겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 180e0df9-a5be-ae34-3a84-cd1b45b46ad9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:180e0df9-a5be-ae34-3a84-cd1b45b46ad9
msgctxt "he2268498g9756g4ee5g805cgeca53ad3a12e"
msgid ""
"It is not guidance I offer, but a leash. We will help you to control "
"yourself - until you can free yourself of these urges, and use the Slayer "
"form freely."
msgstr ""
"안내하려는 게 아니라 목줄을 채우려는 거다. 네가 이 충동에서 벗어나, 자유롭게 슬레이어 형태를 사용하게 될 때까지 스스로를 통제할 수 "
"있도록 돕겠다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1affc32f-3293-74f0-c16b-1574efd0a7e8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:1affc32f-3293-74f0-c16b-1574efd0a7e8
msgctxt "h6cf4c05cg1232g4f44gbda6gd763be79edbf"
msgid "Your past is not my future."
msgstr "당신의 과거와 내 미래는 다를 겁니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1e5eed98-14b6-ee4d-1a7d-23d7ab20a1e8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_DarkUrge_KilledIsobel_State_KilledIsobelByKillingNightsong = False
#.      - ORI_DarkUrge_KilledIsobel_Requirement = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:1e5eed98-14b6-ee4d-1a7d-23d7ab20a1e8
msgctxt "h9c8ce9d7g9bc2g4c78gb0d9g6bfce13d0802"
msgid "Isobel was my doing... the rest of Last Light was an accident."
msgstr "제가 이소벨을 죽였어요... 최후의 빛에서 일어난 다른 일들은 순전히 사고였어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1ea62182-e6d6-c525-fe33-bbe9ca068be2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:1ea62182-e6d6-c525-fe33-bbe9ca068be2
msgctxt "h32e5c9e8g12e5g471bga855ge3c651e2ecc7"
msgid "My rest was fine, until a looming druid came to pry."
msgstr "어떤 드루이드가 살금살금 나타나기 전까진 그럭저럭 잘 자고 있었어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2091c6d8-0326-d3bf-564e-463c0b9c83c8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_DarkUrge_KilledIsobel_Requirement = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:2091c6d8-0326-d3bf-564e-463c0b9c83c8
msgctxt "h3da7ad57g6362g48a1gafc3ge4377cfabcbc"
msgid "I stole every little life in Last Light."
msgstr "최후의 빛에서 하찮은 생명들을 거두었지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 220586c4-5928-0027-3afa-c3853e6090c2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:220586c4-5928-0027-3afa-c3853e6090c2
msgctxt "h7e02233dg3726g4587g87b4g8710e1b66214"
msgid "I don't owe you answers, especially not at sword-point."
msgstr "대답하고 싶지 않아요. 특히 칼끝을 겨누고 있는 상대라면 더더욱."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Minsc
#. NodeID = 22c7ad6e-9641-0760-f357-dda0c588b932
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:22c7ad6e-9641-0760-f357-dda0c588b932
msgctxt "hfa9eeb14g603bg490agbb88g0e75f4946160"
msgid ""
"Do not thank us, friend. It is not as if we didn't consider killing you "
"instead."
msgstr "너무 감사하지 말라고, 친구. 일이 안 좋게 돌아가면 널 죽일 작정이었으니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 27604e8d-e39d-039d-0fa8-9122dfaa96f7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:27604e8d-e39d-039d-0fa8-9122dfaa96f7
msgctxt "had560d49gd943g4e79gbc77g6f389f3d6e0e"
msgid "But that would be a mercy. One you have not earned."
msgstr "자비로 여겨도 좋다. 차마 네가 얻지 못한 것 말이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 299084b4-1297-1a7a-3b9a-735eeeca440d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:299084b4-1297-1a7a-3b9a-735eeeca440d
msgctxt "h0fd614a1geb6dg40c1g8210g51d66a033bab"
msgid ""
"This is your father's true legacy. Not his children - but the fear they "
"plant in <i>us</i>. The savagery it blossoms into."
msgstr ""
"이게 바로 네 아비의 진정한 유산이다. 놈의 핏줄들이 아니라, <i>우리</i> 내면에 자라나게 하는 공포 그 자체 말이다. 잔혹함이 그 "
"결실이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Minsc
#. NodeID = 29fdaf74-3850-6fd3-eb7d-9204ec0f107b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_3 = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:29fdaf74-3850-6fd3-eb7d-9204ec0f107b
msgctxt "hdb4cbc31g6e39g4268gb948g1605ed14328f"
msgid ""
"<i>What? </i>Evil cannot serve good, Jaheira. That is why it is <i>evil.</i>"
msgstr "<i>뭐?</i> 악은 선을 섬길 수 없다, 자헤이라. 그래서 <i>악</i>인 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2acb245d-7198-3871-e174-87a34e54291f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:2acb245d-7198-3871-e174-87a34e54291f
msgctxt "hd2717c60g3ed8g4153gb334g89d7acbf08ed"
msgid "What if I slip out of control again? You will kill me?"
msgstr "또 다시 통제 불능 상태에 빠지면 어쩌지? 나를 죽일 건가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 2c6df406-7294-951b-c46e-7f72a870bf96
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:2c6df406-7294-951b-c46e-7f72a870bf96
msgctxt "h51139a96g6430g4078ga196gcd3d5a4aac9d"
msgid ""
"You are twice-tainted, yes. But whatever you have done - you might yet serve "
"the good."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 2dea7364-ec10-32bd-7c39-e95c073b8f33
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:2dea7364-ec10-32bd-7c39-e95c073b8f33
msgctxt "hdebb3884gc0bag4d91gb376g2ba5b1729c15"
msgid ""
"You first. I find that sleep escapes me, so I might as well take the watch."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 30162e2d-5f9d-d722-945b-9ddfd495ddf7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_State_DarkUrge_ToldJaheiraBhaalspawn = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:30162e2d-5f9d-d722-945b-9ddfd495ddf7
msgctxt "h835b9427g3d2cg4b16gb2d4gd5d6620030a4"
msgid "So the game is up at last."
msgstr "이런 놀이도 이제 다 끝이군요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 301ebc08-63d3-0de3-347e-16cd3a6a765a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:301ebc08-63d3-0de3-347e-16cd3a6a765a
msgctxt "hc9b8d442g3dc9g462bg90c7g4797185b0cea"
msgid "To watch over me - or to protect against me?"
msgstr "지켜 주겠다고요? 감시하는 게 아니라?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 31b8a5fc-60d6-9a1c-fa6e-e78eed31f907
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:31b8a5fc-60d6-9a1c-fa6e-e78eed31f907
msgctxt "h0d13b0f5gae59g44c1g8732g188d9f346653"
msgid "Sleep well."
msgstr "잘 자."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 34d61986-ee7d-8b16-5d1a-2dc4b718182f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:34d61986-ee7d-8b16-5d1a-2dc4b718182f
msgctxt "h03439fc1g9c7ag482ag91d4ga8a87ac80a8b"
msgid "Then we shall make this swift."
msgstr "그럼 빨리 끝내도록 하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 36c63265-1b16-5efa-67fa-ec6e45ab0608
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:36c63265-1b16-5efa-67fa-ec6e45ab0608
msgctxt "h46d36b9bg8c05g45e9g8e39g838f2114e458"
msgid ""
"And what is it I owe? Should I allow some horror to be born anew, when I "
"could end it here and now?"
msgstr "그럼 널 살려 둬야 할 이유는 뭐지? 또 다른 공포가 새로 태어나는 모습을 지켜봐야 하나? 지금 여기서 끝장낼 수 있는데도?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3739ba60-a503-a0c7-5ea5-2b60da671aaa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:3739ba60-a503-a0c7-5ea5-2b60da671aaa
msgctxt "hcb794752g47fdg47d6g8942g949df97620d7"
msgid "My birthright, in all its vile glory."
msgstr "타고난 권리, 그것이 가져다 줄 사악한 영광들."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3b62c4a0-709f-d43e-aa2f-2a7c48ae7dcd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:3b62c4a0-709f-d43e-aa2f-2a7c48ae7dcd
msgctxt "hc6f898e4gff8fg4c8fgbff4gd0f6fb9e6fce"
msgid "Kill me then, coward. I dare you to try."
msgstr "그럼 얼른 죽여, 겁쟁이. 어디 한번 해 보라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 48b25552-4519-2241-6407-da028b197f12
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:48b25552-4519-2241-6407-da028b197f12
msgctxt "hbf4d196fgfd55g412cg98aag3bed95e5ca30"
msgid "I suppose you'll have your answer when you wake in the morning."
msgstr "내일 아침에 일어나 보면 알게 되겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Minsc
#. NodeID = 4acda949-51c3-b628-1551-edd6ac72d6ed
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:4acda949-51c3-b628-1551-edd6ac72d6ed
msgctxt "hc31940bcg5208g4740g8479g6ad5fca1457a"
msgid ""
"Leave the future for hathrans and hamsters to divine. We speak only of this "
"moment."
msgstr "미래는 하트란들한테 맡겨 놓고 햄스터를 찬양하라. 중요한 건 지금 이 순간이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Minsc
#. NodeID = 4b433203-3603-afef-c1a9-64d5ab03bab8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_Companion_Leave(2) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:4b433203-3603-afef-c1a9-64d5ab03bab8
msgctxt "had390c80gac16g4fa6gbf53g8bcb0dbec670"
msgid ""
"If there is still good in you - find it quickly, says Boo. Or the next time "
"we meet, you will know my rage."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Minsc
#. NodeID = 4baf5f47-256a-9a80-9f73-bcd349c52e06
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:4baf5f47-256a-9a80-9f73-bcd349c52e06
msgctxt "h80bcb0d0g1986g4da4ga900gf8e42e9432d9"
msgid "STORIES!"
msgstr "이야기!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4f0cf945-a0cc-fd28-cd06-04bb2c97e465
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:4f0cf945-a0cc-fd28-cd06-04bb2c97e465
msgctxt "h346f7e9fg13fdg450aga54cgdb5d5cd41df2"
msgid "My rest was fine, until a looming druid came to pry."
msgstr "어떤 드루이드가 살금살금 나타나기 전까진 그럭저럭 잘 자고 있었어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 4f471555-e6d3-7986-452b-79723bd4d31c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:4f471555-e6d3-7986-452b-79723bd4d31c
msgctxt "h7e67fa0age049g43e2g9b1cg92c8bcb327f2"
msgid ""
"Whatever its source, the Slayer form is a weapon like any other. And if you "
"mean to master it, I know where you must go."
msgstr ""
"과정이야 어쨌든, 슬레이어 형태는 유용한 무기가 될 수 있어. 그 힘을 지배할 방법을 찾고 있다면, 어디로 가야 하는지 알고 있지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 4fcaf8ec-e8fe-8dd6-6c89-d3ce66265e5f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:4fcaf8ec-e8fe-8dd6-6c89-d3ce66265e5f
msgctxt "h31264ab6g7662g498fg89a0gdc8bc46a8b25"
msgid ""
"That <i>birthright</i> may well bring you to a bloody end. How many should I "
"allow to go with you?"
msgstr "네 <i>생득권</i>은 결국 피비린내 나는 결말만을 가져다 줄 뿐이야. 당최 얼마나 많은 이들을 끌어들일 생각이지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Minsc
#. NodeID = 4fcbfbc3-d560-e2f2-45f2-dab444a0aa94
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:4fcbfbc3-d560-e2f2-45f2-dab444a0aa94
msgctxt "h1489fe09gfe18g41c4ga44fg30edfc53b95e"
msgid ""
"As will I. Jaheira tells me a debt is owed - even if my heart and hamster do "
"not understand it."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 5369588e-6974-0d58-f598-87931fdfaa7a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:5369588e-6974-0d58-f598-87931fdfaa7a
msgctxt "h82e7ba34g947cg427fg9f0aga43db762dbb9"
msgid ""
"If I must lie awake, then so must you - only fair, considering that <i>you</"
"i> are the reason. "
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 53bb24e0-c108-215b-ec8c-1502c7957f14
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_Companion_Leave(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:53bb24e0-c108-215b-ec8c-1502c7957f14
msgctxt "h9c8afaa4g12d1g471cg9b63gc6377f334c96"
msgid ""
"As you wish, then. We take our leave. I hope you have mastered yourself, "
"when next we meet. If not, we will do what we must."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 544bfa13-f961-dae6-fed2-caecaa70fa4d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:544bfa13-f961-dae6-fed2-caecaa70fa4d
msgctxt "h14588cc8gb3f3g45e2ga06egc44f4579ed21"
msgid ""
"The dreams alone do not concern me. It is what waking deeds they might "
"inspire."
msgstr "꿈속에만 머무른다면 아무 문제 없지. 깨어난 뒤에도 영향을 준다면 문제가 되고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 54e39265-429e-f654-ad32-3ab8c3307081
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_DarkUrge_State_GivenSlayerForm = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:54e39265-429e-f654-ad32-3ab8c3307081
msgctxt "hc29e85aeg5e50g4f56g9416gd7934761e4c7"
msgid ""
"*The sleeping blood-beast within claws and scratches at your resting mind. "
"You are, as ever, mere hairs away from its grasp.*"
msgstr ""
"*잠자는 핏빛 짐승이 평온한 마음을 발톱으로 긁어 댑니다. 항상 그래왔듯, 당신은 손 닿을 거리에 떨어져 있는 머리카락에 지나지 "
"않습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 55de0f90-9fb1-e425-c93a-d77e599e027d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:55de0f90-9fb1-e425-c93a-d77e599e027d
msgctxt "hc83a331agde4ag47d5gb66agd89547acdbc3"
msgid "Then would you call it mercy, if the next night I never let you wake?"
msgstr "그럼 다시는 깨어나지 않도록 해 주면, 기꺼이 받아들이겠나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Minsc
#. NodeID = 55fc44fd-2eec-727a-6f9a-5dc98ff29d2f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:55fc44fd-2eec-727a-6f9a-5dc98ff29d2f
msgctxt "h93759c46g1723g4a5fga404g0896bb8502ed"
msgid "But not yours alone to walk."
msgstr "꼭 혼자 선택할 필요는 없다네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 59022f9e-e03d-98dc-10f7-5d80c4397f5f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:59022f9e-e03d-98dc-10f7-5d80c4397f5f
msgctxt "he80f85e5g9dddg4590g8ca0g9d99f84abe0d"
msgid "I suppose you do not."
msgstr "그럴 일은 없을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 59ece9bd-9243-09d1-9f12-b554685964b0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:59ece9bd-9243-09d1-9f12-b554685964b0
msgctxt "hf7266ef8g25d8g44a1g8740g826ac8fb78fe"
msgid ""
"And so I come to ask: what did it take for you to earn that Slayer-skin you "
"hide so well?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 5a788ea7-3ba9-31a5-e9b3-829a1a0af2a8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:5a788ea7-3ba9-31a5-e9b3-829a1a0af2a8
msgctxt "h5c2971f0gfa09g4b96ga1f8g2fd2826a896e"
msgid ""
"*The ranger's thoughts flit through your own, searching, probing for "
"something specific. Until he finds...*"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5b48e6bd-eb1b-8c4c-3ebd-08b282376570
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:5b48e6bd-eb1b-8c4c-3ebd-08b282376570
msgctxt "h54b6899bg3eecg46e5gb9acga6fcfc94ad3f"
msgid "Thank you. For everything."
msgstr "고마워요. 전부 다요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5d66019f-32b1-78ee-1186-d26b82be9622
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:5d66019f-32b1-78ee-1186-d26b82be9622
msgctxt "h26603f55gef5ag4409g8b5egc98ee1ef1ed8"
msgid "Helpless. Like I can deny him nothing."
msgstr "무력함. 내게 거부권 따윈 없는 것 같아요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 5e7bba83-3662-e237-b4a9-79c16f6abd87
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:5e7bba83-3662-e237-b4a9-79c16f6abd87
msgctxt "h4a329f78g3429g4fc0ga787g1529ee20f263"
msgid ""
"The burden of your blood is yours to carry, but you need not carry it alone."
msgstr "네 혈통은 스스로 짊어져야 할 짐이겠지만, 혼자 짊어질 필요는 없다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 5ec905b2-90fa-46f7-5c54-8061bd2900ab
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:5ec905b2-90fa-46f7-5c54-8061bd2900ab
msgctxt "h142f8aadgb7d5g4708ga233g2bd29baa226e"
msgid ""
"It might be that you have to turn and face her - you cannot change that. All "
"you can choose is <i>how</i> you meet her: as another bloodied child of "
"Bhaal, or as yourself."
msgstr ""
"피할 수 없다면 차라리 정면으로 맞서야 할지도 몰라. 변치 않는 사실이지. 다만 <i>어떤 모습으로</i> 대면할지는 네 선택에 달려 "
"있어. 또 다른 바알의 피투성이 자식이거나, 너 자신으로서."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5f6a23e2-0175-fbdf-35d5-079a31b8f685
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_State_DarkUrge_ToldJaheiraBhaalspawn = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:5f6a23e2-0175-fbdf-35d5-079a31b8f685
msgctxt "h88a47626ga1e2g4860g9d1cg556443c01dfa"
msgid "Is this the reward for my confession? A dagger in the night?"
msgstr "내 고백을 이런 식으로 갚으시겠다는 건가요? 오밤중의 단검으로?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 6127dbcc-c60c-a126-44f8-a4bc02867c0c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:6127dbcc-c60c-a126-44f8-a4bc02867c0c
msgctxt "h1c6fef01gfb95g4d9eg965aga7fbdb49ed8b"
msgid ""
"Cast yourself into the dark if you wish. I mean to be there to pull you back "
"- by the hand, or the scruff."
msgstr "정 그러고 싶다면 어둠 속으로 뛰어들라고. 난 네 녀석을 뒤로 끌어당기려는 것뿐이니. 손을 잡든, 목덜미를 잡든 말이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 61efe005-3d9a-075d-8c27-317bff2316e6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:61efe005-3d9a-075d-8c27-317bff2316e6
msgctxt "hf371f326g68b7g4e6ag8fe6g26077c65e7d8"
msgid "For now, take what rest you can - we will watch over you this night."
msgstr "당장은 쉴 수 있을 때 쉬어 둬. 우리가 밤새 네 곁을 지킬게."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 6222ac69-23a3-7b2b-4f9a-849fd2fb5ce7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:6222ac69-23a3-7b2b-4f9a-849fd2fb5ce7
msgctxt "hf57ef256g72b0g4b5fg9939g165230d771cb"
msgid "So - what did it take to earn that new Slayer-skin of yours?"
msgstr "그래, 새로운 슬레이어 형상을 얻기 위해 어떤 대가를 바쳤지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Minsc
#. NodeID = 6247b653-3262-b80c-2dec-d8a9fc49aa57
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:6247b653-3262-b80c-2dec-d8a9fc49aa57
msgctxt "h615696abg1155g4c75g8eb9g5e803f0b2400"
msgid ""
"And for this, you will need Boo. He has tasted Bhaalspawn flesh before - and "
"he would not mind another bite."
msgstr ""
"그러자면 부의 도움이 필요할 거다. 부는 이미 한 번 바알스폰의 살점을 맛봤지. 한 입 더 먹는다고 무슨 일이 생기진 않을 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 64e65f54-8832-a44a-9ee9-e20db00704db
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:64e65f54-8832-a44a-9ee9-e20db00704db
msgctxt "hff328b5bgcc9cg4e3bg93b0ga7d7527a4093"
msgid "How do I know you won't kill me?"
msgstr "자다가 목이 달아날지 누가 알겠어요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Minsc
#. NodeID = 6859d2ad-3ebd-6e3e-c5ce-cd917715e252
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:6859d2ad-3ebd-6e3e-c5ce-cd917715e252
msgctxt "h2f13b4e7g36dfg4e39gaf83g8ae586a9b0fb"
msgid "...<i>No.</i>"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 685e9d83-6a5f-d5d4-1d2c-9332118464ff
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:685e9d83-6a5f-d5d4-1d2c-9332118464ff
msgctxt "h40f63595gb9f5g4e62g8eeag578c5847e842"
msgid "And if I embrace Father's power? Grant unto him my love?"
msgstr "아버지의 힘을 받아들이면, 내 사랑을 받아 주시지 않을까요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 689539ed-2a9b-ab40-6f41-ef76bfb235a6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:689539ed-2a9b-ab40-6f41-ef76bfb235a6
msgctxt "h81a3f294g278cg408fg9819ge539178e4f37"
msgid ""
"I've been sensing something, you see. A formless but familiar dread, which I "
"have only now been able to put a name to."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 6c71f885-abea-fd2f-c5f0-14dca6f64246
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:6c71f885-abea-fd2f-c5f0-14dca6f64246
msgctxt "hdf9591c0g6c88g4471gb548gee0bc9e3a2dc"
msgid ""
"I <i>believe</i> it went over a cliff-edge, buried in an ogre's backside. "
"And it was <i>still </i>talking..."
msgstr ""
"놈이 낭떠러지 아래로 떨어져, 오우거 엉덩이 밑에 깔렸다고 <i>믿었지</i>. 그런데도 <i>여전히</i> 떠들기를 멈추지 않더군..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6c7ec6c6-acf0-cfce-4e38-3a933577ade2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:6c7ec6c6-acf0-cfce-4e38-3a933577ade2
msgctxt "hce77d0a0g54b8g457ag9979g778c2e4dfe50"
msgid "Come on, let's go back to sleep."
msgstr "좋아, 다시 자러 가자고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Minsc
#. NodeID = 6fe33ff4-d8e2-5c06-2e76-be1f7a262264
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: MALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:6fe33ff4-d8e2-5c06-2e76-be1f7a262264
msgctxt "h03fec09cg28e7g4e72gb801ged67b255b0dd"
msgid "Jaheira, he tried to make me... I <i>almost</i>..."
msgstr "자헤이라, 녀석이 나를... 난 <i>더 이상</i>..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Minsc
#. NodeID = 6fe33ff4-d8e2-5c06-2e76-be1f7a262264
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: FEMALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:6fe33ff4-d8e2-5c06-2e76-be1f7a262264
msgctxt "h2e5f8df2g09a2g4b38ga57ag990e1cbcd3c9"
msgid "Jaheira, she tried to make me... I <i>almost</i>..."
msgstr "자헤이라, 녀석이 나를... 난 <i>더 이상</i>..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Minsc
#. NodeID = 6fe33ff4-d8e2-5c06-2e76-be1f7a262264
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:6fe33ff4-d8e2-5c06-2e76-be1f7a262264
msgctxt "h99fa4fa7g338bg4d94g998bg0b87966257a6"
msgid "Jaheira, they tried to make me... I <i>almost</i>..."
msgstr "자헤이라, 녀석이 나를... 난 <i>더 이상</i>..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 70d243b2-c796-296e-d829-52f9532e5939
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:70d243b2-c796-296e-d829-52f9532e5939
msgctxt "h44c56925gcf64g4168gab2agd6498f2f5226"
msgid "For now, take what rest you can - I will watch over you this night."
msgstr "당장은 쉴 수 있을 때 쉬어 둬. 오늘밤은 내가 곁에서 지켜 줄게."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 71a3e1e8-69da-cf7c-014b-b18595c68c53
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_State_DarkUrge_ToldJaheiraBhaalspawn = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:71a3e1e8-69da-cf7c-014b-b18595c68c53
msgctxt "he4d9236bg498eg4852gaad6gc8569215409e"
msgid "How could you possibly know?"
msgstr "도대체 어떻게 알아내신 거죠?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 71f1857b-c27f-f9f5-f2f7-ef45f17a30ac
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_3 = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:71f1857b-c27f-f9f5-f2f7-ef45f17a30ac
msgctxt "h78ac015cgad43g4ba6g8a7dgb87ffc3099f7"
msgid ""
"I have spent my life fighting your father in whatever form he chose to take. "
"By rights, I should cut you down here."
msgstr "나는 네 아비와 싸우는 데 일생을 바쳤다. 놈이 어떤 형태를 취했든 말이지. 의무에 따라, 여기서 널 죽이겠다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 727afaf6-3270-97b7-f4df-66470aa51696
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:727afaf6-3270-97b7-f4df-66470aa51696
msgctxt "h2dc00d3cg0d7fg4776g84a3g7a5808d3eb17"
msgid ""
"Innocent blood. As innocent as my own: I have no control over when my body "
"kills."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 74cfaa53-1ef1-c4c0-a0fd-b8c8448bcb23
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - NIGHT_DarkUrge_BloodWeddingFollowup = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:74cfaa53-1ef1-c4c0-a0fd-b8c8448bcb23
msgctxt "hbcb76ba7g9eb0g438fga6d6ge3bc4458ddf2"
msgid ""
"*Another watches your body, while it is possessed by the night. You do not "
"dream alone.*"
msgstr "*밤기운에 사로잡혀 있는 동안 또 다른 누군가가 당신의 육신을 지켜봅니다. 잠자리가 어수선합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 7654d0f0-33cc-2652-f59a-9743072c4055
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:7654d0f0-33cc-2652-f59a-9743072c4055
msgctxt "hcece2983g6025g45e3gbb82gd9f802433f05"
msgid ""
"*A single prod is enough to send his fury into a twisted spiral, wrapping "
"around you then storming over to Jaheira.*"
msgstr "*단 한 번의 자극으로 그의 분노가 뒤틀린 나사 형상을 취하더니, 당신을 감싸고는 이내 자헤이라를 향해 돌진합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Minsc
#. NodeID = 772f3b83-9119-e395-0643-567998936bed
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:772f3b83-9119-e395-0643-567998936bed
msgctxt "h2e173d75g0f67g4e23gae18g30cb1d2feb9f"
msgid ""
"You will answer for this, fiend. And it will be an answer of the "
"<i>screaming</i> sort."
msgstr "대가를 치러야 할 거다, 마귀여. 이번엔 특별히 <i>비명</i>으로 받아 가도록 하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7889b8b1-8bf4-c079-5609-303df8f1384e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_3 = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - ILLITHID(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:7889b8b1-8bf4-c079-5609-303df8f1384e
msgctxt "hfdddbf58g19e6g4836gbefbga46b63d7ec17"
msgid "<i>Poke at Minsc's mind to stoke his rage.</i>"
msgstr "<i>민스크의 정신을 건드려 분노를 일으킨다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 7b46784c-1315-ac30-bafd-26e138efdb2c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:7b46784c-1315-ac30-bafd-26e138efdb2c
msgctxt "h7b8ca5edgdfcfg499fga81cg991e40fef3f8"
msgid ""
"You would not be the first to turn the taint in your blood to your "
"advantage. But there are barriers a Bhaalspawn must overcome, first."
msgstr "네 혈관에 흐르는 오점을 유리한 쪽으로 써먹었던 사람이 있긴 했지. 하지만 먼저 바알스폰으로서 뛰어넘어야 할 장벽이 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Minsc
#. NodeID = 7ce74364-31be-8cd9-d7ad-52c1a6e9455f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:7ce74364-31be-8cd9-d7ad-52c1a6e9455f
msgctxt "h3b7d3dbag8db0g45e6g9d60g1caf864102e2"
msgid ""
"I think you are still dreaming if you see a dagger before you. She has a "
"sword - two of them, in fact."
msgstr "눈앞에 단검이 보이면 아직 꿈속에 있는 거다. 그녀는 검을 들고 있다. 무려 두 개나."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7d7692f6-5400-52d8-5dd5-397b8aafc0ea
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:7d7692f6-5400-52d8-5dd5-397b8aafc0ea
msgctxt "h748bdcf9g82b2g4911ga48fg07e7af745eee"
msgid "I intend to become Bhaal's Chosen. So bow, or die."
msgstr "난 바알의 간택자가 될 자다. 엎드려 절하거나 죽어라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 7f179bec-37dc-20d9-37fd-81c234e962b8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:7f179bec-37dc-20d9-37fd-81c234e962b8
msgctxt "he53c5bcfge6ecg403egb5e8g085ffee38cc3"
msgid ""
"Whatever path you choose, I fear it will lead you to the same point. The "
"same enemy."
msgstr "어떤 길을 선택하든, 결국 모든 선택이 하나의 지점, 하나의 적으로 이어지지는 않을까 우려스럽군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Minsc
#. NodeID = 811c7240-2336-8255-4d36-eb911099f4df
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:811c7240-2336-8255-4d36-eb911099f4df
msgctxt "h6797858dg552ag44c7g9875g1ec37a5480b1"
msgid ""
"Are we so faithless? As you wish - while we watch over you, Boo shall be "
"watching over us."
msgstr "우리가 그렇게 못 미더운가? 마음대로 해라. 우리가 널 지켜보는 동안 부 또한 우릴 지켜볼 테니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 824af68b-a648-72ee-a20d-de46a9c12977
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:824af68b-a648-72ee-a20d-de46a9c12977
msgctxt "h225000cfga968g4e3ega4acg83523143ce15"
msgid ""
"All I can offer is the promise that, should you choose to do so, you will "
"not meet her alone."
msgstr "만약 내 말대로 하겠다면, 약속하지. 그 여자와 홀로 독대하게 될 일은 없을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Minsc
#. NodeID = 8a176be2-ceb0-3eaa-f85a-aaa0806b818a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:8a176be2-ceb0-3eaa-f85a-aaa0806b818a
msgctxt "h86baf434g1232g43ceg899eg7ac424416fd4"
msgid "Have you ever fought with a talking sword?"
msgstr "말하는 검이랑 싸워 본 적 있나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 8a4fe6f9-7e7b-3497-328a-3c4c133e6afc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:8a4fe6f9-7e7b-3497-328a-3c4c133e6afc
msgctxt "h6c952e31g392ag4d03gac2ag90083ddc0f3b"
msgid ""
"You have not confessed it all, I think. There is something in the air "
"tonight - the scent of a terrible and familiar power."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 8accb119-3c93-c5da-a4e0-d3193adfa952
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:8accb119-3c93-c5da-a4e0-d3193adfa952
msgctxt "h886715ceg4730g4dffga5d9g2aa5e7289076"
msgid "And when you stand against him, you will not stand alone."
msgstr "놈에게 맞서기로 결심했다면, 혼자 맞서도록 두지 않으마."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 8e9fe29e-1705-91cf-383d-ba7bf96a83af
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:8e9fe29e-1705-91cf-383d-ba7bf96a83af
msgctxt "h5274e8e3g5cc1g4102g9cb3g958f1664fade"
msgid ""
"Perhaps I was too swift to put up my blades. But we will not play into your "
"father's hands this night."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = GROUP_ORI_DU
#. NodeID = 8fce5daf-6a4d-bab6-cd7d-0e2f912b17f7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 18
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:8fce5daf-6a4d-bab6-cd7d-0e2f912b17f7
msgctxt "h07223faegcbdbg4327gbf2agfdf0cfc653b3"
msgid "Or perhaps I will take you to my Father directly - as trophies."
msgstr "어쩌면 널 아버지께 전리품으로 바쳐도 좋겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 90012619-2fe2-a815-0ade-2ef5a1c91358
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:90012619-2fe2-a815-0ade-2ef5a1c91358
msgctxt "h117777a0g97c4g48d5g8292g64f4eeec375b"
msgid "<i>Wait. </i>"
msgstr "<i>잠깐. </i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 93b1b4e1-43db-30a7-0fc1-b4e57c251174
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:93b1b4e1-43db-30a7-0fc1-b4e57c251174
msgctxt "he5f8922age2ccg437eg93dfgdd371af05632"
msgid "My path is mine alone to choose."
msgstr "내 길은 내가 선택합니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 970fcb12-750a-ddbc-7e3d-57464c943323
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:970fcb12-750a-ddbc-7e3d-57464c943323
msgctxt "hd407a51bgd3b0g4da8gb260gd3b52f26c26b"
msgid "Lilarcor."
msgstr "라일라코르 얘기군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9ae14dc4-53a5-1fe1-4cbc-7fb38304e337
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_3 = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:9ae14dc4-53a5-1fe1-4cbc-7fb38304e337
msgctxt "hf6751b92gc62bg42a2g80f5ga6c76cbc1332"
msgid ""
"I won't sleep again. Tell me something of the old days, since they're on "
"your mind."
msgstr "잠이 오지 않네요. 얘기가 나와서 말인데 옛날 얘기 좀 들려주시죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9b13edc5-0583-a5be-e683-e6ba4195ec4f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:9b13edc5-0583-a5be-e683-e6ba4195ec4f
msgctxt "he259a7f8gacb3g4fbcg801bg272e28974a1b"
msgid "'A better way?' It's too late. My cruel deeds cannot be undone."
msgstr "'더 나은 길?'이라고요? 너무 늦었어요. 내 악행은 되돌릴 수 없습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Minsc
#. NodeID = 9de3a4ce-05ee-cd30-91e6-fc4a87f0efdb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:9de3a4ce-05ee-cd30-91e6-fc4a87f0efdb
msgctxt "h008bb533gf1f5g4220g809cg384d9febed18"
msgid ""
"Boo remembers the scent of Bhaalspawn. Like rot on the tongue - meaning no "
"offence."
msgstr "부는 바알스폰의 냄새를 기억한다. 혀가 썩는 냄새지. 악의는 없다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 9e884cd4-07e3-72c6-8ac2-f07e1950ceb0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:9e884cd4-07e3-72c6-8ac2-f07e1950ceb0
msgctxt "h10e08155g2f8eg4d9dg8c57gb0da79ce1297"
msgid "There we have our answer. But we might as well hear it from you."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9efc2295-7020-c7fd-a022-b44dac0660bf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_State_DarkUrge_ToldJaheiraBhaalspawn = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:9efc2295-7020-c7fd-a022-b44dac0660bf
msgctxt "h2566502fgce01g435bgae1cg02a444566768"
msgid "How could you possibly know?"
msgstr "도대체 어떻게 알아내신 거죠?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 9f5bd000-5ad9-eb87-77af-de1408a97a6e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:9f5bd000-5ad9-eb87-77af-de1408a97a6e
msgctxt "h8a262310g64ccg4fdbg8427gbcd0b5b826f8"
msgid ""
"*For a moment, the briefest, weakest moment, Jaheira appears as she truly "
"is. Simply an old woman, uncertain and <i>afraid.</i>*"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = a0f77e14-39de-d983-8fd3-e5ead19faccf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:a0f77e14-39de-d983-8fd3-e5ead19faccf
msgctxt "h614400f0g2e2bg423aga7d1gdc90626f9432"
msgid "For now, rest. Sleep escapes me, so I might as well take the watch."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Minsc
#. NodeID = a10a4346-3ff7-8329-be33-8650a13f4264
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:a10a4346-3ff7-8329-be33-8650a13f4264
msgctxt "ha6e145bcg16f3g4844gad70g854ff957e5a8"
msgid "We do not loom, friend. We tread soft and sure as hunting hamsters."
msgstr "우린 살금살금 걷지 않았다, 친구. 사냥에 나선 햄스터처럼 부드럽고 확실하게 걸었지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = a502f04e-d327-7534-7239-babbb301476d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_3 = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:a502f04e-d327-7534-7239-babbb301476d
msgctxt "h08d87d5cg93a4g4f91g9414g4d3d2e557cbc"
msgid ""
"*A spike of rage, quickly muffled - Minsc's mind still lingers near your "
"own, and he does not like what is coming to pass.*"
msgstr ""
"*분노가 솟구쳤다가 빠르게 가라앉습니다. 민스크의 정신은 여전히 당신의 정신 가장자리를 서성이고 있습니다. 그는 돌아가는 상황이 마음에 "
"들지 않는 것 같습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Minsc
#. NodeID = a6587f0d-ff3c-75bb-02cb-f48601e97278
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: MALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:a6587f0d-ff3c-75bb-02cb-f48601e97278
msgctxt "h08663a47g18afg4906g8787g9f57e02505ad"
msgid ""
"But you have reminded us that when evil calls, we might stop our ears with "
"virtuous cotton. <i>Hasn't</i> he, Jaheira?"
msgstr "하지만 네 덕에 새삼 깨달았다. 악이 부르거든, 의로운 목화솜으로 귀를 막아버리면 그만이다. <i>안 그래</i>, 자헤이라?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Minsc
#. NodeID = a6587f0d-ff3c-75bb-02cb-f48601e97278
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: FEMALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:a6587f0d-ff3c-75bb-02cb-f48601e97278
msgctxt "h4508b453gb433g4166ga8adg751d2cd8f5f4"
msgid ""
"But you have reminded us that when evil calls, we might stop our ears with "
"virtuous cotton. <i>Hasn't</i> she, Jaheira?"
msgstr "하지만 네 덕에 새삼 깨달았다. 악이 부르거든, 의로운 목화솜으로 귀를 막아버리면 그만이다. <i>안 그래</i>, 자헤이라?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Minsc
#. NodeID = a6587f0d-ff3c-75bb-02cb-f48601e97278
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:a6587f0d-ff3c-75bb-02cb-f48601e97278
msgctxt "h14d0a734g9727g4291g8801ge264b941b5a0"
msgid ""
"But you have reminded us that when evil calls, we might stop our ears with "
"virtuous cotton. <i>Haven't </i>they, Jaheira?"
msgstr "하지만 네 덕에 새삼 깨달았다. 악이 부르거든, 의로운 목화솜으로 귀를 막아버리면 그만이다. <i>안 그래</i>, 자헤이라?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = a65fc99e-5e45-9ea1-517d-ee85c427a85a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:a65fc99e-5e45-9ea1-517d-ee85c427a85a
msgctxt "h93c68a2dgf3f2g4f2cg8812g1731d9d92bb8"
msgid ""
"Are you truly your own master? What is it you feel, when father's dreams "
"come calling?"
msgstr "너는 진정 너 스스로의 주인인가? 아버지의 꿈이 찾아오면 어떤 기분이 들지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Minsc
#. NodeID = a8f0a00d-c1bb-eaaf-c56b-10c217b515ef
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:a8f0a00d-c1bb-eaaf-c56b-10c217b515ef
msgctxt "h1d319367gc542g4118ga0bag71f2056eba95"
msgid ""
"She is worrying. Which worries me. Which worries Boo. Which ought to worry "
"<i>you.</i>"
msgstr "그녀는 걱정하고 있다. 나도 그렇고, 부도 그렇지. <i>너</i>도 걱정하는 게 좋을 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a928ec86-6e35-cfdc-c02e-c7c935dfcdb1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:a928ec86-6e35-cfdc-c02e-c7c935dfcdb1
msgctxt "h673e754ag38f4g4c51g8a2fg96f807f3dadb"
msgid "Bathing in my dearest friend's gore."
msgstr "가장 소중한 친구의 피로 목욕했지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ab9e977f-077e-d9d5-df50-0e52342f0a5a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:ab9e977f-077e-d9d5-df50-0e52342f0a5a
msgctxt "hf00e8b84g1119g4d4fg80ccg53318d59295b"
msgid "My rest was fine, until a looming druid came to pry."
msgstr "어떤 드루이드가 살금살금 나타나기 전까진 그럭저럭 잘 자고 있었어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b7a8ac3d-8952-593b-8ca0-5bee52bf52f2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_State_DarkUrge_ToldJaheiraBhaalspawn = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:b7a8ac3d-8952-593b-8ca0-5bee52bf52f2
msgctxt "h49f491d2g8229g4f9fg9319gfae5eba8a9d8"
msgid "So the game is up at last."
msgstr "이런 놀이도 이제 다 끝이군요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = b97e2f6f-1db4-3184-80ef-84c165ddf4f9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_3 = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:b97e2f6f-1db4-3184-80ef-84c165ddf4f9
msgctxt "h7810b388gdf8fg4fe6gb62eg431a235253ca"
msgid ""
"You know better than that, <i>Stone Lord.</i> We found the good in you - and "
"we found it in another Bhaalspawn, once before."
msgstr ""
"너도 잘 알고 있을 텐데, <i>바위 군주.</i> 우린 네 안의 선을 찾아냈어. 예전에도 또 다른 바알스폰에게서 같은 걸 발견했었지, "
"아마."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = badec5ee-efb1-490b-3b79-590b65487b19
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:badec5ee-efb1-490b-3b79-590b65487b19
msgctxt "h0d87b97bg62b9g48f9g8080gd356e84983cb"
msgid ""
"I've slept beside a Bhaalspawn before. I know the signs - the dreams, the "
"urges... the <i>power.</i>"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = bd468f04-18aa-a630-b82f-cea269eacbda
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:bd468f04-18aa-a630-b82f-cea269eacbda
msgctxt "h09380d9egce1eg4cdegbde3gbcdf08d94baf"
msgid ""
"No need for such dramatics. I will go with eyes wide open - and the hope "
"that I know you a little better than you know yourself."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Minsc
#. NodeID = bd5f6bee-d032-0743-8235-d40eb3a708cb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:bd5f6bee-d032-0743-8235-d40eb3a708cb
msgctxt "he7ec293eg3de9g47ebg9305g508911acdae8"
msgid ""
"Yes! A mighty blade, but a mouthy one, too. I wonder what happened to it."
msgstr "그거야! 강력한 칼이지만 입이 너무 많다. 무슨 일이 있었는지 궁금하다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = bd842e30-ae1f-22f0-8bed-0deaeba246d1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:bd842e30-ae1f-22f0-8bed-0deaeba246d1
msgctxt "h8e6466b7g038dg4dc0gbecfg5f45930fd34c"
msgid "Dark dreams?"
msgstr "어두운 꿈이었나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = bf901b46-7faa-d1df-40c3-716335a3e0f2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:bf901b46-7faa-d1df-40c3-716335a3e0f2
msgctxt "h2377b034g29c6g4fd7gbc18ga3ee69d28a17"
msgid ""
"Show daddy dear that you alone choose your fate. You are a child of Bhaal - "
"but that need not be <i>all</i> that you are."
msgstr ""
"네 아빠 앞에서 스스로 운명을 선택하는 모습을 보여 줘. 넌 바알의 아이지만, 그걸로 네 <i>전부</i>가 결정되는 건 아니니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = c1d8f548-1c4c-2635-62d6-863f848ca0ae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:c1d8f548-1c4c-2635-62d6-863f848ca0ae
msgctxt "hfb6c4b2fg02eeg4fb8g8c55gf8caadd519ad"
msgid "Almost. There is but one piece left to play."
msgstr "아마도. 아직 끼워 맞출 퍼즐이 하나 더 남았어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = c2af887f-310f-a346-4f06-a806cf4afb19
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:c2af887f-310f-a346-4f06-a806cf4afb19
msgctxt "h4ee795dfg03beg4007g9d5ag903571f5fb5e"
msgid "I am truly bored of that phrase."
msgstr "그 대사는 정말이지 지긋지긋하군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = c2e9fce9-9683-c1c4-a843-59c1c876524b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:c2e9fce9-9683-c1c4-a843-59c1c876524b
msgctxt "h033609e9gda01g4fa7gbdb0ge885b91c6015"
msgid "I don't - not yet."
msgstr "추측일 뿐이야. 아직은."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c300d15a-6883-a2fe-0529-8f856ff18990
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_State_DarkUrge_ToldJaheiraBhaalspawn = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:c300d15a-6883-a2fe-0529-8f856ff18990
msgctxt "hee4bcce1gcd75g401fgab61gf99930eb919c"
msgid "How could you possibly know?"
msgstr "도대체 어떻게 알아내신 거죠?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c32d5284-1214-cc08-ffe5-654397b6f99f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:c32d5284-1214-cc08-ffe5-654397b6f99f
msgctxt "h5d738679gae46g41edg8258gc6b9500c6938"
msgid "Tell me what I must do."
msgstr "뭘 해야 할지 알려줘요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = c37a1c76-9694-9f72-6efd-26f47cb31915
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:c37a1c76-9694-9f72-6efd-26f47cb31915
msgctxt "hbfd7e772g1b50g43f1gb183g66257c8400f5"
msgid "Ever the Bhaalspawn's lot. To bring death, or wait for it to find them."
msgstr "바알스폰의 숙명이란. 죽음을 불러오거나, 찾아오길 기다려야 하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c57f7a23-e560-cb1c-361b-86ffdab31d43
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_State_DarkUrge_ToldJaheiraBhaalspawn = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:c57f7a23-e560-cb1c-361b-86ffdab31d43
msgctxt "h9e291908g046bg4740gbc6eg0190783add3d"
msgid "Is this the reward for my confession? A dagger in the night?"
msgstr "내 고백을 이런 식으로 갚으시겠다는 건가요? 오밤중의 단검으로?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = c5c6bbb7-3e3a-200b-15c7-94c209bf5885
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:c5c6bbb7-3e3a-200b-15c7-94c209bf5885
msgctxt "hdf628625gc1b7g435dgbc39g196724529667"
msgid ""
"Those of your kind. Orin - I am sure you already know that so long as she "
"lives, she will never stop hunting you."
msgstr "네 동족, 오린 말이야. 그 여자가 살아있는 한 끈질기게 널 찾아다닐 거라는 사실을 모르지는 않겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ccb17e1f-161d-3977-456e-1a1daa021ddf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:ccb17e1f-161d-3977-456e-1a1daa021ddf
msgctxt "h43b952bcgda08g4e0cg9afagad4d4a3dc22d"
msgid "It's sickening. I never asked for this power, and hope to be rid of it."
msgstr "역겨워요. 어차피 원하지도 않은 힘인데, 얼른 사라져버리기만을 바랄 뿐이죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d0cb581f-0a44-e90a-0140-9a6440ddd135
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_State_DarkUrge_ToldJaheiraBhaalspawn = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:d0cb581f-0a44-e90a-0140-9a6440ddd135
msgctxt "h47915bd4g7d6bg4b4bga320gd737440a7387"
msgid "So the game is up at last."
msgstr "이런 놀이도 이제 다 끝이군요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = d119bc12-dd9d-11b1-8b0a-ac674ad0382d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:d119bc12-dd9d-11b1-8b0a-ac674ad0382d
msgctxt "hf9ab6c15ga952g456dga00bg2d23aed72257"
msgid "You will be protected. Even from yourself."
msgstr "아무도 널 해칠 수 없을 거다. 너 자신조차도."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = daac06f1-3b2b-4fe3-8525-bfbe80d33244
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:daac06f1-3b2b-4fe3-8525-bfbe80d33244
msgctxt "h826a4189gf715g4fa9g89b2g7a70fa68c8e7"
msgid ""
"*Tonight's troubled rest is, as ever, overwhelmed by your killing fate. You "
"dangle above a dark precipice, one move away from falling.*"
msgstr ""
"*여느 때와 같이, 간밤의 근심 어린 휴식은 피비린내 나는 운명으로 뒤덮입니다. 당신은 어두운 절벽 위에 매달려 있고, 살짝만 움직여도 "
"추락할 수 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = dabc60b7-6d4e-7b3a-4c87-46ea46a29e42
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:dabc60b7-6d4e-7b3a-4c87-46ea46a29e42
msgctxt "h67a1c25fg0afdg4e96ga90fg6102f9ad0cc5"
msgid "What are you doing, Jaheira?"
msgstr "자헤이라, 무슨 일이죠?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = db3ab3ac-1383-7bb5-96c7-141ee51cb9a8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:db3ab3ac-1383-7bb5-96c7-141ee51cb9a8
msgctxt "heacfab40g40d1g46c4gbc32gf119f843325c"
msgid "Don't patronise me. I can do without your guidance."
msgstr "선심 쓰는 척하지 마. 당신의 안내 따윈 없어도 그만이니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = defca531-2f65-ce6e-2552-1b66d8cbbb24
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:defca531-2f65-ce6e-2552-1b66d8cbbb24
msgctxt "h9b34d754ga654g4e74g9c00gbffa7df24903"
msgid ""
"You are what you are, child of Bhaal. But that need not be <i>all</i> that "
"you are."
msgstr "그게 바로 네 본모습이란다, 바알의 아이야. 하지만 그걸로 네 <i>전부</i>가 결정되는 건 아니지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Minsc
#. NodeID = e3e39a06-5a59-95f9-900f-11d65a9495c0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:e3e39a06-5a59-95f9-900f-11d65a9495c0
msgctxt "h2f7f2b38g38f6g443cgbc68gfbbccb49b8ba"
msgid ""
"It would be like swinging a sword by the wrong side. Painful - but it can be "
"effective, too."
msgstr "엉뚱한 방향으로 칼을 휘두르는 거나 마찬가지야. 고통스럽겠지만, 효과가 있을 수도 있지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = ed298cbb-4145-1426-2ef1-3f0ac33afc71
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:ed298cbb-4145-1426-2ef1-3f0ac33afc71
msgctxt "h189be2f0g3630g4567g915fg5e8fba74e88b"
msgid ""
"*No more dreams await you in sleep this night. Only the warm knowledge that, "
"indeed - you are not alone.*"
msgstr "*오늘밤에는 더 이상 꿈에 시달리지 않아도 됩니다. 당신이 혼자가 아니라는, 따뜻한 확신만이 남아 있을 뿐입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ee53a748-a735-00f5-9435-11a09f230715
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:ee53a748-a735-00f5-9435-11a09f230715
msgctxt "hafcf0cc8g8211g4f07g84c5g5f49d9210c04"
msgid "And what will become of me, if I beat her?"
msgstr "내가 이기고 나면 어떻게 되지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = ef60618e-a57e-ba2c-37b6-74961f31a9fd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:ef60618e-a57e-ba2c-37b6-74961f31a9fd
msgctxt "h0cd59326g6074g474bg94efgd336fb8ba47e"
msgid ""
"To face the other of your kind - Orin. So long as the other lives, neither "
"of you can claim your full power."
msgstr "너의 또 다른 동족, 오린. 서로가 살아 있는 한, 너흰 그 힘을 완전히 차지할 수 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f0fbc0d4-c8be-08c7-89f8-5fd86ddd9959
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:f0fbc0d4-c8be-08c7-89f8-5fd86ddd9959
msgctxt "hd67195fdgef08g4853gae89g6f5921f921f6"
msgid "Bathing in my lover's gore."
msgstr "연인의 피로 목욕했지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = f76844a6-8140-c2bf-f2cd-0cb85168b02d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:f76844a6-8140-c2bf-f2cd-0cb85168b02d
msgctxt "hc3f3cb2cgcdf2g4b25g8e33gd9efb8613e33"
msgid "There is one certain way. I hold it in my hand."
msgstr "확실한 방법이 하나 있지. 지금 내 손에 들려 있고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = f82c7b0d-35a0-715d-f790-28157a250da4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:f82c7b0d-35a0-715d-f790-28157a250da4
msgctxt "ha57cce12ga09cg4fc8gb8a6g0798bc2cc719"
msgid "You have not confessed it all, I think."
msgstr "글쎄, 전부 털어놓진 않았잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f9375bd3-ec96-bee2-004b-7f70b8baf02e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:f9375bd3-ec96-bee2-004b-7f70b8baf02e
msgctxt "he5206182g0968g4c75gaa7dgb802aafdf2ad"
msgid "What are you doing, Jaheira?"
msgstr "자헤이라, 무슨 일이죠?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Minsc
#. NodeID = fa14e546-09e4-a292-8e03-f63f4a3234de
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:fa14e546-09e4-a292-8e03-f63f4a3234de
msgctxt "h2194d20bg59d1g4795gac02ge264d174eb20"
msgid "No game. A serious matter, to rouse Boo from his beauty sleep."
msgstr "놀이 아니다. 부를 아름다운 잠에서 깨우는 건 심각한 문제다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = facd85e5-1a18-826a-fae6-245bd13fe39c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_CFM_BloodweddingFollowup:facd85e5-1a18-826a-fae6-245bd13fe39c
msgctxt "hc133898cg9cb6g4330g88e5gc2f6416eb42b"
msgid "What are you doing, Jaheira?"
msgstr "자헤이라, 무슨 일이죠?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 04d4356b-0411-0f6d-92fa-3133f8804445
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:04d4356b-0411-0f6d-92fa-3133f8804445
msgctxt "h5d14dae1g8a5cg4a38g90bfgcc14d86d6e8d"
msgid ""
"I fled Elturel along with dozens of others. We're in a grove nearby - "
"things... are bad. Real bad."
msgstr "전 다른 이들과 함께 엘투렐을 탈출했어요. 저희는 근방의 숲에 있는데, 상황이... 안 좋아요. 정말 심각해요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 053e896e-1104-01c9-93c2-0a7542523dab
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:053e896e-1104-01c9-93c2-0a7542523dab
msgctxt "hef9ab121g8b1bg4b1ega0ebg515d49fa097f"
msgid ""
"I couldn't stay in the grove with the others - just waiting to die. So I "
"left."
msgstr "다른 이들과 함께 숲에 남아서 죽기만을 기다릴 수는 없었어. 그래서 떠났지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 06b4a9f7-ed07-3d1b-574b-aa34938dd414
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:06b4a9f7-ed07-3d1b-574b-aa34938dd414
msgctxt "he9161544g3342g47cfga453g85fb867293a4"
msgid "Please, oh, <i>please.</i>"
msgstr "부탁이에요, <i>제발.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 06c2e406-3cba-840a-4398-a109974db1d7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:06c2e406-3cba-840a-4398-a109974db1d7
msgctxt "h2e21e261g656fg4dd7g838bg2d12aae867d0"
msgid "Joking aside, thank you. You won't regret this - I promise."
msgstr "농담은 이쯤하고, 감사해요. 이 선택을 후회하지 않게 할게요, 약속해요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 06ef0d0b-75ac-8904-0899-110b7e0dfa73
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:06ef0d0b-75ac-8904-0899-110b7e0dfa73
msgctxt "he91f3782gf38ag48bcg919ag81e13e901270"
msgid "It's <i>you.</i>"
msgstr "하필 <i>너야.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0b924a41-cb38-9b8f-6cf5-d1231a399f37
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_State_InGoblinCamp = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:0b924a41-cb38-9b8f-6cf5-d1231a399f37
msgctxt "h5b674e2ag4669g4c61gbacfgb8dec7173199"
msgid "How in the Hells did <i>you </i>get here?"
msgstr "대체 무슨 수로 <i>여기까지 </i>온 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 0bb6b5ab-e125-f1e9-a714-6fb5dff6bd04
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:0bb6b5ab-e125-f1e9-a714-6fb5dff6bd04
msgctxt "h5b33f140g8c6eg4a8fgb021ge02d5f96f659"
msgid ""
"First you convince me to quit being a bard, then you threaten to kill me? "
"Charming as ever."
msgstr "처음엔 바드는 그만두라고 설득하더니, 이젠 날 죽이겠다고 협박까지 하는 건가요? 어쩜 그리 한결 같은지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 0cb21fa3-3fac-17d2-279f-d069264aa513
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CAMP_DarkUrge_Event_AlfiraUpset(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:0cb21fa3-3fac-17d2-279f-d069264aa513
msgctxt "h2f4fc39fg48f2g4f52g9daag7e433d0c1ad7"
msgid "...Fine. Goodnight."
msgstr "...알겠어. 잘 자."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 10ecad8f-5192-9beb-76b9-9832e8a19ccf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:10ecad8f-5192-9beb-76b9-9832e8a19ccf
msgctxt "hc539b75agda3eg43c3gb051g28580e17dc82"
msgid "You can stay for the night, but I want you gone by morning."
msgstr "여기서 하룻밤 자도 되지만, 내일 아침이 되면 돌아가."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 13699386-e51b-8244-7eb0-82320bf84976
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Event_SelectedRandomCompanionInDialog(7) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(7) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - ORI_Event_SelectedRandomCompanionInDialog(7) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:13699386-e51b-8244-7eb0-82320bf84976
msgctxt "h950d84a2g30f7g42b9g9291ga57b063923a7"
msgid "Bad luck to turn a bard away from a campfire. Just saying."
msgstr "바드를 쫓아내면 불운이 찾아온다고 하더라. 그냥 알고 있으라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 13b6f4cf-3da3-b43b-bf6c-30d65e8cb453
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:13b6f4cf-3da3-b43b-bf6c-30d65e8cb453
msgctxt "ha20721efg18bag4a85g9a8agfeabc958baaa"
msgid "Where are you headed?"
msgstr "어디로 가려고 했는데?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 155c4b36-e830-4593-8be4-139f3d13fa71
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Event_SelectedRandomCompanionInDialog(2) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(2) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - ORI_Event_SelectedRandomCompanionInDialog(2) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:155c4b36-e830-4593-8be4-139f3d13fa71
msgctxt "h85c80c63gfa09g4e42g8324gc77a721afc53"
msgid ""
"Let her stay if you want. But if that bard breaks out in song, I'm not "
"having it."
msgstr "원한다면 머물게 해. 하지만 저 바드가 노래로 내 신경을 건들면, 가만두지 않겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 15e3d858-ab83-bc67-b483-287f8b527524
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:15e3d858-ab83-bc67-b483-287f8b527524
msgctxt "hbdc4e344g86cfg4f51gbe40geb0fc2bdb42d"
msgid "Waterdeep... Neverwinter. I don't know. The farther the better."
msgstr "워터딥이나, 네버윈터... 나도 몰라. 여기서 멀수록 좋겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 1c4a3208-b15f-990a-e231-6fd449280eb7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:1c4a3208-b15f-990a-e231-6fd449280eb7
msgctxt "h420ac9d8g7ef8g4acbg8ccfgb75837c7690c"
msgid "All right, I'm going!"
msgstr "알았어요, 가면 되잖아요!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 1d3f72ff-fd01-fdec-25b6-a6f66dd46fff
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CAMP_DarkUrge_Event_AlfiraJoined = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:1d3f72ff-fd01-fdec-25b6-a6f66dd46fff
msgctxt "h4b161bafg8267g40e8gb331g0bc11953e5d2"
msgid "I won't let you down - I promise."
msgstr "실망하게 하지 않을 거예요, 정말이에요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1d8dcc98-a41f-6251-5fd5-e5ca9ad80096
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:1d8dcc98-a41f-6251-5fd5-e5ca9ad80096
msgctxt "h393e15abgf7f6g44ffg8294ga6ae6b63e5ef"
msgid "Sleep by the latrine, and don't say a word to me."
msgstr "저 변소 옆에서 자고 나한테 한마디도 하지 마."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 20fe7f0e-5bf2-fa12-7025-0f23055faff7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:20fe7f0e-5bf2-fa12-7025-0f23055faff7
msgctxt "hf461371cg1701g46f8g9bafg82a13752b6e7"
msgid "Remind me who you are, again?"
msgstr "네가 누구인지 다시 소개해줄래?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 22a2ea50-5914-044a-f8ff-94ee56ad57c1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CAMP_DarkUrge_Event_RecruitAlfira = True
#.   Object:
#.     - OriginAddToParty(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:22a2ea50-5914-044a-f8ff-94ee56ad57c1
msgctxt "h28c1c19bg3978g422bgbe6fg36022c4ee62f"
msgid "You can stay - for now. Let's see how you fare."
msgstr "여기 머물러도 좋아, 당장은. 잘 적응하는지 보겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 2424a301-53ab-98c5-2e9c-60039f712a6b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:2424a301-53ab-98c5-2e9c-60039f712a6b
msgctxt "h371faf10g12d2g4af8ga9f3gcff782b3f7ff"
msgid "But I can fight! I won't hold you back, I swear it."
msgstr "하지만 저도 싸울 수 있어요! 방해되지 않게 할게요, 맹세코."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 249a7f66-28a7-c538-27ab-ca265f1c4903
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:249a7f66-28a7-c538-27ab-ca265f1c4903
msgctxt "ha17d5a81gc20fg4229gbac8g5ad59e15ec19"
msgid "I saw your fire and I hoped for a safe place to rest..."
msgstr "난 불빛을 발견했고 안전한 곳에서 쉬고 싶었을 뿐이야..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 24ae44ca-904b-ebd5-cba0-e85ddd717efa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:24ae44ca-904b-ebd5-cba0-e85ddd717efa
msgctxt "h6d00a5bbgc1e4g41efgae0eg5d610dfa979e"
msgid "What's <i>that </i>supposed to mean?"
msgstr "그 <i>삐딱한</i> 말투는 무슨 의미지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 250fd659-99e0-13ad-4b0c-8d93b7332f46
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_State_InGoblinCamp = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:250fd659-99e0-13ad-4b0c-8d93b7332f46
msgctxt "h42b05782gd047g4e08g9378g0f6db40226c6"
msgid "Alfira! What are you doing out here?"
msgstr "알피라! 여기서 뭐하고 있어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 25377444-d7b3-2003-1421-57d6a60ebfd0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:25377444-d7b3-2003-1421-57d6a60ebfd0
msgctxt "ha93e4662g7935g422bg8b93g24e50e4ff719"
msgid ""
"Look, I did as you said - I quit being a bard. You were right - I wasn't any "
"good. But it... left me in a bad way."
msgstr ""
"들어봐, 난 네가 하라는 대로 했어, 바드를 그만뒀지. 네 말이 맞았어, 난 재능이 없어. 하지만 이것으로... 난 잘못된 선택을 했어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 25ffa941-874e-ef81-7422-0d4037303316
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:25ffa941-874e-ef81-7422-0d4037303316
msgctxt "h9ccdd266g561fg4b7dgadb4g8c838d37d910"
msgid "Get out. Now."
msgstr "당장 나가."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 26b8c81f-48b7-e200-2811-c4b8b2d24a11
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CAMP_DarkUrge_Event_RecruitAlfira = True
#.   Object:
#.     - OriginAddToParty(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:26b8c81f-48b7-e200-2811-c4b8b2d24a11
msgctxt "hadd6350cgc66fg4e51g8899g7edabfc8089c"
msgid "Why don't you join me? I'll keep you safe."
msgstr "나랑 함께 다니는 건 어때? 안전히 지켜줄게."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 28c4a201-4853-b1c3-0446-9d1b734a3edb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:28c4a201-4853-b1c3-0446-9d1b734a3edb
msgctxt "hf6a54dfagcb7fg4e33gac8ag70f6ecbd53eb"
msgid "All right... all right. I'll find someone else. I'm sure."
msgstr "그래요... 알았어요. 다른 사람 찾아볼게요. 분명 있겠죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 29dfbfe5-12ae-4626-3884-169005b55317
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:29dfbfe5-12ae-4626-3884-169005b55317
msgctxt "hc9a892d7gcf34g4f17g8d41g7348f71ce38d"
msgid "It's pure luck I got this far. I'm, well, exhausted."
msgstr "여기까지 온 것도 운이 좋았어요. 전, 지금, 꽤 지쳤거든요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 2c0587be-16a7-567f-ca87-0061c240df5a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_TieflingBard_State_FinishedSong = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:2c0587be-16a7-567f-ca87-0061c240df5a
msgctxt "heec93805gf3fbg4569g8687gbe6bbe9fa1d7"
msgid "I'm so glad I found - wait, it's me!"
msgstr "찾아서 정말 다행 - 잠깐만, 저에요!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 2c1a496e-29a6-f56b-e46c-058e52558e09
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:2c1a496e-29a6-f56b-e46c-058e52558e09
msgctxt "ha311e495gbedbg4da6gad91g23690b76b09d"
msgid "I'm sorry for barging in like this, but I had to come find you."
msgstr "이렇게 불쑥 나타나서 죄송해요. 그치만 꼭 당신을 찾아야 했어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2c2194cd-db57-9bb9-d992-e0c19b69c22b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:2c2194cd-db57-9bb9-d992-e0c19b69c22b
msgctxt "h855f4001g2293g49a0g823fg591879311b93"
msgid "Leave. Now."
msgstr "여길 떠나. 당장."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2cd2f212-382b-5891-7119-2ffb19304bdd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:2cd2f212-382b-5891-7119-2ffb19304bdd
msgctxt "h8db462e2gcfc1g4b64ga5cdgddd96fe52127"
msgid "You can stay then night, but then you leave. Alone."
msgstr "여기서 하룻밤 자고 가도 돼. 하지만 내일은 너 혼자 돌아가."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 2e7a1208-0143-7b7b-3bfc-b02cba314e3d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:2e7a1208-0143-7b7b-3bfc-b02cba314e3d
msgctxt "h4865aa24gd9c2g4ca4g9075gab80dc249841"
msgid "All right, all right! I just... I was sure you would help."
msgstr "그래요, 알았어요! 전 그저... 당신이 도와줄 거라 생각했어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 3029bc92-c9d3-f8bb-4afe-3a14b8a26931
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:3029bc92-c9d3-f8bb-4afe-3a14b8a26931
msgctxt "h66e55149g0d64g4cabga893g2b6037a9646c"
msgid ""
"Hah. I know who you are - how could I not? You're all anyone in the grove "
"talks about."
msgstr "하. 당신이 누군지는 잘 알아요. 어떻게 모를 수 있겠어요? 숲에선 다들 당신 얘기만 하던데요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 30ffb651-98ac-c650-706d-890f87f40712
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:30ffb651-98ac-c650-706d-890f87f40712
msgctxt "hefbfeb98g8dc7g4290g9125g22988863483c"
msgid "Oh, yes! Everything is fine - thanks to you."
msgstr "아, 네! 다들 괜찮아요. 다 당신 덕분이에요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 319f7fbb-5582-afdf-16ef-68144b7c617a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Event_SelectedRandomCompanionInDialog(5) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(5) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - ORI_Event_SelectedRandomCompanionInDialog(5) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:319f7fbb-5582-afdf-16ef-68144b7c617a
msgctxt "hc15b1430g41a9g433eg8801gf555ddddafec"
msgid "She seeks a safe haven. What sort of earsgang would refuse it?"
msgstr "바드가 안전한 거처를 찾고 있구나. 어떤 귀머거리가 거부하겠는가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 3551a05e-7652-d1bb-ce8e-7dd89158e5e4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:3551a05e-7652-d1bb-ce8e-7dd89158e5e4
msgctxt "h129cadb5ga9aag4a39g8fecg17128f4a28c3"
msgid ""
"Argh. This is the last thing I need. Look - you left me... in a bad way."
msgstr "아악. 이것 만큼은 피하고 싶었는데. 들어봐, 너 때문에... 난 잘못된 선택을 했어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 359f5aad-52a2-f93a-5da9-9987b8132044
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_TieflingBard_State_FinishedSong = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:359f5aad-52a2-f93a-5da9-9987b8132044
msgctxt "h9bf81d3age040g4102g808dg8e9439a931a6"
msgid ""
"You've, well, inspired me. I want to stand on my own two feet, to prove that "
"I can be half the bard Lihala was."
msgstr ""
"당신은, 그래요. 저를 도와주셨잖아요. 저는 이제 당당히 제 힘으로 일어서서 돌아가신 바드 리할라 선생님을 대신할 수 있음을 증명하고 "
"싶어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 39fb90fe-52c4-217c-5596-b1683905ba7d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:39fb90fe-52c4-217c-5596-b1683905ba7d
msgctxt "haaaac5c0g34ebg4e80gbd05g8ef79fc3133b"
msgid ""
"Unfortunately, I'm exhausted. If I take you to the grove now, I'll get lost -"
" I know it."
msgstr "안타깝게도, 전 너무 지쳤어요. 지금 당신을 숲속으로 데려가다간 길을 잃고 말 거예요. 제가 알아요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 3c4d8a02-0bea-b3e4-5b33-3a4d946935cb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:3c4d8a02-0bea-b3e4-5b33-3a4d946935cb
msgctxt "ha010ad65gadf4g48f1gb3e7g531bf3868f81"
msgid ""
"That's why I'm here. When I'd heard what you'd done - it inspired me. Made "
"me feel brave again."
msgstr "그게 제가 여기 있는 이유죠. 당신이 한 일을 들었을 때, 너무 감동 했어요. 다시 용기를 찾은 것 같았죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 3f4a289f-b0c7-3550-3678-891263897c7a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - DEN_TieflingBard_Event_SmashedLute(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:3f4a289f-b0c7-3550-3678-891263897c7a
msgctxt "hc4956fb2gff2cg4859g8174g48a7972eb46c"
msgid "Look, after you broke my lute, I was... in a bad way."
msgstr "들어봐, 네가 내 류트를 박살 낸 후, 나는... 잘못된 선택을 했어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 406bbad2-0e49-365a-cacc-46f835877d72
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:406bbad2-0e49-365a-cacc-46f835877d72
msgctxt "h7215e9acgd418g490fg8f4ag1f008ccb731c"
msgid ""
"Unless I hide away from the world, I can't avoid it. So I'd rather face it "
"head on - with you."
msgstr "세상으로부터 숨지 않는 한, 피할 수 없어요. 차라리 정면으로 맞서기로 했어요. 당신과 함께."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 40fcb8be-a723-7e02-6376-061d5d92703d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:40fcb8be-a723-7e02-6376-061d5d92703d
msgctxt "h22dc75e7g2c6bg4affg8e1fg676b65dd36c3"
msgid "I thought you many things, but cruel? That's a first."
msgstr "널 보면 많은 것들이 떠올라, 하지만 잔인함? 그게 제일 강해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 439513c0-3434-4bf0-84ea-e9f5575f5a47
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Event_SelectedRandomCompanionInDialog(7) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(7) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - ORI_Event_SelectedRandomCompanionInDialog(7) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:439513c0-3434-4bf0-84ea-e9f5575f5a47
msgctxt "h92477c68gad89g464eg8444g69646e3027f5"
msgid "Bad luck to turn a bard away from a campfire. Just saying."
msgstr "바드를 쫓아내면 불운이 찾아온다고 하더라. 그냥 알고 있으라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 43bf6d4b-e139-6c3c-7202-e47c077ddc28
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Event_SelectedRandomCompanionInDialog(6) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(6) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - ORI_Event_SelectedRandomCompanionInDialog(6) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:43bf6d4b-e139-6c3c-7202-e47c077ddc28
msgctxt "hbacd7e46g3d8ag4ee4ga54ag2dc6513e8449"
msgid ""
"We have room at the campfire yet - let the girl stay. I wouldn't want it "
"said that I am any less than a perfect gentleman."
msgstr "야영지에 아직 남는 자리 많이 있잖아, 소녀가 머물게 해줘. 나는 신사답지 못했다는 말을 조금이라도 듣고 싶지 않다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 4414cea6-ecf8-84b9-6d8d-b57e1e91be98
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:4414cea6-ecf8-84b9-6d8d-b57e1e91be98
msgctxt "heeb8578bgf824g4dd4ga2ceg5fee75031939"
msgid ""
"I need your help! I fled Elturel along with dozens of others. We're in a "
"grove nearby - things... are bad. Real bad."
msgstr ""
"당신 도움이 필요해요! 전 다른 이들과 함께 엘투렐을 탈출했어요. 저희는 근방의 숲에 있는데, 상황이... 안 좋아요. 정말 심각해요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 441c6452-80a9-aeff-2e58-4b770af2fa59
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:441c6452-80a9-aeff-2e58-4b770af2fa59
msgctxt "hffa5d4ddg57fag4993gbadeg65c4031b0c6c"
msgid ""
"Look, I'm here because I saw your fire and hoped for a safe place to rest. "
"Would you mind if I stayed her tonight?"
msgstr ""
"잘 들어봐, 내가 여기 있는 이유는 여기 야영지의 불을 발견하고 안전한 장소가 있길 바랐을 뿐이야. 하룻밤만 머물게 해주면 안 될까? "

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 454164cb-0332-622d-9ed3-ee9925300845
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - c8e8e9a4-d7dc-d778-a79a-3f07a71f2567_perusiasionsuccess = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:454164cb-0332-622d-9ed3-ee9925300845
msgctxt "h5265e9c4gd54fg4aefgabccg0ab94b15e4f7"
msgid "I'm not going to say it's fine, because it's not. But thank you."
msgstr "괜찮다고는 안 할게요. 안 괜찮으니까요. 그래도 고맙네요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 461dd780-3327-1b8f-7c7c-8e88a06129ab
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:461dd780-3327-1b8f-7c7c-8e88a06129ab
msgctxt "hd68687aagcfd3g4998g8d72g030731501975"
msgid ""
"You've, well, inspired me. I want to stand on my own two feet, to prove that "
"I can be half the bard my teacher was."
msgstr ""
"당신은, 그래요. 저를 도와주셨잖아요. 저는 이제 당당히 제 힘으로 일어서서 돌아가신 바드 선생님을 대신할 수 있음을 증명하고 싶어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 479196a9-e401-f6e0-1842-3f4ea4539557
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - c8e8e9a4-d7dc-d778-a79a-3f07a71f2567_perusiasionsuccess = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:479196a9-e401-f6e0-1842-3f4ea4539557
msgctxt "hce3262f4g6cc1g4e22g8037g46bd6227149f"
msgid "Really? I don't know."
msgstr "진심이야? 난 잘 모르겠는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4acf687d-8986-c36c-0724-07beacc98840
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:4acf687d-8986-c36c-0724-07beacc98840
msgctxt "hc7175e67ga16cg40a1gac02g8137e79604a5"
msgid "Give me one reason not to kill you right now."
msgstr "너를 지금 당장 죽이지 말아야 할 이유 하나라도 말해봐."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4c9609cc-d4a0-a87e-c6f2-d29fe95a91f4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CAMP_DarkUrge_Event_RecruitAlfira = True
#.   Object:
#.     - OriginAddToParty(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:4c9609cc-d4a0-a87e-c6f2-d29fe95a91f4
msgctxt "h5ce0d857g9af9g44b2gb56bg43a5ca442f28"
msgid "I just wanted to hear you beg a little - you can join me."
msgstr "네 간절한 모습을 조금 더 보고 싶었을 뿐이야, 같이 가자."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 4faa698d-16fc-2dd5-1e1a-8be8082765fc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:4faa698d-16fc-2dd5-1e1a-8be8082765fc
msgctxt "hc49bc2c2g1ea4g4655gb86dg70c066d39e16"
msgid ""
"It means I did as you said - I quit being a bard. I wasn't any good, "
"remember?"
msgstr "네가 하라는 대로 했다는 뜻이야. 바드를 그만뒀어. 난 재능이 없잖아, 기억 안나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 4fbfee14-a9a6-2a6c-cf45-377b4fac0492
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - DEN_TieflingBard_Event_SmashedLute(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:4fbfee14-a9a6-2a6c-cf45-377b4fac0492
msgctxt "ha8ca98dag9834g4a74g8877g3711a4d61143"
msgid ""
"That would only be the second-worst thing you've done to me - you lute "
"breaking arsehole."
msgstr "넌 내게 이미 그보다 더한 짓을 했잖아, 류트 부숴 먹은 개자식아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 4fdcac2c-66a6-a938-4f1f-30e71e7ac53f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:4fdcac2c-66a6-a938-4f1f-30e71e7ac53f
msgctxt "h1ab50334g4c41g4736g83c9gb5a739bd60e9"
msgid ""
"True. But I'm a bard, remember? I want to do more than sing about other "
"people's adventures."
msgstr "맞아요. 그치만 저 바드인 거 알잖아요? 다른 이들 영웅담 노래하는 것 말고도 잘하는 게 많아요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 50cfe3d7-4502-0e68-ee9f-f1ce51aa0794
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Event_SelectedRandomCompanionInDialog(6) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(6) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - ORI_Event_SelectedRandomCompanionInDialog(6) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:50cfe3d7-4502-0e68-ee9f-f1ce51aa0794
msgctxt "hd3484050g6a9fg4c22g87b2g32cba41d4127"
msgid "Wonderful! The more, the merrier."
msgstr "아주 좋아! 사람은 많을수록 좋은 법이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 51b4a0f2-6af1-4f33-228a-47cab6e4a3cf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:51b4a0f2-6af1-4f33-228a-47cab6e4a3cf
msgctxt "h45a3c91ag9338g47c0gbbfbgcfb90220cf7f"
msgid "<i>Ready yourself to attack.</i>"
msgstr "<i>공격을 준비한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 53013943-2d5a-4978-f2e8-97f3a1e8b2ec
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CAMP_DarkUrge_Event_AlfiraHappy(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:53013943-2d5a-4978-f2e8-97f3a1e8b2ec
msgctxt "h4571b86egfc8dg4c8bga1bbga52e77fb7123"
msgid "Goodnight, and thank you. I mean it."
msgstr "잘 자요, 그리고 감사해요. 정말이에요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 53079a30-a3cc-b4ea-a00b-3407345df7c9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:53079a30-a3cc-b4ea-a00b-3407345df7c9
msgctxt "hef2106b4g3127g4ec9gbba3g346eb09b7d0e"
msgid ""
"I'm only here out of necessity. I saw your fire in the dark, and I'm, well, "
"exhausted. I need somewhere safe to rest."
msgstr "난 도움이 필요해서 왔을 뿐이야. 어둠 속에서 불을 발견했고 난, 그러니깐, 지쳤다고. 안전하게 쉴 장소가 필요해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 57181cf9-9cf1-56c9-b54d-5349af90758d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Event_SelectedRandomCompanionInDialog(3) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(3) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - ORI_Event_SelectedRandomCompanionInDialog(3) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:57181cf9-9cf1-56c9-b54d-5349af90758d
msgctxt "h1f92ccd9g9a69g4ab8g95f2g5e4a0ea2d2a6"
msgid ""
"Safer to keep her here than blundering around by herself - wouldn't want her "
"accidentally leading the wrong sort of attention to us."
msgstr "혼자 주위에서 걸리적거리게 하는 것보다 여기 두는 게 더 안전하겠지, 실수로 어떤 이상한 것들을 끌고 올지도 모르니깐 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5b5aa0cb-4c8b-c4a8-8677-be9aeefe8284
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:5b5aa0cb-4c8b-c4a8-8677-be9aeefe8284
msgctxt "h50910f9fg008dg4f8bg931ega8e28b07e995"
msgid "Is something wrong? Are the tieflings all right?"
msgstr "무슨 문제 있어? 티플링 사람들은 괜찮아?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 5df55b84-b8f0-e377-1106-9feb57085eab
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:5df55b84-b8f0-e377-1106-9feb57085eab
msgctxt "hcdfa5aeeg9bb1g42e1gaa29ga680cd19ca6f"
msgid ""
"Sorry, I don't mean to sound ungrateful, I'm just exhausted. Why don't we "
"talk about it in the morning?"
msgstr "미안, 불평하려던 건 아니야, 너무 지쳤어. 내일 아침에 다시 이야기해도 될까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 5e41e9be-3225-b4a8-57f1-1c941f980c45
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Event_SelectedRandomCompanionInDialog(7) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(7) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - ORI_Event_SelectedRandomCompanionInDialog(7) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:5e41e9be-3225-b4a8-57f1-1c941f980c45
msgctxt "hbc9f067cgf57eg42begb24eg90acf1514386"
msgid "Very good! Break out that lute, bard - I'm in the mood for a song."
msgstr "아주 좋군! 류트 좀 연주해봐, 바드. 마침 노래가 듣고 싶었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 5f679ad2-04a2-0edf-0798-15c0e139096e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:5f679ad2-04a2-0edf-0798-15c0e139096e
msgctxt "h15fac78eg746eg40c3g9625g302c83f77f2d"
msgid ""
"Let me stay the night, and I'll take you to the grove in the morning. "
"<i>Please.</i>"
msgstr "여기서 하룻밤만 보내게 해줘요. 아침에 숲으로 데려다 줄게요. <i>부탁이에요.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 60a95b4d-0e3f-3177-871c-83e22198bb6c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_State_InGoblinCamp = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CAMP_DarkUrge_Event_RecruitAlfira = True
#.   Object:
#.     - OriginAddToParty(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:60a95b4d-0e3f-3177-871c-83e22198bb6c
msgctxt "hb76897b8g1b8bg4b69g9e6bg5fd898ede8f8"
msgid ""
"You managed to sneak through enemy grounds - you'd be useful in the party."
msgstr "적진에서 여기까지 몰래 숨어서 들어오다니, 생각보다 쓸모 있을지도 모르겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 627bb4b5-efe8-2f0e-972a-4a5165ad7d90
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GEN_DisappearOutOfSightWhenAvailable(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:627bb4b5-efe8-2f0e-972a-4a5165ad7d90
msgctxt "h2cf9734dg15a2g4228gbbcag869f619b54b9"
msgid "If the gods have any sense of justice, we won't meet again."
msgstr "만약 신들이 일말의 양심이 있다면, 다시는 보지 말자."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 65fdbf8d-57af-005b-76ca-0f6b849e7923
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:65fdbf8d-57af-005b-76ca-0f6b849e7923
msgctxt "h4983a213g3121g4b9ega532g40cfd36793e3"
msgid "*Her voice is steady - her gaze unflinching. She's telling the truth.*"
msgstr "*그녀의 목소리는 침착하며, 시선에는 떨림이 없습니다. 그녀는 진실을 말하고 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 66508033-ccd0-efd8-c640-1bcecbcbe46c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - DEN_TieflingBard_Event_SmashedLute(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:66508033-ccd0-efd8-c640-1bcecbcbe46c
msgctxt "h92d41e05g6f8cg4d8agafa5g020031fb6e7a"
msgid "You know what it means, you lute-breaking arsehole."
msgstr "무슨 의미인지 알잖아, 류트 박살낸 개자식아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 66f48180-e35c-feba-dd81-284c9f1d9156
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:66f48180-e35c-feba-dd81-284c9f1d9156
msgctxt "hbb8d058age1c2g4a66gba30g32b13f76e7c2"
msgid "Give me one reason not to kill you."
msgstr "널 죽이지 말아야 할 이유 하나만 말해봐."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 67cd2083-c491-a7ff-c98d-72f57a897185
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:67cd2083-c491-a7ff-c98d-72f57a897185
msgctxt "h37bd32beg8a09g46d2g9ec0gf58366e436df"
msgid "Grab a bedroll or leave."
msgstr "누울 자리 찾든가 아니면 돌아가든가."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 69667734-0e2d-98e9-2ed2-faee92a10216
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:69667734-0e2d-98e9-2ed2-faee92a10216
msgctxt "hdfd76f54g8dcbg42fegb4dfga33b3a6a8e81"
msgid "You? No - I don't think you will."
msgstr "네가? 아니, 그럴 사람 아닐 텐데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 6973fcb7-2dda-4dc5-9d3f-13aa9278cb58
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Event_SelectedRandomCompanionInDialog(2) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(2) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - ORI_Event_SelectedRandomCompanionInDialog(2) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:6973fcb7-2dda-4dc5-9d3f-13aa9278cb58
msgctxt "h79ee23e4g7109g413ega338gf7974f11e91a"
msgid ""
"Let her stay if you want. But if that bard breaks out in song, I'm not "
"having it."
msgstr "원한다면 머물게 해. 하지만 저 바드가 노래로 내 신경을 건들면, 가만두지 않겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 6ba3ef41-b6df-8407-d64b-59bc008627f1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CAMP_DarkUrge_Event_AlfiraUpset(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:6ba3ef41-b6df-8407-d64b-59bc008627f1
msgctxt "h984e422bga866g473agb5bagc5aec36056da"
msgid ""
"I don't have the energy for this. I'm going to bed. Don't worry - I'll be "
"gone by first light."
msgstr "더 이상 말 할 힘도 없어. 자러 갈게. 걱정 마, 해가 뜨자마자 사라져 있을테니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 6dae04fd-4b73-c6d8-6238-7ed116deec02
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:6dae04fd-4b73-c6d8-6238-7ed116deec02
msgctxt "h1eae9cd5g3db7g4b19g8c2fg0ab9689a8ab2"
msgid ""
"Really? Oh, I'm so relieved. Everyone is going to be so happy to see you - I "
"know it!"
msgstr "정말요? 아, 정말 다행이에요. 다들 당신이 온 걸 환영할 거예요. 진짜로요! "

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6e99ebae-e8c9-3c95-858e-9bf721fd4e33
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_State_InGoblinCamp = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CAMP_DarkUrge_Event_RecruitAlfira = True
#.   Object:
#.     - OriginAddToParty(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:6e99ebae-e8c9-3c95-858e-9bf721fd4e33
msgctxt "h24e96af4g5b9cg4613ga58cg950ea5851b37"
msgid ""
"You managed to sneak through the <i>goblin camp </i>- you'll be very useful."
msgstr "<i>고블린 야영지</i>까지 들키지 않고 오다니, 넌 큰 도움이 되겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 6eee12a1-147d-39d3-b928-b363b0d94679
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:6eee12a1-147d-39d3-b928-b363b0d94679
msgctxt "he451be30g1940g400cg9091g63a2ba484fab"
msgid "Don't. Just don't."
msgstr "하지 마. 하지 말라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 707f7111-ee9f-f87c-0687-bed2418c6b03
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:707f7111-ee9f-f87c-0687-bed2418c6b03
msgctxt "ha3f5d3f3g3d7bg422aga169g807098e0ec35"
msgid "I'm Alfira - a bard from the grove. I don't mean any harm!"
msgstr "전 알피라라고 해요. 숲에서 온 바드예요. 해치러 온 건 아니에요!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 731f6943-df6a-6e0a-2008-26cda5e17361
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_General_State_Entered = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:731f6943-df6a-6e0a-2008-26cda5e17361
msgctxt "h1afbcd86gb74ag42d8gac26g17236dfea054"
msgid "I'm so glad I found - wait!"
msgstr "드디어 찾았... 잠깐만!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 747c1ec6-0950-8348-712e-89ab837757ae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:747c1ec6-0950-8348-712e-89ab837757ae
msgctxt "hed943d24gee26g4793g9be2g20058a386fe4"
msgid "Wait - wait! I'm not your enemy, quite the opposite, in fact!"
msgstr "잠깐… 잔깐만요! 전 적이 아니에요, 오히려 그 정반대라고요!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 7507c18f-b1aa-3374-0ef0-c6cca61bfce3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CAMP_DarkUrge_Event_AlfiraUpset(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:7507c18f-b1aa-3374-0ef0-c6cca61bfce3
msgctxt "h28978ee9gbe95g4261gbbe2geedfd549ce67"
msgid "Thank you. Goodnight."
msgstr "고마워. 잘 자."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 76dc5bee-4c89-ca33-885e-5b452e30d1cf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:76dc5bee-4c89-ca33-885e-5b452e30d1cf
msgctxt "h9db9f172gcc9ag4b30gb501g61ce63265e38"
msgid "Yes! Thank you - you won't regret it!"
msgstr "좋았어! 감사해요, 절대 후회하지 않을 거예요!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 77b75ed5-2fac-8268-1b1d-b9e10d30a083
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:77b75ed5-2fac-8268-1b1d-b9e10d30a083
msgctxt "heb252767g0b8ag4020ga503g490a731a1b7c"
msgid "Leave - now."
msgstr "당장 떠나."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 78a817f4-1b1c-e98e-8a33-ca722b9693ab
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:78a817f4-1b1c-e98e-8a33-ca722b9693ab
msgctxt "hc17b3c20g7542g46d2g90d7g923e1429268a"
msgid "It's Alfira from the grove!"
msgstr "숲에서 만났던 알피라!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 7922f9da-3a15-4604-11a5-c7080609aa76
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GEN_DisappearOutOfSightWhenAvailable(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:7922f9da-3a15-4604-11a5-c7080609aa76
msgctxt "h2d63acdag9de5g4c80gafcega6fe55d41d35"
msgid "Goodbye."
msgstr "잘 있어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 79458f27-1eaf-72f9-de9e-3c1249e58858
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CAMP_DarkUrge_Event_AlfiraHappy(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:79458f27-1eaf-72f9-de9e-3c1249e58858
msgctxt "h899e51e9g7d92g483fgad58g40703ad00d43"
msgid ""
"I'll grab a few winks, and then I'll lead you there first thing in the "
"morning. Thank you - I'm glad I found you."
msgstr "잠깐 눈 좀 붙이고 해가 뜨자마자 그곳으로 안내할게요. 고마워요. 당신을 찾아서 다행이에요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 7a0f265f-1abe-cf00-39da-20dacb9adf8b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:7a0f265f-1abe-cf00-39da-20dacb9adf8b
msgctxt "h4e50ef45gccb1g4a41g9d02gd28b7bb66b46"
msgid "And if that doesn't work, well, we'll need protection on the road."
msgstr "그리고 만약 일이 잘 안 풀리면, 뭐, 저 길바닥에서 우리를 지켜줄 사람이 필요하겠죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 7c45a67d-088e-a28c-0fc5-e5205e1e5177
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:7c45a67d-088e-a28c-0fc5-e5205e1e5177
msgctxt "hfe6b26e3gd163g4cc3g9e2eg59a1d5eecb19"
msgid "Gods, this is the last thing I need."
msgstr "신이시여, 이것 만큼은 정말 피하고 싶었는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 7d264c8b-6991-1f3e-a29d-ce2aa8f8ac92
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:7d264c8b-6991-1f3e-a29d-ce2aa8f8ac92
msgctxt "hf4a5f00agdeffg40b0ga0b9gdf9fdb58a700"
msgid ""
"Why did I bother trying to explain myself? I've met steaming piles of "
"excrement more pleasant than you."
msgstr "내가 이걸 지금 왜 설명하고 있지? 김이 모락모락 나는 똥 덩어리를 봤을 때도 너보단 반가웠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 7f3b3366-fbc9-c7fe-125b-2c742c60521a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GEN_DisappearOutOfSightWhenAvailable(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:7f3b3366-fbc9-c7fe-125b-2c742c60521a
msgctxt "h3f1de5aeg654cg40ddg8d91g5e11f39f1fb8"
msgid "Gods. You really are a bastard, you know that?"
msgstr "맙소사. 넌 진짜 쓰레기 새끼야, 알고는 있어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 7ff35623-0386-3911-a365-c7fdfdbe0d9b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CAMP_DarkUrge_Event_AlfiraUpset(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:7ff35623-0386-3911-a365-c7fdfdbe0d9b
msgctxt "h8932b0cfgbb3dg486fgb47ag0d0a5da96050"
msgid "Goodnight - I guess."
msgstr "좋은 밤 되세요. 에휴."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 81c247af-7681-2ce6-03d7-6adb8498e40a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Event_SelectedRandomCompanionInDialog(4) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(4) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - ORI_Event_SelectedRandomCompanionInDialog(4) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:81c247af-7681-2ce6-03d7-6adb8498e40a
msgctxt "h4a4cc723g1fe7g4a71g9bd4gd62750571360"
msgid "I'd be careful, little waif, we don't all play nicely."
msgstr "나라면 더 조심할 거야, 꼬맹이. 우리가 모두 착한 건 아니거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 81fe1077-3c17-5faf-3302-960fa3cec8cd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:81fe1077-3c17-5faf-3302-960fa3cec8cd
msgctxt "h4d653a62g29e7g4ce3g813fg184db5a4e691"
msgid "Really? Oh, this is wonderful!"
msgstr "정말요? 아, 너무 좋아요!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 8a186ad9-c8c1-0590-28ba-d4b503a53e4d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:8a186ad9-c8c1-0590-28ba-d4b503a53e4d
msgctxt "h69d5edb8ge787g4378ga835ge3cd2e099680"
msgid "Oh. We met in the grove? I heard what you did - how much you helped us."
msgstr "어. 우리, 숲에서 만났는데요? 당신 행적 들었어요. 저희를 많이 도와줬다고요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8cd602ee-2c78-440a-da97-22a3c128b218
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:8cd602ee-2c78-440a-da97-22a3c128b218
msgctxt "h6bf4cc33g0996g4138gb781gd5b8793bcef7"
msgid "What exactly do you want me to do?"
msgstr "정확히 뭘 해주길 원해?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 91c412ed-3281-13bc-941d-4b7aefc0069d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:91c412ed-3281-13bc-941d-4b7aefc0069d
msgctxt "hb6193a59g18f8g48a5gab3eg6e7b3074230c"
msgid ""
"Hah! Then well played, because I was moments away from getting on my knees."
msgstr "하하! 그렇다면 정말 연기 잘하시네요, 방금 저는 무릎 꿇기 직전이었으니까요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 9311186e-8a26-4684-95fe-f8f1bee85cdf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Event_SelectedRandomCompanionInDialog(5) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(5) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - ORI_Event_SelectedRandomCompanionInDialog(5) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:9311186e-8a26-4684-95fe-f8f1bee85cdf
msgctxt "ha7668511gd4b1g4a3dg9101g9b321aec40ec"
msgid "She seeks a safe haven. What sort of earsgang would refuse it?"
msgstr "바드가 안전한 거처를 찾고 있구나. 어떤 귀머거리가 거부하겠는가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 975e8380-fa4f-7b20-eeef-e0eb5ca4b53f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:975e8380-fa4f-7b20-eeef-e0eb5ca4b53f
msgctxt "hf17f89c8g8395g484eg9685g093d10531c2c"
msgid ""
"The druids are threatening to kick us out, but goblins swarm the roads. If "
"we leave, we're dead. If we stay, we're dead."
msgstr "드루이드는 저희를 쫓아내려고 위협 중인데, 밖에는 고블린들이 가득해요. 쫓겨나면 저희는 죽어요. 머물러도 죽은 목숨이고요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9c96812c-a3e6-4652-90a2-44338d1f320a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CAMP_DarkUrge_Event_RecruitAlfira = True
#.   Object:
#.     - OriginAddToParty(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:9c96812c-a3e6-4652-90a2-44338d1f320a
msgctxt "ha60078c8ge955g4d21g8eabgcbfc75cd77ad"
msgid "You may join me - I'd love to have you."
msgstr "합류하도록 해, 너와 함께한다니 기쁘군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9d45e904-f5f2-7aa6-e3af-ec2302595c97
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_State_InGoblinCamp = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:9d45e904-f5f2-7aa6-e3af-ec2302595c97
msgctxt "h9fc84a7dg810fg43afg933dg3032faff9d14"
msgid ""
"What are you doing in the middle of the <i>goblin camp? </i>It's very "
"dangerous."
msgstr "어떻게 <i>고블린 야영지 </i>한가운데까지 온 거야? 여긴 아주 위험해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9f3f88cd-c4f4-35f0-a552-583949c2104a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:9f3f88cd-c4f4-35f0-a552-583949c2104a
msgctxt "h6250e3c3gae08g4cc6g8341gbc27a58aec1a"
msgid "I should kill you for barging in here."
msgstr "몰래 들어왔으니 죽여버려야겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = a20eca12-0c2b-0a68-1fa5-645fb8a67ffe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CAMP_DarkUrge_Event_AlfiraHappy(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:a20eca12-0c2b-0a68-1fa5-645fb8a67ffe
msgctxt "hdf872cedg7139g4b69g9134g86e7ae520ed8"
msgid "But it... doesn't sound like such a bad idea. Goodnight, and thank you."
msgstr "그래도... 완전 나쁜 생각은 아닌 것 같네. 잘 자, 그리고 고마워."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = aedfd825-85e7-581d-2c5e-287e8464c5fd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CAMP_DarkUrge_Event_RecruitAlfira = True
#.   Object:
#.      - OriginAddToParty(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:aedfd825-85e7-581d-2c5e-287e8464c5fd
msgctxt "hc9da5b95g6aadg4860gbb95gd79e035dcc90"
msgid "Fine."
msgstr "좋아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = af464e69-4b99-6c91-7391-07e432d5924b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Event_SelectedRandomCompanionInDialog(5) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(5) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - ORI_Event_SelectedRandomCompanionInDialog(5) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:af464e69-4b99-6c91-7391-07e432d5924b
msgctxt "h8ac36883gf414g4d34g887cgc42827b11623"
msgid "Ease your worries, warm your hands. We owe you that much."
msgstr "걱정은 내려놓고, 손부터 녹이세요. 그정도는 베 풀 수 있으니까요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = b212b750-a6a3-c313-c16c-76dc853bfd80
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_General_State_Entered = True
#.      - DEN_TieflingBard_State_FinishedSong = False
#.   User:
#.      - DEN_Bard_HasMet_User(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:b212b750-a6a3-c313-c16c-76dc853bfd80
msgctxt "haf1f7fa1g44d2g4fa9gbb6bg55f71544b6c3"
msgid "I'm so glad I found - wait!"
msgstr "드디어 찾았... 잠깐만!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = b3616ed5-3e9e-00d7-9fdc-00006e77bb5f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:b3616ed5-3e9e-00d7-9fdc-00006e77bb5f
msgctxt "hb3e9de10gbf12g4055gb0ceg52b715403fb7"
msgid ""
"I've been running since Elturel - and when we finally arrived in the grove, "
"we found danger there, too."
msgstr "전 엘투렐에서부터 계속 도망쳐왔어요. 마침내 숲에 도착했지만, 그곳도 안전하진 못했고요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b3776155-229b-b676-a28f-02e745391382
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:b3776155-229b-b676-a28f-02e745391382
msgctxt "h2dd65ed3g56b2g4708ga296ga3566b6a15a9"
msgid "Fine - I'll help."
msgstr "좋아, 도와주지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b4e1e8a1-cd9e-d4fa-57fa-e234a05aaa22
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:b4e1e8a1-cd9e-d4fa-57fa-e234a05aaa22
msgctxt "hbc5f4768g84afg492eg9d48g8580b64e864d"
msgid "No - I have no time for weaklings."
msgstr "안돼. 약해 빠진 티플링은 필요 없다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = b6a7fc77-1938-e672-8cce-299710121c43
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:b6a7fc77-1938-e672-8cce-299710121c43
msgctxt "h8e1d9982gaf3fg41d4g9c3ag2f4fac281120"
msgid "Whoa - whoa! I'm here because of you!"
msgstr "워, 워! 전 당신을 찾으러 여기까지 왔어요!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = b888fb67-721c-4a8c-b578-4660d903ca5b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Event_SelectedRandomCompanionInDialog(3) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(3) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - ORI_Event_SelectedRandomCompanionInDialog(3) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:b888fb67-721c-4a8c-b578-4660d903ca5b
msgctxt "h1b8bb02eg9bd6g4350gb556g243a2880c111"
msgid ""
"She may not be much of an asset, but I doubt she'll be a hindrance. Let her "
"stay."
msgstr "큰 도움이 되진 않겠지만 그렇다고 방해가 될 것 같지도 않네. 머물게 해줘."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b9a22985-cfbf-ae41-f437-10801e87a11e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:b9a22985-cfbf-ae41-f437-10801e87a11e
msgctxt "h25dec475g5d6bg46bdg8e1eg3b122ec30303"
msgid "Tell me about the grove."
msgstr "숲의 상황에 대해서 말해줘."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = ba9693be-07b8-0d37-4521-98c92fda92d4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:ba9693be-07b8-0d37-4521-98c92fda92d4
msgctxt "hc15143e5g4188g4e7bgb2a0gde3f6f96668f"
msgid "All right..."
msgstr "알겠어요... "

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bbb6ba0f-d235-7734-4b31-25ab647f9730
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:bbb6ba0f-d235-7734-4b31-25ab647f9730
msgctxt "hf5651e05gbb33g4721g8c77gace4931824a6"
msgid "My services come at a price - give me everything you have."
msgstr "내 도움에는 가격이 붙는데, 가진 것 전부 내놔."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = bd9dc953-ed0a-a7c0-7a30-1b6180a2048f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Event_SelectedRandomCompanionInDialog(2) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(2) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - ORI_Event_SelectedRandomCompanionInDialog(2) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:bd9dc953-ed0a-a7c0-7a30-1b6180a2048f
msgctxt "hb3893899g173bg4518g8e94g967b816b5dfc"
msgid "Mm. Just keep it quiet, hear?"
msgstr "음. 조용히만 있으라고, 알겠어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = bfd924f7-c0d6-8e35-ebbe-897a01e43679
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CAMP_DarkUrge_Event_AlfiraUpset(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:bfd924f7-c0d6-8e35-ebbe-897a01e43679
msgctxt "h4ce8a333gede8g4ebeg8f72g5477bb41dd79"
msgid "Goodnight and... thank you for letting me stay."
msgstr "잘 자 그리고... 머물게 해줘서 고마워."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = c00a04da-5cc1-42e6-8562-2e5c129712f5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Event_SelectedRandomCompanionInDialog(6) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(6) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - ORI_Event_SelectedRandomCompanionInDialog(6) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:c00a04da-5cc1-42e6-8562-2e5c129712f5
msgctxt "h80685849g4af5g4622g900agbfa86394307f"
msgid "Oh, come on, let her stay - we have room to spare."
msgstr "아, 그냥 좀 머물게 해줘. 남는 자리도 많잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = c1e02e00-cf1f-1e61-e130-ddfd4a30f6b7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:c1e02e00-cf1f-1e61-e130-ddfd4a30f6b7
msgctxt "h2ba083bfgae16g494dgb5b5g293fec9a8522"
msgid "But my friends, all of us, we'll die without help!"
msgstr "하지만 제 친구들이, 저희 모두가, 당신 없으면 죽고 말 거예요!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c344e7b2-bca4-47aa-3e7f-7dda9022f41e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:c344e7b2-bca4-47aa-3e7f-7dda9022f41e
msgctxt "h959451cfg82f7g4e56g810fg15ca8ccf65dd"
msgid "So you ran like a coward? Good to know."
msgstr "그래서 겁쟁이처럼 도망쳐오셨겠다? 어련하시겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = c42795fb-06c9-e9ff-a3d8-5a3e4be5b17c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:c42795fb-06c9-e9ff-a3d8-5a3e4be5b17c
msgctxt "h4eaf39c1g6319g42aaga94bgdc97635a2fbe"
msgid ""
"I want to join you - to fight by your side. I want to help people - as "
"you've helped me."
msgstr "당신과 함께하고, 당신 편에 서서 싸우고 싶어요. 당신이 절 도와줬던 것처럼, 사람들을 돕고 싶어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = c625f6e9-5db1-4ecc-194f-609c63ecf459
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_TieflingBard_State_ConvincedToQuit = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:c625f6e9-5db1-4ecc-194f-609c63ecf459
msgctxt "h8d1f631bg4088g4b88g97c1gbaad6d678748"
msgid "Please, stay your blade! I mean no - oh."
msgstr "잠시만요, 해치지 마세요! 저는 나쁜 사람이, 앗."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = c6e17131-264e-7b9a-4c6b-83b7a88e7c0d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:c6e17131-264e-7b9a-4c6b-83b7a88e7c0d
msgctxt "hda612e79g1af6g4a95g82ffgadb974cc059e"
msgid ""
"Things between us and the druids are tense. If you could mediate - maybe "
"convince them to let us stay, that would be a big help."
msgstr ""
"드루이드와 우리 사이가 심각해지고 있어요. 중재가 필요해요. 그들을 어떻게든 설득해서 우리가 떠나지 않게 해준다면 큰 도움이 될 거예요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = ca01b71d-e399-3fd9-2cec-b371583b758f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:ca01b71d-e399-3fd9-2cec-b371583b758f
msgctxt "hcae08040g1766g4a33g843bg1b175b5366de"
msgid "My name is Alfira - I'm a bard. I mean no harm!"
msgstr "전 알피라라고 해요. 바드고요. 해치러 온 건 아니에요!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = cb571842-2502-5538-31a9-3b56576e125c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:cb571842-2502-5538-31a9-3b56576e125c
msgctxt "h4b84af28gd7a2g4a65ga601g870c21b11f76"
msgid "I'm sorry. I just saw your fire and ran towards it. I need your help."
msgstr "죄송해요. 여기 불빛을 보곤 냅다 뛰어왔어요. 당신 도움이 필요해요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cbe9a6ee-7ddb-2f58-6f42-cbc1acbcc1ea
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:cbe9a6ee-7ddb-2f58-6f42-cbc1acbcc1ea
msgctxt "he262a380gbb45g435fg953bgfe592f80a2e5"
msgid "Are you sure? I lead a dangerous life."
msgstr "정말 확실해? 내가 가는 길엔 위험이 잔뜩 도사리고 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = ccfdeccd-6bdd-b683-e9fa-6be0be4c34a6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:ccfdeccd-6bdd-b683-e9fa-6be0be4c34a6
msgctxt "hdafeecedg4d76g486aga4bag604dd497784f"
msgid "Because I need help - desperately."
msgstr "당신 도움이 필요해요. 정말 절실하게요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d0b55969-6a7c-9f29-efb2-ffebeb028dd7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_State_InGoblinCamp = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:d0b55969-6a7c-9f29-efb2-ffebeb028dd7
msgctxt "h4e1c970cgcd82g4a09gb385g07f28b9e2361"
msgid "That much of a fool, you got lost in the <i>goblin camp</i>?"
msgstr "그렇게 멍청한 짓을 해놓고, 또 <i>고블린 야영지</i>에서 길을 잃었다고?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d16bdc73-ad7f-9ee2-83d2-f8524d12eff4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_State_InGoblinCamp = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:d16bdc73-ad7f-9ee2-83d2-f8524d12eff4
msgctxt "h77c3a450ga25cg4102gb8e6g73dda4fef265"
msgid "Alfira! How did you find your way here? It's very dangerous."
msgstr "알피라! 여긴 어떻게 찾아온 거야? 정말 위험한 곳인데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = d5ee667a-2490-fecc-c6b5-ab815b519f35
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_TieflingBard_State_FinishedSong = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:d5ee667a-2490-fecc-c6b5-ab815b519f35
msgctxt "he26a11cagfd0dg4a98ga2f4g1d1def1131d1"
msgid ""
"Oh. We met in the grove? You helped me finish my song - the Weeping Dawn?"
msgstr "어. 우리, 숲에서 만났잖아요? 당신이 노래 완성하는 것도 도와줬고요. '흐느끼는 새벽' 기억 나요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = d622fbbf-2158-c9ba-863c-bb22bb1c1ad9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Event_SelectedRandomCompanionInDialog(3) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(3) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - ORI_Event_SelectedRandomCompanionInDialog(3) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:d622fbbf-2158-c9ba-863c-bb22bb1c1ad9
msgctxt "hacd6f11ag07bag4336ga03aga8c8d49a0aba"
msgid "Oh don't be such a killjoy. What's the worst that could happen?"
msgstr "아 너무 예민하게 굴지 말자고. 나빠질게 뭐가 있어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d6998be2-11a2-3683-41a6-d0515d9e15ab
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:d6998be2-11a2-3683-41a6-d0515d9e15ab
msgctxt "h605c23dbg5ea7g4026gb92dg022013bb8157"
msgid "It's safer for you at the grove."
msgstr "넌 숲에 있는 편이 더 안전해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d69a6ec0-bc7e-1791-b682-66c38503fb30
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:d69a6ec0-bc7e-1791-b682-66c38503fb30
msgctxt "h42baf2d6g60d6g4555ga959g8702034f317d"
msgid "Don't sneak up on people like that."
msgstr "그런 식으로 몰래 접근하지 마."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = d91598b5-d54c-5d91-d501-5c4995b63c4e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:d91598b5-d54c-5d91-d501-5c4995b63c4e
msgctxt "h05a4ff89gc467g435bg8b19g15c6b49e3705"
msgid "Not a problem."
msgstr "걱정 마셔."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = dd0cdf57-2c81-3000-0426-5782fd6fc732
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_State_InGoblinCamp = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:dd0cdf57-2c81-3000-0426-5782fd6fc732
msgctxt "h4edd8581g6bfeg4db9g8b55ge7de3d9ac694"
msgid ""
"You wandered through the <i>goblin camp</i>? You must really want to meet me."
msgstr "날 찾아 <i>고블린 야영지</i>까지 돌아다녔다고? 정말 만나고 싶었나 보네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = dea5d4cd-90c6-bc44-03bc-01da91e3eb38
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:dea5d4cd-90c6-bc44-03bc-01da91e3eb38
msgctxt "h6ddce99bgb0a3g43e8ga389gcd7397439734"
msgid "Sure - I'm happy to help."
msgstr "물론이지. 기꺼이 도와줄게."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = dedc0d7a-5be2-da40-ffb6-fd34ece04fe9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:dedc0d7a-5be2-da40-ffb6-fd34ece04fe9
msgctxt "hcf18a3efg677ag4c75ga79fg773b08ec1c2f"
msgid "What are you doing here? It's dangerous."
msgstr "여기서 뭐 하는 거지? 여긴 위험한 곳이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = df31df0b-e60e-33e5-1329-40ca604b0c2b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:df31df0b-e60e-33e5-1329-40ca604b0c2b
msgctxt "hd52f16b8g9e17g4ef8g98acg9c56c85f6cd5"
msgid "I'm sorry for upsetting you."
msgstr "화나게 해서 미안해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e15b3556-3067-d33c-8ac0-adffd1cd9602
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:e15b3556-3067-d33c-8ac0-adffd1cd9602
msgctxt "h9d136b23g65ceg44f9gbd93g2ecbcaf38a2e"
msgid ""
"I'm [GEN_PlayerName_c11eee1e-7815-6143-7233-f2427799fa53]. Nice to meet you."
msgstr "내 이름은 [GEN_PlayerName_c11eee1e-7815-6143-7233-f2427799fa53]. 만나서 반가워."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e4433747-6eae-652d-ad70-b0f29eb65f38
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:e4433747-6eae-652d-ad70-b0f29eb65f38
msgctxt "h7de44a6dg1bb3g4535gba09gdec25f9e59a4"
msgid "State your purpose, or die."
msgstr "여기 온 목적을 말해, 아니면 죽이겠다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = e45f38d3-83c6-467f-8f85-5f8c7ced023a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Event_SelectedRandomCompanionInDialog(4) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(4) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - ORI_Event_SelectedRandomCompanionInDialog(4) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:e45f38d3-83c6-467f-8f85-5f8c7ced023a
msgctxt "hc340a548ga540g4a9bga916g2df017428722"
msgid ""
"As long as she doesn't start serenading me. I've had enough of bad poets "
"singing of my looks."
msgstr "나를 향해 갑자기 세레나데를 부르지만 않으면 괜찮아. 내 외모를 칭송하는 쓰레기 같은 시는 이미 충분히 들었다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e4780a01-fca1-06d6-b304-83f15fef01bc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:e4780a01-fca1-06d6-b304-83f15fef01bc
msgctxt "h7dd9498dg97b1g43f9g8b41g9e369ad59294"
msgid "Stay out of my way and be gone in the morning."
msgstr "걸리적거리지 말고 아침이 되면 떠나."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e68fee3e-a91b-c910-e36c-ea9496fbca97
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:e68fee3e-a91b-c910-e36c-ea9496fbca97
msgctxt "he0d0173fg7ec9g44degbe2ag0f003677e6dc"
msgid "Alfira? Why are you here?"
msgstr "알피라? 여긴 왜 온 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e99b60d8-0468-74c3-1427-89d2ac04e7a3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:e99b60d8-0468-74c3-1427-89d2ac04e7a3
msgctxt "h94983be3g0523g45f5ga9f2g3563c979027e"
msgid "I don't care - get out."
msgstr "내 알 바 아니야. 돌아가."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = ea204b9c-86b6-0854-660d-9f4ebe1a38c6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Event_SelectedRandomCompanionInDialog(4) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(4) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - ORI_Event_SelectedRandomCompanionInDialog(4) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:ea204b9c-86b6-0854-660d-9f4ebe1a38c6
msgctxt "h53ddd7abg3d81g41ffgb983ge9583b3dca59"
msgid ""
"\n"
"Really? Just like that? All right, but if she reaches for that lute, it's "
"firewood."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"정말? 이렇게 쉽게? 뭐 좋아, 하지만 만약 이 여자가 류트를 잡으려 하면, 장작더미로 만들어 줄거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = ea3a6d45-04d2-347f-f960-51cb4fd80dcc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:ea3a6d45-04d2-347f-f960-51cb4fd80dcc
msgctxt "h70330119g0d28g44e1g8954g94017a9c7d11"
msgid ""
"Please - it's dark and I'm... I'm afraid. Just one night - I beg of you."
msgstr "제발, 밖은 어둡고 난... 너무 무서워. 딱 하루면 되니까, 이렇게 빌게."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = ec0d45fd-7dfb-85f5-4e2c-06d7106ca284
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:ec0d45fd-7dfb-85f5-4e2c-06d7106ca284
msgctxt "h2b0f4b62g616eg4617gbaa2gc560c395164c"
msgid ""
"I want to make my own stories. And I can't think of anyone else I'd rather "
"share that with."
msgstr "이제 저만의 이야기를 써 내려가고 싶어졌어요. 그리고 이 이야기를 함께 쓸 다른 사람은 떠오르지 않아요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = ecbd53f9-778e-0b9e-f791-81c9e4769127
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:ecbd53f9-778e-0b9e-f791-81c9e4769127
msgctxt "hd1b98a38g870bg47dfg9a08g78e03e1c20f3"
msgid ""
"I want to join you - to fight by your side. I want to help people, as you've "
"helped us."
msgstr "당신의 일행에 합류하고 싶어요. 함께 싸우게 해주세요. 절 도와주셨듯이 저도 다른 사람들을 돕고 싶어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ed6ee992-a0a6-8201-48dd-b53269423eda
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:ed6ee992-a0a6-8201-48dd-b53269423eda
msgctxt "hdffca06ag0c50g465ag96aagfd65dc8b4824"
msgid "I changed my mind - get out. Now."
msgstr "생각이 바뀌었어. 나가. 당장."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = eee05cfc-ccb5-8b05-368f-1f00f3be3f8f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:eee05cfc-ccb5-8b05-368f-1f00f3be3f8f
msgctxt "hecc07187g12cag484dga6dfg8da7878e14b5"
msgid "Fine."
msgstr "알겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = ef259829-7c8f-49cd-cd3f-e2af7bf7f2fa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:ef259829-7c8f-49cd-cd3f-e2af7bf7f2fa
msgctxt "ha61a796ag1603g4605g913fgc05e49b58103"
msgid ""
"You're all anyone talks about in the grove. Hearing all you've done inspired "
"me."
msgstr "숲속에서는 모두 당신 얘기만 하고 있어요. 당신이 한 모든 일을 듣고 전 감동했어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = f5ba4d10-1fee-e479-fd33-bf2d27b72d39
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CAMP_DarkUrge_Event_AlfiraUpset(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:f5ba4d10-1fee-e479-fd33-bf2d27b72d39
msgctxt "he68e91c5g8204g4fcbg81eeged2c0aea74f8"
msgid "I'll be gone by first light. Good night."
msgstr "동이 트기 전에 떠날게요. 잘 자요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = f613532e-7a99-5f2f-77be-71cede92aa71
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:f613532e-7a99-5f2f-77be-71cede92aa71
msgctxt "h6217f7e1g6777g4ab1g9a00ga71a051b800c"
msgid "Really? Just like that? Oh, thank you - thank you so much."
msgstr "정말요? 이렇게 쉽게? 아, 고마워요, 정말 고마워요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = fd09cd62-b826-6024-83cc-bffc2c69a86d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:fd09cd62-b826-6024-83cc-bffc2c69a86d
msgctxt "h1eb0cf9bgcc88g4995g9d66g1aa5bcc67528"
msgid ""
"You can clearly handle yourself in a fight. And we, well, we're not exactly "
"warriors."
msgstr "싸움을 굉장히 잘하시더군요. 하지만 우리는, 그래요, 분명히 전사가 아니라고요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = ff2f52a1-326f-509e-82fe-cec28d5f7315
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_AlfiraArrives:ff2f52a1-326f-509e-82fe-cec28d5f7315
msgctxt "h30561ec7gc37cg454bga8e5g221f464fef95"
msgid "But... fine. Here. That's all I have."
msgstr "하지만... 알겠어요. 여기요. 제가 가진 전부예요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 00633df0-256e-7ded-2af0-874281a44ded
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives:00633df0-256e-7ded-2af0-874281a44ded
msgctxt "ha95410a5gc8c4g4a3ega9b7g91d9637f11d4"
msgid "What kind of music do you write?"
msgstr "어떤 종류의 음악을 작곡해?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives
#. Speaker = Quil Grootslang
#. NodeID = 0149a958-eba3-40f8-a4a4-2682786d38f3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives:0149a958-eba3-40f8-a4a4-2682786d38f3
msgctxt "h1ccce839gee24g405cga43egd9ae39edc86a"
msgid "Please, oh, <i>please. </i>It would mean so much to me."
msgstr "부탁해, 오, <i>제발.</i> 정말이지 너무나도 고마울 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives
#. Speaker = Quil Grootslang
#. NodeID = 02968e60-2b38-43ad-8bb5-022521289988
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives:02968e60-2b38-43ad-8bb5-022521289988
msgctxt "h95284087gff16g403aga0dbgc184665dc3d3"
msgid ""
"Well met. Goblins roughed me up and stole my hose when they heard me singing "
"<i>Hatchling Love</i>."
msgstr "무지 반갑다. <i>부화하는 사랑</i>을 불렀더니만 고블린들이 날 괴롭히고 내 호스를 훔쳐갔지 뭐야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 08dce1f4-0ff0-4965-9234-12cafb3beda0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives:08dce1f4-0ff0-4965-9234-12cafb3beda0
msgctxt "h43832e8agb2c4g431agb743g7783ef4b47ec"
msgid "No."
msgstr "안 돼."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives
#. Speaker = Quil Grootslang
#. NodeID = 0ef00070-4749-965d-752c-b30d8c1cbeec
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives:0ef00070-4749-965d-752c-b30d8c1cbeec
msgctxt "hfe5b7542g8455g4057ga5c3g8dd8fba3b301"
msgid ""
"I've been given a great chance. My song-score: <i>Affairs in Ancient Abeir: "
"Songs of Draconic Love </i>is due to be published in the Gate!"
msgstr ""
"다시 없을 기회를 잡았거든. 내 작곡집, <i>고대 아베이르에서 있었던 일: 드래곤족 사랑 노래들</i>이 발더스 게이트에서 출판될 "
"예정이야!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 105613ab-b57b-457d-4c93-05c407efb1d5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives:105613ab-b57b-457d-4c93-05c407efb1d5
msgctxt "h17ec214dg18bcg4ad3g9623g73d3f446359e"
msgid "My head is on my shoulders, not in the clouds."
msgstr "내 머리는 어깨 위에 있어. 뜬구름 속 말고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 10fb2ba5-a5c6-99d7-dd74-4789d90fc8af
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives:10fb2ba5-a5c6-99d7-dd74-4789d90fc8af
msgctxt "h4213f023gde4dg4f71g88bag30d9218a6cbc"
msgid "I think they hardly know I exist."
msgstr "내 존재조차 잘 모르는 것 같아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives
#. Speaker = Quil Grootslang
#. NodeID = 14790507-2c69-47b5-81e4-d5d5c58f38bb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives:14790507-2c69-47b5-81e4-d5d5c58f38bb
msgctxt "hdd73b75bg8997g4187g80c2g25c19d238641"
msgid ""
"But- agh, I have worked for <i>years </i>on my music, I just have to bring "
"my songbook safely to Baldur's Gate."
msgstr ""
"그치만, 아아, 난 이 음악 작업에 <i>여러 해</i>나 매달렸어. 그저 이 작곡집을 발더스 게이트에 무사히 가져가기만 하면 돼."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives
#. Speaker = Quil Grootslang
#. NodeID = 15bc1ca1-b813-fc71-5c13-01daf794c0ab
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives:15bc1ca1-b813-fc71-5c13-01daf794c0ab
msgctxt "hf6743e4ag70bdg4c4fgbcccg8b9f659c23fc"
msgid ""
"I grew up smiling about my little secrets to myself. I would have been "
"laughed at if I admitted to anyone how I felt. It is not our kind's way."
msgstr "난 내 비밀을 혼자 간직하고 살았어. 다른 사람에게 내 마음을 털어놨더라면 웃음거리가 됐을걸. 우리 종족의 방식이 아니니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives
#. Speaker = Quil Grootslang
#. NodeID = 15cd64d2-2940-3d11-9646-667c04e8f55f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives:15cd64d2-2940-3d11-9646-667c04e8f55f
msgctxt "h5c155b4egd034g4109g8686g2fe835451722"
msgid ""
"This one, <i>Sky-Swain</i>  is about what it might feel like to mate in the "
"air, in the age where wings were yet with us."
msgstr ""
"이 노래, <i>하늘에서 사랑에 빠진 남자</i>는 공중 짝짓기 과정이 어떤 느낌인지 묘사하는 노래야. 아직 날개가 우리와 함께하던 시대 "
"노래지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 15fab68a-a9cf-05ab-455f-22115f277c6c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Origin_PartOfTheTeam_Karlach = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives:15fab68a-a9cf-05ab-455f-22115f277c6c
msgctxt "h3962cd46g355eg4357g863dgeed1105caa49"
msgid ""
"Karlach seems like she has so much love to give, if she found the right "
"person."
msgstr "칼라크는 적당한 사람만 나타나면 아낌없이 사랑을 퍼줄 것 같아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives
#. Speaker = Quil Grootslang
#. NodeID = 16e28884-4eff-bde1-2d95-2374e8caa6b0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives:16e28884-4eff-bde1-2d95-2374e8caa6b0
msgctxt "hac574f0bge1e5g4308gad32g1ee32ec46a4a"
msgid "Well, in all honesty, I ran from Tymanther to avoid my egg-duty."
msgstr "으음, 솔직히 말해서, 난 알 낳는 의무를 피해 타이만더에서 도망쳤어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1a8de7ba-03a7-475b-beaa-880794cf658d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives:1a8de7ba-03a7-475b-beaa-880794cf658d
msgctxt "hcdd369f7g2b2dg4ee9g9db2gc39300da6c0f"
msgid "Stay at the edge of the camp, and stay quiet."
msgstr "야영지 가장자리를 쓰도록. 잠 깨우지 말고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives
#. Speaker = Quil Grootslang
#. NodeID = 1d92e0d1-ca72-02e5-12de-639524b656bd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives:1d92e0d1-ca72-02e5-12de-639524b656bd
msgctxt "hbbcd3d04g6303g48a9g9053g33a4c31ff7b6"
msgid ""
"I can't risk another night in the open - the goblins might steal my "
"manuscript next time. Surprised they didn't take it when they lifted my "
"poulaines."
msgstr ""
"오늘밤도 노숙할 수는 없어. 이번엔 고블린들이 내 원고를 훔쳐 갈지도 몰라. 구두를 도둑맞았을 때 원고를 안 들고 간 건 놀라웠지만."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives
#. Speaker = Quil Grootslang
#. NodeID = 1f61cac2-c48a-058a-58b4-dc517f8acc47
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives:1f61cac2-c48a-058a-58b4-dc517f8acc47
msgctxt "h185c3683gb512g45e0ga6aeg27afa5d9ed0a"
msgid ""
"I don't think most of us stop hoping, ever, really. Not even when duty "
"stamps us down."
msgstr "우리 대부분이 희망을 놓으리라고는 생각 안 해. 정말로. 의무가 우리를 짓누를 때도 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives
#. Speaker = Quil Grootslang
#. NodeID = 1fe78e2c-c2a7-67a7-d179-fbed5d3c6ece
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives:1fe78e2c-c2a7-67a7-d179-fbed5d3c6ece
msgctxt "h7cb5cdb5g8fdeg4537gb3efge27c78a07bca"
msgid ""
"And that's what the songbook's about. Lost lost, lingering love, never acted "
"on. Never spoken."
msgstr "그리고 그게 내 작곡집의 요지야. 잊고 잊혀진, 차마 행동에 옮기지 못해 미련을 남기는 사랑. 전례가 없지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives
#. Speaker = Quil Grootslang
#. NodeID = 2816019d-41f1-0c73-b3b0-b9af9d6b687c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives:2816019d-41f1-0c73-b3b0-b9af9d6b687c
msgctxt "h213d0002ge95cg4002g926egb42e1f56b0a8"
msgid ""
"Perhaps. But I want to capture this feeling, while it still strikes hot."
msgstr "그럴지도. 어쨌든 이 느낌이 강렬하게 남아 있을 때 착상을 얻고 싶어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2b23e833-5dee-feb8-ed34-e2bc5371ce45
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives:2b23e833-5dee-feb8-ed34-e2bc5371ce45
msgctxt "h79f3da7ege416g4e8bgbb49gc8fdb7d4c926"
msgid "Are you any good in a fight?"
msgstr "싸움은 좀 해?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives
#. Speaker = Quil Grootslang
#. NodeID = 2f63d7d2-cb37-e621-e34e-0f91d57345d3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives:2f63d7d2-cb37-e621-e34e-0f91d57345d3
msgctxt "h366fe359g8edcg4522gaae6ge9a456ac7c75"
msgid ""
"But I have my whole life ahead of me... Things will be different now I'm on "
"the Sword Coast. I can't wait for what is coming next!"
msgstr ""
"하지만 창창한 미래가 내 앞에 펼쳐져 있는걸... 이제 소드 코스트에 왔으니 많은 게 달라질 거야. 어떤 일이 일어날지 너무 기대돼!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives
#. Speaker = Quil Grootslang
#. NodeID = 31cadde8-640a-12db-6b2d-d43b8f80e0f3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives:31cadde8-640a-12db-6b2d-d43b8f80e0f3
msgctxt "h478645a7g514fg4828g92dbgf5879506359c"
msgid "Spoken like someone who's never heard a dragonborn throatsong."
msgstr "드래곤본식 배음 창법을 한 번도 들어본 적 없나보네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 323b413d-8bc4-7b26-c89e-a6d1372f0d98
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives:323b413d-8bc4-7b26-c89e-a6d1372f0d98
msgctxt "h87884d2agfb32g451fga736ga6c00059f8a6"
msgid "No, and I'm not sure if I'll ever be able to tell them."
msgstr "아니, 어떻게 말을 꺼내야 할지도 모르겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 34b0570e-870c-4823-97fe-c2ab8c8419c5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(7) = True
#.      - AVATAR(7) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives:34b0570e-870c-4823-97fe-c2ab8c8419c5
msgctxt "h7b47f213g9bffg4cf8gad90g226181cb629c"
msgid "Never say no to a bard. They'll write all sorts of mean shit about you."
msgstr "바드의 부탁은 거절하지 마. 돌아가면 너에 대해 온갖 좆같은 노래를 써재낄 테니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3629c759-9d11-34cc-a335-c8b735ab7e8b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Origin_PartOfTheTeam_Wyll = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives:3629c759-9d11-34cc-a335-c8b735ab7e8b
msgctxt "h32d4bc99gd391g4ff1g975dg8467b90f9d51"
msgid "Wyll is such a gentleman, I imagine he'd make an even better partner."
msgstr "윌은 신사라서, 훨씬 더 좋은 동반자가 될 수 있으리라 생각해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives
#. Speaker = Quil Grootslang
#. NodeID = 41de9a07-7a2e-e969-ccc9-d286b2d59284
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives:41de9a07-7a2e-e969-ccc9-d286b2d59284
msgctxt "h46ee43d4g1da9g48d4gb7cfg22d219dea8d0"
msgid ""
"I'm in a big big rush, though. I fear that if I don't get there in the next "
"few days they're gonna print some kobold bone-flute instrumentals instead."
msgstr ""
"매우 서두르고 있긴 하지만 말이야. 며칠 내로 거기 도착하지 못하면, 출판사에서 코볼트 뼈 피리 악곡집을 대신 출판할까 봐 걱정이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 44c4af67-f5dd-7afd-eca1-ca318a8671f4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives:44c4af67-f5dd-7afd-eca1-ca318a8671f4
msgctxt "hc2d61f66g8d26g4d3aga627g3c99dc57c4aa"
msgid "I've been honest enough, so far."
msgstr "아직까진 충분히 솔직했지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 46680ea3-e40f-eec6-13b1-6b67aaf22c01
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Origin_PartOfTheTeam_Shadowheart = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives:46680ea3-e40f-eec6-13b1-6b67aaf22c01
msgctxt "h411d22fagffbbg44c2gb5bag1740a2ceea43"
msgid "Shadowheart is pure grace."
msgstr "섀도하트라면 순전한 은혜지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 48757cfc-80e4-5ece-bc02-abfaf7079b70
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives:48757cfc-80e4-5ece-bc02-abfaf7079b70
msgctxt "h23b1e154g4f19g4550g83f5gd0a3ce5e5665"
msgid "Why were you travelling on the road, in the middle of the night?"
msgstr "어쩌다 오밤중에 여행길을 떠난 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives
#. Speaker = Quil Grootslang
#. NodeID = 4f3e8786-6970-3f90-4098-ae0a4d0b4e38
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DRAGONBORN(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives:4f3e8786-6970-3f90-4098-ae0a4d0b4e38
msgctxt "h97f262a8gcf5eg40d1ga50bg6ae6d79089e8"
msgid ""
"I know we must marry into whichever clan suits our own. And I know we're not "
"allowed to let love drive us,"
msgstr "우리 모두가 부족에서 정해준 대로 결혼해야 한다는 건 알아. 사랑 같은 감정에 이끌려서는 안 된다는 것도."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 56b54b09-77d7-64a0-3200-9db4a62f57d1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DRAGONBORN(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives:56b54b09-77d7-64a0-3200-9db4a62f57d1
msgctxt "hceb5e864gaf01g4604g9ff6g647dc1ddc135"
msgid "You're very far from our people's home."
msgstr "동족들의 고향에서 멀리도 떠나왔구나."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 608918ad-9caf-3bcc-3863-24e4bd771d1a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives:608918ad-9caf-3bcc-3863-24e4bd771d1a
msgctxt "h8c33c7e3g2cbcg4b53g9556g7c130da10a87"
msgid "That's quite enough culture for one evening!"
msgstr "오늘 밤을 빛내줄 찬란한 걸작이로구만!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives
#. Speaker = Quil Grootslang
#. NodeID = 65b75ba3-f58a-eaea-49d1-a0b9594fe642
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives:65b75ba3-f58a-eaea-49d1-a0b9594fe642
msgctxt "h5ad1406ag0127g4257ga397g5aacad31ff01"
msgid ""
"There's a special feeling to having love all to yourself, don't you think? "
"For no one to know."
msgstr "짝사랑도 짝사랑 나름의 매력이 있어, 그렇지 않아? 아무도 모르는 비밀이잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 689e3858-424c-4eac-a35c-b2970ded3bc7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - AVATAR(2) = False
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(2) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives:689e3858-424c-4eac-a35c-b2970ded3bc7
msgctxt "h2bb57625gc804g459ega603g861daeb76111"
msgid "Invite her in, cast her out. I see no difference either way."
msgstr "들이든지, 내보내든지. 어느 쪽이든 별반 다르지 않을 것 같군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 737b2c55-e7c1-594b-55da-3aa3d7ee3288
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives:737b2c55-e7c1-594b-55da-3aa3d7ee3288
msgctxt "h2c70efd6g6dcbg4f15gada2g006d7c33dcf7"
msgid "I'll tell them when I'm sure they'll say it back."
msgstr "나와 같은 마음이라는 확신이 들면 말하겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 77b91e8c-9ea8-cee3-4a10-5ff8dbe9f110
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Origin_PartOfTheTeam_Gale = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives:77b91e8c-9ea8-cee3-4a10-5ff8dbe9f110
msgctxt "h0d28c5f5gcdf0g4c43gae5bg4a50fd46d9a3"
msgid "Mock me as you will, but I have a thing for Gale."
msgstr "맘대로 놀려도 좋아, 그렇지만 게일에게 마음이 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 78864bf4-5c9b-ead7-19f4-c0c470dff574
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives:78864bf4-5c9b-ead7-19f4-c0c470dff574
msgctxt "h8aae2bb9gc1c8g49e5ga718gee5b98766039"
msgid "It's too soon for that..."
msgstr "그러기엔 너무 이른걸..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 78c5ffb0-41e2-8ebd-6b0f-4ded7126e8ba
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives:78c5ffb0-41e2-8ebd-6b0f-4ded7126e8ba
msgctxt "h56a1c26dg1cf4g4294g895bg431aa88e81e3"
msgid "You're painfully innocent."
msgstr "고통스러울 정도로 순수하구나."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives
#. Speaker = Quil Grootslang
#. NodeID = 7979c0d7-6b9b-55b6-d178-234a4762e0fa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives:7979c0d7-6b9b-55b6-d178-234a4762e0fa
msgctxt "h89ee5bc4g3797g4d60g8658gf0c2f7a569d1"
msgid ""
"I've prepared a dense manuscript of new love-chants, to be throat-sung in "
"Tymanther style."
msgstr "새로운 사랑 노래들로 원고를 빽빽하게 엮었지. 타이만더식 후음 창법으로 부를 수 있도록."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives
#. Speaker = Quil Grootslang
#. NodeID = 799ba02d-440a-4a3e-aef5-aa0b34a277fc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives:799ba02d-440a-4a3e-aef5-aa0b34a277fc
msgctxt "hcdf0d784g3bcbg446ag85c9g90a44b4cd4ae"
msgid "Yes! Thank you - I'll write your name in the dedication!"
msgstr "예이! 고마워, 네 이름을 꼭 감사 글에 실을게!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives
#. Speaker = Quil Grootslang
#. NodeID = 7a42af63-9456-1db8-62f2-910201478929
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - DRAGONBORN(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives:7a42af63-9456-1db8-62f2-910201478929
msgctxt "h7d8285cfg8507g460egbb0dg952d4517a3fa"
msgid ""
"'Sides, it's hardly ever I meet another with scales as lovely as mine. "
"You're the kind of gorgeous I dreamed of nesting with as a girl."
msgstr ""
"게다가 나만큼 사랑스러운 비늘을 가진 동족은 만나기 힘든데 말이야. 넌 내가 어렸을 때 함께 둥지를 트는 걸 꿈꿨던 그런 멋진 부류야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives
#. Speaker = Quil Grootslang
#. NodeID = 7ab2cd1b-988b-98d3-1931-dc71dc0aa926
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 81aba643-494e-b67a-5b67-26b444848c8d_neverloved = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives:7ab2cd1b-988b-98d3-1931-dc71dc0aa926
msgctxt "h3900b6dfgc1a9g49f3ga2aegb1ee1016d9ae"
msgid "But I've never even been kissed and I can't stop myself from dreaming."
msgstr "하지만 난 아직 키스조차 해 보지 않았어. 꿈꾸길 멈출 수가 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives
#. Speaker = Quil Grootslang
#. NodeID = 8d9859d3-9634-685a-881f-2c43d5e1ccf4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives:8d9859d3-9634-685a-881f-2c43d5e1ccf4
msgctxt "h9f97008fg4198g4a7ag9600ga2b88067cd8d"
msgid "Oh my! Are you sure? Are you really sure!"
msgstr "어머 세상에! 정말이지? 정말 듣고 싶은 거 맞지!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives
#. Speaker = Quil Grootslang
#. NodeID = 931a9c6b-326d-2d67-9109-872d2bf32394
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives:931a9c6b-326d-2d67-9109-872d2bf32394
msgctxt "h20097963g4339g4636g89f7g7146eb417153"
msgid ""
"Although half the time it's for some Society of Brilliance twat with two "
"left feet writing a book about us."
msgstr "물론 대개는 광명회 사람들 앞에서 공연했지. 우리 종족에 관해 책 쓰기를 좋아하는 몸치들 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 93800040-3cb2-061b-452a-3124af7db734
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_DrowCommander_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_DrowCommander_State_Dead = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives:93800040-3cb2-061b-452a-3124af7db734
msgctxt "h2ef06dc5g9f79g4b1dgb7fdg64a2d9d3fd2e"
msgid "I met the most amazing, bewildering Drow the other day..."
msgstr "얼마 전에 정말 놀랍고도 혼미하게 만드는 드로우를 만나긴 했지..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives
#. Speaker = Quil Grootslang
#. NodeID = 94a063a5-b4ce-71c2-5ab2-f91869a38944
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives:94a063a5-b4ce-71c2-5ab2-f91869a38944
msgctxt "h72d83959g0ff1g4603gb487gcd327f9ef018"
msgid ""
"<i>Sigh</i>. I know. It's not the first time I've been robbed, I am only "
"glad I didn't get hurt."
msgstr "<i>휴</i>. 나도 알아. 이런 강도질이 처음도 아니고, 그냥 안 다쳐서 다행일 뿐이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives
#. Speaker = Quil Grootslang
#. NodeID = 95e19ade-a82a-97d3-d424-1018f288f2df
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives:95e19ade-a82a-97d3-d424-1018f288f2df
msgctxt "h6e8ffcaag0fc7g4316g9ed0ga40a3b05f5e2"
msgid ""
"Hardly a soul on the Sword Coast has heard our kind's love chants. I've made "
"a fair bit of coin performing them."
msgstr "소드 코스트 사람들 중에 우리 종족의 사랑 노래를 들어본 사람은 무척 드물걸. 난 그걸로 공연을 다니며 돈 좀 만졌지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9c126923-c653-f9f5-f715-9975072f697e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives:9c126923-c653-f9f5-f715-9975072f697e
msgctxt "h09551fafga48fg4a72g87b0gb1669b761e0e"
msgid "Our hearth is open, and there is safety beside it."
msgstr "우리 모닥불은 열려 있어. 그 옆이라면 안전할 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a0a66888-99f9-fdbf-8b6c-a48eff84ec94
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives:a0a66888-99f9-fdbf-8b6c-a48eff84ec94
msgctxt "hf727e647g0e35g4733g8081g33bedd1e601d"
msgid "Will you sing a draconic song for me?"
msgstr "용족의 노래를 한 번 불러줄래?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a10eaad3-0eec-e247-5567-23ae8d774d93
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DRAGONBORN(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives:a10eaad3-0eec-e247-5567-23ae8d774d93
msgctxt "h5748bc76g8e9ag436bgb6c8gf4106c20263f"
msgid ""
"I don't think I've ever even been to our homeland... I know nothing of our "
"clans."
msgstr "고향 땅을 밟아 보기나 했는지도 잘 모르겠어... 난 우리 부족에 대해 아는 게 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives
#. Speaker = Quil Grootslang
#. NodeID = a15caf4a-e5ce-b059-d004-6ed5eb43487c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives:a15caf4a-e5ce-b059-d004-6ed5eb43487c
msgctxt "heb32cf24g8b31g49efg8dbag720fb0bd8873"
msgid ""
"Ah, you're a fearsome one! Fine by me, I'll get some shut-eye. Although I do "
"sometimes whistle when I snore..."
msgstr "아, 성미가 아주 살벌하구나! 난 괜찮아, 눈만 좀 붙일 테니까. 가끔 코를 골면 휘파람 소리가 나긴 하지만..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = a240da43-bdb1-43fb-a11c-bda57f81e2b3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - AVATAR(5) = False
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(5) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives:a240da43-bdb1-43fb-a11c-bda57f81e2b3
msgctxt "h1ed5345eg539eg4f0eg9e26gde8feec93eab"
msgid "Oh, but she seems such a delight! Let her stay, at least for the night."
msgstr "오, 그럼에도 설렘을 감추지 못하잖아! 하룻밤만이라도 머무르게 해 주자."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a3cab128-0545-a5ba-5123-268ac7f0b434
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives:a3cab128-0545-a5ba-5123-268ac7f0b434
msgctxt "hb3ba76a4gf65eg461fga63fg16a91359ea07"
msgid "So you ran away from home?"
msgstr "그래서 고향을 떠나온 건가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives
#. Speaker = Quil Grootslang
#. NodeID = a4da630c-6f3d-e05a-e3fb-aa0f1055844a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives:a4da630c-6f3d-e05a-e3fb-aa0f1055844a
msgctxt "h24ed7e0cg4a2dg42a7gbe51gfd7f5420117f"
msgid "Well, your life is poorer for it."
msgstr "그렇다면 네 인생은 더 초라할 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a67560d8-f0f8-a862-2deb-661d597dd575
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives:a67560d8-f0f8-a862-2deb-661d597dd575
msgctxt "h72ef26fcg6b98g427cgba08g75390ae4bc8b"
msgid "It's dangerous out there to be travelling on your own..."
msgstr "혼자서 여행하기는 위험할 텐데..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives
#. Speaker = Quil Grootslang
#. NodeID = a7a35b53-33c0-99a7-1acc-8fa0c3f2fcaa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_Bard_Backup_State_Arrived = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives:a7a35b53-33c0-99a7-1acc-8fa0c3f2fcaa
msgctxt "ha10d64cbgc860g4ac4gb64fg9983922b3578"
msgid "Thanks for the fire."
msgstr "불자리 고마워."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives
#. Speaker = Quil Grootslang
#. NodeID = ab496b1a-0578-4da0-dbff-33fbff47c92f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives:ab496b1a-0578-4da0-dbff-33fbff47c92f
msgctxt "he149776fg1038g4a78gb288g717ace5d554e"
msgid ""
"And have you said so? Do they know even one little bit of how you really "
"feel?"
msgstr "그런 마음을 표현해 봤어? 네 친구는 네 마음을 조금이라도 눈치채고 있을까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives
#. Speaker = Quil Grootslang
#. NodeID = aec58097-e309-b1cf-9163-d0fb2d3c7adc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives:aec58097-e309-b1cf-9163-d0fb2d3c7adc
msgctxt "h96661343g8c54g4651g9535g63be0cc19cb3"
msgid "Oh, there are sixty nine more verses, I'm only just beginning!"
msgstr "어머, 이 뒤로 예순 아홉 소절이나 더 있는걸. 이건 시작일 뿐이야!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives
#. Speaker = Quil Grootslang
#. NodeID = af05b982-7ab9-70dd-65ff-fade85e15553
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives:af05b982-7ab9-70dd-65ff-fade85e15553
msgctxt "hd47834e1gffebg4539gb85dgc01ace540bb2"
msgid ""
"You wouldn't have half a bedroll for a lost minstrel, would you? I can pay "
"for my board with music, if you care for it?"
msgstr "길 잃은 음유시인을 위해 침낭 하나 정도는 내어 줄 수 있겠지? 삯은 음악으로 지불하고 싶은데, 그쪽만 관심 있다면?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b24934a1-0d41-7c9d-b00d-b332ec9997c9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives:b24934a1-0d41-7c9d-b00d-b332ec9997c9
msgctxt "hd762b34dg2157g4457gb606gd264f5628f70"
msgid "Who are you?"
msgstr "넌 누구지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b4098366-79e6-b1ef-c161-ebe19504ccd9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives:b4098366-79e6-b1ef-c161-ebe19504ccd9
msgctxt "h380a29ccg397eg4f99gb027g5d81d5321e79"
msgid "What's the worst that could happen?"
msgstr "뭐, 나쁠 거 없잖아?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b6068e04-eb6b-452f-9c73-0b8b07bfc072
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives:b6068e04-eb6b-452f-9c73-0b8b07bfc072
msgctxt "h67179b3bg7b5cg49fagb390g0087ba1609cd"
msgid "Fine."
msgstr "좋아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b62972b8-b862-2808-e476-ad1e53a48249
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 81aba643-494e-b67a-5b67-26b444848c8d_neverloved = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives:b62972b8-b862-2808-e476-ad1e53a48249
msgctxt "h1266e8d9g4cf6g4b7eg88f4gc7e0772c7bde"
msgid "How do you write love songs, if you've never found love yourself?"
msgstr "사랑에 빠져 본 적도 없으면서 어떻게 사랑 노래를 쓰겠다는 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b9d73e29-5d0f-5f3c-cffc-4b39ab667fdd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives:b9d73e29-5d0f-5f3c-cffc-4b39ab667fdd
msgctxt "h5e0652ecgf9eeg4eebg8ad7gd31efc5d64c7"
msgid "Ah, the true language of love."
msgstr "와, 진정한 사랑의 언어를 맛봤어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives
#. Speaker = Quil Grootslang
#. NodeID = bbd6d7ec-b4d2-ca53-1309-d28fc77103c1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives:bbd6d7ec-b4d2-ca53-1309-d28fc77103c1
msgctxt "h6c9fbd3egbf2dg482bgb07fge5253af281ef"
msgid "<i>Wux-VOREL-EL-EL-EL-EL</i>"
msgstr "<i>으리우-락-스워-럴-렐-렐-레울</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives
#. Speaker = Quil Grootslang
#. NodeID = bcd0393e-f23a-4aa1-8056-426d3b431ad2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_Bard_Backup_State_Arrived = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives:bcd0393e-f23a-4aa1-8056-426d3b431ad2
msgctxt "h0ecc3e3cgf9bcg40c4g90bcg952a580ed1a7"
msgid "Hark! Hark! A camp, and, Oghma-willing, some friendly faces."
msgstr "하크, 하크! 야영지다. 게다가 오그마께서 함께하사, 반가운 얼굴들이잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = be673d74-edb5-4846-be41-cec62974b212
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives:be673d74-edb5-4846-be41-cec62974b212
msgctxt "hae00e1b8g4780g4dd8g878ag9929bfc242ea"
msgid "You can't stay - I have no time for weaklings."
msgstr "거절하지. 약자에게 낭비할 시간은 없다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives
#. Speaker = Quil Grootslang
#. NodeID = c1d6ca8f-83a8-bee5-cb89-3fdc5beda3fc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives:c1d6ca8f-83a8-bee5-cb89-3fdc5beda3fc
msgctxt "ha7f2f70fg1181g43aega747gaaf25fb30ab0"
msgid ""
"I'll just stay one night, promise, then I'll be gone. I know I'm ice-blood, "
"but I get <i>cold so fast</i>, I need to be by the fire."
msgstr "하룻밤만 묵을게. 약속해. 금방 떠날 거야. 내가 냉혈동물이긴 하지만, 너무 <i>빨리 차가워져서</i>, 불 옆에 있어야 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = c36034ad-34fd-48e9-9d51-da0d85704d88
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - AVATAR(3) = False
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives:c36034ad-34fd-48e9-9d51-da0d85704d88
msgctxt "h54caafbdg3e20g43ceg9ddagd82e8dd78791"
msgid "Oh, let her stay. What's the worst that could happen?"
msgstr "아, 그냥 머무르게 하자. 더 나빠질 상황도 아니잖아?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c401ced5-08bd-1afd-92bc-c1e40f04f6fe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives:c401ced5-08bd-1afd-92bc-c1e40f04f6fe
msgctxt "hcee5854aga90ag4288g8ec8gea4250206e29"
msgid "Erm, on second thoughts, let's go to sleep."
msgstr "음, 다시 생각해보니, 그냥 자러 가는 게 낫겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives
#. Speaker = Quil Grootslang
#. NodeID = c5b6fb3a-ba1a-4d62-91eb-7afae57ee1e8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GEN_DisappearOutOfSightWhenAvailable(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives:c5b6fb3a-ba1a-4d62-91eb-7afae57ee1e8
msgctxt "h22bb0e54g96b1g4050gad8agc21924fc7567"
msgid ""
"Fine... if I must... but there's trouble out there, and I don't have so much "
"as a butterknife on me."
msgstr "알았어... 정 그렇다면... 하지만 밖에서 문제가 생기면 어떡하지. 난 변변찮은 버터칼 하나도 없는데..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = ca989b0e-c6e7-4e7c-9216-077c3ad64739
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - AVATAR(6) = False
#.      - REALLY_GALE(6) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives:ca989b0e-c6e7-4e7c-9216-077c3ad64739
msgctxt "h13092ef0gadcag4caagb8beg33ea2f307bee"
msgid ""
"She hardly seems a danger to us. Let the girl stay, if she's desperate "
"enough to think our troupe good company."
msgstr "딱히 위험해 보이지도 않는걸. 그냥 머무르게 해 주자. 얼마나 절박하면 우리 일행을 덥썩 믿고 부탁하겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives
#. Speaker = Quil Grootslang
#. NodeID = d168c0aa-487b-60da-6544-561c9675f683
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives:d168c0aa-487b-60da-6544-561c9675f683
msgctxt "h23b2f6d8ga244g4237gb1c1g2b708b68e2a0"
msgid ""
"My clan-name has been struck. I named myself anew after a long-dead poet."
msgstr "내 부족 시절 이름은 이제 없어. 오래전에 죽은 시인 이름을 따서 내 이름을 새로 지었지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives
#. Speaker = Quil Grootslang
#. NodeID = d55b594c-1b98-d99a-1994-386b76e0c489
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives:d55b594c-1b98-d99a-1994-386b76e0c489
msgctxt "hfe55c7e0g242fg4801g8321g967f679d6aa4"
msgid "Pfft. It's a miracle I'm still alive!"
msgstr "풉, 살아 있는 게 기적이지!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives
#. Speaker = Quil Grootslang
#. NodeID = d720b040-e862-ae5e-0eb6-da143f43ed50
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives:d720b040-e862-ae5e-0eb6-da143f43ed50
msgctxt "h9233498cg42fdg436ega02bge37f96bf89aa"
msgid ""
"Quil Grootslang, soon to be published in the songbook <i>Affairs in Ancient "
"Abeir: Songs of Draconic Love. </i>If I make it to Baldur's Gate with my "
"manuscript, that is."
msgstr ""
"퀼 그루트슬랭, 곧 출판될 <i>고대 아베이르에서 있었던 일: 드래곤족 사랑 노래들</i>의 저자야. 내 원고를 발더스 게이트에 가져갈 "
"수 있을 때나 그렇다는 얘기지만."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d920fb86-0a33-64c2-ceb3-de3a8b991b0e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Origin_PartOfTheTeam_Laezel = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives:d920fb86-0a33-64c2-ceb3-de3a8b991b0e
msgctxt "h0c7deafbg8eadg454cga4a6ga2fe737c994d"
msgid "I'll never meet another like Lae'zel, that's for sure."
msgstr "레이젤 같은 사람은 한 번도 만나 본 적 없어. 확실해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives
#. Speaker = Quil Grootslang
#. NodeID = db238f6f-aedd-36ee-b095-b5b216674d32
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives:db238f6f-aedd-36ee-b095-b5b216674d32
msgctxt "h3c589369g8005g435fga84fgffaa9bb3f510"
msgid "<i>Ari-ARUX-UX-UX-UX-UX</i>"
msgstr "<i>아우리-아루-저우-저우-저우-저우</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = db3c44bd-a116-d014-3c68-2090e4a4ffd9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives:db3c44bd-a116-d014-3c68-2090e4a4ffd9
msgctxt "h1d8eb384g8b1fg4d0fgb4b6gebbe4de01599"
msgid "<i>Run away</i>."
msgstr "<i>도망친다</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = db89357e-f0d8-84d4-85c1-20cc219e12b3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives:db89357e-f0d8-84d4-85c1-20cc219e12b3
msgctxt "hd2439d60gde1bg41afg8a11g2ba99f68b905"
msgid "Well, I'm sure it's of anthropological interest to someone."
msgstr "음, 확실히 누군가는 인류학적인 흥미를 느낄 수 있겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives
#. Speaker = Quil Grootslang
#. NodeID = dbba6613-f7f4-f58c-f03a-da2182b2c1ea
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives:dbba6613-f7f4-f58c-f03a-da2182b2c1ea
msgctxt "hcaa5f51fg6a79g4f76ga98eg5eabd68e769b"
msgid "Is there someone who you think you might love? Come on, I won't tell."
msgstr "사랑할 수도 있다 생각하는 사람 있어? 얼른, 말 않을 테니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives
#. Speaker = Quil Grootslang
#. NodeID = df33f4c0-8876-7663-de3a-70d1805ac7b9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives:df33f4c0-8876-7663-de3a-70d1805ac7b9
msgctxt "h3189bdc0gda51g4e0ag88afg59040b37168d"
msgid "Then you are free..."
msgstr "그렇다면 넌 자유의 몸인 거야..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e064e34b-9171-2834-7638-32f07ff604ae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_Halsin2_Event_FlirtedWithHalsinInWLDMainA(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Halsin_State_PermaDefeated = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives:e064e34b-9171-2834-7638-32f07ff604ae
msgctxt "h9a4d79begb774g4793g9221g10bfdc52e91d"
msgid "My mind and loins are captive to thoughts of Halsin."
msgstr "난 몸도 마음도 죄다 할신에게 빼앗겨버렸어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = eade70a0-0bb8-4960-9c24-a64945ed106f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - AVATAR(4) = False
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(4) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives:eade70a0-0bb8-4960-9c24-a64945ed106f
msgctxt "hf7d982ebg5019g47d9gbe64g7eb48706c838"
msgid "Gods, let her stay if she shuts the hells up."
msgstr "이거 참, 그냥 입 닥치기만 하면 머무르게 하자고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f0ea82b5-051a-42d6-2c94-156318dffb33
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives:f0ea82b5-051a-42d6-2c94-156318dffb33
msgctxt "ha275a666gd171g4947g8e14ga632292497f8"
msgid "<i>Leave</i>."
msgstr "<i>떠난다</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f28e095b-4db7-1637-d018-24868c9990e9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Origin_PartOfTheTeam_Astarion = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives:f28e095b-4db7-1637-d018-24868c9990e9
msgctxt "h7eab42e8g0b78g4c59g9d3cgdce9af12c55d"
msgid "Astarion might be the most perfect being to ever walk the day."
msgstr "햇빛 아래 걷기엔 아스타리온이 가장 완벽하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives
#. Speaker = Quil Grootslang
#. NodeID = f56eaa71-48de-bf0f-f3a5-a2d460e09154
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira_CFM_BardBackupArrives:f56eaa71-48de-bf0f-f3a5-a2d460e09154
msgctxt "h3437bbe3g6c7bg4bc9ga10dg521a6e3f3702"
msgid ""
"You probably don't know, but the dragonborn clans arrange their children's "
"marital unions. Love is considered irrelevant to egg-duty."
msgstr "아마 잘 모르겠지만, 드래곤본 부족들은 아이들을 중매로 결혼시켜. 사랑은 알 낳는 의무와는 무관하다 생각해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 014c8c83-607b-5ddb-b2f4-5b792b80655f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:014c8c83-607b-5ddb-b2f4-5b792b80655f
msgctxt "hef295d63g9b1bg4c11gb5b0g90299865790d"
msgid ""
"*Images overwhelm you: the <i>kith'raki</i> attacking the nautiloid; warring "
"demons and devils; the twitching <i>ghaik</i> tadpole.*"
msgstr ""
"*당신을 덮치는 환상: <i>키스락</i>이 노틸로이드를 공격하고 있고, 데몬과 데빌이 싸우고 있으며, <i>게이크</i> 올챙이가 "
"꿈틀거리고 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 018ec6b3-fee2-d4d2-2fe8-6380758a00e3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:018ec6b3-fee2-d4d2-2fe8-6380758a00e3
msgctxt "he159968bg34f9g4fdag9136g7910f056534b"
msgid "<i>Squeeze your eyes tighter.</i>"
msgstr "<i>눈을 더 꽉 감는다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 01fb8bfb-0883-703d-1321-7c3d724ddc40
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:01fb8bfb-0883-703d-1321-7c3d724ddc40
msgctxt "h03340278g1390g46a9gbafeg9807c5e6c34a"
msgid ""
"*Every time they flicker shut, the tadpole seems to twitch behind them.*"
msgstr "*눈을 깜빡일 때마다, 올챙이가 눈 뒤에서 경련을 일으키는 것 같습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 06347a09-4438-8ef5-6656-4f6273a5cd37
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:06347a09-4438-8ef5-6656-4f6273a5cd37
msgctxt "h508beda3ga326g49e0gbc09ga2bbcd07d194"
msgid ""
"*Agitation overcomes imagination. Like it or not, the <i>ghaik</i> has "
"bested you this day.*"
msgstr "*상상력을 뛰어넘는 불안이 당신을 엄습합니다. 좋든 싫든, <i>게이크</i>는 오늘 당신을 꺾었습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 067700fb-f45e-e305-5b1b-5def514c64f2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:067700fb-f45e-e305-5b1b-5def514c64f2
msgctxt "h54406e0bge431g4f2fg9235g44fdc0d9f8a1"
msgid "*As the fire settles, tension bleeds from your body.*"
msgstr "*불이 잦아들자, 당신의 몸에서 긴장이 풀립니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 08e2445b-a502-bab7-475f-e097a6669f0f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - SELDARINEDROWELF(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:08e2445b-a502-bab7-475f-e097a6669f0f
msgctxt "hc178fcb8g3772g4c58gadfegeb9f35ca2795"
msgid ""
"*You picture a cup, ancient and elven: priceless. Drinking from it honours "
"the dead - those lost to Lolth's predation.*"
msgstr ""
"*당신은 매우 귀중한 고대의 엘프 잔을 상상합니다. 이 잔을 마시는 것은 죽은 자, 즉 롤쓰의 약탈에 희생된 자들을 기리는 것입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 0b581d2f-2cc1-5ac5-9056-89a229d6b550
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:0b581d2f-2cc1-5ac5-9056-89a229d6b550
msgctxt "hf9cbede3g1e5ag4438g8b87g9b7ed34387ff"
msgid ""
"*You have to understand it. Master it. Which means you need to find an "
"expert.*"
msgstr "*당신은 그것을 이해해야 합니다. 터득하세요. 즉, 전문가를 찾아야 합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 0ca5d540-bbca-8169-1ca0-f82303e32c72
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:0ca5d540-bbca-8169-1ca0-f82303e32c72
msgctxt "h83b1a4bbg2504g46f9ga1f2g328023f2f9fc"
msgid ""
"*You are the Blade of Frontiers. You'd conquered bugbears and banshees! "
"You'd conquer this challenge, too.*"
msgstr "*당신은 변경의 칼날입니다. 버그베어와 밴시도 극복한 적이 있습니다! 이번 시련도 극복할 수 있을 것입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 0f95a49c-0bcc-7e1f-6ed3-0e1f1091d5ea
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:0f95a49c-0bcc-7e1f-6ed3-0e1f1091d5ea
msgctxt "hb20d7580g9aa2g44a9ga721g76f07a50368a"
msgid ""
"*Next you feel a sudden wave of nauseating terror: in seven days you'll be a "
"mind flayer.*"
msgstr "*이제 메스꺼움이 밀려오는 공포를 갑자기 느끼게 되고, 7일 안에 마인드 플레이어가 될 것입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 10c189ce-851f-f9ef-1e47-27ce2d815bc3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ELF(0) = True
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(0) = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_ELF
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:10c189ce-851f-f9ef-1e47-27ce2d815bc3
msgctxt "hba66aa1bgbb96g44c2g8eb7gbe71e8df67b7"
msgid ""
"*Falling into your trance should have been as easy as breathing, yet peace "
"eludes you.*"
msgstr "*무아지경에 빠지는 것은 숨 쉬는 것만큼 쉬워야 하지만, 평화는 찾아오지 않습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 12dc8372-2af6-5511-7f17-8b1abfa77957
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:12dc8372-2af6-5511-7f17-8b1abfa77957
msgctxt "he04657d4g3aacg466eg8353g99b9c829613a"
msgid ""
"<i>Put Mizora out of your mind. A cure for this tadpole is your top "
"priority.</i>"
msgstr "<i>미조라를 머릿속에서 지운다. 이 올챙이에 대한 치료가 최우선이다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 1324368e-5f8a-4bb4-192d-a20af20d0e9d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - LOLTHDROWELF(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:1324368e-5f8a-4bb4-192d-a20af20d0e9d
msgctxt "he8fa29b8g26a3g4aacgbc93gd4f6f8019f5e"
msgid ""
"*The vision in your mind is simple: a stone altar to Lolth, the knife upon "
"it bloody with sacrifice.*"
msgstr "*당신의 마음속 장면은 단순합니다. 롤쓰에게 바쳐진 돌 제단, 제물의 피로 물든 칼.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 14253672-71b8-9d2d-bdb5-ed6a33da4147
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:14253672-71b8-9d2d-bdb5-ed6a33da4147
msgctxt "h87d449bbg3a80g46b5ga650g8296af86932c"
msgid "*With or without Mystra's help, tomorrow you will find it.*"
msgstr "*미스트라의 도움이 있든 없든, 내일이면 찾을 수 있을 겁니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 14760ba9-9283-8bd7-5cef-7c2e1ef63361
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ELF(0) = True
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(0) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:14760ba9-9283-8bd7-5cef-7c2e1ef63361
msgctxt "h5365e78eg8786g413dgb756g6084d7073c22"
msgid ""
"*Fire spills across your thoughts: dragon's breath. The tadpole slithers, "
"twisting deeper into your skull.*"
msgstr "*불꽃이 당신의 머리속을 덮칩니다. 드래곤의 브레스. 올챙이가 두개골 깊숙이 비틀어지며 미끄러지듯 움직입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1561a85e-5d70-de4b-f8e9-bc029149db3a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:1561a85e-5d70-de4b-f8e9-bc029149db3a
msgctxt "hb770bf35g8a7bg417egafa0g87e3dc658542"
msgid ""
"<i>Let your mind drift to Mizora. What would it take for her to break your "
"pact?</i>"
msgstr "<i>생각을 미조라에게로 돌린다. 그녀가 당신과의 계약을 깨려면 어떤 조건이 필요할까?</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 16701d0b-b3de-b49c-b4bb-f40753e3be4c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 5
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:16701d0b-b3de-b49c-b4bb-f40753e3be4c
msgctxt "h165c9d61g9a8ag4400g91edgef57550751fe"
msgid ""
"<i>Contemplate peace. Death can be sought in battle if purification is too "
"far.</i>"
msgstr "<i>조용히 숙고해 본다. 정화가 너무 늦으면 전투 중 죽음이 찾아 올 수 있다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 176e76d8-12ff-dff0-3995-c9997c6f76a9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:176e76d8-12ff-dff0-3995-c9997c6f76a9
msgctxt "h82b11f64g3934g4426gbd20g52f07cf7d028"
msgid "*Under the strange and open sky, sleep claims you.*"
msgstr "*이질적이고 탁 트인 하늘 아래서, 잠이 당신을 찾아옵니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 17d69e68-1cf5-5161-bc50-3349d5d69277
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:17d69e68-1cf5-5161-bc50-3349d5d69277
msgctxt "hf8545495g6234g43d1gb5c9g97a8051b50c4"
msgid ""
"*All you know for sure is, given time, it will turn you into one of them.*"
msgstr "*확실한 것은 시간이 지나면, 당신도 그들 중 한 명으로 변할 것이라는 점입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 17f6f6ec-1ad8-9a1a-3536-07e60523fba0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:17f6f6ec-1ad8-9a1a-3536-07e60523fba0
msgctxt "hef9d8f7dg79a7g4557gb8ceg01b3f5e9fa45"
msgid ""
"*You have fulfilled her will - retrieved the relic for her. Everyone has "
"perished but you.*"
msgstr "*당신은 그녀의 의지를 이행했습니다. 그녀를 위해 유물을 되찾았습니다. 당신만 빼고 모두 죽었습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 18661fbb-8eb3-233a-81ff-2959bfdf0dea
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:18661fbb-8eb3-233a-81ff-2959bfdf0dea
msgctxt "ha8d6140eg8534g40e8ga3e1g0adf502c79e1"
msgid ""
"*Baldur's Gate feels almost like a dream, after everything that has happened "
"to you.*"
msgstr "*당신에게 일어난 일들을 생각하면, 발더스 게이트는 마치 꿈처럼 느껴집니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 18f4f00b-36f6-d651-0452-c5e831943b09
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:18f4f00b-36f6-d651-0452-c5e831943b09
msgctxt "h43a50458ge2afg41a8g9783g82e9135f0307"
msgid "*You clench your eyes tighter and search for sleep in the darkness.*"
msgstr "*당신은 눈을 꽉 감고 어둠 속에서 잠을 청합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 19ed0bc0-9ec1-6fb3-e709-39057e5b27b5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Constitution
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:19ed0bc0-9ec1-6fb3-e709-39057e5b27b5
msgctxt "h3372aa56gc824g440bg8936g37a11ce3eb0f"
msgid ""
"<i>Imagine yourself beheading the very </i>ghaik<i> that had infected "
"you.</i>"
msgstr "<i>당신을 감염시킨 바로 그 </i>게이크<i>의 목을 베는 장면을 상상해 본다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 1a1c75e3-1357-5f5c-b3df-5c6c6b067116
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:1a1c75e3-1357-5f5c-b3df-5c6c6b067116
msgctxt "h7ed8d22cgbb03g4a5fga0f8g85fe9d055e80"
msgid "*You seek rest, but an active mind refuses you.*"
msgstr "*당신은 휴식을 갈구하지만, 적극적인 마음이 당신을 거부합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 1af7fec0-c005-9f7b-c351-f79f4c4cbac7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:1af7fec0-c005-9f7b-c351-f79f4c4cbac7
msgctxt "ha369d2a6g41b7g4de3gb099g85c064936b1c"
msgid "*Stripped raw and restless, you find no peace that night.*"
msgstr "*벗겨진 채로 불안하게, 그 날 밤 평온함은 없었습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 204b2fc5-a0ae-0330-dccf-7097d9642bb7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:204b2fc5-a0ae-0330-dccf-7097d9642bb7
msgctxt "h4044d299g23fdg4902g8667gf481aa3b3a02"
msgid ""
"*Nothing. Does a tadpole sleep? You tell yourself that's a silly thing to "
"wonder.*"
msgstr "*아무것도 느껴지지 않습니다. 올챙이는 잠을 잘까요? 그것에 의문을 품는 게 바보같은 일이라고 스스로에게 말합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 25aaf756-7870-c0d6-0a80-48cb92292f8a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:25aaf756-7870-c0d6-0a80-48cb92292f8a
msgctxt "h56dc99eag59cag4e96g8b37g83b122992d36"
msgid "*Warm air; rustling leaves. A perfect night to sleep under the stars.*"
msgstr "*따뜻한 공기, 바스락거리는 나뭇잎. 별빛 아래에서 잠들기에 완벽한 밤.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 261e96e5-e413-dc7d-3197-a7ffe1467cf9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:261e96e5-e413-dc7d-3197-a7ffe1467cf9
msgctxt "h351b0d4dg82aag4e1agba6cg1f9c945177fc"
msgid ""
"*Dragons, gith, and the Hells themselves have come after you. Yet it is this "
"creature that lingers in your skull.*"
msgstr "*용, 기스, 그리고 지옥 그 자체가 당신을 쫓아왔습니다. 여전히 당신의 두개골에 남아있는 것은 이 괴물입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 2795bb94-2e25-7a8a-1630-4bce50aed3c6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:2795bb94-2e25-7a8a-1630-4bce50aed3c6
msgctxt "h8fbd890ag07cbg4b8agbaf4gde7b2dddcf65"
msgid ""
"*Disgust churns deep in your stomach, leaving you resigned to a night "
"without sleep.*"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 28469de4-9b79-c186-d8a8-e9d242213832
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:28469de4-9b79-c186-d8a8-e9d242213832
msgctxt "h522c324cgd496g4168g9a6fg51c189660fac"
msgid "*The wreckage. The flames. The dead...*"
msgstr "*잔해. 화염. 죽은 자들...*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 2a1b17ea-0c4b-da83-b628-bf65614b9494
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:2a1b17ea-0c4b-da83-b628-bf65614b9494
msgctxt "haa5e9120g617bg40c5gb290gc18a0b736367"
msgid ""
"*Yet it is a dream of hope. You may be countless miles away, but it isn't an "
"impossible journey.*"
msgstr "*여전히 그것은 희망의 꿈입니다. 셀 수 없을 거리만큼 멀리 떨어져 있지만 불가능한 여정은 아닙니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 2c7c3f71-9adb-1220-c874-b207faf2ca3b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:2c7c3f71-9adb-1220-c874-b207faf2ca3b
msgctxt "h146f9680g3f41g4026gb013g1589525dd425"
msgid ""
"*... unless you understand it. Master it. Which means finding an expert.*"
msgstr "*... 혹은 그것을 이해하게 된다면. 터득하세요. 즉, 전문가를 찾아야 합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 3387b9ac-eff5-31e0-f9bb-deac846a592e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:3387b9ac-eff5-31e0-f9bb-deac846a592e
msgctxt "h3cb05ea9g19fdg4e81gb231g46c87b365ac3"
msgid ""
"*You have to rid yourself of the tadpole. Shar herself is counting on you.*"
msgstr "*당신은 그 올챙이를 제거해야 합니다. 샤는 당신을 믿고 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 33c3bb51-ee18-abe4-93d0-25d8ea6b8658
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:33c3bb51-ee18-abe4-93d0-25d8ea6b8658
msgctxt "hd2fc0f15gf717g46dcga59fgae4805739c9f"
msgid "*Resolve strengthened, you fall into a deep slumber.*"
msgstr "*의지가 강해지자, 당신은 깊은 잠에 빠집니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 36043eab-5ca4-e2c7-f111-903397ce7fa9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:36043eab-5ca4-e2c7-f111-903397ce7fa9
msgctxt "hef9f1511gb3eeg48bfg84a6ga36817dff5a7"
msgid ""
"*You will see those gates again. That promise sinks deep into your heart as "
"your eyes drift shut.*"
msgstr "*당신은 그 문을 다시 보게 될 것입니다. 눈을 감으면 그 약속이 가슴 깊숙이 가라앉습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 370fec20-5b28-a20f-1ce8-e39149e56cf1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:370fec20-5b28-a20f-1ce8-e39149e56cf1
msgctxt "h5622fc02g438eg4f23g8273g046735f7928e"
msgid "*You smile, meditating on the flames that engulf his cruel face.*"
msgstr "*당신은 미소 짓습니다. 그의 잔인한 얼굴을 집어삼키는 불길을 생각하며.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3742e452-4686-91cf-eaf4-36340871f6d8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:3742e452-4686-91cf-eaf4-36340871f6d8
msgctxt "h1084573dg9633g4a96gbb97g304e586fcebb"
msgid "<i>You recall the dragons. Not even Hell had stopped them.</i>"
msgstr "<i>드래곤들을 기억해낸다. 지옥조차도 그들을 막지 못했다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 3788b038-9434-a480-4c7d-6c7254093999
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:3788b038-9434-a480-4c7d-6c7254093999
msgctxt "h74266333g0c75g4135g8a71gb05025cfec63"
msgid "*Only the sounds of the wilderness answer.*"
msgstr "*오직 야생의 소리만이 대답합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 38914422-192e-5cb3-ae5b-bf293f4ce91c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:38914422-192e-5cb3-ae5b-bf293f4ce91c
msgctxt "haa89e45fge33fg4d68gb86fg57c3bbe9575b"
msgid ""
"*Let it listen. You will dream of all the ways to make this power your own.*"
msgstr "*귀 기울여 보세요. 당신은 이 힘을 당신의 것으로 만드는 모든 방법을 꿈꾸게 될 것입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 38f017ca-3c2d-1b54-b3b2-bd45abe473d3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:38f017ca-3c2d-1b54-b3b2-bd45abe473d3
msgctxt "haf64bebcg9f23g4196g87fdge666ac6e2f48"
msgid ""
"<i>Think about your master. He'll be furious you didn't bring him dinner.</i>"
msgstr "<i>당신의 주인에 대해 생각해 본다. 그의 저녁을 차려주지 않았다고 화를 낼 것이다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 3bb88fb8-f079-7ec0-6c02-b70ab8d7b81f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:3bb88fb8-f079-7ec0-6c02-b70ab8d7b81f
msgctxt "hde65ea6fg6fe4g4b8fgb442gf5f1920ecdce"
msgid ""
"*To make you one of them, of course. Isn't that what mind flayers always "
"want?*"
msgstr "*물론, 당신을 그들 중 하나로 만들기 위해서입니다. 마인드 플레이어들은 항상 그런 걸 원하지 않나요?*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 3bd94852-1754-ef09-ae4c-d7d62359f9cb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:3bd94852-1754-ef09-ae4c-d7d62359f9cb
msgctxt "hca39b38cg3981g47fcg9ae5g5a6cb0826bf2"
msgid ""
"*One moment, you'd been bartering with Mizora for freedom. The next, whisked "
"away by tentacle monsters.*"
msgstr "*한순간, 당신은 자유를 위해 미조라와 거래를 하고 있었습니다. 그 다음 순간, 촉수 괴물에게 납치되었습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3d5d04a4-e6a4-017b-4a87-ff1b107d7b44
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Intelligence
#. DifficultyClass: 5
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_ELF(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_GALE(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(0) = False
#.      - BALDURIAN(0) = True
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(0) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:3d5d04a4-e6a4-017b-4a87-ff1b107d7b44
msgctxt "h15fa47ffgc028g4d14gabc1g390ed9777be1"
msgid "<i>Force the tadpole out of your mind. Think of home instead.</i>"
msgstr "<i>올챙이를 당신의 마음에서 끄집어낸다. 대신 고향에 대해 생각한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3de9b670-8ca9-8094-65cf-8e804acdc384
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:3de9b670-8ca9-8094-65cf-8e804acdc384
msgctxt "haa6b7e55g0baeg431fgbd68gff798c1a4aae"
msgid "<i>Focus on the problem - who would know the most about this?</i>"
msgstr "<i>문제에 집중한다. 누가 이 문제에 대해 가장 잘 알고 있을까?</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 3eaca7ff-7948-d39f-da64-654f0caabd47
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:3eaca7ff-7948-d39f-da64-654f0caabd47
msgctxt "hd1525039g803dg44e3ga9c5g9824bd61ea95"
msgid ""
"*You clench your eyes tight and leap into darkness. And like always, Mizora "
"follows closely behind.*"
msgstr "*눈을 꽉 감고 어둠 속으로 뛰어듭니다. 그리고 언제나처럼 미조라가 바짝 뒤따라 옵니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 3f508c48-526a-f0b0-4664-a98738a7279f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - SELDARINEDROWELF(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:3f508c48-526a-f0b0-4664-a98738a7279f
msgctxt "h3052f5e1g9273g47afgaa32gcfc5cd7f0075"
msgid ""
"*The fire fades, a meaningless distraction. You hold the cup again, ignoring "
"the crack along its belly, and drink.*"
msgstr "*불은 꺼지고, 의미 없는 산만함만 남았습니다. 당신은 다시 잔을 들고, 컵의 금이 간 부분에도 아랑곳 하지 않고 들이킵니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 3fb12eab-f132-8838-f6f1-4bcda5c82ded
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:3fb12eab-f132-8838-f6f1-4bcda5c82ded
msgctxt "haa6f392dg99dcg40bcga1f8g9043c6b0b16b"
msgid "*Every day this abomination is in your head, you put others at risk.*"
msgstr "*이 역겨운 것이 당신의 머릿속에 존재하는 한, 다른 이들을 위험에 빠뜨리게 됩니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 3fc0c8be-f7ac-2ca4-8e59-6eac1e1b91bc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:3fc0c8be-f7ac-2ca4-8e59-6eac1e1b91bc
msgctxt "h86868175gada5g4cb8gb714g85a0ed4252eb"
msgid ""
"*Getting rid of the tadpole will mean returning to the darkness. Unless...*"
msgstr "*올챙이를 제거하는 것은 어둠으로 돌아가는 것을 의미합니다. 혹은...*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 3fdd16ff-b4e4-269c-65e7-3083fb926f23
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:3fdd16ff-b4e4-269c-65e7-3083fb926f23
msgctxt "h7505d3cfgc82dg46ffg9911gce6c24d45413"
msgid ""
"*Every night that passes is another night the monster inside you grows.*"
msgstr "*매일 밤이 지날수록 당신 안에 있는 괴물은 점점 커져 갑니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 47487713-c38f-da8a-d088-c269a9b083ae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:47487713-c38f-da8a-d088-c269a9b083ae
msgctxt "hbd5e5210ga35eg44edg8206g6b9941b4cbcd"
msgid "*And you will find it, no matter the cost.*"
msgstr "*그리고 당신은 치유법을 찾을 것입니다. 어떤 대가를 치르더라도.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 495285db-1ae7-4655-f0a1-0780bf1c7c84
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:495285db-1ae7-4655-f0a1-0780bf1c7c84
msgctxt "hd7b47b41g1104g4e20g9b43gba3c87be0b0b"
msgid ""
"*Despite everything, you relax into peaceful meditation, satisfied with all "
"that's happened. Perhaps you wouldn't sleep so well if you knew what was "
"coming.*"
msgstr ""
"*이 모든 것들에도 불구하고, 벌어진 모든 일에 만족하며 평화로운 명상을 취합니다.어떤 일이 생길지 알았다면 이렇게 편한 잠을 청할 수는 "
"없었을 겁니다. *"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 4a5fff38-6879-0075-e0d7-61b54a53d014
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:4a5fff38-6879-0075-e0d7-61b54a53d014
msgctxt "h8eb3674ag82c0g487bg829agd4891f72f4c4"
msgid ""
"*The <i>ghaik</i> larva is curled up in your skull, no doubt pleased with "
"itself.*"
msgstr "*<i>게이크</i> 유충은 당신의 두개골 속에서 웅크리며, 분명히 스스로 만족하고 있을 것입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 4a93f889-5d6b-0a5a-7e81-3dc4bb8328ca
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:4a93f889-5d6b-0a5a-7e81-3dc4bb8328ca
msgctxt "h3cb0eedege4ecg48f2g9464gca0f8dae5706"
msgid ""
"*Of course - you might already be a mind flayer by the time you return to "
"Cazador.*"
msgstr "*물론, 당신이 카사도어에게 돌아가는 순간 이미 마인드 플레이어가 되어 있을지도 모릅니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 4c199a4e-b181-498d-696c-ed5d4cb76a95
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:4c199a4e-b181-498d-696c-ed5d4cb76a95
msgctxt "h63228fffg87e0g4d76ga61eg14c17bededf2"
msgid "*Every abomination would be gutted and burned to ash.*"
msgstr "*모든 가증스러운 것들은 내장을 파내어 재가 되도록 태워버릴 것입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 4c338ed0-609c-bed8-e2be-fc8d26ea5d29
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:4c338ed0-609c-bed8-e2be-fc8d26ea5d29
msgctxt "hddc56924g9199g415cg8533g79ed20e0b57e"
msgid "*You think on the day. The sunshine. Being alive - more or less.*"
msgstr "*당신은 그 날을 생각합니다. 햇살. 살아있다는 것, 좋든 싫든.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 4c98b578-3d21-0fce-4539-4794e602d44a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:4c98b578-3d21-0fce-4539-4794e602d44a
msgctxt "h38a562ebgf49dg49feg8748g44b62fc1960c"
msgid ""
"*It burns relentlessly, like a red dragon's breath scorching you from the "
"inside out.*"
msgstr "*레드 드래곤의 브레스처럼, 그것은 당신의 안팎을 태우며 끊임없이 타오릅니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 4d9b4dcb-29eb-35a1-a24f-255d1f415409
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:4d9b4dcb-29eb-35a1-a24f-255d1f415409
msgctxt "hac404ae9g7f47g4da9g9f9bga7c1fdd8323e"
msgid ""
"*It's a question destined to remain unanswered. In seven days you'll be a "
"mind flayer yourself.*"
msgstr "*아직 답이 나오지 않은 질문입니다. 7일 후면 여러분도 마인드 플레이어가 될 것입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 4e24ea12-5627-5803-4ee8-08a32b720968
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ELF(0) = True
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(0) = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_WOODELF
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:4e24ea12-5627-5803-4ee8-08a32b720968
msgctxt "hafbdcb9dg1f7fg4f2fg80fdg24fa5c976263"
msgid ""
"*The flames cool, dispelled as the image you know emerges again: nature's "
"sublime majesty.*"
msgstr "*화염이 식고 사라지면서, 당신이 알던 자연의 멋진 웅장함이 다시 드러납니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 4e24ea12-5627-5803-4ee8-08a32b720968
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ELF(0) = True
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(0) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:4e24ea12-5627-5803-4ee8-08a32b720968
msgctxt "h745c5200g8447g42abg820fgbb494dc636e1"
msgid ""
"*The flames cool, dispelled as the image you know emerges again: wild, "
"glorious magic.*"
msgstr "*화염이 식고 사라지면서, 당신이 알던 거칠고 영광스러운 마법이 다시 드러납니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 50eacfea-0585-2908-0424-21c48ff9cbe3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:50eacfea-0585-2908-0424-21c48ff9cbe3
msgctxt "h8688d15fgd4acg4afega4d3g2532e6bf9e9e"
msgid "*Rest eludes you as you stare at the wrong side of the stars.*"
msgstr "*별의 잘못된 방향을 응시하고 있어 마음의 안정이 되지 않습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 51367df2-fe3a-1db3-811a-69f8752beccf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:51367df2-fe3a-1db3-811a-69f8752beccf
msgctxt "h62735e82ge5cag4f70g9481g95545c93d884"
msgid ""
"*The worm in your head might not even have an appetite for undead meat.*"
msgstr "*당신 머리 속의 벌레는 심지어 언데드 고기에도 식욕이 없을 수도 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 51ddb445-53f2-bf37-ce33-e39c81b7202f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:51ddb445-53f2-bf37-ce33-e39c81b7202f
msgctxt "hfeb6729fgb673g4182g93efg4e2f049aa218"
msgid "*Every cut is meditation. It reshapes the world to Vlaakith's will.*"
msgstr "*모든 일격을 명상합니다. 블라키스의 뜻에 따라 세상을 재구성합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 520886b7-a721-57c9-2d18-a10efac77c60
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:520886b7-a721-57c9-2d18-a10efac77c60
msgctxt "h6288bf12g0c47g456bgafa3ge53843778156"
msgid "*... you, and your parasite. You are tainted now. Imperfect.*"
msgstr "*... 당신, 그리고 당신의 기생충. 당신은 지금 더럽혀졌습니다. 불완전합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 523a9c72-c265-1230-9f0a-cab09aebea74
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:523a9c72-c265-1230-9f0a-cab09aebea74
msgctxt "h51b49c77ged8cg491bga138g32b6e9ba18bf"
msgid ""
"*Except all you can picture is citizens with their skulls splintering open, "
"tentacles sprouting from broken mouths.*"
msgstr "*당신이 상상할 수 있는 것은 두개골이 쪼개지고 입에서 촉수가 돋아나는 시민들의 모습 뿐입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 5530985b-6c04-572e-86fa-74d0845aef74
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:5530985b-6c04-572e-86fa-74d0845aef74
msgctxt "hf1a627a7g1e86g46bcga291ge78cdc7b8966"
msgid "*As precious as sleep, and the night's oblivion.*"
msgstr "*잠도 소중하고, 밤의 망각도 소중합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 569e113c-61c2-e462-e1fc-39a9a8c80918
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:569e113c-61c2-e462-e1fc-39a9a8c80918
msgctxt "h30f87acdg04b9g4371g9754g4a8aa45ad740"
msgid ""
"*Today? You'd been kidnapped by mind flayers, chased through Hell by "
"dragons, and thrown out of a burning ship.*"
msgstr "*오늘은? 당신은 마인드 플레이어에게 납치되고, 용에게 지옥을 넘나들며 쫓기고, 불타는 배에서 내던져졌습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5a55cb9a-f092-5ca7-b64c-8c6e10c8a3a6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Intelligence
#. DifficultyClass: 5
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:5a55cb9a-f092-5ca7-b64c-8c6e10c8a3a6
msgctxt "hbf540aa4g173eg43d2g9b81g44c8b6986d6f"
msgid ""
"<i>Close your eyes. Relax. Imagine dragging your old master into the "
"sunlight.</i>"
msgstr "<i>눈을 감는다. 긴장을 푼다. 옛 주인을 햇빛 속으로 끌고 간다고 상상한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 5aa514e1-1e19-c3dc-c3f3-9d3d627e8d97
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:5aa514e1-1e19-c3dc-c3f3-9d3d627e8d97
msgctxt "h7eaefb65g4cfeg4c29g98c1g0a0c6a4ca4c3"
msgid ""
"*You will take this chance to overcome and ascend. <i>Even the </"
"i>kith'raki<i> will bow to you</i>.*"
msgstr "*이 기회를 이용해 이겨내면 지위가 상승하게 될 것입니다. 키스락<i> 조차도 당신에게 허리를 굽힐 것입니다</i>.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 5ba9606c-55d7-8d9b-24b0-61781ab40f06
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:5ba9606c-55d7-8d9b-24b0-61781ab40f06
msgctxt "ha44636b0gaf3fg4d1cg82d6g6a2d7607cedd"
msgid ""
"*'Suffering is not a curse, but a gift'. So the <i>varsh</i> had taught you.*"
msgstr "*'고통은 저주가 아니라 선물이다.' 이렇게 <i>바쉬</i>가 당신에게 가르쳐 주었습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5cfbe083-200f-b8c4-1d48-ac9dbb5bd78c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:5cfbe083-200f-b8c4-1d48-ac9dbb5bd78c
msgctxt "h759295aag6918g41b7g95bbgf84acd4e3594"
msgid "<i>Reach for the box, hidden among your belongings.</i>"
msgstr "<i>당신의 소지품들 사이에 숨겨진 상자를 향해 손을 뻗는다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 619e0431-71e2-1e0c-d34c-722f7a22345e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:619e0431-71e2-1e0c-d34c-722f7a22345e
msgctxt "h288db093gfc12g45b0gb868g2cc2af752732"
msgid "*But some promises, even the Blade of Frontiers can't keep.*"
msgstr "*하지만, 변경의 칼날조차 지킬 수 없는 약속이 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 61a630c8-f87a-a4ba-2e13-eb2582d46c5e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:61a630c8-f87a-a4ba-2e13-eb2582d46c5e
msgctxt "h692c0af1gc57dg48fagb0b1g152c8f6cae85"
msgid ""
"*You wonder if it could hear these thoughts - if it knows you're planning a "
"rebellion.*"
msgstr "*그 괴물이 이런 생각들을 들을 수 있는지 궁금합니다. 반란을 꾀하는 계획을 알아채는지 말입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 6231cd10-a83f-6d72-0d60-6f8287a48631
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:6231cd10-a83f-6d72-0d60-6f8287a48631
msgctxt "hb2b4fe23g466ag4a55gbd7fg02269f4e5be2"
msgid ""
"*As the trance stabilises, your breath deepens. Be it cure or cage, "
"something must be done about the tadpole.*"
msgstr "*명상 상태가 안정되자, 당신의 호흡이 깊어집니다. 치료든 가둬두는 방법이든, 올챙이에 대한 조치가 취해져야 합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 63e86f90-b09d-413f-e1f0-e063d8de83cb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:63e86f90-b09d-413f-e1f0-e063d8de83cb
msgctxt "h0308190fg96c4g4f9dg8d25gfc5d27237ac2"
msgid ""
"*It had been melodious - soothing even. Not in the most detailed of tomes "
"have you encountered mention of such a thing.*"
msgstr ""
"*그것은 감미로웠고, 심지어 진정되는 것 같습니다. 당신이 본 책 중에는 그런 것에 대해 자세히 설명한 걸 본적은 없는 것 같습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 654be4a3-35eb-1903-46f7-82fc6542c820
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:654be4a3-35eb-1903-46f7-82fc6542c820
msgctxt "h49a41d35g0372g4dfbg8f8eg7e9d3432adae"
msgid ""
"*You have to rid yourself of the tadpole. Then Shar will come to you - "
"honour you as you honour her.*"
msgstr "*당신은 올챙이를 제거해야 합니다. 그러면 샤가 당신에게 올 것입니다. 당신이 그녀를 존중하는 것처럼 당신을 존중할 것입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 67196b3e-51dd-58f6-93aa-281e0308d2b7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:67196b3e-51dd-58f6-93aa-281e0308d2b7
msgctxt "h01956d2aga757g4766gb79bg0d281f5b917a"
msgid ""
"*You wonder if your ability to walk in the sun is a side effect of the "
"tadpole the mind flayer put in your eye. It must be?*"
msgstr "*당신이 햇볕 아래서 걸을 수 있게 된게 마인드 플레이어가 눈에 넣은 올챙이의 부작용일 거라 의심합니다. 정말 그럴까요?*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 6a46b567-1b32-688a-a8ea-cf88e42f8f8b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:6a46b567-1b32-688a-a8ea-cf88e42f8f8b
msgctxt "h8d293928gf015g480ega48ag058817219f53"
msgid ""
"*You drive away all fears, and give yourself to the darkness. A deep sleep "
"soon follows.*"
msgstr "*당신은 모든 두려움을 몰아내고, 어둠에 몸을 맡깁니다. 곧 깊은 잠이 찾아옵니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6affde0b-db59-edca-4ed8-23f04eae4a80
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Constitution
#. DifficultyClass: 5
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ELF(0) = True
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(0) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:6affde0b-db59-edca-4ed8-23f04eae4a80
msgctxt "h3349577dg4d97g444bg9091ga50661455d09"
msgid "<i>Refuse to break. Anything can be endured in the trance.</i>"
msgstr "<i>명상이 깨지는 걸 거부한다. 이 명상 속에서는 무엇이든 견딜 수 있다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6b3acb6b-7238-7920-fcbe-31eff4a14371
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:6b3acb6b-7238-7920-fcbe-31eff4a14371
msgctxt "ha1180e49ga3b6g4ae1gbed1g97d2972c7774"
msgid "<i>Shove the images away. You need sleep.</i>"
msgstr "<i>형상을 밀어낸다. 잠이 필요하다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 6b4a23f1-aa6f-cb75-4e8b-5824308ae514
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:6b4a23f1-aa6f-cb75-4e8b-5824308ae514
msgctxt "h8577bfa8g214fg48fegb3c1g08b2d0fcb448"
msgid "*And you felt the sun on your skin...*"
msgstr "*게다가 당신의 피부위로 태양이 느껴집니다...*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6eb5f397-6024-b0ab-fe23-d9cf9262f2e7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:6eb5f397-6024-b0ab-fe23-d9cf9262f2e7
msgctxt "had6c28feg294dg4244gba80g1097c896a442"
msgid "<i>Shut your eyes and silently thank Shar for the night's beauty.</i>"
msgstr "<i>눈을 감고 밤의 아름다움에 대해 조용히 샤에게 감사한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 6f76e2d6-2953-c280-9e27-557e6675d6fe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_DUERGARDWARF
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:6f76e2d6-2953-c280-9e27-557e6675d6fe
msgctxt "h553d7051g45a0g4a15g8cf8ge6170d016102"
msgid ""
"*Your people threw off the mind flayer's shackles before. Like your "
"ancestors, you would endure.*"
msgstr "*당신의 동족들은 예전에 마인드 플레이어의 족쇄에서 벗어난 적이 있습니다. 당신의 조상들처럼, 당신도 견뎌낼 것입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 6f76e2d6-2953-c280-9e27-557e6675d6fe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_DEEPGNOME
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:6f76e2d6-2953-c280-9e27-557e6675d6fe
msgctxt "h8a646fdag6cebg4926g9e7fge7f93b26a537"
msgid ""
"*Your people have survived the drow, the duergar, and every monster the "
"Underdark has to offer. A mind flayer is nothing.*"
msgstr ""
"*당신의 동족들은 드로우, 듀에르가, 그리고 언더다크에서 튀어나온 모든 괴물들에게로부터 살아남았습니다. 마인드 플레이어는 아무것도 "
"아닙니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 70b0f450-f73c-3ce5-ae06-71cdcf0530ff
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:70b0f450-f73c-3ce5-ae06-71cdcf0530ff
msgctxt "h6b54710bg84a1g4ee3gb06fg3ad6c4d22f1f"
msgid "*Their empty, alien eyes haunt you through a night of fitful sleep.*"
msgstr "*그들의 공허하고 이질적인 눈이 당신을 괴롭히며 밤새 잠을 설치게 합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 719e086e-476c-6d65-c0f6-52a1be8e1255
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:719e086e-476c-6d65-c0f6-52a1be8e1255
msgctxt "h42d85c2bgad5bg4567gaec7g9c6c56ce3060"
msgid ""
"*Hell surrounds you, flames licking at your body. The tadpole in your head "
"convulses.*"
msgstr "*지옥이 당신을 둘러싸고, 불길이 몸을 핥습니다. 머릿속 올챙이가 경련을 일으킵니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 7320f2d1-7835-7db9-c21e-9deddb7afc17
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:7320f2d1-7835-7db9-c21e-9deddb7afc17
msgctxt "he3eeb148gbf27g4d96ga1a4g725ecfe0e0d3"
msgid ""
"*You have to get rid of it. You have to survive. You are the only one left "
"to ensure Shar's glory.*"
msgstr "*당신은 그것을 제거해야 합니다. 살아남아야 합니다. 당신은 샤의 영광을 지킬 수 있는 유일한 사람입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 76b4ed23-7b2d-c9ee-b6e5-e6f1e27b02ed
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 5
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_ELF(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_GALE(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(0) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:76b4ed23-7b2d-c9ee-b6e5-e6f1e27b02ed
msgctxt "h663564e9gfe5eg447eg9041gab99b6c1b9e5"
msgid ""
"<i>The tadpole influences you. Perhaps you might influence it in "
"return...</i>"
msgstr "<i>올챙이가 당신에게 영향을 준다. 반대로 당신도 올챙이에 영향을 줄 수 있을지도...</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7a011bc1-38c4-31b5-96eb-4caa96bad324
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DROWELF(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:7a011bc1-38c4-31b5-96eb-4caa96bad324
msgctxt "h3ae493d9g3f26g428ega89bg3f9325849032"
msgid "<i>Let the pain claim you.</i>"
msgstr "<i>고통이 오도록 둔다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 7dc9d62b-dbae-f874-00bc-40ba7b75dd9c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ELF(0) = True
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(0) = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_WOODELF
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:7dc9d62b-dbae-f874-00bc-40ba7b75dd9c
msgctxt "h5c3a0f0cgdcdfg435dg8a59gf73a9808454d"
msgid ""
"*The flames fall away, a mere illusion. You are one with the forest again, "
"sitting at peace.*"
msgstr "*불길은 사라지고, 그저 환상에 불과했습니다. 당신은 다시 숲과 하나가 되어, 평화롭게 앉아 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 7dc9d62b-dbae-f874-00bc-40ba7b75dd9c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ELF(0) = True
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(0) = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_HIGHELF
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:7dc9d62b-dbae-f874-00bc-40ba7b75dd9c
msgctxt "ha12910cegf3a0g4e27gaed2g5d138b06ebd1"
msgid ""
"*The flames fall away, a mere illusion. You are one with the Feywild again, "
"agleam in revelry.*"
msgstr "*불길은 사라지고, 그저 환상에 불과했습니다. 당신은 다시 페이와일드와 하나가 되어 환희에 젖어 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 7e4fcd25-1a08-866c-6ef4-6bcaafb1ef5f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:7e4fcd25-1a08-866c-6ef4-6bcaafb1ef5f
msgctxt "h4d4d734eg0305g4696g913fg175970126905"
msgid "*Without a cure, you cannot restore your honour before Vlaakith.*"
msgstr "*치유되지 않는다면, 블라키스 앞에서 명예를 회복할 수 없습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 7f5a409c-f963-9002-bcea-fdcbca95ed88
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:7f5a409c-f963-9002-bcea-fdcbca95ed88
msgctxt "h20438fa3ge91bg49c0g85f1g2f54ebf868a6"
msgid ""
"*You try to focus, but all you can see are the menacing eyes of a mind "
"flayer.*"
msgstr "*집중하려고 하지만, 보이는 것은 마인드 플레이어의 위협적인 눈빛뿐입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 7f8f8dad-1d5f-d21b-a1e1-01be7010675a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:7f8f8dad-1d5f-d21b-a1e1-01be7010675a
msgctxt "hb3b87cb7g76b5g4714ga0cdg93fe3563d8a3"
msgid ""
"*Fire spills across your thoughts: dragon's breath. The tadpole slithers, "
"twisting deeper into your skull.*"
msgstr "*불꽃이 당신의 머리속을 덮칩니다. 드래곤의 브레스. 올챙이가 두개골 깊숙이 비틀어지며 미끄러지듯 움직입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 83a39290-6a02-9ba7-251b-16cc9282bf5b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:83a39290-6a02-9ba7-251b-16cc9282bf5b
msgctxt "h736e3366g7666g4ca9g9ae9gac3d5a7f2eac"
msgid ""
"*No! You refuse to accept it. If there's magic that can hold cities afloat, "
"there has to be magic that can wither a damned tadpole.*"
msgstr ""
"*안 돼! 당신은 그걸 받아들이지 않습니다. 도시를 물에 띄울 수 있는 마법이 있다면, 망할 올챙이도 말라 죽일 수 있는 마법이 있어야 "
"합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 8542eddd-416e-8010-b11d-27d17f48876f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:8542eddd-416e-8010-b11d-27d17f48876f
msgctxt "hc1cf32c7g1d37g43fegb703g048c48539504"
msgid ""
"*You can almost feel its thick skull in your grasp, almost smell its silver "
"blood clogging the air.*"
msgstr "*당신은 그의 두툼한 두개골이 손에 잡힐 듯하고, 은빛 피가 공기를 가득 채우는 냄새가 느껴질 정도입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 85c56dac-4014-1f19-9fa8-23d703ba2846
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:85c56dac-4014-1f19-9fa8-23d703ba2846
msgctxt "he6ddfe34g4313g4cefgbf73g50ad518f6925"
msgid ""
"*Baldur's Gate is close to your master's coven, but also home to amazing "
"scholars. Still, that's a problem for the morning.*"
msgstr ""
"*발더스 게이트는 당신 주인의 소굴과 가까울 뿐만 아니라, 대단한 학자들의 고향이기도 합니다. 하지만, 그건 나중의 문제입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 871c0819-a53e-e816-362f-0a1c7f547efe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:871c0819-a53e-e816-362f-0a1c7f547efe
msgctxt "h3eea6120g14f8g49c3gbcbbg545ebea6413c"
msgid ""
"<i>Foremost in your thoughts is the mind flayer - its unexpected voice.</i>"
msgstr "<i>당신의 생각 속에 가장 먼저 떠오르는 것은 마인드 플레이어, 예상치 못했던 목소리다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 8acb3bca-747c-5ac0-babe-b85d38805bfe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:8acb3bca-747c-5ac0-babe-b85d38805bfe
msgctxt "h9769baa3gc83cg4ba2gb5acgf0047be0c38b"
msgid ""
"*You could try getting rid of the tadpole, but that probably means returning "
"to the darkness. Unless...*"
msgstr "*당신은 올챙이를 제거할 수도 있지만, 그것은 아마도 어둠으로 돌아가는 것을 의미할 것입니다. 혹은...*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8bd878ce-edcc-7495-331b-83cc79c6e861
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:8bd878ce-edcc-7495-331b-83cc79c6e861
msgctxt "h853b45b7g46f8g4210g9ac6g238cb6d33ea0"
msgid ""
"<i>Place a hand over the back of your head, trying to feel the tadpole.</i>"
msgstr "<i>머리 뒤에 손을 대고, 올챙이를 느껴본다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 8e54447d-285e-54ab-78fb-21a3b4397cac
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:8e54447d-285e-54ab-78fb-21a3b4397cac
msgctxt "h56ceb8afg372fg4f92g998cg68f6b3bb1933"
msgid ""
"*You imagine your fingers contorting into claws, and your skin rippling and "
"bulging.*"
msgstr "*당신의 손가락이 발톱으로 변하고, 피부가 부풀어 오르는 것을 상상합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 8e766ada-7df5-17ee-785b-f8910974bcdd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:8e766ada-7df5-17ee-785b-f8910974bcdd
msgctxt "h486d8bdegc30fg4cbagb6b2g98774854e312"
msgid ""
"*The flames cool, dispelled as the image you know emerges again: blood and "
"darkness.*"
msgstr "*화염이 식고 사라지면서, 당신이 알던 피와 어둠이 다시 드러납니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 921e7122-d928-4f76-c029-445fed74d59c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:921e7122-d928-4f76-c029-445fed74d59c
msgctxt "h3bd99bf4ga466g4f0bg8c05g62ceeecced25"
msgid "<i>Let your thoughts turn to the crash.</i>"
msgstr "<i>그 불시착 했을 때로 생각을 돌려 본다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 949f5349-f62f-7016-5420-0ba7b8fbc1d2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:949f5349-f62f-7016-5420-0ba7b8fbc1d2
msgctxt "h74f4faafga54dg45ecgb353g5255078f7cc0"
msgid "*Your thoughts turn to courage; a deep sleep soon follows.*"
msgstr "*당신의 생각은 용기로 바뀌고 곧 깊은 잠이 찾아옵니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 952fbc2e-fae2-9dbc-6387-301902e42da3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:952fbc2e-fae2-9dbc-6387-301902e42da3
msgctxt "h96bc0506g48b5g414dgbe5bg60f155631184"
msgid "*Without answers, you lay haunted for the rest of the night.*"
msgstr "*대답을 찾지 못한채, 당신은 밤새 괴로워 합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 95d14623-74ee-a149-5e52-7f3017597d88
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:95d14623-74ee-a149-5e52-7f3017597d88
msgctxt "h96fe48d2g1accg45a6g8d24g8182eab13638"
msgid ""
"*... all nothing compared to what came before. Compared to the tadpole.*"
msgstr "*... 이전에 있었던 일과 비교하면 아무것도 아닙니다. 올챙이와 비교하면 아무것도 아닙니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 9617080d-d39d-253e-bba9-a218aeb8314b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:9617080d-d39d-253e-bba9-a218aeb8314b
msgctxt "h0c28833eg1530g43f3g9fedge63382822051"
msgid "*So many brothers and sisters sacrificed for it. Only you remain.*"
msgstr "*수많은 형제자매들이 희생했습니다. 오직 당신만 남았습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 98db15ad-d8da-55a5-9416-6bc751f1af58
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ELF(0) = True
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(0) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:98db15ad-d8da-55a5-9416-6bc751f1af58
msgctxt "hd917d80eg116dg4bf2ga8feg8e2cbd5eaab2"
msgid ""
"*Every night that passes is another night the monster inside you grows.*"
msgstr "*매일 밤이 지날수록 당신 안에 있는 괴물은 점점 커져 갑니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 9a48fbf6-c88c-d500-b4d4-1c2b79e9db99
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:9a48fbf6-c88c-d500-b4d4-1c2b79e9db99
msgctxt "h51598095gc6bfg436fga52bg96dfd57f279b"
msgid "*No exercise had prepared you for such extraordinary circumstances.*"
msgstr "*이런 특별한 상황에 대비한 훈련은 없었습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 9aee3113-09ec-1120-1123-41311b4d5792
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:9aee3113-09ec-1120-1123-41311b4d5792
msgctxt "h3cad10cdg07e2g4c92gaa5ag02b79dbbcde1"
msgid ""
"*They were majestic in their fury. Could they too be vanquished by something "
"as small as a tadpole?*"
msgstr "*그들의 분노는 장엄했습니다. 그들도 올챙이처럼 작은 존재에게 정복당할 수 있을까요?*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9b051f4e-f9e7-2d4d-ff0e-aefce0ed7d48
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_ELF(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_GALE(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(0) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:9b051f4e-f9e7-2d4d-ff0e-aefce0ed7d48
msgctxt "h71fe46e2g48ccg461dga1dega2dae8a229fc"
msgid "<i>Focus. Finding a cure is all that matters.</i>"
msgstr "<i>집중한다. 치유법을 찾는 것이 중요하다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 9b080574-38b9-fe3a-4902-803f17da4ccf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:9b080574-38b9-fe3a-4902-803f17da4ccf
msgctxt "h5da20456g1b5cg425bg8e4dgd0033bae4035"
msgid "*What was it Mizora had said? Oh yes - 'Over your rotting corpse'.*"
msgstr "*미조라가 뭐라고 했나요? 그래요, '네 썩어가는 시체 위에'라고 했습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 9e3baf08-2f93-5919-f30c-404c80b92947
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:9e3baf08-2f93-5919-f30c-404c80b92947
msgctxt "h3f55f8dbgc62ag4163g88acgbcb7e93349e5"
msgid ""
"*... you and the vile creature inside you. The mere thought of it makes you "
"shiver.*"
msgstr "*... 당신과 당신 안에 있는 역겨운 생명체. 생각만 해도 소름이 끼칩니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 9f3b55c8-d92f-c3b1-27cd-ca7dabbc8d0b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:9f3b55c8-d92f-c3b1-27cd-ca7dabbc8d0b
msgctxt "hce4bdd1fgc406g4bd4gb3a7ge1d3095fb259"
msgid "*Tomorrow, you will fight harder than ever before.*"
msgstr "*내일은, 그 어느 때보다도 더 열심히 싸울 것입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 9feec6a0-bb36-43ec-6a5e-a5898ce8056d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:9feec6a0-bb36-43ec-6a5e-a5898ce8056d
msgctxt "heda8ed83gb4feg4602gaed7gd18078c23c06"
msgid ""
"*Your head is about to burst. The memory consumes your mind, corrupting the "
"trance.*"
msgstr "*당신의 머리가 터질 것 같습니다. 기억이 당신의 정신을 좀먹으며, 명상 상태를 망칩니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = a083df01-a7ac-b7c0-3455-6b0cdc107a48
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:a083df01-a7ac-b7c0-3455-6b0cdc107a48
msgctxt "hae2fade1geffdg4c92g8d66ga0cf5108f6db"
msgid ""
"*How were you caught off-guard on the nautiloid? What was the crucial "
"mistake?*"
msgstr "*당신은 어떻게 해서 노틸로이드에서 방심하게 되었습니까? 결정적인 실수는 무엇이었습니까?*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = a1e34df7-cb2d-e557-135c-1785e4b755fc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:a1e34df7-cb2d-e557-135c-1785e4b755fc
msgctxt "hf53fa047gb075g407cga6aag59958ab52581"
msgid ""
"*The thought is punished by a spike of pain driven right between your eyes.*"
msgstr "*그 생각은 눈 사이를 찌르는 듯한 통증으로 이어집니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a2089ae0-e5fb-b0c4-2790-768c39309db7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_ELF(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_GALE(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(0) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:a2089ae0-e5fb-b0c4-2790-768c39309db7
msgctxt "h966ed0d0g82bdg42adg8542gcf61f94b06ad"
msgid ""
"<i>You have to learn to control the tadpole. It's dangerous, but "
"powerful.</i>"
msgstr "<i>올챙이를 통제하는 법을 배워야 한다. 위험하지만, 강력한 힘을 가지고 있다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = a3b6ac63-1ad3-bfa5-b6e8-cff938b210bc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:a3b6ac63-1ad3-bfa5-b6e8-cff938b210bc
msgctxt "h0006a9ecg23c2g4b09gab55g242d522938d4"
msgid ""
"*Yet the tadpole is in the dark too. Dozens of them, crawling towards you as "
"a mind flayer held your skull in its psionic grip.*"
msgstr ""
"*하지만 올챙이도 어둠 속에 있습니다. 마인드 플레이어가 사이오닉 그립으로 당신의 두개골을 움켜쥔 채, 수십 마리의 올챙이가 당신을 향해 "
"기어갑니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = a51e912a-7b36-9e22-c87c-53294a202c4f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:a51e912a-7b36-9e22-c87c-53294a202c4f
msgctxt "hff1a7686g019bg4718g89bega76c21a51ef8"
msgid "*It is a minor victory, but enough to soothe you to sleep.*"
msgstr "*별 것 아닌 성취지만, 충분히 진정되어 잠들 수 있을 정도입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = a5c31435-26ce-0dea-fd92-617c9bf24046
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:a5c31435-26ce-0dea-fd92-617c9bf24046
msgctxt "h5df1bcd9g7f87g4b82gafedg45935129cce2"
msgid ""
"*You hear only your own thoughts. Shar's presence won't come to you - why?*"
msgstr "*당신은 스스로의 생각밖에 들리지 않습니다. 샤의 존재가 당신에게 다가오지 않습니다. 어째서?*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a6d09097-07c9-cb44-20e7-675fa86bdb72
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Intelligence
#. DifficultyClass: 5
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_UNDERDARK(0) = True
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_ELF(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_GALE(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(0) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:a6d09097-07c9-cb44-20e7-675fa86bdb72
msgctxt "h9f529d75g590eg4772g9704g70e4c1933c17"
msgid "<i>Force the tadpole out of your mind. Think of home instead.</i>"
msgstr "<i>올챙이를 당신의 마음에서 끄집어낸다. 대신 고향에 대해 생각한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = a8ab231d-2fed-bf16-559b-e5c67ca9be72
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ELF(0) = True
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(0) = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_WOODELF
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:a8ab231d-2fed-bf16-559b-e5c67ca9be72
msgctxt "hf0d91b28gef13g429eg8da1g9031a1eb2e56"
msgid ""
"*You recall a wild wood, touched only by the <i>Tel'Quessir</i>. The world "
"around you breathes and blossoms.*"
msgstr "*당신은 <i>텔퀘시에</i>의 손길만이 닿았던 야생의 숲을 기억해 냅니다. 당신 주변의 세계는 숨을 쉬고 꽃을 피웁니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = a8ab231d-2fed-bf16-559b-e5c67ca9be72
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ELF(0) = True
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(0) = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_HIGHELF
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:a8ab231d-2fed-bf16-559b-e5c67ca9be72
msgctxt "h07be5821g909bg4869g8b71g7217232629a0"
msgid ""
"*You picture the Feywild in its colourful glory, the joy of all seasons "
"flourishing at once.*"
msgstr "*당신은 페이와일드의 화려한 장관을 상상합니다. 모든 계절의 기쁨이 한꺼번에 번성하는 모습을요.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = ab01014c-0608-3137-5d81-30e155ec48c4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:ab01014c-0608-3137-5d81-30e155ec48c4
msgctxt "h6e2d63ebg2379g4965ga5ddgf520e242f71c"
msgid ""
"*There is no peace in that truth, only an unease that steals away any chance "
"of sleep.*"
msgstr "*그 진실에는 평안이 없고, 잠잘 기회를 앗아가는 불안만 있을 뿐입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ab0315e3-7e7b-8eb1-234d-9bcc6bcc471d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Constitution
#. DifficultyClass: 5
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:ab0315e3-7e7b-8eb1-234d-9bcc6bcc471d
msgctxt "h09760e49gdc37g4113gbb35ge695ac227779"
msgid "<i>Refuse to break. Anything can be endured in the trance.</i>"
msgstr "<i>명상이 깨지는 걸 거부한다. 이 명상 속에서는 무엇이든 견딜 수 있다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = ab26516b-1e1d-c7fb-95ee-0420eea02d1c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:ab26516b-1e1d-c7fb-95ee-0420eea02d1c
msgctxt "h5d6bc177ga550g45f0g8a9ege76242e33d33"
msgid ""
"*You picture a silver blade cleaving through <i>ghaik</i> and their thralls, "
"one after another.*"
msgstr "*당신은 <i>게이크</i>와 그들의 하수인들을 은검으로 썰어 버리는 상상을 합니다. 하나씩, 하나씩.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = abcba9c8-90a4-f5ca-d5f4-0f2edf657d7c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:abcba9c8-90a4-f5ca-d5f4-0f2edf657d7c
msgctxt "hba47b0aegdeb1g4b3dg961bgf6bfc2cc5304"
msgid ""
"*You offer the head to Vlaakith, your queen. She hands you a sword of silver "
"in return.*"
msgstr "*당신의 여왕 블라키스에게 머리를 바칩니다. 그녀는 당신에게 은검을 보답으로 줍니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ac402ab9-5df4-51a2-1f5f-bfafd42d2f6f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ELF(0) = True
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(0) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:ac402ab9-5df4-51a2-1f5f-bfafd42d2f6f
msgctxt "hd4a42955g2ea0g4051g872bgb33b029baa6b"
msgid "<i>Let the pain claim you.</i>"
msgstr "<i>고통이 오도록 둔다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = b19370a0-c170-f308-f0cc-6325ed0acbc5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:b19370a0-c170-f308-f0cc-6325ed0acbc5
msgctxt "h7c71f302gaa4bg45cbgbb7ag50a1845cb2fa"
msgid "*Sleep comes as you count the fields of the dead, soon to grow.*"
msgstr "*죽은 자들의 묘지를 세면서 잠이 듭니다. 금새 그 수가 불어 납니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = b2dad414-a312-23e9-0419-2aceea291869
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:b2dad414-a312-23e9-0419-2aceea291869
msgctxt "h2ac13e81g39efg41d5g9a3eg79af4265b6ad"
msgid "*You have been enslaved like your ancestors! Rage sparks to hatred.*"
msgstr "*당신은 당신의 조상들처럼 노예가 되었습니다! 분노가 증오로 번집니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = b6273105-1f7d-4e7d-9fb5-41d0afb370f8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:b6273105-1f7d-4e7d-9fb5-41d0afb370f8
msgctxt "h8b385d8bg9067g4c05g8fb7ga3a0824b5b30"
msgid "*If sleep won't come to you, at least darkness will.*"
msgstr "*잠이 오지 않는다면, 어둠이라도 찾아올 것입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = b888ae4a-dfa4-e6c4-93aa-2ed785114f0d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:b888ae4a-dfa4-e6c4-93aa-2ed785114f0d
msgctxt "h93459e12gb525g4445g8c1bg932163f5b825"
msgid "*No. You would only be a failure if you stop fighting.*"
msgstr "*아닙니다. 싸우는 걸 멈췄을 때 비로소 패배자가 될겁니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b95e140c-0fb7-e3d6-634f-c8530076e4cf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 5
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ELF(0) = True
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(0) = False
#. TagRule: DROWELF or DROWHALFELF
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:b95e140c-0fb7-e3d6-634f-c8530076e4cf
msgctxt "h2acb09b1g6d2ag4f79ga648gfbe7d8de77f9"
msgid ""
"<i>You have walked your dreams countless times before. Will this memory to "
"pass.</i>"
msgstr "<i>당신은 전에도 셀 수 없이 꿈속을 걸었었다. 이 기억도 지나가리라.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bc6aa0e1-52b4-15d6-f063-c42f1fe60c16
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:bc6aa0e1-52b4-15d6-f063-c42f1fe60c16
msgctxt "h763086f7g8f5cg4c36ga98eg5bf72c8fb7dc"
msgid "<i>Shut your eyes.</i>"
msgstr "<i>눈을 감는다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = bcf9019e-4f09-0a84-6b5c-0fac182f3a2c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ELF(0) = True
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(0) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:bcf9019e-4f09-0a84-6b5c-0fac182f3a2c
msgctxt "h27e69215gae85g418fgb31bg303e3e5f690f"
msgid "*Agony bursts behind your eyes, and the whole world goes dark.*"
msgstr "*당신의 눈 뒤에서 고통이 터져 나오고, 온 세상이 어두워집니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = bdb16315-183a-8618-8b5e-12eeb2151a29
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:bdb16315-183a-8618-8b5e-12eeb2151a29
msgctxt "haf7b33e2g472bg42d5g8afag377bb72f1149"
msgid "*Your anger is clarifying, pure and bright. It burns away all doubt.*"
msgstr "*당신의 분노는 명확하고 순수하며 밝습니다. 모든 의심을 태워버립니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = be40aa2b-22c0-2ca9-e8f2-813eecab7aa3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:be40aa2b-22c0-2ca9-e8f2-813eecab7aa3
msgctxt "h4ed62a84g2493g49f3gaf95g0b6abadd7661"
msgid ""
"*You have prepared all your life to fight the <i>ghaik</i>. You dream of "
"presenting one of their vile heads to Vlaakith in Tu'narath!*"
msgstr ""
"*당신은 <i>게이크</i>와 싸우기 위해 평생을 준비해 왔습니다. 그들의 역겨운 머리를 튜나라쓰에 있는 블라키스에게 바치는 것을 꿈꿔 "
"왔습니다!*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = bede2786-c4fb-b548-c670-3fc9f5f9b220
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:bede2786-c4fb-b548-c670-3fc9f5f9b220
msgctxt "h0f37fabfg75f1g4eeagb337g73e13aad0a39"
msgid "*A shame your mind has other ideas.*"
msgstr "*당신은 딴 생각을 하고 있단 사실에 수치스럽습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = c0ec3655-0995-ac9e-a870-21371dfb2363
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:c0ec3655-0995-ac9e-a870-21371dfb2363
msgctxt "h9fef225bgde79g4dd0gb776g961e6ec8343d"
msgid ""
"*It's still inside you. Does it watch the night sky even now, through your "
"eyes?*"
msgstr "*그것은 여전히 당신 안에 있습니다. 지금도 당신의 눈을 통해 밤하늘을 보고 있을까요?*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = c2daa110-9cd1-370a-3c0c-5a51dca8a7b3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:c2daa110-9cd1-370a-3c0c-5a51dca8a7b3
msgctxt "h08ad2185g191cg4063g8321gabb56ec77cc7"
msgid ""
"*You mentally shuffle through places likely to have an expert in mind "
"flayers. Candlekeep? Neverwinter? Menzoberranzan? Baldur's Gate...*"
msgstr "*마인드 플레이어에 대한 전문가가 있을 법한 장소가 머릿속으로 스쳐갑니다. 캔들킵? 네버윈터? 멘조베란잔? 발더스 게이트...*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = c2ef53fa-cabf-eb81-9912-a7ce6b5edaff
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:c2ef53fa-cabf-eb81-9912-a7ce6b5edaff
msgctxt "h2b48b681gd69dg48f4g84bbg33aa96e732bc"
msgid "*As if you don't have enough problems already...*"
msgstr "*지금도 해결해야 될 문제가 쌓여 있음에도 불구하고...*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c30a5829-9488-49c0-fe37-3f8edac5b001
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Intelligence
#. DifficultyClass: 5
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:c30a5829-9488-49c0-fe37-3f8edac5b001
msgctxt "ha93f2d7ageac7g46c7gb9a7g2f952d23add4"
msgid "<i>Shame claws at you like rot. Are you a failure?</i>"
msgstr "<i>부끄러움이 당신을 문드러지게 할퀸다. 당신은 패배자인가?</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = c3cf4969-9d24-349d-aaa0-c6fe4b036173
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ELF(0) = True
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(0) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:c3cf4969-9d24-349d-aaa0-c6fe4b036173
msgctxt "haea2e65fg2aeeg4fd6ga4e1gd35ca1421aad"
msgid ""
"*Your head is about to burst. The memory consumes your mind, corrupting the "
"trance.*"
msgstr "*당신의 머리가 곧 터질 것 같습니다. 그 기억이 당신의 정신을 좀먹고, 명상 상태를 망가뜨립니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = c41f0a96-e58f-3214-9eb7-2cfc93f378dc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:c41f0a96-e58f-3214-9eb7-2cfc93f378dc
msgctxt "h5820ebd9g7fb0g411bgbfeagfe8ab68f020f"
msgid "*Agony bursts behind your eyes, and the whole world goes dark.*"
msgstr "*당신의 눈 뒤에서 고통이 터져 나오고, 온 세상이 어두워집니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = c4cdd83d-697b-41e9-5660-a226f1b9d1f7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:c4cdd83d-697b-41e9-5660-a226f1b9d1f7
msgctxt "h4c9e71a1gf25cg4889gbd63gbb877abf4721"
msgid "*Gazing up at the night sky, you try to will yourself to sleep.*"
msgstr "*밤하늘을 올려다보며 잠을 자려고 의지를 다집니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = c6903a41-13de-77aa-6a42-0f149e0312b2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:c6903a41-13de-77aa-6a42-0f149e0312b2
msgctxt "h21ee240cg1ddfg4e45g8315g40a90b317fba"
msgid ""
"*Devils and demons swarm your thoughts. Soon, they will be swarming your "
"dreams.*"
msgstr "*데빌과 데몬이 당신의 생각을 뒤덮습니다. 곧, 그들은 당신의 꿈에 몰려들 것입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = c6a9c21e-6d08-f131-68f8-99eb7e863b57
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:c6a9c21e-6d08-f131-68f8-99eb7e863b57
msgctxt "h76468d93g6457g4801g92b5g5c898fd2b223"
msgid "*You should have burst into flames.*"
msgstr "*당신은 불길에 휩싸였어야 했습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c7aedd73-a580-b0c0-06df-5bd2efc1aa2a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:c7aedd73-a580-b0c0-06df-5bd2efc1aa2a
msgctxt "h64e44f9cgdd7fg45aagb516g30344141252e"
msgid "<i>Try to remember what came before the mission.</i>"
msgstr "<i>임무 전에 무엇이 있었는지 기억해 내려고 한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = c93b17d7-8b44-773f-501e-a16cdad082f0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:c93b17d7-8b44-773f-501e-a16cdad082f0
msgctxt "h9e5db5b8gbc18g4b19g942fgb2a161393f26"
msgid ""
"*You close your eyes and try to focus on his delightful screams, but they "
"quickly turn into your own. They only stop when tentacles burst from your "
"mouth.*"
msgstr ""
"*눈을 감고 그의 유쾌한 비명에 집중하려고 하지만, 비명은 금세 자신의 비명으로 바뀝니다. 입에서 촉수가 터지고 나서야 비명이 멈춥니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = ca8ea4f7-20a5-2f58-2fad-5558e0081d5b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:ca8ea4f7-20a5-2f58-2fad-5558e0081d5b
msgctxt "h26541537g68d1g4369g8fecge2b63d765772"
msgid "*You shudder, resigning yourself to whatever dark rest awaits you.*"
msgstr "*당신은 몸을 떨며, 어두운 안식이 당신을 기다리고 있다고 체념합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cbe02827-30ec-095b-54e0-57c27eb38ff3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Constitution
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:cbe02827-30ec-095b-54e0-57c27eb38ff3
msgctxt "h3d3455e2g7ea0g41e6ga83eg5d6fbb7c9e86"
msgid "<i>Meditate on your teachings.</i>"
msgstr "<i>당신이 배운 것들에 대해 명상한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cc3e38e6-dab3-4b64-f708-2439e481bb74
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:cc3e38e6-dab3-4b64-f708-2439e481bb74
msgctxt "h7e94974ege2d3g4ec9g9049g22b1c507ddbd"
msgid "<i>Roll over, push it all from your mind.</i>"
msgstr "<i>모르겠고, 모든 생각으로부터 벗어난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = ccc3f940-ed36-b480-5944-d5061dc18b94
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:ccc3f940-ed36-b480-5944-d5061dc18b94
msgctxt "hbeb81d2ag0476g4968gad3bgf3bfc6be6296"
msgid ""
"*Are you such precious cargo that they'd race through the Hells' bowels to "
"protect you?*"
msgstr "*지옥의 창자를 거쳐 경주할 만큼 당신은 귀중한 화물인가요?*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = cd6f6c1d-b5cf-8e1b-c280-3e1104d0563c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:cd6f6c1d-b5cf-8e1b-c280-3e1104d0563c
msgctxt "h90f687e0g67ccg40a4g9334g170ea4549f1e"
msgid "*Seven. In seven days you'll be a mind flayer.*"
msgstr "*일곱. 7일 후에 당신은 마인드 플레이어가 될 수 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = d0059c3e-7b21-2015-ed2e-c6c9195682af
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:d0059c3e-7b21-2015-ed2e-c6c9195682af
msgctxt "h2fdf0e93g51f5g4342g8e46gb038cd8d8955"
msgid ""
"*Your memories are foggy - as your mission requires them to be: Shar's "
"secrets are precious.*"
msgstr "*당신의 기억은 흐릿합니다. 당신의 임무가 그런 상황을 요구하기 때문입니다. 샤의 비밀은 소중합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = d0cbeec7-bc3a-3c61-eb4d-15d1ce3ac4c0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:d0cbeec7-bc3a-3c61-eb4d-15d1ce3ac4c0
msgctxt "h1d0c62ceg0832g49adg9441gc785141819a7"
msgid ""
"*Your head twinges. Is it the tadpole, you wonder? Had you imagined it - or "
"were you soon to turn?*"
msgstr "*머리가 찌른 듯이 아픕니다. 당신 생각에 올챙이 때문일까요? 단순한 환통이었을까요, 아니면 곧 변해 버릴까요?*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = d1d5dc31-0807-62cd-bbb9-639a44c76aaf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:d1d5dc31-0807-62cd-bbb9-639a44c76aaf
msgctxt "h5ee1fa09g0391g471fgb9dfgf10cfce7ce23"
msgid "*You'd do anything to be a great hero - or so you once thought.*"
msgstr "*당신은 위대한 영웅이 되기 위해 무엇이든 할 수 있었습니다. 혹은, 한때 그렇게 생각했습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = d71be9e1-efa5-9ea0-4637-a8776f23b6a2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:d71be9e1-efa5-9ea0-4637-a8776f23b6a2
msgctxt "h99ce7204gf803g42a6g9ff8g812f0a78f2a4"
msgid ""
"*There is no conquering the agitation. Like it or not, mind flayers have "
"bested you this day.*"
msgstr "*불안을 정복할 수는 없습니다. 좋든 싫든, 오늘은 마인드 플레이어가 당신을 이겼습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = d77c555b-2208-12fd-e5b0-52355e22f958
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DROWELF
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:d77c555b-2208-12fd-e5b0-52355e22f958
msgctxt "hd2233347g0134g4fa3g83d5g114284b35d25"
msgid ""
"*The dark is familiar, but not comforting. It is a struggle to sink into "
"your trance, weaving together memory, ambition, and purpose.*"
msgstr "*어둠은 익숙하지만 위로가 되지는 않습니다. 명상 상태에 빠지기 위해 기억과 야망, 목적을 하나로 엮어 몸부림칩니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = d86e909c-0146-d00c-fd95-7aad292eabea
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:d86e909c-0146-d00c-fd95-7aad292eabea
msgctxt "h3d556c98g2806g46f5gbce6gaf00595a416b"
msgid ""
"*He'll believe you if you tell him what happened. But he won't forgive.*"
msgstr "*당신이 무슨 일이 있었는지 말한다면 그는 믿을 것입니다. 하지만 용서하지는 않을 것입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = da983391-3c8b-b61b-4bfd-14c50280e6c6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:da983391-3c8b-b61b-4bfd-14c50280e6c6
msgctxt "h60d21d4cgaa82g4ccegb02cg200dbfeb42b8"
msgid ""
"*Protect the box. Find your contact in Baldur's Gate. Fulfil Shar's command.*"
msgstr "*상자를 보호해야 합니다. 발더스 게이트에서 접선자를 찾아야 합니다. 샤의 명령을 완수해야 합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = dc15cf5c-4475-31e5-5d5e-c02233a9cf66
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 5
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:dc15cf5c-4475-31e5-5d5e-c02233a9cf66
msgctxt "h8981859cg8bfeg44cagb2aeg5055b6f2de77"
msgid ""
"<i>You have walked your dreams countless times before. Will this memory to "
"pass. </i>"
msgstr "<i>당신은 전에도 셀 수 없이 꿈속을 걸었었다. 이 기억도 지나가리라.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = dcc80dbb-431b-4aa4-29cd-1a46bdc43738
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:dcc80dbb-431b-4aa4-29cd-1a46bdc43738
msgctxt "h5088bfffg3bb9g415dg87e2g0e0026dd70c3"
msgid ""
"*Its weight reassures you. Shar's will and your destiny, right in your "
"grasp.*"
msgstr "*그 무게가 당신을 안심시킵니다. 샤의 의지와 당신의 운명이, 바로 당신의 손 안에 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = dce361c3-93e1-7d0d-048e-4a5f1220da07
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:dce361c3-93e1-7d0d-048e-4a5f1220da07
msgctxt "hcfde61dbg9afcg4e0ag94ddgfa9a81396cbe"
msgid ""
"*Until you know more about the tadpole, you can't be sure how much danger "
"you're in.*"
msgstr "*올챙이에 대해 더 자세히 알기 전까지는, 당신이 얼마나 위험한 상황에 처해 있는지 확신할 수 없습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = dd9df1f1-5830-b51f-76bc-4f879719d129
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_DUERGARDWARF
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:dd9df1f1-5830-b51f-76bc-4f879719d129
msgctxt "hb4418754g6cefg48dag98d1g43f10ec65f5f"
msgid "*You belong with dark stone and black iron. There is work to be done.*"
msgstr "*당신이 있을 곳은 어두운 돌과 검은 철이 있는 곳입니다. 거기서 해야 할 일이 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = dd9df1f1-5830-b51f-76bc-4f879719d129
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_DEEPGNOME
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:dd9df1f1-5830-b51f-76bc-4f879719d129
msgctxt "h640c09feg4a10g4d06g8375g898762e78bf2"
msgid "*You belong with your people, down in the dark that never fades.*"
msgstr "*당신이 있을 곳은 당신의 동족들이 있는 곳입니다. 절대 사라지지 않을 어둠 속.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = df1ba2b0-84fd-3290-179f-f8a59f3f024d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ELF(0) = True
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(0) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:df1ba2b0-84fd-3290-179f-f8a59f3f024d
msgctxt "h96dfd04cga03dg4b4fg9746gef4e4b42ed59"
msgid ""
"*Hell surrounds you, flames licking at your body. The tadpole in your head "
"convulses.*"
msgstr "*지옥이 당신을 둘러싸고, 불길이 몸을 핥습니다. 머릿속 올챙이가 경련을 일으킵니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = e00a0b32-0379-1424-27dd-741ed8f6dc39
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:e00a0b32-0379-1424-27dd-741ed8f6dc39
msgctxt "h66124ea1g080bg432fga872gfe5181ae7464"
msgid "*Sudden exhaustion washes over you.*"
msgstr "*갑작스러운 피로감이 밀려옵니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = e047fae3-e86a-9181-3ad8-f4101118aca8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:e047fae3-e86a-9181-3ad8-f4101118aca8
msgctxt "h97673933g7905g4eabg8383gc34629fa6192"
msgid ""
"*Your honour can be restored before Vlaakith. It <i>would</i> be restored.*"
msgstr "*당신의 명예는 블라키스 앞에서 회복 할 수 있습니다. 명예는 <i>회복 될 것</i>입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = e15ccf05-00a4-76e0-9eeb-8c5df4bd6ac1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:e15ccf05-00a4-76e0-9eeb-8c5df4bd6ac1
msgctxt "h329eafc8g2bfag4e56gbc58g51031ecd47d4"
msgid ""
"*But you'll know all about it soon enough. In seven days you'll be a mind "
"flayer yourself.*"
msgstr "*하지만 곧 모든 것을 알게 될 것입니다. 7일 후면 여러분도 마인드 플레이어가 될 것입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = e4e00683-4be6-2750-6257-53298b1bfc87
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - LOLTHDROWELF(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:e4e00683-4be6-2750-6257-53298b1bfc87
msgctxt "hf893c383ge098g4b90g9531gb1eaf4c981e2"
msgid ""
"*The flames fall away, a mere illusion. You sit the dark again, beside "
"Lolth's majesty.*"
msgstr "*불꽃이 사그라들며 환영만이 남았습니다. 당신은 다시 어둠 속에 앉아, 롤쓰의 장엄함을 바라봅니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e90b6808-1a2f-3681-9ada-a1147295e618
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Constitution
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:e90b6808-1a2f-3681-9ada-a1147295e618
msgctxt "h8e650347gfb83g4dd3gacf5gbb634ae2133f"
msgid "<i>Shut your mind to all thought.</i>"
msgstr "<i>생각을 모두 닫아버린다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = ea2842ce-30e6-3ad3-b779-45d3774c1ea2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_ELF(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_GALE(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(0) = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_UNDERDARK
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:ea2842ce-30e6-3ad3-b779-45d3774c1ea2
msgctxt "h1c788899g86f9g4138g84e4g0500cb5f48d6"
msgid ""
"*The deep dark should lull you to sleep, yet your eyes refuse to stay "
"closed.*"
msgstr "*깊은 어둠이 당신을 잠들게 해야 하지만 눈은 감기지 않습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = ea2842ce-30e6-3ad3-b779-45d3774c1ea2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_ELF(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_GALE(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(0) = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_PLANAR or REALLY_RARE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:ea2842ce-30e6-3ad3-b779-45d3774c1ea2
msgctxt "hfbd6bca9g5e40g414dgabcfg6084cfc71fa9"
msgid ""
"*This is not the world you know. Rest feels impossible, no matter how heavy "
"your eyes become.*"
msgstr "*이건 당신이 아는 세상이 아닙니다. 눈이 아무리 무거워져도 휴식이 불가능하게 느껴집니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = ea2842ce-30e6-3ad3-b779-45d3774c1ea2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_ELF(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_GALE(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(0) = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_BESTIAL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:ea2842ce-30e6-3ad3-b779-45d3774c1ea2
msgctxt "haa94c1deg19fbg4994gad20g3ef9e0af40da"
msgid ""
"*This is not a nest or haunt, any place of comfort. Closing your eyes only "
"intensifies the unease.*"
msgstr "*이곳은 둥지나 소굴, 어떤 안락한 장소도 아닙니다. 눈을 감으면 불안감이 더 심해질 뿐입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = ea2842ce-30e6-3ad3-b779-45d3774c1ea2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_ELF(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_GALE(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(0) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:ea2842ce-30e6-3ad3-b779-45d3774c1ea2
msgctxt "he7f59937g0f9cg46e2g8034g4bf9e9a95130"
msgid "*A calm night is a mercy, yet your eyes refuse to stay closed.*"
msgstr "*고요한 밤은 자비롭지만, 당신의 눈은 감기지 않으려 합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ea98c78e-8d5a-b7a5-398e-b31cced4a52c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:ea98c78e-8d5a-b7a5-398e-b31cced4a52c
msgctxt "hc5b35263g7f7cg4000g846bg0051a861b4b1"
msgid ""
"<i>Consider the tadpole. Can a vampire spawn even become a mind flayer?</i>"
msgstr "<i>그 올챙이를 생각해 본다. 뱀파이어 스폰도 마인드 플레이어가 될 수 있을까?</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = eae09650-633a-f5b8-dc4c-64948365e734
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:eae09650-633a-f5b8-dc4c-64948365e734
msgctxt "h0b2f163ag870dg4143gb3f9g05b55c76ea77"
msgid ""
"<i>Think back to the abduction. What do these creatures want with you?</i>"
msgstr "<i>납치당했던 상황을 생각해 본다. 이 생물들이 당신에게 원하는 것은 무엇일까?</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = ebce2efb-b52d-20b1-55cc-dcad6a7b606c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:ebce2efb-b52d-20b1-55cc-dcad6a7b606c
msgctxt "h08d2debfgbb0fg4050g954agc296619ce076"
msgid "*Your life is your own. No wriggling tadpole is going to change that.*"
msgstr "*당신의 삶은 당신 자신의 것입니다. 꿈틀거리는 올챙이도 그 사실을 바꾸지 못합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ec0b8490-9341-09cf-cda0-d2a25522d43d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:ec0b8490-9341-09cf-cda0-d2a25522d43d
msgctxt "h5ad985e8gf3c8g4de0g8854g49608c76fda9"
msgid ""
"<i>Pray to Shar. Her blessing will help you weather the trials ahead.</i>"
msgstr "<i>샤에게 기도를 올린다. 그녀의 축복이 앞으로의 시련을 이겨낼 수 있도록 도와줄 것이다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = ee39c3cf-c021-faa3-a4f0-e7aaadcfeabd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:ee39c3cf-c021-faa3-a4f0-e7aaadcfeabd
msgctxt "ha6d2adcdg0954g42e5gaea0g1b8917462727"
msgid ""
"*The agony refuses to fade until you collapse against your bedroll in a cold "
"sweat.*"
msgstr "*차가운 땀에 젖어 침낭에 쓰러질 때까지 고통은 사라지지 않습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = efa1d59c-bb57-5a1f-38fa-b03fef2e0583
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:efa1d59c-bb57-5a1f-38fa-b03fef2e0583
msgctxt "he4550f5cg8077g4b04ga281g6934fcce2ba4"
msgid "*Useless - you can't stop thinking of Shar's sacred mission.*"
msgstr "*소용 없습니다. 샤의 신성한 사명에 대한 생각을 멈출 수 없습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = effa2ca8-ab22-37cf-6591-d7507c08ed02
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:effa2ca8-ab22-37cf-6591-d7507c08ed02
msgctxt "h565a5541gbc46g4269g99c9g8d2e5f2c333b"
msgid "<i>Recall the light's comforting warmth. It's been an eternity.</i>"
msgstr "<i>빛의 따스한 온기를 떠올린다. 아주 오랜 시간전의 일이다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = f0f9e6ba-5799-7294-4460-1c5e56f1ee33
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:f0f9e6ba-5799-7294-4460-1c5e56f1ee33
msgctxt "h4e291250gc3d0g4c17gb5aegab1525cc5f4e"
msgid "*Sleep claims you, determination buoyed by gentle dreams.*"
msgstr "*잠이 당신을 사로잡고, 부드러운 꿈에 이끌려 결심을 굳힙니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = f1445fbb-d628-cdd0-f382-5b393ec4cf88
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:f1445fbb-d628-cdd0-f382-5b393ec4cf88
msgctxt "h0ce21343g0683g4233g9895g26e8c432eb0a"
msgid ""
"*All you have to do is turn the tables - cage the creature before it cages "
"you.*"
msgstr "*당신이 할 일은 그저 판을 뒤집는 것뿐입니다. 그 괴물이 당신을 가두기전에 당신이 먼저 그 괴물을 가두는 겁니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = f1b631d3-00b7-c459-a520-4ee5012447b2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:f1b631d3-00b7-c459-a520-4ee5012447b2
msgctxt "hec71a3dbgdb64g440dgaad2ga6adcb389e2b"
msgid ""
"*You cannot prod it, but you can make it clear that you are watching. What "
"is there to fear when it is the one stuck inside <i>you?</i>*"
msgstr ""
"*당신은 그것을 조종할 수 없지만, 당신이 지켜보고 있다는 것을 확실히 알게 할 수 있습니다. 안에 갇힌 것이 <i>당신</i>이라면, "
"무엇이 두려울까요?*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = f33aacab-42ae-9212-88fe-ce8ec7dc8693
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:f33aacab-42ae-9212-88fe-ce8ec7dc8693
msgctxt "h2c3b6f80gb080g4bc8gbe42g3eab7832d32b"
msgid ""
"*You fall into fitful sleep, your dreams dominated by the blood-lakes of "
"Hell and snarling <i>ghaik.</i>*"
msgstr "*당신은 뒤척이며 잠이 듭니다. 꿈속에서는, 지옥속 피의 호수와 <i>게이크</i>가 으르렁거리는 모습들로 가득찹니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = f52fdd49-520b-ff72-bbe3-4096a820444c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:f52fdd49-520b-ff72-bbe3-4096a820444c
msgctxt "hc93c8c12g1086g4a57gb87dg1e8858df0153"
msgid "*You try to rest, but your mind won't settle.*"
msgstr "*쉬려고 해도 마음이 진정되지 않습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = f56d353c-dd8a-1f4b-9f22-127e52d4557c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ELF(0) = True
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(0) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:f56d353c-dd8a-1f4b-9f22-127e52d4557c
msgctxt "heed7607egbbc9g499ag9149gaaa859a94691"
msgid ""
"*As the trance stabilises, your breath deepens. Be it cure or cage, "
"something must be done about the tadpole.*"
msgstr "*명상 상태가 안정되자, 당신의 호흡이 깊어집니다. 치료든 가둬두는 방법이든, 올챙이에 대한 조치가 취해져야 합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = f6ab5681-bc78-8d09-f663-ee793fb45546
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:f6ab5681-bc78-8d09-f663-ee793fb45546
msgctxt "h6caeb3acgc108g45d2gaad4g0f8b16d3e2a8"
msgid ""
"*The day had been a surreal spectacle - scarcely to be comprehended by the "
"sane mind.*"
msgstr "*그 날은 초현실적인 광경이었습니다. 제정신으로는 도저히 이해할 수 없는 광경이었습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = f717de46-788d-cb18-11e3-72a92f69aff4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:f717de46-788d-cb18-11e3-72a92f69aff4
msgctxt "h02fba371g02e8g46c7ga232g5088f4c2197c"
msgid ""
"*You focus on that spot of pain from when it slipped behind your eye, to "
"where it now lurks.*"
msgstr "*당신의 눈 뒤로 그것이 미끄러져 들어간, 지금은 숨어 있는 그 고통의 지점에 집중합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = fa3731eb-c55e-7f8c-5aa7-74fafcfedc38
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:fa3731eb-c55e-7f8c-5aa7-74fafcfedc38
msgctxt "hea2a328ag0812g4dafgac93g63ba3ccaa22c"
msgid ""
"*Just yesterday you were seducing a young noble, luring him to your master's "
"lair.*"
msgstr "*바로 어제 당신은 젊은 귀족을 유혹하여, 당신 주인의 은신처로 유인하고 있었습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = fae6ff71-279a-11cb-ff94-95f6df106dc2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:fae6ff71-279a-11cb-ff94-95f6df106dc2
msgctxt "h7ca210a0g9462g473bgbb11g635d68bf49a3"
msgid "*The memories blacken into oblivion, only to be replaced by a number.*"
msgstr "*기억은 망각 속으로 사라지고, 오직 하나의 숫자로 대체됩니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fb3165e5-bfe0-e994-a7b1-8782ad8a01eb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 5
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:fb3165e5-bfe0-e994-a7b1-8782ad8a01eb
msgctxt "h0d40087bg734dg4193g9cabgdda93c406f53"
msgid "<i>Rage fills you. Turn the feeling to higher purpose.</i>"
msgstr "<i>격노가 당신을 채운다. 그 감정을 더 중요한 결심으로 돌린다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = ff53f218-6a99-8914-9ebf-fd21afe8e51d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:ff53f218-6a99-8914-9ebf-fd21afe8e51d
msgctxt "h180d8c90g7433g4369g9e8bgcff7b90c13fa"
msgid "*Confident thoughts. You almost believe them.*"
msgstr "*확신에 찬 생각들. 당신은 그 생각들을 거의 믿습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = ffa91461-f072-c56c-fb74-f980dd5cecb9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD:ffa91461-f072-c56c-fb74-f980dd5cecb9
msgctxt "hc427c5degc3e7g41dcga719g8e3b093d3c58"
msgid "*A simple explanation. And wrong, you wager.*"
msgstr "*간단한 설명입니다. 틀렸다고 생각하면 내기해도 됩니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 004d167e-7307-4af7-bc36-ff359e122150
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:004d167e-7307-4af7-bc36-ff359e122150
msgctxt "hdf0f8bedg8239g4423gb78fg6d46f9b67431"
msgid ""
"*Instead, recent memories overwhelm you: the <i>kith'raki</i> attacking the "
"nautiloid; warring demons and devils; the twitching <i>ghaik</i> tadpole.*"
msgstr ""
"*대신, 최근의 기억들이 당신을 덮칩니다. 노틸로이드를 공격하는 <i>키스락</i>, 데몬과 데빌들의 전투, 꿈틀거리는 <i>게이크</"
"i> 올챙이.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 00a12836-3dd8-41d2-82ea-fc6068207b01
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:00a12836-3dd8-41d2-82ea-fc6068207b01
msgctxt "hf5da50c2g07a1g4b04g9950ga6e2180a7496"
msgid "<i>Squeeze your eyes tighter.</i>"
msgstr "<i>눈을 더 꽉 감는다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 00dd9e92-6bb7-1307-6364-a38398ce4e37
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:00dd9e92-6bb7-1307-6364-a38398ce4e37
msgctxt "h12ed8a1bg63d0g433egba02g296be06da8bd"
msgid ""
"<i>The air smells so much better here. And the breeze, and the trees, and "
"the everything of it all. I could die now, and that'd be all right.</i>"
msgstr "<i>이곳의 공기는 너무나도 상쾌하군. 게다가 산들바람, 나무들, 그리고 이 모든 것들. 이제 죽어도 여한이 없어.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 011cbdd7-574c-45fc-a84a-ec9b14c4e623
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:011cbdd7-574c-45fc-a84a-ec9b14c4e623
msgctxt "h76131ef2g604dg48ceg9b2bg5b137b571c14"
msgid ""
"*Every time they flicker shut, the tadpole seems to twitch behind them.*"
msgstr "*눈을 깜빡일 때마다, 올챙이가 눈 뒤에서 경련을 일으키는 것 같습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 02017c65-e756-4793-b82f-0fe490232eb7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:02017c65-e756-4793-b82f-0fe490232eb7
msgctxt "hb311bc69ga105g4306gb95bgae23902e5d95"
msgid ""
"*Agitation overcomes imagination. Like it or not, the <i>ghaik</i> has "
"bested you this day.*"
msgstr "*상상력을 뛰어넘는 불안이 당신을 엄습합니다. 좋든 싫든, <i>게이크</i>는 오늘 당신을 꺾었습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 025ae036-fdbd-6d69-864d-6bdba5d5d3e3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - WARLOCK(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:025ae036-fdbd-6d69-864d-6bdba5d5d3e3
msgctxt "h62c3c945ga294g4cc5g9f31gc26866863ad4"
msgid ""
"*Whatever deal you made with your patron still stands, but they are in your "
"magics, not in your mind.*"
msgstr "*당신의 후원자와 맺은 계약이 뭐든간에 여전히 유효하지만, 그 계약은 마법 안에 있지, 마음 안에 있지는 않는 것입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 0272abcc-1be7-450e-8d96-153c32329cc9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:0272abcc-1be7-450e-8d96-153c32329cc9
msgctxt "h9f69bf6dg35b7g4794g89eagfaba8b769c34"
msgid "*As the fire settles, tension bleeds from your body.*"
msgstr "*불이 잦아들자, 당신의 몸에서 긴장이 풀립니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 03c0d7d8-2baf-4001-8cfc-b7313b500c48
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - SELDARINEDROWELF(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:03c0d7d8-2baf-4001-8cfc-b7313b500c48
msgctxt "h4200ced2g1c0eg493eg8868g6676ee62516a"
msgid ""
"*You picture a cup, ancient and elven: priceless. Drinking from it honours "
"the dead - those lost to Lolth's predation.*"
msgstr ""
"*당신은 매우 귀중한 고대의 엘프 잔을 상상합니다. 이 잔을 마시는 것은 죽은 자, 즉 롤쓰의 약탈에 희생된 자들을 기리는 것입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 03e37526-8f49-14a2-f6e4-bf2c1f066d7c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:03e37526-8f49-14a2-f6e4-bf2c1f066d7c
msgctxt "he2b88bb9gcddfg4890g9f3eg99b3882d0a6d"
msgid ""
"<i>Yes. Rest. Sleep. Peace. Ugh, I don't want to sleep! I want to be "
"alive!</i>"
msgstr "<i>그래. 쉬어. 자자. 편안하게. 으, 자고 싶지 않아! 난 살아있고 싶다고!</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 0487193e-292f-3d16-5c6a-94f0650b2121
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - GNOME(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:0487193e-292f-3d16-5c6a-94f0650b2121
msgctxt "he63a8d88g2848g4100g8eb8g656d541d1b9f"
msgid ""
"*Do you feel jolly? Aren't you meant to feel jolly? You don't make a very "
"good gnome.*"
msgstr "*유쾌한 기분이 드나요? 유쾌해야 하는 거 아닌가요? 당신은 그다지 좋은 노움이 아닙니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 04cf8b53-1ebb-9805-7154-ee545efa8225
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:04cf8b53-1ebb-9805-7154-ee545efa8225
msgctxt "h11b25b05g9fa0g4c40gaadfg453d4a71b9d0"
msgid "Good night."
msgstr "잘자."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 05276922-3f46-4eda-827e-29a95ee525ec
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:05276922-3f46-4eda-827e-29a95ee525ec
msgctxt "hd145bf8bgef86g4389g8872g2f0203e7ef50"
msgid ""
"*You have to understand it. Master it. Which means you need to find an "
"expert.*"
msgstr "*당신은 그것을 이해해야 합니다. 터득하세요. 즉, 전문가를 찾아야 합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 066fca7f-85fb-5f96-001e-b0fd04aa368a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:066fca7f-85fb-5f96-001e-b0fd04aa368a
msgctxt "hb3c5ea78g4488g4590gbe12g2d147885fbe9"
msgid "It isn't."
msgstr "그럴 때가 아니야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 082698fc-c64f-4f7b-3d11-9d4202c6d9e4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:082698fc-c64f-4f7b-3d11-9d4202c6d9e4
msgctxt "h53600587gd829g46bbg8a11g802cac1ebf3b"
msgid "Isn't it?"
msgstr "그렇지 않아?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 08883c64-0f61-b981-e462-d74bb38de4a2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:08883c64-0f61-b981-e462-d74bb38de4a2
msgctxt "h27779e81gd764g4fedgb50bg0c3978a59f17"
msgid "*There must be a way through this red fog.*"
msgstr "*이 붉은 안개를 뚫고 나갈 길이 있을 겁니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 0e23fdaf-bfda-4fad-a4ca-bdefd4540a2e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ELF(0) = True
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(0) = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_ELF
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:0e23fdaf-bfda-4fad-a4ca-bdefd4540a2e
msgctxt "he3f95cdeg24d6g4fdfg8b90gc6e9575e1d0b"
msgid ""
"*Falling into your trance should have been as easy as breathing, yet peace "
"eludes you.*"
msgstr "*무아지경에 빠지는 것은 숨 쉬는 것만큼 쉬워야 하지만, 평화는 찾아오지 않습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 0f4d17fb-2a5f-43a9-86dc-a759cc8c29f9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - LOLTHDROWELF(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:0f4d17fb-2a5f-43a9-86dc-a759cc8c29f9
msgctxt "ha80fa4f2ge260g4b41gabbdge61bf159b02c"
msgid ""
"*The vision in your mind is simple: a stone altar to Lolth, the knife upon "
"it bloody with sacrifice.*"
msgstr "*당신의 마음속 장면은 단순합니다. 롤쓰에게 바쳐진 돌 제단, 제물의 피로 물든 칼.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 1057da50-751e-c32c-62ad-b787ae48593c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:1057da50-751e-c32c-62ad-b787ae48593c
msgctxt "h1df6fda6g7871g40afgb836gf9e2cd7091d3"
msgid ""
"*A few scraps of the past come back to you now and then, but you can never "
"quite tell where the knowledge comes from.*"
msgstr "*가끔씩 과거의 기억이 떠오르지만, 그 지식의 출처가 어디인지 알 수는 없습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 112623b8-0632-99fd-9e70-5faf4bcc0f98
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:112623b8-0632-99fd-9e70-5faf4bcc0f98
msgctxt "h838e66d9gdbc4g425cgafc8g7c2e50f51113"
msgid ""
"<i>Fuck no I'm not. I've suffered enough for five Karlachs - and I've had "
"enough.</i>"
msgstr "<i>씨발 당연히 안돌아가. 다섯 칼라크를 위해 충분히 고통받았어. 정말 충분하다고.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 113d487f-c557-fe36-732d-a5ddcdfbc755
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:113d487f-c557-fe36-732d-a5ddcdfbc755
msgctxt "he9dfb69bg39d4g492cg93eaga50ae8269efd"
msgid "It isn't."
msgstr "그럴 때가 아니야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 11568f31-1830-4fa4-b2ce-af0327d5277d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ELF(0) = True
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(0) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:11568f31-1830-4fa4-b2ce-af0327d5277d
msgctxt "hc1b71319g95d8g424fg9eb2g78a2aeffbd3b"
msgid ""
"*Fire spills across your thoughts: dragon's breath. The tadpole slithers, "
"twisting deeper into your skull.*"
msgstr "*불꽃이 당신의 머리속을 덮칩니다. 드래곤의 브레스. 올챙이가 두개골 깊숙이 비틀어지며 미끄러지듯 움직입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1479ed53-a0fb-4308-82ae-48d5a955c57c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 5
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:1479ed53-a0fb-4308-82ae-48d5a955c57c
msgctxt "h03fb65d8gfe09g40dfg982fg20ea5b0585ea"
msgid ""
"<i>Contemplate peace. Death can be sought in battle if purification is too "
"far.</i>"
msgstr "<i>조용히 숙고해 본다. 정화가 너무 늦으면 전투 중 죽음이 찾아 올 수 있다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 15388a74-a4e8-4e4a-8da7-dfab96af886f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:15388a74-a4e8-4e4a-8da7-dfab96af886f
msgctxt "ha72b9876g2bcbg475agbba6g190c5c0f5b4b"
msgid "*Under the strange and open sky, sleep claims you.*"
msgstr "*이질적이고 탁 트인 하늘 아래서, 잠이 당신을 찾아옵니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 16a1bb9e-a3c2-8cd8-7853-ec1ef7a237ec
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:16a1bb9e-a3c2-8cd8-7853-ec1ef7a237ec
msgctxt "h79fa20e3gb633g435fg9bf5g6e48a9d2d103"
msgid "<i>Retreat. Abort. Go back. Ugh - why?</i>"
msgstr "<i>물러나. 중단해. 돌아가. 윽 - 왜?</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 16d8e77a-4241-ef5d-e950-a64cc724b4a1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:16d8e77a-4241-ef5d-e950-a64cc724b4a1
msgctxt "h7d96b4cegd73cg4f80gbcd9g82b52d5d19a5"
msgid ""
"*The call to song is a hollow joy. You are more suited to death's dirge.*"
msgstr "*노래로의 부름은 공허한 기쁨입니다. 당신은 장송곡이 더 잘 어울립니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 170678ff-e3d1-4c31-9bbf-456fd3e3ec77
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:170678ff-e3d1-4c31-9bbf-456fd3e3ec77
msgctxt "heb9187a2g2927g4ad5gae1dgc257edbf1474"
msgid ""
"*All you know for sure is, given time, it will turn you into one of them.*"
msgstr "*확실한 것은 시간이 지나면, 당신도 그들 중 한 명으로 변할 것이라는 점입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 174a1091-d828-454f-be35-4eca567949c8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:174a1091-d828-454f-be35-4eca567949c8
msgctxt "h1ad37651g3549g4f8ag9c52g800467499000"
msgid ""
"*You have fulfilled her will - retrieved the artefact for her. Everyone has "
"perished but you.*"
msgstr "*당신은 그녀의 의지를 이행했습니다. 그녀를 위해 아티팩트를 되찾았습니다. 당신을 제외하고 모두 죽었습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 178e3496-2591-4fb4-a376-e95e2a7967e1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:178e3496-2591-4fb4-a376-e95e2a7967e1
msgctxt "h33c49da3gad5cg4123ga731g90daa67dd802"
msgid ""
"*Baldur's Gate feels almost like a dream, after everything that has happened "
"to you.*"
msgstr "*당신에게 일어난 일들을 생각하면, 발더스 게이트는 마치 꿈처럼 느껴집니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1a76e10e-1fe7-4025-b695-859cc1b83e99
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Constitution
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:1a76e10e-1fe7-4025-b695-859cc1b83e99
msgctxt "h92cedd7cg580dg4488gbd67g6849078525e6"
msgid "<i>Imagine yourself beheading the very ghaik that had infected you.</i>"
msgstr "<i>당신을 감염시킨 바로 그 게이크를 참수하는 상상을 해본다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 1ab7d942-9525-44a2-ae18-9d92bc369201
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:1ab7d942-9525-44a2-ae18-9d92bc369201
msgctxt "hfc29f108g6578g41c5g8c4bgc1e85beee4c0"
msgid "*You seek rest, but an active mind refuses you.*"
msgstr "*당신은 휴식을 갈구하지만, 적극적인 마음이 당신을 거부합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 1bc9a47b-b872-420b-8ec8-5acc9dd15c2a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:1bc9a47b-b872-420b-8ec8-5acc9dd15c2a
msgctxt "h3fe50c00g277dg42e7gac7ag908461330e4f"
msgid "*Stripped raw and restless, you find no peace that night.*"
msgstr "*벗겨진 채로 불안하게, 그 날 밤 평온함은 없었습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 204fab45-a90a-3b72-e79e-7f4ede57b3c6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:204fab45-a90a-3b72-e79e-7f4ede57b3c6
msgctxt "h55d52e06g8a37g4281g8c46g5e75fa2842dc"
msgid ""
"*Instinct tells you, you must protect yourself from you. Discover yourself, "
"before it is too late.*"
msgstr "*본능이 말하길, 자신으로부터 자신을 보호해야 합니다. 너무 늦기 전에, 자신에 대해 알아내야 합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 22cecbf9-3e1e-a872-f1b1-eb4ce4763165
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_DarkUrge_LootedCorpse = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:22cecbf9-3e1e-a872-f1b1-eb4ce4763165
msgctxt "he38c69ddgf812g4df7gbd5bg1c27a5a53599"
msgid "*How much you treasured the sight of the first corpse you touched.*"
msgstr "*당신이 처음으로 만진 시체의 모습을 얼마나 소중히 여겼는지.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2320aed2-573d-4a3a-144c-91853b34af34
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:2320aed2-573d-4a3a-144c-91853b34af34
msgctxt "hc89a6f61g5391g4426ga854g868c0943e3f6"
msgid ""
"While I'm at it, I better find a way to turn down this inferno blazing in my "
"heart."
msgstr "이왕 하는 김에, 내 심장속에서 타오르는 이 지옥의 불길을 잠재울 방법을 찾아야겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 23ddd8d1-cfff-e171-a577-d0dfd04150fa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_DarkUrge_State_KilledSquirrel = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:23ddd8d1-cfff-e171-a577-d0dfd04150fa
msgctxt "ha665d0c1gfeb0g40acga3f1gcf75f0d1c4ac"
msgid "*The adorable flying squirrel.*"
msgstr "*사랑스러운 날다람쥐입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 244f7a79-8523-f05d-aedf-ccbbdd2af30c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:244f7a79-8523-f05d-aedf-ccbbdd2af30c
msgctxt "hcbd230cbg6c9eg4e99ga576g4758c4ee20e5"
msgid ""
"*Though you have a tadpole, you know your broken mind is not like the others "
"who bear the worm.*"
msgstr "*비록 당신은 올챙이를 가지고 있지만, 당신의 상처 입은 마음은 벌레를 품은 다른 이들과는 같지 않다는 것을 알고 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 2481cc03-b0c2-4739-a37f-dfdee4c887d6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:2481cc03-b0c2-4739-a37f-dfdee4c887d6
msgctxt "hd591227ag84b6g4481gaad1g3acfe4314141"
msgid ""
"*Dragons, gith, and the Hells themselves have come after you. Yet it is this "
"creature that lingers in your skull.*"
msgstr "*용, 기스, 그리고 지옥 그 자체가 당신을 쫓아왔습니다. 여전히 당신의 두개골에 남아있는 것은 이 괴물입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 24f11730-cb70-4455-832c-96e8f318b663
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:24f11730-cb70-4455-832c-96e8f318b663
msgctxt "h0d401978g797eg4789ga9aeg98524a985434"
msgid ""
"*Disgust churns deep in your stomach, leaving you resigned to a night "
"without sleep.*"
msgstr "*구역질이 당신의 뱃속 깊은 곳에서 요동치며, 당신은 잠 못 이루는 밤을 보내게 됩니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 26eab3f6-46f0-46a2-9348-38cb64e8b36d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:26eab3f6-46f0-46a2-9348-38cb64e8b36d
msgctxt "h21a04000gbe6bg4accgac12g2ca4fd894a7f"
msgid "*The wreckage. The flames. The dead...*"
msgstr "*잔해. 화염. 죽은 자들...*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 2767d00c-5d05-41a9-9623-b9801852d44d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:2767d00c-5d05-41a9-9623-b9801852d44d
msgctxt "h69fd1a36gff32g4f41ga015g8151eb24381f"
msgid ""
"*Yet it is a dream of hope. You may be countless miles away, but it isn't an "
"impossible journey.*"
msgstr "*여전히 그것은 희망의 꿈입니다. 셀 수 없을 거리만큼 멀리 떨어져 있지만 불가능한 여정은 아닙니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 28442280-827a-4b24-8a27-6c94195f191a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:28442280-827a-4b24-8a27-6c94195f191a
msgctxt "hd706d984g704dg4ff7g9359g0162f2cde521"
msgid ""
"*... unless you understand it. Master it. Which means finding an expert.*"
msgstr "*... 혹은 그것을 이해하게 된다면. 터득하세요. 즉, 전문가를 찾아야 합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2a03748a-bf29-40bf-b592-ee21ccd16855
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:2a03748a-bf29-40bf-b592-ee21ccd16855
msgctxt "h4dbf6724gc3ffg4af5ga226gba9583133187"
msgid ""
"<i>I did it. After ten long years in the Hells, I'm fucking </i>free<i>.</i>"
msgstr "<i>내가 해냈어. 지옥에서 십 년을 썩은 뒤에, 드디어 빌어먹을 </i>자유<i>를 얻었다고.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 2b10d5ce-2f03-252f-fe7a-1827d6955cf3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:2b10d5ce-2f03-252f-fe7a-1827d6955cf3
msgctxt "h23c55b28g9e8fg4331gbc78g28b18d802aef"
msgid ""
"*Inexplicable violent yearnings overwhelm all other thoughts. Who could you "
"possibly be, to be their vessel?*"
msgstr ""
"*설명할 수 없는 격렬한 갈망이 다른 모든 생각을 압도합니다. 당신은 그 갈망들을 담는 그릇이 되어, 어떤 존재가 될 수 있을까요?*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 2f926bfd-8c19-48bd-af57-966bd73a6260
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:2f926bfd-8c19-48bd-af57-966bd73a6260
msgctxt "hc4c98d86gcfaeg4355g88a9gc86587ce2b42"
msgid ""
"*You have to rid yourself of the tadpole. Shar herself is counting on you.*"
msgstr "*당신은 그 올챙이를 제거해야 합니다. 샤는 당신을 믿고 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 3354ed27-eae2-4f13-9f21-dd68443b65ae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:3354ed27-eae2-4f13-9f21-dd68443b65ae
msgctxt "h3d6f0d9bgd2e4g494egbcbbg67fb3c2e13b5"
msgid "*Resolve strengthened, you fall into a deep slumber.*"
msgstr "*의지가 강해지자, 당신은 깊은 잠에 빠집니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 335e2879-7a23-48fa-accf-6c46f7ebaf6a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:335e2879-7a23-48fa-accf-6c46f7ebaf6a
msgctxt "h0dd199efg99dfg4c56g8eddgddb771665fe1"
msgid ""
"*You will see those gates again. That promise sinks deep into your heart as "
"your eyes drift shut.*"
msgstr "*당신은 그 문을 다시 보게 될 것입니다. 눈을 감으면 그 약속이 가슴 깊숙이 가라앉습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 33ba04be-7a30-6ea1-edae-6a381bd207b1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:33ba04be-7a30-6ea1-edae-6a381bd207b1
msgctxt "h426238f2ga91cg448bg95f2gce96ca5de6f1"
msgid ""
"*When you try to think of a home your mind twists itself back to indulge in "
"the delights of the day.*"
msgstr "*고향을 생각하면 마음이 심란해지며 그 시절의 좋았던 날들을 회상하게 됩니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 3429b767-a652-7ec1-31a7-6b428806da6a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - DRUID(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:3429b767-a652-7ec1-31a7-6b428806da6a
msgctxt "h8c7a61dbgbf32g44e1gb57bg2eea204d87b2"
msgid ""
"*Nature provides some soft comforts, but your draw to it is only some faded "
"instinct.*"
msgstr "*자연은 부드러운 편안함을 제공하지만, 자연에 끌리는 것은 한낱 희미해진 본능일 뿐입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 36c41b26-b1f4-4941-bc8d-21aac70e79ad
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:36c41b26-b1f4-4941-bc8d-21aac70e79ad
msgctxt "h8f35682eg8b12g4275g89a9gcff8d00b1203"
msgid "*You smile, meditating on the flames that engulf his cruel face.*"
msgstr "*당신은 미소 짓습니다. 그의 잔인한 얼굴을 집어삼키는 불길을 생각하며.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 37fa3415-35ff-ab92-1394-6f5c9d496a8c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:37fa3415-35ff-ab92-1394-6f5c9d496a8c
msgctxt "h56bdb740gd302g4d84g9246gd962c685a532"
msgid "I'm never going back. Not for anything, not ever."
msgstr "난 절대 돌아가지 않아. 그 어떤 것을 위해서도, 절대."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 385ade18-09bc-4d97-b617-f114beb8a51f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:385ade18-09bc-4d97-b617-f114beb8a51f
msgctxt "h5bb72b7cge038g4f9cgb9b3gdf36dc8595e4"
msgid "*Only the sounds of the wilderness answer.*"
msgstr "*오직 야생의 소리만이 대답합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 38e019fc-be1c-4703-9bad-cf357d134399
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:38e019fc-be1c-4703-9bad-cf357d134399
msgctxt "ha132e369gfa67g474dga803g16ffe1630d8e"
msgid ""
"*Let it listen. You will dream of all the ways to make this power your own.*"
msgstr "*귀 기울여 보세요. 당신은 이 힘을 당신의 것으로 만드는 모든 방법을 꿈꾸게 될 것입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 398c9827-8f2e-4512-bffa-0e56647ad215
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:398c9827-8f2e-4512-bffa-0e56647ad215
msgctxt "hb2b2339bg3b31g4f32g8b9dg8f824fcd4a0f"
msgid ""
"<i>Think about your master. He'll be furious you didn't bring him dinner.</i>"
msgstr "<i>당신의 주인에 대해 생각해 본다. 그의 저녁을 차려주지 않았다고 화를 낼 것이다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 3a1d3667-c824-451f-499f-a60f40416dcd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:3a1d3667-c824-451f-499f-a60f40416dcd
msgctxt "hfec4dff5ge18ag48cdgac59ga6463c5f3c9b"
msgid ""
"*The worship of your God feels an ancient fool's errand you are only "
"following out of habit. When you call to the skies, there is no answer.*"
msgstr "*당신의 신에 대한 숭배는 습관적으로 따르는 고대 바보의 잔심부름처럼 느껴집니다. 하늘을 불러도 대답이 없습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 3b157209-d148-ae4a-3249-3ccc6b0555bb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:3b157209-d148-ae4a-3249-3ccc6b0555bb
msgctxt "hb131d11ag93b6g4aa4gb826ga50018966f2f"
msgid ""
"*As these images flood your mind, you fall soundly asleep like a babe in "
"arms.*"
msgstr "*이 상상들로 당신의 머릿속을 가득 채우는 동안, 당신은 품에 안긴 아기처럼 편안하게 잠들 수 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3d7a808a-56dc-410b-b77c-3292ec0e853b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Intelligence
#. DifficultyClass: 5
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_ELF(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_GALE(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(0) = False
#.      - BALDURIAN(0) = True
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(0) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:3d7a808a-56dc-410b-b77c-3292ec0e853b
msgctxt "h1c6bfa57g92a0g41caga5beg4ec849e29daf"
msgid "<i>Force the tadpole out of your mind. Think of home instead.</i>"
msgstr "<i>올챙이를 당신의 마음에서 끄집어낸다. 대신 고향에 대해 생각한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3d8e6f4d-aef7-48ec-adb2-c533f05cb704
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:3d8e6f4d-aef7-48ec-adb2-c533f05cb704
msgctxt "h839a78b8g86cfg45f6g8979gde75b9324491"
msgid "<i>Focus on the problem - who would know the most about this?</i>"
msgstr "<i>문제에 집중한다. 누가 이 문제에 대해 가장 잘 알고 있을까?</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 3f3145c2-a937-6a2a-0d3b-759057e6686a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:3f3145c2-a937-6a2a-0d3b-759057e6686a
msgctxt "h81707096g18fdg4a97gb8d3gb96c6a9c0643"
msgid "*You recall waking up hearing the pounding war drum of blood.*"
msgstr "*당신은 피가 튀는 전쟁 북소리를 들으며 잠에서 깨어난 기억이 납니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 401e4d13-2a4a-4dce-8f26-896efd8fdce0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - SELDARINEDROWELF(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:401e4d13-2a4a-4dce-8f26-896efd8fdce0
msgctxt "h83d38bfbg93e1g4e03ga4ceg566aa015a863"
msgid ""
"*The fire fades, a meaningless distraction. You hold the cup again, ignoring "
"the crack along its belly, and drink.*"
msgstr "*불은 꺼지고, 의미 없는 산만함만 남았습니다. 당신은 다시 잔을 들고, 컵의 금이 간 부분에도 아랑곳 하지 않고 들이킵니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 40f5ddc2-ed95-4b35-9311-c66ec8cf5af4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:40f5ddc2-ed95-4b35-9311-c66ec8cf5af4
msgctxt "h721bf4e7ged6bg4065gb063g6c116aecb1f2"
msgid "*Every day this abomination is in your head, you put others at risk.*"
msgstr "*이 역겨운 것이 당신의 머릿속에 존재하는 한, 다른 이들을 위험에 빠뜨리게 됩니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 4161b032-81f4-ba97-47eb-093e8235e1c0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - TIEFLING(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:4161b032-81f4-ba97-47eb-093e8235e1c0
msgctxt "h4934c757gc13bg4d2agb39eg5207f42098e3"
msgid ""
"*The magma of Hell's knowledge sometimes bubbles up in your brain's crater, "
"but never reaches a true fire.*"
msgstr "*지옥의 지식의 마그마는 때때로 뇌의 분화구에서 부글부글 끓지만, 진정한 불에는 이르지 못합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 416b1071-fae0-451e-8fc4-8201c8aaf11d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:416b1071-fae0-451e-8fc4-8201c8aaf11d
msgctxt "h1e741d48g12fag453fgb4a2g04ae068f119e"
msgid ""
"*Getting rid of the tadpole will mean returning to the darkness. Unless...*"
msgstr "*올챙이를 제거하는 것은 어둠으로 돌아가는 것을 의미합니다. 혹은...*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 432cd118-aa9e-4ade-a900-1e8ee9c04fed
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:432cd118-aa9e-4ade-a900-1e8ee9c04fed
msgctxt "head162d7gabb0g415agb79bg7257e84b3b4c"
msgid ""
"*Every night that passes is another night the monster inside you grows.*"
msgstr "*매일 밤이 지날수록 당신 안에 있는 괴물은 점점 커져 갑니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 43edf698-198f-3362-bc46-9331b968dfb3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:43edf698-198f-3362-bc46-9331b968dfb3
msgctxt "h59912c2bg2d72g4915g9c94g71e5f9fe7682"
msgid "*As you fall asleep, you are a shivering and shaking mess.*"
msgstr "*당신이 잠들자, 당신은 떨고 있고 몸을 가누지 못합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 44730c3e-8071-4989-a320-67dbcd727d41
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:44730c3e-8071-4989-a320-67dbcd727d41
msgctxt "h5328a558g3c4fg4943gb06cg0207b14cc180"
msgid "*And you will find it, no matter the cost.*"
msgstr "*그리고 당신은 치유법을 찾을 것입니다. 어떤 대가를 치르더라도.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 46d2ff5b-e1d8-4899-951e-a80b91e3d94d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:46d2ff5b-e1d8-4899-951e-a80b91e3d94d
msgctxt "h2eca2cf8g04e0g4f16g9bc4gd9096fd00435"
msgid ""
"*Despite everything, you relax into peaceful meditation, satisfied with all "
"that's happened. Perhaps you wouldn't sleep so well if you knew what was "
"coming.*"
msgstr ""
"*이 모든 것들에도 불구하고, 벌어진 모든 일에 만족하며 평화로운 명상을 취합니다.어떤 일이 생길지 알았다면 이렇게 편한 잠을 청할 수는 "
"없었을 겁니다. *"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 473e88e2-e176-4258-83e4-35232145311a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:473e88e2-e176-4258-83e4-35232145311a
msgctxt "h4056fbc8g898cg4470gb91ag31c9b4063f61"
msgid ""
"*The <i>ghaik</i> larva is curled up in your skull, no doubt pleased with "
"itself.*"
msgstr "*<i>게이크</i> 유충은 당신의 두개골 속에서 웅크리며, 분명히 스스로 만족하고 있을 것입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 477cff35-9406-40d9-98dc-e38ed3dc197a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:477cff35-9406-40d9-98dc-e38ed3dc197a
msgctxt "hc865b379gf8d1g4833gb937gf519c7bbc132"
msgid ""
"*Of course - you might already be a mind flayer by the time you return to "
"Cazador.*"
msgstr "*물론, 당신이 카사도어에게 돌아가는 순간 이미 마인드 플레이어가 되어 있을지도 모릅니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4886aaed-0659-de2a-7ea1-b0f7236488be
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:4886aaed-0659-de2a-7ea1-b0f7236488be
msgctxt "h9e463566g3315g4ba5g8b21g9cbf13793cf3"
msgid ""
"<i>Will you leave that alone? It was five years ago, and the scar's almost "
"healed.</i>"
msgstr "<i>이제 그건 좀 내버려 둬도 되지 않겠니? 5년 전 일이야, 그 상처는 거의 다 아물었다고.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 4b54cba7-953e-408b-b0ab-8bbacd117700
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:4b54cba7-953e-408b-b0ab-8bbacd117700
msgctxt "ha3774a37g34f5g4c42g87b6gb79f88a3bba9"
msgid "*Every abomination would be gutted and burned to ash.*"
msgstr "*모든 가증스러운 것들은 내장을 파내어 재가 되도록 태워버릴 것입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 4cd8c5f3-c04b-4f94-8147-6e79c7d0f0d0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:4cd8c5f3-c04b-4f94-8147-6e79c7d0f0d0
msgctxt "h90e7a61cg09eeg40d9ga820g1a82862523da"
msgid "*You think on the day. The sunshine. Being alive - more or less.*"
msgstr "*당신은 그 날을 생각합니다. 햇살. 살아있다는 것, 좋든 싫든.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 4d916e96-2c51-475c-9008-3af78b777de7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:4d916e96-2c51-475c-9008-3af78b777de7
msgctxt "habac8e7fg9098g4da6gbb37g2ced43b7658e"
msgid ""
"*It burns relentlessly, like a red dragon's breath scorching you from the "
"inside out.*"
msgstr "*레드 드래곤의 브레스처럼, 그것은 당신의 안팎을 태우며 끊임없이 타오릅니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4db44a4c-6a68-861f-c048-30e63708283e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:4db44a4c-6a68-861f-c048-30e63708283e
msgctxt "h50fce386g08b1g4d60gabd2gab21023aa0e9"
msgid "<i>How do I turn you off? Oh wait, I know.</i>"
msgstr "<i>어떻게 하면 널 꺼버릴 수 있을까? 아, 알았어.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 4dcc2dd3-b53b-69fb-4d15-a65eaa671f4e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - PALADIN(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:4dcc2dd3-b53b-69fb-4d15-a65eaa671f4e
msgctxt "h1d6bd5d0g6de6g4fa3g90ffg1782b0476025"
msgid ""
"*The oath you awoke with is some faded instinct. What does it even stand "
"for?*"
msgstr "*깨어난 맹세는 한낱 희미해진 본능일 뿐입니다. 그게 무엇을 의미하는걸까요?*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 4fb9e843-2838-4fdc-b78c-ac966a7b06ed
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ELF(0) = True
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(0) = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_WOODELF
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:4fb9e843-2838-4fdc-b78c-ac966a7b06ed
msgctxt "h05c63340g8171g4ec7g97cag8cb7312b0244"
msgid ""
"*The flames cool, dispelled as the image you know emerges again: nature's "
"sublime majesty.*"
msgstr "*화염이 식고 사라지면서, 당신이 알던 자연의 멋진 웅장함이 다시 드러납니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 4fb9e843-2838-4fdc-b78c-ac966a7b06ed
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ELF(0) = True
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(0) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:4fb9e843-2838-4fdc-b78c-ac966a7b06ed
msgctxt "h7e913047g07e0g4d58ga9d0gb43b86dea19d"
msgid ""
"*The flames cool, dispelled as the image you know emerges again: wild, "
"glorious magic.*"
msgstr "*화염이 식고 사라지면서, 당신이 알던 거칠고 영광스러운 마법이 다시 드러납니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 515d3f8c-4062-4a19-99ec-85b6a16e6ffd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:515d3f8c-4062-4a19-99ec-85b6a16e6ffd
msgctxt "h5f292569g2979g4530gbd0dg8bf35a338932"
msgid "*Rest eludes you as you stare at the wrong side of the stars.*"
msgstr "*별의 잘못된 방향을 응시하고 있어 마음의 안정이 되지 않습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 51b011f3-2a58-4144-084f-2b83c554e072
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:51b011f3-2a58-4144-084f-2b83c554e072
msgctxt "h809df94dged07g4e1fg9883g2f263e654722"
msgid ""
"*The lingering traces of your battle-intuitions are there. But the sly Urge "
"within calls you to use them for <i>harm</i>.*"
msgstr ""
"*당신에게 전투 본능의 흔적이 남아있습니다. 하지만 그 안에 있는 교활한 충동이 <i>해악</i>을 위해 그 본능을 사용하라고 당신을 "
"부추깁니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 526a6d8d-b47b-46ef-9df7-f68463bc7c63
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:526a6d8d-b47b-46ef-9df7-f68463bc7c63
msgctxt "h668a314bgc4eag41c5ga10cg75f802c1ebe5"
msgid ""
"*The worm in your head might not even have an appetite for undead meat.*"
msgstr "*당신 머리 속의 벌레는 심지어 언데드 고기에도 식욕이 없을 수도 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 52c64381-79e2-fdef-2d14-ceed6f669493
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_UNDERDARK(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:52c64381-79e2-fdef-2d14-ceed6f669493
msgctxt "h158bdc05g04b9g47b0gbfc1g32e4196b5116"
msgid ""
"*Images of the Underdark's famed torments sometimes flicker in your head, "
"but your place amongst your kin seems long-lost.*"
msgstr ""
"*언더다크의 악명 높은 고통의 관념이 가끔 머릿속을 스쳐 지나가지만, 동족들 사이에서 당신의 자리는 오래전부터 사라진 듯합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 52de886b-3e3d-4915-92d0-15b902682578
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:52de886b-3e3d-4915-92d0-15b902682578
msgctxt "h79eaebc0g25a6g4015gb9b9g3f804ce54a4b"
msgid "*Every cut is meditation. It reshapes the world to Vlaakith's will.*"
msgstr "*모든 일격을 명상합니다. 블라키스의 뜻에 따라 세상을 재구성합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 5468cbe2-91c7-4cfb-83d8-30aed4eb186a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:5468cbe2-91c7-4cfb-83d8-30aed4eb186a
msgctxt "h90250548ga4dbg487eg97f1gc4e55782f6d4"
msgid "*... you, and your parasite. You are tainted now. Imperfect.*"
msgstr "*... 당신, 그리고 당신의 기생충. 당신은 지금 더럽혀졌습니다. 불완전합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 553c395e-c7c9-abba-0499-c8315fe86766
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:553c395e-c7c9-abba-0499-c8315fe86766
msgctxt "ha9bc38a0g5ca6g448agaa3bgcfcabd9c09e9"
msgid "<i>A minor inconvenience. I'll find a way to get it removed.</i>"
msgstr "<i>사소한 불편함이군. 제거할 방법을 찾아봐야겠어.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 5592be44-d279-4506-beab-e59e581a85dd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:5592be44-d279-4506-beab-e59e581a85dd
msgctxt "hfd1a7516gcfbfg47ddg9bc0g77e1d3554c80"
msgid ""
"*Except all you can picture is citizens with their skulls splintering open, "
"tentacles sprouting from broken mouths.*"
msgstr "*당신이 상상할 수 있는 것은 두개골이 쪼개지고 입에서 촉수가 돋아나는 시민들의 모습 뿐입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 55d48145-347a-489a-b274-0576d5159199
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:55d48145-347a-489a-b274-0576d5159199
msgctxt "hf0c13992gcf78g4c1agaca8g4f1fcf877601"
msgid "*As precious as sleep, and the night's oblivion.*"
msgstr "*잠도 소중하고, 밤의 망각도 소중합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 574cdd36-225c-4d5c-91cd-bd5babac3557
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:574cdd36-225c-4d5c-91cd-bd5babac3557
msgctxt "hefe6e875g8a64g4cbfg9d5dgffe6589ca804"
msgid ""
"*Today? You'd been kidnapped by mind flayers, chased through Hell by "
"dragons, and thrown out of a burning ship.*"
msgstr "*오늘은? 당신은 마인드 플레이어에게 납치되고, 용에게 지옥을 넘나들며 쫓기고, 불타는 배에서 내던져졌습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5941f787-bacf-48e5-85dd-d95262ca0cad
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Intelligence
#. DifficultyClass: 5
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:5941f787-bacf-48e5-85dd-d95262ca0cad
msgctxt "h06e119f1g98bdg4d1agb177gbfefdcaf5f31"
msgid ""
"<i>Close your eyes. Relax. Imagine dragging your old master into the "
"sunlight.</i>"
msgstr "<i>눈을 감는다. 긴장을 푼다. 옛 주인을 햇빛 속으로 끌고 간다고 상상한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 5b8e1d9a-e829-4da9-b3aa-d1774fa421ec
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:5b8e1d9a-e829-4da9-b3aa-d1774fa421ec
msgctxt "hb4cd7f23g62d8g412fgbfe1g4140a6166db1"
msgid ""
"*You will take this chance to overcome and ascend. <i>Even the </"
"i>kith'raki<i> will bow to you</i>.*"
msgstr "*이 기회를 이용해 이겨내면 지위가 상승하게 될 것입니다. 키스락<i> 조차도 당신에게 허리를 굽힐 것입니다</i>.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5d88fb08-9dc9-41f9-bd23-5985b89249df
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:5d88fb08-9dc9-41f9-bd23-5985b89249df
msgctxt "hbb4c51d7ge89dg48b7g8f07gb9f75a62fd34"
msgid "<i>Right. Always. Right?</i>"
msgstr "<i>그래. 항상. 그렇지?</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5e14fe41-4538-ce3e-f5dc-605590b335e1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:5e14fe41-4538-ce3e-f5dc-605590b335e1
msgctxt "h25dbb2fag8b70g4c62g97a3g60314e037d97"
msgid "What if the gods aren't even real?"
msgstr "신이라는 것이 존재하지 않는다면?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5ebe0624-8c7c-9401-ecb0-df6a86903449
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:5ebe0624-8c7c-9401-ecb0-df6a86903449
msgctxt "h89bfea91g294dg4f88g914cgeb2ca0ba32b5"
msgid ""
"<i>So I take his chin in my hand and I lift his face to meet mine and his "
"face softens, like he's seeing me for the first time. 'Karlach...' he says, "
"straightening.</i>"
msgstr ""
"<i>그래서 그의 턱을 손으로 잡고 그의 얼굴을 내 얼굴에 가까이 하면 그의 얼굴이 부드러워지며, 마치 처음 보는 것처럼 나를 바라본다. "
"'칼라크...' 그가 똑바로 서며 말한다. </i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 614f061d-8f7e-4242-ac05-21da96574629
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:614f061d-8f7e-4242-ac05-21da96574629
msgctxt "h20d51318g7f76g4466g86bag1516a6a0ec7a"
msgid ""
"*'Suffering is not a curse, but a gift'. So Kith'rak Urlon had taught you.*"
msgstr "*'고통은 저주가 아니라 선물이다.' 이렇게 키스락 우를론이 당신에게 가르쳐 주었습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 61915386-3bda-45b9-af04-3c32a3f32f37
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:61915386-3bda-45b9-af04-3c32a3f32f37
msgctxt "hdcfa268fg337ag4b3eg8852g48113c28e383"
msgid "<i>Reach for the artefact, hidden among your belongings.</i>"
msgstr "<i>당신의 소지품들 사이에 숨겨진 아티팩트를 향해 손을 뻗는다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 61f1037f-aa3e-0c35-7ec8-a10d9f0f6044
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - MONK(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:61f1037f-aa3e-0c35-7ec8-a10d9f0f6044
msgctxt "h3e4edd5cgdf5cg40eeg9943gf77969e85749"
msgid "*For a monk, you do hyperventilate an awful lot.*"
msgstr "*몽크로서, 당신은 끔찍할 정도로 과호흡을 많이 하고 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 62a42ab5-58c7-4690-981a-8e50668c1621
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:62a42ab5-58c7-4690-981a-8e50668c1621
msgctxt "h4ba8ae76g80a5g4f64g86aeg1ed2ec98b930"
msgid ""
"*The rages in your heart arise as an ancient instinct - your skill in the "
"fray is but a long-lost muscle memory.*"
msgstr "*당신의 마음속에 있는 분노는 고대의 본능으로 일으키지만, 전투에서의 실력은 오래전에 잃어버린 근육의 기억에 불과합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 63861eb7-f91c-5229-e351-3ddbfd578ad9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - DWARF(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:63861eb7-f91c-5229-e351-3ddbfd578ad9
msgctxt "hfdd3e3abg235eg4540g8664g1cc02f5cd437"
msgid ""
"*The comforts of the mine, a simple life, somehow you doubt you led. They "
"don't call to you.*"
msgstr "*광산의 안락함, 단순한 삶, 왠지 자신이 살아왔던 삶이 의심스러워집니다. 사람들은 당신을 부르지 않습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 6407a50f-cee8-4d08-b6c0-f8d2852ecbd5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:6407a50f-cee8-4d08-b6c0-f8d2852ecbd5
msgctxt "h1069bea8g7550g402cgbbbeg7549b5141cb2"
msgid ""
"*You wonder if it could hear these thoughts - if it knows you're planning a "
"rebellion.*"
msgstr "*그 괴물이 이런 생각들을 들을 수 있는지 궁금합니다. 반란을 꾀하는 계획을 알아채는지 말입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 641fe669-26b9-4a76-85dc-b1e5ad5dd7a8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:641fe669-26b9-4a76-85dc-b1e5ad5dd7a8
msgctxt "h05dbd3e6ga93dg4494g900bg0b1579966c55"
msgid ""
"*As the trance stabilises, your breath deepens. Be it cure or cage, "
"something must be done about the tadpole.*"
msgstr "*명상 상태가 안정되자, 당신의 호흡이 깊어집니다. 치료든 가둬두는 방법이든, 올챙이에 대한 조치가 취해져야 합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 66422dbf-88b6-447a-869c-2a10e4289b60
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:66422dbf-88b6-447a-869c-2a10e4289b60
msgctxt "hd410c0e1g9e0cg4bffg9269g69bc8b9bb123"
msgid ""
"*You have to rid yourself of the tadpole. Then Shar will come to you - "
"honour you as you honour her.*"
msgstr "*당신은 올챙이를 제거해야 합니다. 그러면 샤가 당신에게 올 것입니다. 당신이 그녀를 존중하는 것처럼 당신을 존중할 것입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 66e27e6f-d6c4-4134-824b-e2da055a98ad
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:66e27e6f-d6c4-4134-824b-e2da055a98ad
msgctxt "h8643d7bagca46g4b33ga343g4663a33550ef"
msgid ""
"*You wonder if your ability to walk in the sun is a side effect of the "
"tadpole the mind flayer put in your eye. It must be?*"
msgstr "*당신이 햇볕 아래서 걸을 수 있게 된게 마인드 플레이어가 눈에 넣은 올챙이의 부작용일 거라 의심합니다. 정말 그럴까요?*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 676804b9-441a-41e7-4b04-c16b47f12def
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:676804b9-441a-41e7-4b04-c16b47f12def
msgctxt "h95ec85fbg1716g4374gb6d0g3bbcbfd95146"
msgid "<i>Good riddance.</i>"
msgstr "<i>잘가라.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 688af773-2d5b-28c2-1c81-1c34a6809f8f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - WIZARD(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:688af773-2d5b-28c2-1c81-1c34a6809f8f
msgctxt "ha8f22047g79f6g49faga363gab22daa77c19"
msgid ""
"*All your education, your knack for your spells is only present as some "
"distant instinct.*"
msgstr "*당신이 배웠던 모든 것, 주문에 대한 재능은 그저 아득한 본능으로만 존재할 뿐입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6b2b816d-1cc2-f822-69ed-5013502457b7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:6b2b816d-1cc2-f822-69ed-5013502457b7
msgctxt "h1b418688g6d7eg4d3dg9c03ga2674365e1a9"
msgid ""
"<i>Can't wait to eat some roasted chicken. Stand on a sea cliff. Touch "
"someone - oh gods! Touch!</i>"
msgstr "<i>빨리 구운 닭고기를 먹고 싶다. 바닷가 절벽에 서고 싶다. 누군가를 만지고 싶다 - 오 신이시여! 만져!</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 6ba8bf8c-38c4-02e9-04fc-045282b9c490
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:6ba8bf8c-38c4-02e9-04fc-045282b9c490
msgctxt "he40c2dfdg2d45g42ceg9d36g94a2da84d9f3"
msgid ""
"*Your mission should be your focus: finding a githyanki crèche, using a "
"<i>zaith'isk</i> device to silence the <i>ghaik</i> parasite.*"
msgstr ""
"*당신의 임무에 집중해야 합니다. 기스양키의 양성소를 찾고, <i>제이트이스크</i> 장치를 사용해 기생충을 침묵시키는 것입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 6bd0d59f-250e-4dbb-8cb1-aef926aeeddc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:6bd0d59f-250e-4dbb-8cb1-aef926aeeddc
msgctxt "hbc71ed23g220eg4427gb619gd2e1120fd6f8"
msgid ""
"*You drive away all fears, and give yourself to the darkness. A deep sleep "
"soon follows.*"
msgstr "*당신은 모든 두려움을 몰아내고, 어둠에 몸을 맡깁니다. 곧 깊은 잠이 찾아옵니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 6c5188c6-7a06-eaea-41fe-48011c3f604e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - GITHYANKI(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:6c5188c6-7a06-eaea-41fe-48011c3f604e
msgctxt "hb6e12703g1b81g49abgad71g0effa3c56c39"
msgid ""
"*You have been fighting since birth, such as Vlaakith preaches, but you feel "
"little connection to any crèche. Barely a call to your queen.*"
msgstr ""
"*블라키스의 가르침에 따라 태어날 때부터 싸움을 해왔지만, 어떤 양성소와도 연결고리를 거의 느끼지 못합니다. 여왕의 부름 또한 거의 "
"없습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6daf8568-0f70-0e9a-8b6c-81f4e43dcb59
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:6daf8568-0f70-0e9a-8b6c-81f4e43dcb59
msgctxt "h923415ebgce22g4028g81d7g64b231a360d0"
msgid ""
"<i>Sweet silver-tongued halfling perched on my lap - I'll have one hand up "
"her skirt, she'll have one down my top, when there's a knock at the door.</i>"
msgstr ""
"<i>귀여운 은색 혀를 가진 하플링이 내 무릎 위에 앉아 있다. 문을 두드리는 소리가 들릴 때, 내 한 손은 그녀의 치마위에 있을 테고, "
"그녀의 손은 내 상의 아래에 있을 테지.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6e7ada31-803b-4085-9dea-7ff29d5c3c5a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Constitution
#. DifficultyClass: 5
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ELF(0) = True
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(0) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:6e7ada31-803b-4085-9dea-7ff29d5c3c5a
msgctxt "hb85c3c1ege582g4115g93ecg5fb6c9402297"
msgid "<i>Refuse to break. Anything can be endured in the trance.</i>"
msgstr "<i>명상이 깨지는 걸 거부한다. 이 명상 속에서는 무엇이든 견딜 수 있다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 6fe58881-0742-2902-b81b-ad1a40f4ee64
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_DarkUrge_State_HackedGale = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:6fe58881-0742-2902-b81b-ad1a40f4ee64
msgctxt "h6059a80ega09fg4d5fg89dag69ab76cf8f23"
msgid "*The waggling stump you left of that wizard's arm...*"
msgstr "*그 위저드의 팔이 떨어져 나가고 남은 흔들리는 몸통...*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 6fe663fb-b186-efe2-d89a-5dee52a56a12
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:6fe663fb-b186-efe2-d89a-5dee52a56a12
msgctxt "h05ae356cg4411g46d1gb652ga89798413814"
msgid "*There are many, many more kills ahead of you. That is you. A killer.*"
msgstr "*당신 앞에는 수많은 죽음이 기다리고 있습니다. 바로 당신입니다. 살인자.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 70ae3f2d-6439-44ec-a608-b785302f7883
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:70ae3f2d-6439-44ec-a608-b785302f7883
msgctxt "h9b5b0027gc0c9g4cf7g8798ga61007734423"
msgid "*And you felt the sun on your skin...*"
msgstr "*게다가 당신의 피부위로 태양이 느껴집니다...*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7217bb70-6895-4460-8a62-08cd3af2a9fe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:7217bb70-6895-4460-8a62-08cd3af2a9fe
msgctxt "h5104f473g087ag4b83g9bb6g2ef038cb5911"
msgid "<i>Shut your eyes and silently thank Shar for the night's beauty.</i>"
msgstr "<i>눈을 감고 밤의 아름다움에 대해 조용히 샤에게 감사한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 7273eaaf-237f-4e1e-aee6-57eda74d4b84
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_DUERGARDWARF
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:7273eaaf-237f-4e1e-aee6-57eda74d4b84
msgctxt "h70e56b4fg9c51g4a5fg94a9g6d059f8fe239"
msgid ""
"*Your people threw off the mind flayer's shackles before. Like your "
"ancestors, you would endure.*"
msgstr "*당신의 동족들은 예전에 마인드 플레이어의 족쇄에서 벗어난 적이 있습니다. 당신의 조상들처럼, 당신도 견뎌낼 것입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 7273eaaf-237f-4e1e-aee6-57eda74d4b84
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_DEEPGNOME
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:7273eaaf-237f-4e1e-aee6-57eda74d4b84
msgctxt "h16787eb3ged7ag4b14gb581gd684abf3db74"
msgid ""
"*Your people have survived the drow, the duergar, and every monster the "
"Underdark has to offer. A mind flayer is nothing.*"
msgstr ""
"*당신의 동족들은 드로우, 듀에르가, 그리고 언더다크에서 튀어나온 모든 괴물들에게로부터 살아남았습니다. 마인드 플레이어는 아무것도 "
"아닙니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 730eeae2-3d83-4096-a55c-e30a6daadf19
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:730eeae2-3d83-4096-a55c-e30a6daadf19
msgctxt "he97384e3g4069g4c4ag8395g2dd116c0bccc"
msgid "*Their empty, alien eyes haunt you through a night of fitful sleep.*"
msgstr "*그들의 공허하고 이질적인 눈이 당신을 괴롭히며 밤새 잠을 설치게 합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 73dd717c-5702-4a86-8d8a-432b5668a711
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:73dd717c-5702-4a86-8d8a-432b5668a711
msgctxt "hd1b4229ag4b91g4d36gb791gd7ef54d327fe"
msgid ""
"*Hell surrounds you, flames licking at your body. The tadpole in your head "
"convulses.*"
msgstr "*지옥이 당신을 둘러싸고, 불길이 몸을 핥습니다. 머릿속 올챙이가 경련을 일으킵니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 74156afe-c2ed-43c0-83e5-045ea564d434
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:74156afe-c2ed-43c0-83e5-045ea564d434
msgctxt "h0615d336g1991g4663ga480gc5746b1674d6"
msgid ""
"*You have to get rid of it. You have to survive. You are the only one left "
"to ensure Shar's glory.*"
msgstr "*당신은 그것을 제거해야 합니다. 살아남아야 합니다. 당신은 샤의 영광을 지킬 수 있는 유일한 사람입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 75157733-7e2b-4d2e-80be-5357f69ca739
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 5
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_ELF(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_GALE(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(0) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:75157733-7e2b-4d2e-80be-5357f69ca739
msgctxt "h381fd0e1g1bdbg43f6gb233g07e9a57c793e"
msgid ""
"<i>The tadpole influences you. Perhaps you might influence it in "
"return...</i>"
msgstr "<i>올챙이가 당신에게 영향을 준다. 반대로 당신도 올챙이에 영향을 줄 수 있을지도...</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7657e718-c7e9-4e0e-a6bb-3bc8386eeba2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DROWELF(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:7657e718-c7e9-4e0e-a6bb-3bc8386eeba2
msgctxt "hdfbb5bbagba77g465bg97a9gb75303c40a17"
msgid "<i>Let the pain claim you.</i>"
msgstr "<i>고통이 오도록 둔다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 76d5a6a5-e5fe-1668-911c-bd7e47e5f9f5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:76d5a6a5-e5fe-1668-911c-bd7e47e5f9f5
msgctxt "ha4311e44g9e2dg486ag8366gfd9ebc865fd8"
msgid ""
"<i>Liza nods. I smile. I hoist her into my arms, use my free arm to pull "
"Logus in closer. I kiss his neck, slowly, as my face suddenly blows out and "
"my six writhing tentacles latch around his - OH GODS!</i>"
msgstr ""
"<i>리자가 고개를 끄덕인다. 나는 미소 짓는다. 그녀를 내 팔쪽으로 들어올리고, 나머지 팔로 로거스를 끌어 당겨 가까이 한다. 그의 "
"목에 키스하고, 천천히, 갑자기 내 얼굴이 사라지고 여섯 개의 꿈틀거리는 촉수가 그의 - 오 맙소사!</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 77049770-5edc-4190-8157-5a02eab396ee
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ELF(0) = True
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(0) = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_WOODELF
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:77049770-5edc-4190-8157-5a02eab396ee
msgctxt "h6587b795gea07g4f7dgaaa7g22a0ccbd475a"
msgid ""
"*The flames fall away, a mere illusion. You are one with the forest again, "
"sitting at peace.*"
msgstr "*불길은 사라지고, 그저 환상에 불과했습니다. 당신은 다시 숲과 하나가 되어, 평화롭게 앉아 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 77049770-5edc-4190-8157-5a02eab396ee
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ELF(0) = True
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(0) = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_HIGHELF
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:77049770-5edc-4190-8157-5a02eab396ee
msgctxt "he379cf90g9a1ag4905g976eg1e369f15e2af"
msgid ""
"*The flames fall away, a mere illusion. You are one with the Feywild again, "
"agleam in revelry.*"
msgstr "*불길은 사라지고, 그저 환상에 불과했습니다. 당신은 다시 페이와일드와 하나가 되어 환희에 젖어 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 7767ae17-9969-4a97-bd2a-2626953a13af
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:7767ae17-9969-4a97-bd2a-2626953a13af
msgctxt "hedcf1148g0009g458cgb97egfa981e0b85b3"
msgid ""
"*Without a cure, you cannot restore your honour before your queen, Vlaakith.*"
msgstr "*치유되지 않는다면, 당신의 여왕, 블라키스 앞에서 명예를 회복할 수 없습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 7768fec6-2bef-42fb-9bf8-a9db484ee4ea
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:7768fec6-2bef-42fb-9bf8-a9db484ee4ea
msgctxt "hd5a561f0g0346g428bg9de7gb6cff706e77a"
msgid ""
"*You try to focus, but all you can see are the menacing eyes of a mind "
"flayer.*"
msgstr "*집중하려고 하지만, 보이는 것은 마인드 플레이어의 위협적인 눈빛뿐입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 78192e88-64f7-41dd-9487-fce16b3ff2e0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:78192e88-64f7-41dd-9487-fce16b3ff2e0
msgctxt "h1a19940fgeff6g4a36gb58fg638c7417f753"
msgid ""
"*Fire spills across your thoughts: dragon's breath. The tadpole slithers, "
"twisting deeper into your skull.*"
msgstr "*불꽃이 당신의 머리속을 덮칩니다. 드래곤의 브레스. 올챙이가 두개골 깊숙이 비틀어지며 미끄러지듯 움직입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7c69578c-9a09-0b65-be85-db871eb6d333
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:7c69578c-9a09-0b65-be85-db871eb6d333
msgctxt "h36a6da61gc421g4dbag9d5bg449b1ccf81ee"
msgid "<i>The answer is bleak: you were once someone awful.</i>"
msgstr "<i>답은 암울하다. 당신은 한때 끔찍한 존재였다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7df70129-0e7f-bd5d-5d08-7191cd2cdc10
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:7df70129-0e7f-bd5d-5d08-7191cd2cdc10
msgctxt "hdbe9d3b6g3159g4a07gb01bg2e152f55cd64"
msgid ""
"Better not to go there. Plenty of time to fantasise about the future once "
"I'm sure I've <i>got </i>a future."
msgstr "거기에는 가지 않는 편이 좋겠어. 내 미래가 <i>확실해졌을 때</i> 미래에 대해 상상할 시간이 충분히 있을 테니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7fac3941-7819-fec8-5152-8e8972ab18d7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:7fac3941-7819-fec8-5152-8e8972ab18d7
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "O-ho yes. Let's paint a picture. A halfing, a barbarian, and Karlach..."
msgctxt "h7e7f1028gc3e7g4236g9f00gecfad92b7cd2"
msgid ""
"O-ho yes. Let's paint a picture. A halfling, a barbarian, and Karlach..."
msgstr "오-호 그래. 그림을 그려보자. 하플링, 바바리안, 그리고 칼라크..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 802ab2e3-675c-4344-ab48-ff13d51baeae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:802ab2e3-675c-4344-ab48-ff13d51baeae
msgctxt "h6570bc4fgf2ecg4ed1g8601gbb0d18f7b3b3"
msgid ""
"*You can almost feel its thick skull in your grasp, almost smell its silver "
"blood clogging the air.*"
msgstr "*당신은 그의 두툼한 두개골이 손에 잡힐 듯하고, 은빛 피가 공기를 가득 채우는 냄새가 느껴질 정도입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 80cb7386-c411-4c78-aa75-7955a3c4a21e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:80cb7386-c411-4c78-aa75-7955a3c4a21e
msgctxt "h0fe70f8agc6f9g4b73gab07gf3b80d640ec4"
msgid ""
"*Baldur's Gate is close to your master's coven, but also home to amazing "
"scholars. Still, that's a problem for the morning.*"
msgstr ""
"*발더스 게이트는 당신 주인의 소굴과 가까울 뿐만 아니라, 대단한 학자들의 고향이기도 합니다. 하지만, 그건 나중의 문제입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 815c8d9c-476d-2e5f-cdee-41421698b56b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - ROGUE(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:815c8d9c-476d-2e5f-cdee-41421698b56b
msgctxt "habb73514g4ac4g4f78g8563g41cd7c3836be"
msgid ""
"*A friend of daggers all your skills match those of a hot-blooded killer.*"
msgstr "*단검의 친구, 당신의 모든 기술이 대담한 살인마의 그것과 일치합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 829fd41a-647a-fe77-5e53-a1088e333962
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:829fd41a-647a-fe77-5e53-a1088e333962
msgctxt "he50bbd50g896cg456fgb501g5904dfa4684d"
msgid "*Once. But now?*"
msgstr "*한때. 그러면 지금은?*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 84f5fcfc-822b-4caf-ac2b-34f24116b331
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:84f5fcfc-822b-4caf-ac2b-34f24116b331
msgctxt "haf39eadege6f6g4715g8d76ga69f26868831"
msgid ""
"*You could try getting rid of the tadpole, but that probably means returning "
"to the darkness. Unless...*"
msgstr "*당신은 올챙이를 제거할 수도 있지만, 그것은 아마도 어둠으로 돌아가는 것을 의미할 것입니다. 혹은...*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 86ef4b44-49a6-40ac-a5d8-71226bd02bce
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:86ef4b44-49a6-40ac-a5d8-71226bd02bce
msgctxt "haa91423ege563g4ad8g8132g3500322ada8e"
msgid ""
"*The flames cool, dispelled as the image you know emerges again: blood and "
"darkness.*"
msgstr "*화염이 식고 사라지면서, 당신이 알던 피와 어둠이 다시 드러납니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8896f5c1-ac30-413a-9cae-caaada3f62d6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:8896f5c1-ac30-413a-9cae-caaada3f62d6
msgctxt "hd709a95bg0966g4845gbca4ge1cc997a740a"
msgid "<i>Let your thoughts turn to the crash.</i>"
msgstr "<i>그 불시착 했을 때로 생각을 돌려 본다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 8a97d467-9536-475c-a97e-2ac93a03a6b1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:8a97d467-9536-475c-a97e-2ac93a03a6b1
msgctxt "h93d1369cge59eg4ec4g9aadgc28bc81aeb58"
msgid "*Your thoughts turn to courage; a deep sleep soon follows.*"
msgstr "*당신의 생각은 용기로 바뀌고 곧 깊은 잠이 찾아옵니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8aaad4e7-e79d-e0cf-c666-db4dcf937621
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:8aaad4e7-e79d-e0cf-c666-db4dcf937621
msgctxt "h4626c9feg13dfg4f79ga07dg7cbef0c62d34"
msgid "Isn't it?"
msgstr "그렇지 않아?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 8bd84092-9b81-40b6-9fd0-3e6def5299d6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:8bd84092-9b81-40b6-9fd0-3e6def5299d6
msgctxt "h022e00eeg2186g4323ga6a0g47278c924fcb"
msgid "*Without answers, you lay haunted for the rest of the night.*"
msgstr "*대답을 찾지 못한채, 당신은 밤새 괴로워 합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8ce9cbe6-2725-cd04-f86f-f0b6f171fd62
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:8ce9cbe6-2725-cd04-f86f-f0b6f171fd62
msgctxt "h68aed2d9g1ad7g4142g81a9ge2794f6a4039"
msgid "<i>Right.</i>"
msgstr "<i>그래.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 8d8cdb09-d76d-4dc5-ad2d-1671f4abed69
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:8d8cdb09-d76d-4dc5-ad2d-1671f4abed69
msgctxt "h6ffd8906gc200g452fg85cfgab6017c833a3"
msgid ""
"*... all nothing compared to what came before. Compared to the tadpole.*"
msgstr "*... 이전에 있었던 일과 비교하면 아무것도 아닙니다. 올챙이와 비교하면 아무것도 아닙니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 8d8f12aa-fba2-4750-a4c2-6b2d038432d2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:8d8f12aa-fba2-4750-a4c2-6b2d038432d2
msgctxt "hed8a5005g2f44g48afgb35cg99eb843eefd8"
msgid "*So many brothers and sisters sacrificed for it. Only you remain.*"
msgstr "*수많은 형제자매들이 희생했습니다. 오직 당신만 남았습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8e5efd4f-e975-a794-03b3-852244deef67
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:8e5efd4f-e975-a794-03b3-852244deef67
msgctxt "h4ee97681gd124g4673gac0fg585b721f990b"
msgid "OH GODS!"
msgstr "오 신이시여!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8f1b6855-2c2c-e0fd-f693-b2882c777362
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:8f1b6855-2c2c-e0fd-f693-b2882c777362
msgctxt "h2dad238bgfc01g4336g8067g7012a325cbf9"
msgid "It is."
msgstr "그럴 때야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 90d96ec8-088a-46c7-af01-2e92a0c4dc2e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:90d96ec8-088a-46c7-af01-2e92a0c4dc2e
msgctxt "h08abda17gebe3g482ag9fd6gc34770e47955"
msgid "*As you writhe with sickly dreams, a deep dread floods you.*"
msgstr "*당신이 병든 꿈 속에서 몸부림칠 때, 깊은 두려움이 드리웁니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 91e10eff-9ad2-c05e-c071-f6ba9eda3074
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - a236eddc-e296-e38a-cf0c-2e95802c45e3_CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA_KarlachInsightPass = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:91e10eff-9ad2-c05e-c071-f6ba9eda3074
msgctxt "h4f9ba1b2g8a19g450eg89b2g8a77cb22d8e1"
msgid "I'll figure something out. I always do."
msgstr "분명 방법을 찾을 거야. 난 항상 그랬어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 92b68be8-726f-4782-a7d5-66f206cf6ea1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ELF(0) = True
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(0) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:92b68be8-726f-4782-a7d5-66f206cf6ea1
msgctxt "he36fb5f9ge20cg4049g9d27g46a0cf424ff4"
msgid ""
"*Every night that passes is another night the monster inside you grows.*"
msgstr "*매일 밤이 지날수록 당신 안에 있는 괴물은 점점 커져 갑니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 93aec55e-a9a4-0135-c924-31e145d64c85
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:93aec55e-a9a4-0135-c924-31e145d64c85
msgctxt "h57234efbg62f7g4852gb129g8623e97ef1fc"
msgid ""
"<i>Logus saunters over to me and...Liza. We startle. Didn't know he'd be "
"back so soon. 'Let's move this to the bedroom, he grumbles.' </i>"
msgstr ""
"<i>로거스가 어슬렁 거리며 걸어와, 나와... 리자쪽으로. 우리는 깜짝 놀란다. 그가 이렇게 빨리 돌아올 줄은 몰랐다. '침실로 "
"옮기자, 그가 투덜거린다.' </i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 93e033ca-37c2-4d27-84fd-4b2f0949d98c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:93e033ca-37c2-4d27-84fd-4b2f0949d98c
msgctxt "h7feebf96gc6fag4597gb6f0g3678d7ef0f6b"
msgid "*No exercise had prepared you for such extraordinary circumstances.*"
msgstr "*이런 특별한 상황에 대비한 훈련은 없었습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 96352dcc-dc77-5f13-542e-27e53bfc0392
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:96352dcc-dc77-5f13-542e-27e53bfc0392
msgctxt "h8a29465fg5c48g49cbgab9dg9c90a8c5f8fb"
msgid ""
"<i>Don't you have enough to worry about? Go to sleep for fuck's sake.</i>"
msgstr "<i>걱정할 게 그렇게 없나? 지랄말고 잠이나 자.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 96394f21-42e1-41ce-b9f8-183f60a7ca9e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_ELF(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_GALE(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(0) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:96394f21-42e1-41ce-b9f8-183f60a7ca9e
msgctxt "h76471a9bge8d9g41e0g9127g4773675aa54d"
msgid "<i>Focus. Finding a cure is all that matters.</i>"
msgstr "<i>집중한다. 치유법을 찾는 것이 중요하다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 97643608-0ecf-b309-803c-4a0552bed3fa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:97643608-0ecf-b309-803c-4a0552bed3fa
msgctxt "h47926209gc63cg47f0ga18ega935d9ec98b7"
msgid "*It must have been a very long time since you were among your kind.*"
msgstr "*당신이 동족들과 함께한 지 정말 오래된 것 같습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 97baeed1-ce79-39f1-f1cc-47802633b173
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - FIGHTER(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:97baeed1-ce79-39f1-f1cc-47802633b173
msgctxt "h33840c17g5d9dg4480g8820g0bce3629368b"
msgid ""
"*Though you know how to call to order, hold a line and wield a blade, you "
"are doing so out of habit and a forgotten instinct.*"
msgstr "*당신은 명령을 내리고 전열을 가다듬고, 칼을 휘두르는 방법을 알고 있지만, 습관과 잊힌 본능에 따라 행동하는 것입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 99883216-59ed-4d1a-8a2b-25b18ffdd1e2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:99883216-59ed-4d1a-8a2b-25b18ffdd1e2
msgctxt "he9ef6d4cg0e95g4f92gbc59gd43e765af241"
msgid ""
"*... you and the vile creature inside you. The mere thought of it makes you "
"shiver.*"
msgstr "*... 당신과 당신 안에 있는 역겨운 생명체. 생각만 해도 소름이 끼칩니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 99c1b7d4-32c6-738b-a365-1e15571f5abb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:99c1b7d4-32c6-738b-a365-1e15571f5abb
msgctxt "h165d0025g4207g4374g8a82gdb1ede977ff1"
msgid "<i>Swear to resist these sick Urges, whatever the cost.</i>"
msgstr "<i>이 역겨운 충동에 저항하겠다고 맹세한다. 그 대가가 무엇이든.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 9b33e759-327c-4e4d-80fe-92bbcb377151
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:9b33e759-327c-4e4d-80fe-92bbcb377151
msgctxt "h98f9d0e9gf94bg400dg9618gff3eb4cbd898"
msgid "*Tomorrow, you will fight harder than ever before.*"
msgstr "*내일은, 그 어느 때보다도 더 열심히 싸울 것입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 9c4405d5-6c5a-40f3-b912-3d2dd7f210c9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:9c4405d5-6c5a-40f3-b912-3d2dd7f210c9
msgctxt "h3a77e9d3g40b0g47a6g82bag5fc0b55596e6"
msgid ""
"*Your head is about to burst. The memory consumes your mind, corrupting the "
"trance.*"
msgstr "*당신의 머리가 터질 것 같습니다. 기억이 당신의 정신을 좀먹으며, 명상 상태를 망칩니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 9d1483f5-32ae-4c81-9b92-fa2da425f548
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:9d1483f5-32ae-4c81-9b92-fa2da425f548
msgctxt "h59b1c986gd195g4598gadcagb3dcc8d4a057"
msgid ""
"*How were you caught off-guard on the nautiloid? What was the crucial "
"mistake?*"
msgstr "*당신은 어떻게 해서 노틸로이드에서 방심하게 되었습니까? 결정적인 실수는 무엇이었습니까?*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 9d40802c-59e8-83d8-7ccb-653de8091caa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:9d40802c-59e8-83d8-7ccb-653de8091caa
msgctxt "hb25448bcgc1d6g4065gbddfg8d5ec4cba97e"
msgid ""
"*Your body feels aroused imagining a broken twisted neck, and a thrill "
"thinking of a trailing intestine.*"
msgstr "*목이 뒤틀려 부러지는 것을 상상하면 몸이 흥분하고, 길게 뽑아낸 창자를 생각하면 스릴을 느낍니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 9de11e6d-4e5c-4508-84db-4e70f97fb4f5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:9de11e6d-4e5c-4508-84db-4e70f97fb4f5
msgctxt "h00fed47cg37f7g4978gb591g8b52765e0906"
msgid ""
"*The thought is punished by a spike of pain driven right between your eyes.*"
msgstr "*그 생각은 눈 사이를 찌르는 듯한 통증으로 이어집니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a1abd276-9066-4eec-babe-d6ea574ca3a0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_ELF(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_GALE(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(0) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:a1abd276-9066-4eec-babe-d6ea574ca3a0
msgctxt "hbcf1f4b0g8c03g4e9dg8613gacb1b4e93507"
msgid ""
"<i>You have to learn to control the tadpole. You sense it can grant you "
"powers.</i>"
msgstr "<i>올챙이를 통제하는 법을 배워야 한다. 그게 당신에게 힘을 부여할 수 있을 거라 느껴진다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = a2ebd3e1-7da0-4ace-85f7-527c7fe6f0ba
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:a2ebd3e1-7da0-4ace-85f7-527c7fe6f0ba
msgctxt "h554a0301ga5efg4dd3gb9bdgb34fe5b60008"
msgid ""
"*Yet the tadpole is in the dark too. Dozens of them, crawling towards you as "
"a mind flayer held your skull in its psionic grip.*"
msgstr ""
"*하지만 올챙이도 어둠 속에 있습니다. 마인드 플레이어가 사이오닉 그립으로 당신의 두개골을 움켜쥔 채, 수십 마리의 올챙이가 당신을 향해 "
"기어갑니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = a3347529-ac70-4509-9b32-4e4a86b2a9e0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:a3347529-ac70-4509-9b32-4e4a86b2a9e0
msgctxt "h3c34de44gc334g4971g923egc23417cb3a38"
msgid "*It is a minor victory, but enough to soothe you to sleep.*"
msgstr "*별 것 아닌 성취지만, 충분히 진정되어 잠들 수 있을 정도입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = a5fbad83-ee2f-4e41-a565-eb93b6814c1c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:a5fbad83-ee2f-4e41-a565-eb93b6814c1c
msgctxt "haf02a505gf70dg4b18g8e1bg2e047ce64649"
msgid ""
"*You hear only your own thoughts. Shar's presence won't come to you - why?*"
msgstr "*당신은 스스로의 생각밖에 들리지 않습니다. 샤의 존재가 당신에게 다가오지 않습니다. 어째서?*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a77b16db-7303-4502-a3a2-285bb41be02d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Intelligence
#. DifficultyClass: 5
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_UNDERDARK(0) = True
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_ELF(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_GALE(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(0) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:a77b16db-7303-4502-a3a2-285bb41be02d
msgctxt "h415aea90g5b99g495bgae50gb54f1280c3b7"
msgid "<i>Force the tadpole out of your mind. Think of home instead.</i>"
msgstr "<i>올챙이를 당신의 마음에서 끄집어낸다. 대신 고향에 대해 생각한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = a8810095-962d-4fac-80f1-0f5e0920db46
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ELF(0) = True
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(0) = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_WOODELF
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:a8810095-962d-4fac-80f1-0f5e0920db46
msgctxt "h8d0c252bg37a3g4e87gb62dgdd8a844da6f5"
msgid ""
"*You recall a wild wood, touched only by the <i>Tel'Quessir</i>. The world "
"around you breathes and blossoms.*"
msgstr "*당신은 <i>텔퀘시에</i>의 손길만이 닿았던 야생의 숲을 기억해 냅니다. 당신 주변의 세계는 숨을 쉬고 꽃을 피웁니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = a8810095-962d-4fac-80f1-0f5e0920db46
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ELF(0) = True
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(0) = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_HIGHELF
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:a8810095-962d-4fac-80f1-0f5e0920db46
msgctxt "h739c27ccg68d4g4370g8ed5g6901cb4a74b3"
msgid ""
"*You picture the Feywild in its colourful glory, the joy of all seasons "
"flourishing at once.*"
msgstr "*당신은 페이와일드의 화려한 장관을 상상합니다. 모든 계절의 기쁨이 한꺼번에 번성하는 모습을요.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a882d8c0-9ae7-93fd-520b-50d2c00f542f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:a882d8c0-9ae7-93fd-520b-50d2c00f542f
msgctxt "hc3bb15c3g9d29g4152gb31eg8624b149b4ef"
msgid "<i>Wonder - why are these memories so beautiful?</i>"
msgstr "<i>궁금하다. 왜 이 기억들은 이토록 아름다운 걸까?</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = a8cc1905-3311-4f0c-82c2-0bebe07b30ac
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:a8cc1905-3311-4f0c-82c2-0bebe07b30ac
msgctxt "h9d15f761g2dccg4f7eg8512g53d1a658b0d2"
msgid ""
"*There is no peace in that truth, only an unease that steals away any chance "
"of sleep.*"
msgstr "*그 진실에는 평안이 없고, 잠잘 기회를 앗아가는 불안만 있을 뿐입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a9ca3d75-84f2-489c-9a5f-c8f4133b391d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Constitution
#. DifficultyClass: 5
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:a9ca3d75-84f2-489c-9a5f-c8f4133b391d
msgctxt "h633ee3e2gdc25g4198ga58bgca7a0870be89"
msgid "<i>Refuse to break. Anything can be endured in the trance.</i>"
msgstr "<i>명상이 깨지는 걸 거부한다. 이 명상 속에서는 무엇이든 견딜 수 있다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = aa65fb7f-32a5-43cb-9f19-30c73d304637
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:aa65fb7f-32a5-43cb-9f19-30c73d304637
msgctxt "hd4c797a5g3698g4760g85efgac7258029694"
msgid ""
"*You picture a silver blade cleaving through <i>ghaik</i> and their thralls, "
"one after another.*"
msgstr "*당신은 <i>게이크</i>와 그들의 하수인들을 은검으로 썰어 버리는 상상을 합니다. 하나씩, 하나씩.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = aa81469d-98fa-4efa-8198-248a169ca659
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:aa81469d-98fa-4efa-8198-248a169ca659
msgctxt "h17552028g293dg40cfg8dfcg44cd3bb2093f"
msgid ""
"*You offer the head to Vlaakith, your queen. She hands you a sword of silver "
"in return.*"
msgstr "*당신의 여왕 블라키스에게 머리를 바칩니다. 그녀는 당신에게 은검을 보답으로 줍니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = ab66a4d5-f33c-302d-2613-6876d3829148
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_DarkUrge_TieflingGuard5_BrokeLegs = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:ab66a4d5-f33c-302d-2613-6876d3829148
msgctxt "hda1913d0g4cfeg4707g928fg960f2ea12b6a"
msgid "*The crack of that guard's twice-broken legs.*"
msgstr "*그 경비병의 두 번 부러진 다리 골절.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = abdc5428-1844-4d58-b773-3b2e77488efa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ELF(0) = True
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(0) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:abdc5428-1844-4d58-b773-3b2e77488efa
msgctxt "h2db5c794g456ag4481gb3c5g08d64caf7376"
msgid "<i>Let the pain claim you.</i>"
msgstr "<i>고통이 오도록 둔다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ae6ca10c-fafa-5cad-cde3-ff4cacc719fc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:ae6ca10c-fafa-5cad-cde3-ff4cacc719fc
msgctxt "h3a7ba5c0gf549g4fdbg8c0aga01d0284bbe7"
msgid ""
"<i>He puts his hand over mine, steps closer to me. Hand on my waist now as "
"he leans in and kisses me so softly, like he's savouring each sensation.</i>"
msgstr ""
"<i>그의 손을 내 손위로 포개고, 내게 가까이 다가온다. 이제 나의 허리에 손을 얹으며 가까이 기대 부드럽게 키스한다. 마치 모든 "
"감각을 하나씩 음미하듯.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = aeb54024-4327-d71c-9141-839436ec21e5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:aeb54024-4327-d71c-9141-839436ec21e5
msgctxt "hcd74d907g896eg4bd0g821dg03b1a90ca933"
msgid "*Blood. Blood. Blood. Blood. Blood.*"
msgstr "*피. 피. 피. 피. 피.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b0db145a-d78a-9007-92fd-13199f29df64
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:b0db145a-d78a-9007-92fd-13199f29df64
msgctxt "h37025802g50c6g4d57gbf3dg594dcd1742d1"
msgid ""
"<i>Then I'm horizontalling my way around Baldur's Gate, from halfling poet "
"to goliath berserker, until the gods themselves step in.</i>"
msgstr ""
"<i>그리고 나서 내가 아는 발더스 게이트 부근의 모든 이와 자 버리겠어. 하플링 시인에서 골리앗 버서커까지, 신들이 말릴 때까지.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = b3a45539-abba-4b58-9180-4a7c77389b09
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:b3a45539-abba-4b58-9180-4a7c77389b09
msgctxt "h7f337980g054bg4759ga704gbcc02fff015b"
msgid "*Sleep comes as you count the fields of the dead, soon to grow.*"
msgstr "*죽은 자들의 묘지를 세면서 잠이 듭니다. 금새 그 수가 불어 납니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = b3bd70ca-6a2f-4446-b561-2c8f1bf16019
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:b3bd70ca-6a2f-4446-b561-2c8f1bf16019
msgctxt "h884bb6bdge71fg447fg8df9g8859e38be0ec"
msgid "*You have been enslaved like your ancestors! Rage sparks to hatred.*"
msgstr "*당신은 당신의 조상들처럼 노예가 되었습니다! 분노가 증오로 번집니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = b5ca4b80-29f9-4997-9952-67eba5ba5ada
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:b5ca4b80-29f9-4997-9952-67eba5ba5ada
msgctxt "h7c101193gb457g4dc4g9f92g2b623f89a7d7"
msgid "*If sleep won't come to you, at least darkness will.*"
msgstr "*잠이 오지 않는다면, 어둠이라도 찾아올 것입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = b6231fa4-27eb-4583-b151-ea114530c975
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:b6231fa4-27eb-4583-b151-ea114530c975
msgctxt "hd3e71e44gef60g46e2g8e8cge285040b32ac"
msgid "*No. You would only be a failure if you stop fighting.*"
msgstr "*아닙니다. 싸우는 걸 멈췄을 때 비로소 패배자가 될겁니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b67ae067-e1f4-473d-9864-bc36f5e1f131
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 5
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ELF(0) = True
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(0) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:b67ae067-e1f4-473d-9864-bc36f5e1f131
msgctxt "h535e5b21g9045g421agb4f9gfbb5e1b9b711"
msgid ""
"<i>You have walked your dreams countless times before. Will this memory to "
"pass.</i>"
msgstr "<i>당신은 전에도 셀 수 없이 꿈속을 걸었었다. 이 기억도 지나가리라.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b6be70c9-a8e0-48b5-84e6-76b3eb7c5ea5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:b6be70c9-a8e0-48b5-84e6-76b3eb7c5ea5
msgctxt "hfb79661fgcfd9g4a73g9d5bg085fe9d79246"
msgid "<i>Shut your eyes.</i>"
msgstr "<i>눈을 감는다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b6f68a0a-8201-f7e0-bf4d-af3d92376641
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:b6f68a0a-8201-f7e0-bf4d-af3d92376641
msgctxt "h37c68caeg1683g4c47g8ca9gb43b960d5f2a"
msgid "<i>No. Yes. No. Ugh!</i>"
msgstr "<i>아니. 그래. 아니. 으윽!</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = b718749c-843d-4420-a657-da031f6d6f83
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ELF(0) = True
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(0) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:b718749c-843d-4420-a657-da031f6d6f83
msgctxt "he277dd13gc275g4bb6g9790g8b515f1770bc"
msgid "*Agony bursts behind your eyes, and the whole world goes dark.*"
msgstr "*당신의 눈 뒤에서 고통이 터져 나오고, 온 세상이 어두워집니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = b7f4645a-a7e5-4e30-aab9-f9cdef9f4676
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:b7f4645a-a7e5-4e30-aab9-f9cdef9f4676
msgctxt "hc9ad6b22g7f0fg4f8bg8891g9238a8726228"
msgid "*Your anger is clarifying, pure and bright. It burns away all doubt.*"
msgstr "*당신의 분노는 명확하고 순수하며 밝습니다. 모든 의심을 태워버립니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = b888170a-c142-4436-9240-92c26f58f6d1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:b888170a-c142-4436-9240-92c26f58f6d1
msgctxt "hf565d398gac15g43e9g9f44g41363b0edcad"
msgid ""
"*You have prepared all your life to fight the <i>ghaik</i>. You dream of "
"presenting one of their vile heads to Vlaakith in Tu'narath!*"
msgstr ""
"*당신은 <i>게이크</i>와 싸우기 위해 평생을 준비해 왔습니다. 그들의 역겨운 머리를 튜나라쓰에 있는 블라키스에게 바치는 것을 꿈꿔 "
"왔습니다!*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = b8d87253-eff5-f9ce-47f2-a72a73ef200b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - a236eddc-e296-e38a-cf0c-2e95802c45e3_CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA_KarlachInsightPass = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:b8d87253-eff5-f9ce-47f2-a72a73ef200b
msgctxt "hc5c129a9ga46eg44f0gae4dg6169992c5f2e"
msgid ""
"*You can't hide it, even from yourself: you are deeply unsettled by that "
"thing in your brain, and you haven't a clue how to cure it.*"
msgstr ""
"*스스로 숨길 수 조차 없습니다. 당신의 뇌 속에 있는 그 무언가가 당신을 매우 불안하게 만들고 있지만, 어떻게 치료해야 할지 단서 조차 "
"없습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = ba8d6a78-ad1c-4ad4-8894-1843c88c1df2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:ba8d6a78-ad1c-4ad4-8894-1843c88c1df2
msgctxt "hb5eea3fag282cg46ffgaaf5g7645a665f7f7"
msgid ""
"*It's still inside you. Does it watch the night sky even now, through your "
"eyes?*"
msgstr "*그것은 여전히 당신 안에 있습니다. 지금도 당신의 눈을 통해 밤하늘을 보고 있을까요?*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = bb35f3bb-9e4a-45a3-ac0a-0e01773aaa16
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:bb35f3bb-9e4a-45a3-ac0a-0e01773aaa16
msgctxt "h043a4069g5d64g407eg9490ge3220abb6faa"
msgid ""
"*You mentally shuffle through places likely to have an expert in mind "
"flayers. Candlekeep? Neverwinter? Menzoberranzan? Baldur's Gate...*"
msgstr "*마인드 플레이어에 대한 전문가가 있을 법한 장소가 머릿속으로 스쳐갑니다. 캔들킵? 네버윈터? 멘조베란잔? 발더스 게이트...*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bcb0b647-3280-6b96-776a-2a5d2d3962c3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - DEN_Weaponsmith_HasMet(0) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:bcb0b647-3280-6b96-776a-2a5d2d3962c3
msgctxt "hd406be26g2337g434ega6cbgc13ce4a1debe"
msgid ""
"<i>Fucking Zariel. Mutilated me before I even knew what was happening. But "
"I'll have this bloody heart out. Or turned off. Or whatever.</i>"
msgstr ""
"<i>망할 자리엘. 내가 무슨 일이 벌어지는지도 몰랐을 때 내 몸에다 그 짓을 해놓고. 이 개자식의 심장을 뽑아버리겠어. 아니면 심장을 "
"멈춰 버리든가. 아니면 뭐가 됐던.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bd5d77aa-b33c-4cab-99b9-dc706596f62f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Intelligence
#. DifficultyClass: 5
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:bd5d77aa-b33c-4cab-99b9-dc706596f62f
msgctxt "hc807811fg4c03g47f0g8808g5665ad01ec5a"
msgid "<i>Shame claws at you like rot. Are you a failure?</i>"
msgstr "<i>부끄러움이 당신을 문드러지게 할퀸다. 당신은 패배자인가?</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bed87df7-f3a4-7f96-1fe5-b1a34c04e50e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:bed87df7-f3a4-7f96-1fe5-b1a34c04e50e
msgctxt "he14a12a8gd190g47aag8c38gae55d0a5dcd1"
msgid "Finally. <i>Finally.</i>"
msgstr "마침내. <i>마침내.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bedb5e23-9e4a-a6cc-ca12-484a094d368d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:bedb5e23-9e4a-a6cc-ca12-484a094d368d
msgctxt "hb3977d8cg9080g4c10g8f27g213143d42ed7"
msgid "I've got a lot of living to do from here on out. Better rest up."
msgstr "앞으로 살면서 할 일이 많아. 좀 쉬는 게 좋겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = c002fbfe-cd98-470a-d78a-f5e886399440
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - DRAGONBORN(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:c002fbfe-cd98-470a-d78a-f5e886399440
msgctxt "h72453cbfg4c81g4cd1g97feg01320682fdc9"
msgid ""
"*The ancestral knowledge of your dragon-clan is diluted amid the liquid hate "
"in your blood.*"
msgstr "*드래곤 종족에 대한 선조의 지식은 당신의 피 속에 흐르는 증오로 인해 희석됩니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c09022ef-9a64-c2c5-0599-8874a90c5ef0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:c09022ef-9a64-c2c5-0599-8874a90c5ef0
msgctxt "hc029a655g650cg42ceg853dg37549d43c656"
msgid "<i>Not now, anyway. Right? Right.</i>"
msgstr "<i>지금은 안돼, 아무튼. 알겠지? 알겠어.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = c16c8a11-4f2b-1fec-7676-a386ec1f85bb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:c16c8a11-4f2b-1fec-7676-a386ec1f85bb
msgctxt "h50bd3d03g96bfg4984g9e90gb5628393bf04"
msgid ""
"*Your kinsfolk are found everywhere, aren't they? It doesn't narrow much "
"down.*"
msgstr "*당신의 동족은 어디에서나 찾을 수 있지 않나요? 단서는 그다지 좁혀지지 않습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = c19d8df5-f0e9-edc1-c430-e126842b0c34
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - SORCERER(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:c19d8df5-f0e9-edc1-c430-e126842b0c34
msgctxt "h9f8f691eg8851g41aeg8e3fgd5b092b5d645"
msgid ""
"*You are fortunate your sorceries come from your instincts and not your "
"mangled head.*"
msgstr "*당신의 소서러 마법은 엉망진창이 된 당신의 머리가 아니라 본능에서 나오는 것이니 다행입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = c29402e3-abe9-4698-810c-6fa0abde208c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ELF(0) = True
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(0) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:c29402e3-abe9-4698-810c-6fa0abde208c
msgctxt "hda59600bg83d6g48b5gbc2cg60774eecb67f"
msgid ""
"*Your head is about to burst. The memory consumes your mind, corrupting the "
"trance.*"
msgstr "*당신의 머리가 곧 터질 것 같습니다. 그 기억이 당신의 정신을 좀먹고, 명상 상태를 망가뜨립니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = c318f64e-0c71-47f5-b30e-e7264eba5b65
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:c318f64e-0c71-47f5-b30e-e7264eba5b65
msgctxt "hb83bd7e4gd076g4becg839bgf5f34ed0e8fc"
msgid "*Agony bursts behind your eyes, and the whole world goes dark.*"
msgstr "*당신의 눈 뒤에서 고통이 터져 나오고, 온 세상이 어두워집니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = c4455334-9b23-43c9-82c0-c467b0474719
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:c4455334-9b23-43c9-82c0-c467b0474719
msgctxt "h7938615bg903cg4e2ag9f42g29a65305fe0c"
msgid "*Gazing up at the night sky, you try to will yourself to sleep.*"
msgstr "*밤하늘을 올려다보며 잠을 자려고 의지를 다집니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = c552a870-9681-443d-b1e9-db96d335a1b2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:c552a870-9681-443d-b1e9-db96d335a1b2
msgctxt "hf1ed41d9g3539g4823g8289gd1c991eb0ae4"
msgid "*You should have burst into flames.*"
msgstr "*당신은 불길에 휩싸였어야 했습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c55ea769-226a-485e-9888-73135fbdc3c3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:c55ea769-226a-485e-9888-73135fbdc3c3
msgctxt "h5ada0699gd610g491bg9cdbg7ad3e819852c"
msgid "<i>Try to remember what came before the mission.</i>"
msgstr "<i>임무 전에 무엇이 있었는지 기억해 내려고 한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = c5ee1eff-2c24-45e0-a954-35f2c2fed69c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:c5ee1eff-2c24-45e0-a954-35f2c2fed69c
msgctxt "h8000b723ga4cdg46a1g8e02gc551d0ec0e4f"
msgid ""
"*You close your eyes and try to focus on his delightful screams, but they "
"quickly turn into your own. They only stop when tentacles burst from your "
"mouth.*"
msgstr ""
"*눈을 감고 그의 유쾌한 비명에 집중하려고 하지만, 비명은 금세 자신의 비명으로 바뀝니다. 입에서 촉수가 터지고 나서야 비명이 멈춥니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c6de1819-5634-3533-959e-c84b36660daf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:c6de1819-5634-3533-959e-c84b36660daf
msgctxt "h7d51ed09g57edg4bdbgae94gf6eb431e8abf"
msgid "It is."
msgstr "그럴 때야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = c705e0df-4013-41b6-ab5f-b229c3860a5b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:c705e0df-4013-41b6-ab5f-b229c3860a5b
msgctxt "h116e935bgb471g4da8gafdcg9eeff44c1ea1"
msgid "*You shudder, resigning yourself to whatever dark rest awaits you.*"
msgstr "*당신은 몸을 떨며, 어두운 안식이 당신을 기다리고 있다고 체념합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c7dfda08-342c-4ea7-a3c8-b013d0d70108
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Constitution
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:c7dfda08-342c-4ea7-a3c8-b013d0d70108
msgctxt "h0f9ed59ag0cb0g4ee5gac0dg6bd7fcc57ceb"
msgid "<i>Meditate on your teachings.</i>"
msgstr "<i>당신이 배운 것들에 대해 명상한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c873d1bc-8318-4770-8022-1a7e47181efb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:c873d1bc-8318-4770-8022-1a7e47181efb
msgctxt "hac32c5d7gb05eg45feg943fg01a550aba9ed"
msgid "<i>Roll over, push it all from your mind.</i>"
msgstr "<i>모르겠고, 모든 생각으로부터 벗어난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ca2c7b7c-7f3f-59d0-e5cd-2a3a8601bca5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:ca2c7b7c-7f3f-59d0-e5cd-2a3a8601bca5
msgctxt "hf13b6f67g8268g414eg892fg1b440e475bdf"
msgid ""
"<i>Do not go there, Karlach. Not unless you want to burn this camp down.</i>"
msgstr "<i>거기로 가지마, 칼라크. 이 야영지를 불태우고 싶지 않다면 말이야.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cb04a5b0-a63d-0a4c-1e88-aedc7285cca8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:cb04a5b0-a63d-0a4c-1e88-aedc7285cca8
msgctxt "hfe2765d0gceffg4abagaca3g6e3b69f727e7"
msgid "Right."
msgstr "그래."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = cbf1013c-9fe0-4356-a65a-9f62ce4e02df
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:cbf1013c-9fe0-4356-a65a-9f62ce4e02df
msgctxt "h18f1a17egcb38g451ag8172g5be4910f1f97"
msgid ""
"*Your memories are foggy - as your mission requires them to be: Shar's "
"secrets are precious.*"
msgstr "*당신의 기억은 흐릿합니다. 당신의 임무가 그런 상황을 요구하기 때문입니다. 샤의 비밀은 소중합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = cc8e346b-7abf-4498-b2e0-c4a4fd55745c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:cc8e346b-7abf-4498-b2e0-c4a4fd55745c
msgctxt "h7e7f17b2ge4fcg47c0ga22cg8a96512d86f9"
msgid ""
"*Your head twinges. Is it the tadpole, you wonder? Had you imagined it - or "
"were you soon to turn?*"
msgstr "*머리가 찌른 듯이 아픕니다. 당신 생각에 올챙이 때문일까요? 단순한 환통이었을까요, 아니면 곧 변해 버릴까요?*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cf795db0-8dfc-620a-53d9-4a805c6cc06d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:cf795db0-8dfc-620a-53d9-4a805c6cc06d
msgctxt "h709d4f41ga95fg44cfgb76bgae488bf15dea"
msgid ""
"Not quite. Got a mind flayer tadpole in the head to worry about, don't we?"
msgstr "썩 그렇지도 않아. 머릿속에 올챙이가 있어서 걱정이거든, 안 그래?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = d0cefd96-1254-4363-94eb-ff9b8c97fbcc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:d0cefd96-1254-4363-94eb-ff9b8c97fbcc
msgctxt "hde9e6bc3g343eg43cfgac1fg43a58dca48c9"
msgid ""
"*There is no conquering the agitation. Like it or not, mind flayers have "
"bested you this day.*"
msgstr "*불안을 정복할 수는 없습니다. 좋든 싫든, 오늘은 마인드 플레이어가 당신을 이겼습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d1d2ebb0-739f-003e-e673-31d34b6a0162
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:d1d2ebb0-739f-003e-e673-31d34b6a0162
msgctxt "h5e77b2d6g6eabg427fgbb9dg3eeb71c6cbcd"
msgid ""
"<i>He doesn't wait for my reply - it's... Logus... and all ten feet of him "
"are back from the hunt. He steadies a brace of rabbits against the wall and "
"sees us tangled up when - wait! No! Brain! This isn't the time... is it?</i>"
msgstr ""
"<i>그는 내 대답을 기다리지 않는다. 그는... 로거스...였다... 10피트 덩치의 그가 사냥에서 돌아왔다. 그는 벽에 토끼 한 쌍을 "
"고정하고 우리가 뒤엉켜 있는 걸 보더니 - 잠깐! 안돼! 뇌야! 지금은 때가 아니야... 안 그래?</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = d2129e11-95a4-46c7-96ca-9445c2cd4f61
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DROWELF
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:d2129e11-95a4-46c7-96ca-9445c2cd4f61
msgctxt "h4ac6808bg897fg4e6agb47dg5b536b4c4366"
msgid ""
"*The dark is familiar, but not comforting. It is a struggle to sink into "
"your trance, weaving together memory, ambition, and purpose.*"
msgstr "*어둠은 익숙하지만 위로가 되지는 않습니다. 명상 상태에 빠지기 위해 기억과 야망, 목적을 하나로 엮어 몸부림칩니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = d33af950-99a6-430d-b1e1-66cf5575db44
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:d33af950-99a6-430d-b1e1-66cf5575db44
msgctxt "h8a1034aag5482g473egb28fgaefd06174498"
msgid ""
"*He'll believe you if you tell him what happened. But he won't forgive.*"
msgstr "*당신이 무슨 일이 있었는지 말한다면 그는 믿을 것입니다. 하지만 용서하지는 않을 것입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d3dac392-b4ad-22f7-dfb4-7c7851c6d790
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:d3dac392-b4ad-22f7-dfb4-7c7851c6d790
msgctxt "h75893631gcaebg419cga8d1g72a6c8a125e8"
msgid ""
"<i>His hand moves lower, and he pulls me even closer toward him. I'm all "
"nerves now, all starry, as my head explodes, showering him with skull "
"fragments to reveal a mass of tentacles - OH GODS!</i>"
msgstr ""
"<i>그의 손이 아래로 움직이고, 그가 나를 더 가까이 끌어당긴다. 난 이제 완전 흥분됐고, 모든게 반짝이고, 내 머리가 산산조각 나며, "
"그에게 두개골 파편들이 쏟아지면서 촉수다발들이 드러나며 - 오 신이시여!</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d427af71-2ea6-1fe7-ac0f-1dab54cc5c41
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:d427af71-2ea6-1fe7-ac0f-1dab54cc5c41
msgctxt "hcb824f51gce18g4536gbd24g921fe53fc983"
msgid "I hate this."
msgstr "이런 건 싫어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = d658ffe2-7d6f-4820-b1f5-e0191c458c8c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:d658ffe2-7d6f-4820-b1f5-e0191c458c8c
msgctxt "hcfd34376gbbf3g4a60g99d9gc1759b493ea6"
msgid ""
"*Protect the artefact. Find your contact in Baldur's Gate. Fulfil Shar's "
"command.*"
msgstr "*아티팩트를 보호해야 합니다. 발더스 게이트에서 접선자를 찾아야 합니다. 샤의 명령을 완수해야 합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d681a0d2-9317-4eee-8c99-fccc355077ed
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 5
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:d681a0d2-9317-4eee-8c99-fccc355077ed
msgctxt "h80a04536g4145g484fg9199gbedc5bd96ea7"
msgid ""
"<i>You have walked your dreams countless times before. Will this memory to "
"pass. </i>"
msgstr "<i>당신은 전에도 셀 수 없이 꿈속을 걸었었다. 이 기억도 지나가리라.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = d69a6f26-d9d2-40ba-b221-df6239c9ad09
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:d69a6f26-d9d2-40ba-b221-df6239c9ad09
msgctxt "h17dc3fdfg4c46g490egb68egf097ad298453"
msgid ""
"*Its weight reassures you. Shar's will and your destiny, right in your "
"grasp.*"
msgstr "*그 무게가 당신을 안심시킵니다. 샤의 의지와 당신의 운명이, 바로 당신의 손 안에 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = d76e9152-cb21-4b4a-a559-0211fc61af5d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:d76e9152-cb21-4b4a-a559-0211fc61af5d
msgctxt "h98896cbag5293g4e73g8e58gae36ef0de723"
msgid ""
"*Until you know more about the tadpole, you can't be sure how much danger "
"you're in.*"
msgstr "*올챙이에 대해 더 자세히 알기 전까지는, 당신이 얼마나 위험한 상황에 처해 있는지 확신할 수 없습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = d7b2006f-6f33-4331-8ac2-cbae1ac00b6a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_DUERGARDWARF
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:d7b2006f-6f33-4331-8ac2-cbae1ac00b6a
msgctxt "h5d66f570g2d74g424cg80ecg9dafa0a58222"
msgid "*You belong with dark stone and black iron. There is work to be done.*"
msgstr "*당신이 있을 곳은 어두운 돌과 검은 철이 있는 곳입니다. 거기서 해야 할 일이 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = d7b2006f-6f33-4331-8ac2-cbae1ac00b6a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_DEEPGNOME
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:d7b2006f-6f33-4331-8ac2-cbae1ac00b6a
msgctxt "hb6a42ec5ga6f1g4cd5g930bge925ea5e08b9"
msgid "*You belong with your people, down in the dark that never fades.*"
msgstr "*당신이 있을 곳은 당신의 동족들이 있는 곳입니다. 절대 사라지지 않을 어둠 속.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = d8b7604b-450b-45ea-9478-fc3d7ceaca98
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ELF(0) = True
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(0) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:d8b7604b-450b-45ea-9478-fc3d7ceaca98
msgctxt "hf323a553ge400g4e50ga1ccgae92c8620bb5"
msgid ""
"*Hell surrounds you, flames licking at your body. The tadpole in your head "
"convulses.*"
msgstr "*지옥이 당신을 둘러싸고, 불길이 몸을 핥습니다. 머릿속 올챙이가 경련을 일으킵니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d932f553-243f-3cdf-af59-7185ecc2efea
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - DEN_Weaponsmith_HasMet(0) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:d932f553-243f-3cdf-af59-7185ecc2efea
msgctxt "h8244c2a1g5e58g48c5g9c23gab1cebd9739f"
msgid "<i>Dammon seems to've made a good start. I ought to keep him close.</i>"
msgstr "<i>대먼이 좋은 출발을 한 것 같군. 가까이 두는 편이 좋겠어.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = d9da55b7-a436-4acc-88d1-1aabee8d866c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:d9da55b7-a436-4acc-88d1-1aabee8d866c
msgctxt "h4377ba00gb7efg420agbbbdg5e0cef6b08f9"
msgid ""
"*Your honour can be restored before Vlaakith. It <i>would</i> be restored.*"
msgstr "*당신의 명예는 블라키스 앞에서 회복 할 수 있습니다. 명예는 <i>회복 될 것</i>입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = da2f1208-526d-b1fe-5363-85cec95a97d9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: MALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:da2f1208-526d-b1fe-5363-85cec95a97d9
msgctxt "hd97ca72dg3017g4750gb329gc75b91acd2a8"
msgid "<i>The answer is simple: you must be Death himself.</i>"
msgstr "<i>답은 간단하다. 당신은 죽음 그 자체가 되어야 한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = da2f1208-526d-b1fe-5363-85cec95a97d9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: FEMALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:da2f1208-526d-b1fe-5363-85cec95a97d9
msgctxt "h29017ee3g759eg4e5agaeaeg628bd32d2bc3"
msgid "<i>The answer is simple: you must be Death herself.</i>"
msgstr "<i>답은 간단하다. 당신은 죽음 그 자체가 되어야 한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = da2f1208-526d-b1fe-5363-85cec95a97d9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:da2f1208-526d-b1fe-5363-85cec95a97d9
msgctxt "h4776d15bg604ag4d34ga9a7g4fa1270b641a"
msgid "<i>The answer is simple: you must be Death itself.</i>"
msgstr "<i>답은 간단하다. 당신은 죽음 그 자체가 되어야 한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = dbbb7887-d782-9def-75a4-85bb7f7f8440
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:dbbb7887-d782-9def-75a4-85bb7f7f8440
msgctxt "hfda26dccgb4bbg4986g9be3g679bc3a2e819"
msgid "<i>Fret - there is worse in your head than a tadpole.</i>"
msgstr "<i>초조함. 올챙이보다 더 심한 것이 당신 머리 속에 있다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = dc76f598-ca29-8ffa-cad0-6d0abe9df559
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - RANGER(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:dc76f598-ca29-8ffa-cad0-6d0abe9df559
msgctxt "h847c4733g2721g4eb4g82fagdca2e9d34359"
msgid ""
"*The frost of the mountain, the sand of the beach, the mulch of the swamp. "
"There are hints of the trails left. But they are far away.*"
msgstr "*산의 서리, 해변의 모래, 늪의 뿌리 덮개. 흔적의 힌트가 남아 있습니다. 그러나 그것들은 멀리 떨어져 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = dcf103de-ab16-0d8c-4f77-f0847c0fd8c8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:dcf103de-ab16-0d8c-4f77-f0847c0fd8c8
msgctxt "ha7141128gd3c1g4a8bg9cf3gc93e0e6938e6"
msgid "<i>Lean deeper into your foul imaginations.</i>"
msgstr "<i>더욱 역겨운 상상에 빠져든다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = df0a07d2-ed23-41ef-b726-48e3fab3dde1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - LOLTHDROWELF(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:df0a07d2-ed23-41ef-b726-48e3fab3dde1
msgctxt "hd482d79bgf1b2g40f1gacbdgfa6d2d3bd4a3"
msgid ""
"*The flames fall away, a mere illusion. You sit the dark again, beside "
"Lolth's majesty.*"
msgstr "*불꽃이 사그라들며 환영만이 남았습니다. 당신은 다시 어둠 속에 앉아, 롤쓰의 장엄함을 바라봅니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e2fba75d-399d-46db-ac70-1f57b619520c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Constitution
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:e2fba75d-399d-46db-ac70-1f57b619520c
msgctxt "h204aa79cg5917g421ag9dbfgf39d12eb6524"
msgid "<i>Shut your mind to all thought.</i>"
msgstr "<i>생각을 모두 닫아버린다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e376f16e-ddfb-bcbb-e9ff-ebfb971d955d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:e376f16e-ddfb-bcbb-e9ff-ebfb971d955d
msgctxt "h579ddaf6gf79bg4d02gb7efgd3ad77338ce4"
msgid "<i>Probe your mind - what thoughts stand out the most?</i>"
msgstr "<i>당신의 정신을 탐색합니다. 가장 먼저 떠오르는 생각은 무엇입니까?</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = e3f2c2c8-6f31-4594-ad74-c3665b1ecf44
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_ELF(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_GALE(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(0) = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_UNDERDARK
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:e3f2c2c8-6f31-4594-ad74-c3665b1ecf44
msgctxt "h88c266a7ga018g45a1gb577g92decc3e6605"
msgid ""
"*The deep dark should lull you to sleep, yet your eyes refuse to stay "
"closed.*"
msgstr "*깊은 어둠이 당신을 잠들게 해야 하지만 눈은 감기지 않습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = e3f2c2c8-6f31-4594-ad74-c3665b1ecf44
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_ELF(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_GALE(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(0) = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_PLANAR or REALLY_RARE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:e3f2c2c8-6f31-4594-ad74-c3665b1ecf44
msgctxt "h1a41ed2fgd993g48f7gb0e2g71ef5d1bcd93"
msgid ""
"*This is not the world you know. Rest feels impossible, no matter how heavy "
"your eyes become.*"
msgstr "*이건 당신이 아는 세상이 아닙니다. 눈이 아무리 무거워져도 휴식이 불가능하게 느껴집니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = e3f2c2c8-6f31-4594-ad74-c3665b1ecf44
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_ELF(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_GALE(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(0) = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_BESTIAL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:e3f2c2c8-6f31-4594-ad74-c3665b1ecf44
msgctxt "h45c1fb26g2b8dg4c90gbe0cge49c139a21b3"
msgid ""
"*This is not a nest or haunt, any place of comfort. Closing your eyes only "
"intensifies the unease.*"
msgstr "*이곳은 둥지나 소굴, 어떤 안락한 장소도 아닙니다. 눈을 감으면 불안감이 더 심해질 뿐입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = e3f2c2c8-6f31-4594-ad74-c3665b1ecf44
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_ELF(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_GALE(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(0) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:e3f2c2c8-6f31-4594-ad74-c3665b1ecf44
msgctxt "hc1697ec3gf3d9g42ccgad5egb50e2ff2eb85"
msgid "*A calm night is a mercy, yet your eyes refuse to stay closed.*"
msgstr "*고요한 밤은 자비롭지만, 당신의 눈은 감기지 않으려 합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e59c65c3-883d-4fe6-91b6-daec22d227ad
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:e59c65c3-883d-4fe6-91b6-daec22d227ad
msgctxt "hd62b6740g9b70g4336g99e4gea6b2e68554f"
msgid ""
"<i>Consider the tadpole. Can a vampire spawn even become a mind flayer?</i>"
msgstr "<i>그 올챙이를 생각해 본다. 뱀파이어 스폰도 마인드 플레이어가 될 수 있을까?</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = e70f6e97-4797-4834-8fcd-d778fd0a7dab
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:e70f6e97-4797-4834-8fcd-d778fd0a7dab
msgctxt "h4a436c52gb91cg4047gbf9aga282b70ded30"
msgid "*Your life is your own. No wriggling tadpole is going to change that.*"
msgstr "*당신의 삶은 당신 자신의 것입니다. 꿈틀거리는 올챙이도 그 사실을 바꾸지 못합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e7cf7e64-9dcd-4079-940b-5f28dd7b1a86
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:e7cf7e64-9dcd-4079-940b-5f28dd7b1a86
msgctxt "h7530828bg1138g43a6gbfc1g9a2d92f16e22"
msgid ""
"<i>Pray to Shar. Her blessing will help you weather the trials ahead.</i>"
msgstr "<i>샤에게 기도를 올린다. 그녀의 축복이 앞으로의 시련을 이겨낼 수 있도록 도와줄 것이다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = e9046c2f-8fd2-5c8b-614a-2fc700498cf4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:e9046c2f-8fd2-5c8b-614a-2fc700498cf4
msgctxt "h70fe1053gef71g48c9gbf0fg455ce129c97b"
msgid ""
"*How cruel your old life must have been. What could have happened to make "
"you forget?*"
msgstr "*당신의 옛 삶은 얼마나 잔인했을까요. 무슨 일이 있었기에 기억을 잃어 버린걸까요?*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = e94abecd-9263-4a62-8e69-6d82fad2bc2b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:e94abecd-9263-4a62-8e69-6d82fad2bc2b
msgctxt "hf8286fd3ge132g47e3gb1cagbb721a91c292"
msgid ""
"*The agony refuses to fade until you collapse against your bedroll in a cold "
"sweat.*"
msgstr "*차가운 땀에 젖어 침낭에 쓰러질 때까지 고통은 사라지지 않습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = e9786cfe-7a24-4625-b3dc-ffe3d99461c0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:e9786cfe-7a24-4625-b3dc-ffe3d99461c0
msgctxt "hddb4e0b9g5391g4332g953cg0cc2f975da51"
msgid "*Useless - you can't stop thinking of Shar's sacred mission.*"
msgstr "*소용 없습니다. 샤의 신성한 사명에 대한 생각을 멈출 수 없습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ea700e8c-2a06-5f56-556c-92a17ba91769
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:ea700e8c-2a06-5f56-556c-92a17ba91769
msgctxt "h67d90291g9774g41d5gab04g3bf96537e13c"
msgid ""
"<i>Really close. And then, next time he leans in to listen to my heart, I "
"take his chin in my hand and I lift his face to meet mine and I - stop it, "
"brain! This isn't the time! Is it? </i>"
msgstr ""
"<i>정말 가깝군. 그리고 다음에 그가 내 심장 소리를 듣기 위해 귀를 기울이면, 난 그의 턱을 내 손으로 잡고 내 얼굴을 그의 얼굴에 "
"가까이 대고 - 그만, 뇌야! 지금은 그럴 때가 아니야! </i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ee727185-b834-c77c-c8f6-762c88286660
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:ee727185-b834-c77c-c8f6-762c88286660
msgctxt "h7f90e82ag4496g43aeg882dgf0871c3ac021"
msgid "Uh, there was that one time with the three-tusked orthon..."
msgstr "음, 그 세 개의 엄니를 가진 오르쏜이 있었던 그 때 말이야..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ef5588d0-c688-4f85-84d5-62399ea5b3dd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:ef5588d0-c688-4f85-84d5-62399ea5b3dd
msgctxt "h987c882bgf8e3g43dfgac00g7dbf2c4755bc"
msgid "<i>Recall the light's comforting warmth. It's been an eternity.</i>"
msgstr "<i>빛의 따스한 온기를 떠올린다. 아주 오랜 시간전의 일이다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = f0800b3d-9829-4d65-942d-a64c1e7aa6da
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:f0800b3d-9829-4d65-942d-a64c1e7aa6da
msgctxt "h377438aeg7e15g4165g8c2cg8ea734797bf2"
msgid "*Sleep claims you, determination buoyed by gentle dreams.*"
msgstr "*잠이 당신을 사로잡고, 부드러운 꿈에 이끌려 결심을 굳힙니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = f101034d-3cb4-420e-ba37-c4504af88589
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:f101034d-3cb4-420e-ba37-c4504af88589
msgctxt "h924a6997g8521g4d9aga4ccg5d01c2503204"
msgid ""
"*All you have to do is turn the tables - cage the creature before it cages "
"you.*"
msgstr "*당신이 할 일은 그저 판을 뒤집는 것뿐입니다. 그 괴물이 당신을 가두기전에 당신이 먼저 그 괴물을 가두는 겁니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = f11900d5-d545-4480-95e5-b485578757a8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:f11900d5-d545-4480-95e5-b485578757a8
msgctxt "h308f7987g9341g4873gb8d7g89e91d4ac503"
msgid ""
"*You cannot prod it, but you can make it clear that you are watching. What "
"is there to fear when it is the one stuck inside <i>you?</i>*"
msgstr ""
"*당신은 그것을 조종할 수 없지만, 당신이 지켜보고 있다는 것을 확실히 알게 할 수 있습니다. 안에 갇힌 것이 <i>당신</i>이라면, "
"무엇이 두려울까요?*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = f38bef08-c246-4ee9-bf8e-0ca96a7f750f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:f38bef08-c246-4ee9-bf8e-0ca96a7f750f
msgctxt "h57eade45ga399g4fd8gb8c5g0c9c6eec12d5"
msgid ""
"*You fall into fitful sleep, your dreams dominated by the blood-lakes of "
"Hell and snarling <i>ghaik.</i>*"
msgstr "*당신은 뒤척이며 잠이 듭니다. 꿈속에서는, 지옥속 피의 호수와 <i>게이크</i>가 으르렁거리는 모습들로 가득찹니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = f581d46a-b231-46f9-a272-6c474f319fdb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:f581d46a-b231-46f9-a272-6c474f319fdb
msgctxt "h682889c5g692cg4571ga35bg2245900e161a"
msgid "*You try to rest, but your mind won't settle.*"
msgstr "*쉬려고 해도 마음이 진정되지 않습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = f5ebfdda-ff33-4e3a-bf91-aed9de505324
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ELF(0) = True
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(0) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:f5ebfdda-ff33-4e3a-bf91-aed9de505324
msgctxt "hf5d0381cg95cdg4703g834fgb84b98e45a9a"
msgid ""
"*As the trance stabilises, your breath deepens. Be it cure or cage, "
"something must be done about the tadpole.*"
msgstr "*명상 상태가 안정되자, 당신의 호흡이 깊어집니다. 치료든 가둬두는 방법이든, 올챙이에 대한 조치가 취해져야 합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = f6c83df2-fbc0-4f46-a81a-d181f4515997
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:f6c83df2-fbc0-4f46-a81a-d181f4515997
msgctxt "haab289a8g256cg4df0ga7cfgda64ecfd9dd1"
msgid ""
"*You focus on that spot of pain from when it slipped behind your eye, to "
"where it now lurks.*"
msgstr "*당신의 눈 뒤로 그것이 미끄러져 들어간, 지금은 숨어 있는 그 고통의 지점에 집중합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f6fe25b0-ee28-f723-bcd2-7d554756f901
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:f6fe25b0-ee28-f723-bcd2-7d554756f901
msgctxt "h7ecacf06ga73ag473cgb053gb690f8458b6c"
msgid "I maintain an impenetrable silence."
msgstr "완고한 침묵을 유지한다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = f87eaa68-16d5-4a4d-9fcb-89cb970457b1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:f87eaa68-16d5-4a4d-9fcb-89cb970457b1
msgctxt "hbcb9397ag02bdg4370gbc09gdc7c93def284"
msgid ""
"*Just yesterday you were seducing a young noble, luring him to your master's "
"lair.*"
msgstr "*바로 어제 당신은 젊은 귀족을 유혹하여, 당신 주인의 은신처로 유인하고 있었습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fa7f1d45-0ac5-e2a8-e14f-c81a7827e738
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:fa7f1d45-0ac5-e2a8-e14f-c81a7827e738
msgctxt "hede989f8g4740g4c70g97f4gbdd821abf051"
msgid "<i>Think upon your heritage - is there truth hidden there?</i>"
msgstr "<i>당신의 혈통을 생각한다. 거기에 진실이 숨겨져 있을까?</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fb3376d4-553a-4c4f-b1a8-c631b086ae10
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 5
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:fb3376d4-553a-4c4f-b1a8-c631b086ae10
msgctxt "h8f1876a3gd99fg4cfdg9047gcb86088ce974"
msgid "<i>Rage fills you. Turn the feeling to higher purpose.</i>"
msgstr "<i>격노가 당신을 채운다. 그 감정을 더 중요한 결심으로 돌린다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = fe3e771b-fbda-232e-925e-6e627bbec941
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_DarkUrge_State_WoundedBird_PulledWings = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:fe3e771b-fbda-232e-925e-6e627bbec941
msgctxt "hf2aef22fg4a62g43c2gb971g6d81b47410d3"
msgid "*The delicacy of the jay's severed wings.*"
msgstr "*어치의 잘린 날개가 주는 섬세함.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ff55c151-c32e-f14a-da50-327221582b8b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_FirstNight_AvD_PostEA:ff55c151-c32e-f14a-da50-327221582b8b
msgctxt "h94dd0876g8831g4801ga303ga53f73608024"
msgid "<i>Contemplate your craft - why do you have the skills you do?</i>"
msgstr "<i>당신의 기술을 생각해보자. 왜 당신은 그런 기술을 가지고 있는 것일까?</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD
#. Speaker = Tara the Tressym
#. NodeID = 01ecf3d7-3ced-5df1-887c-9cad3e3e503b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD:01ecf3d7-3ced-5df1-887c-9cad3e3e503b
msgctxt "h7794662agd8dcg4ce7ga2e6g106cae4132b3"
msgid "All the more reason I ought to be looking after you."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD
#. Speaker = Tara the Tressym
#. NodeID = 0711e9f9-d6e8-5a02-75d3-22cf10ab4dcc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD:0711e9f9-d6e8-5a02-75d3-22cf10ab4dcc
msgctxt "h00e262d9gb996g40c7g97c7g609a8a4f99af"
msgid ""
"So here I am, come to re-insert myself. After all, remember what happened "
"last time I let you out of sight?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD
#. Speaker = Tara the Tressym
#. NodeID = 19196471-ac68-1f68-2b31-5cb5d2f5814e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD:19196471-ac68-1f68-2b31-5cb5d2f5814e
msgctxt "hb4fb9ae0gba65g4dcfga958g806861a22fef"
msgid ""
"No matter, Mr Dekarios. Tara's here now, and she'll sort you out. But first, "
"my payment."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD
#. Speaker = Tara the Tressym
#. NodeID = 1c0876ca-71d0-f783-22db-0bdca1a4ab43
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD:1c0876ca-71d0-f783-22db-0bdca1a4ab43
msgctxt "h004ba1d8gbf68g4e46gb120g3de32c12af47"
msgid ""
"And I decided 'will not'. And a good thing, too. You look like you haven't "
"had a good meal in days."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD
#. Speaker = Tara the Tressym
#. NodeID = 2993e70d-0efa-1252-2530-006b02f25a84
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD:2993e70d-0efa-1252-2530-006b02f25a84
msgctxt "hce795fd3g717cg42bdga5a5g0bad4880ed64"
msgid ""
"I looked away for a moment, just once, and look where it got us. You, a "
"living doomsday device. The shame."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD
#. Speaker = Tara the Tressym
#. NodeID = 2ad917ab-2f5c-7eb4-3c17-285908167278
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD:2ad917ab-2f5c-7eb4-3c17-285908167278
msgctxt "h8d8f0be3g05ebg486ega6eeg36c1f63131fb"
msgid "Of course, Mr Dekarios. What else are friends for?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD
#. Speaker = Tara the Tressym
#. NodeID = 32b96dd6-d428-0ced-74d6-325577632e4a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD:32b96dd6-d428-0ced-74d6-325577632e4a
msgctxt "h420f1c0bge358g46d0ga2f4g317e667feb7b"
msgid "I don't take orders from my masseuse. Eat up, now. And chat soon."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 35b40af2-fdac-5c7f-02cc-a99e5e3db9da
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD:35b40af2-fdac-5c7f-02cc-a99e5e3db9da
msgctxt "ha05f496eg100eg4fb2gb375g592b0780aea0"
msgid ""
"*You made yourself a walking cataclysm, the annihilation brewing within you "
"just about held at bay by your constant consumption of magical objects. Tara "
"saw it all, but never left your side.*"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 39625755-8c18-7581-c1ae-bc5124737551
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD:39625755-8c18-7581-c1ae-bc5124737551
msgctxt "h4f5635ddge500g4e2eg88b5g4b5d0fcb7153"
msgid ""
"*Nestled amongst your books and papers, Tara bore witness to your greatest "
"triumphs... and your greatest failure.* "
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 3ac9d43f-d9ee-971a-f072-f6cc31863ff3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD:3ac9d43f-d9ee-971a-f072-f6cc31863ff3
msgctxt "hfb7c631bg6cb6g44e0g8837g56ab77328979"
msgid ""
"*You'll need to drain magical energy from a powerful artefact soon. As you "
"contemplate your hubris, your eyelids grow heavier and heavier...*"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD
#. Speaker = Tara the Tressym
#. NodeID = 3b391ab3-40b6-7252-e578-1b0511557dbe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - ORI_Gale_Event_GiveTressymItem(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD:3b391ab3-40b6-7252-e578-1b0511557dbe
msgctxt "h278cb013g4a47g4202g8021g3da3dedf1cb3"
msgid "Speaking of which - I brought you something. For your tummy troubles."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 472639d4-a19c-8be3-353e-ba0d0721397c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD:472639d4-a19c-8be3-353e-ba0d0721397c
msgctxt "h52a4dfa9g0f3eg4128ga78bge527df63d129"
msgid "It's good to see you, Tara. I've missed you very much."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD
#. Speaker = Tara the Tressym
#. NodeID = 482c8452-925d-eaa1-c5ad-596515d08318
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD:482c8452-925d-eaa1-c5ad-596515d08318
msgctxt "hf957d859gd919g4f12ga17ag92f99653e103"
msgid ""
"And I you, of course. The tower just isn't the same without you stomping "
"about in the background."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD
#. Speaker = Tara the Tressym
#. NodeID = 4886da16-32cf-36a0-405c-6eb411accc39
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD:4886da16-32cf-36a0-405c-6eb411accc39
msgctxt "h101ce95ag5b68g413fga694g848907ffecb3"
msgid "It is terribly good to see you, Mr Dekarios."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 4f346c7f-8b79-08db-9a8c-90c2c9471427
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD:4f346c7f-8b79-08db-9a8c-90c2c9471427
msgctxt "ha5de93c6gf90cg4708g8d60g4e9bb1025e80"
msgid ""
"*Your mistakes have been huge. The consequences... memorable. But you won't "
"let anyone die. You can't.*"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 4f4a325e-f85a-3b28-7577-ccf0222c07d2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD:4f4a325e-f85a-3b28-7577-ccf0222c07d2
msgctxt "h5070f551gfaa3g4291gba5egb0bf52043a74"
msgid ""
"*You imagine the explosion. Thousands will die. You have to stop it - "
"ceremorphosis and the orb itself.*"
msgstr "*당신은 폭발을 상상합니다. 수천 명이 죽을겁니다. 폭발을 막아야 합니다. 뇌변이도, 보주도 막아야 합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD
#. Speaker = Tara the Tressym
#. NodeID = 57229ea3-361b-967d-291b-d220c405c553
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD:57229ea3-361b-967d-291b-d220c405c553
msgctxt "h287db26dgb312g4563g96e3g86cb78296b55"
msgid ""
"Well, it isn't the Mother of All Magic, lucky for you. You look terrible. "
"Are you eating?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 59958b37-ad58-893f-3937-453a09aa7b1e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD:59958b37-ad58-893f-3937-453a09aa7b1e
msgctxt "ha7ab86fcg4501g4567g9e6dg99ec7e83e055"
msgid ""
"You promised to stay in Waterdeep. 'Promise,' verb, meaning <i>to swear "
"something will or will not be done.</i>"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 61b7cacd-bab7-dec7-0a72-8e3158c96b9e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD:61b7cacd-bab7-dec7-0a72-8e3158c96b9e
msgctxt "h1942df70g7510g4437gb39dg915e27aa6172"
msgid ""
"*A ring, coursing with magic. The Netherese orb within you shudders, longing "
"to consume, to devour... It must be satisfied.*"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD
#. Speaker = Tara the Tressym
#. NodeID = 63a03cb7-3e55-ce0d-d8c4-e4ce8fc61ad4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD:63a03cb7-3e55-ce0d-d8c4-e4ce8fc61ad4
msgctxt "hc525e2dagb850g4af3g8cf1g3eb2a14c3dee"
msgid "Now eat up! If you explode and kill us all, I'll be furious."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 65312f5b-4720-0370-782f-1b16f486e277
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD:65312f5b-4720-0370-782f-1b16f486e277
msgctxt "h88ea958cg65c9g4d89g8f45g27f8ec01fae9"
msgid "I'm not sure, Tara. It's dangerous out here."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD
#. Speaker = Tara the Tressym
#. NodeID = 678f6ca0-ffcb-a887-87c3-52c85cc2f920
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD:678f6ca0-ffcb-a887-87c3-52c85cc2f920
msgctxt "hceac4045gd741g44b0gbc8fg7ea556450564"
msgid ""
"Making sure you keep on the straight and narrow, as is my task in this weary "
"life."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD
#. Speaker = Tara the Tressym
#. NodeID = 6d829848-2b27-ffad-282d-7948f26efc80
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD:6d829848-2b27-ffad-282d-7948f26efc80
msgctxt "hf4d1dfffg2caeg4b00g8b9ag9fdffa340954"
msgid ""
"We have a great deal of catching up to do. Eat that, have a wash and, for "
"the love of all that's dear, a shave. Then you can fill me in on what I've "
"missed."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 6ed53628-8c3a-49fc-eedc-194c8031a5c0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD:6ed53628-8c3a-49fc-eedc-194c8031a5c0
msgctxt "hcb7571e0gf735g4e16gb717g8d844a365f4e"
msgid ""
"*You know exactly what this illithid parasite will do to you. Within seven "
"days, you'll become a mind flayer.*"
msgstr ""
"*당신은 이 일리시드 기생충이 당신에게 어떤 짓을 할지 정확히 알고 있습니다. 7일 이내에, 당신은 마인드 플레이어가 될 것입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD
#. Speaker = Tara the Tressym
#. NodeID = 715c3210-bf9d-b7de-bdce-dbe3a5b1594e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD:715c3210-bf9d-b7de-bdce-dbe3a5b1594e
msgctxt "he1d0fd65g963ag447fg9a6eg204a370057b8"
msgid "Ahhh, that's it. No one manages the nuances quite like you."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD
#. Speaker = Tara the Tressym
#. NodeID = 7f57fd9b-c910-513c-06b1-149116e71245
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD:7f57fd9b-c910-513c-06b1-149116e71245
msgctxt "hd25543a4g40d0g406bg9c22g8caf73163d90"
msgid ""
"I know, I'm looking exceptionally well. You, on the other hand - how the "
"tidy have fallen. Are you eating?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 86d3ad99-7d36-687a-2413-3b360495ba76
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD:86d3ad99-7d36-687a-2413-3b360495ba76
msgctxt "h912be10eg4e8cg42ffg8c82g1e2d951b0102"
msgid ""
"Goodness, I'd forgotten. Thank the gods you reminded me before I starved to "
"death."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD
#. Speaker = Tara the Tressym
#. NodeID = 911eaa1a-5659-f6a9-8f12-781c466f1487
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD:911eaa1a-5659-f6a9-8f12-781c466f1487
msgctxt "h3cef7edfgade6g4afcg84b7ga446dbebbec9"
msgid "I have my doubts. But first things first..."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = a5fb536a-dc46-b47e-90e0-32992cf2f01d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD:a5fb536a-dc46-b47e-90e0-32992cf2f01d
msgctxt "h58ef030egd686g4db7g9e04g550346418728"
msgid "*Sleep is a hazy oasis on the far side of a desert of worry.*"
msgstr "*잠이란 걱정의 사막 너머의 흐릿한 오아시스입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD
#. Speaker = Tara the Tressym
#. NodeID = ac475433-4740-998e-c7d0-817da2a7617e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD:ac475433-4740-998e-c7d0-817da2a7617e
msgctxt "h9e5b2b9bg5f85g4cefga635gda7b401060ee"
msgid ""
"I won't be teased, heckled, pestered, or vexed, Mr Dekarios. Not before I've "
"had my due."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ade7c6a8-44a5-e6a8-0021-78702d68a916
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD:ade7c6a8-44a5-e6a8-0021-78702d68a916
msgctxt "ha8f414eege8ffg4eacg9790ga06811c7a5e0"
msgid "Dare I ask what you're doing here?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = ae100522-5d49-a852-0950-1d9263aa579f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD:ae100522-5d49-a852-0950-1d9263aa579f
msgctxt "h25d95121g15e8g4442ga1e5g10129959c8e7"
msgid "*You try to think of something else but it's no good.*"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD
#. Speaker = Tara the Tressym
#. NodeID = af339443-c1bf-5cc0-e8c3-8a1fae9d3504
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD:af339443-c1bf-5cc0-e8c3-8a1fae9d3504
msgctxt "h54a9caedg29feg4c7fga8b9g74edb9c32728"
msgid "Anyway - incidentally - I was getting very bored without my friend."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c3f3600e-e74c-90a4-bfbc-a2322b2ca05d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD:c3f3600e-e74c-90a4-bfbc-a2322b2ca05d
msgctxt "hd3844134g45a6g4dcega33eg6bc51804364a"
msgid "Well, well, well. Look what the tressym dragged in."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c79ff225-b667-af68-14df-c5820fc938d8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD:c79ff225-b667-af68-14df-c5820fc938d8
msgctxt "ha3609a76g6454g43c5gbaeeg52c5e5610e44"
msgid "<i>Cast your mind elsewhere.</i>"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ce536a03-84e4-a763-21e9-56986924bf0a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD:ce536a03-84e4-a763-21e9-56986924bf0a
msgctxt "h405839d5g3bffg417fgbd11g11c87e07f011"
msgid "How did you find me?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d03c71b7-e5d6-4c49-24e3-d429e0bd5ac1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD:d03c71b7-e5d6-4c49-24e3-d429e0bd5ac1
msgctxt "h9db56bbbg75a3g4273g9868gde65230c428a"
msgid "You need to go home - now. And that's final."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d3fb89db-7845-b77c-c261-2eca01815c73
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD:d3fb89db-7845-b77c-c261-2eca01815c73
msgctxt "hbb21f269g1e71g4116g8f7bg8a8a651fba29"
msgid "Tara! Is that you?!"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD
#. Speaker = Tara the Tressym
#. NodeID = da6d323f-d3a7-f110-beff-13ac83600377
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD:da6d323f-d3a7-f110-beff-13ac83600377
msgctxt "h23b8a74agf672g4e0dgbfc1gd3800c1bfde8"
msgid ""
"Wizards ask questions, they don't issue imperatives. You ought to know that "
"by now, Mr Dekarios."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = dab04518-2efa-035b-4dbe-9ebb035430ab
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD:dab04518-2efa-035b-4dbe-9ebb035430ab
msgctxt "h663f33e1g7174g479bgbbdegce021a904d46"
msgid "In fact, I think I feel as bad as I look."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e1122c6c-0815-dcd2-e0e5-f6c4f66aca33
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD:e1122c6c-0815-dcd2-e0e5-f6c4f66aca33
msgctxt "h099fbe9fgb1b2g4d42ga5e5g3cf385a39a98"
msgid ""
"<i>Consider that it'll explode, flattening an area larger than Waterdeep.</i>"
msgstr "<i>그게 폭발할 것이고, 워터딥보다 더 넓은 지역을 초토화 시킬 것이라고 생각한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD
#. Speaker = Tara the Tressym
#. NodeID = e402965b-0a5e-e7ae-78ec-94a97996918a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD:e402965b-0a5e-e7ae-78ec-94a97996918a
msgctxt "ha2ec61d2g5a73g45bfgbb8fg5bb40778bba8"
msgid ""
"Handy little spell I've been working on. 'Tara's Catflap of Displacement.' I "
"haven't worked out all the kinks, but I'm starting to be able to find my way "
"around."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e88849da-7c19-671b-c05f-05f089646d53
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD:e88849da-7c19-671b-c05f-05f089646d53
msgctxt "h776a241cgd944g4e10gbbb2g61d0747aa4af"
msgid "Thank you, Tara. I really needed this."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e9f71364-584b-c3a0-dbb5-01388b67eadc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD:e9f71364-584b-c3a0-dbb5-01388b67eadc
msgctxt "h7927cf7dge323g4910g833bg83c3fc0d0692"
msgid "<i>Think of Mystra, goddess of magic.</i>"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ee3314d5-6134-b832-ee0c-95d3dc9581cb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD:ee3314d5-6134-b832-ee0c-95d3dc9581cb
msgctxt "h0a77107ag6ec9g4a80gbce7gb77d8a0fedb9"
msgid "I can look after myself, Tara."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD
#. Speaker = Tara the Tressym
#. NodeID = f26aacf5-72d5-ca18-1496-f571762590e6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD:f26aacf5-72d5-ca18-1496-f571762590e6
msgctxt "hd07d4be6g6462g46d2ga862g99d11a0fcc08"
msgid "Excuse me, Mr Dekarios. Mr Dekarios. Yoo-hoo!"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = f28d96f8-c16e-21aa-61aa-0c32349471b2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD:f28d96f8-c16e-21aa-61aa-0c32349471b2
msgctxt "hdaf3b6f4g6a74g4c5bg94a1gd3e71ce23809"
msgid ""
"*But what about the bomb in your chest? Ceremorphosis is likely to "
"destabilise it. What then?*"
msgstr "*하지만 당신의 가슴에 있는 폭탄은 어쩌죠? 뇌변이는 폭탄을 불안정하게 만들 가능성이 높습니다. 그러면 어떻게 되죠?*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD
#. Speaker = Tara the Tressym
#. NodeID = f5d2efbb-ac7c-a761-8406-830fecced185
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD:f5d2efbb-ac7c-a761-8406-830fecced185
msgctxt "h60970599g0e7cg4cc0g94d0g883864b6b6bc"
msgid ""
"Of course you do. You're still paying the price with that ticking time bomb "
"in your gullet. Ugh, the indignity."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD
#. Speaker = Tara the Tressym
#. NodeID = f6044773-aaa4-93c5-5195-8b2e98f69407
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD:f6044773-aaa4-93c5-5195-8b2e98f69407
msgctxt "h86a38f9dgb54dg4378g99eag0e39e29925e4"
msgid "Destiny is at your door; won't you at least twitch the curtain?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f959baa2-872f-80cf-7c9e-66729df13081
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD:f959baa2-872f-80cf-7c9e-66729df13081
msgctxt "hc9fd3418g62b4g482fg83aag359d5f2eef78"
msgid "Don't get used to it. You need to go back to Waterdeep. Now."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = fdd95252-8ca0-e7b9-32ba-c6aa2de0c023
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD:fdd95252-8ca0-e7b9-32ba-c6aa2de0c023
msgctxt "h7b407148g2f31g44c9gb83aga47fd7de8499"
msgid ""
"*She was furious when she realised what you'd done. Seeking control, trying "
"to prove yourself her equal. You were in love with her. Now you're a danger "
"to everyone you know.*"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD
#. Speaker = Tara the Tressym
#. NodeID = fe78c7ee-990e-cd95-182e-2d19f4050114
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GaleTressymJoin_SD:fe78c7ee-990e-cd95-182e-2d19f4050114
msgctxt "h706e53f6gd46cg4709g9f5fgd6275d3aca3f"
msgid ""
"But I suppose your case is worse than I thought. All the more reason for me "
"to stay and keep an eye on things. We wouldn't want you to make another "
"apocalyptic mistake, would we?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 006b29d8-7e96-53c8-a2c9-b7d0b2b2d3c7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:006b29d8-7e96-53c8-a2c9-b7d0b2b2d3c7
msgctxt "h4d04fe91gd700g4bb7g8840g87d9947b0cdc"
msgid "That's just a lot of delusion speaking."
msgstr "그냥 망상일 뿐이잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 01c141a8-52ef-3acc-3723-eebb0da104d0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 5
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:01c141a8-52ef-3acc-3723-eebb0da104d0
msgctxt "hacb7b9b3gc7c7g4a5bg96f2gd5f60bc4cc71"
msgid "No, there's more to it than that. I know devotion when I see it."
msgstr "아니, 그게 다가 아니잖아. 난 헌신은 보면 알 수 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 02e5a53e-5769-f2d0-5afe-befe617f3fd7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:02e5a53e-5769-f2d0-5afe-befe617f3fd7
msgctxt "ha18432c5g0f3cg44d9gb200g746e43e5734d"
msgid "By all means."
msgstr "물론이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0746aef2-3569-a249-af49-5271b3f8fabe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - SORCERER(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:0746aef2-3569-a249-af49-5271b3f8fabe
msgctxt "h816f2d6ag522dg40dcgb8aegd424d81fa055"
msgid ""
"Magic is like music. But while you need it written down, I can play by ear."
msgstr "마법은 음악과 같아. 음악은 악보가 필요하지만, 난 듣는 것만으로도 연주할 수 있지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 0ce7a8a0-c527-055f-f704-2115ef89867a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:0ce7a8a0-c527-055f-f704-2115ef89867a
msgctxt "h1266d925g98bcg4bd3ga53cg0b73b68959eb"
msgid "*The Weave connects you. The moment feels intimate.*"
msgstr "*위브가 서로를 연결하고 있습니다. 이 순간이 친밀하게 느껴집니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 0ef4944d-2167-e4e0-9415-49c84383c50e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:0ef4944d-2167-e4e0-9415-49c84383c50e
msgctxt "h5b44f3acg7e6fg484fgb08cg56c85d055215"
msgid "You're hard to please, aren't you?"
msgstr "너 참 만족시키기 어려운 사람이구나, 그렇지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 1159e594-06a1-307a-f250-2b65ea643a0f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching_Connected = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:1159e594-06a1-307a-f250-2b65ea643a0f
msgctxt "h3aec17b3g1e76g4e0eg849fgf3f2e02bfaac"
msgid ""
"*You realise the Weave is making you one. You have but to imagine your "
"desire, and Gale will know it.*"
msgstr "*위브로 서로 하나가 되었다는 것이 느껴집니다. 당신의 욕망을 상상하기만 하면 게일이 알아챌 것입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 15905c21-1cd5-2bd8-9298-2f9720912593
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: CLERIC_MYSTRA or PALADIN_MYSTRA
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:15905c21-1cd5-2bd8-9298-2f9720912593
msgctxt "h21ee9bb4ge136g4e6cgba3bg642e0ef9046a"
msgid "It's different, but I can definitely feel Mystra's presence."
msgstr "뭔가 다르지만, 분명 미스트라의 존재감이 느껴져."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 16e6cdb1-0b5d-058f-1010-bd372f6c9ab0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:16e6cdb1-0b5d-058f-1010-bd372f6c9ab0
msgctxt "hb0930d60g4669g4003gbb28g09148f8258d9"
msgid ""
"*You perceive quick-fire gusts of embarrassment, trepidation, and finally... "
"elation.*"
msgstr "*당혹감, 떨림, 그리고 마침내... 엄청난 기쁨이 순식간에 밀려오는 것이 느껴집니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 18704f24-a345-0918-79cb-262dfba67239
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:18704f24-a345-0918-79cb-262dfba67239
msgctxt "h47d769f3g00e6g4126g9871g898950038dfd"
msgid "Actually, never mind. Magic is just not for me."
msgstr "사실은, 신경 쓰지 마. 내게 마법은 맞지 않는 것 같아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 19ba7ca9-55fe-d693-e0c7-d4f0da517929
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:19ba7ca9-55fe-d693-e0c7-d4f0da517929
msgctxt "h6cad0fb1g26a7g4f23g8560g29a07ee77f1a"
msgid ""
"Magic is... my life. I've been in touch with the Weave for as long as I can "
"remember. There's nothing like it."
msgstr "마법은... 내 인생 그 자체야. 난 아주 어릴 때부터 위브와 접촉하며 다루는 법을 배웠어. 다른 일은 생각조차 못했지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1a600b27-9d3b-a342-c725-acb6ddccdc28
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: (CLERIC or PALADIN) and !(CLERIC_MYSTRA and PALADIN_MYSTRA)
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:1a600b27-9d3b-a342-c725-acb6ddccdc28
msgctxt "h2e7b83fag7ecdg43b1g94b9g4ec4ba5db676"
msgid "I wouldn't go quite that far myself."
msgstr "나라면 그 정도로 깊이 가진 않을 것 같은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 1b0ea74f-34d9-ce72-f3e1-de0d802eb0b3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:1b0ea74f-34d9-ce72-f3e1-de0d802eb0b3
msgctxt "haf1ec0fage4dcg415ag865dg36f9006e020d"
msgid ""
"*The Weave evaporates, and as it does so, you realise the night feels "
"suddenly cold and lonesome.*"
msgstr "*위브가 사라집니다, 그러자, 갑자기 밤의 추위와 쓸쓸함이 느껴집니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1c021f2f-8f0f-800b-fa50-1fb67823fb7e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: BARD
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:1c021f2f-8f0f-800b-fa50-1fb67823fb7e
msgctxt "h3420d16dg0726g476dg872dgce520cf96460"
msgid "Ah, Mystra. The matron of magic herself. An ambitious desire, Gale."
msgstr "아, 미스트라. 마법의 여주인. 아주 야심찬 욕망이야, 게일."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1c021f2f-8f0f-800b-fa50-1fb67823fb7e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: WIZARD
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:1c021f2f-8f0f-800b-fa50-1fb67823fb7e
msgctxt "h36fe2782g8790g4d71gaeb6gbb0a7e578352"
msgid "That's Mystra, isn't it?"
msgstr "그건 미스트라잖아, 그렇지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1c8ed5cc-e112-5290-bd79-48cb060c60b9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:1c8ed5cc-e112-5290-bd79-48cb060c60b9
msgctxt "h07bae4eeg90c5g4a73ga2e9g0b8d0ff9b5a0"
msgid "Magical."
msgstr "황홀해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 1fa24920-8a60-b13e-1207-0eab002d5dcf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:1fa24920-8a60-b13e-1207-0eab002d5dcf
msgctxt "hec318197ga599g4f98g94e8gb537e02c4177"
msgid "Good night. Yes. Good night."
msgstr "좋은 밤. 그래. 잘 자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 20430fb8-db8d-2cf1-5a01-79dc1485cefe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Dexterity
#. DifficultyClass: 5
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:20430fb8-db8d-2cf1-5a01-79dc1485cefe
msgctxt "hfc93dff5gda9bg42b2g8bdbgf2196dc578d9"
msgid "<i>Imitate the gesture with a flourish.</i>"
msgstr "<i>과장된 행동으로 손동작을 따라한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 2370ec4b-e4fb-43cd-1c59-36b7ad529489
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CAMP_Gale_SpellTeaching_Mystra = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:2370ec4b-e4fb-43cd-1c59-36b7ad529489
msgctxt "hc4e95019g7816g45edgaa62gf91bebc75199"
msgid "Mystra is all magic. And as far as I'm concerned, she is all creation."
msgstr "미스트라가 곧 마법이야. 그리고 내가 생각하기론, 그녀가 곧 모든 창조물이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2b2fac10-f73a-80ea-0305-665a64559edb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 7
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:2b2fac10-f73a-80ea-0305-665a64559edb
msgctxt "h2b4935a9g23a5g43f3g9a28g9c656b171e94"
msgid "<i>Try to hum a familiar tune.</i>"
msgstr "<i>익숙한 노래를 흥얼거린다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 2c27be13-c0af-fd97-aee8-bf4d2a89950d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:2c27be13-c0af-fd97-aee8-bf4d2a89950d
msgctxt "h98ed379bg28e3g4f23gb2a7g05c102c7481f"
msgid ""
"*Suddenly: the scent of rosewater and a sense of wellbeing. A sliver of "
"Weave that tastes sweet on the tongue.*"
msgstr "*불현듯 장미 향수의 내음과 만족감이 느껴집니다. 위브 한 조각이 혀끝에 달콤한 맛으로 내려앉습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 2e3a1d71-4fa4-733a-4712-3350732b90fd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:2e3a1d71-4fa4-733a-4712-3350732b90fd
msgctxt "h7dc86404g5550g4b5bgbe6bg01ed956f20e1"
msgid "That was... unnecessary."
msgstr "그건... 필요 없었는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 2fbafb04-d4b2-4d0c-54d8-ea5db6171f6e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:2fbafb04-d4b2-4d0c-54d8-ea5db6171f6e
msgctxt "h3dc3cdb5g5050g4517ga3c6g54f717ac8a53"
msgid "Truly."
msgstr "정말로."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 31c23af0-3420-3abb-266d-20bf01e4c86f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching_Pictured_Head(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:31c23af0-3420-3abb-266d-20bf01e4c86f
msgctxt "hc37ab3e1gf10cg4dfdg9fa5gf7d77b1b10fb"
msgid "<i>Picture kicking him in the gut.</i>"
msgstr "<i>그의 고간을 발로 차는 상상을 한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 31f9cd25-b988-0371-380c-0611b4a806c3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CAMP_Gale_SpellTeaching_Scene = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:31f9cd25-b988-0371-380c-0611b4a806c3
msgctxt "h5ecb508dgadd1g461cgadbbge1e5dbae0b05"
msgid "Oh! My, you startled me. I... I was miles away."
msgstr "오! 이런, 깜짝 놀랐네. 난... 잠시 딴생각 중이었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 32764b81-bf9e-edcf-3abe-1735b168d4e2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Intelligence
#. DifficultyClass: 7
#. TagRule: !REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:32764b81-bf9e-edcf-3abe-1735b168d4e2
msgctxt "h013a262cg9551g4a4dg9136g75ee3c2eacb6"
msgid "<i>Recall a memory of early youth, a happy family moment.</i>"
msgstr "<i>어린 시절 행복했던 순간을 떠올린다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 33d11619-d066-2c38-5e3a-927678d8beb5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:33d11619-d066-2c38-5e3a-927678d8beb5
msgctxt "h8bee5695g3ab5g4e74g899fgd8d9e33c4a97"
msgid "Good night. I enjoyed sharing a moment of magic with you."
msgstr "잘자. 너와 마법의 순간을 함께할 수 있어서 즐거웠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 374c62da-da6e-643c-e5cb-e6d1d9cbf3b1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:374c62da-da6e-643c-e5cb-e6d1d9cbf3b1
msgctxt "h2e50c664gc1ccg476ag9139gd1fdba8406f9"
msgid "Of course, of course. I was just... practising an incantation."
msgstr "물론, 물론. 난 그저... 주문을 연습하고 있었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 38c90626-58f8-ef5a-f141-29d27d7bb7d0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:38c90626-58f8-ef5a-f141-29d27d7bb7d0
msgctxt "h7babda0aga643g4249gbb4agf5ed6dcb88a4"
msgid ""
"<i>Harmony comes easily to you. Allow it to wash over your mind and "
"magic.</i>"
msgstr "<i>조화가 당신에게 편안히 찾아온다. 조화가 당신의 마음과 마법을 씻어내도록 허용한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 3ea57936-2f04-1251-917e-1e48b37b0360
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - PALADIN(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:3ea57936-2f04-1251-917e-1e48b37b0360
msgctxt "h60299bbag9a9dg4282ga50cg81a36d0ccf0a"
msgid "I'm no paladin, like you are. It's different for a wizard."
msgstr "난 너처럼 팔라딘이 아니야. 위저드에겐 달라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 4000c6be-330b-3147-a9bd-81e073d09fad
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:4000c6be-330b-3147-a9bd-81e073d09fad
msgctxt "hf4ddb1adg98f8g4b67g8fc1gdc417d00147e"
msgid ""
"I think it's a mistake to hold that conviction, but I cannot force your hand."
msgstr "그런 신념을 가지는 건 실수인 것 같지만, 네게 강요할 생각은 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4054f96d-6ef8-5811-61aa-e85acc0a9c44
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 5
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:4054f96d-6ef8-5811-61aa-e85acc0a9c44
msgctxt "hb003c20aga8eeg4589gb489g4bd2f842d463"
msgid "You don't have that look on your face when you're looking at 'no one'."
msgstr "'아무나'를 바라볼 때는 그런 표정을 짓지 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 42701a61-18ae-ad52-fb96-43ad459ea609
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching_Pictured_Walk(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:42701a61-18ae-ad52-fb96-43ad459ea609
msgctxt "h1eb8e8afg476cg46e1g9582g578471a3082f"
msgid "<i>Picture a walk, holding hands.</i>"
msgstr "<i>손을 잡고 걸어가는 상상을 한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 42e6e0f7-5f20-0dd6-9d15-29b2323f72bd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:42e6e0f7-5f20-0dd6-9d15-29b2323f72bd
msgctxt "ha4677b71g9fbdg4650gbaceg604483c514c1"
msgid "Always a pity when opportunities slip us by."
msgstr "기회를 놓치는 것은 언제나 안타까운 일이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 42fcd82c-9275-d908-6060-d4d0738173d6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:42fcd82c-9275-d908-6060-d4d0738173d6
msgctxt "h3b700221g0fb8g486agbdfag8dfed2b34829"
msgid "You wouldn't say that if you felt what I feel."
msgstr "네가 나처럼 느꼈다면 그렇게 말하지 않았을 텐데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 45a04f88-9d0d-b428-6cfc-12d95f5cc1ca
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:45a04f88-9d0d-b428-6cfc-12d95f5cc1ca
msgctxt "hc829a36bg3799g4414g9160gb089cda8d867"
msgid ""
"No sculpture or painting could ever do her justice, only the fabric that she "
"herself is and embodies:"
msgstr "어떤 조각이나 그림도 그녀의 모습을 표현하지는 못해, 그저 그녀의 파편만을 표현할 뿐이지:"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 45c544d4-17eb-a663-afad-e3c778e256f4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - WIZARD(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CAMP_Gale_SpellTeaching_Success = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:45c544d4-17eb-a663-afad-e3c778e256f4
msgctxt "h8b7d6ed0gc177g45cfgb1f6g5980e5997afc"
msgid "Look at that. We're channelling the Weave. How does it feel?"
msgstr "이거 봐. 우리가 위브를 다루고 있어. 느낌이 어때?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 4b2b508a-36c0-9495-30d7-5f69666a8c8f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:4b2b508a-36c0-9495-30d7-5f69666a8c8f
msgctxt "hb445d98cge6fdg43f1gb045ga28abf17761a"
msgid "She does. She's... She's Mystra."
msgstr "그래. 그녀는... 그녀는 미스트라야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 4c6b76cf-30b1-406c-0e28-76f2dcf57853
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CAMP_Gale_SpellTeaching_Mystra = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:4c6b76cf-30b1-406c-0e28-76f2dcf57853
msgctxt "h1dd1c195g0d34g40a3g9ab7g0c74e214351a"
msgid "*You are safe. You are nestled in the cup of her hand.*"
msgstr "*당신은 안전합니다. 당신은 그녀의 손 안에 따뜻이 앉아 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5704f696-357d-900e-c624-2e90b6413a8c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching_Pictured_Nothing(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:5704f696-357d-900e-c624-2e90b6413a8c
msgctxt "h96031b70ge3b7g42cfg938fg288d9ff6660a"
msgid "<i>Picture nothing. This is a bad idea.</i>"
msgstr "<i>아무것도 상상하지 않는다. 이건 별로 좋은 생각이 아니다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 577b18e1-3f1c-8d17-eed2-867416e6bd7a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:577b18e1-3f1c-8d17-eed2-867416e6bd7a
msgctxt "h958380e4g54bdg47bag9b69g515ac8d9dbb6"
msgid "Not quite. But this is the easy part. Shall we try again?"
msgstr "틀렸어. 하지만 이건 쉬운 부분이야. 다시 해볼까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 57daea63-18c4-554b-1ab3-7278b32f8787
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Intelligence
#. DifficultyClass: 7
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:57daea63-18c4-554b-1ab3-7278b32f8787
msgctxt "hf93eac97gebe9g4e50g8bb3gcc967388ca14"
msgid "<i>Repeat the words, slowly, but carefully.</i>"
msgstr "<i>천천히, 조심스럽게 따라한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5c90868a-3994-b4bd-7070-6749a70c4ee4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - SORCERER_WILDMAGIC(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:5c90868a-3994-b4bd-7070-6749a70c4ee4
msgctxt "hdcd7bdeeg75fbg4520gb04dg972785e360ff"
msgid "It's less 'music and poetry', and more 'I hope I don't blow up'."
msgstr "'음악과 시' 보다는 '제발 터지지 말아 주세요' 같은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 611762eb-d96b-b88f-8029-30f7c44778ff
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:611762eb-d96b-b88f-8029-30f7c44778ff
msgctxt "h5827273egc2edg4e9bgb23cg9936f0c8f355"
msgid "That it does."
msgstr "실로 그렇지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 6223cbf4-36ef-22db-9ed5-d677bb7f5b36
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:6223cbf4-36ef-22db-9ed5-d677bb7f5b36
msgctxt "h40cf0836gacb0g4935g99d7ge47c26b1b2bf"
msgid "Disinterest is such a disheartening condition."
msgstr "무관심이라니 아주 비관적인 태도군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 62935cd5-49d8-a015-2dbd-f3af1fe272f9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:62935cd5-49d8-a015-2dbd-f3af1fe272f9
msgctxt "h337f0099g1e87g4444ga50cga121fd6d817a"
msgid "No, I have no interest in such magic."
msgstr "아니, 그런 마법엔 관심 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 6405e804-a823-4774-2623-711b59afb78e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:6405e804-a823-4774-2623-711b59afb78e
msgctxt "h47f6fc38g3f0ag4dc3gb589g44051116099c"
msgid "The Weave."
msgstr "위브 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 64870780-5191-44e2-ae71-f9315397d2e5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:64870780-5191-44e2-ae71-f9315397d2e5
msgctxt "hd78be8b5g720cg4042g88ffgd298ad1acb3b"
msgid "Yes - as raw and ancient as the veins of Bahamut."
msgstr "그래, 바하무트의 정맥 만큼이나 오래되고 변하지 않았지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6c896eb8-a3c7-220e-93b6-a1cb55875c20
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: CLERIC_MYSTRA or PALADIN_MYSTRA
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:6c896eb8-a3c7-220e-93b6-a1cb55875c20
msgctxt "h469e2714g7bceg4a1fg8b0bgff287640755b"
msgid "I quite agree. There's no greater deity than Mystra."
msgstr "동의해. 미스트라보다 위대한 신은 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6f0c5ae7-3fd2-3fdd-7647-44f7826cfa55
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:6f0c5ae7-3fd2-3fdd-7647-44f7826cfa55
msgctxt "hbc776fc2gd067g4f5bg94adgb511fa770dbd"
msgid "If you say so."
msgstr "네가 그렇다면야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6f10dde9-0620-0071-16e3-3755edd5909e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:6f10dde9-0620-0071-16e3-3755edd5909e
msgctxt "h39dfe200g4eecg4d94gaf9dga5f6b3af00c0"
msgid "Sounding more of a poet than a wizard there, Gale."
msgstr "위저드보다는 시인처럼 들리는데, 게일."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 6f32d753-f3c3-b472-60b4-cebb4e7c80e9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:6f32d753-f3c3-b472-60b4-cebb4e7c80e9
msgctxt "ha15e0724g19e0g43cdg9396g902e47a09fd0"
msgid ""
"There it goes. How easily things slip away from us, no matter how hard they "
"were in the obtaining."
msgstr "여기까지네. 아무리 어렵게 얻은 것이라도 얼마나 쉽게 우리 곁에서 멀어지는지 몰라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 6f3927e2-3164-d234-3c41-1c2da276313b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:6f3927e2-3164-d234-3c41-1c2da276313b
msgctxt "h6fad0584g8747g4c82g925bge5b1097606a9"
msgid "No, but you do understand, don't you?"
msgstr "그래, 하지만 이해는 되잖아, 안 그래?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 6fc16be6-3a30-0bc5-701e-5b76e9053904
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:6fc16be6-3a30-0bc5-701e-5b76e9053904
msgctxt "h0959b28bg1aeeg4537gb094g513d5e497108"
msgid "You just don't understand."
msgstr "이해가 안 되나 보네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 70b99e90-1b8e-0219-b662-d886ccabb852
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 7
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:70b99e90-1b8e-0219-b662-d886ccabb852
msgctxt "h19da919dgeec5g41e0g88aag42dcc6128867"
msgid "<i>Picture the perfect darkness - to be in the womb of Shar.</i>"
msgstr "<i>완벽한 어둠을 상상한다. 마치 샤의 자궁 속에 있는 것처럼.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 70f414e8-b039-7fd1-1043-12dd9fc4ede1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:70f414e8-b039-7fd1-1043-12dd9fc4ede1
msgctxt "ha66db4b3g9628g4adega714g6c565e6bf220"
msgid "I'm going to bed. Perhaps this was all a mistake."
msgstr "자러 가야겠어. 이 모든 게 실수였는지도 모르겠네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7366181a-e591-6072-a447-6e09da176dd9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:7366181a-e591-6072-a447-6e09da176dd9
msgctxt "h49b8cbdbg02c3g4db6g9c69gcf96638680c2"
msgid "It feels like a good time to call it a night."
msgstr "이만 잠을 자기에 좋은 시간인 것 같네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 75168310-f97b-b613-574d-b1087097469f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:75168310-f97b-b613-574d-b1087097469f
msgctxt "h55f83fa3gfdb4g4964gaa87g15edf01c51df"
msgid "Excellent. Now repeat after me: <i>Ah-Thran Mystra-Ryl Kantrach-Ao</i>."
msgstr "좋았어. 이제 날 따라 말해 봐: <i>아-쓰란 미스트라-릴 칸트라크-에이오</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 7637025b-f05b-3355-ca81-f74065dea432
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:7637025b-f05b-3355-ca81-f74065dea432
msgctxt "h50c5bceeg3784g49dcg961ag38e062242460"
msgid ""
"Perhaps we can share the experience by reaching into the Weave together."
msgstr "함께 위브에 연결해 경험을 나눌 수 있을지도 몰라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 7939cdb2-64a0-2740-474d-cf12b6f56f4d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:7939cdb2-64a0-2740-474d-cf12b6f56f4d
msgctxt "h7474d07dg4487g49fbga6fag02c859970767"
msgid "Not praying. Not quite. I was just... practising an incantation."
msgstr "기도하는 건 아니었어. 난 그저... 주문을 연습하고 있었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7b2e2bfd-b974-33da-719f-e2d4abdff926
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:7b2e2bfd-b974-33da-719f-e2d4abdff926
msgctxt "h0ff7da37g8d42g4cafg9ec9g05c2cd8c08e4"
msgid ""
"Magic <i>is</i> music, poetry, and beauty. Though I suspect you and I "
"perform it differently."
msgstr "마법은 음악, 시, 그리고 아름다움이야. 물론 너와 내가 그걸 행하는 방법은 다르겠지만."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7c7d35a6-5bcc-38f1-5bec-56b74f551ee6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:7c7d35a6-5bcc-38f1-5bec-56b74f551ee6
msgctxt "hab213654g4045g46bag9088g5a4ce0088b82"
msgid "<i>This feels too intimate. It's time to let slip the Weave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>너무 친밀한 느낌이다. 이제 위브를 보내줄 시간이다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7efcd6af-c9a8-f038-be1f-88276f7fbf71
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: !(BARD and SORCERER and WIZARD)
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:7efcd6af-c9a8-f038-be1f-88276f7fbf71
msgctxt "h7abd866ega35dg4e04gbe8dg281c87b6c94f"
msgid "The figure you conjured: who is she? Someone you miss?"
msgstr "네가 만들었던 환영: 그녀는 누구야? 네가 그리워하는 사람인가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 7fd84208-1689-c88d-6b2d-d9854b511694
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: CLERIC_MYSTRA or PALADIN_MYSTRA
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:7fd84208-1689-c88d-6b2d-d9854b511694
msgctxt "h6edada68g2b56g4e1bgaff7g5e7267796e86"
msgid ""
"In any case, don't blame yourself. Mystra can be a fickle mistress. As I'm "
"sure you're aware."
msgstr "어쨌든 너 자신을 탓하진 마. 미스트라는 변덕스러울 때가 많으니까. 너도 알겠지만 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 81ccab13-bb07-56ff-5251-44fb386bbc04
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:81ccab13-bb07-56ff-5251-44fb386bbc04
msgctxt "hf7f25594g2078g4cedg9341g6fbbd1eee36d"
msgid ""
"*You see - or is it sense? - the unmistakable presence of Mystra, the Lady "
"of Mysteries.*"
msgstr "*무언가 보입니다. 아니, 느껴진다고 해야 할까요? 분명 신비의 여인, 미스트라의 존재감입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 82435e2f-f557-f7a5-9136-7ca2b7ee79c4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Dexterity
#. DifficultyClass: 5
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:82435e2f-f557-f7a5-9136-7ca2b7ee79c4
msgctxt "h52d15e69g981ag4acfga5a5ge770187aea09"
msgid "Yes, I will try again."
msgstr "그래, 다시 해볼게."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 8432acae-957f-2937-109e-1562b2efa7d1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:8432acae-957f-2937-109e-1562b2efa7d1
msgctxt "hb0302ef7g9fc2g4bb3gbbf2g4a3f3a6d996b"
msgid ""
"No, I'm sorry, but it looks like magic's not on the cards tonight. Perhaps "
"I'm not quite the teacher I fancy myself to be."
msgstr "미안하지만 오늘은 마법을 배울 수 없을 것 같아. 생각보다 내가 가르치는데 소질이 없나 봐."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 84e3659d-0103-c458-d273-8525047225ec
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: CLERIC_MYSTRA or PALADIN_MYSTRA
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:84e3659d-0103-c458-d273-8525047225ec
msgctxt "hd082fc92g1942g4561g9ed7g9f0b8bcb9979"
msgid "That's Mystra - the Mother of All Magic herself."
msgstr "그건 모든 마법의 어머니인 미스트라잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 85ae6c32-b54f-3205-824a-f12e68f93482
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: CLERIC
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:85ae6c32-b54f-3205-824a-f12e68f93482
msgctxt "h8c5ae224gf481g46eegaa42g2d40b6e4828a"
msgid "I know that look. You were praying to your goddess, weren't you?"
msgstr "그 모습이 누군지 알겠군. 네 여신에게 기도하고 있었잖아, 안 그래?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 86dab1f2-8a30-d9f9-f03a-d2f7baf7630a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:86dab1f2-8a30-d9f9-f03a-d2f7baf7630a
msgctxt "hf21f6099gb8f7g4fa5ga642g1ac257aa7650"
msgid "Pretty."
msgstr "예쁜데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 88ab6544-3bc4-9727-c00e-d6afe2d7cfd8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: BARD or SORCERER or WIZARD
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:88ab6544-3bc4-9727-c00e-d6afe2d7cfd8
msgctxt "h20448763gf95fg466ega4a0g88b765e5c028"
msgid "<i>Imitate the gesture with ease.</i>"
msgstr "<i>손쉽게 손동작을 따라한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8986943a-4e6e-8480-eeb6-2ca394d7bd7b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 5
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:8986943a-4e6e-8480-eeb6-2ca394d7bd7b
msgctxt "hd4d02f1bg82c2g41e9ga818g97e8cc1f0074"
msgid ""
"There's more to it than that. The figure I saw: she means something to you."
msgstr "뭔가 더 있잖아. 내가 봤던 그 형상, 그녀가 분명 너에게 의미 있는 사람이겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 899e430a-7a2e-7753-5307-83ce0578aa30
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: CLERIC_MYSTRA or PALADIN_MYSTRA
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:899e430a-7a2e-7753-5307-83ce0578aa30
msgctxt "hc0696795g9d01g410egb04ag72f84b8fc33d"
msgid "Mystra normally answers me through prayer, but I don't mind trying."
msgstr "미스트라는 보통 기도를 통해 내게 응답하지만, 좋아, 시도해서 나쁠 건 없지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8a9e13ca-3f47-2a3b-29f9-824615749637
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:8a9e13ca-3f47-2a3b-29f9-824615749637
msgctxt "h49371a7egd38ag42f0gaf76ge78310ecf58f"
msgid "I didn't realise the depth of your devotion."
msgstr "네가 그렇게까지 헌신적인 줄은 몰랐는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8b843acd-6161-bcac-dbc8-a9988fb5a01c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:8b843acd-6161-bcac-dbc8-a9988fb5a01c
msgctxt "h7b325994g1c40g4450g8b23g139d150ba6c7"
msgid "Just go to sleep, why don't you. We have a long day ahead of us."
msgstr "잠이나 자지 그래. 앞으로 긴 여정이 있을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 8d3df4a5-a291-67f9-d5e1-cace469ac721
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:8d3df4a5-a291-67f9-d5e1-cace469ac721
msgctxt "h0fef219eg30bcg4859ga66ag5feb85e102a5"
msgid "What can I say? She's... She's Mystra."
msgstr "뭘 더 말할 수 있겠어? 그녀는... 그녀는 미스트라야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8f4530cb-e355-1a8f-348e-a41c325a1ef5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - SORCERER(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:8f4530cb-e355-1a8f-348e-a41c325a1ef5
msgctxt "h36c5a4e3gb9e3g4c6bga839g487fef0aa1c9"
msgid "That's the deity you wizards adore - Mystra, right?"
msgstr "너희 위저드들이 흠모하는 여신, 미스트라잖아, 그렇지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 908a81bb-291a-5236-702a-dab7f17b1b06
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: !(CLERIC_MYSTRA and PALADIN_MYSTRA)
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:908a81bb-291a-5236-702a-dab7f17b1b06
msgctxt "he3dca26fg1df7g4223gbbcbg214658a7f5a4"
msgid ""
"In any case, don't blame yourself. Mystra can be a fickle mistress. Coy to a "
"tee."
msgstr "어쨌든, 자책하지 마. 미스트라는 변덕을 자주 부리거든. 수줍음이 많아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 91e73139-4569-083f-6ece-c4be4be68e89
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: BARD or SORCERER or WIZARD
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:91e73139-4569-083f-6ece-c4be4be68e89
msgctxt "ha0cda056gb333g4e54ga017g5229b284d179"
msgid "Is it the same for you?"
msgstr "네게도 마찬가지인가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 93fb8526-434b-da93-ecb7-76994c9e9fb6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: BARD
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:93fb8526-434b-da93-ecb7-76994c9e9fb6
msgctxt "h08330878g80ddg4a7fg8261g2729fc4f86f0"
msgid ""
"There are many tales of mages falling madly in love with Mystra. Doesn't "
"tend to end well."
msgstr "미스트라와 미친 듯한 사랑에 빠진 마법사 이야기는 많이 있어. 하지만 대부분은 결말이 좋지 않지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 93fb8526-434b-da93-ecb7-76994c9e9fb6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: SORCERER or WIZARD
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:93fb8526-434b-da93-ecb7-76994c9e9fb6
msgctxt "hbdf3317fge425g4629gba12gd4b244eb17ce"
msgid "Care to tell me why you were conjuring an image of Mystra?"
msgstr "실례가 안된다면 왜 미스트라의 환영을 보고 있었는지 물어도 될까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9590f335-3989-aa44-17fd-9d004a7b72a8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Dexterity
#. DifficultyClass: 5
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:9590f335-3989-aa44-17fd-9d004a7b72a8
msgctxt "h3125fabagf440g4532g8997ga570e6d84ae0"
msgid "<i>Imitate the gesture slowly and as precisely as you can.</i>"
msgstr "<i>최대한 느리고 세밀하게 손동작을 따라한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 96fc3c3b-bb82-fc9e-a89c-6c5dba910310
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:96fc3c3b-bb82-fc9e-a89c-6c5dba910310
msgctxt "ha9636c7dg0af2g420dg90e1ge1ccbfda1b90"
msgid "Long days, yes."
msgstr "긴 하루지, 그래."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 98db28a6-da92-aaaa-b33b-da18622baded
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: (CLERIC or PALADIN) and !(CLERIC_MYSTRA and PALADIN_MYSTRA)
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:98db28a6-da92-aaaa-b33b-da18622baded
msgctxt "h791709b2g02e7g4c75gba20g2957a1241816"
msgid "Magic normally comes to me through prayer, but I don't mind trying."
msgstr "마법은 주로 기도를 통해 내게 오지만, 시도해 봐서 나쁠 건 없겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 991e5185-a4ed-e398-a208-058a0a32e6b7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:991e5185-a4ed-e398-a208-058a0a32e6b7
msgctxt "h8388a084gdb2bg425eg9cfag6d2cd3568ac1"
msgid ""
"I think it's a mistake to give up on the brink of success, but I cannot "
"force your hand."
msgstr "성공을 눈앞에 두고 포기하는 건 실수라고 생각하지만, 강요할 순 없지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 9953eed9-c0b6-2efe-40fb-14b886dbb14a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CAMP_Gale_SpellTeaching_Mystra = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:9953eed9-c0b6-2efe-40fb-14b886dbb14a
msgctxt "had21b187gb943g4d5fg9e5cg6d9a647bc71c"
msgid "*You are safe. You are nestled in the cup of Mystra's hand.*"
msgstr "*당신은 안전합니다. 미스트라의 손길 속에서 따뜻하게 안겨있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 9c302155-90ef-faed-bae6-fdde4a7cb5fd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - WIZARD(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CAMP_Gale_SpellTeaching_Success = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:9c302155-90ef-faed-bae6-fdde4a7cb5fd
msgctxt "h3fda792eg64dbg4f93g844age4b440011512"
msgid "You did it. You're channelling the Weave. How does it feel?"
msgstr "해냈군. 위브를 다루고 있어. 느낌이 어때?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9c4ab844-563f-96da-2230-530ec962968b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 7
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:9c4ab844-563f-96da-2230-530ec962968b
msgctxt "h20d5f5f2g93e9g459dga4b4gee3486a67a77"
msgid "<i>Think of the here and now: this unexpected moment of learning.</i>"
msgstr "<i>예상치 못했던 배움의 시간, 바로 이 순간을 떠올린다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 9ef58620-380d-e912-aa31-250624d0bac1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:9ef58620-380d-e912-aa31-250624d0bac1
msgctxt "hfa9fe820ge510g45b7g856cg5049280809a3"
msgid "I'm no cleric, like you are. It's different for a wizard."
msgstr "난 너처럼 클레릭이 아니야. 위저드에겐 달라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 9f0bfde9-722c-71f9-6979-498cd8035630
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - ORI_State_DatingGale(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:9f0bfde9-722c-71f9-6979-498cd8035630
msgctxt "he253440egc574g4bb5g95feg9e25c02b2239"
msgid "I... I didn't think..."
msgstr "난... 그럴 줄은..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = a07a0493-4258-9776-fda8-fc81217ced02
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:a07a0493-4258-9776-fda8-fc81217ced02
msgctxt "heb310344gdeffg40d2g8b44g578df3a90c08"
msgid "I see you understand."
msgstr "이해한 것 같네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = a6d44a04-165f-feba-5f3b-462bfb46ab40
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:a6d44a04-165f-feba-5f3b-462bfb46ab40
msgctxt "h73b72af1g1ae4g4f28gac45g0b981ef49297"
msgid ""
"I do - because it's through practice that I seek to perfect. To augment."
msgstr "하지, 난 연습을 통해 완벽을 추구해. 실력을 키우는 거지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a7a9bdfe-91bf-db89-a69f-b8b21d0ce55b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: SORCERER or WIZARD
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:a7a9bdfe-91bf-db89-a69f-b8b21d0ce55b
msgctxt "hb8f3c2bfg827eg4540g8b1bg89b7d0630696"
msgid "<i>An easy incantation. Simply repeat after Gale.</i>"
msgstr "<i>쉬운 주문입니다. 게일을 손쉽게 따라합니다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a892efeb-92f5-7493-3936-f7122ad59dfd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:a892efeb-92f5-7493-3936-f7122ad59dfd
msgctxt "h76295d44g9f67g44d6ga8a0gc957a79e17e2"
msgid "<i>Hold on to the moment. It's a good night for intimacy.</i>"
msgstr "<i>잠시 순간을 즐긴다. 친밀감을 느끼기에 좋은 밤이다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = aca9494a-ebef-3083-007d-64794644aa5f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:aca9494a-ebef-3083-007d-64794644aa5f
msgctxt "h3fc7badfg8a08g4d86gaf22g62249a26c6a7"
msgid "I'll leave you to it then. Good night."
msgstr "그럼 그냥 내버려 둘게. 잘자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = ae29d14f-8778-b690-7703-d3f19f363501
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:ae29d14f-8778-b690-7703-d3f19f363501
msgctxt "hac40864bgd700g4955g9853g58e92c8ba784"
msgid "And long, lonesome nights."
msgstr "아주 길고 외로운 밤이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = ae721d1c-f4cf-c1b5-d838-4b49ecda3e4e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:ae721d1c-f4cf-c1b5-d838-4b49ecda3e4e
msgctxt "hd64742cege948g4fa8g9e70gb449f9d426cb"
msgid "Believe it or not, I can relate."
msgstr "믿거나 말거나, 나도 공감해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b0c81e13-adad-35d1-7f7c-e516eaed45e3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:b0c81e13-adad-35d1-7f7c-e516eaed45e3
msgctxt "hcc990cefg3d02g4beegbb99g0604c6cf6227"
msgid "Actually, I dislike tongue twisters. Let's just call it a night."
msgstr "사실, 어려운 발음은 싫어서. 이만 자자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b195bc8d-eec0-f6a1-4051-ae96dcf4aa27
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:b195bc8d-eec0-f6a1-4051-ae96dcf4aa27
msgctxt "hae786e7dg8b1eg44dfgb42bg866a20648604"
msgid "I practise magic, not melodrama."
msgstr "난 마법을 연습해, 멜로 드라마가 아니라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b23f9211-ab34-7d2a-82a5-71d0b39723fb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:b23f9211-ab34-7d2a-82a5-71d0b39723fb
msgctxt "h6f3974c6g711eg4b5fga912gcf546e7baf33"
msgid ""
"That's too abstract for my tastes. Let's just forget about it, shall we?"
msgstr "내겐 너무 추상적인 개념이야. 그냥 없던 일로 하자, 알겠지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = b7864894-c519-36ec-bd05-4f1a8c228472
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:b7864894-c519-36ec-bd05-4f1a8c228472
msgctxt "h4bfb3fc6g68b4g4b2egaacdg5c5a61bc1369"
msgid "Most pleasant, in fact. Most welcome."
msgstr "사실, 아주 즐거운 상상이었어. 아주 환영이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b8b25226-0471-2730-8da1-cfaca12fdf99
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching_Pictured_Spike(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:b8b25226-0471-2730-8da1-cfaca12fdf99
msgctxt "h695138ecgf58fg42c8g8868g5d06a6e691e9"
msgid "<i>Picture his severed head on a spike.</i>"
msgstr "<i>그의 절단된 머리가 창에 꽂혀있는 상상을 한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b929acbd-04cc-2b65-4bc4-e40cedd1dac3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:b929acbd-04cc-2b65-4bc4-e40cedd1dac3
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h9b767e57g8ddbg411dg86b2g795f6bc83c04"
msgid "Is everything all right?"
msgstr "괜찮은 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ba3347fb-359e-ef82-e19b-9a45a51cf150
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - WIZARD(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:ba3347fb-359e-ef82-e19b-9a45a51cf150
msgctxt "hc313df06gc095g4cb8g9030ga0736c02f055"
msgid "I quite agree. There's no greater deity than Mystra."
msgstr "동의해. 미스트라보다 위대한 신은 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = bb678939-6e77-4ba7-1d62-8b3fd30acbc8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:bb678939-6e77-4ba7-1d62-8b3fd30acbc8
msgctxt "hb0db02eegc527g4058g92bbg6dc08d7fdf6e"
msgid ""
"*Ah, yes: the scent of rosewater and a sense of wellbeing. A sliver of Weave "
"that tastes sweet on the tongue.*"
msgstr "*아, 그래요. 장미 향수의 내음과 만족감. 위브 한 조각이 혀끝에 달콤한 맛으로 내려앉습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = bbc40045-59fb-d8f2-4cae-0a39f1ee0435
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:bbc40045-59fb-d8f2-4cae-0a39f1ee0435
msgctxt "he92a9596ga026g46c8g9088g45f690a472d9"
msgid ""
"Fair enough - though in the end we're still playing the same composition."
msgstr "인정할게 - 어쨌거나 우린 여전히 같은 음악을 연주하고 있잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = bbec738b-4211-f25a-20f6-1b408417aee6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:bbec738b-4211-f25a-20f6-1b408417aee6
msgctxt "h9bd0141cg4f0bg4dbagb9b0g47ab607f9148"
msgid ""
"Still, it is magic in its purest, most essential rapture that I'm trying to "
"impart."
msgstr "들어봐. 난 가장 순수하고 본질적인 종류의 황홀경을 선사하기 위해 노력 중이라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = be1f58a4-b303-d6a3-7232-b412a10e74a8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: !(BARD and WIZARD)
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:be1f58a4-b303-d6a3-7232-b412a10e74a8
msgctxt "h53947a4ega7f2g4dfcgb2fdg9a02932b19a9"
msgid "Who is that?"
msgstr "그건 누구야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = bec21ab9-40a5-1254-e31d-3f087be22f60
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:bec21ab9-40a5-1254-e31d-3f087be22f60
msgctxt "ha2193194ga08fg48c2g9ca4g5e75d5b951ea"
msgid ""
"It's like music, poetry, physical beauty all rolled into one and given "
"expression through the senses."
msgstr "그건 마치 음악, 시, 육체적 아름다움이 모두 하나로 합쳐져 감각을 통해 표현되는 것과 같아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c127e657-b1b2-887e-7f7a-cee4bdb42e45
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 7
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:c127e657-b1b2-887e-7f7a-cee4bdb42e45
msgctxt "he92541f3g016cg41c4g8517gec3926222f89"
msgid "<i>You sense power in these words. Speak them deliberately.</i>"
msgstr "<i>단어에서 힘이 느껴진다. 신중히 따라한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = c72776d3-6267-e26c-862c-a52ccce018c9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:c72776d3-6267-e26c-862c-a52ccce018c9
msgctxt "hdebfbe49g44c6g4094g917dg457ac52e1627"
msgid "No, no. She's no one, really. I was just... practising an incantation."
msgstr "아니, 아니야. 그냥 아무나 만든 거야. 난 그저... 주문을 연습하고 있었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cb03aec3-f8ee-3316-28b9-0f68b5e4a4cb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - SORCERER(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:cb03aec3-f8ee-3316-28b9-0f68b5e4a4cb
msgctxt "hf9500bb3gffd7g4d98gb082gfd1003290c8e"
msgid "How narrow-minded. Magic goes far, far beyond Mystra."
msgstr "참 편협하군. 마법은 미스트라에서 멈추지 않아, 그보다 훨씬 복잡한 것이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cb785f50-eae9-a40f-67f8-0d642bce50c9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 7
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:cb785f50-eae9-a40f-67f8-0d642bce50c9
msgctxt "h0e1928eega61ag43b9g8b77g7e2439b43f85"
msgid "<i>Belt the words with a little flourish on 'Ao'.</i>"
msgstr "<i>'Ao' 부분에 약간의 기교를 더한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = cbffa771-5d67-6d49-cb85-6ddac83151fc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:cbffa771-5d67-6d49-cb85-6ddac83151fc
msgctxt "h84a0d6afg96d7g46a1g9f6eg504bab8e84cb"
msgid ""
"*You see - or is it sense? - the presence of a woman, the woman who hovered "
"over Gale's palm.*"
msgstr "*무언가 보입니다. 아니, 느껴진다고 해야 할까요? 분명 게일의 손바닥 위에 떠다니던 그 여인의 존재감입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ccadb7f8-8ae6-0b1b-de1a-200df9058977
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:ccadb7f8-8ae6-0b1b-de1a-200df9058977
msgctxt "hbbf1039cgd26fg48c8g8d0dg086904e4f64a"
msgid "It's getting late. Perhaps another time."
msgstr "시간이 늦었네. 다음에 다시 하자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ce0ed910-2fdc-a970-a43c-b29a4533e49a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - WIZARD(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:ce0ed910-2fdc-a970-a43c-b29a4533e49a
msgctxt "hb24fc3c6g63ccg48d3g844fga362db9d3ab5"
msgid ""
"<i>Recede into the calm centre of your mind, just like you were taught at "
"the academy.</i>"
msgstr "<i>아카데미에서 배운 대로 마음속의 고요한 중심부로 물러난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = cf7abb1c-a941-ef71-fbda-da5d15ced957
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: !(BARD and SORCERER and WIZARD)
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:cf7abb1c-a941-ef71-fbda-da5d15ced957
msgctxt "h29f613c8g813dg4462g9fa2ga1103884d5f0"
msgid "Would you like to experience this?"
msgstr "너도 경험해 보겠어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d01147f0-a89d-891f-a489-9e52e8c1625d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - SORCERER_DRACONIC(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:d01147f0-a89d-891f-a489-9e52e8c1625d
msgctxt "h1adb6ef0gc0c6g4e9ag843bg2f9a33ee0723"
msgid "My magic is both ancient and raw. Sometimes even volatile."
msgstr "내 마법은 고대의 것이면서 동시에 정제되지 않았어. 가끔은 변덕스럽기도 하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = d05e9245-ed46-baf9-de75-c0c92730a589
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:d05e9245-ed46-baf9-de75-c0c92730a589
msgctxt "h3ee0e121g1966g49c1g9f9eg7cf5b31bfebc"
msgid ""
"*You feel something strange - like a kind word and a kind touch at the same "
"time. It's warm and comfortable.*"
msgstr "*묘한 기분이 듭니다. 마치 친절한 말과 손길이 동시에 느껴지는 것 같습니다. 따스하고 편안합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = d3a5cdf7-05b2-afc8-63aa-62117577213d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:d3a5cdf7-05b2-afc8-63aa-62117577213d
msgctxt "h4f796311g770eg46deg8ee3gb630f3b53e1d"
msgid ""
"Pish posh. One might as well deny one's mother's womb as the cradle of life."
msgstr "헛소리군. 그건 어머니의 자궁이 생명의 요람임을 부정하는 것이나 다름없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d5cdfba3-994c-872f-422d-d89ec09a1bfe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: BARD or SORCERER or WIZARD
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:d5cdfba3-994c-872f-422d-d89ec09a1bfe
msgctxt "h3b098e9fg20f0g4a8ag9523g0bc540735833"
msgid "The same as it always does."
msgstr "항상 그랬던 것처럼 말이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d69000f6-379b-3b48-a42c-b905d86560a0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 7
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:d69000f6-379b-3b48-a42c-b905d86560a0
msgctxt "h66710354g5e01g4418ga196g8a9810df1388"
msgid "<i>Repeat the words, bold and proud.</i>"
msgstr "<i>대담하고 자랑스럽게 따라한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = d6c4606f-f828-ff46-4ea5-e1d97e502da3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:d6c4606f-f828-ff46-4ea5-e1d97e502da3
msgctxt "h006d08b7g7803g469egb9f7g76062004aa67"
msgid ""
"I can't quite describe it, the need I sometimes feel to see her - to draw "
"the filaments of fantasy into existence."
msgstr "말로는 표현할 수 없지만, 뭔가 가끔 그녀를 보고 싶다는 욕구, 환상의 실타래를 현실로 끌어들이고 싶다는 욕구가 느껴져."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = d77103cc-9048-8b67-6ba7-a99a58518a9a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:d77103cc-9048-8b67-6ba7-a99a58518a9a
msgctxt "h07a6c634g9a37g4f50gacbfgd91000ee702c"
msgid ""
"Very good. Now I want you to picture in your mind the concept of harmony. As "
"true as you can."
msgstr "아주 잘했어. 이제 머릿속에 조화의 개념을 그려봐. 최대한 사실적으로."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d8cb35fb-a6ff-6c7c-42e0-d6d4db9fdb34
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 7
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:d8cb35fb-a6ff-6c7c-42e0-d6d4db9fdb34
msgctxt "he1a1c935g9b3ag49bcg9fecg1d01098eb73e"
msgid ""
"<i>Picture a place of utter peace, away from all harm and the mayhem of "
"civilisation.</i>"
msgstr "<i>모든 위험과 문명의 혼돈에서 벗어난 완전한 평화의 장소를 상상한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = d938bb79-bff0-5ff4-937a-06b8dc4d400d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:d938bb79-bff0-5ff4-937a-06b8dc4d400d
msgctxt "h437ef5d1gb682g4a28gb21fg12a48e5d6916"
msgid "Good night."
msgstr "잘자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = db038b26-6779-ce26-cd5b-9db5daa34500
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:db038b26-6779-ce26-cd5b-9db5daa34500
msgctxt "h87817865g350bg47b9g9499g2957044a7bcf"
msgid "Good gods, what on earth makes you picture that?"
msgstr "이런 세상에, 왜 그런 상상을 하는 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = dcd83427-eb5c-20d0-cd35-7fe5429036fb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - SORCERER(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:dcd83427-eb5c-20d0-cd35-7fe5429036fb
msgctxt "he851c18cgc5bbg46fbg97f1g54eb9a84cc09"
msgid "<i>Sink deep into your magic. It is who you are. It is home.</i>"
msgstr "<i>마법 속으로 깊이 빠져든다. 마법이 곧 당신이다. 마법이 곧 고향이다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = deaad2a0-7a72-498a-9ecf-c20436286b73
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:deaad2a0-7a72-498a-9ecf-c20436286b73
msgctxt "h175b0be1gd0c4g4613gb9deg360619cc7247"
msgid "Then follow my lead."
msgstr "그럼 날 따라해 봐."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = dfc6d837-8974-7e39-62b0-8920e4365d25
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:dfc6d837-8974-7e39-62b0-8920e4365d25
msgctxt "hb93e1c9bg78deg4a86ga5a5gdf7134255a01"
msgid "Yes, I would."
msgstr "그래, 물론."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = e3299b98-4ce3-7a9d-2a1f-fc9507eb44bb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:e3299b98-4ce3-7a9d-2a1f-fc9507eb44bb
msgctxt "h9b6e3546g4118g45afgb82ag90d9ea18b956"
msgid "Quite so. The Weave is a sensitive conduit."
msgstr "그렇지. 위브는 꽤 민감한 매개체거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e4bc7332-481d-e713-468a-e97a54a8a2de
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:e4bc7332-481d-e713-468a-e97a54a8a2de
msgctxt "h6d83d1efg846cg46afg9d4fg5e5c12c131e6"
msgid "It's different for me. Not quite so intense."
msgstr "내 경우는 좀 달라. 그렇게 과장된 편은 아니거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e5ec51e0-ba61-7f97-ce4d-5a6c68074a65
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching_Pictured_Kiss(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:e5ec51e0-ba61-7f97-ce4d-5a6c68074a65
msgctxt "h56e8be5dg99dbg4bccga5e5g88fcbf1c927d"
msgid "<i>Picture kissing him.</i>"
msgstr "<i>그와 키스하는 상상을 한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e78be582-5256-ffd9-ebb9-9e1fa8435677
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Dexterity
#. DifficultyClass: 5
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:e78be582-5256-ffd9-ebb9-9e1fa8435677
msgctxt "h225c1b91g07ebg4129g8fceg121cf002e2a2"
msgid "<i>Imitate the gesture quickly and decisively.</i>"
msgstr "<i>재빠르고 정확하게 손동작을 따라한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e7ced0d9-d12f-63d2-ff61-a537f7083f99
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:e7ced0d9-d12f-63d2-ff61-a537f7083f99
msgctxt "h8f60f232ge0bcg40ddg8924g38bf16990f18"
msgid "No, thanks. Not my cup of tea, clearly."
msgstr "아니, 괜찮아. 확실히, 내 분야는 아니야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = e899b673-74e4-3172-11d6-a325455a25a2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:e899b673-74e4-3172-11d6-a325455a25a2
msgctxt "ha693b6ffg31f6g4e33ga5dfg9bf3340e1e80"
msgid ""
"*There's something like the anticipation of a kiss, then the pleasure of "
"being cloaked in peace.*"
msgstr "*키스에 대한 기대감, 그리고 평화로움 속에 숨어 있는 즐거움 같은 것들이 느껴집니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = e99eb3c4-47d9-3a69-d0be-a0abe0d6a0c7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:e99eb3c4-47d9-3a69-d0be-a0abe0d6a0c7
msgctxt "h865f2d08g2252g4f34gb528ge4fb6f5cf766"
msgid "Now you."
msgstr "이제 네 차례야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = f0740159-5994-3cbc-be28-d892d5a4e638
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:f0740159-5994-3cbc-be28-d892d5a4e638
msgctxt "ha2dbe914g7b82g4283ga39eg39c74376b978"
msgid "You read too much into it. I was merely indulging in my passion."
msgstr "지나친 해석이군. 난 그저 내가 좋아하는 일에 빠져 있었을 뿐이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = f177bbd8-d7ab-1a8d-54ae-850746c4e87f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:f177bbd8-d7ab-1a8d-54ae-850746c4e87f
msgctxt "h118b0f98g52d6g41f4gb633g30cc89d49e08"
msgid "Perhaps I can show you what I mean by reaching into the Weave together."
msgstr "어쩌면 함께 위브를 다루면서 내가 전달하고 싶은 바를 보여줄 수 있겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = f2d39620-af73-326e-626e-2e0159e5a12f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:f2d39620-af73-326e-626e-2e0159e5a12f
msgctxt "h691e2bfdg516eg40ffg9734g2e5155701189"
msgid "I know."
msgstr "나도 알아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = f364ae37-a099-5c71-e90d-634a7d2d60e6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:f364ae37-a099-5c71-e90d-634a7d2d60e6
msgctxt "h11dabe76g889ag47b3gb07bg3206d8e32309"
msgid ""
"*A familiar feeling - like a kind word and a kind touch at the same time. "
"It's warm and comfortable.*"
msgstr "*익숙한 느낌 - 다정한 말과 손길이 한번에 느껴집니다. 따뜻하고 편안합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = f3e7e583-de55-48f4-c581-655f70029947
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:f3e7e583-de55-48f4-c581-655f70029947
msgctxt "hadcf9376g52e1g4e06g943eg79ab131ad3da"
msgid "Sorry, I wasn't expecting... But it is a pleasant image to be sure!"
msgstr "미안해, 전혀 예상하지 못해서... 하지만 분명 좋은 상상이었어!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f402d515-cdad-8505-50b6-a3d35a7e27bc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:f402d515-cdad-8505-50b6-a3d35a7e27bc
msgctxt "h7f8d2e1fg8e42g4e84g9977g36a26b8bf086"
msgid "You're a good teacher."
msgstr "넌 아주 훌륭한 선생이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f5bce21a-b2fd-c9e4-11fe-07eed87da5ff
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: (CLERIC or PALADIN) and !(CLERIC_MYSTRA and PALADIN_MYSTRA)
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:f5bce21a-b2fd-c9e4-11fe-07eed87da5ff
msgctxt "h83ecbd98g9a0dg4cbeg8812g4c84ad043e43"
msgid "It's different, but I can definitely feel a familiar kind of presence."
msgstr "뭔가 다르지만, 분명 친근한 존재감이 느껴져."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f7319247-5969-9c54-0d1c-497dc18d33f9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:f7319247-5969-9c54-0d1c-497dc18d33f9
msgctxt "h5522ceb2g5b67g41cdgbb14g8a1b6deafd60"
msgid "That sounds very familiar, yes."
msgstr "익숙한 이야기군, 그래."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f8bdffad-38b8-4a1b-0b04-4873c4b8fb69
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:f8bdffad-38b8-4a1b-0b04-4873c4b8fb69
msgctxt "h4040857cg00f1g4798g92e4g218c0f00c8cc"
msgid "Cut that out. The light could attract enemies."
msgstr "그만둬. 빛이 적들을 불러들일지도 몰라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = fa9a0cd6-1012-313b-9da7-e267b7be8022
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:fa9a0cd6-1012-313b-9da7-e267b7be8022
msgctxt "h2dd8849eg6c33g4d38gbd90gcc71d09b12b4"
msgid ""
"I think it's a mistake to give up so easily, but I cannot force your hand."
msgstr "너무 쉽게 포기하기엔 좀 아깝지만, 억지로 등 떠밀 수야 없지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = fdbf0ea1-d8de-f08f-f2d4-f76e0b9e1b97
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:fdbf0ea1-d8de-f08f-f2d4-f76e0b9e1b97
msgctxt "h01834900g2ac5g49a7ga0e2g930b80661e9b"
msgid "It's a kind of love after all."
msgstr "거의 사랑이나 다를 바 없지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = ffdea39b-7270-c0e6-393e-f8f900fd7df3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Gale_CRD_SpellTeaching:ffdea39b-7270-c0e6-393e-f8f900fd7df3
msgctxt "he687eb67ga389g4d48gb2f1gd35d3e285e28"
msgid ""
"There it goes. I suppose a blow to the stomach upsets the Weave as much as "
"it would me."
msgstr "여기까지네. 위브도 나만큼이나 배에 타격을 입었나 봐."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_CFM_DrowBetrayalReaction
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 02d51de1-b3e3-6bbd-0500-89ecaf5e542e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(2) = True
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_DrowPartner(0) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - AVATAR(2) = False
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(2) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - d8096a9e-f04c-6a49-67f6-0e71b4099140_inclusion = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_CFM_DrowBetrayalReaction:02d51de1-b3e3-6bbd-0500-89ecaf5e542e
msgctxt "h5d3b2dabgb334g45b2gb5c8g3afc55c94837"
msgid ""
"First you sow, now you reap. I trust you shall be more selective going "
"forward, lest it's <i>your</i> blood I spill."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_CFM_DrowBetrayalReaction
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 50a57156-8987-a22c-e77b-550fe458ea05
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(4) = True
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_DrowPartner(0) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - AVATAR(4) = False
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(4) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - d8096a9e-f04c-6a49-67f6-0e71b4099140_inclusion = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_CFM_DrowBetrayalReaction:50a57156-8987-a22c-e77b-550fe458ea05
msgctxt "h4effe605g56f9g4ac0g9475g702f60dd86f7"
msgid "Well. I hope your romp was worth it."
msgstr "뭐. 적어도 너희 섹스는 즐거웠길 바라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_CFM_DrowBetrayalReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 683de292-168e-58af-3b58-22c9958fb92a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - d8096a9e-f04c-6a49-67f6-0e71b4099140_inclusion = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_CFM_DrowBetrayalReaction:683de292-168e-58af-3b58-22c9958fb92a
msgctxt "hde7982beg00a3g4184g92d7gc60f89e528d5"
msgid "What's done is done - but we should check the corpses for valuables."
msgstr "끝난 건 끝난 거고, 시체를 뒤져서 쓸만한 걸 좀 찾아봐야겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_CFM_DrowBetrayalReaction
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 69e54090-b905-df13-2202-32763f8b19b6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(1) = True
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_DrowPartner(0) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - AVATAR(1) = False
#.      - REALLY_GALE(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - d8096a9e-f04c-6a49-67f6-0e71b4099140_inclusion = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_CFM_DrowBetrayalReaction:69e54090-b905-df13-2202-32763f8b19b6
msgctxt "hda0439deg0367g470bgac35gafc748bb7dee"
msgid ""
"Minthara. To sleep with her is to dream of death. Plenty of that to go "
"around."
msgstr "민타라. 그녀와 자는 건 자살행위야. 죽는 방법은 그거 말고도 넘쳐난다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_CFM_DrowBetrayalReaction
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 6c96919f-8343-8138-cd07-8dd9d6e10e5a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(2) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - AVATAR(2) = False
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(2) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - d8096a9e-f04c-6a49-67f6-0e71b4099140_inclusion = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_CFM_DrowBetrayalReaction:6c96919f-8343-8138-cd07-8dd9d6e10e5a
msgctxt "h4eb25360g7a35g4157g8048gcf1f47870e46"
msgid ""
"Leave the corpses be, let the maggots feast. Our betrayers deserve no better."
msgstr "시체는 놔둬, 구더기들이 파먹게 두라고. 배신자들에게 어울리는 말로야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_CFM_DrowBetrayalReaction
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 7687281b-9193-5c57-fa4d-33cb80569d4c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(3) = True
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_DrowPartner(0) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - AVATAR(3) = False
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(3) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - d8096a9e-f04c-6a49-67f6-0e71b4099140_inclusion = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_CFM_DrowBetrayalReaction:7687281b-9193-5c57-fa4d-33cb80569d4c
msgctxt "hc75fd348g8716g45begb4abg6a76b63ee063"
msgid ""
"Talk about having your cake then killing it. I hope all your romantic "
"liaisons don't end this way."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_CFM_DrowBetrayalReaction
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 82ccda85-200c-9287-0b20-f94a951d39b3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(3) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - AVATAR(3) = False
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(3) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - d8096a9e-f04c-6a49-67f6-0e71b4099140_inclusion = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_CFM_DrowBetrayalReaction:82ccda85-200c-9287-0b20-f94a951d39b3
msgctxt "hd9b0b370gc30ag49a5gaf2eg59ff35d47c45"
msgid ""
"That's one way to end a party. Let's mop up the goblin leftovers and get "
"some rest."
msgstr "파티를 끝내기에 아주 안성맞춤이네. 이제 고블린 시체를 치우고 좀 쉬자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_CFM_DrowBetrayalReaction
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = d092d5ee-bec1-638f-756e-c5efbe575ce3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_CFM_DrowBetrayalReaction:d092d5ee-bec1-638f-756e-c5efbe575ce3
msgctxt "h880cc3f7g5dc3g41fdgac00ge573d1c961a6"
msgid "*The campsite is secure. Blood-soaked, but secure.*"
msgstr "*야영지의 안전을 확보했습니다. 피로 물들긴 했지만, 안전하긴 하죠.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_CFM_DrowBetrayalReaction
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = e83b35d9-ee98-c935-1502-daf7f3b09af5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(1) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - AVATAR(1) = False
#.      - REALLY_GALE(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - d8096a9e-f04c-6a49-67f6-0e71b4099140_inclusion = True
#. TagRule:
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_CFM_DrowBetrayalReaction:e83b35d9-ee98-c935-1502-daf7f3b09af5
msgctxt "h5016fc3fg61e4g4abagac54gc1776a2be33e"
msgid "Bloodshed by day, bloodshed by night. What a jolly bloody life we lead."
msgstr "낮에도 피를 적셨는데, 밤에도 마찬가지네. 아주 피투성이 인생이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_CFM_DrowBetrayalReaction
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = fa9688e4-5e23-2338-24ec-64fc04025a2e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(4) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - AVATAR(4) = False
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(4) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - d8096a9e-f04c-6a49-67f6-0e71b4099140_inclusion = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_CFM_DrowBetrayalReaction:fa9688e4-5e23-2338-24ec-64fc04025a2e
msgctxt "h3e123e77g1c39g45a5ga708g2b2f646444a7"
msgid "What a party. We should do this again."
msgstr "완벽한 파틴데. 언제 한번 더 해야겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_CFM_Raiders
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 06213ad6-e55f-7917-2dd1-d527e21b27e6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_7 = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - AVATAR(6) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_Companion_Leave(6) = True
#.   Quest:
#.     - ORI_COM_Wyll.CompanionLowRelation(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_CFM_Raiders:06213ad6-e55f-7917-2dd1-d527e21b27e6
msgctxt "h63a51466g039dg475egb03cg0691a482d883"
msgid ""
"As I feared - there is no place in your company for me. I want no part of "
"this, or of you."
msgstr "내가 우려했던 대로, 너의 무리에는 내가 설 자리가 없어. 나는 이 일이나 너와 엮이고 싶지 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_CFM_Raiders
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 0a5aa765-562b-b6f6-bfea-5b05d4d5bc69
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_CFM_Raiders:0a5aa765-562b-b6f6-bfea-5b05d4d5bc69
msgctxt "h4ede4c88gfda0g4badg9044gb743355f8609"
msgid ""
"If you tire of their company, come to me. I may have other uses for you yet."
msgstr "이들의 무리가 지겹다면, 나에게 와라. 너는 아직 내게 다른 쓸모가 있을지도 모르니."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_CFM_Raiders
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 0fba6443-612b-9f99-a011-5101301a4aea
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_CFM_Raiders:0fba6443-612b-9f99-a011-5101301a4aea
msgctxt "h60b7081ege292g4ad9ga18dgc85a753116e3"
msgid "You fought well. And so did these creatures, thanks to our leadership."
msgstr "잘 싸웠다. 이 생물들도 우리 지도력 덕분에 잘 싸웠고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_CFM_Raiders
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 1f46d5bc-8797-539c-50ef-51e4ff48e6a9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Event_CompanionsLeave = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_CFM_Raiders:1f46d5bc-8797-539c-50ef-51e4ff48e6a9
msgctxt "h9aed6dd5g9e21g4c3fgbb28g3ccee6737691"
msgid "*But you are intercepted before you can join the party.*"
msgstr "*하지만 당신은 파티에 참여하기 전에 가로막힙니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_CFM_Raiders
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 2463e581-7d03-df35-fd10-00f5d6434280
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_6 = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_CFM_Raiders:2463e581-7d03-df35-fd10-00f5d6434280
msgctxt "h6a2ad704g6af9g4940g80e3ge15e16015f1e"
msgid ""
"*Volo has fallen into the goblins' clutches again, and appears to be "
"chronicling your misdeeds.*"
msgstr "*볼로가 또다시 고블린의 손아귀에 넘어가서, 당신의 악행을 기록하는 것 같습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_CFM_Raiders
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 2ae63565-ac95-cb4d-22d9-cdaec886dca5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_AttackOnDen_Drow_AcceptedSeduction = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_CFM_Raiders:2ae63565-ac95-cb4d-22d9-cdaec886dca5
msgctxt "ha4564681g453fg44d4gb327g6413d424f452"
msgid "When you tire of their company, come to me. Tonight, you are mine."
msgstr "이들과 어울리는 게 지겨워지면, 내게 와라. 오늘밤, 너는 내 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_CFM_Raiders
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 56798ca3-4b0b-c2f7-7628-940fd9cee43a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - AVATAR(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_CFM_Raiders:56798ca3-4b0b-c2f7-7628-940fd9cee43a
msgctxt "h5c575975gaedeg4aebg8876g56c87e7a06de"
msgid ""
"*As you approach your camp, the raucous celebrations have already begun.*"
msgstr "*당신이 야영지에 도착했을 땐, 이미 시끌벅적한 축하 행사가 시작된 후였습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_CFM_Raiders
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 6ac1819d-332e-cb5d-e356-16d61ad5d8ba
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Event_CompanionsLeave = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_CFM_Raiders:6ac1819d-332e-cb5d-e356-16d61ad5d8ba
msgctxt "hce242a3egb73eg4506ga90egdc0f556cd936"
msgid "*Some of your companions have left... perhaps forever.*"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_CFM_Raiders
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 7d23e6b8-cc93-1443-cbc4-22d69f47068c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_CFM_Raiders:7d23e6b8-cc93-1443-cbc4-22d69f47068c
msgctxt "hd5d95632g2ae4g4e50ga37bg2b09006d07e6"
msgid ""
"*The goblins praise the Absolute, but their celebrations also honour their "
"leaders. Minthara - and you.*"
msgstr "*고블린들은 절대자를 찬양하지만, 그들의 축제는 그들의 지도자 또한 기립니다. 민타라와 당신입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_CFM_Raiders
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 9a303d90-52ec-7eed-ea7e-858717a69297
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_8 = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - AVATAR(7) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_Companion_Leave(7) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_CFM_Raiders:9a303d90-52ec-7eed-ea7e-858717a69297
msgctxt "ha02f4b07g03fdg4157g9af1g8075383dbbc4"
msgid ""
"I didn't escape the Hells to lose my soul to another evil. I can't be part "
"of this anymore."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_CFM_Raiders
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = afa25521-68d3-b5db-c721-c9be1759bd75
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_CFM_Raiders:afa25521-68d3-b5db-c721-c9be1759bd75
msgctxt "hbbc77e08gf8f0g42b4gafc9g036a14645fca"
msgid ""
"*The goblins praise the Absolute, but their celebrations also honour their "
"leaders - including you.*"
msgstr "*고블린들은 절대자를 찬양하지만, 그들의 축제는 그들의 지도자들 또한 기립니다. 당신을 포함해서요.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_CFM_Raiders
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = b23d9609-621e-aceb-3665-bd7531dc927a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Event_SeveralCompanionsLeave = True
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_7 = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - AVATAR(6) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_Companion_Leave(6) = True
#.   Quest:
#.     - ORI_COM_Wyll.CompanionLowRelation(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_CFM_Raiders:b23d9609-621e-aceb-3665-bd7531dc927a
msgctxt "h5f77191dgfaf4g4f00g9fc9gaad62537ea0c"
msgid ""
"As I feared - there is no place in your company for us. We want no part of "
"this, or of you."
msgstr "내가 우려했던 대로, 너의 무리에는 우리가 설 자리가 없어. 이 일이나 너와 엮이고 싶지 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_CFM_Raiders
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = f9144565-2de3-c8ca-eb03-eab98fccf9b5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_CFM_Raiders:f9144565-2de3-c8ca-eb03-eab98fccf9b5
msgctxt "h3a2ae750gca95g4380gb46dgcbd38146992e"
msgid ""
"*As you approach your camp, the raucous celebrations have already begun.*"
msgstr "*당신이 야영지에 도착했을 땐, 이미 시끌벅적한 축하 행사가 시작된 후였습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 0655e0b9-7d3f-e0c2-d7fe-20260f01bed1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal:0655e0b9-7d3f-e0c2-d7fe-20260f01bed1
msgctxt "h3c788fd6ga32ag47b2g81b4gb37fb4396fe3"
msgid "I know a way, yes. Soon, you will be in the Absolute's presence."
msgstr "그래, 방법이 있긴 하지. 곧 넌 절대자님을 영접하게 될 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 065b9f34-820f-d138-eb15-54d302e9bf14
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal:065b9f34-820f-d138-eb15-54d302e9bf14
msgctxt "he4d82ef2g9e1dg4a8bga4b9ge1ae341667c8"
msgid ""
"She told me to decide your fate, to determine if you are worthy. If you are, "
"I am to send you into Her embrace, at the seat of her power."
msgstr ""
"내게 네 운명을 결정하라고, 네게 자격이 있는지 판단하라고 하셨다. 만약 자격이 있다면 널 그분의 품, 그분의 힘의 중심부로 보내야 "
"한다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 06ff4572-238b-7177-f334-ace19ad37b7d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal:06ff4572-238b-7177-f334-ace19ad37b7d
msgctxt "he0e7e138gbcc4g4377g8465g1f0c882462d4"
msgid "If She wanted you dead, I would not spare you. You live by Her grace."
msgstr "그분께서 네가 죽길 원하셨다면, 내가 너를 살려 두지 않았을 거야. 넌 그분의 자비로 살아있는 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 0992ffe0-c4e6-c5dd-a365-dc2526fa2da7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal:0992ffe0-c4e6-c5dd-a365-dc2526fa2da7
msgctxt "h56ab1c1agd000g4787g9a9bg5c2067566fec"
msgid ""
"I believed for a moment that we might share a path. But I still sense that "
"absence inside you... and I fear it."
msgstr ""
"잠시 우리가 같은 길을 걸을 수 있다고 믿었다. 하지만 아직도 네 안에서 그 <i>부재</i>가 느껴지는군... 난 그것이 두렵다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 0a54fd26-ea09-d8e7-7638-1515b8f56b8a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal:0a54fd26-ea09-d8e7-7638-1515b8f56b8a
msgctxt "hbe2e74bbg71c6g44beg945agc16c6ceebb59"
msgid "I do not know - but I do know that She allowed me to spare you."
msgstr "나도 모른다. 다만 그분이 내가 너를 살려주는 걸 허락하셨다는 건 알고 있지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 0abbb181-dcdd-aa66-a7e2-ce1b830fb5c1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal:0abbb181-dcdd-aa66-a7e2-ce1b830fb5c1
msgctxt "h8c1dd2d7g084eg411dgbd75g15ea9b03d99a"
msgid "With difficulty - but I can help."
msgstr "어렵지만, 내가 도와줄 수 있다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0b33b1d7-fdf0-e473-c161-7359c2dceec0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal:0b33b1d7-fdf0-e473-c161-7359c2dceec0
msgctxt "h963ea7adgc37cg4185g9455g307c6332d759"
msgid "I'm ready. How do I get there?"
msgstr "준비됐어. 그곳에 어떻게 도착할 수 있지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 12e61f90-4d2f-9d9d-f32e-6ad7286bcac4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal:12e61f90-4d2f-9d9d-f32e-6ad7286bcac4
msgctxt "he58cd757gce1eg4dd2g8925g7610d24023f2"
msgid ""
"But then a miracle happened. As I took out my blade, Her voice returned to "
"me... and She told me what I must do to purge myself of doubt."
msgstr ""
"그런데 그때 기적이 일어났지. 내가 칼을 꺼내드는 순간 그녀의 목소리가 다시 들리게 된 거야... 그녀는 내가 의심을 떨쳐내기 위해 뭘 "
"해야 할지 알려주셨다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 137545de-c97b-10b6-e418-743f42c7bc32
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_DrowToldMoonrise = True
#.     - GLO_Absolute_Knows_MoonriseTowers = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal:137545de-c97b-10b6-e418-743f42c7bc32
msgctxt "hcb722d2fg3302g4f5bgb657g47b368103d07"
msgid ""
"Travel to Moonrise. We will meet again there, at the heart of the Absolute's "
"power."
msgstr "문라이즈로 떠나라. 절대자님의 힘의 심장부인 그곳에서 우린 다시 만날 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 160d6ff4-4d19-4130-e046-777b5c715ad7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal:160d6ff4-4d19-4130-e046-777b5c715ad7
msgctxt "h52e39547g4f89g462eg8452gfa78a2ade50e"
msgid ""
"To gather our forces in this region. They're ill-disciplined - without a "
"strong hand, they'll disperse."
msgstr "이 지역에서 우리 병력을 소집하려 한다. 놈들은 군기가 빠져 있어서, 강력한 통제가 없으면 흩어지고 말 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1a048cfa-a037-96b5-18d7-0a4585bd9a46
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal:1a048cfa-a037-96b5-18d7-0a4585bd9a46
msgctxt "hb8abc21ag4f18g43efg9854gbd380127c44c"
msgid "Where will you go now?"
msgstr "이제 어디로 갈 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 1a442979-3295-7549-c90e-bbb26507696c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal:1a442979-3295-7549-c90e-bbb26507696c
msgctxt "h42c20383gf6b8g4eafga304g0fcffa70b36e"
msgid ""
"When the Absolute failed to answer me, I feared that you had somehow "
"infected me with that same absence."
msgstr "절대자께서 답해주지 않았을 때, 네가 어떤 식으로든 내게 그런 <i>공허함</i>을 옮긴 것은 아닐까 두려웠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 1c27fd4d-8a03-e6b2-f419-b8e39f2c30f7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal:1c27fd4d-8a03-e6b2-f419-b8e39f2c30f7
msgctxt "h63741e20g3731g43e1gbdb1g0f6f9e206bff"
msgid ""
"I asked Her why She had chosen you, made you one of Her faithful, when you "
"are so clearly broken. Beautiful, but broken."
msgstr ""
"그분에게 왜 널 선택하셨는지, 엉망인 게 분명한 널 어째서 그녀의 신자로 만드셨는지 여쭈었지. 아름답지만 내면은 상처투성이인 널."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1d28b1f6-6fb8-82c9-8d98-f2e178c3f93f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_NightWithDrow_Satisfied = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal:1d28b1f6-6fb8-82c9-8d98-f2e178c3f93f
msgctxt "h9fbb0058g8fddg4b82ga8f2g6ae4a86db4cf"
msgid "You said the Absolute demanded my death - why?"
msgstr "넌 절대자가 내 죽음을 원한다고 했지. 어째서?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 2488f18d-2a64-0a0c-0970-504a5b4f96ae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal:2488f18d-2a64-0a0c-0970-504a5b4f96ae
msgctxt "h5750e563gc8fcg4b05g8211g2047a7d710df"
msgid "And so I decided that you must die."
msgstr "그래서 난 네가 죽어야 한다는 결론에 이르렀다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 34192c85-2d8f-e529-73c6-727e71e8f0d5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal:34192c85-2d8f-e529-73c6-727e71e8f0d5
msgctxt "hd907bdecgf294g4d5dgaa3fgfbf21bdc14a0"
msgid ""
"I wish that were true. But I still sense that absence inside you... and I "
"fear it."
msgstr "그 말이 사실이었으면 좋겠지만, 난 여전히 네 안에 있는 공허함을 느낄 수 있어... 두렵게도."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 34830429-268a-0f99-2933-7d7a85c1825c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal:34830429-268a-0f99-2933-7d7a85c1825c
msgctxt "h9a263b23g7e63g431aga54ag0eb162faa80b"
msgid "Then you do not belong to the Absolute."
msgstr "그렇다면 넌 절대자님께 어울리지 않는다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3562e3f2-0309-f67f-17b8-f2e9e9e51ba0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal:3562e3f2-0309-f67f-17b8-f2e9e9e51ba0
msgctxt "hc0ef9092g29c8g4df3g907cg5b2e23988bf7"
msgid "I prefer to decide my own fate."
msgstr "내 운명은 내가 정하고 싶은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 36b30f68-dd05-49dc-b648-ca28ddcd14ce
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - SCL_Drider_State_HasMintharaSpidersLyre(0) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GOB_DrowCommander_Event_GivePlayerSpiderLyre(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal:36b30f68-dd05-49dc-b648-ca28ddcd14ce
msgctxt "h63a98a17g7910g4eaegafbbg2067e16084bc"
msgid ""
"This harp will summon him. Play it when you are in the shadows, and he will "
"come to you and know that you are a friend."
msgstr "이 하프가 그를 불러낼 거다. 그림자 속에서 연주하면 네가 아군이라는 걸 알고 그 녀석이 다가올 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 3778c2b3-8059-de9d-309e-8846b063f96b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Event_BetrayalPlayer(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal:3778c2b3-8059-de9d-309e-8846b063f96b
msgctxt "hdaedccfagea8ag46c8g8246gb785d4a33d72"
msgid ""
"*In your dream, you stand over yourself as you sleep. A knife in your hand, "
"murder in your heart.*"
msgstr "*꿈속에서, 당신은 잠든 자신을 바라보고 있습니다. 손에는 칼이, 마음에는 살기가 가득합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 38a19077-3d72-52b1-718f-0dc35977860e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal:38a19077-3d72-52b1-718f-0dc35977860e
msgctxt "h2dcad589geb8dg4884g93d8g2daafd69212a"
msgid "You <i>will</i> be."
msgstr "<i>그러게 될</i> 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 3f656bf5-f9c1-c7b8-f4b9-eef9ca185912
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal:3f656bf5-f9c1-c7b8-f4b9-eef9ca185912
msgctxt "hc1468c62gbb61g4582g8423g324e9179e80a"
msgid "You've played your part. The glory for this victory will be mine alone."
msgstr "너는 네 역할을 다했다. 이 승리의 영광은 오로지 나만의 것이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 42f60c23-2716-5c83-a2f7-9eded8fb2dff
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal:42f60c23-2716-5c83-a2f7-9eded8fb2dff
msgctxt "h1f0e27c7g3a59g459ag985dgcab43011f5d4"
msgid ""
"I watched over you as you slept, peaceful and silent, and I spoke to our god."
msgstr "세상 모르고 잠든 널 지켜보다가 우리의 신께 말을 걸었다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 4815bb50-6430-6eeb-3c10-bf009fab9750
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal:4815bb50-6430-6eeb-3c10-bf009fab9750
msgctxt "he3663d1cg249cg4392gb8bfgaeaf6cfefd0c"
msgid ""
"When we next meet, we will be together in the Absolute's presence, and She "
"will make us Her champions."
msgstr "다음번 만날 때는, 우리 둘 다 절대자님의 존재 하에 함께 할 것이다. 그리고 그분이 우리를 자신의 전사로 삼으실 테지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 4b1b455b-d539-e749-725a-3bd5f0cdc9e7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal:4b1b455b-d539-e749-725a-3bd5f0cdc9e7
msgctxt "h375015a7gde3cg4a88ga315gfe377acc674a"
msgid ""
"Wrong. The Absolute brought you to me, and now She will take you into Her "
"presence at Moonrise."
msgstr "틀렸어. 절대자님이 너를 내게 데려왔고, 이제 문라이즈에서 그분이 너를 맞이하실 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5766906a-b93c-f94d-4681-9eca9785c34a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal:5766906a-b93c-f94d-4681-9eca9785c34a
msgctxt "h9c60c784g2465g418aga39eg902a0f79a1a5"
msgid "I'm not sure I'm ready for this."
msgstr "내가 준비가 됐는지 모르겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 5e4153aa-21cc-e549-2c8b-4f2bc18963a8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal:5e4153aa-21cc-e549-2c8b-4f2bc18963a8
msgctxt "hc21667fag6128g42c1g8022gaca2abd2cb77"
msgid "In time, I believe we may be together."
msgstr "때가 되면 우린 하나가 되리라 믿는다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 644c232b-f5b0-9f7f-55c5-336e4f5f8db6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_NightWithDrow_Satisfied = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal:644c232b-f5b0-9f7f-55c5-336e4f5f8db6
msgctxt "h3c205836g75f9g4739gb962gfc3d3a8f8853"
msgid ""
"She will test you. If you fail, you will break; if your faith is strong, you "
"will become something even more beautiful."
msgstr "그분이 너를 시험하실 것이다. 실패하면 부서지고, 네 믿음이 강하면 더욱 아름다운 존재로 거듭나겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 6908597c-e496-e7d1-9f90-aba0d0e9cecd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal:6908597c-e496-e7d1-9f90-aba0d0e9cecd
msgctxt "h59b22d91g551cg4ad2g986bg190e17d888d3"
msgid ""
"I take no pleasure in what I must do. In another life, I would have taken "
"you as my consort in Menzoberranzan."
msgstr "내가 해야만 하는 일이 즐겁진 않아. 다른 생이었다면, 멘조베란잔에서 너를 내 배우자로 삼았을 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 6d8ba3a8-6b12-e2b1-adea-3401bcaf3254
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal:6d8ba3a8-6b12-e2b1-adea-3401bcaf3254
msgctxt "hb986d239g462cg496cga4d0ge76b82e3e775"
msgid ""
"Go to him when you are ready. I will lead what remains of my forces to "
"Moonrise ahead of you."
msgstr "준비가 되면 그에게 가라. 나는 먼저 문라이즈로 남은 병력을 끌고 갈테니."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6fcc3c31-82cd-6953-cbfb-69cbf7fb1662
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 2
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal:6fcc3c31-82cd-6953-cbfb-69cbf7fb1662
msgctxt "h016576f0g57ffg49d0ga319g8f69f4d673f2"
msgid "We're both worthy. Let's go to the Absolute together."
msgstr "우리 둘다 자격이 있어. 함께 절대자님께 가자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 783d7803-999f-4e21-23db-7712d0d0d4f7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal:783d7803-999f-4e21-23db-7712d0d0d4f7
msgctxt "h4eba6610g8e41g4046g88a0gf2c269d0152c"
msgid "No. I'm a survivor."
msgstr "아니. 나는 생존자다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 7dc833d4-49fd-34b1-ea03-908d92117c1c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: FEMALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal:7dc833d4-49fd-34b1-ea03-908d92117c1c
msgctxt "h1998ac86g9fa0g4c7ag9a03g11c245df5743"
msgid "It is time - kill her!"
msgstr "때가 됐다. 이 여자를 죽여라!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 7dc833d4-49fd-34b1-ea03-908d92117c1c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: MALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal:7dc833d4-49fd-34b1-ea03-908d92117c1c
msgctxt "h2e0c6a62gf916g4d87g9a69gbdbfe055eaae"
msgid "It is time! Kill him!"
msgstr "때가 됐다! 이 자를 죽여라!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 7dc833d4-49fd-34b1-ea03-908d92117c1c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal:7dc833d4-49fd-34b1-ea03-908d92117c1c
msgctxt "hf35078a4g93d1g4e3bgb337gbf972b1b9c1c"
msgid "It's time - kill them!"
msgstr "때가 됐다. 이들을 죽여라!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 7f63acfe-4545-6d09-48f2-da7b6e79f989
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Knows_CreaturePath = True
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_State_DrowBetrayalPacified = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal:7f63acfe-4545-6d09-48f2-da7b6e79f989
msgctxt "hcd8b76b6g2d30g4c83gb900gb45e1e6c8419"
msgid ""
"But I can protect you. A wretched creature in my service can guide you "
"through the curse."
msgstr "하지만 내가 널 보호해 줄 수 있다. 내 휘하에 있는 징그러운 괴물 녀석이 저주를 헤치고 널 안내할 수 있을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 7fba06a1-b79a-239d-d722-4cb1e7ae071c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal:7fba06a1-b79a-239d-d722-4cb1e7ae071c
msgctxt "hbfe0b4c2g5a4ag44a1g9d04g93e0521e78e5"
msgid "Good - you are awake. I want to taste your fear."
msgstr "좋아, 일어났구나. 너의 두려움을 맛보고 싶다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7fd46948-ff19-8894-0b3d-63c97abb6902
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 15
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal:7fd46948-ff19-8894-0b3d-63c97abb6902
msgctxt "h5a265cd4g0bc2g4106g8496gb46223ad66f6"
msgid "You'd try kill me? <b>I AM THE ABSOLUTE'S FIST!</b>"
msgstr "감히 나에게 도전할 생각인가? <b>난 절대자의 피스트라고!</b>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 8112ef8d-7cc2-bd51-2280-5c25960d7579
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal:8112ef8d-7cc2-bd51-2280-5c25960d7579
msgctxt "hf20cd373g985bg40c7g8b29ge15b1d18fd53"
msgid ""
"When you meet Her at Moonrise, She will show you Her design, and your part "
"in it."
msgstr "네가 문라이즈에서 그분을 만나면, 그분이 계획과 너의 역할을 알려주실 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 8470faf9-4f2b-c5a5-6e78-991c6039179c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal:8470faf9-4f2b-c5a5-6e78-991c6039179c
msgctxt "h5f8e90b0gecc8g4ff3gb580g7a7caef3a3ac"
msgid ""
"Then steel yourself. If you are uncertain, you will not even survive the "
"journey."
msgstr "그렇다면 마음을 단단히 먹어라. 확신이 없으면, 여정에서 살아남지 못할 테니."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8626ca6e-b890-080c-d0cd-d5621b4c21d9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal:8626ca6e-b890-080c-d0cd-d5621b4c21d9
msgctxt "h8abbf28egd9bdg4f07gaadfgc11bb2515dc5"
msgid "The heart of power - what is this Moonrise, exactly?"
msgstr "힘의 심장부 - 문라이즈라는 게 정확히 뭐야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 868b9207-efda-e9d5-f12e-b74045f289de
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 12
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal:868b9207-efda-e9d5-f12e-b74045f289de
msgctxt "h51a96bf1g8a07g4270g9627gd80e9fc8f0f9"
msgid "Don't make this personal. I am a servant of the Absolute, same as you."
msgstr "개인적인 결정으로 일을 그르치려 들지 마. 난 너랑 같은 절대자님의 종복이라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 896a379f-ad95-6fef-0ed4-75556fd64e17
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal:896a379f-ad95-6fef-0ed4-75556fd64e17
msgctxt "he69d05c0g6be7g4cd0ga544ge64613572961"
msgid ""
"*You are ready to strike, to end your own life - but then a shock runs "
"through your mind. This is no dream.*"
msgstr "*자신의 목숨을 끊기 위해 공격할 준비가 되었지만, 갑자기 충격이 당신의 마음 속을 스쳐 지나갑니다. 이건 꿈이 아닙니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 8f110587-a4f7-22d8-a7c5-3148cecd41bf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal:8f110587-a4f7-22d8-a7c5-3148cecd41bf
msgctxt "h13527206g19d8g4ea6gbeeag3cc5cb403366"
msgid "That might be. But you have not been <i>truly</i> tested yet."
msgstr "그럴 지도. 하지만 넌 아직 <i>진정한</i> 시험을 거치지 못했다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 929c38ac-bb5e-401f-55ad-44efd73d746d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal:929c38ac-bb5e-401f-55ad-44efd73d746d
msgctxt "h30eb207cg6282g4c6aga536g42147a0c541d"
msgid "You're a coward."
msgstr "너는 겁쟁이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 94428490-5afe-3df4-5116-71742f3d89fc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_NightWithDrow_Satisfied = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal:94428490-5afe-3df4-5116-71742f3d89fc
msgctxt "he46a7edcg1c91g4297g93feg9e86c8cbcce1"
msgid "Wake up, True Soul. We must talk."
msgstr "일어나, 참된 영혼. 해야 할 얘기가 있다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 9fac66cd-4d8f-d326-3d09-96f55093c7dc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal:9fac66cd-4d8f-d326-3d09-96f55093c7dc
msgctxt "hf0282d78gd26ag4a77g8e52gc849ae629e63"
msgid ""
"She will test you. If you fail, you will break; if your faith is strong, you "
"will become something greater than yourself."
msgstr "그분은 널 시험하실 거다. 실패한다면 꺾이게 되겠지만, 믿음이 강하다면 네 자신보다 위대한 존재가 되겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = a2690db7-1e2c-170c-d14d-085454694522
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal:a2690db7-1e2c-170c-d14d-085454694522
msgctxt "hcc8b5da2g1becg41e8g8896g83b7b616a5dc"
msgid ""
"Then you have chosen. Whatever you truly are, you will die before you can do "
"anymore harm."
msgstr "그럼 선택한 게로군. 네 실체가 무엇이든 간에 어떠한 해를 끼치기 전에 죽을 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = a694eda1-291b-0130-092e-12a6eec8a0c9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal:a694eda1-291b-0130-092e-12a6eec8a0c9
msgctxt "ha7633552g5a9bg4d59g8ebcgac78a4ac10fd"
msgid "But you will be, and soon. I am curious to see if you survive."
msgstr "하지만 시험이 있을 거다. 곧. 네가 살아남을지 궁금하군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ae4ef483-acd8-c786-9803-3d94b5e73986
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal:ae4ef483-acd8-c786-9803-3d94b5e73986
msgctxt "h1bf21815g1f3dg437egb7b6g83ab7eb00c48"
msgid "I'll go wherever I choose."
msgstr "내가 가기로 한 곳으로 갈 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = b3fedcf1-ce05-8700-b292-a76f5c15f641
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal:b3fedcf1-ce05-8700-b292-a76f5c15f641
msgctxt "h241d5becg6830g4a7cg9eb1g1730c906de76"
msgid "There is something missing in you, and I do not understand it."
msgstr "네 안엔 무엇인가 빠져 있어. 내가 알지 못하는 무언가가."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b430cee5-b064-6157-a328-6c16e0668f6b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal:b430cee5-b064-6157-a328-6c16e0668f6b
msgctxt "h9bd9cb15g8d4cg4d3fga532g015d8b2cb560"
msgid "What is this creature?"
msgstr "그 괴물이란 게 뭔데?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b58721f7-e333-3557-acae-05bc25dbf954
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal:b58721f7-e333-3557-acae-05bc25dbf954
msgctxt "hbeb7ccceg7fe4g4fcdg9d25gb8429e880dc3"
msgid "I'm not afraid of you."
msgstr "난 네가 두렵지 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = bc7d3148-c5aa-7480-2987-033eb30ba4a8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal:bc7d3148-c5aa-7480-2987-033eb30ba4a8
msgctxt "h2481aaeag72c2g4db8g8e1egf29cc4c61647"
msgid ""
"Did he, now? Let me guess: the snivelling brat's failed his duty. Nothing if "
"not expected."
msgstr "그가 그렇게 말했나? 내가 맞춰보지: 그 투덜대는 애송이가 임무에 실패했겠군. 놀랄 일도 아니야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c6fa5d24-deab-3e4a-5b18-e1ec8d82a8da
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal:c6fa5d24-deab-3e4a-5b18-e1ec8d82a8da
msgctxt "h460ffc26ge724g4648g99bbg63214a95e142"
msgid "If I go to the seat of Her power, it will be to destroy Her."
msgstr "내가 그녀 곁으로 가게된다면 그건 오로지 그녀를 파멸시키기 위해서일 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c7c3d8a7-68e1-c0d1-3cc4-50017faacaaf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal:c7c3d8a7-68e1-c0d1-3cc4-50017faacaaf
msgctxt "h6b9c8420gda36g466bga8c9gdef361f7948f"
msgid "Where will I find him?"
msgstr "어디서 그를 찾을 수 있지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = d0cd1836-26b6-8cec-f12f-0d09b0eb4c9a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal:d0cd1836-26b6-8cec-f12f-0d09b0eb4c9a
msgctxt "h263a551agca74g4582gae55g759e458c942a"
msgid "Good. I believe you."
msgstr "좋아. 믿어보도록 하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d448ab02-9bd2-2629-6ed4-56c0fb806911
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 2
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal:d448ab02-9bd2-2629-6ed4-56c0fb806911
msgctxt "hec635401g6de6g4d54g88a7g7ab40ad9b1ea"
msgid "I only wish to please the Absolute - send me to Her."
msgstr "내겐 절대자님을 기쁘게할 생각뿐이야. 날 그녀에게 보내줘."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = df2dec84-692f-1ed2-ce43-feda5611d502
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 15
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal:df2dec84-692f-1ed2-ce43-feda5611d502
msgctxt "ha53b5908g0933g4f47g997bg634f7c5daff8"
msgid "You wouldn't dare kill me - I'm a True Soul, same as you."
msgstr "나를 죽일 순 없을걸. 난 너와 같은 참된 영혼이라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e04e4699-805f-30a3-2d52-28cde85eddb4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_DrowCommander_Quest_AskedAboutPassage = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal:e04e4699-805f-30a3-2d52-28cde85eddb4
msgctxt "h07611b7fge177g420fga22ag7729c347beb0"
msgid "And you will provide a safe journey, as you promised?"
msgstr "그럼 약속한 대로 안전한 여행길을 제공해 줄 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = e30d987b-a3ee-66cf-9e62-a2e2127ac1df
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal:e30d987b-a3ee-66cf-9e62-a2e2127ac1df
msgctxt "hdb655883g3450g4737ga5f6g10c84eb52bbe"
msgid ""
"The Absolute has spoken to you already, in whispers, but at Moonrise you "
"will be in Her presence."
msgstr "절대자님이 이미 속삭임으로 너에게 말씀하셨겠지만, 문라이즈에서 너는 절대자님을 알현하게 될 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e638679d-489f-f323-40b6-442921690a2b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Absolute_Knows_MoonriseTowers = True
#.      - GOB_DrowCommander_Quest_AskedAboutPassage = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GOB_DrowCommander_Quest_AskedAboutPassage = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal:e638679d-489f-f323-40b6-442921690a2b
msgctxt "he1dc8861gb35cg4034gae4bg2bb89f1e2ce7"
msgid "Can you tell me how to reach Moonrise safely?"
msgstr "문라이즈로 가는 안전한 방법을 알려줄 수 있나? 참된 영혼 니어가 그러기로 약속했는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e7d3db62-da66-f0de-7858-83b1e7181ff3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_NightWithDrow_Satisfied = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal:e7d3db62-da66-f0de-7858-83b1e7181ff3
msgctxt "h783b4063g7cdag47a7g93b4gf20086383841"
msgid "Why would I follow that path when you just threatened to kill me?"
msgstr "너는 방금 날 죽이려고 위협했는데, 내가 왜 그 길을 따라가야 하지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = e8a87866-94c5-bb94-3d76-1cffb1663234
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal:e8a87866-94c5-bb94-3d76-1cffb1663234
msgctxt "h25a2ac0dg794dg4859g8152g36d0887d057b"
msgid ""
"He was a drow once. Now he is an abomination, a victim of Lolth's cruelty."
msgstr "그는 한때 드로우였으나, 롤쓰의 잔혹함에 희생되어 지금은 혐오스런 존재가 되었지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = e8cfd622-e937-4af7-81b2-9b589868e962
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal:e8cfd622-e937-4af7-81b2-9b589868e962
msgctxt "h40edd1fbgb437g4e9cgbf3dg28eb0d041e6b"
msgid ""
"The land around Moonrise is cursed. Travelling there will sap your strength "
"and your sanity."
msgstr "문라이즈 주변의 땅은 저주 받은 곳이지. 그곳을 여행하면 너의 힘과 정신이 약화될 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = eabdf0f7-3400-4004-cead-b395780a0c06
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_NightWithDrow_Annoyed = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal:eabdf0f7-3400-4004-cead-b395780a0c06
msgctxt "h9cdfe01fgaaa3g4ee4g80acg0e2b9671215e"
msgid ""
"Good - you are awake. I want to taste <i>your</i> fear, just as you tasted "
"mine."
msgstr "좋아, 일어났구나. <i>너의</i> 두려움을 맛보고 싶다. 네가 내 것을 맛본 것처럼."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = ef42c229-61f9-1977-c64c-0a7d2ea22885
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal:ef42c229-61f9-1977-c64c-0a7d2ea22885
msgctxt "h7669c7f5gbecbg4082gaebag0587eea76b41"
msgid ""
"I warn you - he is quite mad, but he knows the path to Moonrise better than "
"anyone."
msgstr "다만 경고해 줘야겠군. 누구보다도 문라이즈로 향하는 길을 잘 알고 있긴 하지만, 그놈은 완전히 돌아버렸어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = f6b9f488-0e77-f80c-6ced-84e64af3bc47
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Quest:
#.     - GLO_PathToMoonrise.MintharaToldPath(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal:f6b9f488-0e77-f80c-6ced-84e64af3bc47
msgctxt "hcadc7fbcg4be1g4c70g9577ge06bdbefc9fd"
msgid ""
"His minions will wait for you at the mountain pass, on the threshold of the "
"shadow curse."
msgstr "그의 졸개들이 그림자 저주의 문턱 산길에서 기다리고 있을 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fc44f6d0-c517-aed0-5d79-5690aef0c52a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_DrowCommander_Knows_SentByNere = True
#.      - UND_TheDrowNere_Quest_SentToMinthara = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_DrowCommander_Knows_SentByNere = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal:fc44f6d0-c517-aed0-5d79-5690aef0c52a
msgctxt "h608d859agdd66g4ca3gb2fag29c25eb74c0d"
msgid ""
"I met True Soul Nere in the Underdark. He warned me against working with you."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = ff8a1b4f-f135-eae1-b60f-1b4358da8c82
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CAMP_PartySize_AtLeast2 = True
#. TagRule:
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_DrowBetrayal:ff8a1b4f-f135-eae1-b60f-1b4358da8c82
msgctxt "h8b11ec6bgb20ag4a0bga093gee3c1957d37e"
msgid "It is time - kill them!"
msgstr "때가 됐다. 이들을 죽여라!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 018f3681-a89d-6398-f9e3-7e1a9bb940c2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Halsin_Knows_ShadowCurse = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:018f3681-a89d-6398-f9e3-7e1a9bb940c2
msgctxt "h8c282ca4g1809g4324ga4a8g133490f5e723"
msgid "What's so dangerous about it?"
msgstr "그곳이 뭐 때문에 그렇게 위험한 거죠?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 0283c56d-20ea-6799-b78e-49bc45de31e0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:0283c56d-20ea-6799-b78e-49bc45de31e0
msgctxt "h859a85e5g7bc7g4ce1g88d9g6867161c2792"
msgid ""
"I've long sought to return to Moonrise Towers. It seems our fates have "
"aligned."
msgstr "나도 오랫동안 문라이즈 타워에 돌아가기를 기다렸다네, 끝맺을 일이 있어서 말이야. 우리 운명이 맞닿은 것 같군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0285322b-c52b-2e36-c8d5-e513afce6b92
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:0285322b-c52b-2e36-c8d5-e513afce6b92
msgctxt "h7cb0b440gaf36g47f3ga784ga45cbd7afd72"
msgid "How are you so sure Moonrise is where I have to go?"
msgstr "문라이즈 타워에 가야 한다고 어째서 그렇게 확신하는 거죠?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 02d43344-b83b-ccd4-4f5c-4f6f681f97dd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CAMP_Halsin_Knows_AboutSharranTunnel = True
#.   Quest:
#.     - GLO_PathToMoonrise.HalsinToldPath(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:02d43344-b83b-ccd4-4f5c-4f6f681f97dd
msgctxt "h4c48f575gb6abg4572gb409g89a71bbe490e"
msgid ""
"You could also go <i>under</i>. There is a tunnel somewhere in the ruined "
"temple of Selûne. It leads to Moonrise Towers through the Underdark."
msgstr ""
"<i>지하</i>로 가는 방법도 있지. 폐허가 된 셀루네의 신전 어딘가에 터널이 있어. 이를 통해 언더다크를 거쳐 문라이즈 타워로 갈 수 "
"있을 거라네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 045422ff-4a22-f80e-439d-2b331c9f26a6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:045422ff-4a22-f80e-439d-2b331c9f26a6
msgctxt "h825aefdag675eg4b5fg92c7gf31d1c7ca932"
msgid ""
"I don't know. Ketheric's followers were defeated or vanished before the "
"effects of the curse took hold."
msgstr "모르겠군. 케서릭의 추종자들은 저주의 영향이 퍼지기 전에 패퇴하거나 사라졌어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 06777307-e473-443e-4c51-3c941f301a63
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:06777307-e473-443e-4c51-3c941f301a63
msgctxt "h61c39401g02ddg4d11ga648g10efc1be36fe"
msgid "Already...? If only I'd gone with you instead of Aradin."
msgstr "벌써...? 아라딘 대신 그대와 같이 갈걸 그랬군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 07e2892d-8252-412f-80f9-47425396eefe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:07e2892d-8252-412f-80f9-47425396eefe
msgctxt "h076be22cg1a2dg4de9ga22fg203d3596ef84"
msgid ""
"Contrary to how some think of us, we druids can play politics when necessary."
msgstr "다른 이들이 우리에 대해 생각하는 것과는 다르겠지만, 우리 드루이드들은 필요하다면 정치적 행동도 할 수 있다네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 0bb34809-9b35-74cf-cf87-03eefe19cf95
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:0bb34809-9b35-74cf-cf87-03eefe19cf95
msgctxt "h5263573bge4b8g425cgbf20g0fd2b48c1836"
msgid "As bones, perhaps. But their hidden structures might still remain."
msgstr "유골 정도는 남아 있을지도 모르겠군. 하지만 그 자들의 숨겨진 구조물은 아직 남아 있을 걸세."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 151aa03e-003a-6616-b91a-e0515f726feb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:151aa03e-003a-6616-b91a-e0515f726feb
msgctxt "h9bde66e0g5fc5g47e2ga3d1gbfaf65de8ae3"
msgid ""
"I've chosen a successor as First Druid - Francesca of the High Forest. A "
"bird's already been dispatched to summon her."
msgstr "내 뒤를 이을 최고 드루이드로 높은 숲의 프란체스카를 선정하게 됐네. 이미 그녀를 소환하기 위해 새 한 마리를 보냈지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 153cced5-a4c0-7ccf-569d-817d22695f2b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:153cced5-a4c0-7ccf-569d-817d22695f2b
msgctxt "hbe3270b6g24d2g4bdeg8cb2g9789114842c4"
msgid ""
"There is a terrible curse surrounding Moonrise Towers - a shadow curse that "
"drains away all light and life."
msgstr "끔찍한 저주가 문라이즈 타워 주변을 에워싸고 있어. 모든 빛과 생명을 집어삼키는 그림자 저주지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1659a831-8285-6e84-9bb5-f361b4a462ea
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:1659a831-8285-6e84-9bb5-f361b4a462ea
msgctxt "he5f60b96gbcaag4618g9d24g2cf7e3a07fdd"
msgid "What would you do?"
msgstr "당신이라면 어떻게 하겠습니까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 169db345-480a-5bf8-ca18-70c24ffc5b1e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Underdark_EverEnteredBefore = False
#.      - GOB_TempleAccess_Event_PuzzleSolved = False
#.      - GLO_Halsin_Event_PreferUnderdarkRoute = True
#.   Local:
#.      - c12e62ff-c2e8-b0eb-7d2d-00ee77177078_HiddenEntranceInSeluneTemple = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - c12e62ff-c2e8-b0eb-7d2d-00ee77177078_HiddenEntranceInSeluneTemple = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:169db345-480a-5bf8-ca18-70c24ffc5b1e
msgctxt "hf75082bbgecd9g49e2g9482geb9aff3ad1eb"
msgid "How do I find this passage through the Underdark?"
msgstr "언더다크를 통해 가는 경로를 어떻게 찾죠?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 17f53720-4ba6-410e-4a9b-c84ecf7b492a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:17f53720-4ba6-410e-4a9b-c84ecf7b492a
msgctxt "hc7336d9agccdcg4cb8g9e57gdcfe5f1774c6"
msgid ""
"I believe if you find this entrance, you'll discover a route that leads to "
"Moonrise Towers, bypassing the worst of the shadow curse."
msgstr ""
"내 생각에 그대가 이 입구를 찾을 수 있다면, 끔찍한 그림자 저주의 영향을 피해서 문라이즈 타워로 향하는 길을 발견할 수 있을 걸세."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 19935708-8b59-f55a-fe53-8fb7df44f61b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:19935708-8b59-f55a-fe53-8fb7df44f61b
msgctxt "hd896831ag552fg476eg8b67g4d0b879726df"
msgid ""
"It may be some time before you are afforded another such night - there is "
"much to be done, and I promised I would help you however I could."
msgstr ""
"이런 밤을 또 보낼 수 있으려면 시간이 좀 걸릴지도 모르겠지만, 해야 할 일은 많고, 난 그대에게 할 수 있는 한 도와주기로 약속했었지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 1e515fbe-c68d-9424-d08f-b5a3165dbaf2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:1e515fbe-c68d-9424-d08f-b5a3165dbaf2
msgctxt "h159cafe6g0cb6g4b39g9010g40a9e7384476"
msgid ""
"There is a tunnel leading from the temple of Selûne right down into the "
"Underdark and beyond. The entrance is hidden somewhere in the ruins."
msgstr "셀루네의 신전 아래 언더다크와 그 너머로 향하는 통로가 있어. 입구는 폐허 어딘가에 숨겨져 있을 걸세."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 1e747bc0-d00d-3d20-b2d3-d87fd8907ae0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:1e747bc0-d00d-3d20-b2d3-d87fd8907ae0
msgctxt "h6734dd9eg05d4g408dgadb0g5abfd40d0222"
msgid ""
"To get to the Towers, you'll need to pass through a terrible place - a "
"<i>cursed</i> place."
msgstr "타워에 가려면 끔찍한 곳을, <i>저주받은</i> 곳을 통과해야 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 20363bad-a046-8faa-8797-4308ea3150d4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Underdark_EverEnteredBefore = False
#.      - GOB_TempleAccess_Event_PuzzleSolved = False
#.   Local:
#.      - c12e62ff-c2e8-b0eb-7d2d-00ee77177078_HiddenEntranceInSeluneTemple = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - c12e62ff-c2e8-b0eb-7d2d-00ee77177078_HiddenEntranceInSeluneTemple = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:20363bad-a046-8faa-8797-4308ea3150d4
msgctxt "ha5a96d83gb125g473egbb4cg60fd6ddc56cb"
msgid ""
"I advise you start in the temple of Selûne - if you find the Dark "
"Justiciars' hidden entrance, it could lead you all the way to Moonrise."
msgstr "셀루네의 신전에서부터 시작하는 것을 권하지. 다크 저스티시어들의 숨겨진 입구를 발견하면, 어떻게든 문라이즈로 갈 수 있을 걸세."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 234fe345-58f4-f323-d17c-3b5d9ad666f6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:234fe345-58f4-f323-d17c-3b5d9ad666f6
msgctxt "h55375a9cgac0cg496agada0g78bf2c9f04eb"
msgid "All right. We'd better get moving."
msgstr "알겠어요. 이제 움직일 시간이군요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 24fbde07-b76b-b2eb-2db1-362b1c6a9544
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:24fbde07-b76b-b2eb-2db1-362b1c6a9544
msgctxt "hebd3d1b9g5d8cg4136g8f6egc24da387a0e4"
msgid "The Absolute's forces can tolerate such a place?"
msgstr "절대자의 병력은 그걸 견딜 수 있는 겁니까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2544a8e3-ae4b-8a45-fb03-f3183638cfad
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:2544a8e3-ae4b-8a45-fb03-f3183638cfad
msgctxt "h1f35d896g606eg4f3fg969fg3eac0dff0412"
msgid "This shadow curse - does it affect Shar worshippers?"
msgstr "그림자 저주라는 건, 샤 숭배자들에게도 영향을 미치는 겁니까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 26274f9c-000d-0709-ee57-61347ddba31d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ShadowHeart_InParty_Knows_SharWorshipper = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - Shadowheart_InParty_InterestInDarkJusticiars = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:26274f9c-000d-0709-ee57-61347ddba31d
msgctxt "h9711b65agac4eg4ac6ga880g1147b753895c"
msgid "Dark Justiciars? I must see for myself."
msgstr "다크 저스티시어라고요? 직접 봐야겠군요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 266daf27-aae1-3ede-a130-4045315bfcca
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - DEN_ShadowDruid_HasMet_Opposed(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_ShadowDruid_State_RathIsPermaDefeated = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:266daf27-aae1-3ede-a130-4045315bfcca
msgctxt "h698fdb07ga1bfg472bg83a7g1d01b611bc4b"
msgid "What about one of the others? Rath, perhaps?"
msgstr "다른 드루이드 중에서는 어때요? 라스라든지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 28e1a4dc-5811-17bc-bb9c-544a67d13c90
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:28e1a4dc-5811-17bc-bb9c-544a67d13c90
msgctxt "h9c970507g53cfg453dga04dgf2789cf9314e"
msgid ""
"From this stronghold, Ketheric's forces could access both the temple of "
"Selûne and Moonrise Towers - but he was defeated before he could launch an "
"attack."
msgstr ""
"그 요새에서 케서릭의 군대는 셀루네의 신전과 문라이즈 타워, 두 곳에 모두 접근할 수 있었지. 하지만 놈은 미처 공세를 시작하기도 전에 "
"패퇴하고 말았네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 2c7cc44f-d51c-6e76-64c6-1a162344629c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Volo_OperationFailed = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:2c7cc44f-d51c-6e76-64c6-1a162344629c
msgctxt "hc798d0e9g95d6g4637ga663gf6b58af4f0f3"
msgid ""
"What, were you expecting a spell? A potion? Or perhaps you thought I'd "
"conduct a cack-handed operation on you right here."
msgstr ""
"뭐, 주문이라도 기대했나? 물약이나? 아니면 내가 바로 이 자리에서 그대의 머리를 깨고 수술이라도 해줄 거라고 생각했는지도 모르겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 303aed2a-9b48-79a3-ceb2-ec2d37e7d24f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:303aed2a-9b48-79a3-ceb2-ec2d37e7d24f
msgctxt "h66ae05b5g3c34g49aeg9398g5b5a7e1faa1f"
msgid ""
"So it seems, though I don't know how. You will have to choose your approach "
"carefully."
msgstr "방법은 모르겠지만, 그런 것 같군. 접근 방식을 신중하게 선택해야 할 걸세."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 31a78067-f41e-e420-77c2-d8c59ff734fa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:31a78067-f41e-e420-77c2-d8c59ff734fa
msgctxt "he43f360bgd9a2g48adg8374g3132dd5d886b"
msgid ""
"With luck, and the Oak Father's blessings, we might actually survive. Are "
"you ready?"
msgstr "행운과 참나무 아버지의 축복이 함께한다면, 정말로 살아남을 수 있을지도 모르지. 준비는 되었나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 323d46a6-fb27-55f3-b3f2-c8d563d6699f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:323d46a6-fb27-55f3-b3f2-c8d563d6699f
msgctxt "h15cead15g3faag4cd6g8733g77514a69f9c9"
msgid ""
"The decision is yours, but I'd favour the Underdark. Even a place like that "
"is the lesser evil compared to the shadow-cursed lands."
msgstr ""
"결정은 그대의 몫이지만, 나라면 언더다크를 통해 가겠네. 그런 곳이라도, 그림자 저주의 영향을 받은 곳을 통과하는 것보다는 나을 테니."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 327614da-194d-0558-17f3-da3b9d4a44fa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:327614da-194d-0558-17f3-da3b9d4a44fa
msgctxt "h8de6a956ge2dfg4169g8cefgce9e4a7db9e9"
msgid ""
"Aradin and his lot were looking for a way down there - they were promised "
"riches if they retrieved a relic called the Nightsong. But I think there's "
"more."
msgstr ""
"아라딘 일행도 그 지하로 가는 길을 찾고 있었네. 이들은 '밤의 노래'라는 유물을 되찾아주고 부를 얻기로 했던 모양이지만 내 생각에는 "
"그보다 더 많은 것이 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 32cb0a82-2f1b-55c7-fb58-79ef089d20d1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:32cb0a82-2f1b-55c7-fb58-79ef089d20d1
msgctxt "h2fe2b0d1g09d0g4b32gb06ag972db9868ecc"
msgid ""
"This is why I chose Francesca. She will restore simplicity and purity to the "
"grove in my absence."
msgstr "그렇기에 프란체스카를 고른 걸세. 내가 없는 동안 그녀가 숲의 소박하고 순수한 모습을 되찾아줄 수 있을 것이니."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 33cf20d7-1abc-b310-2b45-85a0028e0bcc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:33cf20d7-1abc-b310-2b45-85a0028e0bcc
msgctxt "h792fdb25g8c3eg44ccgaaa0g942a58989e00"
msgid "Danger. Are you sure that's the best way to Moonrise?"
msgstr "위험해 보이던데, 그게 문라이즈 타워로 가는 가장 좋은 방법인 게 확실합니까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 371e0807-7436-e7f9-d188-3e246f673471
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GITHYANKI
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:371e0807-7436-e7f9-d188-3e246f673471
msgctxt "h174faffbgeaf3g45f9g9135gbe04a9614fdf"
msgid ""
"There must be another way to cure myself - my kin have dealt with these "
"parasites before."
msgstr "분명 치유할 방법이 더 있을 겁니다. 우리 종족은 이미 이 기생충 문제를 처리한 적이 있거든요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 371e0807-7436-e7f9-d188-3e246f673471
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:371e0807-7436-e7f9-d188-3e246f673471
msgctxt "hbfc09dd7gb77eg4100gb1a7ge2b604259242"
msgid "There must be another way to cure myself."
msgstr "분명 치유할 다른 방법이 있을 겁니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 376135e7-b61d-476d-8b99-b17bfde3a996
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - c12e62ff-c2e8-b0eb-7d2d-00ee77177078_HiddenEntranceInSeluneTemple = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:376135e7-b61d-476d-8b99-b17bfde3a996
msgctxt "h2b139c96g83ecg4f6fgbca5gde76d4768e2b"
msgid "Indeed. We've quite the journey ahead of us."
msgstr "물론이지. 우리 앞에는 긴 여정이 남아 있다네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 386336fb-dd8f-a45c-16f6-80113402f9f5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:386336fb-dd8f-a45c-16f6-80113402f9f5
msgctxt "h622b71beg660fg46e5gb71dga292dde8b419"
msgid ""
"I won't be held accountable just because you're naive enough to expect easy "
"answers. Now allow me to continue."
msgstr "쉬운 길을 바라는 그대의 안일함까지 내 탓으로 돌리진 말아주겠나. 이제 하던 말을 계속하겠네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 3b16413f-7f10-4c94-9749-87a5af2eb4a6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(4) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(4) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:3b16413f-7f10-4c94-9749-87a5af2eb4a6
msgctxt "h65fd4077g3eb1g4af1gbefcg13c5f98f9084"
msgid ""
"We get a cure <i>and</i> the chance to hit these arseholes where they live? "
"Sounds good."
msgstr "치유할 방법을 찾고, 이 개자식들이 사는 곳을 공격할 기회<i>까지</i> 있다고? 재밌겠는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3e57a22b-38ed-fef0-b2d2-b0182b00541a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_UNDERDARK(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Halsin_Event_PreferUnderdarkRoute = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:3e57a22b-38ed-fef0-b2d2-b0182b00541a
msgctxt "hb0cb4eb6g83fag4f30g944bg880826ae8ed8"
msgid ""
"The Underdark's my home. Better to take that route than risk this curse."
msgstr "언더다크는 내 고향입니다. 이 저주를 무릅쓰느니 그 길을 택하겠습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 40358dca-0a6e-2523-381c-20255242a194
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_ElevatorToScl_Used = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:40358dca-0a6e-2523-381c-20255242a194
msgctxt "h4ee80b12ge7a3g417eg887fg507e2be74a71"
msgid "Absolute followers - but that's about all."
msgstr "절대자의 추종자들이 있더군요. 하지만 그게 전부였습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 418364e8-c0b5-8da2-8bc2-fff312247427
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:418364e8-c0b5-8da2-8bc2-fff312247427
msgctxt "h38f36400g2e77g407bg9ecfgbcedea59c568"
msgid "What do you suggest?"
msgstr "어떻게 하면 좋을까요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 41ebe8ca-51ca-3c94-3f51-cb77d33badc1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:41ebe8ca-51ca-3c94-3f51-cb77d33badc1
msgctxt "h51c38307g11c4g4f8bg9d97g986925521bb4"
msgid "Unfinished business, and a lifetime of regret to repair."
msgstr "끝내지 못한 일이고, 평생에 걸쳐 만회해야 할 후회지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 42aae879-3b09-81b3-2569-3b518aacaa35
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:42aae879-3b09-81b3-2569-3b518aacaa35
msgctxt "h9e8f02c3g3b87g4cb5ga59bgd9c62299fa80"
msgid ""
"I spent years researching the curse, trying to put an end to it. Nothing has "
"worked - yet."
msgstr "나는 저주를 끝내기 위해, 이를 연구하는 데 수년을 보냈네. 하지만 아무것도 소용이 없었지. 아직은 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 43950457-57c0-0189-fd8c-562bd077bbe9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CAMP_Halsin_Knows_ShadowCurseMotivation = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:43950457-57c0-0189-fd8c-562bd077bbe9
msgctxt "ha3278846g8c8ag4d22gb544g9ad47d784296"
msgid ""
"Is that why you went with Aradin? You thought he might uncover this route to "
"Moonrise?"
msgstr "그래서 아라딘과 함께 간 겁니까? 아라딘이 문라이즈로 가는 길을 알아낼 수 있을 거라 생각해서?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 43c79756-ffe7-a26a-fc9c-822cea572801
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:43c79756-ffe7-a26a-fc9c-822cea572801
msgctxt "h199c3e90g25f8g4c03gb4d4gd97200d4dc49"
msgid "Let's go, then."
msgstr "그럼, 갑시다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 4b3fcee5-4b55-88b7-14af-5fbb79b911c9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_AdventurersQuest_Knows_LeaderMap = False
#.      - GLO_Underdark_EverEnteredBefore = False
#.      - GOB_TempleAccess_Event_PuzzleSolved = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:4b3fcee5-4b55-88b7-14af-5fbb79b911c9
msgctxt "h945d53e3g3897g4ce7g8859gf8d9c904bfbb"
msgid ""
"One of those who died had a clue that was supposed to help us find the "
"hidden entrance to the Underdark."
msgstr "죽은 이들 중 하나가 언더다크로 향하는 숨겨진 입구를 찾는 단서를 가지고 있었네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 4c832246-97fd-63c4-a75e-69cc0be58bc1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_AdventurersQuest_Knows_LeaderMap = False
#.      - GLO_Underdark_EverEnteredBefore = False
#.      - GOB_TempleAccess_Event_PuzzleSolved = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - DEN_AdventurersQuest_Knows_LeaderMap = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:4c832246-97fd-63c4-a75e-69cc0be58bc1
msgctxt "h6bbb56fegd344g4f1eg9d20gdaa7514582cb"
msgid ""
"A dwarf called Brian, I believe. Though there's no guarantee that the "
"goblins left him recognisable."
msgstr "내 기억이 맞다면, 브라이언이라는 이름의 드워프였어. 하지만 고블린들이 그를 멀쩡히 내버려 뒀을지는 모르겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 4f5519b9-063e-43be-41ee-f57e2277fcc1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:4f5519b9-063e-43be-41ee-f57e2277fcc1
msgctxt "hd8b421cdgc58eg43e0ga39agb22e105fdd2a"
msgid ""
"Resentment will spring up like mushrooms no matter what I do. You cannot "
"please everyone and you'd be a fool to try."
msgstr "내가 무엇을 하든 원망은 버섯처럼 솟아날 걸세. 모든 사람을 만족시킬 수는 없고, 그러고자 하는 것은 어리석은 일이니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 51bef1f7-389d-22f3-6588-640a077746c3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_ElevatorToScl_Used = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:51bef1f7-389d-22f3-6588-640a077746c3
msgctxt "hd4341b65g714ag4564ga05fg439fff72587a"
msgid "I found an elevator - but it leads right into the shadow curse."
msgstr "승강기를 찾았습니다. 하지만 바로 그림자 저주로 향하는 것 같더군요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 53b8e74e-0817-04cb-5406-2f88b6485992
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_DruidAttack_State_PrepAfterDeathOfDruids = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:53b8e74e-0817-04cb-5406-2f88b6485992
msgctxt "h80d71901gf70ag4b38g8254ge5c5fa94f4c3"
msgid "First and only Druid. What will Francesca even do here?"
msgstr "최고이자 유일한 드루이드겠죠. 프란체스카가 대체 여기서 할 수 있는 게 있긴 한가요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 543979d1-7946-767a-864c-dfd875256e74
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Halsin_Knows_AboutGrymforge = False
#.      - GLO_DuergarCamp_EverEnteredBefore = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:543979d1-7946-767a-864c-dfd875256e74
msgctxt "h165850e2g3464g4ffcg9e7cgf91591f0c103"
msgid "I already found the place you're talking about - it's called Grymforge."
msgstr "당신이 말하는 장소는 이미 찾았어요. 그곳은 그림포지라 불리더군요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 572acbf9-836b-66f9-821b-ea65d45ee426
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:572acbf9-836b-66f9-821b-ea65d45ee426
msgctxt "h19430219gf219g402cgad5dg252bd2320608"
msgid ""
"You've already been? Impressive. You'll make me redundant at this rate. What "
"did you find?"
msgstr "이미 다녀왔다고? 인상적이네. 그 속도라면 내 도움도 필요 없겠군. 무엇을 발견했나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 5dc6dcb0-a381-2a01-5c3f-2cb7e49d9bc8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:5dc6dcb0-a381-2a01-5c3f-2cb7e49d9bc8
msgctxt "h8ef4b87eg7251g4c92gb054g7d65ccfe1571"
msgid ""
"Aradin and his lot were looking for the same entrance - they sought an "
"artefact called the Nightsong that was supposed to be housed somewhere down "
"there."
msgstr ""
"아라딘 일행도 같은 입구를 찾고 있었는데, 그들은 그곳 어딘가에 보관되어 있을 것으로 추정되는 '밤의 노래'라는 아티팩트를 찾고 있었지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 5f0886c0-e3fb-f05e-5130-c08af405c2dd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:5f0886c0-e3fb-f05e-5130-c08af405c2dd
msgctxt "h6a5b26a2g4bfag4e38gbba0g8cc587cc86de"
msgid ""
"Moonrise Towers beckons. I've told you all I know, and now I'll join your "
"camp to help you face whatever's to come."
msgstr ""
"문라이즈 타워가 손짓하는군. 나는 아는 것을 모두 말했으니, 이제 그대의 야영지에 합류해서 앞으로 닥칠 일에 맞설 수 있도록 돕겠네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 5fde4dd9-e32b-3ea2-f0ae-f074a1a896b8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:5fde4dd9-e32b-3ea2-f0ae-f074a1a896b8
msgctxt "hba85ec0ag3892g4afeg81e2g23fbefa461b4"
msgid ""
"You'll need to pick up where Aradin left off - find the hidden entrance. "
"It's somewhere in the temple of Selûne."
msgstr "아라딘의 뒤를 이어 숨겨진 입구를 찾아야 하네. 셀루네의 신전 어딘가에 있지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6245deb5-c065-a2c1-207f-46d233b580be
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:6245deb5-c065-a2c1-207f-46d233b580be
msgctxt "h5568f0bbg7b01g49f7ga6f6ge4a3cebd695c"
msgid "Remind me - what exactly lies ahead?"
msgstr "다시 알려줘요, 정확히 어떤 여정이 기다리고 있는 거죠?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 627ce8a3-6d93-e972-86a3-1df170e8c5ae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:627ce8a3-6d93-e972-86a3-1df170e8c5ae
msgctxt "h40723808g6dafg4892g8921g26f02c1c1cb8"
msgid "May Silvanus guide us."
msgstr "실바누스께서 인도해주시길."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 62af99c3-335a-bbcf-2016-e2b6eed6a3e2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Halsin_Knows_ShadowCurse = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:62af99c3-335a-bbcf-2016-e2b6eed6a3e2
msgctxt "h4e68013dg2a64g4de5ga996g88deb3ab72fe"
msgid "Moonrise Towers it is then. I'd better make haste."
msgstr "그렇다면 문라이즈 타워로 가야겠군요. 서둘러야겠어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 62e89365-300c-3ce7-fed2-0cac4eef151d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:62e89365-300c-3ce7-fed2-0cac4eef151d
msgctxt "h7697e2ceg18d2g4a1fgb280gd86923b10cb2"
msgid "I've got more exploring to do."
msgstr "탐색을 계속해 봐야겠습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 632a5e51-5bdb-827b-f7fe-86b6a2f51cac
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Halsin_Knows_MoonriseBriefing = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:632a5e51-5bdb-827b-f7fe-86b6a2f51cac
msgctxt "hea4e9db9g59e2g4689g85c5g370cba2476b9"
msgid ""
"The journey, specifically - it's extremely perilous. Though it seems you're "
"well accustomed to navigating danger."
msgstr "그 여정 자체가 매우 위험할 걸세. 하지만 그대는 위험을 헤쳐나가는 데 뛰어난 것 같군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 6b1bf3ea-f8d6-97e6-cccd-aaf8a5dfae2a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:6b1bf3ea-f8d6-97e6-cccd-aaf8a5dfae2a
msgctxt "hbc040677g1f75g435ag8e35g99b659e2fc09"
msgid ""
"I helped overthrow Ketheric Thorm and his Dark Justiciars years ago. But I "
"failed to prevent him from unleashing darkness across the region before he "
"was defeated."
msgstr ""
"여러 해 전에, 난 케서릭 쏨과 그의 다크 저스티시어들을 타도하는 데 기여했지. 하지만 놈이 패배하기 전에 이 지역에 어둠을 풀어놓는 "
"것을 막진 못했네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 6b6dcc67-0630-9ae2-7eca-4f463745a8ba
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:6b6dcc67-0630-9ae2-7eca-4f463745a8ba
msgctxt "hb65fcab1gfcd9g4904g9782gf2751f85ee26"
msgid "Wait. There's more you need to know."
msgstr "잠깐. 그대가 알아야 할 것이 더 있네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 6c581c9b-a07c-b18f-62e7-55bff5351d9e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:6c581c9b-a07c-b18f-62e7-55bff5351d9e
msgctxt "ha0760a36gd4ccg44d5gb386g1c5a1f2d398f"
msgid ""
"By all means - pursue any leads you may have. But I sense all roads will "
"lead to Moonrise."
msgstr "필요하다면 모든 단서를 추적해 보게. 하지만 결국 모든 길은 문라이즈로 이어질 것 같군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 6ff91770-6f2e-a7a5-c25c-90118c09e1ca
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_DruidAttack_State_PrepAfterDeathOfDruids = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:6ff91770-6f2e-a7a5-c25c-90118c09e1ca
msgctxt "hc84e1983g4e6bg4b64g8cfeg2ea5b4354c39"
msgid ""
"A fellow druid. I can count on her to tend to the grove in my absence. Help "
"it heal."
msgstr "동료 드루이드라네. 그녀라면 내가 없는 동안 숲을 믿고 맡길 수 있지. 치유를 도와줄 테고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7118f87c-4b2b-cf6a-14ea-ea538df6fea3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:7118f87c-4b2b-cf6a-14ea-ea538df6fea3
msgctxt "hb33c19ffg43ddg4a56gaaf2gcfa490d4afac"
msgid "Very shrewd of you."
msgstr "좋은 통찰력이네요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 721d9243-6758-e0e1-2176-9bf80c153601
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - DEN_Apprentice_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_Apprentice_State_Dead = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:721d9243-6758-e0e1-2176-9bf80c153601
msgctxt "h0763b12bg42b4g4756gb72fge5ebd1ce48fd"
msgid "Couldn't Nettie take over?"
msgstr "네티가 대신할 수는 없었나요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 738c4d4d-31c7-ea03-c6c6-87ae498f0624
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:738c4d4d-31c7-ea03-c6c6-87ae498f0624
msgctxt "h00ccf6dcgf825g4b21g9d4bg9547613dacdc"
msgid "Won't this cause resentment?"
msgstr "이 결정이 원망을 사지는 않을까요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 74b30909-a7e4-6592-f9f2-de54cd37f76b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_UNDERDARK(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Halsin_Event_PreferOverlandRoute = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:74b30909-a7e4-6592-f9f2-de54cd37f76b
msgctxt "h647a7ecdg9f2bg49f6g9b83g7e7c6a4ef75b"
msgid ""
"I don't want to risk getting lost in the Underdark - I'll journey overland."
msgstr "언더다크에서 길을 잃는 위험을 감수하고 싶지는 않군요. 지상으로 모험해야겠습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 77a7d59d-9e03-3f04-3494-6c5d001edc79
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Halsin_Knows_MoonriseBriefing = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:77a7d59d-9e03-3f04-3494-6c5d001edc79
msgctxt "h780c4a6cgbd8eg4ffdg81dcg59b1087ba555"
msgid ""
"It may be some time before you are afforded another such night - there is "
"much to be done."
msgstr "이런 밤을 또 보낼 수 있으려면 시간이 좀 걸릴지도 모르겠지만, 해야 할 일은 많다네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 79bdf490-b09d-02c1-9e68-48b8a9762be7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:79bdf490-b09d-02c1-9e68-48b8a9762be7
msgctxt "h4d1e03e6g46d1g45c1g86f0g5e521f5aeef3"
msgid ""
"I need her to stay focused on her training - the grove will need a skilled "
"healer in my absence."
msgstr "내가 없는 동안 숲에는 숙련된 치유사가 필요하니, 그녀가 훈련에 집중할 수 있게 해줘야 하네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 79d933b5-3b46-5216-fcd6-c7c61b93ce91
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:79d933b5-3b46-5216-fcd6-c7c61b93ce91
msgctxt "h08d7da35gc4cag435dg91ecg22ab57f646ef"
msgid ""
"If I can join you and get close to Moonrise, perhaps I can lift this curse, "
"same as you may find a cure for your infection."
msgstr "만약 내가 함께 문라이즈에 가까이 갈 수 있다면, 그대는 감염을 치유할 방법을 찾고 나는 이 저주를 풀 수 있을지도 모르지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 7b54335c-f885-4477-a4d3-6138e38b884e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(6) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(6) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:7b54335c-f885-4477-a4d3-6138e38b884e
msgctxt "h2049c22dg8f9bg4c00g9490gd4701b23dbab"
msgid "To Moonrise Towers, then. May the sun and stars guide us."
msgstr "그럼, 문라이즈 타워로 가야겠군요. 태양과 별이 우릴 인도하기를."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 7c824875-e598-2d42-da10-31bfc68ae225
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_Lockdown_State_Active = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:7c824875-e598-2d42-da10-31bfc68ae225
msgctxt "h7472c94eg3119g4ee4g8c75g55125730bf7c"
msgid ""
"It's lost to me. Perhaps in time I can open it up to the world again, but "
"for now, I must help you."
msgstr "숲은 내 손을 떠났다네. 때가 되면 숲을 다시 세상과 이어 보일 수도 있겠지만, 지금의 나는 그대를 도와야겠네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7fd6bce5-584e-1b74-6be1-cfcaeb32f820
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_UNDERDARK(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Halsin_Event_PreferUnderdarkRoute = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:7fd6bce5-584e-1b74-6be1-cfcaeb32f820
msgctxt "hdb4ed5dcgd790g4cbfg891fgc268c5230829"
msgid ""
"I never thought I'd say this, but it sounds like the Underdark is the safer "
"route."
msgstr "내가 이런 말을 할 거라고는 생각도 못해봤지만, 언더다크가 더 안전한 길인 것 같군요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 8026fedf-c7eb-52f6-0e53-5c9ce5b28231
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:8026fedf-c7eb-52f6-0e53-5c9ce5b28231
msgctxt "h17c96c2fgb2ebg46c9g8679ge0330fe4e236"
msgid ""
"Rath has promise, but he has a ways to go yet. He wasn't able to stop Kagha "
"by himself. The grove needs experience and a strong hand."
msgstr ""
"라스는 장래가 유망하지만, 아직은 갈 길이 멀지. 카그하를 막을 역량이 없었잖나. 숲에는 경험이 많고 의지가 강한 이가 필요하다네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 80d62694-3cfc-66ee-b446-c8463d06e4dd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_AdventurersQuest_Knows_LeaderMap = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - DEN_AdventurersQuest_Knows_LeaderMap = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:80d62694-3cfc-66ee-b446-c8463d06e4dd
msgctxt "h76509e46g8e4dg4619g84b1g8afde7ed1ee6"
msgid ""
"One of the adventurers had a clue to help find it - a dwarf called Brian. It "
"might still be found on his corpse, wherever the goblins left it."
msgstr ""
"모험가 중 한 명이 그걸 찾는 단서를 가지고 있었지, 브라이언이라는 드워프였어. 고블린들이 그의 시체를 어디 뒀는진 모르겠지만, 아직 "
"그곳에 남아 있을지도 모르네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 8630f156-7f9e-f429-5dc8-ff18703e81d6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:8630f156-7f9e-f429-5dc8-ff18703e81d6
msgctxt "h838f9184g1816g4c8cgbfe7g9a29dd87aae1"
msgid ""
"I'm glad you approve - I do not truly <i>care </i>if you approve, but I am "
"glad."
msgstr "그대가 좋아한다니 기쁘군. 정말로 좋아하는지는 <i>상관</i> 없지만, 어쨌거나 기쁘다네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 89e74f44-7577-14ce-2fff-a5bdf6ba3fd2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:89e74f44-7577-14ce-2fff-a5bdf6ba3fd2
msgctxt "he5cdd7f1ga618g4105ga5b8gda135f3f7152"
msgid "Onward then. We'll speak soon, I'm sure."
msgstr "나아가자. 장담컨대, 우리는 곧 다시 대화할 걸세."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 8b4f0204-537a-d042-5214-60de34dd9d13
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_DruidAttack_State_PrepAfterDeathOfDruids = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:8b4f0204-537a-d042-5214-60de34dd9d13
msgctxt "hc3738915g72e7g4c9bgb30dg9baa5773fcb9"
msgid ""
"Precisely! Who indeed? You do not know, and neither do any of the others."
msgstr "바로 그거지! 그게 누구냐고? 그대는 모르겠지, 그리고 숲의 다른 이들도 마찬가지고 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 8c60d02a-abd5-86a0-7689-8efae1f0dfbb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:8c60d02a-abd5-86a0-7689-8efae1f0dfbb
msgctxt "h9b869d81gd8fbg4b18g9926g0b0e59188d1a"
msgid ""
"You're half-right - you have to get to Moonrise, but you still have a choice "
"of how to get there."
msgstr "반은 맞네. 그대는 문라이즈 타워로 가야만 하지만, 그 방법은 선택할 수 있지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 8d19c286-caad-3e10-d805-eb16604e3777
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:8d19c286-caad-3e10-d805-eb16604e3777
msgctxt "h9f0c3cd2g185dg4862g9e46g920148ee6194"
msgid "Anything is preferable to risking the shadow curse."
msgstr "그림자 저주를 피할 수 있다면 어떤 방법이라도 취해야 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 9156228e-3400-d988-f2f4-bd851352ec0b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:9156228e-3400-d988-f2f4-bd851352ec0b
msgctxt "h938934a6gfc41g46fag8355gd71d62170797"
msgid ""
"Precisely. Then perhaps I could have done something about both the shadow "
"curse and ceremorphosis aberrations."
msgstr "정확하네. 그랬으면 내가 그림자 저주와 괴이한 뇌변이 양쪽 모두에 손을 쓸 수도 있었을 텐데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 920c242f-bd5b-60ed-de3d-49b0f53e1fb7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:920c242f-bd5b-60ed-de3d-49b0f53e1fb7
msgctxt "h5ef12efdgfba8g49c6g8a92gec58c527631d"
msgid "That's it? Just go to this place?"
msgstr "그게 전부인가요? 그냥 그 장소로 가는 게?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 957a23f0-eefa-f68f-456e-5d22139df8e4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:957a23f0-eefa-f68f-456e-5d22139df8e4
msgctxt "hec43aa92g543dg4677g9feegd2216a45d44a"
msgid ""
"You could go overland - along the Risen Road or through the mountains. "
"Easier at first, but you'll run into the shadow curse eventually."
msgstr "치솟은 길을 따라 지상으로 가거나 산을 통과할 수도 있다네. 처음에는 더 쉽겠지만, 결국 그림자 저주를 맞닥뜨리게 되겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 995b3657-5273-c086-7025-0ee87a861148
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Absolute_Knows_MoonriseTowers = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:995b3657-5273-c086-7025-0ee87a861148
msgctxt "he0d1c643gdeefg44aeg8678gffafb93e9827"
msgid ""
"Any who linger are twisted by the curse; they become shadow beings - "
"tormented, <i>dangerous </i>souls."
msgstr "그곳에 머무르는 자는 저주에 의해 뒤틀려, 그림자의 존재가 되고 말지. 고통받는 <i>위험한</i> 영혼 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9be7e5cc-c990-4df2-5fed-54df859d482f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Underdark_EverEnteredBefore = False
#.      - GOB_TempleAccess_Event_PuzzleSolved = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - c12e62ff-c2e8-b0eb-7d2d-00ee77177078_HiddenEntranceInSeluneTemple = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:9be7e5cc-c990-4df2-5fed-54df859d482f
msgctxt "h9f99ac57g88aeg4465ga5c9g624dd444bb72"
msgid "So how do I find this underground route?"
msgstr "그래서 그 지하 경로를 어떻게 찾죠?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9c67226a-3fa3-6ad9-2049-46b7a77dfbf8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:9c67226a-3fa3-6ad9-2049-46b7a77dfbf8
msgctxt "h83898ac3ga457g4341g8239gf24b7141ed00"
msgid "Sounds like I've no choice - I need to find a way through."
msgstr "선택권이 없는 것 같은데, 뚫고 지나갈 길을 찾아야겠습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9c6de8d5-4bd3-bd0b-db37-727872b15e76
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:9c6de8d5-4bd3-bd0b-db37-727872b15e76
msgctxt "hfcd2592agfadeg42b3gb46ega09a487f39ce"
msgid "Sounds like the grove will be in good hands then. We should get going."
msgstr "그럼, 숲은 잘 돌아갈 것 같네요. 이제 떠나보죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a02375e1-b679-6b14-b816-c62e7c0d8743
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:a02375e1-b679-6b14-b816-c62e7c0d8743
msgctxt "h65027f7bg3814g46b7g8c2cge83b619a8f10"
msgid "I am."
msgstr "준비됐습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = a2fb3ca9-72ef-96bd-531c-419142b52ba4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - Shadowheart_InParty_InterestInDarkJusticiars = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:a2fb3ca9-72ef-96bd-531c-419142b52ba4
msgctxt "h4636c984g6ec7g4e9cga345gba2f61f80256"
msgid "Sounds rather ingenious."
msgstr "꽤 기발한 것 같군요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = a405da77-d1cc-db4a-2ff2-bfc48fbc231a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:a405da77-d1cc-db4a-2ff2-bfc48fbc231a
msgctxt "h39c8ab50g2c27g48e5gb65agff416c24bb5c"
msgid ""
"Nature speaks to me. Birds report what they've seen. And I've overheard "
"goblins speaking of it, too. Moonrise is at the heart of all this, I'm sure "
"of it."
msgstr ""
"자연이 나에게 말을 전해 주고, 새들은 자신이 본 것을 보고하지. 그리고 나는 고블린들이 그것에 대해 말하는 것도 엿들었네. 이 모든 "
"것의 중심에는 문라이즈가 있다고 내 확신한다네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = a42e1f96-13d5-74cc-6d2a-3a9d9f876865
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:a42e1f96-13d5-74cc-6d2a-3a9d9f876865
msgctxt "h8dd957c0gcc6ag48b8g9464g22614fcf82b0"
msgid ""
"I trust you enjoyed your evening? After all your efforts, it was well-"
"deserved."
msgstr "저녁 시간을 충분히 즐겼나? 자네의 노고를 감안하면, 충분히 즐길 가치가 있었겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a48e6a7d-5982-fb09-ff3d-fd225d7bada0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: (CLERIC_SHAR or PALADIN_SHAR) and !REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:a48e6a7d-5982-fb09-ff3d-fd225d7bada0
msgctxt "ha7240bdcg324bg4554g9a2ag1f971b8ed36b"
msgid "Are these Sharrans still to be found?"
msgstr "그 샤 숭배자들을 아직 찾을 수 있을까요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = a59f6b4f-4201-d64b-bf66-14d602c13d36
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Halsin_Quest_GoToMoonrise = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:a59f6b4f-4201-d64b-bf66-14d602c13d36
msgctxt "h7e44ba0cg716bg4388ga791g02a7be608799"
msgid ""
"I'm certain a cure for you can be found at Moonrise Towers, but it's... "
"complicated."
msgstr "그대를 치유할 방법이 문라이즈 타워에 있다는 것은 확신하지만, 조금... 복잡하다네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a67bc694-a394-5e0d-403c-dc869985e774
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Halsin_Event_PreferOverlandRoute = True
#.      - GLO_Underdark_EverEnteredBefore = False
#.      - GOB_TempleAccess_Event_PuzzleSolved = False
#.   Local:
#.      - c12e62ff-c2e8-b0eb-7d2d-00ee77177078_HiddenEntranceInSeluneTemple = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - c12e62ff-c2e8-b0eb-7d2d-00ee77177078_HiddenEntranceInSeluneTemple = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:a67bc694-a394-5e0d-403c-dc869985e774
msgctxt "h813a3228gdf6fg4a15g9123gedb42896b9df"
msgid ""
"Say I decide to try this Underdark route after all - how do I get started?"
msgstr "내가 결국 언더다크로 가겠다고 결정한다면, 어디서 시작하죠?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = a6b24ecf-fb7a-5aba-b266-b31eebfac70d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Halsin_Knows_AboutGrymforge = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:a6b24ecf-fb7a-5aba-b266-b31eebfac70d
msgctxt "hce3fe8b9gd2f6g455fg90c4g9f3751fabd8c"
msgid ""
"It may prove impossible to avoid the shadow curse entirely, but if you find "
"any way to limit your exposure, seize it."
msgstr ""
"그림자 저주의 영향을 완전히 피해 가는 것은 불가능할지도 모르지만, 노출을 최소화할 기회가 있다면, 그 기회를 반드시 잡아야 하네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = b34f2020-b40c-ae7f-2d8f-b999cdc647aa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:b34f2020-b40c-ae7f-2d8f-b999cdc647aa
msgctxt "h53bd25a9gf12dg45efg8087g9122ec1495d9"
msgid "No. At least, not right now."
msgstr "없지. 적어도, 당장은 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b38bf060-2a8a-206a-a21f-3206ce3c613e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - c12e62ff-c2e8-b0eb-7d2d-00ee77177078_UnfinishedBusiness = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CAMP_Halsin_Knows_ShadowCurseMotivation = True
#.   Local:
#.     - c12e62ff-c2e8-b0eb-7d2d-00ee77177078_UnfinishedBusiness = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:b38bf060-2a8a-206a-a21f-3206ce3c613e
msgctxt "h1e9b12c7ga093g4193gbc83ge320aad710e5"
msgid "You want to come to Moonrise as well? Why?"
msgstr "문라이즈 타워에 함께 가겠다고요? 왜죠?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = b55602e1-cd4f-03bd-449c-e3a1a2b5eeb5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:b55602e1-cd4f-03bd-449c-e3a1a2b5eeb5
msgctxt "hf3c9d2e7g4ad2g452egb5a9geb5a1f870f47"
msgid ""
"That sounds like what you need. But the next part of the journey mightn't be "
"straightforward - or safe."
msgstr "그게 그대에게 필요한 것 같군. 하지만 여정의 다음 부분은 그리 간단하지 않을 테고, 안전하지도 않을 걸세."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b5b086cb-376a-f059-3252-b3f1b72a4cbe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Underdark_EverEnteredBefore = True
#.      - GOB_TempleAccess_Event_PuzzleSolved = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:b5b086cb-376a-f059-3252-b3f1b72a4cbe
msgctxt "hdd19bab9gf70cg49d5gb6ddg6deac0726625"
msgid ""
"I've already found a way into the Underdark. I can pick up the trail from "
"there."
msgstr "이미 언더다크로 가는 길은 찾았어요. 거기서 길을 따라가면 되겠군요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = ba04c7c5-aae6-4209-a68b-1e503d151c43
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(2) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:ba04c7c5-aae6-4209-a68b-1e503d151c43
msgctxt "h2d617b88gb371g4ddag8534g3b5975216c4a"
msgid ""
"I suppose it was too much to hope we were going to be cured here and now. To "
"Moonrise, then."
msgstr "여기서 당장 치유될 거라 생각했던 건 과한 기대였나 보네요. 그럼, 문라이즈로 갑시다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = ba6f5ede-5ad3-0c80-93db-6c652b3f2f3c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:ba6f5ede-5ad3-0c80-93db-6c652b3f2f3c
msgctxt "h80e0faaag528dg4581gb892gd7380c32ca33"
msgid ""
"She can tend to the grove, help it heal. In time, others will join. Perhaps "
"some day I can return."
msgstr ""
"그녀가 숲을 돌보고 치유를 도울 수 있을 걸세. 시간이 지나면, 다른 이들도 함께하겠지. 언젠간 내가 돌아올 수 있을지도 모르고 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bdc206d1-8c5b-f4b4-7c8c-efe261d9c39c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_TempleAccess_Event_PuzzleSolved = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:bdc206d1-8c5b-f4b4-7c8c-efe261d9c39c
msgctxt "h3f981e3ag4f08g4d85g8b02gd315e63c7947"
msgid "I found the hidden entrance in the temple of Selûne - the way is clear."
msgstr "셀루네 신전의 숨겨진 입구를 발견했습니다. 길은 분명합니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bf375bf5-604d-cba0-2a97-72927d5d8cd2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_DruidAttack_State_PrepAfterDeathOfDruids = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:bf375bf5-604d-cba0-2a97-72927d5d8cd2
msgctxt "hb8e447aag869cg4807g9ba9g82bfd8c1116f"
msgid "I'll trust your judgement."
msgstr "당신의 판단을 믿겠어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = bf693fc5-763a-93a5-e7bf-d95ecb65aa0c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:bf693fc5-763a-93a5-e7bf-d95ecb65aa0c
msgctxt "hb639a7a3g246eg40b6gbf1eg81021cf833ff"
msgid "You may reconsider once you see the effects of the curse for yourself."
msgstr "저주의 효과를 직접 보고 나면 생각이 바뀔 수도 있다네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = c019cd32-196f-2d05-ce87-1feb77c4793a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:c019cd32-196f-2d05-ce87-1feb77c4793a
msgctxt "h7dc1d485g1026g4096g86b6g27151bdd1e0f"
msgid ""
"This curse shrouds everything in shadow - you will not find life, light or "
"anything natural there."
msgstr "이 저주는 모든 것을 그림자로 뒤덮지. 그곳에선 어떤 생명도, 빛도, 자연스러운 것도 보지 못할 걸세."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = c1d43b59-94cb-2184-14c8-bf4bb6e50e65
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:c1d43b59-94cb-2184-14c8-bf4bb6e50e65
msgctxt "h59e65dfbgf04eg4b82g99b8gd8fa22f90195"
msgid "What were you expecting? That I'd mumble a spell or whip out a potion?"
msgstr "뭘 기대한 건가? 내가 주문을 외우거나, 물약이라도 꺼낼 줄 알았나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = c2b76c11-aa7a-6fdb-3e16-3d3973fe65a5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:c2b76c11-aa7a-6fdb-3e16-3d3973fe65a5
msgctxt "he822b62dg85a9g4e6fg8357g678e0fd1736f"
msgid ""
"Tread carefully. You're on the right track, I'm sure - but there'll still be "
"danger and difficulty before you reach Moonrise."
msgstr ""
"조심해서 나아가게나. 확실히 올바른 방향으로 향하고 있긴 하지만, 문라이즈에 도착할 때까지 어떤 위험과 어려움이 도사리고 있을지 모르니."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c339c675-83f1-ea74-261d-fce6c063126e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_UNDERDARK(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Halsin_Event_PreferOverlandRoute = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:c339c675-83f1-ea74-261d-fce6c063126e
msgctxt "ha53b8042g0c48g4dcbgb6e8ga3ce119f385a"
msgid "I know the Underdark - it's lethal. I'll travel overland."
msgstr "언더다크가 어떤 곳인지 알고 있습니다. 위험한 지역이죠. 지상으로 여행해야겠습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = c5dbc32d-b808-b8dc-70ee-f841e31d9b79
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Halsin_Knows_PlayerTadpoleCondition = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Halsin_Knows_PlayerTadpoleCondition = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:c5dbc32d-b808-b8dc-70ee-f841e31d9b79
msgctxt "h8d5d2262g84c2g44ceg9020gfa80fa074aee"
msgid ""
"I knew about your tadpole the moment I saw you. An archdruid knows all that "
"is natural... and <i>unnatural</i>. I have studied this menace for some "
"time, and wish to see it eradicated."
msgstr ""
"그대를 보는 순간 올챙이가 있는 걸 알았다네. 대드루이드는 자연스러운 것과... <i>그렇지 않은 것</i>을 모두 알고 있지. 이 "
"위협에 대해 한동안 연구를 했고, 그걸 근절하고 싶다네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cc0affd9-be22-4a72-bfa9-baa49b42b5a1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CAMP_Halsin_Knows_SuccessorFirstDruid = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CAMP_Halsin_Knows_SuccessorFirstDruid = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:cc0affd9-be22-4a72-bfa9-baa49b42b5a1
msgctxt "h6557c44eg66dag4b5ega4c8gb55e7268dbd5"
msgid "What about the grove?"
msgstr "숲은 어쩌고요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = cc1912a3-f3e6-9565-0ac5-681161afefae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Halsin_Knows_DarkJusticiars = True
#.     - ORI_Shadowheart_Event_DarkJusticiarHint = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:cc1912a3-f3e6-9565-0ac5-681161afefae
msgctxt "hf522df66ge887g4ebeg814fg003c59bf305a"
msgid ""
"Long ago, a man called Ketheric Thorm built a secret stronghold deep down "
"there, before rallying a whole army of Dark Justiciars - Shar worshippers."
msgstr ""
"오래 전에, 케서릭 쏨이라는 남자가 저 깊숙한 지하에 비밀 요새를 지었어. 그리고선 다크 저스티시어 군대를 소집했지. 샤 신도들 말일세."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = cf851304-ab75-460a-bc95-0dffb331fb85
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:cf851304-ab75-460a-bc95-0dffb331fb85
msgctxt "h33c21874g5464g4ef1g9dcfgdcf8c9187392"
msgid ""
"The grove needs to move beyond the mistakes of the past. What it needs is an "
"unknown quantity; an outsider who can enforce the Oak Father's teachings "
"without bias."
msgstr ""
"이 숲은 과거의 실수를 넘어서기 위해 낯선 것들이 많이 필요하지. 바로 참나무 아버지의 가르침을 편견 없이 행할 수 있는 외부인이라네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d38282f8-1738-cbee-a36d-637c02756a06
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:d38282f8-1738-cbee-a36d-637c02756a06
msgctxt "h69f52a4ag591bg4c73gbe1cgdfd09ff13ab7"
msgid "Who?"
msgstr "누구라구요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = d6338d55-ecf3-0ff8-3a1d-f6cc80772740
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:d6338d55-ecf3-0ff8-3a1d-f6cc80772740
msgctxt "h97134bdag30d3g4939g9628g136e5ef3e28c"
msgid ""
"But in my eagerness, I put far too much faith in the abilities of Aradin and "
"his band. We didn't even get close."
msgstr "하지만 간절함 때문에 아라딘과 그 용병대의 능력을 너무 믿었지. 우린 가까이 가지도 못했다네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = d9c5ba60-5b84-475a-b0a7-3c1faaeccb3d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:d9c5ba60-5b84-475a-b0a7-3c1faaeccb3d
msgctxt "hf89e483bg2dbeg48bega205g8fff5773e249"
msgid ""
"Let's not forget the devil Karlach. The Coast is in danger for as long as "
"she's loosed on it. We need to find her - and kill her."
msgstr "데빌 칼라크도 잊으면 안 돼. 녀석을 잡지 않으면 소드 코스트는 위험에 빠질 테니까, 그 여자를 찾아서 죽여야만 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = da6ec462-0fa3-ae82-7da9-224ce6f9df13
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:da6ec462-0fa3-ae82-7da9-224ce6f9df13
msgctxt "hab25921cg1e02g4f2ag8e85g04e5fe9c3f6a"
msgid ""
"I would like to join your camp, if you'll allow me. I can offer my skills, "
"my counsel."
msgstr "그대가 허락한다면, 야영지에 합류하고 싶네. 나는 기술과 자문을 제공할 수 있지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = dcd497a6-04e4-571a-9949-26eaabecd1b7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:dcd497a6-04e4-571a-9949-26eaabecd1b7
msgctxt "h6e767061g5569g4351g9e7bg294eba4fc472"
msgid ""
"I'm certain. The Underdark is dangerous, yes, but the alternative is "
"suicide. Be patient and be thorough - the path will reveal itself in time."
msgstr ""
"확신한다네. 언더다크도 위험하긴 하지만, 다른 길로 가는 건 자살행위지. 인내심을 갖고 철저히 준비하면, 이윽고 길이 드러날 걸세."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = dd7189d3-1967-45ea-b29b-24c2bb0ccf72
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(5) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(5) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:dd7189d3-1967-45ea-b29b-24c2bb0ccf72
msgctxt "h536d3f28gfbf6g4109gaa23g2f3b64be909f"
msgid ""
"Finally, we're catching up on our puppet master. And the hunt ends at "
"Moonrise Towers."
msgstr "마침내, 이제 우리를 지배하려는 자에 가까워지고 있군. 문라이즈 타워에서 사냥이 끝날 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = e3b9680d-0126-892e-f5ae-655ee7293a54
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:e3b9680d-0126-892e-f5ae-655ee7293a54
msgctxt "h22e0bed0g57bcg4bd3g905dg7974715c735c"
msgid ""
"Few can resist it without dying, or transforming into shadow beings. You can "
"try to journey overland if you wish, but I strongly advise you you go "
"<i>under</i>."
msgstr ""
"죽거나, 그림자의 존재가 되지 않고 버틸 수 있는 이들은 거의 없지. 원한다면 지상으로 여정을 떠나도 좋지만, <i>지하를</i> 통해 "
"가는 것을 강력히 권한다네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = e44cc5e8-3959-d715-7256-de9ea8f52571
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:e44cc5e8-3959-d715-7256-de9ea8f52571
msgctxt "hcc726b75g7890g4b10gab68gc6f50d1c1cf0"
msgid ""
"If you can find this place, I'll wager it will reveal a more direct path to "
"Moonrise Towers, and may even bypass the worst of the shadow curse."
msgstr ""
"이곳을 찾을 수 있다면, 문라이즈 타워로 곧바로 가는 길이 열릴 것이라 장담한다네. 어쩌면 그림자 저주를 우회할 수 있을지도 모르고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = e51f9a4f-da48-c483-e0a3-961041c7636f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - c12e62ff-c2e8-b0eb-7d2d-00ee77177078_HiddenEntranceInSeluneTemple = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:e51f9a4f-da48-c483-e0a3-961041c7636f
msgctxt "h9d84b94eg0e3eg4631g97d9gd03dee7f3d27"
msgid "Now, we've quite the journey ahead. Best get started."
msgstr "자, 이제 긴 여정이 남아있으니. 시작하는 것이 좋겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = eb676202-7205-49cb-acef-6663a61ea647
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:eb676202-7205-49cb-acef-6663a61ea647
msgctxt "hbf3e0f3cg6211g41b7g8417gce3850779e69"
msgid ""
"Do not be so impatient to move on as Halsin. As ever, the githyanki crèche "
"remains our priority."
msgstr "할신처럼 조급하게 움직이지 말자고. 언제나 그랬듯, 기스양키 양성소가 우리 최우선 목표야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = f96f3133-b02c-dbed-ee3c-36a92d0f632a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:f96f3133-b02c-dbed-ee3c-36a92d0f632a
msgctxt "h7e953577g2527g49abga166gd26f6646de62"
msgid ""
"Keep looking. If they're present, then it's likely there's a route to "
"Moonrise somewhere."
msgstr "계속 찾아보게나. 그들이 거기 있다면, 문라이즈로 향하는 통로도 분명 근처 어딘가에 있을 걸세."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fa7d9e87-6189-6cf1-6994-73d26ba6e364
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_ShadowDruid_State_RathIsPermaDefeated = True
#.      - DEN_Apprentice_State_Dead = True
#.      - DEN_DruidAttack_State_PrepAfterDeathOfDruids = False
#.      - DEN_ShadowDruid_State_KaghaIsDead = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:fa7d9e87-6189-6cf1-6994-73d26ba6e364
msgctxt "ha4d3e7c3g10b1g4fc7gaf65gedfa8c9c7b70"
msgid "There's nobody in the grove you'd choose?"
msgstr "숲에선 아무도 고를 사람이 없었습니까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fac9ed44-b400-771c-b7a8-36c894ca17b7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SCO_HalsinMorningAfter:fac9ed44-b400-771c-b7a8-36c894ca17b7
msgctxt "h130eeb8fg1792g4ffeg93c8gf5f94d487905"
msgid ""
"I was expecting more from you than a lead towards some distant, dangerous "
"prospect."
msgstr "당신이 어떤 멀고 위험한 장소로 향하는 단서를 주는 것보다는 많은 것을 해주시길 기대했는데 말이죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 0019b776-e454-b637-9325-3141ca70f988
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_ForgingOfTheHeart_State_KarlachSecondUpgrade = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:0019b776-e454-b637-9325-3141ca70f988
msgctxt "h4e772d21ge093g41d8gaf42g69118ed1e0a8"
msgid ""
"I'd hate for anyone to think they can bed me and just talk the night away."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 021a3bc9-6091-90de-b864-7a41391b3ab5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 267b08d1-1b0e-6f03-47c3-bc7491501a7e_MentionedPleasure = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:021a3bc9-6091-90de-b864-7a41391b3ab5
msgctxt "hbdd4c4b2g99fag426dga2aag3df4d5f1b56b"
msgid "What do any of us want? Pleasure."
msgstr "우리 모두가 원하는 게 뭐겠어? 쾌락이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 029696dc-a5d9-8a12-c5c7-5e21395968a6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_ForgingOfTheHeart_State_KarlachSecondUpgrade = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:029696dc-a5d9-8a12-c5c7-5e21395968a6
msgctxt "hc105a4c2gfd1dg40f1g944dga51b5fd3c9cc"
msgid ""
"Finally. I was starting to wonder if immolation would have been easier than "
"talking. "
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 04fd622d-23ff-b912-f38a-7c3ca13cd7bc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:04fd622d-23ff-b912-f38a-7c3ca13cd7bc
msgctxt "hc987ab81g6411g4bb3gbb71g869367dc6128"
msgid "No, I don't want this."
msgstr "아냐. 난 이걸 원하지 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0668acbf-3229-ceec-5a32-0542aa72386f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - ORI_Astarion_Event_LearnedPoemNoInfernalForQuestUpdate = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:0668acbf-3229-ceec-5a32-0542aa72386f
msgctxt "h9363cb7cga41bg45e7ga929g5f80699d637a"
msgid "You've <i>never </i>seen it?"
msgstr "정말 <i>한 번도</i> 본 적이 없다고?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 069f147c-2b5b-37d2-5cfa-46152684dfd1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:069f147c-2b5b-37d2-5cfa-46152684dfd1
msgctxt "h930decc1g7d13g403bg934bg1bc8bc484bb2"
msgid "Twice in this short space of time? Doesn't sound very satisfying."
msgstr "그 짧은 시간에 두 번이나? 별로 재미는 못 볼 것 같은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 085459cc-51ac-c3d0-d313-6e3821c8028a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_TIEFLING(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - ORI_Astarion_Event_LearnedPoemInfernalForQuestUpdate = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:085459cc-51ac-c3d0-d313-6e3821c8028a
msgctxt "h2e0887c5ga8c0g41c7g9476ge274d415a2e4"
msgid "Why did he write it in Infernal? That's normally a devil's language."
msgstr "그 자가 왜 지옥어로 이걸 썼을까? 일반적으로 데빌이 쓰는 언어인데 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 0ba7667a-f1fb-8e73-69f7-a9cafca04a91
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:0ba7667a-f1fb-8e73-69f7-a9cafca04a91
msgctxt "h9236fd2cg8707g4f69g89e8gbaa07bcdfa13"
msgid "Yes. It's a poem. My old master considered himself quite the artist."
msgstr "맞아. 시야. 내 옛 주인은 자기가 꽤 대단한 예술가라고 생각했거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 0e00d54a-4584-b188-4b35-df1e49a376fe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:0e00d54a-4584-b188-4b35-df1e49a376fe
msgctxt "ha4d9bc4cg7867g4401gb10bg92a421857c1f"
msgid ""
"I don't know. I never asked for a reading and it's not like I can just peek "
"in a mirror to see."
msgstr "모르겠어. 누구한테 읽어 달라고 부탁해본 적도 없고, 그렇다고 내가 거울로 그냥 볼 수 있는 것도 아니라서."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 0f31fb09-48c9-e879-ee95-c9652ba9321c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_Astarion_Knows_Vampireness = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:0f31fb09-48c9-e879-ee95-c9652ba9321c
msgctxt "hfc6dffd2gf8ccg469eg8d8fgb84cde2cb59e"
msgid "Really? I thought we had an understanding. A connection."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 0ffe203d-4f24-9c8f-6115-b7fd1c9c73ee
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:0ffe203d-4f24-9c8f-6115-b7fd1c9c73ee
msgctxt "hbfd00b18g24b9g411cg88b5gef49b43f37b8"
msgid "He captured me. Kept me for years as his slave."
msgstr "그가 날 가뒀어. 수많은 세월 동안 날 그의 노예로 부렸지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 108cd0b2-6aaa-3a8b-a203-036c23c71acb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_TIEFLING(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - ORI_Astarion_Event_LearnedPoemInfernalForQuestUpdate = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:108cd0b2-6aaa-3a8b-a203-036c23c71acb
msgctxt "h888c3d40ge3bag4f15g8d0cg44bdc4ff7618"
msgid "Why did he write it in Infernal? That's normally a devil's language."
msgstr "그 자가 왜 지옥어로 이걸 썼을까? 일반적으로 데빌이 쓰는 언어인데 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 111236f5-ba26-52d8-482e-b02ba10a45fe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:111236f5-ba26-52d8-482e-b02ba10a45fe
msgctxt "h429cafe5gb853g4a22g9327g6712d9082324"
msgid ""
"There may be an inferno in you, Karlach, but at the end of the day you've "
"been frigid for a decade, isn't that right?"
msgstr "아무리 지옥불을 품은 칼라크라고는 하지만, 넌 어차피 십 년도 넘게 쓸쓸하게 혼자 지냈겠지, 안 그래?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 118353e2-2543-d1b4-0fba-4dc0d05d5e07
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_Astarion_Knows_Vampireness = True
#. TagRule: SORCERER or WARLOCK or WIZARD
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:118353e2-2543-d1b4-0fba-4dc0d05d5e07
msgctxt "h0ea37178g0e7bg4066g9c0bgbedfc9322355"
msgid "Try to 'taste' me and I'll incinerate you."
msgstr "날 '맛 보려' 한다면 불태워주지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 118353e2-2543-d1b4-0fba-4dc0d05d5e07
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_Astarion_Knows_Vampireness = True
#. TagRule: CLERIC or PALADIN
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:118353e2-2543-d1b4-0fba-4dc0d05d5e07
msgctxt "ha6b7aed5g18a6g4735gaf9agfd741e44ed9c"
msgid ""
"Try to 'taste' me and I'll blast you with enough divine energy to turn you "
"to ash."
msgstr "날 '맛 보려' 한다면 신성한 힘을 날려 잿더미로 만들어주지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 118353e2-2543-d1b4-0fba-4dc0d05d5e07
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_Astarion_Knows_Vampireness = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:118353e2-2543-d1b4-0fba-4dc0d05d5e07
msgctxt "h7b297e58gd494g4853g850dg4c96bf293c60"
msgid "Try to 'taste' me and I'll kill you where you stand."
msgstr "날 '맛 보려' 한다면 그 자리에서 죽여주지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 11fe5070-eb20-a35d-e6ae-9214d168b7a3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:11fe5070-eb20-a35d-e6ae-9214d168b7a3
msgctxt "h0e2a65c6g04c5g48f3g9ec6g16fb3228e3c0"
msgid "I think you want to be known. To be tasted."
msgstr "넌 알려지고 싶은 것 같은데. 맛보여지고 싶어 하고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 1230e557-f315-b308-f4ab-5311eaf7c11b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_Astarion_Knows_Vampireness = False
#.      - ORI_Astarion_Knows_CazadorMaster = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - ORI_Astarion_Knows_CazadorMaster = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:1230e557-f315-b308-f4ab-5311eaf7c11b
msgctxt "ha618bb1bgb3f0g4734g8913ga5633bfdd5b4"
msgid "My past isn't exactly a happy story."
msgstr "내 과거는 결코 행복한 이야기는 아니야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 127c3c63-b256-4ce3-6c11-e7f134b3e62e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:127c3c63-b256-4ce3-6c11-e7f134b3e62e
msgctxt "hde20e743g05a6g4f99gbde8gdf690bc3fad5"
msgid "Yes, I can feel my bedroll calling. Let's go."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 129bbb3d-b539-cbfa-6a6c-c7890a3a5eaf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:129bbb3d-b539-cbfa-6a6c-c7890a3a5eaf
msgctxt "h8f11322egff2bg45ecgbe7bgbf2af9937b7b"
msgid "Given the noise you made last night, I'm sure they already know."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 1416ac22-7c2e-3af7-f0ad-991f05ee59dd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:1416ac22-7c2e-3af7-f0ad-991f05ee59dd
msgctxt "h2bc42797gdd65g4965g858cgb67e4fc5c4d4"
msgid "All denied to us because of what Zariel did to you."
msgstr "자리엘이 네게 한 짓 때문에 아무것도 할 수 없지만."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 144b1dc8-7d3e-21d3-91e4-609ded7ab4dd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:144b1dc8-7d3e-21d3-91e4-609ded7ab4dd
msgctxt "h988e06a1gd0cfg4688gba77gdeb464ecc503"
msgid "Waiting to have you."
msgstr "널 가질 이 순간을 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 157c90f6-a17f-3e27-a4a8-60a0219e2d8e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - Astarion_InParty_AskedPast(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - Astarion_InParty_Event_ToldAboutMagistrate(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:157c90f6-a17f-3e27-a4a8-60a0219e2d8e
msgctxt "h713367a2g8aecg43c2gae6bga4a506a0b8cf"
msgid ""
"I told you that I was a magistrate in Baldur's Gate, but that's only part of "
"it."
msgstr "내가 발더스 게이트에서 치안판사였다고 말해줬었지만, 그게 다가 아니야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 16d1f098-ee80-04e0-6d86-e6476fde6570
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:16d1f098-ee80-04e0-6d86-e6476fde6570
msgctxt "hd20007e3gc4bfg42dcg8a00gb01f6f5f8633"
msgid "You want to try that again? Without being a jackass, maybe?"
msgstr "방금 뭐라고 했어? 좀 듣기 좋게 다시 말해볼래?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1755a863-d1af-54e1-c5a7-0347d30ed5d0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_Astarion_Knows_Vampireness = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - ORI_HadSexWithCompanion(1) = True
#.     - ORI_HadSexWithAstarion(1) = True
#.   User:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion_Bite(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:1755a863-d1af-54e1-c5a7-0347d30ed5d0
msgctxt "h5413b3aagf05cg4be9ga2afgc0d34983fb05"
msgid "<i>Roll playfully and offer him your neck.</i>"
msgstr "<i>장난스레 돈 뒤, 그에게 당신의 목을 허락한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 17a4ffdf-7b8d-73fc-7488-e110d757ed88
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:17a4ffdf-7b8d-73fc-7488-e110d757ed88
msgctxt "hed0605feg7358g42dcgbc65g3096b4aa9b68"
msgid "Let's get back to camp."
msgstr "야영지로 돌아가자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 17b15044-4fd1-f20f-2a6c-522275285ebd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:17b15044-4fd1-f20f-2a6c-522275285ebd
msgctxt "h1aeda3a5gc7eag4d48g915bg30881d916b33"
msgid "Well I can't just check in a mirror, can I?"
msgstr "내가 그냥 거울을 갖다 놓고 확인할 수 있는 건 아니잖아, 안 그래?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 1988f09c-a326-984f-eff7-81ee65ddbc18
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_Astarion_Knows_Vampireness = False
#.      - ORI_Astarion_Knows_CazadorMaster = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - ORI_Astarion_Knows_CazadorMaster = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:1988f09c-a326-984f-eff7-81ee65ddbc18
msgctxt "h7cae0e32gb958g4732gbc66g9b4a655e3b40"
msgid "My past isn't exactly a happy story."
msgstr "내 과거는 결코 행복한 이야기는 아니야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 1b87d59b-3f46-502b-b0d2-97814b4d70c7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:1b87d59b-3f46-502b-b0d2-97814b4d70c7
msgctxt "h56e09367g733eg4eb2gbbf8g76cfde57b894"
msgid ""
"He composed and carved that one over the course of a night. He made a lot of "
"revisions as he went."
msgstr "그 놈이 하룻밤 사이에 시를 지어 내 등에 새겨 넣었지. 나중에 더 많이 수정을 했고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 1de1ea0c-bc18-e9a4-d559-8619f80c84c0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:1de1ea0c-bc18-e9a4-d559-8619f80c84c0
msgctxt "h1d89b887gf8e1g4085g98deg7515ff4a1879"
msgid "And don't feel the need to brag to the others about our little tryst. "
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 2108a0a9-58f0-a56b-8357-88663a2484c3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CAMP_Astarion_SecondNight_RaidersCelebration = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:2108a0a9-58f0-a56b-8357-88663a2484c3
msgctxt "h2215ecf2g0163g40aag9cb6g918650f5c3c3"
msgid ""
"Anyway, enough pillow talk. Let's go, before the goblins start stirring."
msgstr "어쨌든, 잠자리 얘기는 그만하자. 고블린들이 말썽 일으키기 전에 가자고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 22ada62b-ec86-16c1-6d38-6bdc9886f739
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:22ada62b-ec86-16c1-6d38-6bdc9886f739
msgctxt "h97527e34ga19cg4930g90f2g4a4da2fb886c"
msgid "It was."
msgstr "그랬지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 24edd710-9d53-f185-d7d9-42eea282ec6b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:24edd710-9d53-f185-d7d9-42eea282ec6b
msgctxt "h2e677e38g2277g4abeg917cga90565cdc059"
msgid ""
"You've no idea the stories I could tell, sweet Karlach. But you - you're "
"just -"
msgstr "네가 상상조차 못할 이야기가 많아, 우리 칼라크. 그런데 넌 그냥 - 넌 고작 -"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 26c3c004-3d44-7e72-67cf-5060109e582f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:26c3c004-3d44-7e72-67cf-5060109e582f
msgctxt "h5ac0aaaag5f50g404bg92eeg1b5a9fbd4621"
msgid "Can I see?"
msgstr "볼 수 있을까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 290874f3-4a18-b523-9e31-fcc13880a410
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - ORI_Astarion_Knows_PoemInfernal = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:290874f3-4a18-b523-9e31-fcc13880a410
msgctxt "h5991cf5cg7a14g4c07gb80eg4d6163ff3ede"
msgid "Infernal? I... Who knows? The bastard was insane."
msgstr "지옥어라고? 나도... 누가 알겠어? 그 자식은 미친 놈이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 2a36a05b-f188-9935-a51a-2ceca51bb079
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:2a36a05b-f188-9935-a51a-2ceca51bb079
msgctxt "h834deccag5b3eg44e4g9ec2g54b2341ad3d8"
msgid "No! I'm not."
msgstr "아니! 전혀."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 2ac731ea-2106-ba78-05b7-4b90794de281
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:2ac731ea-2106-ba78-05b7-4b90794de281
msgctxt "hbe87fb9fg9e24g4cd3gbabdg5380818ccf42"
msgid ""
"Now, shall we head back? We should try to get some rest before the sun comes "
"up."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2be1b9f1-fd2a-be64-8434-6e54c621c350
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_Astarion_Knows_Vampireness = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:2be1b9f1-fd2a-be64-8434-6e54c621c350
msgctxt "h5ea9b429g1ffdg4fd8gbf50g44bcf14bb780"
msgid "Wait, we're moving too fast."
msgstr "잠시만, 너무 빨라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 2c7f5d68-930d-12ae-e373-cc33ad206ec4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_ForgingOfTheHeart_State_KarlachSecondUpgrade = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:2c7f5d68-930d-12ae-e373-cc33ad206ec4
msgctxt "h141566c6gc1a1g4245g9d76g14b7e4fc74e9"
msgid ""
"Finally. I was starting to wonder if immolation would have been easier than "
"talking. "
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 2f4ca1b4-6e2f-3827-7633-e698d8b1c7a9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:2f4ca1b4-6e2f-3827-7633-e698d8b1c7a9
msgctxt "hc54ea7abg01d4g498dg9745g6e1223983c11"
msgid "Well. To quote you: 'Fuck.'"
msgstr "아. 네가 좋아하는 말대로다. '좆됐네.'"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 300a8d56-5eba-6178-1432-2048cc9d6cf5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - ORI_Astarion_Knows_PoemInfernal = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:300a8d56-5eba-6178-1432-2048cc9d6cf5
msgctxt "h1d4a1b12g165eg4ec6g98d4gd86aaaea6038"
msgid "Infernal? I - no. It doesn't matter what it says."
msgstr "지옥어? 난 - 아니. 어차피 뭐라고 쓰여있는지는 상관없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 31fcc37b-e297-4887-71a4-30e194ac11d3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:31fcc37b-e297-4887-71a4-30e194ac11d3
msgctxt "h30e6dac2gf9eeg4779g8804g50ba31b1854e"
msgid "Did you enjoy it? It felt like you weren't fully there."
msgstr "넌 즐거웠어? 뭔가 넌 주의가 다른 곳에 있는 것 같던데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3374f2bd-feb8-8036-ce7f-33b6d6937685
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:3374f2bd-feb8-8036-ce7f-33b6d6937685
msgctxt "hcea5e4b3g5b1bg46d7gaa1dg6b22a6020b19"
msgid "I'm sorry, that sounds terrible."
msgstr "유감이야, 정말 끔찍했을 것 같은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 33cdf653-64aa-3e56-2e28-bc0095ce157c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:33cdf653-64aa-3e56-2e28-bc0095ce157c
msgctxt "hfab96083ge4dag4992gbcf7gd8fd4d3748d3"
msgid "You don't have me yet."
msgstr "아직 날 가진 건 아닌데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 38d22924-4f73-9e02-09a9-36934e98d5bb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:38d22924-4f73-9e02-09a9-36934e98d5bb
msgctxt "ha1f105e0gc66fg4afdgb25cge4d948c587d7"
msgid "I was holding back a little, it's true. I didn't want to lose control."
msgstr "사실이야, 조금 참고 있었어. 통제력을 잃긴 싫었거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 390f4abf-d438-ea0a-8971-d100a09a0c87
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:390f4abf-d438-ea0a-8971-d100a09a0c87
msgctxt "hade5ddc3g13deg4e28g8b42gf53d6f749223"
msgid "It was."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3b273e0e-e305-edae-7389-eda1b815c2df
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - ORI_Astarion_Event_LearnedPoemNoInfernalForQuestUpdate = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:3b273e0e-e305-edae-7389-eda1b815c2df
msgctxt "h458aa8cfg8581g4a1cg919dga53bfa17d397"
msgid "You've <i>never </i>seen it?"
msgstr "<i>한 번도</i> 본 적 없다는 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 3c84e7ce-71b2-0080-76d6-18c6a99de251
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:3c84e7ce-71b2-0080-76d6-18c6a99de251
msgctxt "ha70eb0f5gbfb4g4233g9319gd2599af71a7a"
msgid "What do we do, if not... that?"
msgstr "우리가 가만히 있으면 뭘... 뭘 하는데?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 3db98148-6314-8475-3323-8864c308d771
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:3db98148-6314-8475-3323-8864c308d771
msgctxt "h42173f80g8402g48afgbc8bg901e8ab6e35b"
msgid ""
"But we should move. We've got a big day ahead of us, and I can't spend it "
"all chatting to you."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 3ed15113-89c7-9fe6-9f3a-cc09ccc23581
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:3ed15113-89c7-9fe6-9f3a-cc09ccc23581
msgctxt "h6671bfb0g364ag4893gbf4dg480e1aaaf436"
msgid ""
"Finally. I'm just glad your performance last night was better than your "
"pillow talk."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 3f5cbb51-0129-5a71-d2d1-e34ea47c1d8c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:3f5cbb51-0129-5a71-d2d1-e34ea47c1d8c
msgctxt "h4a83e59cg5481g4d1cgb3c6g3db9d3b93a39"
msgid "And if I can't see it, you certainly can't."
msgstr "그리고 내가 보지 못한다면, 너도 분명히 못 볼 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 4024979f-22bb-ad8e-e399-d349eb47f1da
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:4024979f-22bb-ad8e-e399-d349eb47f1da
msgctxt "h26bbedf2gcac5g4d5cgb470g94e2d8073f6a"
msgid "Then let's have some fun."
msgstr "그럼 함께 즐거운 시간을 보내자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 42b8e8fb-6ecf-fa13-7864-215e282dba3c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:42b8e8fb-6ecf-fa13-7864-215e282dba3c
msgctxt "h7180f361g22b0g4c31g8698g5d015413163e"
msgid "You weren't <i>that </i>good."
msgstr "네가 <i>그렇게 </i>잘하진 않았어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 43858512-dd99-a97a-42eb-976a7e30f73e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:43858512-dd99-a97a-42eb-976a7e30f73e
msgctxt "h29702a10gda3bg473eg90a5g321944b3af18"
msgid "I was holding back, if anything. Worried that I might... lose control."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 446c07f8-f03f-2ca5-20c2-23af1ea5cb4e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_AttackOnDen_State_RaiderVictory = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:446c07f8-f03f-2ca5-20c2-23af1ea5cb4e
msgctxt "h84184ac0gf40fg4619gba37ga50d66c96218"
msgid "Now, shall we get on? I want to go before the goblins start waking up."
msgstr "자, 그럼 이만 가 볼까? 고블린들이 깨어나기 전에 가보고 싶은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 458d155f-2db2-2b3f-98ae-3f1eba52240c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:458d155f-2db2-2b3f-98ae-3f1eba52240c
msgctxt "ha677b3f7gea4fg4d87gb433gc7d8466e8479"
msgid "It seems I was wrong. Pity. You look delicious in the moonlight."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 46710601-7dd0-d7ad-ef1a-318bfe475dc8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:46710601-7dd0-d7ad-ef1a-318bfe475dc8
msgctxt "hdc7fe4bcgbcecg44b4gb38cg02e57d24d455"
msgid ""
"I don't know. I never asked for a reading and it's not like I can just peek "
"in a mirror to see."
msgstr "모르겠어. 누구한테 읽어 달라고 부탁해본 적도 없고, 그렇다고 내가 거울로 그냥 볼 수 있는 것도 아니라서."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 4bc374fe-9e18-8a95-19eb-4ca47b1b5e49
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_Astarion_Knows_CazadorMaster = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:4bc374fe-9e18-8a95-19eb-4ca47b1b5e49
msgctxt "hf1ef9b69g69a1g48faga83eg0d3b23a1b189"
msgid ""
"It's a poem. A gift from Cazador. He considered himself quite the artist and "
"used his slaves as a canvas."
msgstr "시이지. 카사도어가 준 선물이야. 그 자식은 자기가 꽤 대단한 예술가라고 생각했고, 노예들을 캔버스처럼 썼지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4eccb931-e338-8128-9156-bbe0b2a2685e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   User:
#.      - ORI_Astarion_Knows_ScarsIsCazadorPoem_Character(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   User:
#.     - ORI_Astarion_Knows_ScarsIsCazadorPoem_Character(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:4eccb931-e338-8128-9156-bbe0b2a2685e
msgctxt "h747df673gecb8g47adg8940gfa3c7342d11c"
msgid "Interesting scars. Where'd you get them?"
msgstr "흥미로운 흉터네. 어쩌다 생긴 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4f69653f-df29-34f8-d233-c39e85754f9b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:4f69653f-df29-34f8-d233-c39e85754f9b
msgctxt "h250ea8d4g5121g49f2g898dg07b4357f70fc"
msgid "I am normal. 'Fucked up' is the height of normalcy."
msgstr "난 정상이야. '좆된 상태'가 정상의 기준이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4fa064c7-ba66-5331-83db-ab3c4cbf5c06
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - ORI_Astarion_Event_LearnedPoemNoInfernalForQuestUpdate = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:4fa064c7-ba66-5331-83db-ab3c4cbf5c06
msgctxt "hf9774a22g23bdg4750g9c0dge82e497d1f64"
msgid "What does it say?"
msgstr "뭐라고 적혀 있는 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 4fa73600-54ff-9ede-1e6f-01aeccde64de
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:4fa73600-54ff-9ede-1e6f-01aeccde64de
msgctxt "hf7199abdga4abg48efgbd02g4b7f84cd41c7"
msgid "Cazador said the scars were his gift. A poem to carry with me."
msgstr "카사도어는 이 흉터가 그의 선물이라고 했지. 내가 가지고 다닐 시라고 했어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 4fd6b0f9-9e76-79bb-cc56-15f3eabc8d66
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:4fd6b0f9-9e76-79bb-cc56-15f3eabc8d66
msgctxt "h674276a1g8e43g451bg8512ge4fd80230370"
msgid "You sleep light. I thought you'd be exhausted after last night."
msgstr "넌 아주 짧게 자는구나. 어젯밤 이후로 탈진해 버렸을 줄 알았는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 4fe66c51-a0a4-e49b-1427-4d80e70786e2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:4fe66c51-a0a4-e49b-1427-4d80e70786e2
msgctxt "hb653492bgab47g47dega3c9g4fbde9a6e668"
msgid "You sleep light. I thought you'd be exhausted."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 530b0870-f313-bb0e-97c4-15a0a40e3780
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:530b0870-f313-bb0e-97c4-15a0a40e3780
msgctxt "h42b8b30fgd8e4g4986ga485gf090f0f5c31c"
msgid "And if I can't see it, you certainly can't."
msgstr "그리고 내가 보지 못한다면, 너도 분명히 못 볼 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 580d0e6b-e9e3-4e1c-1012-452d921b0286
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_TIEFLING(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - ORI_Astarion_Event_LearnedPoemInfernalForQuestUpdate = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:580d0e6b-e9e3-4e1c-1012-452d921b0286
msgctxt "h5a2f79b5gdd04g466fgaa07g408736d05ab0"
msgid "It's written in Infernal. I could read it, if you like?"
msgstr "지옥어로 써졌는데. 원한다면 읽어줄까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 59b714d8-b3b3-ebca-d054-e348b57cd69f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:59b714d8-b3b3-ebca-d054-e348b57cd69f
msgctxt "h954d0d4dg6e7cg4b29gba7bgcd5d61521e87"
msgid "But we should probably get back before we're missed. People might talk."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 59c13fb7-fddb-6ceb-e2ac-58ae7edf3c64
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:59c13fb7-fddb-6ceb-e2ac-58ae7edf3c64
msgctxt "h431f36c1g6689g4becg8609gff2243e04409"
msgid "Waiting to have you."
msgstr "널 가지게 될 날을."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 5d180305-8131-7336-223e-be84194cafea
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:5d180305-8131-7336-223e-be84194cafea
msgctxt "hc2e6b696gb93bg46f9g945fgc66acde718a4"
msgid ""
"The mind flayers weren't my first kidnapping. A long time ago, I crossed "
"Cazador - a powerful man in Baldur's Gate."
msgstr "난 마인드 플레이어에게만 납치되었던 게 아니야. 오래전에, 카사도어라는 남자를 거슬렀지. 발더스 게이트의 강력한 자였어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5d4e87bf-e52c-aff8-5e6d-90a80f05f586
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_ForgingOfTheHeart_State_KarlachSecondUpgrade = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:5d4e87bf-e52c-aff8-5e6d-90a80f05f586
msgctxt "hada01247gc060g486fg8f38g8d51dfde3e2a"
msgid "I enjoyed that. Did you?"
msgstr "즐거웠어. 너는?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 5e5450f0-13ab-6279-117b-4daa61da0bf7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:5e5450f0-13ab-6279-117b-4daa61da0bf7
msgctxt "hc66484e6g3f22g43aagaa99gb31eb14df6d3"
msgid "Whatever the bastard wrote, it won't change what he did to me."
msgstr "그 개자식이 뭐라고 썼건, 나한테 했던 짓이 바뀌진 않으니."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 5e87daa4-14ec-e312-ca8b-9606eb77f433
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:5e87daa4-14ec-e312-ca8b-9606eb77f433
msgctxt "h3ab4991bg6736g412aga557geea7143478c8"
msgid "That was my second kidnapping, when the mind flayers snatched me up."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 62c60205-338e-9e20-2414-d6000f107a83
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:62c60205-338e-9e20-2414-d6000f107a83
msgctxt "hffdf69f3gbb58g4904g8afegd50e2e99f94f"
msgid "Given the noise you made earlier, I'm sure they already know."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 639e58fe-1ecf-a2ad-2871-a902283d7a46
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:639e58fe-1ecf-a2ad-2871-a902283d7a46
msgctxt "h9e9cdd61gf8e7g460fga4deg629396383cc8"
msgid "<i>Say nothing, just let him kiss you.</i>"
msgstr "<i>아무 말도 하지 않고, 그가 키스하게 둔다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 6672df2d-22f2-74d1-d51e-349005698a59
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:6672df2d-22f2-74d1-d51e-349005698a59
msgctxt "hd6eefaa0g416eg4441gbcf8g484505f1839d"
msgid "Yours. Mine. Our collective ecstasy."
msgstr "너와. 나. 우리가 함께하는 황홀경 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 66772b72-221e-bcdd-cf51-bb135068aa98
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:66772b72-221e-bcdd-cf51-bb135068aa98
msgctxt "hc5bdf999gb240g4079gaf57gcb7340f5a388"
msgid ""
"Why don't we put ourselves out of this misery and just sleep? If I can at "
"least look at you, I won't have wasted my whole evening."
msgstr "이 우울한 대화는 그만두고 잠이나 잘래? 널 지켜보기라도 한다면 아예 시간만 날린 것 같지는 않겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 67f43f9b-5922-e1d2-8e43-ad0bbc07f1a0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:67f43f9b-5922-e1d2-8e43-ad0bbc07f1a0
msgctxt "ha18b233agec5eg4714ga133gb4fe8f35d11a"
msgid "All right, Karlach. Let's try it your way."
msgstr "알았어, 칼라크. 네 방식대로 하자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 682b2fa9-893c-ffeb-e28c-4c14219c692e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:682b2fa9-893c-ffeb-e28c-4c14219c692e
msgctxt "hc197231dg02eag4303g9fa7g2568a4d367ea"
msgid "After the life you've led, I'm not surprised."
msgstr "지금까지 네가 살아온 방식을 생각해 보면 그럴 만도 하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 688fb123-6c18-9cfc-4754-3ce95cbe55ae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 267b08d1-1b0e-6f03-47c3-bc7491501a7e_MentionedPleasure = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:688fb123-6c18-9cfc-4754-3ce95cbe55ae
msgctxt "h01bff877g6632g48b6g9229ge62aeb125f8a"
msgid ""
"I wasn't going to bite you. I told you this was about pleasure, not hunger."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 69cadb4e-d0c3-a53a-1540-a853e3b5f8f2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:69cadb4e-d0c3-a53a-1540-a853e3b5f8f2
msgctxt "ha48a4a0bg58efg4d95g9107g261ce6d6e427"
msgid "Believe it or not, I did. You're certainly... different."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6a76b5d7-afa1-ad4c-3884-a4c8791d3abf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - ORI_Astarion_Event_LearnedPoemNoInfernalForQuestUpdate = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_ELF
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:6a76b5d7-afa1-ad4c-3884-a4c8791d3abf
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h31d1aadcgb0a6g420cga327g53caf957fa1f"
msgid "All right, let's head back to camp and get some rest."
msgstr "좋아. 그럼, 가 보자고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6a76b5d7-afa1-ad4c-3884-a4c8791d3abf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - ORI_Astarion_Event_LearnedPoemNoInfernalForQuestUpdate = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:6a76b5d7-afa1-ad4c-3884-a4c8791d3abf
msgctxt "h52c60707gd969g40a2g83e5g56d1e773ec7c"
msgid "All right, let's head back to camp and get some sleep."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 6b217464-1e8b-895a-53c4-d9ec5d938bc2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:6b217464-1e8b-895a-53c4-d9ec5d938bc2
msgctxt "h8b486360g6541g4a42gb895gc46c4e2be953"
msgid "You've seen enough already."
msgstr "이미 충분히 봤잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6b43d213-8e17-7280-62de-d71d67d3be7f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_Astarion_Knows_Vampireness = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:6b43d213-8e17-7280-62de-d71d67d3be7f
msgctxt "h852a1282gcff3g4c79g86e8gb27c9acfcb47"
msgid "Tasted? I'm not some snack."
msgstr "맛봤다고? 난 간식 같은 게 아니야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6bf269eb-09e7-643f-b66e-191636e38ae8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   User:
#.      - ORI_Astarion_Knows_ScarsIsCazadorPoem_Character(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   User:
#.     - ORI_Astarion_Knows_ScarsIsCazadorPoem_Character(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:6bf269eb-09e7-643f-b66e-191636e38ae8
msgctxt "h0b0d6e6egd950g483dga3a6g72d8ab494f7a"
msgid "Interesting scars. Where'd you get them?"
msgstr "흥미로운 흉터네. 어쩌다 생긴 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 6e0c2d53-f05e-edb8-a46f-c0229556e471
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_ForgingOfTheHeart_State_KarlachSecondUpgrade = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:6e0c2d53-f05e-edb8-a46f-c0229556e471
msgctxt "he726b83dga78cg4a81g8820g8adb05874088"
msgid ""
"I'd hate for anyone to think they could bed me and just talk the night away."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6eeaf32a-849b-c86d-d933-f73d51486a96
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:6eeaf32a-849b-c86d-d933-f73d51486a96
msgctxt "ha022ed0bg00ecg4eadg80e0g5cc517640ce9"
msgid "Did you enjoy it? It felt like you weren't fully there."
msgstr "넌 즐거웠어? 뭔가 넌 주의가 다른 곳에 있는 것 같던데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 6f19192c-1353-941c-00fd-9564db0affdc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:6f19192c-1353-941c-00fd-9564db0affdc
msgctxt "h405a247fga284g4f81g954bg7b80c889a42e"
msgid "Believe it or not, I did. You're certainly... different."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 6fe3aef9-e0ea-d1d9-10c9-a5c3ba893b8f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:6fe3aef9-e0ea-d1d9-10c9-a5c3ba893b8f
msgctxt "h3e219e35g5e5ag4b86gb5e4ga8bcd438a974"
msgid ""
"Now let's get back to camp and our bedrolls. We should try to get some rest "
"tonight."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 702bf338-08b5-7202-af97-9dc0f97f8405
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - ORI_Astarion_Event_LearnedPoemNoInfernalForQuestUpdate = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:702bf338-08b5-7202-af97-9dc0f97f8405
msgctxt "h5b93a104gb688g4e2dgbc2bg80ad619a28dd"
msgid "Is it a good poem, at least?"
msgstr "적어도 잘 쓴 시겠지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 72a2f70a-35eb-a138-360b-f26ce43ead5c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:72a2f70a-35eb-a138-360b-f26ce43ead5c
msgctxt "h41751c1cg6ee3g4370g8937g4da8849871a6"
msgid "Time to get going."
msgstr "이만 갈 시간이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 731ec555-a39f-f4d6-b48a-42f9396e91e9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:731ec555-a39f-f4d6-b48a-42f9396e91e9
msgctxt "h8e860b48g169bg48fag8fdegc060fdf69080"
msgid "'Just be' what, exactly? Frustrated? Bored?"
msgstr "'이대로' 어떻게? 답답하게? 지루하게?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 767b4228-c6a0-5ba6-fb81-f1c2fcbb67a7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - ORI_Astarion_Event_LearnedPoemInfernalForQuestUpdate = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:767b4228-c6a0-5ba6-fb81-f1c2fcbb67a7
msgctxt "h887b0343gc216g4765g8f45g79cab43a66a6"
msgid ""
"*You recall the sharp, complex lines of the script - it was written in the "
"language of the Hells.*"
msgstr "*당신은 이 글씨의 날카롭고 복잡한 선을 떠올립니다. 이 글은 지옥의 언어로 쓰였습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 76835c96-9ef8-c4ee-f7b1-c7c80a1bb605
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:76835c96-9ef8-c4ee-f7b1-c7c80a1bb605
msgctxt "hc0e57493g2752g4789ga191gd6df78e7ac21"
msgid "I was holding back, if anything. Worried that I might... lose control."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 77586a2b-d466-d456-401b-9d25e81363b6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:77586a2b-d466-d456-401b-9d25e81363b6
msgctxt "h075487aeg8b64g4a81g859cg476e16061d2e"
msgid "I'm sorry, that sounds terrible."
msgstr "유감이야, 정말 끔찍했을 것 같은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 77dd6860-0804-e4b4-17fb-e53d45389b6a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:77dd6860-0804-e4b4-17fb-e53d45389b6a
msgctxt "h017dfa59gf201g4e45gba76gf256ff6bb433"
msgid "Trust me, it's a challenge for both of us."
msgstr "그래, 우리 둘 다 해결해야 할 문제지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 78ae30ae-158e-897f-e7f1-8b4ca8eb2689
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_AttackOnDen_State_RaiderVictory = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:78ae30ae-158e-897f-e7f1-8b4ca8eb2689
msgctxt "hd8bd2e76g1bb6g4405g978fg5d11c639f685"
msgid "My thoughts exactly. I want to go before the goblins start waking up."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 7907d6d3-21fb-e094-6bd5-16f2f513124c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CAMP_Astarion_SecondNight_TieflingsCelebration = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:7907d6d3-21fb-e094-6bd5-16f2f513124c
msgctxt "he52aea7bg16eag43e2g9ac8g9ef141f4b12f"
msgid ""
"Anyway, enough pillow talk. Let's go, before the tieflings drag us into "
"another mess."
msgstr "어쨌든, 잠자리 얘기는 그만하자. 또 티플링들 소란에 휘말리기 전에 가자고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 7967503f-8e1f-45d7-2530-5c3c1588e151
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:7967503f-8e1f-45d7-2530-5c3c1588e151
msgctxt "h020ca5ecg118cg4e5fgb0cag2cf2a019e1ba"
msgid "Waiting since the moment I set eyes on you."
msgstr "널 처음 봤던 그 순간부터 기다리고 있었지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7bd6f72c-a8da-296a-616c-f76d28f4cf96
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_ForgingOfTheHeart_State_KarlachSecondUpgrade = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:7bd6f72c-a8da-296a-616c-f76d28f4cf96
msgctxt "h399d47f0g548ag4745g9de2ge2f6bf3fb126"
msgid "I enjoyed last night. Did you?"
msgstr "어젯밤은 즐거웠어. 너는?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7c1c84ec-40b3-45e8-fd9e-4c014ec62c74
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:7c1c84ec-40b3-45e8-fd9e-4c014ec62c74
msgctxt "h6217575cgd4f4g41acg9ff3ge4c1be3adccb"
msgid "Not staying for a cuddle?"
msgstr "함께 껴안고 있을 생각은 없어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 7ce8b2b2-1757-4a34-c24b-e75c763a5591
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:7ce8b2b2-1757-4a34-c24b-e75c763a5591
msgctxt "h935cd81fgf7a2g4beag9cebg4142573ce494"
msgid "Not a great improvement, but at least they didn't mutilate me."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7d665494-3173-a812-871f-990475abfee0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_Astarion_Knows_Vampireness = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:7d665494-3173-a812-871f-990475abfee0
msgctxt "ha2860267g80c5g4a69g8686g2ea95ca69c84"
msgid "Hang on, soldier. I don't want to be 'tasted'. I'm not a snack."
msgstr "이봐, 신참. '맛보는' 건 아니지. 난 간식이 아니라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7da3a440-8d7b-d19e-3fc5-b8fda616a0d3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_TIEFLING(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - ORI_Astarion_Event_LearnedPoemNoInfernalForQuestUpdate = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:7da3a440-8d7b-d19e-3fc5-b8fda616a0d3
msgctxt "he4453469g158fg449ag839agc82e177f4114"
msgid "Aren't you curious to know what it says?"
msgstr "뭐라고 쓰여 있는지는 궁금하지 않아?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 80755ef9-115f-224d-7bb0-11fb5a1f42f3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:80755ef9-115f-224d-7bb0-11fb5a1f42f3
msgctxt "heee455e4g50ceg4074g8692gcf9745cc1c70"
msgid "I'm having to learn how to slow down. It isn't easy."
msgstr "진정하는 법을 알아내는 중이야. 쉽게는 안 되네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 83b93f50-2a39-0676-3ae8-b6e4f1e25874
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:83b93f50-2a39-0676-3ae8-b6e4f1e25874
msgctxt "h3269e3e7gd75bg405cgba3dg979bb2059049"
msgid "I - you know, I have no idea what to do with you."
msgstr "내가 - 하핫, 있지, 나 이제 어떻게 해야 할지 전혀 모르겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 849b4def-2ec3-a464-4d66-51003e273e15
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:849b4def-2ec3-a464-4d66-51003e273e15
msgctxt "h69919337g3ee0g4fd1gbb94g05209c1504cd"
msgid "You're leaving?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 85631875-45db-785b-44cf-fb6aba7665e4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:85631875-45db-785b-44cf-fb6aba7665e4
msgctxt "hf38c99d2gde1dg417egb5b8g69cc092d65bd"
msgid "But maybe that's not a bad thing."
msgstr "하지만... 그게 나쁘다는 건 아니야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 859e7828-b371-a7fe-0b05-60c4dfc94fdd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:859e7828-b371-a7fe-0b05-60c4dfc94fdd
msgctxt "h873fa6d3g42bag426agba52g9c970e266ac5"
msgid "Or maybe you don't."
msgstr "아니, 모르려나."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 85ef3e46-4625-190f-040c-478b641ef39a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - ORI_Astarion_Event_LearnedPoemNoInfernalForQuestUpdate = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:85ef3e46-4625-190f-040c-478b641ef39a
msgctxt "hbc057960g2c7fg455cg8279g30ad94418f55"
msgid "Is it a good poem, at least?"
msgstr "적어도 좋은 시긴 해?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 8610b136-e25c-cd07-1c0d-a559660f1461
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:8610b136-e25c-cd07-1c0d-a559660f1461
msgctxt "hff0ad415gbda2g472bg8094g69132d3ba9f3"
msgid "Suddenly? Darling, you haven't been paying attention."
msgstr "갑자기? 자기, 눈치가 좀 없구나."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 863682ee-b3a9-e240-f94a-3e5dfcd5f7aa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:863682ee-b3a9-e240-f94a-3e5dfcd5f7aa
msgctxt "h27274b79gd847g4a04g8beeg80929c8bf621"
msgid "Why did he write it in Infernal?"
msgstr "왜 이걸 지옥어로 적어뒀어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 8637727c-1e30-05ad-ca4c-f06cb4213370
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:8637727c-1e30-05ad-ca4c-f06cb4213370
msgctxt "h23575e92g88f8g4dd8g9f4fga0165c5f4748"
msgid ""
"It doesn't matter anyway. Whatever the bastard wrote, it won't change "
"anything he did to me."
msgstr "그건 어차피 상관없어. 그 개자식이 뭐라고 적었든, 내게 한 짓은 변하지 않을 테니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 87a9b08b-6290-e8e2-159d-430e5111c6b6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:87a9b08b-6290-e8e2-159d-430e5111c6b6
msgctxt "h7c57d4a9g074dg4090gb1b1gbb75638c81b7"
msgid "Why did he write it in Infernal?"
msgstr "왜 이걸 지옥어로 적어뒀어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 8ab33ff7-4fc1-0e06-6daa-18b2b56684dd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:8ab33ff7-4fc1-0e06-6daa-18b2b56684dd
msgctxt "hefd533a9g8010g4221g804dg6e90510515c1"
msgid ""
"But what's a sinner to do when faced with the very embodiment of chastity?"
msgstr "과연, 순결의 상징과도 같은 널 상대로 이 죄인이 뭘 해야 할까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 8af7fb92-cee8-662e-8bed-4e4b7806b671
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 267b08d1-1b0e-6f03-47c3-bc7491501a7e_MentionedPleasure = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:8af7fb92-cee8-662e-8bed-4e4b7806b671
msgctxt "h4a30b2aagd193g409fg96d3gd0a3b5705118"
msgid ""
"I wasn't going to bite you. I'm here because I thought we'd have a little "
"fun."
msgstr "난 널 물려고 했던 게 아니야. 같이 재미 좀 볼려고 여기 왔던거지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8d12bff5-9541-6f0f-1e6a-f6cb5c9fe3e5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:8d12bff5-9541-6f0f-1e6a-f6cb5c9fe3e5
msgctxt "h673659b9g947ag4098ga6b5ge96c195036a5"
msgid "Nothing. I'm leaving."
msgstr "됐어. 나 간다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 8e909a65-5c96-e8ac-1ff1-e613fb0892fe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:8e909a65-5c96-e8ac-1ff1-e613fb0892fe
msgctxt "h9703b936g870eg4cdbg8179gbfe40a4bb8a7"
msgid "You think you know the life I've led? The experiences I've had?"
msgstr "내가 어떻게 살았는지 네가 아는 것 같아? 지금까지의 내 '경험'을?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8fc05e11-96e1-e28c-7d7c-0c425223ffa3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:8fc05e11-96e1-e28c-7d7c-0c425223ffa3
msgctxt "hda07c1ceg2229g482bgb4cfg4a1c071f6616"
msgid "I could always go again."
msgstr "언제든 또 할 수 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 9200c7f3-4d14-2c1b-ede0-32a2ea743c72
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:9200c7f3-4d14-2c1b-ede0-32a2ea743c72
msgctxt "hb9ba2223g0d3fg4e42ga125g37ca2a1f191f"
msgid "That was my second kidnapping, when the mind flayers snatched me up."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 9279afe4-980d-c726-38a2-1baf3145c349
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - ORI_Astarion_Knows_CazadorMaster = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:9279afe4-980d-c726-38a2-1baf3145c349
msgctxt "h2db50468g9ff6g41abgaef2g89c3ab7aed7d"
msgid ""
"It's a poem. A gift from my old master, Cazador. He considered himself quite "
"the artist and used his slaves as a canvas."
msgstr "그건 시야. 내 옛 주인, 카사도어의 선물이지. 그는 자기 노예를 캔버스로 삼으며 스스로를 대단한 예술가인 양 여겼어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 951f22d4-4d2e-be96-ddab-8c853cac3b03
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:951f22d4-4d2e-be96-ddab-8c853cac3b03
msgctxt "h4519c410g4a24g4f02ga766g88d67bfbac69"
msgid ""
"Finally. I'm just glad your performance earlier was better than your pillow "
"talk."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 960597ac-b509-ebec-74d5-9bfb74981823
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:960597ac-b509-ebec-74d5-9bfb74981823
msgctxt "hd303e1a7g3f8fg4608gafdfg861f0e150676"
msgid "Enough. You don't get to talk to me like that."
msgstr "그만. 나한테 그런 식으로 말하지 마."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 97ccbb56-1268-dafa-8da1-ad456792a01b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebratrion_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion_State_Happened = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:97ccbb56-1268-dafa-8da1-ad456792a01b
msgctxt "h2dbfc458ga9fbg492bgb6d4g08f743fb59ff"
msgid "There you are. I've been waiting."
msgstr "거기 있었구나. 기다리고 있었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 98176b84-9430-addd-6054-a06d7e8cb232
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - ORI_Astarion_Event_LearnedPoemNoInfernalForQuestUpdate = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:98176b84-9430-addd-6054-a06d7e8cb232
msgctxt "h6383c0ddg600dg450bg8822gb5f04480436a"
msgid "What does it say?"
msgstr "뭐라고 써진 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 9821b6e7-0b68-2879-f65e-14a50ed516a0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:9821b6e7-0b68-2879-f65e-14a50ed516a0
msgctxt "h477c2ee6g11feg4665g84bag4acce72135c0"
msgid "I don't know, it's not like I can look in a mirror and see."
msgstr "나도 몰라, 내가 거울을 갖다 놓고 볼 수 있는 건 아니라서."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 99a77bff-e65f-b16b-9f00-45a3bf4385e2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:99a77bff-e65f-b16b-9f00-45a3bf4385e2
msgctxt "h951e315eg2c15g48c7gab47g0206bc0c576b"
msgid "Well I can't just check in a mirror, can I?"
msgstr "내가 그냥 거울을 갖다 놓고 확인할 수 있는 건 아니잖아, 안 그래?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 9a867dec-2d95-7906-4e1a-7850ff681b57
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:9a867dec-2d95-7906-4e1a-7850ff681b57
msgctxt "h4f19c367gd26fg43b6gb6a1g6337051e363a"
msgid ""
"Not being able to touch you, having to slow down, it's all... I'm just not "
"used to it."
msgstr "널 만지지도 못하고, 차분하게 있는 이런 게... 난 영 익숙하지 않아. "

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9abd08a5-03a4-7aa9-ffac-2d6b6938cb54
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   User:
#.      - ORI_Astarion_Knows_ScarsIsCazadorPoem_Character(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:9abd08a5-03a4-7aa9-ffac-2d6b6938cb54
msgctxt "hf1c68a11g6d3dg4ac7gb501g6f1357b3893b"
msgid "That's Cazador's poem on your back? Written in scars?"
msgstr "네 등에 있는 게 카사도어의 시야? 흉터로 새겨진 글귀?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 9d8f67dc-8251-3591-1ab6-bca0c9188455
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:9d8f67dc-8251-3591-1ab6-bca0c9188455
msgctxt "hcbcba87cgd48dg46cag9734ge7a48fcd4804"
msgid ""
"Although your condition means tasting you could be a risky proposition. "
"You're quite the forbidden fruit, aren't you?"
msgstr "다만 네 상태 때문에 맛보기가 꽤나 위험하긴 하겠어. 달콤한 금단의 열매로구나, 너는?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9e2aa100-e559-bc7f-678f-6255f9483f82
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:9e2aa100-e559-bc7f-678f-6255f9483f82
msgctxt "h40024326g7afbg4a6eg964bgba6bcb93b8ef"
msgid "I want to be with you so badly."
msgstr "너랑 같이 이 밤을 보내고 싶어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 9e63de99-1d30-9f88-d68d-acade68d8dc0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - ORI_Astarion_Knows_PoemInfernal = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:9e63de99-1d30-9f88-d68d-acade68d8dc0
msgctxt "h92655d31gcb29g4613g9f53gcd05c6bf0069"
msgid "Infernal? I - no. It doesn't matter what it says."
msgstr "지옥어? 난 - 아니. 어차피 뭐라고 쓰여있는지는 상관없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9f534ddc-596d-b02f-f124-fc9520ac8edd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:9f534ddc-596d-b02f-f124-fc9520ac8edd
msgctxt "he38e10c2g5971g4c01ga4fagbd52f2c3541c"
msgid "What's really going on here, Astarion? Suddenly you're so vicious."
msgstr "무슨 일이야, 아스타리온? 갑자기 공격적인데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = a016aed7-1148-2616-576c-3626ad432e8c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:a016aed7-1148-2616-576c-3626ad432e8c
msgctxt "h3da7c478gf202g4931g8af6gcbb13ac69cb4"
msgid ""
"I thought we had an understanding, but I guess I'll just entertain myself "
"tonight."
msgstr "오늘 밤은 서로 합의한 줄 알았는데, 어쩔 수 없지, 그냥 혼자 즐거운 시간을 보내야겠네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = a0c4b2a7-fd09-c45e-247f-70c906318bbb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:a0c4b2a7-fd09-c45e-247f-70c906318bbb
msgctxt "h870c07e4g747ag40efg992fg6362073e0425"
msgid ""
"Now, shall we get on? I want to go before anyone else thanks me for saving "
"their tails."
msgstr "자, 그럼 이만 가 볼까? 자기 꼬리를 구해줬다고 감사하는 사람을 더 보기 전에 가보고 싶거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = a0edbd7d-57a2-5d74-132f-ae422423a39d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:a0edbd7d-57a2-5d74-132f-ae422423a39d
msgctxt "h711450c9g1e50g451dg8f7cgc6e25dfed84b"
msgid "No! I'm not."
msgstr "아니! 궁금하지 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = a1cf2e2f-e93e-5652-1b32-0b5d12a08717
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_Astarion_Knows_Vampireness = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:a1cf2e2f-e93e-5652-1b32-0b5d12a08717
msgctxt "h67dbca78g71e0g47dbgb8e1g620411b8acc2"
msgid "Now let's go. We've wasted enough time already."
msgstr "이제 가자. 이미 시간은 충분히 낭비한 것 같은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = a3891791-dfe4-3c02-1853-ac271b6c8216
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:a3891791-dfe4-3c02-1853-ac271b6c8216
msgctxt "hc5d50191g3305g4c04g9c4eg48de123f4c86"
msgid "Yes. It's a poem. My old master considered himself quite the artist."
msgstr "맞아. 시야. 내 옛 주인은 자기가 꽤 대단한 예술가라고 생각했거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a497ac81-f160-4e2e-21b2-ee3b0a83c987
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_TIEFLING(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - ORI_Astarion_Event_LearnedPoemNoInfernalForQuestUpdate = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:a497ac81-f160-4e2e-21b2-ee3b0a83c987
msgctxt "h63d5c86egeb1dg46e2gb353ge8e8b5384ca4"
msgid "Aren't you curious to know what it says?"
msgstr "뭐라고 쓰여 있는지는 궁금하지 않아?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a56ee411-77b8-1d6a-649f-27245ff4a4db
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   User:
#.      - ORI_Astarion_Knows_ScarsIsCazadorPoem_Character(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   User:
#.     - ORI_Astarion_Knows_ScarsIsCazadorPoem_Character(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:a56ee411-77b8-1d6a-649f-27245ff4a4db
msgctxt "h95833990gedceg499dg89a4g39bbd5e583b2"
msgid "I wanted to ask about your scars first. Where'd you get them?"
msgstr "먼저 네 흉터에 대해서 묻고 싶은데. 그건 어쩌다 생긴 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = a5ad2d04-964f-54d0-c389-9419fe5404cc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - ORI_Astarion_Knows_CazadorMaster = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:a5ad2d04-964f-54d0-c389-9419fe5404cc
msgctxt "h40feee47gd6b1g4527gbfccg745d523ab951"
msgid ""
"It's a poem. A gift from my old master, Cazador. He considered himself quite "
"the artist and used his slaves as a canvas."
msgstr "그건 시야. 내 옛 주인, 카사도어의 선물이지. 그는 자기 노예를 캔버스로 삼으며 스스로를 대단한 예술가인 양 여겼어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = a763256f-ba2c-6bdb-0d5c-6e00671d5856
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:a763256f-ba2c-6bdb-0d5c-6e00671d5856
msgctxt "h5c697d7bg1632g4e65g89e7g3cd7596e1009"
msgid "I don't know, it's not like I can look in a mirror and see."
msgstr "나도 몰라, 내가 거울을 갖다 놓고 볼 수 있는 건 아니라서."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = a9c0e62b-94bc-7fc9-1c26-cce84a48f2d8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - ORI_Astarion_Event_LearnedPoemInfernalForQuestUpdate = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:a9c0e62b-94bc-7fc9-1c26-cce84a48f2d8
msgctxt "h1c009b69g7932g42aeg94d3gb961c3e3be72"
msgid ""
"*You recall the sharp, complex lines of the script - it was written in the "
"language of the Hells.*"
msgstr "*당신은 이 글씨의 날카롭고 복잡한 선을 떠올립니다. 이 글은 지옥의 언어로 쓰였습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a9c25781-8dab-9794-45a5-7415681f4679
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:a9c25781-8dab-9794-45a5-7415681f4679
msgctxt "h31c3239dgf64dg4657gb3a7gac76bd2117b5"
msgid "And he gave you those scars?"
msgstr "그 자가 흉터를 새긴 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = abfe4587-2a0e-ede8-71aa-00e8848fb528
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - ORI_Astarion_Event_LearnedPoemNoInfernalForQuestUpdate = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:abfe4587-2a0e-ede8-71aa-00e8848fb528
msgctxt "h4465a0dbg76d6g4c69gb136g6d3b4b720263"
msgid "All right. Let's get moving, then."
msgstr "좋아. 그럼, 가 보자고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = aca512a0-61d6-1c0e-768d-3b06e6e33378
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:aca512a0-61d6-1c0e-768d-3b06e6e33378
msgctxt "h626b4311g2e12g4f32gad57g843e5c68d3b1"
msgid "Can I see?"
msgstr "봐도 될까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ae6e3a71-b06b-d30b-6029-840298479937
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:ae6e3a71-b06b-d30b-6029-840298479937
msgctxt "hc9e9384cgd28cg47d1g8bf1g8124e2ba015f"
msgid "And what do you want?"
msgstr "그럼 네가 원하는 건 뭐야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = b0073a48-872f-5a61-1815-18b6759718d3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 267b08d1-1b0e-6f03-47c3-bc7491501a7e_MentionedPleasure = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:b0073a48-872f-5a61-1815-18b6759718d3
msgctxt "hab175a77gf417g4008g8537gded86532598b"
msgid "This isn't about hunger. It's about pleasure."
msgstr "이건 배고픔 때문이 아니야. 즐거움을 위한 거지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b073a7d6-5c63-ed0f-cc93-729ae4c943d7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_Astarion_Knows_Vampireness = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:b073a7d6-5c63-ed0f-cc93-729ae4c943d7
msgctxt "hffdb40f6gab08g49d3gb59dg2ffa2bfe1cd0"
msgid "Keep your fangs to yourself, soldier."
msgstr "송곳니 꽂을 생각은 관둬, 신참."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = b0c650ee-81e9-97b4-ca6d-7e48899b2414
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:b0c650ee-81e9-97b4-ca6d-7e48899b2414
msgctxt "hffb5435dg52deg4d85ga0f6gd19c56bab82c"
msgid "Waiting since the moment I set eyes on you."
msgstr "널 처음 봤던 그 순간부터 기다리고 있었지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b1d0b14a-af71-bfeb-fb0e-52a1c3400b4e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:b1d0b14a-af71-bfeb-fb0e-52a1c3400b4e
msgctxt "h4f8ef4d3ge9a4g459ega593g567c7ae8c0fb"
msgid "And he gave you those scars?"
msgstr "그리고 그가 네게 그 흉터를 남겼다고?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = b20f8905-9ffb-2ff8-198c-762a6cee64eb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:b20f8905-9ffb-2ff8-198c-762a6cee64eb
msgctxt "habe71cb6g6667g458ag833egb3d1a66f9456"
msgid "But if you don't trust me, then I guess even that's off the table."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = b2ff5c2d-1e71-f26f-f725-fcfb33beec8c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:b2ff5c2d-1e71-f26f-f725-fcfb33beec8c
msgctxt "h84e59096gb7bbg4a59g9ffbgfdada41f39f0"
msgid ""
"The mind flayers weren't my first kidnapping. A long time ago, I crossed "
"Cazador - a powerful man in Baldur's Gate."
msgstr "난 마인드 플레이어에게만 납치되었던 게 아니야. 오래전에, 카사도어라는 남자를 거슬렀지. 발더스 게이트의 강력한 자였어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = b3920e62-4a9f-6e9a-0654-13443c3b9271
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:b3920e62-4a9f-6e9a-0654-13443c3b9271
msgctxt "h31ca3927ge897g47c5gb583gaf81fdcd06df"
msgid ""
"My thoughts exactly. It's been a fun night so far, but I can feel my bedroll "
"calling."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b5f587ad-4904-ea5c-3c94-953df4a8522c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:b5f587ad-4904-ea5c-3c94-953df4a8522c
msgctxt "hfc012b16g84b6g445cg94c2gd1d16eb8e44c"
msgid ""
"We can just talk. As long as we want. Then we can sleep. Near, but not too "
"near."
msgstr "그냥 대화하면 되잖아. 하고 싶은 만큼. 그다음엔 같이 누워서 자는 거지. 너무 붙지는 말고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = b73fb9c3-677a-1f70-72fa-1642f7f17cd7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:b73fb9c3-677a-1f70-72fa-1642f7f17cd7
msgctxt "h84a7a36eg5d9ag489ega5f8g1aa5ff836100"
msgid "He captured me. Kept me for years as his slave."
msgstr "그가 날 가뒀어. 수많은 세월 동안 날 그의 노예로 부렸지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = b88898b3-2fbd-36d6-e8bc-09a533077ba8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_Astarion_Knows_CazadorMaster = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:b88898b3-2fbd-36d6-e8bc-09a533077ba8
msgctxt "h57dfee9cgcde8g4c55g88a8ga996b7520931"
msgid ""
"It's a poem. A gift from Cazador. He considered himself quite the artist and "
"used his slaves as a canvas."
msgstr "시이지. 카사도어가 준 선물이야. 그 자식은 자기가 꽤 대단한 예술가라고 생각했고, 노예들을 캔버스처럼 썼지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = baeb8961-2f6d-f92b-d67a-cfd6e1a491bf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_ForgingOfTheHeart_State_KarlachSecondUpgrade = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:baeb8961-2f6d-f92b-d67a-cfd6e1a491bf
msgctxt "hab439aa2gf3a6g460ag962ag7646e83fa86c"
msgid "Not staying for a cuddle?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bb37699e-5a6c-750b-70d4-838f551abe56
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:bb37699e-5a6c-750b-70d4-838f551abe56
msgctxt "h03201601gd5c2g40eag9f73g1412ddb06c9f"
msgid "Sure, let's go."
msgstr "물론이지, 가자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bcdfcba1-ccb6-d8a4-4252-0460899d7dc5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:bcdfcba1-ccb6-d8a4-4252-0460899d7dc5
msgctxt "h2eb67e2bg853eg40e3g97e1gba8ab0793ffa"
msgid "<i>Nod.</i>"
msgstr "<i>끄덕인다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c00ebeb5-a1ba-1eea-fa73-c3efcb01e1e5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:c00ebeb5-a1ba-1eea-fa73-c3efcb01e1e5
msgctxt "h7a59d512g5a6cg4fb6gbd68gb26bdfea6c26"
msgid "Hold on - I'm not sure about this."
msgstr "잠깐만, 확신이 서지 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = c1299714-986d-518f-9a85-884870d4079e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:c1299714-986d-518f-9a85-884870d4079e
msgctxt "he8810242g7015g40d3gbdc8g1de90cc6c8f4"
msgid ""
"Oh no - don't you tar me with your 'normal' brush. My demons keep me "
"extraordinary."
msgstr "어허, 네 '정상' 기준으로 날 오염시키지 마. 나는 아주 특별한 결점이 많다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = c2497e70-49ee-a635-36e7-cd7214ba8aee
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:c2497e70-49ee-a635-36e7-cd7214ba8aee
msgctxt "hd945df30ga758g45c3gad55g1165158327f1"
msgid "Tempting, but this might not be the time or the place."
msgstr "구미가 당기지만, 지금은 때와 장소가 적절하지 않을지도 모르겠네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c43caf92-7d4f-03f1-b33a-00ff10d7143e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:c43caf92-7d4f-03f1-b33a-00ff10d7143e
msgctxt "h6b845a9cg642dg4fbdg9f20gf6fa7978f715"
msgid "<i>Grin and let him kiss you.</i>"
msgstr "<i>미소를 짓고 그가 키스하도록 내버려둔다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = c496cbf2-1ffb-1bf7-5439-658cc3b0e6de
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_ForgingOfTheHeart_State_KarlachSecondUpgrade = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebratrion_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion_State_Happened = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:c496cbf2-1ffb-1bf7-5439-658cc3b0e6de
msgctxt "hb3d0c78eg0b85g4e61g87ecg88ac51516746"
msgid "There you are. I've been waiting."
msgstr "거기 있었구나. 기다리고 있었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c7d4d854-4260-672b-f735-9d104f360295
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   User:
#.      - ORI_Astarion_Knows_ScarsIsCazadorPoem_Character(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:c7d4d854-4260-672b-f735-9d104f360295
msgctxt "h1508d52dg3ee5g42cagb8b9g1a292ebe5d6d"
msgid "That's Cazador's poem on your back? Written in scars?"
msgstr "네 등에 있는 게 카사도어의 시야? 흉터로 새겨진 글귀?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = c83927fc-6b3b-0368-e153-985557b84c0e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:c83927fc-6b3b-0368-e153-985557b84c0e
msgctxt "hfced5951gc1d6g4c5dg9af5gfc78991460db"
msgid ""
"I - ...I'm sorry, Karlach. It's just, not being able to touch you - having "
"to slow down, it's... I'm just not used to it."
msgstr "하, 난... 미안해, 칼라크. 그게 있지, 널 만지지도 못하고, 차분하게 있는 게... 난 영 익숙하지 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = c903b584-564d-a948-c645-cc73f1550486
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:c903b584-564d-a948-c645-cc73f1550486
msgctxt "hb61c9afcg38a8g4c74ga9acg5da012499232"
msgid "My dear, you're much more boring than I gave you credit for."
msgstr "하. 자기야, 넌 내 생각보다 재미없는 사람이구나."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = c94de1ec-551e-ce6b-1aa7-a177e978bbc9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:c94de1ec-551e-ce6b-1aa7-a177e978bbc9
msgctxt "h6bf2cd17g9b5eg4dbeg9c22g7c85e82d03af"
msgid "Karlach, champion of the Hells, wants to talk and then fall asleep?"
msgstr "지옥의 투사 칼라크가, 그냥 수다만 떨다가 코 자겠다고? "

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = ca494ba5-45c5-467a-e447-cfa8caf4e79c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:ca494ba5-45c5-467a-e447-cfa8caf4e79c
msgctxt "hfc97db69g803cg43d2g84a9g14df28298bb9"
msgid ""
"It doesn't matter anyway. Whatever the bastard wrote, it won't change "
"anything he did to me."
msgstr "그건 어차피 상관없어. 그 개자식이 뭐라고 적었든, 내게 한 짓은 변하지 않을 테니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cb98843c-6307-06bc-1279-1bdec9a3b6d4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:cb98843c-6307-06bc-1279-1bdec9a3b6d4
msgctxt "h99a9b028g6dd0g4132g9deegd457fae62b22"
msgid "You weren't <i>that </i>good."
msgstr "네가 <i>그렇게 </i>잘하진 않았어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = d0094ca5-9b30-db25-a434-beff3c0eeb84
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:d0094ca5-9b30-db25-a434-beff3c0eeb84
msgctxt "h70f86e39g9a31g4b2eg89cfgf71d003d9121"
msgid "Tempting, but this might not be the time or the place."
msgstr "구미가 당기지만, 지금은 때와 장소가 적절하지 않을지도 모르겠네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = d09b24e1-46ba-29e7-60a6-8c612692bb87
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:d09b24e1-46ba-29e7-60a6-8c612692bb87
msgctxt "h52e752e8g2231g40e3g9e68g4211f691fdf5"
msgid "How dare you - I'm a consummate lover."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d166eea8-dc77-dbbb-6a3a-e7b82df4ac79
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   User:
#.      - ORI_Astarion_Knows_ScarsIsCazadorPoem_Character(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:d166eea8-dc77-dbbb-6a3a-e7b82df4ac79
msgctxt "h71a3c47fga60cg4515ga576g48ae1773bff4"
msgid "I wanted to ask about your scars first. Is that Cazador's poem?"
msgstr "먼저 네 흉터에 대해서 묻고 싶은데. 그거, 카사도어의 시야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = d2555202-97b1-f1a4-0101-c90efacc6c3b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:d2555202-97b1-f1a4-0101-c90efacc6c3b
msgctxt "hf2f9c462g5c02g4c4ag8c70g47dd398c9b6b"
msgid "Now let's go, before I regret my restraint last night."
msgstr "이제 가자, 내가 어젯밤의 자제력을 후회하기 전에."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d3aa3fd6-719c-8e85-3dcc-1bc05bfbc094
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   User:
#.      - ORI_Astarion_Knows_ScarsIsCazadorPoem_Character(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:d3aa3fd6-719c-8e85-3dcc-1bc05bfbc094
msgctxt "hb1b177f2g2727g447bg90f0g997ac32f1619"
msgid "I wanted to ask about your scars first. Is that Cazador's poem?"
msgstr "먼저 네 흉터에 대해서 묻고 싶은데. 그거, 카사도어의 시야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = d4d965fb-b2ff-1db5-e060-ab85d11c601f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:d4d965fb-b2ff-1db5-e060-ab85d11c601f
msgctxt "ha8ca88bagf2d8g40b4g90f8g6d303f7f36e7"
msgid "How dare you - I'm a consummate lover."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d61acfbd-f31a-605f-4950-4344cb6f73b0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:d61acfbd-f31a-605f-4950-4344cb6f73b0
msgctxt "h6709fc05g043ag4a5fga8e7g50fb5c6ac848"
msgid "You don't have to 'do' anything. We can just be."
msgstr "굳이 애써서 뭘 '할' 필요 없어. 그냥 이대로 있으면 되잖아. "

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = d7d4587d-170f-bf32-a5c3-6f06075c4f38
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:d7d4587d-170f-bf32-a5c3-6f06075c4f38
msgctxt "hd83ae59egbffeg49f5g9ec8gcb1c27b65228"
msgid "Karlach! You know what I mean."
msgstr "칼라크! 내 말이 무슨 말인지 알잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = dbb85669-c074-9d8e-635d-8af9128b75bb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   User:
#.      - ORI_Astarion_Knows_ScarsIsCazadorPoem_Character(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   User:
#.     - ORI_Astarion_Knows_ScarsIsCazadorPoem_Character(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:dbb85669-c074-9d8e-635d-8af9128b75bb
msgctxt "h7ce9ccb0g6e65g4866ga710gcc3499105076"
msgid "I wanted to ask about your scars first. Where'd you get them?"
msgstr "먼저 네 흉터에 대해서 묻고 싶은데. 그건 어쩌다 생긴 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = dc87d7be-d7fd-b552-750a-ffb5100bdfcd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:dc87d7be-d7fd-b552-750a-ffb5100bdfcd
msgctxt "h07a1c37fga2e1g4023g8b61gbc783d57ada6"
msgid ""
"Urgh! Why is this so difficult? I'd have already bedded you twice if you "
"were <i>normal</i>."
msgstr "으으! 왜 이렇게 어려워? 네가 <i>정상이었으면</i> 벌써 두 번은 했겠다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = dc903205-511c-7f76-bcee-69edb9dae6a4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:dc903205-511c-7f76-bcee-69edb9dae6a4
msgctxt "h7975953fgbfa8g456fga70cg21bdf3a5088b"
msgid "Yes. What of it?"
msgstr "그래. 뭐가 궁금한데?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = dcb2595c-1fb2-26f1-01c2-da8fefee8b47
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   User:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion_Bite(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:dcb2595c-1fb2-26f1-01c2-da8fefee8b47
msgctxt "hc7bdddf8gde8bg4996gb24bgb1df4085ec38"
msgid "Delicious as you were, I didn't want to go too far."
msgstr "네가 정말 맛있긴 했지만, 너무 멀리 가고 싶진 않았어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = dd4499a5-0730-80b1-4327-23bbd68b3bd9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:dd4499a5-0730-80b1-4327-23bbd68b3bd9
msgctxt "h0f2a8f2dg18b3g43a2g839cg2c9ce5eb4989"
msgid "Yes. What of it?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ddd02f3e-70e2-e33a-d065-848bbaa95b1e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_Astarion_Knows_Vampireness = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - ORI_HadSexWithCompanion(1) = True
#.     - ORI_HadSexWithAstarion(1) = True
#.   User:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion_Sex(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:ddd02f3e-70e2-e33a-d065-848bbaa95b1e
msgctxt "hd0c7d22bg0236g4d5cg8276g36977800f9ff"
msgid "<i>Relax. Enjoy yourself. Trust him not to bite you.</i>"
msgstr "<i>긴장을 풀고. 이 시간을 즐긴다. 그가 당신을 물지 않을 거라 믿는다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = e171d224-3aa3-93f8-392e-0e84db730314
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:e171d224-3aa3-93f8-392e-0e84db730314
msgctxt "h4423721bg0131g46f3g8f8eg5f10766545fa"
msgid "Not a great improvement, but at least they didn't mutilate me."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = e22446bd-87eb-2ae4-f8a7-f783d1e9da28
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:e22446bd-87eb-2ae4-f8a7-f783d1e9da28
msgctxt "h16a4223bgf81cg4ee9gb5e0g4d683eaaa5de"
msgid "Trust me, the feeling is exceptionally mutual."
msgstr "걱정 마. 그 감정은 나도 똑같이... 간절하게 느끼고 있으니까. "

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = e2be5da1-79f8-116a-7db3-c96b9452aa3c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:e2be5da1-79f8-116a-7db3-c96b9452aa3c
msgctxt "h011860bag8fa1g4bedg8e9bgd7cf89fbaf90"
msgid "Then what are you doing here?"
msgstr "그럼 여기서 뭘 하고 있는 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = e2d29fec-936a-b00d-3918-7b9821684904
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:e2d29fec-936a-b00d-3918-7b9821684904
msgctxt "h7d9489d5g19fcg408bg9ea2g2ac22d965173"
msgid "So, can you -... I don't know. Help? Show me what to do?"
msgstr "그러니까 네가 혹시... 글쎄, 모르겠다. 도와줄래? 내가 뭘 해야 하는지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = e5582d10-7035-93b2-6e2e-378ea9c6a1df
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - Astarion_InParty_AskedPast(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - Astarion_InParty_Event_ToldAboutMagistrate(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:e5582d10-7035-93b2-6e2e-378ea9c6a1df
msgctxt "hddb18008gab0ag4e61g8223gae2a45829f9e"
msgid ""
"I told you that I was a magistrate in Baldur's Gate, but that's only part of "
"it."
msgstr "내가 발더스 게이트에서 치안판사였다고 말해줬었지만, 그게 다가 아니야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = e5775904-9247-b759-542c-862f2c9e6338
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:e5775904-9247-b759-542c-862f2c9e6338
msgctxt "ha0aca23ag197dg4a7cgbbeag310dd670e23d"
msgid "And don't feel the need to brag to the others about our little tryst. "
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e5f70753-45f2-b2e4-5b46-fad654ec82fc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:e5f70753-45f2-b2e4-5b46-fad654ec82fc
msgctxt "h80f1a30ag3309g405bg9aceg29e1a57c9ab8"
msgid "I want to have fun - that's it."
msgstr "즐거운 시간을 보내고 싶을 뿐 - 그게 전부야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e5ff2d24-fe21-117c-604a-cca03305f1c4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_Astarion_Knows_Vampireness = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - ORI_HadSexWithCompanion(1) = True
#.     - ORI_HadSexWithAstarion(1) = True
#.   User:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion_Sex(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:e5ff2d24-fe21-117c-604a-cca03305f1c4
msgctxt "h01348cd4ga0bag4576g8afegb04ecf8e3969"
msgid "<i>Relax. Enjoy yourself.</i>"
msgstr "<i>긴장을 풀고. 이 시간을 즐긴다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = e64c5ba9-1ef1-2a47-43c4-1d80c8a622f2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:e64c5ba9-1ef1-2a47-43c4-1d80c8a622f2
msgctxt "h6b4f00c6g445fg4e87gb2b8ge78be697c63c"
msgid "This is impossible - <i>you're </i>impossible!"
msgstr "아오, 못해먹겠네. <i>너 때문에</i> 못해먹겠어!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = e7694443-2edf-b172-1925-c3ac9cc9a2f2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:e7694443-2edf-b172-1925-c3ac9cc9a2f2
msgctxt "he47e0871g8cf6g4d86g8317g018075936190"
msgid ""
"He composed and carved that one over the course of a night. He made a lot of "
"revisions as he went."
msgstr "그 놈이 하룻밤 사이에 시를 지어 내 등에 새겨 넣었지. 나중에 더 많이 수정을 했고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = e8309ff6-908e-a62c-c564-9e21427b0ded
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:e8309ff6-908e-a62c-c564-9e21427b0ded
msgctxt "he3b878a5g8f17g4998g9551gdaf9a27f58ef"
msgid "I was holding back a little, it's true. I didn't want to lose control."
msgstr "사실이야, 조금 참고 있었어. 통제력을 잃긴 싫었거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e83fe5e1-4240-de6b-1c75-70488cf36af6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:e83fe5e1-4240-de6b-1c75-70488cf36af6
msgctxt "hab90e24cge6b9g41eeg9cd4g1d479d131f4e"
msgid "I could always go again."
msgstr "2회전이라면 환영이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = e89eec97-bf67-b8a7-5557-8f76e286c921
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   User:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion_Bite(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:e89eec97-bf67-b8a7-5557-8f76e286c921
msgctxt "h03035aa0gf222g4902gb547g3332fbedfd41"
msgid "Delicious as you were, I didn't want to go too far."
msgstr "네가 정말 맛있긴 했지만, 너무 멀리 가고 싶진 않았어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = ea44128e-f83f-7272-9690-7231a89419bc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:ea44128e-f83f-7272-9690-7231a89419bc
msgctxt "hc5a6fd18g5e89g4cdag9fe6g9bc2ea36bf59"
msgid "Cazador said the scars were his gift. A poem to carry with me."
msgstr "카사도어는 이 흉터가 그의 선물이라고 했지. 내가 가지고 다닐 시라고 했어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = ea7c56a3-512c-cca1-4b4b-244c748f3d1b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:ea7c56a3-512c-cca1-4b4b-244c748f3d1b
msgctxt "h5bcdace0g5dd5g4b4dg8e2ag455d4b267dd7"
msgid "That's what you want, isn't it? To lose yourself in me?"
msgstr "그게 네가 원하는 거 아니야? 내 품속에 깊게 파고드는 거?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = eba56abd-5aaf-7d14-3552-6325fc114191
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:eba56abd-5aaf-7d14-3552-6325fc114191
msgctxt "he474573bg53eag4befg829eg2310b3644451"
msgid "How did you escape?"
msgstr "어떻게 탈출했어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = eddb0091-406c-b140-0412-69d4b0e2641c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:eddb0091-406c-b140-0412-69d4b0e2641c
msgctxt "h17733c78gc6bbg4a85gae73g603eb3abc910"
msgid "Don't I? You're here. And I don't think you want to talk."
msgstr "그런가? 네가 여기 있잖아. 그리고 대화나 하러 온 것 같진 않은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = f1059854-a8eb-72ec-c458-30fea96be04c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:f1059854-a8eb-72ec-c458-30fea96be04c
msgctxt "he43bc0c0g7a46g43a7g9791g2c5c705bb637"
msgid "You've seen enough already."
msgstr "이미 충분히 봤어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = f15a6bac-4470-0a07-0a0f-ea318415b2ce
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:f15a6bac-4470-0a07-0a0f-ea318415b2ce
msgctxt "h81d22c19g7c63g4caeg894dgedbdf0b219d8"
msgid ""
"Anyway, let's back to camp and our bedrolls. We should try to get some rest "
"tonight."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f2446076-10b4-dbb2-3578-7c44abbd31a3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:f2446076-10b4-dbb2-3578-7c44abbd31a3
msgctxt "hb3e676d0g4042g46e2g8de2gb5350ed123e5"
msgid "How did you escape?"
msgstr "어떻게 탈출한 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = f2f3d43f-a215-bfbc-94b9-dcc9552f5cca
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:f2f3d43f-a215-bfbc-94b9-dcc9552f5cca
msgctxt "h08f33e2eg68dfg4ce1g8be8gdc98429820f2"
msgid "I thought so."
msgstr "그럴 줄 알았어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f38b231a-0990-958c-7964-1048dcee6f8f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_Astarion_Knows_Vampireness = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:f38b231a-0990-958c-7964-1048dcee6f8f
msgctxt "hb4075261g78a8g43c1gbd87gf19af62a1dd3"
msgid "Keep those teeth away from me!"
msgstr "그 이빨 저리 치워!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f65c9417-de3c-fac3-ea3c-d3bdf514f503
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_TIEFLING(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - ORI_Astarion_Event_LearnedPoemInfernalForQuestUpdate = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:f65c9417-de3c-fac3-ea3c-d3bdf514f503
msgctxt "h94f5640bgbeb8g4883g9ff1gd3316235de7d"
msgid "It's written in Infernal. I could read it, if you like?"
msgstr "지옥어로 써졌는데. 원한다면 읽어줄까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = f6c679a3-b6b8-034c-e3ed-c9edd54d4912
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:f6c679a3-b6b8-034c-e3ed-c9edd54d4912
msgctxt "h87dd04c0g9dd2g4aa0g8c37g82e494423d5e"
msgid "Whatever the bastard wrote, it won't change what he did to me."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = f709f21d-5f9d-9b2e-d74f-3553c339d290
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:f709f21d-5f9d-9b2e-d74f-3553c339d290
msgctxt "h5e8e6664g6310g4784g96bfgf30a658567eb"
msgid "This is - well... you know, I have no idea what to do with you."
msgstr "하... 이게, 그... 사실, 이제 어떻게 해야 할지 전혀 모르겠어. "

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f712503b-4df9-a46e-3aa1-26b397641ab8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:f712503b-4df9-a46e-3aa1-26b397641ab8
msgctxt "h669ad2dbga53cg44daga446g0ca2636021f6"
msgid "I don't know either. This is all just as new for me as it is for you."
msgstr "나도 몰라. 이런 상황이 처음인 건 나도 마찬가지라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = f8d1d487-ede3-75d8-6a48-0ac0cc7609c4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - ORI_Astarion_Knows_PoemInfernal = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:f8d1d487-ede3-75d8-6a48-0ac0cc7609c4
msgctxt "h6251c618gfe70g45e4gbc1bg3624dc1592c9"
msgid "Infernal? I... Who knows? The bastard was insane."
msgstr "지옥어라고? 나도... 누가 알겠어? 그 자식은 미친 놈이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fa6eb6b1-9b1c-4e22-db00-337c9069d7f1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:fa6eb6b1-9b1c-4e22-db00-337c9069d7f1
msgctxt "h47cd2c30gf841g4e75ga63ag2f3bb88c84c0"
msgid "Actually, I think I've changed my mind. I'm going to go."
msgstr "있지, 사실 마음이 바뀌었어. 난 갈래."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = fa91bcd5-bf54-874a-2baa-60015d158fe3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:fa91bcd5-bf54-874a-2baa-60015d158fe3
msgctxt "h7967556ag1fb9g44cfg9f85g7e8834d5c07b"
msgid "Listen, it's just -... I'm sorry, all right? Is that what you want?"
msgstr "저기, 난 그냥... 미안해. 알았어? 이러면 될까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = fb6a2678-5b21-3b31-7aaa-3f63e311e63d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:fb6a2678-5b21-3b31-7aaa-3f63e311e63d
msgctxt "h69700262g8463g4cfcg976dg32f69d325ced"
msgid ""
"My thoughts exactly. I want to go before anyone else thanks me for saving "
"their tails."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fd0ccf48-05c2-1b85-c475-90127981e84b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_ForgingOfTheHeart_State_KarlachSecondUpgrade = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithAstarion:fd0ccf48-05c2-1b85-c475-90127981e84b
msgctxt "h74cfc357g33fag4bffg905eg9b33c4d9975a"
msgid "Not staying for a cuddle?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 0fc2f3c7-687e-e4af-6fea-93c4bca7ef57
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow:0fc2f3c7-687e-e4af-6fea-93c4bca7ef57
msgctxt "h17a5a8ceg054bg4229gba85g678e86d23711"
msgid ""
"I would have you by my side in Menzoberranzan when our work on the surface "
"is done."
msgstr "지상에서의 일이 끝나면 너를 멘조베란잔으로 데려가 내 곁에 두겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 13d5ed92-757c-2d75-d3f8-8bf5b13fc6ac
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow:13d5ed92-757c-2d75-d3f8-8bf5b13fc6ac
msgctxt "h84aaff87gd23cg4247ga5dcg6943f012fdf8"
msgid "I'm glad we did this - I enjoyed it more than the battle."
msgstr "이렇게 되어서 기쁘군. 전투보다 즐거웠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 165e01e4-2e1c-b268-42d6-006044768287
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow:165e01e4-2e1c-b268-42d6-006044768287
msgctxt "hae308b74ge678g4f1ag9da2g61d54e6417d9"
msgid ""
"Perhaps that is what I deserve. I have failed Her. The weapon I seek is "
"nowhere to be found."
msgstr "어쩌면 내게 합당한 처사인지도 모르지. 그분을 실망시켰으니. 내가 찾던 무기는 아무 데서도 발견할 수 없었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 18da2223-e583-97db-96ed-eb7ffb3028db
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 15
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_NightWithDrow_TookControl = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_DARK_URGE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow:18da2223-e583-97db-96ed-eb7ffb3028db
msgctxt "h2e6b22f3g46f5g4bbdg99cfg573d157f35a3"
msgid "<i>Pry into the heart of her fears.</i>"
msgstr "<i>그녀의 마음을 비틀어 열고 공포심을 파고든다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 18da2223-e583-97db-96ed-eb7ffb3028db
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 15
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_NightWithDrow_TookControl = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow:18da2223-e583-97db-96ed-eb7ffb3028db
msgctxt "h922cffd2gf5d4g4b19g8c7cg4c39e6587dcc"
msgid "<i>Push deeper into her fears.</i>"
msgstr "<i>그녀의 공포 속으로 더 깊이 파고든다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 1a2c0df4-e3d1-2a57-79ca-04f7b39a8934
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow:1a2c0df4-e3d1-2a57-79ca-04f7b39a8934
msgctxt "h1f28fd23g43c8g43b7gb6a7g61c947f341aa"
msgid "How is that possible?"
msgstr "어떻게 가능한 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 20cb224b-8a92-3791-656d-3bf43ba236c3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow:20cb224b-8a92-3791-656d-3bf43ba236c3
msgctxt "h7c58ef79gf8d0g46b6g97cag5de6c944ce54"
msgid "I'm sorry - I meant no harm."
msgstr "미안하군. 해치려던 건 아니었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 237740ea-2316-d51c-52cf-e26e5dd1f49c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow:237740ea-2316-d51c-52cf-e26e5dd1f49c
msgctxt "h06bb1a8ag9c39g4ccag8b23g0f12554c688b"
msgid "And you shall have me."
msgstr "그렇다면 날 가지게 될 것이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 2775a3a1-6512-c45e-335b-1cd1ce321074
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow:2775a3a1-6512-c45e-335b-1cd1ce321074
msgctxt "h1b71344fg7d60g470egbdf6g34f2f9a97d2a"
msgid ""
"So much that has happened since I left the Underdark is like a dream of "
"somebody else's life. I... do not know myself anymore."
msgstr "언더다크를 떠난 뒤로 겪은 그 많은 일들은 마치 누군가의 꿈인 것만 같아. 난... 더 이상 내가 누구인지 모르겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2a8044d0-9b76-bd34-7b2b-82b091116f03
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow:2a8044d0-9b76-bd34-7b2b-82b091116f03
msgctxt "h9593d90agef9ag42edgb10agd6fed8a1df17"
msgid "<i>Do as she says.</i>"
msgstr "<i>시키는 대로 한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 2ac70e3d-7588-4994-9c63-a3b5a2c9397d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow:2ac70e3d-7588-4994-9c63-a3b5a2c9397d
msgctxt "h12839c9cg0ee2g45aegb241g8e10ac9ecbde"
msgid ""
"I could say the same of you. There is something about you that disturbs me."
msgstr "같은 말을 해야겠는걸. 너에겐 날 불안하게 만드는 무언가가 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3060b9e5-eec5-cf9f-063a-b28ce0848b35
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow:3060b9e5-eec5-cf9f-063a-b28ce0848b35
msgctxt "ha9bed6b0g7805g4c3cg8080g2f858d22e4c3"
msgid "Is this a seduction or a sacrifice?"
msgstr "유혹인가, 제물을 바치려는 건가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 30b2fe3b-7d39-d327-5cb9-517ca69f1d50
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow:30b2fe3b-7d39-d327-5cb9-517ca69f1d50
msgctxt "h1f54e5e5gd960g4322g8248gde13f5a3561e"
msgid "The weapon you sought - I have it. It blocks Her influence."
msgstr "당신이 찾던 그 무기, 나에게 있어. 그게 절대자의 영향력을 막은 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 33bd99f9-fad6-96c4-e9eb-a308c545cc9d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow:33bd99f9-fad6-96c4-e9eb-a308c545cc9d
msgctxt "h260b4d86g3502g44bega8b1gd7c6af9c85df"
msgid "You're here - good. Come with me."
msgstr "여기 있었군, 좋다. 따라와라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 3500a3e5-d7b4-1c43-415f-118a72b0affb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow:3500a3e5-d7b4-1c43-415f-118a72b0affb
msgctxt "hf2c971d1g1eedg4c72ga89eg087f38727146"
msgid "Now, lie down."
msgstr "그러면, 눕거라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3635d5f8-904c-ff04-eaf0-12d85b4733fb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow:3635d5f8-904c-ff04-eaf0-12d85b4733fb
msgctxt "hfe677950g807fg48bega3d4gd0ee8513fb1b"
msgid "There's no shame in being afraid."
msgstr "두려움을 느낀다고 부끄러워해야 할 이유는 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 44960ca7-3e87-9990-b729-e40ff235f84b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow:44960ca7-3e87-9990-b729-e40ff235f84b
msgctxt "h380ed9e5g23d7g4ea3ga044g2185f66fa6ce"
msgid "You are right... but I cannot deny what my heart tells me."
msgstr "맞는 말이지만... 내 마음의 목소리를 부정하지 못하겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 46616b2e-b3e2-eaea-8300-78e2a5a716be
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow:46616b2e-b3e2-eaea-8300-78e2a5a716be
msgctxt "hb4a6927cg31abg43cbgbc79g5d3fdc4b5353"
msgid "If this is a lie, it is a dangerous one. Show me."
msgstr "거짓말이라면 각오해야 할 거야. 보여 줘."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 474b9514-1213-b2e7-0b36-039a9483a309
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow:474b9514-1213-b2e7-0b36-039a9483a309
msgctxt "h5d199fa9g686eg4ab1g9098g6cd3845d4319"
msgid "Don't you think your mind shows you the truth?"
msgstr "마음이 진실을 보여준다고 생각하지 않나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 4a2dad79-e20f-855e-41d0-89f136c6c9e6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow:4a2dad79-e20f-855e-41d0-89f136c6c9e6
msgctxt "h368aad7fg6d7dg43efgb17cg708007ccdaae"
msgid "Then go - rest. We will discuss our next move in the morning."
msgstr "가서 쉬어라. 앞으로 어떻게 할지 아침에 얘기를 나누도록 하자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 4d633ec3-d8fc-85fc-9922-97180c308302
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_NightWithDrow_Satisfied = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow:4d633ec3-d8fc-85fc-9922-97180c308302
msgctxt "h9ef8f1fag673ag437bg941cgef152c36bf73"
msgid "I must pray, and you must rest. Tomorrow we will have fresh orders."
msgstr "난 기도해야겠고, 넌 쉬어야 해. 내일이면 새 명령이 내려질 테지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 51aecf09-cd02-25eb-f7c6-14380ac6c20f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow:51aecf09-cd02-25eb-f7c6-14380ac6c20f
msgctxt "hecac19c5gc0bag41b2g9bd0g4f0e73c4bf3f"
msgid ""
"*She flinches as layers of her psyche peel back, revealing the scars of a "
"life spent anticipating a knife in the back.*"
msgstr ""
"*그녀의 마음 속 껍질 한 겹이 벗겨지며, 등 뒤에 칼이 꽂힐 것을 걱정하며 보낸 삶의 흉터를 드러냅니다. 이에 그녀는 움찔합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 547b1f6e-97b5-cee6-c2dd-864ae0ac9b3e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow:547b1f6e-97b5-cee6-c2dd-864ae0ac9b3e
msgctxt "h019e14b3g41a7g47f5gae9fgb238a0e0914b"
msgid "There's more to you than I thought."
msgstr "당신은 내 생각보다 복잡한 사람이더군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 59452165-6e09-7457-6386-31b400242bba
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow:59452165-6e09-7457-6386-31b400242bba
msgctxt "hf19449c4gc52dg4fe8gb497gd91d1ce02489"
msgid "The Absolute isn't what you think it is."
msgstr "절대자는 당신이 생각하는 그런 존재가 아니야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 5bdd3994-9569-7b36-11c9-5fb1c928a5f0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow:5bdd3994-9569-7b36-11c9-5fb1c928a5f0
msgctxt "h2c5604fbg1291g460bga9d6ge2d3dffd1b74"
msgid "*The artefact pulses softly, sending out a warning. It is afraid.*"
msgstr "*아티펙트가 경고의 의미로 가볍게 맥동합니다. 두려워하고 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5ecc6a64-a28f-3d49-70b0-55551626b281
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow:5ecc6a64-a28f-3d49-70b0-55551626b281
msgctxt "h8140f0ccga6e1g43bfg9880g347dcba2b6cb"
msgid "Care to tell me why?"
msgstr "어째서인지 알려주지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 5f5a7e40-f00a-0056-0ca0-b2961edb0ca1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_NightWithDrow_Annoyed = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow:5f5a7e40-f00a-0056-0ca0-b2961edb0ca1
msgctxt "ha419c115gf1b7g4ff8g8c80gd5cd140e6362"
msgid ""
"I harnessed my fear long ago - it sharpens me. You would do well to do the "
"same."
msgstr "나는 오래 전에 두려움을 길들였어. 두려움은 나를 날카롭게 만들지. 너도 길들이는 게 좋을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 607ded2c-d0ff-33f6-7078-2432ab5a8640
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow:607ded2c-d0ff-33f6-7078-2432ab5a8640
msgctxt "hd2dac7fdg941cg4e6egbabcgb85df6d9349b"
msgid ""
"*The memories of countless dead, slain too soon - not just enemies, but "
"family, friends, lovers.*"
msgstr "*너무 일찍 죽임당한 수많은 자들에 대한 기억입니다. 적뿐만 아니라, 가족과 친구, 사랑하는 이들까지.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 66e560c1-ea60-696e-b226-868f87d329ad
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow:66e560c1-ea60-696e-b226-868f87d329ad
msgctxt "hbc366b46g992fg4cf0g83cagcc0210f9717d"
msgid "Curiosity - there's more to you than I thought."
msgstr "호기심. 당신은 내 생각보다 복잡한 사람이더군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 66fd79fe-2a21-fcaa-0c8c-b5b989d504d7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow:66fd79fe-2a21-fcaa-0c8c-b5b989d504d7
msgctxt "h333c6178gd7c4g47e2g9947g39863d226a8a"
msgid "<i>Don't let the Urge ruin the moment. Desire. Focus on desire.</i>"
msgstr "<i>충동이 이 순간을 망치게 두지 않는다. 욕망에 집중한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 67fdcdeb-57cc-4694-5ae1-4a9e6f96e4f7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow:67fdcdeb-57cc-4694-5ae1-4a9e6f96e4f7
msgctxt "hc0e3fe86g1b35g493dg9ed1g8fe7756b2df8"
msgid ""
"This is blasphemy... but so much that has happened since I left the "
"Underdark is like a dream of somebody else's life. I... do not know myself "
"anymore."
msgstr ""
"이건 신성모독이야... 그렇지만 언더다크를 떠난 뒤로 겪은 그 많은 일들은 마치 누군가의 꿈인 것만 같았지. 난... 더 이상 내가 "
"누구인지 모르겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 69255d76-5902-0892-9f69-8de8d56f3105
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow:69255d76-5902-0892-9f69-8de8d56f3105
msgctxt "h446f5d61g755bg4120gbae3gdb3ab32a7eb1"
msgid ""
"If She told me to, I would. But I do not hear Her... and perhaps that is a "
"sign that you must live."
msgstr "그리 명하신다면 따라야겠지. 하지만 그분의 목소리는 들리지 않아... 어쩌면 그것이 네가 죽어선 안 된다는 신호일지도."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 762e06d3-c4a9-8169-f1ff-c6621a2e72e4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow:762e06d3-c4a9-8169-f1ff-c6621a2e72e4
msgctxt "hda52f25fge7c3g449cga49fg87e7d7ac9b9a"
msgid "You learn fast."
msgstr "배움이 빠르구나."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7674ffa8-512c-4f96-4a2c-89e3e5470828
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow:7674ffa8-512c-4f96-4a2c-89e3e5470828
msgctxt "ha328e12dgbbedg435cg8f56g3216f1474760"
msgid "Not this. I want to leave."
msgstr "이건 아니야. 가야겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7a494769-5ab7-7f4d-a85a-feae01394318
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow:7a494769-5ab7-7f4d-a85a-feae01394318
msgctxt "h36daf935g0f8fg4094gb790g0b19546296b1"
msgid "<i>Focus on her desire.</i>"
msgstr "<i>그녀의 욕망에 집중한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 7adc1c03-9e07-92d9-1ae1-ad1ca55e702b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow:7adc1c03-9e07-92d9-1ae1-ad1ca55e702b
msgctxt "h9b5e41c4g6d6cg4767gbfd7g372313359e54"
msgid "Neither. It is an instruction."
msgstr "둘 다 아니야. 이건 명령이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 7bdbe85e-8fc9-a491-a539-57f4c6eee070
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow:7bdbe85e-8fc9-a491-a539-57f4c6eee070
msgctxt "h91d44a05g28dcg4e2bg9006gb7ed87e9dcab"
msgid ""
"*And half-hidden at the centre of her desire, you discover something "
"unexpected - fear.*"
msgstr "*그리고 그녀의 욕망의 한가운데, 반쯤 가려진 것이 있습니다. 예상하지 못한 것입니다. 공포.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 804e37bc-c610-631b-aec4-5e9bf01a462e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow:804e37bc-c610-631b-aec4-5e9bf01a462e
msgctxt "h048118cegf6aag4cb5ga8f1g6e98635f01e9"
msgid ""
"Not a lie, a test. Your orders are to kill those who have the weapon. Would "
"you kill me?"
msgstr "거짓말이 아니라 시험이야. 그 무기를 지닌 자를 죽이라는 게 당신이 받은 명령이었지. 날 죽일 건가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 8237d0b1-d279-06b8-230a-c4d34fd93234
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow:8237d0b1-d279-06b8-230a-c4d34fd93234
msgctxt "hdb0a42bbg5bbfg46d7g9eaagb57661c71fe4"
msgid "Then leave. You would only have disappointed me."
msgstr "그럼 떠나라. 너는 나를 실망시켰을 뿐이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 82ba5722-8b96-d777-3d4d-c15b08c08ea6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow:82ba5722-8b96-d777-3d4d-c15b08c08ea6
msgctxt "hdfb3aed1gfa80g4a25gb9a2g9819884b82c6"
msgid "You don't need to ask. Look. Let our minds touch."
msgstr "물을 필요가 없는걸. 봐. 마음끼리 닿게 하자고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 89d16291-f98c-7105-2759-38b62ffc263b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_NightWithDrow_Satisfied = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow:89d16291-f98c-7105-2759-38b62ffc263b
msgctxt "h47bbad5fgbad4g42f0g9b34g8f5afc129771"
msgid ""
"It screams. It silences the Absolute, and it screams. What is it? What are "
"you?"
msgstr "비명을 질러대고 있어. 절대자님을 침묵시키다가, 이젠 비명을 지르다니. 그건 뭐지? 넌 대체 뭐야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 963e42c7-1b02-b695-f7d0-c44a20b7a49b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_NightWithDrow_Annoyed = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow:963e42c7-1b02-b695-f7d0-c44a20b7a49b
msgctxt "hff96d69fgcd52g4bf5gb220g8e64e10367c5"
msgid "Leave. <i>Now.</i>"
msgstr "가라. <i>당장.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 9918683c-8548-c41d-7296-338cfb75fbc1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow:9918683c-8548-c41d-7296-338cfb75fbc1
msgctxt "h81000106g7bb0g44d2g89eegf6c342302d66"
msgid "You are right."
msgstr "옳은 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 9c8f12be-dd16-33f6-e4c3-76a735378c9d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow:9c8f12be-dd16-33f6-e4c3-76a735378c9d
msgctxt "h796beb74g3291g4bb3ga989g8f968e048886"
msgid "That was not yours to see."
msgstr "네겐 볼 자격이 없었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9e9f1e64-45ee-69be-fb64-20560f73b51f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow:9e9f1e64-45ee-69be-fb64-20560f73b51f
msgctxt "h615bd7a2g4d59g4f01ga632g208269b15bc9"
msgid "Maybe She has abandoned you."
msgstr "어쩌면 당신을 버렸나 보지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 9fecb335-bee2-b9cd-4a19-eb2ca410ae0d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow:9fecb335-bee2-b9cd-4a19-eb2ca410ae0d
msgctxt "hf76baa97g0964g4d30g9948gc71d0f9cec6d"
msgid "*An image of her naked body against yours flashes into your mind.*"
msgstr "*당신의 벗은 몸과 맞닿은 그녀의 나체가 순간 머릿속에서 번득입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = a3ef9a24-40c1-17b9-0bcf-f0a932e3c11f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow:a3ef9a24-40c1-17b9-0bcf-f0a932e3c11f
msgctxt "h967fcbb0g5fd1g4147gb9e3g27b95e6885e0"
msgid "Now, silence. Lie down."
msgstr "이제, 조용히. 누워라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a8029545-1695-fada-577e-987d7cebbb49
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow:a8029545-1695-fada-577e-987d7cebbb49
msgctxt "h3e8bb659g4e50g4d7fgb3a1g3257e3208bce"
msgid "Then your doubt is a dangerous thing. Push it to one side."
msgstr "그렇다면 당신의 의심은 위험한 것이로군. 의심은 내려둬."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = a8188a9b-e713-9c4d-523e-b9d44af80462
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow:a8188a9b-e713-9c4d-523e-b9d44af80462
msgctxt "h538fa24eg395eg494ag831ag378b7fb09cc3"
msgid "I have seen your mind - I know everything I need to know."
msgstr "네 마음속을 보았어. 알아야 하는 건 다 알고 있다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = a8e735c5-67a9-22d3-6a5f-8a53739dd48d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow:a8e735c5-67a9-22d3-6a5f-8a53739dd48d
msgctxt "h72ea3be1gcce9g4ca9g8339g02b2ace403fd"
msgid "Speak to me. Tell me what is in your heart."
msgstr "말해봐. 마음속에 무얼 담아두었는지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = ad3dcd68-61b0-cd51-3249-fff58f99e3a2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow:ad3dcd68-61b0-cd51-3249-fff58f99e3a2
msgctxt "h67e8d84eg623cg4cb6g9545gbbd68d04b55d"
msgid "No. I want the truth. I want to hear it in your voice, not in my mind."
msgstr "아니. 난 진실을 원해. 내 마음이 아닌 네 목소리로 듣고 싶어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = b0334245-f0b2-a7ac-58c6-f17a10d3b0a4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow:b0334245-f0b2-a7ac-58c6-f17a10d3b0a4
msgctxt "hc7ad251cgf1a7g43f6g8dbdge8e8fd15b2a2"
msgid ""
"The Absolute was silent, and - strange to say - that brought me comfort."
msgstr "절대자께서 침묵하시자 이상한 말이지만 마음이 평온해졌지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b06a6183-d9cc-525e-af1f-b6eb95a58f81
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow:b06a6183-d9cc-525e-af1f-b6eb95a58f81
msgctxt "ha2e154d5gbb0fg4bfbgb05eg68a8ed9105b1"
msgid "I wanted a bit of fun, not a heart-to-heart."
msgstr "난 그저 가볍게 재미 좀 보려는 것뿐이었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b177bbdc-a567-b859-b77e-9b1050ba0e76
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow:b177bbdc-a567-b859-b77e-9b1050ba0e76
msgctxt "h996f682agda96g4fdega0e3g1911b982d5ae"
msgid "I think we need to know each other a little better first."
msgstr "먼저 서로에 대해 좀 더 알아가야 할 것 같은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = b9aef978-fdb0-91e2-15db-84279b654767
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow:b9aef978-fdb0-91e2-15db-84279b654767
msgctxt "he2228eb1g6521g4e93gb2d9g72e0aad8b9c2"
msgid ""
"Quiet - if She hears you, She will kill us both. I have felt Her love, but I "
"have also seen Her wrath. Those who turn from Her grace die screaming."
msgstr ""
"조용. 그분께서 들으신다면 우리를 죽이실 거야. 난 그분의 사랑을 겪었지만, 그분의 분노도 보았어. 그분의 은혜에서 등을 돌리는 자들은 "
"비명을 지르며 죽게 되지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ba9015d9-8db7-c5de-b01c-478a614df86f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow:ba9015d9-8db7-c5de-b01c-478a614df86f
msgctxt "he02b25e1ge78dg448ag8e78g3e81b5c5e2bd"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = bb6fdab5-1d7f-d999-bbc6-a995401954dd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow:bb6fdab5-1d7f-d999-bbc6-a995401954dd
msgctxt "h21e29c5ag8526g49c4g98d2gfc8e95ce0dd8"
msgid ""
"As did I. During the battle, my mind raced, my blood burned... I was "
"righteous. But tonight, I only heard your breath and your voice."
msgstr ""
"나도 그랬어. 전투 중엔 가슴이 두근대고, 피가 끓어올랐어... 난 정의를 행하고 있었지. 그렇지만 오늘 밤은, 네 숨소리와 목소리만 "
"들렸어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = be2b0c41-da3d-5526-7ceb-9e2b4a9794db
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow:be2b0c41-da3d-5526-7ceb-9e2b4a9794db
msgctxt "h15794367gcfc2g4645gb931g4b8d8086598b"
msgid "I only heard your breath and your voice."
msgstr "네 숨결과 목소리만이 들렸지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bfce9a58-05c6-05c3-8229-776f249be5e0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow:bfce9a58-05c6-05c3-8229-776f249be5e0
msgctxt "h54720a07g00cbg4004g8374g501d9ec9fa20"
msgid "You're nothing but a coward."
msgstr "당신은 그저 겁쟁이일 뿐이었군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = c028e2c1-e2b7-23fc-90d5-adace8d1b69e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow:c028e2c1-e2b7-23fc-90d5-adace8d1b69e
msgctxt "h2afb9045gdd01g4e18ga1b0g2a7930062322"
msgid "Do not speak. Just do as I say."
msgstr "말은 그만. 내가 시키는 대로만 하거라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = c045e218-e7cb-5196-d904-f3377895f25f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow:c045e218-e7cb-5196-d904-f3377895f25f
msgctxt "hf57f07e5g283eg4253g86d3g59281d93d11c"
msgid ""
"The moment we were alone together, something changed. I felt it, and you "
"must have felt it too."
msgstr "우리가 단둘이 있게 되었을 때, 무엇인가가 바뀌는 게 분명 느껴졌어. 너도 마찬가지일 테지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = c8d21404-bbe4-dd5e-d646-0aaf4ec47f1f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_NightWithDrow_Annoyed = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow:c8d21404-bbe4-dd5e-d646-0aaf4ec47f1f
msgctxt "he540ba2fg419cg484fg823ag6693839f3655"
msgid "You are incapable of harming me. Get out of my sight."
msgstr "넌 날 해칠 수 없어. 내 눈앞에서 썩 꺼져라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cad74888-c236-c786-1a0f-d570f375576d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow:cad74888-c236-c786-1a0f-d570f375576d
msgctxt "h275ba322g9881g4903gba5eg3361ac3ebaab"
msgid "This isn't my idea of a good time."
msgstr "이건 '좋은 시간'이 아닌데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = cb8ab63d-bfe2-54bd-13c3-46d159f650b0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow:cb8ab63d-bfe2-54bd-13c3-46d159f650b0
msgctxt "h30f4cde8g1a15g45d2g95fcgfc301c2e71c1"
msgid "The Absolute fell silent."
msgstr "절대자님의 목소리가 사라졌어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = ccf65ea5-b9c4-199c-f220-9041fd65792a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow:ccf65ea5-b9c4-199c-f220-9041fd65792a
msgctxt "h6ffb6f3cga40dg40b7gbe45g707e83cd379e"
msgid ""
"Your obedience will make this more enjoyable for both of us. Tell me what "
"you want."
msgstr "네가 복종하면 우리 둘 모두에게 더 즐겁겠지. 무얼 원하는지 말해보거라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cde700b9-ef85-dc7e-eb97-7bafef53f0b9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow:cde700b9-ef85-dc7e-eb97-7bafef53f0b9
msgctxt "hf77b675eg420ag4887gb8fbged2b668a0774"
msgid "<i>Do as she says.</i>"
msgstr "<i>시키는 대로 한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cec2f9ab-7ce2-8584-6c3d-d07a2da26b77
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_NightWithDrow_TookControl = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_DARK_URGE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow:cec2f9ab-7ce2-8584-6c3d-d07a2da26b77
msgctxt "hd02345c2g5ad5g4de3gb323g1a1d472aa74d"
msgid "<i>Pry into the heart of her fears.</i>"
msgstr "<i>그녀의 마음을 비틀어 열고 공포심을 파고든다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cec2f9ab-7ce2-8584-6c3d-d07a2da26b77
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_NightWithDrow_TookControl = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow:cec2f9ab-7ce2-8584-6c3d-d07a2da26b77
msgctxt "h59695b9fg8ccfg4260g921dg79c40e07418e"
msgid "<i>Push deeper into her fears.</i>"
msgstr "<i>그녀의 공포 속으로 더 깊이 파고든다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = d106e969-5f5f-900c-9f5a-b2fe5468bf9e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Event_DUKillMinthara = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow:d106e969-5f5f-900c-9f5a-b2fe5468bf9e
msgctxt "h4cb4320bg660eg40e8g95b1g9072b9e843b0"
msgid "*You draw her closer, with all the vim of a lover's first embrace.*"
msgstr "*당신은 마치 연인의 첫 번째 입맞춤 같은 열정으로 그녀를 끌어당깁니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d10ae7e1-33f3-0862-e30b-1e2e5f0e9d3c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow:d10ae7e1-33f3-0862-e30b-1e2e5f0e9d3c
msgctxt "hc15ab43cg66f1g4e02gaee5g033f7494e4f3"
msgid "Passion - I enjoyed that more than the battle."
msgstr "열정. 전투보다도 즐거웠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d47d47c6-391f-6418-fc77-5e11bfd2bb7e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow_Upset(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow:d47d47c6-391f-6418-fc77-5e11bfd2bb7e
msgctxt "h0c125b9cg8fe4g4c5agb5c7g84a8ba7541e7"
msgid "Regret - I wanted a bit of fun, not a heart-to-heart."
msgstr "후회. 가벼운 마음으로 재미 좀 보려던 것뿐이었는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d6c645cf-b077-20a9-8722-f8f4c510a32d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow:d6c645cf-b077-20a9-8722-f8f4c510a32d
msgctxt "h164dc4cagbf77g4a48g826dgf585201f6eb3"
msgid "I want you."
msgstr "당신을 원해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = dacc56ea-89f4-243f-d991-bb5a4007afd9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow:dacc56ea-89f4-243f-d991-bb5a4007afd9
msgctxt "hf4ee2f03gd18eg4864g801egb7587cbc7a1e"
msgid "Your question is heresy. You should pray for forgiveness."
msgstr "이단적인 질문이군. 용서를 구하는 기도를 하셔야겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = db6d96c0-10dd-4e3f-7639-77131b425c59
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow:db6d96c0-10dd-4e3f-7639-77131b425c59
msgctxt "hba95ada1g811bg4a22g9921g44c5702cb2cb"
msgid ""
"<i>Open your mind to her. Reveal all that you know about the artefact.</i>"
msgstr "<i>민타라에게 마음을 열어 보인다. 아티팩트에 대해 알고 있는 모든 정보를 드러낸다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = dcb0798f-bf98-9bea-03ab-3f9b9c2a8599
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - ORI_HadSexWithMinthara(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow:dcb0798f-bf98-9bea-03ab-3f9b9c2a8599
msgctxt "h19e42890gff07g4bfdgbff1g73cadef09eaa"
msgid ""
"*As your bodies lock together, so do your minds. Her whole being is laid "
"bare before you.*"
msgstr "*당신과 그녀의 몸이 서로 맞물리면서, 마음도 함께 맞물립니다. 그녀의 존재 전체가 당신 앞에 벌거벗고 누워 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e3c0f66d-e27c-f86f-d1de-949bac08048f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow:e3c0f66d-e27c-f86f-d1de-949bac08048f
msgctxt "h7c78b55ag6e32g448dga6e2gcb18094c0c88"
msgid "<i>Imagine snapping her neck.</i>"
msgstr "<i>목을 부러뜨리는 상상을 한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = ee315e05-2ab5-8d35-a6fc-00c410c30f56
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_NightWithDrow_Annoyed = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow:ee315e05-2ab5-8d35-a6fc-00c410c30f56
msgctxt "h255aa14fge5a5g43acg9a85gcfc10153c51d"
msgid "My body could have been yours, but some things are mine alone."
msgstr "내 몸은 가질 수 있었겠지만, 어떤 것들은 나만의 소유다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = efffb4da-3a31-3665-03c2-de841b77dda1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow:efffb4da-3a31-3665-03c2-de841b77dda1
msgctxt "h77185998gbbb8g4802g93fbg7b8a24c0c6e8"
msgid "I don't believe you."
msgstr "거짓말."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = f399737b-b043-b1bb-569c-0869158f78d4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow:f399737b-b043-b1bb-569c-0869158f78d4
msgctxt "hc5db0c4fg96a1g4406g8e59g468fe565793a"
msgid ""
"The Absolute owns my mind. I cannot remember a time when her voice did not "
"fill it. Except tonight... tonight the Absolute was silent."
msgstr ""
"절대자께서 내 마음을 소유하신다. 그분의 목소리로 채워지지 않았던 때가 기억나지 않아. 오늘 밤을 제외하면... 오늘 밤 그분께선 "
"침묵하셨다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = fc14b903-faea-0672-f5c9-672fef892401
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow_Upset(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow:fc14b903-faea-0672-f5c9-672fef892401
msgctxt "h22959f89g7ffbg4727g9ebeg6f9aa1028886"
msgid "Except tonight. Tonight, I wanted this - for myself."
msgstr "오늘 밤만 제외하고. 오늘 밤엔 내 자신이 이걸 원했어. 스스로."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fe3fbf18-6645-3201-efc8-8c15694a1208
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow:fe3fbf18-6645-3201-efc8-8c15694a1208
msgctxt "h12523c00gf279g4d0egaa92g982932e46bb0"
msgid "The Absolute can't reach you while you're with me."
msgstr "내 곁에 있는 동안엔 절대자가 당신에게 간섭할 수 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = feec0f8e-7b78-9ac8-cb29-3a6704e4bfc1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithDrow:feec0f8e-7b78-9ac8-cb29-3a6704e4bfc1
msgctxt "hd20f5310g549ag4a6egbdc3g16650a354686"
msgid "Or a sign that She has abandoned me."
msgstr "혹은 그분께서 날 버리셨다는 뜻일지도."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 0103e29b-b1ca-132d-c831-2929c0e7ab6d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:0103e29b-b1ca-132d-c831-2929c0e7ab6d
msgctxt "h1da8ba2ag70b0g4144g92cfge8153cef2a87"
msgid "Sounds like you just need a little more liquid inspiration."
msgstr "술이 좀 더 들어가야겠는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 01e61b8e-c416-1f3e-5d03-8d961d7dc260
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_ForgingOfTheHeart_State_KarlachSecondUpgrade = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:01e61b8e-c416-1f3e-5d03-8d961d7dc260
msgctxt "h1b39c916g0de8g4025ga82fg8c211dbf1bd0"
msgid "Shadowheart..."
msgstr "섀도하트..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 022a51e2-ec71-7d19-da92-63415bb7a767
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:022a51e2-ec71-7d19-da92-63415bb7a767
msgctxt "h723e55c7ga89fg4566g8764gaf9d28f83026"
msgid "I hope there'll be more to come."
msgstr "이런 순간이 더 있었으면 좋겠다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 02960967-b62d-cf4b-736c-43999433345c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:02960967-b62d-cf4b-736c-43999433345c
msgctxt "h1966fb38g2829g470egac53gffe7a527b2f3"
msgid "It helps me create all new memories."
msgstr "내가 새로운 기억을 만들어 가는 데 도움이 돼."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 02985796-df83-f63d-53f0-dab17c500318
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:02985796-df83-f63d-53f0-dab17c500318
msgctxt "hc29cd5b8g093ag4091gb3f4g5e252b06a6b9"
msgid "Bashful come the light of day?"
msgstr "밝은 곳에선 수줍음을 타는 편인가 보지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 03d034be-36b8-f28f-0611-10b74417afa0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_ForgingOfTheHeart_State_KarlachSecondUpgrade = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:03d034be-36b8-f28f-0611-10b74417afa0
msgctxt "h1aa3b9dcg8007g457fg9f0dg772d3ab3b271"
msgid "<i>Let the moment pass.</i>"
msgstr "<i>그 순간이 지나가게 한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 09e73dc9-547b-b6d3-032a-a06e4ffb22bd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:09e73dc9-547b-b6d3-032a-a06e4ffb22bd
msgctxt "hfd834919g8497g47dbga912g20168e26b967"
msgid "It's not convenient - it's true."
msgstr "질문을 피하는 게 아니야, 그게 진실이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 0a38c9a7-eda2-fc8c-586e-98121101f6cf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:0a38c9a7-eda2-fc8c-586e-98121101f6cf
msgctxt "h27b955f3gd6c8g4d14gb310g4bc116e8e188"
msgid "Now tell me something about yourself."
msgstr "이제 너에 대해 좀 얘기해 줘."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 0a84751f-207f-1d74-67b9-b4924125cccf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:0a84751f-207f-1d74-67b9-b4924125cccf
msgctxt "ha499238dgcbf2g4c5cga3a5gc52c8788e389"
msgid "Oh, no. I provided the refreshments. You can supply the entertainment."
msgstr "오, 아니지. 마실 건 내가 가져왔잖아. 재미는 네가 담당해 줘."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0de2d313-5399-356f-2be8-bfdf89357e4c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SC_NightWithShadowheart_SharedPersonal(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:0de2d313-5399-356f-2be8-bfdf89357e4c
msgctxt "h290a80eegb859g4018g98f8g57c435cc09a4"
msgid ""
"<i>Tell her about your death - how you'd been attacked by a Gur tribe and "
"'saved' by Cazador.</i>"
msgstr "<i>당신의 죽음에 대해 이야기해준다. 구르 집단에게 공격받고 카사도어에게 '구해졌던' 이야기.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 0dfabaf6-fa1e-e748-7eb7-2060ee922b64
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:0dfabaf6-fa1e-e748-7eb7-2060ee922b64
msgctxt "h76c1bf5agee92g4d9eg8c79g972820306963"
msgid "Me too."
msgstr "나도 마찬가지야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 101101c0-aa11-6f0e-9bed-5d1ca1de8cf5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:101101c0-aa11-6f0e-9bed-5d1ca1de8cf5
msgctxt "h617bd580g6327g44a9g9ff2g9a5073da8c90"
msgid ""
"And no tadpoles, dragons, marauding goblins, or anything like that. "
"Something about <i>you</i>."
msgstr "올챙이, 드래곤, 고블린 습격대 같은 이야기 말고. <i>너</i>에 대해서 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 12add19b-cca9-1ba2-8a44-d51dd5b94bd9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:12add19b-cca9-1ba2-8a44-d51dd5b94bd9
msgctxt "hb9bda12egbfaeg4f91gb134g82242837ffc9"
msgid "<i>Thank her for the wine and leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>와인을 준 것에 감사 인사를 표하고 떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 12f2dba1-c52d-1757-1b37-bd41e68a9a71
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:12f2dba1-c52d-1757-1b37-bd41e68a9a71
msgctxt "h2020545dg230eg4cc9gbed6gcc39a20de442"
msgid "But you're sweet to notice."
msgstr "그래도 알아채주다니 참 다정하네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 1349993a-5f89-927a-6218-f1dafd096ee6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:1349993a-5f89-927a-6218-f1dafd096ee6
msgctxt "ha40b080cg85bdg4b1fgbaa5gadd79a842d3e"
msgid "A lot of the little things... they're lost to me right now."
msgstr "수많은 소소한 기억들... 내겐 지금 하나도 남아있지 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 1906af55-8ae3-510a-6b90-e5e9065ffa04
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:1906af55-8ae3-510a-6b90-e5e9065ffa04
msgctxt "h2e4a2dcfg316dg48dbga3b7g3da466948b45"
msgid "On the contrary."
msgstr "반면에."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1b666476-d49f-7d5c-2fad-bfaeb328d3b0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - e7a33d30-9eb9-a7be-9dfc-487f852022aa_OneGulp = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:1b666476-d49f-7d5c-2fad-bfaeb328d3b0
msgctxt "hbdbd830cg9c76g412bga03dgbd4639144a3d"
msgid "<i>Shrug and drink deeply.</i>"
msgstr "<i>어깨를 으쓱하고 쭉 들이켠다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 1bd621c1-2c26-e633-04a7-b6007a2ef959
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:1bd621c1-2c26-e633-04a7-b6007a2ef959
msgctxt "h1f82cb10gb01bg4e7bgb470g8ee0f7180542"
msgid ""
"Another moment won't kill them, I suppose... Well, it might, but let's take "
"that risk."
msgstr "여기서 시간 좀 더 보낸다고 큰일나진 않겠지... 뭐, 그럴지도 모르지만, 감수하자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 1c0bf19a-c48f-34c4-c703-7abcbcb8dfe1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:1c0bf19a-c48f-34c4-c703-7abcbcb8dfe1
msgctxt "hf1f8de37g4458g460dgbd70g8db4ddc0c3eb"
msgid ""
"Oh, I'm aware. Several come to mind right now... but I'm going to tempt fate "
"and say we can take our time."
msgstr "아, 나도 알아. 당장 몇 가지가 떠오르지만... 유혹을 뿌리치고 서두르지 않을래."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 1d1eb5cc-c5c2-8c7d-b07b-8db455b04efd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:1d1eb5cc-c5c2-8c7d-b07b-8db455b04efd
msgctxt "hb49c533eg10feg443egafd3g0f6392693e57"
msgid "I know. One of my many fine qualities."
msgstr "나도 알아. 내 수많은 매력 중 하나지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 1e13e3b6-bb0f-64ce-5f58-a5f393d74d70
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:1e13e3b6-bb0f-64ce-5f58-a5f393d74d70
msgctxt "h4e0c02b8gdcf6g4e13g99c3g2c04042a1a2e"
msgid "So eager. I'm surprised it took you this long."
msgstr "정말 열정적이구나. 이렇게 오래 걸렸다는 게 놀랍네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 22c85ba6-7bc9-5efb-5ece-5eabc441d212
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:22c85ba6-7bc9-5efb-5ece-5eabc441d212
msgctxt "h95b780b1g19b4g4a8egb18eg69714557cfb7"
msgid "I insist."
msgstr "꼭 들어야겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 23c35242-6562-0feb-9bbf-e909e026ede1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_ForgingOfTheHeart_State_KarlachSecondUpgrade = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:23c35242-6562-0feb-9bbf-e909e026ede1
msgctxt "h9b29bcaeg5c20g43d6g93e1g0e466a95def0"
msgid "<i>Kiss her.</i>"
msgstr "<i>그녀에게 키스한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2517eb63-8aeb-ad51-ca89-b6952d9bdf15
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:2517eb63-8aeb-ad51-ca89-b6952d9bdf15
msgctxt "h745ed607g0679g44c2g90b0g1d1369babe1b"
msgid "To victory."
msgstr "승리를 위하여."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 27236643-6444-f589-48fb-e54a8eec81d6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:27236643-6444-f589-48fb-e54a8eec81d6
msgctxt "hdaf5e53bg6f82g40b9g999egda2449774b02"
msgid "You're beautiful."
msgstr "예쁘네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 28cb785f-b0f9-0169-09d1-54dc3390e8e0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:28cb785f-b0f9-0169-09d1-54dc3390e8e0
msgctxt "h09184809g4fc8g4281gbebeg509ca4fea132"
msgid "Fair enough. I didn't mean to pry."
msgstr "좋아. 캐물으려고 한 건 아니야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 296b4198-7940-6249-0db0-0676614b8d67
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:296b4198-7940-6249-0db0-0676614b8d67
msgctxt "hcf918088g827bg439dga3d0g7f4b84825b1b"
msgid "Nothing worthwhile should be rushed anyway."
msgstr "가치 있는 것일수록 서둘러서는 안 되는 법이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 29abb945-6ed8-8132-7a5d-eae2e16b3974
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:29abb945-6ed8-8132-7a5d-eae2e16b3974
msgctxt "hfbacdac0g7843g4328gac9eg5aa3f9c31656"
msgid ""
"But I can be patient, and I think you can too. Who knows what the future "
"will bring our way?"
msgstr "하지만 난 참을 수 있어, 너도 그럴 수 있을 거야. 우리 미래에 무슨 일이 벌어질지 누가 알겠어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2a6ea2ff-cbc2-226a-c4c6-2fde66cfdab3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:2a6ea2ff-cbc2-226a-c4c6-2fde66cfdab3
msgctxt "ha6c5563fgbc21g419dg8d9fg7697a6037d71"
msgid "There's no need to thank me."
msgstr "나한테 고마워할 필요는 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2ca76033-15ff-5763-296b-2800bc1930d2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:2ca76033-15ff-5763-296b-2800bc1930d2
msgctxt "h128d7654g25b3g452fg9aedgf0387c0690e1"
msgid "You know, if you want something... I think you should take it."
msgstr "있잖아, 바라는 게 있으면... 그냥 그걸 취하는 게 좋을 것 같아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 2d6c9439-64b5-de49-0b7e-8580fcdd6221
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:2d6c9439-64b5-de49-0b7e-8580fcdd6221
msgctxt "h47a5a14cgbf21g4d23g9c10gb130b6f77766"
msgid "Heh. Not worried, are you? Rest easy."
msgstr "헤. 걱정되는 건 아니지? 안심해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 2dcd9250-7479-a6a4-302d-dfe5ea05dfc1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:2dcd9250-7479-a6a4-302d-dfe5ea05dfc1
msgctxt "h66665949gc37cg4601g9e2cga5acc6f8e848"
msgid "*She trails off. You read an invitation in her eyes.*"
msgstr "*그녀가 머뭇거립니다. 당신은 그녀의 눈빛에서 유혹을 느낍니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 2e125273-76ac-d33d-39ae-3a1697731873
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ShadowHeart_InParty_Knows_SharWorshipper = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:2e125273-76ac-d33d-39ae-3a1697731873
msgctxt "ha449cd85gc68eg435ag957fg27b269891b5b"
msgid "Where I come from, that's frowned upon."
msgstr "내가 온 곳에선, 그건 손가락질받을 일이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2f814009-9587-89cf-bec9-d214e80a335f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:2f814009-9587-89cf-bec9-d214e80a335f
msgctxt "h8e4bd0c8gb6f3g482aga8c5ga68fd21d2749"
msgid "The pain was worth it."
msgstr "그럴 가치가 있었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 33791312-c648-9622-797c-de0d3a108eee
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:33791312-c648-9622-797c-de0d3a108eee
msgctxt "h48fdcab2g5a95g452agb91age33609a91754"
msgid "It was just what I needed."
msgstr "딱 내게 필요했던 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 38d76bc7-8832-cd03-5baa-59ecda72941d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:38d76bc7-8832-cd03-5baa-59ecda72941d
msgctxt "h9f06ccb2ga12fg4e89g8745gc1417a5bcd16"
msgid "<i>Kiss her.</i>"
msgstr "<i>그녀에게 키스한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3b8248e7-59b4-81a7-11cd-facf5defebeb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:3b8248e7-59b4-81a7-11cd-facf5defebeb
msgctxt "h8ae4162cg77e9g4b99g96c3g7945b35d8471"
msgid "To friendship."
msgstr "우정을 위하여."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 43336d3d-ee97-c752-5c8b-0dcfb217093c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:43336d3d-ee97-c752-5c8b-0dcfb217093c
msgctxt "h4d0e7e26gd7c3g4b55gbabag2d9bcced46f5"
msgid "We should head back."
msgstr "이만 돌아가는 게 좋겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 43600435-e7a5-c18a-3d4b-1ca132c0457c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:43600435-e7a5-c18a-3d4b-1ca132c0457c
msgctxt "hc3f634a1gd12eg4292g9d30gd1286e49e06a"
msgid ""
"What, you're discouraged from confiding? Talking about your feelings? "
"Sounds... lonely."
msgstr "왜, 털어놓는 게 꺼려져? 자신의 감정에 대해 이야기하는 게? 참... 외로울 것 같네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 458cd6e7-458c-123f-7ec4-a70d344edfb1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:458cd6e7-458c-123f-7ec4-a70d344edfb1
msgctxt "h892af949ga824g4ff2g9a94geb21bd862a33"
msgid "A little tingle."
msgstr "조금 얼얼한걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 45e17618-65cb-dd84-65df-fe59eac4d2d6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Camp_Event_SkipSleepCutscene = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:45e17618-65cb-dd84-65df-fe59eac4d2d6
msgctxt "hf11ba7fbg84dfg4f0eg8bdbgddeb015c8334"
msgid "Nearly light. The others will be awake soon..."
msgstr "날이 거의 밝았네. 다른 사람들이 곧 깰 거야..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4a6d0384-040a-7886-5fbd-f7f07fedb777
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:4a6d0384-040a-7886-5fbd-f7f07fedb777
msgctxt "h1d36c5e6g2c26g477ega0bcg7db6fc54bacc"
msgid "What do you have in mind? Besides the bottle, that is."
msgstr "무슨 생각 하고 있어? 술 마시는 거 말고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 4ae4a70d-e3c7-8368-c401-18d19755004e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:4ae4a70d-e3c7-8368-c401-18d19755004e
msgctxt "h7655637ag94dag4f16g8437gaeba16434ad2"
msgid "Good to know. For the future..."
msgstr "알아두면 좋지. 나중을 위해서..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4b762f2f-8374-1dd1-b2c4-785cd60655ce
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_HALFORC(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SC_NightWithShadowheart_SharedPersonal(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:4b762f2f-8374-1dd1-b2c4-785cd60655ce
msgctxt "hdfdb71dag1e9eg4f14g8addgc08b4be54fed"
msgid ""
"<i>Speak of an uncertain youth, neither fully at home with humans or orcs. A "
"youth that forged resilience, self-reliance.</i>"
msgstr ""
"<i>인간이나 오크와는 완전히 다른 존재였던, 불안정한 유년 시절에 대해 말한다. 유연성과 자립심을 길러야 했던 유년 시절에 대해.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 4ba0242e-ccc7-cc4c-e3ac-60e2e8cd3474
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:4ba0242e-ccc7-cc4c-e3ac-60e2e8cd3474
msgctxt "hb7f8d500g4e0bg4ae4g85e4g3901a01cd012"
msgid ""
"Karlach. You're very beautiful, you know. I might even kiss you if I valued "
"my life a little less."
msgstr "칼라크. 넌 알겠지만 정말 아름다워. 내가 목숨을 조금만 덜 소중히 여겼다면, 너에게 키스했을지도 몰라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4c34b2d7-5a49-f0b6-e9ae-807fb754d41a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SC_NightWithShadowheart_SharedPersonal(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:4c34b2d7-5a49-f0b6-e9ae-807fb754d41a
msgctxt "h25799c09gdca4g48eegbedfgea5ac833bb60"
msgid ""
"<i>Tell her the darkness inside of you wasn't caused by an accident. It was "
"done out of love for someone.</i>"
msgstr "<i>당신 내면의 어둠이 사고로 인한 것이 아니라고 말해준다. 누군가를 향한 사랑에서 비롯된 것이라고 전한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 4c794825-7ccf-102d-06f2-ed8440feb160
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - Shadowheart_InParty_Event_RomanceHappened(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.     - ORI_Shadowheart_State_FirstRomanceHappened = True
#.   Object:
#.     - ORI_State_DatingShadowheart(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:4c794825-7ccf-102d-06f2-ed8440feb160
msgctxt "ha1755205g5c08g4ad5g985bgc39c9dad395f"
msgid "Anyway. Thank you for tonight."
msgstr "어쨌든. 오늘 밤은 고마워."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4db6be8f-1737-e0f9-bfb8-ae720eb97cd3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:4db6be8f-1737-e0f9-bfb8-ae720eb97cd3
msgctxt "h80670f96gd4aag4ec0g89e7g18fa1d31a742"
msgid "We should head back."
msgstr "이만 돌아가는 게 좋겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4e87b84c-061e-a265-eaae-b2c0020f2637
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:4e87b84c-061e-a265-eaae-b2c0020f2637
msgctxt "ha65ec6cfgd320g4d45g8a0eg9001e9de29d1"
msgid "Straight answers. Got any for me?"
msgstr "아주 솔직한 대답이야. 날 위한 건 없어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 523a509b-315c-45a7-505a-030dbbe2ea55
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart_State_Happened = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:523a509b-315c-45a7-505a-030dbbe2ea55
msgctxt "h70a10ad4gdbe0g45d1gb835gfc4cdbe129f2"
msgid "You made it. Come here - sit with me."
msgstr "왔구나. 이리 와서 내 옆에 앉아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 5381f4b0-8ec4-cfaf-1076-073ee520a0e0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:5381f4b0-8ec4-cfaf-1076-073ee520a0e0
msgctxt "he1f22237gc260g4213g88e4g33f1aecf1647"
msgid "Oh... yes. I suppose we'll have to."
msgstr "아...그래. 그래야 할 것 같네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 5f82db63-819d-089c-76de-5bcff01c7d76
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:5f82db63-819d-089c-76de-5bcff01c7d76
msgctxt "h6f270a53gbf03g419ag9f55ge0fee516d305"
msgid "I can sympathise, truly."
msgstr "진심으로 공감되네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 5ff2c4d6-2801-0629-6fad-cdd57492ac10
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:5ff2c4d6-2801-0629-6fad-cdd57492ac10
msgctxt "h378724d0g0842g43e2g8cf1g01a517ae5d66"
msgid "Oh, I'm perfectly fine, but the mood is well and truly dead."
msgstr "오, 난 괜찮아, 하지만 분위기가 완전 죽어버렸네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 60b69572-8d12-e494-571d-2a2d4aeef104
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:60b69572-8d12-e494-571d-2a2d4aeef104
msgctxt "hcd3cab6fg3572g4456g8702g49902ddd45cc"
msgid "Don't stop now. Not just as things are getting interesting..."
msgstr "지금 멈추진 마. 이제 막 상황이 흥미로워지고 있는데 말이야..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 60c17536-d65d-2818-5e98-0454f8af6885
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:60c17536-d65d-2818-5e98-0454f8af6885
msgctxt "he6a19800gbf01g4ed3g85afg405ce76933ff"
msgid "Straight answers are overrated. Where's the discovery?"
msgstr "솔직한 건 재미없어. 그럼 알아가는 재미가 없잖아?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 655ec5b7-949e-da91-fb0b-08edc340e5ce
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:655ec5b7-949e-da91-fb0b-08edc340e5ce
msgctxt "h8a068db5gfd71g4b2dg91f5g959e9654c0b7"
msgid "You don't waste time, do you?"
msgstr "시간 낭비는 싫잖아 안 그래?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 65a790f2-fe55-daae-e05d-a4718d96358a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:65a790f2-fe55-daae-e05d-a4718d96358a
msgctxt "h046d115bg2edfg4cefg935bg5719250ca7af"
msgid "<i>Smile and say nothing.</i>"
msgstr "<i>아무 말도 하지 않고 미소 짓는다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6b0332e5-b90d-8e3a-b5d3-0c5bf8d3331c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:6b0332e5-b90d-8e3a-b5d3-0c5bf8d3331c
msgctxt "h9014cb25g7feeg4c97ga4b5g1dd165f05abc"
msgid "We should do this again sometime."
msgstr "언제 또 하자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 7081a62e-65c3-b658-449e-95fcaf1c8c2c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:7081a62e-65c3-b658-449e-95fcaf1c8c2c
msgctxt "hf9502448g187ag4815g932fgf8aa7733cafb"
msgid "I... We should head back."
msgstr "난... 우리 돌아가야겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 72d72a5b-4d82-1b7b-7572-fc8b705a4e1e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_ForgingOfTheHeart_State_KarlachSecondUpgrade = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:72d72a5b-4d82-1b7b-7572-fc8b705a4e1e
msgctxt "h112dc7afg791fg4c5ag83a2gdfdcaaa5f8c7"
msgid "You know, if you want something... I think you should take it."
msgstr "있잖아, 바라는 게 있으면... 그냥 그걸 취하는 게 좋을 것 같아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 739f48c1-acf2-0b81-fc26-6b433a0516f8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:739f48c1-acf2-0b81-fc26-6b433a0516f8
msgctxt "h6e6230c2ga7bdg4d9bgb523g447c1ba280f9"
msgid ""
"You read my mind. But with your fire... our first kiss might be our last."
msgstr "내 마음을 읽었군. 하지만 네 화염으로... 우리의 첫 키스가 마지막이 될지도 몰라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 74af23c6-9a0f-5e5c-ee9c-bee49e754f71
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:74af23c6-9a0f-5e5c-ee9c-bee49e754f71
msgctxt "h57885d7ag32fag4870g94f1gbd09d8288436"
msgid "Perhaps, but please - enough about me. Sharing's bad for my complexion."
msgstr "그럴지도, 하지만 이제 내 이야기는 그만하자. 공유는 내 전문이 아니라서 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 7586be4f-0993-845d-29d5-b514f9642266
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:7586be4f-0993-845d-29d5-b514f9642266
msgctxt "h8ae88990gdebbg41b4g87fdg34d25b1adf2c"
msgid "Someone's enthusiastic. Maybe I should have brought a barrel."
msgstr "열정적인 분이 계시네. 아예 한 통을 가져올 걸 그랬나."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 77051ad8-3b65-e733-5cb2-06c47740853d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:77051ad8-3b65-e733-5cb2-06c47740853d
msgctxt "h72c94fb9g68bbg46f3gb006gfa8094bdeefd"
msgid "I should think so."
msgstr "당연히 그래야지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 78bfff24-c63e-7b54-6e7a-3c9c66b3b7bb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:78bfff24-c63e-7b54-6e7a-3c9c66b3b7bb
msgctxt "hc64d2846g86f2g4d55g9806g8aebf7d3b49f"
msgid "I'd like to think that would've happened anyway."
msgstr "그냥 어차피 일어났을 일이라고 생각하고 싶네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 79467a52-416e-acdc-cf86-468c5b10832e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:79467a52-416e-acdc-cf86-468c5b10832e
msgctxt "h190d0f0eg9176g42bagaeadg52027f8bc48b"
msgid "Heh, I did! And you remembered."
msgstr "헤, 그랬지! 기억해 줬구나."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 7c31a0f9-cf01-5f4c-4cff-8b53f61e4b43
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:7c31a0f9-cf01-5f4c-4cff-8b53f61e4b43
msgctxt "he949106ag16ceg4cc2gbc79g1eac1d028b02"
msgid "Very well, have it your way. To friendship."
msgstr "좋아, 네 식으로 하자. 우정을 위해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7cd1248a-d2b6-c642-7aa3-b5c7298b79f1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:7cd1248a-d2b6-c642-7aa3-b5c7298b79f1
msgctxt "h82377976ga30eg43feg8e29gbdbd6aee75a5"
msgid "I suppose there's not that much of a rush."
msgstr "그렇게 서두를 필요는 없겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 7d8892c3-9f4a-cae3-b2b1-cbcd089231e2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:7d8892c3-9f4a-cae3-b2b1-cbcd089231e2
msgctxt "h83a8e128g5fb6g4f40gbcd6ge7f141b89b46"
msgid "Lots of people make promises. Few keep them."
msgstr "많은 이들이 약속은 하지. 그걸 지키는 이들은 별로 없지만."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 80632e59-e766-edc3-2c21-0cdf2c872cca
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - e7a33d30-9eb9-a7be-9dfc-487f852022aa_OneGulp = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:80632e59-e766-edc3-2c21-0cdf2c872cca
msgctxt "h5a1975a0g9661g4639g881bg2e24c6fa73ac"
msgid "<i>Drain the cup in one swallow.</i>"
msgstr "<i>잔을 한 모금에 비워버린다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 81371e3d-a514-4b8c-4e97-aa9b7fc7ed34
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:81371e3d-a514-4b8c-4e97-aa9b7fc7ed34
msgctxt "hf203d96bgec1fg4129gb4e9g57f5a5302a1c"
msgid "Don't laugh... but I'm not quite sure I have anything to share."
msgstr "웃지 말고 들어... 하지만 내가 공유해 줄 게 있기는 한지조차도 모르겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 87ac6107-b343-b779-6d73-240fbd914e3a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:87ac6107-b343-b779-6d73-240fbd914e3a
msgctxt "h5fc46622g8d4dg43bfg9259gb38c8fa0a749"
msgid "Fishing for blackmail material, that's all."
msgstr "협박할 거리를 찾는 거지, 그뿐이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 89d26f8b-eed0-f442-8031-fdc5ccacbc7a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:89d26f8b-eed0-f442-8031-fdc5ccacbc7a
msgctxt "h69bb670fg9962g44a8g8794gb20ffcf518e6"
msgid "We should head back. We might be missed."
msgstr "돌아가야 해. 우리를 찾고 있을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 89fb2c89-e35c-e1c6-2f0c-18f0482f3f58
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SC_NightWithShadowheart_SharedPersonal(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:89fb2c89-e35c-e1c6-2f0c-18f0482f3f58
msgctxt "h364232dfg862bg4d2dgbaf8gf54172c3bc91"
msgid "Your turn - I insist. A little give and take is only fair."
msgstr "네 차례야. 꼭 들어야겠어. 주는 게 있으면 받는 게 있어야 공평하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8aeb732a-8655-186c-6d20-7746ce613556
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:8aeb732a-8655-186c-6d20-7746ce613556
msgctxt "h06032b79gf7fag4e52g8b96g01c7f8804ead"
msgid "<i>Let the moment pass.</i>"
msgstr "<i>이 순간이 지나가게 둔다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 8b42334c-08fb-afc8-9ac6-c714a1d9dba5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - Shadowheart_InParty_Event_RomanceHappened(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.     - ORI_Shadowheart_State_FirstRomanceHappened = True
#.   Object:
#.     - ORI_State_DatingShadowheart(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:8b42334c-08fb-afc8-9ac6-c714a1d9dba5
msgctxt "hcfe466degc353g4b3cg9621g45fb715fa34b"
msgid "Thank you for last night."
msgstr "어젯밤은 고마웠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8b69ed85-a65b-aff3-b59c-745d2a13a9c7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:8b69ed85-a65b-aff3-b59c-745d2a13a9c7
msgctxt "hd95d4cf2g7cbdg4fc0gaf92g203cadfbf9fe"
msgid "To survival."
msgstr "생존을 위하여."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 8ed313e9-5bf8-cf3f-8ce1-19edcd6f2775
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:8ed313e9-5bf8-cf3f-8ce1-19edcd6f2775
msgctxt "hf06e7d8dg60f8g437dg87a5g9458be2cbb9a"
msgid "How morbid. Yet fascinating."
msgstr "정말 소름 끼치네. 하지만 동시에 대단히 매력적이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 8ee10c06-9713-568d-a3c8-7c236698e9c4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:8ee10c06-9713-568d-a3c8-7c236698e9c4
msgctxt "h41e2f70dgcac1g4bd7g8a8cgc25128f3e4be"
msgid "But please - enough about me. Sharing's bad for my complexion."
msgstr "하지만 제발, 이제 내 이야기는 그만하자. 공유는 내 전문이 아니라서."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 9007fac5-c402-6e47-1a29-6ec741377489
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:9007fac5-c402-6e47-1a29-6ec741377489
msgctxt "h143289ccgb21dg422dga467gf2c35c02c2b5"
msgid "Good. A little mystery will keep you on your toes."
msgstr "좋아. 약간의 수수께끼도 긴장을 위해 좋지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 918b87d9-cf59-a176-6f57-dfb290b5ab16
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:918b87d9-cf59-a176-6f57-dfb290b5ab16
msgctxt "h030a051fg550bg4a65g9b4eg7d532647ed42"
msgid "Did you think I wouldn't show?"
msgstr "내가 나타나지 않을 줄 알았어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 93e55e5a-7860-6a0c-17bc-1e63fbd52d79
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:93e55e5a-7860-6a0c-17bc-1e63fbd52d79
msgctxt "h12f186fcgf67eg4734ga365g572a4c51b5ac"
msgid "My pleasure."
msgstr "나도 기뻐."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9621496d-0b97-f041-bf71-11fafbb2ba97
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:9621496d-0b97-f041-bf71-11fafbb2ba97
msgctxt "h0eeeade0g425fg4c57g82e1g94ea5a1c2e65"
msgid "Drinking wine won't help that."
msgstr "포도주를 마신다고 해결되진 않겠네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 9bce45a3-a381-4ec6-9965-5d8c39c124b5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:9bce45a3-a381-4ec6-9965-5d8c39c124b5
msgctxt "h7be19c23gc29cg4780gaf11g1d9cae9e03fe"
msgid "Go on - I insist."
msgstr "어서. 꼭 들어야겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 9bf7ac9c-d79d-41b0-c068-9932df88d0e7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:9bf7ac9c-d79d-41b0-c068-9932df88d0e7
msgctxt "h01119aebg74bfg4f3bg8946g513d15edc176"
msgid "To insatiable urges."
msgstr "채울 수 없는 충동을 위하여."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 9cc525b1-daeb-766b-864a-4bb45fe52ec6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:9cc525b1-daeb-766b-864a-4bb45fe52ec6
msgctxt "h3f615a62gd4bcg4158gb5f8g9caf4f551563"
msgid "Bold. What does 'us' entail?"
msgstr "대담하네. '우리'는 무슨 뜻이야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9d1fca4f-6023-1c34-f718-c9bd5260b55e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:9d1fca4f-6023-1c34-f718-c9bd5260b55e
msgctxt "h881d4096ga770g4500ga8efg11ded91a2502"
msgid "You have me curious now."
msgstr "궁금해졌어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a067f07c-30b3-d7bf-4f82-9df6f1d07765
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DRAGONBORN(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SC_NightWithShadowheart_SharedPersonal(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:a067f07c-30b3-d7bf-4f82-9df6f1d07765
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h00ce2f28g2084g423eg8cf5g139233955a28"
msgid ""
"<i>Speak of dedication to your clan above all else. A life of honour and "
"duty that supersedes even blood.</i>"
msgstr "<i>그 무엇보다 중요한 당신의 집단을 위한 헌신에 대해 이야기한다. 혈통조차 초월하는 헌신과 의무를 다하는 삶에 대해.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = a493c923-3b3a-7ab8-f8bd-9d2ce7a8734a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - Shadowheart_InParty_Event_KissHappened(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:a493c923-3b3a-7ab8-f8bd-9d2ce7a8734a
msgctxt "h73909e49gb47cg447cga1feg7486b5e4a014"
msgid "That didn't hurt, did it?"
msgstr "아프지는 않았지, 그렇지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = a57f14d6-59f4-480e-925d-8960633aa3a7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:a57f14d6-59f4-480e-925d-8960633aa3a7
msgctxt "h546c8c33g2ecfg4cf4gbbedgbc2c449b1d8d"
msgid "Dominant, self-centred, savouring another's loss..."
msgstr "지배적인 데다, 자기중심적이고, 다른 이들의 상실을 음미한다라..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = a69ec07a-c1eb-1e17-8516-c1725a27b65c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:a69ec07a-c1eb-1e17-8516-c1725a27b65c
msgctxt "ha507d3b2g994dg4f8fga506g84fb7c6b0563"
msgid ""
"Well then. Head on back. I'm sure your cold bedroll is missing you terribly."
msgstr "그래 그럼. 돌아가. 네 차가운 침낭이 널 아주 그리워하고 있을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a7ca590f-f630-695f-52c2-75a737dcda06
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SC_NightWithShadowheart_SharedPersonal(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:a7ca590f-f630-695f-52c2-75a737dcda06
msgctxt "hdd6d7f87ge16fg438ag9221gc4463e0738fa"
msgid "<i>Relate Mizora's hold over you - and your eagerness to be free.</i>"
msgstr "<i>미조라가 당신에게 끼친 영향과 자유롭고자 하는 열망에 대해 이야기 한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a82bb017-da5e-e2ab-f031-ec9223635611
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:a82bb017-da5e-e2ab-f031-ec9223635611
msgctxt "hef92cf5ag5629g4651g9adeg3e06a04258bd"
msgid "I'm not sure what else I can say."
msgstr "다른 말을 뭘 해야 할지 모르겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = a9332e78-1934-517b-32df-1e2e43009935
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart:a9332e78-1934-517b-32df-1e2e43009935
msgctxt "h9da3333dg3318g4fd8g8a3dgd3b790fa70fa"
msgid "I suppose so. Celebration's over - time to pick up the trail again."
msgstr "그런 것 같네. 축하 시간은 끝났어, 이제 다시 길을 떠날 시간이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_ROM_NightWithShadowheart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a9917ee0-e07b-5929-cce0-e220f4229fd7
