msgid "<i>Karlach.</i>"
msgstr "<i>칼라크.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_SelectNight
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = faf43f77-c439-8c4d-baa0-2b17b2f35e2a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_SelectNight:faf43f77-c439-8c4d-baa0-2b17b2f35e2a
msgctxt "hd7e3474ag9bb6g4c3cgb37dge550cb701490"
msgid "Be mine tonight, and you will know why."
msgstr "오늘 밤, 내 것이 되면 알 수 있을 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_SelectNight
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = fd83622c-a70b-ccd7-3a16-2d1618a33526
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_SD_SelectNight:fd83622c-a70b-ccd7-3a16-2d1618a33526
msgctxt "h2666ffadg6809g4028gb82eg3d975ae16aa7"
msgid "Disappointing. But perhaps you lack the imagination to satisfy me."
msgstr "실망스럽군. 어쩌면 나를 만족시켜줄 상상력이 부족한 걸지도 모르겠구나."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 03603fb9-f48b-993b-5e3e-f103d6e508fd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Halsin_Event_PreferOverlandRoute = True
#.   Local:
#.      - 2f91518a-75e0-fd8c-d5d8-b38fc64aee5c_HiddenEntranceInSeluneTemple = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 2f91518a-75e0-fd8c-d5d8-b38fc64aee5c_HiddenEntranceInSeluneTemple = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:03603fb9-f48b-993b-5e3e-f103d6e508fd
msgctxt "h01f836e6g524cg494fga6b9ge37eee34ffa6"
msgid ""
"Say I decide to try this Underdark route after all - how do I get started?"
msgstr "내가 결국 언더다크로 가겠다고 결정한다면, 어디서 시작하죠?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 03a7b049-22c4-1535-4d62-dbd3b593e213
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 2f91518a-75e0-fd8c-d5d8-b38fc64aee5c_HiddenEntranceInSeluneTemple = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:03a7b049-22c4-1535-4d62-dbd3b593e213
msgctxt "h794eb2e6g2181g4d89g9c8cge093382a63df"
msgid "Now, we've quite the journey ahead. Best get started."
msgstr "자, 이제 긴 여정이 남아있으니. 시작하는 것이 좋겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 042a28ca-cf0a-7d16-262a-02749ebf46a0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: (CLERIC_SHAR or PALADIN_SHAR) and !REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:042a28ca-cf0a-7d16-262a-02749ebf46a0
msgctxt "h98fd55ebgeeb0g426eg84a5g8eaca79ac444"
msgid "Are these Sharrans still to be found?"
msgstr "그 샤 숭배자들을 아직 찾을 수 있을까요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 05f98a0f-f5bb-429d-9783-59d10394c77d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(4) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:05f98a0f-f5bb-429d-9783-59d10394c77d
msgctxt "h3a67c4f4gfb2bg4c18g9caeg5dc94011ffef"
msgid ""
"We get a cure <i>and</i> the chance to hit these arseholes where they live? "
"Sounds good to me."
msgstr "치유할 방법도 <i>찾고,</i> 그 개자식들의 본거지에서 놈들을 칠 수 있다고? 난 찬성이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 07640c86-a630-9af7-b081-2ba2f9e6a18a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:07640c86-a630-9af7-b081-2ba2f9e6a18a
msgctxt "h7ea386cdg607cg49b8gbbccg72ebe4ca94ed"
msgid "Perhaps... but I wouldn't want to place all my faith in blind luck."
msgstr "그럴지도... 하지만 맹목적인 운에 모든 믿음을 걸고 싶지는 않다네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 080a0c56-654b-b55e-aec0-318944cb1416
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:080a0c56-654b-b55e-aec0-318944cb1416
msgctxt "hcad06531g7c47g46ddg8afag547c60f09a07"
msgid ""
"I had no idea anyone beyond their ranks was infected. You have my sincere "
"sympathies."
msgstr "놈들 집단 외에도 감염된 사람이 있는 줄은 전혀 몰랐네. 그대를 진심으로 위로하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 0861698c-4379-4f48-2cb5-107f0c68abd8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:0861698c-4379-4f48-2cb5-107f0c68abd8
msgctxt "haca3a5a2g7736g4cbfg9cdcga644fbd489f5"
msgid "There's also the shadow curse - it's an affront and must be cleansed."
msgstr "게다가 그림자 저주도 있지. 이는 자연에 대한 모욕이며, 반드시 정화되어야 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 09124eb2-9db4-791f-5b63-b83be896a58f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:09124eb2-9db4-791f-5b63-b83be896a58f
msgctxt "h73aa2c39g7572g476egbc9fg8597146cd25c"
msgid "I don't know what you're talking about."
msgstr "무슨 얘기를 하시는 건지 모르겠군요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 09dbecf1-5d32-0877-32ff-7e7d9d912939
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_State_LeadersAreDead = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:09dbecf1-5d32-0877-32ff-7e7d9d912939
msgctxt "he460f94aga39bg44c7g80cfg084dbb4edd23"
msgid ""
"I am Halsin, First Druid of the Emerald Grove - and I owe you my thanks."
msgstr "나는 할신, 에메랄드 숲의 최고 드루이드라네. 그대에게 감사를 빚졌군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 0a63173e-1249-81fb-d74e-52c50971b9d8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_AdventurersQuest_Knows_LeaderMap = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:0a63173e-1249-81fb-d74e-52c50971b9d8
msgctxt "h5e5e8ccfgfe81g4538g97bcga29e2413745c"
msgid ""
"One of those who died had a clue that was supposed to help us find the "
"hidden entrance to the Underdark."
msgstr "죽은 이들 중 하나가 언더다크로 향하는 숨겨진 입구를 찾는 단서를 가지고 있었네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 0b8fc6f0-6204-413c-aa94-b40c638b9ba3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:0b8fc6f0-6204-413c-aa94-b40c638b9ba3
msgctxt "he1d470f0ge471g40abgb102gdaec810ddf55"
msgid ""
"These tadpoles obey one master. If the <i>ghaik</i> have united in a single "
"Creed, my Queen is in danger."
msgstr ""
"이 올챙이들은 하나의 주인을 따른다. 만약 <i>게이크</i>들이 하나의 신념 아래 뭉친 것이라면, 여왕님께 위협이 될지도 모르겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 0be91112-0080-68a6-8340-049622490be7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:0be91112-0080-68a6-8340-049622490be7
msgctxt "hea670f92g9c6dg4244ga7fdg96871f76487f"
msgid ""
"And where do you suppose that ship was taking you? Moonrise, I'll wager. The "
"journey differs, but the problem is the same."
msgstr ""
"그렇다면 그 함선이 그대를 어디로 데려가고 있었다고 생각하는가? 난 문라이즈였을 거라고 확신하네. 여정은 다양하지만, 결국 문제는 똑같군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 0c5aad45-80dc-04fe-46ff-4d9be58487a2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ShadowHeart_InParty_Knows_SharWorshipper = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - Shadowheart_InParty_InterestInDarkJusticiars = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:0c5aad45-80dc-04fe-46ff-4d9be58487a2
msgctxt "h2de92f6cga77fg4462gb893g17d8fbe97a1a"
msgid "Dark Justiciars? I must see for myself."
msgstr "다크 저스티시어라고요? 직접 봐야겠군요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0e80cc6d-f278-cbb7-111d-431e28b3a248
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:0e80cc6d-f278-cbb7-111d-431e28b3a248
msgctxt "hc49859b5g2894g407dg8ea4gd0a4b5572cb2"
msgid "Sympathies? Can't you help me?"
msgstr "위로한다고요? 도와줄 순 없는 건가요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0fd61f63-d4da-fe1e-982c-7f26c1efde15
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Halsin_Knows_StudiedTadpole = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Halsin_Knows_TadpoleResearch = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:0fd61f63-d4da-fe1e-982c-7f26c1efde15
msgctxt "h8e4dd4dfge268g431bgb4cfgb22c7396177e"
msgid "How do you know all this?"
msgstr "어떻게 이 모든 걸 알고 있는 겁니까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 104a0a15-45e1-5f0d-f342-240548207056
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CAMP_Halsin_Knows_AboutSharranTunnel = True
#.   Quest:
#.     - GLO_PathToMoonrise.HalsinToldPath(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:104a0a15-45e1-5f0d-f342-240548207056
msgctxt "h6910266ege045g4b80g8811g59837a0386c5"
msgid ""
"You could also go <i>under</i>. There is a tunnel somewhere in the ruined "
"temple of Selûne. It leads to Moonrise Towers through the Underdark."
msgstr ""
"<i>지하</i>로 가는 방법도 있지. 폐허가 된 셀루네의 신전 어딘가에 터널이 있어. 이를 통해 언더다크를 거쳐 문라이즈 타워로 갈 수 "
"있을 거라네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 131e8a5b-251c-618f-0866-abe3a24371bb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:131e8a5b-251c-618f-0866-abe3a24371bb
msgctxt "h055ecc74g4895g475egbad3gd3f16d8d4560"
msgid ""
"I'm glad you approve - I do not truly <i>care </i>if you approve, but I am "
"glad."
msgstr "그대가 좋아한다니 기쁘군. 정말로 좋아하는지는 <i>상관</i> 없지만, 어쨌거나 기쁘다네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 13652931-0dd7-8c88-2dd8-4181462b8356
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:13652931-0dd7-8c88-2dd8-4181462b8356
msgctxt "h5f15ba4fgd1d7g427dgbdfegbea747da4100"
msgid ""
"There is a tunnel leading from the temple of Selûne right down into the "
"Underdark and beyond. The entrance is hidden somewhere in the ruins."
msgstr "셀루네의 신전 아래 언더다크와 그 너머로 향하는 통로가 있어. 입구는 폐허 어딘가에 숨겨져 있을 걸세."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 145d28e3-034b-825d-2d96-0603eec8c19e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_DruidAttack_State_PrepAfterDeathOfDruids = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:145d28e3-034b-825d-2d96-0603eec8c19e
msgctxt "hbb1e690agab82g423eg9a1ege18492f679e3"
msgid "I'll trust your judgement."
msgstr "당신의 판단을 믿겠어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 16cba23e-fd38-67f9-77be-c55e0a915b56
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Halsin_Knows_MoonriseBriefing = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Halsin_Knows_MoonriseBriefing = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:16cba23e-fd38-67f9-77be-c55e0a915b56
msgctxt "h46871548g1b8bg46cbg846fgb435327f9737"
msgid ""
"I will join you, help you with that which plagues you. The illithid curse is "
"a blight to all nature."
msgstr "그대와 함께 놈들을 처치하는 것을 돕겠네. 일리시드는 모든 자연에 재앙이니."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 194e38c2-d740-0613-4541-d6d644491cf0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - IMPOSSIBLE = True
#.   Local:
#.      - 2f91518a-75e0-fd8c-d5d8-b38fc64aee5c_Orpheus = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 2f91518a-75e0-fd8c-d5d8-b38fc64aee5c_Orpheus = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:194e38c2-d740-0613-4541-d6d644491cf0
msgctxt "hfa4141fcged48g4228gb4e5g444e671647f3"
msgid "I'm shielded from the worst of the parasite's magic."
msgstr "최악의 기생충 마법으로부터 보호받고 있어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1ad23691-0f45-2847-b919-b6e49b8a3a14
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_Apprentice_State_Dead = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:1ad23691-0f45-2847-b919-b6e49b8a3a14
msgctxt "h6ac2063dg6161g4a3fg9cf5g948e18ae6b65"
msgid "Couldn't Nettie take over?"
msgstr "네티가 대신할 수는 없었나요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 1d095e38-b172-ec31-3e2f-ed3b46a26144
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:1d095e38-b172-ec31-3e2f-ed3b46a26144
msgctxt "h9f692dfaga371g4ea0gb37age70be0deeb83"
msgid ""
"I'd still be target practice for goblins if you hadn't come along. I think I "
"can trust you."
msgstr "그대가 와주지 않았다면 계속 고블린에게 돌을 맞고 있었겠지. 그대는 믿어도 될 것 같군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 1d9f0054-eef7-8b05-89de-78b7a7570388
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:1d9f0054-eef7-8b05-89de-78b7a7570388
msgctxt "h4cc920f5g98bbg4e75g8ffdga185253ab1d9"
msgid ""
"No, this is different. <i>Altered.</i> But I believe I know where answers "
"can be found - Moonrise Towers."
msgstr "아니, 다른 것이야. <i>변형된 것이지.</i> 하지만 나는 답을 어디서 찾을 수 있는지 알고 있다네. 바로 문라이즈 타워지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 22737e39-2114-6c62-4ddf-00781a0d292b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:22737e39-2114-6c62-4ddf-00781a0d292b
msgctxt "h64162b44gdc48g45d2g9c80g1c07daecfc91"
msgid ""
"If you hadn't killed the leaders of that goblin horde, the grove would be no "
"more. I am in your debt."
msgstr "그대가 고블린 무리의 지도자들을 죽이지 않았다면, 숲은 소멸했을 걸세. 그대에게 빚을 졌군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 2344cb25-52da-0966-edfc-1b4349aa2f8a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:2344cb25-52da-0966-edfc-1b4349aa2f8a
msgctxt "he26ad6ffg7dcbg4952gbb0bgf5d4a7ff30dc"
msgid ""
"There's a chokehold of magic, binding the creature to you. Any efforts to "
"remove it would almost certainly kill you - or worse."
msgstr ""
"그대를 옥죄고 있는 마법이 있는데, 그 생명체를 그대와 결속하고 있다네. 그 기생충을 제거하려고 하면, 분명 그대가 죽고 말겠지. 그보다 "
"끔찍한 운명이 기다리고 있을지도 모르고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 248d9091-897d-9f40-be8f-b69a7e215eda
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_Lockdown_State_Active = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:248d9091-897d-9f40-be8f-b69a7e215eda
msgctxt "hbd0aec9eg37e7g4123gbe80gb32f80263421"
msgid ""
"It's lost to me. Perhaps in time I can open it up to the world again, but "
"for now, I must help you."
msgstr "숲은 내 손을 떠났다네. 때가 되면 숲을 다시 세상과 이어 보일 수도 있겠지만, 지금의 나는 그대를 도와야겠네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2519c68a-9419-7b8b-a098-ee42078df666
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:2519c68a-9419-7b8b-a098-ee42078df666
msgctxt "h24879372g5105g4511ga1adg69b9e59214fd"
msgid "You're welcome, I suppose."
msgstr "천만에요, 라고 말하면 되겠죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 26093cd1-cfb8-9411-6058-065094799a7f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:26093cd1-cfb8-9411-6058-065094799a7f
msgctxt "h0d207c74g3e8eg492eg85a7g9c74f00f050c"
msgid ""
"I was expecting more from you than a lead towards some distant, dangerous "
"prospect."
msgstr "당신이 어떤 멀고 위험한 장소로 향하는 단서를 주는 것보다는 많은 것을 해주시길 기대했는데 말이죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 26243bea-3d0f-0946-5b8a-274ae52e395e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:26243bea-3d0f-0946-5b8a-274ae52e395e
msgctxt "h4a58fd43g1c6dg4486ga484ga52ada5d21e2"
msgid ""
"Few survive long - those who do are transformed by the curse. It is not a "
"place to venture into lightly."
msgstr "살아남는 이들은 소수지, 그런 이들은 저주에 의해 뒤틀리고 말아. 가벼운 마음으로 여행할 수 있는 곳이 아닐세."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2693f2c4-70c6-38c6-06d9-e3c124afaf19
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_TempleAccess_Event_PuzzleSolved = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:2693f2c4-70c6-38c6-06d9-e3c124afaf19
msgctxt "h1dbd87e4g5f9fg496cg8515g1d2ff5fae1a5"
msgid "I found the hidden entrance in the temple of Selûne - the way is clear."
msgstr "셀루네 신전의 숨겨진 입구를 발견했습니다. 길은 분명합니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 274b5423-3989-b41a-b397-0963df0d2fee
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Halsin_Quest_GoToMoonrise = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:274b5423-3989-b41a-b397-0963df0d2fee
msgctxt "h95000e6bge1c6g4bcag9abagf671d156b8c7"
msgid ""
"The path is now clear - we have to get to Moonrise Towers. Do you remember "
"what I told you? About getting there?"
msgstr "이제 길이 분명해졌군. 문라이즈 타워로 향하자. 내가 알려준 내용은 기억하고 있나? 어떻게 그곳으로 가는지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 27e578d2-b528-18a8-6f24-3a048d106102
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_ElevatorToScl_Used = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:27e578d2-b528-18a8-6f24-3a048d106102
msgctxt "hfee9f642g339cg4250gaefag05b6746588b8"
msgid "I found an elevator - but it leads right into the shadow curse."
msgstr "승강기를 찾았습니다. 하지만 바로 그림자 저주로 향하는 것 같더군요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 29136533-b801-8589-453f-f991f07e8171
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:29136533-b801-8589-453f-f991f07e8171
msgctxt "hc15630c6g9f39g4193g9f69gda7a1841e530"
msgid ""
"Tread carefully. You're on the right track, I'm sure - but there'll still be "
"danger and difficulty before you reach Moonrise."
msgstr ""
"조심해서 나아가게나. 확실히 올바른 방향으로 향하고 있긴 하지만, 문라이즈에 도착할 때까지 어떤 위험과 어려움이 도사리고 있을지 모르니."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 29ecd98a-4c50-0d09-d6f2-469f1d1447ea
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:29ecd98a-4c50-0d09-d6f2-469f1d1447ea
msgctxt "h290f4202gf768g4588g809bgf457f7091c50"
msgid ""
"Indeed, and may the Oak Father watch over us on our journey. We will speak "
"soon, I'm sure."
msgstr "물론. 그리고 참나무 아버지께서 우리 여정을 지켜보실 걸세. 곧 다시 대화하게나."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 2b8b78ac-9fb8-9ef5-9556-f61d73d734b6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:2b8b78ac-9fb8-9ef5-9556-f61d73d734b6
msgctxt "ha312b9a7g58abg4111ga6d4gbc360860572e"
msgid ""
"She can tend to the grove, help it heal. In time, others will join. Perhaps "
"some day I can return."
msgstr ""
"그녀가 숲을 돌보고 치유를 도울 수 있을 걸세. 시간이 지나면, 다른 이들도 함께하겠지. 언젠간 내가 돌아올 수 있을지도 모르고 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2d1c2335-a13f-510f-9e04-58ce7305cf4d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:2d1c2335-a13f-510f-9e04-58ce7305cf4d
msgctxt "h046f05e3g54ccg471bg9152ge6fbfedccb48"
msgid "Seems it's high time we got on our way."
msgstr "보아하니 우리도 떠나야 할 때가 된 것 같군요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 2df88e65-e8b6-0615-f994-d70c5718be59
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:2df88e65-e8b6-0615-f994-d70c5718be59
msgctxt "h46ffb760g110fg4935gb30cgccea040fc7d1"
msgid ""
"But in my eagerness, I put far too much faith in the abilities of Aradin and "
"his band. We didn't even get close."
msgstr "하지만 간절함 때문에 아라딘과 그 용병대의 능력을 너무 믿었지. 우린 가까이 가지도 못했다네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 302a6229-6aea-f2ae-fabe-91cb095b4839
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:302a6229-6aea-f2ae-fabe-91cb095b4839
msgctxt "h4d6eb62bg71fag402bgac23g9dce29d2bf7f"
msgid ""
"All too well - I could even sense it from afar. Now let me confirm it; I "
"need to know exactly what we're dealing with..."
msgstr "아주 잘 알지. 멀리서도 느껴질 정도였다네. 이제 확인시켜 주게. 정확히 무엇을 상대하는 건지 알아야 할 터이니…"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 30467b09-9682-5f2e-fea5-ad8439613b7d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Halsin_Quest_GoToMoonrise = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:30467b09-9682-5f2e-fea5-ad8439613b7d
msgctxt "h9dd7a411g75b5g4813g9f1ag8abc03c12482"
msgid ""
"It's the source of this magic, and where the cultists send their captives - "
"to be infected. They're building an army. Innocents go in, True Souls come "
"out."
msgstr ""
"마법의 근원이자, 이 광신도들이 그들의 포로를 보내 감염시키는 곳일세. 놈들은 군대를 만들고 있어. 무고한 자가 들어가서, 참된 영혼이 "
"되어 나오지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 3056231e-d1dd-c29c-af55-50d76baaa890
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_WolfPens_HalsinBear_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:3056231e-d1dd-c29c-af55-50d76baaa890
msgctxt "he7249611gc215g4237g8cf6g645f981c1d17"
msgid "I know. It's what brings me here."
msgstr "알고 있네. 그것 때문에 온 걸세."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 32bb409c-41b8-5553-1d1c-b29207b75947
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Volo_OperationFailed = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:32bb409c-41b8-5553-1d1c-b29207b75947
msgctxt "ha5ed1221gf5c1g4cc6gbde4g2ba77bf85c95"
msgid ""
"What, were you expecting a spell? A potion? Or perhaps you thought I'd "
"conduct a cack-handed operation on you right here."
msgstr ""
"뭐, 주문이라도 기대했나? 물약이나? 아니면 내가 바로 이 자리에서 그대의 머리를 깨고 수술이라도 해줄 거라고 생각했는지도 모르겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 33333ba5-30a2-a0b6-f456-3c8e3c43e797
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:33333ba5-30a2-a0b6-f456-3c8e3c43e797
msgctxt "hf7edbd42g110eg44b2gb72cgd07183ca3986"
msgid "This shadow curse - does it affect Shar worshippers?"
msgstr "그림자 저주라는 건, 샤 숭배자들에게도 영향을 미치는 겁니까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3350db47-aeb8-34f5-1a4b-27ab30925a37
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 2f91518a-75e0-fd8c-d5d8-b38fc64aee5c_UnfinishedBusiness = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 2f91518a-75e0-fd8c-d5d8-b38fc64aee5c_UnfinishedBusiness = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:3350db47-aeb8-34f5-1a4b-27ab30925a37
msgctxt "h1088e0f1ge481g49b0g886eg392c2f38025a"
msgid ""
"You mentioned you had unfinished business in Moonrise Towers - what did you "
"mean?"
msgstr "문라이즈 타워에 끝내지 못한 일이 남아있다고 했잖아요, 그게 무슨 뜻이죠?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 335f553a-7561-a7d9-163b-b882e75ecb77
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_WolfPens_HalsinBear_HasMet(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:335f553a-7561-a7d9-163b-b882e75ecb77
msgctxt "ha28c7361g3ef2g4d40ga8d5g2a6433fe942c"
msgid "I know - your <i>infection</i>."
msgstr "그대의 <i>감염에</i> 대해 알고 있네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 33bc1870-68ba-444a-9e0d-c2893241bb45
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(6) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:33bc1870-68ba-444a-9e0d-c2893241bb45
msgctxt "ha4daa968gd81eg4586gb662g870b9ba21144"
msgid ""
"At last, a cure is in reach. To the Towers, then, where the moonlight will "
"lend way to a new dawn."
msgstr "마침내, 치료법이 가까이 있구나. 문라이즈 타워로 가자. 달빛이 새로운 새벽으로 향하는 길을 비춰주겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 344a31c2-74d9-bbbd-9ef9-9c9ac71d376a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:344a31c2-74d9-bbbd-9ef9-9c9ac71d376a
msgctxt "h8f617226gae89g45cdg89c6g56e4b8563768"
msgid ""
"A drow forced me to defend myself. Afterwards, I was able to study the "
"parasite that slithered out of the corpse, see what drives these 'True "
"Souls'."
msgstr ""
"어떤 드로우와 싸워야만 했지. 그 시체에서 기어나온 기생충을 연구할 수 있었고, 무엇이 이 '참된 영혼'을 움직이는지 알 수 있었네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 3473a6c3-5f71-08cd-0b7d-96b2c7b97266
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:3473a6c3-5f71-08cd-0b7d-96b2c7b97266
msgctxt "h152c1390ge180g4633gaf94g5c8ec39b51a5"
msgid ""
"I would like to join your camp, if you'll allow me. I can offer my skills, "
"my counsel."
msgstr "그대가 허락한다면, 야영지에 합류하고 싶네. 나는 기술과 자문을 제공할 수 있지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 3662d359-cb3e-9910-e0ed-03fab0b0d5d1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:3662d359-cb3e-9910-e0ed-03fab0b0d5d1
msgctxt "hfbdc8f4eg243ag4f2bga64bgfe4fb4c01ff5"
msgid ""
"But... something's <i>different</i>. You're aware of the monster inside you. "
"You don't bow to the Absolute, like the True Souls do..."
msgstr ""
"하지만... 뭔가 <i>다르군</i>. 그대는 내면에 있는 괴물을 인지하고 있어. 참된 영혼들처럼 절대자에게 복종하지 않고 있지..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 36c8ea65-e6b0-3b1b-b03e-cb5acbe18ce7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:36c8ea65-e6b0-3b1b-b03e-cb5acbe18ce7
msgctxt "h775d5d90g3430g41cbg9d55g3bae4660ce87"
msgid "I'm not entirely sure - but I'll take all the help I can get."
msgstr "확신은 못하겠지만, 받을 수 있는 도움은 다 받겠어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 37063e91-d016-b6ae-6556-f2868817aec5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:37063e91-d016-b6ae-6556-f2868817aec5
msgctxt "hfc170918g1545g423egb306gd70f29ddf7b8"
msgid ""
"The decision is yours, but I'd favour the Underdark. Even a place like that "
"is the lesser evil compared to the shadow-cursed lands."
msgstr ""
"결정은 그대의 몫이지만, 나라면 언더다크를 통해 가겠네. 그런 곳이라도, 그림자 저주의 영향을 받은 곳을 통과하는 것보다는 나을 테니."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 373b0365-9130-c7d5-1e9d-a3ac8c95e9e1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_Lockdown_State_Active = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:373b0365-9130-c7d5-1e9d-a3ac8c95e9e1
msgctxt "ha328e9abgc619g47b5gab15gd0684aa4d9c3"
msgid "What about the grove?"
msgstr "숲은 어쩌고요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 3760a622-9e6f-1d43-37ae-9bb875533a4c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:3760a622-9e6f-1d43-37ae-9bb875533a4c
msgctxt "h42eac070gc0f6g46b7gac6cg420f49800465"
msgid ""
"Keep looking. If they're present, then it's likely there's a route to "
"Moonrise somewhere."
msgstr "계속 찾아보게나. 그들이 거기 있다면, 문라이즈로 향하는 통로도 분명 근처 어딘가에 있을 걸세."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 3b440507-0c2f-f743-4b9f-e3da31f02321
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 2f91518a-75e0-fd8c-d5d8-b38fc64aee5c_HiddenEntranceInSeluneTemple = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 2f91518a-75e0-fd8c-d5d8-b38fc64aee5c_HiddenEntranceInSeluneTemple = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:3b440507-0c2f-f743-4b9f-e3da31f02321
msgctxt "h468450e8g0cc5g4e97gbd56g4e901f8458cb"
msgid ""
"I advise you start in the temple of Selûne - if you find the Dark "
"Justiciars' hidden entrance, it could lead you all the way to Moonrise."
msgstr "셀루네의 신전에서부터 시작하는 것을 권하지. 다크 저스티시어들의 숨겨진 입구를 발견하면, 어떻게든 문라이즈로 갈 수 있을 걸세."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 3b9b5fb0-9063-c0e7-faa6-f0eeb86969d9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:3b9b5fb0-9063-c0e7-faa6-f0eeb86969d9
msgctxt "h9c4df261g2c1fg4dc7g911eg575edfccc9b8"
msgid ""
"I need her to stay focused on her training - the grove will need a skilled "
"healer in my absence."
msgstr "내가 없는 동안 숲에는 숙련된 치유사가 필요하니, 그녀가 훈련에 집중할 수 있게 해줘야 하네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 3bb009db-6641-f436-d55c-d4a72f6c1053
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:3bb009db-6641-f436-d55c-d4a72f6c1053
msgctxt "hf7f1489bg3e39g4c11g9551g16380e938d6f"
msgid ""
"So it seems, though I don't know how. You will have to choose your approach "
"carefully."
msgstr "방법은 모르겠지만, 그런 것 같군. 접근 방식을 신중하게 선택해야 할 걸세."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 3c0be20a-db73-883e-f2bb-ac730ce54130
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - Shadowheart_InParty_InterestInDarkJusticiars = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:3c0be20a-db73-883e-f2bb-ac730ce54130
msgctxt "h38cc77a6gd89dg48edg9969g67c7581816e7"
msgid "Sounds rather ingenious."
msgstr "꽤 기발한 것 같군요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3ccf88f8-4a1a-b2b7-7d73-6339fe12fc61
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:3ccf88f8-4a1a-b2b7-7d73-6339fe12fc61
msgctxt "h7076a3b5ga4d1g4c16gbf05g4d769a457f77"
msgid "Very shrewd of you."
msgstr "좋은 통찰력이네요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3e7c5ad5-59d6-1414-7f48-c35d602c86e9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:3e7c5ad5-59d6-1414-7f48-c35d602c86e9
msgctxt "h8a3455cbg6709g450cgb05bgba117760baa0"
msgid "Moonrise Towers? What is that place?"
msgstr "문라이즈 타워라고? 거긴 뭐 하는 곳이죠?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3e80f374-cf8e-68d7-8299-e7021208f578
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Halsin_Knows_ShadowCurse = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:3e80f374-cf8e-68d7-8299-e7021208f578
msgctxt "he64b88a6g01adg411dgb8a2ge0c176cf365d"
msgid "The Absolute's forces can tolerate such a place?"
msgstr "절대자의 병력은 그걸 견딜 수 있는 겁니까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 41e3f6e5-378e-fdf0-92e7-ee8aff3f0f31
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_DruidAttack_State_PrepAfterDeathOfDruids = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:41e3f6e5-378e-fdf0-92e7-ee8aff3f0f31
msgctxt "h42eb4863g50e5g40d0g9852g1003fc049a15"
msgid "First and only Druid. What will Francesca even do here?"
msgstr "최고이자 유일한 드루이드겠죠. 프란체스카가 대체 여기서 할 수 있는 게 있긴 한가요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 42b7c100-a581-0ea8-dfbd-49bf5c6e048c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:42b7c100-a581-0ea8-dfbd-49bf5c6e048c
msgctxt "h62f50b72g017ag434ag86e1g967b4ff2ddb6"
msgid "But I'm afraid it won't be easy, or quick."
msgstr "하지만 안타깝게도 일이 손쉽거나, 빠르지는 않을 걸세."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 42f0a015-c359-5c69-a49f-610afa7f2fdd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:42f0a015-c359-5c69-a49f-610afa7f2fdd
msgctxt "he0e59aa6g5e32g42cag8a88g416bdfee7b7c"
msgid ""
"And I may be able to help you find a more definitive solution to your "
"problem."
msgstr "또한, 그대가 더 확고한 해결책을 찾는 데 도움이 되어줄 수 있을 듯하네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 43ed2e7d-c676-c739-5df9-f6c75763c219
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:43ed2e7d-c676-c739-5df9-f6c75763c219
msgctxt "h7bcf0f22g1376g447ega125ga5cc7d1725e0"
msgid ""
"Don't worry, I'm not here just to sing your praises. I believe I can help - "
"with your tadpole."
msgstr "걱정하지 말게나. 그대에게 찬사를 보내기 위해 이곳에 왔을 뿐이니. 내가 그대를 도울 수 있을 것 같네, 올챙이 문제 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 452b5e5d-1a25-eda0-3d4a-9fb147468d4b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:452b5e5d-1a25-eda0-3d4a-9fb147468d4b
msgctxt "h61e3e4c3gab09g48dfg9f9bgcfe7d3871ab7"
msgid "This magic you mentioned - it isn't normal for these parasites?"
msgstr "당신이 언급한 마법 말이에요, 그 기생충에게 흔히 나타나는 것이 아닌가요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 455e4491-bf21-c2fc-0a98-f035c85cb143
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:455e4491-bf21-c2fc-0a98-f035c85cb143
msgctxt "h32256b06g3398g4db8gaff3ga25e2970937b"
msgid ""
"Nature speaks to me. Birds report what they've seen. And I've overheard "
"goblins speaking of it, too. Moonrise is at the heart of all this, I'm sure "
"of it."
msgstr ""
"자연이 나에게 말을 전해 주고, 새들은 자신이 본 것을 보고하지. 그리고 나는 고블린들이 그것에 대해 말하는 것도 엿들었네. 이 모든 "
"것의 중심에는 문라이즈가 있다고 내 확신한다네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4564e882-f293-7f82-f820-a0224a4a4890
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Halsin_Knows_StudiedTadpole = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:4564e882-f293-7f82-f820-a0224a4a4890
msgctxt "hb895eda1g9fceg48eagac7egf84eaaaf41f1"
msgid "You learned all this from your studies?"
msgstr "연구를 통해 이 모든 사실을 알게 됐습니까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 45a4bbf6-2e10-8ce9-677e-be4d99cd5af4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:45a4bbf6-2e10-8ce9-677e-be4d99cd5af4
msgctxt "h6aafae95gd35bg43c9gb337g3de5ff1de704"
msgid ""
"I'm certain. The Underdark is dangerous, yes, but the alternative is "
"suicide. Be patient and be thorough - the path will reveal itself in time."
msgstr ""
"확신한다네. 언더다크도 위험하긴 하지만, 다른 길로 가는 건 자살행위지. 인내심을 갖고 철저히 준비하면, 이윽고 길이 드러날 걸세."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4624ebc6-d580-7281-c08f-fa6cd04caf2a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Halsin_Knows_AboutGrymforge = False
#.      - GLO_DuergarCamp_EverEnteredBefore = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:4624ebc6-d580-7281-c08f-fa6cd04caf2a
msgctxt "hdb8128edg43dcg49bag9edfg5a10efc4a9ba"
msgid "I already found the place you're talking about - it's called Grymforge."
msgstr "당신이 말하는 장소는 이미 찾았어요. 그곳은 그림포지라 불리더군요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 47916793-76e9-910b-dc89-848b6e20e6c5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:47916793-76e9-910b-dc89-848b6e20e6c5
msgctxt "hf7a72e4dgd8ceg4b21g8883gbc5b8e0fcb00"
msgid ""
"I wish to come with you, help solve this <i>problem </i>that's plaguing you. "
"It's the least I can do."
msgstr "그대를 괴롭히는 이 <i>문제</i>를 해결하는 데 도움을 주고 싶네. 내가 그 정도는 해줘야지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 4c1bb58f-ff23-dbd2-2382-84f22fdca4fe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 2f91518a-75e0-fd8c-d5d8-b38fc64aee5c_HiddenEntranceInSeluneTemple = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:4c1bb58f-ff23-dbd2-2382-84f22fdca4fe
msgctxt "hf38a7989gc68eg458cg9d79gd22156453e5d"
msgid "Indeed. We've quite the journey ahead of us."
msgstr "물론이지. 우리 앞에는 긴 여정이 남아 있다네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4de1665c-03f3-0d5f-c10e-79283b51bdcb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Halsin_Knows_StudiedTadpole = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:4de1665c-03f3-0d5f-c10e-79283b51bdcb
msgctxt "h1f086141g46d4g4217ga057g19e1f22b6c0a"
msgid "You learned all this from your studies?"
msgstr "연구를 통해 이 모든 사실을 알게 됐습니까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 549520c9-9a00-593e-33c4-e152959c0b5b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:549520c9-9a00-593e-33c4-e152959c0b5b
msgctxt "h5a55f3f9g1604g4e98g9376g217161d30024"
msgid "This magic you mentioned - it isn't normal for these parasites?"
msgstr "당신이 언급한 마법 말이에요, 그 기생충에게 흔히 나타나는 것이 아닌가요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 56335a3e-1c13-d31c-50bb-a501ac2147d6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_AttackOnDen_State_DenVictory = True
#.      - GOB_WolfPens_State_HalsinIntroHappened = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:56335a3e-1c13-d31c-50bb-a501ac2147d6
msgctxt "h056d9639gdc10g4b33gaa4dga2bdaeae7a80"
msgid ""
"I heard how you saved the grove; it wouldn't be right for me to let you "
"leave without expressing my gratitude."
msgstr "당신이 숲을 구해준 이야기를 들었는데, 고마움을 표하지 않고 떠나게 두는 것은 옳지 않을 걸세."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 564cd100-1c57-1686-9910-b1f93a5b32e4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:564cd100-1c57-1686-9910-b1f93a5b32e4
msgctxt "hd4556930g02d8g48a6ga869gb1679075d30a"
msgid "As bones, perhaps. But their hidden structures might still remain."
msgstr "유골 정도는 남아 있을지도 모르겠군. 하지만 그 자들의 숨겨진 구조물은 아직 남아 있을 걸세."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 56886e25-d000-39b2-31f2-94dd0704f8fa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:56886e25-d000-39b2-31f2-94dd0704f8fa
msgctxt "h88188f9ag9ab3g46e2g978fg90ba93238812"
msgid ""
"You could go overland - along the Risen Road or through the mountains. "
"Easier at first, but you'll run into the shadow curse eventually."
msgstr "치솟은 길을 따라 지상으로 가거나 산을 통과할 수도 있다네. 처음에는 더 쉽겠지만, 결국 그림자 저주를 맞닥뜨리게 되겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 56c8bc92-a725-7ef7-5386-5997db74df0e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_Lockdown_State_Active = False
#.      - CAMP_Halsin_Knows_SuccessorFirstDruid = False
#.      - DEN_AttackOnDen_State_DenVictory = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CAMP_Halsin_Knows_SuccessorFirstDruid = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:56c8bc92-a725-7ef7-5386-5997db74df0e
msgctxt "h85c23215gd999g456fgb762gbf97846ffb36"
msgid "What about the grove?"
msgstr "숲은 어쩌고요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 582c188c-ed41-e0e8-f68b-7668a065db2f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:582c188c-ed41-e0e8-f68b-7668a065db2f
msgctxt "hb1657ef9g6feeg4e8eg8c82g21ecc4f00690"
msgid ""
"I've chosen a successor as First Druid - Francesca of the High Forest. A "
"bird's already been dispatched to summon her."
msgstr "내 뒤를 이을 최고 드루이드로 높은 숲의 프란체스카를 선정하게 됐네. 이미 그녀를 소환하기 위해 새 한 마리를 보냈지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 583d9073-0d51-c0ef-cc4d-9faf2dc4c6ba
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Halsin_Knows_StudiedTadpole = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Halsin_Knows_TadpoleResearch = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:583d9073-0d51-c0ef-cc4d-9faf2dc4c6ba
msgctxt "hd08bd8d9g85f0g4f4dga1b5g172c1d3f2e7e"
msgid "How do you know all this?"
msgstr "어떻게 이 모든 걸 알고 있는 겁니까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 58f903c9-e9bc-737c-c522-901d8e831ff8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_UNDERDARK(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Halsin_Event_PreferUnderdarkRoute = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:58f903c9-e9bc-737c-c522-901d8e831ff8
msgctxt "hf5c42b30g35dbg49aag91b9ga11705e13795"
msgid ""
"I never thought I'd say this, but it sounds like the Underdark is the safer "
"route."
msgstr "내가 이런 말을 할 거라고는 생각도 못해봤지만, 언더다크가 더 안전한 길인 것 같군요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 59e8b336-07e2-7187-6774-5c49d67522fc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:59e8b336-07e2-7187-6774-5c49d67522fc
msgctxt "ha2733d0cgb189g423ag96dagf7e2d86703ed"
msgid ""
"Few can resist it without dying or transforming into shadow beings. You can "
"try to journey overland if you wish, but I strongly advise you go "
"<i>under</i>."
msgstr ""
"죽거나, 그림자의 존재가 되지 않고 버틸 수 있는 이들은 거의 없다네. 원한다면 지상으로 여정을 떠나도 좋지만, <i>지하를</i> "
"통하는 것을 강력히 권하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 5a43f88f-7ffc-0b6d-96fc-7cb1f7f68001
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:5a43f88f-7ffc-0b6d-96fc-7cb1f7f68001
msgctxt "he155456fg2749g41a8g98dcgd7a2012bc562"
msgid ""
"I believe if you find this entrance, you'll discover a route that leads to "
"Moonrise Towers, bypassing the worst of the shadow curse."
msgstr ""
"내 생각에 그대가 이 입구를 찾을 수 있다면, 끔찍한 그림자 저주의 영향을 피해서 문라이즈 타워로 향하는 길을 발견할 수 있을 걸세."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 5b1ad514-3417-89d4-5153-a408de7398c7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:5b1ad514-3417-89d4-5153-a408de7398c7
msgctxt "h712a3b16g3682g4ea1ga02ag98033c36281b"
msgid "Be glad it did, or you'd be a True Soul by now."
msgstr "그래서 다행이었다고 생각하게, 아니면 지금쯤 참된 영혼이 되었을 테니."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 5d94aa94-75d6-fb3a-57ab-b03c4c878b97
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_Lockdown_State_Active = False
#.      - GLO_Halsin_State_WillSkipGrove = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:5d94aa94-75d6-fb3a-57ab-b03c4c878b97
msgctxt "hc1af079cg581cg48a3g89ffg370c9281499b"
msgid ""
"My thanks again, for all you did. With the grove safe, I am free to turn to "
"other matters."
msgstr "그대가 해준 모든 일에 다시 감사를 표하지. 이제 숲이 안전해졌으니, 다른 문제에 집중할 수 있겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6132f311-c34b-1346-f9e8-773f970931db
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:6132f311-c34b-1346-f9e8-773f970931db
msgctxt "h6db9d1abga592g4da7ga325gc67472ffe7bf"
msgid "This magic isn't typical of ceremorphosis?"
msgstr "이 마법은 일반적인 뇌변이의 특징이 아닌 건가요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 628637b7-73f5-9344-1a63-9ab403d33484
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:628637b7-73f5-9344-1a63-9ab403d33484
msgctxt "hcfcca144g877eg4380g8e9agbcb8bbb653e0"
msgid ""
"Thank you. I will grieve when I can, but for now, I must find another way to "
"serve nature - by helping you."
msgstr "고맙군. 슬픔은 잠시 미뤄두고, 지금은 자연을 섬길 다른 방법을 찾아야겠네. 그대를 도움으로써 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 62977226-c40f-897d-6579-ceaa3e0393ef
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:62977226-c40f-897d-6579-ceaa3e0393ef
msgctxt "hc0b5d06ege1aeg4bffga6bcg05168c07f7dc"
msgid ""
"By all means - pursue any leads you may have. But I sense all roads will "
"lead to Moonrise, in the end."
msgstr "물론이지, 어떤 단서라도 쫓아가 보게나. 하지만 결국엔 모든 길이 문라이즈로 향할 테지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6428ed87-aff4-7928-c0fe-883b60d74d85
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_UNDERDARK(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Halsin_Event_PreferUnderdarkRoute = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:6428ed87-aff4-7928-c0fe-883b60d74d85
msgctxt "hd2fcfa92g58f2g4277g85e8gacc9b215c52a"
msgid ""
"The Underdark's my home. Better to take that route than risk this curse."
msgstr "언더다크는 내 고향입니다. 이 저주를 무릅쓰느니 그 길을 택하겠습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 64696fc7-77a5-22dc-19c7-abdee87bd4ba
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:64696fc7-77a5-22dc-19c7-abdee87bd4ba
msgctxt "hcaf5059eg17c3g4803g8e8ag8ef7063f234c"
msgid ""
"If you hadn't seen to the leaders of that goblin horde, the grove would be "
"no more. I am in your debt."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 64b081b0-bce8-34fd-b294-3b4e20bd28d6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:64b081b0-bce8-34fd-b294-3b4e20bd28d6
msgctxt "h6cc38c99g88b9g40bdga373g5699a2e706b8"
msgid ""
"Don't be coy - I can sense the imbalance in you. Now let me confirm it, so I "
"can be certain of what we're dealing with..."
msgstr "숨기지 말게. 그대 내부의 불균형이 느껴진다네. 이제 확인시켜 주게. 정확히 무엇을 상대하는 건지 알 수 있도록…"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 65c5fd68-99e1-1e12-ae86-b09e1a7b9ba4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:65c5fd68-99e1-1e12-ae86-b09e1a7b9ba4
msgctxt "h7cb1c6d4g895cg4c7fgbaf8g1b5f0255cbef"
msgid ""
"Once we are cleansed, we infiltrate Moonrise Towers. Should there be "
"<i>ghaik</i>, we snatch their heads, one by one."
msgstr "우리가 정화되고 나면, 문라이즈 타워를 공격하자. 거기 <i>게이크</i>가 있다면, 놈들의 머리를 하나씩 박살내주는 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 660d06ef-a976-1ebe-9546-64988dc9a83b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:660d06ef-a976-1ebe-9546-64988dc9a83b
msgctxt "hd1793dcfgbf7ag41cdg93c9gb9c62802388e"
msgid "How is this possible...?"
msgstr "어떻게 이런 일이...?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 6615a110-2496-434b-9567-40d24c02af7e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:6615a110-2496-434b-9567-40d24c02af7e
msgctxt "h46a98a66g9678g4d1agab9bg2b4f2a0af73a"
msgid ""
"I suppose it was too much to hope we were going to be cured here and now. To "
"Moonrise, then."
msgstr "여기서 당장 치유될 거라 생각했던 건 과한 기대였나 보네요. 그럼, 문라이즈로 갑시다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 6962e500-6364-6984-7cf3-4ce68278a514
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Halsin_Knows_DarkJusticiars = True
#.     - ORI_Shadowheart_Event_DarkJusticiarHint = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:6962e500-6364-6984-7cf3-4ce68278a514
msgctxt "ha4409c16gdea4g4effgb62dg90554f7a7088"
msgid ""
"Long ago, a man called Ketheric Thorm built a secret stronghold deep down "
"there, before rallying a whole army of Dark Justiciars - Shar worshippers."
msgstr ""
"오래 전에, 케서릭 쏨이라는 남자가 저 깊숙한 지하에 비밀 요새를 지었어. 그리고선 다크 저스티시어 군대를 소집했지. 샤 신도들 말일세."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 69acd7f4-6dd5-b718-7a62-b9d455482299
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:69acd7f4-6dd5-b718-7a62-b9d455482299
msgctxt "h88785a1eg080fg43dbga5c6ga5c46f005c15"
msgid "Remind me."
msgstr "다시 알려주십시오."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 6a032b9d-4a1f-84b5-df0a-2c81378f06c3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_DruidAttack_State_PrepAfterDeathOfDruids = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:6a032b9d-4a1f-84b5-df0a-2c81378f06c3
msgctxt "h55d4612bg76f9g46dbgbadega8a1821177d3"
msgid ""
"A fellow druid. I can count on her to tend to the grove in my absence. Help "
"it heal."
msgstr "동료 드루이드라네. 그녀라면 내가 없는 동안 숲을 믿고 맡길 수 있지. 치유를 도와줄 테고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6ab65f27-d8e1-6be2-3884-ec6fa5b32801
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_ShadowDruid_State_RathIsPermaDefeated = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:6ab65f27-d8e1-6be2-3884-ec6fa5b32801
msgctxt "hbb80f49fg1ab6g4846gbdf6g67597867794b"
msgid "What about one of the others? Rath, perhaps?"
msgstr "다른 드루이드 중에서는 어때요? 라스라든지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6ae1b260-a8f9-c631-b26b-856a629cb932
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Halsin_Event_RevealedNautiloidEscape = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Halsin_Event_RevealedNautiloidEscape = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:6ae1b260-a8f9-c631-b26b-856a629cb932
msgctxt "hab8335b4g4cfcg4c52gaf08g45fb5eef0200"
msgid ""
"I wasn't taken to Moonrise - I was infected on a mind flayer ship, before it "
"crashed."
msgstr "저는 문라이즈에 이송되지 않았습니다. 마인드 플레이어 함선이 추락하기 전에, 그곳에서 감염되었죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 6dbcfea6-9a8a-0f90-6b3c-6c8fb154f8de
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:6dbcfea6-9a8a-0f90-6b3c-6c8fb154f8de
msgctxt "h9bc69aacg1e2dg4262gab29g117050b7cb05"
msgid "You may reconsider once you see the effects of the curse for yourself."
msgstr "저주의 효과를 직접 보고 나면 생각이 바뀔 수도 있다네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 6e5bb070-8e03-3f8b-80a5-58c14ccf190b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:6e5bb070-8e03-3f8b-80a5-58c14ccf190b
msgctxt "hfd60bcbcg3375g429fg8de5g33d13364bac1"
msgid "It is sealed off to me, to the whole world. Forever, perhaps."
msgstr "숲은 내게서, 온 세상에게서 단절되고 만 거야. 어쩌면 영원히 말일세."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6e840990-1fef-3650-77d5-e7feaa68fd65
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:6e840990-1fef-3650-77d5-e7feaa68fd65
msgctxt "hb6353f87g3990g4684g910bg4e5a5c6fd3a8"
msgid "'Almost'? That means I still have a chance. One I intend to take."
msgstr "'거의'? 가능성이 있다는 뜻이군요. 그 정도라면 감수하겠습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 6f49e286-7260-7b38-df69-90dc1e2b06e2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:6f49e286-7260-7b38-df69-90dc1e2b06e2
msgctxt "h2f816d21g9b31g4844g9ba0g5916f7e375ac"
msgid ""
"An ancient citadel, abandoned for years - and for very good reason - until "
"these cultists took it over."
msgstr "고대의 요새지. 이 사교도들이 차지하기 전까지 여러 해 동안 버려져 있었는데, 버려진 데에는 아주 분명한 이유가 있었다네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 6f704659-0705-ae9e-330f-6561356b4640
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:6f704659-0705-ae9e-330f-6561356b4640
msgctxt "h5b3b1feeg6877g4391gb7d9gca4723a1c86a"
msgid ""
"I sensed what was done to you from afar. Now let me confirm it; I need to "
"know exactly what we're dealing with..."
msgstr ""
"멀리서 그대에게 어떤 일이 벌어진 건지 느껴졌네. 내가 확인할 수 있게 해주게, 우리가 어떤 문제에 직면해 있는지 확신을 얻을 수 "
"있도록..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 6f771486-de0f-666b-c3fc-bf01dfb96113
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:6f771486-de0f-666b-c3fc-bf01dfb96113
msgctxt "h42de90f4g849ag4e76g8e9ag8758eda3b9cb"
msgid ""
"A drow forced me to defend myself. Afterwards, I was able to study the "
"parasite that slithered out of the corpse, see what drives these 'True "
"Souls'."
msgstr ""
"어떤 드로우와 싸워야만 했지. 그 시체에서 기어나온 기생충을 연구할 수 있었고, 무엇이 이 '참된 영혼'을 움직이는지 알 수 있었네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 7207f9ca-0107-9065-2d4f-0ca3a1df62c7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:7207f9ca-0107-9065-2d4f-0ca3a1df62c7
msgctxt "hf9d24004gc6e4g4b14g9f35gff1d3d2a50ea"
msgid ""
"I had no idea anyone beyond their ranks was infected. You have my sincere "
"sympathies."
msgstr "놈들 집단 외에도 감염된 사람이 있는 줄은 전혀 몰랐네. 그대를 진심으로 위로하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 751d0cea-31e7-6218-bebb-32a8d52705a3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Halsin_Event_RevealedNautiloidEscape = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:751d0cea-31e7-6218-bebb-32a8d52705a3
msgctxt "hd4e2f1cbg6925g4b44ga706gd3781f2ca1d9"
msgid "That must be where the ship was taking me - before it crashed."
msgstr "그 함선은 그곳으로 저를 데려가려 했던 거네요. 추락하기 전에는 말이죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 76e59499-c934-274c-9a66-8411cf78fc8d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:76e59499-c934-274c-9a66-8411cf78fc8d
msgctxt "h310c4e2ag26a3g4e5fgb7c0g9a23cb105cd7"
msgid ""
"There is a terrible curse surrounding Moonrise Towers - a shadow curse that "
"drains away all light and life."
msgstr "끔찍한 저주가 문라이즈 타워 주변을 에워싸고 있어. 모든 빛과 생명을 집어삼키는 그림자 저주지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 78be18f7-ff54-6651-cd32-5ec494d2be79
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:78be18f7-ff54-6651-cd32-5ec494d2be79
msgctxt "hdaa9e1a4g907eg4ebdg8439g9a32fc1dccf4"
msgid ""
"I helped overthrow Ketheric Thorm and his Dark Justiciars years ago. But I "
"failed to prevent him from unleashing darkness across the region before he "
"was defeated."
msgstr ""
"여러 해 전에, 난 케서릭 쏨과 그의 다크 저스티시어들을 타도하는 데 기여했지. 하지만 놈이 패배하기 전에 이 지역에 어둠을 풀어놓는 "
"것을 막진 못했네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 78fc79d5-17b5-4bb1-80e1-788361770f9c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:78fc79d5-17b5-4bb1-80e1-788361770f9c
msgctxt "h9e0f537cg8207g4cd8g8ec7g893c5b5b2cd1"
msgid "That sounds... novel. What is it that protects you?"
msgstr "그것 참... 신기한 일이로군. 그대를 지켜주는 그 정체가 뭔가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 79017afb-7bf4-cb6f-ff54-6fbdfc99e6e0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:79017afb-7bf4-cb6f-ff54-6fbdfc99e6e0
msgctxt "hd349de90g6712g4932g8c84g736521d0b47f"
msgid ""
"Or I was, at least. I went there - the grove is sealed off to me, to the "
"whole world."
msgstr "적어도, 예전에는 그랬네만. 숲에 다녀왔네. 이제 숲은 나하고도, 온 세상하고도 단절되었지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7aa7601f-1605-2c50-f655-fcdc23b52561
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:7aa7601f-1605-2c50-f655-fcdc23b52561
msgctxt "h00359a15ged04g4891gb20ag2a853cdb00f4"
msgid "Sounds like the grove will be in good hands, then. We should get going."
msgstr "그럼, 숲은 잘 돌아갈 것 같네요. 이제 떠나보죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7b304660-7aa3-afb0-7a42-a2a4ffd6a306
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:7b304660-7aa3-afb0-7a42-a2a4ffd6a306
msgctxt "he4e7cddfg6d3ag477cgb150g4951567e13b4"
msgid "Forget about the grove. What are you doing here?"
msgstr "숲 얘기는 그만 하고, 여기서 뭐 해요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 7bff56fd-3f3d-5132-1d4f-2dff9611b425
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:7bff56fd-3f3d-5132-1d4f-2dff9611b425
msgctxt "h85385679ga57dg4684gaa2dg604215e03825"
msgid ""
"Luckily, you have time - this magic has slowed your ceremorphosis to a "
"crawl. I just can't fathom why someone would do that."
msgstr ""
"다행히도, 아직 시간이 있소. 이 마법이 뇌변이의 진행 속도를 크게 늦췄네. 다만 대체 누가 그렇게 했는지 헤아릴 수 없을 뿐이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 7c714bd6-7f62-0c42-ed1d-97f7c447c7bc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:7c714bd6-7f62-0c42-ed1d-97f7c447c7bc
msgctxt "h5fb25f21g354fg4b78g92c0gf777957eb1dd"
msgid ""
"This is why I chose Francesca. She will restore simplicity and purity to the "
"grove in my absence."
msgstr "그렇기에 프란체스카를 고른 것이오. 내가 없는 동안 그녀가 숲의 소박하고 순수한 모습을 되찾아줄 수 있을 것이오."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 7e1157a7-7759-e042-f7f7-d02f70953f89
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:7e1157a7-7759-e042-f7f7-d02f70953f89
msgctxt "h28ebc487g8785g4d2ag9c83g05dbcad5ee91"
msgid "Anything is preferable to risking the shadow curse."
msgstr "그림자 저주를 피할 수 있다면 어떤 방법이라도 취해야 하오."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 805fd69b-65e6-762b-c183-0b326198ac75
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:805fd69b-65e6-762b-c183-0b326198ac75
msgctxt "hb8aae89bg50a5g4449g9eceg179712a9af13"
msgid "Sympathies? Can't you help me?"
msgstr "위로한다고요? 도와줄 순 없는 건가요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 80919b08-afb4-d0ec-28b8-80c6c735fd1a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:80919b08-afb4-d0ec-28b8-80c6c735fd1a
msgctxt "hf752a3d0gfdc9g426cgba6fgad60394a9fe1"
msgid ""
"I've long sought to return to Moonrise Towers - unfinished business. It "
"seems our fates have aligned."
msgstr "나도 오랫동안 문라이즈 타워에 돌아가기를 기다렸소, 끝맺을 일이 있어서 말이오. 우리 운명이 맞닿은 것 같군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 822d929d-33ea-7060-b856-0ed4ffcb40d5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:822d929d-33ea-7060-b856-0ed4ffcb40d5
msgctxt "h9f73de13ga91dg42ecg8f17g79c38f2f554c"
msgid ""
"You're half right - you have to get to Moonrise, but you still have a choice "
"of how to get there."
msgstr "절반만 맞았네, 문라이즈에 가야 하는 것은 맞지만, 여전히 그곳에 어떻게 갈 것인가를 결정해야 하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8237b104-be50-bcc8-79e1-4a27b476b735
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:8237b104-be50-bcc8-79e1-4a27b476b735
msgctxt "he075f738g8f92g4e43ga30fg6d631eb121c4"
msgid "Won't this cause resentment?"
msgstr "이 결정이 원망을 사지는 않을까요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 83a0101b-ca4f-8efb-32f3-526ecc02047f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:83a0101b-ca4f-8efb-32f3-526ecc02047f
msgctxt "h92eb0cbfg1d68g4cdcg9678gb96d1e67a081"
msgid ""
"The grove needs to move beyond the mistakes of the past. What it needs is an "
"unknown quantity; an outsider who can enforce the Oak Father's teachings "
"without bias."
msgstr ""
"이 숲은 과거의 실수를 넘어서기 위해 낯선 것들이 많이 필요하오. 바로 참나무 아버지의 가르침을 편견 없이 행할 수 있는 외부인이라오."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 850a934f-2225-210d-5a4e-b74c4c38329b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Halsin_Knows_ShadowCurse = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:850a934f-2225-210d-5a4e-b74c4c38329b
msgctxt "h3af272efg55dfg4548g8679gdf736a5626f6"
msgid ""
"Doesn't sound like I've much choice - I need to get to Moonrise, curse or "
"not."
msgstr "제게 선택지가 있는 것 같진 않군요, 문라이즈 타워로 향해야겠어요, 그곳이 저주 받았든 아니든."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 85bd92ad-7dec-9f0d-1762-054a12be31b8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 2f91518a-75e0-fd8c-d5d8-b38fc64aee5c_HalsinKnowsAboutMoonrise = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 2f91518a-75e0-fd8c-d5d8-b38fc64aee5c_HalsinKnowsAboutMoonrise = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:85bd92ad-7dec-9f0d-1762-054a12be31b8
msgctxt "h2f5544f0ge0b8g4346g981age0a446142162"
msgid "How are you so sure Moonrise is where I have to go?"
msgstr "문라이즈 타워에 가야 한다고 어째서 그렇게 확신하는 거죠?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 86130730-81b9-4108-aff8-9e9409a1a155
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(7) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:86130730-81b9-4108-aff8-9e9409a1a155
msgctxt "h4982475cgb60fg4651g8abag3b3ce6d79a20"
msgid ""
"This is sobering news indeed, but there's no use crying over spilt milk. If "
"this is our only option, to Moonrise Towers we go."
msgstr "분명 슬픈 소식이지만, 이미 엎질러진 물을 두고 울고 있어서는 의미가 없지. 문라이즈 타워가 우리 유일한 선택지라면, 나아가자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 8a73c00d-6204-2156-96bf-09453abeafaf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:8a73c00d-6204-2156-96bf-09453abeafaf
msgctxt "h3b822311g77b8g4648gb1d9g258578a4f104"
msgid ""
"Precisely. If we can understand just what this magic is, then perhaps we can "
"rid you of this parasite."
msgstr "정확하오. 이 마법이 어떤 것인지 이해할 수 있다면, 당신 속에 있는 기생충을 제거할 수 있을지도 모르오."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 8ac77de8-d217-f5b5-8f95-ee1b77f8adcd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Halsin_Knows_PlayerTadpoleCondition = True
#.     - GLO_Daisy_State_TriggerDaisyMissionStatement = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:8ac77de8-d217-f5b5-8f95-ee1b77f8adcd
msgctxt "h640fc71dg98e6g4edeg85e7g310e6d8f15b1"
msgid ""
"There's a chokehold of magic, binding the creature to you. Any efforts to "
"remove it would almost certainly kill you - or worse."
msgstr ""
"그대를 옥죄고 있는 마법이 있는데, 그 생명체를 그대와 결속하고 있다네. 그 기생충을 제거하려고 하면, 분명 그대가 죽고 말겠지. 그보다 "
"끔찍한 운명이 기다리고 있을지도 모르고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8cf5ca77-fc67-0d94-cb56-1bdb80bac3c6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Halsin_Event_RevealedNautiloidEscape = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Halsin_Event_RevealedNautiloidEscape = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:8cf5ca77-fc67-0d94-cb56-1bdb80bac3c6
msgctxt "h7428a1cbg4f18g42f3g8d14g832d889aece3"
msgid ""
"I escaped from an illithid ship after being infected. Maybe the process was "
"interrupted."
msgstr "감염되고 나서 일리시드 함선에서 탈출했어요. 변이 과정에 방해가 있었을지도 모르죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 8de8013f-d91e-710d-d838-80577e1ff88a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:8de8013f-d91e-710d-d838-80577e1ff88a
msgctxt "hda3ab244g34beg48a4gb250g0f3dd42004b5"
msgid ""
"I spent years researching the curse, trying to put an end to it. Nothing has "
"worked - yet."
msgstr "나는 저주를 끝내기 위해, 이를 연구하는 데 수년을 보냈다네. 하지만 아무것도 소용이 없었지. 아직은 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 8e75a61c-6a7a-161e-89a1-2cc15afef445
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:8e75a61c-6a7a-161e-89a1-2cc15afef445
msgctxt "h35d6f381gad44g411eg8e9ag00487ecd3a82"
msgid ""
"Resentment will spring up like mushrooms no matter what I do. You cannot "
"please everyone and you'd be a fool to try."
msgstr "내가 무엇을 하든 원망은 버섯처럼 솟아날 걸세. 모든 사람을 만족시킬 수는 없고, 그러고자 하는 것은 어리석은 일이니."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 8fd61e85-f83a-1835-14df-0c63dff42385
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 2f91518a-75e0-fd8c-d5d8-b38fc64aee5c_HiddenEntranceInSeluneTemple = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:8fd61e85-f83a-1835-14df-0c63dff42385
msgctxt "h5991cbc7gb21bg4bdegb079g43fa7a6dda87"
msgid ""
"You'll need to pick up where Aradin left off - find the hidden entrance. "
"It's somewhere in the temple of Selûne."
msgstr "아라딘의 뒤를 이어 숨겨진 입구를 찾아야 하네. 셀루네의 신전 어딘가에 있지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9133b3d6-a435-ecad-d0aa-146fc2ec4409
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Halsin_Knows_ShadowCurse = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:9133b3d6-a435-ecad-d0aa-146fc2ec4409
msgctxt "h279992c1gf484g415fg971bg47af64dac413"
msgid "What do you suggest?"
msgstr "어떻게 하면 좋을까요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 9255ce94-b6ab-1248-af6e-ee381f6bb220
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_WolfPens_State_HalsinIntroHappened = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:9255ce94-b6ab-1248-af6e-ee381f6bb220
msgctxt "h0ee56a3bg1065g4da9gab1bga2cba1bc2734"
msgid ""
"I have nowhere else to turn, it seems. I went to the grove, but... I cannot "
"face what has happened there."
msgstr "내겐 이제 다른 선택지가 없는 것 같군. 숲으로 향했지만, 그곳은... 그곳에 벌어진 일을 차마 지켜볼 수 없었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 9315f954-d1f8-0ec2-732d-7a0eb130461b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:9315f954-d1f8-0ec2-732d-7a0eb130461b
msgctxt "h37a401ffgd31cg421dg9bd3g9d589ff7b9cf"
msgid ""
"If we can get to Moonrise and understand just what this magic is, then "
"perhaps we can rid you of this parasite."
msgstr "만약 우리가 문라이즈에 가서 이 마법의 정체를 알아낼 수 있다면, 이 기생충을 제거할 수 있을지도 모르지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 94808dc5-c274-6068-3025-d78b583aa506
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:94808dc5-c274-6068-3025-d78b583aa506
msgctxt "h15c5909eg166ag4b61ga0b6gb0afeb415753"
msgid ""
"Aradin and his lot were looking for a way down there - they were promised "
"riches if they retrieved a relic called the Nightsong. But I think there's "
"more."
msgstr ""
"아라딘 일행도 그 지하로 가는 길을 찾고 있었네. 이들은 '밤의 노래'라는 유물을 되찾아주고 부를 얻기로 했던 모양이지만 내 생각에는 "
"그보다 더 많은 것이 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 94b303cd-a876-6f99-305a-139bc796bb63
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_UNDERDARK(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Halsin_Event_PreferOverlandRoute = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:94b303cd-a876-6f99-305a-139bc796bb63
msgctxt "hdab785eagf37cg437cg8349g983d2da67335"
msgid "I know the Underdark - it's lethal. I'll travel overland."
msgstr "언더다크가 어떤 곳인지 알고 있습니다. 위험한 지역이죠. 지상으로 여행해야겠습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 950a6c45-6bfb-bb53-fa09-310eabe4227f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_AdventurersQuest_Knows_LeaderMap = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - DEN_AdventurersQuest_Knows_LeaderMap = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:950a6c45-6bfb-bb53-fa09-310eabe4227f
msgctxt "h9eb23d37gd315g4f46gaf1cg22831d77b74e"
msgid ""
"A dwarf called Brian, I believe. Though there's no guarantee that the "
"goblins left him recognisable."
msgstr "내 기억이 맞다면, 브라이언이라는 이름의 드워프였어. 하지만 고블린들이 그를 멀쩡히 내버려 뒀을지는 모르겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 95528fb5-8299-640d-8d54-ad1845e14bb6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Underdark_EverEnteredBefore = False
#.      - GOB_TempleAccess_Event_PuzzleSolved = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 2f91518a-75e0-fd8c-d5d8-b38fc64aee5c_HiddenEntranceInSeluneTemple = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:95528fb5-8299-640d-8d54-ad1845e14bb6
msgctxt "h42c97dd0gc504g4860gbb61gab31468d8c10"
msgid "So how do I find this underground route?"
msgstr "그래서 그 지하로를 어떻게 찾죠?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 958697eb-5869-a545-5ad9-3bbc9896b717
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:958697eb-5869-a545-5ad9-3bbc9896b717
msgctxt "h2b132dc4g94bag4af7ga339g4ba81c3697db"
msgid "I was right to seek you out. You're after a cure for this parasite."
msgstr "그대를 찾아 나서길 잘했군. 기생충을 치료할 방법을 찾고 있구나."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 961585cd-22d3-895d-91de-ebeaf5823f89
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Halsin_Event_WillJoinAtCamp = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:961585cd-22d3-895d-91de-ebeaf5823f89
msgctxt "h47ac1d43ge15fg4a3dg973cg252a953a52d3"
msgid ""
"A fine camp you have here. Certainly an improvement on that filthy cage the "
"goblins had me in."
msgstr "깔끔한 야영지를 차려두었군. 고블린 놈들이 날 가둬두었던 더러운 철장에 비하면 훨씬 낫다네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 9752c234-7027-fb1a-b255-30fee34f74dd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:9752c234-7027-fb1a-b255-30fee34f74dd
msgctxt "hfdea01e1g63bcg4688gb821g0d483d23134a"
msgid ""
"It's immensely powerful, whatever it is - strong enough to slow "
"ceremorphosis to a crawl. Luckily, that gives you more time."
msgstr ""
"그게 대체 무슨 존재인지는 모르겠지만, 정말 강력해. 뇌변이의 속도를 무척 느리게 만들 정도의 힘이 있단 말이야. 공교롭게도 그 덕에 "
"시간을 더 벌 수 있지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 9881ed4d-0481-8b73-e78d-e99ab8f56183
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:9881ed4d-0481-8b73-e78d-e99ab8f56183
msgctxt "h5647614bg0c56g4588g9504g26a83ab82b26"
msgid "I am Halsin, First Druid of the Emerald Grove."
msgstr "나는 에메랄드 숲의 최고 드루이드, 할신이라고 하네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 9acbf196-df77-90cc-9bb9-82c4ebaf71f2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:9acbf196-df77-90cc-9bb9-82c4ebaf71f2
msgctxt "hb2fffb5ag5b5cg4db5gb3ddg7874887ed57a"
msgid ""
"There is hope... but it isn't found here, at my hands - at least not yet."
msgstr "희망은 있지만... 여기서 찾을 순 없었고, 내 손에 있지도 않다네. 적어도 아직은 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 9af68241-a4f5-015a-3e6a-51fc439c82ed
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:9af68241-a4f5-015a-3e6a-51fc439c82ed
msgctxt "h648a20ecga816g4e56g8ae0gf6ba8bbc373e"
msgid ""
"Patience. I can't just snap my fingers... but I know where the solution "
"almost certainly lies - Moonrise Towers."
msgstr ""
"침착하게나. 그저 내 손가락을 튕긴다고 해결할 수 있는 것이 아니야... 하지만 그 해결책이 어디에 있는지는 확실히 알고 있네, 문라이즈 "
"타워지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 9d01b539-693e-d7a4-a35c-1f8e147c4239
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:9d01b539-693e-d7a4-a35c-1f8e147c4239
msgctxt "hab668bdagdf75g402fg85cfg50832c3682f3"
msgid ""
"I may be able to help you find a more definitive solution to your problem."
msgstr "자네의 문제에 보다 확실한 해답을 찾는 일을 도울 수 있을 지도 모르네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9da06dc7-6de8-b050-3cd5-a7283b5e9183
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:9da06dc7-6de8-b050-3cd5-a7283b5e9183
msgctxt "h3e467cedg8be7g4ba0g9944g6424f1d4f4d1"
msgid "And you think I'll find a cure if I find this source at Moonrise?"
msgstr "그리고 당신은 내가 문라이즈에서 이 근원을 찾으면 치유할 방법도 찾을 수 있을 거라고 생각하나요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = a0402d03-be75-0e92-57c1-ea03415d8298
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:a0402d03-be75-0e92-57c1-ea03415d8298
msgctxt "hd16c6830g8507g4051g8114gbebe7a9ecc3b"
msgid ""
"Your resolve is most admirable. It'll serve you well for where you've to go -"
" Moonrise Towers."
msgstr "그대의 결의는 매우 감탄스럽소. 그대가 앞으로 향해야 할 곳에서 아주 유용하겠군, 문라이즈 타워 말이오."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = a2fe1421-c4fd-4caf-1ee4-a96510eb86bb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:a2fe1421-c4fd-4caf-1ee4-a96510eb86bb
msgctxt "h91108defgc8bag40e3gade7g26d8ab6c1cdd"
msgid ""
"Patience. I can't just snap my fingers... but I know where the solution "
"almost certainly lies - Moonrise Towers."
msgstr ""
"침착하시오. 그저 내 손가락을 튕긴다고 해결할 수 있는 것이 아니오... 하지만 그 해결책이 어디에 있는지는 확실히 알고 있소, 문라이즈 "
"타워지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = a4504e21-33e8-9740-f0dc-76e761e60177
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_WolfPens_State_HalsinIntroHappened = True
#.      - GOB_State_LeadersAreDead = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:a4504e21-33e8-9740-f0dc-76e761e60177
msgctxt "h3b69230ag73d1g4926g9591g196346977ecc"
msgid ""
"I owe you a debt for seeing to the goblins' leaders. Now I'm here to pay "
"that debt."
msgstr "그대에게 고블린 지도자들을 처리해 준 빚을 졌지. 이제 그 빚을 갚으러 왔소."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = a782611a-bb10-8352-ed92-4dcedc465aac
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:a782611a-bb10-8352-ed92-4dcedc465aac
msgctxt "hd2401b42g5837g4e5ag93c9gbdd225fe9b5a"
msgid ""
"Those illithid creatures threaten the natural order - it's my duty to do "
"what I can to stop them."
msgstr "일리시드 생명체들이 자연의 질서를 위협하고 있소. 이를 막기 위해 최선을 다하는 것이 내 의무라오."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a96a2ce1-70ed-ba98-3408-b4c53ad48241
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_Lockdown_State_Active = False
#.      - CAMP_Halsin_Knows_SuccessorFirstDruid = False
#.      - DEN_AttackOnDen_State_DenVictory = False
#.      - GOB_State_LeadersAreDead = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CAMP_Halsin_Knows_SuccessorFirstDruid = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:a96a2ce1-70ed-ba98-3408-b4c53ad48241
msgctxt "h54526686g647dg4aa6ga6f3ge3949a761a70"
msgid "What about the grove?"
msgstr "숲은 어쩌고요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = abbd8861-9f66-6235-4b0d-83203211dae5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_ElevatorToScl_Used = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:abbd8861-9f66-6235-4b0d-83203211dae5
msgctxt "hf4aeb79cge632g4e7egabf8gb1e3e902ee52"
msgid "Absolute followers - but that's about all."
msgstr "절대자의 추종자들이 있더군요. 하지만 그게 전부였습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = ac2eafdc-7a04-6d1b-26d8-9cb29cab0c97
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:ac2eafdc-7a04-6d1b-26d8-9cb29cab0c97
msgctxt "heddf800bga47fg4698gb153g3ff5c74ed2f6"
msgid ""
"From this stronghold, Ketheric's forces could access both the temple of "
"Selûne and Moonrise Towers - but he was defeated before he could launch an "
"attack."
msgstr ""
"그 요새에서 케서릭의 군대는 셀루네의 신전과 문라이즈 타워, 두 곳에 모두 접근할 수 있었지. 하지만 놈은 미처 공세를 시작하기도 전에 "
"패퇴하고 말았네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ad4f31a7-b7d4-6057-184d-e8bb2cb531ec
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Halsin_Knows_ShadowCurse = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_GITHYANKI
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:ad4f31a7-b7d4-6057-184d-e8bb2cb531ec
msgctxt "h7351e4b5ge46fg4682ga4aag0e87e5306679"
msgid ""
"There must be other ways to cure myself - my kin have dealt with these "
"parasites before."
msgstr "분명 절 치유할 다른 방법이 있을 겁니다. 내 동족은 과거에도 이 기생충을 처리한 적이 있죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ad4f31a7-b7d4-6057-184d-e8bb2cb531ec
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Halsin_Knows_ShadowCurse = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:ad4f31a7-b7d4-6057-184d-e8bb2cb531ec
msgctxt "ha37f2e18gfd43g47c9gb487gbadc4d159eff"
msgid "I'm sure there must be other ways to cure myself."
msgstr "분명 절 치유할 다른 방법이 있을 겁니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ae445703-d387-d8dd-2338-f107e232a6a7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CAMP_Halsin_Knows_ShadowCurseMotivation = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:ae445703-d387-d8dd-2338-f107e232a6a7
msgctxt "h72949bbdgdcc3g4f8fgbe75g351a5c02ad72"
msgid ""
"Is that why you went with Aradin? You thought he might find this route to "
"Moonrise?"
msgstr "그래서 아라딘과 함께 간 겁니까? 아라딘이 문라이즈로 가는 길을 찾을 수 있을 거라 생각해서?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = af6b66f3-652c-5be0-16f7-89d00f62c931
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:af6b66f3-652c-5be0-16f7-89d00f62c931
msgctxt "h48b4b836gf277g4f29ga25eg8fa3114849b4"
msgid "I don't know."
msgstr "저도 모르겠습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b085318e-bf42-d6b5-05ea-703c58f731c4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:b085318e-bf42-d6b5-05ea-703c58f731c4
msgctxt "h5be54be2g642eg4904ga1f0g8585ec9134ba"
msgid "Who?"
msgstr "누구?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = b2261083-4687-7082-5b91-e862d8f507b8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:b2261083-4687-7082-5b91-e862d8f507b8
msgctxt "hef4d2fe3g1098g42fagaf5cg6b55dd204e55"
msgid "Already...? If only I'd gone with you instead of Aradin."
msgstr "벌써...? 아라딘 대신 그대와 같이 갈걸 그랬소."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = b2a1c2ac-ef32-958f-fdab-85156570d9fc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:b2a1c2ac-ef32-958f-fdab-85156570d9fc
msgctxt "h0c134997ge68dg4901gb11fgffa496341112"
msgid ""
"Indeed. After we dealt with the drow that ambushed us, Nettie and I were "
"able to inspect the corpse - and the creature that slithered out of it."
msgstr "그렇소. 네티와 나는 우리를 급습한 드로우를 처리한 후, 시체와 그 시체에서 기어나온 생명체를 조사할 수 있었소."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = b320c103-7f93-bb93-4d20-4060ef1c7bed
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_DruidAttack_State_PrepAfterDeathOfDruids = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:b320c103-7f93-bb93-4d20-4060ef1c7bed
msgctxt "hbf3ec53dg7bb4g40feg9b96ga9b49e63f3a3"
msgid ""
"Precisely! Who indeed? You do not know, and neither do any of the others."
msgstr "바로 그거요! 그게 누구냐고? 그대는 모르겠지, 그리고 숲의 다른 이들도 마찬가지고 말이오."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = b3fe4f4d-a061-670b-cd6f-7a300b1face5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:b3fe4f4d-a061-670b-cd6f-7a300b1face5
msgctxt "h8cdb1dabg83d3g437dgaf86g5b9ef405290c"
msgid ""
"Contrary to how some think of us, we druids can play politics when necessary."
msgstr "다른 이들이 우리에 대해 생각하는 것과 다르게, 우리 드루이드들은 필요한 경우엔 권모술수도 부릴 수 있소."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = b61567c1-16db-81e8-ff64-b251dcf30d5b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Absolute_Knows_MoonriseTowers = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:b61567c1-16db-81e8-ff64-b251dcf30d5b
msgctxt "hee1fe7e4g5943g45c1gb4abgb9b08a0e3c46"
msgid ""
"If you can find this place, I'll wager it will reveal a path to Moonrise "
"Towers, bypassing the worst of the shadow curse."
msgstr "이곳을 찾을 수 있다면, 그림자 저주를 피해 문라이즈 타워로 가는 길이 열릴 것이라 장담하오."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = b6abb339-5a13-3206-5407-8be702c2c3f2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:b6abb339-5a13-3206-5407-8be702c2c3f2
msgctxt "h731fb3begdabeg487cg8a2ag59f293a62943"
msgid ""
"I won't be held accountable just because you're naive enough to expect easy "
"answers. Now allow me to continue."
msgstr "쉬운 길을 바라는 그대의 안일함까지 내 탓으로 돌리진 말아주겠나. 이제 하던 말을 계속하겠네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bacc6f58-f151-8a6f-e92e-010f829b72d1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:bacc6f58-f151-8a6f-e92e-010f829b72d1
msgctxt "h621ea813g4ecfg45e9gbf26ge016a73d607f"
msgid "Let's go, then."
msgstr "그럼, 갑시다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bc710da7-6193-c577-6315-9c3d9eb60b60
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Halsin_Knows_ShadowCurse = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Halsin_Knows_ShadowCurse = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:bc710da7-6193-c577-6315-9c3d9eb60b60
msgctxt "hc315f0ffg0893g4ac0gaba2gc4807dccd1ba"
msgid "What's so dangerous?"
msgstr "뭐가 그렇게 위험하죠?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = bd594adf-536b-971a-88ef-d3259162155c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:bd594adf-536b-971a-88ef-d3259162155c
msgctxt "h6739edc6g8581g464cgb38ag8628d74c2116"
msgid ""
"Rath has promise, but he has a ways to go yet. He wasn't able to stop Kagha "
"by himself. The grove needs experience and a strong hand."
msgstr ""
"라스는 장래가 유망하지만, 아직은 갈 길이 멀다오. 그는 스스로 카그하를 막지 못했소. 숲에는 경험이 많고 의지가 강한 이가 필요하오."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = bfb59e37-270d-eddd-4be9-e45f7c69dc8c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:bfb59e37-270d-eddd-4be9-e45f7c69dc8c
msgctxt "he804c90fg9151g4bf3gb354g1582d96cf87e"
msgid ""
"Oak Father preserve you, child... You're infected, aren't you? The mind "
"flayers' spawn."
msgstr "자식이여, 참나무 아버지께서 보호해 주시길... 그대는 감염된 것 아닌가? 마인드 플레이어의 산물에 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = c13496bb-ad18-6ff3-0426-614b4d3ab97b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:c13496bb-ad18-6ff3-0426-614b4d3ab97b
msgctxt "haf04921bg3a5fg4ff9ga032g004c93e03db9"
msgid ""
"Aradin and his lot were looking for the same entrance - they sought an "
"artefact called the Nightsong that was supposed to be housed somewhere down "
"there."
msgstr ""
"아라딘 일행도 같은 입구를 찾고 있었는데, 그들은 그곳 어딘가에 보관되어 있을 것으로 추정되는 '밤의 노래'라는 아티팩트를 찾고 있었네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c1352445-1270-6f59-ce15-7e3f573d43cd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:c1352445-1270-6f59-ce15-7e3f573d43cd
msgctxt "h213951b4gb1d5g48c9ga0b2gab90752f1ce0"
msgid "I've got more exploring to do."
msgstr "탐색을 계속해 봐야겠습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = c7f6d15e-4c06-4b4d-ba8b-c4b5601eca9e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(5) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:c7f6d15e-4c06-4b4d-ba8b-c4b5601eca9e
msgctxt "hbea4455cg4c8dg4999g808fga59d30175eec"
msgid ""
"Finally, we're catching up on our puppet master. And the hunt ends at "
"Moonrise Towers."
msgstr "마침내, 이제 우리를 지배하려는 자에 가까워지고 있군. 문라이즈 타워에서 사냥이 끝날 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = ca0ee601-7096-31ad-eae9-381b567b8335
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:ca0ee601-7096-31ad-eae9-381b567b8335
msgctxt "hf232c8eagf09ag4446gb935g13dae6e36a1b"
msgid ""
"Precisely. Then perhaps I could have done something about both the shadow "
"curse and ceremorphosis aberrations."
msgstr "정확하네. 그랬으면 내가 그림자 저주와 괴이한 뇌변이 양쪽 모두에 손을 쓸 수도 있었을 텐데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = ca717669-2970-723f-4fa8-79d64b130399
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_AdventurersQuest_Knows_LeaderMap = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - DEN_AdventurersQuest_Knows_LeaderMap = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:ca717669-2970-723f-4fa8-79d64b130399
msgctxt "hdbeb760agba27g4928ga0abg82997a1a9fdd"
msgid ""
"One of the adventurers had a clue to help find it - a dwarf called Brian. It "
"might still be found on his corpse, wherever the goblins left it."
msgstr ""
"모험가 중 한 명이 그걸 찾는 단서를 가지고 있었지, 브라이언이라는 드워프였어. 고블린들이 그의 시체를 어디 뒀는진 모르겠지만, 아직 "
"그곳에 남아 있을지도 모르네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = ca949f8e-7548-8e3a-c994-ac8a793ab98f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:ca949f8e-7548-8e3a-c994-ac8a793ab98f
msgctxt "hfe6a0088gea00g4db5ga4beg6a6d5f959365"
msgid ""
"I don't know. Ketheric's followers were defeated or vanished before the "
"effects of the curse took hold."
msgstr "모르겠군. 케서릭의 추종자들은 저주의 영향이 퍼지기 전에 패퇴하거나 사라졌어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = cbf452e9-4c4e-4186-475e-ea4369764b74
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_AttackOnDen_State_DenVictory = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:cbf452e9-4c4e-4186-475e-ea4369764b74
msgctxt "hcb58c98agbee1g4a78g814bgfa7c9bc9b922"
msgid ""
"I am Halsin, First Druid of the Emerald Grove - which <i>you</i> saved. "
"Thank you."
msgstr "나는 에메랄드 숲의 최고 드루이드, 할신이라네. <i>자네가</i> 나를 구했어. 고맙네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = ce0bff07-2dc7-6930-2753-bdd42c16efc9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:ce0bff07-2dc7-6930-2753-bdd42c16efc9
msgctxt "h8f3d42b3g0f52g4e64gbd1fgf22efb60b599"
msgid "No. At least, not right now."
msgstr "없지. 적어도, 당장은 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d0778a11-ba7e-11de-02cb-08a92d440302
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:d0778a11-ba7e-11de-02cb-08a92d440302
msgctxt "hba8e124fge9bfg45a2gb4d5g19850ee082d4"
msgid "What would you do?"
msgstr "당신이라면 어떻게 하겠습니까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d30e582f-8d00-d1b8-5aa0-67806380cb6f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:d30e582f-8d00-d1b8-5aa0-67806380cb6f
msgctxt "h707ad8f6g41bag4d58g9598g1897d58c81b5"
msgid "This magic isn't typical of ceremorphosis?"
msgstr "이 마법은 일반적인 뇌변이의 특징이 아닌 건가요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d39d6f52-ac31-222b-b57f-9487e5d35090
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:d39d6f52-ac31-222b-b57f-9487e5d35090
msgctxt "hfd4989f2g2f8eg417fgb7bdg021544ef70c7"
msgid "I remember. To Moonrise Towers, then."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d4cb1bbb-3944-3bcc-cf0e-85dae82613c3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Halsin_Event_PreferUnderdarkRoute = True
#.   Local:
#.      - 2f91518a-75e0-fd8c-d5d8-b38fc64aee5c_HiddenEntranceInSeluneTemple = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 2f91518a-75e0-fd8c-d5d8-b38fc64aee5c_HiddenEntranceInSeluneTemple = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:d4cb1bbb-3944-3bcc-cf0e-85dae82613c3
msgctxt "h4a8257d1gb2eag4162gb6ebg26f75a311f94"
msgid "How do I find this passage through the Underdark?"
msgstr "언더다크를 통해 가는 경로를 어떻게 찾죠?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = d6d03a19-e50b-ef67-f7df-fb74be4d6b52
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:d6d03a19-e50b-ef67-f7df-fb74be4d6b52
msgctxt "hc6afbc4cg6dfdg4082g99e5g0b6c98aa3870"
msgid ""
"That sounds like what you need. But the next part of the journey mightn't be "
"straightforward - or safe."
msgstr "그게 그대에게 필요한 것 같군. 하지만 여정의 다음 부분은 그리 간단하거나 - 안전하지 않을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = d9156cef-54e7-a9bf-7ed1-d2e5047ca0b1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:d9156cef-54e7-a9bf-7ed1-d2e5047ca0b1
msgctxt "h553f0922g8b9cg4dcbg88a4gb3844ec815f8"
msgid ""
"No, this is different. <i>Altered.</i> But I believe I know where answers "
"can be found - Moonrise Towers."
msgstr ""
"아니, 다른 것이라네. <i>변형된 것이지.</i> 하지만 나는 답을 어디서 찾을 수 있는지 알고 있다네. 바로 문라이즈 타워지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = d9fd3758-31dc-12da-4d95-ef90a9e0ea8d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:d9fd3758-31dc-12da-4d95-ef90a9e0ea8d
msgctxt "hb0763f9eg0287g4187gb840g360b1b0c0cba"
msgid "Hmm. Sometimes a mysterious cure is worse than the disease."
msgstr "흠. 때로는 신비로운 약이 병보다 나쁠 때도 있지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = da9ce2d0-a61a-07e2-bd48-9eb3c8e7b24d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_UNDERDARK(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Halsin_Event_PreferOverlandRoute = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:da9ce2d0-a61a-07e2-bd48-9eb3c8e7b24d
msgctxt "hcc389481g8b47g4ac0gac76g427191da9fdf"
msgid ""
"I don't want to risk getting lost in the Underdark - I'll journey overland."
msgstr "언더다크에서 길을 잃는 위험을 감수하고 싶지는 않군요. 지상으로 모험해야겠습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ddfc7634-bc59-5eed-1745-fab3b827a854
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:ddfc7634-bc59-5eed-1745-fab3b827a854
msgctxt "h197d9305gc743g4cf3gb8bcgb06feb5e564d"
msgid "That's it? Just go to this place?"
msgstr "그게 전부인가요? 그냥 그 장소로 가는 게?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = de2f9d88-ace3-4787-707d-26d337d56f9f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Halsin_Knows_AboutGrymforge = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:de2f9d88-ace3-4787-707d-26d337d56f9f
msgctxt "hd5074a16gd86fg4f73gafa6g6de1c3e58013"
msgid ""
"It may prove impossible to avoid the shadow curse entirely, but if you find "
"any way to limit your exposure, seize it."
msgstr "그림자 저주의 영향을 완전히 피해 가는 것은 불가능할지도 모르지만, 노출을 최소화할 기회가 있다면, 반드시 사수하시게."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = defe294b-5234-b79e-e03f-c156d09f8cd1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:defe294b-5234-b79e-e03f-c156d09f8cd1
msgctxt "h9dd10a15g4786g4fa7g8035g0600df4fc09c"
msgid "May Silvanus guide us."
msgstr "실바누스께서 우리를 인도하시기를."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e18852c1-c0e8-f16f-db03-fc7a9bb0a395
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:e18852c1-c0e8-f16f-db03-fc7a9bb0a395
msgctxt "h31e23991gf3dag415dgada6gad3b5954c78a"
msgid "That doesn't sound much like hope to me. Can't you help?"
msgstr "별로 희망적으로 들리진 않군요. 도와줄 순 없습니까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = e3416c2a-8f72-7b92-7130-30bf6964fbad
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:e3416c2a-8f72-7b92-7130-30bf6964fbad
msgctxt "h0637c609gb571g4caagad23g21ea645f6497"
msgid "A fine camp you have here. My apologies for showing up unannounced."
msgstr "근사한 야영지를 차려 두었군. 예고도 없이 찾아와서 미안하네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e3681b89-d451-3ecb-53b8-138e70037543
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_WolfPens_HalsinBear_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:e3681b89-d451-3ecb-53b8-138e70037543
msgctxt "h29fcf079gce06g4a8agbd52g11b2d5f829d3"
msgid "You promised you'd do something about my infection."
msgstr "당신이 제 감염에 대해 뭔가 해주기로 약속하셨잖아요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = e4cacdaf-4e93-4a8d-d3d6-865424e6efac
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:e4cacdaf-4e93-4a8d-d3d6-865424e6efac
msgctxt "hc8d4f981gfe22g4193ga5afg2b4b2db98ded"
msgid ""
"Apart from facing legions of Absolute followers? The whole region is "
"shrouded in a curse - a shadow curse."
msgstr "절대자 교단의 군단을 마주하는 것 말고 말인가? 그 지역 전체가 저주로 뒤덮여 있네. 그림자 저주지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e59fecd7-dc4d-4fdb-3b4e-472260b596b8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:e59fecd7-dc4d-4fdb-3b4e-472260b596b8
msgctxt "hfa860b1bgd759g47e9g8677g894e374bbee2"
msgid "I'm sorry about the grove."
msgstr "숲의 일은 유감이에요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e8f53c86-1e41-5d6a-7fd1-0e4f9e9fa7bf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Halsin_Knows_IsMissing = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:e8f53c86-1e41-5d6a-7fd1-0e4f9e9fa7bf
msgctxt "h1411fb02gadf9g4bbegb3beg99a23daa0315"
msgid ""
"First Druid? You sound like someone who could help with a problem I have..."
msgstr "최고 드루이드라고요? 당신이라면 제 문제를 도와줄 수 있을지도 모르겠군요..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = e92aaf43-c0a9-89dc-aad5-2f439b66cd21
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Halsin_Knows_IsMissing = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:e92aaf43-c0a9-89dc-aad5-2f439b66cd21
msgctxt "h88a6532fg78c3g4047g851cg8cb9fa4e9015"
msgid "Looking for you, of course. We have work to do."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = e92fe6e1-993a-8f8e-745e-f56dd485b391
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Absolute_Knows_MoonriseTowers = True
#.     - GLO_Halsin_Quest_GoToMoonrise = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:e92fe6e1-993a-8f8e-745e-f56dd485b391
msgctxt "h4ae871dcg42fag40abg835cg67d74735f993"
msgid ""
"That place is where the cultists send their captives. Innocents go in, True "
"Souls come out. It has to be the source of this magic."
msgstr ""
"그 장소는 이 광신도들이 그들의 포로를 보내는 곳이오. 무고한 자가 들어가면, 참된 영혼이 나온다오. 이것이 바로 이 마법의 근원일 "
"것이오."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = e9c43586-47a7-f8e4-fd84-beb940517148
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:e9c43586-47a7-f8e4-fd84-beb940517148
msgctxt "h586f9e0bgfea7g40d4g855ega619a31e2cef"
msgid ""
"Indeed. After we dealt with the drow that ambushed us, Nettie and I were "
"able to inspect the corpse - and the creature that slithered out of it."
msgstr "그렇소. 네티와 나는 우리를 급습한 드로우를 처리한 후, 시체와 그 시체에서 기어나온 생명체를 조사할 수 있었소."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e9e19c5d-383f-d85a-dcf9-b28cc4cd5698
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Halsin_Knows_ShadowCurse = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Halsin_Knows_ShadowCurse = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:e9e19c5d-383f-d85a-dcf9-b28cc4cd5698
msgctxt "he9aa2e9bg8c14g4e92gbdd1gac6adc4515ca"
msgid "There's no time to spare, then - to Moonrise Towers."
msgstr "그럼 낭비할 시간이 없겠군요, 문라이즈 타워로 갑시다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f46a0230-f527-f36c-468f-91162a599411
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:f46a0230-f527-f36c-468f-91162a599411
msgctxt "hcb88911ag16efg484eg9180g33784006117b"
msgid ""
"You can see that I have free will - you don't need to know any more than "
"that."
msgstr "보시다시피, 제겐 자유 의지가 있죠. 지금 말씀드릴 수 있는 건 그것뿐이에요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = f4d23b5d-81f0-7202-f781-b1dde36a49ce
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:f4d23b5d-81f0-7202-f781-b1dde36a49ce
msgctxt "h4bc6764dg2b50g47ceg8a3cg4648cdbaaf1b"
msgid "What were you expecting? That I'd mumble a spell or whip out a potion?"
msgstr "뭘 기대한 것이오? 내가 주문을 외우거나, 물약이라도 꺼낼 줄 알았소?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = f6324b70-f0c9-81f0-88fd-06123050a17f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Halsin_Knows_IsMissing = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:f6324b70-f0c9-81f0-88fd-06123050a17f
msgctxt "h93399503gbf69g4e80gb860g96c08ac0e4f4"
msgid ""
"I'm here for you. I believe I can help with the parasite lurking within."
msgstr "그대를 도우러 왔네. 그대 머릿속에 있는 기생충 문제, 나라면 해결할 수 있을 걸세."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = f6c9ddb0-8875-d08f-dade-d7965902d106
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:f6c9ddb0-8875-d08f-dade-d7965902d106
msgctxt "h1e4b8f8dg4fdeg49a1gb57bg19570df78760"
msgid ""
"If I can join you and get close to Moonrise, perhaps I can lift this curse, "
"same as you may find a cure for your infection."
msgstr "만약 내가 당신과 함께 문라이즈에 가까이 갈 수 있다면, 당신은 감염 치료제를 찾고 나는 이 저주를 풀 수 있을지도 모르오."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f748221a-c020-a1c5-8e9f-eb37c8e00061
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 2f91518a-75e0-fd8c-d5d8-b38fc64aee5c_UnfinishedBusiness = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CAMP_Halsin_Knows_ShadowCurseMotivation = True
#.   Local:
#.     - 2f91518a-75e0-fd8c-d5d8-b38fc64aee5c_UnfinishedBusiness = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:f748221a-c020-a1c5-8e9f-eb37c8e00061
msgctxt "h6ef87824g3265g4dd4gb81ag5e9ce4a424ec"
msgid "You want to go to Moonrise yourself? Why?"
msgstr "당신도 문라이즈 타워로 가겠다고요? 왜죠?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f7a05dc5-3f12-845b-ea6c-f86e664f6159
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:f7a05dc5-3f12-845b-ea6c-f86e664f6159
msgctxt "h98eebd25gf1b8g48c4g8024g48f95bd671cc"
msgid "You know about my problem...?"
msgstr "제 문제에 대해 아시나요...?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f9205c3d-5c6c-7b7c-efa4-90634b1314eb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_ShadowDruid_State_RathIsPermaDefeated = True
#.      - DEN_Apprentice_State_Dead = True
#.      - DEN_DruidAttack_State_PrepAfterDeathOfDruids = False
#.      - DEN_ShadowDruid_State_KaghaIsDead = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:f9205c3d-5c6c-7b7c-efa4-90634b1314eb
msgctxt "h6e12ec57g1f68g406cgbdd0g105e3439f7e0"
msgid "There's nobody in the grove you'd choose?"
msgstr "숲에선 아무도 고를 사람이 없었습니까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f9c3edb6-f2ca-b91e-d364-041e11d161a9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_WolfPens_HalsinBear_HasMet(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:f9c3edb6-f2ca-b91e-d364-041e11d161a9
msgctxt "h5339ababg1c88g4d76g867dg0eef1af08dbb"
msgid ""
"That doesn't sound much like hope to me. Can't you just help here and now?"
msgstr "그건 딱히 희망적인 이야기 같지 않은데요. 지금 당장 여기서 절 도울 순 없나요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = faaa710e-c4dc-54ca-8afe-961891be088a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:faaa710e-c4dc-54ca-8afe-961891be088a
msgctxt "hf2a7cdf8gdcdeg4122g9483g520153a85383"
msgid ""
"For years now, this curse has consumed all light and life. It spits out only "
"darkness and despair."
msgstr "벌써 수년째, 이 저주는 모든 빛과 생명을 집어삼키고 있소. 오직 어둠과 절망만을 내뱉고 있지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = fdd79487-155b-5917-c209-3132bee74239
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:fdd79487-155b-5917-c209-3132bee74239
msgctxt "h168a6bd4g58c0g43a9gaecdgfb31af968c8f"
msgid ""
"You've already been? Impressive. You'll make me redundant at this rate. What "
"did you find?"
msgstr "이미 다녀왔다고? 인상적이군. 그 속도라면 내 도움도 필요 없겠구려. 무엇을 발견했소?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = fe286f84-41ef-7c7a-86a7-712148313a36
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:fe286f84-41ef-7c7a-86a7-712148313a36
msgctxt "h58d620e3gb047g4e5cgbe37g177703c693d2"
msgid ""
"Find whoever's behind the parasites and the magic. If we can understand it, "
"then perhaps we can <i>cure </i>it - provided you survive long enough."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fe460033-fa30-36db-8eb0-ef05bd6e583b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:fe460033-fa30-36db-8eb0-ef05bd6e583b
msgctxt "hecd850f4g64ddg4fdeg836fg3fabf3da80b0"
msgid "Danger. Are you sure that's the best way to Moonrise?"
msgstr "위험해 보이던데, 그게 문라이즈 타워로 가는 가장 좋은 방법인 게 확실합니까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = fe5d4ade-cfda-4001-a52a-f3fc4ecd3f3d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:fe5d4ade-cfda-4001-a52a-f3fc4ecd3f3d
msgctxt "h5943e027g7dbag452dgb632g6b9560abcc70"
msgid ""
"Wait, please. There's more. The whole region around Moonrise is shrouded in "
"a curse - a shadow curse."
msgstr "잠깐, 기다려주시오. 알아둬야 할 게 더 있소. 문라이즈 인근 지역 전체가 그림자 저주에 싸여 있소."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ffa8c005-4609-27b4-0567-2d80ffb10838
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Underdark_EverEnteredBefore = True
#.      - GOB_TempleAccess_Event_PuzzleSolved = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsReturn_CFM:ffa8c005-4609-27b4-0567-2d80ffb10838
msgctxt "hb7079550gd636g4a47gbe95gefe3c5da9ae8"
msgid ""
"I've already found a way into the Underdark. I can pick up the trail from "
"there."
msgstr "이미 언더다크로 가는 길은 찾았어요. 거기서 길을 따라가면 되겠군요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsRevenge_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 058a1ff7-9ce7-1751-3774-e7dd20d1bb9c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsRevenge_CFM:058a1ff7-9ce7-1751-3774-e7dd20d1bb9c
msgctxt "h1970349agffb7g4a79gb4cdg6a6b3da63ca3"
msgid "There's nothing left to be said. My mercy died when I saw the grove."
msgstr "더 할 말은 없다. 숲의 모습을 보고 나서 내 자비심은 사라졌어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsRevenge_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 12ab5edc-9f1d-74ed-fa49-c7677d71cbe5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_WolfPens_State_HalsinIntroHappened = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsRevenge_CFM:12ab5edc-9f1d-74ed-fa49-c7677d71cbe5
msgctxt "h1af2c27ag861cg4c53gb3degeb2b084e45db"
msgid ""
"When I met you, I thought we were destined to be allies. But you made that "
"impossible."
msgstr "내가 널 만났을 땐, 우리가 동지가 될 운명이라 생각했다. 하지만 네가 그걸 불가능하게 만들었지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsRevenge_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 15b68362-1903-c845-0421-71951909ab85
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsRevenge_CFM:15b68362-1903-c845-0421-71951909ab85
msgctxt "h14fc1502gf2dcg4716g8f84g1f5ebc1467ad"
msgid ""
"You have no idea what you've done, do you? Or perhaps you simply don't care?"
msgstr "너 자신이 무슨 짓을 했는지 전혀 모르겠나? 아니면 신경도 안 쓰는 건가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsRevenge_CFM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1adc6059-1dc9-c11a-7f34-f2a923a89e8f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsRevenge_CFM:1adc6059-1dc9-c11a-7f34-f2a923a89e8f
msgctxt "h06cefe2bg6507g48f2g9b48g369f434f5ceb"
msgid "Of course - I did what I had to do. Your grove got in the way."
msgstr "몰론 - 나는 해야 할 일을 한 거야. 당신의 숲은 방해만 됐어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsRevenge_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 2cea9b40-888e-e78d-ed8f-ade944366bcf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsRevenge_CFM:2cea9b40-888e-e78d-ed8f-ade944366bcf
msgctxt "h4e3f2fd7g3ef5g4e44gb153gd780f615870d"
msgid "Tell me... was it worth it?"
msgstr "말해 봐라... 그럴 만한 가치가 있었나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsRevenge_CFM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 358d906a-a23f-9143-f59f-89fd467d5548
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsRevenge_CFM:358d906a-a23f-9143-f59f-89fd467d5548
msgctxt "hdb0ee8f3g42d9g482fg95fbg5068da02da39"
msgid "<i>Attack him.</i>"
msgstr "<i>그를 공격한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsRevenge_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 38998a84-1c6b-421e-ff5e-53ad36b44139
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsRevenge_CFM:38998a84-1c6b-421e-ff5e-53ad36b44139
msgctxt "hb95cbb9bg65d8g40f5gaa40g93baaabd8165"
msgid "There's always a choice - but you made yours. Now I make mine."
msgstr "언제나 선택의 여지는 있다. 너는 네 선택을 한 것이다. 나도 내 선택을 하겠다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsRevenge_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 449a83f9-41a5-fd51-df1c-86f71767adea
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_WLDMAIN_State_InRegion(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsRevenge_CFM:449a83f9-41a5-fd51-df1c-86f71767adea
msgctxt "h5519ce62g5fb6g4235g9e58g4739e4a4441d"
msgid ""
"Look at you - camping amidst the Oak Father's creations, as if you hadn't "
"just <i>defiled  </i>his most sacred ground."
msgstr ""
"너 자신을 봐라. 참나무 아버지의 신성한 터를 <i>더럽히고서</i>, 아무런 짓도 안 했다는 듯이 그분의 창조물들 사이에서 야영을 하고 "
"있지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsRevenge_CFM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4e061664-6e35-1ba1-4c15-24a2c5f89e74
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_WolfPens_State_HalsinIntroHappened = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsRevenge_CFM:4e061664-6e35-1ba1-4c15-24a2c5f89e74
msgctxt "hfbab0874g30b8g4794gbc0fg9b9ccac4f784"
msgid "Wait... who the hells are you?"
msgstr "잠시만... 대체 누구신지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsRevenge_CFM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a51b085e-4dca-1c7f-8978-5c5c179f1b58
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsRevenge_CFM:a51b085e-4dca-1c7f-8978-5c5c179f1b58
msgctxt "h52d6590bg1b3dg4b41gb707gbd42ed7aff0c"
msgid "I'm sorry. I had no choice."
msgstr "죄송합니다. 선택의 여지가 없었어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsRevenge_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = a5536338-e35c-ac75-22b3-23dcbdbb365a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsRevenge_CFM:a5536338-e35c-ac75-22b3-23dcbdbb365a
msgctxt "hdee254ceg140ag4e9bga5efg887a184630ca"
msgid ""
"Look at you - resting without a care, as if you hadn't just <i>defiled  </"
"i>the Oak Father's most sacred ground. "
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsRevenge_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = b94e9fca-db82-cfeb-7220-19dae5f0d636
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsRevenge_CFM:b94e9fca-db82-cfeb-7220-19dae5f0d636
msgctxt "he689ce87g134cg45adga52cgac1dce2202e8"
msgid ""
"The grove stood for generations. It was our link to Silvanus. Now it's "
"nothing but blood and ashes - thanks to <i>you</i>."
msgstr ""
"그 숲은 많은 세대를 거쳤다. 우리가 실바누스님께 연결될 수 있는 고리였어. 이제 <i>네놈</i> 덕분에 피와 잿더미만 남았지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsRevenge_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = d1bd341c-d7de-3395-c2c5-859ac1f671a5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsRevenge_CFM:d1bd341c-d7de-3395-c2c5-859ac1f671a5
msgctxt "h7c02d24ag3d9dg4ad4g81d0gc866dc95348c"
msgid "You have upended nature's balance. Only your death can restore it."
msgstr "너는 자연의 균형을 무너뜨렸어. 오직 너의 죽음만이 균형을 되찾을 수 있다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsRevenge_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = d34eb171-7ec0-776e-1bce-fb04468ebbb9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsRevenge_CFM:d34eb171-7ec0-776e-1bce-fb04468ebbb9
msgctxt "h0ef3030dg17fcg46f7g9fbeg4f8dc97ce5ff"
msgid ""
"I am Halsin. First Druid of the Emerald Grove. And I am here to visit "
"nature's fury upon <i>you</i>."
msgstr "나는 할신이다. 에메랄드 숲의 최고 드루이드지. 그리고 <i>네놈</i>에게 자연의 분노를 선사해 주러 왔다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsRevenge_CFM
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = ed3acb4c-6ffc-93ef-751d-45b7f09399f7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Halsin_Quest_AskedKilledLeaders = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsRevenge_CFM:ed3acb4c-6ffc-93ef-751d-45b7f09399f7
msgctxt "h77ffbe1dg90f6g41c2gaa1bg3a8f7c28ba55"
msgid ""
"I thought you'd help me. I thought we'd help each other. Instead you chose "
"this."
msgstr "네가 나를 도와줄 것이라 믿었다. 우리가 서로 도울 수 있으리라 믿었다. 대신 너는 이 길을 택했군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsRevenge_CFM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ef8c1f62-f282-340f-dceb-935cc0a7c23f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsRevenge_CFM:ef8c1f62-f282-340f-dceb-935cc0a7c23f
msgctxt "h8d0301fegaac1g458dg895bg720c3663cdd8"
msgid "Calm down. Come sit by the fire and we can talk this over."
msgstr "진정하세요. 불 옆에 앉아서 이 일에 대한 이야기를 나눠 보자고요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsRevenge_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 31056fb1-5c35-47f0-a04d-52f41b7de99d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_2 = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsRevenge_PAD:31056fb1-5c35-47f0-a04d-52f41b7de99d
msgctxt "hf5b9d5b5gf4f2g4549g92c6gd9937670f310"
msgid "You couldn't just walk away, could you? Stupid man."
msgstr "그냥 떠날 수 없었지, 그렇지? 멍청이 같으니."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsRevenge_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 31056fb1-5c35-47f0-a04d-52f41b7de99d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_2 = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsRevenge_PAD:31056fb1-5c35-47f0-a04d-52f41b7de99d
msgctxt "h95340774g5a29g4bb2g892dg95cd89a8b48e"
msgid "So ends Halsin. Can't blame the man for seeking vengeance."
msgstr "그렇게 할신도 끝이 났군. 복수를 위해 온 것을 비난할 수는 없겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsRevenge_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 31056fb1-5c35-47f0-a04d-52f41b7de99d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_2 = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsRevenge_PAD:31056fb1-5c35-47f0-a04d-52f41b7de99d
msgctxt "h06ede6adg96feg4a82g8405g3af16aae41aa"
msgid ""
"Damn. I wish it hadn't ended like this. Halsin was only doing what was right."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsRevenge_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
