msgctxt "hf7586b0egff57g4fd9g8528g09f6d164bec9"
msgid "A foolish act. One does not face githyanki without expecting to die."
msgstr "어리석은 행동이군. 누구도 죽을 각오를 하지 않고서는 기스양키에 맞서지 않는다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsRevenge_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 31056fb1-5c35-47f0-a04d-52f41b7de99d
