msgctxt "h2da88433gd3feg4310gbff3g7815057093cc"
msgid ""
"He could've been a useful ally instead of a dead enemy, had we done things "
"differently."
msgstr "우리가 다르게 행동했다면 그는 쓸모 있는 아군이 될 수 있었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsRevenge_PAD
