#, fuzzy
msgctxt "hda669878g4c91g4452gb015g77f15c0ce289"
msgid ""
"He died honouring the fallen. I grieve for him. He has my utmost respect."
msgstr "정의를 구현하려고 온 거군. 나였어도 똑같이 했을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsRevenge_PAD
