msgid "He couldn't just walk away, could he? Stupid man."
msgstr "그냥 떠날 수는 없었겠지, 안 그래? 멍청이 같으니."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsRevenge_PAD
