msgctxt "h5cc9e45fgfc10g43cbga60eg09a0869ea9d9"
msgid ""
"He could've been a useful ally instead of a dead enemy, had things gone "
"differently."
msgstr "상황이 좀 다르게 흘러갔더라면 그는 쓸모 있는 아군이 될 수 있었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsRevenge_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
