#, fuzzy
msgctxt "ha08a9c17g3e23g49d6ga0cbgee637d9c738c"
msgid "He was a fine man. He would have made a finer ally."
msgstr "이렇게 되어 정말 유감스럽군. 좋은 아군이 되었을 텐데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsRevenge_PAD
