msgid "First Druid, and now last druid. Thanks to me."
msgstr "최고 드루이드였는데, 최후의 드루이드로 죽었군. 내 덕분에."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsRevenge_PAD
