msgctxt "h45262b63gf8a7g4d22g85a9g21c520f26161"
msgid "Can't say I blame the man for seeking vengeance."
msgstr "복수를 위해 찾아온 남자를 비난할 수는 없겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsRevenge_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ad7db905-dcd1-47fa-5ed2-fc81bbace005
