msgctxt "h344fe9b7gf661g4e21g9aceg935c040dd4c1"
msgid ""
"He found what he came for. One does not face githyanki without expecting to "
"die."
msgstr "그가 여기로 온 목적을 맞이한 거지. 아무도 죽을 각오를 하지 않고서 기스양키에 맞서지 않는다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsRevenge_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
