msgctxt "hb351abaag188fg4283g86b7g1df083048bb5"
msgid "There's no taking it back now. We just have to move on."
msgstr "이제 돌이킬 수 없어. 넘어가야 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_HalsinsRevenge_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ad7db905-dcd1-47fa-5ed2-fc81bbace005
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
