#, fuzzy
msgctxt "hc39ea44dg421fg4f3dga11bg1718c8b15b23"
msgid "Dance with me. Bleed with me. Bruise me so that you might possess me."
msgstr "춤추자. 피흘리자. 날 멍들게 하면 날 사로잡을 수 있을 거다."

