msgctxt "h3949252bg4e0eg4f6eg92a6g58529111a33a"
msgid "That is how you earn my trust. Not how you earn my flesh and spirit."
msgstr "그건 내 신뢰를 얻은 방법이지. 내 육체와 영혼을 차지한 방법이 아니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Laezel_ROM_SD_Romance2_WokenUpByLaezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 64580f3d-6fb0-4a23-b90a-34f7ca85f28d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
