msgid "Let's fight. I will show you that I'm worthy of your obsession."
msgstr "싸워보자고. 내가 집착할 만한 가치가 있다는 걸 보여주겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Laezel_ROM_SD_Romance2_WokenUpByLaezel
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 7b7167a8-7a81-4cbd-a086-ce378e6b2ed0
