msgid "We fight. I test you in battle."
msgstr "우린 싸운다. 널 전투에서 시험하겠다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Laezel_ROM_SD_Romance2_WokenUpByLaezel
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 81a9e7fa-4807-4774-900a-c01e05fcc9a5
