msgctxt "hac4ae375g55d6g42b3g8669g330d2cc7fab3"
msgid "<i>Link to Lae'zel's parasite. Show her Vlaakith's mind.</i>"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Laezel_VlaakithVisit_CFM_LaezelCom
#. Speaker = Vlaakith
#. NodeID = 7724eb07-1a41-05d1-2bbd-1725226b8ae8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Laezel_VlaakithVisit_CFM_LaezelCom:7724eb07-1a41-05d1-2bbd-1725226b8ae8
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "hff8fe7d0g00a1g4612g8aa5g65df746adc96"
msgid ""
"The Heretic Prince would shatter us in an instant. The Great Dominion, "
"shrunk to the head of a pin."
msgstr "반역자들의 왕자가 당장이라도 우릴 산산조각 낼테지. 위대한 제국이, 바늘 머리 크기로 줄어버렸다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Laezel_VlaakithVisit_CFM_LaezelCom
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 7e2abcb2-ba3f-7b03-aee2-f0d320aae68c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GITHYANKI
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Laezel_VlaakithVisit_CFM_LaezelCom:7e2abcb2-ba3f-7b03-aee2-f0d320aae68c
msgctxt "h5dd9cb6ege0ebg4fa2g89abg7a74f81050c5"
msgid ""
"*In this endless sea of understanding, you find truth. There is no "
"cleansing, no ascension, no Chosen. Vlaakith will take Lae'zel's life "
"essence - and yours - for herself.*"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Laezel_VlaakithVisit_CFM_LaezelCom
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 7e2abcb2-ba3f-7b03-aee2-f0d320aae68c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Laezel_VlaakithVisit_CFM_LaezelCom:7e2abcb2-ba3f-7b03-aee2-f0d320aae68c
msgctxt "hc24da22eg1299g4865gbb88ga219010ee5e1"
msgid ""
"*In this endless sea of understanding, you find truth. There is no "
"cleansing, no ascension, no Chosen. Vlaakith will take Lae'zel's life "
"essence for herself.*"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Laezel_VlaakithVisit_CFM_LaezelCom
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 84592f57-2513-378d-7408-146dfb875d92
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Laezel_VlaakithVisit_CFM_LaezelCom:84592f57-2513-378d-7408-146dfb875d92
msgctxt "h2be9fb60g1eebg4a16ga7c9gdc3bab92e7c9"
msgid ""
"*Your mind spins, your heart races. There is only endless void - and you are "
"caught in the Undying Queen's orbit.*"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Laezel_VlaakithVisit_CFM_LaezelCom
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 8972d491-a6f2-6a1e-2911-2ae5b5654248
