#. TagRule: REALLY_GITHYANKI
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Laezel_VlaakithVisit_CFM_LaezelCom:8972d491-a6f2-6a1e-2911-2ae5b5654248
msgctxt "h3b2079fdg59ffg495dga648g7c6c9161c0db"
msgid ""
"*Your parasites resonate. You feel Lae'zel's ecstasy as she moves to kneel "
"before your Undying Queen.*"
msgstr "*당신의 기생충이 공명합니다. 불멸의 여왕 앞에 무릎꿇으려 하는 레이젤의 환희가 느껴집니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Laezel_VlaakithVisit_CFM_LaezelCom
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 8972d491-a6f2-6a1e-2911-2ae5b5654248
