msgctxt "h657b55e0g24eeg44d9gba01g17b178982dc2"
msgid "Who is the person inside the Prism?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Laezel_VossCampConfrontation_SCO_LaezelAvatar
#. Speaker = Kith'rak Voss
#. NodeID = 62da0e3e-2853-7135-ea93-e53ea16f839b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_GithChokepoint_Event_LaezelOMStarted = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Laezel_VossCampConfrontation_SCO_LaezelAvatar:62da0e3e-2853-7135-ea93-e53ea16f839b
msgctxt "h66af2795g3f9fg4b54g9fb9g4d053091911b"
msgid "I've not come to kill you, Lae'zel. I've come to aid you."
msgstr "난 널 죽이러 온 게 아니다, 레이젤. 도우러 왔지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Laezel_VossCampConfrontation_SCO_LaezelAvatar
#. Speaker = Kith'rak Voss
#. NodeID = 648c8871-2568-c2bc-2432-b4ee10a65827
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Laezel_VossCampConfrontation_SCO_LaezelAvatar:648c8871-2568-c2bc-2432-b4ee10a65827
msgctxt "h655ee564g6824g484ag8238gfcb1ecbe6d63"
msgid "Your choice is made. <i>Hta'zith!</i>"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Laezel_VossCampConfrontation_SCO_LaezelAvatar
#. Speaker = Kith'rak Voss
#. NodeID = 6523d976-d0b6-696d-9ec7-663012dc4d0c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - ORI_Laezel_State_MetVossInAct2 = True
#.     - ORI_Laezel_State_CanProceedToAct3 = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Laezel_VossCampConfrontation_SCO_LaezelAvatar:6523d976-d0b6-696d-9ec7-663012dc4d0c
msgctxt "h61f2333eg6b9ag4bf2gaeabg03519809667a"
msgid "Child of Gith. Or should I say - <i>Hshar'lak</i>?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Laezel_VossCampConfrontation_SCO_LaezelAvatar
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 68b54680-a171-55b0-bd68-739aef666b60
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Laezel_VossCampConfrontation_SCO_LaezelAvatar:68b54680-a171-55b0-bd68-739aef666b60
msgctxt "h1fab5dc7gfc06g4966g917bg6798aec61f33"
msgid "What are you asking of me, Voss?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Laezel_VossCampConfrontation_SCO_LaezelAvatar
#. Speaker = Kith'rak Voss
#. NodeID = 6e1e5606-a92e-828f-916e-4d8944704d96
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Laezel_VossCampConfrontation_SCO_LaezelAvatar:6e1e5606-a92e-828f-916e-4d8944704d96
msgctxt "he2d1af75geb6bg483dgabaagb0b0c9e51271"
msgid ""
"If they have not said, they must have good reason. And I won't be the one to "
"betray them."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Laezel_VossCampConfrontation_SCO_LaezelAvatar
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7107e98d-db60-86b0-3494-374eeb8928af
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Laezel_VossCampConfrontation_SCO_LaezelAvatar:7107e98d-db60-86b0-3494-374eeb8928af
msgctxt "h2aacc4aag29bfg490dgb4f0gb66711ca1172"
msgid ""
"A <i>kith'rak</i> resists the Undying Queen? That either makes you a fool - "
"or a hero."
msgstr "<i>키스락</i>이 불사의 여왕에 대항한다고? 바보 같은 이야기야. 아니면 영웅이든지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_Laezel_VossCampConfrontation_SCO_LaezelAvatar
