#, fuzzy
msgctxt "hcfbc2f4dgb54ag4e37ga3a9g25345ab16e6c"
msgid ""
"He's still young. I remember Gomwick would let me sleep under his cloak when "
"I was a pup. It helps."
msgstr "아직 어리니까. 내가 아직 강아지일 때 곰윅이 망토 안에서 자게 해줬어. 도움이 돼."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_OwlbearCub_CFM_Dog
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1e7fbceb-bc27-32d6-eeb4-7a42da57385a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
