msgctxt "hd35b5d26g0386g452dg9102g2e1015dd17c0"
msgid "You two looked cozy together. Bad dreams aside."
msgstr "너희 둘 같이 편해 보였어. 악몽은 그렇다 치고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_OwlbearCub_CFM_Dog
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2076d49f-bac6-b2b0-bb53-22e4eceaeea6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
