msgctxt "hf3747fd1g00a9g48f4g935eg0585039308de"
msgid "What's going on? I thought something was wrong."
msgstr "무슨 일이야? 뭐가 잘못된 줄 알았잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_OwlbearCub_CFM_Dog
