msgctxt "h87259d05g5d23g49d2g8e3ageb6f6d46dbf3"
msgid ""
"*The sounds stop. Whatever just happened, it's too late to intervene now.*"
msgstr "*소리가 멈춥니다. 무슨 일이 일어났는지는 몰라도, 이제 간섭하기엔 늦었습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_OwlbearCub_CFM_Dog
#. Speaker = Scratch
#. NodeID = 6c5b1a1c-1b90-5055-6f49-f3a0c417c4ee
