#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_OwlbearCub_CFM_Dog:6c5b1a1c-1b90-5055-6f49-f3a0c417c4ee
msgctxt "h87a99ecdg914bg4e8fgace3g11df51f8d538"
msgid "Best friends! It's nice to have company, while you're gone all day."
msgstr "단짝 친구야! 네가 하루종일 가 있는 동안 함께할 친구가 있어 좋아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_OwlbearCub_CFM_Dog
