msgctxt "hace407deg80a8g48b0g9231ge25af965e488"
msgid "Hush now, it was just a nightmare. We're safe here, with master."
msgstr "이제 쉿, 나쁜 꿈이었을 뿐이야. 여기서 주인님과 함께라면 우린 안전해."

