msgid "Hush now, it was just a nightmare. We're safe here, with our guardian."
msgstr "이제 쉿, 나쁜 꿈이었을 뿐이야. 여기서 수호자님과 함께라면 우린 안전해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_OwlbearCub_CFM_Dog
