msgctxt "h885999c8gd5a4g4a1fg83e9gbcbc43203691"
msgid "All right, keep it down. Folk are trying to rest."
msgstr "좋아, 조금만 조용히 하자. 다들 자려고 하니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_OwlbearCub_CFM_Dog
