msgctxt "hdd434b3agfae9g4cb6g8b73g2b66bad7849c"
msgid "We have a new bargain: I pay nothing, and you leave the camp alive."
msgstr "새로운 거래를 제안할게: 난 한 푼도 내지 않고, 너는 이 야영지를 살아서 나가는 것이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_SchoolOgres_CFM_DebtCollection
#. Speaker = Lump the Enlightened
#. NodeID = 7f9e607d-0843-58a4-9c1a-513d80ac2048
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_SchoolOgres_CFM_DebtCollection:7f9e607d-0843-58a4-9c1a-513d80ac2048
msgctxt "hef726fd8g0785g42e6g9958gecff7614c653"
msgid ""
"One excepted, of course. We made a bargain, sweet stuff - and I've come to "
"collect."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_SchoolOgres_CFM_DebtCollection
#. Speaker = Lump the Enlightened
#. NodeID = 924978a4-be5e-4216-f00f-08fba21aa5ba
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - FOR_SchoolOgres_State_SummonedThrice = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_SchoolOgres_CFM_DebtCollection:924978a4-be5e-4216-f00f-08fba21aa5ba
msgctxt "h48c43c5egc4f2g4774g845fg1beb0d83c5ca"
msgid "Consider your debt paid. I will leave your flesh unbroken."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_SchoolOgres_CFM_DebtCollection
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9d6a1d9d-423c-31ae-9223-8b92c45c39c3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_SchoolOgres_CFM_DebtCollection:9d6a1d9d-423c-31ae-9223-8b92c45c39c3
msgctxt "h742b934cgcb90g4e40ga105g0d0703f7e5b6"
msgid "Disgusting. I'm not letting you lick me."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/Campfire_Moments/CAMP_SchoolOgres_CFM_DebtCollection
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a22463a8-613a-47b9-6638-511df6afd8fa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
