msgctxt "h04edbd46gabefg4757g850fgd4a602fffdc2"
msgid ""
"'Goblins swarmed, but we were brave and fried them all with a Thunder Wave!'"
msgstr "'고블린이 수없이 몰려왔지만 용감하게도 천둥파로 모두 튀겨버렸다네!'"

