msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/ADs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_AD_ZevlorReflections
#. Speaker = Zevlor
#. NodeID = 26d73cbc-5dd6-478a-8863-8f39d1b5de64
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 62a477f0-8e07-d522-2672-fff06b538b41_C = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 62a477f0-8e07-d522-2672-fff06b538b41_C = False
#.     - 62a477f0-8e07-d522-2672-fff06b538b41_B = False
#.     - 62a477f0-8e07-d522-2672-fff06b538b41_A = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/ADs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_AD_ZevlorReflections:26d73cbc-5dd6-478a-8863-8f39d1b5de64
msgctxt "h750ceabcg1ee3g41aagaad7g6a7c16911d40"
msgid "No. Let them have fun. I'll be ruining it come morning anyway."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/ADs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_AD_ZevlorReflections
#. Speaker = Zevlor
#. NodeID = da861cba-6f25-46e6-990b-60b987be78be
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 62a477f0-8e07-d522-2672-fff06b538b41_B = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 62a477f0-8e07-d522-2672-fff06b538b41_C = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/ADs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_AD_ZevlorReflections:da861cba-6f25-46e6-990b-60b987be78be
msgctxt "ha9f9ffa4g3abeg4d19ga9ffg5f1f7da10448"
msgid "I should be out there, talking with them. In... just a moment, maybe."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/ADs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_AD_ZevlorReflections
#. Speaker = Zevlor
#. NodeID = f8372036-4c45-4234-a146-905404cae166
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 62a477f0-8e07-d522-2672-fff06b538b41_A = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 62a477f0-8e07-d522-2672-fff06b538b41_B = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/ADs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_AD_ZevlorReflections:f8372036-4c45-4234-a146-905404cae166
msgctxt "hbb2ff7a5g538cg4887g800egffa9b7037d9d"
msgid "No more. I can't afford to lose any more of them."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 392ef43e-254b-42d7-88d6-435a99434f2f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_BackupLeader:392ef43e-254b-42d7-88d6-435a99434f2f
msgctxt "h3f26f49cgbdf6g444dg9725g8289d6483f36"
msgid "That's an odd diversion. Not enjoying the party?"
msgstr "특이한 행동인걸. 파티가 마음에 들지 않는 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 40a9b034-76a2-83e5-6bfd-651e8141805f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_BackupLeader:40a9b034-76a2-83e5-6bfd-651e8141805f
msgctxt "h41eb2d65gdd56g4c66gbf89g3e4c2a678be7"
msgid "Planning on a heavy night?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Cerys
#. NodeID = 4d2f3b9d-ad38-8d37-b977-9aebd65b7714
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_BackupLeader:4d2f3b9d-ad38-8d37-b977-9aebd65b7714
msgctxt "h2154077fgd24fg4584g88f5gfc26e8f953bc"
msgid "Never said I wasn't. I do enjoy it, seeing everyone like this."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Cerys
#. NodeID = 5183cee4-12e5-2424-9ec8-467ce4979fea
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_BackupLeader:5183cee4-12e5-2424-9ec8-467ce4979fea
msgctxt "h129b0781g5eb6g46b2gb869g97efc6bae3b6"
msgid ""
"Long way yet to Baldur's Gate. Then we find a tavern, and <i>they</i> can "
"carry <i>me</i> home."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Cerys
#. NodeID = 61df9d7e-29c0-07fd-b825-b03b0b38a5a5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_BackupLeader:61df9d7e-29c0-07fd-b825-b03b0b38a5a5
msgctxt "h4ee73acfg05beg46b0ga03dg70d671d964eb"
msgid ""
"With enough drink to make the eyes float, aye. But it's the pounding heads "
"after I'm thinking of."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Cerys
#. NodeID = 6beb642c-db8a-041f-bcd9-ccc4bcca0584
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_BackupLeader:6beb642c-db8a-041f-bcd9-ccc4bcca0584
msgctxt "h9826b596g75f8g4e18gb34dga53c443f3f8c"
msgid ""
"I'll have to make it up to you in Baldur's Gate. In... about a tenday, let's "
"say."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Cerys
#. NodeID = 758a3073-c5e0-c7af-09a4-0013c68520dc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_BackupLeader:758a3073-c5e0-c7af-09a4-0013c68520dc
msgctxt "h0d38b7acg37eag4472gbf40g311db46ff49c"
msgid "An early morning - road's stretching before us yet."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 87fa75ff-2166-e077-8608-d14c76ee917b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_BackupLeader:87fa75ff-2166-e077-8608-d14c76ee917b
msgctxt "h41697b64g7cc5g4db6g82f4g6bc790f7948e"
msgid "Foraging? There's plenty to go around here."
msgstr "식량? 여기에 넘쳐나는 게 식량인걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Cerys
#. NodeID = 940f9e06-03e4-5c17-8a43-180198940baf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_BackupLeader:940f9e06-03e4-5c17-8a43-180198940baf
msgctxt "h4a280cd0ge745g44aag8245g74ae306aa62e"
msgid ""
"Or that they bring better visions once they've been left to dry for a tenday."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Cerys
#. NodeID = 967dcf26-0edb-5250-d062-0c24689862da
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_BackupLeader:967dcf26-0edb-5250-d062-0c24689862da
msgctxt "h896ea9feg768eg4519g8f5bg87f4295953f7"
msgid ""
"I want my people to enjoy themselves tonight - then I want them out of bed "
"and moving by dawn."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Cerys
#. NodeID = 96c556c9-2fb9-7b84-b52e-87c30b9cafb6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_BackupLeader:96c556c9-2fb9-7b84-b52e-87c30b9cafb6
msgctxt "hbdaf11bege949g4d83g8b84g040f23da2113"
msgid ""
"You can teach me to pronounce that Elvish twaddle when you're half-cut "
"later, <i>ebrath.</i>"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9cc3c88f-404e-c9db-f4d2-86e579be8c38
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_BackupLeader:9cc3c88f-404e-c9db-f4d2-86e579be8c38
msgctxt "h4e80dd4cg74dcg4d1bga49ag7340775d8298"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Cerys
#. NodeID = a52bc8ed-8a4c-a03b-ab05-d3584b568d56
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_BackupLeader:a52bc8ed-8a4c-a03b-ab05-d3584b568d56
msgctxt "h60417f43ga899g4d60gbc48g21fba3d378b6"
msgid "They're hangover cures, not high poetry."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bc9fb0f5-abbd-e9dd-9fac-e053caa63420
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ELF(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_BackupLeader:bc9fb0f5-abbd-e9dd-9fac-e053caa63420
msgctxt "h9722e979g7bf7g4763g8f65g9440dd4cc71c"
msgid "The Tel'Quessir names for those herbs are far more elegant."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Cerys
#. NodeID = bf963e3c-39ba-65fb-afc2-019166c2e722
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_BackupLeader:bf963e3c-39ba-65fb-afc2-019166c2e722
msgctxt "hcb958fd9gca95g4d5eg954dg7e27bf9a4526"
msgid ""
"I won't enjoy rolling them out of bed in the morning, but I'll do it anyway."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Cerys
#. NodeID = c5e65138-7c03-6e7a-d1fa-491cbf7de59c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_HasMet_Leader(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_BackupLeader:c5e65138-7c03-6e7a-d1fa-491cbf7de59c
msgctxt "hb41217ddg5091g49a6g98dfg8b028faf7872"
msgid "Gobweed, brekka leaf, Sune's Breath..."
msgstr "걸쭉한 약초, 브레카 잎, 순의 숨결..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Cerys
#. NodeID = d5dcbb1f-c278-1b2a-1b93-774e74ecd730
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_BackupLeader:d5dcbb1f-c278-1b2a-1b93-774e74ecd730
msgctxt "h7f6df63bg94ccg4cf6gaa38g1f7bcb7274e2"
msgid "Can't say I've heard of those."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Cerys
#. NodeID = e16db8a3-1738-e78d-d9f9-87c5e47cf551
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_HasMet_Leader(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_BackupLeader:e16db8a3-1738-e78d-d9f9-87c5e47cf551
msgctxt "h51cef11ege16bg4352gaf46g750e59971e56"
msgid ""
"Go on, enjoy yourself. I'll hang on a while - 'til the weepy philosophy "
"starts, anyway."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Cerys
#. NodeID = ed0a5e38-0ef2-a580-0bff-b08fe91f9334
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_BackupLeader:ed0a5e38-0ef2-a580-0bff-b08fe91f9334
msgctxt "h0e9ff950g5767g400egb980g368e0f43bfaf"
msgid "Aye? Heading out for forage - you need something?"
msgstr "응? 식량을 찾으러 가는데 필요한 거 있으세요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f3aa7678-da97-0c3f-3006-107f7639815d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - DRUID(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_BackupLeader:f3aa7678-da97-0c3f-3006-107f7639815d
msgctxt "hbc0f1b7fgc563g4950g8515gaf515b848cfe"
msgid ""
"See if you can find some <i>aysling</i> mushrooms. This could be a <i>real "
"</i>party."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = f98eaf5b-71a3-a67a-a366-ae44227cbc84
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_BackupLeader:f98eaf5b-71a3-a67a-a366-ae44227cbc84
msgctxt "h38813ed5gd3f2g473cg9132gbee66116f9e4"
msgid ""
"*You recognise the names - herbs known to relieve the symptoms of a "
"hangover.*"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Cerys
#. NodeID = fdc746f2-bf6e-06d7-4ac9-0b9527e6c5b4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_BackupLeader:fdc746f2-bf6e-06d7-4ac9-0b9527e6c5b4
msgctxt "ha711d8d6g0e86g464dgac10g5f639b1c1cdb"
msgid "But they can chew roots while we walk. I'm not heartless."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 00a758cc-06ab-5219-5739-16801297b046
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard:00a758cc-06ab-5219-5739-16801297b046
msgctxt "h94e56911ge1ebg4c05g888bgd939f0fa3ed7"
msgid "That deserves to be remembered."
msgstr "그 모습은 기억할 가치가 있어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 016230df-efba-ee72-24d5-0087b7f5fb2c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard:016230df-efba-ee72-24d5-0087b7f5fb2c
msgctxt "ha689a25cg53c0g4ec6g994ag44d6dd30894c"
msgid "Skilled as I'm sure you are, I don't need my exploits put to song. "
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0d4c6907-1f88-617e-777f-fc23853d1857
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DUERGARDWARF(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard:0d4c6907-1f88-617e-777f-fc23853d1857
msgctxt "h3e991f64ge63dg47adg828bg2a6f26e2c3b8"
msgid "Shut it. The last thing I want is some sappy song about me."
msgstr "시끄러. 나에 대한 싸구려 노래는 전혀 원하지 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0e186a64-cb22-6dad-5ede-584d36b9fc82
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard:0e186a64-cb22-6dad-5ede-584d36b9fc82
msgctxt "h1424a01bg9fb2g4287g8c56g288bc1c99109"
msgid "How about courage? Classic song material."
msgstr "용기는 어때? 고전적인 노래 소재잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 15b6f3a0-14c1-1a94-1ac4-823552aad82c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard:15b6f3a0-14c1-1a94-1ac4-823552aad82c
msgctxt "hb0b633f7gf207g439fg931eg6e3c00d4bbf4"
msgid ""
"Sing of my battle spirit, and how it mirrors that of the ferocious and "
"beloved Queen Vlaakith."
msgstr "내 전투 정신을 노래해라. 그리고 맹렬하고 존경스런 블라키스 여왕님의 전투 정신과 얼마나 닮았는지를."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 1926c163-9315-e5a1-2b6a-9f55a95ef5be
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_HasMet_Bard(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard:1926c163-9315-e5a1-2b6a-9f55a95ef5be
msgctxt "h03bb6754g221bg43ccg962fg1f6cc4a2a02f"
msgid ""
"Your song <i>was</i> coming along. Then things began spinning... worry not, "
"I shall return to it at first light!"
msgstr ""
"당신 곡이 거의 완성되고 있었는데 말이죠. 갑자기 주변이 빙빙 돌기 시작하더니... 걱정하진 마세요, 내일 아침이 밝으면 완성할 거예요!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 1ec5b600-cebd-0c52-8c09-8f9a3c3a357b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_HasMet_Bard(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard:1ec5b600-cebd-0c52-8c09-8f9a3c3a357b
msgctxt "h6c9202f3ga40dg4b8bg9372gebda4227ec36"
msgid ""
"This might be the wine talking, but I'm feeling <i>inspired.  </i>Thinking "
"of writing my next song - about you."
msgstr "취해서 그런 건진 모르겠지만, <i>영감을 얻은 </i> 기분이에요. 다음 곡은 당신에 대한 곡이 될 것 같아요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 219b312f-dc16-f17c-355a-c2b0427edf8c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard:219b312f-dc16-f17c-355a-c2b0427edf8c
msgctxt "h1b1be6bag2754g4378gb4f1g91624c7b61ae"
msgid ""
"After Elturel, I think you're right. Faerûn deserves to see us as we "
"<i>really</i> are."
msgstr "엘투렐에서의 일을 겪고 나니, 당신 말씀이 맞는 것 같아요. 페이룬은 우리를 <i>있는 그대로</i> 봐야 해요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2a7904f5-9f5e-a021-810e-b1927debdcea
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: CLERIC_GOOD or CLERIC_NEUTRAL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard:2a7904f5-9f5e-a021-810e-b1927debdcea
msgctxt "h2e988489g37a1g4cd7g80a2g7292c2dbbe42"
msgid "I don't deserve such praise. I serve a higher power."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 3d4eba74-e5da-cf97-4d7b-ef35d02b9585
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard:3d4eba74-e5da-cf97-4d7b-ef35d02b9585
msgctxt "h89b3fffbg78e8g4aa6g8b6cg4db174090a64"
msgid "With a name like that, the song practically writes itself!"
msgstr "이름만 들어도 노래가 절로 만들어지네요!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 402571ba-8a8b-66a6-fdfa-2785e50a0653
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard:402571ba-8a8b-66a6-fdfa-2785e50a0653
msgctxt "h3c2296afgd34ag45f2g8c71g9d118575a3e7"
msgid "Erm, all right - it's your song. Now what rhymes with 'dirty elf'..."
msgstr "음, 알았어요. 당신 노래니까요. 그럼 '음탕한 엘프'와 운율이 맞는 단어가..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 41fa90ce-d46d-9e19-e076-daecf1b849cd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_HasMet_Bard(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_TieflingBard_State_ConvincedToQuit = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard:41fa90ce-d46d-9e19-e076-daecf1b849cd
msgctxt "he4c710e9g260bg424fgb0bbg2804c34895ea"
msgid ""
"You tried the wine? My teacher never let me have any. I must say, it is "
"<i>delicious</i>."
msgstr "이 포도주 마셔봤어요? 제 스승님은 제가 술을 못 마시게 했거든요. 마셔보니 정말 <i>맛있네요</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 4347ad33-74a7-cc4f-9ced-d1aab4bd6668
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard:4347ad33-74a7-cc4f-9ced-d1aab4bd6668
msgctxt "hf92ca759g61d9g4a88ga519gdf710120aece"
msgid "But of course. You achieved something far beyond mere fact."
msgstr "물론이죠. 당신의 업적은 단순한 사실보다 더 대단한 것이에요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 48a66baf-5ebd-a1b1-522b-b70275a7015e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard:48a66baf-5ebd-a1b1-522b-b70275a7015e
msgctxt "hba247258g684eg4a41gb577g1397b3daeef0"
msgid "Hah. As usual, getting ahead of myself. Enjoy your night, then!"
msgstr "하. 평소처럼, 너무 앞서나갔네요. 그럼, 즐거운 저녁 시간 보내세요!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 52ed6069-c78a-3b65-a23f-9776fd4e0dc5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard:52ed6069-c78a-3b65-a23f-9776fd4e0dc5
msgctxt "h894acf1eg157bg4160g9c28g1be7b32a4d82"
msgid "'By the Weave, and light-filled touch...' You're going to love it!"
msgstr "'위브와 빛이 가득한 손길로...' 당신도 분명 마음에 드실 거예요!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 5eafc727-4096-8de3-c0d6-32aaa36effc6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard:5eafc727-4096-8de3-c0d6-32aaa36effc6
msgctxt "hf9cfc727gc9acg46abgbd66gb5320d2fbcb7"
msgid "Oh... sure. Of course. Have a nice night."
msgstr "오... 그럼요. 물론이죠. 좋은 밤 보내세요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 5f23f096-cd57-e937-b325-294f1a034e95
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard:5f23f096-cd57-e937-b325-294f1a034e95
msgctxt "h3c7aaf07ga335g485ag977dga3df8c547b0d"
msgid ""
"Oh! That's very... visceral. I might tone it down a touch, but I'll keep the "
"intent."
msgstr "오! 그거 정말... 생생하네요. 몇 가지 수정할 부분이 있긴 하지만, 의미는 그대로 유지할게요. "

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 61c7ae63-52ea-3ba4-5dae-628280a51afa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Event_RefusedBardSong(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard:61c7ae63-52ea-3ba4-5dae-628280a51afa
msgctxt "h035e67d1gf82fg42beg8b9bgcd83722c3000"
msgid "Honestly? I'd rather you didn't."
msgstr "솔직히? 아예 하지 않았으면 좋겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 6afb6715-6fd3-ef98-9252-08609d176351
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard:6afb6715-6fd3-ef98-9252-08609d176351
msgctxt "h2a898c12g8001g4c54g8462g7cfffacf4a7f"
msgid ""
"Pfft. The gods have enough people singing about them. But fine - I'll do my "
"best!"
msgstr "푸흡. 이미 수많은 사람들이 신에 대해서 노래한다고요. 하지만 알겠어요. 최선을 다할게요!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6e793f38-a722-72dd-75ca-ec09c78084bb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - FIGHTER(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard:6e793f38-a722-72dd-75ca-ec09c78084bb
msgctxt "haf5c34a9g146fg4dcegbd05g161158f2153d"
msgid "Sing about my prowess in battle."
msgstr "전투에서의 내 솜씨에 대해 노래해 줘."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6fa42178-36a7-efe7-02c9-a983e9c85c82
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard:6fa42178-36a7-efe7-02c9-a983e9c85c82
msgctxt "h8d5b4a66gdf13g4693gad5fg2dde526630ad"
msgid "How about the goblin spines I'd ripped out with my bare hands?"
msgstr "내가 맨손으로 고블린 척추를 뽑아버린 건 어때?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 7b3bf7bb-bf12-18f4-0211-25079584d9f6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard:7b3bf7bb-bf12-18f4-0211-25079584d9f6
msgctxt "hb78a4c68g91e5g42b2ga18fgb0090ffa1f19"
msgid ""
"Fitting. Seeing you fight makes us, makes <i>me</i>, feel like I'm capable "
"of anything."
msgstr "어울리네요. 당신이 싸우는 모습을 보면 저희가, 아니, 제가 뭐라도 할 수 있겠다는 느낌이 들어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 7c25c302-7f92-c139-ab5f-2604223e503a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Event_RefusedBardSong(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard:7c25c302-7f92-c139-ab5f-2604223e503a
msgctxt "h82305238g7ea4g4ad2gad35gc91de55ed2de"
msgid ""
"Don't worry: I'm not secretly composing something for you - simply enjoying "
"my evening."
msgstr "걱정 마세요, 당신을 위해 뭔가 비밀스럽게 작곡하는 건 아니니까. 그냥 제 저녁 시간을 즐기고 싶을 뿐이에요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7c3ecccd-0750-aec8-402f-7591fadc1900
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard:7c3ecccd-0750-aec8-402f-7591fadc1900
msgctxt "h021927eeg7d22g4bd7g9e64gf7f642534b40"
msgid "If I want a song about me, I'll write it myself."
msgstr "날 위한 노래가 필요했으면, 내가 직접 썼겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 81c9f6ee-7bcc-2b42-f498-3ce19cf2d5b0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard:81c9f6ee-7bcc-2b42-f498-3ce19cf2d5b0
msgctxt "h7144a0b2ga661g42c4g9cabg8b5c081b0602"
msgid "Not really. I'm not much of a bard."
msgstr "딱히. 내가 바드는 아니라서."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 8231b991-cf3e-fa7b-0869-43c0cb037138
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard:8231b991-cf3e-fa7b-0869-43c0cb037138
msgctxt "hac3d9970g976fg462bga320g960abc2255d8"
msgid "But I need an angle. Any ideas?"
msgstr "아이디어가 필요해요. 도와주시겠어요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 84e23716-52a6-7530-e541-5af7dc9bd15a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - DEN_General_TieflingGuard10_PromisedDrink(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard:84e23716-52a6-7530-e541-5af7dc9bd15a
msgctxt "hc7173ae8gaf76g469fg9069g838ab4a7fa50"
msgid "Heh. Lakrissa would approve."
msgstr "헤. 라크리사도 마음에 들어했을 거예요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 8bddb0e5-1101-ac89-4e51-aa5cfcf0c6c4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_TieflingBard_State_ConvincedToQuit = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_HasMet_Bard(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard:8bddb0e5-1101-ac89-4e51-aa5cfcf0c6c4
msgctxt "hb2f99ba6gf4f6g493fg9fdbg012ccc2c33b1"
msgid ""
"I still have no idea what to do in Baldur's Gate. Bah. That's tomorrow's "
"problem."
msgstr "아직 발더스 게이트에 가면 뭘 해야 할지 모르겠네요. 흥. 그건 내일 고민해도 되겠죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 8c523562-6d34-85a5-f034-15ff77e0ac57
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard:8c523562-6d34-85a5-f034-15ff77e0ac57
msgctxt "h0058c006g6136g40c7gb519g5a00389b00e5"
msgid ""
"But if she's as ferocious as you, she must be quite impressive. I'll do my "
"best!"
msgstr "하지만 그분이 당신만큼 맹렬하다면, 분명 꽤 인상적이겠네요. 최선을 다할게요!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 9b320728-27dd-c346-dc73-f81b056f7db9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard:9b320728-27dd-c346-dc73-f81b056f7db9
msgctxt "he39eb3e8g9e67g4cd4g96deg0a1f17b04b75"
msgid ""
"Humble heroes make the best ballads. But fair - I'll not force you. Enjoy "
"your night!"
msgstr "겸손한 영웅들이 최고의 발라드 주인공이 되는 법이죠. 하지만 좋아요, 강요하진 않을게요. 즐거운 밤 보내세요!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 9c0791cb-566e-c4d9-0be0-363fce50ac49
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard:9c0791cb-566e-c4d9-0be0-363fce50ac49
msgctxt "h59f26c5ag3c03g49a9gb682g6b89ddc273c8"
msgid ""
"Absolutely! 'With a foot in two worlds, you're the force joining both... ' "
"You're going to love it."
msgstr "완전 좋아요! '두 세계에 발을 걸친 그대는 두 세력을 합치는 길...' 당신도 분명 마음에 드실 거예요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a3a824c4-85a5-9a99-eace-bc185af2e815
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard:a3a824c4-85a5-9a99-eace-bc185af2e815
msgctxt "h71114c04g22a3g4a6cga3d0ge834a95c668a"
msgid "Let it be only as truthful as true poetry would permit."
msgstr "시가 허용하는 만큼만 솔직해지자고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a5817d8f-d846-0625-cd5b-02dd17fdb231
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Event_RefusedBardSong(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard:a5817d8f-d846-0625-cd5b-02dd17fdb231
msgctxt "hf135c347gded0g4c6ag9eb8g6b82decab4eb"
msgid "If I hear my name in a song, your life is forfeit."
msgstr "노래에서 내 이름이 나오면, 넌 죽은 목숨이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = a94753e5-9690-ba51-6e5e-90088d7d9b83
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard:a94753e5-9690-ba51-6e5e-90088d7d9b83
msgctxt "h85bae149ge2deg4226g87e4gbb20eb797691"
msgid "I'm not familiar with this Vlaakith, I'm afraid."
msgstr "블라키스라는 이름은 처음 듣는데요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = af9c6cd6-cedc-aecd-5e89-9baf6c19542d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard:af9c6cd6-cedc-aecd-5e89-9baf6c19542d
msgctxt "h35cc8ed9gb96cg49b2gaeccg88482a3679c7"
msgid "Fine, grumpypants. Serves me right for trying to be nice."
msgstr "알았어요, 심술쟁이 씨. 친절하게 다가간 보답이 이거네요. "

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b06c191a-b64c-cf68-5817-7edde246c2a5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard:b06c191a-b64c-cf68-5817-7edde246c2a5
msgctxt "hc62e9114gf6f7g43c2g9657g35750b46b39a"
msgid ""
"Just mention the legend that is the Blade of Frontiers, the hardiest hero to "
"ever travel the Sword Coast."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b76f5f49-8a3b-7d1d-9b15-06fe6a3dd73d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard:b76f5f49-8a3b-7d1d-9b15-06fe6a3dd73d
msgctxt "h6c938d9cg28bfg44ceg9fd8g2af6e641ba06"
msgid "Have you seen this body? It would be a crime not to sing about it."
msgstr "이 몸매 봤어? 내 몸매에 대해 노래를 부르지 않으면 그건 범죄야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = b8a6d1e6-2a81-1919-4391-e4e59c2c6f6d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard:b8a6d1e6-2a81-1919-4391-e4e59c2c6f6d
msgctxt "h85914147g6262g4672g94dcgfa1d6dcdfbd1"
msgid ""
"Fitting. You're braver than half this camp combined. That deserves to be "
"remembered."
msgstr "알맞네요. 당신은 이 야영지에 있는 사람들 절반을 합친 것보다 용감해요. 그건 기억할 가치가 있죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c4601c87-2e24-87e0-9af7-4ed9cb80fa2c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_DROWHALFELF or REALLY_HALFORC or REALLY_HIGHHALFELF
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard:c4601c87-2e24-87e0-9af7-4ed9cb80fa2c
msgctxt "h7946da47ge443g4fd1g8808ga8dbaf270dca"
msgid "Maybe a song about my mixed heritage? It's a point of pride for me."
msgstr "내 혼혈 혈통에 대한 노래는 어때? 내 자랑인데 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = c867e776-19d6-da27-0d5f-cdb5a17bdfbd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard:c867e776-19d6-da27-0d5f-cdb5a17bdfbd
msgctxt "h25c154c1g4b55g450dga5ceg01705c004f9e"
msgid "'A smile that sets the heart aglow...' You're going to love it!"
msgstr "'심장을 불태우는 미소...' 당신도 분명 마음에 드실 거예요!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = c8b09eff-17e3-746f-c274-ad1c7f493176
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard:c8b09eff-17e3-746f-c274-ad1c7f493176
msgctxt "hf6d80797g352bg4d0cgaea6g064d037ebeca"
msgid "Oh, come <i>on.</i> There must be something!"
msgstr "아, <i>제발요</i>. 뭔가는 있겠죠!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = d5259c21-3b65-6858-6af2-36cd5c445885
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard:d5259c21-3b65-6858-6af2-36cd5c445885
msgctxt "h578b8a41gbdcfg4025g8ee8gce0b9498a935"
msgid "I couldn't agree more."
msgstr "지당하신 말씀이에요. "

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = db2183a5-4d43-644b-98e1-53661e2a1b64
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_AttackOnDen_State_RaidReady = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_HasMet_Bard(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard:db2183a5-4d43-644b-98e1-53661e2a1b64
msgctxt "he8b79258gcb11g4445g8436gf95ace1ca060"
msgid ""
"This might be the wine talking, but I'm feeling <i>inspired.  </i>I want to "
"get a start on your song."
msgstr "취해서 그런 건진 모르겠지만, <i>영감을 얻은 </i> 기분이에요. 당신에 대한 노래를 쓰고 싶어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e44760b4-be81-c723-f8c1-9a2f0edef6a6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard:e44760b4-be81-c723-f8c1-9a2f0edef6a6
msgctxt "h7f8a7478gb477g4adcga7fcgcc9a5519ca3e"
msgid "Make it a song for everyone who fought. Couldn't have done it alone."
msgstr "오늘 싸웠던 모든 이들에 대한 노래를 만들어줘. 나 혼자선 해내지 못했을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e76b053d-ff5d-e8b3-40c0-815d78502da1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LOLTHDROWELF(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard:e76b053d-ff5d-e8b3-40c0-815d78502da1
msgctxt "h6c2eec63g72aag4b95gaf91gbe497ac2c31b"
msgid "Sing about surface elves - and how filthy and pathetic they are."
msgstr "지상 엘프들에 대한 노래를 불러줘, 그들이 얼마나 추잡하고 한심한가에 대해 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f29dee6f-1b90-bc00-6c4a-8e40167a0156
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_TIEFLING(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard:f29dee6f-1b90-bc00-6c4a-8e40167a0156
msgctxt "h2a9557ecg017eg4d66ga1edg14dd1592a488"
msgid "Sing about our people. We deserve it."
msgstr "우리 동족들에 대한 노래를 불러줘. 다들 그럴 만한 자격이 있으니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = f3719d4d-5a8c-262b-def0-0a9a88470b45
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard:f3719d4d-5a8c-262b-def0-0a9a88470b45
msgctxt "h585ed777g1a68g439cg9608gf9d065af583e"
msgid "Of course. I guess it was a silly idea. Have a nice night."
msgstr "물론이죠. 바보 같은 생각이었나 봐요. 즐거운 밤 보내세요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f4d6c199-21bb-d5d0-c963-7d3702725804
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard:f4d6c199-21bb-d5d0-c963-7d3702725804
msgctxt "he5347f6eg900bg4b24g971cg8066b1d33fd4"
msgid ""
"There's just so much. Let's start with my physical beauty and go from there."
msgstr "너무 많아. 그냥 내 육체적 아름다움에 대한 내용으로 시작하자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fd05ed7a-dddb-b57f-0708-11436366f8e1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard:fd05ed7a-dddb-b57f-0708-11436366f8e1
msgctxt "h962da064g29f1g4891g8fd4g17cc42b5df85"
msgid "I'd rather hear a song about Mystra."
msgstr "미스트라에 대한 노래를 듣고 싶은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = fe8b26bd-0815-33ea-5c9a-d5f67a7885d0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard:fe8b26bd-0815-33ea-5c9a-d5f67a7885d0
msgctxt "he0a03843g6baag4c21g9c8cg12ce0d9df7fe"
msgid "I don't know any ballads about her. But I can write one for you!"
msgstr "그녀에 대한 노래는 하나도 모르지만. 당신을 위해 하나 써드릴게요!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = ff32ee21-d146-f670-294b-2d5d59f22241
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Bard:ff32ee21-d146-f670-294b-2d5d59f22241
msgctxt "h33a5dac5g1dddg497fg8058gde100efe4fca"
msgid "One raunchy ballad, coming up!"
msgstr "그럼, 선정적인 노래로 갈게요!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_CourierDog
#. Speaker = Scratch
#. NodeID = 035c94c4-4c08-9a73-fab5-8b8786c5c787
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_HasMet_CourierDog(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_AttackOnDen_State_DenVictory = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_CourierDog:035c94c4-4c08-9a73-fab5-8b8786c5c787
msgctxt "h9fb17214gdb5dg4ea5ga58ag66bc7a73731b"
msgid "*Woof! Woof!*"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_CourierDog
#. Speaker = Scratch
#. NodeID = 29e50b0a-b3f6-fe76-0927-fd526946b3c2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_HasMet_CourierDog(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_AttackOnDen_State_DenVictory = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_HasMet_CourierDog(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_CourierDog:29e50b0a-b3f6-fe76-0927-fd526946b3c2
msgctxt "ha21018e4gd9d3g4e22gb26eg5d7279e4c879"
msgid "*Panting.*"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_CourierDog
#. Speaker = Scratch
#. NodeID = 42f70f88-8bfd-46d0-a387-fd64b61c34d6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_HasMet_CourierDog(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - PETPAL(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_HasMet_CourierDog(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_CourierDog:42f70f88-8bfd-46d0-a387-fd64b61c34d6
msgctxt "h45c063b5g07c4g4710g9d6cg506ffeb5360d"
msgid "These creatures are loud. Ugly. I hope they aren't your friends."
msgstr "저 생물들은 시끄럽고 못생겼어. 쟤들이 네 친구는 아니었으면 좋겠는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_CourierDog
#. Speaker = Scratch
#. NodeID = 5f3187fd-abd1-4d17-2671-1490fdceda88
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_HasMet_CourierDog(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_CourierDog:5f3187fd-abd1-4d17-2671-1490fdceda88
msgctxt "h3b8c4d9cgd086g4396g81b2gdc27e0a0e567"
msgid "*Grrrr.*"
msgstr "*으르르.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_CourierDog
#. Speaker = Scratch
#. NodeID = 6ba1f637-48a5-5708-3e51-4dc5ed4fe74b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_HasMet_CourierDog(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_AttackOnDen_State_DenVictory = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - PETPAL(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_HasMet_CourierDog(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_CourierDog:6ba1f637-48a5-5708-3e51-4dc5ed4fe74b
msgctxt "hb1976db9g78f6g42cdgbcf9ge70a6dbce349"
msgid "I like these people. They're joyful. It's... contagious."
msgstr "난 이 사람들이 좋아. 즐거워하는데, 전염성이 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_CourierDog
#. Speaker = Scratch
#. NodeID = 721c1214-b890-cd79-88ac-2c958410fac5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_HasMet_CourierDog(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_HasMet_CourierDog(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_CourierDog:721c1214-b890-cd79-88ac-2c958410fac5
msgctxt "he736134cgd51dg4e36gade2g8cca91f31eed"
msgid "*Whine.*"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_CourierDog
#. Speaker = Scratch
#. NodeID = e030f887-0cfa-1f41-796c-97e85605c175
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_HasMet_CourierDog(1) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - PETPAL(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_CourierDog:e030f887-0cfa-1f41-796c-97e85605c175
msgctxt "hc4f80c2cgd35fg4aa6g9ba9g0e9160234175"
msgid "I wish they'd stop looking at me like I'm food."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_CourierDog
#. Speaker = Scratch
#. NodeID = ee1ac786-c9ea-a32a-89a6-fad6d1a75e01
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_HasMet_CourierDog(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_AttackOnDen_State_DenVictory = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - PETPAL(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_CourierDog:ee1ac786-c9ea-a32a-89a6-fad6d1a75e01
msgctxt "h1acb1dc9g8708g4b3dgb4d3gbfbfa722cb78"
msgid "I wouldn't mind if you let them stay. Just a thought."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Drow
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 02513487-e05a-6070-4aba-d3d5881e8810
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Drow:02513487-e05a-6070-4aba-d3d5881e8810
msgctxt "h21a5801bg305fg4708g9557g64dabd07ca25"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Drow
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 06410ede-676b-40b9-054f-46c9e6bf0e8b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_DrowRefused(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Drow:06410ede-676b-40b9-054f-46c9e6bf0e8b
msgctxt "hf77ef850g1f8bg4bbbgb36agd3cbdf82f1aa"
msgid ""
"*Then her teeth fasten to your lip, biting, tearing - blood spills into your "
"mouth, rushes down your throat.*"
msgstr "*그녀의 이가 당신 입술을 꽉 물고, 찢어버립니다 - 피가 당신의 입으로 흘러 들어가, 목을 타고 내려갑니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Drow
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0c86150e-c53f-6172-27d8-068d3d696d4c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_HasPartner(1) = True
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_DrowPartner(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Drow:0c86150e-c53f-6172-27d8-068d3d696d4c
msgctxt "hab792be5gce13g4573ga725g1a97d6c685b6"
msgid "I'll beg if you want me to."
msgstr "원한다면 싹싹 빌수도 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Drow
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 13aebd45-960e-7e3f-cfec-f75dab9ec704
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_DrowHasPartner = True
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_HasPartner(1) = True
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_DrowPartner(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Drow:13aebd45-960e-7e3f-cfec-f75dab9ec704
msgctxt "h7a6edc55g62e0g4ce9gb194gf55347b2a128"
msgid "Yes. I'm yours, Minthara."
msgstr "물론. 난 네 것이야, 민타라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Drow
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 16261ad3-540a-a183-e776-6eb9a0af2f48
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_HasMet_Drow(1) = True
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_DrowRefused(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Drow:16261ad3-540a-a183-e776-6eb9a0af2f48
msgctxt "hf72fca05g6937g4c52g922ag17851af44b47"
msgid ""
"Already regretting your decision? I hope you're ready to beg for my company."
msgstr "벌써 네 결정을 후회하는 건가? 내가 함께하길 바란다면 무릎 꿇고 빌 준비가 되어있어야 할 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Drow
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 28bd361a-c3d1-9327-051f-6c062d9a6948
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_DrowCommander_Quest_AskedAboutPassage = True
#.   Local:
#.      - 2b2de826-a377-2755-b48c-ed0bc646a099_MentionedNere = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 2b2de826-a377-2755-b48c-ed0bc646a099_MentionedNere = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Drow:28bd361a-c3d1-9327-051f-6c062d9a6948
msgctxt "h703baf6eg59b2g41a7ga529ga08f9d65cffe"
msgid "You promised safe passage to Moonrise Towers. Or did you forget?"
msgstr "문라이즈 타워로 가는 안전한 길을 안내해 준다더니. 까먹은 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Drow
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 444b3685-1cb7-7eae-8335-1a055c9c81cd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Drow:444b3685-1cb7-7eae-8335-1a055c9c81cd
msgctxt "hc0669c05gfa90g4de7gbfecg9761547cda9e"
msgid "How disappointing for you. I could have shown you ecstasy."
msgstr "안된 일이야. 나라면 완전히 널 보내줄 수 있었는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Drow
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 52866db7-8c3b-3b76-98b5-41e52d3fdc7a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Absolute_Knows_MoonriseTowers = True
#.      - GOB_DrowCommander_Quest_AskedAboutPassage = False
#.   Local:
#.      - 2b2de826-a377-2755-b48c-ed0bc646a099_MentionedNere = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GOB_DrowCommander_Quest_AskedAboutPassage = True
#.   Local:
#.     - 2b2de826-a377-2755-b48c-ed0bc646a099_MentionedNere = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Drow:52866db7-8c3b-3b76-98b5-41e52d3fdc7a
msgctxt "h4ea87f60gb7cdg4796g86e6g0f2fcf79238f"
msgid "Tell me how to reach Moonrise."
msgstr "문라이즈로 가는 법을 알려줘."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Drow
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 722dc629-f536-0f90-3941-96a51f25132d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_DrowPartner(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Drow:722dc629-f536-0f90-3941-96a51f25132d
msgctxt "h411aa509g1167g42e3g8ed7g742a92d16be4"
msgid ""
"Celebrate as long as you please, but save your strength. There will be no "
"rest tonight - your body is mine."
msgstr "원하는 만큼 축하해도 좋지만, 체력을 아껴 둬. 오늘 밤은 쉴 생각 하지 않는 게 좋을 거야. 네 몸은 내 거니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Drow
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 7cc6f901-311b-9210-c13b-0f196c7741f0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Drow:7cc6f901-311b-9210-c13b-0f196c7741f0
msgctxt "h78fab953g919fg4a12ga944g4afd865fbc5f"
msgid ""
"In Menzoberranzan, the high-born would prostrate themselves before me for a "
"fleeting taste of my body."
msgstr "멘조베란잔에서는, 제일 고귀한 이들 조차도 내 몸을 잠깐이라도 맛볼 수 있다면 바닥에 납작 엎드릴 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Drow
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 833695c2-0767-2a48-9ea6-0986a4b14f4b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Drow:833695c2-0767-2a48-9ea6-0986a4b14f4b
msgctxt "h43495d20g6a01g4834g93f6ga4fecbf500ab"
msgid "Wait until morning, True Soul. All will be revealed."
msgstr "아침까지 기다려라, 참된 영혼. 그때가 되면 모든 게 밝혀질 테니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Drow
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 8ccf125c-43b8-91bd-e039-4a35eedb6fec
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHunt_HasMet_Drow(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Drow:8ccf125c-43b8-91bd-e039-4a35eedb6fec
msgctxt "h91b56729gd374g4026ga8c1g858b86dd6cde"
msgid ""
"*As she looks you up and down, her mind touches yours - you feel her hand at "
"your neck, her lips closing around yours.*"
msgstr ""
"*그녀가 당신을 위아래로 바라볼 때 그녀의 마음이 당신의 마음에 닿습니다. 당신은 그녀의 손이 당신의 목에 닿고 그녀의 입술이 당신의 "
"목을 감싸는 것을 느낍니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Drow
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 8edeeafa-d795-4d07-a985-dc447a801d40
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_DrowHasPartner = True
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_HasMet_Drow(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Drow:8edeeafa-d795-4d07-a985-dc447a801d40
msgctxt "h468d871dg30f2g4ec1g8ec1g1ac190c2a4d5"
msgid ""
"The goblins are your responsibility tonight. I have other matters to attend "
"to."
msgstr "고블린들은 오늘 네가 맡아라. 난 다른 중요한 일이 있어서, 이만."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Drow
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 94b71500-0544-a0f2-f480-c8496742682c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Drow:94b71500-0544-a0f2-f480-c8496742682c
msgctxt "h35c09106gb2a2g4e7ag8fc8gf062d554e091"
msgid "Good. I will join you when you go to your bed. You are mine."
msgstr "좋아. 네가 잠자리에 들면 나도 동참하겠다. 넌 내 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Drow
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 9c248732-22cb-874d-0efc-5eb0dc469650
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_HasPartner(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Drow:9c248732-22cb-874d-0efc-5eb0dc469650
msgctxt "h092dee9eg15f3g4bd0gb89cg23b204d24d7a"
msgid "Give your body to me."
msgstr "네 몸을 내게 바쳐."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Drow
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = a2b92f1c-c040-1414-5363-b67032fa6c7c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Drow:a2b92f1c-c040-1414-5363-b67032fa6c7c
msgctxt "h21af046ag0c57g4845ga6f8gb330e53d3524"
msgid ""
"If you already have doubts, you would only have disappointed me. Get out of "
"my sight."
msgstr "네가 이미 의심을 품고 있다면, 나를 실망시킬 뿐이야. 내 눈앞에서 사라져."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Drow
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = a4e1306c-d009-d623-10a5-7712975be25c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Drow:a4e1306c-d009-d623-10a5-7712975be25c
msgctxt "h825fb4fag9458g4a72ga12agc53c2c0c2189"
msgid "You are barely worthy to <i>look</i> at me. Get out of my sight."
msgstr "하지만 넌 날 <i>볼</i> 자격도 없어. 내 눈앞에서 꺼져버려."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Drow
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = a5f924b4-536b-3162-89c1-2614ec2d75c4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Drow:a5f924b4-536b-3162-89c1-2614ec2d75c4
msgctxt "hfdd9b340g5cafg4229g9b20gb781e5e5dbae"
msgid ""
"Did he, now? Let me guess: the snivelling brat's failed his duty. Nothing if "
"not expected."
msgstr "그가 그렇게 말했나? 내가 맞춰보지: 그 투덜대는 애송이가 임무에 실패했겠군. 놀랄 일도 아니야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Drow
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b8a4eb3b-3e17-c022-7dae-d259059e1f0c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_DrowRefused(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Drow:b8a4eb3b-3e17-c022-7dae-d259059e1f0c
msgctxt "h36635a64g0357g4e54g9216g23e38282b20f"
msgid "Back off. I'm not interested."
msgstr "물러 서. 난 관심 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Drow
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c464bfea-f081-3f04-b7fe-374816fddb68
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_DrowRefused(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Drow:c464bfea-f081-3f04-b7fe-374816fddb68
msgctxt "h4d693383gc419g4b93gaea3gcceaf37da4a4"
msgid "No. I've changed my mind."
msgstr "아니. 마음이 바뀌었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Drow
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = d9f6a528-09d2-00df-52cf-1c68d34c7d64
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_DrowHasPartner = True
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_DrowRefused(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Drow:d9f6a528-09d2-00df-52cf-1c68d34c7d64
msgctxt "hf2281f39gb944g4fbaga808gff39cc93c3cb"
msgid "Begone, insect. I have found somebody more deserving."
msgstr "꺼져라, 벌레 자식. 너보다 더 나은 사람을 찾았으니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Drow
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = db9f5cde-546f-7bc4-cf7e-3965d792ff9a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_DrowCommander_Knows_SentByNere = False
#.      - UND_TheDrowNere_Quest_SentToMinthara = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_DrowCommander_Knows_SentByNere = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Drow:db9f5cde-546f-7bc4-cf7e-3965d792ff9a
msgctxt "hf0605648gae1cg4829gbce1gcf353088456c"
msgid ""
"I met True Soul Nere in the Underdark. He warned me against working with you."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Drow
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = eeb5943e-599e-7319-f7e7-c6169aa774d7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_DrowHasPartner = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHunt_HasMet_Drow(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Drow:eeb5943e-599e-7319-f7e7-c6169aa774d7
msgctxt "h0c2fdbe3g5139g44a1g86e6g84b47d36b661"
msgid ""
"Celebrate our victory. We have earned the Absolute's favour, but She will "
"ask more of us soon."
msgstr "승리의 축배를 들자. 우린 절대자님의 총애를 얻었어. 곧 우리에게 더 많은 일을 주시겠지만."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Drow
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = f1191305-35ac-ff96-e8a8-f6f47a572869
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_AttackOnDen_Drow_AcceptedSeduction = True
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_State_HasPartner(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Drow:f1191305-35ac-ff96-e8a8-f6f47a572869
msgctxt "h8bc8992bg5012g4cdcgbaf6gf0fb03d5d439"
msgid "Are you ready to give yourself to me?"
msgstr "너 자신을 내게 바칠 준비는 됐나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Drow
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f369ad35-bf33-fd88-9944-49d0eea51a43
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Drow:f369ad35-bf33-fd88-9944-49d0eea51a43
msgctxt "h1953e9dcgfd1ag4748gbe86g934d387c0546"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Drow
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = f6c0fa30-4597-feb1-40f7-fcf9960ecc4d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Drow:f6c0fa30-4597-feb1-40f7-fcf9960ecc4d
msgctxt "hc5eab1d7g8701g403fgbefdg8a221417907c"
msgid "You have already chosen a distraction for the night, I see."
msgstr "이미 오늘 밤을 보낼 다른 방법으로 머리가 가득 차 있는 것 같군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Drow
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fe0646ce-6e8b-15cc-28fd-bcf41a0b094d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Drow:fe0646ce-6e8b-15cc-28fd-bcf41a0b094d
msgctxt "h16d6af90g0dadg4835gaf3eg4b45e3860054"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_FlirtyTiefling
#. Speaker = Lakrissa
#. NodeID = 5e468a1c-997f-ca71-0def-0fd71a84e09c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_HasMet_FlirtyTiefling(1) = False
#.      - DEN_General_TieflingGuard10_PromisedDrink(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_HasMet_FlirtyTiefling(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_FlirtyTiefling:5e468a1c-997f-ca71-0def-0fd71a84e09c
msgctxt "h2867c4d5g0b49g45bcg95c4g6eb541c1dd43"
msgid ""
"Consider this a preview for when we get to Baldur's Gate. Remember - the "
"first round is on me."
msgstr "우리가 발더스 게이트에 가서 겪을 일에 대한 소개라고 생각해. 기억해, 첫 잔은 내가 산다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_FlirtyTiefling
#. Speaker = Lakrissa
#. NodeID = 6d8250fe-ee7b-e8f1-2494-1a2e65943960
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_HasMet_FlirtyTiefling(1) = True
#.      - DEN_General_TieflingGuard10_PromisedDrink(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_FlirtyTiefling:6d8250fe-ee7b-e8f1-2494-1a2e65943960
msgctxt "h1e84b30agfaf5g4167gbde4ged8ce8fd0907"
msgid "Go on - the others will kill me if I keep you all to myself."
msgstr "가봐, 널 내가 독점하면 다른 이들이 날 죽여버릴 테니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_FlirtyTiefling
#. Speaker = Lakrissa
#. NodeID = 7e48ed06-0cb9-cffe-4c04-7fad1729e159
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_HasMet_FlirtyTiefling(1) = True
#.      - DEN_General_TieflingGuard10_PromisedDrink(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_FlirtyTiefling:7e48ed06-0cb9-cffe-4c04-7fad1729e159
msgctxt "hb58e31d9g5ce9g46f4gbafeg3195661186de"
msgid ""
"Go chat with the others. Wouldn't be fair to keep you all to myself - for "
"now."
msgstr "다른 이들과도 대화해 봐. 내가 널 독점하는 건 불공평하니까, 당장은 말이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_FlirtyTiefling
#. Speaker = Lakrissa
#. NodeID = a1fd68b5-9db9-0f64-6718-985a1acb34c0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - DEN_General_TieflingGuard10_PromisedDrink(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_HasMet_FlirtyTiefling(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_FlirtyTiefling:a1fd68b5-9db9-0f64-6718-985a1acb34c0
msgctxt "h13acd528g096dg483agbbceg68d92ad9c532"
msgid ""
"Hope you're enjoying the night, hero. I certainly am. Cheers to many more "
"like this."
msgstr "오늘 밤을 즐기고 있기를 바라, 영웅. 난 확실히 그러고 있으니까. 이런 날이 더 많기를."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin001
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 00448f51-e0e6-ad26-5f98-f1c97c7e0959
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Event_MetBardBeforeParty = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin001:00448f51-e0e6-ad26-5f98-f1c97c7e0959
msgctxt "h192a7e64g6dfdg4c36g83bdg9c5bd0a03b63"
msgid ""
"*Though it is scuffed and smeared with blood, you realise the lute belonged "
"to Alfira, the tiefling bard.*"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin001
#. Speaker = Goblin Brawler
#. NodeID = 0207e209-138c-a5f1-01e0-66c2c8b49a36
