msgctxt "hbc08a78cge3acg4c9dgaf8agb50f9bd5d197"
msgid "Anything for the cause."
msgstr "목적을 위해서라면 뭐든지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin001
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 0f0f9fa4-754d-2be6-fd7a-24436a0d6c6a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_TadpoledCount5(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_TadpoledCount5(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin001:0f0f9fa4-754d-2be6-fd7a-24436a0d6c6a
msgctxt "h7fc31ec7gc049g4f1egb693g4412fc1617e4"
msgid ""
"*Your blood runs quicker, feeding the gnawing absence at the centre of your "
"mind.*"
msgstr "*피가 더 빨리 흐르면서, 당신의 정신 한가운데를 좀먹는 허전함을 양분으로 채웁니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin001
#. Speaker = Goblin Brawler
#. NodeID = 16bba045-641d-acc1-d1fe-a209b0d5e958
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin001:16bba045-641d-acc1-d1fe-a209b0d5e958
msgctxt "h2c1b96aag659cg4215g9f26gc2c8e0b8f73f"
msgid "Th-thank you, True Soul."
msgstr "가-감사합니다, 참된 영혼이시여."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin001
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 185a7bc8-eb68-45ed-a531-35397cf3856c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_TadpoledCount6(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_TadpoledCount6(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin001:185a7bc8-eb68-45ed-a531-35397cf3856c
msgctxt "h05ca7289g04d1g41dcg9d8agf0e2bf02fc0f"
msgid ""
"*The presence deep in your mind is awake, unblinking. This is it. A single "
"word pervades your consciousness: 'Soon'.*"
msgstr ""
"*당신의 정신 속 깊이 자리잡은 존재가 태연스레 깨어납니다. 올 것이 왔군요. 한 단어가 당신의 의식 속으로 스며듭니다. ‘곧’*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin001
#. Speaker = Goblin Brawler
#. NodeID = 1a88394a-bb00-1f23-0f0d-b833a8cd2ab7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin001:1a88394a-bb00-1f23-0f0d-b833a8cd2ab7
msgctxt "h0b7045dcge485g4314g8c8egbf32615ed86b"
msgid ""
"A pleasure. My name's Ripper - put in a good word for me at Moonrise, yeah?"
msgstr "만나서 반갑습니다. 전 리퍼라고 합니다. 문라이즈에 가시면 저에 대해 좋은 말을 좀 전해주시겠습니까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin001
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 30d814b5-c68f-5de5-07d4-88dd821ba8b7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin001:30d814b5-c68f-5de5-07d4-88dd821ba8b7
msgctxt "h98ddcb99g019dg4c3fgbb08gb19e836bfb2c"
msgid "You fought well. This prize is yours."
msgstr "잘 싸우더군. 이 상은 네 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin001
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 3f626788-7a00-fa7c-848d-6c287adb78dd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_TadpoledCount2(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_TadpoledCount2(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin001:3f626788-7a00-fa7c-848d-6c287adb78dd
msgctxt "h1473cb40gfff1g4bb2gb9fcg5979dd2e4f92"
msgid ""
"*Something stirs deep within you, hungry and alert... it's taking something "
"you'll never get back.*"
msgstr "*몸 깊숙한 데서 굶주리고 기민한 존재가 꿈틀댑니다... 잃으면 되찾지 못할 뭔가를 좀먹고 있군요.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin001
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 4386b11d-f072-a012-fd9f-23f028cd4a16
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_Tadpoled_UsedToday1(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin001:4386b11d-f072-a012-fd9f-23f028cd4a16
msgctxt "hb9a5f34egcafag4cc5gb0b9g2e3ee30be9d6"
msgid ""
"*The mark glows, but you feel nothing in response. Your illithid power is "
"beyond reach until you rest.*"
msgstr "*문양이 빛나지만, 어떤 반응도 느껴지지 않습니다. 일리시드 능력을 더 사용하려면 휴식을 취해야 합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin001
#. Speaker = Goblin Brawler
#. NodeID = 57c38a08-6489-b778-fea3-190f2d435a93
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin001:57c38a08-6489-b778-fea3-190f2d435a93
msgctxt "ha76dca22gdfa4g4e72gbf2bgac78a25e2b52"
msgid ""
"A pleasure. My name's Ripper - put in a good word for me at Moonrise, yeah?"
msgstr "만나서 반갑습니다. 전 리퍼라고 합니다. 문라이즈에 가시면 저에 대해 좋은 말을 좀 전해주시겠습니까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin001
