msgctxt "hc546a89ag649bg4c20g8362gfc7f6e370c0b"
msgid "True Soul, sir. A present, straight from the battlefield."
msgstr "참된 영혼 나으리. 전장에서 바로 가져온 선물입니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin001
