#.     - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Event_TransferHeart(1) = True
#. TagRule: MALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin001:c4ebb850-29f1-7b91-6567-5c911b71f63c
msgctxt "hfac1182dga17eg41fcg9214g4ab8e096c9ef"
msgid ""
"Didn't mean to hold out on you, sir. Just didn't think you'd be interested, "
"is all."
msgstr "숨기려고 한 것이 아닙니다, 나으리. 다만 관심이 없으실 것 같아서 그랬습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin001
#. Speaker = Goblin Brawler
#. NodeID = c4ebb850-29f1-7b91-6567-5c911b71f63c
