msgctxt "ha3cb84f9g7448g4f3dg8ffbgf6fa264f8c92"
msgid "<i>Accept both the heart and the lute.</i>"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin001
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = d1733d0a-0816-245d-b7f7-2b3a852cdfcf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   User:
#.      - GLO_TadpoleIntro_NPC(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin001:d1733d0a-0816-245d-b7f7-2b3a852cdfcf
msgctxt "h04f4f201ge57ag4e52gb7e5g9a95c29bbfbb"
msgid "*As the symbol glows, power courses through you. <i>Authority</i>.*"
msgstr "*문양이 빛나며, 몸에 흐르는 힘이 느껴집니다. <i>권위</i>.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin001
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = d3944797-d75d-1b32-c262-ed1ae3c0cd30
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.     - TRUESOUL(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin001:d3944797-d75d-1b32-c262-ed1ae3c0cd30
msgctxt "h946cd332gd381g4897ga7f1geb7dc73d9620"
msgid ""
"*Your mind is full, bursting with ecstasy and terror. Finally, it is coming. "
"You are becoming.*"
msgstr "*당신의 정신이 황홀경과 공포로 가득 차오릅니다. 마침내, 때가 됐군요. 당신은 변화 중입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin001
#. Speaker = Goblin Brawler
#. NodeID = d56e42da-3a37-3ddd-27a9-6be96801062f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: FEMALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin001:d56e42da-3a37-3ddd-27a9-6be96801062f
msgctxt "hf5f73932g9020g4502g9149g57cdec0d1368"
msgid "Of course. Didn't mean to hold out on you, ma'am."
msgstr "물론입니다. 당신께 숨기려는 뜻이 아니었습니다, 마님."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin001
#. Speaker = Goblin Brawler
#. NodeID = d56e42da-3a37-3ddd-27a9-6be96801062f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: MALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin001:d56e42da-3a37-3ddd-27a9-6be96801062f
msgctxt "hd2db0d30gaf92g4431g9e76gffbf1dbe2277"
msgid "Of course. Didn't mean to hold out on you, sir."
msgstr "물론입니다. 당신께 숨기려는 뜻이 아니었습니다, 나으리."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin001
#. Speaker = Goblin Brawler
#. NodeID = d56e42da-3a37-3ddd-27a9-6be96801062f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin001:d56e42da-3a37-3ddd-27a9-6be96801062f
msgctxt "h8b29b890g7c84g4331g849eg966b1c147e27"
msgid "Of course. Didn't mean to hold out on you, True Soul."
msgstr "물론입니다. 당신께 숨기려는 뜻이 아니었습니다, 참된 영혼이시여."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin001
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = e9d359c3-ff21-e7f2-a2da-b6846d9dd980
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   User:
#.      - GLO_TadpoleIntro_NPC(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   User:
#.     - GLO_TadpoleIntro_NPC(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin001:e9d359c3-ff21-e7f2-a2da-b6846d9dd980
msgctxt "he120264cg82fbg4852g9079g88aa85a8f934"
msgid ""
"*A strange symbol glows, marked on their flesh, and something within you "
"stirs in response.*"
msgstr "*그들의 살갗에 새겨진 기묘한 상징이 빛나고, 이에 반응하여 당신 내면의 무언가가 꿈틀거립니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin001
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ee73b008-4c04-9c84-c844-fcc5669ce2bf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_Tadpoled_UsedToday1(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = False
#.      - ILLITHID(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 5c7da982-bc01-dcdb-bc8c-e9bc3ef5baea_GaveReward = True
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_Tadpoled_UsedToday1(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin001:ee73b008-4c04-9c84-c844-fcc5669ce2bf
msgctxt "hbbf46bf9gb621g4943g930eg122dec1b669b"
msgid ""
"I know you have more than some bloodied instrument. Empty out your pockets."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin002
#. Speaker = Goblin Brawler
#. NodeID = 5193c9e9-aae8-dffd-60a1-92ff5112e0a8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_HasMet_Goblin002(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin002:5193c9e9-aae8-dffd-60a1-92ff5112e0a8
msgctxt "had3a6056gafc9g43b6g92c6g166c7b6ed243"
msgid "Heh, heh. Red with the blood of those heathens!"
msgstr "헤헤. 불신자들의 피로 물들었어!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin002
#. Speaker = Goblin Brawler
#. NodeID = c0a1d429-1515-bb4d-4f3e-d4c66f0ecc9e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_HasMet_Goblin002(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin002:c0a1d429-1515-bb4d-4f3e-d4c66f0ecc9e
msgctxt "h9d7e9027ga4f5g41abg8398gee674348f7a8"
msgid ""
"I got it all red for ya. Red for our love for the Absolute! Heh heh heh."
msgstr "당신을 위해 다 빨갛게 만들었습니다. 절대자님에 대한 저희 사랑으로 빨갛게! 헤헤헤."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin003
#. Speaker = Goblin Tracker
#. NodeID = 2172e819-a7d3-3a48-5562-d9e7e7fa3c41
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - TIEFLING(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin003:2172e819-a7d3-3a48-5562-d9e7e7fa3c41
msgctxt "hb7c37c30g2281g4766g98c8g9583d6f7d2a7"
msgid "Guess ya do have some devil's blood in there, don't ya?"
msgstr "짐작건대 넌 데빌의 피를 타고난 게 틀림없어, 그렇지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin003
#. Speaker = Goblin Tracker
#. NodeID = 487aa9a1-0453-b529-095b-facda1162058
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_HasMet_Goblin003(1) = True
#. TagRule: TIEFLING
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin003:487aa9a1-0453-b529-095b-facda1162058
msgctxt "hd4ed9849gdb55g4c44gbbdag87b4b4984f8a"
msgid ""
"Never thought I'd be followin' a tiefling into battle - and against your own "
"kind!"
msgstr "티플링을 따라 전투에 참여할 줄 전혀 생각도 못했어 - 게다가 너의 종족이랑 싸우면서 말이야!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin003
#. Speaker = Goblin Tracker
#. NodeID = 487aa9a1-0453-b529-095b-facda1162058
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_HasMet_Goblin003(1) = True
#. TagRule: LOLTHDROWELF
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin003:487aa9a1-0453-b529-095b-facda1162058
msgctxt "hfdaf041ege5c1g4090gb7dfgc98ae380e0e3"
msgid ""
"Never thought I'd be followin' a drow of my own free will - and then come "
"out of battle alive!"
msgstr "내 의지로 드로우를 따라 전투에 참여할 줄 전혀 생각도 못 했어 - 게다가 전투에서 살아남을 줄이야!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin003
#. Speaker = Goblin Tracker
#. NodeID = 487aa9a1-0453-b529-095b-facda1162058
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_HasMet_Goblin003(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin003:487aa9a1-0453-b529-095b-facda1162058
msgctxt "h22692ac7ge959g4dc7gac63gba133c90799e"
msgid ""
"Never thought I'd follow someone like you into battle - but you're twice as "
"mean as any hobgoblin!"
msgstr "너 같은 녀석을 따라 전투에 참여할 줄 생각도 못했어 - 하지만 너는 홉고블린보다 두 배나 더 잔인해!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin003
#. Speaker = Goblin Tracker
#. NodeID = d32f9ce8-3c66-ead5-cc8f-3051ecbee2b3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_HasMet_Goblin003(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin003:d32f9ce8-3c66-ead5-cc8f-3051ecbee2b3
msgctxt "hb8de52a4gdbc1g45b1g9b5dg43fe58243b1c"
msgid "We'll show those heretics. Burn them all to the ground!"
msgstr "저 이단자 놈들에게 보여줄 것이다. 놈들을 전부 불태워 버리자!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin003
#. Speaker = Goblin Tracker
#. NodeID = fd3adb7f-5614-c04f-e36c-1a3e157b63cc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin003:fd3adb7f-5614-c04f-e36c-1a3e157b63cc
msgctxt "h6896405dge91ag4e04g97f6g3edf540faf05"
msgid "The Absolute smiles on you. On all of us!"
msgstr "절대자가 너희들에게 웃어 주셨어. 우리 모두를 향해!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin004
#. Speaker = Goblin Tracker
#. NodeID = 2b9296f0-4e39-86b4-501b-21b006d51eec
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_HasMet_Goblin004(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin004:2b9296f0-4e39-86b4-501b-21b006d51eec
msgctxt "h3389726cg1bdbg4a91gb620g3b94d0549176"
msgid "Anythin' shows its face here, we'll skin it alive."
msgstr "여기서 누구든 얼굴을 보이면, 산 채로 가죽을 벗길거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin004
#. Speaker = Goblin Tracker
#. NodeID = cc61aaf0-c044-ead9-7211-7253159a88aa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_HasMet_Goblin004(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin004:cc61aaf0-c044-ead9-7211-7253159a88aa
msgctxt "h8a429ddeg7915g42e4g97f8gb4f5e8364558"
msgid "Don't lift a finger, boss! I'm keepin' guard. You go have a drink!"
msgstr "대장님, 손가락 하나도 움직이지 마세요! 제가 경비를 서겠습니다. 대장님은 술 한 잔 드시러 가세요!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin005
#. Speaker = Goblin Tracker
#. NodeID = 15041b3f-60c7-ed2a-cef4-718dfa874af9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_HasMet_Goblin005(1) = True
#. TagRule: FEMALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin005:15041b3f-60c7-ed2a-cef4-718dfa874af9
msgctxt "h29c202b7ge1b2g4f72g868eg4e907592eb8f"
msgid "No other incidents, ma'am."
msgstr "다른 일은 없습니다, 마님."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin005
#. Speaker = Goblin Tracker
#. NodeID = 15041b3f-60c7-ed2a-cef4-718dfa874af9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_HasMet_Goblin005(1) = True
#. TagRule: MALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin005:15041b3f-60c7-ed2a-cef4-718dfa874af9
msgctxt "hf8e13c70gbdfbg41a8gb334gc9771e576960"
msgid "No other incidents, sir."
msgstr "다른 일은 없습니다, 나으리."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin005
#. Speaker = Goblin Tracker
#. NodeID = 15041b3f-60c7-ed2a-cef4-718dfa874af9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_HasMet_Goblin005(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin005:15041b3f-60c7-ed2a-cef4-718dfa874af9
msgctxt "h6d0a8bfdga705g47e6gaa8fgedb7bedcbe9d"
msgid "No other incidents to report."
msgstr "다른 보고할 일은 없습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin005
#. Speaker = Goblin Tracker
#. NodeID = 21b9c9c3-224f-4d07-c693-7d25bcaf1377
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin005:21b9c9c3-224f-4d07-c693-7d25bcaf1377
msgctxt "h855c2904gea18g40d7g862eg16666d7c786d"
msgid "Any of those druids is still alive, they'll know not to mess with us."
msgstr "아직 살아있는 드루이드가 있다면, 우릴 건드리면 안 된다는 걸 깨달을 겁니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin005
#. Speaker = Goblin Tracker
#. NodeID = fe2efdb9-e889-9649-f673-98ac432a20e1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_HasMet_Goblin005(1) = True
#. TagRule: FEMALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin005:fe2efdb9-e889-9649-f673-98ac432a20e1
msgctxt "h8a035f1bg2f6ag4c4ag8788gcceec26f9c4e"
msgid ""
"Coast all clear, ma'am. Some stinkin' bird flew by some time ago, but I got "
"it straight through the neck."
msgstr "상황은 모두 정리됐습니다, 마님. 얼마 전에 냄새나는 새 한 마리가 날아왔는데, 제가 목을 바로 꿰뚫어버렸죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin005
#. Speaker = Goblin Tracker
#. NodeID = fe2efdb9-e889-9649-f673-98ac432a20e1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_HasMet_Goblin005(1) = True
#. TagRule: MALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin005:fe2efdb9-e889-9649-f673-98ac432a20e1
msgctxt "hfb6672dfgc3b4g472bg95f7g77fcc00bd326"
msgid ""
"Coast all clear, sir. Some stinkin' bird flew by some time ago, but I got it "
"straight through the neck."
msgstr "상황은 모두 정리됐습니다, 대장. 얼마 전에 냄새나는 새 한 마리가 날아왔는데, 제가 목에 바로 맞췄죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin005
#. Speaker = Goblin Tracker
#. NodeID = fe2efdb9-e889-9649-f673-98ac432a20e1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_HasMet_Goblin005(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin005:fe2efdb9-e889-9649-f673-98ac432a20e1
msgctxt "h1f88d4b9g0dafg4b5eg81e6g0eb10a7ac01f"
msgid ""
"Coast all clear. Some stinkin' bird flew by some time ago, but I got it "
"straight through the neck."
msgstr "상황은 모두 정리됐습니다. 얼마 전에 냄새나는 새 한 마리가 날아왔는데, 제가 목을 꿰뚫어버렸습죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin006
#. Speaker = Goblin Tracker
#. NodeID = 50d60eaa-474d-3548-14c0-30b2e48afb5d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_HasMet_Goblin006(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin006:50d60eaa-474d-3548-14c0-30b2e48afb5d
msgctxt "h26f57125g0468g4028g9e3bg23669115cc46"
msgid ""
"Soon as the Absolute gives the command, we'll burn everythin' to the ground. "
"No one can stop us anymore."
msgstr "절대자께서 명령하는 대로, 우리는 모든 것을 불태워버릴 것이다. 아무도 우리를 막을 수 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin006
#. Speaker = Goblin Tracker
#. NodeID = d8c6f22f-2d58-63f8-670a-0bb25e986c4a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_HasMet_Goblin006(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin006:d8c6f22f-2d58-63f8-670a-0bb25e986c4a
msgctxt "h2d7bbc13gd82ag4bf0ga4dfg987043345746"
msgid ""
"You smoked 'em all out like it was nothin', True Soul. Imagine what a "
"<i>Disciple </i>could do."
msgstr ""
"당신은 그들을 원래 무의 상태였던 것처럼 모두 연기로 몰아냈습니다, 참된 영혼이시여. <i>신봉자</i>가 할 수 있는 것을 상상해 "
"보십시오."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin007
#. Speaker = Goblin Devout
#. NodeID = 1b296eb8-22f3-3c5f-c052-49c423224101
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_HasMet_Goblin007(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin007:1b296eb8-22f3-3c5f-c052-49c423224101
msgctxt "h56dce67cg8733g4431gb83bgdd5b91666e8f"
msgid "Honour to fight alongside you, boss."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin007
#. Speaker = Goblin Devout
#. NodeID = 2dfb069c-7f5d-a7d0-4123-17b102d63f20
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_HasMet_Goblin007(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin007:2dfb069c-7f5d-a7d0-4123-17b102d63f20
msgctxt "hd919b21eg0c10g4948gb8aeg3c255bf89269"
msgid ""
"Never seen a True Soul in action before - I'd follow you to the Hells and "
"back."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin007
#. Speaker = Goblin Devout
#. NodeID = 50f10b4d-cb41-d0ff-eaf6-886c503ac651
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin007:50f10b4d-cb41-d0ff-eaf6-886c503ac651
msgctxt "h88285f9fg3d37g4040g9423g57382fb35c16"
msgid ""
"Once we're rested, we should carve our way right to Baldur's Gate. Whole "
"world needs to know what we did here. "
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin008
#. Speaker = Goblin Warlock
#. NodeID = 37da650f-4882-dd69-c2b0-2fb17e5b636a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_HasMet_Goblin008(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin008:37da650f-4882-dd69-c2b0-2fb17e5b636a
msgctxt "h7ffb8266gc9a2g4e29g921age1135620c391"
msgid "Our gift to the Absolute. May the whole world see His strength!"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin008
#. Speaker = Goblin Warlock
#. NodeID = b9adfdd6-fc88-73f5-1627-303b59128aa5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_HasMet_Goblin008(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin008:b9adfdd6-fc88-73f5-1627-303b59128aa5
msgctxt "h54845327gef29g4a79gb62fg7d6a4568de7f"
msgid "Beautiful, ain't it? A tribute to our strength!"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin009
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0c9aecb2-beec-a81d-ae21-1c275ebcbd98
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin009:0c9aecb2-beec-a81d-ae21-1c275ebcbd98
msgctxt "hb7f63ef5g4c25g4de2g8c8cg40abe1e3cc5a"
msgid ""
"My connection to the Absolute is private. I can't pray in front of lowly "
"novices."
msgstr "내 절대자와의 연결은 사적인 것이다. 비천한 수련생들 앞에서 기도할 순 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin009
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 0cc08cdf-7f7b-0540-c10b-e06898105877
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_TadpoledCount2(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_TadpoledCount2(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin009:0cc08cdf-7f7b-0540-c10b-e06898105877
msgctxt "h6f293a1eg9e0eg4285gb1f7g3264065b50a8"
msgid ""
"*Something stirs deep within you, hungry and alert... it's taking something "
"you'll never get back.*"
msgstr "*몸 깊숙한 데서 굶주리고 기민한 존재가 꿈틀댑니다... 잃으면 되찾지 못할 뭔가를 좀먹고 있군요.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin009
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 148204c2-2b66-e827-d008-25f34634d0ed
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin009:148204c2-2b66-e827-d008-25f34634d0ed
msgctxt "hc2caa233g27ccg4256gbb6bg40fdb753d7c2"
msgid ""
"<i>Step up to the shrine, touching your fingers to your heart and your "
"head.</i>"
msgstr "<i>손가락으로 심장과 머리를 만지며 성소에 다가선다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin009
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 1e183c49-68f2-c890-7e63-972fa3b205bd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   User:
#.      - GLO_TadpoleIntro_NPC(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin009:1e183c49-68f2-c890-7e63-972fa3b205bd
msgctxt "h657ac750ga66eg4d79ga060g2c3a71e0ebd5"
msgid "*As the symbol glows, power courses through you. <i>Authority</i>.*"
msgstr "*문양이 빛나며, 몸에 흐르는 힘이 느껴집니다. <i>권위</i>.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin009
#. Speaker = Goblin Booyahg
#. NodeID = 1ed098cf-f706-fcb6-35cb-b48e7090b949
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHuntcelebration_Event_DamageGoblin = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin009:1ed098cf-f706-fcb6-35cb-b48e7090b949
msgctxt "h8bd8f0d2g602bg4d48gba6dg8e88a40fd12c"
msgid "Glory to the Absolute!"
msgstr "절대자에게 영광을!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin009
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 36a0112b-fa2c-0b74-a2dd-e0b13de6eecd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_TadpoledCount4(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_TadpoledCount4(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin009:36a0112b-fa2c-0b74-a2dd-e0b13de6eecd
msgctxt "he84f5e53g170eg4454gb0dagfeef59310cf1"
msgid ""
"*A shadow swims across your vision, and a familiar voice tells you to be "
"calm. You are loved.*"
msgstr "*그림자가 낀 듯이 눈앞이 흐려지더니, 익숙한 목소리가 당신을 달래줍니다. 사랑이 느껴집니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin009
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 464d77c9-180c-5ad7-f7bd-975ee17f5ee1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_Tadpoled_UsedToday1(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = False
#.      - ILLITHID(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_Tadpoled_UsedToday1(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin009:464d77c9-180c-5ad7-f7bd-975ee17f5ee1
msgctxt "h7d71aa78gad45g470aga083g405b449bd28c"
msgid ""
"The Absolute wants more - you should add your own blood to the offering."
msgstr "절대자께서는 더 많은 걸 원하신다. 네 피도 공물로 바치도록."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin009
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 54d90dfa-738f-012a-871c-e1f555c0b6c8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.     - TRUESOUL(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin009:54d90dfa-738f-012a-871c-e1f555c0b6c8
msgctxt "h77f8870cgf856g4ae5gb506g21ff8caee20b"
msgid ""
"*Your mind is full, bursting with ecstasy and terror. Finally, it is coming. "
"You are becoming.*"
msgstr "*당신의 정신이 황홀경과 공포로 가득 차오릅니다. 마침내, 때가 됐군요. 당신은 변화 중입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin009
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 57f716ed-7ad2-1047-60ab-471faca8fa41
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_Tadpoled_UsedToday1(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin009:57f716ed-7ad2-1047-60ab-471faca8fa41
msgctxt "h0257708bgacd8g4fadga5a4gd4614ff58c26"
msgid ""
"*The mark glows, but you feel nothing in response. Your illithid power is "
"beyond reach until you rest.*"
msgstr "*문양이 빛나지만, 어떤 반응도 느껴지지 않습니다. 일리시드 능력을 더 사용하려면 휴식을 취해야 합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin009
#. Speaker = Goblin Booyahg
#. NodeID = 6a28559f-7282-e36f-c19b-30060aa8bbd6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: FEMALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin009:6a28559f-7282-e36f-c19b-30060aa8bbd6
msgctxt "hd487053bgd816g4410g9e42g871bdbf4f64f"
msgid ""
"Apologies, ma'am. I already lost a lot of blood durin' the fight - an' I "
"still have to see the shrine finished."
msgstr "죄송합니다, 마님. 저는 이미 전투에서 많은 피를 흘렸습니다 - 그리고 여전히 신전이 완성되기를 보고 싶습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin009
#. Speaker = Goblin Booyahg
#. NodeID = 6a28559f-7282-e36f-c19b-30060aa8bbd6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: MALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin009:6a28559f-7282-e36f-c19b-30060aa8bbd6
msgctxt "h431c41eagdd6dg4073g8e08g82652bb54faf"
msgid ""
"Apologies, sir. I already lost a lot of blood durin' the fight - an' I still "
"have to see the shrine finished."
msgstr "죄송합니다, 나으리. 저는 이미 전투에서 많은 피를 흘렸습니다 - 그리고 여전히 신전이 완성되기를 보고 싶습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin009
#. Speaker = Goblin Booyahg
#. NodeID = 6a28559f-7282-e36f-c19b-30060aa8bbd6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin009:6a28559f-7282-e36f-c19b-30060aa8bbd6
msgctxt "h425c1f81g4bbeg4a79ga3c0g92c9f83e7021"
msgid ""
"Apologies, True Soul. I already lost a lot of blood durin' the fight - an' I "
"still have to see the shrine finished."
msgstr "죄송합니다, 참된 영혼이시여. 저는 이미 그 싸움에서 많은 피를 흘렸습니다 - 그리고 여전히 신전이 완성되기를 보고 싶습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin009
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6aeb2a90-afc0-3380-5046-448135ad85e0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin009:6aeb2a90-afc0-3380-5046-448135ad85e0
msgctxt "h072e3bfcg0194g4006ga5bbg1e57136587bc"
msgid "<i>Offer a silent prayer to Shar.</i>"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin009
#. Speaker = Goblin Booyahg
#. NodeID = 7ae1c2fd-2d6c-eae5-1b65-e8fc4e90905d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin009:7ae1c2fd-2d6c-eae5-1b65-e8fc4e90905d
msgctxt "h005e5153gc931g4457gb59bg9559576248f9"
msgid "C-certainly."
msgstr "무-물론입니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin009
#. Speaker = Goblin Booyahg
#. NodeID = 7e5530d1-13f9-16b3-60f5-45e45166d310
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin009:7e5530d1-13f9-16b3-60f5-45e45166d310
msgctxt "h64f99138g5281g476bgaedbg8d0bc04d6cdc"
msgid "Certainly. I meant no offence, True Soul."
msgstr "물론입니다. 실례를 범할 생각은 아니었습니다, 참된 영혼이시여."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin009
#. Speaker = Goblin Booyahg
#. NodeID = 88edafe4-c204-c3e6-8bc5-36db81a09237
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_HasMet_Goblin009(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin009:88edafe4-c204-c3e6-8bc5-36db81a09237
msgctxt "h045bb57fg35a9g4118g813eg9c1eaf1f2eed"
msgid ""
"Let the Absolute hear your prayers. Let the blood of Her enemies flow over "
"you!"
msgstr "절대자께서 당신의 기도를 듣도록 하시죠. 그분 적의 피가 당신의 몸 위로 흐르도록!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin009
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 89b99e92-5410-d398-a8f1-ebddaad54a37
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_TadpoledCount6(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_TadpoledCount6(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin009:89b99e92-5410-d398-a8f1-ebddaad54a37
msgctxt "hde5bb1e1gf935g43b6g9e2eg19cc3b7d0163"
msgid ""
"*The presence deep in your mind is awake, unblinking. This is it. A single "
"word pervades your consciousness: 'Soon'.*"
msgstr ""
"*당신의 정신 속 깊이 자리잡은 존재가 태연스레 깨어납니다. 올 것이 왔군요. 한 단어가 당신의 의식 속으로 스며듭니다. ‘곧’*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin009
#. Speaker = Goblin Booyahg
#. NodeID = ae6f6724-711c-6be4-b9c5-eeaa22730f1a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_HasMet_Goblin009(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin009:ae6f6724-711c-6be4-b9c5-eeaa22730f1a
msgctxt "h43f9b3fcg2fc2g4ad8gbc84ge31795ad4ae5"
msgid ""
"You hear the Absolute's voice, don't you? I will soon - I can already feel "
"Her coming closer!"
msgstr "당신도 절대자의 목소리를 듣지 않습니까? 저도 곧 듣게 될 것입니다. 그녀가 다가오는 것을 이미 느낄 수 있습니다!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin009
#. Speaker = Goblin Booyahg
#. NodeID = b1197180-5a03-de0f-670b-493bb24a5aeb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin009:b1197180-5a03-de0f-670b-493bb24a5aeb
msgctxt "he9031907g2c24g4436g95e4g752c192c70c5"
msgid "May the Absolute give us all power!"
msgstr "절대자께서 우리에게 모든 힘을 주시길!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin009
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b3362645-bbba-58ac-5cfc-3bfd27d2072d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_Tadpoled_UsedToday1(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_Tadpoled_UsedToday1(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin009:b3362645-bbba-58ac-5cfc-3bfd27d2072d
msgctxt "hac5e5d82g386ag42d2g8212g6d43a09d1d00"
msgid ""
"The Absolute wants more - you should add your own blood to the offering."
msgstr "절대자께서는 더 많은 걸 원하신다. 네 피도 공물로 바치도록."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin009
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = bd1f3aee-da30-2e99-d971-a33a667cdb6b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_TadpoledCount1(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_TadpoledCount1(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin009:bd1f3aee-da30-2e99-d971-a33a667cdb6b
msgctxt "h7915ba4bg0a29g48ecga2a8gdf4aaa5c80b9"
msgid "*A shiver runs across your mind... You feel sated.*"
msgstr "*전율이 불현듯 머릿속을 스쳐 지나가고... 만족감이 듭니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin009
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = bfce2622-313f-cda3-05bb-2dda3f74bdc9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_TadpoledCount3(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_TadpoledCount3(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin009:bfce2622-313f-cda3-05bb-2dda3f74bdc9
msgctxt "hef4c9354g335eg44bcg9136gacdc29232a59"
msgid "*Your mind lurches, reeling suddenly as if... bitten.*"
msgstr "*뭔가에 깨물린 것처럼 느닷없이 정신이 휘청거립니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin009
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = c39a43a9-f47d-1ab6-f336-475022844b20
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_TadpoledCount5(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_TadpoledCount5(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin009:c39a43a9-f47d-1ab6-f336-475022844b20
msgctxt "h3460c8ebg24d7g4451ga7abg6191b203baac"
msgid ""
"*Your blood runs quicker, feeding the gnawing absence at the centre of your "
"mind.*"
msgstr "*피가 더 빨리 흐르면서, 당신의 정신 한가운데를 좀먹는 허전함을 양분으로 채웁니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin009
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d026022a-634c-fad4-9f88-4c52999a69a4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin009:d026022a-634c-fad4-9f88-4c52999a69a4
msgctxt "hf9ecea67g6b35g437egbd17geb2781e9198e"
msgid "<i>Put the bowl to your lips and drink every last drop.</i>"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin009
#. Speaker = Goblin Booyahg
#. NodeID = d38143b7-dbdf-afbb-963c-8019e914db6d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin009:d38143b7-dbdf-afbb-963c-8019e914db6d
msgctxt "h4f8c1433g107fg4472gbc59gaa066e3f8733"
msgid "May the Absolute be with you forever, sir!"
msgstr "영원히 절대자가 당신과 함께 하시길, 나으리!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin009
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e9439b22-20b2-70b8-d0be-bbc25aebf13a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin009:e9439b22-20b2-70b8-d0be-bbc25aebf13a
msgctxt "h2d2e3a42ge796g4303g997ag1974edab9810"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin009
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = f73e6c1a-04de-17e4-a9f9-764a3a60d068
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   User:
#.      - GLO_TadpoleIntro_NPC(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   User:
#.     - GLO_TadpoleIntro_NPC(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Goblin009:f73e6c1a-04de-17e4-a9f9-764a3a60d068
msgctxt "h26dbfc53g02c7g4174g9760g6bed53256e44"
msgid ""
"*A strange symbol glows, marked on their flesh, and something within you "
"stirs in response.*"
msgstr "*그들의 살갗에 새겨진 기묘한 상징이 빛나고, 이에 반응하여 당신 내면의 무언가가 꿈틀거립니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Halsin
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 00a26667-6c51-4cd0-e30a-d8a109c31a93
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Halsin:00a26667-6c51-4cd0-e30a-d8a109c31a93
msgctxt "hb8916e08g70f3g4279g8f0bgb51c2f118e2f"
msgid "Take your own advice, why don't you? Go on - mingle a little."
msgstr "조언이 거꾸로 된 것 아닌가요? 빨리요. 같이 어울려 노셔야죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Halsin
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 15a690ef-49ed-409b-13ad-6b3ec352cc86
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_HasMet_Halsin(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Halsin:15a690ef-49ed-409b-13ad-6b3ec352cc86
msgctxt "ha6528bb0ga07cg4496g8db8g2f506d92411d"
msgid ""
"Enjoy yourself tonight. I'll come find you in the morning so we can talk."
msgstr "오늘 밤은 즐기시오. 아침에 다시 찾아올 테니 그때 이야기를 나누지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Halsin
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 1f649725-5ec9-6816-e279-51379c126a64
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Halsin_Knows_MoonriseBriefing = True
#.   Object:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHunt_HasMet_Halsin(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Halsin:1f649725-5ec9-6816-e279-51379c126a64
msgctxt "hf7ed4491g2b14g4be4ga25fgd3fe4f34efe7"
msgid ""
"Enjoy yourself tonight. Come morning, we've got a hard road ahead of us."
msgstr "오늘 밤은 즐기시오. 아침이 오면, 험난한 길이 우리 앞을 기다리고 있으니."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Halsin
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 1fc325e5-4f10-15f3-338b-596ea94609bb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Halsin_Knows_MoonriseBriefing = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHunt_HasMet_Halsin(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Halsin:1fc325e5-4f10-15f3-338b-596ea94609bb
msgctxt "h39577bc9g4cceg4231g8dd1g99fc33332939"
msgid ""
"Go on now, don't waste a night like this talking to me. We'll have plenty of "
"time together on the way to Moonrise."
msgstr "어서 가시게, 이런 밤을 나와 이야기하며 낭비하지 말고. 문라이즈로 함께 가는 도중에 얘기할 시간은 충분히 있을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Halsin
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 204376e9-417c-a8cc-8a94-1341d77c5587
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Halsin:204376e9-417c-a8cc-8a94-1341d77c5587
msgctxt "hd9720dd8g79c2g44c2g9f27gb48289a178b5"
msgid ""
"We'll have time to spare for that, I sense. I'm surprised you haven't had "
"your fill of me already."
msgstr "내 직감상 곧 그럴 기회가 있을 것이네. 알아야 할 건 다 알려줬다고 생각했는데, 의외로군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Halsin
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 28e1f76f-6cf1-b8b1-bb29-418306ef7c59
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Halsin:28e1f76f-6cf1-b8b1-bb29-418306ef7c59
msgctxt "h81e182aag3d15g48e1g8216g47e7dea66bbf"
msgid "Suit yourself."
msgstr "그리 하시죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Halsin
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 29b4b8ca-2d59-97c7-bee5-a7c39e35046f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Halsin:29b4b8ca-2d59-97c7-bee5-a7c39e35046f
msgctxt "h2cbd5f6cg7798g445ag9822g5b38fbb2ae8e"
msgid "There's other things we could do besides talking..."
msgstr "대화 말고도 할 수 있는 일이 있을 것 같은데..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Halsin
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2b42c587-7375-4757-eca8-8b2d915726f3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Halsin:2b42c587-7375-4757-eca8-8b2d915726f3
msgctxt "h839a803bg51edg49f9g8b43ge397e4945527"
msgid "But I'd like to get to know you some more now."
msgstr "당신에 대해서 더 알고 싶습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Halsin
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 38672fc0-aa6e-817c-0bb1-d4a603860d4f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Halsin:38672fc0-aa6e-817c-0bb1-d4a603860d4f
msgctxt "h30bb6dbbg8619g4177gb94fg69f2567b49eb"
msgid "Ah, I see. Perhaps I can help you with that, another time."
msgstr "아, 알겠네. 다음에 그 문제에 대해 함께 얘기해 보세."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Halsin
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4099be19-3b4d-da46-2fe0-b6be1afdf11f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Halsin:4099be19-3b4d-da46-2fe0-b6be1afdf11f
msgctxt "hf4888389ge9b4g4ca4ga1a0g6e129967a16a"
msgid "We'll talk another time."
msgstr "나중에 얘기하도록 하죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Halsin
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 40cbb3ec-1c52-f180-a0b8-83eee2c62f93
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Halsin:40cbb3ec-1c52-f180-a0b8-83eee2c62f93
msgctxt "he160a9d8g3cb5g435cgabe6gcd1f3de2f4a4"
msgid ""
"But there are many grateful people here who want to spent time with you. I "
"must not keep you all to myself. As enjoyable as that may be."
msgstr ""
"하지만 이곳엔 고마워 하는 많은 사람들이 그대와 함께 시간을 보내고 싶어 하네. 내가 그대를 독점해선 안 되겠지. 그게 즐겁긴 하지만."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Halsin
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 6b8dbebf-eb86-9d3b-3583-025e94bd5df8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Halsin:6b8dbebf-eb86-9d3b-3583-025e94bd5df8
msgctxt "hfac9b2fcgdab5g4364ga247g7ff1f221696c"
msgid ""
"Then you have never heard me singing. Which makes you <i>very </i>fortunate."
msgstr "자네가 내 노래 솜씨를 몰라서 그렇겠지. <i>천만다행</i>인 줄 알게나."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Halsin
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6ecda6e4-cbc9-25aa-8017-5493d8c5aa5f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Halsin:6ecda6e4-cbc9-25aa-8017-5493d8c5aa5f
msgctxt "hfe8ae46cge773g4345g90a9gdd0fb28552b8"
msgid "I thought you might care to have a drink with me."
msgstr "저랑 술 한 잔 하고 싶을 거라 생각했는데요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Halsin
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7f44adea-a177-f4be-adf8-651be12c5f1e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Halsin:7f44adea-a177-f4be-adf8-651be12c5f1e
msgctxt "h5607c043g82e2g4761g95a4gc9fbe898e18c"
msgid "I fail to see the problem."
msgstr "뭐가 문제인지 모르겠습니다만."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Halsin
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8035963b-df80-afe6-195e-b22cef3a296a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Halsin:8035963b-df80-afe6-195e-b22cef3a296a
msgctxt "hbb0aefcdgdd14g480bg876fgdf5cf1ff2bf5"
msgid "Hardly. I want to <i>really </i>get to know you."
msgstr "부족해요. 난 당신을 <i>제대로</i> 알고 싶다고요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Halsin
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 87ad55a2-4e89-82ef-eebe-c849bf7e6753
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHunt_HasMet_Halsin(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Halsin:87ad55a2-4e89-82ef-eebe-c849bf7e6753
msgctxt "h012569c0g8e83g47fag912ag4f6ae7300c35"
msgid ""
"Go on now, don't waste a night like this talking to me. We'll discuss your "
"problem tomorrow."
msgstr "어서 가게, 이런 밤을 나와 이야기하며 낭비하지 말게. 자네 문제에 대해서는 내일 얘기해 보도록 하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Halsin
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 8eaf8f6b-4748-a7f6-b70b-1ec7c52679fa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Halsin_BranchExhausted(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Halsin:8eaf8f6b-4748-a7f6-b70b-1ec7c52679fa
msgctxt "h66943a66g4be9g46a5gb02egefaaffee30cc"
msgid ""
"Go on, enjoy yourself. Seek out some wine before it runs dry - there are a "
"lot of thirsty people around here."
msgstr "어서, 즐거운 시간 보내게. 포도주가 바닥나기 전에 맛 좀 봐야 하지 않겠나, 여긴 목마른 사람 천지라네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Halsin
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = be08a8b8-1ce9-7371-402d-efd813473ca3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Halsin:be08a8b8-1ce9-7371-402d-efd813473ca3
msgctxt "h100973c1g6b70g4e63g8864g9a51a54bc2c1"
msgid "Perhaps there's something else you'd rather do then..."
msgstr "그렇다면 다른 일을 할 수 있을지도 모르겠는데요..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Halsin
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = c64f0523-4011-19cb-62fb-d0260b7afd55
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Halsin:c64f0523-4011-19cb-62fb-d0260b7afd55
msgctxt "h03675f2cg9864g418bg980cga6bc72c522e6"
msgid ""
"In truth, I rarely imbibe. The stuff goes right to my head. Before you know "
"it, I'd be breaking into song or declaring love to the first person I laid "
"eyes on."
msgstr ""
"사실, 난 술을 즐기지 않네. 금방 머리 꼭대기까지 취해버리거든. 나도 모르는 사이에 음주가무에 끼어들거나 처음 본 사람에게 사랑을 "
"고백하곤 하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Halsin
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = e692ccfa-3d1c-c058-cfd3-81324a583ba0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Halsin:e692ccfa-3d1c-c058-cfd3-81324a583ba0
msgctxt "h783e73ffgff94g4bd2g8515gfb2a91820f67"
msgid ""
"Later, perhaps. Don't worry about me. A night under the stars amidst "
"nature's creation is just what I need after being locked up in the goblins' "
"dungeon."
msgstr ""
"다음에 또 기회가 있겠지. 내 걱정은 말게. 고블린 지하 감옥에 갇혀 지내는 동안 밤하늘에 수놓인 이 별빛들이 몹시도 그리웠다네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Halsin
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = e94e20a3-8d4e-46dc-a088-af303e797c49
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Halsin:e94e20a3-8d4e-46dc-a088-af303e797c49
msgctxt "hbbeb2136gfad8g4b2bgadeagd48f7e5772b2"
msgid "I'm sure there are. You strike me as extremely... resourceful."
msgstr "분명 그렇겠지. 그나저나 자네 정말... 능숙하게 들이대는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_IrritatedTiefling
#. Speaker = Guex
#. NodeID = 283e9db5-5d12-44a2-4e8a-b8b379d2840f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_IrritatedTiefling:283e9db5-5d12-44a2-4e8a-b8b379d2840f
msgctxt "hc34a70edg4bcdg40d1g8881gd426073aa7df"
msgid "We'll be in a city, with roads and markets... and <i>homes</i>."
msgstr "도시에 갈 거야, 도로와 상점... 그리고 <i>집</i>이 있는 곳으로."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_IrritatedTiefling
#. Speaker = Guex
#. NodeID = 5b9183db-38a1-9486-1864-d2059821e0ad
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_HasMet_IrritatedTiefling(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_IrritatedTiefling:5b9183db-38a1-9486-1864-d2059821e0ad
msgctxt "hbc742fccg9f33g4d88gae49gfe9ccaad8027"
msgid "Think of it - no more caves, no more tents, no more running away."
msgstr "생각해 봐, 더 이상 동굴도, 천막도, 도망가는 일도 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_IrritatedTiefling
#. Speaker = Guex
#. NodeID = 5cc93ecc-db14-7807-d000-d62849add98c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_HasMet_IrritatedTiefling(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_IrritatedTiefling:5cc93ecc-db14-7807-d000-d62849add98c
msgctxt "h1fad4bb7g31e7g44f8ga6fag051e02f4a64f"
msgid "To beds and hearths! To dirty pubs and dwarven ale!"
msgstr "침대와 난로를 위해! 지저분한 주점과 드워프 에일을 위해!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_KidLeader
#. Speaker = Mol
#. NodeID = 069c2eec-1f48-f8ff-6c18-f780f339ea41
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_KidLeader:069c2eec-1f48-f8ff-6c18-f780f339ea41
msgctxt "h7ae2c9c4ge203g4d67g90c9gbe20d2da1cd8"
msgid "I don't owe anyone."
msgstr "난 누구에게도 빚진 거 없어. "

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_KidLeader
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 09e56d09-a9c2-d9a2-a9b7-a54548bfad31
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_KidLeader:09e56d09-a9c2-d9a2-a9b7-a54548bfad31
msgctxt "h4f1425c5g20e6g40c1gbf5cg23f01ed3eef2"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_KidLeader
#. Speaker = Mol
#. NodeID = 13a0a36d-ea55-bfca-3b75-2d976f26a242
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_HasMet_KidLeader(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_Hideout_Event_BefriendedThieflings = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_KidLeader:13a0a36d-ea55-bfca-3b75-2d976f26a242
msgctxt "hcdfa1fc6g718bg4e66ga03bg4b3afb1ac8b8"
msgid ""
"Go on, enjoy yourself. But if any of them sleep past noon they're getting "
"left behind."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_KidLeader
#. Speaker = Mol
#. NodeID = 1655c1c1-5c2f-3f9a-b70d-86e5f32ab792
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_Thieflings_Event_GaveMolIdol = True
#.   Object:
#.      - DEN_Thieflings_State_HasIdol(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_KidLeader:1655c1c1-5c2f-3f9a-b70d-86e5f32ab792
msgctxt "h2d3d16c1gc46cg417agac89g7b5ef0463a33"
msgid "If any of your stuff goes missing, just let me know. You're family now."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_KidLeader
#. Speaker = Mol
#. NodeID = 166d3108-b020-52aa-dd63-e2cb72c051f5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_KidLeader:166d3108-b020-52aa-dd63-e2cb72c051f5
msgctxt "h64be428eg3d00g4737ga5d4gf6a4dc65d9f4"
msgid "Just like I'll be glad to be rid of them once we're there."
msgstr "우리가 그곳에 가고 나면, 어른들한테서 해방되는 것도 마찬가지로 기쁜 일이겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_KidLeader
#. Speaker = Mol
#. NodeID = 1afdda3f-50d0-5b3d-65bd-b7855fc66663
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_KidLeader:1afdda3f-50d0-5b3d-65bd-b7855fc66663
msgctxt "h3133f484g04aag4733gadf1g205101c0677c"
msgid "Go on, enjoy yourself. I've squirreled away a few extra bottles."
msgstr "어서 즐기라고. 내가 몇 병 더 쟁여놨으니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_KidLeader
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 263ca8af-2e30-aca5-554a-29585367182b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 14
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_Thieflings_Event_AgreedStealIdol = True
#.      - DEN_Thieflings_Event_RefusedGiveIdol = False
#.      - DEN_Thieflings_Event_GaveMolIdol = False
#.   Object:
#.      - DEN_Thieflings_State_HasIdol(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_KidLeader:263ca8af-2e30-aca5-554a-29585367182b
msgctxt "hfe112dd0g1424g46c2gb540gd7bd65e94f9d"
msgid "I didn't touch the idol. Don't know what happened to it."
msgstr "난 우상에 손 댄 적 없는데. 당최 무슨 일이 일어난 건지 원."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_KidLeader
#. Speaker = Mol
#. NodeID = 29bca1d9-e698-b3dd-62bc-cb33e9cac4b1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_KidLeader:29bca1d9-e698-b3dd-62bc-cb33e9cac4b1
msgctxt "h0e88e80dg5987g40bcga6afg25e858283790"
msgid ""
"But if you mind your manners, maybe I'll remember you when I'm running the "
"Gate."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_KidLeader
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 30ef0136-d5d3-c43c-ce03-a571bef571c0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - ROGUE(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_KidLeader:30ef0136-d5d3-c43c-ce03-a571bef571c0
msgctxt "h55fd6ed2g7522g4249ga6a7gd307b1cb52d4"
msgid "Here's some free advice: never bargain, just take what's yours."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_KidLeader
#. Speaker = Mol
#. NodeID = 371f627a-be16-1a66-fd2c-269249f94a45
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_KidLeader:371f627a-be16-1a66-fd2c-269249f94a45
msgctxt "h9bbfd9f0gcfbag4e62gacd8g3087fe7d8908"
msgid "You're a terrible liar. We had a deal."
msgstr "거짓말인 거 다 알아. 우린 거래하기로 약속했잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_KidLeader
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 41986757-096c-cb0c-5807-0c24d3f2cd54
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_KidLeader:41986757-096c-cb0c-5807-0c24d3f2cd54
msgctxt "h523ba6cdg1048g4800g9adbg1169a4dacdf9"
msgid "Never been a specialty of mine, no."
msgstr "내 전문 분야가 아니야, 절대 안 돼."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_KidLeader
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5293b17e-1ee5-f85b-6427-623b9ef16148
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_KidLeader:5293b17e-1ee5-f85b-6427-623b9ef16148
msgctxt "h390a5ddbgc86ag4079ga103g0f7bc2c35fe2"
msgid "What are you doing way over here?"
msgstr "이렇게 멀리까지 나와서 뭘 하는 거니?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_KidLeader
#. Speaker = Mol
#. NodeID = 58c271ed-339a-9a5d-438d-9a2eda5641ef
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - DEN_Hideout_Event_BefriendedThieflings = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_KidLeader:58c271ed-339a-9a5d-438d-9a2eda5641ef
msgctxt "hc7f3aaeegc722g4c8agad54gaf80bef33fc2"
msgid ""
"Thanks. See you in Baldur's Gate, I hope. Now scram, before I get emotional."
msgstr "고마워. 발더스 게이트에서 보면 좋겠네. 이제 꺼져, 감정적으로 되기 전에."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_KidLeader
#. Speaker = Mol
#. NodeID = 5d6a3769-62a9-30a2-d36e-5192c3f660c8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_Thieflings_Event_GaveMolIdol = True
#.   Object:
#.      - DEN_Thieflings_State_HasIdol(0) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_KidLeader:5d6a3769-62a9-30a2-d36e-5192c3f660c8
msgctxt "h83dfc83fg5259g4c65gad50gc4e217d60ca7"
msgid "Somebody stole the idol. If I find out who it was... I'll recruit 'em."
msgstr "누군가 우상을 훔친 거야. 누구였는지 알아내면... 걔네들을 고용할 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_KidLeader
#. Speaker = Mol
#. NodeID = 60f64b77-1b4f-6c64-1d42-610d82bdde1a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - DEN_Hideout_Event_BefriendedThieflings = False
#.     - DEN_Thieflings_Event_RefusedGiveIdol = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_KidLeader:60f64b77-1b4f-6c64-1d42-610d82bdde1a
msgctxt "h63a6bd0ag3fa5g413ag9b74g77079dc525fe"
msgid "Sounds more like a challenge than advice. Keep an eye on your pack."
msgstr "조언보다는 참견같이 들리는데. 배낭 잘 간수하라구."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_KidLeader
#. Speaker = Mol
#. NodeID = 618be855-5f76-09fe-06d8-572ab94e8045
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_HasMet_KidLeader(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_KidLeader:618be855-5f76-09fe-06d8-572ab94e8045
msgctxt "h94e1c042g1b90g4d25g84e0ga6beec1084c2"
msgid "Hey, you. Can you keep a secret?"
msgstr "저기요. 비밀 잘 지키세요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_KidLeader
#. Speaker = Mol
#. NodeID = 6ae4c451-60ea-b934-71c6-8843d5d6414f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_KidLeader:6ae4c451-60ea-b934-71c6-8843d5d6414f
msgctxt "h712c21a1g7ad7g4109g9eeeg2b0679142b46"
msgid ""
"When the barrel's tapped out, I'll be there to save the night. For a price, "
"of course."
msgstr "술통이 바닥나면, 내가 구세주로 등장하는 거지. 물론, 값을 치러야 하겠지만."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_KidLeader
#. Speaker = Mol
#. NodeID = 7fc028df-9e55-6e0f-2b82-9b22241ccbd0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_KidLeader:7fc028df-9e55-6e0f-2b82-9b22241ccbd0
msgctxt "h8352ae81gee4fg462fg923fge12b8661661e"
msgid "I'm not. I'm glad they can celebrate before we've even got to the Gate."
msgstr "그런 게 아니야. 우리가 발더스 게이트에 도착하기도 전에 어른들이 축하할 수 있어서 기쁘다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_KidLeader
#. Speaker = Mol
#. NodeID = 84adf6f1-69a2-274a-71ff-227574b6292f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - DEN_Thieflings_Event_RefusedGiveIdol = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_KidLeader:84adf6f1-69a2-274a-71ff-227574b6292f
msgctxt "hbea31a67gcf90g43a7gbfd0g21962a28b7f7"
msgid "Damn it. Having that stashed away would have made life a lot easier."
msgstr "망할. 그걸 손에 넣었다면 삶이 좀 폈을 텐데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_KidLeader
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 87c04585-5765-8a4f-85a2-57b61b625081
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_KidLeader:87c04585-5765-8a4f-85a2-57b61b625081
msgctxt "h582bda1fg855cg4989gb70eg72aae2b0caaf"
msgid "Of course. My lips are easily sealed."
msgstr "물론이지. 내 입술은 아주 무겁단다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_KidLeader
#. Speaker = Mol
#. NodeID = 996a7f05-210c-7390-7105-26a9594c6c98
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_KidLeader:996a7f05-210c-7390-7105-26a9594c6c98
msgctxt "h48bd40beg5c84g4f34g9581g40c09e04c83e"
msgid "Suit yourself."
msgstr "마음대로 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_KidLeader
#. Speaker = Mol
#. NodeID = 9a3f0283-e1a9-0d71-47ba-87785225033c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_KidLeader:9a3f0283-e1a9-0d71-47ba-87785225033c
msgctxt "h20fbb797g2c3cg4cfbgb2efg06633645d3a5"
msgid ""
"Watching a bunch of old folks get dumber by the dram-full. And when they run "
"dry..."
msgstr "늙은이들이 술이나 마시고 멍청해지는 모습을 지켜보는 거지. 그리고 술이 떨어지면..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_KidLeader
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a5da064c-ce23-371a-c325-63e74f142dbd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_Thieflings_Event_AgreedStealIdol = True
#.      - DEN_Thieflings_Event_RefusedGiveIdol = False
#.      - DEN_Thieflings_Event_GaveMolIdol = False
#.   Object:
#.      - DEN_Thieflings_State_HasIdol(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - DEN_Thieflings_Event_GaveMolIdol = True
#.   Object:
#.     - DEN_Thieflings_Event_TransferIdol(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_KidLeader:a5da064c-ce23-371a-c325-63e74f142dbd
msgctxt "hff501c6fg4dd8g4e2egbd04g2e868e47f5ea"
msgid "Here you go. This idol's all yours."
msgstr "여기 있어요. 우상은 당신 거예요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_KidLeader
#. Speaker = Mol
#. NodeID = b36cf4d8-e8d1-fe40-f10e-bbff0e75b6bb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_KidLeader:b36cf4d8-e8d1-fe40-f10e-bbff0e75b6bb
msgctxt "hb26a2b87g4c37g485cg8a38gc7d98a7d62f9"
msgid "Just between you and me - I nicked some wine."
msgstr "저희끼리니 하는 말인데, 제가 포도주를 좀 꽁쳐뒀어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_KidLeader
#. Speaker = Mol
#. NodeID = b5d577d2-1442-1ff3-e0b5-79ee99fd3b83
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - DEN_Hideout_Event_BefriendedThieflings = False
#.     - DEN_Thieflings_Event_RefusedGiveIdol = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_KidLeader:b5d577d2-1442-1ff3-e0b5-79ee99fd3b83
msgctxt "h84cc9540g2a8bg4227g9093g668d77d078e7"
msgid "Fine. Hope the damn thing's cursed."
msgstr "좋아. 그 망할 물건에 저주나 깃들라지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_KidLeader
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bee2c2aa-e2d9-951d-b7b9-009bd303787d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_KidLeader:bee2c2aa-e2d9-951d-b7b9-009bd303787d
msgctxt "hecb44d37g3fbfg4f4bg9b0eg17e2e416ed25"
msgid "And now the deal's off. Maybe this will teach you something."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_KidLeader
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c19f3de7-d056-a6de-b861-a3d9588e4a6e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_Thieflings_Event_AgreedStealIdol = True
#.      - DEN_Thieflings_Event_RefusedGiveIdol = False
#.      - DEN_Thieflings_Event_GaveMolIdol = False
#.   Object:
#.      - DEN_Thieflings_State_HasIdol(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_KidLeader:c19f3de7-d056-a6de-b861-a3d9588e4a6e
msgctxt "hd35d76e9gb99ag4f13ga2e2ga826ae0813b6"
msgid "That idol of yours went missing, sorry to say."
msgstr "당신의 우상이 사라졌어요. 유감이에요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_KidLeader
#. Speaker = Mol
#. NodeID = d86e8f96-a608-9e68-bbc2-f831285c9215
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_KidLeader:d86e8f96-a608-9e68-bbc2-f831285c9215
msgctxt "h70298634gfa68g41a0ga231g77e2834cd73f"
msgid "And <i>that </i>sounds like the wine drowning your wits."
msgstr "포도주 마시더니 재치라곤 하나도 안 남은 것 같네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_KidLeader
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = dc72cae8-9539-74eb-8008-afd99f34467c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - DEN_Thieflings_State_HasIdol(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - DEN_Thieflings_Event_GaveMolIdol = True
#.   Object:
#.     - DEN_Thieflings_Event_TransferIdol(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_KidLeader:dc72cae8-9539-74eb-8008-afd99f34467c
msgctxt "hc7ae7c60g8171g411cgae08g9a845fdb9246"
msgid "Fine. Take it."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_KidLeader
#. Speaker = Mol
#. NodeID = e1725393-2023-6e32-5cbf-a052d4c2126c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_HasMet_KidLeader(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_KidLeader:e1725393-2023-6e32-5cbf-a052d4c2126c
msgctxt "h081ad769g010fg490bgaf83g347e4ee1a7b2"
msgid ""
"This party's boring. Should've put me in charge - now, that'd be a <i>real</"
"i> party."
msgstr "이 파티는 완전 지-루하네요. 제가 주최하게 해줬어야 했어요, 그랬으면 <i>진짜</i> 재밌는 파티를 보여줬을 텐데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_KidLeader
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e480b38a-720e-1f53-583b-1ba376b01ced
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_KidLeader:e480b38a-720e-1f53-583b-1ba376b01ced
msgctxt "ha568c852g35f9g44c6ga731g0dcde66ff115"
msgid "Don't be so harsh on your elders."
msgstr "너희 어른들에 대해 너무 가혹하게 말하지 말렴."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_KidLeader
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = eaa4cae6-4597-7a7c-301e-2d5b396682ed
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_KidLeader:eaa4cae6-4597-7a7c-301e-2d5b396682ed
msgctxt "h2cc68e81g187eg437bg9877gf56f625ae2a6"
msgid "Indeed - and now you owe me."
msgstr "물론이지, 그리고 이제 넌 빚을 진 거란다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_KidLeader
#. Speaker = Mol
#. NodeID = eac2d8cb-13fc-e496-e293-6951be579539
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_Hideout_Event_BefriendedThieflings = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_HasMet_KidLeader(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_KidLeader:eac2d8cb-13fc-e496-e293-6951be579539
msgctxt "h8b3344c6g351cg4889gaac4gc08e87491a7d"
msgid "You came through for us. That's a change from most adults I know."
msgstr "너는 우릴 위해 싸웠어. 다른 어른들이랑은 다르네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_KidLeader
#. Speaker = Mol
#. NodeID = ef2fc07f-d3e3-68c4-cf06-52b9bfd620e8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_KidLeader:ef2fc07f-d3e3-68c4-cf06-52b9bfd620e8
msgctxt "h81ad845dgfa54g4e77g8834gf33d2da7ede5"
msgid ""
"I've got a few bottles tucked away to keep things flowing. For a price, of "
"course."
msgstr "계속 마실 수 있도록 제가 몇 병 더 준비해줬어. 물론, 값을 치러야 하겠지만."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_KidLeader
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f98ea470-ee04-8079-faae-803ccc5105e0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_KidLeader:f98ea470-ee04-8079-faae-803ccc5105e0
msgctxt "ha450e572g9fb1g494fgb4caga2248e3f786c"
msgid "That sounded dangerously close to a compliment."
msgstr "칭찬 치곤 아주 위험한 발언이구나."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Lover1
#. Speaker = Danis
#. NodeID = 6acfbdd3-7388-f767-b566-cc71b081cc4e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_YoungLover02_State_PermaDefeated = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_HasMet_Lover1(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Lover1:6acfbdd3-7388-f767-b566-cc71b081cc4e
msgctxt "h7ea0145egf58cg4abbg8f5bg90a0dc7899e3"
msgid ""
"I planned on sitting it out tonight. Then I imagined what Bex would say, "
"and..."
msgstr "오늘 밤은 그냥 넘어가려고 했어. 그러다 벡스라면 뭐라고 말했을지 생각해 봤는데..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Lover1
#. Speaker = Danis
#. NodeID = a3a6c985-6dbc-aea5-76e0-d4520d780397
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_HasMet_Lover1(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Lover1:a3a6c985-6dbc-aea5-76e0-d4520d780397
msgctxt "h87036c34g24d0g45ffgb4c5g51ca4f2a0efb"
msgid "<i>Sharee!</i> That's Infernal for 'cheers'."
msgstr "<i>샤리!</i> 지옥어로 '건배'라는 뜻이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Lover1
#. Speaker = Danis
#. NodeID = dcaf9e91-0ba9-2ad9-f42d-051e0bf80175
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_HasMet_Lover1(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_YoungLover02_State_PermaDefeated = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Lover1:dcaf9e91-0ba9-2ad9-f42d-051e0bf80175
msgctxt "h1418b136g8383g444ag8073g99e0c754b01e"
msgid "Thanks for letting us do this. I feel... maybe not good. But better."
msgstr "이런 행사를 허락해 줘서 고마워. 기분이... 좋진 않지만, 조금은 나아졌어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Lover1
#. Speaker = Danis
#. NodeID = f07686ce-5500-2791-0a52-1161c49156fa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Lover1:f07686ce-5500-2791-0a52-1161c49156fa
msgctxt "h72c9e80eg2aa1g438bga91cg9ba5a8416f7b"
msgid "Well. Bottom's up."
msgstr "좋아. 쭉 들이켜."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Lover1
#. Speaker = Danis
#. NodeID = f0e53c85-29fe-398e-43b0-24849abdf2b2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_HasMet_Lover1(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Lover1:f0e53c85-29fe-398e-43b0-24849abdf2b2
msgctxt "hf46f91e3ge321g4a74g9d45g86ba53f1ea54"
msgid ""
"Do devils even grow turnips? Can't <i>all</i> be souls and 'flesh of the "
"damned'."
msgstr "데빌도 순무를 키울까? 영혼이랑 '지옥에 떨어진 자들의 살점'만 먹진 않겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Lover1
#. Speaker = Danis
#. NodeID = fb6d630b-b44f-2098-d1b5-a60203079926
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Lover1:fb6d630b-b44f-2098-d1b5-a60203079926
msgctxt "hb7ce902fgc138g4a49g937bgf18dc5d649a3"
msgid "Or possibly 'turnip'."
msgstr "'순무'라는 뜻일지도 모르지만."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Lover2
#. Speaker = Bex
#. NodeID = 101ad5cd-de37-14cd-11d5-256d3ac03e80
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Lover2:101ad5cd-de37-14cd-11d5-256d3ac03e80
msgctxt "h9d541c5ag168fg4699gb4cfg22fa4964a475"
msgid "Nope. No. I need to lie down."
msgstr "아니. 아니다. 누워야겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Lover2
#. Speaker = Bex
#. NodeID = 45ae05ac-accf-4484-9bad-55870753a973
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_HasMet_Lover2(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Lover2:45ae05ac-accf-4484-9bad-55870753a973
msgctxt "hfcf4212ag2c5dg4573gb63fgdf99f51dcfaa"
msgid "Lie down. <i>Then </i>dance."
msgstr "일단 눕고. <i>그다음 </i>춤 춰야지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Lover2
#. Speaker = Bex
#. NodeID = caade43a-48c3-4b3b-7377-d037f7aa1d20
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_HasMet_Lover2(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Lover2:caade43a-48c3-4b3b-7377-d037f7aa1d20
msgctxt "h34e1d52fgcecbg48ceg9fb0gffa869747ecd"
msgid "I need to dance!"
msgstr "춤을 춰야겠어!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Lover2
#. Speaker = Bex
#. NodeID = e46c3c97-ce48-5acb-ec57-f727474869af
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_YoungLover01_State_PermaDefeated = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_HasMet_Lover2(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Lover2:e46c3c97-ce48-5acb-ec57-f727474869af
msgctxt "h6f569853gad11g46eegb8d6gb342e4e80a8b"
msgid ""
"Thanks for letting us do this. There wasn't time for a proper send-off "
"for... for the dead."
msgstr "이 자리를 마련해 줘서 고마워. 죽은 이들을 제대로 떠나보낼 시간이... 없었거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Lover2
#. Speaker = Bex
#. NodeID = e8537bdf-fd32-35e2-087b-1963f74e61bd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_HasMet_Lover2(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_YoungLover01_State_PermaDefeated = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Lover2:e8537bdf-fd32-35e2-087b-1963f74e61bd
msgctxt "h7f718b66g5bb3g4214ga842gcb91f072144a"
msgid "I'd probably be tucking Danis in by now. He never could hold his drink."
msgstr "원래라면 지금쯤 다니스 이부자리 깔아줬을 텐데. 술도 못 하면서 연신 퍼마셔댔을걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Camp/NPCs/CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_OwlbearCub
#. Speaker = Owlbear Cub
#. NodeID = 5c8970fe-c606-0c2d-661d-ffb1760e76fb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
