msgctxt "he511bb2bg2ce6g4023ga964g8271235d19ff"
msgid "Follow my lead."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/SoloDreams/CAMP_Wyll_SD_HavenRomance_ROM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = dfb2338a-e813-58f8-982a-3ff03685d0d6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/SoloDreams/CAMP_Wyll_SD_HavenRomance_ROM:dfb2338a-e813-58f8-982a-3ff03685d0d6
msgctxt "h35f345aeg8742g4645g8b6eg6c0265e00386"
msgid "It wasn't hard. You just make it <i>look</i> hard."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/SoloDreams/CAMP_Wyll_SD_HavenRomance_ROM
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = e2c33678-801e-0aaa-f023-64c0629a6816
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/SoloDreams/CAMP_Wyll_SD_HavenRomance_ROM:e2c33678-801e-0aaa-f023-64c0629a6816
msgctxt "hfece4f29ga698g4c80g928fgc3a689113ba7"
msgid ""
"Figured it was time to brush up on my skills. I wouldn't want to fail my new "
"partner."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/SoloDreams/CAMP_Wyll_SD_HavenRomance_ROM
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = e2f2a1d0-87aa-0fe9-7d60-1727fcb1299b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/SoloDreams/CAMP_Wyll_SD_HavenRomance_ROM:e2f2a1d0-87aa-0fe9-7d60-1727fcb1299b
msgctxt "h7e769a2dg0e1cg450fga9acg5b9e485c5713"
msgid "I deserve that. And I wish I could give more than 'sorry's in return."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/SoloDreams/CAMP_Wyll_SD_HavenRomance_ROM
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e5b56d7c-31d6-a1c5-3536-7cbc6ce63b56
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/SoloDreams/CAMP_Wyll_SD_HavenRomance_ROM:e5b56d7c-31d6-a1c5-3536-7cbc6ce63b56
msgctxt "he5b48608g3db5g4a53ga7e4gfeb292f8d559"
msgid "I'd like to, but I'm afraid I'll trip over my own feet."
msgstr "나도 그러고 싶은데, 내 발에 걸려 넘어질지도 몰라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/SoloDreams/CAMP_Wyll_SD_HavenRomance_ROM
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = f3b714d7-8f5e-788b-cbf5-3f8e46749f58
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/SoloDreams/CAMP_Wyll_SD_HavenRomance_ROM:f3b714d7-8f5e-788b-cbf5-3f8e46749f58
msgctxt "h7f643319g2be4g4ce6ga818g7d527fd2b781"
msgid ""
"I need them to be <i>just</i> right. I wouldn't want to fail my new partner."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Camp/SoloDreams/CAMP_Wyll_SD_HavenRomance_ROM
